(N'Shirley', N'Parker', N'shirley.parker1001@example.com', '2014-07-18', 5, N'Love it! Am slowly trying to complete my sims 2 collection. Was very excited to have some more places and things for my sims to do. Just love all the added new stuff to my sims world. Now I have more job options for them and like how easy everything is for me to figure out and explore. Thanks! Am very, very satisfied with my purchase. Look forward for more things for my sims.'),
