(N'Sarah', N'Fisher', N'sarah.fisher7588@example.net', '2014-07-19', 5, N'Aswome game Iove it!!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Nguyen', N'ashley.nguyen7259@example.com', '2014-07-19', 3, N'Works okay, occasionally doesn''t recognize game when you change the case'),
(N'Linda', N'Perry', N'linda.perry2215@example.net', '2014-07-19', 5, N'Always loved the series.... A great one here as well.... Delivery was quick, game is brand new... Great price....'),
(N'Emily', N'Morris', N'emily.morris4231@example.com', '2014-07-20', 5, N'excellent gift'),
(N'Emily', N'Morris', N'emily.morris4231@example.com', '2014-07-20', 5, N'great xmas gift'),
(N'Heather', N'Reed', N'heather.reed8062@example.com', '2014-07-20', 3, N'It was bad when I first bought it but soon my brain probably learned how to be accustomed to the Wonky L3 and R3 sticks... So basically, I had this controller for a year and it hasn''t been all that good but it is OK just a good OK! The reason is that when you first get the controller it sucks on CoD since you aim and move two inches or 4 away from your target. It is too sensitive when it first arrives but soon I left it alone for a month and came back and it was fixed for an odd reason. It could be because of software updates I guess'),
(N'Jessica', N'Khan', N'jessica.khan4880@example.com', '2014-07-20', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Jessica', N'Khan', N'jessica.khan4880@example.com', '2014-07-20', 5, N'Super'),
(N'Matthew', N'Rodriguez', N'matthew.rodriguez8351@example.com', '2014-07-20', 4, N'This is the best thing that could have come around; the only thing that was wrong with it was it charges all four at the same time. So if you only need one to charge, you have to choose all four.'),
(N'Christine', N'Clark', N'christine.clark1772@example.org', '2014-07-20', 5, N'A good game'),
(N'Paul', N'Anderson', N'paul.anderson8193@example.org', '2014-07-20', 3, N'It''s always good to have a good quality old stuff'),
(N'Julie', N'Morales', N'julie.morales9021@example.com', '2014-07-20', 4, N'For normal playstation controllers to pc, this works perfectly. I had no problems for that out of the box. But dance pads are a whole other story. Out of the box, this will not work properly with games like stepmania and OpenITG. The pad is detected as a regular joystick, and the arrows are mapped as axis. This means you will not be able to push two opposite arrows at the same time.... normally. After searching all over the internet, I came across the solution. It involves using a couple of scripts, but it short it remaps the dance pads arrows to keyboard keys. I created detailed instructions and provided downloads on the stepmania forums. It will be under Input, Adapters and Controllers titled "Axis Fix For ANY Dance Pad" With that set up, the game works flawlessly with my redoctane ignition 2.0 dance pad.'),
(N'Michael', N'Murphy', N'michael.murphy3487@example.net', '2014-07-20', 5, N'Item was exactly as described, prompt delivery and well-packaged!'),
(N'Gary', N'Gomez', N'gary.gomez8340@example.com', '2014-07-21', 4, N'Expected a top quality keyboard and wasn''t disappointed. The orange 45g switches aren''t as noisy as I was afraid they might be (I got the Razer BlackWidow Ultimate 2014 Stealth Edition), key function is comfortable, board layout and spacing is ideal for me. I''ve been running a Logitech G15 for many years so I''m still getting used to the stylized characters on the Razer and the green backlight as opposed to orange, but I''m liking the feel of the Razer so far. Good responsiveness for gaming, and of course programmable keys are always a win. Having a sleep mode key is an interesting addition I haven''t seen before. It''s very green. The only ''negatives'' are that (1) I am right handed and the USB outlet and mic/headphones plugs are on the right side of the keyboard where I have my mouse, so I probably won''t use them as the wires would get in the way.. would much prefer them on the left side then I''d definitely make use of them, and (2) a little disturbed about their cloud-based software...'),
(N'Peter', N'Carter', N'peter.carter1510@example.org', '2014-07-21', 5, N'Works great with Gameboy Printer!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Rodriguez', N'nathan.rodriguez8724@example.net', '2014-07-21', 5, N'Good product'),
(N'Karen', N'Evans', N'karen.evans2224@example.net', '2014-07-21', 5, N'It''s Diablo III, but better. Simple as that. Runs great in WINE on Linux.'),
(N'Paul', N'Martinez', N'paul.martinez5626@example.com', '2014-07-21', 2, N'I broke it lol. It''s not entirely the cables fault since it got stuck between my desks and I tried to yank it out but it didn''t resist much at all. The way the yellow plug pulled from the jacket just sucked. I didn''t pull that hard. Had to buy another one. These plugs always feel kind of cheap, this is the second one I''ve broken by accident. I have 5 consoles and this is only an issue with Sony Playstaion gear. One cracked in half and I couldn''t snap it back together, then this one came loose from the joint. Didn''t feel like soldering it. Buying one from an aftermarket supplier.'),
(N'Emma', N'Turner', N'emma.turner6129@example.com', '2014-07-21', 3, N'It''s an alright game. Fun to play.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Nowak', N'ethan.nowak2493@example.org', '2014-07-21', 5, N'This was a gift for my girlfriend. It was a game she had as a kid and never could find it herself. We both love the game and play it all the time'),
(N'Kyle', N'Clark', N'kyle.clark6606@example.net', '2014-07-21', 5, N'Was purchasing games for my son''s birthday and was unsure if he was going to like this game but I scored major mommy points as he is so in love with this game and has been playing it everyday since receiving it and the best part he plays along with his brothers.'),
(N'Helen', N'Coleman', N'helen.coleman2916@example.org', '2014-07-21', 4, N'Dark Souls 2 is the toughest challenge of 2014 for console gamers. In a time where most game designers assist the player as much as they can so they can feel heroic, the Dark Souls series does everything it can to murder you. Although there are many improvements over Dark Souls, this game feels unpolished. Story: 8/10 In a dark medieval world, you die and your cursed soul is compelled to journey to the ruins of Drangleic Castle. As you journey through the countryside, your memory fades until getting to Drangleic is the only thing that matters. Once there, you plunge into an abyss of horrific fantasy. It''s a dark, twisted world, inhabited by undead who have lost their humanity and gone hollow. A hollow creature is a pitiful sight, reduced to a mindless undead who viciously attacks anything with a soul. The world is also full of demonic bosses who block your way. Aided by other lost souls, you must battle your way through the world and claim the throne. Gameplay: 8/10 Dark Souls 2 is...'),
(N'Laura', N'Foster', N'laura.foster4464@example.net', '2014-07-21', 5, N'You really can''t go wrong with bioshock. This game didn''t have the same effect on me as Bioshock one or Infinite, but it''s definitely worth it.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Boyd', N'ravi.boyd7850@example.org', '2014-07-21', 3, N'This is pretty standard MMO. It starts off a little boring, gets more fun later. It has decent PVP, and somewhat lackluster raiding. Overall if you''re really looking for an MMO it will scratch the itch, but it doesn''t have what I want to make it a mainstay. I know they put a lot of hard work into this game, but it only kept me interested for about 6 months. Good luck gamers!'),
(N'Frank', N'Sullivan', N'frank.sullivan8933@example.org', '2014-07-21', 4, N'Pros: Comes with 2 games, Trophy Support, Dualshock Support and the GOW Game Directors Live videos. Cons: The Video Content is censored, broken down and cut. Not sure if it''s because of time or disc space, but I don''t see the reason for cutting it. Also, it''s an M Rated game. Why censor curse words and delete the scene talking about violence. That is stupid. I''d say get this collection for the two games. If you really want to see the video content just download it for $5-10 on PSN uncensored and uncut.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Allen', N'joseph.allen8779@example.org', '2014-07-22', 4, N'Thanx'),
(N'Helen', N'Patel', N'helen.patel4253@example.org', '2014-07-22', 5, N'Perfect timing and working great :)'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Cruz', N'cheryl.cruz8422@example.com', '2014-07-22', 2, N'Good thing I got it for free this is by far one on the worst PES games ever, I had always been a PES fan and never admited fifa was even close,by the time the 2013 releases came, I tought FIFA made a huge improvement and they were very good, but I kept playing PES 13 and it was not bad, I had fun with the gameplay, despite having to download a bunch of patches to have licensed teams. When the 14 came in I tried both demos and got so impressed by FIFA14 that I switched sides, FIFA is extremely superior to PES, better graphics, better stadiums, more teams, better online support, better commentators and most important a more realistic gameplay, the gameplay pm PES looks like slow motion, it''s painful, some movements on the players got improved but they don''t look realistic at all. Now comes the time for the 2015 releases and I will try both again, since I still want to believe in PES, but to be honest, I am almost sure FIFA will beat them again.'),
(N'Anita', N'Walker', N'anita.walker4580@example.org', '2014-07-22', 5, N'I love this game! It is challenging and fun to play. I would recommend this game to anyone who enjoys hidden object games and solving mysteries!. This is a most enjoyable game and would appeal to almost any age group.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Kim', N'ethan.kim8875@example.org', '2014-07-22', 3, N'Great games'),
(N'Peter', N'Jackson', N'peter.jackson7434@example.com', '2014-07-23', 3, N'I had relatively high expectations for this game since it''s supposed to be a part of the Parasite Eve series, which I really like. When I played this one it came off as just another shooter game with a semi-decent story. It''s okay, but not as great as I was hoping it would be.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Thompson', N'benjamin.thompson1193@example.org', '2014-07-23', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Dee', N'Cox', N'dee.cox6390@example.com', '2014-07-23', 4, N'if wwe 13 was never made this game would be the best out. its a great game but story mode is hard. I unlocked all the characters and I was satisfied with the legends on there like rvd the rock and stone cold. Great game.'),
(N'Omar', N'Henderson', N'omar.henderson6713@example.org', '2014-07-23', 5, N'Not actually a great party game, but lots of cool single player modes. I bought it because I thought it would be a solid multiplayer game for my little sisters, but I can''t complain. We play it enough.'),
(N'Gary', N'Ortiz', N'gary.ortiz7677@example.net', '2014-07-23', 5, N'One of the best R.E. games out.'),
(N'Mark', N'Wright', N'mark.wright1824@example.net', '2014-07-23', 4, N'So far so good except for one of the 2 chargers is acting up now. It will not charge the controllers properly. They seem to charge well, and then last a few seconds.'),
(N'Betty', N'Myers', N'betty.myers8134@example.com', '2014-07-23', 5, N'Awesome.'),
(N'Joan', N'Price', N'joan.price5665@example.com', '2014-07-24', 1, N'Defective item, it never worked. I was tested in three different consoles. Do not put me in touch with the supplier at the time.'),
(N'Joan', N'Price', N'joan.price5665@example.com', '2014-07-24', 5, N'Excelente producto.'),
(N'Christina', N'Patel', N'christina.patel2130@example.org', '2014-07-24', 3, N'gave it as a gift'),
(N'William', N'Wang', N'william.wang1576@example.com', '2014-07-24', 1, N'I really don''t like this game play is too slow'),
(N'Michael', N'Alvarez', N'michael.alvarez4782@example.org', '2014-07-24', 5, N'Came the day I expected it and everything was in that was mentioned. Love this game and has to be the defining game of what a gamecube was capable of graphics wise! And added loads more content to an already classic title. Resident Evil still takes the cake for me but this is definitely right next to it!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Martin', N'brandon.martin6756@example.org', '2014-07-24', 5, N'Probably the best single player FPS in existence (in my opinion). Loved this game, it has an incredible plot, and the aesthetics are also amazing. I consider it one of those "must play before you die" games for any gamer.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Young', N'rebecca.young9211@example.com', '2014-07-24', 3, N'sort of a meh for me. these little rubber grips are too soft in my opinion. getting them on takes a fair amount of effort, and once on the pretty readily slip right off again. the plastic is more slippery than the rubber that is already on the PSV nubs so they effectively made my grip worse.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Martinez', N'jerry.martinez6897@example.org', '2014-07-24', 2, N'This is my first Vita Slim... I have a Fat and it has been working like a champ for years. Love the new slim, love the color but hate the wireless (radio) in the slim. I literally have my Vita within 4 feet of a cisco EA1200.... and show only 1 bar. If I am within 10 inches of it i get full bars, as I step away instantly drop off. I have a EA2700 and have the same issue, I get full bars when within inches of the AP, step away even 5 feet and down to one bar and I am not able to connect. In addition I find that each time I turn the unit back on (from sleep mode, not full power off) it never connects to the AP it was connected to before. The AP in question is 6 feet from the Vita and still every time I have to go into settings, re-connect to the AP. I searched and was not able to find other''s with this problem so I''m assuming my it''s just with my vita. As is it''s not a keeper, just trying to decide if I want to gamble with another import model or go with the US vita slim. Update - I...'),
(N'Mateo', N'Nguyen', N'mateo.nguyen8613@example.net', '2014-07-24', 5, N'Bought this for an 8 year old grandson. He loves it! It came in a timely manner and I was able to give it to him for his birthday.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Walker', N'shirley.walker4903@example.com', '2014-07-25', 5, N'Nice colors and good soft rubber material !'),
(N'Marcus', N'Gutierrez', N'marcus.gutierrez8905@example.org', '2014-07-25', 5, N'I purchased this for my Astro A50s, so I could connect my iPhone 5S for music, phone calls, Teamspeak, etcetera. Works great, though you will need to push the plug firmly to get it seated into the jack on the A50s, it''s a snug fit. The smaller 2.5 jack (for the Xbox 360 controller) is the side that goes into the headset, while the larger jack goes into the 5S (or any standard sized headphone jack). I would buy the product again.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Perez', N'carolyn.perez8630@example.com', '2014-07-25', 4, N'So far, I''m loving it! The arrow keys can be a little daunting at first, but I guess I will get used to it overtime. LEDs are pretty and bright (can be adjusted) and the most important factor (not really) it clicks! No, seriously, this thing sounds soooo sexy I could type on it all day! And I''m not even too big of a typist! I play games more than I do typing, and it feels good for that too! Overall amazing keyboard, unless you''re some type of "Ultra-Keyboard Warrior Pro", than you will have no problem using this keyboard. UPDATE: After using the keyboard for around 8 hours, the arrow keys around the numpad started to dim, along with a dead LED. I just returned it to amazon, and the new replacement should be in about 1 day from now. Had to knock a star off for that. UPDATE UPDATE! 8/10/14: So it''s been about a week 1/2 and I already have another dead LED? What the heck! I didn''t pay 90+ dollars for this! I''m sorry, but I''m going to try and get a refund, because there is no way I''ll...'),
(N'Eric', N'Rogers', N'eric.rogers1676@example.org', '2014-07-25', 5, N'Excellent description and functions wonderfully. Great purchase.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Allen', N'ivan.allen6458@example.com', '2014-07-25', 4, N'fast services and delivery, great game a lot of fun ....'),
(N'Diane', N'Moore', N'diane.moore9772@example.com', '2014-07-25', 3, N'For the price you really can''t beat it but, I must say that the chat volume is a little lower than I would like when the volume is maxed out. Decent for the price.'),
(N'Luis', N'Coleman', N'luis.coleman8544@example.net', '2014-07-25', 5, N'This game is flat out the best GameCube game I have ever played. It''s a great game if you ever have friends over, because it has a offline split-screen co-op feature. It is also still possible to play online using a private server, which is great. The game is a great collectible, if I were you...I''d buy it while it''s still cheap. You can find it here on Amazon for a variety of prices, lowest I have seen is about $35, which is a pretty good price for the game. Great graphics for its time, great game play, and great music. Just a great game overall.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Carter', N'kimberly.carter5503@example.net', '2014-07-25', 5, N'It was what she was expecting.'),
(N'Henry', N'Johnson', N'henry.johnson3332@example.net', '2014-07-25', 5, N'SUCH A FUN GAME, ITS LIKE A MESSED UP MARIO GAME, BUT REALLY FUN. LOVE PLAYING WITH MULTI PLAYS AND SOLO.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Butler', N'kyle.butler5062@example.org', '2014-07-25', 5, N'It is great'),
(N'Kyle', N'Flores', N'kyle.flores6881@example.net', '2014-07-25', 3, N'wouldn''t download and play right'),
(N'Aisha', N'Hall', N'aisha.hall7944@example.com', '2014-07-26', 5, N'its good but itis poor in cheats for pokemon Y'),
(N'Walter', N'Morales', N'walter.morales8133@example.com', '2014-07-26', 3, N'the disc is useless. after googling and reading other reviews, it installed and worked fine'),
(N'Emily', N'Phillips', N'emily.phillips8883@example.org', '2014-07-26', 3, N'The game is pretty good. It does have a bad glitch. The game will freeze Isaac in the aiming mode. This means you can''t climb ladders, stomp, run or operate the bench. I''ve tried to play it three times. I''ve gotten far as trying to get the shuttle going and that''s it. I may start over one more time. After that I''m sending a letter to EA asking for a refund.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Kelly', N'sandra.kelly8421@example.com', '2014-07-26', 5, N'I''m so addicted to the different Katamari games I have one for ps2, ps3 and xbox 360. It''s, a little harder to get used to on the PSP due to the fact it''s missing a 2nd analog stick however once you get used to it you will have just as much fun.'),
(N'Megan', N'Martinez', N'megan.martinez6390@example.com', '2014-07-26', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Scott', N'Jimenez', N'scott.jimenez5507@example.org', '2014-07-26', 2, N'I can only get these to work 30% of the time. The connection is weak to the point that the GameCube controller will come disconnected at the slightest jostle. Most of the time, the GameCube controller takes on a mind of it''s own and random commands are input. I may end up watching Netflix, turning off my wii, or just opening and closing apps. This is only remedied by shutting down the Wii and turning it back on. Even then, that only works every fourth or fifth time. When I do get it to connect properly, it works exactly as described. Great idea, poor execution.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Ivanov', N'christopher.ivanov1207@example.com', '2014-07-26', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Peter', N'Suzuki', N'peter.suzuki2496@example.org', '2014-07-26', 5, N'One of the best RPGs I have played in years'),
(N'Priya', N'Bell', N'priya.bell4934@example.net', '2014-07-26', 5, N'Audio quality on these is great. Maybe not matching my Sennheisers (that cost quite a bit more), but way better than a number of other inexpensive headphones I''ve used. The microphone is plenty adjustable, and easy to flip up and out of the way when not needed. Build quality overall isn''t bad. A bit plasticky (so don''t sit on them too many times), but they seem okay. Comfort is also good. Not hard or uncomfortable to wear for a few hours at a time. Turtle Beach did a nice job with these. I''m sure there are nicer headsets out there, but they''d probably be two or three times the price. I kind of wish the plugs were appropriately color coded. We have those standards to make life easy when plugging stuff in. That said, the adapter to separate microphone and speaker channels worked fine on my computer, and gave a bit of added reach that was helpful for my desktop computer (located under my table). Without that adapter, I might have needed a separate extension cable, the main one is only...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Howard', N'kathleen.howard3771@example.org', '2014-07-26', 5, N'Its one of the classics from the days of arcades.'),
(N'Mei', N'Jackson', N'mei.jackson6626@example.org', '2014-07-26', 5, N'Great Game!! Easy to Play, good story! Its Almost like playing a ''Movie''. I really like the originality of this game and the gameplay.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Sullivan', N'kelly.sullivan2986@example.org', '2014-07-26', 5, N'Great game, I spent many an hour playing this back in the day, love the Close Combat game series. A classic game.'),
(N'Heather', N'Murphy', N'heather.murphy8402@example.org', '2014-07-26', 5, N'Very sturdy and thick for the price, very good quality and a must have for all gamers.'),
(N'Donald', N'Fisher', N'donald.fisher4751@example.org', '2014-07-26', 5, N'great game got it in good time after I ordered it'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Diaz', N'benjamin.diaz8465@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Diaz', N'benjamin.diaz8465@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Ryan', N'Garcia', N'ryan.garcia6898@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'I bought this for a gift, I was told they like it very much and play it daily. Good service, arrived on time.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Garcia', N'ryan.garcia6898@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'This was a gift for someone else, they have told me they enjoy it very much, play it daily. The service was good, arrived right on time.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Bennett', N'victoria.bennett7936@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'excelente producto'),
(N'Carol', N'Flores', N'carol.flores3813@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'I bought this game for my sister''s birthday and she loves it. Even though it''s very short, like any other Sonic game, it has additional missions to unlock new artwork and songs. And plus, all the sonic characters from previous games make their appearance, they aid you on some missions or you compete in some challenges against them. Long story short, the game is great and I recommend it for any Sonic fan.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Taylor', N'joyce.taylor9909@example.org', '2014-07-27', 2, N'They have made this game in a way that requires you buy the dlc to have a chance. It''s no surprise with ea being in charge and their greedy little fingers corrupting all of the franchises they keep putting out.'),
(N'Justin', N'Butler', N'justin.butler3793@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'Super!, Great game!, as Advertise!'),
(N'Peter', N'Taylor', N'peter.taylor2321@example.com', '2014-07-27', 3, N'Not as great as I thought it would be. Storry skips around and no real direction'),
(N'David', N'Reyes', N'david.reyes2479@example.net', '2014-07-27', 5, N'Great product...very durable and does as it says it will. I love this case especially since songs is now $18.'),
(N'Noah', N'Alvarez', N'noah.alvarez7124@example.org', '2014-07-27', 4, N'Terrible XBOX 360 graphics, silly plot and limited game play. That said, it''s anime chicks slicing up zombies in bikinis because the more blood they get on them, the more powerful they become. Awesome! :-) This really should be a "it''s so bad, it''s good" cult game.'),
(N'Henry', N'Thomas', N'henry.thomas1359@example.com', '2014-07-27', 5, N'It''s Baldur''s Gate in it''s original form. Certain devs want to claim they improved it (and are selling such) but the community beat them to it and were ripped off.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Khan', N'lauren.khan8046@example.net', '2014-07-27', 2, N'The controls make this Vita game a bad port of a very nice game I loved on PC many years ago. It is hard to get your creature to ''flow'' in the right direction. I missed so many objects I was aiming for simply because the creature would not move in the direction I was pointing. There is a sense of speed in the PC version that just is not evident in this Vita version due to the wonky controls. Final verdict: Don''t bother playing this even if it''s free. Just play the old Flash-powered version.'),
(N'Frank', N'James', N'frank.james4628@example.org', '2014-07-28', 5, N'Got it for the good looking case'),
(N'Diane', N'Khan', N'diane.khan8124@example.com', '2014-07-28', 1, N'FAKE! My XBOX never hung before I put this piece of junk in it. Returned it immediately.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Jimenez', N'douglas.jimenez5769@example.org', '2014-07-28', 5, N'IT WORKS GREAT AND I REALLY LIKE THAT IT COME FAST'),
(N'Patricia', N'Martinez', N'patricia.martinez4304@example.org', '2014-07-28', 5, N'Everything was in the condition stated, included everything like description said all in very good/like new condition. Disc had no scratches! Plays perfect, very happy. Would buy from again.'),
(N'Julie', N'Garcia', N'julie.garcia9115@example.org', '2014-07-28', 3, N'If you buy it directly from Smite you get 400 gems. I didn''t get that with this.'),
(N'Justin', N'Ferreira', N'justin.ferreira3343@example.com', '2014-07-28', 5, N'Excellent game!!!'),
(N'Justin', N'Ferreira', N'justin.ferreira3343@example.com', '2014-07-28', 3, N'Not the best Croft offering.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Chavez', N'patrick.chavez8801@example.net', '2014-07-28', 4, N'Could be much better for ergonomics and trigger feel... But that being said this is the best trigger case out there.. Took a big drop almost right away with no damage whatsoever to case or system'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Clark', N'jonathan.clark2093@example.org', '2014-07-28', 5, N'Super fun and marvelous!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Brown', N'aaron.brown7532@example.net', '2014-07-28', 5, N'This is a game I never knew was ever made this is a great game I love it .'),
(N'Victoria', N'Allen', N'victoria.allen3217@example.org', '2014-07-28', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Mitchell', N'benjamin.mitchell2859@example.com', '2014-07-28', 5, N'great product and better service!'),
(N'Anna', N'Raghunathan', N'anna.raghunathan4002@example.net', '2014-07-28', 5, N'Excellent long cord to charge gamepad. Plugs into console or a cell phone wall adapter. Console must be on to charge if charging in console. I use it for plug and play and it works great.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Kumar', N'sarah.kumar3350@example.org', '2014-07-28', 5, N'This review is for the Razer Taipan Battlefield 4 mouse. EXCELLENT price for this product. For whatever reason, this mouse is normally more than $60. I got this mouse for $45. Frankly, the battlefield skin makes it look...gimmicky. Plus, I don''t play Battlefield 4. And the skin doesn''t look like it has anything to do with the battlefield franchise, except that it says "Battlefield 4" on it. But it''s exactly the same mouse as my standard Razer Taipan mouse.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Gray', N'hiroshi.gray6477@example.com', '2014-07-29', 4, N'I enjoyed this game. I wasn''t sure what to expect when I got it, but I glommed onto the "hacking" aspect of the game. I really enjoyed a recent CBS TV show "Intelligence" where the lead character could hack into anything. While this isn''t handled the same way as that TV show, the concept of "hack anything" was there, so I enjoyed that angle of it. It feels in a lot of ways like Grand Theft Auto - a lot of the same game play mechanics are there. I know more recent iterations of GTA had aspects of interacting with your world, but not quite like this. I have to say I really enjoyed the hacking aspect of this game. From reading other reviews, I see where people didn''t, but that is not the case for me. It would be unfair to call it a "poor man''s Grand Theft Auto", because I think this game stands strongly on its own, but if you have played GTA before, you''ll recognize a lot of the dynamics of that series'' play in here. That doesn''t make it bad to me - just familiar. The one thing I...'),
(N'Robert', N'Walker', N'robert.walker9951@example.com', '2014-07-29', 5, N'amazing'),
(N'Steven', N'Bailey', N'steven.bailey8330@example.net', '2014-07-29', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Jacob', N'Carter', N'jacob.carter7036@example.org', '2014-07-29', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Alexander', N'Garcia', N'alexander.garcia6102@example.com', '2014-07-29', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Emily', N'Henderson', N'emily.henderson4750@example.com', '2014-07-29', 5, N'What an amazing game this truly is. I love all the new twists they have done with racing underwater, gliding, anti gravity and vehicle customization. All the tracks are very good as well. The only minor complaints I have is it is much harder to get good items in this game, while the computer gets good items the entire game add that with the higher CPU difficulty on 150CC makes it extremely tough to get 3 gold stars on 150 CC. other then that it is an almost perfect game and well worth purchasing a Wii U for this game alone!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Gray', N'michelle.gray5421@example.org', '2014-07-29', 5, N'The new vita fits very snugly. Thank goodness for the finger holes to dig it out when I want to. LIke the little pockets for cartridges and memory. Good job amazon.'),
(N'David', N'Patel', N'david.patel8020@example.org', '2014-07-29', 5, N'Smells a little funny at first but works 100% and is great for storing the 3DS. Hard to find a better case for the price!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Hill', N'deborah.hill9927@example.com', '2014-07-29', 4, N'I love this game a lot more than I thought I would. Admittedly, I am not a "die hard" Mario Kart fan. I remember playing on my cousin''s SNES sometimes when we were kids, and that was a lot of fun. I own the Wii version now, but did not stay interested in it enough to progress very far when it came to unlocking things (the over abundance of the blue shell really made it discouraging and frustrating for me). That has been my only experience with Mario Kart until now. Mario Kart 8 has exceeded all my expectations. I am so hooked on this game! I''ve unlocked all the characters, racetracks, and over half of the vehicle parts. Working on getting all the stamps also. The level of customization in the game is awesome. Not only do you pick a character, you have a choice of many different karts and bikes, tires, and gliders. The combinations are endless! The items are way more balanced out compared to MK Wii. That freaking blue shell is more of a rarity. Racers at the back of the pack still...'),
(N'Karen', N'Ortiz', N'karen.ortiz3495@example.com', '2014-07-30', 5, N'One of the best games ever made top 10 rpg of all time'),
(N'Nadia', N'Hill', N'nadia.hill4281@example.com', '2014-07-30', 5, N'I have been actively playing for Skyrim for months as a casual gamer. I don''t play many other games on a regular basis because I have lost interest in gaming some years ago. Besides Skyrim, there just wasn''t any game that kept me going, in terms of gaming enthusiasm and motivation. But now, I am putting Skyrim away as a new contender has arrived in my man-cave along with my PS4 gaming console. The Last of Us is a beautiful game, displaying at 1080p. The game play is very smooth and it looks like a series of cut-scenes while I control my DualShock 4 controller. And speking of DC 4 controller, it is a big step up from the previous DualShock 3 controller. The learning curve can somewhat steep at first, if you''re a casual gamer like myself. But once you get the hang of it, The Last of Us is a joyride. This game has not bore me yet, unlike many other titles I have played for my PS3 and Xbox 360. And as much as it provided me with hours of entertainment, Skyrim was beginning to get a...'),
(N'Ashley', N'Brown', N'ashley.brown5087@example.org', '2014-07-30', 3, N'I don''t have many bad things to say besides that the game glitched and buffered as I journeyed around town. The story wasn''t awful, just ok. It was also a little shorter than I expected, which caused me to lose interest while playing. Not much of a challenge either. Just an ok game overall.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Kelly', N'deborah.kelly7229@example.org', '2014-07-30', 5, N'Excellent will shop again'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Wright', N'rebecca.wright3284@example.org', '2014-07-30', 5, N'this game runs even more beautifully on the ps4. and even looks better. deff worth the buy ...they also have a 30 framerate lock on it or people to test ans see what the ps3 version is like but running at 60 frames at 1080p is so much better'),
(N'Nadia', N'Kumar', N'nadia.kumar6121@example.net', '2014-07-30', 1, N'Guess I didn''t read or search long enough. It arrived and I found it had to be bought, AGAIN, online at Steam, at twice the price, in order to use it.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wang', N'jacqueline.wang1628@example.org', '2014-07-30', 5, N'great game'),
(N'George', N'Rogers', N'george.rogers3136@example.net', '2014-07-30', 5, N'Thank you arrived safely!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Collins', N'kimberly.collins3888@example.net', '2014-07-30', 5, N'verygood skin fitgoid grip and prevent my controller from scratches.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Sanders', N'ravi.sanders3481@example.net', '2014-07-31', 3, N'Its like being Robocop! Then again what is going on with the plot? Alien invasion? Really? Crysis 3 is the video game equivalent of Kate Upton. Top heavy but ultimately unsatisfying on any sort of intellectual level.'),
(N'Brian', N'Anderson', N'brian.anderson4329@example.net', '2014-07-31', 5, N'A classic game'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Parker', N'hiroshi.parker7682@example.org', '2014-07-31', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Scott', N'Gomez', N'scott.gomez3399@example.net', '2014-07-31', 5, N'made a GREAT Gift'),
(N'Walter', N'Roberts', N'walter.roberts2599@example.org', '2014-07-31', 5, N'The movie these are based on was simply not good. I would go so far as to say the movie was boring. Because of that I wasn''t expecting much and this was one of the last infinity sets we picked up. I am happy to say it is one of the best sets and it is lots of fun. I recommend this one more than I would recommend cars or monsters university and it is right up there with pirates of the Caribbean.'),
(N'Edward', N'Allen', N'edward.allen7293@example.com', '2014-07-31', 4, N'Secret Code: Go to career mode, select "Start New Career" and type in "The Beast" to fight as the green boxer.'),
(N'Sofia', N'White', N'sofia.white5186@example.com', '2014-07-31', 5, N'It works and delivery was here before time.'),
(N'Donna', N'Adams', N'donna.adams6885@example.org', '2014-07-31', 4, N'I am very picky about headphones, and I actually liked these much better than I expected. The primary reason being that they are quite comfortable and the drivers are not too close too the ear. There are times when headphones are necessary. I like to play Rocksmith but the rest of my household doesn''t like when I play it. This way I bother no one. I''ve got a lot of headphones, many of them very high end. I keep changing them out because to me headphones are essentially uncomfortable. What I like about these is that with the 60mm drivers the headset is bigger and the drivers are further from my ear. This makes me able to wear them longer than almost any other head set. The external control and the ability to change sound types without software is a clever idea. Unfortunately I don''t care all that much for the processing. It doesn''t do much except add a slight layer of artificiality to the sound. I prefer the headphones plugged straight into the audio jack of my MacBook Air. Overall...'),
(N'Amy', N'Jimenez', N'amy.jimenez4432@example.net', '2014-07-31', 3, N'Its ok'),
(N'Amy', N'Jimenez', N'amy.jimenez4432@example.net', '2014-07-31', 4, N'FUN!'),
(N'Ivan', N'Hall', N'ivan.hall1725@example.org', '2014-07-31', 5, N'The Game works great my sister in law loves this game.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Myers', N'ravi.myers2123@example.org', '2014-07-31', 3, N'okay'),
(N'Ravi', N'Myers', N'ravi.myers2123@example.org', '2014-07-31', 1, N'This has got to be one of the worst games I have ever played on PS3. Definitely not worth buying. Throw it away!!!!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Morris', N'jeffrey.morris6409@example.com', '2014-07-31', 4, N'Fun game but I was hoping for a World Cup career setting :('),
(N'Cheryl', N'Kelly', N'cheryl.kelly8488@example.com', '2014-07-31', 4, N'I expected something . . . . . . more. . I am torn between Forza Motorsport 3 and 4 when it comes to game play. I really enjoyed the linear season play as I worked my way up the ranks. You lose that in FM4. The added tracks, the enhanced graphics and the massive number of cars that I get to choose from in game and on XBOX Live are wonderful. It gets 4/5 stars because FM4 falls on its face when it comes to season play.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Nelson', N'jennifer.nelson9028@example.com', '2014-07-31', 5, N'Awesome game to play with your kids. Very fun puzzles and lots of characters.'),
(N'Luis', N'Ramirez', N'luis.ramirez3507@example.com', '2014-07-31', 5, N'These are used now with the older xbox 360. My son will ue it occasionally now and still uses these parts. They are important to play without using batteries over and over and the controller was well made. He wanted an extra controller for friends and this was a goo purchase'),
(N'Luis', N'Ramirez', N'luis.ramirez3507@example.com', '2014-07-31', 5, N'Purchase for my son a while ago he loves xbox games and all accessories except for their head set which breaks in no time.'),
(N'Amy', N'Hughes', N'amy.hughes3753@example.org', '2014-07-31', 5, N'This is another amazing game in the Smash Bros. series with cool stages, great controls, and amazing characters like Mario, Link, Captain Falcon and Fox. It also has cool new characters like Mr. Game and Watch, Dr. Mario, Marth, and Zelda/Sheik. I just wish the price was lower. I know it''s a classic and amazing game but it doesn''t need to be $40+ dollars. Luckily, I got my copy for a good low price. Overall, it''s an amazing[but expensive] game that I would recommend for any Smasher.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ward', N'jessica.ward1047@example.net', '2014-07-31', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Barbara', N'Martinez', N'barbara.martinez6940@example.net', '2014-07-31', 4, N'codes arrived fast and worked'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Watson', N'hiroshi.watson2058@example.org', '2014-07-31', 5, N'Every thing as expected'),
(N'Jerry', N'Gomez', N'jerry.gomez4631@example.net', '2014-08-01', 4, N'Great game, it''s a never game must buy! Seller was fast with shipment!'),
(N'Anna', N'Bell', N'anna.bell2368@example.com', '2014-08-01', 4, N'I feel like this camera adds more than 10 lbs. Certainly not flattering, at all. But still does a great job with the play room games.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Powell', N'ivan.powell4748@example.net', '2014-08-01', 5, N'My granddaughter loved everything she received. It was great doing business with you, thank you very much.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Powell', N'ivan.powell4748@example.net', '2014-08-01', 5, N'Thank you for having this available. I was amazed with the fast shipping experience and the price was perfect. Thank you.'),
(N'Donald', N'Morgan', N'donald.morgan2475@example.com', '2014-08-01', 5, N'buen producto'),
(N'Omar', N'Thompson', N'omar.thompson9670@example.com', '2014-08-01', 1, N'Worst game ever made!!!!'),
(N'Omar', N'Thompson', N'omar.thompson9670@example.com', '2014-08-01', 5, N'If you need virtual surround, this unit will deliver! Using it on my X12 but can be used for multiple applications. Recommend this item!!!'),
(N'Walter', N'Gonzalez', N'walter.gonzalez6415@example.com', '2014-08-01', 3, N'Game is fun but has a very limited song list. You can double that list but you have to pay for each song you add. So, it is a bit of a scam. I would say buy it if you can find it in a bargain bin somewhere but don''t pay the full price for it.'),
(N'Brian', N'Anderson', N'brian.anderson8216@example.com', '2014-08-01', 5, N'Favorite AC yet. Pirate Samurais (or Samurai Pirates?) are great for storytelling. Never thought I''d write that.'),
(N'Noah', N'Mitchell', N'noah.mitchell7118@example.com', '2014-08-01', 5, N'a perfect game just got more perfect with 1080p and 60 fps. If you never played it on PS3 and have a PS4 I highly recommend you buy it.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Ross', N'rebecca.ross9415@example.com', '2014-08-01', 5, N'These stick covers help with getting a better grip on the R and L stick completely- no slipping of your thumbs with these little devils. I find it most helpful during EA UFC game, however it just has a great feeling overall.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Collins', N'jacqueline.collins3150@example.net', '2014-08-01', 5, N'Amazing!'),
(N'Matthew', N'Carter', N'matthew.carter4293@example.org', '2014-08-01', 5, N'Item was just what I wanted. Good transaction.'),
(N'Kyle', N'King', N'kyle.king7073@example.org', '2014-08-01', 3, N'First battlefield game I ever got in to. It''s ok. Nothing special.'),
(N'Mary', N'Wright', N'mary.wright3532@example.net', '2014-08-01', 4, N'gift'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Lewis', N'rebecca.lewis9193@example.org', '2014-08-01', 5, N'Great game .'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Lewis', N'rebecca.lewis9193@example.org', '2014-08-01', 5, N'Best video game ever . Thank you !'),
(N'Nathan', N'Cook', N'nathan.cook7560@example.com', '2014-08-01', 3, N'A and Y replacements were a bit tight, and did not press and release well. X, B, and Guide replacements were a good fit and have action as good as the original buttons.'),
(N'Janet', N'Howard', N'janet.howard1125@example.com', '2014-08-01', 1, N'I bought this to save money but after two weeks of playing and saving games to my hard drive it went bad. The hard drive does not allow you to play games and will inially cause your x box to freeze.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Smith', N'shirley.smith9846@example.net', '2014-08-01', 5, N'Lets start by saying those one star reviews should be falling stars out of here! I bought for ps3 and loved it! Don''t regret buying again for ps4. Wow!!'),
(N'Judith', N'Wilson', N'judith.wilson9991@example.net', '2014-08-01', 4, N'The sequel (if it can be called that) to Sonic Adventure 2 Battle. It''s also the beginning of Shadow''s fall from grace as well as Knuckles''. It would be in Shadow''s regard as I''ll explain shortly. The game play was pretty unique getting to control 3 different characters at once, the levels were fun and challenging (though repetitive since it''s the same ones for each team), the graphics and animation were better, the camera angle still floundered a bit in some cases but was better, the plot however I feel was lackluster compared to SA2 Battle. Metal Sonic somehow makes a return (unless Eggman simply built another one and this one betrayed him) and is actually the mastermind behind it all. As I mentioned in my SA2 Battle review, fans were excited over Shadow''s return however this time Shadow is not the original, just a robot clone. After all, Dr. Eggman had access to his grandfather''s studies and works, why wouldn''t he clone the Ultimate Life Form? Shadow''s role from here on out...'),
(N'Lauren', N'Okonkwo', N'lauren.okonkwo5335@example.com', '2014-08-02', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Angela', N'Cox', N'angela.cox4090@example.org', '2014-08-02', 5, N'The controller feels good in the hands, and with playtesting, we find the controls to be very reliable and responsive. This is true even of the D-pad, which is a frequent source of problems with other controllers. The price is very reasonable, too; we''re going to complete our set of four, so we can all have a good controller for those 4-player games!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Edwards', N'andrew.edwards2797@example.com', '2014-08-02', 5, N'Fast delivery, product quality is very good, very happy shopping!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Thompson', N'ashley.thompson9806@example.org', '2014-08-02', 5, N'Very fun game! It can get kind of boring(for me at least) playing this game by yourself after you''ve put in a decent amount of hours but it''s always fun playing(building) this game with more people. Definitely recommend having this in your game collection!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ruiz', N'michelle.ruiz8298@example.net', '2014-08-02', 4, N'Interesting and challenging.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Hughes', N'melissa.hughes6296@example.org', '2014-08-02', 5, N'This is such a cute game! It has all four season, although they only last for 7 or so days and all of the towns from other expansion packs are updated to feature the seasons content. They have festivals for every seasons as well as new activities and home decorating/building content.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Morales', N'samantha.morales6376@example.org', '2014-08-02', 3, N'it ok'),
(N'Janet', N'Thompson', N'janet.thompson8113@example.org', '2014-08-02', 4, N'I am a battlefield online fan for almost three years now. I loved the story mode from battlefield 3 and bad company 2. But this one is too shallow and doesn''t continue the story from previous games. As for the multuplayer, there were a few bugs that kept a bad impression for a few months, but now that they are gone, it feels awesome. Best FPS online multiplayer out there.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Stewart', N'ashley.stewart6563@example.com', '2014-08-02', 5, N'Excellent product. Fast shipping. Highly recommended!'),
(N'Karen', N'Evans', N'karen.evans3571@example.com', '2014-08-02', 5, N'No problems'),
(N'Kofi', N'Parker', N'kofi.parker5429@example.org', '2014-08-02', 5, N'I ran my PS3 for 5 hours straight, the temperature in my house got up to 82, and for the first time this summer my PS3''s internal fan didn''t go into turbo mode. This is an excellent product that I would recommend to any owner of an old school PS3.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Davis', N'kyle.davis8751@example.org', '2014-08-02', 5, N'works great beats game stop prices'),
(N'Ashley', N'Webb', N'ashley.webb8716@example.com', '2014-08-03', 5, N'Definitely a well designed game that anyone can play. If your looking for a shooter for the younger kids but don''t want to let them play Call of Duty get this. No blood and gore. Very cartoon like.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Richardson', N'brenda.richardson3389@example.com', '2014-08-03', 4, N'I never owned an original Xbox so I can''t tell you how this version compares to the original version. However, some screenshots I''ve seen show that they at least did a pretty decent job upgrading it to HD. I mainly bought this game because I almost always have to play all the games in a series, if they''re on a console I own, unless it''s obvious that I need to pass up one of the chapters. So basically, I bought this because I wanted to play Fable 2 and 3 but I wanted to know all the backstory, etc. I still haven''t played 2 or 3 but they just looked like more mature games and this one looks more like a kid''s game. I was pleasantly surprised that I found it very enjoyable. The graphics are a bit cartoonish but I can get past that if the game overall is good. Afterall, I love the Ratchet and Clank series and they have that same kind of graphics. As far as gameplay, I found the controls to be a bit hard to get used to but I managed well enough and it was pretty much like a lot of other...'),
(N'Ashley', N'Sullivan', N'ashley.sullivan5090@example.net', '2014-08-03', 1, N'Game is for very young kids onle. Will not entertain the average gamer.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Kowalski', N'marcus.kowalski4581@example.net', '2014-08-03', 3, N'It was nothing like original SH Series, Not for people looking for Nostalgic HD'),
(N'Eric', N'Rogers', N'eric.rogers1829@example.com', '2014-08-03', 5, N'We got this several months ago to keep a new set of controllers ready for our Wii U. I was very happy it is available in black to match the new controllers as we have another charger for a Wii attached to another TV and those controllers and charger are white. Nice to have a way to keep things organized! Anyway as with all these chargers (at least all the ones I have used) it is a bit tricky to line up the charge pins for connection but the LEDs on the front of the unit let you know when connection is made and a little jiggling usually gets the job done. Of course, if you remove the wrist strap every time I''m sure connection would be easy - but who wants to have that hassle! Overall, highly recommended'),
(N'Debra', N'Rogers', N'debra.rogers9368@example.com', '2014-08-03', 4, N'I bought these controllers after I bought a GCN. They arrived in the mail on schedule, and after that I tested both out. First thing, the overall condition of both differed, and While they don''t look 100%, they both played very nicely, but while I was playing a game like smash bros melee, one of the controllers didn''t register the Y-Button right away, so I had to press it in a little m'),
(N'Brandon', N'King', N'brandon.king8494@example.com', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Excellent!!!'),
(N'Jose', N'Raghunathan', N'jose.raghunathan6673@example.com', '2014-08-04', 5, N'awesome game. new levels keep you on your toes and sometime get frustated,but it''s worth it'),
(N'Jose', N'Raghunathan', N'jose.raghunathan6673@example.com', '2014-08-04', 5, N'LIFESAVER,EASY AND GUICK,DON''T HAVE TO STOP TO RECHARGS LAWAYS HAVE ONE READY. THANKS'),
(N'Jonathan', N'James', N'jonathan.james7330@example.org', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Get it'),
(N'William', N'Okonkwo', N'william.okonkwo2034@example.org', '2014-08-04', 5, N'The first game purchased for our kids new Xbox One. I haven''t played it because it is summertime and they never get off the game system. It is a hit with the boys whether they are playing alone or in a 2 player game. The martial arts fights are realistic to say the least and the graphics are unforgettably good. They are just beginning to play online after the first few days of using it, but so far they are holding their own against the online crowd. You can create your own fighter, use a precreated one and change easily. This is going to be one of their all-time favorites, I can tell. You can hear them yell as they battle each other or online enemies.'),
(N'Peter', N'Moore', N'peter.moore7928@example.org', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Great little toy the kids love it because it''s a special color. Although the character doesn''t show up in the game as all gold.'),
(N'Emily', N'Hughes', N'emily.hughes8911@example.net', '2014-08-04', 4, N'Came in nice condition fast. Worked without any cleaning and was cheap. Its a very fun game, and I would buy again.'),
(N'Emily', N'Hughes', N'emily.hughes8911@example.net', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Does what its said to do and is high quality.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Roberts', N'kenneth.roberts2721@example.net', '2014-08-04', 5, N'It works.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Rodriguez', N'gregory.rodriguez8715@example.com', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Love the story, good graphics and awesome battle system.'),
(N'Karen', N'Coleman', N'karen.coleman7912@example.net', '2014-08-04', 5, N'For the price, these can''t be beat. I bought a couple, to use with my black ps3 remotes. Great value, and they work and fit very well with the controller. Worth the purchase.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Gray', N'ethan.gray5018@example.org', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Muy bueno'),
(N'Paul', N'Garcia', N'paul.garcia1064@example.net', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Bought two years ago! Still going strong and working as it''s supposed to! VERY happy with this XBox! :)'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Barnes', N'evelyn.barnes3352@example.org', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Great game for anyone new to the xbox one or the series goes through a past of the 2 other games and is easy to pick up on the controls the gralphics are beautiful I have had it scence last christmas and it is still amazing and a grat game for easy and fun achievements'),
(N'Gary', N'King', N'gary.king2498@example.net', '2014-08-04', 5, N'Happy'),
(N'Mateo', N'Chen', N'mateo.chen6589@example.com', '2014-08-04', 5, N'nice history excelente game I recommended to everybody because the graphics, the sound, everything is great'),
(N'Laura', N'Richardson', N'laura.richardson2456@example.net', '2014-08-05', 1, N'I don''t like this game.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Jack', N'Alvarez', N'jack.alvarez8692@example.org', '2014-08-05', 5, N'Was skeptic coming from AC III story but this game exceeded my expectations. This game was a breath of fresh air coming from the turd of a game that AC III was. This game will provide you with countless hours of entertainment and is worth the buy.'),
(N'Betty', N'Wright', N'betty.wright5439@example.org', '2014-08-05', 5, N'May daughter read the entire set within a week. We need MORE!!!!'),
(N'William', N'Morris', N'william.morris1627@example.com', '2014-08-05', 5, N'cable was good'),
(N'Nathan', N'Russell', N'nathan.russell4152@example.org', '2014-08-05', 4, N'Crass and hilarious. Awesome.'),
(N'Amara', N'Gray', N'amara.gray5957@example.org', '2014-08-05', 5, N'Second best game ever made! Only one better is the original if you ask me. Brings me back to when I was a kid.'),
(N'Larry', N'Parker', N'larry.parker5625@example.com', '2014-08-05', 5, N'Looks and works great'),
(N'Brenda', N'Thompson', N'brenda.thompson4215@example.net', '2014-08-05', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Donna', N'Flores', N'donna.flores2214@example.com', '2014-08-05', 3, N'A small background on the story is that it revolves around a rebellion to free Ancaria from a Dark Elf named Zane. The world is in need of a group of heroes in order to accomplish what others evidently cannot. This is where you come in. There is nothing really that special about the story and it mainly serves as nothing more than a cheap gimmick to help fuel the players progression. Every now and then the characters will try and pawn off a series of jokes as an attempt to spice things up, but many seem out of place and simply aren''t that funny. The story is level based, but I don''t want to spoil how many levels there are or how long they are. I will simply say that the game is certainly not as long as Sacred 2. The world map for Sacred 3 is basically a level selection menu. There is a path in which the player travels along nodes, and each of these nodes is a level. Some of them pertain to the story and others are simply a small side area. It is also worth noting that the game is...'),
(N'Nicole', N'Torres', N'nicole.torres8285@example.com', '2014-08-05', 2, N'This is far beyond different from a Sacred game that I''ve played. It feels more like a cheap arcade hack & slash with annoying voice acting. I best describe and summarize this video game as, "boring". The first person to review this compares it to a "watered down Diablo 3", this is true. I think its a combination of a watered down Diablo 3 with a hint of extremely watered down Gauntlet Seven Sorrows. The gameplay and game mechanics are what contribute to what I find most unattractive. The game is more like an arcade game. You basically go through a level and then after that you can upgrade your armor / skills / spirits / buy items. There is no autosave function between long levels, so if you need to go somewhere , you would have to restart from the very beginning of the level. You can''t actually pause the game even in offline mode since the game is always real-time. There are no actual "Game Options" in which you may want to change some of the settings. All you can change is the...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Edwards', N'nathan.edwards7481@example.net', '2014-08-05', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Wei', N'Rodriguez', N'wei.rodriguez3715@example.com', '2014-08-05', 2, N'I really enjoyed the first two ghost recon games for the 360, but this one I had trouble enjoying. The plot feels forced and the squad orders don''t feel the same as the last two. It''s more of a shooter on rails to me. The kinect is gimmicky and works intermittently.'),
(N'Edward', N'Kim', N'edward.kim9533@example.org', '2014-08-05', 5, N'Respawn entertainment is made up of the guys who did the late great Call of Duty and Modern Warfare games. They got themselves fired after MW2 (my personal favorite) and so a few years later this is their next game. Wow, what a blast this game is. The charm of Infinity Ward/Respawn games is how superbly the first-person perspective is used to thrill the gamer. Little details are taken care of, subtle shifts in perspectives, so that you can truly feel like you are in a world and not just a cutscene. In this game, you can jump and run and gun like a maniac, storm over the battlefield at the helm of this crazy-powerful suit of armor, this game is the closest game in a long time that feels like flying. As a pilot, you''re just a human, but you have a little jump pack which lets you run along walls. You can also climb up walls and up ledges making for some impressive verticality. What does this mean? it means that you''re never boxed in. You are always a window away from freedom. Everyone...'),
(N'Samantha', N'Gomez', N'samantha.gomez9995@example.org', '2014-08-05', 5, N'Better than the 1000 model in almost every way. Screen difference is hardly noticeable to the normal player, and the other advancements more than compensate.'),
(N'Steven', N'Anderson', N'steven.anderson3652@example.com', '2014-08-06', 5, N'Kids Love It'),
(N'Noah', N'Robinson', N'noah.robinson2725@example.net', '2014-08-06', 5, N'nice set of games'),
(N'Marcus', N'Raghunathan', N'marcus.raghunathan8175@example.net', '2014-08-06', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Angela', N'Taylor', N'angela.taylor1997@example.org', '2014-08-06', 4, N'The best price ever for a first-party accessory. I don''t use the camera function of this device much, but it''s picture quality is not terrible: grainy, yet bright. Granted, my living room isn''t the best lit, so while I say the camera picture is grainy, you could interpret that to mean that it''s excellent in low-light environments. Like I said, though, I don''t use the camera functions. I bought this camera because I am sick and tired of wearing a bluetooth headset just to yell at foo''s on the Internet. I solely use this camera for the microphone functions. I can speak, people can hear me, I can hear them (out of my TV speakers). There doesn''t seem to be much feedback or echoing, but that will depend on how far away you are from the TV, the acoustic properties of the room you''re in, and how far away your speakers are from the camera. My only complaint has to lie with Sony, who, through a past firmware update, limited the microphone volume of their first-party devices (camera and...'),
(N'Mary', N'Jackson', N'mary.jackson3645@example.com', '2014-08-06', 5, N'Love the sims! All great additions to the game.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Hall', N'ronald.hall6189@example.net', '2014-08-06', 5, N'This game is great! I love the new balanced gameplay.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Khan', N'andrew.khan8477@example.net', '2014-08-06', 5, N'I''ve played this game over and over at least 30 times and the magic never ends. It''s fun, emotional, action packed and an all around good time! Especially the interaction between classic and newer Disney characters, gotta love it! I recommend this game to everyone and anyone!'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Young', N'hiroshi.young3171@example.net', '2014-08-06', 5, N'This game is fun, i love it, managing your city as a mayor, building your own home, too many things to mention.'),
(N'Jack', N'Thomas', N'jack.thomas4413@example.net', '2014-08-06', 5, N'Great Value for a great seires, I hope this is the last one. Capcom it''s time to move the seires forward. The new fighters (althought they are not new just more of a reentrie) they all play well and feel great among the rest.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Davis', N'benjamin.davis1104@example.net', '2014-08-06', 4, N'I bought this one for a few dollars more than the one pictured with the Arabic writing, assuming that was some sort of fake. I got this one in the mail and it turned out to be the exact same thing! Some Arabic words but it works. Hopefully it''s legit. Microsoft didn''t say anything yet and it''s been 3 months, so it must just be a forgein card . . .'),
(N'James', N'Richardson', N'james.richardson4449@example.org', '2014-08-06', 5, N'Very well!!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Phillips', N'joshua.phillips9987@example.com', '2014-08-07', 4, N'ok game'),
(N'Matthew', N'Edwards', N'matthew.edwards8814@example.org', '2014-08-07', 5, N'STEP DAUGHTER LOVES IT'),
(N'Jacob', N'Wood', N'jacob.wood3696@example.net', '2014-08-07', 4, N'Great series! Just wish its was the collector''s edition.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Foster', N'jeffrey.foster4998@example.net', '2014-08-07', 5, N'Great classic'),
(N'Omar', N'White', N'omar.white6489@example.net', '2014-08-07', 5, N'Cats and Dogs and maybe a horse'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Lopez', N'cynthia.lopez6823@example.net', '2014-08-07', 5, N'I have come back to this game after a few years. This time around I played it with the final Community Patch and on a new, fast machine. This combo has cured complaints about stuttering and crashes. The patch also makes the game positively beautiful. After playing Oblivion and Two Worlds and Risen and Skyrim and others, I have to say that this (and Gothic 2) are, for me, the best RPG games ever made. There are are a number of reasons for this, from the quality of the rendering to the lack of prissy constraints (like having to sell potions to alchemists and so on) to the lack of hand holding (no arrows pointing to a destination, barely a mention of the destination actually :). The maps are crappy but in a good way, you are on your own except for major destinations. In short, it is a game for adults. You have to focus. The interesting thing with Gothic (1, 2 &3) is that money actually matters. You can''t assume that you can afford a better armor or bow, you have to save up. That is...'),
(N'Deborah', N'Foster', N'deborah.foster3091@example.org', '2014-08-07', 4, N'Man, the G402 Hyperion Fury Gaming Mouse is one mean looking mouse. It has a really cool pulsating blue glow where the G is, and a very futuristic looking design that looks like it could take off on its own power and smash a hole right through my apartment. The video on Logitech''s site proclaims "cutting edge science" and makes it sound like they''ve solved the world''s greatest problem. It''s obvious Logitech spent a lot of money on the CG animations, making it slick, zoomy, and looking like something out of the recent TRON film. It''s all very fancy. You should watch it for laughs. The back of the box has some silly buzzwords which nobody knows what they mean: "exclusive Delta Zero Technology", "Fusion Engine", and "Opti-Shift". Marketing hyperbole aside, this is just a fancy optical mouse, right? Yes, but a mouse purpose-built with some awesome bells and whistles, designed specifically for hardcore FPS gamers, where speed and precision are paramount. The mouse has a rated 1 ms...'),
(N'Raymond', N'Perry', N'raymond.perry3514@example.com', '2014-08-07', 5, N'One of all time great Star Wars games'),
(N'Kevin', N'Phillips', N'kevin.phillips4745@example.net', '2014-08-07', 5, N'Thank you for your business. The product was just what I wanted.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Walker', N'marcus.walker7533@example.net', '2014-08-08', 5, N'Nice cover'),
(N'Luis', N'Richardson', N'luis.richardson5385@example.net', '2014-08-08', 4, N'A great value. Game play is fun.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Cruz', N'sofia.cruz6165@example.com', '2014-08-08', 5, N'Simple to use and mount. It fits on all of the TVs I have. A really thick older flat screen and some new slim LED models.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Chen', N'andrew.chen2193@example.com', '2014-08-08', 5, N'one of the best thing i bought for my computer Xbox 360 controllers are better then PlayStation controllers'),
(N'Michael', N'Scott', N'michael.scott7676@example.org', '2014-08-08', 5, N'Excellent! Thanks.'),
(N'Walter', N'Campbell', N'walter.campbell1243@example.net', '2014-08-08', 3, N'it is fun to play.'),
(N'Walter', N'Campbell', N'walter.campbell1243@example.net', '2014-08-08', 3, N'i like this game.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Hughes', N'deborah.hughes6004@example.org', '2014-08-08', 5, N'Good game for this platform, lots to do.'),
(N'Amy', N'Jackson', N'amy.jackson8282@example.org', '2014-08-08', 4, N'After having played the first Socom game ,Zipper has steadily made a downward spiral in their Socom series video games. Now if Zipper would only start making their Socom games like the first Socom game,only make Boomer smarter an less suicidal.'),
(N'Eric', N'Johnson', N'eric.johnson1007@example.org', '2014-08-08', 4, N'Not much to say about it, other than its a nice "cute" case for your ps vita. It fits pretty snug, doesnt have much space for anything other than your handheld. The bobblehead is a + if you like to collect stuff. Purchased this for my sister, she likes it.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Butler', N'patrick.butler3933@example.com', '2014-08-08', 5, N'Its a PlayStation brand controller. You can''t get a better one.'),
(N'George', N'Turner', N'george.turner9033@example.com', '2014-08-09', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Alvarez', N'jessica.alvarez7293@example.net', '2014-08-09', 5, N'Fits in my 3ds like the original on. but it''s a different color. I can know if it''s lost or not'),
(N'Shirley', N'Ivanov', N'shirley.ivanov5232@example.net', '2014-08-09', 5, N'Just a wonderful game! Plays well on Windows 7 with 6 megs of ram. This is the way games were meant to be played. I''ve played many of these and this is the first time I''ve ever had one, you can configure any-way you desire; from difficult and no clues and difficult hidden object sections, to easy clues and sparkles on everything you need, and easier to find objects. The game is a bit dark all through it but that''s what they wanted. It was a great game because I actually had FUN playing it, and the difficulty even at the highest level was enjoyable. Some of the games today are SOOO hard, they''re NOT FUN anymore, but this one makes you think while it still delivers a lot of enjoyment while doing it. The puzzles not very difficult, and everyone can play this as it also comes with a "TELL-ALL" strategy guide. Graphics are very good....sounds are great....music is okay. A bit short for me but okay. I would recommend it to everyone that likes mystery hidden/object formats. If anyone...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Young', N'nathan.young4861@example.com', '2014-08-09', 4, N'Great game. But the single player campaign is short. Great graphics and story. A must if you are looking for great fist person shooters.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Wilson', N'nancy.wilson7079@example.org', '2014-08-09', 3, N'Had its issues in the beginning. The single player still doesn''t work but the multi-player works and is a blast. All the bad reviews say nothing about the fact they did fix this games mulitplayer.'),
(N'Gary', N'Reed', N'gary.reed4790@example.org', '2014-08-09', 5, N'great'),
(N'Jack', N'Gray', N'jack.gray2943@example.com', '2014-08-09', 5, N'Kids love this game'),
(N'Marcus', N'Perry', N'marcus.perry9578@example.net', '2014-08-09', 5, N'I only have the demo, but in my opinion it is better then FIFA 14. This game is also very realistic with the fouls, penalties, expressions, and the introduction to the game. My favorite part is the commentaries, it seems like they are always Captain Obvious. For example, if I slide tackle someone and he falls down screaming in agony, they say something like "Oh, that''s probably a foul right there." I like how they added new features such as the stadiums. you can either choose Estdio do Maracan or other stadiums based in So Paulo. EA Sports also added 1 new difficulty, beginner. It is useful for practicing your skills or just getting high scores (My highest is 11-0 Brazil vs. New Zealand but my friend managed to score 20 goals in one game.). I bet playing online is a nightmare, whenever I play on professional-legendary my player has no room to move so my option is to either shoot or pass. I can''t actually pass; All my teammates always seem to be behind me. The only complaint I have...'),
(N'Amy', N'Sanders', N'amy.sanders6545@example.org', '2014-08-09', 5, N'uh its mario kart cant go wrong with that. online is fun and keeps the replay higher. i just wish there was a track editor but oh well still 5 star.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Jones', N'jennifer.jones4365@example.net', '2014-08-09', 3, N'The graphics look amazing on the PS4. I just have no clue what the hype is about?! I finished it for the story and the voice acting, that is the only good thing about this game. It is insanely repetitive. Go get this ladder, go get this plank, go get this pallet, go move this dumpster.... then sneak past these enemies, pick up this brick or bottle, then shoot these zombies in the head.... It just repeats the same process after every scene, but with new detailed areas, but it is the same boring concept through-out. The AI isn''t that intelligent even on the difficult settings. Price wise this is worth it if you want to finish this and the DLC in a couple weeks. Otherwise I played through the game twice and can''t bring myself to do it anymore. Once you finished the story and maxed out Joel, you will probably let this game collect dust or sell it.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Gutierrez', N'raymond.gutierrez8919@example.com', '2014-08-09', 1, N'Nope'),
(N'Megan', N'Rodriguez', N'megan.rodriguez4776@example.org', '2014-08-09', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Frank', N'Rivera', N'frank.rivera2450@example.net', '2014-08-09', 5, N'Best platform ever.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Walker', N'aaron.walker7350@example.net', '2014-08-09', 5, N'The game console arrived on time, and the box was in great shape. I was happy there were games built into the console so I didn''t have to buy a ton of games. I would buy this item again if I needed one ever again.'),
(N'Anita', N'Rodriguez', N'anita.rodriguez6635@example.com', '2014-08-10', 5, N'This is my favorite action RPG on the Wii. The story and characters are outstanding. The combat is fun and engaging, if still imperfect. There are fun and interesting optional side quests and the New Game + option allows for expanded opportunities. I highly recommend this game to action RPG fans.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Flores', N'carolyn.flores5637@example.com', '2014-08-10', 5, N'great product, fast service'),
(N'Michael', N'Rogers', N'michael.rogers3145@example.org', '2014-08-10', 3, N'satisfactory'),
(N'Aisha', N'Baker', N'aisha.baker2250@example.net', '2014-08-10', 5, N'EXCELLENT'),
(N'Debra', N'Hill', N'debra.hill7641@example.org', '2014-08-10', 5, N'The graphics are fantastic, i think even better than AC IV Black Flag. The cinamatic scences are better than AC IV BF, my apinion. I use Win 7 64bit sp1 and there are NO glitches whatsoever unlike what other people say. Honestly i like this game way better than AC IV BF even after beating AC IV 3 times cause i like that game alot to. THIS GAME IS A GREAT BUY!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Nowak', N'kenneth.nowak9464@example.net', '2014-08-10', 5, N'All ok'),
(N'Mei', N'Jackson', N'mei.jackson6626@example.org', '2014-08-10', 5, N'In my Opinion better than ''Heavy Rain'' ! Very nice Story, likeable characters , I didn''t want it to end ! I don''t mind that its Almost like playing through a Movie, it''s different and Easy to Play. i never got stuck and needed to look something up online. I Would definetely recommend this game :)'),
(N'Barbara', N'Moore', N'barbara.moore1888@example.org', '2014-08-10', 3, N'all good...'),
(N'Jack', N'Roberts', N'jack.roberts8041@example.net', '2014-08-10', 5, N'i love this game and i am not a gamer!!'),
(N'Walter', N'Coleman', N'walter.coleman9422@example.com', '2014-08-11', 5, N'Good product and price. Good quality.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ruiz', N'michelle.ruiz1008@example.org', '2014-08-11', 5, N'Resident Evil 2 was my introduction to the Resident Evil franchise and the survival horror genre, so this game means a lot to me. I don''t rate games or movies based on nostalgia, because let''s be honest: some things just don''t age well in the test of time and lose their effect that may have been once powerful in one''s childhood. However, I must say: this still stands out as the best zombie horror game ever made. Best survival horror game ever made? That could be debatable with other strong contenders such as Silent Hill 2 and Dead Space 1. However, as far as zombie/mutated creatures games go, this stands on top. It has numerous jump scares and a great creepy atmosphere that leaves you tense while exploring the abandoned Raccoon City police department. Resident Evil 2 introduces Leon Kennedy and Claire Redfield, who would go on to star in future hit installments Resident Evil 4 and Resident Evil Code: Veronica (respectively speaking). Leon is a rookie cop in Raccoon City and meets...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'James', N'carolyn.james1184@example.com', '2014-08-11', 4, N'This is my first BlazBlue purchase. After renting the previous few games I decided to finally commit to buying the next installment. This one has an impressive roster, the best so far.. the maps look the best they have in any BlazBlue yet with very subtle and awesome details. I would really love to give this game 5 stars.. Buuuuut: The DLC characters to finish the roster seem abit ridiculous at $7.99 a character. Sorry Kokonoe.. you look fun but I''m not taking the bait.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ramos', N'aisha.ramos7442@example.org', '2014-08-11', 3, N'As far as the actually visuals its looks awesome very cool now here''s what sucked: EXTREMELY difficult to align and place Pieces were hard to adhere to on my XL'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Singh', N'kenneth.singh9366@example.org', '2014-08-11', 5, N'Great game for Kids and family time. definitely recommended for moms and dads to jump in and have fun with their kids.'),
(N'Donna', N'Walker', N'donna.walker6577@example.net', '2014-08-11', 5, N'great'),
(N'Peter', N'Jimenez', N'peter.jimenez1492@example.net', '2014-08-11', 5, N'good game'),
(N'James', N'Cruz', N'james.cruz7533@example.net', '2014-08-11', 3, N'I''m writing this review because I want to call attention to the problem I personally experienced with two of my four cables in the set. For some people this will be a non-issue, but for others (particularly those who want to play Smash Bros. Melee), this is a huge, game-breaking problem. These cables seem to have a delay to them. I initially noticed it because I used my Hori Game Pad (which is essentially a GCN controller shaped like a Super Nintendo controller and primarily used for GB/GBA games via the Game Boy Player; it has no control sticks, only a d-pad). I tried to play Super Mario Bros. 3 on the Game Boy Player using the controller. The A button had a delay of approximately .5 seconds, which led to some unnecessary deaths. I then plugged standard first party GCN controllers into the extension cables. Super Smash Bros. was unplayable against anyone using a Wavebird wireless controller because of the delay. As Smash players know, that is a lot of time under those...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Harris', N'amanda.harris6432@example.org', '2014-08-11', 4, N'works great with new battery I bought'),
(N'Emily', N'Cruz', N'emily.cruz9134@example.com', '2014-08-11', 5, N'realy fun game to play'),
(N'Diane', N'Stewart', N'diane.stewart4054@example.net', '2014-08-11', 5, N'Never a problems, pretty much like the second one, don''t like the fact that the binoculars are on right thumb as I''ve hit them occasionally during a fight and was injured....put the dang thing somewhere else as I never use them anyway....anyway, pretty much the same game, better graphics, definitely worth the price as is the DLC I played.....no freezing or any other problem or save problems or anything of the like except the DLC doesn''t save, well some levels save during the session, but not so you can play the same game after turning it off.'),
(N'Noah', N'Stewart', N'noah.stewart6907@example.net', '2014-08-11', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Jerry', N'Wisniewski', N'jerry.wisniewski2114@example.com', '2014-08-11', 5, N'Bought for my husband for his b-day and he loved it. It works great for the rechargeable batteries; I did not try regular "rechargeable batteries"'),
(N'Lauren', N'Singh', N'lauren.singh2459@example.org', '2014-08-11', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Lauren', N'Singh', N'lauren.singh2459@example.org', '2014-08-11', 5, N'cool'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Tanaka', N'jeremy.tanaka9128@example.com', '2014-08-11', 5, N'One of the best 2d platformer EVER. That''s a very high compliment.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Tanaka', N'jeremy.tanaka9128@example.com', '2014-08-11', 5, N'One of the best games available on PS3. It''s underrated and has an interesting alchemy crafting system.'),
(N'Anna', N'Bell', N'anna.bell2368@example.com', '2014-08-12', 4, N'Good game. Got a little repetitive after a bit though, but thankfully you don''t have to do all the side missions.'),
(N'Angela', N'Miller', N'angela.miller1273@example.org', '2014-08-12', 5, N'The most fun, innovative game ive ever played!'),
(N'Janet', N'Ortiz', N'janet.ortiz2602@example.org', '2014-08-12', 5, N'I like the basketball ones. With the bumps. It helps when I play Fight night champion'),
(N'Debra', N'Wang', N'debra.wang6220@example.com', '2014-08-12', 5, N'Great game so far. The graphics are very nice, great voice acting that just immerses you in the game at all times, good controls, so far an amazing game. Definitely worth checking out! I''ve only had a few visual glitches here and there which is a little dissapointing seeing as it is a remastered game but nothing that ruins the overall gameplay.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Price', N'nathan.price2858@example.net', '2014-08-12', 5, N'Gift for Grandson for good grades in school. He absolutely loves this game and plays it constantly.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Ward', N'nadia.ward1357@example.org', '2014-08-12', 5, N'Wonderful game.'),
(N'Charles', N'Robinson', N'charles.robinson5846@example.org', '2014-08-12', 5, N'This is the first video game console I played. It really started gaming with analog sticks. If you want to see what games were like in the 1990''s, just for the sake of old games, get it. There are so many creative games for this. Also, it was the first video game console to use DVD discs! How about that? XD'),
(N'Michael', N'King', N'michael.king7850@example.org', '2014-08-12', 5, N'Game got better!!! 1080p 60fps is perfect. I''m not writing a review because there is already a million by now. Just wanted to give my 2 cents. Still my favorite game ever.'),
(N'Richard', N'Suzuki', N'richard.suzuki4755@example.org', '2014-08-12', 3, N'Everyone seems to be obsessed with lens flair these days. Half the game is staring straight into the sun. Sunglasses did exist in the 1940s. The game would earn a 4.5 out of 5 if not for the blinding light BS that seems to be prevalent in all forms of visual entertainment these days.'),
(N'Noah', N'Sullivan', N'noah.sullivan3961@example.org', '2014-08-13', 5, N'The cable is just right but my problem is getting enough wattage to power the 3DS.'),
(N'Wei', N'Carter', N'wei.carter3990@example.com', '2014-08-13', 3, N'Worked great for about a month then the charger stopped working.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Raghunathan', N'cynthia.raghunathan5876@example.org', '2014-08-13', 5, N'Gorgeousl graphics, game wise. It''s like a movie, really. It has a storyline and it is not just a first person shooter like Call of duty and Destiny. The Last of Us is a Hall of Fame game for players'),
(N'Kyle', N'Bailey', N'kyle.bailey9096@example.com', '2014-08-13', 5, N'Good!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Webb', N'dennis.webb2614@example.net', '2014-08-13', 5, N'The Wii to HDMI converter does exactly as expected. Great product!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Howard', N'kenneth.howard3857@example.net', '2014-08-13', 4, N'Very entertaining! Kids loved it!'),
(N'Eric', N'Allen', N'eric.allen7754@example.org', '2014-08-13', 5, N'Expensive but no regrets here, they are so comfortable that you can spend hours and you wouldn''t notice. I use it with my PS4 and they work great for games and movies. Battery life is great and I like that it will automatically turn off if it detects you aren''t using it, you sometimes forget you are wearing them and get distracted so it is a good feature.'),
(N'Justin', N'Wilson', N'justin.wilson7269@example.net', '2014-08-13', 5, N'Although it seens to be a little vlagile fragile, by the price it worths for sure. Good plug and play. Really good to play games on Nintendo 64 emulator.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Nowak', N'sharon.nowak6970@example.net', '2014-08-13', 1, N'I do not like this game I wish I could have sent it back. That is the way it is some time you get a good one and some times you don''t. It lookes like I didn''t this time'),
(N'Amara', N'Taylor', N'amara.taylor7072@example.org', '2014-08-13', 1, N'As good as Arkham Asylum and City are, this game is equally as bad. From a snooze fest of a story to the dull and uninspired game play, it is an excruciating experience from beginning to end. Game Informer gave this game a 0.75 out of 10.0! The game was so bad that they canceled the planned PS2 version. Thank goodness for that. Let''s not speak of this game again. Ever again.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Kelly', N'barbara.kelly4307@example.com', '2014-08-13', 4, N'Saves stuff what more do you need it to do.'),
(N'Emma', N'Chen', N'emma.chen8591@example.org', '2014-08-13', 5, N'Great mouse that lasts a long time. I have used it game and as an everyday mouse. For 3 months I have not had to change batteries yet. I enjoy using the dpi adjustment especially as a way to quickly change the sensitivity for anyone use my mouse. (I use a very high sensitivity while browsing) Its well made and fits my hand comfortably.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Green', N'sofia.green6215@example.com', '2014-08-13', 4, N'I never really bought this game, but I have played everything this game had to offer via borrowing from a friend. The game itself isn''t too different from MW2 but I love the local features and the Spec Ops! It is what made the game fun for me and my friends. I would only recommend trying this game if you have a few buddies to play it with. But that is honestly my opinion. With Advanced Warfare coming up from the horizon, the choice is completely up to you.'),
(N'Laura', N'Harris', N'laura.harris6114@example.org', '2014-08-14', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ramos', N'cynthia.ramos2692@example.com', '2014-08-14', 5, N'My kids love it - and isn''t that all that matters?'),
(N'Anthony', N'White', N'anthony.white8212@example.net', '2014-08-14', 4, N'reliable cords are always needed and these aren''t but its because my cat loves to eat cords. i have to replace these things to get the data transfer ability but the bit cords transfer energy for some point of time before going dead'),
(N'Eric', N'Williams', N'eric.williams5357@example.org', '2014-08-14', 5, N'Love it! Thank you'),
(N'Daniel', N'Kowalski', N'daniel.kowalski1699@example.org', '2014-08-14', 2, N'A pretty good headset that has issues with crackling noises during PC gaming. The crackling can get so bad that it eventually shuts down the headphones, requiring that you unplug and replug them in to regain sound. I tried many avenues to troubleshoot the problem but nothing ever fixed the issue. I eventually had to replace these headphones with new ones that are not USB.'),
(N'Karen', N'Kumar', N'karen.kumar6769@example.net', '2014-08-14', 5, N'Great simulator'),
(N'Jerry', N'Reyes', N'jerry.reyes4417@example.com', '2014-08-14', 5, N'One of the most fun realistic games out there just like the actual world cup of this year back in June!! great game!! for all video games lovers.....'),
(N'Nadia', N'Torres', N'nadia.torres2902@example.net', '2014-08-14', 5, N'Product as expected'),
(N'Patricia', N'Collins', N'patricia.collins5458@example.net', '2014-08-14', 5, N'they work perfectly'),
(N'Dennis', N'Thomas', N'dennis.thomas1218@example.com', '2014-08-14', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Joseph', N'Boyd', N'joseph.boyd1152@example.net', '2014-08-14', 5, N'The games I purchased were definitely satisfactory; however, even though www.xbox.com displayed that the game is compatible with the Xbox 360 it wasn''t. So I have the game I just can''t play it, neither can the fellas that I purchased a game for either. Disappointed with Xbox, but the purchase was on point.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Watson', N'nathan.watson5772@example.org', '2014-08-14', 5, N'classic, very cool game with lots to do and big maps, its always fun, but that being said this is TOTAL PROPGANDA, just keep that in mind'),
(N'Nathan', N'Watson', N'nathan.watson5772@example.org', '2014-08-14', 5, N'a must play, everybody needs some pyramid head in their lives when they''re old enough'),
(N'Aaron', N'Howard', N'aaron.howard9208@example.net', '2014-08-15', 5, N'Great condition'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Patel', N'cheryl.patel1883@example.org', '2014-08-15', 5, N'The game is beautiful and is totally worth the price, love it'),
(N'Susan', N'Gonzalez', N'susan.gonzalez3535@example.net', '2014-08-15', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Anita', N'King', N'anita.king2445@example.org', '2014-08-15', 5, N'Love this game but no continuous play and the map was larger =( if that was changed it would be so good'),
(N'Linda', N'Lee', N'linda.lee5938@example.org', '2014-08-15', 5, N'loved the game.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Parker', N'jeremy.parker3016@example.org', '2014-08-15', 4, N'This is my first fight stick and I''m relatively pleased so far. I''m not a fan of the button layout, but luckily the stick''s funky buttons fit with the presets of SF4. I haven''t tried any other games as of yet for issues with the buttons.'),
(N'Walter', N'Phillips', N'walter.phillips1888@example.net', '2014-08-15', 5, N'love this game'),
(N'Michael', N'Rodriguez', N'michael.rodriguez1148@example.net', '2014-08-15', 5, N'My stepson got this for his birthday last March. I don''t really like video games, but the very first video games (post-NES) were Star Wars PC games for Windows 95/98 (Tie Fighter, X-Wing vs. Tie Fighter) back in 1998 and 1999. Loved them so much my dad and I would have to replace joysticks every 3 months or so because we wore them out. I stopped playing games after Nintendo 64 for several years until I got a laptop and played the COD and Medal of Honor games. Then took another long break until my stepson got Star Wars Battlefront for PC in 2013. I played it and was immediately hooked and played the crap out of it until I beat it twice. Fast forward to 2014 and we got him Battlefront 2 for his X-Box 360. I hesitated playing it until I did multiplayer with him and was hooked. I am not a "gamer" by any means, but I really enjoyed this game. Hard to believe it''s 9 years old. The graphics are pretty good. There''s no HD-quality graphics, and everything is in D1 720x480 resolution, which...'),
(N'Karen', N'Singh', N'karen.singh6270@example.com', '2014-08-15', 5, N'Excellent!'),
(N'Debra', N'Gutierrez', N'debra.gutierrez3314@example.net', '2014-08-15', 5, N'it was awesome'),
(N'Alexander', N'Torres', N'alexander.torres1160@example.com', '2014-08-15', 5, N'I got this game several months after It came out, I think the updates fixed up so many things. I don''t find anything bad now after read many reviews. I find this game fun and nice to play. Is you like call of duty games you''ll find this awesome.'),
(N'Donna', N'Bell', N'donna.bell4838@example.com', '2014-08-15', 5, N'This adapter allows devices that are fussy about their charging source be recharged through nearly anything. The PS Vita (which this is marketed towards) is a prime example of this, which for some reason doesn''t allow users to recharge the system reliably through any off-brand wall charger, portable power banks, and USB ports on any computer. This is a cheap solution which remedies this issue, there isn''t much to say other than it just works. I am not entirely sure what other devices could use this, but I strong suggest PS Vita owners look into getting one of these for the sake of charging freedom.'),
(N'Christine', N'White', N'christine.white9788@example.com', '2014-08-15', 1, N'Worst FF game ever. Disgrace to the FF7 series. Horrible storyline, just shameful.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Jones', N'carlos.jones4191@example.com', '2014-08-16', 5, N'lots of fun'),
(N'Judith', N'Kumar', N'judith.kumar5476@example.com', '2014-08-16', 5, N'Great price on a PS3.'),
(N'Mei', N'Sanders', N'mei.sanders1996@example.org', '2014-08-16', 5, N'The Original gamecube controller, works fine, but the L and R trigger and not like the old ones. They do not have the guiding rod that makes them go up and down perfectly vertically. I had a old broken gamecube controller whose L and R worked fine, so i switched those out with the ones that came with this one. Now its just as good as the good ole days.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Jones', N'carolyn.jones4048@example.org', '2014-08-16', 4, N'First amazon digital download, and still playing it. Although not as much play these days, I still break it out once in awhile.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ortiz', N'stephanie.ortiz4377@example.net', '2014-08-16', 3, N'PS3 version is better so many glitches and bugs it''s insane.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Walker', N'kelly.walker2577@example.com', '2014-08-16', 5, N'Hate the Kinect but love this. Works great. EZ to put up. Looks NICE.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Perez', N'andrea.perez5040@example.net', '2014-08-16', 4, N'It''s ok. Addictive game for PS Vita'),
(N'Andrea', N'Perez', N'andrea.perez5040@example.net', '2014-08-16', 4, N'Good game.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Bailey', N'kyle.bailey3800@example.net', '2014-08-16', 5, N'Functions as expected, shipped in a timely fashion, package was received in excellent condition, and above all the product works as expected.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Lopez', N'stephen.lopez6188@example.com', '2014-08-16', 5, N'good'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Nowak', N'rebecca.nowak6311@example.com', '2014-08-17', 5, N'Excellent set. everything came in great condition and looks exceptional on my controller...it''s fun to buy may kits in different colors so you have may variations on color scheme for your controller!'),
(N'Ivan', N'Wisniewski', N'ivan.wisniewski4865@example.com', '2014-08-17', 5, N'I own a PS3 set of Turtle Beach headphones and the release of the PS4 has been problematic in terms of available headsets. This upgrade kit finally offers users of previously PS3-compatible headphones a way of hooking them up to a PS4 for minimal cost. Although it comes as no surprise that this comes out 9 months after the PS4 (after all, Turtle Beach had other more expensive headphones to clear out first), it finally offers those who decided to patiently wait an option to finally use their old headphones. The 3.5 mm adapter allows game audio connection while the USB connection offers chat capability...yes, all wired, unfortunately, but at least you don''t have to spend $100 for a headset that still features lackluster audio capability just because you have an alternative platform.'),
(N'Omar', N'Ruiz', N'omar.ruiz6929@example.com', '2014-08-17', 3, N'need good light'),
(N'Omar', N'Ruiz', N'omar.ruiz6929@example.com', '2014-08-17', 4, N'heavy game, not for kids, regular story!!!'),
(N'Walter', N'Murphy', N'walter.murphy2229@example.org', '2014-08-17', 5, N'I already own a Gamecube Controller Indigo I use it to play Gamecube games on my Nintendo Wii, but the draw back with the indigo controller is that the cable is too short, so I have to use an extension but that makes the cable too long, then I try a KMD Komodo Shockwave Wireless Black Controller but the Gamecube games that I enjoy (The Legend of Zelda Windwalker and Four Swords), the batteries simply don''t last to enjoy those long run games, so I decided to give a change to this white controller. My impression so far is that is the best controller available for Gamecube that I have used, they have an amazing grip, the plastic is awesome, your hand fits perfectly and they don''t make you feel uncomfortable at any time and the cable is the perfect size to use the console like I do a 2.5 Meters from the TV. I already have the opinion that the Gamecube controllers had the best Analog available, I said that with the indigo, now this white controller improves all the features the indigo...'),
(N'Ivan', N'Rivera', N'ivan.rivera9679@example.net', '2014-08-17', 5, N'Didn''t work for my N64, but good quality regardless'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Nelson', N'evelyn.nelson3691@example.net', '2014-08-17', 4, N'Can''t get enough.'),
(N'Jack', N'Ortiz', N'jack.ortiz7626@example.com', '2014-08-17', 4, N'Very good overall and fun to play. However, I am quite upset that it does not support my steering wheel/pedals. I contacted tech support and was told that the game does not support steering wheels/pedals period. It would be much more fun if it did!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Baker', N'aisha.baker9926@example.net', '2014-08-17', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Frank', N'Perry', N'frank.perry4369@example.com', '2014-08-17', 3, N'Great years ago but I was impressed with the state of technology back in the day. I guess I must had been nostalgic.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Cook', N'aisha.cook2370@example.net', '2014-08-17', 5, N'great'),
(N'Stephen', N'Hill', N'stephen.hill6127@example.com', '2014-08-17', 5, N'Helps you get more lives to beat those tough old school games. Lots of code support online still.'),
(N'Henry', N'Perry', N'henry.perry6886@example.com', '2014-08-18', 3, N'There are plenty of reviews of TLOU as a game so I''ll be reviewing the port. As a port this game is incredibly average bringing the usual increase in resolution and DLCs which one would expect. There is no new model to or improvements graphics engine to speak off leaving a decidedly last gen feel to the environments. For example all of the game''s cars are still card boxes with painted windows instead of being physical objects. Now they''re card boxes with higher resolution textures. That being said this is still the best game on the PS4, which is in some ways, disappointing.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Alvarez', N'anthony.alvarez5662@example.com', '2014-08-18', 4, N'Chizuru can be kind of annoying and tends to fall in the "stubborn but ultimately helpless" female trope, but overall the game is still enjoyable in spite of her character flaws. I recognize that this is a text-only game, which is fine with me. As someone who typically plays through a game until they have everything, collecting endings and pictures appealed to me, though I could easily see this type of game not being everybody''s cup of tea. I love that they had the Japanese audio since it really irks me to hear English voice actors butchering the character''s name. The addition of the bloodlust and demons was interesting, but I think the series would have been better without it. I am so over vampires and demons and was kind of hoping for a more "normal" historical setting - but I guess game developers think that historical settings are too boring? The male protagonists are overall charming and interesting, though there is definitely an air of patriarchal dominance in the way they...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Okonkwo', N'kimberly.okonkwo4265@example.org', '2014-08-18', 4, N'My grandson loves this. Got it for him for Christmas along with the game chair.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Myers', N'ivan.myers6200@example.org', '2014-08-18', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Frank', N'Peterson', N'frank.peterson3137@example.net', '2014-08-18', 5, N'I love this game ! Can''t wait til it gets here!!!!'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Wisniewski', N'cheryl.wisniewski5639@example.com', '2014-08-18', 5, N'Game is great bought it at used good condition it looked brand new not a single scratch or smudge and it plays great'),
(N'Sofia', N'Martinez', N'sofia.martinez8602@example.org', '2014-08-18', 1, N'doesn''t work properly in my computer'),
(N'Donna', N'Peterson', N'donna.peterson6124@example.net', '2014-08-18', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Tyler', N'Young', N'tyler.young9779@example.org', '2014-08-18', 4, N'Ok they only last a few months. Money pit replacing 12 yr old sons accessories but these are cheaper price than Microsoft brand and work just as well'),
(N'Justin', N'Hall', N'justin.hall4583@example.org', '2014-08-18', 5, N'Been loving this game. It may just be the classic feel of the old call of duty''s with mechs....but it is one hell of a damn good feeling. let me just say that.'),
(N'Angela', N'Murphy', N'angela.murphy8811@example.com', '2014-08-18', 5, N'bought for my gf. it seems to work fine'),
(N'Amanda', N'Green', N'amanda.green5148@example.org', '2014-08-18', 3, N'Just got into the game!!..Seems tough but interesting!!..I''m sure it will pick up and become more immersive!!..We''ll see!!...'),
(N'Marcus', N'Garcia', N'marcus.garcia2024@example.org', '2014-08-19', 5, N'works as expected'),
(N'Daniel', N'Walker', N'daniel.walker3649@example.net', '2014-08-19', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Wood', N'cynthia.wood1843@example.org', '2014-08-19', 5, N'husband loves it so I love it too'),
(N'Kelly', N'Kelly', N'kelly.kelly7564@example.com', '2014-08-19', 4, N'Game is fun for a time, and is a true successor to the previous games.'),
(N'Judith', N'Diaz', N'judith.diaz4640@example.org', '2014-08-19', 1, N'I wouldn''t recommend this at all. First complaint is that the leds aren''t bright enough (yes thats a personal complaint but i thought id throw it out there) second, biggest complaint is the software. The software that is used to set up what the buttons do is nice and user friendly, but it doesnt work properly. I have all of my keys set up, the saitek test works properly, but in game or in any other text fiel, it doesn''t bother to work the way I set it up. Buy logitech......'),
(N'Kyle', N'Kelly', N'kyle.kelly2879@example.net', '2014-08-19', 4, N'Easy installation'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wood', N'jacqueline.wood7639@example.net', '2014-08-19', 5, N'This is a great value, with fully half or more of the titles included providing fun gaming and, in my opinion, four or five keepers to play again sometime. Shipped quickly and downloaded all with no problems running Windows 7. If you like dark-themed HOGs with a touch of adventure, you''ll be glad you got this one.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Campbell', N'amanda.campbell7111@example.com', '2014-08-19', 5, N'Excellent product, I recommend it widely.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Walker', N'michelle.walker3538@example.com', '2014-08-19', 5, N'All of the stories, hype, awards, and accolades surrounding this game are all well deserved. The story is epic. The gameplay is functional and fluid. The overall performance of this game when it''s played at 60 Frames Per Second have to be seen to be believed. I have replayed this game at least 8 times already and after I finish again, i''m going to play it again. The Last Of Us is one of the best games I have ever played, and played, and played!!! Definitely worth 50 bucks.'),
(N'Gary', N'Ortiz', N'gary.ortiz1021@example.org', '2014-08-19', 5, N'Quite an awesome game! I enjoyed the plot and the usage of favorite DC characters!'),
(N'Julie', N'Taylor', N'julie.taylor5202@example.com', '2014-08-19', 3, N'The Turtle Beach Z60 gives fairly decent sound quality, is fairly comfortable, and has a good mic. Unfortunately ''decent'' and ''fairly'' aren''t good adjectives to describe a $120 (at time of review) gaming headset. Details below: Packaging - The Z60 comes in an attractive package, as might be expected from turtle beach. Included are instructions/warranty information, the headset, the mic (its detachable, a nice touch), and the headset control box (volume controls, mic controls, mode controls). Fit, Comfort, and Aesthetics- The Z60 is a fairly attractive set of headphones, with a nice minimalist red line running around the cup. They''re relatively light (especially compared to wireless headphones) and decently comfortable. My wife and I both liked them - she prefers them over my Corsair Vengeance 2100 (they''re much heavier), I prefer the Corsair. The mic is flexible but can''t bent completely upright. If you want it out of the way (to eat, for example) you''ll need to take it off the...'),
(N'Wei', N'Rivera', N'wei.rivera3715@example.org', '2014-08-19', 5, N'Awesome game. One of the last person to get on the band wagon.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Johnson', N'kimberly.johnson7997@example.net', '2014-08-19', 5, N'Great controller. I use this controller with my computer for emulated games. Works great, easy to connect. It is a little bit larger and heavier than a PS3 controller, but has the same basic shape. It runs on standard batteries and seems to have a pretty good lifespan on those batteries, as mine are still going. The controller is comfortable to use, even though it is heavy. The product is great for the price, I would certainly suggest picking one up.'),
(N'Eric', N'Moore', N'eric.moore8449@example.net', '2014-08-20', 5, N'Works great if you have seen to movie you''ll love this'),
(N'Eric', N'Moore', N'eric.moore8449@example.net', '2014-08-20', 5, N'Works just find'),
(N'Paul', N'Howard', N'paul.howard6052@example.org', '2014-08-20', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Paul', N'Howard', N'paul.howard6052@example.org', '2014-08-20', 5, N'Son loves it'),
(N'Sofia', N'Thompson', N'sofia.thompson1772@example.org', '2014-08-20', 4, N'Good but...it was a little to scary for me. I gave this as a gift to my nephews and they loved it.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Morris', N'hiroshi.morris2120@example.com', '2014-08-20', 5, N'Loved it. I wish I that very first contra.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Green', N'ravi.green6019@example.org', '2014-08-20', 5, N'Game is better than expected. Graphics looks awesome even with 100+ zombies on screen at the same time. Better than the first two.'),
(N'Linda', N'Hall', N'linda.hall2119@example.net', '2014-08-20', 5, N'GREAT BUY'),
(N'Lauren', N'Nguyen', N'lauren.nguyen8437@example.com', '2014-08-20', 5, N'Enjoy my system. Looking forward to seeing how it develops in the next couple of years'),
(N'Lauren', N'Nguyen', N'lauren.nguyen8437@example.com', '2014-08-20', 3, N'boring'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ramirez', N'dennis.ramirez5276@example.net', '2014-08-20', 2, N'It''s ok.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ramirez', N'dennis.ramirez5276@example.net', '2014-08-20', 5, N'My son loved this Game.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Perry', N'jonathan.perry8762@example.net', '2014-08-20', 4, N'A pretty good action game, however it lacks content, general depth, and its story is no where up to the quality of the show''s writing. Where the show felt like it was written for adults and happened to be kid friendly, this feels more written for kids and happens to be adult friendly. As a portable title, it''s great to take out and play for really quick sessions. The levels are short and easy to digest, and the multiplayer mode has pretty competent AI bots to play against.'),
(N'Luis', N'Foster', N'luis.foster8206@example.net', '2014-08-21', 5, N'Awesome mouse for the price. It''s sensitive, smooth and looks great. I haven''t even used the software that came with it yet, and I already love the color schemes and on the fly DPI switching. Get this if you need a great mouse, especially if it fits with a red color scheme. The cable running from the mouse to the PC is braided red as well.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd1353@example.com', '2014-08-21', 5, N'The WiiFit Metter is the perfect gadget to Wii Fit U, I actually buyed this one to get the free version of Wii Fit U that nintendo send as a 1 moth gif, but this gadget is so great that I buyed a second one to my mother, it helped me to know the average''s Kcal that i burn in a normal day and with it information control my diet, so since I had this gadget (and wii FitU) I had a better idea about what eat in a day, before I know that my weight was around 184 pounds, now after adjust my diet my weight is araond 176 pounds'),
(N'Patricia', N'Butler', N'patricia.butler8446@example.org', '2014-08-21', 4, N'The Tales series doesn''t always get a release in North America. Case in point, when Tales of Xillia was finally released in North America, Japan already had the sequel. It''s finally come stateside and it is quite a good game in and of itself. Even if it feels far too familiar just a little too soon. That being said, Tales of Xillia 2 is another good game in the series. A lot of the time when a JRPG has a sequel you can generally get away without playing the game before it. In most cases you get a whole new cast of characters, but a world that''s been changed by the events of the previous outing. The story is often different and sometimes even references to the original aren''t too much. Games like Lunar 2: Eternal Blue and even Chrono Cross are games where one can safely jump in without playing the previous game. Tales of Xillia 2 isn''t quite like that. While you could jump in without knowledge of the first one... it''s simply a bad idea to do so. Yes, the story is new, but many of...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Walker', N'michelle.walker3519@example.org', '2014-08-21', 1, N'Waste of money. Also gave these away. I can see why discontinued. Material so soft that it wouldn''t even slide in place to protect. I bought a hard cover made by Nintendo. Much better.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Walker', N'michelle.walker3519@example.org', '2014-08-21', 5, N'Fun. Works like normal . No issues. Thanks.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Wilson', N'alexander.wilson5088@example.org', '2014-08-21', 5, N'Extermination is tremendously intense and fun, but can get difficult in some parts such that when you beat the game it is an incredibly satisfying journey. The story is really good in the vein of "the thing" or "Cold Fear" and similar titles, but the game play here is really great and unique. Voice acting could be a bit better, but this is a minor quibble, and this is early PS2, so that was to be expected. This game has parts that really freak you out, but it is really intense and stays with you. Great game warranting 5 stars in my opinion. Buy it. If I may make a suggestion, I purchased an Action Max Replay cheat card for 21 dollars, and it has a bunch of codes like more ammo, health etc... that make the game eminently more playable and a bit easier to get through some of the challenges without having to replay numerous times. This makes the game really enjoyable, in my opinion, although it is still challenging and extremely fun. I have attached the link here- Datel Max...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Campbell', N'ryan.campbell5120@example.net', '2014-08-21', 5, N'To Start off the review, I''ve been using mechanical keyboards for a long time now, and this keyboard model is one of the best that I''ve used in a long time. It is extremely durable, and well built, with no issues at all. The keyboard itself is fairly simple and straight forward, so for those of you looking for just a plain and simple mechanical keyboard without all of the extra nonsense thrown in, this is for you. That being said, the keyboard preforms exactly how it should, quick, precise, and without fail. The typing experience is phenomenal. Now, lets cover some of the key switches that are more popular, and the ones that I have personally used/owned. Red Switches: Red switches are linear, meaning they go straight up and down with no bump or click. These are preferable for gaming because it is faster to rapid press each key, though, it is not preferable to typing for most because it is almost like dipping your fingers into water, elegant, but no resistance and you cant tell at...'),
(N'Christina', N'Walker', N'christina.walker5830@example.org', '2014-08-21', 2, N'For a headset supposedly designed around xbox and gaming these are not the best for voice chat. I bought these and used them with the Xbox 360 before they released the adapters for the Xbox One. I intended them for use on the Xbone. They work well with the X360 but you need a total of 20Ft of cable two connections blah blah blah. Sound quality on both systems are on par. The voice chat on the 360 is good. Voice chat on the Xbone is terrible I paid well over the current price for these and I expected to get a good headset not just earphones. Even when yelling over the mic people say it sounds like I am miles away from the mic. Since the release Polk has claimed updates to fix the problem which have not came or never worked. They sent out a whole other mic to use with this headset just to improve voice quality. The new mic has to be right next to your mouth to achieve optimal voice output. I don''t know how this product has received so many good reviews. Most of these reviews are not...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Watson', N'jonathan.watson3384@example.net', '2014-08-21', 3, N'Gift'),
(N'Edward', N'Gray', N'edward.gray7778@example.com', '2014-08-22', 3, N'The seller is working with me and I am giving him 2 thumbs up for that!'),
(N'Anthony', N'Bell', N'anthony.bell3296@example.com', '2014-08-22', 5, N'i used to play this long ago and i actually liked it, i remember me and my bro used to play the minigolf and had lots of fun, this game its worth buying if you''re interested on it.'),
(N'Dennis', N'King', N'dennis.king6235@example.com', '2014-08-22', 5, N'One of the best looking device out there, I''m glad I decided to throw in the extra $$ for this 3ds. Great gift for anyone, even if they are not fans of Zelda series. Great pick up for the price. Would recommend to friends.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Moore', N'lauren.moore8499@example.net', '2014-08-22', 5, N'It is a game that nobody should stop playing it, mainly the followers of this saga. Great images and history, I recommend it.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Taylor', N'elizabeth.taylor3454@example.org', '2014-08-22', 5, N'Very happy with our purchase and delivery.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Torres', N'stephen.torres5802@example.com', '2014-08-22', 5, N'I really like this game. It is the most visually appealing MMO I''ve ever played. I like the versatility provided by the point system. I am a big fan of single-mega servers, though it presents some unique challenges, especially for operating player markets (broker/auction house type things.) You can''t really create an auction house big enough to hold auctions from a million different players. ESO has an ok work around with the guild auction houses, and they are working to make improvements. The gameplay is fun. the skill bar is limited, but you can learn a lot of different skills and swap different skills into the bar any time you''re out of combat. I like the crafting system too. Voice acting is great, and the main story behind the gameplay is also really good.'),
(N'Anna', N'Nelson', N'anna.nelson9632@example.net', '2014-08-22', 5, N'Works great , just what I needed'),
(N'Jose', N'Myers', N'jose.myers5411@example.net', '2014-08-22', 5, N'Excelent products'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Young', N'tomasz.young9594@example.org', '2014-08-22', 5, N'Worked like a charm'),
(N'Douglas', N'Henderson', N'douglas.henderson1099@example.org', '2014-08-22', 5, N'The BEST game EVER'),
(N'Gary', N'Collins', N'gary.collins6299@example.org', '2014-08-23', 5, N'Loved the game the first time I played it. Arrival condition great, speed wonderful.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Garcia', N'ivan.garcia5383@example.com', '2014-08-23', 5, N'Thanks for a white controller great sell'),
(N'Christine', N'Gray', N'christine.gray2013@example.org', '2014-08-23', 5, N'With This cable..... You can do a whole bunch of things, like those minigames from animal crossing, transfer chao on your GBA and....... Pokmon Battles if you have pokemon colosseum! You can have battles from game to the GBA, or register your pokmon from Sapphire, Ruby, Fire red, and leaf green! It''s compatibe with: Original GBA : Yes GBA SP : Yes Game Boy Micro : I''m not sure but i think you need an adapter. I have an SP so it works perfectly !'),
(N'Ivan', N'Young', N'ivan.young7252@example.org', '2014-08-23', 5, N'great for 6 and under'),
(N'Ashley', N'Suzuki', N'ashley.suzuki5612@example.net', '2014-08-23', 5, N'Awesome condition'),
(N'Kofi', N'Raghunathan', N'kofi.raghunathan5808@example.org', '2014-08-23', 4, N'Awesome product only negative is that some games have to be upside down in case.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Harris', N'anthony.harris3974@example.net', '2014-08-23', 5, N'Like any Legend of Zelda game, this is a very good game. It has tons of problem solving, challenging enemies, great story, secondary weapons, health upgrades, sword upgrades, a huge world to explore, and a ton of other things that make Link to the Past so awesome.'),
(N'Steven', N'Coleman', N'steven.coleman6175@example.org', '2014-08-24', 5, N'Great game, I just bought it with few scratches that affect the sound. Still I will try to clean the scratches later to see if it fix the issue. Overall great game as I remembered.'),
(N'James', N'Ruiz', N'james.ruiz3134@example.org', '2014-08-24', 5, N'great!'),
(N'Luis', N'Gray', N'luis.gray7421@example.org', '2014-08-24', 5, N'This is a very good game and a fine addition to my video game collection. I consider this game to be a classic for the PS2 and Xbox.'),
(N'Maria', N'Long', N'maria.long4959@example.com', '2014-08-24', 4, N'Its great holds all the games, i don''t have cases for.'),
