(N'Justin', N'Baker', N'justin.baker7376@example.net', '2014-08-24', 3, N'I was hoping for so much more with this expansion. I have played since September of 2004 and I liked the other expansions and I really wanted to like this one. The leveling process was not as fun as it has been in the past. It is my fault for having high expectations I guess. Already pre-ordered the next one I hope it is better.'),
(N'Justin', N'Baker', N'justin.baker7376@example.net', '2014-08-24', 4, N'Fun game and all but I really wish I could have got one the bad guys instead of one the Empires Sith warriors. The figure is pretty well detailed and his light saber can come off.'),
(N'Dee', N'Cruz', N'dee.cruz1465@example.net', '2014-08-24', 4, N'works great but came a little damaged'),
(N'Lisa', N'Morales', N'lisa.morales9629@example.org', '2014-08-24', 4, N'Not skyrim; but what is? It is a solid game.'),
