(N'Michael', N'Kim', N'michael.kim4971@example.net', '2014-08-25', 3, N'This game was fun for a little while and then became too hard and frustrating for my interest. I am a hardcore Simpsons fan and I am rather disappointed.'),
(N'Adam', N'Coleman', N'adam.coleman4751@example.com', '2014-08-25', 5, N'Works great. Does the job!'),
(N'Charles', N'Diaz', N'charles.diaz4655@example.org', '2014-08-25', 5, N'best game'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Reed', N'nicholas.reed9914@example.com', '2014-08-25', 5, N'Really like it.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Robinson', N'rebecca.robinson4913@example.com', '2014-08-25', 5, N'Learn Self Defense and exercise for real. Very good to exercise for hours.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Hall', N'daniel.hall7823@example.org', '2014-08-25', 3, N'Having read amazing reviews for the Infamous franchise, I picked this up hoping it would be a strong early entry in the PS4 library. Having been somewhat disappointed by games like Sniper Elite III and Watch Dogs, this one looked interesting enough (I haven''t played any other Infamous games before this one). I was immediately struck by how great the visuals are and the voice acting is really solid. The story imo is a bit weak and the gameplay, while constantly changing/upgrading, does get a bit boring and stale nonetheless. Side missions are more of an annoyance than anything, and the main storyline feels like it''s dragging. Several times I''ve forgotten what I''m supposed to be doing. Maybe I''m missing something, but this game is about as average as it gets. Not bad, but really not all that fun/exciting either.'),
(N'Mark', N'Taylor', N'mark.taylor5061@example.net', '2014-08-25', 5, N'What a great way to give a boost to your old headsets. This will plug in to my headsets that are a few years old.this wad easy to use as well as set up. Just plug in and use. This will save you from buying a new headset. And transform your old one into new. Overall great product.'),
(N'Angela', N'Alvarez', N'angela.alvarez7090@example.net', '2014-08-25', 1, N'This is not Sacred 3! Even Sacred 2 with all the bugs & glitches is much better than this one. This game should be renamed to "Sacred arcade edition" and add one warning: "there is no loot"'),
(N'Omar', N'Perez', N'omar.perez3953@example.com', '2014-08-25', 3, N'Case was okay I guess'),
(N'Melissa', N'Phillips', N'melissa.phillips6973@example.com', '2014-08-25', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Hannah', N'Sanders', N'hannah.sanders9509@example.com', '2014-08-25', 3, N'It was great at the time'),
(N'Alexander', N'Ramirez', N'alexander.ramirez1222@example.net', '2014-08-26', 4, N'good investment'),
(N'Nathan', N'Watson', N'nathan.watson3243@example.org', '2014-08-26', 1, N'Honestly, I don''t know if I should put blame on the game developer or Sony''s console. I''m in a love-hate relationship with this game. I REALLY want to play the game. In fact, the games been sitting in my living room since the release date, and I pre-ordered it months ago! My problem appears to be that I can''t play for more than 15 minutes without it crashing. I have a brand new PlayStation 4, which I bought to play The Last of Us. It''s been almost a month and I still can''t play the game. I can''t even play multiplayer without it crashing. UPDATE: I contacted Sony support for further assistance with my game crashing every time I attempted to play it. I explained that I would always receive the error code "CE-34878-0" after every crash. Sony support was just horrible! The only advice that I received from Sony support was that it could either be my PlayStation or the game that caused the game to crash. If it was a defective copy of the game, they could do nothing for me. All in all, I...'),
(N'Kofi', N'Taylor', N'kofi.taylor2453@example.net', '2014-08-26', 5, N'it works and its cheap and it puts some of my favorite games ever on my TV its the best thing i have in my house, oh god without this cord i don''t know what i would do with my life, i would probably fall into a deep depression. in fact this cord is the only thing in my life, im madly in love with this cord, i think i want to marry this cord i love it so much. oh man look at that out put plug mmmmmm that thing looks so good and don''t even get me started on the input jacks. that''s it im going to purpose to this cord right now!'),
(N'Maria', N'Smith', N'maria.smith1504@example.org', '2014-08-26', 1, N'There are lots of things to improve. It is a good start and a game with really good intentions, but it feels like a beta when you shoot or try to defend. It is a nice way to get crazy when you see how much time it takes to charge the shoot power just to see your efforts go sink. You can be hand to hand with the goalkeeper and shoot to his hands. The game is so manual that it is not where you shoot but your player direction where the ball will go, which is always the hand of the goalkeeper. Buy this game just to practice for the 15 version.'),
(N'Betty', N'Morales', N'betty.morales4515@example.org', '2014-08-26', 2, N'it fits kind of lose on my ps4 controller. although i admit that the original ps4 coating on the stick was already worn off. that is the reason i bought the item so i was expecting it to work on the bare plastic.'),
(N'Carol', N'Wang', N'carol.wang1433@example.com', '2014-08-26', 4, N'Fun game, but not the best COD.'),
(N'Omar', N'Watson', N'omar.watson4169@example.org', '2014-08-26', 5, N'I''m very happy I get the game as expected, met with the delivery time are very responsible seller, my thanks I''m pleased.'),
(N'Ivan', N'White', N'ivan.white8145@example.net', '2014-08-26', 5, N'Simply outstanding!!!'),
