(N'Sandra', N'Ferreira', N'sandra.ferreira1606@example.org', '2014-08-26', 3, N'Grandson used it one time, has not used since.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Moore', N'joseph.moore9490@example.com', '2014-08-26', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Kyle', N'Williams', N'kyle.williams5874@example.org', '2014-08-26', 5, N'I love this game! It''s one of my favorite games of all time! I actually used to lay out Tyson 3 times a day as a friggin ritual! It was my favorite thing to do when I got home from school(I was a loser). I can''t even get up to him now. The farthest i have gotten recently was Soda pop. I now get nervous when i fight the bigger boxers and fail. It''s funny because most of the boxers have the same style but some are just faster and stronger. Mike fights like a lot of the other characters but he''s a lot faster and he''ll knock you out with one shot. If you can calm your nerves and learn the timing to dodge his punches as well as the pattern that he throws them in you could lay him out cold no problem. Unfortunately i can''t do it anymore. :('),
(N'Benjamin', N'Smith', N'benjamin.smith9763@example.net', '2014-08-27', 5, N'I like it a lot.'),
(N'Luis', N'Barnes', N'luis.barnes7049@example.net', '2014-08-27', 4, N'Purchased this splinter cell for the coop ability because I needed more multiplayer games to play with friends. I''ve always been the shoot em up kill everyone gamer not really a sneak around and not kill any bad guys kind of gamer so I love that you can do both if you want. Both the multiplayer and single player campaign are fun and challenging especially when you play the splinter cell way. The graphics and customization of weapons are great. The one problem I have though is that the game environment and lighting and always very dark. Even with the brightness and gamma turned up its still difficult to see and move in the dark areas during gameplay. For some reason in this splinter cell he isn''t given the ability of NVG''s. Other then that I have no complaints definitely a fun game to play with friends(who are decent gamers).'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Harris', N'elizabeth.harris8190@example.net', '2014-08-27', 5, N'A+'),
(N'William', N'Torres', N'william.torres7980@example.com', '2014-08-27', 5, N'It''s almost three years since I bought these and they haven''t lost their charge. I also bought the Nyko brand and those only seem to last 6-8 hours while these last atleast 10. I''ve seen alot of people complain about these but I think it''s poor battery management. Battery''s are rather fragile when it comes to their charging power. You must always drain them before charging and make sure they''re fully charged before unplugging them.'),
(N'Anthony', N'White', N'anthony.white8212@example.net', '2014-08-27', 5, N'these things are handy when you need to transfer data to a new hard drive. this is a real version and works great for any transfer jobs you might have.'),
