(N'Emma', N'Wisniewski', N'emma.wisniewski6327@example.org', '2014-08-27', 3, N'It works. Do read all the posts with advice on "How To" change these out. 3 *''s b/c I liked the original one better, all those years while it worked. And, b/c I haven''t tried the one other choice that had decent reviews. This one ain''t bad I guess but I sure miss the original, wish I could find one...at least all my buttons still work good.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Kelly', N'pamela.kelly1661@example.com', '2014-08-27', 1, N'What a piece of " " this is! Worst port in the world. An insult to every PC gamer!'),
