(N'Anita', N'Martin', N'anita.martin3161@example.org', '2014-08-27', 5, N'Still my favorite game to this day. This series is very dear to me. I love the Disney characters involved and the battle scenes are so much fun.'),
(N'Amy', N'Gonzalez', N'amy.gonzalez3030@example.net', '2014-08-27', 5, N'ty so much what a deal!'),
