(N'Wei', N'Morgan', N'wei.morgan3995@example.org', '2014-08-28', 5, N'Ive never played any of the other Luigi Mansion titles, so this one was my first, and I cna say, it was quite refreshing to play. The game play was a stray from most other games I ever played, and I liked how you were rewarded with upgrades along the way. And don''t let this game fool you. It''s not a kiddie game. There were some pretty hard challenges and puzzles in the game. This is a great game if you are the type to pick up and go. I played this game, then stopped for 6 months, then picked it up and continued where I left off from and beat it. I don''t think I will ever reply since I beat it, but I highly recommend at least a play through.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Martinez', N'olivia.martinez4256@example.org', '2014-08-28', 5, N'Great experience, everything as described. Great seller'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Powell', N'carolyn.powell7775@example.org', '2014-08-28', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Brian', N'Kelly', N'brian.kelly4550@example.org', '2014-08-28', 5, N'I''ve had this for several months and it continues to work perfectly. The only thing I''d change about it is to add a longer USB cord.'),
(N'Linda', N'Fisher', N'linda.fisher7725@example.net', '2014-08-28', 3, N'Works pretty good, there are plenty of documented issues, mostly inflicted by newer driver updates, earlier updates for this headset had the led indicator for mute and open mic as a solid blue or red. NOW, when muted the light flashes constantly, I''ve had to put tape over the led area as the blinking/flashing begs my peripheral vision for attention. There''s also currently a buzz whenever the mic is muted.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Morgan', N'nadia.morgan1647@example.org', '2014-08-28', 5, N'Thanks! nice condition!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Collins', N'nathan.collins2385@example.com', '2014-08-28', 5, N'Quick delivery, good price, excellent quality. Thank you.'),
(N'Luis', N'Jenkins', N'luis.jenkins2195@example.org', '2014-08-29', 5, N'This game is the bomb ! It takes margong to the next level for sure. It does get difficult really fast, I would have liked more easier games to ease into it, but, I take the challenge and run. Thx for the super fast shipping too!'),
