(N'Aaron', N'Torres', N'aaron.torres9113@example.net', '2014-08-29', 4, N'Got stuck ....really stuck ...... on a few of these......Professor Layton does it again.........I just wish they would make these games for another format......one that is bigger .......for the tablets, eReaders or something..........but I like all of the Layton series and this is a good one.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Martinez', N'jerry.martinez1838@example.net', '2014-08-29', 5, N'Awesome TPS, good controlls, really fun to play. good story Update: I finished this game and I can tell you, this is one of the best stories I''ve ever played, the principle of the game itself is nothing new, it''s a third person shooter, and plays very nicely, BUT, what this game excels at is its story and its music, the story is so unexpected, it''s awesome! and the music, I personally like all the soundtrack, but I completely love the battle theme, that melody haunts me! Overall 10/10, if I had knew before of this game I''d buy it immediately and original, not a used one, because it''s well worth it.'),
