(N'Luis', N'Nguyen', N'luis.nguyen1233@example.net', '2014-08-30', 3, N'I liked it but couldn''t use it on my backwards compatible PS3 the game loaded up fine and worked ok but I couldn''t use my guitar for the game I had to send it back.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Morgan', N'jacob.morgan8711@example.org', '2014-08-30', 4, N'Love the game, but hate trying to play it online. With all the shenanigans of late on charging consumers for extra bandwidth, or forcing them to get data through a soda straw, playing a complicated online game like Civilization can cause you to pull your hair out by the roots. It''s worse when it''s a game with great graphics and tons of new stuff to play with. I''m sticking to the installed version just to avoid the hassle.'),
