(N'Jose', N'Hughes', N'jose.hughes7591@example.org', '2014-08-30', 5, N'Highly Recommend! Fast delivery! Exactly as described!'),
(N'Omar', N'Wright', N'omar.wright3976@example.com', '2014-08-30', 5, N'This game was a couple of years old when I bought it. Found a huge online presence. The scenery is worth the game alone. Amazing how they captured the southwest and all the different ecosystems complete with the animals that lived in them. Just a fun game to play. The biggest complaint is the dialogue, WOW. Too many cinema scenes. But it''s still one of my top 5 favorites.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Howard', N'elizabeth.howard5623@example.org', '2014-08-30', 5, N'My boyfriend literally forgot I existed while playing this game. It''s that good.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Wilson', N'andrew.wilson4957@example.com', '2014-08-31', 4, N'I remember getting this for my 13th birthday:) As a young girl and even now, I LOVE DRAGONS. While everyone raved about Crash, I rooted for Spyro. This game might seem like one of those spin-offs that aren''t worth your money, but I remember all the great times I had playing this. The story line was surprisingly good, and having replayed it, I can still say that it is rather good as a story. While the game isn''t GREAT, for what it is, it''s surprisingly really good. I finished the game in under 20 hours, and have been waiting to get my hands on the sequel ever since. The villain is not what you think she is.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Webb', N'nadia.webb3013@example.org', '2014-08-31', 2, N'I wish I could have a better review on this item,two week after I got it,I started hearing grinding sounds from this PlayStation 2 not only the annoying grinding sounds..this PS2 WILL NOT play my DVD movies'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ferreira', N'ethan.ferreira1814@example.net', '2014-08-31', 5, N'For fans of Phineas and Ferb, this game is a no-brainer. It''s an easy game, but not so easy it becomes boring. The problem with a lot of kid''s games these days is they make them unnecessarily difficult... I''m a gamer, have been my whole life, and some "kids" games have frustrated me to no end with seemingly impossible objectives or obstacles. This game doesn''t suffer from that issue. It''s great for 2 players as well. The camera angles are smart, and the graphics are decent. At times there''s quite a bit of dialog to get through, but fans of the show shouldn''t mind. Original voice-casting, except for Major Monogram. Overall, this game is fun for all ages.'),
(N'Henry', N'Mendoza', N'henry.mendoza2028@example.com', '2014-08-31', 4, N'had this about 4 years and gets used now and again. Still great condition and works well.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ruiz', N'michelle.ruiz1008@example.org', '2014-08-31', 5, N'It''s basically the same great stuff you loved in the original classic DOOM games, only this time in a more modern format and more tension this time making it feel like a survival horror title occasionally. I first played this game way back in 2004 when it was first released. It''s still intense and highly enjoyable to this day. DOOM 3 has aged well for a 10-year-old game!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Robinson', N'samantha.robinson9938@example.net', '2014-08-31', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Matthew', N'Mendoza', N'matthew.mendoza6185@example.org', '2014-08-31', 3, N'was ok...'),
(N'Andrew', N'Khan', N'andrew.khan8477@example.net', '2014-08-31', 1, N'To even play the entire game you have to buy multiple figures which are priced pretty high already. But this isn''t Spyro! This is a monstrosity that they''ve turned our favorite purple dragon into.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Hernandez', N'katherine.hernandez7654@example.net', '2014-08-31', 5, N'Works as well as the original wii wheels. Weighs about the same as the original too. Compliments the Mario and Luigi wii-motes nicely.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Harris', N'andrea.harris6569@example.org', '2014-08-31', 5, N'My gamers be groovin in the kingdom - thanks guys!!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Kelly', N'timothy.kelly5095@example.com', '2014-08-31', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Timothy', N'Kelly', N'timothy.kelly5095@example.com', '2014-08-31', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Brenda', N'Roberts', N'brenda.roberts7107@example.com', '2014-09-01', 2, N'I liked Fight Night Round 3. That game was was good for it''s day. This is a joke that''s not funny. No character creation. No character customization. No choices in the story play. Bad decisions when it come to game play design. At one point you fight a guy who is obviously a super heavyweight while you play a middleweight. He''s a full foot taller and has a reach over 6 inches longer than your fighter. He weighs way more than your fighter. Result? RUN AWAY FOR 2 ROUNDS?!? Seriously?!? How is that fun? Also have had to play that bout for 3 times already on the easiest setting and still can''t seem to last 2 rounds. Just bad. No wonder this studio was shut down. They had no concept of fun or creativity. Every wrestling game since the 90''s has had create a character mode. Why this was left out of the game is beyond me. The only reason I can think of is laziness. I was sad when I heard this franchise was over, but now I understand.'),
(N'Donald', N'Smith', N'donald.smith9941@example.org', '2014-09-01', 4, N'The only thing frustrating about this game is how unobtainable some of it is. I am NOT going to do 24 hour races... So in a way, it''s a turnoff that I can''t "complete" the whole game. It was fun and frustrating at the same time.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Wang', N'evelyn.wang5322@example.net', '2014-09-01', 5, N'Excelent game'),
(N'Diane', N'Lewis', N'diane.lewis7775@example.com', '2014-09-01', 4, N'Didn''t really enjoy this game. But I do know a lot of people that do!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Morris', N'douglas.morris2674@example.org', '2014-09-01', 5, N'good'),
(N'Douglas', N'Morris', N'douglas.morris2674@example.org', '2014-09-01', 3, N'it was okay'),
(N'Laura', N'Ivanov', N'laura.ivanov5802@example.net', '2014-09-01', 4, N'What makes this game, in my humble opinion, a must for Wii users is the feeling of being playing a first-person shooter when the game, in fact, is a third-person shooter. Play as it is and you certainly will feel the same. It is the kind of game that makes you feel sorry for not having a Nintendo before - and I am not even a fan-boy (believe: I have no age nor weight anymore for stupid things like defending a brand with guns and all, specially in times like this where people is guided to buy propaganda instead of factual games).'),
(N'Kofi', N'Thompson', N'kofi.thompson6007@example.com', '2014-09-01', 5, N'Fun game for kids and turtle fans. Simple and fun.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Howard', N'elizabeth.howard3122@example.com', '2014-09-01', 4, N'good'),
(N'James', N'Raghunathan', N'james.raghunathan8585@example.net', '2014-09-02', 4, N'I just play the campaign aspect of games; Starhawk is not your typical shooter - some shooting games incorporate sequences where you drive a vehicle or operate a turret for a short period of time, using simple controls. With Starhawk, operating land and air vehicles take up a good chunk of the game. In addition to that, there are spots in the game where you build and utilize structures, like defensive walls and automated gun turrets, adding a another layer of strategy to the battles. With all this going on, the game has a much steeper learning curve than most shooters. Still, once I got the hang of it, I really had a lot of fun with the some parts of the game, like the air battles. If all you want to do is ''gun and run'', this game is definitely not for you. If you want to do more than just shoot, and you have the time to get used to the controls, then "Starhawk" is worth checking out.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ross', N'stephanie.ross9740@example.com', '2014-09-02', 5, N'Great Statue, Great game, Great Price.'),
(N'Amara', N'Ivanov', N'amara.ivanov7931@example.org', '2014-09-02', 5, N'Great screen protector!'),
(N'Carlos', N'Garcia', N'carlos.garcia4091@example.org', '2014-09-02', 4, N'Feels very much like the original GC, and the signal is really good. I bought this controller to play emulators on my Wii, and it works very well for that.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Morales', N'amanda.morales9335@example.org', '2014-09-02', 5, N'Unplug that mouse from your computer, replace it with this Logitech joystick, download the software from IMG, and you are good to go. Yes, you can replace your computer mouse with a joystick. But you need to get the software to make it work. There are free software that you can download, but I chose to purchase mine from a company called IMG (Innovation Management Group). This Logitech Extreme 3D Pro Joystick and the "Joystick-to-Mouse" software from IMG work perfectly together. I got the idea to do this because an acquaintance of mine suffers from arthritis. The nature of her work include a lot of data entry,as well as document processing. She has tried "ergonomic" mice, but have not gotten relief. We bought this Logitech joystick, bought the software, and installed on her workstation. It has worked wonders for her, but the adjustment is taking a lot of time. Moving that cursor with a joystick is not as precise for her as with her mice. It is taking time, but she is slowly...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Carter', N'joshua.carter9424@example.org', '2014-09-02', 5, N'Great fun, a solid follow up to the first game'),
(N'Anita', N'Campbell', N'anita.campbell3631@example.net', '2014-09-02', 1, N'Figured this would be another great Resident Evil game - It was just boring and it sucked. Don''t waste your money on this garbage, it''s just Capcom leeching as much money as it can out of a trusted franchise name.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Ramirez', N'benjamin.ramirez7779@example.org', '2014-09-02', 1, N'Does EA Games understand that when they release a sequel, there is an expectation that that sequel will surpass the game that came before it? Apparently not. There is no point to this release except to make the company more money. They ensure that by including virtually nothing of interest in this base game, so that if you want anything even remotely interesting you will be forced to by the multitude of expansion packs yet to come. Things I don''t like: * Awkward and unintuitive controls. * Cartoony-looking sims. * A weird, closed-off feel if you''re used to playing Sims 3. You can''t drive, bike, jog, or walk anywhere. You can''t even cross the street to say hi to your neighbor. There isn''t even a neighborhood (such as it is) view, except when you use your phone. You can''t even go home without using your phone. Apparently your phone is now some sort of teleporting machine - one that leads directly to a loading screen. * No pools. No toddlers. No dishwashers or trash compactors....'),
(N'Olivia', N'Wright', N'olivia.wright5574@example.com', '2014-09-02', 3, N'good story, short tho'),
(N'Ashley', N'Wood', N'ashley.wood3195@example.org', '2014-09-02', 5, N'great'),
(N'Judith', N'Bennett', N'judith.bennett5650@example.net', '2014-09-02', 5, N'I already had this, but lost one of the disks, it''s good enough that I had to buy the disks again'),
(N'Laura', N'Ruiz', N'laura.ruiz4920@example.org', '2014-09-02', 5, N'This game was in perfect condition!'),
(N'Amara', N'Brown', N'amara.brown1202@example.org', '2014-09-03', 4, N'Fun game'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Ferreira', N'evelyn.ferreira5683@example.net', '2014-09-03', 5, N'I love the game, I however didn''t like how it came in a PS1 game case with the disk covered in fingerprints and muck. Though I cleaned it and it works perfectly fine.'),
(N'Anna', N'Watson', N'anna.watson4783@example.net', '2014-09-03', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Castillo', N'kimberly.castillo4151@example.net', '2014-09-03', 5, N'Good very good'),
(N'Susan', N'Russell', N'susan.russell2476@example.com', '2014-09-03', 5, N'Love this game, for many reasons: - The difficulty of the game - The feel of getting pass a difficult boss or map - The replay value (over 70 hours showing on one character, getting close to 30 on another) - The Beauty of it (Looking forward to an Xbox One Dark Souls in the future) - The PVP'),
(N'John', N'Carter', N'john.carter2246@example.org', '2014-09-03', 5, N'excellent, very good service'),
(N'Debra', N'Morris', N'debra.morris7163@example.net', '2014-09-03', 5, N'Love this game :) great condition, too. I do test these products out myself and give a very honest review. I am one that reads the reviews carefully when making purchases so I appreciate those who take the time to post reviews! If my review has been helpful to you, please give me a "Yes" vote on my review!'),
(N'Paul', N'Alvarez', N'paul.alvarez7021@example.org', '2014-09-03', 1, N'I have a led tv installed close to the wall about 2'''' gap and the kinetic tv mount has 4'''' long so won''t fit between the tv and the wall, I''m frustrated with it!. grrrrrrrrrrr.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Sanders', N'sandra.sanders9079@example.com', '2014-09-04', 5, N'This is an awesome game for the Vita, and well worth the buy. If you''re still considering this or Soul Sacrifice/Soul Sacrifice Delta, then consider this: Soul Sacrifice Delta is download only right now (not sure if that''ll change or not) and Soul Sacrifice has much less content than Delta, while Toukiden is hard copy or download. In Toukiden you craft all the armor you obtain by hunting monsters and getting the right parts, in SSD you just reach the specified level and the armor/Raiments are given to you, you just have to get the right offering (item) in order to get another color. I have both games and love them both and they each have their pros and cons, but overall I would give Toukiden a better rating, but only slightly. The thing that sets Toukiden apart is the atmosphere and general storyline of the game. Toukiden has a village with people and allies to befriend while SSD takes all that and turns it into a menu/book. A menu/page to select different weapons (offerings),...'),
(N'Nadia', N'White', N'nadia.white6117@example.org', '2014-09-04', 4, N'all fine'),
(N'Kelly', N'Bell', N'kelly.bell6694@example.net', '2014-09-04', 5, N'So Amazing! I never though I could get sounds like this out of a headset! When I first set it up, it wasn''t paired with the receiver. So when I plugged in into the controller I was like "These are ok".... Then I realized I hadn''t set them up correctly. Once I did.... WOW! I would definitely recommend these. The box was really official. It was wrapped like they where brand new. Everything in the box just like getting new ones. The headset was very clean, and didn''t have any scratches or any defects that made them seem used. I had the Turtle Beach XO FOUR, but those are like generic earbuds compared to these.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Long', N'marcus.long1947@example.net', '2014-09-04', 5, N'Awesome game with an engrossing storyline. Felt like I was watching a movie! More please!!!!'),
(N'Justin', N'Nguyen', N'justin.nguyen7953@example.net', '2014-09-04', 5, N'GUNS! GUNS! GLORIOUS GUNS!!! ...for about 30 minutes.'),
(N'Priya', N'Mendoza', N'priya.mendoza6297@example.net', '2014-09-04', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Mei', N'Flores', N'mei.flores7107@example.com', '2014-09-04', 4, N'Good guitar!'),
(N'Mei', N'Flores', N'mei.flores7107@example.com', '2014-09-04', 5, N'Works perfectly'),
(N'Mei', N'Flores', N'mei.flores7107@example.com', '2014-09-04', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Singh', N'stephanie.singh1313@example.org', '2014-09-05', 4, N'Watch Dogs, graphically, looks great. The city is full of life and the streets don''t feel empty. Lots of cars and lots of people with various personal details that you can see or hack for cash, information, songs, access codes and system keys. Though I did see some popups which you don''t want in a next generation console, graphically it is still remarkable. After several hours some stuff gets repeated, especially hacked voice conversations. When I initially started watch dogs, I was underwhelmed with all aspects of game play. The driving was a chore and taking down enemy vehicles were a nightmare. Action was not fluent and unlike GTA you were limited how you do and approach things. Hacking was fun but did not seem very effective at creating explosions to take down enemies. Hacking traffic lights to stop enemy vehicles were mostly useless - especially at night with lesser vehicles around. Avoiding the police or enemies in cars was near impossible. That is till I got it right. After...'),
(N'Nadia', N'Ali', N'nadia.ali8008@example.net', '2014-09-05', 5, N'Excellent deal for 2 years and instant gratification, doesn''t get better.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Hughes', N'ethan.hughes6571@example.org', '2014-09-05', 5, N'AAA+++'),
(N'Mateo', N'Mitchell', N'mateo.mitchell3508@example.org', '2014-09-05', 5, N'It worked'),
(N'Maria', N'Cook', N'maria.cook8809@example.com', '2014-09-05', 1, N'don''t work on w/7'),
(N'Brandon', N'Chen', N'brandon.chen5091@example.com', '2014-09-05', 5, N'Love this game!'),
(N'Sandra', N'Torres', N'sandra.torres4075@example.net', '2014-09-05', 5, N'Good gift!'),
(N'Mei', N'Hall', N'mei.hall1645@example.net', '2014-09-05', 4, N'Its a great little game very much in tune with Super Mario Bros. However in my opinion it still lacks the spark and downright fun experience that you get when you play the all time classic Mario games. The customization portion of the game can be fun, but it can also seem overwhelming at times. Specially if you only want to sit and play for an hour, you want to play the game and not have to mess around with 10 other things you can do. The game is definitely fun, it just won''t be replacing classics like Mario any time soon.'),
(N'Charles', N'Stewart', N'charles.stewart5153@example.org', '2014-09-05', 5, N'my grandson loves his DS'),
(N'Larry', N'Powell', N'larry.powell6488@example.org', '2014-09-06', 5, N'This is a great game and the price was great as well.'),
(N'James', N'Adams', N'james.adams8986@example.com', '2014-09-06', 1, N'its a pain to try and plug the controllers into it. not the best design, I would skip pass this one. I traded it in at my local game store to get a better one.'),
(N'Megan', N'Collins', N'megan.collins2626@example.org', '2014-09-06', 5, N'im sure its good even though I haven''t played it'),
(N'Megan', N'Collins', N'megan.collins2626@example.org', '2014-09-06', 5, N'these are ground breaking. you already know this.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Baker', N'brenda.baker3201@example.com', '2014-09-06', 4, N'For a game it could be better.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Perry', N'jeffrey.perry6735@example.net', '2014-09-06', 4, N'I bought this game knowing it had missing features and such. But I also knew the custom content would help fill the game out and appears EA is very aggressive about supporting the CC plus mod community, The game runs super smooth and the load times are much faster than any Sims before it. The build system shines with the ease of building and editing already built structures. The Sims creator has bright spots but I was a little disappointed with the lackluster starting clothes, hair, etc.'),
(N'Christina', N'Rodriguez', N'christina.rodriguez2840@example.org', '2014-09-06', 5, N'Just quick and simple. it helps prevent sweat from handling in those cut tight games when needed (whatever game you are particularly into) and all around looks good on the controller depending on your color. Like my brother gold controller and black silicone skin. pretty awesome.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Turner', N'kenneth.turner3232@example.org', '2014-09-06', 5, N'great game fast delivery'),
(N'Maria', N'Fisher', N'maria.fisher4468@example.net', '2014-09-06', 5, N'These reviews are spot on. What really impressed me was the fitment of all 3 parts...everything is perfect. I feel much better leaving this in the hands of my 7 yr old now.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Morris', N'elizabeth.morris7938@example.com', '2014-09-06', 5, N'The instrutions are in chinese but is a very nice controller.'),
(N'Julie', N'Turner', N'julie.turner1428@example.org', '2014-09-06', 5, N'Excellent!!'),
(N'Heather', N'Murphy', N'heather.murphy8402@example.org', '2014-09-06', 5, N'Perfect fit exactly as described a plus by me thank you'),
(N'Anna', N'Patel', N'anna.patel5686@example.org', '2014-09-07', 5, N'Good game. good for the whole family to enjoys.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Khan', N'dennis.khan7829@example.net', '2014-09-07', 3, N'The part that goes on the disk tray broke off when I put it on. Didn''t use any force.'),
(N'William', N'Kelly', N'william.kelly6274@example.com', '2014-09-07', 5, N'Works great. Nice replacement when my last one died on us.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Kelly', N'marcus.kelly2052@example.net', '2014-09-07', 5, N'Really easy install'),
(N'Douglas', N'Anderson', N'douglas.anderson5075@example.com', '2014-09-07', 5, N'Kids had a ball with this game. Good, clean, fun for kids of all ages. I received this quickly as promised, in the condition I was promised so what more could you possibly ask from a seller! Thank you!'),
(N'Mary', N'Morgan', N'mary.morgan7842@example.org', '2014-09-07', 5, N'great for a gift'),
(N'Alexander', N'Bennett', N'alexander.bennett2347@example.net', '2014-09-08', 3, N'This is a unique game for a shooter. Had some drawbacks but fairly easy game to play.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Kelly', N'rebecca.kelly6667@example.net', '2014-09-08', 4, N'The plastic feels light and cheap but it works and Id rather have the PlayStation sponsored one than the off brand.'),
(N'Jose', N'Stewart', N'jose.stewart6377@example.org', '2014-09-08', 5, N'works well and easy to install - does what it says it does :)'),
(N'Hannah', N'Bennett', N'hannah.bennett8502@example.com', '2014-09-08', 5, N'it`s good.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Bennett', N'hannah.bennett8502@example.com', '2014-09-08', 5, N'works good.'),
(N'Susan', N'Miller', N'susan.miller6154@example.org', '2014-09-08', 5, N'good'),
(N'Matthew', N'Flores', N'matthew.flores2781@example.org', '2014-09-08', 5, N'Kids use'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Green', N'tomasz.green7403@example.net', '2014-09-08', 2, N'Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn''t. Doesn''t seem to have any rhyme or reason- you put the controller on the charging point, and sometimes the white controller icon in the front lights up and indicates that it is charging. Other times nothing happens. Repeat a few times and it usually picks up the signal. Pretty cheap feeling overall, but sometimes does the trick. At least it looks nice.'),
(N'Diane', N'Long', N'diane.long5304@example.com', '2014-09-09', 1, N'(+/-) The core game play is solid - that is the controls of combat and how one uses their abilities. Occasionally frenetic fights demand not only quick thinking and leverage of weaponry and skills, but also some level of teamwork. However the content itself takes place in tiny maps in several locations, forcing one to re-visit the same exact parts of the same maps ad nauseam from the very start of the game (+/-) The presentation is sometimes marvelous, but uneven. Everything from dusty, whimsical, windswept surfaces on a decaying Earth to a Venus slowly reverting to its acidic, volcanic roots. While the graphics aren''t spectacular the game does look good and runs well at a steady frame rate. At the same time it suffers from some poor textures, a likely artifact of being a cross-generation game (-) The story is oddly hidden away for the most part, leaving the bulk of backstory and mythos in hidden locales that one must visit Bungie''s website to read. Pedestrian narrative for what''s...'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Baker', N'tomasz.baker3816@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'I haven''t had any problems with mine so far. For anyone looking to change batteries in old Nintendo games, I would recommend it! As with all precision tools, it will eventually wear out. The only flaw is that it''s hard to grip the smooth handle part when removing tight screws. Could use rubber to make it easier. Five stars anyway!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Taylor', N'kofi.taylor2453@example.net', '2014-09-09', 5, N'works great and it came in a plastic case rather than a sleeve'),
(N'Daniel', N'Hughes', N'daniel.hughes5713@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'everithing ok'),
(N'Amara', N'Cox', N'amara.cox7929@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'so funny!!'),
(N'Donald', N'Peterson', N'donald.peterson9225@example.com', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Like it'),
(N'Douglas', N'Castillo', N'douglas.castillo8179@example.net', '2014-09-09', 1, N'now i see the whole point of Halo. it was meant to be a prototype for the real game, named Destiny. which obviously, is meant to be on playstation consoles. i notice a lot of graphical slowdow, and sound is iffy on the xbone, even though its for the next gen. XBL matchmaking is broken! for some reason, M$ decided to use g2 bluray sized cases, in the footsteps of what sony had been doing since ps3. marked improvement, but they flipped it and put the disc on the left instead. wow what a way to retaliate. like a child throwing a tantrum. for the limited edition in particular, there is no talking cube thing. might as well, since you are probably on a budget if you are getting the xbone version.'),
(N'Judith', N'Rogers', N'judith.rogers3028@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'love this game, keeps you busy.'),
(N'Jack', N'Moore', N'jack.moore1752@example.com', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Son loves this game! He plays it all the time!'),
(N'Emily', N'Jones', N'emily.jones2239@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Ivan', N'Garcia', N'ivan.garcia2677@example.com', '2014-09-09', 1, N'This game has deleted my saves, I saved MULTIPLE times yesterday and they''re all gone. Done with it, going to look into returning it. It also has crashed 3 times.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Webb', N'jeremy.webb4681@example.com', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Great fits perfectly and works'),
(N'Carlos', N'Ali', N'carlos.ali4896@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Great game, cool extras, nifty box.'),
