(N'Emma', N'Wang', N'emma.wang1247@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Dennis', N'Walker', N'dennis.walker5565@example.org', '2014-09-09', 5, N'otimo'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Ward', N'jacqueline.ward4739@example.org', '2014-09-09', 4, N'Hands down the best rpg/shooter game in 2014, not that last year killzone shadow fall was in my top ten but destiny sure over achieves it. The combination of almost similar to Halo is definitely nostalgic, yet bungie has made it their own game. The graphics are greatly detailed and more or less the sci-fi tone is in there. Highly recommend buying it on next gen'),
(N'Anthony', N'Wisniewski', N'anthony.wisniewski2430@example.net', '2014-09-09', 4, N'Good game'),
(N'Michelle', N'Jackson', N'michelle.jackson6271@example.net', '2014-09-09', 3, N'The game is filled with pop in textures and lagging servers that sometimes crash without warning. The story wasn''t that great, not to mention super short for how much you pay for the game. I would rate Battlefield 4 as an ok game that''s not so terrible that it''s not even worth picking up, but there are definitely better games you could choose from the Playstation 4 game library.'),
(N'Scott', N'Bennett', N'scott.bennett3430@example.org', '2014-09-09', 4, N'While the Bioshock franchise will always be my favorite, I really enjoyed this game. It was a good mix of a first-person shooter as well as a sneak/stealth game. There are a lot of options for upgrading depending on your playing style. I especially loved the very stylized and gritty feel of the game. In a lot of ways this game is incredibly similar to the Bioshock games and I would recommend this (and I have already) to everyone. The only downside, and why i downgraded it to 4 stars, is that it was just too short. The downloadable content does add a bit to the time you can spend on it, but I would have preferred to have more added to the campaign story line.'),
(N'Walter', N'Barnes', N'walter.barnes1362@example.com', '2014-09-09', 4, N'Cool to have game audio wirelessly without expensive wireless headset. However, sound quality can be spotty and some crackles will be there. Overall still useable with the reception weaknesses. Volume control button are nice addition. I use these with a pair of beats and sometimes apple earbuds.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Hill', N'deborah.hill9927@example.com', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Does exactly what it is intended to do. Works great with both the official Sony brand controllers as well as the off brand ones. The rumble still works on the controller when I use the extension. It plugs in snugly. It''s pretty durable. I bought two of them and they have lasted me over a year. There is no indication that they are going to break any time soon either.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Morgan', N'pamela.morgan1294@example.net', '2014-09-09', 5, N'good'),
(N'Ravi', N'Martinez', N'ravi.martinez9798@example.net', '2014-09-09', 5, N'Good product'),
(N'Nathan', N'Coleman', N'nathan.coleman1911@example.com', '2014-09-10', 5, N'I used a Logitech G5 for about ten years. It was a fantastic mouse. When I was ready to replace it, I looked for something that was pretty much exactly the same as the G5. The G500s is really a worthy successor to the G5. It''s got all of the things that you expect to have on a gaming mouse without too much nonsense. It''s easy to configure, and you can do quite a bit with the buttons that are there. The mousewheel is just great - I had no idea that I would ever have any reason to use a free-spinning mousewheel, but since I started using this mouse, I use it all the time. When not spinning freely, the wheel has a very, very nice ''clicking'' motion - not a loud motion at all; it just feels perfect. One of my favorite things about the G5 was the adjustable weight. I was very pleased to see that this feature was retained for the G500s. You may find the feature useless, especially if you prefer a super light mouse - I don''t. I like a heavy, substantial mouse. With a quality mousepad, a...'),
(N'Richard', N'White', N'richard.white4545@example.com', '2014-09-10', 5, N'Thank you ! Love it!'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Diaz', N'rebecca.diaz6299@example.net', '2014-09-10', 5, N'Simple pick up and play game for anyone. I play this with my girlfriend often and she hardly games. I can easily play solo on any number of the harder difficulties for more of a challenge by myself.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Carter', N'elizabeth.carter3220@example.com', '2014-09-10', 5, N'excellent, recommend !!!!!'),
(N'Adam', N'Rivera', N'adam.rivera4000@example.org', '2014-09-10', 5, N'You cant put a price on security and this delivers. Worth every cent to protect my system.'),
(N'Wei', N'Allen', N'wei.allen4857@example.org', '2014-09-10', 5, N'I have purchased every major console ever released in the US, with the one exception being the Wii U and I will probably buy that one as well somewhere down the line. When it comes to the companies themselves, I have no preferences. I understand that competition in the marketplace actually benefits gamers substantially as it keeps prices down and it spurs innovation. I have no favorites, I simply want access to the best games of each generation, regardless of what platform they are on. That being said, I definitely prefer gaming on my Xbox over my Playstation and it has absolutely nothing to do with liking one company more than the other and everything to do with the controller. I have never been a big fan of Sony''s dual shock controller. While it works ok, I am just not a fan of the ergonomic aspect of the controller, at all! I start getting cramps in as little as 2-3 hours of gaming. Maybe its just me, but it just doesnt fit my hands well at all. Enter the Xbox 360, which had the...'),
(N'Carlos', N'Ali', N'carlos.ali3475@example.net', '2014-09-10', 5, N'that''s good'),
(N'Richard', N'Diaz', N'richard.diaz6402@example.net', '2014-09-10', 5, N'EXCELLENT ON-LINE PLAY...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Barnes', N'aaron.barnes2937@example.org', '2014-09-10', 5, N'Definitely my favorite Elder Scrolls game. I honestly rather play this than Skyrim. Obviously the graphics aren''t great due to the games age but other than that it''s perfect. I found myself very bored with Skyrim, it holds your hand too much. It tells you exactly where to go, what to do and even indicates it on your map. I also found myself in God mode and killing everything with 1-2 sword strikes by level 15. I got tired of it so I decided to play this game again for the first time in 3 years. While the graphics are bad when you compare them to Skyrim I found myself enjoying it much more. It doesn''t hold your hand or tell you exactly what to do or where to go, you actually have to use your intuition and read things. The combat it much different in this game so keep that in mind if you''ve never played it before.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Anderson', N'douglas.anderson5854@example.com', '2014-09-10', 3, N'The game is real fun to play. Gun play is awesome. Graphics, environment look very pretty. Technically it plays and feels like a Bungie game. Kudos for Activision and Bungie for doing extensive alpha, beta to ensure the game played flawless on launch day. The game is a simple shooter and it is best when played with 2 other friends. Your friends need not be competent, as long as they stay alive you can have lot of fun circle strafing and mowing waves after waves. The big jarring issues with the game is - Lack of content and modes: You will be playing the same missions, just with higher level AI. AI at higher level doesn''t do any thing different, they just throw more minions in the fight. In MP, there is no private lobby or load outs or any thing that we see in standard 3rd tier MP games. - Simple AI; The main boss in most of the strike mission could just be a rock or a big jello. Strike missions will end once you fire close to 2000 bullets at the big boss in the middle. You get...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Richardson', N'michelle.richardson5984@example.net', '2014-09-10', 1, N'The game is good, but the product itself, the Ghost Edition is a complete failure. The packaging was smashed and so the box is garbage and my GHOST REPLICA has dust under the lens (eye) so it''s not looking how it should. Awesome "collector''s edition"'),
(N'Victoria', N'Howard', N'victoria.howard2132@example.org', '2014-09-10', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Sharon', N'Torres', N'sharon.torres8621@example.net', '2014-09-10', 1, N'Try making something new and not reselling customers the same content. This has become an integrity issue.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Flores', N'tyler.flores1942@example.org', '2014-09-10', 4, N'It says it comes with an AC adapter, but it comes with no cord at all. You have to use the charging cable that came with one of your pro controllers for this to work. That''s why I subtracted one star.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Boyd', N'nadia.boyd8023@example.com', '2014-09-10', 4, N'I''ve played Just Dance 2 on the Wii for a while now and got this game to keep with the times. I was kinda sad at the lack of songs that came with the game and suggest for anyone to Google the list of songs in the game before you buy.'),
(N'Brian', N'Suzuki', N'brian.suzuki9227@example.org', '2014-09-10', 3, N'The PS Vita 2000 Silicone Skin does fit the new Vita (a.k.a. the Vita Slim), although it''s a more loose than I would have liked. This makes it easy to put on and take off, but it also diminishes the sleek look of the Vita more than I would have liked. The loose fit winds up just looking sloppy. I also wasn''t a fan of the white printing on the front and the back. On the positive side, it was well-designed to fit all of the Vita''s numerous buttons and controls very well. I expect that it will protect the Vita from scratches but not from any significant shocks or drops. I use the skin when I''m traveling with the Vita and I''m happy enough with it given the low price. However, with a little bit more attention to the fit and looks department, it could have been an always-on solution.'),
(N'Adam', N'Okonkwo', N'adam.okonkwo8104@example.com', '2014-09-10', 5, N'Great game. My family and I really enjoy playing. Somewhat a little difficult compared to other Cabelas games but holds our interest.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Gutierrez', N'timothy.gutierrez9132@example.com', '2014-09-10', 5, N'Excellent PC game, need more of this type of game.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Gutierrez', N'timothy.gutierrez9132@example.com', '2014-09-10', 5, N'Interesting PC game.'),
(N'Jason', N'Cooper', N'jason.cooper1378@example.org', '2014-09-10', 4, N'the sims 3 show time is fun and all.'),
(N'Noah', N'Lopez', N'noah.lopez8861@example.net', '2014-09-11', 5, N'Wow, this game shocked me. Never heard of it before receiving it as a gift, and it is great. Fast paces, heart-pounding, non-stop action, for sure. It is also a very different, futuristic FPS game. LOVED IT!'),
(N'Anita', N'Taylor', N'anita.taylor1694@example.org', '2014-09-11', 5, N'Use it for my ps4 controller since the rubber on the thumb stick is starting to peel. Works great'),
(N'Michael', N'White', N'michael.white3767@example.com', '2014-09-11', 5, N'Thus game is amazing must buy'),
(N'Jacob', N'Miller', N'jacob.miller1609@example.net', '2014-09-11', 4, N'Purchased this game-pad from my local electronics store and have had no issues. The controller hooked up easily to my Windows 8.1 laptop, my MB Air and to my Samsung tab and even on my ps3 when my controller broke. All in all for the price it is close to a great experience. My biggest dislike with this controller is that at times you will have to unplug and fiddle with the buttons to get the computer to recognize. The keys are rather loud and plastic feeling, and even though I have used this controller for more than a year it still has an almost stiff feel to the buttons.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Taylor', N'nicholas.taylor8875@example.org', '2014-09-11', 5, N'You are Aiden Pierce, a hacker on the streets of Chicago bent upon avenging the murder of your six year old niece. Throughout the campaign, you will amass an arenal of leathal firearms and expand your transportation with a plethora of performace cars, heavy freight trucks and fire engines as well as motercycles capable of reaching relative speeds in excess of 185 mph (provided you don''t meet your fate in a head on collision with a dumptruck). Firstly, I want to give praise to the designers behind the vehicle performace engine. Each car is unique with its own areas of high performance and limitations. Accelleration and braking are handled in a realistic manner and with the handbrake (controlled with (B) on Xbox) you can now drift around hairpin turns with ease. Just try and avoid the newstand. Your car will never run out of gas however, when engaging in car battle, be sure to jump into a beefy muscle car or heavy truck unless you want to find yourself downrange of a police blockade...'),
(N'Judith', N'Johnson', N'judith.johnson9580@example.net', '2014-09-11', 5, N'Cool game very cool'),
(N'Mateo', N'Butler', N'mateo.butler4636@example.org', '2014-09-11', 5, N'I throughly enjoyed the first Dead Space which I say a thrilling and creative experince. Well everything from the first one has been improved upon in the sequel. The only complaints I can say about this game is that it seemed short, but that could just be from me playing it non-stop. Also, some of the events that happen could be seen as just another rehashing of the original game and may seem stale to the average player. Really those are not even my complaints, just some possible ones. I''m officially a fan of this franchise and am looking forward to the third installment, which I have heard some bad things about, but I will be the judge of that myself.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Wright', N'jennifer.wright3437@example.org', '2014-09-11', 5, N'At the time of purchase, Amazon had the best price for the 12 month gold membership card. It worked perfectly.....no issues downloading.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ivanov', N'ryan.ivanov6341@example.net', '2014-09-11', 1, N's*** overkill too much going on in to little place, gtav rules.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Howard', N'jerry.howard7992@example.org', '2014-09-11', 5, N'The silicone protective fits very good on the controller,but there is mild to strong odor of paint coming from the silicone case. I would recommend going on YouTube and looking at a video on how to put these on the controller, since there are no instructions that come with the package. The material is kind of thin and it can tear apart easily if your not being careful.'),
(N'Steven', N'Jackson', N'steven.jackson1164@example.com', '2014-09-11', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Janet', N'King', N'janet.king3491@example.org', '2014-09-11', 4, N'for some like me instead of getting my vanity pet after redeeming my key and then logging into the game it took 24 hours after redeeming the key to get a in-game mail with the pet attached to it.'),
(N'Wei', N'Flores', N'wei.flores8954@example.org', '2014-09-11', 5, N'This product will allow you to connect a ps2 controller to a ps3 but what they don''t put on there is that it can connect a ps1 and ps2 controller to a pc. this product will go great and is way better than having a snes controller where the dpad is not so good. most likely I will buy another one.'),
(N'Charles', N'Ali', N'charles.ali2419@example.org', '2014-09-11', 5, N'As Advertised & Shipped Quickly'),
(N'Andrea', N'Powell', N'andrea.powell3267@example.org', '2014-09-12', 4, N'Dont get me wrong Destiny has incredible graphics, and a well thought out story. But this is Bungie. I expected a lot more from them, especially because this was supposed to show that they could something else besides Halo. I don''t think they achieved that.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Chen', N'olivia.chen5949@example.com', '2014-09-12', 5, N'Very pleased with these. I bought this set with my new Destiny/PS4 bundle. They sound great! My friends have no problem hearing me and my family don''t have to listen to my surround sound blaring in the house. The only beef I have is more the PS4... The wireless USB headset adapter. Once plugged into the PS4, you only have one USB port left. When both your controller and headset are beginning to depleat, you have no extra port to play and charge. This headset will pick up your noisey kids too. All the complaints aside, I still give this headset a solid *FIVE STARS* I can''t speak for the black headset, but this white set is just SEXY!!!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Baker', N'hannah.baker6377@example.org', '2014-09-12', 1, N'I don''t like hack and slash.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Webb', N'amanda.webb1296@example.org', '2014-09-12', 5, N'Excellent item!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Morales', N'aisha.morales4538@example.net', '2014-09-13', 2, N'Front and rear wheel steering? Really? I think the first Monster Jam games were easier to play for a younger audience and the control scheme in this one over complicated things. I will probably sell this so I don''t have to hear the kids complain about how hard it is.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Henderson', N'evelyn.henderson1490@example.org', '2014-09-13', 5, N'Excelent product; THE BEST !!!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Gonzalez', N'kenneth.gonzalez7205@example.org', '2014-09-13', 5, N'was good little short and did not have too many places to go. big deal was mostly underground. it was too short for me. it was enjoyable, but could have been better'),
(N'Thomas', N'Richardson', N'thomas.richardson1471@example.net', '2014-09-13', 5, N'*BE SURE TO PLAY THE FIRST ONE FIRST!!* This isn''t one of those games where you can jump in at any game and get the full experience--if you want the FULL Danganronpa "Hope Defeats Despair''s Ugly Face" Experience, play the first one FIRST! Anyway, this game is everything you want it to be, and more! Similar gameplay to the first, but with improvements. There is also an open world where you can roam freely in a 3rd person sorta way. DGR2 keeps it up with crazy character designs and insanely amazing character personalities--twists, tough trials, inklings to the first game, the whole 9 yards! And best of all, there''s a great ending that ties up most of the loose ends--unlike the first game''s ambiguous ending! The only downside is that the game is a little short--but that might because I played it religiously for days on end...time flies when you''re having fun! Long story short, PLAY it, ENJOY it!! But play the first game first!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Henderson', N'pamela.henderson7392@example.com', '2014-09-13', 5, N'Classics.'),
(N'Eric', N'Murphy', N'eric.murphy4596@example.net', '2014-09-13', 5, N'Creates magical powers when played in game. Great magic elemental character.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Cruz', N'kathleen.cruz4644@example.org', '2014-09-13', 5, N'Guild Wars 2 has been out for a while, but without a doubt a great game. The amount of exploration in this game is huge and there''s always something to do from missions to events to huge world events. I would highly advise to play with a friend as it does make the game much funner, and you''ll have someone to level with. Overall GW2 is well worth the cost as it truly is a good game.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Nelson', N'carolyn.nelson6219@example.com', '2014-09-13', 5, N'This adapted is exactly what you need if you are trying to connect your old Xbox 360 gaming headsets onto the Xbox one. Only your chat pin goes into the adapted and the speaker one goes into your TV/monitor. So far so good, no complains here.'),
(N'Robert', N'Foster', N'robert.foster9532@example.net', '2014-09-13', 5, N'The battery was easy to install and it works perfectly. I would recomend this item to any 3DS owner. My son no longer has to charge the battery daily,which has damaged the charge dock.'),
(N'Debra', N'Johnson', N'debra.johnson3102@example.net', '2014-09-13', 5, N'All tested and all work great.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wang', N'jacqueline.wang1628@example.org', '2014-09-13', 5, N'entertaining'),
(N'Omar', N'Myers', N'omar.myers6925@example.org', '2014-09-13', 2, N'Bulky, inflexible and ugly. The Xbox 360 plug''s switch (HD/SD) gets flipped too easily, which completely reboots your Xbox. You can''t have it plugged into two things at once, even if one is off, or it gets confused (loss of audio, etc)'),
(N'Lucia', N'Barnes', N'lucia.barnes4043@example.com', '2014-09-13', 4, N'These have a nice feel to them and easily stretch over the existing original thumb grips. I do think I have a defective set however. Every five times I play there is one that is constantly coming off. But they are the best thumb grips I have used yet! I just have to keep my eye on that one so I do not lose it.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Clark', N'jessica.clark5923@example.com', '2014-09-13', 5, N'good'),
(N'Omar', N'Barnes', N'omar.barnes8768@example.net', '2014-09-13', 5, N'Presently playing CRYSIS. Already played CRYSIS WARHEAD and CRYSIS-2. Makes the next games make sense. This game is intense and hard in the easiest level, but great fun and challenge.'),
(N'Linda', N'Hall', N'linda.hall1866@example.com', '2014-09-14', 5, N'My son liked this game a lot'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Wilson', N'tomasz.wilson6635@example.com', '2014-09-14', 5, N'I was once dispatched by Jeff Rothschild to help out Id Software on Quake''s networking code on DOS. After I was done with the work, I was invited by Carmack, Romero, and Cash to a friendly LAN game of Quake. "We''ll give you all the weapons and come after you with axes." That match barely lasted 15s, with me dead and all I was carrying gone. As you can imagine, I''m not a great first person shooter (FPS) gamer, nor is the FPS my favorite choice of genre. However, I''m cheap and love a good deal, so when PSN had a sale on Killzone Mercenary and I saw the rave reviews online, I picked it up. I tried the first mission and died very quickly, and so dismissed it as being too hard for a noob like me until I bought my brother a PS Vita Slim for his birthday. Unlike me, he''s a FPS aficionado, and so I started playing the game again in the hopes that we could do a multiplayer game one of these days. Surprisingly, the PS Vita Slim has been sold out on all on-line stores, so if you want one my...'),
(N'Debra', N'Powell', N'debra.powell2262@example.net', '2014-09-14', 4, N'Great gift. Love Reel Deal Slots'),
(N'Debra', N'Powell', N'debra.powell2262@example.net', '2014-09-14', 3, N'Was a gift'),
(N'Patricia', N'Gonzalez', N'patricia.gonzalez2926@example.com', '2014-09-14', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Donald', N'Sanders', N'donald.sanders5867@example.com', '2014-09-14', 5, N'the best game'),
(N'Patrick', N'Murphy', N'patrick.murphy8834@example.org', '2014-09-14', 3, N'There is something to be said about the first time you load up a new game. Those feelings are ramped up a notch when its a brand new IP. The level of anticipation and the feeling of anything being possible as you embark on a completely new adventure. Unless you have been living under a rock on a deserted island then you have most likely heard about this little game called Destiny developed by Bungie over the past four plus years. It promised to be equal parts MMO and FPS rolled into, as Bungie likes to call it, a Shared-World Shooter. Therein lays the central issue that prevents Destiny from, to quote their marketing tagline, Become a legend. Simply put, Destiny has an identity issue; it never seems to know what it wants to do, but tries to do everything. Prior to release Bungie promised gamers an epic engaging world changing story. With deep narrative that would engage the player even after the story had come to a close. Sadly, the story if you can even call it thatis anything...'),
(N'Carol', N'Brown', N'carol.brown8251@example.com', '2014-09-14', 4, N'The Sims 4 is a much better game than I would have been lead to believe had I gone by MetaCritic user reviews alone. The primary complaint seems to be the lack of content, but it has about as much as I expected for a base game, given the history of the Sims and its expansion packs. The core engine, however, more than makes up for it. The seamless world is now gone and instead there are loading screens when you travel between lots. There are two towns and each town is broken up into about a half-dozen neighborhoods. There is one "downtown" neighborhood with bars etc., one park, and a number of housing neighborhoods. While in each neighborhood, your sim(s) can wander about throughout the whole neighborhood but will experience a loading screen if you attempt to enter a lot that is not the one you''re currently "in." Overall, I think this system is actually an improvement over the seamless world because the load times (and save times!) are much, much faster than in the Sims 3. Each...'),
(N'Michael', N'Bennett', N'michael.bennett4769@example.com', '2014-09-14', 1, N'This is the worst piece of crap Nintendo has put out in decades. The range is less than 10 feet for the wireless controllers. They insist on forcing you to use the old wii-motes for games, and you can only pair 1 tablet to each wiiu. They shot themselves in the foot there. Besides, our tablet just tells us it cannot connect to the base, and NOBODY KNOWS HOW TO FIX IT. We are being told to just buy a new tablet, and if that doesn''t work to buy a new wiiu. WHAT??????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????? Our friends lost hundreds, if not thousands of hours of saved data on the infinity game. That is a trap by the way. It will cost you THOUSANDS of dollars to get all the figurines needed to play as the characters. IF YOU LOSE THE FIGURINE YOU LOSE THE ABILITY TO PLAY AS THAT CHARACTER!!!!! Who do these a-holes think they are anyway?'),
(N'Shirley', N'Nowak', N'shirley.nowak2367@example.net', '2014-09-14', 5, N'very light better design than xbox and ps for me. easy to use maybe some would say the Y button is hard to reach but it is just fine.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Nowak', N'shirley.nowak2367@example.net', '2014-09-14', 5, N'next generation console. the beast console this generation. i''m waiting for the new Fifa game for me to be back again for playing with my PS4. So far, Wii U games and a few Madden 15 games for me.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Morgan', N'ryan.morgan5595@example.com', '2014-09-15', 4, N'Not the worst game I''ve ever played, and on the other hand, it''s not THE BEST game that I''ve ever played. For a launch title on the PS4, this one is a very solid choice.'),
(N'Linda', N'Torres', N'linda.torres4641@example.org', '2014-09-15', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Donald', N'Ross', N'donald.ross5653@example.net', '2014-09-15', 4, N'Good Game'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Russell', N'cheryl.russell2186@example.net', '2014-09-15', 4, N'Sweet game...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Watson', N'kenneth.watson3225@example.org', '2014-09-15', 4, N'It came with a cardboard case which my son was not happy about.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Smith', N'anthony.smith6438@example.com', '2014-09-15', 5, N'THE BEST AMAZON PC GAMES AND PRICES'),
(N'Christine', N'Brown', N'christine.brown3468@example.com', '2014-09-15', 4, N'Works on Windows 8.1 64 bit. Sometimes misbehaves, but I just re-install the driver and it starts working again. But that is an easily ignorable problem for me and the benefit is great being able to use an xbox controller for my Steam games.'),
(N'Walter', N'Phillips', N'walter.phillips4242@example.com', '2014-09-15', 5, N'Good as OEM. In fact, might BE OEM.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Butler', N'olivia.butler3376@example.org', '2014-09-15', 5, N'Before Skyrim: 192 lbs., training for my first triathlon, completed 100 mile bike ride, promoted 4 times in 3 years at company, dating three attractive, intelligent women and moving towards a serious relationship with one. After Skyrim: 265 lbs., run out of breath walking up a flight of stairs, rejected from over 2 dozen interviews and trying desperately not to get fired, haven''t touched a woman in months. Totally worth it.'),
(N'Omar', N'Smith', N'omar.smith3442@example.net', '2014-09-15', 5, N'Great game, one of the best local couch co-op on the wii-u right now. Tracks are fun, good visuals recommend pro controllers to go with it.'),
(N'Dee', N'Rodriguez', N'dee.rodriguez8274@example.com', '2014-09-16', 5, N'This was all too great for me and I''m excited to have this.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Davis', N'kimberly.davis1811@example.net', '2014-09-16', 5, N'Awesome game , great grafics , fun and easy play. Not for kids under 5 , a bit hard for that age. Great fast delivery too.'),
(N'Joan', N'Price', N'joan.price6038@example.org', '2014-09-16', 3, N'sounds ok for the price. nothing amazing. my biggest problem and why i would not recommend it is that the increments by which you can increase/decrease the volume are huge. the volume goes from whisper quiet to almost painfully loud in just one increment of volume increase. i contacted customer support and there is nothing they say they can do and if the volume goes up and down then it''s working and there is no more fine adjustment. bass can only be adjusted by the remote. some connections are in awkward positions to access.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Okonkwo', N'kimberly.okonkwo4265@example.org', '2014-09-16', 4, N'very nice game for him.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Morgan', N'jeffrey.morgan2272@example.org', '2014-09-16', 5, N'good gift'),
(N'Rachel', N'Jenkins', N'rachel.jenkins3005@example.com', '2014-09-16', 5, N'Love it. Simple. Thin. Great low price. Not to bulky. Doesn''t have a much of crap I don''t need built in. Holds my system upright and looks sleek while doing it.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Mitchell', N'christopher.mitchell5590@example.com', '2014-09-16', 4, N'not bad not as stealthy as other hitman games but still fun'),
(N'Olivia', N'Chen', N'olivia.chen9846@example.com', '2014-09-16', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Rachel', N'Cook', N'rachel.cook1653@example.net', '2014-09-16', 2, N'will never b like the 1st on PS 1'),
(N'Jessica', N'Martinez', N'jessica.martinez5014@example.com', '2014-09-16', 3, N'I expected a lot more from this game... honestly, except for the cut scenes, it is downright lack-luster. The game appears to run on the same game engine as "Defiance" and has very similar (eerily similar) game play. It combines So-So FPS action against cookie cutter bosses, inter-mixed with "stunning" cut scenes that only get your hopes up while you "travel" (push A to fast travel??? REALLY???) to bland bases with little to no interaction or plot development. Run here, get this mission, talk to this guy, kill 40 of these things... take this item.. ran back to the start... "push A to fast travel"... it''s just rather monotonous and dull. This game is another in a long line of disappointments that have urged me towards giving up my Xbox in general... and also one that leads me to believe we should be able to demand our money back when a game disappoints us to this extent.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Evans', N'barbara.evans8107@example.com', '2014-09-17', 5, N'Fallout 3 allows the player the opportunity to immerse himself/herself into the fantasy world of post-apocalyptic America. Quite enjoyable.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Reed', N'sarah.reed3604@example.org', '2014-09-17', 5, N'Fun and challenging game. Love it!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Reed', N'kelly.reed6317@example.com', '2014-09-17', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Victoria', N'Cooper', N'victoria.cooper7153@example.com', '2014-09-17', 1, N'Don''t even waste your time or money. I admit I got it gave it a try and was completely disgusted with the hype and unanswered questions before the game came out. For all you newbie players, you might like it but for a long time eashl player and vet of the game series, what a rip off. I went back to the ps3 version and that is almost a carbon copy of 14. Ea you really flubbed this one and it''s going to take a lot to gain my trust back. Read the 5 and 4 star reviews, it was either grandpa and grandma Christmas gifts or 10 year olds who have bought their very first ea nhl hockey game. Or they have no clue or have played an actual game of Hockey, go to bed!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Butler', N'nancy.butler5852@example.net', '2014-09-17', 5, N'Nice product'),
(N'Steven', N'Tanaka', N'steven.tanaka3896@example.org', '2014-09-17', 2, N'Dont like it because it is a cheap build, not like the Taipan. Taipan has sensors to calibrate the tracking and feels better. Naga Hex has the shiny surface, believe me it looks great but when you play it slips and I feel it gets warm after time. I bought it with SteelSeries 4HD Pro Gaming Mouse when I put it on the surface bottom corner right was touching the mouse pad. It felt off and the noise was irritating. Thanks god that I had some stickers from another mouse so I elevate it about 0.5 mm. Now it has no issues. But out of the box you couldn''t use it like that.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Nelson', N'jacob.nelson3094@example.com', '2014-09-18', 5, N'Just a straight improvement over the first game. Huge selection of songs and nice added features. I''m very please with my purchase. Showed up very early on launch day no damage to the limited edition. Can''t wait to get into Versus mode with my friends.'),
(N'Dee', N'Mendoza', N'dee.mendoza9043@example.org', '2014-09-18', 5, N'This may sound odd, but out of all the Pokemon Mystery Dungeon games I''ve sampled... Gates of Infinity was the best I ever played. Call it personal biased, but I''ve always hated the Hunger feature of the previous Mystery Dungeon games. They put too much stress on me, and took me right out of enjoying any moment of it. Plus the fact that you were apart of a Guild, doing what the "Boss" tells you to, to make money, and only getting a small amount of it, never set well with me, either. Gates of Infinity removed these problems, and made YOU, the player, the Guild Leader. It allows you full customization of your land, from setting up Berry Fields to help you through dungeons, Dojos that up the stats of specific Pokemon types for better move sets, and even Mini Games to acquire common and rare items that can be useful to you within and out of the story. The one downside would probably be the lack of the Pokemon Quiz, however I never fully liked that either. The Pokemon choices, however...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Howard', N'ravi.howard7502@example.net', '2014-09-18', 5, N'awesome. Love it.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Russell', N'victoria.russell4915@example.org', '2014-09-18', 5, N'PRICE AND IST TO RECIEVE');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Donna', N'Miller', N'donna.miller4866@example.net', '2014-09-18', 2, N'I was really looking forward to playing this but was disappointed to discover the game suffered from a lack of polish in many areas. Mainly, the painfully slow process of character progression coupled with the insane cost of character upgrades. The combat is also lacking - you can''t "lock on" to an enemy and have the camera automatically keep them in view during combat - you have repeatedly take your thumb off the attack button to reposition the camera with the thumbstick to keep your foe in sight, couple that with the slow-to-respond controls & you will quickly become irritated. Also your attacks are pretty weak until you are able to afford some expensive new moves - which as I already mentioned happens at a snails-pace. The in-game map system is another nightmare. When you get to a new area you''re pretty much left on your own to wander around trying to find someone who will sell you a map. Why doesn''t the character have the ability to make a map on the fly as you travel and...'),
(N'Melissa', N'Jones', N'melissa.jones5149@example.net', '2014-09-18', 1, N'I installed the game but could not play it. It said I needed to register the game but there seem to be no way to register online, like the site was no more.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Jones', N'melissa.jones5149@example.net', '2014-09-18', 1, N'boring. old game'),
(N'Angela', N'Singh', N'angela.singh8028@example.org', '2014-09-18', 5, N'works'),
(N'Douglas', N'Parker', N'douglas.parker8994@example.net', '2014-09-18', 1, N'Bad movie'),
(N'Ashley', N'Gomez', N'ashley.gomez6368@example.com', '2014-09-18', 5, N'Excellent product! SUPER FAST DELIVERY! THANKS!'),
(N'Dee', N'Jackson', N'dee.jackson5060@example.org', '2014-09-19', 5, N'I absolutely LOVE this game on PS4. I am also a PC owner of the game and I now prefer to play on my console. Game has only gotten better with the changes brought forth by Blizzard. With them promising patch support for consoles this game will only get better.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Rogers', N'christopher.rogers4295@example.net', '2014-09-19', 4, N'Final Fantasy III was originally not released in the US, along with II. However, II saw a release with Final Fantasy Origins on the PlayStation 1 with the original Final Fantasy, and also on Game Boy Advance. This DS release is the first time the American audience has seen, and it''s quite a good one. Like the first two games, you only have 4 characters, but III originated the Job system. You unlocked different Jobs, or Classes, for your characters as the story moves along, and you end up with quite a few different options for your party. You start out with the original 6 Jobs from the first game, Warrior, Thief, White Mage, Black Mage, Red Mage, and Monk, and eventually you have 23 to choose from. Being able to mix and match your characters'' abilities is nice, as your party is never predetermined. The music is fantastic, as always with a Final Fantasy game, and the graphics are quite nice for the DS. Also, the game is fairly difficult. If you''re not a fan of leveling up your...'),
(N'George', N'Perry', N'george.perry6952@example.net', '2014-09-19', 5, N'Best game on PS4!'),
(N'Mary', N'Peterson', N'mary.peterson4173@example.org', '2014-09-19', 5, N'Love hello kitty, and I love this, comes in handy'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ortiz', N'ryan.ortiz4314@example.com', '2014-09-19', 5, N'Awesome beta'),
(N'Megan', N'Alvarez', N'megan.alvarez2219@example.net', '2014-09-19', 3, N'It''s not bad. It crashes easily though.'),
(N'Robert', N'Chen', N'robert.chen6771@example.net', '2014-09-20', 5, N'very good iting thanks'),
(N'Andrea', N'Russell', N'andrea.russell7882@example.net', '2014-09-20', 5, N'Loved this game. And this was from someone who was burnt out on shooters because of Halo and Call Of Duty!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Russell', N'andrea.russell7882@example.net', '2014-09-20', 5, N'Awesome little collection'),
(N'Samantha', N'Patel', N'samantha.patel7533@example.com', '2014-09-20', 5, N'Perfect bundle!!!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Miller', N'elizabeth.miller6135@example.com', '2014-09-21', 3, N'It''s a cute hidden-object game. The graphics are nice, but the game is a little slow. I play it once in a while and enjoy it for a while.'),
(N'Walter', N'Mitchell', N'walter.mitchell3054@example.org', '2014-09-21', 5, N'Underrated gem in my opinion. For 20bucks it''s a bargain. Fun game with a little scary moments. Wacky as hell but that the point.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Anderson', N'brandon.anderson7138@example.org', '2014-09-21', 4, N'Lots of action!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Anderson', N'brandon.anderson7138@example.org', '2014-09-21', 5, N'Not your big name mouse, has some big features to love. Would recommend it. Good customer service, had a dead one at first, glad I did not give up, got it replaced, no issues since.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Anderson', N'brandon.anderson7138@example.org', '2014-09-21', 2, N'Have to watch out for the code problem with any used PC game today, if it is already used, the software blocks install. Only buy if being purchased as a replacement disk.'),
(N'Paul', N'Collins', N'paul.collins8156@example.com', '2014-09-21', 5, N'First off let me say that I didn''t like this game. I guess I''m just too old school to appreciate new innovative games and ideas. I like Mario games similar to SM64 with big levels and variety. Mario Galaxy was the exact opposite with small similar space based levels. I also prefer the old controllers over the motion sensitive ones. I don''t want to wave my arms about just to play a video game. Anyway don''t let it be said I don''t have an open mind. Being a long time Nintendo fan I wanted to give it a try and even though I didn''t care for it I do think it''s a great innovative game for those that like new experiences. As are all Nintendo''s games it was very polished. The graphics were beautiful and control was spot on. Nintendo spent a lot time on getting it perfect and they succeeded. Even though it wasn''t the kind of Mario game I was hoping for it certainly deserves five stars.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Reyes', N'sharon.reyes7853@example.com', '2014-09-21', 5, N'excellent producto and time'),
(N'Shirley', N'Castillo', N'shirley.castillo3460@example.com', '2014-09-21', 5, N'Can''t believe how much time I can still spend on this game. This was one of the best GTA games ever in my opinion, aside from GTA 5 of course.'),
(N'Betty', N'Clark', N'betty.clark2516@example.org', '2014-09-21', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Ramos', N'jennifer.ramos9786@example.org', '2014-09-21', 5, N'Daughter stole this from me. I liked it while I had it.'),
(N'Justin', N'Davis', N'justin.davis8022@example.org', '2014-09-21', 5, N'Variety of levels keep you on your toes!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Castillo', N'samuel.castillo7234@example.net', '2014-09-22', 5, N'I love this franchise to death the humor the epicness that they deliver right before a big battle it''s the perfect mixture of light heartedness and seriousness at the same time. There''s a great amount of replay value as with every Disgaea game once you finish the main story you have the post game which introduces the secret characters all the dlc from the original disgaea 4 the cheat shop allows you to make things even harder hence why there''s replay value. Overall it''s great as a game I know about the bugs well only the baciel 1 since it happened to me eh not a big deal can''t wait for disgaea 5!..oh and SARDINES! Eat lots and lots of SARDINES!!! Playing this game :p'),
(N'Julie', N'Russell', N'julie.russell8430@example.org', '2014-09-22', 5, N'If you enjoyed the Hyperdimension Neptunia games, you will enjoy Fairy Fencer F. Fun characters, lighthearted story and nifty combat system all made for an enjoyable experience.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Cruz', N'lucia.cruz5662@example.com', '2014-09-22', 5, N'It charges within no time great buy looks good'),
(N'Helen', N'Jackson', N'helen.jackson1755@example.org', '2014-09-22', 5, N'Redeemable on Steam. Have not yet played the game but there are many in depth game reviews out there.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Young', N'raymond.young5074@example.com', '2014-09-22', 5, N'Excellent...'),
(N'Jacob', N'Garcia', N'jacob.garcia3972@example.net', '2014-09-22', 5, N'My husband loves it SO MUCH!!'),
(N'Lisa', N'Smith', N'lisa.smith6998@example.com', '2014-09-22', 4, N'As a more "unrealistic" racing game enthusiast this really peaked my interest. It has extreme neck breaking speeds, sharp curves, and plenty of destruction. It really has lived up to the expectations of the franchise in my opinion. A list of my favorite features are as follows: -You can see other players on the map and race them head to head on the fly -Plenty of car upgrades and the ability to unlock more including pursuit tech -Rather large map that is open world'),
(N'Nancy', N'Reyes', N'nancy.reyes2697@example.org', '2014-09-22', 4, N'My fav golf game!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Reyes', N'nancy.reyes2697@example.org', '2014-09-22', 3, N'Fun group game'),
(N'Kofi', N'Taylor', N'kofi.taylor4947@example.net', '2014-09-22', 5, N'I thought they didn''t work, but I didn''t follow all of the directions completely. Comfortable, great sound, and one volume control for listening to chat and another for all other sound. If you play any kind of online co-op games you need a headset with a good microphone. These are perfect for the price. Ideally, you shouldn''t have your console directly above your screen because the cord will block your view. The cord is rather heavy, but it''s quite long (which you want) so it has to be thick to carry the signal. The cord doesn''t have a shirt clip, but I don''t want one. I''d forget it was attached, set the headphones down, then walk away while still tethered to the console.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Moore', N'tomasz.moore4642@example.org', '2014-09-22', 5, N'It works great, I transferred all of my info from my other memory card and it works great. the only thing I noticed one of the screws was a little loose but I read that''s how it supposed to be, if they are too tight card may not work. I''m a happy camper now because I can play all my old PS 2 games again.'),
(N'Anita', N'Nguyen', N'anita.nguyen1217@example.org', '2014-09-23', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Stephen', N'Peterson', N'stephen.peterson9500@example.net', '2014-09-23', 3, N'Great concept and design, but it''s just a big hassle most of the time. I have it connected to my PC and Xbox and it ha the ability to change channels with the push of a button but getting it set up to work correctly was a pain in the ass since it can only receive one digital optical and one set of red/white R/L stereo hookups. In both situations, then you need another hookup for the mic to work and you end up using a minimum of four different cords hooked up properly. That''s not really that bad, but then the headset likes to register sounds and voices incredibly low. Razer replies saying you need to amp up the volume then, but then music destroys your eardrum while voices are regular. They then suggest you turn down main music volume and keep voice volume maxed which you then have to change every game you play. When you decide not to use your headset since you''re playing single player or something, then the game is super quiet and you end up changing to volume back, then a friend...'),
(N'Paul', N'Thomas', N'paul.thomas6881@example.net', '2014-09-23', 5, N'got this for my grandson for christmas so he hasn''t played it yet but I charged it and played with it and it was ok'),
(N'Melissa', N'Thomas', N'melissa.thomas7228@example.net', '2014-09-23', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Kelly', N'Bennett', N'kelly.bennett6179@example.com', '2014-09-23', 5, N'I love it . The Ps4 user interface i fast. Big upgrade from the Ps3. I am not a fan of Destiny personally still a solid 7/10 i would grade it , I just bought it for the white console. I uploaded a few pictures. One thing to know is you won''t be able to sell the game(destiny disk) back to a retailer like Gamestop because it has the "Not for Resale" on both the Game disk and the case.( Check the pictures) Now, my only downside is the controller''s battery life. Not as long as the Ps3, but I am grateful enough that I didn''t have to deal with replaceable batteries. I am mostly playing Call of Duty Ghost which looks a lot better than the Ps3 version.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Cox', N'ashley.cox9580@example.org', '2014-09-23', 5, N'This is a good product, I like it'),
(N'Amara', N'Rogers', N'amara.rogers7181@example.net', '2014-09-23', 1, N'doesn''t work with newer OS'),
(N'Daniel', N'Hall', N'daniel.hall9815@example.org', '2014-09-23', 5, N'This is one of the all-time greatest games ever made. Period. Exclamation Mark. Quadruple exclamation mark.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Anderson', N'douglas.anderson5854@example.com', '2014-09-23', 4, N'Compared to the PS3 eye, this camera is far far better. Works much better even under indoor lights. If you use the move controller, it pretty much picks up movement 100% of the time even with zero lights. You could even use it for simple commands like turning on and off the PS4. For the price it is a cool accessory to have, especially Playroom app uses it very well. It is not good enough for Just Dance and other games without move controller. It will get easily confused if more than one person is in front of the camera. But for the price, it is hard to expect more. Wish it used standard USB interface.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Lewis', N'mateo.lewis2523@example.net', '2014-09-23', 5, N'Game works great'),
(N'Heather', N'Jones', N'heather.jones1995@example.org', '2014-09-23', 4, N'destiny, I just need to play it more. I'' not a group player yet, I''m 57 and not the greatest player so I will have to find a group that is will to teach and let me get better which I would love to do. I just picked my avatar and have yet to get started but I am going to spend the entire next weekend playing and learning. hope later to find some people to play with.'),
(N'Anna', N'Raghunathan', N'anna.raghunathan4002@example.net', '2014-09-23', 2, N'Fits okay and looks okay but not practical at all. If you enjoy playing games then skip this and keep your ps4 controller naked. It affects the dual thumb sticks motion and the face buttons as well. Also it does not add any grip so why bother. When I put it on and tried to play infamous second son I hated the experience since I couldn''t control and attack with precision. I took it off right away and gameplay felt good and precise again. So skip this.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Rodriguez', N'jeremy.rodriguez1207@example.org', '2014-09-24', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Brown', N'jennifer.brown1419@example.org', '2014-09-24', 5, N'i am very happy whit this article.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Cooper', N'katherine.cooper4771@example.com', '2014-09-24', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Diane', N'Reyes', N'diane.reyes3597@example.net', '2014-09-24', 5, N'works great!'),
(N'Donna', N'Hill', N'donna.hill6178@example.com', '2014-09-24', 4, N'I like it'),
(N'Jacob', N'Edwards', N'jacob.edwards9533@example.org', '2014-09-24', 5, N'Great sounding, comfortable, sound quality is through the roof, the sound clearity is better than the steelseries Siberia V2, only issue i had was my mic doesn''t work but i bought my set refurbished so the issue might have been on the mic, they tried fixing it and it didn''t work. Still a great product'),
(N'Laura', N'Nguyen', N'laura.nguyen5466@example.com', '2014-09-24', 5, N'The product works well, but I don''t like the games that go with it! I got the product in excellent shape and in good time!'),
(N'Peter', N'Myers', N'peter.myers1220@example.net', '2014-09-24', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Wei', N'Jones', N'wei.jones8279@example.com', '2014-09-24', 5, N'Fantastic Game. One of the best RPGs of all time. Blizzard did a great job. Fun for all ages, in my opinion.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Sanders', N'jeremy.sanders3251@example.org', '2014-09-24', 5, N'Item packaged well and shipped promptly. Item undamaged and as described.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Ali', N'barbara.ali5948@example.org', '2014-09-24', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Michelle', N'Jackson', N'michelle.jackson6271@example.net', '2014-09-24', 5, N'With Mega Man X Collection you get all your favorite Mega Man X games in one great gaming masterpiece! This is essential to own for any Mega Man fan for a fairly cheap price. It''s definitely worth it.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Jackson', N'michelle.jackson6271@example.net', '2014-09-24', 5, N'By far the best campaign of a shooter I have ever played except maybe the Halo series.'),
(N'Priya', N'Richardson', N'priya.richardson7847@example.net', '2014-09-24', 5, N'Great football game to all those who love football!'),
(N'Susan', N'Khan', N'susan.khan8135@example.com', '2014-09-24', 5, N'excellent, I am satisfied with the product'),
(N'Justin', N'Martin', N'justin.martin8598@example.com', '2014-09-24', 5, N'Excellent product !! arrive on time !! perfect !!'),
(N'James', N'Murphy', N'james.murphy4003@example.org', '2014-09-24', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Robinson', N'carolyn.robinson7085@example.net', '2014-09-24', 5, N'Terrific 1st person shooter game. AI has greatly improved but you still get idiot enemies from time to time. The sound is perfect for gunfire. A little light on the grenade. I play this game from time to time over and over. Fun to shoot the weapons and idiot enemies.'),
(N'Judith', N'Mendoza', N'judith.mendoza2506@example.com', '2014-09-25', 5, N'Works perfectly for my PC gaming purposes.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Stewart', N'gregory.stewart9325@example.org', '2014-09-25', 5, N'LOVE! I have three of these and they have held up to three kids. Wonderful product!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Diaz', N'jeremy.diaz7240@example.org', '2014-09-25', 5, N'I''ve beaten the game already and atm I''m capping out my vanguard marks for better gear. I don''t know about you guys but the gameplay is addicting when is the last time someone gets a game for the story? I don''t know about you but when I play mmos I skip the story all the time. It''s all about gameplay baby! And Destiny''s just that. Wanna be the best? Go grind the levels and get your legendary ain''t it fun working up to be the best? And plus there''s 6 man raids possibly more in the future! It''s so called an mmo which means content is released later so stop hating go play the new upcoming call of duty if you don''t like work.'),
(N'Jacob', N'James', N'jacob.james2602@example.org', '2014-09-25', 5, N'I love this product. It is so much easier to just charge my controllers after use then to have to replace batteries all the time. The product was in great condition when I got it in the mail and it works great.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Okonkwo', N'timothy.okonkwo1631@example.net', '2014-09-25', 5, N'GREAT. CAME AND WORKS AS EXPECTED.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Wood', N'deborah.wood9030@example.net', '2014-09-25', 5, N'Great Order. It has the guides that I need. Great Price, Gets down to every little detail in the game.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Wang', N'ronald.wang3716@example.com', '2014-09-25', 4, N'Silent Hill Origins is cool'),
(N'Jose', N'Wang', N'jose.wang6072@example.org', '2014-09-25', 1, N'Absolutely god awful. If you played Fifa 14 right when it came out you would remember how terrible ball control and passing was from launch. This is the EXACT same thing as Fifa 15. Passing takes 3 seconds to register with the player and ball control is completely gone from this game. EA SAID they enhanced the 360 ball control but what they really meant to say was they took it out of the game completely. This game is completely void of any enhancements from the previous installment and even went as far as taking away game modes like tournament mode... All in all this game is a complete waste of time and should not be bought (to save from pulling out hair) until they put out a giant patch fixing everything they "worked hard to improve." EA has once again taken $60 from me, promising to give hours of fun, instead giving me a nice $60 door stop... A terrible one at that.'),
(N'Henry', N'Gutierrez', N'henry.gutierrez9920@example.org', '2014-09-25', 1, N'not user friendly at all.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Robinson', N'brenda.robinson3268@example.com', '2014-09-25', 5, N'My son loves his Skylanders Giants! Thanks Amazon!'),
(N'Edward', N'Scott', N'edward.scott8908@example.net', '2014-09-25', 5, N'I own two regular Wii wheels (a black and white one), and recently purchased two of these...so the kids won''t fight over who gets the Luigi wheel (a favorite character at our house). These are almost identical to the original wheels, as far as overall shape and performance. The only difference I can detect in quality are that these probably weigh an ounce or two less, not enough to make them feel significantly different. While they might be just a tiny bit lighter, they make up for that in style, if you are a Luigi fan, that is. :) They look just like the picture, very cute, and they work just as well as my original Wii wheels.'),
(N'Karen', N'Cruz', N'karen.cruz6077@example.net', '2014-09-26', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Nathan', N'Evans', N'nathan.evans7097@example.org', '2014-09-26', 5, N'good price'),
(N'Daniel', N'Ortiz', N'daniel.ortiz2978@example.net', '2014-09-26', 5, N'I have to say this clear case is perfect, it fits very snug of the 3DS. It doesn''t slip out and the hinges are made well. Perfect for showing off the color of your 3ds and it keeps it free of dirt and scratches. Definitely worth the money.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Nelson', N'stephanie.nelson2201@example.net', '2014-09-26', 4, N'It works great and I can play my wii virtual console games with my gamecube games'),
(N'Noah', N'Ward', N'noah.ward1713@example.org', '2014-09-26', 5, N'grandson liked it. that''s all that matters, right?'),
(N'Carol', N'Mitchell', N'carol.mitchell1474@example.org', '2014-09-26', 5, N'When I bought a Wii, I didn''t realize how quickly I was going to run out of internal storage when I started downloading games from the Wii Store. Stores pretty much everything... just a bummer I had to buy it.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Green', N'carlos.green2432@example.net', '2014-09-26', 5, N'Excellent, very good product.'),
(N'Anita', N'Ruiz', N'anita.ruiz9438@example.org', '2014-09-27', 5, N'the game was good I loved it'),
(N'Anita', N'Ruiz', N'anita.ruiz9438@example.org', '2014-09-27', 5, N'very good game my grandson loves it'),
(N'Andrew', N'Hughes', N'andrew.hughes4516@example.net', '2014-09-27', 1, N'This is a defective product. It works ok for a while, but the batteries become dull to recharging very soon and your controllers will not stay connected properly. This is a big waste of money. Get the plug and play with lithium ion batteries instead.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Cruz', N'barbara.cruz1264@example.net', '2014-09-27', 4, N'Great game! love it!!'),
(N'Janet', N'Webb', N'janet.webb5250@example.com', '2014-09-27', 5, N'Definitely worth the buy!'),
(N'Peter', N'Long', N'peter.long6549@example.net', '2014-09-27', 5, N'I am very happy with my figurine. It is all the seller promised.'),
(N'Luis', N'Long', N'luis.long5557@example.com', '2014-09-27', 5, N'Loads of fun, a great game'),
(N'Joyce', N'Ivanov', N'joyce.ivanov9100@example.org', '2014-09-27', 5, N'It''s Mario Kart. If you''ve played one, you''ve played them all. Not a lot of major changes, but they''re beneficial nonetheless. For one, online multiplayer is much more stable and enjoyable than MK6 on the Wii. While anti-gravity doesn''t revolutionize the Mario Kart franchise, it''s a neat little gimmick. As usual, the tracks are varied and fun to play on. My only gripe with the game is the over saturation of baby drivers. I do think the DLC slated for a release this holiday will somewhat solve the problem. Defiantly worth buying at retail.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Hernandez', N'carolyn.hernandez3071@example.com', '2014-09-27', 5, N'Excellent game'),
(N'Linda', N'Mendoza', N'linda.mendoza9496@example.com', '2014-09-27', 5, N'Great and fast'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Lee', N'cynthia.lee6393@example.com', '2014-09-27', 5, N'There''s a learning curve to it (if you''ve never played the Dynasty Warriors), which I really like!:D It looks beautiful and runs like a charm on the Wii U. The gameplay is really fun also once you get the concept down. If you''re a Zelda fan, this is a must have. Plus, Lana is pretty freaking hot.'),
(N'Diane', N'Jimenez', N'diane.jimenez7838@example.net', '2014-09-28', 3, N'I haven''t finished it yet but have been disappointed that it seems to be more of the same thing from previous games with slightly better graphics.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Howard', N'lucia.howard2174@example.net', '2014-09-28', 5, N'Fist thing to point out is that I am only interested in manager mode not online play or ultimate team. Love the new manager mode in Fifa 15. Being able to manager a club and a country has taken the game to a new level. Not knowing what players are rated until you scout them was frustrating to start with but it makes it much more of a challenge and much more realistic so I think it was a good move. The game play is great and I like the match updates from Alan McAnally it''s a great feature.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Baker', N'gregory.baker5709@example.com', '2014-09-28', 5, N'good'),
(N'Angela', N'Cooper', N'angela.cooper6594@example.net', '2014-09-28', 5, N'Good product. Spent lots of time playing it and learning strategies.'),
(N'Gary', N'Russell', N'gary.russell3929@example.com', '2014-09-28', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Shirley', N'Price', N'shirley.price1247@example.org', '2014-09-28', 2, N'Crap'),
(N'Yuki', N'Williams', N'yuki.williams4997@example.net', '2014-09-28', 5, N'daughter loves it'),
(N'Mary', N'Harris', N'mary.harris5360@example.org', '2014-09-28', 4, N'This deal was amazing. It was 5 dollars for the whole command and conquer series and it is compatible with windows 8. The only thing that makes me mad is I have to download origin to download and play. That is basically it for bad parts. Otherwise its a great product.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Ramirez', N'elizabeth.ramirez6710@example.org', '2014-09-28', 1, N'There is no offline mode!? I live in the US, and we have the slowest internet in the world so I can''t be expected to go online every time I play this game. That said, the graphics are horrible, and I lag so badly too. If they had this on the PC, at least I could bring it somewhere with better connectivity, and the graphics would be nicer on my laptop.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Taylor', N'nancy.taylor8298@example.net', '2014-09-29', 4, N'Works great'),
(N'Linda', N'Clark', N'linda.clark4219@example.net', '2014-09-29', 4, N'Heavy duty is an understatement. My only complaint is its lack of versatility. It doesn''t carry much other than the vita (I have the handles and a few cards to bring along) but if your main interest is protecting the vita then this is an ideal product. I do agree that the snap feels flimsy, but it hasn''t been a problem yet.'),
(N'Eric', N'Mendoza', N'eric.mendoza3545@example.org', '2014-09-29', 5, N'The classic, truly innovative Call of Duty. Call of Duty 4 changed the landscape of Multi-player. Since MW3, not so much. The story is also a classic. Arguably the best'),
(N'Patrick', N'Jackson', N'patrick.jackson4270@example.org', '2014-09-29', 5, N'This game is super addicting. Would recommend to play for all ages as long as they can read.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Morales', N'nancy.morales3370@example.com', '2014-09-29', 5, N'Missing the stick :( other than that works perfectly'),
(N'Alexander', N'Gonzalez', N'alexander.gonzalez6909@example.com', '2014-09-29', 5, N'I put off getting this game for years ( The 360 versions ), and never knew what a disservice I was doing myself. The 360 versions stayed at a higher price and that was what kept me from picking them up , because I wasn''t sure if I would like the game , and I hate wasting my money .. Well , the fact that the 360 versions kept a higher price through out the years should have been a clear indication to me that the Metro games were actually great games and I should have bought them , but I didn''t. Well i saw this game on sale for 39.99 at best buy and finally decided to give it a go , I mean this way I am only paying 19.99 for each game. After all my procrastination and money pinching I have finally played the games and they are OUTSTANDING !!! I kind of wish I had played them on the 360 years ago but at the same time not , because the game has had a complete make over and it looks and plays fantastic .. Story : Both Metro 2033 and last light have a very gripping story , you can just...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wright', N'kelly.wright6706@example.com', '2014-09-29', 5, N'I love this game'),
(N'Janet', N'Baker', N'janet.baker6874@example.org', '2014-09-30', 5, N'Good! Husband likes it.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Khan', N'marcus.khan3312@example.com', '2014-09-30', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Angela', N'Edwards', N'angela.edwards3435@example.com', '2014-09-30', 5, N'I don''t really have many complaints, except battle mode, and the voting system on online multiplayer is just stupid. But overall great game and a must own for Wii U owners.'),
(N'Emily', N'Anderson', N'emily.anderson6024@example.org', '2014-09-30', 5, N'Not typically a head-phones guru but this thing rocks. Great sound and great mic. Good controls as well and it is comfy! Love it!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Ivanov', N'hannah.ivanov7270@example.org', '2014-09-30', 4, N'The foundation is great - the mechanics are solid and gameplay is great. PvE story started great, but got confusing and disjointed very quickly. I ignored the story line once I hit the moon, particularly the dialogue from our little buddy, Ghost. I''d rather listen to the musical score unadulterated by inane banter. But once you hit level 20, it becomes a rather dull grind to miraculously find a legendary engram (and even more miraculously get anything good from that jerk, the Cryptarch). Playing missions and strikes are harder levels seem pointless as you don''t get any rewards. So, you''ll spend 2-3x more trying to earn enough stuff to buy the legendary armor, which then allows you to rank up. Which then allows you permission to play higher level strikes and raids. The strikes are dull as there''s nothing new. And raids aren''t feasible unless you have an entire team of six of high ranked Guardians. Other than switching it up by playing as another class, there''s no point in continuing...'),
(N'Donald', N'Garcia', N'donald.garcia1444@example.com', '2014-09-30', 5, N'It''s a really good game. Something both the old and new generation of mario fans would like.'),
(N'Scott', N'Robinson', N'scott.robinson1940@example.org', '2014-09-30', 5, N'My kid loved it!'),
(N'Emily', N'Murphy', N'emily.murphy5986@example.com', '2014-09-30', 5, N'This game is FIRE'),
(N'Victoria', N'Gomez', N'victoria.gomez9205@example.net', '2014-09-30', 5, N'Look here....Ive been playing racing games since the game Night Driver on the atari 2600. This is the best racer I have ever played. The only bad thing is no Porsche. This game is just amazing. Its got everything thats been great about racers all in one game. Sure, a few more cars would be cool, but 200+ isn''t bad. This is such a complete fun arcade inspired racer that I cant believe one could do better. You can adjust the settings and make it hard core sim if you wanted, but Ill stick to the hyper speed, steroid infused grip machines. racing around in the impressive weather and day/night cycles isn''t a bad touch either. bravo turn 10. bravo.'),
(N'Michael', N'Boyd', N'michael.boyd6958@example.org', '2014-10-01', 5, N'My goto racing game. Very good game.'),
(N'Michael', N'Boyd', N'michael.boyd6958@example.org', '2014-10-01', 5, N'Coming from always playing COD I must admit this game is much better!!'),
(N'Charles', N'White', N'charles.white3048@example.org', '2014-10-01', 5, N'This has now become my favorite game on the PS4. Free-roam Mordor and slaughter all the orcs you like? Yes, please! The voice acting is top notch (Troy Baker never ceases to amaze me with his diversity and talent). The story and background is superb, there actually is more here than just chopping orcs to pieces (but that''s the best part, definitely). The gameplay is out of this world. The combat just feels fluid and natural. It does take a bit to get used to the controls, unless you are an Arkham series veteran and you should be able to slide right in. Luckily, I had played the Batman games and this wasn''t too overwhelming for me. Even if you haven''t though, keep at it! You''ll likely die alot at first, but that''s actually part of the story and the Nemesis system they have built. It will really give you incentive to track down that orc that "killed" you and get revenge. And when you do... oh revenge is so sweet.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Jenkins', N'tyler.jenkins1594@example.net', '2014-10-01', 3, N'Decent game, too hard to unlock characters so kind of kills replay value.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Hall', N'jeffrey.hall5717@example.com', '2014-10-01', 3, N'I believe the main issue I had with this was the plastic wire that hold the Bluetooth on to your ear. The earpiece never seem to set fully into my ear making it very hard to hear other players. I will be buying a 3rd party Bluetooth piece next time'),
(N'Mei', N'Lopez', N'mei.lopez6738@example.net', '2014-10-01', 3, N'this product is great but it doesn''t seem that useful unless you are a streamer. I bought it with the thought of streaming some gameplay but besides doing that it''s just a camera. Maybe in the future it will get some more use out of it but for now i don''t really think it''s worth it'),
(N'Aaron', N'Campbell', N'aaron.campbell5592@example.com', '2014-10-01', 5, N'Works without issue. 64GB is definitely the right size and is perfect if you have PlayStation Plus. I can''t see running out of space anytime soon'),
(N'Betty', N'Jones', N'betty.jones2450@example.net', '2014-10-01', 5, N'My Son loves this!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Henderson', N'cynthia.henderson3960@example.org', '2014-10-01', 5, N'this game came very quick and the cartridge was very clean and looked brand new. the game plays great. i am very pleased with this seller. THANK YOU.'),
(N'Peter', N'Garcia', N'peter.garcia6650@example.com', '2014-10-01', 5, N'It''s a strange thing to have no interest in a product for it''s entire production life, only to want it fervently literally 3 days before its release. I''m a gamer through and through. I''ve played more games than I can remember, and my morning news cycle consists of reading blogs like Kotaku and more traditional news sites like IGN, Polygon, and Giant Bomb. Yea, gaming is pretty much my biggest hobby, and huge part of my life. I mention this only because of the peculiar circumstances that led me to buying this game. A month ago, I was aware of the existence of this game. I knew nothing about the mechanics, the story, or anything related to the games production. I mean, it''s a licensed game. I''ve been burned by licensed games too many times to actually care about them anymore. Then, something special happened. Something that almost never happens in the cut and dry world of games. This relatively unknown game started getting rave reviews by some very reputable sites. At first I thought...'),
(N'David', N'Moore', N'david.moore9481@example.com', '2014-10-01', 5, N'I only used this connector on a computer tv card and it connects very easily. It is the right length'),
(N'Joseph', N'Price', N'joseph.price3367@example.org', '2014-10-01', 5, N'This game was a lot of fun to play though. It features many characters from recent and old Sony consoles/games. If you are a fan of Smash Bros this is definitely the closest thing to it. This is a must have'),
(N'Anthony', N'Torres', N'anthony.torres7605@example.net', '2014-10-01', 5, N'Love these, changes color at will. So fits your mood for the time. Keys work well and don''t need to slam on them to make them work. Well lighted for dark rooms.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Ross', N'olivia.ross7614@example.com', '2014-10-01', 2, N'Mechanically terrible, the defending is now completely broken. Sound track is worse than 14. I love this game and hate it at the same time. I wish PES had more fifa rights'),
(N'Carlos', N'Hernandez', N'carlos.hernandez4453@example.net', '2014-10-01', 4, N'Now, I am a KH pro. I play all these games at LV1. I can tell you, that this is probably the best portable KH game, HOWEVER it is NOT like KH2FM (my favorite KH game of all time.) The gameplay in this game is excellent, but the defensive system is trash. Also the AI in this game is CRANKED UP. OH GOD IS IT CRANKED UP. Your own party members suck so bad, but the enemy AI on Critical will tear you to shreds. The music is arguably some of the best in the series, and you will get many hours of this game. The worst part is well... :/ The end game/ NG+ stuff is dumb. You fight a boss named Julius which, he is easier than Ice Titan (and I beat Ice titan in 1.5 HD at LV1). And not all the fights are refightable, such as Ansem 1 and 2. I also have the Mark of Mastery edition.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Jimenez', N'samantha.jimenez5734@example.net', '2014-10-02', 1, N'This game is complete step back compared to nhl 14. The graphics seems off, I don''t feel like I have controll of the player compared to nhl 14. There''s no way to turn off the vibrate on the controller and it shakes out of your hand everytime you make a turn. They say they''re comming out with 5 on 5 game play, but if its not 6 on 6 including the goalie then I''m going to be really disappointed. The goalie believe it or not is apart of the game EA. I used to have fun playing goalie sometimes. All in all like everyone else I''m disapointed and will NEVER pre-oreder a EA game again. And this is coming from a guy who pretty much played nhl 14 everyday last year.'),
(N'Priya', N'Roberts', N'priya.roberts2228@example.org', '2014-10-02', 5, N'First off I use a full racing setup with the Thrustmaster TX Racing Wheel, Thrustmaster GTE Rim, Thrustmaster T3PA pedals, Thrustmaster TH8A Shifter, and the Next Level Racing Wheel Stand and this game feel AMAZING! Honestly the wheel feels better with this game then in Forza 5. The offroad physics are great, it''s pretty challenging and yet very chaotic and adrenaline pumping. The free roam aspect is amazing as well, wherever you wanna go, you can go. This game to me personally, is a simcade title cause it does have a very slight arcadey feel to it, but with all assists off it''s very much a simcade plus through that in with the fact that you can tune and the dynamic weather and time, it''s definitely the closest thing to a simulation open world racing game yet. The graphics are amazing and impressive, the sound design is unbeatable, and the amount of content is simply astonishing. This game has over 200 cars with more on the way via DLC, almost 700 events to do in the single player...'),
(N'Timothy', N'Walker', N'timothy.walker3291@example.net', '2014-10-02', 5, N'awesome game, fast delivery'),
(N'Christina', N'Cooper', N'christina.cooper2054@example.net', '2014-10-02', 3, N'nice'),
(N'Christina', N'Cooper', N'christina.cooper2054@example.net', '2014-10-02', 4, N'good game'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Butler', N'cynthia.butler3915@example.net', '2014-10-02', 5, N'as expected'),
(N'Susan', N'Russell', N'susan.russell2476@example.com', '2014-10-02', 5, N'Love it! Great Assassins Creed game in a different setting, about time!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Rogers', N'mateo.rogers4263@example.com', '2014-10-02', 5, N'I love this game, especially for the very modest discount price I paid. The Wordmaster mode is similar to the game "Password". The Anagram mode is stimulating, but not so hard to be frustrating. There is a clue to help you get the Anagram word correct. The graphics are very pleasant and relaxing. The best thing about this game is that you can elect to input your answers by pressing the keys on the little keyboard, rather than writing them out. I often have trouble with handwriting recognition, when I use the Nintendo software. If you enjoy word games, you will probably enjoy this game. There are only two games to choose to play, but they are very entertaining and will get your mind working.'),
(N'George', N'Gray', N'george.gray3044@example.com', '2014-10-02', 2, N'Well it''s an Xbox. Works how it needs to, though I am very puzzled as to why the 4 gigs of internal storage are missing.'),
(N'Mei', N'Bailey', N'mei.bailey8186@example.org', '2014-10-03', 5, N'encantado'),
(N'Brian', N'Kim', N'brian.kim8674@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'A true classic for the wii system.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Foster', N'benjamin.foster4142@example.org', '2014-10-03', 5, N'I love this case. Fits DS or 3DS size consoles and additional room to fit a game box holder.'),
(N'Angela', N'Reyes', N'angela.reyes1633@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'best choice for your Gaming PC , you most take One or Tow form this controller .'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Green', N'jonathan.green1203@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'Great game & brand new!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wood', N'jacqueline.wood7639@example.net', '2014-10-03', 3, N'Arrived promptly and no trouble downloading. These games, in my view, would be most appropriate for children or young teens. Worth the purchase price.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ferreira', N'ethan.ferreira6878@example.org', '2014-10-03', 5, N'Love this game'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ferreira', N'ethan.ferreira6878@example.org', '2014-10-03', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'William', N'Nguyen', N'william.nguyen5877@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'good'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ortiz', N'stephanie.ortiz4377@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'it was in perfect condition'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Butler', N'cynthia.butler3915@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'like'),
(N'Timothy', N'Okonkwo', N'timothy.okonkwo1631@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'Great fun'),
(N'Melissa', N'Powell', N'melissa.powell6325@example.org', '2014-10-03', 5, N'great'),
(N'Ashley', N'Moore', N'ashley.moore9072@example.com', '2014-10-03', 5, N'These cases are perfect for what I need them for, to keep my pre-owned GameStop games that have gummed up cases, in like new condition, pristine & perfect, I''m OCD this way. All my games are in their original cases, some more than seven years old and the discs look as good as the day I bought them, my PS2''s the same way and they''re older. These cases are perfect, I reccomend them.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Thomas', N'deborah.thomas4119@example.net', '2014-10-03', 5, N'all glitches aside. Awesome story that i had so much fun playing'),
(N'Lauren', N'Wang', N'lauren.wang6398@example.com', '2014-10-04', 5, N'Fun, but really hard'),
(N'Nadia', N'Ali', N'nadia.ali8008@example.net', '2014-10-04', 1, N'I like the idea of this, and everything works fine if it weren''t for the terrible battery life. You can hardly leave the controller unplugged for five minutes after a full charge!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Patel', N'raymond.patel4641@example.com', '2014-10-04', 5, N'WOW AMAZING! so much fun and so many characters. Online play is great!'),
(N'Julie', N'Wood', N'julie.wood2369@example.com', '2014-10-04', 4, N'Resistance Burning Skies wasn''t a bad game but a good game. Story was good even though the game has only mission 6 to7 mission. I don''t attack games for its graphics if the gameplay is good which it is, coming from Killzone mercenary to this you could clearly see the difference but luckily it has new game plus and gun gameplay is awesome I just wish the game was 2 to 3 mission longer and the graphics was bump up. I think hardcore or mild fans of the Resistance franchise should give it a try.'),
(N'Christine', N'Martinez', N'christine.martinez2503@example.net', '2014-10-04', 5, N'great'),
(N'Brian', N'Hughes', N'brian.hughes7556@example.org', '2014-10-04', 5, N'Five stars! I love these. I prefer thumb grip covers for my PS4 controller that have rubber nubs not just the concave design. I ordered the Pairs X and they were good, but the rubber nubs would fall off. The rubber they use is too soft or brittle. The Ortz are harder rubber but still very grippy! I love them and highly recommend them!'),
(N'Megan', N'Bailey', N'megan.bailey1390@example.com', '2014-10-04', 5, N'I don''t believe i own this game so i don''t know why i need to rate it with amazon, but i have halo 3 and that is a great game.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Thomas', N'hiroshi.thomas1044@example.net', '2014-10-04', 5, N'I''m kinda satisfy :-)'),
(N'Eric', N'Moore', N'eric.moore8449@example.net', '2014-10-05', 5, N'Works Great'),
(N'Jessica', N'Chavez', N'jessica.chavez3700@example.net', '2014-10-05', 5, N'thumbs up'),
(N'Andrew', N'Martin', N'andrew.martin9882@example.org', '2014-10-05', 5, N'My g-son love''s it'),
(N'Katherine', N'Garcia', N'katherine.garcia9274@example.net', '2014-10-05', 5, N'Gift?'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Cook', N'tomasz.cook5649@example.net', '2014-10-05', 5, N'Excellent. Tmnt better the. Tournament fighters snes .'),
(N'Andrew', N'Parker', N'andrew.parker5601@example.net', '2014-10-05', 5, N'This is my favorite expansion pack because it gives me an option to live life on the water front or spend it managing resorts and deep sea exploration plus more. If you love the water, give your Sims 3 a fresh experience of life on the open seas. I love the houseboats. So far the only thing that i find wrong with it is that (depending upon how much Custom Content) you have installed in the game, it will take some time to load. Not a real big issue but the game camera is in need of great improvements when you are on the water, (in my opinion). Would I recommend it for you? Yes, because if you are a serious Sim player then this expansion is worth it at the current price. I wouldn''t recommend it if it was much higher in price. Wait for a sale price.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Evans', N'joseph.evans9473@example.net', '2014-10-05', 2, N'controller support was terrible and other add-ons that offered support was not better. support seemed to be made to lag keyboard and mouse. all call of duty games are worth revisiting and could generate massive sales if they would go back and add the support. if it was offered on the xbox, which means the support is there due to use of a striped version of windows being also used it would be to easy. the developers obviouse to not want the sales, or benefit those who play.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Peterson', N'christopher.peterson6893@example.net', '2014-10-05', 5, N'The best video game system I played in long time to find the best of the next gem consoles'),
(N'Luis', N'Miller', N'luis.miller1645@example.com', '2014-10-05', 5, N'exelente'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd1353@example.com', '2014-10-06', 5, N'When I first saw it I said this is a Samurai Warrior game with Zelda''s characters, but is much more, this game is a perfect fusion of two great sagas, Dinasty/sammurai Warriors and The Legend of Zelda, a fan on any of these sagas can be confortable with this game that take elements of both * Dinasty Warriors: The gameplay is almost the same that in Dinasty/Samuray Warriors, with some added from the legend of Zelda Games, the character can''t jump but can lock some strong enemies like in the legend of zelda, some characters had more that one kind of weapon (for example Link, can fight with a sword or with magic) and the gameplay with the same character change dependind of the weapon equipped * The Legend Of Zelda: In the Stoty Mode U can se that is basically a story of a Zelda''s game, but had more action, in battle appears missions to accomplish like in Samurai Warriors and you can find new weapons in chest and use it in battle like in a Zelda game. The game like a said before is a...'),
(N'Walter', N'Richardson', N'walter.richardson5415@example.org', '2014-10-06', 3, N'was ok'),
(N'Joseph', N'Hill', N'joseph.hill8826@example.net', '2014-10-06', 5, N'good'),
(N'Aaron', N'Green', N'aaron.green3386@example.com', '2014-10-06', 5, N'Can''t stop playing this game. There could be more content variety, but what''s there is so well done that it more than makes up for it.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Cook', N'samuel.cook7112@example.net', '2014-10-06', 5, N'Excellent headset. I''ve had no problems with it whatsoever.'),
(N'Angela', N'Lee', N'angela.lee2273@example.net', '2014-10-06', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Christine', N'Flores', N'christine.flores4299@example.com', '2014-10-07', 5, N'This is the same type I controller I used to own when I previously owned a Dreamcast. I like the color and feel, though not essential, is a reasonable purchase if style and personal taste matters to you even in gaming.'),
(N'David', N'Raghunathan', N'david.raghunathan6343@example.net', '2014-10-07', 5, N'I wanted a mouse for use In MMOs, so I wanted a mouse with lots of buttons that were easy to press. Overall the mouse is nice the software used to set the settings on what button does what could be better. It also has a lot of DPI choices to control sensitivity and you can even bind buttons to the mouse to change the DPI without getting into the software. You can set multiple profiles and can bind a button to switch between profiles. Overall I use it in ArcheAge and without a doubt it has made playing the game a lot easier. I have a button bound to hold in the modifier keys so rather than having to reach over to hold in shift and then press 9 I can just shift my thumb back a bit and hit the shift key on my mouse.'),
(N'Noah', N'Miller', N'noah.miller3071@example.com', '2014-10-07', 5, N'Love this game sooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo much!!!!!'),
(N'Eric', N'Edwards', N'eric.edwards8759@example.com', '2014-10-07', 5, N'Pure fun racing...looks so good, the sense of speed is exhilirating..can''t wait for the weather to be added, and the community stuff to go online today. Bravo. (If you prefer games with guns and stop lights, move along, we''re racing here)'),
(N'Richard', N'Diaz', N'richard.diaz6402@example.net', '2014-10-07', 4, N'My son plays this alot on the the computer, I figured in order for me to get some computer time, I buy this for the Xbox... Now we are both happy...'),
(N'Luis', N'Robinson', N'luis.robinson6806@example.com', '2014-10-07', 3, N'This is a game that came out around the time of Mist. Its a pure adventure-quest game, no matching included, the best kind of puzzle game. Its basically a shammon based game where a chosen young guy is sent on a quest to defeat the darkness as the bearer of light. The game is OK except the graphics are pre-super VGA. They are attractive but kind of washed out in appearance and looking more like impressionistic paintings. If it was in today''s graphics resolution it would be very rich. But other then that the game is interesting with good soundscape and voice. The interface is quite unusual and take some getting use to. Another bad thing about this game is you have to play with the disks in the CD-ROM drive. In your search you will do quite abit of wandering to find the items you need to progress in the game. You may want to get a hint book or doc off the web. I have just finished the game and I found it to be very abstract, severely lacking in hints. The walkthrough is a must unless...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Davis', N'cheryl.davis1960@example.org', '2014-10-07', 4, N'This game does have potential, if only the servers worked. I bought the digital download version and season pass. Was it worth the 11 month delay? Not right now, can''t play online. I''ll update my review later.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Rodriguez', N'sandra.rodriguez7708@example.com', '2014-10-07', 4, N'The TurtleBeach Z60 is a star - no doubt. ++ It packs powerful bass, clear vocals, and a decently separated mid-range. ++ The cans are excellent at blocking out almost all external sound, and sound leakage is typically low. ++ It is versatile - you can use it with your mobile devices as well as with a PC (USB port). ++ It is built solidly, and looks and feels like a quality product. However, there are a few issues that prevented me giving it the full 5-stars. -- Its headband is very tight and hard to adjust - hopefully that will loosen over time. -- My ears get annoyingly warm - the cans fit tight and are made of a fabric that traps heat. -- I am not a fan of the bright lights on the sound controller. However, the real reason for the lack of 5-stars is that it simply does not compare very well to the awesome Corsair Vengeance 2100 which has the added bonuses of being wireless and cheaper. If you get a chance to compare the two, try out the virtual barber shop 3D audio illusion from...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Peterson', N'pamela.peterson6123@example.com', '2014-10-07', 5, N'I always buy HORI really superb products'),
(N'Ashley', N'Khan', N'ashley.khan5031@example.net', '2014-10-07', 4, N'This is past of the gimmick in the new version of Skylanders. Each bad guy has an element they are associated with, so to capture them you have to have a trap of that element. I think they want to encourage kids to have multiple of each elements, but that is not needed. In the main area of the game, you can change the evil character that is in a given trap. You can not do this change while in a level, so you have to plan ahead if you need something different. That being said, we went ahead and got all the different elements, so we have 1 of each element, and I do not think that we will need more than that.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Bailey', N'matthew.bailey5618@example.net', '2014-10-07', 1, N'Broke in 1 month. Controller won''t stay down on dock so there''s no way to charge it. Terrible. BTW it was gently used, not abused at all, and still broke in 1 month of light use.'),
(N'Julie', N'Carter', N'julie.carter1435@example.org', '2014-10-07', 3, N'This is a pretty mindless beat em up. It''s ok but nothing great. Plenty of button mashing, a little strategy but not much. It controls well and looks very nice. this is not an rpg and nothing like a typical Zelda game. Gets kind of boring but I played through it to see all the Zelda locations.'),
(N'John', N'Howard', N'john.howard5410@example.com', '2014-10-08', 5, N'Nice gane'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Boyd', N'carolyn.boyd2207@example.org', '2014-10-08', 5, N'This super Mario game is perfect fun and entertaining it''s the original Nes version the sound jumping fireballs everything identical stages exactly no new worlds same world from world 1 to world 8 it came in great condition label is perfectly intact perfect cartridge hardly any scratches gray colored like the original nes games it came with red case extra bonus playing this game takes you back to your youth years as a child playing it great game I definitely recommend.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Boyd', N'sofia.boyd5311@example.net', '2014-10-08', 5, N'This is the best game I''ve ever played'),
(N'Adam', N'Collins', N'adam.collins7476@example.net', '2014-10-08', 5, N'This 3.8mm security Bit Screwdriver is the perfect tool when you need to clean or replace the dead battery on your NES, SNES, N64, GB, GBC, and VB game carts. Nintendo put the special security screws on their game carts because they want you to buy a whole new game rather than easily replacing the batteries. The tool can be used alone with your hand or inserted onto a handle bit. I was finally able to remove the security screws on my gold Zelda OOT cart and check the battery. The battery was brand new, the seller didn''t realize the + metal contact was not making any contact with the battery so I put some electrical tape between the battery and contact and now the game saves great. This tool is a mandatory tool to own if you need to clean or replace the batteries in your NES, SNES, N64, GB, GBC, and VB carts.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Fisher', N'mateo.fisher6010@example.com', '2014-10-08', 5, N'Been looking for this game for awhile and it''s great. Great remastered version I the orginal with small tweaks for the DS. My only gripe is that the camera is very annoying and you often have to manually change view only to have it change once you move.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Turner', N'deborah.turner6932@example.com', '2014-10-08', 5, N'EXCELLENT'),
(N'Robert', N'Lopez', N'robert.lopez8377@example.com', '2014-10-08', 2, N'I would write a long review but would just be repeating what everyone else is writing. Overrated.... I''m already tired of playing it and I never once got the addicted "I have to play it" feeling. I find the only reason I play it now is just to try to fully upgrade my still first warlock trophy and that feels like a horrible grind. What a disappointment, I was excited and even bought the destiny ps4 bundle (with the white PS4) now years after this game is long gone I will still look down at my white unique PS4 and remember how ps4 got me on my very first purchase....:('),
(N'Samantha', N'Rogers', N'samantha.rogers6571@example.net', '2014-10-08', 1, N'It''s clear that 2k puts its efforts into next gen consoles and give last gen consoles the same game over and over. They brought back crews to try and hold us over, but it''s still the same game from the last 2 years. No real upgrades or changes.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Thompson', N'rachel.thompson5755@example.org', '2014-10-08', 5, N'Creative Assembly nailed it! Not only is this the best Alien game ever made, it''s also the best game I have played this year (along with Shadow of Mordor). Make no mistake, this game is hardcore. It''s difficult, anxiety-inducing and exciting. It also simply drips with atmosphere. I''ve never come across another game that creates a true sense of place like this one does. It begins to feel almost real at times. The amazing atmosphere comes down to two things: the awesome sound design and the incredible graphics. I have to say that this is the best looking game I have played so far. I am playing it on the PC and it looks absolutely incredible. Yes, even better than Crysis 3, in my opinion. At least if you are comparing the interiors of Crysis 3 to these interiors. What''s amazing, though, is not only does this game look astonishingly good, it also runs very well. I am able to max out every setting and run the game at 2560 x 1400 resolution and still maintain 60fps at all times. In other...'),
(N'Gary', N'Parker', N'gary.parker1694@example.net', '2014-10-08', 3, N'Some good, and some bad in this far from inexpensive headset. This is a review of a free product I received through the Vine program for those who read this before the official commercial release date. First and foremost, this is billed as, shown as, and sold as a GAMING headset, so if you want some wireless headphones that do "everything" look elsewhere. Apparently there was some initial confusion as the comparison table in the description said Bluetooth originally, and that has been changed to "wireless". Those who ordered under the wrong description would I''m sure get a refund no problem. Now back to the headset - wireless it is, as in a RF (radio frequency) USB adapter is plugged in to the PS3 (in my case) and once the headphones are fully charged, there is uninterrupted and pretty much loss-less sound within a reasonable distance. This is NOT that easy to set up (I am using a PS3) First install the USB stick, then plug in the digital audio cable to the side of the usb adapter,...'),
(N'Alexander', N'Rogers', N'alexander.rogers9721@example.com', '2014-10-08', 5, N'such a fun game for anyone who''s a fan of the military first person shooter. great online game play as well. highly reecommend'),
(N'Ivan', N'Wright', N'ivan.wright3290@example.org', '2014-10-08', 5, N'A must have for an Xbox One controller.'),
(N'Susan', N'Barnes', N'susan.barnes9690@example.org', '2014-10-08', 5, N'Great item 5 stars*****'),
(N'Amanda', N'Bennett', N'amanda.bennett5815@example.org', '2014-10-08', 5, N'Love it!! Best buy ever!! Great seller!!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Martin', N'daniel.martin4252@example.org', '2014-10-09', 5, N'This game is so good. I enjoy the top down zelda so much more than the new 3d games. I recently beat this and seasons back to back. this game is much harder than seasons but it is also more original, which makes it more fun in my opinion. Seasons is a great game, but its more of a throwback to the original zelda where as Ages is more new content. both games are great. put them both together and you get arguable the best zelda experience ever. Seasons is more relaxing while Ages is more challenging. Although if you had never played the original zelda i could see Seasons being challenging as far as the best way to best some of the bosses.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Adams', N'katherine.adams5117@example.com', '2014-10-09', 5, N'Great gaming headphones. They are very comfortable to wear and I am quite please with my purchase. I hope they last a long time but only time will tell. Cool that the ear piece lights up.'),
(N'Robert', N'Cook', N'robert.cook8813@example.com', '2014-10-09', 5, N'Great product, shipped fast. Thank you!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Tanaka', N'cynthia.tanaka1819@example.org', '2014-10-09', 3, N'I bought this game hoping it would make learning the guitar easier. I honestly didn''t learn anything, and gave up just as fast as the first time I tried to learn the guitar. My friend who is an experienced guitar player found the game difficult to play. I ended up selling the guitar that I bought along with the game and still don''t have any idea how to play.'),
(N'Ravi', N'King', N'ravi.king9642@example.org', '2014-10-09', 3, N'The technology in Crysis 3 is really good. The gameplay is solid. The controls are fluid. It is a better effort by Crytek than that horrendous Crysis 2. While the later portion of the game was forgettable, I do give them points for a solid effort overall. Even then, it is an average game at most.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Sanchez', N'sharon.sanchez6689@example.net', '2014-10-09', 5, N'Awesome fast shipping, great quality item!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Scott', N'kimberly.scott4960@example.com', '2014-10-09', 4, N'This generation of consoles is shaping up to be almost exactly like generations of consoles in the past - marred somewhat by game launch delays; exclusivity windows; online problems - the list goes on. Also like previous generations young, angst-filled fanboys have taken to their favorite online forum to talk trash and predict the imminent demise of one gaming company or another. Like anonymous, passive-aggressive, Charles Schwab wannabes the fanboy cannot rest until absolutely sure that their console of choice is the clear winner and bask in a brief moment of self-validation. Enter DriveClub. From the beginning it was clear that a lot of folks were going to hate this game. It is after all a PlayStation exclusive (strike one); the game was originally supposed to be a PS4 launch title and was delayed (strike two); and Evolution Studios, the creators of DriveClub, had the audacity to promote their game (strike three). Lastly, a less than smooth launch of the game - the online portion...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Thompson', N'joyce.thompson6417@example.com', '2014-10-09', 5, N'My son loved this.'),
(N'Janet', N'Clark', N'janet.clark7613@example.com', '2014-10-09', 4, N'Overall the gift was a successful but the game gets boring overtime'),
(N'Dee', N'Raghunathan', N'dee.raghunathan2650@example.org', '2014-10-09', 5, N'Man I played these games when I was younger and couldn''t resist when I saw this. Brought back some great memeories and still fun!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Brooks', N'kimberly.brooks3406@example.com', '2014-10-09', 5, N'As subject states, was perplexed for a second as to how the adapter was syncing but the game pad wasn''t. Unplugged the Logitech wireless USB adapter for my mouse/keyboard combo and viola! Just played some Bioshock 2 and it worked flawlessly. Have fun!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Robinson', N'ashley.robinson5115@example.org', '2014-10-09', 5, N'mem'),
(N'Tyler', N'Campbell', N'tyler.campbell6105@example.com', '2014-10-10', 5, N'it is very nice and the key board lights up which is a luxury especially when you play in the dark. i recommend this and is worth every penny.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Singh', N'ronald.singh2727@example.com', '2014-10-10', 5, N'It works!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Singh', N'ronald.singh2727@example.com', '2014-10-10', 5, N'tasty'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Richardson', N'jacqueline.richardson3630@example.com', '2014-10-10', 5, N'Excellent game fulfilled my expectations, I hope to buy another time with you'),
(N'Anna', N'Collins', N'anna.collins8896@example.com', '2014-10-10', 2, N'The silliest game in the world when they bring you to the ground. WWE 2k is gonna be way better.'),
(N'Helen', N'Cox', N'helen.cox2294@example.net', '2014-10-10', 3, N'Description said it was complete got it and it''s missing the manual.. Shipping was quick'),
(N'Carlos', N'Thomas', N'carlos.thomas7538@example.net', '2014-10-10', 3, N'Not a very good game rather boring and unexciting...wish I would have saved my money. This game would be a good game for a kid to play.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Wright', N'hiroshi.wright5670@example.net', '2014-10-10', 2, N'Bought the game as digital download, all I have to say is that I wish they gave us Forza Horizon 2 on Playstation. This game was an utter disappointment. There are invisible walls making me feel like I am 6 years old playing with bumper lanes when I bowled... Wish I could ask sony for a refund. The driving mechanics don''t feel anything different from Need For Speed. The only thing that this game has over any other racing game is the background scenery. That is it... Pros: -good scenery and lighting -good audio engineering Cons: -Horrible driving mechanics (gta V has better car physics and handling) -AI ruins single player -Online still doesn''t work for me -Tracks are incredible boring and all feel the same -All cars handle and feel the same, but sound different. Verdict: The game is designed for beginners or little kids who just want to jump in and start playing a racing game. Sadly, it is the only option for ps4 owners in terms of racers along with need for speed rivals. If you...'),
(N'Christopher', N'Martinez', N'christopher.martinez1138@example.net', '2014-10-10', 4, N'I beat my brother at least 20 times.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Gutierrez', N'alexander.gutierrez2293@example.net', '2014-10-11', 1, N'Great seller game sux'),
(N'Paul', N'Foster', N'paul.foster6848@example.org', '2014-10-11', 5, N'Had fun playing the game.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Roberts', N'gregory.roberts9599@example.net', '2014-10-11', 5, N'A fitting sequel to Total Annihilation. Love playing this game!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Jenkins', N'barbara.jenkins3075@example.com', '2014-10-11', 1, N'Be very careful about any game that is connected to Steam. Bought a couple of games that were connected to Steam and after a few months I got a blocking message telling met that my ID was blocked. So I tried to contact Steam and for THREE months I go the runaround. Finally I contacted the seller who contacted Steam who finally told me to download Steam again. But when I did that it came with the that bogus FBI virus that locks you out of your computer unless you pay $300. I tried everything to get rid of it but nothing worked. Finally I had to reload the whole operating system and that wiped out everything in my hard drive. But now the game tells me that it is registered to another user and it won''t work. So once again I had to try to get help from Steam and they are not responsive. In the end I just threw it away since it was already past the warranty period. And if read some of the reviews on many of these games you will see that there are a lot of people with the same issues.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Okonkwo', N'joyce.okonkwo8676@example.org', '2014-10-11', 5, N'work great'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Davis', N'evelyn.davis8988@example.com', '2014-10-11', 4, N'COULD HAVE SEEEN TWO GAMES BUNDLED TOGETHER RATHER THEN JUST ONE BUT OTHER THAN THAT IT IS GREAT TO USE LOVE THE GAMES'),
(N'Amy', N'Wisniewski', N'amy.wisniewski4048@example.org', '2014-10-11', 5, N'Thank you. .'),
(N'Helen', N'Evans', N'helen.evans5061@example.com', '2014-10-11', 5, N'Excellent game after all the updates'),
(N'Paul', N'Taylor', N'paul.taylor4827@example.net', '2014-10-11', 5, N'good'),
