(N'Katherine', N'Webb', N'katherine.webb5568@example.org', '2014-10-12', 5, N'fast delivery excellent this game is very good'),
(N'Anna', N'Nguyen', N'anna.nguyen6383@example.org', '2014-10-12', 5, N'It can be a little weird to start using this, but over time you will get used to it and connecting and disconnecting a controller will become easier. The controllers light will turn orange when plugged in and does not bother me when I am trying to sleep with the least amount of light possible.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Moore', N'jonathan.moore1936@example.org', '2014-10-12', 5, N'I was originally going to get a PS4 at launch but wasn''t going to have the funds so I had to cancel my pre-order. Then a week before the console launches, I find I can afford it but I can''t find available anywhere. The launch comes and goes. Then a few days before the Xbox One launches, Amazon is getting the Xbox back in stock. I am a long time Playstation & Nintendo fan and generally have a negative look on Xbox. I swallowed my pride and ordered it. I can say having had the console for almost a year, I made the the right choice! I love the Xbox One. I love the interface, I love the features (including Kinect, for the most part but you defiantly don''t need it) I love the games its had so for. Now I know the PS4 is more powerful but I don''t care. And before anyone says anything, I did buy a ps4 back in March. I played Battlefield 4 & Infamous Second Son. I was very disappointed with the console. It felt more like a PS3.5 then a next gen experience. So I returned it. That''s just my...'),
(N'Megan', N'Lee', N'megan.lee3704@example.org', '2014-10-12', 3, N'The largest irritant of this game is how you lose all your equipment and money whenever you die, which happens a lot because each stage has a large difficulty "curve" until you''ve ground out enough levels in previous stages to take on the next. Not terrible, not fantastic. Something to play in the vein of disgaea.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Richardson', N'patrick.richardson5954@example.com', '2014-10-12', 5, N'Had to buy Y on demand but it fun to have both with pokemon bank i suggest it'),
(N'Melissa', N'Ramirez', N'melissa.ramirez7296@example.com', '2014-10-12', 5, N'EXCELLENT...'),
(N'John', N'Ivanov', N'john.ivanov8675@example.net', '2014-10-12', 5, N'Excelent.'),
