(N'Laura', N'Perry', N'laura.perry9594@example.net', '2014-10-13', 2, N'Not shaped very well for PS3 controllers. The edges barely cover the joysticks, and one of them won''t stay on (just a little too small). I think they should have separate versions for Xbox and PS. Still, they are nice after you get them on. Reduce my thumb fatigue by leaps and bounds.'),
(N'Janet', N'Moore', N'janet.moore8574@example.org', '2014-10-13', 5, N'Definitely a great game that won''t bore you. Perfect mix of great stealth gameplay and hack and slash combat, with some RPG leveling mixed in. Was unsure about this game before i got it, but took the plunge and it has blown me away and my expectations didn''t do the game justice.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Barnes', N'yuki.barnes3427@example.org', '2014-10-13', 5, N'At first I thought the controls and the difficulty in aiming were a big flaw of this game. I completed it in easy first just to get used to it. As you play, you get better at aiming. Head shots need just one bullet. This type of difficulty is annoying at first, but it probably reflects more of how the real world would be, I guess. Investigating every single room is important, as you need to find supplies to survive and also to upgrade weapons. Shooting arrows silently is more effective to kill Clickers than using a gun, as you need to shoot those things at least 3 times for them to fall dead. One arrow does the job, sometimes two are needed. Crafting and using smoke and shrapnel bombs makes progress more interesting when there are crowds of enemies you need to clear out while not having enough bullets and/or unable to hide or run away. Now for the gay part - I''m not sure if this came from the pervert dreams of some of the game developers, or if this is an attempt on the politically...'),
(N'Jacob', N'Anderson', N'jacob.anderson7695@example.com', '2014-10-13', 4, N'its challenging and fun!!!!!'),
(N'Michael', N'Sullivan', N'michael.sullivan1182@example.com', '2014-10-13', 5, N'In my opinion this game is better than assassins creed!! I like assassins creed but this to me was much better. I also love how the ps4 controller makes noises!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Clark', N'joyce.clark9983@example.net', '2014-10-13', 5, N'It works like a charm.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Hall', N'kathleen.hall5994@example.com', '2014-10-13', 5, N'This game is addicting. Me and my family will stay up past midnight mining and crafting away. Basically you take blocks and build stuff and fight zombies and such. You can raise animals and harvest crops and so much more. The graphics aren''t all that great since everything is just blocks but its still really good. Also although there is no story you can create your own by building things like houses and such and making a story out of it. A lot people have YouTube videos of stories and creations they made so check those out to get inspired. Also they have add ons so you can change your character so it looks like Borderlands characters, Castle Crashers, Mass Effect, Skyrim, Star Wars, and so much more. Also they have other add ons where it changes the blocks to look like different thing instead of the plain old looks. The world is also massive and there''s to explore. The cave systems are also fun and they are easy to get lost in. Overall this game is fun and very addicting.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Howard', N'aaron.howard9218@example.net', '2014-10-13', 5, N'Always loved this game as a kid. This product still looks the way it probably did when it was first made 20-something years ago.'),
(N'Larry', N'Nowak', N'larry.nowak4453@example.org', '2014-10-13', 4, N'Love this game. I actually couldn''t stop playing until I beat it. I still play with friends at least once a week. If you are a fan of Mortal Kombat then you should check this out for sure.'),
(N'Charles', N'Lee', N'charles.lee3779@example.com', '2014-10-13', 5, N'great'),
(N'Luis', N'Powell', N'luis.powell2568@example.com', '2014-10-14', 1, N'i have the goty which has a known problem of freezing up and mine does so it is unusable i feel that i have been cheated'),
(N'Luis', N'Powell', N'luis.powell2568@example.com', '2014-10-14', 5, N'realy enjoy this game enough to mod it and play again'),
(N'Kelly', N'Hill', N'kelly.hill6279@example.net', '2014-10-14', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Melissa', N'Okonkwo', N'melissa.okonkwo6970@example.org', '2014-10-14', 5, N'This fits perfectly and I''m so glad I get screen protectors. It''s important to have as a accessory and hori is always my favorite brand.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Okonkwo', N'melissa.okonkwo6970@example.org', '2014-10-14', 5, N'This protected my screen from a travel mishap where a metal spachula attacked it. All I can say is thank god I had this.'),
(N'Ryan', N'White', N'ryan.white5375@example.net', '2014-10-14', 3, N'not fully thought out i think. it works well for the device itself and a few games but you cant even fit the charging cord/adapter with it. kind of a necessity if your gonna "travel" don''t ya think.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wright', N'kelly.wright9645@example.net', '2014-10-14', 5, N'Although third party, this expansion is still loads of fun!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Singh', N'thomas.singh9650@example.org', '2014-10-14', 2, N'I wish the Amazon rating system went in half star increments. 3 stars is too many, but I feel that 2 is too low...... The graphics are vastly improved (as they should be for the new gen consoles) & the team of Doc Emerick & Eddie O calling the games is a big upgrade! However, aside from that, it''s essentially NHL 14 with a roster update. The career modes put out by EA is so far behind any of the 2K franchises, it''s embarassing. The difficulty settings need to be fully customized for anything close to a realistic game (please note EA Sports, that 6+ goals per team per game is not a common occurance in the NHL). EA needs to actually put out a complete game for once........'),
(N'Brenda', N'Mitchell', N'brenda.mitchell8698@example.org', '2014-10-14', 5, N'MUY BUENOS, RECOMENDADO 100%'),
(N'Joshua', N'Davis', N'joshua.davis2557@example.net', '2014-10-14', 2, N'This is most definitely not ready for Prime Time. Stay away for now. 1) I knew this going in, but only 720p and 1080i support for video display. Which wouldn''t be a big deal if... 2) All the movies available for rent/purchase through the Sony Store are ALL STANDARD DEFINITION. This will not replace a Roku or Apple TV if you wish to use it as a streaming box with the perks of being able to stream your PS4 from another room to another set. 3) Although it may be coming, there is zero support for apps for Netflix, Amazon Prime, Hulu Plus, or even Youtube. 4) About the only thing this is good for is playing your PS Vita games on your set. But this is cumbersome and here are my reasons. 4A) I have a Nyko Controller grip for my PS Vita. When I want to play games on my TV, I have to detach the Nyko grip entirely from my Vita, take out the memory card, insert it into the PS TV, activate the games, and play. Obviously to get it back to the way it was before and play these games on my Vita, I...'),
(N'Walter', N'Bailey', N'walter.bailey7721@example.net', '2014-10-14', 3, N'PSTV is kind of a mixed bag and how well it works depends on what your intentions to use this are for. I bought this solely as a cheap Vita alternative and for that it works great! It doesn''t play ALL Vita games (you can almost immediately eliminate those with touch controls) but it played the ones I was most interested in. Vita games look good on 720, putting it on 1080 makes them look kinda crappy unless it''s like a visual novel. PSP games look kind of bad and pixelated and PSOne games look ATROCIOUS. There''s also no knowing how many future Vita games will be supported so keep that in mind as well. If you''re buying this for remote play or for streaming apps I''d say no go or at least don''t purchase right now because it really sucks. Most apps aren''t supported and the remote play is super laggy even on a stable internet connection. They even suggest that you use a direct connection to your modem for best remote play results (which sorta defeats the purpose). Also Netflix have...'),
(N'Shirley', N'Murphy', N'shirley.murphy3381@example.org', '2014-10-14', 5, N'This is a must get game! I got this game to play through on my youtube channel (Xzulas) and because I''ve always been a huge fan of the Alien series. I asked my Subscribers what they wanted me to play video game wise during live feeds and everyone told me you have to get this game. I had fans tell me not to play this in the dark and not to wear head phones they even went as far as to tell me to lay down plastic under my chair. It was great I knew then, that I had to get this game. I had two options at the time or purchase my laptop or my sort of dying PS3. I went with my laptop and steam download purchased from Amazon, it was easy as always the game worked right away after install, the settings are simple and my xbox 360 pc controller works perfect of course. The game is amazing, its not a 1st person shooter its a adventure horror type game kind of like the 1st resident evil which was the 1st video game to scare the crap out of me. Its got depth and a great story line it will leave...'),
(N'Barbara', N'Ward', N'barbara.ward3565@example.net', '2014-10-15', 5, N'I would agree with another reviewer that this game is one of the best released so far. The Evil Within is challenging even on "easy" difficulty. It actually punishes you for making hasty decision making and then again if you''re too slow you''ll be punished also. There are situations that require tactical planning and then there are situations where if you hesitate you''re basically dead meat. I was stuck in chapter (the first one) before I just decided to hurry up and run for the elevator which I should have figured from the previews anyway. The controls are excellent, though the pistol you start with seems a little useless, I found it easier to sneak up on enemies and shank them, useless you like to lose a lot of health with every confrontation and fight your way through which isn''t very smart. Sometimes it''s better to sneak away or run like hell. The game seems to force the player to judge a situation and react with the best possible choice. This is the thinking person''s horror...'),
(N'Karen', N'Singh', N'karen.singh6378@example.net', '2014-10-15', 5, N'Gosh, these are just awesome. Blocks out sounds and has amazing bass!'),
(N'Carlos', N'Parker', N'carlos.parker4525@example.org', '2014-10-15', 5, N'It was a fast delivery and the gameplay Rocks no complaints here'),
(N'Jason', N'Garcia', N'jason.garcia6250@example.org', '2014-10-15', 5, N'cool'),
(N'Jacob', N'Sanders', N'jacob.sanders1036@example.com', '2014-10-15', 5, N'LOVE this game. Graphics are good as it gets and the story line is amazing. Well done is an understatement.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Johnson', N'tomasz.johnson1787@example.org', '2014-10-15', 5, N'Verry good'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Sanders', N'jeremy.sanders8343@example.net', '2014-10-15', 1, N'This wouldn''t sync with my XBOX 360 Wireless controller at all'),
(N'Brian', N'James', N'brian.james6798@example.net', '2014-10-15', 5, N'I bought this when five came out and it is really fun game good shipping and packaging couldn''t be happier with this product.'),
(N'Brian', N'Parker', N'brian.parker8020@example.com', '2014-10-15', 5, N'Ok this game takes place after the original Borderlands, but before the sequel Borderlands 2... so you get the PRE sequel :) Some people complain it is like a "Big DLC" to BL2, but I really don''t care - I love it.. it''s fun it''s addictive it''s Borderlands :) The game controller layout is exactly the same as BL2 which is great since you can hop right in and not "relearn" controls. The looks and feel and humor are all there as expected, but the atmosphere and low gravity gives a cool tweak to movements (oh and it also gives you the new melee attack of "butt slams" ;) ) Right now I am playing as Claptrap, and telling you.. it''s fun.. really fun... like "I will only play for a little bit.. next thing you know it''s 3AM fun ;) Get it... why?! ..." REASONS!" ***** JIm'),
(N'Julie', N'Jenkins', N'julie.jenkins4808@example.com', '2014-10-15', 5, N'Game was pretty fun especially since i have never really played a super smash bros game yet til now. The game features many of the past characters from the previous titles and new comers(villager from animal crossing, wii fit trainer, etc.). Online mode is pretty fun, but the fights can extremely lag if you don''t have the decent wifi (I use cox high speed internet and it works pretty well with almost no lag). The game has multiple styles of minigames and actual one on one fights so theres really high replay value. Lastly the game doesn''t include an actual story like its predecesor super smash bros brawl. While the game doesn''t have a story line the gamplay in itself makes up for it and more.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Baker', N'nancy.baker7020@example.com', '2014-10-15', 5, N'FAST SHIPPING! GREAT PRICE! THANKS!!!'),
(N'Jerry', N'Carter', N'jerry.carter6802@example.org', '2014-10-15', 4, N'It''s dark, it''s creepy, and it''s loaded with jump scares and brutal death animations, sounds like the ingredients for a great survivor horror game and The Evil Within has all that. Right off the bat, the game throws you right into the thick of things with one of the best tutorial levels in a game I''ve ever played. Trying to sneak around this giant Leatherface looking enemy while trying to get the hang of the controls and figure out what to do to advance all at the same time so not much of a learning curve in this one and I died probably about a dozen times in the tutorial level alone. The game hints early on that it''s not going to be the easiest and the game is a constant challenge, it hardly ever lets up. Constant waves of enemies fighting you all the while you''re running out of ammo, it''s a constant adrenaline rush and there have been numerous times already where I barely got through a section with enough ammo and there have been many times where I have run out of ammo altogether...'),
(N'Nadia', N'Fisher', N'nadia.fisher9384@example.net', '2014-10-15', 5, N'Shin Megami Tensei 4 is a Awesome JRPG game from Altus!! The Gameplay is Turn-Based but it''s pretty fast and the Soundtrack is amazing to hear!! The story is very interesting and there are choices you have to make so you can have different endings depending on your Play-through. This was my first time playing a Shin Megami Tensei Game and I loved it. If you are a Newcomer or Shin Megami Tensei fan that loves JRPG Games, You must get this, you won''t regret it!! :)'),
(N'David', N'Clark', N'david.clark7696@example.org', '2014-10-15', 5, N'This is the EPITOME of graphic adventures. No other game has even come close to GRIM FANTANGO when it comes to humor (of all shades and shapes), inventiveness, delicious irony, creative graphics and plain good-ol'' FUN!! This is a 15-year old game mind you - yet, it retains its freshness as any true work of art. THIS is the road not taken by the gaming industry. THIS is how computer games should have been. Not the pathetic cookie-cutter products of mega-corporations working in-tandem with hardware companies and trying to hook everybody with their latest Always-Online DRM scheme... Your character (hilarious and lovable Manny Calavera) is already...dead when you start. In fact he has been dead for some time, stuck in limbo, trying to pay his way to a better afterlife by selling tickets to other souls on their way to paradise. Guess what: corruption is not limited just to this world. And where there is corruption, there is oppression; and where there is oppression, there is always a...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Ward', N'stephen.ward8789@example.net', '2014-10-15', 5, N'Got here on time. Works great. Replaces the whole back, so if you don''t care what color your battery cover is. Love the light change to let you know they are ready.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Allen', N'matthew.allen3521@example.net', '2014-10-15', 4, N'It has games, ranging from quick pick up puzzle games to 40+ hour rpgs to platformers, shooters (both over the shoulder and first person) and even a few truly unique experiences utilizing the front and back touch. I don''t use it for much else however there is YouTube, Skype and a web browser only draw back is it comes with very limited space.'),
(N'Julie', N'Phillips', N'julie.phillips2119@example.com', '2014-10-16', 2, N'One word: Tedious. I didn''t like this ND installment from the start. I have absolutely no interest in the Greek alphabet, history, or mythology. The setting was a snore, the characters uninteresting, and the character Niobe was shown in two places at once (a clear oversight because of a Her Interactive deadline). I miss the early Nancy Drew games. She needs to have an adventure in England or New York or even a cruise ship. No more Greek, Egyptian, or weird sheep infested locations (Shattered Medallion, anyone?). The puzzles in this game were incredibly tedious and annoying to play. I took no enjoyment in flipping back and forth through a ridiculous and loooooong script to find out how to play some of them. And there was hardly ever a real clear explanation as to how to play some of the puzzles. I had to use the hints more in this game than I ever have. Warnings at Waverly and Secret of the Old Clock are still my top favorites. There''s variety and interesting characters and games....'),
(N'Donald', N'Perez', N'donald.perez9162@example.com', '2014-10-16', 1, N'Probably the only good thing to come out of Russia, Tetris was made famous during the heydays of Game Boy and became the highest selling game ever, mainly because it was included with the Game Boy. So, the NES version of Tetris became inevitable. So, here you have it: Tetris for NES. There is not much to say. It''s rather a purposeless game with no end and no clear idea of what to aim for. I personally like Dr. Mario more. All in all, people like playing Tetris, but I don''t. Check my youtube videos in how to beat this game by typing in "Mr. Math Expert" and the name of the game. so you can learn how to.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Okonkwo', N'melissa.okonkwo6970@example.org', '2014-10-16', 5, N'I love love love all Zelda games, now if only I could beat them all 100%'),
(N'Megan', N'Ramos', N'megan.ramos3451@example.org', '2014-10-16', 2, N'I bought this when it was on sale for only like 10 bucks new. I didn''t have high expectations coming in because of all the bad press and reviews. Playing through, I actually didn''t think it was all that bad. That is until I go to a boss fight that was unbeatable. If you''ve played this before, you strap in to a power loader and fight a giant alien as well as smaller aliens. It was so cheap in the way you would die, it was almost a joke. The AI that is supposed to help you in this game are absolutely worthless. I tried so many times to get past it to no avail. Oh well, the statue that comes with it was worth the $10 and looks nice on my shelf at least (pretty sturdy with nice weight to the base)!'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Rodriguez', N'rebecca.rodriguez7913@example.org', '2014-10-16', 1, N'Pretty awful game. The graphics are subpar. The gameplay is repetitive. And the big gimmick is that this is the city from the first game, but all messed up. *shrug* If I had played the original less than 5 years ago, I might enjoy that a little more, but honestly, it''s all bland and dumb dumb dumb. Zero charm.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Cruz', N'ravi.cruz9706@example.com', '2014-10-16', 4, N'If you''ve played the original Space Invaders on the arcade cabinet 3 decades ago, then you should have no problems with this "Extreme" installment. You still shoot down enemy ships; however, it takes a while to get used to the more complex logistics that are contained within the game, so I''ll try to explain it as best as I can. First off, there are several modes to choose from: Arcade Mode, Ranking Mode (no saving is allowed), or the much more satisfying Multiplayer mode. On the bottom left screen, you will start with a Normal Cannon. As you progress with shooting down those pesky Space Invaders, you will eventually acquire one of 4 power-ups: Laser (blue), Bomb (red), Broad Shot (green), or Shield (silver). Each power-up is very helpful along the way but they don''t last forever. You can gain these incredible power-ups by killing 4 ships of identical color. Next is the Feature panel. You will light it up by shooting down invaders in the specific order you see on the screen;...'),
(N'Christina', N'Moore', N'christina.moore5116@example.org', '2014-10-16', 1, N'Within 2 weeks there was a shorage in the cord, so it works off and on, I blame my kids because they play it while it''s charging, (and the one from nintendo did the same, hence the purchase of this one) So I just have to come up with a better solution for my family.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Coleman', N'lisa.coleman5308@example.org', '2014-10-16', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Khan', N'hiroshi.khan5648@example.org', '2014-10-16', 5, N'I bought this to act as a second ps4 and it does just that. Case and point. I have an awesome roku 3 for all my media entertainment needs. I don''t care to watch Netflix nowhere else.'),
(N'Angela', N'Moore', N'angela.moore1489@example.com', '2014-10-16', 5, N'a great game that is like Zelda'),
(N'Sofia', N'Cook', N'sofia.cook9103@example.com', '2014-10-16', 5, N'Great game! Hours of fun! Awesome Zelda themed Dynasty Warriors game with many RPG upgrade options.'),
(N'Ravi', N'James', N'ravi.james4990@example.com', '2014-10-17', 5, N'good'),
(N'Lauren', N'Sanders', N'lauren.sanders1222@example.net', '2014-10-17', 5, N'Replacement for my scratched game. Fast ship! Thanks'),
(N'Lauren', N'Sanders', N'lauren.sanders1222@example.net', '2014-10-17', 5, N'Replacement game, fast ship. As described'),
(N'Sandra', N'Wright', N'sandra.wright4504@example.com', '2014-10-17', 5, N'I am with the other hundreds of people reviewing here, I have put many hours into the PC version of this game. I will never touch the PC version again. This game was made for consoles. The controller works wonderfully, the graphics are good and very rarely drop. The co-op is a blast. I feel Blizzard is making the game even better with the many updates and fixes they are making (goblin den anyone?). If you are on the fence about this game for the PS4, please stop reading the reviews and buy it. You will not look back!'),
(N'Peter', N'Chen', N'peter.chen7789@example.net', '2014-10-17', 5, N'Excellent product'),
(N'Larry', N'Morgan', N'larry.morgan7203@example.com', '2014-10-17', 5, N'I love Lego Games and anything Lord of the Rings. So I had to get this game. I had heard many good things about the game and they were right. Its a really fun game. The levels do a great job of recreating important scenes from the hobbit movies whether is the troll caves to riding down the river in barrels. It is amazing how they can turn a simple scene as to feeding the dozen or so dwarfs into a level...especially the singing part with dishes. The scenes that play out are funny. The voice acting is great since it is taken from the movies themselves. It is quite funny to see a serious scene acted funny with movie audio. Dont get this if you are expecting all three movies. This game contains the first two "An unexpected journey" and "Desolation of Smaug" with the third film "battle of the five armies" rumored to be dlc. So expect to pay extra money eventually for the full experience or wait to see if they release a full version. If you haven''t played a lego game in a while they is a...'),
(N'Samuel', N'Hernandez', N'samuel.hernandez1290@example.net', '2014-10-17', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Steven', N'Wright', N'steven.wright6336@example.org', '2014-10-17', 5, N'It''s interesting to note just how many offerings are available concerning gaming headsets that currently exist on the market to date. We''ve gone from a limited variety to a plethora (and yes...that is a very fitting use of that word) of choices in gaming headsets. When it comes to reviews for headsets, you the reader, must be very careful, considerate and mindful about what you''re reading, because the likes and dislikes of a particular headset are COMPLETELY subjective. Why do I say that? I will tell you exactly why: Personal Preference. Why does it really come down to those two little words? I will tell you exactly why: The success or failure of a particular gaming headset is, largely, up to the individuals expectations and what that person has determined to be their comfort zone concerning 3 things: 1) Quality, 2) Engineering and 3) Wireless or Wired. Frankly, I''m surprised that we still have the huge amount of gaming headset offerings that we do, but it still comes down to those...'),
(N'Sandra', N'Johnson', N'sandra.johnson6534@example.net', '2014-10-17', 3, N'Fix the unsmooth button movement.'),
(N'Donna', N'Cooper', N'donna.cooper4533@example.com', '2014-10-17', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Mei', N'Stewart', N'mei.stewart8440@example.com', '2014-10-17', 5, N'lots of good fun,'),
(N'Lucia', N'Hughes', N'lucia.hughes9567@example.net', '2014-10-17', 5, N'excellent product!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Reyes', N'jessica.reyes5734@example.com', '2014-10-17', 5, N'One of the best in this fun series. Clear, bright images and challenging enough to be addictive yet solvable too. Highly recommend.'),
(N'Wei', N'Ivanov', N'wei.ivanov7055@example.org', '2014-10-17', 1, N'Got mine, first week they worked perfectly. Sounded great. I sit them down on my shelf, to plug-in my surround sound headphones. Leave them there for about 3-4 days. I try them again, and they don''t work. Perfect. Good way to spend $60.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Kelly', N'carolyn.kelly8886@example.net', '2014-10-17', 4, N'Great headset. They aren''t as bulky as some of the other turtle beach headsets Ive used. They fit comfortably and block out a lot of the sounds around you. Really makes you feel like you''re in the game. Plus the Star Wars theme is pretty awesome!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Lewis', N'nadia.lewis1608@example.net', '2014-10-18', 5, N'Kids like this character for their Skylanders game for the wii'),
(N'Adam', N'Cooper', N'adam.cooper1508@example.net', '2014-10-18', 5, N'awesom'),
(N'Matthew', N'Ross', N'matthew.ross9405@example.net', '2014-10-18', 4, N'I was really looking forward to this game when it was first announced. Unfortunately, I found it somewhat disappointing. I''m a huge fan of Ace Attorney, but I''ve only played one Professor Layton game. In my opinion, the two series didn''t mesh all that well together in this game. The puzzles, though enjoyable, really interrupted the flow of the story. On the other hand, if you''re a huge fan of Layton, you''ll probably find the trial portions and dialogue somewhat tedious. In addition, the puzzles in this game weren''t particularly difficult. What really got to me was the ending of the story. Just to warn you guys, the story in this game is much more Layton than Phoenix Wright, if you''re familiar with the Layton games. Despite finding the story underwhelming, I overall enjoyed the game, thanks to the trial portions, the soundtrack, and the production values.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Wood', N'kathleen.wood1863@example.org', '2014-10-18', 5, N'Packaging well and shippping fast. The PSV has instruction in Japanese and good picture for teaching how to use it and connect to PSN.'),
(N'Charles', N'Brown', N'charles.brown5539@example.com', '2014-10-18', 5, N'I have played other games based on the Lord of the rings but this one was different. It has a great story and fantastic gameplay. The characters are lifelike and believable. The controls are simple and fun when they are combined for killer moves. Also there are comedic moments in the gameplay. I really just began to play but I really love this game.'),
(N'Debra', N'Hernandez', N'debra.hernandez2385@example.com', '2014-10-18', 1, N'This is absolutely ridiculous, 2k sports just EA''d us.... To start it off when i first popped in this game i thought that they a copy of 2k14 had been put on the disc by mistake. But long behold, I figured out that 2k sports left a giant sh** on 360 fans NBA. I mean there is literally no improvement, the menu is the same, the ROSTER is the same except for Lebron and some rookies. I will go as far to say this is a downgrade from 2k14, that''s right a downgrade. IF YOU HAVE NOT PLAYED 2K14 YET DO NOT BUY THIS, BUY 2K14. The only difference besides what I mentioned already is a new shooting system, which sucks, and a new soundtrack. That''s right, the want you to pay 60 dollars FOR ROOKIES, A SOUNDTRACK, AND A NEW SHOOTING SYSTEM!!! WTF? And guess what, apparently 2k doesn''t care about online experience at all because the servers still SUCK. Btw create a legend is gone also. For so long 2k has been making Nba better and better. They have added new modes, improved the graphics big time,...'),
(N'Christina', N'Long', N'christina.long4975@example.net', '2014-10-18', 3, N'Very childish story. As a teenager, I am disappointed.'),
(N'Richard', N'Walker', N'richard.walker3061@example.net', '2014-10-18', 3, N'Great game, has all the mario characters, and the storyline is fun. The only thing was that the story was too short.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Richardson', N'ronald.richardson1956@example.net', '2014-10-19', 5, N'Bought as a gift. They love it and think it is amazing.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Wilson', N'melissa.wilson1881@example.net', '2014-10-19', 5, N'I remember my sophmore year in high school, Sega Saturn came out. And it had some great jaw dropping games! Among those, was Panzer Dragoon. Panzer Dragoon is a rail shooting style of game. But, you are riding a dragon & it is in third person perspective/view. The gameplay was (and still is) simple yet great! The sound effects & music in the game are very awesome! And the graphics were great at it''s time. All these years have passed. So the graphics have aged. But, they still look decent at least in my opinion. Though there are only a handful of levels the game is challenging quickly. It has a pretty decent replay value. The Panzer series has a cult following to this day. If you can get this game, and you are a collector/hard core gamer such as myself. I would highly recommend picking up this game!!! It''s harder & harder to come by now. And the game holds it''s value. I had bought it years back. And very happy to still have it in my collection. If you play old school-current games...'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Butler', N'jacqueline.butler9181@example.net', '2014-10-19', 4, N'I pre ordered this game and it came yesterday. At first encounter, I''m not crazy about the menu system but the game itself is super. Great follow up from Forza 5. The oversteer \ understeer is more realistic as is the traction. It seems smother: refined. Just impressions after a few hours. Oh, by-the-way, I''m not enamored with the in game purchasing. Maybe if I spend enough money I won''t even have to play it at all. Back before the wheel was invented this was called cheating,. Really! Without that, it would have scored 5 stars. Anyway, get this simulation, you''ll like it. Another quality ride from Forza. Great courses and graphics. Just eats up the hours.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Rogers', N'hiroshi.rogers2955@example.net', '2014-10-19', 1, N'Ordered this product and got a case that says metroid prime on the front and looks like a dog chewed it up really good. Looks nothing like the item in the picture!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Perry', N'kimberly.perry4549@example.net', '2014-10-19', 5, N'Best game in the series. If you enjoy any Harvest Moon, this will provide you hours of enjoyment and great replay value. One of the gems to be released on the PSX'),
(N'Sharon', N'Parker', N'sharon.parker4087@example.net', '2014-10-19', 3, N'Nice graphics, many of the objects were glaringly out of sync with the game''s theme which I found off-putting. Worst was the frequent crashing which made the game almost unplayable. There is no separate way to save the game so with each crash you lose progress and have to continually repeat the same steps to get back to where you were.'),
(N'Jose', N'Watson', N'jose.watson3710@example.com', '2014-10-19', 5, N'This type of duke nukem was my favorite by far. Looking froward to getting land of the babes too! Too bad they RUINED dukes legacy by releasing the pile of warm garbage regretfully called duke nukem forever...'),
(N'Linda', N'Morgan', N'linda.morgan7770@example.net', '2014-10-19', 3, N'Single player campaign was great, wonderful graphics. Multiplayer was clunky and easily forgettable. I beat the story, and shelved the game, where it''s stayed since.'),
(N'Emma', N'Young', N'emma.young5898@example.com', '2014-10-19', 2, N'Boooooring, only played it for 5 minutes and I was done, maybe if I was 7 would enjoyed it but still not worth it.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Brooks', N'kyle.brooks9592@example.net', '2014-10-19', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Sofia', N'Stewart', N'sofia.stewart4037@example.org', '2014-10-19', 5, N'It''s Metroid. 2. On the gameboy. It''s awesome of course. Sprite size is restrictive and it does feel like the game might have been able to do more w/ a smaller Samus, but that''s the only real knock I have. Well, ok. The low life beeps are annoying too. But you can remedy that part yourself at least.'),
(N'Luis', N'Nguyen', N'luis.nguyen3174@example.net', '2014-10-19', 5, N'Excelent Game'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wang', N'rachel.wang7419@example.net', '2014-10-19', 3, N'Feels like you''re playing a movie. Great graphics, great story, but I want to play the damn game not watch it play.'),
(N'Walter', N'Gutierrez', N'walter.gutierrez5959@example.net', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Awesome game. So well crafted. A work of art that is super fun to play.'),
(N'Scott', N'Gutierrez', N'scott.gutierrez2876@example.net', '2014-10-20', 5, N'this was for my grand-son who is a sergeant in JROTC, so was exactly what he wanted- kinda matches his JROTC Raiders uniform- and he loves it!!!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Fisher', N'hannah.fisher2549@example.com', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Fisher', N'kenneth.fisher2688@example.com', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Nephew loves it !!!!'),
(N'Brian', N'Wilson', N'brian.wilson4789@example.net', '2014-10-20', 3, N'The games not bad but when you gte the game at 2:30 pm and at about 8:30pm the same day your finshed makes you glad you didn''t pay $70.00 for it'),
(N'Barbara', N'Anderson', N'barbara.anderson6072@example.com', '2014-10-20', 5, N'good'),
(N'Ronald', N'Okonkwo', N'ronald.okonkwo7847@example.net', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Very happy, exceptional quality, fits my games and accessories fine.'),
(N'Carol', N'Torres', N'carol.torres8312@example.org', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Perhaps the best Fire Emblem yet. I liked the relationship stuff, but moreso, I loved the graphics. I also liked the ability to go back and train my units, although it defeats the purpose of strategy a little. Overall, fun game.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Raghunathan', N'raymond.raghunathan7478@example.org', '2014-10-20', 5, N'loved it.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wilson', N'kelly.wilson4368@example.net', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Bought this as a birthday present for my fiance. She loves it. It plays nice, the screen is clear. It came exactly as the seller described. Thank you for being honest in your product description. There were small scuffs, as stated, but NO WHERE near as bad as I thought.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Fisher', N'carlos.fisher7685@example.com', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Great game if you are like me an pouring over every Bioware game possible while waiting for the next installment of Mass Effect. Gameplay is the same as the first one, and the story similarly does a great job of creating a mystery on the first level.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Fisher', N'sarah.fisher5324@example.com', '2014-10-20', 5, N'great product'),
(N'Patricia', N'Flores', N'patricia.flores4370@example.net', '2014-10-20', 4, N'So, let me first address the "same ol'' thing" reviews: 1. In Borderlands 1 and 2, the characters and powers you chose were almost identical, and I didn''t see anyone up in arms. The 2 dlc characters were not interesting enough at all for me to purchase. This game has 4 all new characters with completely new powers and wild skill trees. 2. It was 4 years between BL 1 and 2, and only 2 years between BL2 and the Pre Sequel. So, it was obvious there was not going to be a brand new game engine, especially if this game was only for the 360 and PS3. There were plenty of previews and interviews to make this determination. It shouldn''t have come as such a shock. Now with that out of the way, I''m really happy with what I''m seeing so far. If you''re familiar with the series, then there''s practically no learning curve. Same types of weapons (with the addition of lasers and cryro weapons), class mods, grenade mods, etc. Managing oxygen is not very hard at all, although I did have to retreat to...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Miller', N'ethan.miller4879@example.com', '2014-10-20', 5, N'Diablo 2 is honestly one of the greatest games I''ve ever played. I have been playing it on and off since I was 5. Still not bored of it. Buy it. And the expansion. It''s an amazing MMORPG'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ramos', N'jeremy.ramos6785@example.org', '2014-10-21', 5, N'my son enjoys this video game and had no complaints'),
(N'Marcus', N'Khan', N'marcus.khan7202@example.org', '2014-10-21', 4, N'I recommend this game, especially for strategy fans. Worth having in library. However, several aspects of game are a challenge to understand (such as Morale). None are gameplay inhibitors, though.'),
(N'Priya', N'Morales', N'priya.morales7555@example.com', '2014-10-21', 3, N'... but I merely liked it. This is a very hard to score game. On the one hand, the production values are amazing, and there''s a lot of effort put into this. I can''t accuse the game for being lazy, perhaps for trying to be too much at once? Beyond: Two Souls is the story of Jodie, a girl who since birth has been mentally linked to an unstable, intangible and telekinetic entity called Aiden. Suffering from a lonely childhood she is then studied and recruited as a special agent, using her special ability to do missions no one else can. But when she''s forced to do something that hurts her very soul, she abandons and becomes a fugitive. What to say about this game? First, let''s go with the positives. The main draw of this game is, of course, the presence of celebrities Ellen Page and Willem Dafoe, both of whom do an amazing work of acting their respective roles, magnified by the amazing motion capture and animation work, making these characters seem really alive. The visual style of...'),
(N'Judith', N'Morgan', N'judith.morgan3096@example.org', '2014-10-21', 5, N'i love it thx its perfect'),
(N'Yuki', N'Gonzalez', N'yuki.gonzalez8154@example.net', '2014-10-21', 4, N'Your sim can now travel the world with this expansion pack. Make new friends, explore tombs, you can now build dungeons and tombs, and your sim can learn new skills (martial arts, nectar making, and photography). Only problem is once you explore the tomb that''s it, if your sim returns to the tomb its just how you left it (although some the treasure chests do restock)'),
(N'Ryan', N'King', N'ryan.king9133@example.com', '2014-10-21', 3, N'Even the Sony ones fall apart. They are worth it while they last.'),
(N'Jose', N'Adams', N'jose.adams1423@example.org', '2014-10-21', 5, N'PERFECT! Came on time!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Green', N'nicholas.green9880@example.com', '2014-10-21', 5, N'excellent product, great quality and can be used with many devices at the same time, I will buy another set of turtle beach when mine get bad.... if that happens! got''em for quite some time and still work like new'),
(N'Janet', N'Bailey', N'janet.bailey1708@example.com', '2014-10-21', 5, N'Product was very nice'),
(N'Andrea', N'Campbell', N'andrea.campbell3934@example.com', '2014-10-21', 5, N'Excellent product, very well done. I recommend it.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Roberts', N'kimberly.roberts9232@example.com', '2014-10-21', 5, N'Heard from my brother that this game was gonna be great before it even came out. So I got it for my lord of the rings nerd/fiance and he is in love with it! Graphics are the best ps4 has ever done. Fight scenes epic. And I''m just a girl who doesn''t play these games so how would I know? Exactly.'),
(N'Judith', N'Wilson', N'judith.wilson7223@example.org', '2014-10-21', 5, N'This is probably the best game of this console generation. It''s beautiful and plays so well. I''ve spent over 120 hours on here and I haven''t done nearly everything I can. The value is there. Would highly recommend.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Diaz', N'kevin.diaz7318@example.net', '2014-10-21', 3, N'Game was Ok, a little glich at first, but it corrected itself.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Wood', N'timothy.wood3664@example.net', '2014-10-21', 3, N'Alright game'),
(N'Janet', N'Young', N'janet.young9999@example.net', '2014-10-22', 5, N'awesome game'),
(N'Christine', N'Okonkwo', N'christine.okonkwo2490@example.com', '2014-10-22', 3, N'Great game, great multiplayer but the campaign has a game breaking glitch. There is a constant repeating message that comes up saying "you failed to protect the president''s vehicle." Other than that, good game.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Tanaka', N'jacqueline.tanaka3330@example.net', '2014-10-22', 5, N'Great game thank u'),
(N'Linda', N'Carter', N'linda.carter4670@example.net', '2014-10-22', 4, N'This was a fun game and definitely an improvement on graphics but not as good as previous versions. I found that the new gameplay was a little bit too easy.'),
(N'Frank', N'Morgan', N'frank.morgan2536@example.com', '2014-10-23', 5, N'The megaman franchise is over, and since megaman legends stopped at PlayStation one, I had to grab this, plus I already played it before but never beat it! and I love the animated series, this I going right I my game collection.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Williams', N'zachary.williams2349@example.com', '2014-10-23', 4, N'good controller'),
(N'Justin', N'Sanchez', N'justin.sanchez4334@example.net', '2014-10-23', 2, N'Why the two stars??? I am a huge fan of car games. That''s why I bought this game. However, my excitement fizzed out after I installed the game. For one thing, you can''t play this game without the CD in the CDROM, even though I spent 40 minutes installing it on my computer system. Second, although the game came with manual with list of key commands and what not, I simply can''t get past "press START button" to start the game no matter what key I press on my keyboard. Since i cant press start button, it just keeps playing the game intro. it looks like the games good but i cant start the game....'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Wood', N'jeremy.wood2107@example.com', '2014-10-23', 4, N'Now that I am an experienced gamer I enjoy this very much. I didn''t like the game before because I thought it was too hard. I had not been playing games for long. Now I have breezed through 14 chapters in two days and I am on the 15th. This is on easy mode. I will probably put it on hard to see what it is like. I would recommend to anyone playing this game that you must must must stalk up on green gel and upgrade your weapons and abilities as much as possible. That is what will get you through this game. Without advanced weapons you will not make it. If the controls are too difficult, go to the control section of the menu and change the sensitivity. It makes a world of difference.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Sanchez', N'lauren.sanchez7268@example.net', '2014-10-23', 5, N'the color is awesome "GO UTES"'),
(N'William', N'Nelson', N'william.nelson2482@example.org', '2014-10-23', 4, N'I really enjoyed this game! Puzzles were great; it actually scared me a couple of times when ''being watched.'' The tempo was good with minor repetitiveness (i.e. returning more than twice to a previous scene).'),
(N'Helen', N'Martinez', N'helen.martinez4412@example.org', '2014-10-23', 4, N'Great But Difficult Game. To the Point Where Its Frustrating. But a Classic Game. Has Unlockable Characters Like Motaro and Shao Kahn. Great to Play As Them But Only On a Two-Player Match. Not In The Tower Unfortunatly.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Harris', N'barbara.harris3478@example.net', '2014-10-23', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Megan', N'Mendoza', N'megan.mendoza3754@example.org', '2014-10-23', 5, N'I recently bought this game, and it is amazing. The graphics are splendid, the atmosphere of the game is incredible and the story so far is very good. The game itself not very scary, but i have to say that it has a certain thrill on it, that it makes it quite entertaining Also the game it''s quite hard, but it makes it more challenging which I truly like, also i noticed that you have to rely more on stealth that in firepower due to the lack of ammo and guns. It''s worth the money, so buy it'),
(N'Brenda', N'Parker', N'brenda.parker6799@example.net', '2014-10-23', 5, N'Great game. I love the Ar Tonelico series. I bought it used and it works perfectly. I have played the game twice now and have had no complications out of the game.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Ward', N'hiroshi.ward7694@example.net', '2014-10-23', 4, N'good purchase'),
(N'Mary', N'Collins', N'mary.collins8171@example.net', '2014-10-23', 5, N'Great quality generic product.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Cook', N'douglas.cook1096@example.org', '2014-10-23', 4, N'Replaced the one we lost'),
(N'Douglas', N'Cook', N'douglas.cook1096@example.org', '2014-10-23', 5, N'Another great FIFA game'),
(N'Jack', N'Barnes', N'jack.barnes9124@example.org', '2014-10-23', 4, N'This is a pretty nice game as it allows you to really become Jango Fett (even though it is 3rd person). You get to kill, fly, bounty, shoot and navigate through well done levels and even learn more about Jango and the prequel trilogy as a result. Not bad. I was real impressed with how different the levels were in this game and how much you had to think to beat them. While some took a long time to figure out, it eventually turned into a lot of fun. Some levels still remain challenging (level seven onward minus the last one but unlike Rogue Squadron the levels don''t insanly irritate me mostly. However the biggest problem is the bounties, you have to find them with no clues usually and it''s very hard to capture them sometimes. You only gain concept art by bounting them so you can try but once you get to level nine, I''d say forget it. Good game.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Peterson', N'carolyn.peterson9641@example.com', '2014-10-23', 5, N'It worked'),
(N'Wei', N'Smith', N'wei.smith8357@example.org', '2014-10-24', 5, N'Just awesome!'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Watson', N'carolyn.watson5521@example.com', '2014-10-24', 5, N'Fun!'),
(N'Noah', N'Bennett', N'noah.bennett1419@example.com', '2014-10-24', 5, N'This product came in good condition, works well, and I have not had any issues. Thanks'),
(N'Melissa', N'Gray', N'melissa.gray1489@example.com', '2014-10-24', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Brown', N'aaron.brown5411@example.net', '2014-10-24', 5, N'in line with expectations and offered , arrived at the date indicated , and in excellent condition , very happy with the product.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Tanaka', N'dennis.tanaka4801@example.org', '2014-10-24', 5, N'Wow this game is so much fun. Watched some you tube videos before buying and was not impressed. I went ahead and bought the game and I''m glad I did. Great action slasher game play with a decent story and acceptable graphics. It''s no game of the year but it''s a ton of fun and worth every penny.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Peterson', N'alexander.peterson3127@example.net', '2014-10-25', 3, N'The case is OK. It''s well made and will protect the vita from scratches and light bumps. However, I like to put the vita in a book bag or suitcase that contain other (hard) objects. This case is soft and will not prevent a book or whatever from pressing on the joysticks. On a number of occasions I''ve found my vita''s battery completely discharged because it was activated by some object pressing through the case. I need a hard case for travel. I''m using an AmazonBasics case now.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ruiz', N'jeremy.ruiz1536@example.net', '2014-10-25', 5, N'Takes a bit to get use to, but it does change things you will see.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Nelson', N'andrew.nelson7321@example.net', '2014-10-25', 5, N'good'),
(N'Yuki', N'Jones', N'yuki.jones6427@example.com', '2014-10-25', 5, N'Your valuable vintage NES games, along with their respective instruction booklets will fit in these cases perfectly, receiving protection from the varied elements that they most certainly deserve. These cases are very well made, durable, aesthetically pleasing, and "factory-fresh" as well. Frankly, I prefer these over the Nintendo originals - I most definitely will be purchasing many more of these. UPDATE: 2+ years later > I now have 44 of these, purchased here as well as eBay, and they are ''holding'' up beautifully! It would have been rather nice though if they were available in a few other colors - oh well ...'),
(N'Sofia', N'Davis', N'sofia.davis6939@example.net', '2014-10-25', 5, N'thanx'),
(N'Karen', N'Perry', N'karen.perry9902@example.com', '2014-10-25', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Olivia', N'Suzuki', N'olivia.suzuki7302@example.net', '2014-10-25', 5, N'Now I am going to say I was going to give it a four stars but I''m using them as I type to listen to music and I realized that the quality of sound is actually pretty good. When I saw them in the box I had initially thought they were made from cheap plastic and maybe they are but when I got them out they seemed really fit and well built and the texture was pleasing. Pros: Great Sound Good Build Pretty comfortable for the most part Cons: The wire seems like it might give out after a while, just my thought from experience with dozens of other headphones and their wires gave out. It is a little stiff but after extending the legs it made for a tighter fit and therefore increasing the directness of the sound.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Hall', N'lauren.hall7951@example.net', '2014-10-26', 3, N'good'),
(N'Noah', N'Perry', N'noah.perry3342@example.com', '2014-10-26', 5, N'Absolutely one of the few real exclusive gems to the original Xbox! This game proved how original Sega could be,Fast paced,amazing soundtrack I went out and bought on CD because of how great it was. This game seriously needs a Sequal and HD remake for Xbox 360 or Xbox One doesn''t matter which it just needs to happen'),
(N'Victoria', N'Henderson', N'victoria.henderson8214@example.org', '2014-10-26', 5, N'Thank you'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Young', N'cheryl.young7586@example.org', '2014-10-26', 5, N'fantastic till the controllers went south.'),
(N'Mark', N'Harris', N'mark.harris9281@example.net', '2014-10-26', 1, N'NOT A SONY FAN. NEW GAME BROKE DOWN IN LESS THAN SIX MONTHS AND THEY WOULDN''T STAND BEHIND IT. BOUGHT THE CONTROLLERS AND NEVER HAD A CHANCE TO USE THEM.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Ivanov', N'carlos.ivanov2184@example.net', '2014-10-26', 1, N'Do not buy this product. They do not fit right and wobble alot. If u thought u had dead zone before these will double it. I even tried glue and putting paper inside the socket to make them fit tight. No dice. Save urself $10'),
(N'Eric', N'Long', N'eric.long6870@example.com', '2014-10-26', 5, N'Outstanding!'),
(N'Paul', N'Chavez', N'paul.chavez5977@example.org', '2014-10-26', 5, N'I like Straight up Adventure Games with no Hidden Object Scenes... However some HOPA Games are AweSome in spite of those scenes and this is one of them.. I will Definitely Play this game over several times Love It!!'),
(N'Anna', N'Suzuki', N'anna.suzuki9529@example.org', '2014-10-27', 4, N'Great device for the PC on other games.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Thomas', N'victoria.thomas4638@example.net', '2014-10-27', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Charles', N'Barnes', N'charles.barnes7895@example.net', '2014-10-27', 5, N'Easily the best sports game my family and I have ever played!'),
(N'Joseph', N'Peterson', N'joseph.peterson8558@example.net', '2014-10-27', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Christina', N'Garcia', N'christina.garcia9399@example.org', '2014-10-27', 3, N'Update: As of this week, I have returned the game back to Amazon. When people describe this game as ''mindless demon killing'', they are right. I thought I would like this game because I have played all previous version of this from console to arcade. The game play is nice and smooth. Graphics are OK, but that''s not a big deal to me. I''m just tired of this kind of story. I want to really think when I''m playing a game, not this stuff. There is nothing gained from me playing this game, only the time I have spent on it...I can never get back. Plus there is no Kinect 2.0 integration whatsoever with this game, which is a shame. The price was nice, but I would recommend waiting until the price drops to at least half.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ferreira', N'ethan.ferreira6878@example.org', '2014-10-27', 5, N'Kick butt game lots of fun.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Khan', N'dennis.khan2489@example.net', '2014-10-27', 4, N'Labyrinth of Lies opens with a scream. Not to give away any surprises, I''ll leave you hanging there and focus on the plot. Nancy has arrived for yet another internship, this time at a museum of ancient culture in Greece. The museum includes a classic amphitheater that''s been revamped for modern use. When I say revamped, I mean extensively revamped as a basement of multiple levels has been built and is currently filled with the sets of the Greek underworld (the labyrinth of the title) as actors practice for the opening night of Persephone in Winter. The museum curator who called for Nancy''s aid has rushed off to deal with a problem at customs, searching for artifacts that have disappeared and leaving Nancy as a liaison to the acting troupe. The police have already come and interviewed all the actors, who are remaining on site for their final dress rehearsal, as well as searching their rooms. And the police found nothing to implicate anyone. And I, as the player, found that in...'),
(N'Carlos', N'Gutierrez', N'carlos.gutierrez7157@example.com', '2014-10-27', 5, N'Great game son loves it'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Webb', N'rebecca.webb8993@example.org', '2014-10-27', 5, N'great game, keeps the kids entertained.'),
(N'Linda', N'Hall', N'linda.hall2119@example.net', '2014-10-27', 5, N'Good buy'),
(N'Sarah', N'Khan', N'sarah.khan4786@example.net', '2014-10-27', 5, N'Great game. Even better with other people. Excellent graphics (for the time), music, and control (after tweaking joystick sensitivity) Many different modes to keep you coming back.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Khan', N'sarah.khan4786@example.net', '2014-10-27', 5, N'Classic game. Controls take some getting used to. While the graphics are clearly dated, they have a certain charm about them. Great replay value, with designing endless new and different roller coasters and theme parks.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Kim', N'timothy.kim8112@example.net', '2014-10-27', 5, N'A stellar game! With all the retro-tracks from the SNES addition onward, this game is a nostalgic delight as well as a beautifully crafted game. The new tracks and mechanics are immensely enjoyable. ...though if you really want to compete, you need to buy a wii gamepad. You don''t need a special Wii U one. The old ones for the Wii work fine. The motion controls are fine for casual play, but really getting the most out of every slide on every corner requires a gamepad.'),
(N'Omar', N'Castillo', N'omar.castillo5077@example.net', '2014-10-28', 5, N'I do love my Mahjong games, would highly recommend this game for yourself or as a gift.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Bailey', N'melissa.bailey3386@example.net', '2014-10-28', 5, N'No issues. Nintendos ability to make add ons and products like these easy and with no issues still continues to amaze me'),
(N'Melissa', N'Bailey', N'melissa.bailey3386@example.net', '2014-10-28', 5, N'So far this is the best 3ds XL grip I have used. Works great for super smash!'),
(N'Omar', N'Raghunathan', N'omar.raghunathan9061@example.org', '2014-10-28', 1, N'I have bought this game at Gamestop and it has been freezing on me. I am not sure if its the game or the console.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Ross', N'joseph.ross5189@example.net', '2014-10-28', 5, N'Best Madden I ever played!'),
(N'Frank', N'White', N'frank.white6677@example.com', '2014-10-28', 3, N'Fair. For me, it got old pretty quickly. Largely a rehash of the original in a different locale. Nice that it has some sections somewhat near coastal water, but you''re blocked from getting too close (unfortunately). And there are significant portions of the map you''re blocked off from that you apparently have access to in the XB1 version. I don''t miss the annoying cut scenes with rivals from the original, but I do miss the attractive female Festival attendees - they''re pretty much completely MIA this time. And instead of Ms. Hart from the original, your race adviser in this sequel is a guy. As before, the towns are largely lifeless ghost towns. The opponent AI is a bit too aggressive for my taste - it often feels more like demolition derby than actual racing (which basically applies to all Forza titles I''ve tried - 3, 4 & FH1). And the traffic is always getting in the way, especially at the most inopportune times. In case anyone from Turn 10 reads these reviews, if there''s going to...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Morgan', N'amanda.morgan6439@example.com', '2014-10-28', 5, N'Get behind the music and take control of the beat and the music itself in this new game. Talk about awesome, I have to say that this game was SO much fun to play and to experience. As someone who is a huge fan of all types of music, this game really takes you behind the music and allows you to be in the driver seat. While the graphics may remind you of of some of the dance games of the past, this game has you become the director and by the end your arms will probably be a bit tired, but the reason is that you are now the conductor and in control, so keep up with the music! I also have to comment and commend the makers on the variety of music selected for this game. There is a bit of everything for any music lover, and I''m sure that as time goes on more music will become available too. If you love music and have always wanted to be in the driver seat to the music that you have heard, strap yourself in and jump on for a fun ride, you will be glad that you did! *I received this for...'),
(N'Brian', N'Ramos', N'brian.ramos2203@example.net', '2014-10-28', 5, N'great'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Kumar', N'jonathan.kumar6767@example.org', '2014-10-28', 5, N'The gameplay can be a little slow (depending on how you play it; I play slow, but once I got used to it, I was dropping traps like BAM!!) A la Rube Goldberg machine-esque fun. This game needs quite a bit of tinkering, trial, error and imagination to pull off some amazing combo traps. The story is quite good and the characters are wacky and funny. Its fun experimenting with the different traps available. I loved the game and character designs. If you like a game where you can set your own pace and love goldberg contraptions (and feel like a general badass) then I recommend you give the game a try!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Fisher', N'ethan.fisher4287@example.net', '2014-10-28', 5, N'well made to say the least,very good price.early shipping,good seller.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Hernandez', N'brenda.hernandez5174@example.net', '2014-10-28', 4, N'I just received this game, I''m not too good on the game thing, but I love trying. I watched it being played by others, so I am sure I will like it.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Turner', N'benjamin.turner9444@example.org', '2014-10-28', 5, N'playing game on max settings. lots of fun.'),
(N'Edward', N'Barnes', N'edward.barnes5466@example.net', '2014-10-28', 4, N'Great prduct, wish it was easier to use the charger it''s self. Don''t like having to angle it into the dock to charge, also wish the light indicator was much more visible For The Charge process.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Russell', N'alexander.russell5421@example.org', '2014-10-28', 4, N'Nice!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Young', N'timothy.young8807@example.org', '2014-10-28', 5, N'Great Game'),
(N'Timothy', N'Young', N'timothy.young8807@example.org', '2014-10-28', 5, N'Works Great'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee6164@example.org', '2014-10-28', 5, N'Simply put this game is amazing. It came very early in the PS3 era which you can tell since it doesn''t have any trophies. The story is very emotional and interesting. The art style fits the game perfectly and the music is great. Its not the easiest game so it can be unforgiving at times but once you get the hang of it, it is a lot of fun and very rewarding, . The game is a Tactical RPG and also a 3rd person shooter, but it has more RPG elements than anything else. When a soldier dies on the battlefield they are gone for the rest of the game which add to the emotional depth each mission has. This is a must have for all PS3 owners'),
(N'Maria', N'Myers', N'maria.myers5469@example.org', '2014-10-28', 5, N'good'),
(N'Matthew', N'Jackson', N'matthew.jackson2253@example.net', '2014-10-28', 5, N'Family time is at an all time high!'),
(N'Amara', N'Wright', N'amara.wright7917@example.org', '2014-10-29', 4, N'ill be back for more.. but didn''t come with a box.. but still works good.. back to playing LOZ'),
(N'Justin', N'Ramirez', N'justin.ramirez9553@example.com', '2014-10-29', 5, N'Still working.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Kelly', N'brandon.kelly8911@example.com', '2014-10-29', 2, N'not compatible with all driving games'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Sanchez', N'nicholas.sanchez5992@example.com', '2014-10-29', 5, N'Reliable device'),
(N'Jerry', N'Torres', N'jerry.torres4008@example.net', '2014-10-29', 4, N'Pretty fun if it''s with friends and has good replay value.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Okonkwo', N'amanda.okonkwo1144@example.org', '2014-10-30', 5, N'One of the best mouses I have ever used. I have the naga 2014 and now this one just makes it even better with the wireless advantage. Charge and play feature. This was definitely made for gamers by gamers. If your a true gamer then you know how you would want your mouse to be.'),
(N'Scott', N'Hall', N'scott.hall3487@example.net', '2014-10-30', 5, N'Daughter loves it. Long cable. Sounds great, looks great. Done.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Tanaka', N'nadia.tanaka4969@example.net', '2014-10-30', 5, N'Bought as gift for a young teen. They thought the game was a good buy!'),
(N'Ivan', N'Jackson', N'ivan.jackson2663@example.org', '2014-10-30', 5, N'Resident Evil 5 - Playstation 3 ; item comes as descriebd'),
(N'Peter', N'Nguyen', N'peter.nguyen7461@example.net', '2014-10-30', 4, N'Installing these can be a little time consuming and delicate work however the feeling is good once used. They feel original and perform better with out the fabric the OEM ones had. I give it four stars because the installation is rather delicate. I''d recommend taking it slow, on a nice big table to avoid losing pieces or buttons that may or may not pop out. Youll have to remove the board inside to access the buttons but don''t disconnect the wire if you don''t have to. Also don''t be afraid to use some strength to open up the controller and closing it up, don''t be afraid of popping noises when disassembling and reassembling taking care not to get buttons or wires caught in the closing.'),
(N'Noah', N'Morales', N'noah.morales5016@example.com', '2014-10-30', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Flores', N'rebecca.flores3779@example.com', '2014-10-30', 5, N'bought this for my current boyfriend at the time and although i hope he trips over this item and dies the items awesome so i give 5 stars'),
(N'Jack', N'Barnes', N'jack.barnes9124@example.org', '2014-10-30', 5, N'While I did struggle with this game for a time, I look back at it and I feel this is a great game. It has a very creative plot line, great visuals, levels that challenge you differently in terms of navigation and enemy situation. The useage of different character strengths was very creative (though I feel patrick is useless), the boss battles while tough at first were good and the useage of slide portions brillent. I also love how the game collected some of the humor the show has (although some of it is lost due to the tone of the game). I could go on but the others i think have covered this. As for problems, any I had have faded away minus finding all of Patricks socks still being hard and I wish the game did have a real ending instead of having 100% and that''s it.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Hall', N'jennifer.hall7371@example.org', '2014-10-30', 5, N'I had played all series of ths game and I do not like lose this last game'),
(N'Christine', N'Ward', N'christine.ward9373@example.net', '2014-10-30', 5, N'TX'),
(N'Steven', N'Gomez', N'steven.gomez4475@example.net', '2014-10-31', 1, N'If I could give this game zero stars I would, I implore anyone thinking about wasting money on this incomplete garbage to think otherwise. There are much better games coming out don''t reward EA and add to your frustration by purchasing this heap. Missing features, Cheap AI, bugs. Honestly this game is not worth the asking price. It wouldn''t be worth it if it was free. Please don''t buy this game.'),
(N'Steven', N'Okonkwo', N'steven.okonkwo5676@example.net', '2014-10-31', 5, N'as described'),
(N'Linda', N'Baker', N'linda.baker7014@example.net', '2014-10-31', 4, N'I LIKE IT'),
(N'Daniel', N'Murphy', N'daniel.murphy5739@example.net', '2014-10-31', 5, N'How much more can I say about a dust cover? =)'),
(N'Deborah', N'Scott', N'deborah.scott5021@example.org', '2014-10-31', 2, N'NOTE: We did like this while it lasted, but it didn''t last very long. _________ This takes some getting used to. The mapping isn''t the same as what you might be used to if, like this family, you are a big fan of the original gamecube controllers. The controller is also slightly bulkier than the gamecube controller. However, this has zero latency and works great. Even though it''s a little bit bigger than what my son and I are used to, we both thought it was very ergonomic. Also, having it plug into the wiimote, instead of the console, makes it a lot easier to use (again, NO latency - this is amazing). The button layout may not be what you are accustomed to with brawl-type games, where your combinations happen quickly, but my son and I traded back and forth with this on a couple of platformers and cruised along just fine.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Hughes', N'lisa.hughes5599@example.org', '2014-10-31', 5, N'Love this. My other was stolen. Great price & super fast shipping. Would buy again. Highly recommend.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Ferreira', N'mateo.ferreira4278@example.com', '2014-10-31', 5, N'Nice Game'),
(N'Walter', N'Carter', N'walter.carter7594@example.com', '2014-10-31', 5, N'Awesome series.'),
(N'Edward', N'Parker', N'edward.parker7578@example.net', '2014-10-31', 5, N'nice game'),
(N'Mark', N'King', N'mark.king9771@example.org', '2014-10-31', 5, N'very good product'),
(N'Charles', N'Jackson', N'charles.jackson4376@example.net', '2014-10-31', 4, N'MADDEN IS TO FOOTBALL WHAT AN ANT IS TO MAKING A HILL'),
(N'Jose', N'White', N'jose.white9444@example.org', '2014-10-31', 5, N'GRANDKIS LOVE THIS'),
(N'Judith', N'Morgan', N'judith.morgan8859@example.com', '2014-10-31', 4, N'My five year old LOVES the figurines! The game is fun enough to me, but only engaged him for a short time... I think he may grow into it. One the other hand, he slept with Thor in the bed. [Update Mar 2015] He grew into it. Oh wow, did he grow into it! This game is ADDICTIVE, sort of like mine craft. If I can impose time limits (and I''m a bit miffed that Disney isn''t providing more help with that one), there seems to actually be some educational parts of this: there are some challenges where he basically has to program. It''s not "code" per se, but the logic has a programming feel to it: there are certain objects, like buttons, that have actions (methods) like stepping on or stepping off, and those actions can trigger something else to happen to another object (like a door unlocks). I haven''t seen any for loops or if-then statements, but I won''t be surprised when I do!'),
(N'Emma', N'Jimenez', N'emma.jimenez4265@example.net', '2014-10-31', 1, N'Does not work with Linux without serious advanced ability to compile drivers. Get the other one, not this one.'),
(N'Diane', N'Cooper', N'diane.cooper5471@example.net', '2014-11-01', 1, N'*Warning* Buyer beware. After reading the other reviews I thought I''d try this out. Mine was defective right out of the box. After charging it for 5 hours none of the player lights on the bottom would light up and it would not sync with my wiiu. This is the first time I''ve ever had to return something to Amazon. I ended up buying the USA version at a Gamestop and it works beautifully.'),
(N'John', N'Anderson', N'john.anderson4718@example.org', '2014-11-01', 5, N'ok'),
(N'James', N'Taylor', N'james.taylor2102@example.com', '2014-11-01', 5, N'Coin and exclusive item. Worked just fine. Submit a ticket if your vanity pet doesn''t show up. It was instant for my wife, but took me an extra day for it to show in my mail.'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez8906@example.org', '2014-11-01', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Joshua', N'Nguyen', N'joshua.nguyen2435@example.net', '2014-11-01', 5, N'Such a solid controller. Only design nitpick is not having concave Y & X buttons but an absolutely top-notch controller for what it is.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Miller', N'deborah.miller2723@example.net', '2014-11-01', 4, N'It''s okay'),
(N'Dee', N'Rodriguez', N'dee.rodriguez7311@example.org', '2014-11-01', 1, N'In all honesty, I really wanted to like this controller. I read between the five and one star reviews, hoped that some of these one star reviews were just doing it wrong, I''ve bought plenty of Nyko gear before so why would they be bad now? For those that don''t want to read a wall of text I''ll say this; that $20 I spent on this, well, I could have bought a relatively nice dinner for myself with it. I could have rented some movies. I could have put it in my savings account. I could have flushed it down the toilet! These would have been better options for my money than having this shipped to my house. If I could, I''d give this a zero star review. This controller charges through micro USB, which is nice in our world of smart phones setting this standard. The "charger" that comes with this is a joke. If you still do not heed the warnings of all these reviews and buy this controller, get yourself a longer charging cable, or else you''ll be stuck with a turd. What am I saying though, you...'),
(N'Heather', N'Murphy', N'heather.murphy8402@example.org', '2014-11-01', 5, N'Perfect fit best product have tried others this is best thank you'),
(N'Pamela', N'Ortiz', N'pamela.ortiz1285@example.org', '2014-11-02', 3, N'Ok game'),
(N'Pamela', N'Ortiz', N'pamela.ortiz1285@example.org', '2014-11-02', 5, N'Good game play!!!'),
(N'Steven', N'Lee', N'steven.lee7313@example.org', '2014-11-02', 3, N'Fun game however its not GTA. If you like open world sandy box type games, pick this one up when it goes on sale.'),
(N'John', N'Ward', N'john.ward2525@example.com', '2014-11-02', 3, N'You will like it when you start, but after some time ...... It''s really boring game'),
(N'Thomas', N'Wood', N'thomas.wood1134@example.com', '2014-11-02', 5, N'This game is awesome, i play all the time i can and with friend is much better. Have a lot of content and a lot of game modes.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Mitchell', N'hiroshi.mitchell1350@example.net', '2014-11-02', 5, N'Got the game sooner than I thought and it worked great. Perfect to extend Gamerscore.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Kumar', N'hiroshi.kumar2059@example.com', '2014-11-03', 4, N'My son likes it, the graphics are advance and the challenges or levels are exciting. Good game.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Chen', N'olivia.chen5949@example.com', '2014-11-03', 5, N'Best product I have bought since PS3. I can''t get enough of Destiny and the Glacier White is sexy!!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Morgan', N'andrew.morgan2163@example.org', '2014-11-03', 1, N'Well, this sure is a disappointing game. A few stupid and unneeded gameplay tweaks. Fewer wrestlers. Fewer options. No custom music. Graphics are the same as WWE2K14. And, of course, the offensively obligatory DLC you have to pay for (if you are a hardcore WWE fan) that should have been in the game from the get go. AVOID AT ALL COSTS. Buy WWE2K14. It is certainly the BEST game in this series to date. Yes, the moves are bit too fast, but the gameplay is solid, the ref does not get in the way, the targeting system is good, and the roster is INCREDIBLE! Andre, Hulk, Bundy, Studd, Big Poppa Pump, Randy Savage, Steamboat, Jake the Snake, Mr. Perfect. Compare it to THIS stink-fest game and you''ll quickly realize how lazy WWE2K15''s game-makers are. Come on! 2K, what the heck!?! In WWE2K15 you have NOTHING to brag about. NOTHING. At LEAST they should have created an awe-inspiring line-up of wrestlers from the very start of WWF to WWE today, but . . . no. They just recreated last year''s...'),
(N'Nancy', N'Gomez', N'nancy.gomez2923@example.org', '2014-11-03', 4, N'We''ve played all the other Just Dance games, so we had to get this one! PROS: -Amazing music! It seriously has some of the best music I''ve seen on any of the just dance games! -Great reactions. The game reacts very well to the wiimote. -Background stuff. Having things in the background definitely takes a whole new dimension to the game! -Online play - being able to play someone online is really fun and makes it fun even if you''re just playing by yourself! CONS: -Difficult interface. We spent 15 VERY frustrating minutes trying to figure out how to make a new dancer card! For those who want to know, here''s how: NEW DANCER CARD: Go to YOUR dancer card. At the bottom you''ll find "local dancers". CLICK THAT and you can finally create a new dancer! VERDICT: Just Dance 2015 is definitely a good addition to the whole series and we''re very glad we got it!'),
(N'Peter', N'Richardson', N'peter.richardson3938@example.com', '2014-11-03', 5, N'Great replacement for oem equipment.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Lewis', N'hannah.lewis9471@example.org', '2014-11-03', 1, N'Did make it, but no sound! Wasn''t worth the wait!!! Want something to make up for it!!!'),
(N'Amara', N'Ramos', N'amara.ramos5917@example.org', '2014-11-03', 5, N'no problems'),
(N'Charles', N'Edwards', N'charles.edwards1280@example.org', '2014-11-03', 4, N'thanks great product'),
(N'Daniel', N'Sanchez', N'daniel.sanchez5691@example.com', '2014-11-03', 4, N'Nice Product & good price !!!!!!'),
(N'Megan', N'Lewis', N'megan.lewis5710@example.net', '2014-11-03', 5, N'good game and good buy'),
(N'Jose', N'Butler', N'jose.butler9115@example.org', '2014-11-03', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Emily', N'Reed', N'emily.reed5670@example.com', '2014-11-03', 5, N'good'),
(N'Omar', N'Campbell', N'omar.campbell6675@example.org', '2014-11-03', 2, N'Because of all the other good reviews on this site I decided to buy this headset. Unfortunately, it wasn''t as good as everyone else was saying. The sound quality is good and its nice that it works for all the consoles (except next gen). There was one problem though, and it''s arguably the most important. It was very uncomfortable to wear. It''s not adjustable, so the plastic part is really tight. This eventually loosens up but that wasn''t my main complaint. The cushions are soft for sure, but they aren''t think or firm enough to stop the speakers from pressing against the cartilage of my ear. It hurts really bad. I later realized that I could twist the speakers around, and turning them 180 degress mitiagated the problem but its still a minor problem and I can''t wear the headset for too long. Usually like 2 hours max and it gets too bothersome. This headset would have been perfect if not for that one problem. I don''t know if I''m the only one who experienced that problem since I didn''t...'),
(N'Frank', N'Garcia', N'frank.garcia9804@example.com', '2014-11-03', 5, N'kids loved it!!'),
(N'Frank', N'Garcia', N'frank.garcia9804@example.com', '2014-11-03', 4, N'fun for a group'),
(N'Judith', N'Foster', N'judith.foster4063@example.com', '2014-11-03', 5, N'It was exactly what I wanted i recommended that you buy it');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Luis', N'Young', N'luis.young3033@example.com', '2014-11-04', 5, N'Very fun game. Suprised for the 9.99 price tag. Worth a spin!'),
(N'Angela', N'Clark', N'angela.clark4096@example.com', '2014-11-04', 4, N'Even though it''s hard, the game gives power ups like extra life and continuous, once u stack up enough, the game can be beaten. The game it''s fun to play, not to bad graphics, just like the old versions. It''s tricky to adjust the calibration, like other people said, adjust it from far then play near.'),
(N'Gary', N'King', N'gary.king1934@example.com', '2014-11-04', 5, N'great game!'),
(N'Judith', N'Kowalski', N'judith.kowalski6928@example.com', '2014-11-04', 4, N'What can I say ? Its Lucas arts and a Jedi game at that! My son loves it! The good guys against the bad. A no brainer--loads of fun. And it teaches the child what choices to make that effect the outcome of good against evil.'),
(N'George', N'Lewis', N'george.lewis5246@example.net', '2014-11-04', 5, N'great screen protector'),
(N'Diane', N'Stewart', N'diane.stewart4054@example.net', '2014-11-04', 1, N'State upfront I am not done....but what I have played, the save points, what I have had to repeat because of where those save points are....wouldn''t have bought this piece o sht. From Black Ops 2 I have regretted this franchise.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Miller', N'samuel.miller1792@example.com', '2014-11-04', 5, N'excellent price, prodict and service'),
(N'Richard', N'Kumar', N'richard.kumar2121@example.net', '2014-11-04', 5, N'fun game!'),
(N'Luis', N'Jones', N'luis.jones6083@example.org', '2014-11-05', 4, N'Not the best first person shooter game that I have played, but it''s good enough. Because it''s PS3, there is a lot more detail and much better sound. The main reason that I bought this game is because of the absolute lack of WWII Pacific games. Other then that, not much different from any other fps game.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Fisher', N'amanda.fisher4780@example.org', '2014-11-05', 5, N'grandson loves this.'),
(N'Peter', N'Coleman', N'peter.coleman4693@example.net', '2014-11-05', 5, N'Its not for me, but the boys and if you have a player at home you know it is a have to get items to keep them out of trouble!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Lopez', N'ethan.lopez3793@example.com', '2014-11-05', 5, N'A+++'),
(N'William', N'Raghunathan', N'william.raghunathan3046@example.net', '2014-11-05', 3, N'It looks and feels like Black Ops 2 except with a double jump and dash. Guns are about the same. Kill streaks and perks are about the same. The different things I noticed was..... You will die more from behind, above and to the side. (because of the double jump) The maps are small and have two or three stories(aka roofs) that you can jump up above the ground level to kill people. The gameplay is faster and less teamwork heavy (because of the map designs and double jump.) Autoaim is stronger than previous CODs. Rifles dominate the map. Graphics are nothing special. Lag is about the same as Black Ops 2 You will like this Game IF you liked Black Ops 2 and your not a camper. you like fast paced arcade shooting games. your first COD was Black Ops 2 or Ghosts. You will Not like this Game IF you hated BO2, MW3 and Ghosts. you like to camp and slowly clear rooms. you want this to be a realistic war simulation. you plan on playing competitively or in a team using tactics.'),
(N'Michael', N'Fisher', N'michael.fisher9279@example.org', '2014-11-05', 5, N'I enjoy not being tangled up in wires I also enjoy being able to have a headset that it is lightweight and that is easy to use. Being able to control the chat and game volume on one side and then being able to control presets on the other. Oh and it has an internal battery that can be recharged... With this purchase I am updating from my old headset that I used for the PS3 and Xbox 360 my Px5 Turtle Beach Headset.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Gonzalez', N'yuki.gonzalez5767@example.net', '2014-11-05', 5, N'This is good controller holeder it helps you not to drop the controller or get your hands swety its well made one thing I can say is that I wish thumb stick area was little shorter'),
(N'Yuki', N'Gonzalez', N'yuki.gonzalez5767@example.net', '2014-11-05', 5, N'This is a very good product it wooked I wish I could still u but my 3dsxl broke 2 month it worked very well'),
(N'Jacob', N'Singh', N'jacob.singh8247@example.org', '2014-11-05', 1, N'Ugh, this is an ugly game with very poor controls and mechanics. It is not Harvest Moon. If I wanted to spend hours and hours messing with blocks of land I would play Minecraft. I am so disappointed and will be returning this game. I will carry on enjoying Fantasy Life until Story of Seasons comes out.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Powell', N'hiroshi.powell8918@example.net', '2014-11-06', 5, N'I will start out by saying this along with hctp were both bought after I played svr 2008. I bought this just to have every svr even though it doesn''t have the roster from hctp it did overall improve the game wether its graphics gameplay or animations I still had a lot of fun I completed season mode. The people who talk bad about this game is because of the roster so now this completes my collection I own every wwe game from hctp to wwe 2k14 now all I need is 2k15 which I''ll get in a couple of weeks. This game is defenitely good get it if you still have a ps2 this game has commentary not like its predecessor hctp and also wrestler introductions so yeah highly recommended.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Scott', N'rebecca.scott9409@example.com', '2014-11-06', 5, N'Custom designed to fit each console, Protect your console from dust, UV, liquids (repellent) and dirt. Back panel cutaway allows for protection without having to remove back cables (console must be powered off before placing cover). Proudly designed and manufactured in the U.S.A. This fits stuggly and works great on my PS4, love it, well worth the money.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Cooper', N'kofi.cooper9718@example.net', '2014-11-06', 5, N'Pros No lag all dedicated servers Gameplay 64 man servers are console is AWESOME! Very solid game Cons None Just got COD Advanced warfare and it is pitiful compared to BF4. This right now is the #1 FPS game for PS4.'),
(N'Walter', N'Ramirez', N'walter.ramirez5434@example.net', '2014-11-06', 5, N'works perfectly'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Chavez', N'jonathan.chavez5892@example.net', '2014-11-06', 5, N'I"m actually saving this for my daughter for Christmas. Haven''t opened it yet. However, we rented Animal Crossing for the 3DS several times from the video store and all three of my kids just love this game. I like that they have to "work/go fishing" on the game to earn "money" to then pay for their house and outfits and other items they want to decorate their room. Good lesson to learn at ages 6, 9 and 10. I personally only played the Wii version of this game for a few minutes, but I can see the kid appeal. Cute for kids. Creative.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Reed', N'christopher.reed2641@example.org', '2014-11-06', 5, N'Grand kids love this game and play it when they stay over.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Ferreira', N'kofi.ferreira1944@example.net', '2014-11-06', 5, N'The Season Pass Voucher worked fine for me Best deal ever! You other guys must have gotten Vouchers that had been used via Key Generator! I have seen this happen before! Don''t let these two discourage you from buying this 2 disc set its all around an incredible series I hope they finish it!!!'),
(N'Julie', N'Nowak', N'julie.nowak2919@example.org', '2014-11-06', 5, N'First off let me start by saying that my intention of buying the Playstation TV was for the Remote Play feature. I didn''t want to to buy another Playstation 4 to use at my girlfriend''s house. Instead I bought this to use Remote Play to control and play my PS4 from her house. Using a wire it is awesome!! Wireless don''t try it. I was playing Call Of Duty Advanced Warfare away from home without having to bring my whole Playstation 4!! This has save me over $400 dollars of having to buy another system. You can have your PS4 in rest mode and it will still link to your Playstation 4. Just go to settings and power save settings and change what the PS4 can do while its sleeping. I repeat you do not have to be on the same network to control and play with your Playstation 4!!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Lewis', N'stephen.lewis6876@example.net', '2014-11-06', 4, N'I really like this bundle. The White XBox looks great. It would be nice if this included the actual game, instead of the token, since the hard drive isn''t all that big, but I still love it. The game is a lot of fun. Is it the most challenging? No, but it is fun. Lots of colors and noises and explosions - big fun.'),
(N'Amy', N'Jackson', N'amy.jackson3785@example.org', '2014-11-06', 5, N'It''s good quality works great and shipping is quick! :)'),
(N'Brenda', N'James', N'brenda.james2141@example.com', '2014-11-07', 5, N'Great...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Foster', N'aaron.foster1649@example.net', '2014-11-07', 5, N'played perfect, thank you'),
(N'Douglas', N'Reed', N'douglas.reed9144@example.net', '2014-11-07', 1, N'This game was a complete disaster. There is nothing about this game I liked. Yes, it''s a Minecraft clone, but it''s not a very good one. The graphics are ugly. The controls are utterly complicated. The game prides itself on the fact you don''t have to equip an item. It''s all context driven. The problem is when I go to water my crops the only option I''m given is to fertilize them. I can''t even figure out how to build anything, and can''t find a single answer online since the game is so new. Is it that the game is slow? Maybe. I don''t know, but I''ve been playing it for hours and haven''t been able to change things or make progress. Normally "it sucks" is what people say when they really mean "I suck." I get me saying that I can''t figure out how the game works would make it sound like I''m mad at it because I suck, and I''m sure people who figured it out are probably going to rate this review down. The real problem with it is that there''s a complete lack of explanation within the game or...'),
(N'Judith', N'Rogers', N'judith.rogers3028@example.org', '2014-11-07', 5, N'enjoyed playing these games, have not played all yet.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Singh', N'lucia.singh4532@example.net', '2014-11-07', 4, N'If you like trains and the strategy of building a railroad, where to run the tracks, what businesses are best for that part of the country etc, this game is pretty cool. It''s a nice change from other genres when you need a break. Like in my case, shooters.'),
(N'Diane', N'Jackson', N'diane.jackson5107@example.net', '2014-11-07', 5, N'I was a fan of the original game and wanted even more and am blown away Platinum, Sega and Nintendo worked together to get this game released. I enjoyed the post game content and playing more to unlock more costumes and weapons etc. Nice to see a game that still has a ton of unlockables instead of just releasing DLC. The online challenges are fun and were a nice addition I didn''t know about until I had the game. Packaging a port of the first game is awesome and makes the game really welcoming to new players and Nintendo fans. Anyone that''s familiar with Bayonetta I definitely recommend playing on the hardest difficulty from the start.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Long', N'rebecca.long7477@example.com', '2014-11-07', 5, N'This is a S-Video cable for Pre-Wii Nintendo systems, PlayStations, and the original Xbox. If you''re looking for a reliable cable for your Sony Trinitron or machine that accepts S-Video inputs, go for this. Forget buying knockoffs that only give you headaches.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Martinez', N'kenneth.martinez8575@example.org', '2014-11-07', 5, N'nothing to say ... its perfect'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Young', N'hiroshi.young4157@example.net', '2014-11-07', 5, N'"You''re a Pomeranian living in a post-nuclear Japan. All humans are eradicated, and you have to fight against deer, crocodiles, lions, and cheetahs!" My first response to this was, "A Pomeranian against a lion? You''re kidding, right? That sounds like the stupidest game ever. How on earth could that be fun?" I don''t know how they did it, but they made that concept into the greatest game. I can play this for hours without getting bored. You can play as several different kinds of animals; from Pomeranians to bears, goats to giraffes, Akitas to zebras. Each time you complete the main mission on one animal, it opens a new animal, making the replayability of this game almost everlasting. The longest I''ve managed to live out my generations so far is 76 years. I think it was on the Beagle. The only negative I have is that I wish it had more diverse music, rather than the two or three tracks that it has. After a couple hours it starts to drone on and I end up needing to take a break - if it...'),
(N'Steven', N'Brown', N'steven.brown8544@example.net', '2014-11-07', 5, N'Great game to pass time and don''t get to upset if you die or have to fix something be cuz of a creep'),
(N'Zachary', N'Peterson', N'zachary.peterson7744@example.com', '2014-11-07', 4, N'Works great for the price. It''s coming loose after some wear, but you pay for what you get.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Turner', N'christopher.turner3584@example.com', '2014-11-07', 1, N'**I got this game nov 3 and its now nov 7 and I''m completely bored in it. Most weapons suck. Scorestreaks suck. No reply theater to show off to your friends and people online. No multiplayer achievements. Menu system looks dated and ugly. Graphic engine is dated and ugly. Guns sound like crap. Pointless campaign. Make it co-op or don''t make it at all. Exo survival is about the most fun thing here but even that gets old after awhile. Don''t waste your parent''s money. They work hard for it. Do them a favor and get it used.'),
(N'Noah', N'Jones', N'noah.jones5806@example.net', '2014-11-07', 5, N'Ok.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Price', N'thomas.price8230@example.net', '2014-11-07', 5, N'Can chop peoples arms and legs off with a sword 9/10!'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2014-11-08', 5, N'Battle Mode is weird and not fun like the other games in the series, but the rest of the game is remarkable.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Morales', N'olivia.morales8418@example.org', '2014-11-08', 5, N'I really like games that make you think fast of what you''re going to have to do to survive to get to the next level. I have other games but they don''t give you the challenge and that''s what makes the game exciting to play. The graphics in this game are fantastic and the movement of the characters are amazing. You have that realization that this is a great game to play and you have to survive in order to keep playing. Each level gets a little more intense which makes you ready and you are more alert for what ever comes your way in this game.'),
(N'Edward', N'Jenkins', N'edward.jenkins1628@example.net', '2014-11-08', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Janet', N'Rivera', N'janet.rivera3681@example.com', '2014-11-08', 2, N'This is very poorly made. It does the job for a while, but eventually peters out well before what you might expect.'),
(N'George', N'Stewart', N'george.stewart8721@example.net', '2014-11-08', 5, N'As of now, I am still unable to use this headset because I cannot, so far, get the Corsair program to install on my Windows XP computer. I have searched the box the headset came in and no where on it does it give any systems operating requirements. I have tried installing it via my WinRar program and though I get the black Corsair icon, when I click on it absolutely nothing happens. I have uninstalled and reinstalled it two times and am now downloading another compression program from FileHippo. I will update this review when I have determined that I can or cannot use them. As far as the headset itself, it is a bit large for my head even when adjusted to the smallest setting. I am female and they are not as secure as other gaming headsets that I have used. These are better for people with larger sized heads. The earcups are soft and the seem to be well constructed. I re-downloaded the Corsair program again and installed it via WinZip. I have the icon in my tray, but it will not...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Ramirez', N'nathan.ramirez6792@example.com', '2014-11-08', 5, N'Excellent product'),
(N'Anita', N'Gomez', N'anita.gomez6692@example.net', '2014-11-08', 5, N'Nice cam'),
(N'Karen', N'Kumar', N'karen.kumar1109@example.org', '2014-11-08', 5, N'Grandson loves it!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Garcia', N'samuel.garcia5421@example.com', '2014-11-08', 5, N'Was a gift for a friend, friend was happy, great purchase all in all!'),
(N'Robert', N'Martin', N'robert.martin9201@example.net', '2014-11-08', 5, N'Awesome.'),
(N'Priya', N'Patel', N'priya.patel4468@example.org', '2014-11-08', 4, N'It''s a little aged, but this game is great when it comes to thinking on your feet'),
(N'Jose', N'Brown', N'jose.brown8464@example.com', '2014-11-08', 4, N'Fun game'),
(N'Jose', N'Brown', N'jose.brown8464@example.com', '2014-11-08', 4, N'Fun games'),
(N'Robert', N'Cox', N'robert.cox8464@example.net', '2014-11-08', 5, N'Haven''t yet got,to play it but looks amazing'),
(N'Daniel', N'Kumar', N'daniel.kumar7072@example.com', '2014-11-09', 2, N'This COD has awesome graphics and one of the best campaigns I''ve played in a COD in the past few years. Nonetheless, I buy COD for the multiplayer and the multiplayer is rather bad. Everyone who is doing well appears to be using modified controllers or otherwise cheating with their system (aim bots primarily.) Also, there is massive lag compensation, so if you have decent internet, prepare to be penalized. I often put 20+ bullets into an enemy and they kill me with one shot. When I switched to my crappiest internet, I actually started doing better! How on earth does that make sense as a game feature... I mean, I didn''t get better at the game, or worse, I just switched my internet to a worse one and somehow lag compensation is now on my side. Thats just stupid. For those of you who don''t know, lag compensation saps bandwidth from people with good connections and gives it to those who have worse connections. That said, the hit recognition is horrible, everyone I talk to says they put...'),
(N'Nadia', N'Morales', N'nadia.morales2386@example.com', '2014-11-09', 5, N'Son loves it, Good value'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ward', N'dennis.ward2415@example.org', '2014-11-09', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Gary', N'Kumar', N'gary.kumar9434@example.com', '2014-11-09', 4, N'Love this game its very fun to play.'),
(N'Gary', N'Kumar', N'gary.kumar9434@example.com', '2014-11-09', 5, N'Way cool game. Loved playing it. It makes a great addition to any kingdom hearts fans collection.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Lee', N'aisha.lee2797@example.net', '2014-11-09', 1, N'Save yourself some money and just buy the Vita. The PS Vita is an amazing handheld console no doubt about that and I have noting negative to say about the Vita itself. The reason i''m giving this one star is because of the game, Borderlands 2 is so broken on the Vita it''s almost unplayable. The only good control settings are for left handed players so if your right handed be prepared to throw grenades when you don''t mean to by accidentally tapping the screen with your thumb or accidentally using your ability. Also frame rate is a massive problem during boss fights. Again, good system just a crappy bundle.'),
(N'Steven', N'Morales', N'steven.morales9202@example.com', '2014-11-09', 3, N'I didn''t like this much, it''s very hard to draw a good picture. the gameplay is ok, not anything special. just doesn''t really hold your attention.'),
(N'Peter', N'Edwards', N'peter.edwards4787@example.net', '2014-11-09', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Lewis', N'kimberly.lewis6321@example.com', '2014-11-09', 1, N'Absolute garbage.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Green', N'rachel.green1086@example.com', '2014-11-09', 4, N'This game is a fun game that takes me back to my childhood. I sold it once as a kid, but I had to get it back.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Carter', N'shirley.carter5535@example.org', '2014-11-09', 5, N'Totally love this wheel I play with need for speed.'),
(N'William', N'Powell', N'william.powell3785@example.org', '2014-11-09', 5, N'great'),
(N'Donna', N'Thompson', N'donna.thompson3845@example.net', '2014-11-09', 5, N'Very good game with the usual awesome music!'),
(N'Omar', N'Adams', N'omar.adams2466@example.net', '2014-11-09', 1, N'Don''t buy this scam they locked out dual core CPU despite the fact that the hacked version of advanced warfare which ignores the CPU error actually runs the game just fine. They scammed users with this, making them think they need a quad core. The quad core requirements is marking only, as to look like AW is somehow next gen and high tech when its same old COD Engine.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ortiz', N'sarah.ortiz4962@example.com', '2014-11-10', 5, N'Works'),
(N'Jack', N'Walker', N'jack.walker1008@example.net', '2014-11-10', 2, N'Get out the bug spray'),
(N'Christine', N'Alvarez', N'christine.alvarez2164@example.org', '2014-11-10', 5, N'Great sound and versatility! You can use these noise-reducing headphones not only for gaming, but for phone calls at home (not driving--that wouldn''t be safe), or listening to music. Adding the wireless feature, you can use it for the computer and watch movies or listen to music without having to be connected to your desk. The sound isn''t the very best, but for the price, it truly is excellent. The volume can go high without distorting, the bass is very strong, and while the treble is a tiny bit tinny, the overall sound quality has detail and strength. I love these headphones!'),
(N'Henry', N'Rodriguez', N'henry.rodriguez6316@example.com', '2014-11-10', 5, N'I remembered these cases because my copy of max Payne came in one. So i decided to order them for my gameboy advanced games. Now people say that they have trouble opening them well i don''t so if you want to protect your gameboy advanced games well then you should get these.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Wang', N'jerry.wang3228@example.net', '2014-11-10', 5, N'good way to exercise!'),
(N'Emily', N'Brown', N'emily.brown1792@example.org', '2014-11-10', 1, N'[EDIT 6/26/2018] My wife got me one of these shortly after my last one (#4) died. That was in March. It''s now June, and it went out because the button (the left click button of all things) went south on me at a very bad time. Had my wife not gotten this for me, I''d have been using something else. I only used it because it''s a PITA to re-program a new one, but no more. Never again. Even free, (at least for me), it''s not going to be replaced. For everyone else, go ahead and read the rest of the review and decide, but if you want the TL;DR version here, avoid this. It''s great while it lasts, but it has absolutely no durability, and unless they''re under ten bucks each, they''re absolutely not worth the investment. I''ve got other gaming mice earmarked to try when (I knew not "if") it died. The only surprising thing was that the memory wasn''t what died. The buttons went kaput. That''s a first, and frankly, it''s the last time I''m ever going to deal with it. I just wanted to make sure folks...'),
(N'Andrea', N'Walker', N'andrea.walker8063@example.net', '2014-11-10', 3, N'Campaign is fun...multiplayer maps don''t give us anything but futuristic, busy, overly complex landscapes...total spray-fest, not a lot of skill required...how about a nice simple update to Nuketown...something retro? Keep at least SOME of the maps simple!'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Johnson', N'jonathan.johnson2907@example.com', '2014-11-10', 5, N'This game it pretty interesting but I recommend to buy the first game so you could understand this game (ties that blind) I like both and they are awesome and interesting'),
(N'Andrew', N'James', N'andrew.james8201@example.com', '2014-11-10', 5, N'Excelent seller and product'),
(N'David', N'Ferreira', N'david.ferreira3290@example.com', '2014-11-10', 5, N'VERY GOOD!'),
(N'Henry', N'Brown', N'henry.brown2779@example.net', '2014-11-10', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Luis', N'Thompson', N'luis.thompson8966@example.com', '2014-11-10', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Carol', N'James', N'carol.james4118@example.com', '2014-11-10', 4, N'NOT GREAT'),
(N'Dee', N'Foster', N'dee.foster3418@example.org', '2014-11-10', 4, N'Fun game, its spider man 2 with a face lift and a faster fighting mechanic. graphics look good for what they are, marvel characters all look like they should. true to their comic book looks voice acting is very mixed bag mostly average, only 2 person i recognized is wolverines voice actor and moon knights, everyone else sounds generic and trying too hard to be cool sorta thing, spidey sounds aweful, i''m sorry but its the worst voice in the entire game, very whiny and too young. Biggest issue is that the game is not polished, lots of screen tearing and lots of frame rate issues, i get a steady frame rate most of the time but the frame stutters are very intrusive. if you can handle bad framerate n stuttering, especially textures on walls going black and flickering then you''ll still have fun, just ignore the technical stuff. this is a lot better then the movie tie in stuff nowadays'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Murphy', N'tomasz.murphy2098@example.org', '2014-11-11', 4, N'There is nothing wrong with the game , graphics or storyline. Problem is minimum requirements and frame rates designed for superb pc not for all pc''s. I''ve i7 2600k ,8gb ram,r9 270x oc edition,750 watt 80 plus bronze psu. Which is very powerful system in my opinion but not enough for this game I''m playing 1280x720 60 fps ! When I try with 1920x1080 it is getting slow ! It''s a shame of ubisoft otherwise game is good maybe the best storyline.'),
(N'Megan', N'Kelly', N'megan.kelly8697@example.org', '2014-11-11', 1, N'This game is different from all the other Call of Duties. The graphics can be better and I just hate the gameplay on the multiplayer. This game let me down and that''s why I give it a 1 star rating.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Diaz', N'tomasz.diaz6073@example.net', '2014-11-11', 3, N'Sound: 5 Stars Comfort: 4 Stars Setup: 2 Stars Reliability: 1 Star Versatility: 1 Star Instructions: 1 Star The first thing you ''ll notice upon unboxing this headset is the weight. It feels substantial. It also goes large enough to fit comfortably on my head. Even better, it is pretty comfortable with glasses, which is rare. First, you charge it up for about four hours. You have to plug it into a USB port, since it only comes with a USB charging cable. Alternatively, if you have available wall-warts, as I do from the Palm Pre era, then you can wall charge it. After charging the headset, I plugged in the included wireless dongle in my laptop and turned on the headset. Windows 8 installed the drivers and I was ready to go! I fired up Injustice, and viola... the sound was coming from my speakers. I could control the speaker volume from the headset roller control, but the sound would only come from my speakers. Next, I clicked on the audio control in the tray and brought up the Volume...'),
(N'Sofia', N'Ortiz', N'sofia.ortiz2553@example.net', '2014-11-11', 5, N'This is permanently in my reviews list, and I''ve never bought it, but it drives me crazy that it is here. I am beginning to think this is a test by Amazon to see how OCD I am.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Wood', N'patricia.wood4172@example.org', '2014-11-11', 5, N'This one replaced my SteelSeries hard surface pad. It''s texture is superb, making for a smooth mousing operation unmatched by cloth surface pads. Hard is the way to go. Gonna get a second one to use at work.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Hall', N'lisa.hall4750@example.com', '2014-11-11', 4, N'This is a soft-rubber cover which overlaps the hand-unit, adding height, better control and some cushion on the outside. I''m surprised at how much I do like it, it seemed frivolous when I first purchased it, but after using it and comparing the hand-unit without it, it''s absolutely a good and worth while addition to the hand unit. The material is a soft rubber which I''ve taken off and put back on many times - it does not rip or tear, but is very durable.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Clark', N'olivia.clark8761@example.com', '2014-11-11', 3, N'Even if is a CoD version,is great to have finally a official release with "limited" look. All is great, more space, the quality, design, the headset, even the game is acceptable like playing titanfalll, killzone and crysis all in one. But it''s disappoint and a bad movewith the client that all related products except this get a shader for Destiny. (even the limited edition controller) Pay 530 bucks and no bonus, pay 80 and get the shader. So much difference or cost is to send a key of an aesthetics no cost digital extra?'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Gonzalez', N'kimberly.gonzalez7888@example.com', '2014-11-12', 5, N'For what it is (a very cheap semi-controller), it works fine. You can tell it''s not a real nunchuck, but it''s pretty close. The analog stick gives it away, but after some hours I haven''t had any trouble with it. I think the cord is a bit longer than the original as well.'),
(N'Christina', N'Castillo', N'christina.castillo4317@example.com', '2014-11-12', 5, N'I bought this controller to be used with my PC for games. It works well for that purpose. I''ve played Watch Dogs and a few other games on it.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Phillips', N'carlos.phillips7579@example.com', '2014-11-12', 3, N'Difficult controls but has good graphics for money'),
(N'Alexander', N'Young', N'alexander.young4724@example.org', '2014-11-12', 4, N'I hated ghosts, I am an avid COD fan and if this turned out to be anything like ghosts I would have ditched COD. What I like about it is the old COD feel with all the new stuff. I haven''t finished the campaign, but liking it so far. Overall, this is a step in the right direction.'),
(N'James', N'Taylor', N'james.taylor3118@example.com', '2014-11-12', 4, N'Being a die hard fan, its hard for me to not enjoy this installment, especially given it gives you an opportunity to experience life from the other side. And being able to explore the lore from the side of the Templars is a real treat and makes things far more cat and mouse than previous installments. And while all the appeal is still there, there are some pretty wincing flaws. You''re another floating set of eyes at Abstergo, and your introduction to the universe is short and unsatisfying. In lockdown after a set of memories you''re analyzing crashes Abstergo HQ. There''s a lot of retconning and head scratching moments, and the characters wonder aloud repeatedly if Shay survived this or that. But if this is genetic memory, that means he had to survive until he had a kid at least right? These and other plot holes are introduced, but other moments are obvious nods to characters from previous games and are handled pretty well as a cameo. Your colonial Assassin turned Templar is Shay, an...'),
(N'Susan', N'Nowak', N'susan.nowak8577@example.net', '2014-11-12', 5, N'My son really enjoys this game.'),
(N'Betty', N'Green', N'betty.green5616@example.net', '2014-11-12', 4, N'Quality product but too high for my taste Price is decent and seller is great'),
(N'Kyle', N'Chavez', N'kyle.chavez2929@example.net', '2014-11-12', 5, N'good mouse works good'),
(N'Kyle', N'Chavez', N'kyle.chavez2929@example.net', '2014-11-12', 5, N'works great love the big screen'),
(N'Michelle', N'Price', N'michelle.price7802@example.net', '2014-11-12', 5, N'Great game! Arrived as advertised and made happy gamers!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Hill', N'amanda.hill6414@example.net', '2014-11-12', 5, N'omg this survival horror game has it all. it reminds me of the silent hill games. its got plenty of action story and easy of use. the game is laid out into 15 chapters that are wonderful. it has alot of replay value 4 once u beat it u can restart new game + with your same character and equipment. the game sets up a little like a rpg. u gather xp and improve your character as you go. it will make you jump'),
(N'Lauren', N'Howard', N'lauren.howard2936@example.com', '2014-11-12', 5, N'We bought this game when it first came out for the Wii, and seven years later we are STILL playing this game on a regular basis. "Mario Party 8" is a great family game, that everyone in the family can enjoy, it''s like a fantastic board game that you play on your TV. As you play the game you unlock new playable characters and new levels to play on. There are several ways to play "Mario Party 8", but I''m going to stick with basic game for this review. The "Party Play" and "Duels" and all of the mini games are fun too, but all stem from the main game. Each player chooses a character "pawn" and then you choose the "board" you want to play on, and there are some fun imaginative levels like "Boo''s Haunted Castle" or "Bowser''s Warped Orbit" to "Donkey Kong''s Jungle", each level has it''s own challenges and layouts. Players take turn "rolling" the dice and moving around the board collecting coins and stars. After each player takes a turn, everyone competes in a mini-game, sometimes working...'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ramos', N'jacob.ramos6318@example.org', '2014-11-12', 4, N'Most Sonic games over the past 10-15 years have received mixed fan responses. Recent exceptions include Colors and Generations, both of which I really enjoyed. These two games seem to get generally positive review scores, and do a fine job of blending the old with the new. My son and I have been playing a lot of Sonic games of late. I had played the Genesis games a bit as a kid, but was never a "Sonic fan", as an owner of Nintendo machines until after several years of game collecting. I''ve had Sonic Adventure since it was released 14 years ago on the Dreamcast, but never played much of it. It was nice to finally pick it up and complete the game with my son. Recently, we''ve been doing a marathon through the majority of the franchise, having played through both Adventure games, Colors, Generations, Sonic Heroes, and the original three (four) Genesis games, as well as several Sonic-themed racing games or similar. As noted above, I was never a "Sonic fan", but I''m a very experienced...'),
(N'Jack', N'Foster', N'jack.foster5673@example.org', '2014-11-12', 5, N'One of the best games I have ever played!'),
(N'David', N'Ferreira', N'david.ferreira3290@example.com', '2014-11-12', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Christine', N'Reyes', N'christine.reyes4980@example.com', '2014-11-12', 4, N'Me and my daughter have spent hours and hours and days playing this game. Gave her a good appreciation for some older music, and it gave us something in common. It even encouraged her to take up the guitar for real.'),
(N'Anita', N'Davis', N'anita.davis8129@example.com', '2014-11-12', 4, N'good'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Singh', N'rebecca.singh5968@example.org', '2014-11-12', 5, N'Both of these are good games and enjoyable. Not as sophisticated as some, but fun. My favorites are games like 1000 Doors that are graphically superb and offer good challenges and elaborate stories, but these games are pretty good. No glitches, interesting stories and appropriate help if you want hints.'),
(N'Betty', N'Jones', N'betty.jones5933@example.org', '2014-11-13', 3, N'I really enjoyed it.'),
(N'Betty', N'Jones', N'betty.jones5933@example.org', '2014-11-13', 5, N'This was a good game, the only critism is that you have to shoot or hit the enemy too many times to kill them.'),
(N'Charles', N'Ivanov', N'charles.ivanov3462@example.com', '2014-11-13', 2, N'Multiplayer simple doesn''t work at all. Single player is ok. Its crashed on my a couple times. Cutscenes are a little jerky in motion.'),
(N'Omar', N'Castillo', N'omar.castillo1285@example.net', '2014-11-13', 1, N'Its NHL 14 with Bergeron on the box!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Long', N'douglas.long6412@example.net', '2014-11-13', 5, N'The PS4 is great! Graphics, game-play, configurations and all that jazz are awesome.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Gutierrez', N'jacob.gutierrez9597@example.org', '2014-11-13', 5, N'It was like a brand new game fresh new right straight out of the oven'),
(N'Jacob', N'Gutierrez', N'jacob.gutierrez9597@example.org', '2014-11-13', 5, N'It works awesome like it was brand new fresh out of the oven lol'),
(N'Stephen', N'Boyd', N'stephen.boyd8205@example.com', '2014-11-13', 5, N'My son love it!'),
(N'Peter', N'Wisniewski', N'peter.wisniewski5081@example.net', '2014-11-13', 5, N'Couldn''t be happier.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Martinez', N'deborah.martinez4135@example.org', '2014-11-13', 5, N'These games are fantastic! I was not old enough to play these games when they came out (I was just born and was like 4 when Jak 3 came out) Jak 1 was cartoony and relaxing to play. Jak 2 made me really think about where I was going and how I was going to perform each jump without dying and having to start the mission all over (Stupid Mountain Collection Mission). Jak 3 made me think of what gun I needed at a certain moment in time, or if I should turn into Dark or Light Jak. The gameplay is awesome. I should also mention no loading screens in any of these games!?!?!? Yeah, no loading screens. And because this is a remastered game, the graphics are great. I don''t care about graphics, as long as the gameplay can make up for not as good graphics. All these games look amazing on the PS3. You can see each little grass blade in Jak 1, see the Baron''s palace from almost anywhere in the city, and in Jak 3 you can see what feels like forever in the desert. Overall, Jak is an amazing game...'),
(N'Nicole', N'Ferreira', N'nicole.ferreira9099@example.org', '2014-11-13', 5, N'The game is amazing. Match making is working for me. Just takes 3-4 minutes to find a match. I played some Halo 2 Anniversary, Big Team Battle, and Halo 4. All worked fine just took 5 minutes. Halo 2 Anniversary took the shortest amount of time to find a game. Campaign is great. Online is great. Graphics are great. Overall great game.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Baker', N'tomasz.baker3816@example.org', '2014-11-14', 5, N'This game is awesome! I love the spinny thing he does to get through areas that mysteriously turn into loops. Totally different from anything you''ve experienced on a game!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Thomas', N'mateo.thomas7421@example.com', '2014-11-14', 5, N'Much better D3 with the expansion than just regular D3, having a blast .'),
(N'Helen', N'Perez', N'helen.perez6522@example.com', '2014-11-14', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Maria', N'Johnson', N'maria.johnson5661@example.org', '2014-11-14', 5, N'Also One of the better games on the Vita! DEFINITELY WORTH HAVING!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Campbell', N'joshua.campbell4355@example.com', '2014-11-14', 5, N'Bought this as a gift. Have yet to know how good the game is. Can''t wait to see.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Wilson', N'brandon.wilson3946@example.net', '2014-11-14', 4, N'It''s very ironic how a 3D madcap crazily-themed minigame collection on the Nintendo Wii has a handheld counterpart that happens to be a 2D platformer released for the then-new 3DS system, which obviously featured a big emphasis on 3D. Nevertheless, Rabbids Travel in Time is a pretty standard platformer. It really doesn''t have anything that any other game of its type hasn''t already tackled. You have your enemies, platforms to run and jump on, disappearing/reappearing grounds, "bottomless" pits, water sections, moving platforms, etc. Fortunately, with those things considered, there''s nothing I can really recall that''s bad about the game. After I was playing through the game, there was a point where I did think "Well, I can''t say I didn''t enjoy it." Everything, from the obstacles to the controls, functions properly, and the levels, while unspectacular, do provide plenty of decent designs and platforming hijinks. For a platformer that might be playing it safe, I still say Rabbids...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Hughes', N'olivia.hughes2156@example.org', '2014-11-14', 1, N'False advertising!!! I paid for the download just like everyone else did and when 10am arrived I wasn''t able to download the game because the release date is on the 18th NOT THE 14th! Well looks like we all got suckered. Way to pay attention guys!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Webb', N'jeremy.webb4681@example.com', '2014-11-14', 5, N'i use to have a duo system then i decided to buy an actual console'),
(N'Jack', N'Rivera', N'jack.rivera7063@example.net', '2014-11-14', 5, N'great condition'),
(N'Dennis', N'Hernandez', N'dennis.hernandez3545@example.com', '2014-11-14', 4, N'Sure they will love a new game to play after Christmas'),
(N'Kelly', N'Taylor', N'kelly.taylor7356@example.net', '2014-11-14', 5, N'The best expansion pack ever. This exspansion review is obviously a little early but wow. This has kept me going more than any other. This game expansion is better than all of the others for sure. More fun things to do, graphical overhaul, garrisons are beyond fun. It feels meaningful this time. Best expansion yet, and yes I''ve played them all.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Gomez', N'kelly.gomez1878@example.net', '2014-11-14', 5, N'This game is taking steps in the right direction. For all you people saying its unrealistic well no duh its set in the future for crying out loud. The graphics on this game are amazing and it still has the traditional play style of call of duty. Its taking steps in the right direction even introducing ranked playlists? Like sure why not? why would you people be ok with payin 60 dollars every year for the same game with new maps and guns and that''s it. The exo-suits in this game add a lot of different play styles. Makes the game enjoyable. So for the people who are saying this game is trash you must just be scared of change. Because this game is going in the right direction for futuristic gaming.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Jimenez', N'tomasz.jimenez7150@example.net', '2014-11-14', 1, N'What a waste, son used it once, hasn''t touched it since, in the closet collecting dust!'),
(N'Luis', N'Bell', N'luis.bell3649@example.com', '2014-11-14', 2, N'Maybe I''m too harsh because I''m used to good games that are well put together like GTA, Hitman, Arkham City, etc., but I really wanted to give this game 1 star. The only reason I didn''t was because it is a really neat concept and I liked the idea of it. I think this game has a couple things going for it. First, its 3rd person rather than a 1st person game. Most zombie games are 1st person shooters and personally I don''t care for those. Second, it''s not all hack and slash. You gather resources and manage people so there''s a little more strategy to it. I also liked the realistic elements such as stamina conservation. Unfortunately for me the game was practically unplayable. The graphics were just absolute crap. They looked like something you would find on a video game from 2001. I''m fairly sure the graphics were comparable to GTA III, which were amazing in 2001 are flat, unrealistic and static in 2014. Controls are all over the place. This was where I had my biggest issue. The...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Ramos', N'pamela.ramos4794@example.com', '2014-11-15', 5, N'This is a cool and fun game, I really enjoyed it. Unfortunatly mine got stolen before I could beat it, but I plan on buying it again. Good gameplay, good graphics, great game!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Ramos', N'pamela.ramos4794@example.com', '2014-11-15', 5, N'I really enjoyed this game. It had a good story and nice graphics. I love mysteries! This is a decently challenging seek and find too. I liked that there were different types of puzzles too. The only thing I would recommend is playing this on an XL, the puzzles were so detailed that I sometimes had a hard time finding objects on my 2DS. But it wasn''t so bad, cause if there was one or two things left that I couldn''t find, I would just use the hint function.'),
(N'Susan', N'Turner', N'susan.turner5852@example.net', '2014-11-15', 5, N'Just what my niece wanted. Thank you amazon. The right gift at the right time.'),
(N'George', N'Anderson', N'george.anderson7333@example.com', '2014-11-15', 5, N'A'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Walker', N'jennifer.walker1784@example.org', '2014-11-15', 4, N'please'),
(N'Linda', N'Kowalski', N'linda.kowalski2605@example.net', '2014-11-15', 5, N'Awesome case !! Hori is a great company! !'),
(N'Lisa', N'Morales', N'lisa.morales5451@example.org', '2014-11-15', 3, N'Fair'),
(N'Lisa', N'Morales', N'lisa.morales5451@example.org', '2014-11-15', 3, N'Poor game'),
(N'Heather', N'Wood', N'heather.wood1012@example.com', '2014-11-15', 4, N'*UPDATE* 11/19/2014 OKay finished this. Strongly want to ding it another star but won''t for now. The game becomes absolutely STUPID later with making the player go through task after task after task. Example: In a room next to a working generator after you got past the alien to make it that far. You do something in that room, then make it many more rooms away and oh sorry haha the generator just shut down. So, now make it back and turn it on again. There''s never any sense at all about how a mission is going: everything is hit this lever, this power coupling, this blah blah blah it just goes on and on like the rabbit hole. In the final mission when you''re finished--oops, sorry, now you are back again and have to make your way yet again to the same point. It truly becomes frustrating and stupid. This is also a complaint other reviewers have made, with at least one calling it Sisyphean. *UPDATE* 11/16/2014 After reading some other reviews I decided to give this another shot--on Easy!...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Hill', N'jeremy.hill3379@example.com', '2014-11-15', 2, N'I was really excited to play this! Soon after I finished my first moon mission and then went back to the tower, I took on another mission on the moon, only to find out I spawned at the same position that I had just spawned at earlier. "Ok I thought to myself, this is just another mission, but the same location. Thats fine, lets do this!" So I finished another mission, returned to the "Tower" with some cool new weapons and well.... then...repeat the above... over and over and over. (Different planets eventually). I got to around Level 19 and got bored and have not been back since.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ward', N'jeremy.ward5298@example.org', '2014-11-16', 5, N'great'),
(N'Ryan', N'Kumar', N'ryan.kumar4838@example.net', '2014-11-16', 3, N'I found the game boring at times, graphics were ok and the story was terrible.'),
(N'Carol', N'Morris', N'carol.morris4858@example.org', '2014-11-16', 5, N'I already bought the other Bluecell analog stick covers a few months before purchasing these ones, but I genuinely just did not like them. They were the soft rubber ones that easily slipped off the analog sticks and didn''t add much grip. These ones are the hard plastic ones that stay on very well and don''t come off easily. I really like these, they feel much nicer and actually add a grip for my thumbs. I''d recommend these over the soft ones, though I do know there''s a lot of people who feel the opposite. I actually bought the soft ones first due to all the reviews complaining about the hard plastic ones! Also, now that I think about it, the title for my review sounds dirty.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Miller', N'jeremy.miller5926@example.com', '2014-11-16', 5, N'This game is most definitely not for everyone. Is this game repetitive? Yes. Is the story highly disappointing? Absolutely. Having said all that, I simply cannot put the game down. Destiny requires patience, a lust for loot and a healthy amount of dedicated friends to play with. No friends to play with? No problem. I began my adventures in Destiny with around 8 or so friends on my friends list, none of which owned the game or were interested in playing with me. I now have almost 40, most of which regularly play Destiny with me. The social experience and cooperative teamwork is a big reason why I love this game. Also, the shooting mechanics are top notch and the higher level guns are just so much fun to shoot, upgrade and collect. The graphics and music are also amazing. If you can''t get past the horrific story, I can''t say that I blame you. But if you accept this game for what it is, and you discover a highly addicting experience like I have, then your purchase will be worth every...'),
(N'Sharon', N'Reed', N'sharon.reed8587@example.com', '2014-11-16', 5, N'A+'),
(N'Lauren', N'Gomez', N'lauren.gomez9772@example.com', '2014-11-16', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Wei', N'Okonkwo', N'wei.okonkwo5562@example.net', '2014-11-16', 1, N'This won''t work in my Vita!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Price', N'christopher.price1455@example.net', '2014-11-16', 5, N'So I was hesitant at first. There wasn''t much information on this game on the Internet or basicly anywhere till it came out. Finally after release day the reviews were popping up and the verdict was in, buy this game it''s great. I decided to go with it and I did not regret it. Started off as a wizard and beat the game as one. Then I tried mining, alchemy , fishing.... Almost all of them to just do it. You can switch between each life very nicely and not lose any progress on what you where on. The game has three different quests you need to compete. The life you''ve choose , butterfly''s requests which gets you to progress through the story and random little NPCs quests which are just tasks for items they want. The story is actually pretty good. There''s a lot of reading as far as the story goes but it''s good. Now how is it like harvest moon or animal crossing? Everyone keeps saying it is , right? Well, animal crossing in the sense of you need to collect items to sell and make "dosh"...'),
(N'Andrea', N'King', N'andrea.king6905@example.net', '2014-11-16', 4, N'Does the job'),
(N'Sarah', N'Green', N'sarah.green5771@example.net', '2014-11-16', 5, N'Released for a handheld, I didn''t have as high of expectation as original Resistance series, but after playing this, I have to say this is one of the better FPS I have played (especially on a handheld). *************************************************************PROS*************************************************************************** -Gameplay: This has a very unique FPS gameplay. Very different than popular COD like FPS games. Different but great. Especially weapons. -Weapons: Resistance weapons are the best aspect of Resistance FPS gameplay. Every weapon have a primary and secondary fire mode. These mode will include classic things like machinegun, shotguns to very cool and highly unique alien weaponry like tagged shots, auger shots (shoot through walls) and more. -Story and timeline: This game takes place in an alternate timeline when chimera are invading the world in late 1900s. The environment it creates is very believable and story is pretty interesting with some...'),
(N'Ivan', N'Foster', N'ivan.foster1139@example.com', '2014-11-16', 5, N'I remember when I first got this, I was elated! The last HM I had played just prior to the release of ToT was AWL. ToT is an amazing game! and so is AP. I honestly can''t tell you which is better as they both have their pros and con''s. So if you have a Wii and you love the HM franchise, check out this game and the next game after it, HM: Animal Parade.'),
(N'Walter', N'Lopez', N'walter.lopez5725@example.net', '2014-11-16', 5, N'This keyboard is top notch as far as mechanical keyboards go. My boyfriend wanted it for his computer, as he''s always on it between browsing the internet or gaming, and ever since he received it, he''s been in absolute love with it. The sounds are distinct but not overly loud to the point of being annoying and the lighting effect is beautiful, also not to a level where it''s annoying as well. It features two USB ports on the side for headsets, mouses, etcetera and has added M buttons for binding gaming keys to which is perfect for what he wanted it for. A must get for anyone serious about their computer, especially pc gamers. =]'),
(N'Dee', N'Flores', N'dee.flores6465@example.net', '2014-11-16', 3, N'This game is ok. I keep having problems with playing it on my computers. I managed to get it working on my laptop, but I have had to reload it twice so far. (Within a week) This game is fun, but definitely not GTA or NFS.'),
(N'Larry', N'Perry', N'larry.perry1341@example.net', '2014-11-16', 5, N'Started playing this with my nephew and I definitely enjoyed it as much as he did, if not more. The ''education'' aspect is well-hidden behind groovy songs and fun game challenges. The interactive screen technology is a great way to get kids off the couch and into a learning environment that''s actually fun. Kudos to LeapFrog for the well-produced and catchy songs that fill this game. I was dancing, laughing and having a great time. It didn''t even feel like babysitting! There were a few games that were harder for the camera to position us correctly, but it may have been a lighting issue. We''re going to try it again in a different room next time to see if it improves. If you get the LeapTV game system, definitely get this Dance and Learn game as well! Lots of fun.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Barnes', N'timothy.barnes6603@example.org', '2014-11-17', 2, N'Knock off brand. Charging is touchy and if the controller tilts wrong it stops charging. Can''t charge two at a time because one controller pushes on the other one enough to disrupt connection. Can be a pain to put on charger.'),
(N'James', N'Richardson', N'james.richardson8046@example.org', '2014-11-17', 4, N'Fit great in the control'),
(N'Samuel', N'Garcia', N'samuel.garcia2529@example.com', '2014-11-17', 1, N'I cant open'),
(N'Charles', N'Price', N'charles.price5717@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'I''ve been a FIFA gamer for about 5 years now, and this game is definitely the best. It fixes previous games'' bugs, and improves on an already solid gameplay experience. Career mode is the best I''ve played it and ultimate team and head to head are great as well. Great game all around.'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2014-11-17', 5, N'The Wiimote works just fine on my Wii U and looks good since it matches the color.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Fisher', N'rebecca.fisher6440@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'item got in perfect conditions'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Edwards', N'jennifer.edwards1644@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'High quality headphones with virtual surround sound to match it. Seriously, the battery lasts pretty long as well.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Reyes', N'amanda.reyes3178@example.net', '2014-11-17', 4, N'The best way to describe the Walking Dead Season One is as an elaborate choose your own adventure story. There is some action, though it''s relatively simple to make it through. The power of the game lies in its narrative and the characters you spend your journey with. The story is powerful and gripping, with decent replay value for a story driven, fairly linear game with limited action. The presentation for the game is decent. The graphics are cell shaded and look hand drawn, a style I enjoy myself but know some people do not . The character models don''t quite move right, leaving you from ever being sucked into the game, but the graphics are not the point. The sound effects and voice acting are top notch. The cast does a great job from beginning to end with even the peripheral characters you run into doing an excellent job. The gameplay is simplistic, but you get what you expect. The game centers around the choices you make and how they affect your character, Lee, and the group he...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Reyes', N'amanda.reyes3178@example.net', '2014-11-17', 4, N'The Wolf Among Us tells an interesting, if fairly generic, murder mystery within the Fables universe. Full disclosure, I know nothing about Fables and wouldn''t if the game hadn''t said it was based on the Fables universe. The games follows Bigby Wolf as he tries to solve a murder mystery set in Fabletown, a fantastical area in New York populated by characters from various fairy tales that have fled "the old country" to find a better life. The characters hide amongst the "mundie" (normal human beings) population through the use of special spells. The cast of characters are genuinely interesting and cover a wide array of fairy tales that I was interested to read about as notes about the characters unlocked throughout the game. The graphics are more or less the same as the Walking Dead games from Telltale, if you''ve played those. Hand drawn looking graphics that do the job. Stylistically well done, but technically won''t blow anyone away. The voice acting is excellent from start to...'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Howard', N'jeffrey.howard4311@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'Nervous at first, Madcatz doesn''t exactly make the bets stuff which is why most of it is so cheap but this controller has held out and done so pretty well with quite a lot of online and offline button mashing.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Evans', N'pamela.evans7494@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'Gift'),
(N'Linda', N'Perez', N'linda.perez8306@example.org', '2014-11-17', 1, N'It really aggravates me when people give a single star due to some issue other than if they are happy with the item. But in this case I don''t know what else to do. IF YOU BUY THIS CODE when you attempt to enter it, you get a message telling you it will be at least Dec. 2014 before you can use the first one. And Jan-Feb 2015 before you can use the other one. I notified Amazon of this & they did give me a prompt refund. But their lack of updating the page so other buyers are aware has prompted this review. But I can say for Destiny itself, I''m sure it will be a great add on.....later this year & early next year. Once we repurchase it when it is usable.....I will update the stars.'),
(N'Priya', N'Rodriguez', N'priya.rodriguez6268@example.net', '2014-11-17', 3, N'So I was seriously rooting for this game when they announced this game. I let the fever and hub bub of the game die down. It has been over 2 months since the game has come out, and can honestly say....It is just ok. They seriously left some big holes in this game. Yeah ok, the story did not make sense, big deal....When people play FPS''ers, who really pays attention to the story? Most just want to hit the button to get to the next thing to shoot or blow up. But, all and all.....the game was really "lack luster", it literally has only about 5 dungeons that you play, over and over again so monotonously. It gets to a point where you are just so bored and drooling over your controller and just hoping to score some kind of sweet gear. Mind you I have done all the dungeons on hardest modes and the Vault of glass, there is simply nothing left to do. They claim it is kind of like a MMO (Massive Multiplayer Online Role Playing game), like World of Warcraft. However, I am just not connecting...'),
(N'Linda', N'Richardson', N'linda.richardson7136@example.org', '2014-11-17', 3, N'Fun for a few hours than repetitive.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Baker', N'sofia.baker6909@example.org', '2014-11-17', 5, N'This controller is a must buy. It''s beautiful and feels comfortable to play games with for long periods of time.'),
(N'Charles', N'Kelly', N'charles.kelly9855@example.com', '2014-11-17', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Ethan', N'Martin', N'ethan.martin7644@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'This was a great deal when I preordered and my opinion has not change. The game is great (Way better than COD Ghost). Multiplayer is smooth a the story is one of the best in a while. Graphics are smooth on the Xbox One and I has not expiences no issues so far. I recommend this box for all COD fans out there.'),
(N'Julie', N'Morgan', N'julie.morgan8795@example.org', '2014-11-17', 5, N'Worth every penny. Best expansion yet.'),
(N'Richard', N'Boyd', N'richard.boyd2595@example.com', '2014-11-17', 4, N'Protects well, but loose around buttons. Could be a little tighter. Not a tight fit'),
(N'Walter', N'Brown', N'walter.brown1965@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'This game and the V3 are the best games I have played. I have had so much fun with them. Bloody and shows everything the bullets hit on the person in detail so I don''t think its child worthy. But adults will have a blast seeing the results of their shoots'),
(N'Richard', N'Evans', N'richard.evans5097@example.org', '2014-11-17', 4, N'GOOD GAME'),
(N'Henry', N'Parker', N'henry.parker3385@example.net', '2014-11-17', 5, N'Good'),
(N'John', N'Jackson', N'john.jackson4416@example.net', '2014-11-18', 5, N'Damm GOOD game and so is SNIPER ll some of those shot or out of this world hard to make...'),
(N'John', N'Jackson', N'john.jackson4416@example.net', '2014-11-18', 5, N'Out standing they need to come out with a walking dead 3k'),
(N'Laura', N'James', N'laura.james2330@example.org', '2014-11-18', 5, N'is a ps3 just awesome'),
(N'Ronald', N'Khan', N'ronald.khan5453@example.net', '2014-11-18', 5, N'Great game made even better on the PS4.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Ruiz', N'lucia.ruiz6676@example.org', '2014-11-18', 5, N'This is a great product, and a great price! saves having to wait for remotes to charge!!'),
(N'Joan', N'Henderson', N'joan.henderson9818@example.org', '2014-11-18', 5, N'Great game!!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ross', N'stephanie.ross9740@example.com', '2014-11-18', 5, N'Mortal kombat bookends? hell yeah!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ross', N'stephanie.ross9740@example.com', '2014-11-18', 3, N'Not the best game out there really repetitive! MP is a joke'),
(N'Nancy', N'Patel', N'nancy.patel6206@example.org', '2014-11-18', 5, N'The dreamGear Comfort Grip is aptly named. It''s very comfortable. It completely eliminated the ache in my hands after a longer play session. 30 minutes of gaming and my hands hurt, not after buying this though. If I had to pick a single gripe, I don''t think the top piece really serves any practical purpose except to pull the design together. It could provide protection from dings and scratches, I''m sure but it''s just another thing to get dirty. I keep just the bottom piece on. But that''s just me. Both pieces though fit good, with only a minor exception. The back of the case doesn''t fit like a glove so you do need to push the case up just a bit to get the power cord into place. There is also a little adjusting to get a game card in and out. That shouldn''t prevent you from picking up this case though because it''s still fantastic and you''re still going to love the way it feels in hand. Goodbye fatigue.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Adams', N'nicole.adams8514@example.net', '2014-11-18', 5, N'Son loves it'),
(N'Aisha', N'Phillips', N'aisha.phillips1212@example.net', '2014-11-18', 5, N'I expected a lot from this game and wow! It was even better than what ive imagined. I don''t think i would ever play a game more entertaining than this.'),
(N'Heather', N'Wisniewski', N'heather.wisniewski9554@example.net', '2014-11-18', 4, N'worked great'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Patel', N'hiroshi.patel1905@example.com', '2014-11-18', 5, N'high quality, fast delivery'),
(N'William', N'Moore', N'william.moore7622@example.com', '2014-11-18', 5, N'All I can say is Wow!!!'),
(N'Alexander', N'Cruz', N'alexander.cruz8359@example.org', '2014-11-18', 5, N'Doom reskinned with xenomorphs. Dark, difficult, and super old school; Glory'),
(N'Sandra', N'Cruz', N'sandra.cruz8306@example.com', '2014-11-18', 5, N'I''ve been playing the campaign for a few hours and I wanted to get a quick review out for those wondering is this worth buying for PS3. I will update this review in more detail later on. Let''s face it. 2014 has more or less been a lackluster year for ''next gen'' gaming. Overhyped, crap disappointments, rinse and repeat. Enter Dragon Age Inquisition (DAI). Possibly the first reason to upgrade to a PS4. If not, you''ll do fine like me, playing this on a PS3 for now. DO YOU NEED TO PLAY ORIGINS AND DA 2 to understand what''s going on in Inquisition? Yes and no. If you are like me and couldn''t get into Origins and completely skipped out on DA 2, google ''Dragon Age Keep guide'' and check out the link on PCgamer''s website called ''Dragon Age Keep - the definitive guide to every choice'', which should pop up as one of the first hits in the google search results. This link on PC gamer''s site explains every choice you need to know about setting up your world state in the Dragon Age Keep. There is...'),
(N'Michael', N'Morales', N'michael.morales8043@example.com', '2014-11-19', 4, N'It''s okay. I wish it had a few more modes though like single player racing whereby you can select the tracks you want to race without having to do an entire cup. The kart speeds could be a little faster. They feel very slow.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Patel', N'alexander.patel8883@example.org', '2014-11-19', 3, N'good'),
(N'Angela', N'Mendoza', N'angela.mendoza8360@example.net', '2014-11-19', 5, N'I was surprised that I didn''t have to beat it like I used to when I was a kid. Console came in great condition.'),
(N'Noah', N'Hill', N'noah.hill8927@example.com', '2014-11-19', 5, N'awesome game'),
(N'Joseph', N'Myers', N'joseph.myers9935@example.net', '2014-11-19', 5, N'This is a great grip for the Vita-2000. Much more comfortable than playing without it and unlike a similar one I had for the Vita-1000 before, you can charge while the Vita is in this grip. It also has a little kickstand which I don''t use much, but it came in handy once. The grip is also light and so doesn''t add much weight.'),
(N'Wei', N'Morales', N'wei.morales4318@example.com', '2014-11-19', 5, N'love ff'),
(N'Wei', N'Morales', N'wei.morales4318@example.com', '2014-11-19', 5, N'Love ff'),
(N'Amara', N'Walker', N'amara.walker1976@example.org', '2014-11-19', 4, N'I quit writing game reviews because the youth of our society is suffering hard from Fanboyism. Negative reviews are shunned and ridiculed, even if they''re spot-on accurate. "You don''t like what I like so I''m marking your review as unhelpful even though I own the product already and completely misunderstand the purpose of this system..." Anyways, as this was is a product I was pretty stoked for, I felt compelled to dust off my opinions and do the whole "game review" thing again. This is essentially Far Cry 3-and-a-half. We meet a psycopathic antagonist right off the bat, and get tossed into a chaotic story in the midst of a tropical environment. Within hours we''re climbing radio towers and liberating outposts, hunting wild animals to craft basic improvements, just as we did in the last game. It''s all very, very familiar. Now, I can''t in-good-conscience climb onto my soap box and say this is bad, as Far Cry 3 was - in my humble opinion - one of the greatest video games to grace the...'),
(N'Larry', N'Gomez', N'larry.gomez7031@example.com', '2014-11-19', 5, N'Bought for son. He loved this game in game boy and loves this one also.'),
(N'Jack', N'Kumar', N'jack.kumar8424@example.com', '2014-11-19', 4, N'A nice memento for those that have played the Original Yoshi''s Island. By the way, many people consider it a easy game, and most of the time is it. But if you play to get all the collectibles or play the special level it gets pretty difficult in some levels.'),
(N'Michael', N'Gray', N'michael.gray6754@example.org', '2014-11-19', 5, N'A must have to any fighting games hardcore player'),
(N'William', N'Ivanov', N'william.ivanov8685@example.org', '2014-11-20', 3, N'The game is ported poorly and I feel like the gameplay is just a rip off of all the really cool fun stuff from the other games in the Call of Duty franchise. That being said it is fun but nothing I could get into nor recommend.'),
(N'Priya', N'Cook', N'priya.cook3281@example.net', '2014-11-20', 5, N'Holds a pretty good charge, can finally play some old games!'),
(N'Jose', N'Ward', N'jose.ward1279@example.net', '2014-11-20', 1, N'i bought this game at gamestop today and at first i was like wow soo cool then after the beginning part the game goes down hill. went driving for 40minutes no enemies at all i restarted thwe game and this time it was just a hassle gameplay is lacking. graphics are amazing but that shouldn''t make the game itself sadly.'),
(N'Angela', N'Wang', N'angela.wang4818@example.org', '2014-11-20', 5, N'Who doesn''t like Batman? If you like the previous Arkham series you''ll love this one.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ortiz', N'sarah.ortiz4962@example.com', '2014-11-20', 5, N'Another Great Gears Game in the Series!!'),
(N'Noah', N'Ferreira', N'noah.ferreira8420@example.org', '2014-11-20', 5, N'fine'),
(N'Noah', N'Ferreira', N'noah.ferreira8420@example.org', '2014-11-20', 4, N'great'),
(N'Noah', N'Ferreira', N'noah.ferreira8420@example.org', '2014-11-20', 5, N'good'),
(N'Dee', N'Sanchez', N'dee.sanchez9079@example.org', '2014-11-20', 2, N'Boring.'),
(N'Frank', N'Kumar', N'frank.kumar7659@example.net', '2014-11-20', 4, N'got it fast. its a gift so won''t know if it works okay till dec. but im sure it will'),
(N'Patricia', N'Cook', N'patricia.cook8626@example.com', '2014-11-20', 5, N'Excellent!!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Ramirez', N'yuki.ramirez8515@example.com', '2014-11-20', 5, N'A gift for my granddaughter. She loves this game. It kept her busy.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ward', N'victoria.ward8846@example.com', '2014-11-20', 4, N'(Over 20 hours in...so didn''t "Complete"...but I have been so thrilled to see the game come out better than DA2, I had to share. And even if you loved DA2, you''ll probably love this game. Also...I don''t hate DA2...just wasn''t the biggest fan.) There were a few PC players that were upset when Dragon Age 2 came out and the gameplay was slightly different. Dragon Age 2 wasn''t an awful game necessarily, it just felt like it went in a different direction. dragon age: Inquisition feels as if Biowarehas picked up some of the pieces that resonated with some gamers from both gamea and put them together. The world is beautifully crafted and while the art slightly line up with DA2 more this is in no way a negative.(DA:O seemed slightly more dark and messy...not in a bad way). I''ve enjoyed wondering around several of the lands and areas I came across; the game has done a great job with transporting us back to Theda''s! The story is at times not quite so smooth. Personally its at least on par...'),
(N'Susan', N'Flores', N'susan.flores9991@example.org', '2014-11-20', 5, N'Fun game for kids and adults! Must play this if you played the first 4 years!'),
(N'Susan', N'Flores', N'susan.flores9991@example.org', '2014-11-20', 4, N'I purchased this game for nostalgia since I remember playing it on the SNES as a kid. I liked the game overall but it made me miss the original. Just a little too flashy for me but overall a good remake.'),
(N'Michael', N'Rivera', N'michael.rivera7505@example.net', '2014-11-20', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Sharon', N'Long', N'sharon.long5821@example.com', '2014-11-20', 5, N'This system works better then the other two versions of the PS2 that I have had the pleasure of owning.'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts1962@example.org', '2014-11-20', 5, N'Great games for those megaman fans.'),
(N'Mei', N'Lopez', N'mei.lopez6738@example.net', '2014-11-21', 2, N'It''s a cool piece of technology but i generally don''t use it or any of the connecting to console functions. They haven''t made any games that I have to have and the one game i do have is getting pretty boring pretty quickly. On top of that my first time buying one the screen crapped out on me so I had to return it.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Raghunathan', N'joyce.raghunathan3279@example.org', '2014-11-21', 3, N'I''m a long time Halo fan but I can''t give this game anything more than a 3 right now, This game is a complete mess right now and even after the patch that was supposed to fix it all has actually made the game worse. The few times you can actually get into a match without it lagging, someone force ending the game, unbalanced teams, endless error code screen, and I could go on and on. I suggest anyone who wants this game to wait for Christmas, hopefully by then we''ll have a somewhat working game.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Edwards', N'cheryl.edwards5280@example.com', '2014-11-21', 5, N'If you enjoy shooting different stag and enjoy playing a game with an MC that has a funny attitude, this is the game for you. The higher the score, the better accuracy, the more levels you unlock. Super fun especially played with at least one other player.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Martin', N'joshua.martin7205@example.net', '2014-11-21', 3, N'As you will read with a lot of the other reviews, there are a ton of issues with this game. The gameplay is pretty fun, and is getting better the further I progress, but there are many things that really take away from the enjoyment of gettnig egrossed in Mordor. First, the loading times are atrocious. Not just loading the game, but every single time you go into the start menu (which you have to do when you: level up, check something on the map, check on Sauron''s army, get intel, need to pee, want to change your runes, get an artifact, etc, etc.) it takes about 10-15 seconds to load back into the game. And that was after downloading the game to my system. The graphics are okay, but my game doesn''t seem to be as buggy as everyone else''s. Some areas of the game are brutally hard, but I was actually looking forward to that. The story is good so far, and the abilities you get to use are pretty fantastic, but overall, this game feels incomplete. The developers should have done more work...'),
(N'Jack', N'Walker', N'jack.walker9641@example.com', '2014-11-21', 1, N'Serious problems with multiplayer and nothing really new at the horizon , make this title just an average one, of course unless you are Nintendo fan I guess which means you are not an adult like me yet. Only adults who play on Xbox or PS as their main console are going to understand this review. What more do you want me to say? You play as nintendos corny characters and fight each other to death. Without blood or the death part, because they have to keep censored for the kids lol i am dead serious lol. The graphics are horrid, you are better off watching a scary movie. The controls are pretty good i guess if you use the gamecube controller, if you use the ipad controller you are going to fail miserably. So please do not do that. The multiplayer lags a lot because of the Wii u''s limitations, i tried to punch pikachu in the face and it kicked me out of the game, i guess it was a little to violent for nintendos taste. The characters suck man, they are the same on every Super Smash...'),
(N'Mateo', N'Powell', N'mateo.powell8639@example.net', '2014-11-21', 5, N'This game is amazing. The amount of content and balance of the characters is amazing. It''s not as fast as Malee but not as slow as Brawl. It''s a good balance with tons of content and finally good internet play. Must play!!!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Wilson', N'nancy.wilson7079@example.org', '2014-11-21', 5, N'Wow. It was a blast before now it''s so much more... First person was not something I expected and was blown away by the experience. Rockstar always delivers a great game.'),
(N'Eric', N'Rogers', N'eric.rogers9559@example.net', '2014-11-21', 5, N'In-depth RPG worthy of Bioware. 90hrs of open-world gaming with actual lore (codex) laced into the story. Great NPC''s with their own intertwined quests and conversations that are different. The graphics aren''t the best of either next-gen console, but the cut-scenes and models aren''t bad either. The music is under rated, I enjoyed it. How many Fallout or Skyrim games are on next gen? None. This was the closest thing so far and for my money it kept my attention longer than AC Unity, Destiny, LOTF, Halo MCC, and others. Character creation is deep, with classes and races carried over from earlier games mythos.'),
(N'Wei', N'Nelson', N'wei.nelson6405@example.org', '2014-11-21', 5, N'Best game ever!!'),
(N'Gregory', N'Morgan', N'gregory.morgan4636@example.net', '2014-11-21', 5, N'Great game. It is a shame that it was never released for PS3. Looks like it will go by the wayside when PS2 bits the dust.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Gray', N'mateo.gray9159@example.org', '2014-11-21', 3, N'Great graphics but gets boring fast. If you don''t care about a short campaign with little or no replay value (IMO) then buy this. If not spend your money on other games.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wright', N'rachel.wright5914@example.org', '2014-11-21', 2, N'yikes... final fantasy fans beware. this game is awful.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Jackson', N'jessica.jackson5670@example.com', '2014-11-21', 1, N'I hated this game played 5 mins and gave it to my niece. Kinda hard'),
(N'Jessica', N'Jackson', N'jessica.jackson5670@example.com', '2014-11-21', 5, N'Yesssss! I love playing franklin. I hate Trevor with a passion. Great graphics, good music, nice fast cars and good stories. I love that they added the skip option because in past games I couldn''t beat the game and had to wait for a guy to come beat it.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Jackson', N'jessica.jackson5670@example.com', '2014-11-21', 5, N'Bought these for my niece the colors were pretty and they were cheap'),
(N'David', N'Webb', N'david.webb3492@example.com', '2014-11-21', 2, N'Have ''09'' ''11'' and ''13''. This is a piece of trash compared to the first three and a terrible step backwards. There is little information of what equipment does, or on what equipment it will work. Some Tipper Trailers won''t fit under pipes on equipment. Some equipment requires larger tractors which is trial or error. You can connect multiple trailers in a train so you either haul small tippers to market, or haul to the silos then use a bigger tipper to get the product to market. The logging feature is good, but can still be rather slow and cumbersome to operate. One huge terrible design is trees and buildings are located so close to the fields the equipment gets hung up at the ends of the rows. Hired help constantly get caught up in every field I''ve tried and it slows things down unless you''re constantly on alert. You can help by buying a chain saw and sawing the trees down, then buy a large tractor with a bucket loader and push the trees away from the fields. One favorable feature...'),
(N'Mateo', N'Smith', N'mateo.smith8415@example.com', '2014-11-22', 1, N'This is a bad product, no function withs the LOGITEC EXTREME 3D PRO, I do not have money tu burn.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Webb', N'katherine.webb1712@example.net', '2014-11-22', 5, N'Daughter loved it'),
(N'Katherine', N'Cooper', N'katherine.cooper1622@example.com', '2014-11-22', 5, N'These are amazing thumbsticks to use to mod a PS4 controller with. Make sure you watch appropriate videos online on how to disassemble and how to re-assemble your controller, instead of just taking a screwdriver and going at it. Don''t let a $10 pair of joysticks be the reason you have to either spend more money fixing your controller, or tossing a $50-60 controller in the garbage. They are perfect, though. I admit, they felt weird under my thumbs the first few times I gamed with them, but a couple days later, they feel better than the rubber ones ever did. They have ridges completely around the outside of the top, and the inside of the top is lowered, so your thumbs have better traction. I used these on my blue controller, and in hindsight, gold would''ve looked a lot better. The blue these things come in look more like they belong on a white, or even black controller over anything else, but don''t expect a dark blue. Since they''re made of metal, I expect these things to last longer...'),
(N'Christopher', N'Kowalski', N'christopher.kowalski4890@example.com', '2014-11-22', 5, N'excelent'),
(N'Christopher', N'Kowalski', N'christopher.kowalski4890@example.com', '2014-11-22', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Janet', N'Carter', N'janet.carter9485@example.net', '2014-11-22', 5, N'just started using mine and i love it.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'White', N'jacqueline.white2867@example.com', '2014-11-22', 4, N'Nice at at a good price.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Perry', N'andrea.perry9508@example.org', '2014-11-22', 1, N'EDIT 2: I contacted TB support and after filling out some information and sending them pictures, I was able to RMA the defective headset back. The cost to ship was about $18 which included insurance and signature. Two weeks after TB received my cracked headset, they shipped me a brand new set, which I received the first week of December. I''ve been using the new set for roughly a month. I have wrapped both extensions with a Loctite reinforced clear wrap to provide some additional support; hopefully this will help prevent it from cracking. Only time will tell. EDIT: I used this headset without any major issue for about 4 months. After that I noticed cracking on the right and left side headset extensions. I take great care of all my gaming gear. As noted below, I own the X41 and Tango. I have owned them for a few years. Both still work great -- not withstanding a few nits here and there. Unfortunately, the Stealth 500X is not designed to the same standard in terms of durability. If...'),
(N'Ashley', N'Ivanov', N'ashley.ivanov9983@example.com', '2014-11-22', 5, N'This game is good'),
(N'Michelle', N'Sullivan', N'michelle.sullivan6252@example.org', '2014-11-22', 5, N'Outstanding game, it''s fun, legitimately scary, challenging, and good story though some people say it''s hard to follow. But it starts to make more sense as the game progresses. If you want a challenging game with some intense moments then I highly recommend The Evil Within, from parts that catch you off guard to one hit boss battles, and some parts where you have to run for your life or die violently, this game isn''t for people who give up easily. So in conclusion I loved it, it''s where the RE series should have stayed.'),
(N'Susan', N'Hall', N'susan.hall3464@example.com', '2014-11-22', 1, N'ok before you write me off as a PlayStation fanboy, I''m not! I own the wii, wii u, and PS3 I own every smash game except for the 3DS version. I''m not impressed with this game, it''s too similar to Brawl, and I''ll be damned to buy an adapter to use a controller that''s 3 generations old! Why didn''t they include story mode???? Nintendo made a huge mistake by not including it, the cinematics are lacking and gameplay is very similar to brawl. All that aside, if this is the only system you own, then get the game, but I highly suggest purchasing Brawl first. This game isn''t worth the $59.99 price tag. If you''re like me and own multiple systems, do yourself favor and purchase PlayStation All Stars, the game is made extremely well, very good level design, nice selection of characters, great graphics, awesome sound, and easy pick up and play gameplay. I already sold this game and will pick up this new iteration when it goes on sale. Personally I don''t like the snide attitude of the creator of...'),
(N'Christina', N'Torres', N'christina.torres6505@example.com', '2014-11-22', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Amanda', N'Ferreira', N'amanda.ferreira9322@example.org', '2014-11-22', 5, N'8 months and still going strong. EZ to setup with windows 8. Works flawless.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Bailey', N'carolyn.bailey1872@example.net', '2014-11-23', 3, N'Its an ok game.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Jenkins', N'alexander.jenkins7936@example.org', '2014-11-23', 5, N'I am thoroughly enjoying this game. I used the dragon age keep to move my stories over and have noticed the various decisions. I got past what I would consider the first chapter and was curious about how much the story could change and went and looked it up and there is a plethora of things to change. A must buy for the dragon age fan. I do suggest if you haven''t played the others to go and do so. Or go and watch IGNs dragon age in 5 min then play with a default story line.'),
(N'Jason', N'Morales', N'jason.morales4290@example.net', '2014-11-23', 4, N'At first, I was ready to give up on the game but I stuck with it...and I''m glad I did. The graphics are very, very impressive on this game. The violence is also quite impressive from lobbing off Orc''s heads'', shoving your dagger in their skull, slitting their throat in a stealth kill...you name it, you will see every kind of violent kill you can imagine in this game. Personally, I''m OK with that, because I knew what it was going to be like before I bought the game. Being able to level up skills and your weapons with runes is a very cool idea. I like the idea that you can''t slap on 15 runes and have a weapon that''s pretty much going to carry you through the game. I''ve seen unlock slots for I think 5. I love the side missions, gathering intel on the captains you are out to kill, I love the wraith mode, I just really am impressed with virtually all aspects of this game. About the only thing I don''t like, which is my gripe on all hack and slash games is it really boils down to nothing...'),
(N'Michael', N'Cooper', N'michael.cooper5927@example.net', '2014-11-23', 5, N'It does what it needs to'),
(N'Brenda', N'Martin', N'brenda.martin3625@example.net', '2014-11-23', 4, N'I am only giving this a 4 because it is feels cheaper and handles more loose than the 360 control that Rock Candy makes. the buttons and sticks all feel very loose and free. This controller does work and installs quickly on a Win7 and Win8 computer. With a little bit of work I got this to work on a Ubuntu 12.04 and 14.04 computer for use with emulators. I could not get this to work with XP but I really did not spend a lot of time getting a modern device to work with an obsolete OS. The only real disappointment I have is that this controller does not have vibration feed back as it has no motors. Overall not a bad controller for the money.'),
(N'James', N'Coleman', N'james.coleman1668@example.org', '2014-11-23', 5, N'Excellent service, 100% positive feedback, very good item.'),
(N'Amy', N'Khan', N'amy.khan2876@example.org', '2014-11-23', 2, N'This controller could be found at "Best buy" when I originally bought it. So straight up honesty on all questions I can imagine. Pros- -Sturdy. The analogs appeared to be calibrated with an adequate stiffness (so no movement of the analogs without it properly registering in the game). -Swap in swap out handle grips. They are a nice feature. But literally... Pointless. The only difference when attaching the shell grips is needing to attach them to feel a different texture under your hands, which by the way, is hard plastic despite what the description in the products info can state otherwise. So there''s no point to this option unless you prefer "smooth" or "ribbed" under your palms. -The USB fit. -The carry case. It''s a nice place to put the controller away. Cons- -No silicone grips fit the analog sticks. -No extenders will fit the analog sticks. -No difference with attachable handle grips. -Nothing special about controller. -the "back button" sticks under the controller casing when...'),
(N'Jessica', N'Evans', N'jessica.evans9957@example.com', '2014-11-23', 5, N'I don''t know why everyone has such a problem with this game. For the amount of sheer coolness this game brings to the RPG table, i can deal with a little overlooked PC control support... To be honest I was skeptical when i received this game in the mail after reading all the complaints here on Amazon. When i was finally able to install from 4 discs i booted the game up and was blown away by the power of Direct-X 11. Tessalation? SSAO options? Magnificent! I love the Bioware compatibility with Windows and Windowed mode. :clap: I thought i would have more fun with the console version so i bought both PC & Xbox ONE editions just to satisfy my curiosity. Then i realized i could output this game in 3K-WS on my Acer Predator gaming PC. So first I began by setting all the graphics to their max settings while in boring 16:9 1080p, then after i finished i closed the game, went into Documents>Bioware>Dragon Age Inquisition>Save>Profile Options profile to change the start up resolution. By...'),
(N'Emily', N'Collins', N'emily.collins1563@example.net', '2014-11-23', 5, N'This game kills my thumbs.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Sanchez', N'lucia.sanchez5130@example.net', '2014-11-23', 4, N'gta nough.said'),
(N'Samuel', N'Young', N'samuel.young4474@example.org', '2014-11-23', 5, N'Good!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Jimenez', N'kevin.jimenez3835@example.org', '2014-11-23', 4, N'This is a pretty decent gaming headset, that is, nevertheless, not without its flaws. It''s even better for listening to music or making phone calls via PC or Mac. One of its best features is just how comfortable it feels on the ears, so if you needed to be on a Mac or a PC all day with headphones that had a mike attached, this would be a pretty good option. It''s very easy to set up. I used it on a Mac, but I know it''s really designed for the XBox and Play Station. For setting up on a Mac, all I had to do was plug the transmitter in to a USB port on my Mac, turn on the mike, then press and hold the pairing button. Once it''s been paired, all you have to do is plug in the transmitter, and turn on the mike and then go into the audio settings on the Mac so that it''s using the "2.4 GHz Wireless headset" as both the output and the input (assuming you want to use the Mike) and it works. It works good for gaming and listening to music. I do hear a bit of noise or interference before the...'),
(N'Jose', N'Price', N'jose.price2025@example.com', '2014-11-23', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Kevin', N'Phillips', N'kevin.phillips7889@example.com', '2014-11-24', 4, N'UPDATE - I had the Direct X crash yesterday. It seemed to be related to me being in Offline mode on Origin. As soon as I connected to Origin and reopened the game, it stopped crashing. Abbreviations guide: Dragon Age: Origins - DAO, Dragon Age II - DA2, Dragon Age Inquisition - DAI, Mass Effect series - ME1, ME2, and ME3. Tactical Camera View - TC. The Premise. After the events of DA2, Thedas is left in complete chaos as the war between the mages and the Templars, having left the Chantry, burns out of control. The Chantry, seeking peace, sets up a meeting...the Conclave... of mages and Templars at a neutral location: The Temple of the Sacred Ashes of DAO fame. While the Conclave is in session, an explosion wracks the Frostback Mountains, killing all the mages, Templars, and Chantry members there. The explosion tears a "Rift" in the sky over the now destroyed Temple, weakening the Veil between Thedas and the Fade. You are the sole survivor, bearing a mark that matches the...'),
(N'Sharon', N'Ortiz', N'sharon.ortiz6317@example.com', '2014-11-24', 3, N'Smash brothers has the fantastic gameplay that we all know and love, 6-8 players is fantastic and not too chaotic like others have said, but the single player experience is pretty lacking. A story mode should have been included in this game with cut scenes etc. Also the classic mode has been tweaked and now includes a coin system in which you can increase the difficulty and reap in more rewards. I found the more arcade like classic modes of previous versions to be superior to this versions. As a single player game you crave that arcade like feel of climbing up the ladder until you reach the final boss. But this game doesn''t have that feel anymore. Moving your fighter on a board and choosing your fighters definitely diminishes the intensity of a traditional arcade like experience that previous versions of smash brothers have offered as well as other fighting games. Also there is no smash the targets mode that Melee offered which is another detraction. The events mode is just ok but...'),
(N'Daniel', N'King', N'daniel.king7040@example.org', '2014-11-24', 2, N'1-1/2 years after release, it still has bugs and sometimes refuses to run.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Taylor', N'ryan.taylor2630@example.com', '2014-11-24', 5, N'awsome game'),
(N'Edward', N'Richardson', N'edward.richardson7918@example.com', '2014-11-24', 5, N'I finished the game and I can say its one of the best games ever. I was so happy to see pokemons from the very first 151.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Wood', N'sofia.wood9901@example.com', '2014-11-24', 4, N'A little too hard for my kind of game.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Wisniewski', N'jonathan.wisniewski7251@example.org', '2014-11-24', 5, N'great'),
(N'Henry', N'Campbell', N'henry.campbell4299@example.org', '2014-11-24', 5, N'All Halo greatness in one place. Genious.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Castillo', N'brenda.castillo4398@example.com', '2014-11-24', 5, N'Excellent attention and excellent product.. Thank you'),
(N'Samantha', N'Webb', N'samantha.webb2081@example.org', '2014-11-24', 1, N'So charge 110 for 20 dollar adapters because they are scarce? Oh the greed wins in this one.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Ortiz', N'nicole.ortiz4205@example.net', '2014-11-24', 5, N'love this game. In great condition'),
(N'Hannah', N'Anderson', N'hannah.anderson3709@example.org', '2014-11-24', 1, N'how can you shoot monsters in this game when they cheat and do not die after their hityou get hit once your aim is off and then the zombies keep hitting and your dead'),
(N'Patrick', N'Raghunathan', N'patrick.raghunathan7066@example.net', '2014-11-24', 5, N'I, like a ton of other people, thought that the new style of Assassins Creed gameplay found in Unity would become the basis for all future AC games. I can say I was wrong and this game truly brings the thrill back into the old mechanics. It''s a new protagonist, a new setting, save for New York, and brand new characters that definitely add to the story. Even Ubisoft, as stated by Kotaku, thought the game was garbage, considering most of the hype and advertising has been spent on ACU. But this game still rises as one of the best AC games in the series. There is much for me to tell you other than to play it, and you''ll feel much more satisfied than playing Unity, which has a short story, falt characters, and glitchy gameplay. 5 out of 5 for sure!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Stewart', N'evelyn.stewart2599@example.com', '2014-11-24', 5, N'Excellent, product was in very nice condition and plays perfectly!'),
(N'Peter', N'Cook', N'peter.cook2067@example.org', '2014-11-25', 5, N'worth buying a console for! and worth buying the next-gen Xbox One version even after purchasing the 360 - amazing improvement in graphics.'),
(N'Heather', N'Castillo', N'heather.castillo8625@example.org', '2014-11-25', 1, N'This was the worst basketball game I ever played so I not going to review this game.'),
(N'Eric', N'Sanchez', N'eric.sanchez9429@example.net', '2014-11-25', 5, N'good'),
(N'Ryan', N'Brown', N'ryan.brown7632@example.com', '2014-11-25', 1, N'I ordered this because it said it was from Pelican Accessories. What i actually received was a generic adaptor. It charges my PSP, but it''s incredibly deceptive that it was advertised specifically as a Pelican adaptor. If I had known, I would not have bought'),
(N'Stephen', N'Khan', N'stephen.khan4963@example.net', '2014-11-25', 5, N'thank u'),
(N'Ashley', N'Thompson', N'ashley.thompson9806@example.org', '2014-11-25', 5, N'BEST.GAME.EVER!!!!! Seriously, this game is so fun and addicting! It never gets boring. So many characters too choose from and to unlock. Buy this for anyone and everyone you know, you will fill their holidays with joy! Even our 3.5 y.o daughter loves this game. Any age will enjoy this game, it is so easy to learn. Now go SMASH!!!'),
(N'Betty', N'Garcia', N'betty.garcia4497@example.net', '2014-11-25', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Luis', N'Allen', N'luis.allen6782@example.net', '2014-11-25', 3, N'Game is fun was very disappointed because I couldn''t put it on windows 8 as it says on its packaging. works alright on windows 7'),
(N'Anna', N'Jimenez', N'anna.jimenez5187@example.com', '2014-11-25', 5, N'Charges my controllers.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Wang', N'nancy.wang5609@example.org', '2014-11-25', 5, N'I had experience with the Genesis version which I really liked, but this one is even better in terms of everything... so much fun, moves easy to figure out and use... graphics are fantastic, superior to Genesis, and I''m a huge Genesis fan to... Must have for any fighter fan or TMNT fan for sure!'),
(N'Debra', N'Watson', N'debra.watson8498@example.net', '2014-11-25', 5, N'*brilliantly, realistically designed cities, country, and oceans *free roam across miles of terrain *combination of a shooter, role-playing game, free roam, and movie! *intricate, realistic, twisting, dramatic storylines (Grand Theft Auto: Vice City''s dialogue script is over 1,000 pages long!) *beautiful graphics'),
(N'James', N'Turner', N'james.turner5142@example.org', '2014-11-25', 5, N'A great game controller especially for intense gamers who develop sweaty hands in the heat of battle. The air flow is a great source in keeping your hands dry and this controller is very comfortable to use with a nicely designed grip setup.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Nowak', N'jessica.nowak3809@example.net', '2014-11-25', 5, N'I will have been playing this game for four years come January 2015. Addicting and enjoyable the game has the most compelling dlc release schedule I''ve ever heard of; once every three months. That is brand new content every three months. I started on PS3 and ported my characters over to ps4 with no issue at all. No game has ever held my attention like this.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Mitchell', N'joyce.mitchell2043@example.org', '2014-11-25', 5, N'My 16 year olds favorite game'),
(N'Ashley', N'Wright', N'ashley.wright1238@example.com', '2014-11-25', 5, N'Great product. [:'),
(N'William', N'Howard', N'william.howard4573@example.net', '2014-11-26', 5, N'I can''t handle earbuds any more, so I decided to try these out. If you like Call of Duty branding, it would be hard to find that stamped in more places than on this set of headphones. The sound and fit are both excellent. These headphone also work for other games just fine, or for music. They don''t need to be used with the PS4, they can be used with any media device. But they are phenomenal with the PS4. The detachable mike works well, as does the base booster. Neither are required for use. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Davis', N'stephen.davis6600@example.org', '2014-11-26', 5, N'It does what it''s supposed to do. You can plug up to 4 GameCube controllers in order to play Smash Wii U, hopefully Nintendo will use it when GameCube games are available on the eShop. It looks good and durable, so buy one if you have the chance.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Williams', N'andrea.williams3364@example.org', '2014-11-26', 5, N'This game is the best 3ds game this year and is waaaaaaay better then brawl, I strongly recommend this to everyone who owns or wants a 3ds'),
(N'Anita', N'Baker', N'anita.baker7880@example.net', '2014-11-26', 5, N'First off let me say I needed a new replacement, as the launch of the new Smash Bros for Wii U, one of my original Jet Black GameCube controllers finally kicked the bucket after playing the new Smash all launch weekend and I got the Bundle. I had four controllers from the start (2 Old, 2 New) and decided to use my first one that came with the console (Sentiment reasons, broken in, I used it for all my GC games when I was younger). It was performing fine, until I started noticing some odd things (dropped inputs, wrong inputs, no responses). Eventually the right side stopped responding to any input. Opening it up reviewed the PCB finally gave way and broke after years of use and travel from Melee, to Brawl, Project M, and finally Sm4sh. So I had high hopes I would be getting an official controller, not a knock-off or 3rd party imitation. To my surprise I got something worth all the $30 I spent. It was a Japan Version of an Official GameCube Controller. The reason this is even better...'),
(N'Raymond', N'Thomas', N'raymond.thomas6513@example.org', '2014-11-26', 3, N'The one problem with this mouse is not an obvious one. The mouse has a wired and a wireless connection. However, if you have the wired connection active, and you wish to switch to the wireless receiver, the gaming software will not detect your mouse as soon as it is disconnected. This problem doesn''t happen every single time, but it does happen. This can be frustrating if you are playing something like Dota 2 and suddenly your buttons aren''t functioning and you have to pause the game, making 9 other people wait for you (if you are lucky) to fix your connection. Sometimes you can turn off the mouse and remove the battery, then plug the battery back in and it will be recognized, or sometimes you can change the receiver''s USB port. However, most of the time you have to restart the computer with only the wireless connection. Now that I have identified the problem my solution is going to be setting up a powered USB position for recharging without using the computer to avoid...'),
(N'Deborah', N'Kowalski', N'deborah.kowalski3452@example.org', '2014-11-26', 5, N'great game,definitely a hidden gem'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Cooper', N'stephanie.cooper6291@example.net', '2014-11-26', 5, N'Forza sets the standard for racing games on the XBox platform.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Richardson', N'kofi.richardson1985@example.net', '2014-11-26', 5, N'I can say this game was awesome. If you liked Persona and Labyrinth games this is for you. Also has Persona 3 and 4 characters in it. Would definitely recommend this because of some unique game play mechanics.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Evans', N'katherine.evans6479@example.org', '2014-11-26', 5, N'good'),
(N'Kyle', N'Gonzalez', N'kyle.gonzalez2931@example.com', '2014-11-26', 5, N'A friend recommended I get a Tekken game. I also remember my friend let me try Tekken 6, and it was fast paced and builds tension trying to defeat your opponent. I enjoyed using the character Lei Wu Long. It''s funny because his fighting style is similar to Jackie Chan''s kung fu styles, like snake and dragon, for example.'),
(N'Richard', N'Bell', N'richard.bell6644@example.com', '2014-11-27', 5, N'Such a fun game! I play this game all the time with my brothers and friends. Mario Kart has never been more fun and has NEVER looked this good!'),
(N'Richard', N'Bell', N'richard.bell6644@example.com', '2014-11-27', 5, N'An unbelievably fun game with more features than I know what to do with. I definitely feel like I got my money''s worth with this game and it is arguably the best Wii U game (so far). A must buy!'),
(N'Carol', N'Alvarez', N'carol.alvarez8930@example.net', '2014-11-27', 4, N'More of a great game to play with friends. Love the itemization.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Nguyen', N'olivia.nguyen6634@example.org', '2014-11-27', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Shirley', N'Ruiz', N'shirley.ruiz9255@example.com', '2014-11-27', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Mary', N'Chen', N'mary.chen4540@example.com', '2014-11-27', 2, N'Mine came and I was impressed at first, and I even got 3 friends to purchase this headset. Now, I feel like an ass, because the boom mic that came with this headset has a short and causes my voice to cut in and out while playing and or severe static distortion! Every time I play I have to mess with the mic and try to find a sweet spot where the mic doesn''t makes this headset impossible to use! Please send me a replacement!'),
(N'Walter', N'White', N'walter.white1670@example.org', '2014-11-27', 5, N'A must for any 32X collection (such a small library they''re all ''musts")'),
(N'Kelly', N'Jenkins', N'kelly.jenkins2341@example.com', '2014-11-27', 5, N'This game is a game changer everything in this game was awesome.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Foster', N'hannah.foster1126@example.org', '2014-11-27', 5, N'Awesome!!!!!! Seriously sweet game!!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Myers', N'nadia.myers5707@example.org', '2014-11-27', 5, N'Thank You!'),
(N'Justin', N'Harris', N'justin.harris1281@example.net', '2014-11-27', 5, N'To parents and adults who are contemplating on buying a Playstation 4 for a younger family member or relative: If you were waiting to buy a PS4 but were not sure if the ecosystem would have enough children and family friendly games, then this is the bundle for you. The Playstation 4 is known primarily as a "mature" video game console, like the Xbox One, and very different from the Wii U. But don''t be fooled, it has its share of really good kids and family games. I would go as far to say it is more family and children friendly than the Xbox One, because here is a great example. It has many Lego games that are fun for the whole family, and the Lego Batman 3 game included is the latest in the Lego DC comics franchise. As with Lego games, this game is filled with fun and sly/cynical adult humor, but in a good, light-hearted way - nothing offensive. There is also the Lego Hobbit franchise, the Lego Marvell comics franchise, and the Lego movie game. And then there is Little Big Planet....'),
(N'Emily', N'Gray', N'emily.gray1717@example.org', '2014-11-27', 5, N'I did not buy this bundle from Amazon but I have to say wow, playing gta v 1080 p / the last of us with a smooth 60 fps is beautiful. I will never go back to last gen! Well maybe :p if there''s some good triple games I haven''t played been on ps plus :D'),
(N'Thomas', N'Patel', N'thomas.patel3389@example.org', '2014-11-28', 5, N'Good game. Play in Europe and Pacific. I like the WWII theme very much. Play was nice and smooth.'),
(N'Gary', N'Okonkwo', N'gary.okonkwo9608@example.com', '2014-11-28', 3, N'cool game'),
(N'Diane', N'Morales', N'diane.morales8989@example.com', '2014-11-28', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'John', N'Suzuki', N'john.suzuki3301@example.org', '2014-11-28', 5, N'The item is in great condition. Thank u'),
(N'Joan', N'Carter', N'joan.carter5557@example.com', '2014-11-28', 5, N'Assassin''s Creed Unity had a bit of a launch failure. The game was riddled with bugs, some making the game unplayable. Because this seems to be happening more often, I generally don''t buy games like this on launch day. (Bethesda taught me that lesson) Now that several gigs worth of updates and patches have been released, I thought it would be a safe bet. I was right. So, do yourself a favor, ignore the 1 star reviews citing the bugs and glitches, they are now irrelevant. I''ve been playing AC since the original and have played all releases both console and portable up to this point. I was getting a little worried with the last couple games as they just didn''t grab me the way that the Ezio Trilogy (AC II, Brotherhood and Revelations). I contemplated giving up on the series, but I''m glad I didn''t. AC: Unity has recaptured the play and feel of the Ezio adventures. The game starts out as most AC titles do. You are an average young person, enjoying your average life. You are quickly...'),
(N'Christina', N'Reed', N'christina.reed4150@example.net', '2014-11-28', 5, N'LOVE IT'),
(N'Lucia', N'Evans', N'lucia.evans2414@example.net', '2014-11-28', 1, N'Hadn''t tried one of these in years. They haven''t changed, they are awful to play. A pity as I ride a sportbike and was looking for something to get me through the winter. Bad graphics, bad sound, and they haven''t quite distilled the experience of riding a bike. Maybe in 10 more years they''ll nail it. Maybe we need VR to pull this off.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Garcia', N'marcus.garcia6546@example.net', '2014-11-28', 3, N'If having every pokemon in game does not concern you, do NOT buy dual pack, buy either OR or AS. Dual Pack: The games are the exact same, just slight differences, playing opposite teams (Teams Aqua and Team Magma). I have so much regrets buying the dual pack for just this fact. Or else, in either game, you get to catch legendary Pokemons just once, so with both games, you get to catch each legendary Pokemon twice. Bonus: Potions are 200-300 PokeMoney a piece, yet not all that useful in game. Potions are prohibited in most online battles. Lamest bonus ever. You could''ve given a special pokemon as a bonus rather. Gameplay: Pokemon anime fan, not old Pokemon gamer or anything. The game is great and story is similar to anime in a way. There''s some puzzles to solve every now and then, the game is easy until you get to the Pokemon League, then it would take some strategy play and look up wikipedia for help knowing each pokemons weaknesses, it''s always what I do when stuck. The starters...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Carter', N'carolyn.carter5550@example.net', '2014-11-28', 3, N'I love this game, but to many people are hacking items and making them Over power thus, making the game insanely boring for online play...'),
(N'Alexander', N'Myers', N'alexander.myers2831@example.net', '2014-11-28', 5, N'love this game when i played it before thats why i bought it and the price was a steal'),
(N'Patricia', N'Tanaka', N'patricia.tanaka6488@example.com', '2014-11-28', 5, N'i love this game'),
(N'Andrea', N'Sanders', N'andrea.sanders1262@example.net', '2014-11-28', 5, N'Amazingly fun'),
(N'Christine', N'Davis', N'christine.davis5649@example.org', '2014-11-29', 5, N'great game i love it'),
(N'Ravi', N'Garcia', N'ravi.garcia9058@example.com', '2014-11-29', 4, N'So far no problems, people can hear me and I hear them very well, ive never owned a headset like this, but its seems great. Not sure if you will find it comfortable, but it fits over my ears well and i feel i have big ears. So overall: +Good fit +Good Sound +Others can hear you clearly +Long Cord +Cord has volume and mute switch -No game to chat volume in headset, but i don''t mind it as much'),
(N'Nathan', N'Phillips', N'nathan.phillips1957@example.com', '2014-11-29', 5, N'great game!!!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Campbell', N'raymond.campbell9084@example.com', '2014-11-29', 3, N'Decent wrestling game.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Ruiz', N'jacqueline.ruiz4890@example.net', '2014-11-29', 3, N'I would rate DA:Origins 5 of 5 stars (and my favorite game of all time), DA2 2.5 stars and Inquisition 3.5. If this game were actually made for the PC I would probably rate it higher. EA/Bioware has sold out the Origins fan who wanted a PC-based roleplaying sequel. As many other people have noted, this game''s controls and even its technical side is not designed for a PC user. I have read numerous other complaints from people whose systems far exceed the minimum requirements yet are experiencing system crashes and/or lag. The Dragon Age servers are just pathetic-- play only offline. I have played only as a mage, so I do not need to move nearly as much as a rogue or warrior character. The controls are undoubtedly hell for such players. There are positives, though: whereas DA 2''s critics were correct when they stated that it has too many boring subplots, this game has many FUN subplots and immersive environments. Unfortunately, the *main* storyline itself is stunningly dull. The...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Perry', N'kimberly.perry4549@example.net', '2014-11-29', 5, N'This game is actually pretty amazing. Kirby of course, almost never disappoints. take all of your favorite SNES, GBA, and NES parts of Kirby, add some more Kirby''s and you have basically one of the best handheld side-scrollers ever made.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Fisher', N'kimberly.fisher7272@example.org', '2014-11-29', 5, N'Good deal, couldn''t pass it up.'),
(N'Peter', N'Murphy', N'peter.murphy6410@example.org', '2014-11-29', 5, N'Loved it.'),
(N'Megan', N'Brown', N'megan.brown9153@example.net', '2014-11-29', 5, N'IT''S GREAT ONE LOVE IT'),
(N'Joan', N'Henderson', N'joan.henderson3307@example.org', '2014-11-29', 5, N'bueno'),
(N'Richard', N'Lopez', N'richard.lopez6278@example.net', '2014-11-29', 4, N'I really liked this shooter. I just hate that I have to pay $20 for a season pass to get the multiplayer. Anything below $29.99 is a steal on this one folks. It also has a hefty download as well as hard drive space. Expect almost 60 GBs to be taken up after all the patches download as well as the multiplayer maps. If you got this on Black Friday special for $15 or $20 then you got a STEAL. I paid $25 and its one of the best PS4 games I have.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Sullivan', N'barbara.sullivan1736@example.net', '2014-11-29', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Stephen', N'Morgan', N'stephen.morgan7830@example.com', '2014-11-29', 2, N'There is a game-breaking (and console-breaking) problem when you first play this game. Now, I got this game on Day 1 from Gamestop but it affects everyone nonetheless. When you first play this game on your Wii U, you will be prompted to download a Day 1 Update. That''s where the problems begin. Now you might see this problem occur within 1 hour, 1 day, 1 week, or just plain ol'' never. Error Code 160-0103 If you are one of the VERY few unlucky ones, your game will crash and you will get the error code mentioned above. Once you get it, Super Smash Bros for Wii U is now completely unplayable. However, every other game is. There is absolutely no way to fix it by yourself and your console must be sent back to Nintendo so they can "repair" it and allow it to play your copy of SSB4. So now you have 2 options: Never play SSB4 or trying to completely format/erase everything in the internal hard drive. DO NOT DO THE LATTER. If you try to erase everything, your console will be completely...'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Morris', N'jennifer.morris4120@example.com', '2014-11-29', 5, N'Absolutely love it. Played terrible in 360. I''m glad I bought an Xbox one. This game is so fun. I love everything about it. It takes a bit to get into it however so just stick in there. Loved the story of origins a bit better but flat out, this game is fun for me. It''s my favorite after game only after origins. If u r a fan do not pass this up. Trust me. Just stick thru the beginning until Haven. Advice: make sure to utilize UR regen and rock armor potions.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Taylor', N'victoria.taylor3053@example.net', '2014-11-29', 4, N'Its like they added a huge expansion to Far Cry 3. So much stayed the same its hard to think of it as a new game. Thats not a bad thing though as I loved Far Cry 3. The world is expansive with lots to explore. I like that they force you to at least attempt some of the side quests to unlock some weapons and skills. I like the new enemies, hunters, that prevent you from dispatching a whole base/outpost just by releasing some caged animal. Not sure I liked the ending or the choices that lead to it. Not to give a spoiler but your left choosing between 3 nearly equally bad outcomes as the "good" ending leaves a lot to be desired. Seems like poor Kyrat will never get a break.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Green', N'anthony.green8846@example.com', '2014-11-29', 5, N'I love this game. I just wish, you could get married, in this game, as you can, in the other Harvest Moon Games.'),
(N'Anita', N'Davis', N'anita.davis5737@example.net', '2014-11-29', 2, N'Was not nearly as fun or dynamic as the Bioshock Infinite base game. Good for fans of the franchise, but not for newcomers who only appreciated Infinite.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Jones', N'sofia.jones9182@example.com', '2014-11-29', 4, N'This game is great! I picked it up after Fallout3 and this is an improvement. There are so many ways this game can go in terms of how it ends. It''s one that can keep you involved and interested for months! Then, you''ll want to go back in a try other ways to change the outcome.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Collins', N'shirley.collins4963@example.net', '2014-11-30', 4, N'One of the best Star Wars games out there. Decent story and great action cinematic moments make this game a must have for Star Wars fans. The action and fighting is fast and intense, the Jedi powers make you feel like a badass as well.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Taylor', N'aisha.taylor5222@example.net', '2014-11-30', 5, N'Excellent game! You will no regrets if you buy it!'),
(N'Edward', N'Ortiz', N'edward.ortiz5020@example.com', '2014-11-30', 5, N'Kids loved playing this.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Henderson', N'nicholas.henderson3440@example.net', '2014-11-30', 5, N'Excellent product'),
(N'Joyce', N'Howard', N'joyce.howard3665@example.org', '2014-11-30', 5, N'I am a 6''7" man whose hands usually engulf the PS4 controller. These made the controller a little mroe bulky and comfortable in my hands. I did not buy them for "sweat absorption" and never had an issue with this so I cannot comment on that feature. They are quite comfortable and easy to apply. If I get a SCUF controller, I will order again.'),
(N'Christina', N'Wang', N'christina.wang4895@example.org', '2014-11-30', 1, N'It''s junk. Doesn''t fit properly. Partially covers the buttons. Ans there is a lot of movement. So basically, this is pure trash! DO NOT PURCHASE...'),
(N'Karen', N'Ward', N'karen.ward2234@example.net', '2014-11-30', 3, N'an ok game but not a good sequel too parasite eve'),
(N'Sharon', N'Young', N'sharon.young8493@example.com', '2014-11-30', 3, N'I actually returned this game because I felt like I was playing Wii graphics on a ps4. I mean I know that it''s no pc standard, but this game doesn''t even come close to ps4 capabilities'),
(N'Stephen', N'Thomas', N'stephen.thomas3684@example.org', '2014-11-30', 5, N'I bought this for my nephew''s birthday and he Loved it! He was Happy I got him his own Headset. His friends on xbox live had one except him. The sound from the headset is pretty great and the blue light glow makes it look cool, especially when playing in a room with little or no light. I also like the fact that the setup was very easy. My nephew loves it, I love it, so I am giving it a 5 Star!'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ortiz', N'rachel.ortiz9940@example.net', '2014-11-30', 5, N'as expected & as advertised!'),
(N'Mark', N'Bailey', N'mark.bailey3692@example.com', '2014-11-30', 5, N'Hot dang, this is my jam.'),
(N'Mei', N'Young', N'mei.young1696@example.net', '2014-11-30', 3, N'They don''t hold the charge but say they are fully recharged. Blaming the charger cord doesn''t seem logical.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Torres', N'sarah.torres8051@example.net', '2014-11-30', 5, N'I love it! The xbox one version works beautifully and has terrific graphics. A great buy in xbox one format.'),
(N'Frank', N'Howard', N'frank.howard5636@example.net', '2014-11-30', 5, N'Epic'),
(N'Barbara', N'Smith', N'barbara.smith7658@example.net', '2014-12-01', 3, N'In case this review is too long, I''ll give you the BLUF (bottom line, up front): I want so much to like this platform. I keep getting so into gaming on it, and then put it down for weeks. Since I still pick up my (very) old and battered PSP and play a few sports games on it from time to time, I am sure that I''ll stick with the Vita long enough to make this a lasting (if not on-again off-again) relationship. The bad? The OS is childish and strange. Tapping through a series of menus for the simplest of actions. This clunkiness will lead you to use your cell phone for all of those extra feature that ''should'' make the Vita shine (music, tv, etc). The ''cute'' buttons give me the feeling of playing on some made for kids tablet, like a leapfrog. -1 Star The browser is odd. It would be forgivable if the WiFi chip weren''t so agonizingly weak. It is slow, non-intuitive, and cranky. I has a larger screen than my phone and I would rather use that to surf. Nuff said on that. -.5 Star The...'),
(N'Gary', N'Kelly', N'gary.kelly2137@example.com', '2014-12-01', 4, N'so far so good. I have just been playing through the solo game for now because I heard of all of the bugs. I am sure they will fix these bugs. Hopefully before I am done with part 4.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Raghunathan', N'alexander.raghunathan8368@example.net', '2014-12-01', 5, N'It is a gift'),
(N'Nancy', N'Gray', N'nancy.gray1022@example.com', '2014-12-01', 5, N'5 stars. You can create your own player. The creators included dozens of cheats, hidden characters, special privileges, and hidden courts!'),
(N'Emma', N'Ramirez', N'emma.ramirez7870@example.org', '2014-12-01', 5, N'ty :)'),
(N'Helen', N'Wisniewski', N'helen.wisniewski8618@example.org', '2014-12-01', 5, N'good'),
(N'Barbara', N'Mendoza', N'barbara.mendoza5567@example.com', '2014-12-01', 5, N'Purchased as a Christmas gift for my Grandson. I know he will love it!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Okonkwo', N'cynthia.okonkwo3861@example.net', '2014-12-01', 4, N'It Works Great!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Jimenez', N'elizabeth.jimenez9601@example.com', '2014-12-01', 5, N'Needed a extra remote for my wiiU new new WiiU is a great system'),
(N'Melissa', N'Lopez', N'melissa.lopez4167@example.net', '2014-12-01', 4, N'Wow. When this came out I was blown away because someone finally gave me a "kick em in the family jewels" option (which never gets old). Too bad it was never continued. It was a fun game that needed more content. Not only could you just kick a guy off a cliff if you didn''t feel like fighting, being able to set up or position yourself to knock over heavy items onto enemies, burn them with a well placed blast of flame from your hands while they were standing in oil or freezing the floor beneath them and kicking them across the ice was awesome. I really don''t like the Might and Magic card games but this RPG/FPS style won me over until they decided to not continue with the title. (Frowny face). Well worth the asking price though.'),
(N'Helen', N'Garcia', N'helen.garcia3299@example.net', '2014-12-01', 4, N'This game will get high reviews pretty much anywhere you look. The voice acting was stellar, with a great vocabulary that didn''t talk down to you like you were stupid, and has the guy who played Megabyte in the cartoon series Reboot so who couldn''t like that? The story is also compelling with treachery, evil, and less black and white than gray. You''ll be kept wanting to see more. I didn''t even mind the over use of block puzzles as much as some. So the reason for a non-perfect score? Technically, the game is as ancient as its PS1 port and it shows. The aforementioned block puzzles as filler and some clipping are signs of the times it came out, but they''re not game ruining. I have to break my notes about the game play into two sections, the game mechanics as they were intended and how it runs on a new system. The only real problems I had with the game itself, other than somewhat shoddy button detection that will have you sometimes striking a door a couple of times before it opens, is...'),
(N'Deborah', N'King', N'deborah.king8595@example.org', '2014-12-01', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Daniel', N'Diaz', N'daniel.diaz5817@example.net', '2014-12-01', 4, N'Great deal, fast shipment.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Brooks', N'raymond.brooks6441@example.com', '2014-12-01', 5, N'Major winner here! Better than the tablet/smartphone version. You can actually see what is going on and the graphics are excellent. This also has exclusive levels only for the PS3.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Butler', N'yuki.butler7952@example.com', '2014-12-01', 1, N'((Intro)) While I''ve never been a fan of BioWare and its games such as KOTOR, Jade Empire and the Mass Effect Trilogy, popular console RPGs that were also available on PC, I''ve always had soft spots for Baldur''s Gate 2 and Dragon Age Origins PC version. After the monumentally disappointing Dragon Age 2, EA and BioWare launched a massive PR campaign saying they would fix all the wrong doings of the past sins. Haha, EA has said the same thing year in year out with Madden Series. Before I delve into my review, I want to say that how much you will enjoy this game is entirely up to whether you''ve enjoyed Dragon Age Origins on PC or Consoles. I''m not interested in condemning those who actually enjoy this game. I am only interested in informing those who loved the PC version of Dragon Age Origins what they should expect with this game. You might still find this game enjoyable. If you actually enjoyed DA O or DA2 on the console version, you will probably have better chance enjoying this...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ivanov', N'cynthia.ivanov9861@example.net', '2014-12-01', 2, N'Currently dissatisfied. Ruined the screen protector because the protector wasn''t marked on which side sticks to the screen. Got it attached but now I need a new one to fix the issue all the issues with lint that got stuck to it when I was trying to rub out the bubbles. Note to others. Make sure you put the right side down because the peel me label isn''t very clear.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Gomez', N'rachel.gomez1721@example.org', '2014-12-01', 5, N'Very happy with my purchase. My son can''t stop playing it'),
(N'Samuel', N'Carter', N'samuel.carter7853@example.org', '2014-12-01', 5, N'Tomodachi life is so fun! This was the first game I purchased for my 3ds. I like how you can just play at your leisure. It''s very interactive, and its even more fun when you can meet people via street pass! I would reccomend this to any casual gamer looking for a fun and easy game, and more advanced gamers who want something to play that''s easy and relaxing.'),
(N'Wei', N'Smith', N'wei.smith4799@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'Awesome!!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Scott', N'samuel.scott9749@example.org', '2014-12-02', 5, N'I am new to the Farcry franchise, but I have always heard good things. I have traditionally been a COD player, with the emphasis on online multiplayer. I was so disappointed in COD AW that I wanted to give Farcry a try, and I couldn''t be more impressed. This game is absolutely stunning. I don''t even know where to begin. The story is great, the landscape is gorgeous, and the game play is dynamic and constantly exciting. I know there were some reviews from long time Farcry fans that complained that this version is not much different than Farcry 3, but take it from me, COD AW was so divergent from previous installments that it just completely let me down. Familiarity is a good thing in gaming, and slowly evolving your franchise is a smart way to keep fans. What I love about this game is the diversity of game play style and different types of activity that you can get involved in. There''s a GTA feel to it with the driving and open world missions. This game does what some of the bigger...'),
(N'Deborah', N'Chen', N'deborah.chen9488@example.org', '2014-12-02', 3, N'The game is challenging,that''s why I play it. I don''t think Tyris is sexy per say,but I like her drive. Its said you barely get to ride the beasts but that is a flat out lie. I revel in riding the really big ones. All in all,the game is ok. Its a take it or leave it choice. The bonus levels are a plus to really kill time and brush up your skills, especially your counters that''s really vital to come out victorious.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Ivanov', N'shirley.ivanov5232@example.net', '2014-12-02', 1, N'I can''t even describe how frustrating this game was to play. It was NO fun and a large part of it was irritation because of how it''s produced. Things are hard to activate when clicking on them. Things have different names other than what we in the U.S. call them. Map is very poor. Hint button tells you hints that you can''t do because you haven''t got the second or third part of the key. JUMPS AROUND EVERYWHERE, in and out of this world plus the mirror world! Things make NO SENSE at times at all. Example:: You find a hand drill. Next you have to find a "bit" to go with it. That''s not enough, now it says you still have to find something to hold it with. So you naturally think of a case or gloves or something that holds. NOPE....what you have to find is the handle that "Doesn''t" hold it, but rather allows you to turn the drill bit round and round in order to do it''s job. Then the drill plays almost NO ROLL in the next step or the game, as so many things are anti-climatic. YOU find a...'),
(N'Lauren', N'Raghunathan', N'lauren.raghunathan2377@example.com', '2014-12-02', 5, N'The Stainless Steel patch opens up a whole new realm of faction and game-play options; but for some reason, no matter who I play, my game keeps crashing at 1150... about 50 turns into the game. It sure is fun up to there though.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Collins', N'nicole.collins9223@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'I love Metroid Other M!! This game is amazing and is so much fun! I love how the graphics looks real and Samus amazing also I love how this game has the characters talking! :) If you pay attention to the game you can feel like you''re in the game and it''s awesome! I love the story as well, the story of Samus and how the baby metroid had saved her is really cool! The game is also kinda like an epic movie which makes it even more fun and interesting! I''m a huge fan of Metroid and this game gets 5 stars and 10/10!'),
(N'Dee', N'Sanchez', N'dee.sanchez9079@example.org', '2014-12-02', 2, N'Its not entertaining'),
(N'Timothy', N'Brooks', N'timothy.brooks9999@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'This is my second set of SteelSeries Siberia. My other pair is arctic white with a cool blue glow (with programmable pulse). I LOVE them. They are the most comfortable gaming headphones I have ever owned. Therefore, I was really stoked to see this new set with FULLY programmable illumination!! (As a female gamer, I am kinda that geek who loves these type of details.) I cannot even tell you how much time I have invested in playing with these headphones ... it is almost hilarious! Like my first set, these are tremendously comfortable. The ear cups are very gentle on the ears ... I can testify to this since I just spent the last four hours leveling a Blood Elf Rogue to 100 in W.o. W. Not one moment of discomfort or readjusting. And, the sound is exactly as expected -- fantastic! I had no problems with vent. (And if you have never seen a SteelSeries mic, you might wonder if it is effective ... trust me, it is!) I cannot foresee the longevity of this particular headset. What I can tell...'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Cox', N'jacqueline.cox5025@example.com', '2014-12-02', 5, N'Power through the learning curve and you will enjoy hours of gameplay with one of the top DS games of all times. You get to use the stylus because you HAVE to use the stylus (majority of DS games can be played with only the keys, so that''s a neat thing); TWEWY is one of the few games that fully utilized the DS gameplay capacity. The learning curve for me was in using all the buttons simultaneously with the stylus, and actually having to keep an eye out on both bottom and top screens. Once you get a hang of it, it''s really fun. You could probably power through the game with button mashing and screen scratching if you needed to... Unique art style but with a noticeable Square Enix/Kingdom Hearts feel, earworm soundtrack, gripping story, character development (glory to that), lovable characters, many hours of gameplay, clothes, pins, food to collect, and an extra chapter after you finish the game that is hilarious when you compare it to the main story'),
(N'Shirley', N'Peterson', N'shirley.peterson2902@example.com', '2014-12-02', 4, N'My favorite game'),
(N'Deborah', N'Baker', N'deborah.baker8704@example.org', '2014-12-02', 5, N'It works just fine for what I''m using it for. You hook one end to your wii or gamecube, and hook the other end to your controller. It''s very useful if you have a big living room so you don''t have to sit a couple of inches from your TV. I have no complaints. I would recommend this product.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Martinez', N'timothy.martinez3664@example.com', '2014-12-02', 5, N'BTPS is a great game. I am a die-hard Borderlands 1 and 2 (plus DLCs) fan, and BTPS is in the same style. The Aussie accents are new, but I have come to really like all the down under slang. The game got really good after I hit level 12 or so, and found several different types of vehicles. The numerous locations, creatures, and weapons is just like in BL 1 and 2. I love looting, finding new weapons and shields, and upgrading skills. This game is a great addition to the BL family.'),
(N'Mary', N'Carter', N'mary.carter5021@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'This is my Game of the Year for 2014 for sure, its fantastic for anyone, and especially for fans of Middle Earth stories. Shadow of Mordor sports the free-running style of Assassins Creed, and the combat system of the Arkham series (why not borrow from the greats, right!). You travel throughout the lands of Mordor in this open world and fight off Urkus, and their leaders; thats the basic story (trust me, its much better than I am making it seem). I only hope that this is the beginning entry to a long series in Middle Earth. The game has great mechanics, looks fantastic, and encourages you to explore and fool around outside of the main story. The Nemesis system, as many people have said, is a unique part of the game that makes the world feel very fluid and real. As you get further into the game, you gain more control over abilities that help you manipulate the world for the better. This is a welcome addition to not just this game, but to the world of video games, and hopefully itll...'),
(N'Wei', N'Boyd', N'wei.boyd6330@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'Great service and great product...'),
(N'Wei', N'Boyd', N'wei.boyd6330@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'Great game, worth the investment.'),
(N'Wei', N'Boyd', N'wei.boyd6330@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'it was every thing that was promised.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Peterson', N'douglas.peterson9297@example.net', '2014-12-02', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Richard', N'Parker', N'richard.parker7415@example.com', '2014-12-02', 5, N'greate'),
(N'Nancy', N'Gray', N'nancy.gray1022@example.com', '2014-12-03', 5, N'5 STAR CLASSIC'),
(N'Amy', N'Coleman', N'amy.coleman4800@example.org', '2014-12-03', 5, N'The game is awesome. Although the story is really short I like the game play. The special edition is awesome too, specially because of the hardcover. Since i have another one my brother is using it, but it fits perfectly the PS Vita (the first version, not the slim one). Mine is PCHJ-10008. I haven''t use the skin yet but it looks ok. And the velvet pouch is cool, the quality is good. So if you know the game and are deciding between the normal edition and the limited one I would say go for the Limited Edition. The hard cover case it''s awesome. And although it doesn''t come with any in-game bonus, the skin, hardcover, pouch and lithograph is worth the price.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Perez', N'anthony.perez2868@example.net', '2014-12-03', 5, N'Perfect, just as described and works perfectly. A+ all the way.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Allen', N'andrea.allen8159@example.org', '2014-12-03', 5, N'This game completely over came my expectations.... it is sooo much fun.... its a shooter.... no brainer.... but story is cool... plays great and looks great.... no hype made about it but defenetly an underrated game....'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Morris', N'kimberly.morris3299@example.org', '2014-12-03', 5, N'as advertised!'),
(N'Angela', N'Russell', N'angela.russell9865@example.net', '2014-12-03', 4, N'Awesome game and it beat going to Gamestop.'),
(N'Heather', N'Ruiz', N'heather.ruiz1652@example.net', '2014-12-03', 3, N'Controls suck something horrible since it''s considering the old DS'' lack of a control stick. You basically have to use the touch screen to move making most if not all of those crazy jumping puzzles impossible.'),
(N'Anna', N'Lewis', N'anna.lewis1734@example.org', '2014-12-03', 5, N'Kids loved this video game'),
(N'Katherine', N'Morgan', N'katherine.morgan6458@example.org', '2014-12-03', 3, N'Vibration on the controller is broken and the controller was not packed very safely.'),
(N'Eric', N'Reed', N'eric.reed6650@example.com', '2014-12-03', 5, N'Good.'),
(N'Larry', N'Ali', N'larry.ali8414@example.org', '2014-12-03', 5, N'a'),
(N'Helen', N'Peterson', N'helen.peterson6293@example.net', '2014-12-03', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Judith', N'Cook', N'judith.cook4282@example.net', '2014-12-03', 4, N'money'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Rodriguez', N'cheryl.rodriguez2140@example.org', '2014-12-04', 4, N'I got this for my boyfriend and he really liked it, thanks :)'),
(N'Kelly', N'Flores', N'kelly.flores3011@example.com', '2014-12-04', 4, N'Fun game. Very fast paced compared to other hunting style games. Frequent load times though.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ward', N'brandon.ward9944@example.net', '2014-12-04', 5, N'Excellent product'),
(N'Patrick', N'Price', N'patrick.price8662@example.com', '2014-12-04', 5, N'Tbh when I bought the mouse, I had no idea what DPI was so I just bought one very high, When I first plugged it in I was like whattttt. Anyway as for the cord and plugging it in, it isn''t bad at all. The cord is at least 6 ft long and is neat and stylish. The coolest features are the five programmable modes and the menu. You can change the controls for all nine buttons on the mouse and the color for each mode as seen in the pictures. Simply click apply to see your changes instantly. The mouse does have a slightly rough exterior which feels weird and cool at the same time btw. I got the mouse for for 30 bucks so it was a very good deal and well worth it. Consider picking one up if it fits your liking.'),
(N'Mei', N'Edwards', N'mei.edwards7654@example.org', '2014-12-04', 3, N'After the last release, The Shattered Medallion, I was hoping for much better. I guess this is better??? But all in all, I was a little underwhelmed. Yes, we got back to an actual mystery, but I still felt very bored throughout, even though I enjoyed most of the puzzles (except for the seeds). Maybe it was the story or lack thereof, or maybe the writing. The highlight of this game for me, was the Grigor character. The rest of the cast, including Nancy, fell flat. It just seems like the magic in these games has been lost in the last few installments. Also, something nagged me throughout the entire game. Why is there a whole elaborate connecting underworld set, but no way for the audience to even view it, except maybe in bits and pieces raised via lift. It was really just like just one big playground for the bad guys. Hello...Wouldn''t that tip you off that there are a few people here that are a bit off? Real fire burning down below (even though they half-explained why) was for no...'),
(N'Peter', N'Ortiz', N'peter.ortiz8888@example.com', '2014-12-04', 5, N'Great game for a good price. The graphics and story are both good and I''d recommend this game to anyone who liked prototype.'),
(N'Carol', N'Butler', N'carol.butler2191@example.com', '2014-12-04', 5, N'Great Product, thank you very much'),
(N'Michael', N'Garcia', N'michael.garcia5196@example.org', '2014-12-04', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Christina', N'Kim', N'christina.kim9019@example.org', '2014-12-04', 5, N'First let''s get some important things out of the way first. 1) This ships from China, so expect 2 week+ delivery time. 2) This ships from China, so expect Chinese quality. More so because this is a clone of other popular gaming mice out there. Clones are ideal for their cheapness and obvious likeness to the original product. Rarely are they as durable as their templates. 3) The actual brand of this mouse is "RHorse." Not sure why it''s "Suppion." I''ve noticed a couple other mice with the "RHorse" brand out there yet under different product names on Amazon. Gotta love China''s copyright laws/regulations. 4) The right and left click buttons are nearly silent- the wheel, and thumb buttons are noisy. Now a little bit more detail. I love this mouse so far. I bought it because I play SC2 on my university''s computers and did not want to bother the other students nearby with all my clicking. Fyi, I make sure the computer lab we have is at least 40% empty before playing- education comes first...'),
(N'Henry', N'Rodriguez', N'henry.rodriguez6316@example.com', '2014-12-04', 5, N'If you plan on getting your memory cards for the PSP than you''re going to have to get it on Amazon. Because gamestop no longer sells them so that is why i have to get from the marketplace so do yourself a favor get the PSP memory cards online because at the one they only sell the system and the games yet and believe me it has a whole bunch of fun games that you can still play.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Wang', N'jerry.wang2902@example.org', '2014-12-04', 4, N'Usual good Halo series.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Wang', N'jerry.wang2902@example.org', '2014-12-04', 1, N'worse game I have ever had. Mickey Mouse would have been much better.'),
(N'Karen', N'Webb', N'karen.webb7612@example.com', '2014-12-04', 5, N'If you want to play at midnight of release go elsewhere. If you do not want to drive for an hour to get the game, this is the way to go!'),
(N'Helen', N'Hill', N'helen.hill1468@example.org', '2014-12-04', 4, N'The Good: The game looks amazing, I am a huge graphics guy. I want the graphics of a game to live up to the potential of the new gen consoles and this game does. The game play is the best of the series. The Bad: The story line is about 22 hours long and to complete all of the side quests you will have about another 18 hours wrapped up in the game. With the cost of these games I want 60-100 hours of play. The sniper rifle''s could have better scopes (better zoom). I wish there was more customization. In all I would say this is the best game of the new gen systems I have played so far.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Diaz', N'aaron.diaz9170@example.net', '2014-12-04', 4, N'Ehhhhhh Far Cry 4 is alright. Endless possibilities of stuff to do, similar like the last one. My main complaint about this game is the motion sickness it causes. The Far Cry series are the only games that I have ever came across that cause me to get sick. I use MotionEaze before I play, making it perfectly manageable. I admit that I get tired of this game very easily... I''ve currently been much more hooked on Dragon Age: Inquisition and a replay of GTA5 (mixed in with some Destiny multiplayer). As far as I can see the story is a little bit weaker than Far Cry 3. Even though its repetitive this is still a wonderful FPS placed in a beautiful world full of interesting characters and intimidating villains. Solid 4/5'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ramos', N'michelle.ramos3954@example.net', '2014-12-04', 5, N'Awesome. Just make sure you have the wii handle cord set right and it''s easily inserted.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Mitchell', N'shirley.mitchell3457@example.net', '2014-12-04', 5, N'It is a necessity when playing the Move games and for the most part, the controller works great. I''ve found that after playing for a while, it needs to be re-calibrated, and this can get annoying, but it''s worth it to enjoy the fun of the games.'),
(N'Peter', N'Jackson', N'peter.jackson7434@example.com', '2014-12-05', 5, N'This is the best Horror game for the PSP. Now, that''s not saying much as there''s only three such games for the PSP that I know of. However, as a Silent Hill game, this is great. The graphics are on par with Silent Hill 2, 3, or 4. And the story is interesting as well, although it is a bit short compared to other Silent Hill''s. Overall, this game is a great portable version of Silent Hill, it doesn''t feel like a portable game, it feels like a PS2 game on my PSP. 5 Stars, highly recommended.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Mitchell', N'samuel.mitchell3281@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'My first FiFA soccer game was FIFA 97. I was played FIFA series until 2002. After then, I played PES series. And PES 6 was best in whole PES series for me. FIFA 15 is my first FIFA series in PS3 and PS4 era. FIFA and PES is quite different from each other. I was played PES for a long time, so PES is friendly to me. But, FIFA 15 if fun to me. I like their micro control, and new defense system. Maybe I''ll play PES15 later, because PES 15 got a great review. Nevertheless, I''ll keep play FIFA series. It is difficult, but fun.'),
(N'Brian', N'Morris', N'brian.morris3058@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Wonderful Christmas presents.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Ali', N'stephen.ali9406@example.com', '2014-12-05', 4, N'wii cocole is osome it worth mony it plays lego batman2 lego batman not lego batman3 wiiu dos thoy and it plays spider man ege of time for more infore maschiene go to shop amozon and tipe all game for wii to see how meny games thave got for wii'),
(N'Sofia', N'Lewis', N'sofia.lewis6111@example.net', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Kids love it'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Tanaka', N'benjamin.tanaka8842@example.com', '2014-12-05', 4, N'An amazingly comfortable headset for extended gaming sessions. Crisp mic sound allows easy communication with team mates. I have been able to keep a multiple hour gaming session going in these and felt no pain in my ears. The two downsides is that the audio quality will not impress for listening to music, despite the CCAW voice coils and neodynium drivers, the other being that the cord is not braided and is rather short unless you use the extension provided with the headset. A minor gripe is that some of the stamped parts makes slight clanking sounds when you move your head around, but that is easily remedied with a dab of hot glue. So on a scale from 1-5 Comfort: 5 Sound Clarity: 5 Music Performance: 3 Mic: 5 Ergonomics: 5'),
(N'Zachary', N'Richardson', N'zachary.richardson6562@example.net', '2014-12-05', 4, N'Easy to use.'),
(N'Mei', N'James', N'mei.james8059@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'tremendo juego'),
(N'Larry', N'Tanaka', N'larry.tanaka8827@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'It made the PSP system so much fun to play on a AV television. It''s like one of those "plug it ''n'' play it" controls.'),
(N'Larry', N'Tanaka', N'larry.tanaka8827@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'I can''t deny it. I love it. It makes the PSP so easy to carry in my pockets.'),
(N'Judith', N'Perry', N'judith.perry7155@example.com', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Fast shipping, item as described!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Moore', N'samantha.moore4171@example.net', '2014-12-05', 3, N'Not much tactile feel, requires a seperate USB cable for charging, buttons a bit too small, method for activating alternative characters are not as intuitive as they could be, doesn''t feel to add much bulk or weight to the controller though, grips on with reasonable strength'),
(N'Samantha', N'Roberts', N'samantha.roberts6962@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Nice so you don''t have to worry about having a headset on all the time.'),
(N'Anna', N'Russell', N'anna.russell3602@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Nicole', N'Edwards', N'nicole.edwards7673@example.org', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Amazing!'),
(N'Luis', N'Ortiz', N'luis.ortiz3148@example.com', '2014-12-05', 3, N'It works as a charger like it says it does and is better than the one that came with the system as it don''t have a huge big huge block that gets in the way and does act like an AC adaptor as well but do recommend that it be plugged into a wall socket for best results as noticed mild heating problem if done any other way....'),
(N'Aaron', N'Diaz', N'aaron.diaz9170@example.net', '2014-12-05', 5, N'I just got these thumb grips today and I have been messing around with them for a few hours. All I can say is that this pack of thumb grips KILLS KontrolFreaks grips, for much cheaper at that. Also, the KontrolFreaks grips clip on to the joysticks, causing the material to wear down where the clips have been placed, ruining the original joysticks. These grips simply slide over the original joysticks providing extra movement, control, and traction. I will never go back to using stock joysticks with no thumb attachments. I recommend this product to anyone browsing for the best buy. 5 stars'),
(N'Sarah', N'Boyd', N'sarah.boyd4993@example.com', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Wood', N'nicole.wood8535@example.net', '2014-12-05', 1, N'Didn''t buy this'),
(N'Deborah', N'Khan', N'deborah.khan7774@example.net', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Excellent recommend 100%'),
(N'Henry', N'Peterson', N'henry.peterson6472@example.net', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Great, simple, good looking, erganomic mouse.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Ross', N'sharon.ross3257@example.com', '2014-12-05', 5, N'Awesome product, price and quality!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Bennett', N'thomas.bennett5476@example.org', '2014-12-06', 5, N'Simple put, the greatest game of all-time.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Bennett', N'thomas.bennett5476@example.org', '2014-12-06', 5, N'Use to have these games, Metal Gear Solid, MGS 2: Guns of Patriots, MGS 3: Snake Eater, when they first came out but they stolen. Glad to have a chance to get them back and beat them again. Truly awesome games right here! Remember: "Only a fool trusts his life to a weapon."'),
(N'Barbara', N'Morales', N'barbara.morales4729@example.net', '2014-12-06', 5, N'This was my first and so far my only charger for my xbox one controllers. I really can''t compare them to others because I have not used any others, but they work as they are supposed to. When they get low on energy, you can simply plug it in while playing with the usb cable provided, which is of good length.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Walker', N'thomas.walker1145@example.org', '2014-12-06', 2, N'The Sims 3: Supernatural is not for everyone. You might very well enjoy having the ability to create vampires, werewolves, fairies, ghosts, etc. that each have their own unique abilities. However, my biggest problem with the expansion was when I wanted to play with normal Sims. I didn''t like that how during the full moon, zombies could come out of the ground or werewolves and vampires could turn normal Sims. For this reason, I ended up disabling it in the options. I didn''t like it but you very well might depending on your play style.'),
(N'Walter', N'Butler', N'walter.butler5370@example.com', '2014-12-06', 5, N'Great product! Works great!'),
(N'Luis', N'Carter', N'luis.carter7787@example.com', '2014-12-06', 5, N'Item delivered as expected. Thank you.'),
(N'Wei', N'Sanchez', N'wei.sanchez9231@example.org', '2014-12-06', 3, N'This game is alright but it''s just not as good as I thought it would be.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Reed', N'rebecca.reed7896@example.com', '2014-12-06', 5, N'Exactly what I wanted and expected, and the product got to my house quickly.'),
(N'Noah', N'Kowalski', N'noah.kowalski2477@example.org', '2014-12-06', 5, N'Great deal!!!!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Lee', N'cynthia.lee6393@example.com', '2014-12-06', 5, N'The best Smash Game out there. If you haven''t heard of this game. GOOGLE IT, YOUTUBE IT. Just check it out and then buy it, cause I know you will love it. This bundle is awesome. Luckily I was one of the first to place a preorder on this before it went out of stock/became ridiculously expensive. This was originally 99.99 (total savings of $10).. not people are listing it for 199.99... yea OK. no. haha wait until amazon restocks them!:) If you want to read my full review for this game just click on my name and search for the super smash bros for wii u review!:) I don''t feel like writing two haha'),
(N'Richard', N'Watson', N'richard.watson6337@example.org', '2014-12-07', 5, N'My granddaughter will be thrilled with this Christmas gift. Thanks for the fast delivery to.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Watson', N'gregory.watson7582@example.net', '2014-12-07', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Michael', N'Tanaka', N'michael.tanaka2191@example.org', '2014-12-07', 5, N'Bought it for a friend. I assume it''s exactly like mine? Haha.'),
(N'Heather', N'Hill', N'heather.hill1749@example.com', '2014-12-07', 4, N'I bought this mouse from Best Buy, I need a mouse fast after my old Razer Naga broke. So far about ~2 weeks the mouse is fantastic, might need time for you hand to get used to but overall a great mouse, I mainly use it for League of Legends and World of Warcraft and I see no delay, and the mouse aesthetics just looks beautiful and so godly. Also, lightweight. I gave it 4 stars because its not worth the $150 i paid for it, and Razer knows that.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Webb', N'shirley.webb6940@example.net', '2014-12-07', 5, N'This headset works great - my son (8 yrs old) took it out from the box - plugged it in his Xbox 360 controller and just works - sounds is excellent - the price is amazing and a great product'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Moore', N'kimberly.moore7425@example.com', '2014-12-07', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Anita', N'Webb', N'anita.webb5347@example.com', '2014-12-07', 5, N'Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War -- Dark Crusade Nice strategy game. Addicting. Best of all. I don''t need the CD/DVD to play this game... after installing it.'),
(N'Brian', N'Kowalski', N'brian.kowalski3824@example.net', '2014-12-07', 1, N'Pros: You get to play as your favorite Marvel character. Cons: Filled with bugs from the jump. I had to replay the first mission several times just to get the boss to spawn. Bugs that should have been fixed with ease have yet to be and it''s very disappointing. The vehicle controls are absolute garbage, Makes what should be an enjoyable experience a nightmare. The combat system is also a disappointment, It''s very shallow. Repetitive and boring missions such as placing a piece of furniture 100 times. Makes the game very tedious and proves how little effort they actually put into it. If you want any real campaign, You''ll have to shell out another 35 dollars for one of the play sets. Even then it''s not much value to it. Aside from exploring the painfully small world, There is nothing to do. Even playing with a friend doesn''t help. Unless you plan on spending hours upon hours creating a whole world by yourself, You are gonna get sick of it real quick. Overall: Disney Infinity is nothing...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Evans', N'carolyn.evans3736@example.net', '2014-12-07', 5, N'Kids will have fun w/ it all day if you leave them,,, Great Purchase,,, 100% Happy Kids at Home.......'),
(N'Anthony', N'Murphy', N'anthony.murphy2396@example.com', '2014-12-07', 4, N'I chose these in advance for heavy usage (Dragon Age Inquisition release!). Especially in games that you use the R3 or L3 to move your character for long periods of walking, this is a thumb saver. It''s comfortable and I like the mold on this much better than the PS4. Long hours in a big game like DA:I is made so much easier now. It is a bit tricky to get on, but once you finesse it into place, it stays put. I found it a bit easier to aim or select targets as well. In all, very pleased.'),
(N'Noah', N'Green', N'noah.green7945@example.net', '2014-12-07', 5, N'nice , i have it like what i want .'),
(N'Mary', N'Edwards', N'mary.edwards8098@example.com', '2014-12-07', 5, N'I''m a huge resident evil fan. I bought this and evil within on their release days. I actually wanted to hate this game, but there was not much out at the time so I bought it to keep me occupied until evil within came out. Well, to the point, I like Alien better. Even with the lack of offensive ability, there is just something about this game that makes it great. It''s hard, pretty, and unlike most games available today. The developers cared about the end user on this one. And that''s special in an industry becoming more tainted every year by greed and bull****'),
(N'Andrew', N'Barnes', N'andrew.barnes5513@example.net', '2014-12-07', 5, N'Thanks a lot.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Rogers', N'evelyn.rogers9112@example.net', '2014-12-07', 5, N'This thing isn''t just for xbox one! As I don''t have it hooked to mine. Hooked my polk psw110 and man it sounds good! I wanted to give our tv a lil more umph! And this seems to be just right!'),
(N'Angela', N'Coleman', N'angela.coleman9765@example.com', '2014-12-07', 4, N'The live and chat pad are great. The headphones are cheap and break easily.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Morgan', N'lauren.morgan2378@example.org', '2014-12-07', 3, N'Assumed this would be a new product, it is not. Came in a mini zipper back with a barcode sticker on it. All stylus'' are there, and seem in good condition, but I find this to be a bit on the sketchy side since it is not stated anywhere that it is a used product.'),
(N'Amy', N'Perez', N'amy.perez8186@example.net', '2014-12-07', 5, N'I love this product!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Singh', N'jeremy.singh6530@example.net', '2014-12-08', 5, N'love this game'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Nowak', N'elizabeth.nowak9182@example.com', '2014-12-08', 5, N'I GOT MY COPY SAT. MORNING AND SPENT MOST OF THE WEEKEND PLAYING IT ! , LET ME SAY THIS ON THE FRONT END , I KNEW VERY LITTLE ABOUT MOTOCROSS OR THE PHYSICS OF THE SPORT , AND IT TOOK SOME GETTING USED TO FOR AN OLDER GUY LIKE ME , BUT ONCE I GOT THE HANG OF IT I LOVED IT ! THIS GAME IS AWESOME WITH GOOD GRAPHICS AND A WIDE RANGE OF OPTIONS ! BUT FOR ME THE QUESTION WHEN I REVIEW A GAME IS , IS IT FUN TO PLAY ? YES !!!!!!!!!!!!! DO YOURSELF A FAVOR AND PURCHASE THIS GAME , ITS A BLAST !!!!!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Martin', N'mateo.martin5179@example.org', '2014-12-08', 4, N'Fun game for the family or by yourself. Keep your brain fit!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Boyd', N'yuki.boyd6300@example.org', '2014-12-08', 4, N'grand son likes to play it.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Webb', N'ronald.webb6073@example.com', '2014-12-08', 4, N'love it'),
(N'Priya', N'Rivera', N'priya.rivera8066@example.com', '2014-12-08', 1, N'the game did not work at all and I was sent a new one and it did not work also.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Allen', N'andrew.allen7691@example.org', '2014-12-08', 4, N'The graphics of this game is kinda ... Meh but the gameplay is good. I just wish that virtual pet games like Nintendogs, Petz, etc. all had the ability to watch your pet grow into an adult and breed *new* pets. Most and if not all virtual pet games let you care for them and all but they stay babies forever. I was hoping that at least Nintendogs would let you raise your pup til it grows to a full grown dog. But this game is the same where your pets stay as babies forever but what makes this one interesting from the rest is that it''s not just puppies and kittens. I started this game by adopting a Macaroni Penguin chick. I am eager to see the other adorable animals that get unlocked later on. This game is perfect for the younger gamers and possibly a way to learn and earn responsibility before parents decide on getting them a real pet. I like this game as a cutesy game to play in times where I need a little pick me up mood enhancement as it is very cute and will leave you with a smile...'),
(N'Peter', N'Ali', N'peter.ali3565@example.org', '2014-12-08', 5, N'Can''t really think of any kind of improvement for these batteries/charger set. The batteries and cover fit perfectly into the controller, and the dock is very small. Barely takes up any space on my entertainment console, and all you have to do is place the controller on it and it charges automatically. It''s an elegant and efficient system unlike a few others I''ve seen that are big and ugly. The batteries hold a charge great and I haven''t had them run out yet, charging them between gameplay sessions. Excellent!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Diaz', N'kofi.diaz7098@example.org', '2014-12-08', 5, N'One of the best PC games ever made, period. More then tops the original. Great graphics but that''s just the beginning of the HL 2 world. You get to be Gordon Freeman, the silent hero in the world that has been conquered by aliens in the "7 Hour War" (you can read a blurb about this on a newspaper clipping on the wall, when you get to your friend Dr Vance''s (voiced by Robert Guillame of TV fame) lab...the aliens have formed a "Combine" of aliens working with human "police", your enemy through the entire huge adventure. The aliens have somehow also, prevented humans from REPRODUCING, there is not one single child in City 17, that is how scary these bastards are. This world is revealed to you bit by bit and your job is to fight your way through "City 17" accomplishing many and various objectives on your way to "the core", your missions will be explained as you go and you will visit dozens of different environments and fight dozens of enemies - human, partly human, aliens of many...'),
(N'Daniel', N'Chavez', N'daniel.chavez5340@example.net', '2014-12-08', 5, N'Are you kiddin me!? This is why I love Amazon, put items in my favorites & wait... wait... wait... Blam! Found COD: Ghosts prestige edition for $40 flat! Can''t beat that, can''t wait for item to arrive so I have something to do on xmas vacation! :)'),
(N'David', N'Phillips', N'david.phillips8102@example.com', '2014-12-08', 5, N'Came the morning of release date and is an exceptional Pokemon remake. I love the amount of available legendaries to catch! A must have!'),
(N'Emily', N'Gray', N'emily.gray8265@example.net', '2014-12-08', 3, N'I like that the video game console plays PS1, PS2, and PS3 games, DVDs, CDs, and BluRay discs. But, the one I have only plays PS1 and PS3 games and the other stuff as well. Plus, my console is acting strange. It won''t play PS3 games and BluRay discs every time I insert one of them. It does not make any sense but yet it is PlayStation 3. I am currently selling it to get a better PS3 that plays all PS1, PS2, and PS3 games as well as other discs successfully.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Johnson', N'brenda.johnson5074@example.com', '2014-12-08', 4, N'GREAT'),
(N'Noah', N'Foster', N'noah.foster7853@example.com', '2014-12-08', 5, N'Great tactical camera for $45, sold the rest of the piece of crap bundle. Five stars.'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts1962@example.org', '2014-12-08', 5, N'Boobs, Ninjas, and fighting. Oh my!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Gonzalez', N'brenda.gonzalez9335@example.net', '2014-12-08', 5, N'bought it used, but it works great.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Miller', N'sharon.miller5328@example.org', '2014-12-08', 4, N'awesome'),
(N'Lucia', N'Robinson', N'lucia.robinson8170@example.com', '2014-12-09', 4, N'My kids loved it'),
(N'Kevin', N'Nguyen', N'kevin.nguyen2862@example.com', '2014-12-09', 5, N'**Before you read the review** Let me point this out now - THE ONLINE MASTERSERVER has been removed by activision, so you don''t have access to servers. (Multiplayer is still playable with around 1000+ players) but you''ll have to manually go to gametracker.com copy the IP address and port number and then do (~) connect "IP here" it took me over a day to figure out how to connect, and I was able to finally manage. As for the longest time I''ve been a call of duty fan (mainly because of COD4) I picked up this game on the 360 back in 2007 and absolutely loved call of duty. I''ve been pre-ordering every CoD since CoD4 (yes and going to the midnight releases up until 2013) As a 360 player I''ve always felt CoD4 was perfect as it is. But as soon as I heard about the pc version (around 2010) I just got so into it, always watching Call of Duty videos on mods exclusive to pc. In 2012 I was able to build my pc and achieve my dream in the gaming world. I just recently just started earning some...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Ruiz', N'stephen.ruiz5632@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'My favorite excellnte fps multiplayer with 64 players at the same time.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Jenkins', N'kenneth.jenkins7869@example.com', '2014-12-09', 5, N'very good !!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Moore', N'ronald.moore6230@example.com', '2014-12-09', 3, N'So, my kids use this for PC gaming, and also on the XB360. We have 2 wireless MS brand, and this generic one. The X button has no X on it. The label cutout on the back is blank. Yes, it''s cheap and generic, but it''s properly weighted and works. The only complaint from my kids is that it''s wired. The second one DOES NOT WORK. It shows up as an unknown device.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Butler', N'tyler.butler6048@example.com', '2014-12-09', 5, N'amazing game and it came with no damages'),
(N'Omar', N'Davis', N'omar.davis4128@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'Looks to be a great gift item!');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Wei', N'Allen', N'wei.allen4857@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'To start this off, I will openly admit that I am not a fan of motion controlled gaming. Maybe its because I have been gaming for 30+ years with some sort of controller in my hand. Whatever the reason, I just vastly prefer a controller in my hand as opposed to motion controls. That being said, I absolutely LOVE what Kinect bring to the Xbox One console outside of motion controlled gaming. My single favorite feature that Kinect brings to the console is without question Skype. I have a cousin who lives down in Florida and we play online games together at least 3-4 times a week. We actually grew up together in Michigan and we were both video game nuts back in the day. I still remember the all nighters we used to pull playing games like Karateka and the Sierra and LucasArts adventure games. Unfortunately, he moved down to Florida with his parents when I was roughly 13. As soon as Xbox Live went live back with the original Xbox, we started playing games together online. We both enjoy the...'),
(N'Anita', N'Baker', N'anita.baker7880@example.net', '2014-12-09', 5, N'Picked this up at Walmart since it was cheaper. Let me say it compliments the Luigi Wii-mote very well. The green really matches well like the Mario version, as well as the official Mario one that came bundled with the Mario Kart 8 Bundle when it originally launched. So this is third party, however it is officially licensed. So it''s expected to work well, and let me say that it does. I tested this with Mario kart 8 and it worked great. I was able to drift boost out of corners and attack the courses like I normally would in a controller. Granted it took me a race to get use to it, but after a lap I was up to my usual snuff. However there is only ONE complaint I have about this. The L is a nice touch, however I wish instead it said Wii like the official one. Next is the back being a solid all green; instead of brown with a yellow circle around the Wii logo. However I won''t take it against it. Also I find it odd that there''s a bit of a dip on the where the Wii-mote''s sensor LED''s...'),
(N'Mei', N'Phillips', N'mei.phillips1395@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'Purchased for granddaughter as present. She loves it. No problems so far. Delivered as promised.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Nowak', N'melissa.nowak6689@example.net', '2014-12-09', 5, N'I got DriveClub on 12/6 so my experience with it has been a lot different than those who played it at launch. I created a club right of the bat and have had online races and completed challenges over the network without issues. I''ve read that it still isn''t working perfectly for all players, but the problems are much, much less prevalent. The driving experience itself is right up my alley. I''m a player who has never been able to get really into simulation racers, as I always want to have a little more fun than real-life physics allows. DriveClub provides that realism aspect in the visual fidelity and the environmental effects, but the handling itself is still arcadey enough to have the fun factor. The visuals in this game are truly something we''ve never seen before. The sound and sights as you''re racing downhill are enough to make your heart race- the sense of speed here is unmatched. Weather was just added to the game (http://a.pomf.se/dwgknv.gif) and it''s a whole additional...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Morales', N'amanda.morales9335@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'Playing this game is the closest thing to living in Westeros! Have you ever wondered what it would be like to live in the world of George Martin''s "Game of Thrones" world? Short of a time machine, this game is the next best option. Many book readers and TV watchers would like to imagine themselves living in the world that George Martin created. The man has created a world that is so rich, so dramatic, and so full of life that I know a fan or two who spend more time in it than they do in the real world. It is a very immersive world. However, reading about it and watching the show are both passive activities. If you would like more interaction and a more immersive experience, buy this game. This is an action-adventure game. You play as a member of House Forrester, a northern family who have been bannermen to Winterfell for over a thousand years. The story takes place during the War of the Five Kings. House Forrester was drawn into the conflict when Robb Stark called in his banners...'),
(N'Betty', N'Jackson', N'betty.jackson7040@example.com', '2014-12-09', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Patricia', N'Bailey', N'patricia.bailey3368@example.com', '2014-12-09', 5, N'This generations greatest classic.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Okonkwo', N'jonathan.okonkwo3606@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'my son is going to love this'),
(N'Judith', N'Howard', N'judith.howard9480@example.net', '2014-12-09', 5, N'best game ever'),
(N'Emily', N'Cox', N'emily.cox7497@example.org', '2014-12-09', 4, N'YS is the best exercise game I''ve seen so far. Which is a shame because it''s far, far from perfect. Overall, it''s a pretty fun. The workouts are good and definitely got a couch potato like me gasping for air. Some of my favorites are wall-breaker, Stomp, Boot Camp, & Boxing. It''s the Objectives area where this game falls FLAT. You setup the Objectives for whatever you''re trying to achieve (lose weight, tone up, etc). So in my case, my objective was 30 minutes a day, 3 days a week, for a total of 360 minutes. However, 1. UbiSoft doesn''t grasp basic math and reporting functions. There''s no way to tell many minutes you worked out on a given day. So at Day 3 when you have 77 minutes (you overachieved one of the previous days) you can''t keep track of how many minutes you''ve done after a given exercise other than to manually subtract your total from the original value. That''s lazy programming. 2. So if I work out 60 minutes six days straight then do nothing for the remaining weeks, will...'),
(N'Hannah', N'Bell', N'hannah.bell7302@example.com', '2014-12-09', 5, N'excellent condition of the box and cd. thank you'),
(N'Sarah', N'Rodriguez', N'sarah.rodriguez4378@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'I was wondering do I or do you have an old purchasing recipt or can I use the invoice for my 36 month protection plan for my ps3?'),
(N'Ethan', N'Okonkwo', N'ethan.okonkwo3857@example.com', '2014-12-09', 4, N'chevere'),
(N'Ethan', N'Okonkwo', N'ethan.okonkwo3857@example.com', '2014-12-09', 1, N'estaba danado'),
(N'Brian', N'Ramirez', N'brian.ramirez5086@example.org', '2014-12-09', 5, N'Full of 80''s references. Very neon. You can do stealth kills. You get a bow and arrow. You can upgrade your sniper rifle to shoot exploding bullets. You can upgrade your shotgun to set things on fire. You can upgrade your assault rifle to shoot lasers.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Singh', N'hiroshi.singh3185@example.net', '2014-12-09', 5, N'It is working great ...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Coleman', N'cynthia.coleman4107@example.org', '2014-12-09', 1, N'I usually love amazon products but after just over a week one of the straps inside broke... I''m very disappointed with this one, but I do see a lot of really good reviews. I''m hoping I just got a bad one.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Butler', N'deborah.butler4312@example.com', '2014-12-09', 5, N'I really loved Deus ex, i have it for PS3 and yet i still bought this one, why? you may ask. Simple, the mistakes this game originally had were precisely what they fixed. The DLC adds more time to enhance your character, Its great to have new game+ so you can try different and better approaches to early missions, plus, its surprising to say how many "small" details have changed, which is pretty obvious since you find a shotgun in the first mission, in that shipping room (you know, the second time you find bad guys). If you''ve never played the game, buy this one, if you have played it and find this game cheap buy it, plus if you are very good, you can have all the trophies again (not important, but still)'),
(N'Lisa', N'Reyes', N'lisa.reyes5917@example.org', '2014-12-09', 1, N'Terrible game. The company does NOT care about their customers. The story was very weak. And now to spit in our faces they reveal that they are removing some types of gameplay and only allowing people who buy their expansion packs to resume playing those modes of gameplay. They''re essentially holding content hostage that you were already allowed to play since launch. What a piece of crap game. I wish I could sell my digital version. I''m EMBARRASSED this company got my money and I will never purchase another game from them, ever.'),
(N'Emma', N'Adams', N'emma.adams9449@example.net', '2014-12-10', 4, N'Great deal for the price and colors are vibrant, but do not use grip it analog stick covers because the silicone is thick and hits the analog stick when moving in any direction. Also the silicone covers become slimy if your hands get sweaty.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Moore', N'aisha.moore9598@example.org', '2014-12-10', 4, N'Great product, very sturdy very high quality inside (yes I opened mine). However there is a very very slight looseness to the main throttle axis. Also the throttle axis analog range (on my product) ranges from 61-255 whereas all my other CH products they are perfectly ranged from 0-255. Its not a big issue, as after you calibrate it you can''t tell the difference in game. I am primarily using this with Elite Dangerous. The mouse like X/Y device on it is extremely well executed, its simply fantastic in Elite mapped to H/V thrusters for both combat and docking. I may have liked to see the mouse position swapped for the POV, but that''s really just for my hands. Others may have a different opinion. I really love the CH software, some say it looks old ... but I would say its really is very intuitive, flexible and works well. I am only dining it one start for the 60-255 range issue. I think it''s a design issue internally, all their other products are top quality I would have like to see a...'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Morales', N'evelyn.morales6924@example.net', '2014-12-10', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Julie', N'Tanaka', N'julie.tanaka8494@example.com', '2014-12-10', 4, N'lots of fun stuff to do in this game, lots of time to waste I wish it was a bit more open and buildings weren''t just props. sometimes it seems like too much game for the 360.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Khan', N'ashley.khan9095@example.com', '2014-12-10', 1, N'This game has major delay from the time you hit a "chord" when you finally hear it out of your speakers, there is a huge lag. There are tons of posts about it, appears the only way to solve it is go analog which xbox one doesn''t support natively or use a external secondary stereo system and I haven''t tested that yet. The delay is enough that I don''t bother to play the game 2 thumbs down.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Gutierrez', N'katherine.gutierrez4626@example.com', '2014-12-10', 5, N'This game seams to have a lot going for it I got it for a Christmas gift and I think it will make any gamer very happy .'),
(N'Justin', N'Carter', N'justin.carter3980@example.org', '2014-12-10', 4, N'There are plenty of reviews here that go over the pros and cons to the game, so I''ll let you go ahead and read those if you''re looking for more specific game critique. I honestly thought it was an okay game. I liked playing 5 better than 6, but those are the only two in the series that I can compare. I watched my Dad play the original resident evil when I was a young kid and that first zombie (you know the one, quit pretending you don''t!) has terrified me for life. I can''t even play any of the games before 5 because it''s just too scary for me. This game is just not the same as the older ones. I don''t find myself being frightened and getting into the same mindset of survival horror that I would like to be in. The physical attacks are fun, but playing through the campaign one time was more than enough for me. Since I finished the campaign, I''ve played this game only a few times. Overall, it''s an alright game but I think I was expecting more out of a Resident Evil.'),
(N'Heather', N'Ramos', N'heather.ramos3427@example.com', '2014-12-10', 4, N'AmazonBasics USB 2.0 A-Male to Mini-B Cable - 6 Feet (1.8 Meters) Now that this is out the way, a review and the reasoning behind that recommendation. Also, don''t pay 30 bucks for this thing; I got mine for $17 shipped with Prime. I''m no stranger to Action Replay and Datel. Great software that helps you out and saves tons of time, hardware can be...meh. I went through FOUR Action Replay back in the days of Pokemon Diamond and Pearl, when I started competitive battling. The hardware just kept dying but at least it never bricked my game. That was a long time ago, though. Perhaps things have changed but what they didn''t change was the low quality USB cable. Now let me blunt and say that you want to replace this crappy cable asap. The USB cable I linked above is the appropriate one to work with the PowerSaves, as I saw reviews saying to replace the cable but didn''t exactly say what cable was needed. Another reason you want to replace the cable is because in terms of length, it''s...'),
(N'George', N'Evans', N'george.evans5589@example.org', '2014-12-10', 1, N'Do not buy this console!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Garcia', N'andrew.garcia9371@example.net', '2014-12-10', 5, N'Sound is OK. Build quality is better then OK. Price to quality is GREAT.'),
(N'Larry', N'Henderson', N'larry.henderson6575@example.com', '2014-12-10', 3, N'The normal AC adaptor for 3DS outputs at 4.6V at 900 milliAmps, but USB 2.0 usually outputs 5V at 500 milliAmps. So this will charge your 3DS, but about 1/2 as fast as the AC adaptor.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'White', N'jacqueline.white2645@example.com', '2014-12-10', 5, N'Really good game, I started playing it week after launch, didn''t noticed any bugs. Best looking AC so far. And thank god they went back to the original concept. I was tired ships, and never ending action with 2% stealth. I wish they make pirate game for all the people who like it and let assassins creed be stealth action game. I really like hope missions set up. Paris is interesting environment to be at. Sunsets are gorgeous in the game. Side quest are interesting and make you more involved in the story (I did not expect that). I really like anomaly''s, very refreshing to see that. If you like Assassins Creed for stealth and story then this is game for you, but if you want to be pirate and kill people Unity will be boring for you. I don''t like online feature of the game ( I tried it twice), but its just me.'),
(N'Susan', N'Kim', N'susan.kim9998@example.com', '2014-12-11', 5, N'Had this controller for a year or two, still going strong. The camo pattern looks great.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Rogers', N'tyler.rogers9986@example.net', '2014-12-11', 4, N'nice controller'),
(N'Lisa', N'Kelly', N'lisa.kelly4331@example.net', '2014-12-11', 3, N'It is almost as fun as any of the Lego games, but compared to Years 1-4? It''s too easy. I expect to do a little bit of work to save students or complete other objectives. I''m not sure if it is easier because they wanted to attract a younger crowd or if they wanted Harry to be more powerful since he is older? I''m pretty sure it''s to make it easier though. That''s a shame because I loved trying to figure out how to open door, rescue students, or enter certain buildings in the previous game. That said, the graphics in this one are much better than Years 1-4. I am very impressed. The Lego characters look the way they always do, but the scenery, backgrounds, and other content look amazing! And while some objectives may be easier, they included items that you interact with something other than a wand. So you may walk over an item this time to get your little coins. In all though, if you''re like me, you''ll want this game either because it''s Harry Potter, Lego franchise, or both. It''s...'),
(N'Debra', N'Perez', N'debra.perez1952@example.net', '2014-12-11', 5, N'Although slightly disturbing and a little old this game is a must have for people who like horror or detective games. The whole thing plays out with you as a person checking a house out and thinking about buying it and things get interesting revealing a troubled past in the house and surrounding area'),
(N'Walter', N'Morris', N'walter.morris2486@example.com', '2014-12-11', 5, N'Awesome Product!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Morris', N'cynthia.morris9073@example.com', '2014-12-11', 4, N'I like this game...I''ve played it so much the disc is starting to wear....I now have to jump over two missions to keep playing....and that daggone sniper in Stalingrad really gives me a headache....'),
(N'Kofi', N'Sanchez', N'kofi.sanchez1914@example.com', '2014-12-11', 5, N'I have been driving formula one since plastation 2 in the 1999 season with EA sports through 2013 with codemasters and let me say with this version they have it almost perfect my only complaint is that after 2011 they changed the way the cars behave when you get off track its like you hit the brakes but your not and I drive with all the assists off. In 2011 version you could get all four wheels off track and not loose speed though you whould pay for it with the loss of traction for a while which is realistic not like how its been since 2012 that its like you slam on the brakes no matter what the surface. If they fix that one problem this game would be perfect. As for comparing it to 2012 or 2013 you can''t the cars handle differen''t, brake differen''t, and sadly sound differen''t and there are suttle differences here and and there its not a repackaged 2013 game like for the first time ever I can actually use the rear view mirrors. The games to me is nearly perfect except for the...'),
(N'Hannah', N'Baker', N'hannah.baker5799@example.org', '2014-12-11', 5, N'Nice product!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Foster', N'ethan.foster8789@example.com', '2014-12-11', 4, N'This is a great game. It is definitely a step up from all the crappy COD games that have been released lately. (excluding BO2) I love everything about it. My only complaint are that you have to have an incredible internet connection to play, and the whole expansion pack scam. Most of my friends are complaining about it. You practically need the expansion pack for anything you want to do now. I can''t even do the weekly and nightly with out it. Other than that it''s a great game!'),
(N'Jose', N'Torres', N'jose.torres5323@example.org', '2014-12-11', 5, N'what can i say...its mario'),
(N'Susan', N'Barnes', N'susan.barnes9690@example.org', '2014-12-11', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Linda', N'Fisher', N'linda.fisher2974@example.org', '2014-12-11', 5, N'Just what my Michael wanted.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Hernandez', N'ashley.hernandez1897@example.com', '2014-12-11', 5, N'My third version I bought, first for Xbox 360, then for PS Vita, then for PC. I love this game...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Watson', N'michelle.watson2312@example.net', '2014-12-11', 5, N'Still a fun game. The graphics are still descent. Great to play with REAL classic players on it'),
(N'Michelle', N'Watson', N'michelle.watson2312@example.net', '2014-12-11', 5, N'MVP is still fun to play and a great nostalgia trip.'),
(N'Megan', N'Coleman', N'megan.coleman1618@example.com', '2014-12-11', 5, N'Fantastic product! Fast delivery! Thank you very much!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Taylor', N'yuki.taylor1148@example.com', '2014-12-11', 4, N'Purchased as a gift, which recipient played many times, so I assume it was good.'),
(N'Mark', N'Campbell', N'mark.campbell2750@example.net', '2014-12-12', 3, N'thanks'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ross', N'patricia.ross5874@example.org', '2014-12-12', 4, N'Nice headset, however upon receiving it, it seems as if i would have gotten the same value out of XOFour. The quality is nice, it looks as sturdy as XOSeven. I usually wear around 7-8 size hat, and this set will feel as if crushing my skull sometimes (its not great, but it will put enough pressure so that outside noise is reduced greatly)[If you wear glasses be prepared to feel the pressure from the frame into your head]. Once you wear it several times, either it gets better or you don''t care anymore (cant figure which, or my head got smaller which i doubt). Sound is solid stereo (but when compared to the virtual 7.1 output of DSS that i get from my X11, its not as crisp and clear). Ive tried to run the headset thru the DSS (Turtle Beach Dolby Surround Sound device) config, and it does make the sound better, but i need an additional adapter to test chat capabilities under this config(2.5mm female-3.5mm male adapter) It serves the purpose, it gives better appreciation of game...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Raghunathan', N'jonathan.raghunathan1147@example.com', '2014-12-12', 5, N'Excellent condition'),
(N'Gary', N'Lee', N'gary.lee4800@example.net', '2014-12-12', 5, N'This is one of those games that has such a perfection that I played it today and it still looks how I remember it as a pre teen. On the other hand my ps1 games , look horrible and not as good as good as my memory remembers. This game is simply a work of eternal art.'),
(N'Paul', N'Rodriguez', N'paul.rodriguez4318@example.net', '2014-12-12', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Judith', N'Gutierrez', N'judith.gutierrez6466@example.org', '2014-12-12', 4, N'If you like the Sims, especially the earlier ones, you will like this version. The storyline is interesting, the objectives are logical (find food, make clothing, shelter yourself, etc), and having up to six players to hop between was fun! Now for the bad: sometimes it''s a little difficult to figure out what to do. Once you have looked through the "plans" both at the workbench, and away from the workbench, it becomes more clear. Loading times kind of suck, but then again it''s not the most modern game ever, so that''s to be expected. Usually, I only use cheats on my second time around a game, but the time taken to fulfill the sim''s needs were taking up all my game time instead of progressing, so I summoned the Cheat Gnome and had a great time! PS: it can be fun to just let your sims go once they''ve found each other, and watch them sit around the fire sharing stores, chilling in the hot springs, cooking gourmet meals on stone stoves, dancing to the airplane radio, and hanging out on...'),
(N'Heather', N'Collins', N'heather.collins8441@example.org', '2014-12-12', 5, N'Awesome fast service love it thank you'),
(N'Kofi', N'Gutierrez', N'kofi.gutierrez5332@example.net', '2014-12-12', 5, N'love it!'),
(N'John', N'Gray', N'john.gray3323@example.org', '2014-12-12', 3, N'I loved Borderlands and Borderlands 2, but could not warm up to this game. There are similar guns and menus that carry over from Borderlands 2, but the added low gravity element added a whole lot of jumping and vertical gameplay that left me wishing for the first 2 games. This is like a brand new Who CD, that pales in comparison to Who''s Next or Quadrophenia (hope there are a few classic rock fans that get the analogy). I''m glad there are people enjoying this game, because I am hoping to see future versions of a Borderlands on the newer gaming machines. The first two installments were rarely about precise gunplay, but after you found the right guns you could take on anything successfully. In this one the gunplay is often a shoot and hope you can hit the target. Enemies jumping around in low gravity don''t make for easy targeting. Good luck with a scoped weapon when enemies are hopping and floating in the air. Though they do seem quite capable of hitting you. Maybe my love of the...'),
(N'Yuki', N'Cooper', N'yuki.cooper4137@example.com', '2014-12-13', 4, N'grips feel good and its easy to put on and take off'),
(N'Ronald', N'Mendoza', N'ronald.mendoza3256@example.com', '2014-12-13', 5, N'PLEASE NOTE, I haven''t used it intensively as I bought it for a Christmas gift and only unboxed it to test it briefly. I''m not too familiar with stock SNES controllers, so I can''t say how authentic or inauthentic it feels. The bottom line is that it worked for me. I''ll edit this review when the party concerned gets her hands on it and able to play with it for a bit. TL;DR, it works as expected. EDIT: Still 5 stars. Also, my niece (the recipient of the gift) is going to try translating the Japanese instruction manual :) She says the controller is pretty similar in overall feel to her stock one, but not being an avid fan of button-mashers, she didn''t see much need for a Turbo or Clear button. I get the feeling I''ll be taking them off fairly soon. Otherwise, still 5 stars.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Hernandez', N'dennis.hernandez5754@example.org', '2014-12-13', 4, N'Can''t wait to Play'),
(N'Priya', N'Nelson', N'priya.nelson2415@example.net', '2014-12-13', 5, N'Leap Frog knows how to make learning fun and this game (and system) is no exception! Dance & Learn contains learning mini-games that can keep your little ones entertained for a long time. It''s a lot like having Mario Party on Wii for tikes but paced more appropriately for young kids and geared toward education. One fun minigame is Rhyme Time where a two line rhyme is displayed in writing and also read aloud. My nephew has lots of fun reaching up and swiping the rhyming word which is displayed by both a picture and the word. In another game, he had to grab at and touch the object that was the right color or respond by touching the smallest object or the widest object and follow other commands that teach a variety of things such as phonics, spelling, opposites, etc. After completing segments, he is rewarded by getting to dance all around while watching himself on the tv screen. Although I am reviewing the game rather than the system, the system has a camera that''s positioned under...'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Suzuki', N'tomasz.suzuki1844@example.org', '2014-12-13', 5, N'What a fun game.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Myers', N'jonathan.myers9749@example.com', '2014-12-13', 5, N'My child has played this game the most. I think she played it for a year before she ever slowed down.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Myers', N'jonathan.myers9749@example.com', '2014-12-13', 5, N'Had it for about 2 or 3 years now. My kid still playes with it. And we use it to watch Netflix.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Roberts', N'rachel.roberts7934@example.org', '2014-12-13', 4, N'Boring quickly if you don''t have friends to play with. Single player content is lacking. 3DS XL screen is too small and low-res for this game when things get crazy, which they do frequently in smash bros. But I got zero suit samus in my pocket now, so what more can I ask for.'),
(N'Debra', N'Price', N'debra.price2069@example.com', '2014-12-13', 4, N'Game downloaded quickly. Game is also very difficult, so play with bots until you get a hang of things, or frustration will become you. Graphics: Fantastic. Runs great even on old cards like my 630, although a better card is recommended for the higher settings. Gameplay: Fast and brutal, with great animations and physics. Archery is as hard as it should be which is to say extremely. Support: Game is updated frequently. Recent additions made the game prettier.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Ward', N'benjamin.ward6710@example.org', '2014-12-14', 5, N'Kids love it'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Butler', N'benjamin.butler3809@example.org', '2014-12-14', 5, N'I bought this game for my girlfriend as a gift because she loves the Kingdom Hearts series. It''s a very solid title and works well in the Kingdom Hearts universe. It''s about as good as you can ask a handheld Kingdom Hearts game to be.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Gonzalez', N'matthew.gonzalez5947@example.org', '2014-12-14', 5, N'This is my kids favorite game. They love playing it with their friends because it is up to 4 players. We got racing wheels for them too so they can really get into the game.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Kowalski', N'andrew.kowalski2580@example.net', '2014-12-14', 5, N'fast delivery, great product.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Barnes', N'melissa.barnes6908@example.net', '2014-12-14', 5, N'worked great!!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Mitchell', N'jeremy.mitchell5673@example.com', '2014-12-14', 4, N'Dual shock gives you the power in your hands to experience the action of the game play almost like your really there on the screen. Sony makes great products and this is hard to beat.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Cooper', N'daniel.cooper1928@example.org', '2014-12-14', 5, N'my son just cant stop playing it.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Price', N'hannah.price9022@example.org', '2014-12-14', 5, N'Lords of the Fallen initially caught my eye because it reminded me of one of my favorite games -- Darksiders. I quickly learned that Lords of the Fallen was not only harder than any game I''ve ever played; but it was also the best I''ve ever played. I thinks it''s important to note that I''ve never played Dark Souls, Demon Souls, Ghoul Souls, Midnight Souls, Black Souls, and any other damn game that includes Souls in the name... Combat -- Listen, this game is not for everyone. The combat can be slow, and pretty methodical at times. It''s a complete contrast to the combo heavy hack and slash titles such as God of War, Darksiders, DmC, etc. I found the combat to be a breath of fresh air, but I can understand how some people could find it boring. It took me awhile to get use to the ''lock on'' enemy targeting system (if you''ve played Darksiders 2, it''s similar to that). I''m sure you guys have heard/read comments about how difficult the combat can be, and that''s absolutely true. However, make...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Gomez', N'rachel.gomez1721@example.org', '2014-12-14', 5, N'Arrived with in the time estimation. Will be a fun xmas gift'),
(N'Samantha', N'Lewis', N'samantha.lewis5684@example.com', '2014-12-14', 5, N'Great service. Go with the PS original if you want the best.:)'),
(N'Aisha', N'Cook', N'aisha.cook2370@example.net', '2014-12-14', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Eric', N'Gutierrez', N'eric.gutierrez3599@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'The shipping was fast everything was great'),
(N'David', N'Diaz', N'david.diaz1285@example.org', '2014-12-15', 5, N'AWESOME GAME YOU GUYS'),
(N'Marcus', N'Cruz', N'marcus.cruz9758@example.com', '2014-12-15', 4, N'another user said the emblem was not center i have 2 and they both center, i wish they used a different type of plastic as this plastic feels inferior, like they used the thinnest cheapest plastic they could get away with, it looks like the type of plastic that gets bridle with age,mine had a small manufacturing defect, it had the slightest bur on the x button. i removed the bur with a knife but knicked more plastic from the x button. they used a soft plastic for the buttons. all those short comings and its still the best pro controller replacement option. i played with the controller for about 30 hrs on xenoblade, i set the A button to auto click the button when i press it by first pressing the turbo button then A, then its set till i reset it, this saves hundreds if not thousands of clicks and makes a difference on longer gaming sessions speed through text or pick up several chests in game at once, set some buttons to turbo(yes you can set all/some/none of the buttons to turbo)...'),
(N'Maria', N'Nowak', N'maria.nowak1033@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'Great gift'),
(N'Maria', N'Nowak', N'maria.nowak1033@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'Nephew loves it'),
(N'Sandra', N'Brooks', N'sandra.brooks2170@example.com', '2014-12-15', 5, N'great game!'),
(N'Jason', N'Scott', N'jason.scott8315@example.net', '2014-12-15', 4, N'I purchased the DVD for the PC because I hate Steam''s slow, buggy, virus-bringing, constant-update-requiring system. Turns out I was wrong. You still need a fast (very fast) utterly reliable Net connection, the patience to wait until Steam is available (its certainly not 24/7), more patience while you inevitable are required to download Steam updates, spybots, trackers, and ads, in order to play your game until Steam drops off line or your Net connection flickers for a milli-second. Then you''re back to the patience issue. I''ve played and enjoyed every version of Civ to date, and I would probably enjoy this one if the game was available. As it is, this is just an opportunity for Steam to dump trackers into your system. UPDATE: I have managed to play 40 hours of the game off-line. As CIV games go it is a huge improvement; combat is now more than just ''the biggest stack wins''. Cities can defend themselves (some), and the management system is much better. Only one combat unit per hex...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Nguyen', N'ronald.nguyen6008@example.org', '2014-12-15', 5, N'Fun little games that will take you on a great trip down memory lane. Reasonably priced at less than the expected price for a 3DS game, since it is a 2D title and technically not a new or full game, but a grouping of mini-games built around previously released titles. I''ve never been a fan of the Wario Ware series due to it''s lack of depth, and while this is similar, it is certainly in my eyes far better.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Wilson', N'gregory.wilson7523@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'I''ve some how never heard of the metro series so when I picked it up I wasn''t expecting much but I was in for a surprise! This is two games remastered for next gen and they look absolutely beautiful. If you enjoyed Fallout or the STALKER you will probably enjoy this game as well. This game kinda limits your exploration in the way that you can''t go back to earlier areas at free will. Besides that I got sucked into this and it didn''t leave my disk tray until I beat both 2033 and last light.... Oh and did I mention it comes with all the DLC? $24 well spent.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Perry', N'ronald.perry8389@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'EXCELENTE PRODUCTO'),
(N'Emily', N'Lopez', N'emily.lopez9066@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'GREAT product'),
(N'Emily', N'Lopez', N'emily.lopez9066@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'great product'),
(N'Emily', N'James', N'emily.james5777@example.net', '2014-12-15', 4, N'love the game but the controls are a bit wonky and hard to deal with i would stick with it on consol'),
(N'Samantha', N'Clark', N'samantha.clark4000@example.com', '2014-12-15', 5, N'This worked perfectly when I bought a new unit.'),
(N'Gary', N'Singh', N'gary.singh2578@example.org', '2014-12-15', 4, N'Overall very impressed with the size of the bundle and for what I paid for it. Quality of the statue surpassed my expectations'),
(N'Kelly', N'Ross', N'kelly.ross9016@example.net', '2014-12-15', 5, N'The greateat game ever...bringing back so many memories!'),
(N'Donald', N'Ortiz', N'donald.ortiz1798@example.org', '2014-12-15', 5, N'my son could not wait for this'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ward', N'andrew.ward3209@example.org', '2014-12-15', 5, N'LOVE THIS'),
(N'Emily', N'Robinson', N'emily.robinson9880@example.com', '2014-12-15', 5, N'Good product'),
(N'Douglas', N'Kumar', N'douglas.kumar9495@example.com', '2014-12-16', 4, N'great pice have to adjust some setings but thats ok has a response time lag though.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Gutierrez', N'joyce.gutierrez4717@example.net', '2014-12-16', 5, N'The Logitech G302 Daedalus Prime MOBA Gaming Mouse is a comfortable and accurate mouse for general use. If you don''t need the gaming features, this mouse is plug-and-play. With the Logitech gaming software, its potential as a gaming mouse is unleashed. With the gaming software installed and active, you can reprogram your mouse buttons to perform either simple or complex actions ("macros"). You can have different profiles for each game, or even different profiles for the same game. You can switch profiles without leaving the game (using hotkeys), and the mouse''s backlight can be programmed to change color by profile so you can confirm the right profile is active. Profiles can be selected automatically when the software detects the launch of a particular game. The sixth button''s standard setting is to switch your DPI setting, which has the effect of speeding up or slowing down your mouse pointer for better speed, or high accuracy. And since this mouse is wired, you get the fastest...'),
(N'Maria', N'Khan', N'maria.khan5917@example.org', '2014-12-16', 4, N'Seems more for the hardcore Aerosmith fan, but it got it for under $4 on here, so I can''t complain. The game plays just like GH III, which is good in my opinion.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Wilson', N'patricia.wilson2777@example.com', '2014-12-16', 2, N'It''s actually extremely disappointing.. The typing is so smooth and I''d love this completely .... .IF IT WORKED.. There are quiute a few keys just not worrking. The "r" and "b" keys arer especially annoying as most of the time it likes to rreapeat itself multiple times, and I''m frrrankly sick of errrasing every single extra "r" it makes, especially when I''m only hitting the keys surrounding it!!.. It wouldn''t bbe quite the probblem if I could just get it replaced - but I can''t. Unless I want to wait until late February .. or I could re-order it now!...... exxcept it''s now more expensive than when I originally ordered it! Amazon can''t work with me on getting this particular keyboard again, so I will be purchasing something else. .I would love it if I could get a working oner!!! You trying gaming when one of youru important keys is "e" and the dang keyboarrd decideds you really wanted to press "r"..... extremely disappointing but I shall be looking elsewhere.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Mendoza', N'carlos.mendoza8974@example.com', '2014-12-16', 5, N'This is simply a code to activate Dark Souls. I had registered my key with a Games for Windows Live account that I forgot... so I bought this key. It worked perfectly. If you''re simply looking for a legit key for Dark Souls, this is what you''re looking for. PROTIP: Register the key to your Xbox Live gamertag, if you own an Xbox360 or Xbox One. Your gamertag already has a "Live Account" on GFWL. You can then log into GFWL with your Xbox gamertag and use the online features. (Also, you won''t forget your login information!) When Namco finally shifts the PC version to Steamworks instead of GFWL, I imagine this problem will go away. Anyone who bought the game on Steam (me) will automatically have their information relayed to Steamworks.'),
(N'Betty', N'Richardson', N'betty.richardson3834@example.com', '2014-12-16', 5, N'Excellent seller. definitely use again********and my Gibson Delux Les Paul 1992 Siverburst loves it too.'),
(N'Karen', N'Ross', N'karen.ross1222@example.net', '2014-12-16', 2, N'Could be a lot better'),
(N'Omar', N'Perez', N'omar.perez3953@example.com', '2014-12-16', 1, N'Worthless'),
(N'Sofia', N'Sullivan', N'sofia.sullivan2682@example.org', '2014-12-16', 5, N'great gift!'),
(N'John', N'Perez', N'john.perez4101@example.org', '2014-12-16', 5, N'More than 10 stars, even! I didn''t know what to make of this game upon seeing the promo back when it came out on PS3. However, after acquiring a PS4 and hearing all the exceptional word of mouth, I decided to give it a shot. Saying I''m glad I did is a severe understatement! This is by the far the best looking game I have played. It feels like the characters really do exist, along with the insane world they live in. Even when it switches from cutscene to gameplay, there is no apparent downgrade in quality. Not an easy feat to pull off! Hopefully we are looking at the future of game titles in this aspect. Then, they won''t be afraid to show us more of the gameplay in the trailers, as opposed to a split-second glimpse. The controls are quite numerous but not overly difficult to master. By the time the 1/2 hour mark came, I was switching between upgrading to moving around to switching weapons smoothly. The tutorial in the beginning really helps with this. The gameplay itself is, well I...'),
(N'Sandra', N'Scott', N'sandra.scott5969@example.org', '2014-12-16', 4, N'good game'),
(N'Sandra', N'Scott', N'sandra.scott5969@example.org', '2014-12-16', 4, N'the best action game'),
(N'Paul', N'Lee', N'paul.lee4672@example.org', '2014-12-16', 5, N'My grandson loved this game. Transaction was completed in a satisfactory manner.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Myers', N'brandon.myers7956@example.org', '2014-12-16', 5, N'Great game, comes brand new!'),
(N'Debra', N'Powell', N'debra.powell1899@example.net', '2014-12-16', 4, N'Works well. The usb cable that comes with it is very long which is a huge plus. Plus it works as a standard USB cable.'),
(N'Mei', N'Torres', N'mei.torres1356@example.net', '2014-12-16', 5, N'Fun game that brings back old memories'),
(N'Samantha', N'Torres', N'samantha.torres2564@example.org', '2014-12-16', 3, N'its ok not bad'),
(N'Omar', N'Flores', N'omar.flores2964@example.org', '2014-12-17', 5, N'great'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Fisher', N'elizabeth.fisher5121@example.net', '2014-12-17', 5, N'Haven''t played yet because it is a present for somebody for Christmas, but I love crazy taxi.'),
(N'Amara', N'Boyd', N'amara.boyd9714@example.net', '2014-12-17', 5, N'lots of fun'),
(N'Heather', N'Wood', N'heather.wood3809@example.com', '2014-12-17', 5, N'A great addition to the original series. They did a good job updating the series to fit today''s standards without losing too much of what was special about the two original games. The sound track by Mick Gordon is probably one of my favorite parts of the game. I''ve been a long time KI fan and even run the biggest KI fan site, I always thought they''d mess up a sequel but they did a great job. New fans to the franchise should love it. Its very similar to most fighting games these days.'),
(N'Helen', N'Mendoza', N'helen.mendoza7250@example.com', '2014-12-17', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Douglas', N'Baker', N'douglas.baker8286@example.com', '2014-12-17', 5, N'Good product, thanks'),
(N'Debra', N'Suzuki', N'debra.suzuki5649@example.net', '2014-12-17', 3, N'love it but the gun is prity much usless.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Mendoza', N'kathleen.mendoza2499@example.org', '2014-12-17', 5, N'way better than the one from astro gaming. my cat chewed up 2 cables from astros and not this one because its shorter and doesnt attract my cat.and its cheaper!!!'),
(N'Frank', N'Ali', N'frank.ali4579@example.com', '2014-12-17', 4, N'I received the product as advertised, fast delivery'),
(N'Melissa', N'Bailey', N'melissa.bailey2976@example.net', '2014-12-17', 2, N'I can not get this game to work on any PC with any operating system, to work at all!! Nothing I do fixes it!!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Singh', N'olivia.singh6109@example.org', '2014-12-17', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Nguyen', N'aisha.nguyen7685@example.com', '2014-12-17', 5, N'Not very far into the game but just awesome so far! Pretty much the same game as Far Cry 3 except different setting, main character and story. And some new animals and vehicles. Still tons of fun though if you were a fan of Far Cry 3. Excellent graphics!'),
(N'Angela', N'Singh', N'angela.singh6535@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'If you liked FC3 even just a little bit, you will absolutely enjoy FC4. Will you love it as much? Maybe, maybe not - it all depends on your expectations. For me, I thoroughly enjoyed FC3 on PS3; it was one of my favorite titles when it came out. FC4 takes the foundation built by FC3 and makes the experience even more rich, giving the player so many options to take on missions as you see fit. HIGHLY RECOMMENDED FOR ALL FANS OF OPEN-WORLD GAMES!'),
(N'Debra', N'Okonkwo', N'debra.okonkwo3763@example.com', '2014-12-18', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Debra', N'Okonkwo', N'debra.okonkwo3763@example.com', '2014-12-18', 3, N'so so'),
(N'Aisha', N'Sullivan', N'aisha.sullivan6117@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'When you have to spend hours waiting, you don''t want to loose battery charge on your DSi. Neither on long trips. Better have the charger on the car at all times.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Wisniewski', N'ivan.wisniewski6717@example.net', '2014-12-18', 4, N'This product is very usefull in the terms of charging four consoles at once but, when it stops charging it doesn''t turn on automatically if you keep it on. So you have to spend your time replugging it in.'),
(N'Henry', N'Jones', N'henry.jones3563@example.net', '2014-12-18', 5, N'my son will love this he will be very surprised when he opens it for Christmas morning it came early which i was happy about it. thanks so much this is awesome thanks again'),
(N'Justin', N'Lopez', N'justin.lopez9410@example.com', '2014-12-18', 5, N'What''s not to love? It''s one of the ergonomically perfect controllers ever made. If you need a good PC controller, this is a good choice.'),
(N'Anita', N'Khan', N'anita.khan9534@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'I love the skylanders. Boom Jet & Night Shift came in great condition. Boom Jet has officially become my favorite of the swapables.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Ramos', N'lauren.ramos3926@example.com', '2014-12-18', 3, N'After the responsiveness and free feeling play in Titanfall, even though I had loved the Borderlands franchise and was really looking forward to this, it felt like I was stuck in the mud. You can barely jump in this game, where in Titanfall, you have a jetpack and you can wallrun, etc. I could only play this game for about 30 minutes and then had to go right back to Titanfall.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Jimenez', N'lauren.jimenez9405@example.net', '2014-12-18', 5, N'Great game, very fun and high replayability...up to 8players can play at once. Some cjaracter require unlocking as in previous installments; the same goes for some stages.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Roberts', N'rebecca.roberts1143@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'I love this game so much that idk where to start! Im addicted. People complain about the performance but i haven''t had any. ATMOSPHERE OF THE GAME: The setting is great! There''s people all over the streets of France and they''re always doing something such as fighting, robbing, protesting, grabbing coffee, interacting, etc. The people are not just walking around in groups like in the older games. If you have been an AC player since the time of Altair & Ezio like i have been and you miss the high walls of the holy land or the tall buildings of Italy and huge churches, the city being full of buildings rather than little bamboo houses, and if you miss the underground caves and roads from AC2 and Brotherhood then this game is for you. If you only like the swamps and oceans then go play Black Flag, AC3, or Rouge. I loved Black Flag & AC3 but AC Unity i love it alittle bit more. The map is huge that honestly it''s overwhelming but in a good way. Theres just so much to do. THE HATE ON THIS...'),
(N'Luis', N'Richardson', N'luis.richardson2452@example.net', '2014-12-18', 5, N'Son likes daddy again'),
(N'Maria', N'Okonkwo', N'maria.okonkwo3388@example.com', '2014-12-18', 4, N'No spoilers included. There are parts of The Evil Within that resemble Resident Evil, Silent Hill, and even a little of The Last of Us. Mostly its somewhat of a cross between RE and SH, and that can never really be a bad thing. Well, except for the fact that generally speaking, the worst parts of TEW were the ones that felt like RE4. Ive seen even people who loved RE4 complain about those particular parts. Its too much of a change of pace from the rest of the game. That aside, I would say The Evil Within most resembles Silent Hill, and Im certainly not complaining about that. Silent Hill is the epitome of survival horror as far as Im concerned, especially with the emphasis they put on interesting stories. So, in a way, I would call this Silent Hill-lite. Theres definitely the survival element to it, and a pretty strong horror element (including in the weird, psychological way that SH is). The story isn''t as strong, and can be a bit confusing, but its not bad. Even the Keeper (boss...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Wisniewski', N'carolyn.wisniewski8698@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Jack', N'Henderson', N'jack.henderson8759@example.net', '2014-12-18', 4, N'Im happy to report everything positive from the first Theatrhythm game was enhanced in Curtain Call and many shortcomings were improved upon (read my review of the first game for more info). First off: only buy this game if you are a huge fan of Final Fantasy or music games in general. Second off: if you are a huge FF junkie, should you buy a 3DS just to play this? Not by itself, but if there are other 3DS games out there youve wanted to play, Curtain Call could be the final nudge you need. Third, here are some points on what was and wasn''t improved upon: - Repetition is still there, but not nearly as bad as it was. The dark note system received an overhaul and is now quest mode. Previously you would grind the same two songs repeatedly for either XP or a certain color of crystal shard. Quest mode gives you more songs and better rewards. Plus you always get a new quest when you beat one. - Less crystal shards required to unlock characters. In the first game, every character took 8...'),
(N'Dee', N'Perry', N'dee.perry6778@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'Fun game to play when there isn''t much going on. Races are fun, cars are fun, graphics are superb, music is not terribly annoying, pretty scenery.'),
(N'Christine', N'Flores', N'christine.flores5648@example.net', '2014-12-18', 5, N'This game is an absolute must buy for any PS4 owner. I am a fan of the Infamous series overall and Infamous 2 is one of my favorite all time titles for the PS3. The graphics are absolutely amazing. The controller interface that the game utilizes is unique and was an unexpected pleasure. The only con that I can say about the whole game is that it seemed too short (although I may have just been playing it too often...). The story centers around an outcast of a human who accidentally discovers he has to ability to absorb powers from other bio-terrorists/conduits. From this point on you can choose whether to follow a good or an evil path throught the story (like the other Infamous titles). You certainly have the most maneuverability of any of the Infamous games which makes the gameplay faster paced than the previous titles. I highly recommend giving this title a try, it is certainly a great value.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Robinson', N'marcus.robinson4439@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'My girl loves it.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Robinson', N'marcus.robinson4439@example.org', '2014-12-18', 5, N'Fun game.'),
(N'Gary', N'Kim', N'gary.kim1889@example.net', '2014-12-18', 5, N'As asked.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Johnson', N'yuki.johnson2363@example.com', '2014-12-19', 4, N'We have not played any of the previous games in this series, so we cannot compare this game to the rest of the series. Rogue has a huge world, but seems constrained nevertheless. You have, it seems, a pretty definite path to follow to complete the game, and side jaunts don''t seem to have much impact. Gear isn''t as critical as in some games we have played. The graphics are good, and were smooth. You need to be pretty proficient with the controller for many of the moves, and I wouldn''t recommend this for gaming novices. The storyline is interesting, but, as mentioned, seems pretty set. It actually reminds me of some very early games -- even text based ones -- where you have to do things in the right order to succeed. We don''t subscribe to X-Box Live, and so the online components were unavailable to us, which might make a difference.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Perez', N'sandra.perez8410@example.net', '2014-12-19', 5, N'Good Game'),
(N'Kofi', N'Perry', N'kofi.perry1112@example.org', '2014-12-19', 5, N'fine..'),
(N'Brenda', N'Lee', N'brenda.lee3745@example.net', '2014-12-19', 5, N'I played a demo version of Fate several years ago, and I absolutely loved it! My brother then bought me the game and I was so excited. I played every day after school and all through the summer, but then it got lost. I was so excited to find this! It''s a great buy and it includes all three games on ONE disk. Just go to the main courtyard from the room you enter when you start. it gives you options to go to each different expansion. I love this, and I''m so happy I found it. Great price and I would recommend to anyone.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Reed', N'amanda.reed9602@example.net', '2014-12-19', 1, N'A boring, clunky, forgettable 3rd person shooter with one saving grace, the X Ray shot. After you''ve seen the X Ray shot, the game your left with is clunky, primitive, with limited gun selections unless you pay for the day one DLC of course. You litterally get 4 of each type of weapon, rifle, sub machine gun, pistol, and no the 1911 isn''t available without the DLC. DLC price gouging aside, this game is so boring, I never finished the campaign, which is amazing since its 9 levels long. There isn''t alot of content, even IF the content was enjoyable, which im telling you, its not. The gameplay itself, is REPETITIVE. Shoot, hide, shoot, hide, shoot. In short, avoid this game, it is a candy coated turd.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Butler', N'jeffrey.butler2321@example.org', '2014-12-19', 2, N'Despite My hopes for this controller, aside from it''s gorgeous look, it is atrocious: it''s too thick, big, bulky; the buttons feel too different from the original GameCube, so they failed mimicking that; they didn''t map the L, R, ZL, and ZR buttons correctly (as in change them from the classic, like the Hori did), so when you go to shield, you grab, or when you go to grind (in Mario Kart Wii), you look behind you. All in all, this controller is a collector''s item, nothing more. It is beautiful, but not functional. The Hori one, however, mimicks the GameCube controller perfectly, definitely get that one. Sure, it has less colour options, but it works far better.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Lee', N'marcus.lee7186@example.com', '2014-12-19', 3, N'Purchased for kids Xmas this year. I pre-ordered it to make sure I had it for under the tree, but never again. Sure, I got a free figure with the $75 purchase price, but it was often at $40 for most of the shopping season on sale. Never again will I pre-order at retail price.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Richardson', N'benjamin.richardson8292@example.org', '2014-12-19', 5, N'Love that you get to play the game. Then, using the characters, go back and find the mini kits and rescue the fifty Stan Lees hidden throughout the game.'),
(N'Angela', N'Roberts', N'angela.roberts5321@example.org', '2014-12-19', 5, N'Excellent conditions delivered as expected. 100% Recommended.'),
(N'George', N'Castillo', N'george.castillo2009@example.com', '2014-12-19', 5, N'Can''t go wrong with a Sony product. I had the original PSP and decided to get PSP GO for my collection'),
(N'Maria', N'Adams', N'maria.adams3356@example.com', '2014-12-19', 4, N'Good headset that I would recommend to anyone Pros - Good sound, comfortable, easy to clean ear cuffs, long cord, and adjustable volume and mic. Cons - after a few hours of use I start to get hot form the padding and sometimes sweat form it, mic is not the best, Wire / Volume adjuster sometimes makes the sound cut out, and wire is too long for my liking Overall this is a good headset for the money and would buy it again but I would opt. for a leather type of padding.'),
(N'Laura', N'Raghunathan', N'laura.raghunathan8611@example.org', '2014-12-19', 1, N'Its a game where all you do is walk. You don''t even need a Wii to play this game, just go outside and walk! This game is worthless'),
(N'Sarah', N'Singh', N'sarah.singh6390@example.net', '2014-12-20', 5, N'Great product, just as described =)'),
(N'James', N'Patel', N'james.patel1633@example.org', '2014-12-20', 1, N'I liked the sims3 but Sims4 look nice but to many loading.... go into other home load... switch to another player that not on the map loading screen.go to another area Loading screen. To many loading screen and it taking away the fun. Sims 1 and 2 can get away with the loading screen but we are talking about sims 4 here.... sims3 was great with big maps and book store and gym. But with sims 4 it small and loading screen everywhere.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Stewart', N'nathan.stewart1260@example.net', '2014-12-20', 4, N'I like it more than I have expected. I even bought the season pass. The Lord of the Hunt expansion is ok. The story is interesting enough. I wish the weapons were more beautiful. I can hardly see them on the character. And they are not as powerful as I thought they should. I want to see more supernatural power. The orcs are very stupid but I guess it is ok. The graphic is pretty good on my GTX 770 and i7. The collecting runes and artifacts are not as exciting as I thought. There is no special weapon for collecting artifacts. I just think the developer didn''t go far enough. I like it but I would like to see more. Hopefully I will see it in the next expansion.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Miller', N'ashley.miller9542@example.net', '2014-12-20', 5, N'it works fine'),
(N'Kevin', N'Flores', N'kevin.flores8676@example.net', '2014-12-20', 5, N'A little small than what expected'),
(N'Joshua', N'Russell', N'joshua.russell8803@example.com', '2014-12-20', 5, N'great game - my boys love it'),
(N'Donald', N'Richardson', N'donald.richardson5616@example.net', '2014-12-20', 5, N'excelente.'),
(N'Jason', N'Harris', N'jason.harris7410@example.com', '2014-12-20', 3, N'These are not great, but they can be a good temporal replacement to a better headset. The thing on the top doesn''t help as much, and you can feel the plastic rim crushing your skull'),
(N'Jessica', N'Clark', N'jessica.clark5923@example.com', '2014-12-20', 5, N'GOOD'),
(N'Nadia', N'Hill', N'nadia.hill9268@example.net', '2014-12-21', 4, N'Get exactly 20 silicone thumbstick protesters and they do a great job of limiting thumb slipping during intense game play, only issue is you may not get exactly all colors as advertised as for I got all colors except for clear in replace I got double rainbow .'),
(N'Adam', N'Ivanov', N'adam.ivanov6591@example.com', '2014-12-21', 2, N'Good product sturdy and works very well...'),
(N'Luis', N'Diaz', N'luis.diaz1189@example.net', '2014-12-21', 3, N'Getting around is annoying and the story is awful but it''s Dead Rising to the core.'),
(N'Charles', N'Reyes', N'charles.reyes6641@example.org', '2014-12-21', 5, N'Awesome Call Of Duty game! The story line is epic and the multi-player is good. Only $14.99 for the Xbox One and it even comes with a code for a free map pack and a 7 day Xbox Live trial.'),
(N'Adam', N'Wood', N'adam.wood3161@example.org', '2014-12-21', 3, N'okay.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Cruz', N'mateo.cruz5860@example.com', '2014-12-21', 4, N'really needs a better rules manual'),
(N'David', N'Clark', N'david.clark1377@example.com', '2014-12-21', 3, N'Good customer service bit the thimb stick holes are not big enough so when you try to move your guy it slowly moves start and back button holes are not big enough and no skrews'),
(N'Betty', N'Sullivan', N'betty.sullivan4650@example.com', '2014-12-21', 5, N'Just as awesome as I remember it! Works well, is in awesome condition, and brings back a ton of memories! It is so good to see Johto region again!'),
(N'George', N'Taylor', N'george.taylor7155@example.net', '2014-12-21', 5, N'Cool'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Scott', N'nicholas.scott2668@example.net', '2014-12-21', 5, N'lots of fun'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Collins', N'jacqueline.collins2350@example.net', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Great Saga!!! Great Game!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Adams', N'daniel.adams2950@example.net', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Awesome game , this is a great deal too!! Couldn''t be happier with this transaction'),
(N'Zachary', N'Singh', N'zachary.singh7206@example.com', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Best way to get an Xbox360 now! I paid $125 on Christmas special, plugged in a 64 Gig USB stick on the back and have plenty of storage for the games I want to play. Who needs a large hard drive if you go about it the right way? Got it to add to our existing Xbox360 in the house for more multiplayer fun! Xbox360 still remains to be the best console on the market right now, more games than any other and so many smaller developer downloadable games make this the go-to device for any and all family members and guests. (we also have PS3, PS4 and Xbox One''s around, but the Xbox 360 remains everyone''s favorite) Plus it''s so much better for streaming video services, we don''t every touch our other streaming devices because they are so slow! OK, had to finally break down and get the 500GB drive expansion for this xbox. But I ended up using much more than I expected.'),
(N'George', N'Murphy', N'george.murphy5401@example.com', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Stephen', N'Martin', N'stephen.martin5537@example.com', '2014-12-22', 5, N'My kids always wanted a wii, so I decided to give them one for Christmas.'),
(N'Anita', N'Khan', N'anita.khan9534@example.org', '2014-12-22', 3, N'I liked the first one better.'),
(N'Anita', N'Khan', N'anita.khan9534@example.org', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Stump Smash is the man. His pummel move is super strong. He also barfs acorns. More of an upfront fighter if you ask me but he''s bad to the bone. Glad I added him to my collection.'),
(N'Anita', N'Khan', N'anita.khan9534@example.org', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Ok got a dark elf wielding a spear riding a skeleton ostrich. What''s not to love about Fright Rider?'),
(N'Sharon', N'James', N'sharon.james1726@example.org', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Fun game'),
(N'Rachel', N'Nguyen', N'rachel.nguyen7749@example.net', '2014-12-22', 4, N'I''m tempted to give this 3 stars but I won''t, simply because the game looks freakin'' amazing if nothing else. The landscapes and textures are simply gorgeous in this, but I think I like Far Cry 3 a little better. It''s a personal thing: Far Cry 3 was set in the islands with a tropical environment but FC4 is set in Tibet I think, where it''s cold (or "looks" cold). I don''t like the cold. Also, in FC3, it''s like the main character transformed from a regular young guy into a killer and his friends didn''t know he was capable of such a transformation. There was just more tension. In this game (part 4), it seemed like the main character was already some kind of soldier or something with special training. Plus he was alone with no friends to see him become somebody dangerous and relentless. Now, there was a level ( or a couple of levels) in the game that were just...ridiculous to me. Psychedelic levels with tie-dye colors and chakra colors. These levels just seemed out of place against the...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Stewart', N'benjamin.stewart4576@example.org', '2014-12-22', 5, N'My Girls have spent a lot of time playing this together. Is a one player but they try to come up with ideas together so it makes it more fun.'),
(N'Wei', N'Foster', N'wei.foster1428@example.org', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Solid build quality, nice storage options, and great design. This is a perfect stocking stuffer or "just because" gift for any Zelda fan.'),
(N'Carol', N'Nelson', N'carol.nelson8911@example.net', '2014-12-22', 5, N'My boyfriend was ecstatic receiving this as a gift. Perfect! Couldn''t ask for more.'),
(N'Steven', N'Okonkwo', N'steven.okonkwo1945@example.org', '2014-12-22', 5, N'excellent buy'),
(N'Robert', N'Chavez', N'robert.chavez6298@example.com', '2014-12-22', 5, N'Son was happy to receive this'),
(N'Lauren', N'Davis', N'lauren.davis2835@example.com', '2014-12-23', 5, N'Great pricing. Awesome product quality. Fast shipping. Will do business again.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Davis', N'ethan.davis5714@example.org', '2014-12-23', 2, N'I know full well this review will be down-voted by all the fanboys out there, but here goes: Seriously, reading all these 5 star reviews, I thought I must have gotten a different game. Maybe the Playstation 2 version?? If I wanted to watch a visually appealing movie, I would. But I bought this to play a video game, to be entertained. I''m sorry, but I''m not entertained by long, slow-moving, straight-line missions. The graphics may be amazing, but the physics are not. At all. The shooting is even worse. Don''t even get me started on the controls. Granted, I can change them, but why are they so bad in the first place...? L1 for sprint?? R2 is both reload and shoot. Square (which is reload in any decent game) and Triangle (again, swap weapon in any decent game) are both taken up by the incredibly unsatisfying "actions" that you do by (you guessed it) pressing either Square or Triangle. Maybe pressing buttons to move planks or drag dumpsters around is fun for some people. Not for me, and...'),
(N'Richard', N'Gutierrez', N'richard.gutierrez7573@example.net', '2014-12-23', 4, N'thanks for good and nice product'),
(N'Wei', N'Mendoza', N'wei.mendoza8553@example.net', '2014-12-23', 2, N'Didn''t really like this game, I mean it''s a cool idea and all. But it just seems like all your doing is figuring out what the game wants you to do. No real challenge just a set coarse.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Wright', N'sharon.wright2362@example.net', '2014-12-23', 5, N'One of my top 3 games ever! This is absolutely a game that I always recommend or insist people own if they have a PS3. I purchased this game when it first came out, before all of the DLC, Move Support, and before any patches. Beat it the second day of owning it. The beginning may start off a tad slow but it had me hooked. From the beautiful visuals to the engaging story. So many different choices you can make that do actually have an impact. Playing the game over does have value as well as you''ll pickup on things that you didn''t the first play through or notice new clues and/or action sequences. Playing with the Playstation Move did make it more engaging although I found it to be a tad buggy at times, requiring me to re-do parts here or there. The origami has been my background on my work computer for years! A must own to your library.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Kowalski', N'jeffrey.kowalski9372@example.org', '2014-12-23', 5, N'excelent'),
(N'Victoria', N'Hughes', N'victoria.hughes4192@example.com', '2014-12-23', 2, N'It just doesn''t work in Windows 8.1. I have installed patch, and I just get a loading screen. I bought this game 2 years ago, when I was running Windows 7. I never played it, until I rediscovered the fact that I owned it. I re-downloaded it, only to be met with frustration.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Clark', N'nathan.clark9082@example.org', '2014-12-23', 2, N'Product is as described. The characters in the game move too slowly.'),
(N'William', N'Parker', N'william.parker2759@example.org', '2014-12-23', 5, N'The video game nerd tool kit. this is great for those of us who have old gaming consoles that need parts replaced. the tips are magnetic which is great for those tiny screws. overall a great purchase.'),
(N'Joan', N'King', N'joan.king5681@example.org', '2014-12-23', 4, N'This game, like Knights of the Round, is a Capcom-made SNES port of an arcade during the early 1990''s when side-scroller beat ''em ups were a dominant genre. Unlike Knights of the Round, this game focuses less on English medieval mythology and more on Tolkien-inspired fantasy. There are 5 characters: Fighter, Cleric, Elf, Dwarf, and Wizard. Keep in mind when picking your character, that the attack will level up as you accumulate points, but the level-up system is not as clear as in Knights of the Round. Nevertheless, the attack range of Fighter, Dwarf, and Cleric will increase, the number of arrows fired by Elf will increase, and attack power of the Wizard will increase. The Fighter attacks with a sword and can defend with a shield, the Cleric will fight with a spiked-hammer weapon and also has a shield, and the dwarf (the smallest character of all) fights with an axe and has a shield. The Elf only has the bow and arrows, and the Wizard only has a magical staff. At the start of the...'),
(N'Jason', N'Reyes', N'jason.reyes3794@example.com', '2014-12-23', 5, N'This controller is GORGEOUS. It has a nice matte paint job with a shiny matte silver smash logo in the center. This controller works and feels exactly like the original controller. I have had no problems with it whatsoever. I would highly recommend this to your Smash Bros. friends and family.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Bennett', N'joshua.bennett3735@example.org', '2014-12-23', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Wisniewski', N'elizabeth.wisniewski4002@example.net', '2014-12-23', 5, N'Wow. What a great fun game. So much fun and amazing graphics.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Cook', N'cynthia.cook9568@example.com', '2014-12-23', 3, N'The game is fairly slow sometimes and it doesnt always read in the gamecube but when it does the game is so much fun i have a blast!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Sanchez', N'jennifer.sanchez4356@example.net', '2014-12-23', 5, N'Excellent.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Mitchell', N'carolyn.mitchell6885@example.org', '2014-12-24', 5, N'Arrived as expected. A gift.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Nelson', N'olivia.nelson8659@example.org', '2014-12-24', 2, N'wore out,the springs inside'),
(N'Robert', N'Powell', N'robert.powell5049@example.com', '2014-12-24', 5, N'The most challenging game i have ever played .. if you don''t like to lose .. then this is your game.. it will challenge you and challenge you for puzzles.. I am stuck on one level but i don''t stop playing because i don''t like to lose. The almost best game i ever bought.'),
(N'Linda', N'Wisniewski', N'linda.wisniewski6782@example.org', '2014-12-24', 5, N':)'),
(N'Joan', N'King', N'joan.king5681@example.org', '2014-12-24', 4, N'I actually mean to give this game a three-and-a-half stars review, but will round up rather than down in this case because the Punisher is my favorite comic book character. I really wanted to like this game more because of my love of the Punisher in comics and film (War Zone), and because I shelled out $50 for a used copy recently. After playing through it a couple times though, I came to the conclusion that it was a hard to love game, and not one of Capcom''s better home console beat ''em ups. Obviously, this game stars Frank Castle aka The Punisher, and is a home console port of the popular arcade game. Co-starring in this game and also playable is Nick Fury, but his trademark cigar-in-mouth has been removed from the home console port as a means of "censorship".This is one of numerous differences between the arcade and the Genesis version, but many fans seem most disappointed by this particular change. The game is a side-scroller beat ''em up with the added flavor of allowing the...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Reed', N'brenda.reed2636@example.com', '2014-12-24', 1, N'Terrible waste of money. If you''re just playing for the combat system, Tera''s a better option and F2P. Story sucks. PVP sucks. Game has nothing going for it other than supposedly cool combat, but the combat is basically just an AOE fest.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Wilson', N'victoria.wilson3365@example.org', '2014-12-24', 5, N'Does not replace virtua cop one but adds a lot to the experience! Level two''s ending is...wow! Drink lots espresso before playing to be able to keep up. Check out the Dreamcast version too.'),
(N'Jose', N'Powell', N'jose.powell7043@example.org', '2014-12-24', 5, N'Works fantastic! Seller was extremely courteous with product. Received a note to me from ''Bry'' thanking me for the purchase. It came with one controller, but it works fine and that''s all I need. Very happy customer.'),
(N'Jose', N'Powell', N'jose.powell7043@example.org', '2014-12-24', 5, N'Slim console, great graphics, nice controller, it''s worth a buy! Only thing is this: for some odd reason, you need a PS1 Memory Card to save your progress when you''re playing a PS1 game. It''s backwards compatible, too.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Howard', N'tomasz.howard2869@example.com', '2014-12-24', 3, N'Son loves having these, works fine'),
(N'Nathan', N'Stewart', N'nathan.stewart7503@example.org', '2014-12-24', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Bennett', N'daniel.bennett1876@example.org', '2014-12-25', 1, N'These were a huge let down, and i have owned allot of Turtle Beach products. For the price i guess i shouldn''t complain, they were comfortable but that''s about it. The sound was terrible barley any bass what so ever. The headset at max volume was really weak, could barley hear anything. I recommend saving your money and investing in a different model of Turtle Beach''s.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Adams', N'ronald.adams8142@example.com', '2014-12-25', 4, N'Great game, plays well. 36 levels each with a side game in between. Match 3, differences, jigsaws, etc.. plus bonus finds in each scene. Again DVG - Intenium is awesome.'),
(N'Judith', N'Sanchez', N'judith.sanchez7477@example.org', '2014-12-25', 4, N'My only real complaint is that the battery door (the whole back) seems to come off by accident a lot, a couple times a week. Other than that it works great.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Ramirez', N'elizabeth.ramirez6710@example.org', '2014-12-25', 1, N'The story and atmosphere started out pretty good, then I realize that it''s impossible or very difficult to continue because of the gameplay. The only way to kill the enemy is by shining a flashlight and shooting them, both method requires battery and ammo which is very scares in the game. Alan cannot kill them by melee or by other means. I pretty much run out of ammo all the time and it gets very frustrating dying over and over again. You cannot just run away from the enemy because they chase after you. This seems like a game driven by story so I don''t understand why they made the battling system so difficult. Anyways, I ended up uninstalling it because the game is more frustrating then it is fun.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Myers', N'sharon.myers7633@example.org', '2014-12-25', 5, N'Great game great service.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Green', N'sarah.green6397@example.com', '2014-12-26', 4, N'Good game'),
(N'Daniel', N'Ruiz', N'daniel.ruiz5478@example.com', '2014-12-26', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Deborah', N'Wood', N'deborah.wood2555@example.com', '2014-12-26', 4, N'I like it. Allot of shooting and allot of... Shooting.'),
(N'Larry', N'Carter', N'larry.carter6330@example.net', '2014-12-26', 5, N'I just wanted to replay this game again and so i bought it. The game works great and its just to much fun'),
(N'Andrew', N'Edwards', N'andrew.edwards2797@example.com', '2014-12-26', 5, N'great, 100% recomended!!!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Hall', N'christopher.hall6769@example.net', '2014-12-26', 5, N':-)'),
(N'Michelle', N'Raghunathan', N'michelle.raghunathan8144@example.org', '2014-12-26', 5, N'gracias muy bueno'),
(N'Ashley', N'Fisher', N'ashley.fisher5857@example.com', '2014-12-26', 3, N'The games are ok really old but if you like hitman buy it'),
(N'Luis', N'Allen', N'luis.allen6782@example.net', '2014-12-26', 4, N'It was a good game'),
(N'Patrick', N'Jackson', N'patrick.jackson6626@example.com', '2014-12-26', 4, N'I''ve had this keyboard for almost four years now and am having to replace it because the W key is starting to wear out from constant use and abuse. It''s a great budget gaming keyboard, and the backlighting makes it usable in the dark. There are seven programmable buttons below the spacebar which are quite handy if you don''t have a customizable mouse, or just want more extra buttons in MMO''s. But those extra buttons are the only part that isn''t backlit, which seems like a serious fluke to me. If you''re a big fan of aesthetics in your gaming rig, the multi-color lighting is a nice touch since it can literally match any color of lighting. Synapse 2.0 (the driver software) is a joke. On-board memory would have been better; or just storing the configs in a file on the computer. Cloud storage is a pointless gimmick and is unneeded, but you have to do it- there is no alternative that allows full customization. Not to mention Synapse has its fair share of bugs, especially on Windows 8.1....'),
(N'Frank', N'Wilson', N'frank.wilson9677@example.org', '2014-12-26', 5, N'THANK YOU !'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Patel', N'cheryl.patel7554@example.com', '2014-12-26', 2, N'First I need to clarify that I love 2k no matter how much I say I hate it when I''m playing. It''s an addictive game for any NBA fanatic like myself. The serious problem I have is with the developers who have basically screwed their fans for a number of consecutive years. The only reason this game is getting 2 stars instead of 1 is that I play regularly. Problems such as glitches, and repetitive nuances that are not usual in a real game. 2k actually changes the game each release without addressing these problems and instead adds conditions that arguably make the game worse. In my opinion, NBA 2k should be a game that mostly involves strategy. It has been dumbed down to NBA Street games by just requiring skill. For example, shot timing is stressed immensely now. Doesn''t matter if Ray Allen is shooting your free throws, if you can''t time right he''s going to miss. This means you need to learn to play with one team at a time to learn how to time their shots correctly. This also makes it...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wisniewski', N'nathan.wisniewski3057@example.net', '2014-12-26', 5, N'Excellent Game'),
(N'Deborah', N'Mitchell', N'deborah.mitchell4815@example.com', '2014-12-26', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Barbara', N'Evans', N'barbara.evans3496@example.net', '2014-12-26', 5, N'fastest shipping and quality item'),
(N'Janet', N'Reyes', N'janet.reyes3508@example.com', '2014-12-26', 5, N'Thank u we have received the game today without any problems'),
(N'Timothy', N'Bailey', N'timothy.bailey5891@example.org', '2014-12-26', 5, N'oh the nostalgia of halo 3'),
(N'Douglas', N'Gonzalez', N'douglas.gonzalez6503@example.com', '2014-12-27', 2, N'This game''s going to require some time to devote to it. I couldn''t get myself to sit down for hours and play the missions. I think there was a lot of hype for an average game but that''s just my opinion. I have attention deficit issues and this was just way to slow of a game for my attention span (a lot of creeping, slow walking, dying and having to completely start the mission over, etc).'),
(N'Susan', N'Powell', N'susan.powell1432@example.com', '2014-12-27', 5, N'Worked as described and intended. Useful cable.'),
(N'Wei', N'Khan', N'wei.khan8957@example.com', '2014-12-27', 5, N'Although this game launched with some serious flaws for several weeks in regards to it''s multiplayer experience, after several patches the game is up and running smoothly for the most part. My only knock against the game (as everyone else''s probably) was the initial multiplayer experience. However, I give this game 5 stars not only for how everything has been fixed (largely), but also for the depth of content. 4 full games in one, and over 4500 gamerscore to earn, with everything from single player, co-op, mutliplayer (again now fixed) to cross game playlists. The experience for me has truly been 5 stars. If this review was written upon receiving the game back on Nov 11, I would probably only give it 4 stars, but if you are looking to purchase a game filled with fun, nostalgia and depth of content, this it the must have game for the xbox one!'),
(N'Christina', N'Henderson', N'christina.henderson3229@example.org', '2014-12-27', 5, N'grandson loves this game.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Lewis', N'deborah.lewis3575@example.org', '2014-12-27', 5, N'You got to love this game if you are a Mega Man fan. It has all the Mega Man X series released, and with the graphics and sound I''ve been missing since playing this game with Super Nintendo, it is very nice to add onto your collection.'),
(N'Jason', N'Jimenez', N'jason.jimenez8413@example.com', '2014-12-27', 2, N'Had no trouble downloading it, but trying to open it was the problem. Upon opening, it froze 5 times. Downloaded and tried again, but on the fourth try it finally opened and played. Not worth the effort though. Graphics are fine, but the play is slow.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'White', N'jeffrey.white2328@example.net', '2014-12-27', 1, N'We agonized over our decision to purchase a new game console this Christmas. We decided on the PS4. Huge mistake. The SONY network, which is integral to this product, has been down since Christmas eve and all SONY has had to say on the topic is the same zero-meaning blather they use to respond to tech support queries. The latest status? SONY reports the network is up. It is not. A lot of people might be sympathetic to Sony given that this was a hack, but if SONY remains vulnerable to a simple denial of service attack it is entirely SONY''s fault. If a simple DOS attack results in days and days of service loss, it is SONY''s fault. SONY has not invested enough in network security, or their security team is entirely incompetent. SONY wants us to pay subscription fees to use their network. I am frankly NOT convinced that my credit card info would be safe in their hands, nor am I convinced that SONY is doing anything at all to fix this situation or harden their systems against intrusion...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Martinez', N'joshua.martinez6175@example.org', '2014-12-27', 5, N'Great product was exactly what we asked for. A+++ seller. Thank you!!'),
(N'Noah', N'Patel', N'noah.patel2873@example.org', '2014-12-27', 5, N'It''s nice to own this quirky game on disc format. I already own it digitally on the PS4 but had to have this when I saw it. If you''re a fan of games like Psychonauts, old school LucasArts adventure games like Day of the Tentacle and Monkey Island, then you owe it to yourself to play this gem.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Reed', N'kelly.reed6320@example.com', '2014-12-27', 5, N'Fun and challenging. Much harder than SMB Wii U which I can get 99 lives and beat in a few hours. This one is fun and it isn''t an updated Mario 64 its different but it is definitely a game you must own if you have yourself a Wii U.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Martin', N'ryan.martin6397@example.org', '2014-12-27', 5, N'The gameplay was my favourite part of Mass Effect 1. All I had to do was upgrade the Sniper Rifle and I never needed to use the Mako except when combating the Sandworms of Dune (the Frank Herbert is strong in this one). I could just perch on a mountain ridge and utterly annihilate everything moving within a base over 100 yards away, including their tanks, with just the sniper rifle. When I got into close quarters all I had to use was the Assault Rifle. The other weapons you get in this game aren''t necessary. Customisation is a hassle when you spend 3/4 of your game time doing it (to be fair, this game IS an RPG, but geez, even I get bored switching out gun parts for the 3,000th time). The companions are unique, interesting and fun to interact with. Shepard is a block of wood with crazy eyes, so don''t look too hard in his/her direction when people are talking. Shepard does not know how to dance, so don''t visit the club dancefloors. Ever. The sound and music are crisp, clear and...'),
(N'Emily', N'Morales', N'emily.morales3321@example.net', '2014-12-27', 5, N'perfect gift'),
(N'Aisha', N'Roberts', N'aisha.roberts7698@example.com', '2014-12-27', 5, N'Awesome well made Amiibo case. It is not a duffle bag but more of a mini square shaped bag and it is pretty cool. It is not very big depending on how many amiibos you have. It does the job to keep them all organized in one place!'),
(N'Paul', N'Peterson', N'paul.peterson7684@example.com', '2014-12-27', 5, N'My 4 year old son has loves hot wheels and this game is great! So cute to virtually be able to go around the tracks =) Came in within the time frame for shipping and in good condition , thank you !'),
(N'Omar', N'Rivera', N'omar.rivera4013@example.org', '2014-12-27', 5, N'Amazing. Enough said.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Gonzalez', N'deborah.gonzalez3760@example.com', '2014-12-27', 5, N'It hasn''t even arrived yet, but I have played this game a lot over the years. It is one of the greatest RTS games of all time. The AI can be tough on harder settings, plus you can have multiple AI''s gang up against you. The resource management isn''t tedious, just metal and power. The controls are very easy to pick up, like second nature. It''s a blast to build up a army of robots and vehicles and clash with your enemies.'),
(N'John', N'Boyd', N'john.boyd3678@example.net', '2014-12-27', 2, N'I''m a long time fan of the franchise, but this offering may have ended my interest. The Good: Great graphics. Beautiful world. Very realistic and fascinating. Lush and fun to explore. The Bad: Story line is amateurish and dull. This is basically the same "loot and shoot" mission style of previous iterations. OK, but not that much fun. However, here is what ended it for me... the radio disk jockey''s drivel. I''m not sure what 12 year old was hired to write the script for the jockey''s banter but it is repugnant and distracts from the already lame game experience (ex: the DJ talks non-stop about feces, his sphincter hygiene and other toilet type blather). Ugh. Very very unnecessary. I''ll finish playing the game and try the online to see if that peps this up at all.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Okonkwo', N'rebecca.okonkwo3993@example.net', '2014-12-27', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Angela', N'Singh', N'angela.singh6535@example.org', '2014-12-28', 4, N'This game is very easy to play, especially if you (or your child) has any gaming experience at all. I played it with my 7-year old and she had no problems with the controls. We breezed through the game in less than 8 hours. There is also some good humor sprinkled throughout. For the price, it''s good entertainment for both kids and adults.'),
(N'Gary', N'Flores', N'gary.flores2724@example.org', '2014-12-28', 2, N'Do not buy anything that uses your console''s power input, it was cause heat problems which could lead to shorting out your console. I''ve seen melted inputs on consoles from these type of air coolers.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Richardson', N'tomasz.richardson5096@example.com', '2014-12-28', 4, N'This is so awesome'),
(N'William', N'James', N'william.james4347@example.org', '2014-12-28', 5, N'For the money it is the best wheel out there. It is comfortable and works like no other that I have used. The force feed is amazing and the leather wrapped steering wheel is very comfortable in the hands.'),
(N'Paul', N'Parker', N'paul.parker4563@example.org', '2014-12-28', 5, N'Gift for My Grandson .... He Loved it'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Chavez', N'jennifer.chavez3062@example.net', '2014-12-28', 5, N'The game was great, and the seller sent it out fast, however the gripe is with the developers and PSN shutting down White Knight Chronicles servers on both 1 and 2. So if you intend to play multiplayer or are looking for some rpg trophies to shoot for, don''t bother with this. However if you enjoy a decent story, fun game play, and a rich anime style fantasy game, then I definitely recommend this.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Howard', N'cheryl.howard1328@example.com', '2014-12-28', 5, N'collected'),
(N'Andrew', N'Chavez', N'andrew.chavez6458@example.org', '2014-12-28', 3, N'I bought this mouse for myself and was so excited and it is a good mouse there are some drawbacks that I found after a month of use. All in all its an ok mouse it is not as good as many of the gaming mouses available and I will most likely end up with another one before too long . The Pros: It looks awesome the color of the black and orange with hints of red look cool and the world of Warcraft log that fads in and out is cool my son loved it. The sides are textured to help keep from slipping when you are moving it around. Its wired this is becoming harder to find but as most games will tell you wired just works better in most cases especially in raiding. The Cons: it is a bit more bulky if you are a female it can be uncomfortable to handle for long periods of time like a three hour raid. I still have not been able to get some of the buttons to sync with my healing mod and the in game set up has been difficult but this may be because I do not understand it even after reading the...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Phillips', N'aisha.phillips1212@example.net', '2014-12-28', 3, N'Cant play fps n e more... makes me really dizzy lol. I was quite upset about the fact the story mode was so short... but i guess i expected that from all cod games.'),
(N'Patricia', N'White', N'patricia.white8746@example.org', '2014-12-28', 1, N'i purchased this game for my preschool aged grandson for Christmas 2014. He was excited when he saw the game but soon lost interest in the game. I have several complaints about this game that is suppose to be for "preschoolers" 1. The Elmo remote cover blocks the signal between the remote and the WII sensor. 2. A child must be able to recognize alphabets to play the games (beginning learners cannot play the game) 3. The zoo part of the game ask players to spell names of animal - I did not know some of the animals'' name 4. A child is required to shake his/her remote to choose an answer to a question - the remote becomes unresponsive thereby losing a child''s interest in the game 5. Parental help is needed to set up the multiple steps to begin playing the game. 6. The game does not pause or go back to the main menu so a parent has to press the home button on the remote, restart the game and re-enter information on the multiple setup screens'),
(N'Sharon', N'Morris', N'sharon.morris7818@example.net', '2014-12-28', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ruiz', N'stephanie.ruiz2945@example.org', '2014-12-28', 5, N'great game!!'),
(N'Mark', N'Perez', N'mark.perez9006@example.com', '2014-12-28', 4, N'There are things I love, and things I find strange. Having played each generation of this game there is always a learning curve when the interface changes. It''s the little things they seemed to improve on. Far too many to name but things like not having to scan a newspaper for several days to get the job you want for your sim. If your sim is grumpy when they cook they will slam the fridge door. You don''t have to listen to the carpool horn every day! Buy mode and build mode have been combined together. I think the only thing I haven''t liked is the open world is gone. You can move around outside your house only so far (couple houses in either direction), but if you want to visit a family next door you still have to travel there. Very limited places to visit. But you can visit other neighborhoods instead of being confined to one neighborhood and then any special expansion places like china, or the future, or vacation spots. It also feels very empty going from the tail end of one...'),
(N'Timothy', N'Taylor', N'timothy.taylor6793@example.org', '2014-12-28', 5, N'interesting'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Morgan', N'hiroshi.morgan4043@example.net', '2014-12-28', 5, N'grandkids love it'),
(N'Hannah', N'Mendoza', N'hannah.mendoza2435@example.org', '2014-12-28', 3, N'It''s alright. I know it''s on a island and all but, jeesh... not really much to show for it. I can''t believe that a tiny little island can hold so many convicts, near a city that is (at least) 1000 times it''s size. As for the actors, I can''t imagine a joker without the voice of Mark Hammel. No one can do it better. The fighting engine is great. Love it when Batman snaps a guy''s arm. But the stealth mode is a bit disappointing. For instance, in the library, he''s in a narrow hall way, and he can only use tall cabinet files to maneuver without being spotted. Come on. Hell, anyone could have spotted him easily in there. No one''s line of vision couldn''t have been that narrow, especially if they are looking for him. Sense the island is small, you''ll be revisiting allot of places quite often to either finish the game, or to find all the secrets that the Riddler left for you. (Which is the only replay value this game has).'),
(N'Deborah', N'Wang', N'deborah.wang6563@example.net', '2014-12-28', 5, N'great'),
(N'Steven', N'Russell', N'steven.russell1778@example.net', '2014-12-28', 5, N'Nice addition to PS4 as an accessory to keep the remotes charged at all times. It stops charging when the remotes are fully charged. However, if you are not careful and touched the micro USB port on the PS4 while they are plugged into the charging station, you get electrocuted.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Chen', N'jacob.chen9309@example.org', '2014-12-28', 4, N'Grandson loves playing this game I gave it to him for Christmas. Delivery was fast.'),
(N'Wei', N'Ivanov', N'wei.ivanov9580@example.org', '2014-12-28', 5, N'I bought this and a dozen other games for my 7 year old nephews new PS4 for Christmas... This is his absolute favorite. I as an adult gamer do not see the attraction, but when of all the games, this is the only one he talks about like crazy and was super excited about I can''t say it is bad. If you are buying this for a 6-9 year old it will be a hit for sure. Comparing this to an adult game like GTAV is like comparing a hotwheels track to a new Coffee pot. They both have different audiences, and their intended audience LOVES them.'),
(N'Karen', N'Diaz', N'karen.diaz6210@example.net', '2014-12-28', 2, N'It will work with PC computers . !! unfortunately every time you turn off your computer you have to go back through the process of re installing and naming the hardware to make it work again !! I do not recommend this product I would just buy one direct from Microsoft instead'),
(N'Luis', N'Kumar', N'luis.kumar2902@example.com', '2014-12-28', 5, N'My kid loved this gift!!'),
(N'Luis', N'Kumar', N'luis.kumar2902@example.com', '2014-12-28', 5, N'Kids love it'),
(N'Sofia', N'Garcia', N'sofia.garcia1975@example.org', '2014-12-29', 3, N'p;urchased used saved money kids liked it'),
