(N'Andrea', N'Howard', N'andrea.howard5483@example.org', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Andrea', N'Howard', N'andrea.howard5483@example.org', '2014-12-29', 5, N'It''s fun'),
(N'Ronald', N'Raghunathan', N'ronald.raghunathan1600@example.com', '2014-12-29', 5, N'GOOD'),
(N'Kelly', N'Johnson', N'kelly.johnson2107@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Cheap price and works .Most of our games won''t respond to it.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Ramirez', N'stephen.ramirez1190@example.com', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Tons of fun. looks much better then the original on 360 and PS3'),
(N'Angela', N'Morgan', N'angela.morgan7811@example.com', '2014-12-29', 5, N'excellent product, product as stated - excellent service! A+'),
(N'William', N'Roberts', N'william.roberts1659@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Grandson age 11 loves this game!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Singh', N'douglas.singh8139@example.com', '2014-12-29', 4, N'better than the movie'),
(N'Susan', N'Perry', N'susan.perry6995@example.com', '2014-12-29', 1, N'Bought it yesterday at store nearby, stopped working today for no reason...unplug and put in official nintendo nunchuck works fine...luckily I still have package and receipt and can return. Too bad, it was pretty.'),
(N'Charles', N'Martinez', N'charles.martinez1458@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'got it for a gift for my brother and he loves it!'),
(N'Ravi', N'Turner', N'ravi.turner2925@example.net', '2014-12-29', 2, N'The Lights are cool. But the rubber on the toggle controls wears out fast and breaks of easily which makes it unbearable on your thumbs to play.'),
(N'James', N'King', N'james.king4842@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ward', N'tyler.ward2340@example.net', '2014-12-29', 4, N'its a good game but the wii u video game got scratched so when I put the disc in the wii u it says it cannot read the disc.'),
(N'Emily', N'Collins', N'emily.collins5973@example.net', '2014-12-29', 4, N'Great'),
(N'Gary', N'Kim', N'gary.kim1643@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'I can''t believe I got this for only $2.99! I saw that it was $2.99 (regularly $25) so I jumped on it, later i saw they were sold out and returned to the $25 mark within seconds. The play and charge kit is amazing, and a must for anyone who doesn''t want to keep buying batteries, even for the price of $25. The cord is nice and long so you don''t have to sit up close to the tv if you want to charge and play at the same time. It charges pretty quickly and doesn''t seem to be effected by charging and charging and charging it. I have even noticed that the Xbox will charge it if you have it plugged in as the system is completely off (not even in standby mode) which I think is pretty cool.'),
(N'Heather', N'Lewis', N'heather.lewis4562@example.org', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Great game, recommend for all'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ferreira', N'brandon.ferreira5388@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Great game..'),
(N'Nancy', N'Perez', N'nancy.perez2169@example.com', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Excellent, very responsible and fast shipping. Thank you very much.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Coleman', N'nancy.coleman7154@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'One of the better games of this year, minus the few error codes every now and then.'),
(N'Jason', N'Gonzalez', N'jason.gonzalez2774@example.net', '2014-12-29', 4, N'The game is basically what it appeared to be when it was revealed at E3. It''s a darker, more serious, hacker version of grand theft auto. The gameplay is good and fun but there''s a few things that disappointed most people who''ve played this game. I''ll detail them out here: 1. Graphics on PS4: when they first revealed this game, they showed it off on a very high end PC machine. Most people were expecting the same level of graphics on the PS4 because it was not made clear that the original gameplay was not on a console. I still think the graphics are good but clearly not as good the trailer. Graphics don''t bother me that much though so this wasn''t a deal breaker for me. 2. Driving mechanics: people were expecting realistic contols and feel for the vehicles and driving sections in the game. I couldn''t care about this issue either. 3. No epic ending or lead into a bigger story: this is what bothered me. Most of the game centers around fairly small time criminals on chicago. My hope was...'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Khan', N'hiroshi.khan5648@example.org', '2014-12-29', 1, N'Not worth the money. Sorry.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Powell', N'victoria.powell7220@example.com', '2014-12-29', 5, N'perfect condition ... Perfect gift'),
(N'Pamela', N'Sullivan', N'pamela.sullivan9119@example.net', '2014-12-29', 5, N'PS4 is my life now! I can''t even sleep now haha'),
(N'Diane', N'Price', N'diane.price7577@example.com', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Still a great series! Small screen takes a little getting used to, since I''ve always played Smash on a TV, but once you get used to it, it''s just as good as the previous entries!'),
(N'Betty', N'Turner', N'betty.turner2319@example.com', '2014-12-29', 5, N'Recomendados!!!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Henderson', N'cynthia.henderson7232@example.com', '2014-12-29', 4, N'Not bad.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Cox', N'thomas.cox4880@example.org', '2014-12-30', 5, N'This is a great product. Good quality and provides a nice place to keep all the controllers together'),
(N'Carlos', N'Williams', N'carlos.williams7275@example.com', '2014-12-30', 5, N'The game has a great story, you also feel like you are actually there fighting the battle.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Young', N'tyler.young3677@example.com', '2014-12-30', 5, N'Bought my 2nd Xbox One from Amazon with AC:U and AC:BF for 349.99 plus I got a 70 dollar Amazon gift card. Christmas day was still able to play a few games in single player. Next day could play online. Can''t say that is true for PSN.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Mitchell', N'zachary.mitchell2164@example.net', '2014-12-30', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Cruz', N'carolyn.cruz2078@example.org', '2014-12-30', 5, N'A++++++'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Cooper', N'kathleen.cooper4810@example.org', '2014-12-30', 5, N'Caro'),
(N'Jack', N'Alvarez', N'jack.alvarez4221@example.net', '2014-12-30', 2, N'The game does not come with help on the game disk.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Russell', N'stephanie.russell5598@example.net', '2014-12-30', 4, N'Easy to set up, but you have to purchase an MS account to use some of the features and down load the Horizon Game...but of course my son loves it...'),
(N'Scott', N'Parker', N'scott.parker4367@example.org', '2014-12-30', 5, N'Received quickly. Good quality. My son has a little trouble getting the games in and out (harder snap) but it''s not bad. It works perfectly for what we need. I like that he can carry so many games and not have to take all their cases! Much less bulky! Holds both DS and 3ds games. Very happy with the purchase.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Hill', N'amanda.hill6414@example.net', '2014-12-30', 4, N'good game not sure if u can find someone to play the online sections of the game'),
(N'Maria', N'Suzuki', N'maria.suzuki1875@example.net', '2014-12-30', 5, N'I feel like I''m in the minority whose played and loved both the Professor Layton and Ace Attorney series. Most of the people I''m seeing have played either one or the other, which is a shame. If you want to get the full enjoyment out of this crossover experience, I highly recommend you play at least the original trilogies of both series. They are worth your time and emotions. If this is your first time hearing about either character, don''t even consider buying this game. Mostly because that''s stupid. Also, consider the fact that both games are story-centric and filled to the brim with text before submitting a negative review complaining about that very fact. You are not this game''s target audience and you need to leave. Nonetheless, this is an exceptional game and should serve as a testament that crossovers are capable of pulling off much more than blatant fanservice, as Level-5 and Capcom have managed to produce an impressive title with gameplay styles that blend well. If a...'),
(N'Ivan', N'Bennett', N'ivan.bennett5073@example.com', '2014-12-30', 5, N'Slight learning curve, won''t take the average player to FPS god or anything. However it does help with fine adjustments. These are convex or domed. They are comfortable once you get use to the added height.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Ivanov', N'douglas.ivanov8423@example.org', '2014-12-30', 5, N'Very nice game.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Harris', N'kelly.harris8263@example.org', '2014-12-30', 4, N'This game is very nice. The graphics are good for a game like this. It''s also very fun. But..the game takes a few hours to download. Also online games take a very long time to load. If you are patient then it won''t be a problem but most of the first person shooters that I get do not take as long to download and load an online server.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Turner', N'sofia.turner3994@example.org', '2014-12-30', 5, N'love it very fun'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2014-12-30', 4, N'I have to defend Escape Dead Island I Love Dead Island & DI Riptide I even bought the mp3 trailer music I have to call out Gamers in general they c/o Nonstop about wanting something Different and new then when anything different or Fresh come along example: (DMC: Devil May Cry & Escape Dead Island) they trash it don''t get behind and go back to playing Call Of Duty or Battlefield but, continue whining about having Nothing New or unique to play! Most Gamers have OCD (OCD is all about going through the motions That''s why COD and the yearly game releases get such a huge buy out every year! Escape Dead Island is something New & Different and gets thrown under the bus ''Cause gamers have become sheep I rented it from Red Box on a Friday kept it for two days I had very low expectations for this title and it surprised the hell out of me This is a very strange animal. It''s a very basic stealth title (which is good it can be extremely hard though) News Flash all you 1-2 Star Reviewers back in...'),
(N'Eric', N'Ruiz', N'eric.ruiz2648@example.net', '2014-12-30', 5, N'worked well'),
(N'Julie', N'Bell', N'julie.bell4637@example.net', '2014-12-30', 5, N'IT LOOKS LIKE IT''S TIME FOR JACK.... TO LET ''ER RIP'),
(N'Brenda', N'Singh', N'brenda.singh5429@example.org', '2014-12-30', 5, N'A great action packed game filled with super heroes and villains from Marvel and Capcom franchises. This is part 3 of Marvel Vs Capcom famous franchise. I recommend this game for Playstation 3.'),
(N'Mary', N'Thompson', N'mary.thompson8494@example.com', '2014-12-30', 5, N'A great add on for FSX'),
(N'Frank', N'Adams', N'frank.adams5287@example.com', '2014-12-30', 5, N'It workes great.'),
(N'Emily', N'Robinson', N'emily.robinson9880@example.com', '2014-12-30', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Zachary', N'Morgan', N'zachary.morgan9507@example.org', '2014-12-31', 5, N'Good one. Kids are enjoying the dance'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Price', N'evelyn.price9000@example.org', '2014-12-31', 5, N'Does the job (needed for the "Rocksmith" PS3)'),
(N'Barbara', N'Boyd', N'barbara.boyd5095@example.net', '2014-12-31', 5, N'My husband and I have owned every Myst game made. Of course over time, we set them aside and moved on to other interests. Years later, I am interested in re-acquiring as many of these games as I can. But reading all these reviews in reference to computer compatibility is a concern. So after much research I found "Good Old Games" website that allows a person to download the games onto their CURRENT computer. These games are formated to work on current operating systems. And you can''t beat the cost. (Riven is $5.99). They don''t have Exile or Revelations, but just about everything else. Definitely worth checking out, so you don''t waste your money trying to download a game that won''t run on today''s systems.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Alvarez', N'lauren.alvarez4568@example.net', '2014-12-31', 4, N'Simply an amazing game. It plays like all the other games, easy to learn but hard to master. Graphics are simply amazing, true use of the unreal engines power! My only complaints about this game is the extremely small character roster. My other complaint is it''s extremely over priced DLC. Not buying a single new character for over $9.'),
(N'Maria', N'Ali', N'maria.ali3572@example.net', '2014-12-31', 5, N'Awesome educational, fun product, quick delivery, great price...Thank you.'),
(N'Anna', N'Smith', N'anna.smith5823@example.org', '2014-12-31', 5, N'It Came on time and it really works Thanks'),
(N'Dee', N'Coleman', N'dee.coleman5231@example.net', '2014-12-31', 5, N'--- 2017 Update. I couldn''t be happier with these headphones. They still sound great, fit comfortably, work properly and show almost no visible wear after three years of ownership despite near constant use. HyperX is our first choice when buying gaming headphones. My original review from 2014 is below. I bought these for my son for Christmas. He was previously using a set of gaming headphones that cost $250. The sound of the prior set was good but he says these sound better. He wears them constantly so I took a listen and the sound quality is very good. I haven''t personally tried the mic but he uses it on a constant basis and says it is clear and other people hear him loud and clear. He was so impressed, he actually bought a second set as a gift for his girlfriend. The one complaint/disappointment that I had with the $250 Sennheiser headphones that preceded these was the fact that they literally fell apart from regular use right at the end of the two-year warranty. For $250, you''d...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Price', N'ethan.price2416@example.com', '2014-12-31', 5, N'Still working after some years!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Jimenez', N'aisha.jimenez8036@example.com', '2014-12-31', 5, N'Bought many times and always happy with the service and the product!'),
