(N'Wei', N'Nguyen', N'wei.nguyen7700@example.org', '2015-01-01', 5, N'Everything went very well with this purchase'),
(N'Emily', N'Jimenez', N'emily.jimenez3941@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'Works perfectly with Pokemon games.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Mitchell', N'kenneth.mitchell4657@example.org', '2015-01-01', 5, N'If you have a child who is into Minecraft then you know that this game is a must. My son would play this all day if we let him. It''s a creative game of building worlds and stuff.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Coleman', N'ravi.coleman4473@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'my daughter loved this item. it shipped quickly.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Chen', N'nicholas.chen7920@example.org', '2015-01-01', 4, N'This game was HARD. Not NES TMNT #1 Hard, but not too far from it either. Unlike Streets of Rage, this game is incredibly unforgiving even for the well practiced and time tested players of its levels with years of experience. 4 stars because some of what made this game so difficult came down to poor character box hit zones, bosses that required suicide tactics to defeat, and when you die - that X-Man is NEVER coming back. He''s not locked up like in turtles either. GONE. Old School Fire Emblem style GONE. Pros: The graphics were great, the characters are fun each in their own right, and before death knocks on your door, this makes for a co-op experience worth a few bucks to get pissed at all over again nowadays.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Wood', N'patricia.wood8162@example.org', '2015-01-01', 5, N'good'),
(N'Sandra', N'Henderson', N'sandra.henderson8453@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'Working!!'),
(N'James', N'Thomas', N'james.thomas4282@example.com', '2015-01-01', 5, N'My son specifically pointed out that this was one of the best games he got this Christmas and that he wasn''t expecting it to be so good. So I thought I should definitely give it a good review.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Ruiz', N'barbara.ruiz3349@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'classic'),
(N'Frank', N'Rivera', N'frank.rivera2450@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Henry', N'Robinson', N'henry.robinson9943@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'Got it, It''s good!'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Rogers', N'jonathan.rogers4614@example.net', '2015-01-01', 3, N'Not what I was especting.'),
(N'Jason', N'Russell', N'jason.russell8177@example.org', '2015-01-01', 5, N'What''s to say, it''s a new PS4 with 2 cool games. Definitely worth the money.'),
(N'Luis', N'Alvarez', N'luis.alvarez2373@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'Great game, but there are alot of words that need to be read throughout the journey.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Perez', N'stephanie.perez5384@example.net', '2015-01-01', 5, N'My niece is a Dora famatic so I got this for her Christmas present. She loves it.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Mendoza', N'aisha.mendoza2247@example.com', '2015-01-01', 1, N'It was all yellow I did not want that one'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Coleman', N'elizabeth.coleman1225@example.com', '2015-01-01', 4, N'Comfortable.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Castillo', N'evelyn.castillo8477@example.org', '2015-01-01', 3, N'sound is great , but it fits tight around your ears. maybe it will give after a while but it hurts the ears if you wear glasses after prolonged gaming sessions. now i know how women feel like wearing a tight bra...and taking it off. but it sounds really good.not my final solution but at $34 i couldn''t pass on it. specially after i lost my playstation wireless stereo headset dongle and needed something not to wake my girlfriend at night.'),
(N'Judith', N'Mendoza', N'judith.mendoza2506@example.com', '2015-01-02', 5, N'Excellent keyboard.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Wood', N'kofi.wood5706@example.org', '2015-01-02', 5, N'I got this as a Christmas present for someone and he gave it a great review. If anyone has suggestions for games that are like this let me know, I''m sure he''d like them.'),
(N'Aisha', N'James', N'aisha.james9280@example.net', '2015-01-02', 5, N'like alway FARCRY is one of the top game and every year is better and better , I recommend it to every ones , thank you to Ubisoft'),
(N'Robert', N'Brooks', N'robert.brooks2592@example.com', '2015-01-02', 3, N'This is good, but it doesn''t go with my wii, but works well with the game cube.'),
(N'Betty', N'Reed', N'betty.reed1907@example.org', '2015-01-02', 5, N'THIS VERSION IS IN JAPANESE The English ver has a different cover. Im just pointing that out cause I got confused and got the wrong one....but don''t mind since I know some Japanese. I hope this helps for those who are looking for the english ver. Also Its a Great Game love it'),
(N'Ronald', N'Evans', N'ronald.evans8505@example.net', '2015-01-02', 5, N'excellent sale'),
(N'Ronald', N'Evans', N'ronald.evans8505@example.net', '2015-01-02', 5, N'excellent purchase'),
(N'Deborah', N'Taylor', N'deborah.taylor4635@example.org', '2015-01-02', 5, N'Great product, great price'),
(N'Jason', N'Ward', N'jason.ward5386@example.net', '2015-01-02', 4, N'Use it to take apart XBOX360 (sim) that unit was pre-own from gamestop'),
(N'Amara', N'Parker', N'amara.parker9852@example.org', '2015-01-02', 5, N'This game really took a ton of people by surprise this year. This game wasn''t anywhere on my radar until I saw professional reviews start coming in. Then I felt like I had to give it a look. Then I felt like I had to own it. Then I played it and enjoyed it WAY more than I expected. It''s definitely what you would call a sleeper hit. The gameplay is a pretty solid hybrid of Assassin''s Creed and the Arkham games. It controls similarly to both and honestly it controls great. There was never a time that I was frustrated with either the combat or exploration controls, it just feels great and what you expect to happen just... happens. It manages to be a better Assassin''s Creed game than Assassin''s Creed really is. And that''s saying something. I''m starting to think Ubisoft should just get Monolith to start making AC games now. Or at least take notes. The game looks great, too! I played it on PS4. It isn''t the most graphically impressive game I''ve played, but it looks pretty good. Frame...'),
(N'Susan', N'Nowak', N'susan.nowak8965@example.com', '2015-01-02', 5, N'Great headphones. The sound is crisp and clear, and as someone who''s not used to using headphones for gaming it''s a totally new and immersive experience. The headset bar is small enough that it stays out oft he way and other players can hear you clearly and without problems. They''re comfortable, fit snugly and sound great. Really no complaints, and the price was reasonable. Highly recommend!'),
(N'Mary', N'Wright', N'mary.wright3532@example.net', '2015-01-02', 3, N'it does as needed'),
(N'Matthew', N'Coleman', N'matthew.coleman7820@example.org', '2015-01-02', 5, N'It arrived brand new and pretty quick too'),
(N'Laura', N'Long', N'laura.long7042@example.com', '2015-01-02', 5, N'Ubisoft Montreal at it''s best. This iteration is very fun and well made. The only draw backs are the save system, which dumps you at a way point, and the cutscenes that you can''t bypass. Otherwise it''s as fun as Skyrim or Half-Life.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Watson', N'sandra.watson7413@example.net', '2015-01-02', 5, N'This is the Alien game everybody has been waiting for. It captures the feel of the first film perfectly. I had reservations about purchasing this game as you cannot actually kill the Alien. My fears were for nothing. There is a great balance in the game with every task that you have to complete. I could not put this game down. I started on the hardest setting and I can tell you there were a few times were I was extremely frustrated but in the end this was a solid game. Great voice acting and a deep story make this game amazing. It is a story that is canon and deserves its place the this universe. I hope there is a sequel.'),
(N'William', N'Cook', N'william.cook4339@example.net', '2015-01-02', 5, N'these are great to have for this small screen games'),
(N'William', N'Cook', N'william.cook4339@example.net', '2015-01-02', 5, N'great game, young teen loved the movie, now plays this all the time'),
(N'Sofia', N'Chavez', N'sofia.chavez2001@example.com', '2015-01-03', 5, N'It keeps the batteries charged'),
(N'Laura', N'Ruiz', N'laura.ruiz4513@example.com', '2015-01-03', 5, N'I recommend'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Foster', N'kathleen.foster3056@example.net', '2015-01-03', 2, N'I''ve been playing the Ratchet & Clank games ever since the series first came out on the PS2, and I always loved the games. I was really impressed with the new HD remastered versions of these games! All three games also do have trophy support. Also, all games are on a single Bluray disc, no voucher codes - although there is a code for a Sly demo. However, the demo expired in March of 2013. Because the demo expired, you can''t unlock the purple lightsaber in Up Your Arsenal by playing the demo. But there is a code for it: pause the game and press circle, square, circle, square, up, down, left, left. As mentioned above, the game does not come in a case. Instead, it comes in a crappy little piece of cardboard. The cardboard was bent when I received it (not the sellers fault), and it was not easy getting the shrink wrap off. If I spent the average new game price of $60, I''d demand a refund, but at the price of $20 for three games, I''m not too concerned about it. The lack of protective...'),
(N'Eric', N'Walker', N'eric.walker1571@example.org', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Excellent.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Lopez', N'kathleen.lopez5977@example.net', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Good!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Foster', N'deborah.foster9923@example.com', '2015-01-03', 4, N'Lots of fun but complicated controls.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Brown', N'alexander.brown8577@example.com', '2015-01-03', 5, N'I love this game! I really love the sea battles. Really enjoy the time period chosen as well. Don''t get me wrong, I loved the Leonardo Da Vinci stuff in the prior game, but am really enjoying the colonial time period and Sons of Liberty storyline. Really just all around good fun.'),
(N'Karen', N'Myers', N'karen.myers7141@example.net', '2015-01-03', 5, N'I was fun a long time ago and it is fun now, under appreciated classic. Looks great if you can appreciate pixel games.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Reed', N'brandon.reed9321@example.com', '2015-01-03', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Perry', N'jeremy.perry8058@example.com', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Great Product for Price!!!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Carter', N'nicole.carter7004@example.org', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Hard game'),
(N'Matthew', N'Rivera', N'matthew.rivera9130@example.org', '2015-01-03', 4, N'This game isn''t totally what I was expecting. For one thing, none of the reviews ever mention the fact that multi-player in this game does not let you use your main character that you created and spend hundreds of hours playing the entire storyline with. It appears to be preset characters that you have to use to pick from, which is just stupid. It makes multiplayer a totally separate game then that isn''t even totally related. This is a big negative for me, maybe not to other people. I have a lot of problems with the rift events. I don''t see anywhere that displays the level of the events, so maybe the ones I tried were too high a level, I don''t know. You walk under a rift, but it doesn''t give any indication on whether you can cast the spell (press the button) to destroy it or not, many times you can''t, while standing under it expecting it to work, which ends up killing you. There was no tutorial or instructions on this. What I do love about the game is the cut scene talking and your...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Johnson', N'aisha.johnson7405@example.com', '2015-01-03', 1, N'Don''t waste your money on this console, get the regular console there is no difference. Just plastic and some paint. That is all there is to it.'),
(N'Jose', N'Martinez', N'jose.martinez5165@example.com', '2015-01-03', 3, N'Wish the songs were more kid friendly.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Jimenez', N'michelle.jimenez9602@example.com', '2015-01-03', 3, N'Seems to be much like the original - I admit we haven''t done a whole lot with it. Was purchased as a gift for my two kids to play together, but your youngest is far to young to really grasp the concept of this game (he''s only 2). 10 year old loses interest pretty fast. She loved it when she was around 7.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Scott', N'andrew.scott1934@example.net', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ivanov', N'jessica.ivanov1135@example.net', '2015-01-03', 5, N'excelent'),
(N'Aaron', N'Sanchez', N'aaron.sanchez3503@example.com', '2015-01-03', 5, N'daughter loves it'),
(N'Sarah', N'Edwards', N'sarah.edwards2813@example.org', '2015-01-03', 5, N'As a big fan of every Mario Kart this game picked up where the Wii''s entry had left, pushes the barrier a little further and recovers from the steps back that Mario Kart Wii had taken: you''re again able to block incoming red/green shells effectively. When you feel like you''ve takes all that the game can offer, go pick up a race over internet and get ready to learn new shortcuts and better ways of taking the next curve :-)'),
(N'Dee', N'Gutierrez', N'dee.gutierrez7258@example.org', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Jessica', N'Young', N'jessica.young6193@example.com', '2015-01-03', 1, N'only used about 3 or 4 times, already stopped working'),
(N'Kofi', N'Martinez', N'kofi.martinez8352@example.org', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Excellent, product as described, delivered as promised.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Johnson', N'deborah.johnson3744@example.com', '2015-01-03', 3, N'I liked'),
(N'Justin', N'Chen', N'justin.chen6701@example.net', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Weve been playing this game for days, including myself and my husband. Bought the wheels and even purchased some of the extra characters. Super awesome game for the whole family.'),
(N'Eric', N'Myers', N'eric.myers3977@example.org', '2015-01-03', 4, N'I used to play this game on Nintendo, so it was no question I would buy the newer version.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Wood', N'samuel.wood3355@example.org', '2015-01-03', 5, N'Fits just fine, buttons are level with the skin but I expected that. Works well for me and now I feel like I''m not gonna break it when I set it down.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Kumar', N'brandon.kumar5407@example.net', '2015-01-04', 5, N'super cool!!!'),
(N'Noah', N'Lopez', N'noah.lopez8861@example.net', '2015-01-04', 3, N'Game looks the same (no new graphics), is full of glitches and will not save. Here it is January 4th and I still cannot get past the option between the girl and the guy - keeps reverting back to that choice, and does not allow me to really get into the game. I''ve played both missions and yet, still go back to the same "choice." At this point, it is 100% frustrating and unplayable. Withstanding, Before every cut scene, the screen fades to black and I have to hit Alt-Ctl-Del or Alt-Tab to start the cut scene, and the xbox 360 controller in Windows 7 is terrible, no matter how much I adjust the sensitivity level. What a joke. Where is the patch Uplay? Wait a few months for this game until they fix it and it comes down in price. I was looking forward to Far Cry 4 and uninstalled Far Cry 3 in anticipation. Bad decision. I just uninstalled Far Cry 4 - had enough. This is not how you treat customers, and these types of beta, pre-releases for PC games is becoming the norm. Enough already,...'),
(N'Andrew', N'Kumar', N'andrew.kumar7491@example.com', '2015-01-04', 4, N'The graphics are wonderful, and the puzzles are mostly fun, but I skipped a bunch of them because the instructions just didn''t make sense to me. Overall, an enjoyable, if short, gaming experience. The HO scenes are more interesting because there are many objects you need to combine first. The story is interesting, and the video sequences are well done. I enjoyed collecting the flowers and money and bulding my garden. It was a nice addition to the game play. My biggest complaint is that it was far too short for me - finished it over 2 days, and not too many hours.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Richardson', N'stephen.richardson7753@example.com', '2015-01-04', 5, N'Great game, much better than expected. I regret holding off on it for so long. If you''re on the fence about this, just get it.'),
(N'Priya', N'Sanchez', N'priya.sanchez7672@example.com', '2015-01-04', 3, N'I have a big head - this is too small for my head. Gave me a major headache.'),
(N'William', N'Khan', N'william.khan4581@example.com', '2015-01-04', 5, N'The game is great, but for being someone who doesn''t really like baseball for me it still does get boring after a while'),
(N'Betty', N'Gutierrez', N'betty.gutierrez1078@example.net', '2015-01-04', 5, N'Great buy and came as promised.'),
(N'Paul', N'Davis', N'paul.davis1235@example.com', '2015-01-04', 5, N'cool game'),
(N'Christina', N'Reyes', N'christina.reyes9068@example.com', '2015-01-04', 5, N'Fast and secure! All like I expected, totally worth it'),
(N'Tyler', N'Perry', N'tyler.perry8492@example.net', '2015-01-04', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Michael', N'White', N'michael.white5726@example.org', '2015-01-04', 4, N'yes'),
(N'Yuki', N'Diaz', N'yuki.diaz4974@example.com', '2015-01-04', 5, N'Fits My 3DS perfectly i''m happy with this buy ..'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ruiz', N'cynthia.ruiz9459@example.com', '2015-01-04', 5, N'excelent game'),
(N'Joan', N'Harris', N'joan.harris5723@example.org', '2015-01-04', 5, N'Great just what he wanted'),
(N'Lisa', N'Flores', N'lisa.flores7162@example.org', '2015-01-04', 4, N'Excellent JRPG, maybe a little bit repetitive but nevertheless a fun and complex (not SMT style, though) game. Lots of fanservice which is not bad because it gives the game more gameplay trying to hook up with the girls. Yes, it''s Japanase creepinees but I love it!'),
(N'Judith', N'Baker', N'judith.baker6945@example.net', '2015-01-04', 5, N'Holds my 2DS fine, can be found cheaper though. Nintendo website can probably point you in the right direction.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Brown', N'jacob.brown5108@example.com', '2015-01-04', 4, N'I am not a hard core gamer, but I am a software designer and a frequent reviewer of gadgets. The hardware portion of this mouse is fine, it''s comfortable and the buttons it provides are easily accessible for right-handed mousing. It even has a couple of premium flourishes: I wish all wired peripherals came with such a nice tangle free woven cable, and the extravagance of the exposed scroll wheel gets you in the mood for some serious desktop hot-rodding. (My daughter also likes the fact that you can turn on pink highlights with the embedded LEDs.) While quite comprehensive in its control features, I do not like the design language used in the configuration software. Grey on black does not make for a easily navigated interface, and I wish people would stop doing it (I''m looking at you Steam) and not try to look like some cyberpunk future. More importantly, I don''t feel the software is well organized in terms of quickly getting things done. And of course, there is no Mac configuration...'),
(N'David', N'Ward', N'david.ward6690@example.com', '2015-01-04', 5, N'Great Job!'),
(N'Emma', N'Davis', N'emma.davis2142@example.com', '2015-01-04', 4, N'okay'),
(N'Noah', N'Myers', N'noah.myers9483@example.com', '2015-01-05', 1, N'The games are great but the EA Origins software that is required to play them is just awful. I had to contact customer service to redeem the codes, which took me over an hour of waiting. The second time I tried to play, the games again would not show up even though they had been redeemed. I tried to contact customer service again regarding the redemption codes but never was able to reach a live person or get it resolved otherwise, after three hours of trying. So overall I wasted more than four hours of my life for a game I got to play one time. I don''t understand why these can''t be played standalone without using Origins.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Stewart', N'michelle.stewart9948@example.org', '2015-01-05', 5, N'Ok great.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Sullivan', N'aisha.sullivan6117@example.org', '2015-01-05', 4, N'Very simple. Charges without problems. USB ports working fine. Delivered in less than a week which it was pretty good considering it does not have the Prime service.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Rogers', N'tomasz.rogers5983@example.org', '2015-01-05', 4, N'My son seems to like it, but he''s a noob... lol'),
(N'Kyle', N'Flores', N'kyle.flores5854@example.org', '2015-01-05', 3, N'Cute game with cute noises not a bad game but not a favorite.'),
(N'Wei', N'Turner', N'wei.turner3533@example.org', '2015-01-05', 5, N'Just what we were looking for.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Ali', N'pamela.ali9903@example.net', '2015-01-05', 4, N'good'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Boyd', N'jacqueline.boyd5115@example.org', '2015-01-05', 3, N'For first impressions, I will give a short list of pros and cons so far. Pros: -Cheap! I paid about $15 for the unit -Plays games fairly well. -Looks like a nice unit -Doesn''t take up tons of room -Controllers are decent. Cons: -Cheap! -Very light; I taped mine to an old disk drive to prevent it from being angrily pulled onto the floor and broken. -Build quality is sketchy; feels like you could just break it by sitting on it in a bean bag chair -Played Blaster Master and it took me about 6 attempts of inserting it and removing it for the graphic glitches to go away. Overall this is quite a decent little system if you can look past the moderate build quality and sketchy compatibility.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Wang', N'olivia.wang4322@example.net', '2015-01-05', 4, N'Far Cry 4 - PlayStation 4 is an incredible experience. I did not play any of the other Far Cry games, so this version was my introduction to this game line. I must say that it is an incredibly well done and executed game. The amount of detail and possible game play here is more than impressive. I am not a teenager (not for a LONG time) and do not play games all that much, but enjoy it when I do. This is the type of game that really makes me appreciate the level of quality that these systems are capable of. The visuals are just amazing. There are a great many scenes and locations that you can explore and it keeps impressing as the game goes on. Again, being an older player I look for different things in games than a younger person probably does. So taking this into account I let my teenage nephew play it when he came over and he found it to be a great game as well. Lots of action, lots of different game play and incredible graphics. What a great experience this game is.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Carter', N'pamela.carter9480@example.com', '2015-01-05', 5, N'xmas gift they loved it'),
(N'Deborah', N'Phillips', N'deborah.phillips1768@example.net', '2015-01-05', 5, N'Cool'),
(N'Amy', N'Alvarez', N'amy.alvarez8337@example.net', '2015-01-05', 5, N'Ok thanks'),
(N'Ryan', N'Russell', N'ryan.russell7910@example.org', '2015-01-05', 5, N'Persona Q is like a jelly donut. It''s the Etrian Odyssey mold with a Persona filling--a pastry which, when you finally get to taste it, turns out to taste maybe just a little less sweet than you had hoped for. All the ingredients are there, but it''s missing something special. But what the heck...Rei would still eat it and want more, and probably so would you. Let''s start with a breakdown of what exactly Persona Q is relative to its "parents". It''s got your Etrian Odyssey dungeons and character formations, with some major changes based on the Persona combat system. Unfortunately, herein lies the problem, albeit a small one. The game really feels like Atlus threw some Etrian noodles at the Velvet Room wall to see what stuck. Obviously the abilities and Persona Fusion mechanics scream "Persona" gameplay, but they are forced into an awkward equilibrium with Etrian Odyssey mechanics. See, Persona games are all about an extremely simple combat system. That''s right, Persona fans, we play...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Parker', N'jonathan.parker6673@example.com', '2015-01-06', 5, N'I LOVE THIS GAME! I preordered it and it came the day of release, and I wasted no time playing it. I actually haven''t finished it yet, but this game is super cute! The puzzles are great, some of the music is remixed from Super Mario 3D World (where this game originated from), and overall it''s just great! The only drawback is that it''s one save file, so if you want to start a new game you''d have to erase the data in this one.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Morgan', N'sharon.morgan8711@example.org', '2015-01-06', 4, N'Nice game but you will get bored after playing it for long time'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Williams', N'carolyn.williams9987@example.com', '2015-01-06', 5, N'Son loves it'),
(N'Diane', N'Ivanov', N'diane.ivanov9123@example.com', '2015-01-06', 5, N'If you waited on D3, you don''t need to wait any longer. Do yourself a favor and pick this up, it''s a great 4 player game and easily the best 4 player co-op game of the PS3''s life cycle.'),
(N'Dee', N'Sanchez', N'dee.sanchez9079@example.org', '2015-01-06', 5, N'My son really loves this game.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Roberts', N'stephen.roberts7591@example.com', '2015-01-06', 5, N'My Sister Loves this game!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Lewis', N'sarah.lewis7796@example.org', '2015-01-06', 5, N'Well, I was a bit of a skeptic at first because I played Far Cry 3 and did not like it nearly as much as this one. I rented this one from a local store for five days and only made it to day four before I had to buy it. This game is amazing in graphics as well as gameplay. Now, partly through my second time playing through the game I still enjoy it as much as the first time. This one is giving GTA 5 a run for my gameplay time. The campaign missions are absolutely great and you''ll find that they tie back in to the campaign later. You get to make choices on who to support and then do their mission, which will lead to consequences later on. Additionally, the missions that are not campaign related are usually pretty good. Sometimes the hunting missions become routine but the random animal spawns and enemy patrols usually keep it interesting. The collectibles are time comsuming to get them all, bet if you do you get a bonus that makes you player even better. I love the stealth aspect of...'),
(N'Emma', N'Gomez', N'emma.gomez3277@example.net', '2015-01-06', 3, N'I played the game off and on for about 3-4 months. It''s one of those games you can just pick-up and play without devoting too much thought or energy, yet still has a fun element to it. I''d say most of the games harder challenges are won by "luck" and not by your particular skill. The game itself is fairly repetitive. You need to match gems in sets of 3 or more (kinda like Tetris) and you typically take turns vs. an opponent. Whoever''s hit-points are reduced to zero first loses. You get spells and attributes to improve your odds of winning matches. The best spells are only available after you capture monsters, which creates one variant of the game play. You''re given a prearranged layout and have to figure out how to eliminate every single gem. Several monsters are tricky and can take awhile to figure out the trick. Once you have captured monsters you can learn their spells, and this creates second harder variant of the core gameplay. Now you have to eliminate set numbers of gems and...'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ali', N'brandon.ali6958@example.net', '2015-01-06', 1, N'Brought this item and it broke 3 weeks later'),
(N'Yuki', N'Lee', N'yuki.lee1563@example.com', '2015-01-06', 5, N'This is a great game with all the fun of twisted metal brought to the psp'),
(N'Brandon', N'Webb', N'brandon.webb9944@example.net', '2015-01-06', 5, N'Cool Game :-)'),
(N'Andrea', N'Watson', N'andrea.watson3740@example.net', '2015-01-06', 5, N'As a fan of Tom Clancy I was very pleased with this game was more than I expected.'),
(N'Carol', N'Wright', N'carol.wright2423@example.net', '2015-01-06', 4, N'Atlus makes some of the best RPGs ever. I never had a DS so with few games i want to play on the 3DS currently it''s great go go back and see what i missed out on. The battle system is cool, attacks aren''t really flashy but are done well enough. The time mechanic is really well done and simple enough to understand once things get going. My only complaint is the low amount of enemy sprites, they get recycled a ton. Entering a new area and seeing a pink version version of the blue and green thing you''ve killed forever is kind of a letdown. Other than that the game''s a blast.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Reed', N'elizabeth.reed9487@example.org', '2015-01-06', 5, N'After the first this is a must and one of the best!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Campbell', N'dennis.campbell5531@example.org', '2015-01-06', 4, N'Totally loved this game and had a blast playing it. I was very disappointed with its preorder bonus since I had to wait like a week to even get it and by then they were just useless extra cars in my collection. Work on that Ubisoft. The game itself while I loved many things about it the one thing I disliked a lot was my lack of freedom to change up what car I used where. I understood this as a game with missions but I had my selection of collection of my cars to use any build but that is sadly not the case. Depending on the mission you are required to use dirt or street kitted cars. Its extremely frustrating to be forced to use a street car on a dirt route. The real time you have a choice like I wanted is when doing the skill challenges laid about the many roads. I wanted there to be more secret cars not just finding the different parts to add onto the only two secret cars you actually get and for being the secret cars they really should have all the kits not just street and dirt.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Rodriguez', N'anthony.rodriguez8688@example.net', '2015-01-06', 5, N'I mean. What a game. Let''s be honest if you''re buying this game you know what you''re getting into. You''re not buying this game because you want a Madden experience. You''re buying this game because the name of this game and the game itself is just hilarious. And he gameplay falls right in line with that. It''s awful but honestly would you want it any other way? Also the only football game with a half time, guitar hero-like, mini game, which is pretty impossible to master. But seriously this is everything I expected and more. 5/5.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Ali', N'kyle.ali3406@example.com', '2015-01-06', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ramirez', N'brandon.ramirez2475@example.com', '2015-01-06', 3, N'Really bad humming from the "streamport". The entire reason I bought this was for that output. You can hack together a cable to fix this. USB cant dump enough juice to properly power the device. Otherwise it''s okay.'),
(N'Scott', N'Robinson', N'scott.robinson8362@example.com', '2015-01-06', 2, N'They try to make it nice, but i found it too boring. Everything is not unique, just standard. Not interesting graphics, not interesting level design, not interesting story. You can play this game only if nothing more to play.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Thomas', N'melissa.thomas9387@example.com', '2015-01-06', 2, N'Played this years ago, but lost my original copy. Tried to run this on Win7 64bit and had issues, even when trying to run it in a shell. Decided that it''s just too old for modern Windows systems and had to give up on trying.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Torres', N'benjamin.torres3775@example.com', '2015-01-07', 5, N'I love it!'),
(N'Jose', N'Foster', N'jose.foster5298@example.com', '2015-01-07', 4, N'Have never beaten it but it has a good setup. It is hard to find a good RTS these days with all the different ideas these companies are trying to put in to get a new setup. Most are fails in my eyes. They took a kind of okay setup and made it better. *cough* Nothing beats Age of Empires 2 though*'),
(N'Dennis', N'Anderson', N'dennis.anderson3446@example.org', '2015-01-07', 5, N'Shipped, received on time. Was amazed when my wife turned on her game boy, the battery wasn''t dry and it practically looks brand new.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Rogers', N'kofi.rogers9493@example.net', '2015-01-07', 5, N'I barely ever even play my Vita, bought it about 2 years ago and it''s been one of those decisions I''ve somewhat regretted just for the simple fact that I don''t use it enough....why? Because half the games are crap in my opinion, but this was the first game I''ve played on Vita that I can''t put down. The only con for me is that it''s Japanese with English subtitles. Definitely recommend to monster hunter fans and everyone else that''s questioning buying this!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Powell', N'stephen.powell4034@example.com', '2015-01-07', 5, N'Absolutely fantastic and the best of the Weird Park series, inventive, clever and with a wide variety of games. Have played many Alawar games and I think this is the best one so far including House of a Thousand Doors. Downloaded cleanly on my Vista system. After the main story is played out; it took me a few days, there is a bonus chapter that is just as entertaining (and surprisingly long).'),
(N'Yuki', N'Lewis', N'yuki.lewis8832@example.net', '2015-01-07', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Mei', N'Turner', N'mei.turner4051@example.com', '2015-01-07', 4, N'If you enjoyed AC: Black Flag you will enjoy this one as well. The game keeps the same game play as the last one but to me it didn''t have a complete story to it. The game takes a turn in the series where the assassins are usually the good guys and Templar''s are bad but in this game the roles are reversed. It has an interesting turn of events and I will explain what I liked and what I didn''t like about this game. Game play is exactly like the previous AC games so if you enjoyed them then you will have no problem with this one. The combat was pretty much the same as it always is hit a button to counter then attack to finish them off. There are a few enemies that where this doesnt work but for the most part they all follow this basic format. For me I don''t have a problem with it because I have always enjoyed the simple combat. Sea Combat is pretty much the same and still as fun! Storyline was short and started out good but became a bit confusing as time went on. The game starts out...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Wilson', N'aisha.wilson9291@example.com', '2015-01-07', 5, N'Best persona game in my opinion,and yes better than 4'),
(N'Wei', N'Mitchell', N'wei.mitchell4962@example.com', '2015-01-07', 3, N'Everything was ok with this seller. Reccomended.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Fisher', N'matthew.fisher3765@example.org', '2015-01-07', 5, N'Love it! A very nice controller.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Okonkwo', N'nancy.okonkwo4281@example.net', '2015-01-07', 5, N'Was purchased for my son for Christmas. He absolutely loved it.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Green', N'samantha.green3567@example.org', '2015-01-07', 4, N'As a fan of the early Mortal Kombat games more than the newer ones this was a pleasant surprise as it seems to take place timewise around the 2nd - 3rd games. Plus this explores the MK universe in a different way through Kung Lao and Liu Kangs adventure through Outworld. Plus MKII is hidden in the game. Wicked BONUS!!!'),
(N'Judith', N'Rodriguez', N'judith.rodriguez3855@example.net', '2015-01-07', 3, N'As advertised'),
(N'Amanda', N'Murphy', N'amanda.murphy5074@example.com', '2015-01-08', 5, N'It''s a great game'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ramos', N'jessica.ramos7174@example.com', '2015-01-08', 4, N'The Good: The 3D models look great in spite of my previous skepticism. The controls feel very good to me, and I personally feel like inputs are a little more forgiving than those in Accent Core, but I can''t tell if this is actually the case or just being slightly too excited about a new release. I thought trimming down the cast was a good move, because I felt the Accent Core cast was getting too big, and it was quite the task to keep track of how everyone functions. It''s fun, complex, and doesn''t forgive thoughtless play. The Bad: Team Red seems to have gotten a little carried away with the Unreal Engine. A dust into an aerial combo or a super now fixes the camera on the character using that move and does this 3D rotation for the former and an ultra close-up for the latter. It''s difficult to counter/respond when your character is suddenly obfuscated or out of the shot entirely. What''s more, the super start-up animation makes it slightly difficult to know right away if your attack...'),
(N'Luis', N'Scott', N'luis.scott6481@example.com', '2015-01-08', 5, N'excelente!!!!!'),
(N'Lisa', N'Kowalski', N'lisa.kowalski4404@example.org', '2015-01-08', 4, N'Pretty good game.'),
(N'Mark', N'Hughes', N'mark.hughes4251@example.net', '2015-01-08', 5, N'excelentes graficas'),
(N'Kofi', N'Morales', N'kofi.morales6676@example.net', '2015-01-08', 2, N'If you want to replay all the campaigns then this is for you however as of January 8 2015 multiplayer is still pretty much unplayable iny case it takes unacceptably long to find a match on any playlist and when you do get in a game expect plenty disconnects so it 4v2 I''ve frankly lost hope that they will ever fix this completely and for the love god can we get better playlist its all pretty much team slayer on your choice of halo 1 through 4 I want skirmish for my choice of game or mabey I wanna play big team battle on just halo 2 please add some kind of master filter for this 343 don''t ruin halo for me'),
(N'Mateo', N'Parker', N'mateo.parker4138@example.net', '2015-01-08', 1, N'It came with a broken piece: the lens'' engine. It wouldn''t play any games, all I could do was navigate the System''s main menu. I had to spend over 50 dollars trying to repair. And when I finally got it to play games, it kept, and keeps, making strong noises while reading game discs.'),
(N'Amy', N'Wang', N'amy.wang9311@example.com', '2015-01-08', 5, N'Kids love it! It is fun and you get tons of exercise!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Sanders', N'daniel.sanders1887@example.com', '2015-01-08', 4, N'This game is pretty good but it is too short. Since I am a Dragon ball, Dragon ball Z, and Dragon ball GT fan, I liked it though. It would have been better if it was longer and more detailed and if one could play with more characters.'),
(N'Noah', N'Foster', N'noah.foster4198@example.com', '2015-01-08', 5, N'I got these after a friend said they were needed for the PlayStation 4 Dual Shock 4 controllers. While they are a little tedious to get onto the thumb sticks, they are pretty grippy and hopefully will protect the controllers for years to come.'),
(N'Adam', N'Martinez', N'adam.martinez5482@example.net', '2015-01-08', 5, N'Didn''t solve my problem, but it worked beautifully.'),
(N'David', N'Chavez', N'david.chavez8699@example.com', '2015-01-08', 3, N'Great game but not the best.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Cox', N'hiroshi.cox5671@example.com', '2015-01-08', 5, N'Really useful'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Sanchez', N'evelyn.sanchez2971@example.net', '2015-01-08', 5, N'this made a big hit with my 10 year old grandson, I don''t play it myself'),
(N'Shirley', N'Diaz', N'shirley.diaz4781@example.net', '2015-01-08', 5, N'This game is aweome. The fact that Media Molecule is not making it anymore did not affect the quality. I can say the franchise is in good hands.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Clark', N'sandra.clark9220@example.net', '2015-01-08', 5, N'Charges super fast.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'White', N'evelyn.white3312@example.org', '2015-01-09', 5, N'Love'),
(N'John', N'Hall', N'john.hall9245@example.com', '2015-01-09', 5, N'Met my expectations.!'),
(N'Omar', N'Campbell', N'omar.campbell2165@example.com', '2015-01-09', 1, N'I HATE IT! Broken L button, no games work on it, could not use it. i am returning it'),
(N'Alexander', N'Brown', N'alexander.brown8577@example.com', '2015-01-09', 5, N'XBOX ONE, with digital downloads of Assassin''s Creed Black Flag and Unity... for $349... Was the best purchase I could have ever made. I don''t even mind having to buy the play and charge kit. Still worth it! I love it!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Richardson', N'ronald.richardson7239@example.org', '2015-01-09', 4, N'works like its supposed to'),
(N'Ronald', N'Richardson', N'ronald.richardson7239@example.org', '2015-01-09', 3, N'it''s an ok game'),
(N'Emma', N'Ferreira', N'emma.ferreira1907@example.net', '2015-01-09', 4, N'would love this game if i didn''t have to grind for the special challenges but anyways fun and beautiful world one of the best killzone storylines in the series'),
(N'Samuel', N'Sullivan', N'samuel.sullivan8088@example.net', '2015-01-09', 5, N'was a gift my mother enjoys these games'),
(N'Hannah', N'Thomas', N'hannah.thomas3305@example.org', '2015-01-09', 5, N'The kinect is great, as I use it all the time to turn on and off my console. Recently the kinect has had some power cycling issues, but Microsoft has been great at troubleshooting and fixing any faulty products that I''ve had. If you plan on using your console as a true entertainment center and TV interface, this is a fantastic product. The controller is wonderful, and snap feature makes gaming and watching TV or videos fun and hassle free.'),
(N'Luis', N'Perez', N'luis.perez3586@example.org', '2015-01-09', 5, N'Fast shipping Thanks!'),
(N'Michelle', N'James', N'michelle.james2197@example.org', '2015-01-09', 5, N'Fun game. A little unsure about it at first but started playing again and im into it more now.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Brian', N'Williams', N'brian.williams4984@example.net', '2015-01-09', 4, N'Works fantastically. Goes into any standard multi bit screwdriver, and fits in any video game that uses this security bit. high quality metal too. It opens a variety of carts and cartridges. From Nintendo to Sega and some other manufacturers. If you need to pop open a cart/cartridge to replace a game save battery; this is what you will need.'),
(N'Brian', N'Thomas', N'brian.thomas7455@example.com', '2015-01-09', 5, N'Nice show case game'),
(N'Larry', N'Sullivan', N'larry.sullivan2140@example.org', '2015-01-09', 5, N'wonderful game that i spend hours on after i defeated story mode i went back and did alot of side missons this game is reasonably priced if u get it used or used in like new condition its hours of gameplay and alot of fun'),
(N'Henry', N'Hill', N'henry.hill6100@example.net', '2015-01-09', 5, N'My son is very happy with this item. No issues.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Harris', N'kenneth.harris5324@example.net', '2015-01-09', 5, N'This game is wonderfully obsessive and I can tell you of at least two people who have totally immersed themselves into it. It''s one of the best designed games I''ve seen in a long time and has so much variety you''ll never get bored. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Dee', N'Stewart', N'dee.stewart5518@example.com', '2015-01-10', 5, N'It arrived by the delivery date and it was a great game.'),
(N'James', N'Reed', N'james.reed5456@example.net', '2015-01-10', 3, N'It''s a fun game and great if you''re into the platforming genre. The levels started to feel too similar for my tastes though. I got bored about a third of the way in.'),
(N'Noah', N'Hill', N'noah.hill8927@example.com', '2015-01-10', 1, N'NOT FUN'),
(N'Patricia', N'Moore', N'patricia.moore6864@example.org', '2015-01-10', 5, N'There is no possible way to sum up how amazing this game was to experience. Growing up and playing the first Smash Brothers I was amazed by it now seeing this I don''t know if Nintendo could make it any better. The gameplay is fluid and I have not seen any lag or glitches while playing any of the modes including online and 8 player smash. The character I''ve used the most by far is little Mac he might have horrible hops but once you get used to his playing style everything is just fine. The only complaint I can think of is that you can''t see your world ranking except for stadium events. This is a childhood dream come true!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Turner', N'patrick.turner8328@example.com', '2015-01-10', 5, N'Playing it now great game'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Henderson', N'benjamin.henderson9960@example.net', '2015-01-10', 5, N'Fun Game.'),
(N'Wei', N'Richardson', N'wei.richardson5726@example.org', '2015-01-10', 4, N'It was a little hard to figure out first, but after messing with settings, it finally worked, it can HARD to get working for windows 8, it took me a few hours, some people may not wanna buy this if you not good with computers.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Rivera', N'christopher.rivera7052@example.org', '2015-01-10', 5, N'I have Both! Awesome revamp to one of the greatest Pokemon Generations. Super, super fun with the same awesome graphics from X and Y and an improved story from the GBA Gen III games. If I had to pick one or the other I simply couldn''t do it. Alpha Sapphire you are fighting PIRATES aka Team Aqua and Sapphire was originally the first of the 2 games I got for the GBA gen Pokes. It will always hold a special place in my heart personally. HOWEVER if you want Nuzleaf or it''s evolved form, Koffing, or Zangoose I''d say go with Omega Ruby instead. Of course just me personally I prefer Alpha Sapphire''s Grimer and Seviper but as far as Lombre or Nuzleaf I''d say Nuzleaf all the way. Ruby gives you Latios while Sapphire gives you Latias so they are legendary clones but one is blue and the other is red. Whatever floats your boat guys but overall I like the whole experience of Sapphire better. A final not: Kyogre from Sapphire has the type advantage over Groudon. I don''t use Legendaries myself...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Taylor', N'stephen.taylor3327@example.org', '2015-01-10', 5, N'AMAZING FIRST PERSON SHOOTER WITH CREEPY ATMOSPHERIC ENVIROMENTS AND PLENTY OF SCARES. GREAT SOUND, CONTROLS, GRAPHICS, AND A GOOD ARSENAL OF WEAPONS.'),
(N'Jason', N'Diaz', N'jason.diaz1194@example.com', '2015-01-10', 5, N'So far so good. I just received it so I can''t advise on longevity. I used to use a high flow fan that would just blow onto the playstation. It worked great but was just too loud and unsightly as it was made for a cabinet vs free standing. This cooling fan is adequate. While the playstation isn''t as cool as the loud fan I used to run, it''s cool enough. Compared to using to no fan, the playstation is much cooler. This unit is quiet and cools it just enough. I wish I would have bought this item in the first place.'),
(N'Brian', N'Myers', N'brian.myers8800@example.org', '2015-01-10', 3, N'Some of these would not play correctly.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Martin', N'deborah.martin6891@example.net', '2015-01-10', 4, N'GOOD.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Morris', N'kelly.morris7098@example.org', '2015-01-10', 5, N'Still the best game I''ve ever played.'),
(N'Justin', N'Rogers', N'justin.rogers5301@example.com', '2015-01-10', 1, N'A "free" download that was little more than a demo for a game that costs easily $220.00 to fully experience, with clunky controls and an interface that was clearly never intended to be used on a computer.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Hill', N'samantha.hill6514@example.com', '2015-01-10', 5, N'Great RPG for anyone looking to spend time on a Blizzard product.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Mendoza', N'aisha.mendoza2247@example.com', '2015-01-10', 5, N'I love it Im beat a game every night lol'),
(N'Mary', N'Barnes', N'mary.barnes4058@example.org', '2015-01-11', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Diaz', N'ryan.diaz9740@example.org', '2015-01-11', 1, N'Worst game in the sims franchise. I wasted eighty dollars on this hot mess. After 120 hours the game quickly became boring. The world is no longer open world. The world has ten--I repeat TEN lots in each world and no there is no create a world tool to add more lots. If you want your sims to go to a community lot you must first wait through a loading screen. You can see your neighbors houses but if you want to actually go there then you have to endure yet another loading screen. If you want to go anywhere that''s not your sims house then you''ll have to endure another loading screen. The world is dead. Story progression has been completely erased. If you want the two towns to progress then you''ll have to play the families in order for the town to progress. Want your sims to own a car? Too bad, there are no cars in this game AT ALL. You know that wonderful tutorial that''s provided for new simmers? Want to turn it off? Guess what: You can''t. Want cute pictures with toddlers and adult...'),
(N'William', N'Williams', N'william.williams4381@example.org', '2015-01-11', 4, N'Decent game but only limited replay value. A few parts can definitely make you jump. Parents if you buy it for children they will probably have nightmares so adhere to the ratings system.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Coleman', N'kyle.coleman8778@example.net', '2015-01-11', 5, N'Love this game'),
(N'Justin', N'Wilson', N'justin.wilson7269@example.net', '2015-01-11', 5, N'Great game. One of my favorites.'),
(N'Donna', N'Morgan', N'donna.morgan5578@example.org', '2015-01-11', 4, N'Its a classic game alright. Interesting story about adventure island. From wikipedia: The player controls Master Higgins, a young man who ventured to Adventure Island in the South Pacific after hearing that the Evil Witch Doctor kidnapped Princess Leilani. To rescue her, Higgins must survive a series of 32 stages. There are eight worlds called "areas", which are divided four stages or "rounds" each, which are further divided into four checkpoints. When the player reaches the fourth round of each area, he must confront a boss at the end to continue to the next area. The game is completed when the player saves the girl after defeating the eighth and final form of the evil lord. Wikipedia has some interesting stuff on this, its worth reading. I gave it four stars because i love playing it but this game alone was the reason i went through so many NES consoles and controllers as a child. My brothers were good, i was awful. I recommend to anyone who loves classic NES.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Perry', N'carolyn.perry4912@example.org', '2015-01-11', 5, N'I bought this with my N64 and I love playing it its one of my favorite games to play im addicted to it I can''t put it down'),
(N'Maria', N'Howard', N'maria.howard9124@example.net', '2015-01-11', 5, N'This is a great game and I love the Ace Combat series.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Sanchez', N'sofia.sanchez9279@example.com', '2015-01-11', 5, N'Got this on sale and I love it. Have one for PS4 as well, but they are different on different consoles. I just couldn''t believe the price and with my prime shipping I got it to play all weekend. Great deal'),
(N'John', N'Taylor', N'john.taylor1614@example.com', '2015-01-11', 2, N'The other games were better in the series.'),
(N'Susan', N'Ferreira', N'susan.ferreira4827@example.com', '2015-01-11', 5, N'I don''t see why people leave a bad review about this game. It''s just as amazing as the last one. I loved Far cry 2 and 3 but 4 is even better. It doesn''t have that complicated gun system that some shooters have. There is tons of stuff to explore. The environments were rich in detail and many languages were spoken to give it that realistic charm. There is no reason to NOT add this game to your collection.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Brooks', N'andrew.brooks6983@example.com', '2015-01-11', 5, N'product as advertised. fast delivery,'),
(N'Aaron', N'Robinson', N'aaron.robinson7372@example.com', '2015-01-11', 5, N'Love it!'),
(N'Dee', N'Okonkwo', N'dee.okonkwo2021@example.com', '2015-01-11', 5, N'Everything as expected. Thank you.'),
(N'Brian', N'White', N'brian.white3361@example.org', '2015-01-11', 5, N'I''m a huge fan of the Mystery Case Files games and this might be my absolute favorite. I''m a huge fan of mystery puzzle games, where you often have to break out a pencil and paper, or even just really think. I''m not the biggest fan of hidden objects as that gets boring, and that is something else I really liked here; there weren''t too many hidden object scenes, and the ones that were there were the best of any game I''ve ever played (there aren''t too many objects to find, and sometimes you have to manipulate the objects to be what ate on your list). There are some puzzles that were so intricate in this game, and unlike any I''ve seen in any game. The puzzles in this game were so much fun that my boyfriend and I would stay home just to play. My only warning is that some of it is pretty hard, and often times we would use the strategy guide, oftentimes we were missing objects to pick up that missed our eye. HIGHLY recommend using the map, which will tell you if something needs to be...'),
(N'Megan', N'Thomas', N'megan.thomas1865@example.net', '2015-01-11', 5, N'Excelent product.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Diaz', N'ashley.diaz2944@example.com', '2015-01-11', 5, N'The sole reason a purchased this was to play Tales of Hearts and other Vita games on my TV with a PS3 controller. Tales being a newer game it had the PlayStation TV compatible logo on it. It got me thinking about this device right away. Now if you have ever played a handheld before on your TV like with a game-boy player or with the PSP component cables you like me, would expect either a smaller screen on the TV or an extremely pix-elated picture. That said I was blown away as I tried out Tales of Hearts today on my 55" TV. This is the only Vita game I have so I can''t compare other games as of yet. This game in particular was originally a DS game so it was not built on the more powerful Vita hardware. It looked very similar to playing the Tales game on the Wii for instance. Either way I was very impressed with it, and like I said was the sole reason I bought it. I gave it 5 stars based on it meeting my personal needs but now on to the negative aspects of it. The Vita as you may know...'),
(N'Christopher', N'Harris', N'christopher.harris1063@example.net', '2015-01-11', 5, N'I wish that it had some better feachers but the games look great n fun to play different kinds of games on it. Works just like one u can get from the US but looks better ; )'),
(N'Kyle', N'Ramos', N'kyle.ramos1047@example.net', '2015-01-11', 2, N'Got these as a Christmas gift. Mic stopped working after two days. After testing it out on a few different platforms I called tech support. They verified the problem and told me to fill a form out online for a warranty replacement. That required a copy of the receipt. Managed to get one from my family, scan it and submit the claim. Then nothing happened for a few days. Instead of waiting any longer, a nice person from Amazon allowed me a full refund of the cost, despite that the headset was over two months past it''s return period (they were purchased in October). THANKS AMAZON! When I finally did hear from Mad Catz/Tritton, it was an e-mail asking me to fill out another form. For the two days the headset did work, I thought they had decent sound quality. They''re a bit bulky for "on ear" headphones. My girlfriend said they made me look like a helicopter pilot. The flexible microphone apparently can''t withstand repeated flexing, judging by my issue. Whoever designed the look of these...'),
(N'Mei', N'Roberts', N'mei.roberts3974@example.org', '2015-01-12', 4, N'Great Game'),
(N'Judith', N'Wisniewski', N'judith.wisniewski2001@example.org', '2015-01-12', 5, N'48 games I grew up on for $5? Why not!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Sanders', N'samuel.sanders3610@example.com', '2015-01-12', 5, N'Bought it for my brother, couldn''t be happier.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ruiz', N'sarah.ruiz9514@example.org', '2015-01-12', 5, N'Halo 4 `Game Of The Year'' edition is the most unique game of the series for its design and premise. Everything that is Halo is present and brand new elements, including the Forerunner weaponry, additional levels for multiplayer and more. A lot of Cortana/ Master Chief moments fans would expect and might not. If a Halo fan, this fits perfectly.'),
(N'Angela', N'Edwards', N'angela.edwards5421@example.org', '2015-01-12', 5, N'Grandson needed something to carry his PSP and games in he loves it!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Rodriguez', N'brandon.rodriguez6044@example.net', '2015-01-12', 5, N'Amazingly fun and addictive. Haven''t been able to pry my wife off it. A great game for a fan of Dragonball Z.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Nguyen', N'douglas.nguyen3539@example.com', '2015-01-12', 5, N'I got this game the first time when I was 5 or 6 years old. I LOVED IT! I was sooo good, that I challenged my dad, and destroyed him. Sadly, it is also because of this defeat that my father never played a video game with me since. good times.'),
(N'Angela', N'White', N'angela.white4097@example.net', '2015-01-12', 5, N'Pros: Does everything you could want in a rechargeable package and does it cost effectively. Cons: None (Wish I would have found this deal sooner. I would have saved A LOT of money on batteries)'),
(N'Wei', N'Scott', N'wei.scott2812@example.net', '2015-01-12', 5, N'Love this PS4. Bought this not for Destiny but for the white console. Destiny is fun but a grindfest.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Phillips', N'melissa.phillips8326@example.com', '2015-01-12', 5, N'excellent product'),
(N'Andrew', N'Wood', N'andrew.wood7060@example.com', '2015-01-12', 5, N'i like its great'),
(N'Ravi', N'Reed', N'ravi.reed3044@example.org', '2015-01-12', 5, N'Amazing!'),
(N'Heather', N'Bell', N'heather.bell5909@example.org', '2015-01-12', 5, N'This is a great game! If you need instructions, go to GameFAQs. They have the right controls for every game, including strategies and tips! A great source to learn how to play, but the game is a lot of fun, dunking, three pointers, stuffs, this game''s got it all!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Clark', N'sharon.clark8994@example.net', '2015-01-13', 3, N'When I first got this keyboard, it was my very first mechanical keyboard. It took me about 1 week or maybe 2 weeks to get used to it. The feeling and the keys. Even now I sometimes slip my finger on my keys and fat finger things, but that rarely happens. It''s great for gaming, but I seem to be having a defect. The wiring USB part that connects to me keyboard, sometimes the signal would drop, and my keyboard would shut down. This would be quite frustrating for me because I play intensive multiplayer games such as CS:GO or LoL. Rarely has it happened during a competitive match, but when it does it pisses me off to no end. Overall, I like the LED lights under the keys, and would have given this keyboard 5/5 score, but since I have faulty wiring (mind you I''ve never messed with the wire or have any animal/children chew on it) it''s just not that great of a product. Also, the past 1.5 years I''ve been using the keys, my WASD keys have been worn out. It barely even resembles the letter it...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Raghunathan', N'pamela.raghunathan3892@example.org', '2015-01-13', 5, N'Great if you like the show and RPGs'),
(N'Michael', N'Cruz', N'michael.cruz5109@example.com', '2015-01-13', 4, N'Great n64 game played it when I was little kid one of the best n64 games ever made next to Mario 64 and 007 golden eye'),
(N'Mei', N'Chavez', N'mei.chavez4566@example.net', '2015-01-13', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Ravi', N'Morgan', N'ravi.morgan7172@example.org', '2015-01-13', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Christine', N'Cook', N'christine.cook1002@example.net', '2015-01-13', 4, N'After having played Far Cry 3 and 4, I find both of them to be very enjoyable shooters. I found the premise of Far Cry 3 ridiculous to the point of unbelievable ("trapped" tourist "forced" to rescue his friends "all by himself" when there are working radio towers to call for help and an FBI agent that offered to fly him off the island - where he can then call for help) and the main character highly unlikable. But I''m there for the shooting, not the great story or characterization, so I was able to enjoy Far Cry 3 despite all that. I found Far Cry 4 a great improvement on the story and character front. Ajay, the main character, is at least literally related to the rebels and therefore it made sense when the people there looked up to him to fight on their behalf. And it made sense that he would be invested in the fight because this was the land his parents were born in. Gameplay-wise, Far Cry 4 is pretty much a carbon copy of Far Cry 3. There''s the added element of calling on your...'),
(N'Daniel', N'Ortiz', N'daniel.ortiz2978@example.net', '2015-01-13', 5, N'Really helps when you need to recharge your gamepad and keep it from getting scratches on it.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Wilson', N'ryan.wilson8686@example.com', '2015-01-13', 4, N'My new go to Xbox One controller. I''ve made my friends and girlfriend jealous with it. Not worth $70 unfortunately... There are controller modders out there who can do MUCH more for a similar price as this total. I got lucky and bought this at Best Buy on Black Friday for around $30-35. Definitely worth that price. I still would have bought this if it had been $60 or lower.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Thomas', N'aaron.thomas2338@example.net', '2015-01-13', 5, N'awesome!!!'),
(N'Zachary', N'Morgan', N'zachary.morgan8901@example.com', '2015-01-13', 5, N'This controller is a must-have on the Wii U if you don''t like the Gamepad. A lot of games support the Pro Controller, including Wind Waker HD and Hyrule Warriors. I personally prefer the Gamepad, but I wanted a good controller to use in Hyrule Warriors co-op (I would not want to subject my friends to the horror of a control scheme that the Wii Remote and Nunchuk offer!). I''ve tried it myself, and it works really well! This particular item is the Japanese version, but thank goodness, controllers are not region locked! It''s essentially the exact same product as the U.S. Pro controller, but the packaging and the sticker on the back are in Japanese. :P That doesn''t really matter that much, though.'),
(N'Debra', N'Johnson', N'debra.johnson1410@example.net', '2015-01-13', 5, N'I have one in black for my XL, as well. I could never play without one of these. Makes the 3DS feel like an authentic console controller. The grip is a bit hard when first unpackaged, but it softens over time to comfortably suit your hands.'),
(N'Omar', N'Thompson', N'omar.thompson5220@example.com', '2015-01-13', 5, N'This is exactly what my son requested for Christmas. He loves it.'),
(N'Noah', N'Parker', N'noah.parker9026@example.com', '2015-01-13', 5, N'This game is a great addition to the Donkey Kong Country series! I remember the original coming out for the SNES back when I was like 16 and I STILL enjoy it as much today as I did then! The graphics look amazing with the Wii U and this game (in my opinion) is exactly what the system is for! Unfortunately, in today''s gaming world, I have come too accustomed to the "complex" controller system, so the simplicity of the controls on this game took quite a bit of getting used to! (I am playing with a Wii U Pro so maybe the extra buttons confused me for a while?) Anyways, after learning the controllers and what buttons are useless I was able to get into the swing of things. Get it?! Ooooook. As stated in the subject,..I''m playing Co-op with a 9 yr old and this pretty much puts the game on INSANE difficulty as the screen doesn''t stretch the way NSMB does when characters get far apart, you simply disappear off screen as your "co player" (a sugar-charged kid) rushes his character forward at...'),
(N'Daniel', N'Boyd', N'daniel.boyd1183@example.org', '2015-01-13', 5, N'This is one of my first Razer products (I also bought their Chroma keyboard) and honestly I thought this company was all about the name. Boy was I wrong. This mouse has PERFECT ergonomics. It feels so nice in the hand. The lighting is really well done. No LED bleed so you don''t get light coming out of crevices it''s not supposed to. The software used to change the colors and effects is pretty simple and easy to use. On the downside, there are very limited effects you can choose from only being static (solid), cycle colors, and breathing (this option is only available on the logo light, not the scroll wheel). I had hoped for more effects and more customization over the stock ones. The logo is crisp and looks quite nice in low light. All in all, the mouse is fantastic! The software is adequate. I would highly reccomend this to anyone looking for a new gaming/day-to-day mouse. I am now a Razer fan! :)'),
(N'Henry', N'Rodriguez', N'henry.rodriguez6316@example.com', '2015-01-13', 5, N'When i first got my ps vita i got this to hold my games and my system. I got mine at a gamestop for $29.99 i mean it''s worth it because it holds 23 games plus 2 memory cards. And the ps vita holder holds 4 games. So get this holder if you have a lot of games and memory cards because they are small and you don''t want to lose them. I have a ps vita slim model that i put in the case because i traded my other one in and got a slim model.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Carter', N'carolyn.carter5550@example.net', '2015-01-13', 5, N'I own this game and I got to say hyrule warriors is probably one of the best dynastry warrior games I''ve ever played lol. Now story aside! The game play is amazing along with the various weapons of choice. There is a lot of modes to choose from as well! You have your Adventure, Legend, Challange, and many more. They implented lots of gameplay into this game and 10-20 hours alone is not enough to unlock it all. The story is iffy but its not meant for the story. Its more meant for the gameplay.'),
(N'Susan', N'Suzuki', N'susan.suzuki6179@example.net', '2015-01-13', 4, N'Excellent game!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Brown', N'nancy.brown1288@example.com', '2015-01-13', 5, N'Quick delivery and works great!!!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Nguyen', N'deborah.nguyen7951@example.com', '2015-01-13', 3, N'Item came in perfect conditions !!'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ortiz', N'ravi.ortiz3887@example.com', '2015-01-14', 3, N'This game is very exciting. Almost like you are taken back in time to their era. The graphics are really some of the best I''ve seen. The tasks are smart and "deadly". You really have to think during this game in order to survive. You''ll find yourself playing this and trying to master it to get to other levels. My son loves it. This is not the type game he is usually drawn to, but this one does it for him. Yeah, you''ll feel like an Assassin'),
(N'Ethan', N'Miller', N'ethan.miller5359@example.org', '2015-01-14', 4, N'exelent'),
(N'Anna', N'Kim', N'anna.kim9890@example.org', '2015-01-14', 3, N'Good product fast shipping!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wood', N'kelly.wood3496@example.org', '2015-01-14', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wood', N'kelly.wood3496@example.org', '2015-01-14', 5, N'great game kids love'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Foster', N'jonathan.foster5366@example.net', '2015-01-14', 5, N'Met my expectations over a $50 headset. Feels comfortable, sounds great, and the mic quality blew my mind (sounded very pleased over it). Very surprised what a $50 headset can do. Would recommend a friend for this headset.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Gray', N'sofia.gray6895@example.org', '2015-01-14', 5, N'Exactly what I need'),
(N'Joshua', N'Raghunathan', N'joshua.raghunathan5382@example.org', '2015-01-14', 3, N'This game is kinda hard to play without looking up some cheat sheets. Beware, it will freak out kids that are easily scared.'),
(N'Richard', N'Bennett', N'richard.bennett4999@example.com', '2015-01-14', 5, N'Just got this today, Great game, and I loved it, but when I Installed the game I ran into a little problem but got it resolved, and the problem was when I inserted disc 2 of the game, it wouldn''t go so I had to copy the files from the disc 2 and the other 2 discs of game to my hard drive in order for the installation too be complete which worked and played fine.'),
(N'Robert', N'Sanchez', N'robert.sanchez7667@example.com', '2015-01-14', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Olivia', N'Lee', N'olivia.lee7909@example.org', '2015-01-14', 5, N'excellent product'),
(N'Anthony', N'Ortiz', N'anthony.ortiz7658@example.net', '2015-01-14', 5, N'An amazing experience, probably one of the best games ever made.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Tanaka', N'patricia.tanaka6488@example.com', '2015-01-14', 5, N'Exellent'),
(N'Wei', N'Boyd', N'wei.boyd6330@example.net', '2015-01-14', 5, N'Really neat game, closely resembles the movie.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Kumar', N'katherine.kumar2776@example.net', '2015-01-14', 5, N'Our Son Loves it and He recommend this game.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Ruiz', N'joshua.ruiz4346@example.net', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Morris', N'jeremy.morris6326@example.net', '2015-01-15', 3, N'This was a gift for our son & he has no complaints. It arrived in a very timely manner.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Ruiz', N'olivia.ruiz3569@example.com', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Works and looks great, no issues. Quick and easy to install!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Diaz', N'sharon.diaz9453@example.com', '2015-01-15', 3, N'If you''re a casual player on a budget, this is a no brainer. Now, I''ve only tried this on a PS2 and a PS3 since that''s what I use. The PS3 games work perfectly with this stick as well as the PS2 games that I''ve downloaded digitally into my PS3. It''s sturdy so I don''t have any problems with it moving around when I play. You can also map the buttons to your liking which is nice. For me the default is fine. The #10 button is the start/menu button. It does have a PS button function. Well, sort of. So, if you press buttons #9 and #10 together, it''ll ask if you want to quit. If you press those buttons and hold them down, it''ll ask if you want to shut the system off. You can''t however press those buttons to turn the system on like the PS button on the PS3 controller. No problem for me. So why did I give it 3 Stars? It''s because my PS2 does not recognize the fighting stick when it''s plugged in. That was a letdown for me because it was advertised as a universal stick. No way I can overlook...'),
(N'Emily', N'Jimenez', N'emily.jimenez3941@example.net', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Really decent mouse. The side buttons are a little bit hard to press but you''ll get use to it. Awesome customizations for every kind of gaming makes it a worthy purchase.'),
(N'Maria', N'Ali', N'maria.ali3572@example.net', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Quick delivery of an excellent product, thank you.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Wisniewski', N'kevin.wisniewski9084@example.com', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Its very short game but it has alot to offer, its very fun game if you have play the whole series up to now. As long time MGS fan to the series this game will help you get super use the gameplay when MGS TPP comes out. Gameplay itself is perfect and new comers and old times like myself will need to learn new controls in order to stay alive plus master gameplay element down so you can own all types of enemy''s you will fight or learn to go fully stealth without anyone noticing you where their ever. Overall gameplay plus missions to get you ready and keep you busy is worth the wait and i give it 5 star for having good start off on what happens to The Boss. I own this game as download and i normally buy on disc but sense it was short i made the buy on the PSN Store plus their is chance it will be add to the MGS TPP disc too if you pay extra amount maybe.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Wilson', N'ronald.wilson3390@example.net', '2015-01-15', 5, N'What can I say? These are perfectly fitting replacement styli for the 3DS XL. The colors are just about as seen in the pictures and are not super bright if that''s your thing.'),
(N'Jose', N'Reed', N'jose.reed9479@example.com', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Daughter loves it!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Okonkwo', N'marcus.okonkwo1733@example.net', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Let me start off by saying by far the best looking fighting game I have ever played. The character details are quite epic and destroy attacks are now like an anime cutscene. Some even get different and even multiple reactions from each character. Now it has been a long time since the last true Guilty Gear release and taking place after the events in Guilty Gear 2, that can make things a little confusing. So be prepared to go read the games profile library before going into Story mode. Story mode is also very different. Rather than fight a battle and trying to change outcomes, it is just story. That is right, get ready to sit and watch events unfold in gameplay cinematics and long dialogue. Does that sound bad? Well I mean it as a good thing since I watched it once by myself and then with my wife who thought it was just as amazing as I did. The fighting is smooth and back just as good as ever and while it features a smaller cast of characters, I really do not mind. After years if...'),
(N'Daniel', N'Edwards', N'daniel.edwards7507@example.net', '2015-01-15', 3, N'For many years now, Resident Evil has continued to evolve the survival horror genre of gaming. As a new Wii U owner, I decided to try out Revelations for myself having no prior expectations aside from having recently replayed RE4 and RE5. What I found was a mixture of good and bad elements. Gameplay: 3/5 This may actually be personal preference, but for me personally, I think Revelations dropped the ball here. Traditionally in the series, the idea was that you are stuck on some remote location either marooned or sent in as a special OPs team member to investigate an outbreak. While the story may follow this trend in spirit, the gameplay is divided into chapters that seem out of place. The action is broke up into chapters instead of being one long event. This for me ruins what was paramount in the other games. This non-continuous style not only breaks up the action, but it also tends to take away the whole survival horror aspect. You also have someone with you on most of the...'),
(N'Robert', N'Sanchez', N'robert.sanchez7667@example.com', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Great game a plus for star wars fans'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Thomas', N'jacqueline.thomas9783@example.net', '2015-01-15', 5, N'Love the game, love the figures. When Im not using them, I display them in my room.'),
