(N'Frank', N'Flores', N'frank.flores9857@example.net', '2015-01-17', 4, N'This was my second purchase, originally purchased CQC, but the recipient was not too fond of the height of the sticks so I knew there were the Alpha''s. He could not be more happy now, my buddy feels more comfortable playing, enjoys the increased grip space and the minor height increase to simulate the height of the Xbox 360 controller on his Xbox One controller.'),
