(N'Mark', N'Roberts', N'mark.roberts9829@example.net', '2015-01-18', 2, N'I couldn''t get past the bad controls. Moving with the joystick made sense, but turning and aiming with the stylus is annoying at best. Should have done turning and forward backward with the joystick, strafe with the left and right buttons, and had more to do with the 4 control buttons on the right. Like grenades or different modes of fire.'),
