(N'Thomas', N'Kumar', N'thomas.kumar5747@example.com', '2015-01-18', 5, N'Turtle Beach is synonymous to great gaming headsets and this one in particular is one of the top tier units they have. Of all the COD branded ones, this is the best. It''s basically a 510 in white and the Ghost logo. Perfect sound, no hiss, easy setup and all the connection that you''ll need. It is also compatible with the next gen systems XB1 (with an additional adapter) and PS4 (albeit wired). The unit came in 2 days and in good packaging as Amazon does best. Get these before they are gone.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Tanaka', N'nadia.tanaka7595@example.org', '2015-01-19', 5, N'Me and my son loved it!'),
(N'Shirley', N'Moore', N'shirley.moore6733@example.com', '2015-01-19', 5, N'As somebody who isn''t good at drawing, this is great practice for drawing cartoon characters. I know some other drawing games/books are more about drawing realistically, but this is good if you want to draw Pokemon, but still have good lighting, painting, angles, etc. I think there are a lot of people like me who say "I''m not good a drawing, and I don''t want to take a full-on art course, but I wish I could just draw some characters well!" This game is a good answer to that.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Robinson', N'sarah.robinson1661@example.org', '2015-01-19', 5, N'love this game'),
(N'Patricia', N'Butler', N'patricia.butler8446@example.org', '2015-01-19', 5, N'If you were gaming back in the 90''s you probably remember a lot of those old point and click adventure games where you often had many choices you could make that would impact the story, how characters react and the outcome of those characters. The games were unique because they had a storybook like feel to them. You see moments of this genre crop up every now and then with games like Hotel Dusk 215 on the original DS or the recent Walking Dead. They''re the kind of games that emphasize storytelling and narrative above exploration. They typically tend to be more about the characters within the game than the world of the game itself. The Wolf Among Us is reminiscent of these kinds of games. It''s a good game from a storytelling standpoint and really comes alive. From it''s opening moments to it''s stylistic look. Yet it''s also a very mature game that shows these kinds of games can still work in an era where so many more of our games are fast paced action shooters or wide open world...'),
(N'Jose', N'Cook', N'jose.cook2859@example.com', '2015-01-19', 5, N'I loved the first Forza Horizon game same I came into this with high hopes and was not at all disappointed. The game is massive as far as the amount of races you have open to you go, even more so if you get the expansion pack. All the racers, both in races and freeroam, are actually "drivatars" which are AI versions of the real people that have played the game, which makes it more interesting and fun, especially when your friends show up in your story mode races and you get to beat them. The DLC is done a little better now because at least when you spend real money to add new cars to the game, you don''t have to spend in-game money to get them (although, my friend couldn''t do this on my same console under his profile so it may be an effect of the VIP Pass and not just an automatic perk of the game.) The controls are great, the graphics and sound are too, the gameplay is fun. The various different car classes all handle differently so it is very varied and will keep you entertained...'),
(N'Lisa', N'Stewart', N'lisa.stewart9489@example.org', '2015-01-19', 4, N'Awesome'),
(N'Kofi', N'Campbell', N'kofi.campbell5861@example.net', '2015-01-19', 3, N'You have to have a really expensive, strong running pc for this to work.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Powell', N'joyce.powell2982@example.org', '2015-01-19', 5, N'The Season Pass will be available for download in late Spring, from what I''ve read. This is like the pre-order for it. When you buy it in the PlayStation Store, complete your purchase like normal, but instead of being able to click the Download button, it just says "Purchased". When it becomes available, you will be able to download it immediately........Not a big deal.......Enjoy.'),
(N'Charles', N'Brown', N'charles.brown5539@example.com', '2015-01-19', 2, N'Had to return for refund. Did not sync with system and when it did the one time it turned off. Plus the instructions were completely in japanese.'),
(N'Betty', N'Kelly', N'betty.kelly5542@example.com', '2015-01-20', 3, N'This game is a nightmare in multiplayer. The screens are hard to follow.'),
(N'Maria', N'Howard', N'maria.howard9124@example.net', '2015-01-20', 5, N'I love this classic Xbox game.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Powell', N'nicole.powell1827@example.net', '2015-01-20', 2, N'The overall concept is great but you can''t calibrate the sights on the gun. I''m a real hunter and the whole fun of shooting is lining up the sites on the target then shooting. I returned it because it got so frustrating.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Fisher', N'deborah.fisher1574@example.org', '2015-01-20', 4, N'good shifters, definitely enhances the steering wheel. A little pricey for what it is other that no other complaints.'),
(N'Linda', N'Bennett', N'linda.bennett1393@example.org', '2015-01-20', 4, N'It''s fine'),
(N'Wei', N'Jackson', N'wei.jackson5333@example.org', '2015-01-20', 5, N'Terrific, as advertised.'),
(N'Jack', N'Baker', N'jack.baker2750@example.net', '2015-01-20', 4, N'Not the best quality, but they do make the games more fun than if you just use the regular controller.'),
(N'Joan', N'Wang', N'joan.wang1261@example.org', '2015-01-20', 5, N'My daughter loves Nancy Drew and she love this one so she gave it five stars.'),
(N'Linda', N'Peterson', N'linda.peterson1152@example.com', '2015-01-20', 5, N'great for travel!!!'),
(N'Sandra', N'Torres', N'sandra.torres8105@example.net', '2015-01-20', 5, N'Used this PS2 disc repeatedly and got in excellent shape. Nowadays you can probably get it used, but I think its better than all of EAs current exercise stuff that was for PS3. I think there is another version of this with higher quality graphics on a different system, but if you are a PS2 person this is perfect. I even followed the meal suggestions. If you are able to use this you will see results.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Coleman', N'raymond.coleman3597@example.net', '2015-01-20', 5, N'I''ve looked all over for GoldenEye for my old school N64 but never could find it. Then I found it on Amazon, this is a nice change from the all digital world of FPS games. The graphics are not bad, but if you plan on playing this on your HDTV I would recommend getting a converter that takes the VGA ( Yellow, White & Red ) cables an converts the VGA signal to HDMI so you can play on your High Definition TV. Played this on christmas with the relatives an they were having a blast. Didn''t think they would considering it''s N64 an not Xbox ONE. Just playing the game gives you a view of how far technology has come, it might be old an not as detailed as some FPS games but still gives you a perspective of what technology used to look like back in 1996 when the N64 was released. Today this game remains a favorite among gamers. If you have kids & a N64 id take the xbox away for a day an have them play N64 so they can see where & how technology has taken Gaming. Just don''t let them play 007...'),
(N'Angela', N'Wang', N'angela.wang1435@example.com', '2015-01-20', 5, N'works good arrived on time'),
(N'Emily', N'Hernandez', N'emily.hernandez1256@example.net', '2015-01-20', 5, N'bought this to go head to head since we already own 1. It''s tons of fun and a lazy way to not have to drag out the board games to have fun as a family.'),
(N'Edward', N'Nguyen', N'edward.nguyen3753@example.org', '2015-01-20', 5, N'Perfect... Thanks!'),
(N'Tyler', N'Jackson', N'tyler.jackson2966@example.com', '2015-01-20', 5, N'Ok everyone I love dragon age and Dragon Age Inquisition is one of the best by far I do how ever regimen that you just get from the xbox one live store instead of buying from anyplace only because it''s cheaper even Dragon Age Inquisition Deluxe Edition is Cheaper then most stores but that''s just my thoughts on the price now for the game it''s self the game play is super fun I haven''t beat the game yet but that what make the game fun doing side quested help you builds your army now it''s a great game but do not get for any kids under the age of 18 being it has nudity and detail sexual content in simple terms it''s uncensored unlike the first 2 Dragon Age were they had censored bra and unwearied this nun of that but other then that the game is fun and some what Educational there are a lot more dragons in this story to fight and the dark spawn is back in greater numbers then before and just about everything will attack you Dragon Age Inquisition is free rooming so there are more place to...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Jones', N'jeremy.jones8219@example.org', '2015-01-20', 4, N'I just got NBA Live 15 and I''ve had NBA 2k15 since release day. My initial thoughts: If you can get NBA Live for half price ($30), it is the better game! So, why would I say that? NBA Live does not have ANY edit features and NO share roster or share player options. But, NBA Live 15 is awesome in the court display and is equal and in some cases superior to NBA 2k15 on player models and flow of the game as I really like the feel of the play. NBA Live 15 also falls short on teams available as there are ZERO classic teams and so far I can''t find a mode that allows me to become a star using classic players ... The real-time records is nice to have and the roster updates are good for me as I played today with current Cavaliers team.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Wright', N'lucia.wright2106@example.com', '2015-01-21', 5, N'nice headset very good sound for the price not as good as the 100 dollars+ headsets but do the job sound i can hear footsteps in games as i couldn''t with a headset i bought for $60 gamestop can hear the bass really good would recommend it for the price'),
(N'Gregory', N'Evans', N'gregory.evans8932@example.com', '2015-01-21', 5, N'I just received my controller today. Now I have 2 controllers because I always had 1. Good affordable price . Happy that I did not have to spend $60, $50 or $40. Thank you Amazon.'),
(N'Donald', N'Nguyen', N'donald.nguyen7453@example.org', '2015-01-21', 5, N'Works great and now my son cannot lose it since it is corded.'),
(N'Emma', N'Foster', N'emma.foster5228@example.org', '2015-01-21', 3, N'Keep in mind that Civ5 now is not what was released as Civ5. That''s important because, with any luck, Beta Centauri will be great before too long. Don''t get me wrong, CivBE is fun now. It''s different enough from Civ5 to be worth buying (but definitely wait for a sale). True, you look at the screen and realize that "energy" is just money and "health" is just happiness, used to slow down rampant city building (or taking). The diplomacy interactions are very much like Civ5 as well, right down to the tedious "you''re friends with X? Wow, so am I maybe we''re all bffs?" Every. Single. Time. From both parties. Still, the alien life adds a twist, as does miasma. The quest system is new and interesting enough. The attitude toward the alien world makes the faction system seem more real that the one in Civ5, which struck me as "you picked a different bonus than the one I picked? I hate you so much!" The start system is something I like. Yes, you pick which side to play, but then you make...'),
(N'Thomas', N'Campbell', N'thomas.campbell2578@example.org', '2015-01-21', 5, N'great'),
(N'Carlos', N'Fisher', N'carlos.fisher7685@example.com', '2015-01-21', 5, N'I initially purchased this game for my Xbox 360 not wanting to spend the additional money on a next gen console until the next Mass Effect game came out. That was my starting reference point for this game, where I did two play-through sessions. The graphics on previous generation console are pretty universally terrible, worse than Origins and certainly lower scale that Dragon Age 2. Luckily Bioware makes up for it in their signature perks, characters, lore, and story. I was afraid they were going to go over board and make it bigger than it truly had to be. Regarding the PC version, I took a stab at doing a minor upgrade. Using an old Acer Tower (original retail $700) from 2009 and a $150 EVGA GeForce GTX 750 ti SC from amazon I was able to run it was high settings, 1080p and boy what a difference. The textures, the detail, they all go into the immersive feel. Skin is wonderful. Facial animations are still a little off. Hard to say much beyond tech specs. I will say that compared to...'),
(N'Adam', N'Wood', N'adam.wood3161@example.org', '2015-01-21', 5, N'Amazing. Great. Excellent.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Hall', N'nathan.hall1624@example.org', '2015-01-21', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Nathan', N'Hall', N'nathan.hall1624@example.org', '2015-01-21', 5, N'fun game son loves it'),
(N'Aisha', N'Gutierrez', N'aisha.gutierrez3176@example.com', '2015-01-21', 5, N'This card works perfectly in my new PS Vita slim. the card packaging is in Japanese but there''s really nothing to read about. It gives you about 59GB of storage as reported by the Vita itself. I got tons of PSV, PSP and PSX games and still have 25GB left.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Campbell', N'jonathan.campbell8329@example.com', '2015-01-21', 3, N'My daughter has played it a lot and like it ok . But my boys don''t seem to want to play . So just tells me it ok not great .'),
(N'Patrick', N'Ferreira', N'patrick.ferreira6405@example.net', '2015-01-21', 5, N'Different type of Lara Croft adventure but still fun all the same.'),
(N'Peter', N'Chen', N'peter.chen4434@example.net', '2015-01-21', 4, N'I really love this controller, I got it a couple yeear ago and decided to write a review on it. The lights are awesome I usually use whatever color I am when I play multiplayer when they assign what color you are sometimes, or I just go with blue. It works like It should and I love the D-pad on this compared to the original 360 controller. I knocked it off a star because on the left joy stick it likes to make the character go move left on the screen and the right joys stick like to look up and to the right. I don''t know if that''s just me or not but when I play it on pc I just fix the dead zone and it sometimes fixes the problem but other than that I''m happy I got this.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Reed', N'ryan.reed4096@example.org', '2015-01-21', 5, N'First o all, why would ay idiot give this anything less than 5 stars? Considering the other crap that comes out for the DS;this is the best RPG on the DS. Especially for fans of Ancient Greece & Rome. Many people who don''t know history, arent''t aware that; though the Romans cpoied everything from the Greeks, thier Gods & heroes had different names. For example, Hercules was Heracles. Zeus, the main god in Greece, had the planet name Jupiter. Ares, was Mars, Hades was Pluto, Hermes was Mercury, etc. This game is really good and makes you feel that you''re in Ancient Greece. The characters are well-ballanced and the story is filled with humor in many places. The battle system is fairly easy to manage and get the hang of. Though I''ve beaten the game many times; I still love playing it! I HIGHLY reccomend this to RPGERS of all ages!!'),
(N'David', N'Martin', N'david.martin7354@example.org', '2015-01-22', 3, N'The only reason this product gets 3 stars is the fact that its the only "up to date" game that is similar to Road Rash..but the graphics aren''t good..and in some areas in the game..it''s too dark.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Johnson', N'katherine.johnson2562@example.org', '2015-01-22', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Samantha', N'Morales', N'samantha.morales2235@example.org', '2015-01-22', 4, N'It''s cool..something different.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Gonzalez', N'jennifer.gonzalez2897@example.net', '2015-01-22', 5, N'my son say''s thank you for the controller he is having a blast with the new controller'),
(N'Samuel', N'Campbell', N'samuel.campbell7251@example.com', '2015-01-22', 1, N'Excellent. What I was expecting.'),
