(N'Omar', N'Jenkins', N'omar.jenkins1057@example.org', '2015-01-22', 5, N'I use this for mmo gaming and it''s great. I love having the buttons on the side. They sped my gameplay up substantially.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Nelson', N'shirley.nelson1144@example.org', '2015-01-22', 5, N'Works great. Indicator lights, small size, will charge 2 battery packs at once. My son plays a lot of x box one games. This keeps him playing without costing an arm and leg in disposable batteries.'),
(N'Henry', N'Clark', N'henry.clark4443@example.org', '2015-01-22', 1, N'Not worth the price, won''t stay on the knobs..'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'James', N'jeffrey.james8953@example.org', '2015-01-22', 5, N'Amazon needs to clean up their reviews and remove these "fake" emo crybabies about scalpers. This happens with any limited edition product, game or otherwise. Yes, there will be more stock coming, but it''s not going to be widespread available like everyone seems to think. Just wait around until release day Feb 13th and hope for the best. I don''t see prices going down (at least longer term). Last but not least, Amazon doesn''t carry Nintendo consoles at retail price anymore, so for the past several years, this site has been a haven for third party sellers listing their Nintendo products at higher than retail price. Do you have to buy from them? No, doesn''t mean you can skew the review ratings on a product listing just because you are dissatisfied with the limited nature of a PREORDER. Back to the console, the styling is nice. It reminds me of the muted designs on the Wii U Zelda gamepad, as it''s not too striking. The inside is red (my favorite color) and while it doesn''t come with...'),
(N'Priya', N'Sanders', N'priya.sanders2691@example.net', '2015-01-22', 5, N'I was saving up for this because I saw a game that only played on this system so I saved up for it and now I got it and it plays great.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Myers', N'sandra.myers5385@example.org', '2015-01-22', 3, N'Apparently my head is too small? It hangs too low on my head even when adjusted. The cord is waaaaaaaaaaay too long so it gets caught on pretty much everything. The mic is poop quality. Sound is okay. The LEDs never turn off. Pretty bulky. But it''s still a decent device.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Garcia', N'sofia.garcia4234@example.org', '2015-01-22', 5, N'wow this game take your mind .'),
(N'Helen', N'Edwards', N'helen.edwards7961@example.net', '2015-01-22', 5, N'Excellent.'),
