(N'Ivan', N'Nowak', N'ivan.nowak9888@example.net', '2015-01-24', 5, N'SSB'),
(N'Kyle', N'Chavez', N'kyle.chavez1356@example.com', '2015-01-24', 1, N'Nope can''t believe this game is even rated it is a broken mess as of 1/25/2015 frame rates are still all over the place. Settings do not matter that much because it just crushes every PC I have. Do yourself a favor and wait another year. Black flag looks and plays way better than this game. If I could retun the game I would as its just broken unoptimized mess.'),
(N'Emma', N'Morales', N'emma.morales8258@example.net', '2015-01-24', 3, N'I''m rating this three stars only for more than one player (it''s manageable). For one player only, it is tedious, frustrating and exhausting. I played so hard to beat just the first world. Finally I did and the second world was beyond hard. I prefer games that aren''t this exhausting and hard. It wasn''t challenging hard, it was just hard as in it''s not fun anymore, hard. The game is cute tho and completely reminds me of super mario bros., only better (if only it wasn''t such a hard game)! Wanted to play this game so bad, but not anymore because I can''t even pass it... I hope Wii U mario bros is easier.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Khan', N'joseph.khan5658@example.org', '2015-01-24', 3, N'gift'),
(N'Daniel', N'Mendoza', N'daniel.mendoza8722@example.com', '2015-01-24', 1, N'Horrible, the very definition of cheap crap. Apps (Netflix, Hulu) do not work. What games there are, crash consistently. Not worth buying under any circumstances. Microsoft clearly has no interest in building quality products and should just go out of business now. Very disappointing purchase.'),
(N'Laura', N'Anderson', N'laura.anderson1527@example.org', '2015-01-25', 5, N'Amazing keyboard for a fraction of the price'),
(N'Amara', N'Smith', N'amara.smith6419@example.net', '2015-01-25', 4, N'Once you get use to the new layout its a worthy addition. This is especially good for fighters. Vmu an rumble packs can be a little hard but not impossible to remove.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Flores', N'hiroshi.flores6027@example.com', '2015-01-25', 5, N'Amazing game i love legend of zelda and this tittle was beautifull!!!'),
