(N'Jason', N'Cooper', N'jason.cooper1783@example.com', '2015-01-25', 5, N'Amazing!!!'),
(N'Debra', N'Singh', N'debra.singh8484@example.org', '2015-01-25', 1, N'wow I expected this to be like grand theft auto but it was not waste of money now I cant even give it away'),
(N'Emma', N'Hughes', N'emma.hughes5500@example.com', '2015-01-25', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Christine', N'White', N'christine.white7506@example.net', '2015-01-25', 5, N'Very great game has all FC3 has and a lot more. Love the guns, graphics, and story.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Rogers', N'lucia.rogers1199@example.net', '2015-01-25', 4, N'fun multiplayer game'),
(N'Samantha', N'Mitchell', N'samantha.mitchell2010@example.org', '2015-01-26', 5, N'Love to play!!'),
(N'Susan', N'Reyes', N'susan.reyes2812@example.com', '2015-01-26', 3, N'You get what you pay for. It''s not a great mouse, but it gets the job done for less than $15.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Davis', N'lauren.davis5589@example.com', '2015-01-26', 5, N'This game is really addicting. Great writing and little missions in each part of Seattle to work on. It makes me want to complete every district. The visuals look amazing in the day and at night. Since I''ve taken business trips to Seattle, I recognize many of the landmarks they faithfully re-created in this game. Each power serves its purpose and it''s great to launch assaults from above on "tanks" below. The "karma" powers are a little over the top so it''s nice that you can only use them every once in a while. Highly recommended if you haven''t already played the Last of Us or Grand Theft Auto V.'),
(N'Larry', N'Ramirez', N'larry.ramirez6673@example.net', '2015-01-26', 2, N'It''s tough to write a negative review for a game that really does have a lot going for it (good gameplay, good story, fairly good but sometimes buggy graphics), but I''m amazed that the developers didn''t spend more time on this. Most of the cut-scenes lag, cut out, or don''t load at all. As other reviewers have noted, every time you have to check a menu, the game takes about fifteen seconds to load. Fifteen seconds might not sound like much but when you need to frequently check your menus, maps, etc., that becomes EXTREMELY annoying! I played the game until the end, and genuinely did enjoy it, but I also received it for $25. I can''t imagine paying $60 for this game! Compared to the rest of the games on the market, I''d say this game is worth about $15, max. I mainly played it for the action and wasn''t too interested in the cut-scenes, but if I were, I probably would have thrown my controller across the room many, many times.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Hill', N'nadia.hill7718@example.com', '2015-01-26', 5, N'Really nice, comfortable case for 3DSXL!!! Protective and comfortable in hands.'),
(N'James', N'Singh', N'james.singh5524@example.com', '2015-01-26', 5, N'Good product, fast shipping, would order again'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Myers', N'elizabeth.myers7965@example.com', '2015-01-26', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Heather', N'Evans', N'heather.evans9338@example.net', '2015-01-27', 4, N'best PES in years. keep working'),
(N'Paul', N'Reyes', N'paul.reyes6212@example.com', '2015-01-27', 5, N'SUPERSMASH BROS!!!!!!!!!! + CONTROLLER + WII U GAMECUBE ADAPTER!!! What more could you ask for! The game beats its past versions and with the return and great feel of the gamecube controller and you up to 8! PLAYERS/FRIENDS! can have many many hours of fun!'),
(N'Frank', N'Henderson', N'frank.henderson3273@example.net', '2015-01-27', 1, N'Yuck. That''s all I can think to say for this game. Yuck. Having been a hard-core Thief player back in the day, I was super excited to see a revamped version of it. Especially with what we''re able to do with next-gen technology. But, none of that mattered with this version... because the ball was dropped at every level. The game play is just flat-out boring. The main character, Garrett, and his little girl-toy, are just flat-out ugly. Hideous, in fact. I have no idea what the storyline is or who the bad guy is. I can''t find even half of the items to steal... not that it matters anyway, because I don''t care to buy anything because the game is so boring. Did I mention the game is boring? I don''t mean to be a "hater," but this franchise has a time-honored tradition of excellence. And this version is such a terrible disappointment. My advice is, don''t bother. Find another game for the PS4. Maybe even one you wouldn''t like. It''ll still be better than this one. The game definitely lives...'),
(N'Frank', N'Henderson', N'frank.henderson3273@example.net', '2015-01-27', 1, N'I have never been as disappointed with a purchase as I was with this one. Because of the bad reviews (which seemed to be toward glitches and other Beta issues), I waited two months to buy it, thinking Ubisoft would release enough patches to clear up the issues... but, apparently, there were so many issues, they couldn''t release them fast enough, because this game sucks. The fighting is atrocious and the parkour is awful. The graphics and finally being able to see the inside of the buildings is fantastic. For that, I would give the designers five stars. But, that stuff doesn''t make a playable game. It makes a pretty one, but not a playable one. I couldn''t figure out even the easiest moves (like how to use the smoke bomb or how to defend myself or how to not grab everything I didn''t want to grab). Like I said, the game play is horrid - even two months after release. Maybe I should''ve waited a year? Or, maybe I shouldn''t have bought it at all. Either way, Ubisoft, Unity is an absolute...'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Reed', N'evelyn.reed8834@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N'WORKS GREAT. COULDNT FIGURE THE THING OUT AT FIRST BECAUSE MINE WAS USED WITHOUT INSTUCTIONS SO I WENT ON THEIR WEBSITE AND IT WAS PRETTY EASY. THE SOUND IS CLEAR. YOU CAN ADJUST THE VOLUME LEVELS THROUGH YOUR GAME SETTINGS. IT WORKED ON MY TWO GAMES THAT USE A MIC. LIPS GREATEST HITS, AND METALLICA ROCK BAND. IM NOT SURE ABOUT GUITAR HERO THOUGH, HAVENT TRIED MY BEATLES ONE YET, I HOPE IT WORKS BECAUSE I READ SOME PEOPLE HAD ISSUES WITH THAT ONE. ; ( ANYWAYS ITS A GOOD MIC TO HAVE. RECOMMENDED'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Nguyen', N'rebecca.nguyen5343@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Chen', N'andrew.chen2193@example.com', '2015-01-27', 5, N'fun and cute at the same time'),
(N'Raymond', N'Cook', N'raymond.cook4950@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N'My grandson loved it, fast delivery'),
(N'Adam', N'Rogers', N'adam.rogers2406@example.org', '2015-01-27', 5, N'Does exactly what its supposed to, once you read how to get it working. If you''re not a person who can dig a little deeper and read instructions this isn''t the product for you.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Powell', N'shirley.powell2645@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N'This game is by no means new. It''s been out for years, and it doesn''t do 3D. I switch the 3D off on all my games anyway, so that''s no problem for me. I really encourage curious gamers to give this a try. It has some aspects that are a bit violent and serious for young kids, hence the T rating, but is overall funky, different, and engaging. Also, it''s a Square Enix game, made by the same people behind much more well known games like Final Fantasy and Kingdom Hearts. It doesn''t play the same way as them, but the same caliber of development and quality is definitely there.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Perry', N'lucia.perry2226@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N'This game was the stuff. I will caution all by first stating that I am a big SW fan, but I honestly think this game is fantastic, though flawed. As a game, it was a 4 star, but the story was so good. The premise is that you play as Vader''s secret apprentice, a young man dubbed "Starkiller," blessed with godly force powers, lethal saber skills, and a best friend who is always trying to kill you. Throughout the game, with plenty of twists, you track down and eliminate powerful Jedi who have escaped Order 66 to build up your experience and to defeat Emperor Palpatine. The story is excellent, as is the voice acting, especially Sam Witwer as Starkiller and Natalie Cox as Juno Eclipse. The graphics are excellent. Though modern releases surely best it in appearances, the game still looks quite good. The Havok engine does a great job with the force effects and lightsaber animations. The soundtrack is also a plus. There are some flaws, such as occasionally gimmicky controls, especially when...'),
(N'Edward', N'Davis', N'edward.davis4383@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N'great'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Mendoza', N'cheryl.mendoza6776@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N':)'),
(N'Joan', N'Nguyen', N'joan.nguyen3513@example.net', '2015-01-27', 5, N'This is ONE OF THE BEST games EVER. Little is changed from the SNES version, besides the better graphics. Please buy this game-you won''t regret it'),
(N'Hannah', N'Hughes', N'hannah.hughes1646@example.org', '2015-01-28', 5, N'Works'),
(N'Ashley', N'Lee', N'ashley.lee9086@example.org', '2015-01-28', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Morales', N'jennifer.morales8653@example.net', '2015-01-28', 5, N'Excellent product and Seller!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Walker', N'melissa.walker7323@example.net', '2015-01-28', 5, N'Great game one of my favorite in the series. But do NOT pay these reseller prices of 60 plus dollars. you can buy this game on nis america or nis europe store for 39.99.'),
(N'Brian', N'Kowalski', N'brian.kowalski3824@example.net', '2015-01-28', 5, N'The first DR game I played was the second one and there were a ton of issues I had with it. DR 3 fixes a majority of those issues. The graphics are greatly improved and the combat is far more fluid and satisfying. I like how it''s no longer time limited and you are pretty much free to explore the open world however you want without having to rush to get things done. Weapon and vehicle combos are a lot cooler looking as well and fun to use during combat. The only real complain that I have is the fact that they fail to capitalize, story wise, on the survivors. The lack of exploration in the story is a bit disappointing and leaves me wanting more. I mean they could easily have this huge Walking Dead like story going on but they simply give the bare minimum. I think it''d be interesting to see story based DLC come to the game to gain more back story and things of that nature. Still, Aside from that it was so worth buying. It''s gonna be one of those games that I can not wait to 100%.'),
(N'Anna', N'Reyes', N'anna.reyes6150@example.net', '2015-01-28', 3, N'Great game but loading time takes FOREVER.'),
(N'Justin', N'Robinson', N'justin.robinson6968@example.net', '2015-01-28', 2, N'I have "collected" all the Assassin''s Creed game sine Desmond was the star in the original Assassins Creed 1 which is by far one of the most difficult to play. It took me a while but I finally got a hang and love for the game. So when AC2 came out I was all over it and totally loved it. I spent hours and hours playing, trying to find the collectibles, trying to 100% all my assassinations. It seems that every year a new game comes out and they keep going from bad to worse. This is by far one of the worst that I have yet to play. Unity feels like a game that was rushed to market to make a quick few dollars. Looking at the price it is now I''m really not surprised that the price has dropped that significantly this quickly. Don''t worry after purchasing this game Ubi wants you to pop a few more of your hard dollars once again. There is also a companion app that is required for you to even a few chests. If you''re not happy with that, then I assume you won''t be happy with the game...'),
(N'Katherine', N'Robinson', N'katherine.robinson3661@example.net', '2015-01-28', 4, N'I don''t like the community that plays starcraft but it is a solid game.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Howard', N'jennifer.howard6560@example.org', '2015-01-28', 1, N'not very good'),
(N'Noah', N'Hernandez', N'noah.hernandez3328@example.org', '2015-01-28', 3, N'Works, but very quinsy. Just buy the real ones.'),
(N'Ivan', N'James', N'ivan.james3474@example.com', '2015-01-28', 5, N'All the bad reviews have no clue at all abouy what there talking about, This game graphic wise is nice gameplay is awesome only minor issue is the controls, Story is decent if plays like dead island and a mix of brink, mirror edge and a few other games but its awesome'),
(N'John', N'Peterson', N'john.peterson8752@example.com', '2015-01-28', 5, N'good'),
(N'John', N'Peterson', N'john.peterson8752@example.com', '2015-01-28', 5, N'excelent'),
(N'Zachary', N'Carter', N'zachary.carter7399@example.com', '2015-01-28', 4, N'The combination of a well developed Parkour movement system and a large open city that supports a tremendous amount of traversal possibilities is what immediately sets this game apart. It just makes sense that adding vertical movement is the perfect response to your shambling and mindless zombies (during the day that is!). Of course things change at night, which is another huge plus for the game as the challenges of navigating in the dark, combined with far more agile and developed infected create an extremely different and many times scary reality. The game rewards the risk to brave the night though, which is a great design aspect. The city is well developed with a lot of details, tons of fully implemented and explorable spaces. There''s a wide variety of materials and objects in the world, which makes it very immersive. Valuables and resources are spread throughout, so exploring is worthwhile. Collectibles are not highlighted by silly game highlighting - they just look like the...'),
(N'Mark', N'Peterson', N'mark.peterson3376@example.net', '2015-01-29', 5, N'Really long battery life and it''s great to have a cord so I can charge my controller and save on batteries.'),
(N'Linda', N'Clark', N'linda.clark4219@example.net', '2015-01-29', 5, N'This was a christmas present for a 7 year old girl, and she simply can''t stop playing it. She has been on it non-stop, and it really gets her up and moving. She doesn''t get much time to exercise aside from this game, so it does a lot to keep her moving. The game is fun and well refined, and a lot of voice actors put their chops to work on it. I was impressed so many were involved in it. Just because it''s a few years old doesn''t mean it''s worth less, but it does get the price down quite a bit. Pick it up for kids and they will love it.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Smith', N'ronald.smith7950@example.com', '2015-01-29', 4, N'fun game'),
(N'Ravi', N'Clark', N'ravi.clark7924@example.com', '2015-01-29', 5, N'good'),
(N'Brian', N'Turner', N'brian.turner8796@example.org', '2015-01-29', 5, N'good job'),
(N'Christine', N'Khan', N'christine.khan7493@example.org', '2015-01-29', 5, N'Played Saints Row IV back on the 360 when it came out and bought the combo on the Xbox One. Saints Row IV is as fun as it was on 360, not much changed graphically but it is a good enough game to play through again. Gat out of Hell was a fun twist while keeping the over the top mechanics from IV without needing to be in a virtual Steelport. Replace gliding with angel wings and you have it. Only down side is that Gat out of Hell was a bit short. Played it on Hardcore and 100% completed it in a weekend. Admittedly that was a good weekend which is why it gets 5 stars.'),
(N'Jason', N'Kumar', N'jason.kumar5078@example.net', '2015-01-29', 5, N'Quick delivery, exactly as described'),
(N'Debra', N'Watson', N'debra.watson8498@example.net', '2015-01-29', 5, N'Graphics: The games all look great. Surprisingly, though a lot of popular titles are actually not in 1080p. This may be why they look so good. When I played PC games I used to commonly use a lower display resolution (with the same aspect ratio) than my display''s default in order to up the quality. Controller: The PS3 controllers connect much faster to the console than Xbox 360''s and they are numbered with actual numbers so everyone knows exactly what player they are. Stereoscopic 3d: This console will tell my tv to go into 3D mode, my xbox 360 doesn''t (with the games I''ve played for both) so I don''t need to look for my remote. Netflix 3D access also, more on this below... Slim: It really is quite slim...'),
(N'Zachary', N'Martin', N'zachary.martin7436@example.org', '2015-01-29', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Aisha', N'Mendoza', N'aisha.mendoza2247@example.com', '2015-01-29', 5, N'great I loved MK when I first played it on ps1'),
(N'Amara', N'Adams', N'amara.adams8793@example.com', '2015-01-30', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Mark', N'Hernandez', N'mark.hernandez9370@example.com', '2015-01-30', 5, N'Nice game thanks.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Wilson', N'marcus.wilson7101@example.com', '2015-01-30', 5, N'Must have for ps4 owners. The game starts off very slow but once you get though maybe a couple of hours it will be all fun and mayhem!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Rivera', N'nicole.rivera6872@example.com', '2015-01-30', 5, N'fun game'),
(N'Jerry', N'Brooks', N'jerry.brooks7080@example.org', '2015-01-30', 5, N'Great Product'),
(N'Robert', N'Perez', N'robert.perez5273@example.com', '2015-01-30', 5, N'it''s awesome!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Nelson', N'samuel.nelson1175@example.com', '2015-01-30', 5, N'if you love star wars, then this is the game for you. well worth the money spent on this game. i''ve enjoyed it each and every time i have replayed it.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Cox', N'hiroshi.cox3087@example.net', '2015-01-30', 5, N'Great game good shooter with solid maps and action. Challenging.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Kelly', N'kathleen.kelly5227@example.net', '2015-01-30', 5, N'Last year of NCAA Football...and it''s a good one.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Powell', N'nancy.powell5183@example.com', '2015-01-30', 5, N'This is a handheld experience of dynasty warriors. I played it in the airport when I had a long layover and it made the time fly by.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Walker', N'patricia.walker6985@example.net', '2015-01-31', 2, N'Had this card for a few months now and it was awesome and ran great for months and I had plenty of space for all my downloaded games, but as of today this card just died on me it would not let me format it at all, I hope I can get a replacement for it because it''s not even old and I expected more than a few months of use out of it for how expensive it was. I will change it to a 5 star if I get a replacement because it ran great when it worked.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Nowak', N'raymond.nowak2946@example.com', '2015-01-31', 4, N'Was a pretty fun game.'),
(N'Debra', N'Nowak', N'debra.nowak7269@example.org', '2015-01-31', 5, N'Just as advertised.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Williams', N'douglas.williams4453@example.org', '2015-01-31', 5, N'fun game for everyone'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Reed', N'evelyn.reed8834@example.net', '2015-01-31', 1, N'AWFUL !!!!!!!!!! WORKS WHEN YOUR RIGHT ON TOP OF YOUR TV AND THATS THAT !!!!!! DONT EVEN BOTHER, THE COOL ZOOM SOUNDED SO GREAT FOR MY TINY ROOM BUT ID BE GREAT FINE MOVING MY CHAIR BACK AND FORTH THAN USING THIS THING.'),
(N'Gary', N'Cook', N'gary.cook4956@example.org', '2015-01-31', 5, N'very good product would recoment it to friends and family'),
(N'Jose', N'Evans', N'jose.evans5698@example.com', '2015-01-31', 3, N'It''s used like the seller said... but it is not sealed right... I mean it is coming apart at the seem... like it''s not glued right or not snapped together right (whichever it is that they seal these things) The buttons are very very stiff which make it pretty hard to play... the D pad and the 4 buttons are stiff... it''s almost like their stuck... It does work though so I guess it will be my player 2 controller... home field advantage for me I guess huh!'),
(N'Joseph', N'Jackson', N'joseph.jackson3548@example.net', '2015-01-31', 1, N'would not stay plugged in the ps4 controller'),
(N'Adam', N'Myers', N'adam.myers3583@example.net', '2015-01-31', 5, N'I find this game very eay to get lost in. Graphics are great, story is good enough; it''s not the best but it is interesting. Voice acting is good, controls are good on both Mouse/KB and gamepad. It does have some performance issues and at the time of writing this AMD useres are having some problems running the game compared to their Intel/Nvidia counterparts. Playing this game is a blast, whether its running around searching for loot, completing missions or just helping people. Going online is also a lot of fun. You can take part in some of the PvP or opt out and group up with others and go about your business as usuall. Co-op in this game comes highly recommended IMO. If you have an Intel i5 or better and a GTX 660 or better, pick it up, it''s a lot of fun. If you''re on AMD, wait for a patch. Dying Light is worth the retail price IMO, however a sale would make it that much sweeter. Current state 4/5 If all performance issues are patched its an easy 5/5 for me.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Turner', N'tyler.turner2517@example.com', '2015-01-31', 5, N'Great detailing in characters.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Gray', N'lisa.gray5533@example.com', '2015-01-31', 1, N'Very hard to figure this out.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Campbell', N'lisa.campbell2115@example.org', '2015-02-01', 5, N'I got this game with my Wii U and i love it , Mario and Luigi games both on one disc but 2 full fun games, This is great Nintendo games.'),
(N'Christine', N'Diaz', N'christine.diaz3923@example.com', '2015-02-01', 5, N'Finally picked this up for the PC. With some mods and enhancements, the PC version really does outclass the console versions in every way possible!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Henderson', N'evelyn.henderson1490@example.org', '2015-02-01', 5, N'Very Good !!!'),
(N'Joseph', N'Morales', N'joseph.morales6929@example.org', '2015-02-01', 1, N'poor quality'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Wang', N'jennifer.wang7510@example.com', '2015-02-01', 2, N'Not as hard as the first game....not user friendly...'),
(N'James', N'Jenkins', N'james.jenkins1319@example.com', '2015-02-01', 5, N'so far so good, work''s great!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Scott', N'tomasz.scott4496@example.net', '2015-02-01', 5, N'Awesome love it Very good service! THANK YOU'),
(N'Joseph', N'Moore', N'joseph.moore9490@example.com', '2015-02-01', 1, N'The product came damaged. It does not work . wireless control is not original.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Kelly', N'brandon.kelly1562@example.org', '2015-02-01', 1, N'I can''t tell you what I think of this game that I just spent 40$ on because it cannot be played without creating an Origin account. I don''t hjave any interest in having an origin account, and I am using my internet for other things, I don''t want to sacrifice my connection speed so that EA can shove marketing BS down my throat. I hate these people. This is not even a game, its an outright scam that EA runs on kids that do not understand what they are giving away. EA used to be a good compnay, I am not sure what happened to transform them into what they are now, but this makes me sick. I spent $40 on this game and it will never be played. Not once. I can''t get a refund because it was digital, and NOWHERE in the products description does it tell you that you have to jump thru hoops and allow EA access to all of your personal info thru 4th party software.... I wish it was possible to boycott these mega corps, but it isn''t, they have intertwined themselves into everything, and you are...'),
(N'Wei', N'Carter', N'wei.carter1422@example.com', '2015-02-01', 5, N'Works perfectly on android devices, comes in a sturdy hard plastic case that also houses the charging cable. Works well with many emulators and games.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Price', N'stephen.price1573@example.org', '2015-02-02', 1, N'One of the worst COD to date next to Ghosts and MW3'),
(N'Hannah', N'Hughes', N'hannah.hughes1646@example.org', '2015-02-02', 5, N'This thing does exactly what I intended-let me hook the Xbox up to my home stereo reciever. I''m running a Monster cable hdmi cord, and this thing fits above it fine-no need for a ''slim'' hdmi cable, as some sellers claim. Just get this, it''s even cheaper than the Turtle Beach one.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Alvarez', N'brandon.alvarez9852@example.com', '2015-02-02', 5, N'thank u'),
(N'Ethan', N'Clark', N'ethan.clark7174@example.org', '2015-02-02', 5, N'This was a great deal. Everything was included in it and the price was right!'),
(N'Matthew', N'Jones', N'matthew.jones4717@example.com', '2015-02-02', 2, N'After using two of these controller for 2 days, both of them have had the cord pull out of the controller, exposing the much more delicate wires. If left this way, they would be broken in short order, and this would be a 1 star review. But, I caught it in time, took the controller apart and affixed the cord properly. They should not be shipping out controllers like this, and it seems that this is a common problem that they have yet to fix. DO NOT BUY unless you are prepared to disassemble the controller in order to fix this issue. Otherwise, I am happy with the operation of the controller and haven''t had any other problems.'),
(N'Christina', N'Garcia', N'christina.garcia9399@example.org', '2015-02-02', 5, N'Awesome concept!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ross', N'jacob.ross2549@example.net', '2015-02-02', 2, N'It has a hum I could hear and other players did too, so I bought turtle beach headphones'),
(N'Jerry', N'Nowak', N'jerry.nowak8229@example.net', '2015-02-02', 5, N'Used can be OK or really excellent,this was excellent condition.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Perez', N'sharon.perez9945@example.com', '2015-02-02', 5, N'Great, wonderful, fantastic, love it.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Cooper', N'matthew.cooper5795@example.com', '2015-02-02', 5, N'good game.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Brooks', N'evelyn.brooks2596@example.com', '2015-02-02', 4, N'it''s ok'),
(N'Jose', N'Hughes', N'jose.hughes2248@example.net', '2015-02-02', 2, N'waist of my money *sigh*'),
(N'Judith', N'Martin', N'judith.martin4222@example.org', '2015-02-02', 2, N'Game just isn''t where Nba live games used to be and should be. I don''t know what happened, but the past couple nba lives have been terrible. Granted nba 2k''s effort this year wasn''t very good either. Just think EA would put as much effort into nba live as Madden. At least be able to edit players.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Lopez', N'evelyn.lopez8790@example.net', '2015-02-02', 4, N'i broke mine first one so i bought this one to replace it thank you for having it'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Wisniewski', N'elizabeth.wisniewski4002@example.net', '2015-02-02', 4, N'Great single player campaigns. Multiplayer needs some work. So much content. Almost too much.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Turner', N'tomasz.turner2458@example.com', '2015-02-02', 5, N'Takes a bit of messing around but i installed it and IT WAS EPIC AND NOSTALGIC. Graphics are good(a bit pixely on bushes but watever) but sall good.'),
(N'Maria', N'Kim', N'maria.kim2663@example.net', '2015-02-02', 5, N'Compralo'),
(N'Samuel', N'Thompson', N'samuel.thompson2404@example.net', '2015-02-03', 5, N'Works great!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Coleman', N'marcus.coleman4991@example.com', '2015-02-03', 4, N'This controller is the same as an Xbox 360 Controller with a twist. It is Stormin'' Cherry in color and is transparent. This controller is also compatible with the PC. When connected to a personal computer you can customize all the butttons except for the guide button. The guide button acts like more of a help button on the PC. It opens the Xbox Accesories help window. You can also use the controller accessories on your computer. With full vibration feedback you will feel every action that you do or is done to you. None of the buttons are hard to press and they aren''t too sensitive. I would recommend this to anybody looking to enhance their PC gaming experience.'),
(N'Anna', N'Ramirez', N'anna.ramirez2039@example.org', '2015-02-03', 5, N'Great game for kids'),
(N'Douglas', N'Thompson', N'douglas.thompson4321@example.com', '2015-02-03', 5, N'very good product my daugther love it, very good music and grafics.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Henderson', N'dennis.henderson5625@example.org', '2015-02-03', 5, N'great case for an older 3DSXL owner. It honestly doesn''t look as much like a lady-wallet as some people say it does, or maybe I''m just comfortable with my masculinity, who knows. it holds the 3ds and three games, has exposed areas for a lanyard if you have something like that attached, and it uses magnetic clips to shut, so you don''t have any annoying velco to worry about with this case. the construction seems good, I, a college student, have been putting it in my bag for two weeks now and it hasn''t been marred. If you want it, get it.'),
(N'Walter', N'Butler', N'walter.butler5370@example.com', '2015-02-03', 5, N'Just as described n works great'),
(N'Paul', N'Barnes', N'paul.barnes6320@example.com', '2015-02-03', 5, N'old school'),
(N'Ivan', N'Nelson', N'ivan.nelson3104@example.org', '2015-02-03', 5, N'I''m a huge Halo fan and bought this to collect!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Edwards', N'benjamin.edwards8595@example.net', '2015-02-03', 4, N'It''s great, addicted hack n slash kill-loot-repeat gameplay. Graphics are a bit choppy, and the game will sometimes erase your save file. If you are OK with those quirks, or like bad metal music, give it a try.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Ferreira', N'kyle.ferreira6194@example.net', '2015-02-04', 4, N'Is a good version.'),
