(N'Amanda', N'Wood', N'amanda.wood2253@example.com', '2015-02-04', 5, N'This game improved so much from the previous game. My only gripe is that there is NO ENGLISH VOICE ACTING!!!! The guys they got for the first one did great, in my opinion, Koei/Tecmo should''ve just called them all up for another go. I''m sure it was because the first didn''t sell well in the US.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Bailey', N'andrea.bailey8531@example.com', '2015-02-04', 5, N'This game has it all, great graphics, great controls, and a rocking soundtrack that makes you want to turn up volume. A game for all ages.'),
