(N'Diane', N'Johnson', N'diane.johnson8539@example.org', '2015-02-05', 5, N'Great quality and works perfect, the extra 6 feet are useful since I was my console 8 fee away from me'),
(N'Anita', N'Williams', N'anita.williams5964@example.com', '2015-02-05', 5, N'The Mario Cart games have been favorites of my boys for a while, particularly my youngest. While there is nothing significant that is new in the Wii U version of the game, he has played it very frequently.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Torres', N'melissa.torres8855@example.org', '2015-02-05', 3, N'I''m a fan of the Mystery Masters collections, but I find this set just average. The two Small Town Terrors games are good and worth playing, as is Portal of Evil: Stolen Runes. The rest are just typical hidden object game fare, and one of them - Amber''s Tales: The Isle of Dead Ships - locked up half-way through and could not be completed. Overall it is still a decent value, but I recommend other entries in the series like Mystery Masters: Legends of Terror or Mystery Masters: Wicked Worlds Collection Here is a list of the games in this set (with links to some of the individual game listings so that you can read more about them): Small Town Terrors: Pilgrim''s Hook Collector''s Edition Portal of Evil: Stolen Runes Collector''s Edition Small Town Terrors: Livingston Viva Media Mind Snares: Alice''s Journey Dream Hills: Captured Magic Dark Romance: Vampire in Love Collector''s Edition Curse of Silent Marshes, The 1912: Titanic Mystery Amber''s Tales: The Isle of Dead Ships Whispered...'),
(N'Priya', N'Powell', N'priya.powell4462@example.com', '2015-02-05', 5, N'Works perfectly on SNES. No issues after many days of continuous use.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Gutierrez', N'ethan.gutierrez9504@example.net', '2015-02-05', 5, N'I never had the chance to get a gamecube microphone at a game store before, so I bought this one! It works really well and my little brother and I can now play all of our gamecube games that require a microphone!'),
(N'Paul', N'Webb', N'paul.webb9578@example.org', '2015-02-05', 5, N'The best controller money can buy and finally I can play Ghost-N-Goblins, Super Mario World and Excitebike the way they are intended. I loved playing Paper Mario 64 with this as well!!!'),
