(N'Cheryl', N'Green', N'cheryl.green9052@example.org', '2015-02-06', 5, N'Great Product!!'),
(N'Eric', N'Thomas', N'eric.thomas2841@example.com', '2015-02-06', 5, N'Great game for adults and children. Would be great if there were online Co op options on lego games. Pros: - Includes many marvel universe characters and of course Stan Lee cameo per level. Each character with their own special abilities. - big open world to explore, and different major marvel settings like Stark Lab. - every character has a purpose to unlock and get into secret passages. Con: - side by side Co op only.'),
(N'Brian', N'Smith', N'brian.smith7993@example.org', '2015-02-06', 5, N'great'),
(N'Paul', N'Ruiz', N'paul.ruiz6399@example.net', '2015-02-06', 5, N'Excellent'),
