(N'Charles', N'Mendoza', N'charles.mendoza6875@example.net', '2015-02-06', 5, N'For a year I was unsure if I should bother with this game or not. Really should NOT have waited a year. This game is so much more than I hoped it would be.. Right off the top, if your looking for another bland FPS game, look elsewhere, they are a dime a dozen. If you like something more. This may be for you. If you prefer far cry over call of duty, this may be for you.. This at its surface is a First person shooter. Luckily it does not stop at its surface, it is deep and different.. in a good way. Can you run from area to area having fire fights? Absolutely. Combat is fun and well done. Or if you prefer a more realistic approach you can stick to the shadows and silently take down your enemys. The combat is top notch. The story is a exceptional. The graphics are about as good as it gets (for a year ago). Overall on a 1-10 scale I would give this a SOLID 9.. The downside, this game will bring an average PC to its knees. My specs: i-7 4770k @ 4.5ghz Evga GTX 970 Running at 1080...'),
(N'Noah', N'Kim', N'noah.kim9196@example.com', '2015-02-07', 5, N'Still using it after almost 2 years!'),
(N'John', N'Ramos', N'john.ramos3293@example.org', '2015-02-07', 5, N'fits perfectly on my kid xl 3ds'),
(N'Dennis', N'Khan', N'dennis.khan7829@example.net', '2015-02-07', 1, N'Horrible. They don''t fit the controller at ALL.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Ramirez', N'rebecca.ramirez4521@example.com', '2015-02-07', 2, N'I got this because my friends wanted me to play. Its not that great. It was seriously hyped. Its Parkour-Mech with, get this, outrageous enemies to you ratio (team of 4 against waves of 4x that). It is not my type of game. maybe better for you?'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Brooks', N'benjamin.brooks8755@example.org', '2015-02-07', 5, N'It was so fun to play this game! Everyone who likes role-playing or strategy games play this! So fun to play online because it''s like taking different trails to get to the same place but your racing with other people. It took me about 10mins to figure out how to play.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Cruz', N'ethan.cruz8210@example.org', '2015-02-07', 3, N'"Hey, let''s pad out the game by forcing the players to spend 99% of it on a boat that''s slower than continental drift and turns with approximately the same speed as a drunk, retarded turtle in Antarctica! Best! Idea! Ever!" The sailing is literally the worst part of the entire game. Removing it was the only thing Unity did right. Good protagonist, story, secondary and side characters. Awful central gimmick.'),
(N'Adam', N'Bell', N'adam.bell5584@example.com', '2015-02-07', 5, N'Really fun'),
(N'Karen', N'Thomas', N'karen.thomas2932@example.net', '2015-02-07', 2, N'Civilization has to be one of my 10 favorite franchises over the past 30 years and has brought me possibly thousands of hours of entertainment and great memories. This game honestly was disappointing and does not live up to the Civ name. It was tedious, lacked the depth of Civ V, and is really a watered-down, poorly done skin on Civ V. I wish I had never bought it.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Roberts', N'sarah.roberts5232@example.net', '2015-02-07', 2, N'I bought these headphones a year ago, right when I was getting back into console gaming. These were a fair price kind of but I needed at least a decent headset. So I bought it, I have previously owned Turtle Beach X11s I believe, back when Turtle Beach was a pretty new company. Then I owned the Astro A40s and Creative Sound Blaster Recon 3D. What I like about them is that they are the most durable out of the previous headphones that I''ve listed. The sound quality was not so great at all, but there''s no surround sound which was to be expected. This would of been of 3 stars if the chat cable (the one from the controller to the headphones) actually did not break so early. So most of the time I have to angle the cable a different way to chat with my friends, which bothered me a lot. I rated this 3 stars because this is kind of a rip off from the start, Its MSRP should of been atleast 60-50$. There''s no outstanding trait of this headphones even if its a bit cheaper than the better...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Jackson', N'amanda.jackson2717@example.org', '2015-02-07', 1, N'Congratulations: you''re now the owner of a system with next to zero first-party support! I hope you like playing imported visual novels, JRPGs, cool indies, or remote play, because that''s all you''ll ever use this handheld for!'),
(N'Larry', N'Roberts', N'larry.roberts9911@example.com', '2015-02-07', 4, N'I played most of this game is a good game'),
(N'Mary', N'Chen', N'mary.chen9235@example.net', '2015-02-08', 3, N'much different than anticipated. you have no weapons. its search. RUN. REPEAT. just not as fun as the other silent hill games'),
(N'Debra', N'Thomas', N'debra.thomas4330@example.net', '2015-02-08', 2, N'Game has bad language, lots of foul language and too much talking and not enough actual action. Not one I would recommend.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Miller', N'hannah.miller1594@example.com', '2015-02-08', 5, N'Many people will tell you that Turtle Beach is a horrible brand, but let me tell you that I have owned 25 Gaming headsets, and 5 are Turtle Beach. This is the best out of them all! For just over $100, you get a wireless headset that works with PS3/PS4/Xbox 360(Certain Models) and Xbox One (Chat Adapter Needed). You get all the accessories you need to need to get started. Its very easy to set up on what ever console you own. The sound is just extraordinary. At 5.1 Dolby Surround Sound, you get to hear all the action! As well as footsteps, grenades, anything you can think of! The Microphone is detachable, but I do say the microphone is the worst thing about the headset, but it still sounds decent! You also have different sound options. If you want more bass or more treble, you can make that happen! And the last thing I''m going to say is that this headset is very comfortable. Like I always say if it''s not comfortable your not gonna like it:) Great buy for any gamer looking for a...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Williams', N'kelly.williams7898@example.com', '2015-02-08', 5, N'Just awesome!!!'),
(N'Paul', N'Reed', N'paul.reed7996@example.org', '2015-02-08', 3, N'I bought this game because I like the series and I figured it would be OK, since the franchise is run entirely by RPG geeks to begin with. This game was not terrible, but it was hard to play it all the way through, since it got really boring after a while. There is almost no character development, a limited variety of items or weapons, and almost no difference in the levels - it''s basically the same thing over and over. But I did finish it, because I''m old-school and that''s how old-school gamers do - after all, I paid for it. I won''t say that his is a game that nobody should get - but I think it should probably be limited to collectors.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Singh', N'olivia.singh4781@example.net', '2015-02-08', 5, N'Great game! I actually wish that my son would play this more!'),
(N'Helen', N'Cox', N'helen.cox2294@example.net', '2015-02-08', 5, N'As described new and works great no issues with it... Batteries are not included with it'),
(N'Paul', N'Myers', N'paul.myers7339@example.org', '2015-02-08', 5, N'Awesome counsel! love it'),
(N'Joseph', N'Patel', N'joseph.patel1759@example.com', '2015-02-08', 5, N'PERFECT'),
(N'Matthew', N'Rodriguez', N'matthew.rodriguez5778@example.net', '2015-02-08', 5, N'excelente producto.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Morgan', N'sarah.morgan3280@example.org', '2015-02-08', 4, N'Fun update of the previous "Infamous" game. Not having all the power options like the last game was a bit of a bummer but graphics were great and the was enjoyable. I won''t play this game a second time but at $20 it was still a worthwhile playing experience.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Patel', N'jonathan.patel7596@example.org', '2015-02-08', 5, N'pure 2d zelda'),
(N'Thomas', N'Rodriguez', N'thomas.rodriguez1423@example.net', '2015-02-08', 5, N'I grew up on smash. I''ve played and owned every single smash bros to date, and loved all of them. This game is just another great iteration in the line of smash bros. There is a ton of variety and so many characters to pick from. The 8-player option is pretty awesome and each of the characters really is quite unique (not as many clones). You can spend a ton of time just trying to learn how to play each character. I really feel odd playing the game with anything but a gamecube controller, but until i can find a gamecube adapter that isn''t being sold by scalpers, the wii u pro isn''t bad for this, though it can be frustrating for someone used to using a different set of controls. Whether you''re playing with friends or alone, there''s plenty to do. The classic mode is fun and you can do it co-op or single-player, the tournament mode is interesting and the mode with crazy hand can be quite enthralling. There''s tons to do and it''s one of the best games for big groups of friends to play at...'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Mendoza', N'rebecca.mendoza4026@example.net', '2015-02-08', 5, N'So much better than any other mouse I''ve ever used!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Ramos', N'patrick.ramos9435@example.net', '2015-02-08', 5, N'Workerd well and lasted as long as we thought it should with no problems.'),
(N'David', N'James', N'david.james9429@example.org', '2015-02-08', 5, N'All ok. Thks.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Foster', N'jessica.foster5364@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'ok 100% recommended'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ramirez', N'brandon.ramirez1715@example.org', '2015-02-09', 5, N'amazing choice for cellphone gamers, also it chargers your phone'),
(N'Anna', N'Jimenez', N'anna.jimenez5187@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'As a long time Metal Gear fan I was really excited to see this collection existed. I missed getting a few of these games since they were not released on the Xbox at that time. I caught back up with Metal Gear when I finally got a PS3 with MGS4. It''s funny to go back and play the original MGS on a big screen. I can remember playing it on my CRT TV and thought it looked so good. It''s fun seeing the evolution of the controls for Metal Gear over the years. After playing MGS:GZ for a while it''s takes a while to get used to the older style of controlling Snake and the limited options you have with him. Over all this is an awesome pickup. It''s funny how I would rather play this then and new CoD that has come out in the past 3 years. I have AW for the PS4 sitting in my cabinet and I''d rather play an old PS1 or PS2 game instead. And so will you.'),
(N'Laura', N'Robinson', N'laura.robinson3804@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'Excellent purchase, came on the estimated date without any problem'),
(N'Richard', N'Raghunathan', N'richard.raghunathan1337@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'I love this thing, let''s me play all my old games. Would buy again for sure!'),
(N'Donna', N'Miller', N'donna.miller2342@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'Great game. The folks at CDPR took a great game and came back with an even greater game. I have seen comments about the content and it was down rated because of it. It is in context with his character as he is a lusty sort and they chose to put it out there. In the first game, you had the sex cards. This one was better in that respect and I didn''t find it distracting from the story line. Definitely not for the kids. I saw a comment about it giving an i5 a workout. If it was a Second Gen Sandy Bridge, it shouldn''t have been an issue, but could have been taxing on the GPU, as it is rather GPU intensive and you need a good one. I have played it on both the GTX 560Ti and GTX 680. Both did fine with the settings maxed out ( except Blur effects, which I don''t like ). It is very much story driven and the decisions you make will determine which direction the game takes. Supposedly there are some 14 different endings. The graphics are lush. I have never cared much for QTE''s but you can tone...'),
(N'Nicole', N'Wang', N'nicole.wang2708@example.org', '2015-02-09', 3, N'First off, you should know that my husband and I are casual video gamers so we are VERY selective about the games we purchase and play. In general, we like games that do not take themselves too seriously, have clear goals or steps to follow, include puzzles that require some thought but are not overly-challenging, can be played in front of children without worry of the content, and are more enjoyable than stressful to play. We also prefer games with the multi-player option so my husband and I can play together and work on teamwork/communication. At first we felt Little Big Planet met all of those criteria and played a few levels before purchasing the game, however we got so frustrated partway through the game that we never finished it. PROS: What we loved about the game was its creativity, unique game play, tons of silly/fun elements like stickers to outfits, multiple lives for each portion of the level, and very very enjoyable to replay. In fact, my husband and I have never...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Rogers', N'carolyn.rogers3726@example.net', '2015-02-09', 5, N'The mouse looks and feels fantastic, very fluid movements and the design is pretty stunning'),
(N'Brandon', N'Baker', N'brandon.baker1127@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'I made the switch from PlayStation to Xbox as soon as the 360 came out (for the simple reason that all my friends were getting 360s and I wanted to play with them), and I''ve been a fan ever since. The online service, interface, content, and exclusives have always been enough to keep me with the Xbox. So when the One came out, I was already pretty convinced that was the system I was going to go with, but decided to wait for the price to drop, and also to see if there were any major issues (like the notorious "Red Ring of Death" that haunted the 360). So I ended up picking one up for Christmas this year (2014). It''s been a great console so far. Unfortunately, it doesn''t seem that you can play a game without installing it (whereas on the 360 the game installation was optional); however, I do not necessarily consider this a drawback since installing the games provides faster load times. The graphics are great, the runtime is incredibly smooth, and the Assassin''s Creed game that comes...'),
(N'Adam', N'Davis', N'adam.davis9413@example.org', '2015-02-09', 5, N'as expected'),
(N'Luis', N'Thomas', N'luis.thomas8341@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'good grip'),
(N'Ravi', N'Edwards', N'ravi.edwards6919@example.com', '2015-02-09', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Daniel', N'Sanchez', N'daniel.sanchez2579@example.org', '2015-02-10', 2, N'Rehashed garbage from last gen.. This series has taken a really bad turn for the worst since 2. RIP Saints Row'),
(N'Maria', N'Sanchez', N'maria.sanchez4384@example.net', '2015-02-10', 4, N'Very fun game, glad a friend recommended it to me.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Lopez', N'sofia.lopez6739@example.net', '2015-02-10', 3, N'Kids played the game for one week and then lost interest, will probably trade it in at Game Stop.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Powell', N'patricia.powell2822@example.net', '2015-02-10', 5, N'Fun filled entertainment, hours of fun!'),
(N'Betty', N'Sanders', N'betty.sanders3292@example.com', '2015-02-10', 5, N'Works very well.'),
(N'Priya', N'Stewart', N'priya.stewart4380@example.com', '2015-02-10', 4, N'This game arrived in excellent condition, closed and sealed. Moreover, I bought it because I wanted to have a different set of fights, I never thought it would be so complicated and difficult to win the campaign ... For fans of fighting recommend this game to those seeking temporary fun better not ...'),
(N'Zachary', N'Lopez', N'zachary.lopez7743@example.org', '2015-02-10', 5, N'More gifts'),
(N'Amanda', N'Reyes', N'amanda.reyes3178@example.net', '2015-02-10', 5, N'I''ve always been a fan of old school western style RPG''s, which seem to mostly live on in recreations of older games. The original Dragon Age Origins was one of the greatest games I''ve ever played and never felt like another RPG reached the same height that game did. Before that it had been Knights of the Old Republic 2 that left me yearning for years. Don''t get me wrong, there are a ton of high quality RPG''s out there. The Mass Effect Series and Deus Ex Human Revolution were outstanding, but neither had the same party style gameplay that the fantasy counterparts in the RPG world have and the Elder Scroll series is just a different style of RPG. Dragon Age Inquisition skipped over the hack and slash style of Dragon Age 2 to return to a level, not quite as high as Dragon Age Origins at its time, that is enthralling with good longevity. The game follows a mighty hero that falls haphazardly into the middle of an apocalyptic event. It''s the fairly standard fare of "I''m a nobody, who...'),
(N'Maria', N'Ruiz', N'maria.ruiz8575@example.net', '2015-02-10', 5, N'I was hoping this would be something like Myst, which I loved playing 15 years ago. Actually, I think this is harder than Myst, but I still love it. I''m just in the early stages, but I''ve solved the six doors puzzle (I know, I''ve got a lot more ahead of me).'),
(N'Helen', N'Edwards', N'helen.edwards8922@example.org', '2015-02-10', 5, N'Out of all the AC games I''ve played(2,3,brotherhood, revelations) this one is my favorite'),
(N'Matthew', N'Sanders', N'matthew.sanders7025@example.com', '2015-02-10', 5, N'we love this mouse!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Kim', N'andrew.kim1294@example.com', '2015-02-10', 5, N'I have been playing pokemon for god knows how long now, and the games never get old. In fact, sapphire was my favorite game out of the entire collection so far, other than the original blue version, which will always be my first and favorite. I''ll admit, I was a little nervous when they made mega evolutions for pokemon, seeing as this is kind of another way to keep the game interesting, but my doubts were unfounded, as the game is as great as ever. Of course, I own Omega Ruby also, but either game is worth the price and is definitely one of the best they have remade. Another cool feature that they added was being able to catch the legendaries from other games, although you cant catch the ones from X or Y. Other than that, i would recommend this game to any pokemon fan out there.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Ali', N'aaron.ali8777@example.com', '2015-02-10', 4, N'This is a pretty damn solid title and it does something a bit new, and playing with your friends is competitive and fun, but most of the time you''d be just sprinting and running looking for monsters. When you do find them, though, it''s a lot of fun to use strategies to attack them. This is a 4v1 game, and it''s fun, but not at groundbreaking as the advertises say it is. Just because it has over 60''awards and nominations doesn''t mean Evolve is the secondcoming of Jesus. You have to play it to believe it that it really deserves 60 awards. So overall, this game isn''t going to hold my attention for long. It''s fun and enjoyable for now, but I''d barely be playing this 1 year from now. So, for my final verdict, pick this game up when the price drops down to $40 and make sure to play with your friends mostly because it''s pretty fun with that.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Jenkins', N'brenda.jenkins5882@example.org', '2015-02-10', 5, N'Loved'),
(N'Kyle', N'Garcia', N'kyle.garcia1634@example.org', '2015-02-10', 5, N'Great games for any Metal Gear fans. Now they just need to do a MGS1 HD remake,'),
(N'Christina', N'Miller', N'christina.miller5238@example.com', '2015-02-10', 4, N'the best game in his genre'),
(N'Christina', N'Miller', N'christina.miller5238@example.com', '2015-02-10', 3, N'only it protects the crystal and not the whole hood'),
(N'Christina', N'Miller', N'christina.miller5238@example.com', '2015-02-10', 4, N'the game of the period in perfect conditions'),
(N'Christina', N'Miller', N'christina.miller5238@example.com', '2015-02-10', 4, N'good pack, only gives slightly small memory'),
(N'Mary', N'Brown', N'mary.brown3940@example.com', '2015-02-10', 5, N'amazing this game is complete does not force you to buy the dlc free maps forever ignore negative reviews this game is good'),
(N'Patricia', N'Henderson', N'patricia.henderson6687@example.net', '2015-02-10', 5, N'It is Link! It is Legend of Zelda! It is awesome and a nod back to the older LoZ games. It has a battle system closer to the older style of play. My only complainant is you lose your weapon if you faint and didn''t by your weapon.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Henderson', N'patricia.henderson6687@example.net', '2015-02-10', 5, N'Great detail for the price! Ike has always been one of my favorite characters in both Super Smash Bro. Brawl and SSB Wii U. I was very happy to finally have a quality figure at an affordable price. These figures are not region locked, so if you need on from the secondary market don''t worry about packaging!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Davis', N'barbara.davis1896@example.net', '2015-02-10', 5, N'This game is amazing. You should buy it. I never played the PS3 version, but this one looks great, has smooth gameplay, and has one of the best story lines I have seen in a video game in a while. The bonus content gives a little extra insight into Ellie''s character as well as bridges a few gaps in the story. On the down-side, if you don''t like a game with a lot of story (& some intense realism), this probably isn''t for you. At times it almost feels like there is more storyline than gameplay.'),
(N'Susan', N'Brooks', N'susan.brooks4734@example.org', '2015-02-10', 5, N'I was a longtime user of Sony MDR-XD100 Stereo Headphones , when they finally started falling apart. As I only use these headsets to play on my computer, I figured I''d look for a gaming headset instead of just headphones. I have never been happier! I am not so nave to think that these are the best headsets ever designed, but for the money I spent on them, I am fairly certain they are the best headsets my money can buy. First, these phones sound leagues better than the Sony headphones I was using. I can hear things in games that I never knew existed. Second, they are as comfortable as many of these reviews state. I immediately replaced the leather covers with the cloth ones (per many of the reviews) and enjoyed the feel immediately. They are comfortable, do not cause "head crush syndrome" like some headsets do, the band is properly padded to avoid pain up to, and the weight is light enough that I can wear them for extended periods of time without discomfort. As for the product...'),
(N'Mei', N'Cook', N'mei.cook6345@example.com', '2015-02-10', 5, N'Fun, Fun, Fun!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Hill', N'kelly.hill6279@example.net', '2015-02-11', 5, N'was received good'),
(N'George', N'Gray', N'george.gray7860@example.net', '2015-02-11', 5, N'Great game! Basically like a Call of Duty for kids and adults. My child originally wanted this, but I found myself playing it more than him!'),
(N'Emma', N'Tanaka', N'emma.tanaka9675@example.net', '2015-02-11', 5, N'excelente producto'),
(N'Rachel', N'Fisher', N'rachel.fisher8975@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Wang', N'jonathan.wang9609@example.net', '2015-02-11', 3, N'There was quite a lack of information about the machine. It didn''t come with a controller. The description says it has a black finish, but this one has a white finish. No clear description as to weather it works or not. It does turn on.'),
(N'Joan', N'Anderson', N'joan.anderson7100@example.net', '2015-02-11', 5, N'If you''re looking for a PS3 game this is loved by my grandson.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Lee', N'marcus.lee7186@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'My oldest 10yr old loves this game. It is a good alternative to some of the more violent military games. I don''t care if other kids in his class play Call of Duty, Battlefield 4, etc - These games are rated T or M for a reason. It is a requirement to have Xbox Live gold to play, as it is a completely online game. You can typically find 12 month cards for $40 or less on sale.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Reyes', N'amanda.reyes3178@example.net', '2015-02-11', 2, N'When I heard Lords of the Fallen referred to as Dark Souls lite I looked forward to playing the game. I''m a huge Dark Souls fan. I dumped over a hundred hours into each entry of the series starting with Demon''s Souls back in the day. And the description is fairly accurate. It is a lite version of Dark Souls. It is a persistent game in that there is no save and load. The game continues on even when you die and you have to recover from your mistake and retrieve your experience which waits for you where you originally died. It has the same tropes of melee combat, equipment burden, magic, boss fights and exploration. But none of it is as good as Dark Souls. It, how do they put it, lacks that certain something. The game looks ok, not great, but no one plays the Souls series for the graphics. The sound is decent, and the voice acting is mostly well done. The world is decently interesting and the lore is worth reading. The gameplay is more melee focused than the Souls series. There is...'),
(N'Jessica', N'Hughes', N'jessica.hughes3100@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'A+'),
(N'Patrick', N'Long', N'patrick.long1976@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'Great loved it.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Singh', N'carolyn.singh3949@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'Ah... memories!'),
(N'Jason', N'Campbell', N'jason.campbell4545@example.com', '2015-02-11', 4, N'It is a excellent game very adictive'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Long', N'evelyn.long2973@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'Best damn mouse I have EVER used. My headshot ratio and accuracy have improved after switching tot his mouse. Using the Steelseries qck+ mouse pad with it, and it is a perfect combo. Especially if you use a low sensitivity.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Cruz', N'carolyn.cruz1652@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'I''ve literally played every version of Virtua Racing that exists. I played it in the arcade as a kid. I played it on the Genesis. I played the Playstation 2 version. And yes, I bought and played the Saturn version. And I am here to tell you that this is indeed the very best version in existence. The original arcade version was fondly remembered for it''s crisp beautiful graphics, and the crazy seat that moved around to try to simulate G-forces. The genesis version lacked a lot of the excitement of the arcade, but it was still very fun to play. And the PS2 version was very pretty, but had horrible sound effects every time your turned sharp etc (really annoying tire screech sound). This version...is awesome. I love racing games on the Saturn, and have actually found very few that I didn''t like (not fond of Daytona USA on Saturn, but that''s about it). This version of Virtua Racing features gorgeous simple graphics and a decent draw distance. It moves at a fast pace, and the controls...'),
(N'Yuki', N'Ivanov', N'yuki.ivanov2631@example.net', '2015-02-11', 1, N'Good game no doubt but I find it strange there is a collectors edition. Why would there be a collector edition to a game that is only online and will 1 day no longer be able to be played? I have the regular edition and waited for it to drop in price when got it. I already feel ripped off because as soon as MS disconnects Xbox live support to 360 players the disc can only be used as a frisbee and the toy is not worth it'),
(N'Larry', N'Bailey', N'larry.bailey9279@example.net', '2015-02-11', 5, N'son was happy to have this'),
(N'Betty', N'Richardson', N'betty.richardson8144@example.net', '2015-02-11', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Charles', N'Russell', N'charles.russell3078@example.com', '2015-02-11', 1, N'First of all, I must say that I didn''t join the beta testing. I was very excited about this game but after playing it for some hours I don''t think this game has as much replayability as the creators have bragged about (and I love both Left 4 Dead games). I''m not able to say how many maps the game currently has but they don''t seem all that different. Then the perks, what are those perks affecting?? because in the hours I have spent playing the game I couldn''t see any perk having a real effect on the gameplay at all. That if you haven''t abandoned trying to play because of the UNSKIPPABLE cutscenes... If anything positive, I would say that the graphics hold quite well.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Murphy', N'jacob.murphy9379@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'actually feels real nice in the hands and will protect it from scratches for sure really glade we got this for our specialty 3DS'),
(N'Ethan', N'Turner', N'ethan.turner5463@example.com', '2015-02-11', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Deborah', N'King', N'deborah.king8137@example.com', '2015-02-12', 5, N'Son and I love it!!!!!'),
(N'Angela', N'Wang', N'angela.wang5887@example.org', '2015-02-12', 1, N'If you want X-Men Children of the Atom in your collection then I STRONGLY suggest skipping the downright HORRIBLE PS1 version and IMMEDIATELY buy the Sega Saturn version, which is damn near arcade perfect. The PS1 version was developed by Probe Entertainment. If your not familiar with them then you definitely should be because their body of work (when they were around) was mostly CRAP, and their port of X:COTA is no different. Maybe if it was given to a different developer then it may have turned out better but no instead we got...this. The PS1 version should be AVOIDED all together. Once you boot it up you''ll notice problems immediately. Graphics are dark and muddy when they should look/be bright and lively. Seriously, the game looks terrible. There''s also massive slowdown when playing...a problem that isn''t in the arcade or Saturn version. And the BIGGEST problem that kills the PS1 version is the fact that literally like half the frames of animation are missing. It looks and...'),
(N'Debra', N'Hill', N'debra.hill7197@example.com', '2015-02-12', 5, N'Playing in 2015. One of the best games ever made on console. Its still every bit as good as in 1995. What more can I say the final boss battle mirrors Divine Comedy one of the most influential pieces of literature in the world. The final boss battle music is unbelievably epic.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Price', N'evelyn.price5116@example.org', '2015-02-12', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Lucia', N'Sanchez', N'lucia.sanchez4235@example.org', '2015-02-12', 5, N'It is like the best game i played in years, the game play and plot are amazing, you may have an issue if you don''t like the cowboy style of the game , but there is so much to do in the game and everything is so entertaining and fun.'),
(N'Janet', N'Adams', N'janet.adams8288@example.org', '2015-02-12', 5, N'Use these everyday and they work great. I did rip one although I don''t specifically remember the instance, and it may have been the cat chewing on it. I''ve really beat the crap out of these and they haven''t worn or slipped yet.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Coleman', N'barbara.coleman2615@example.com', '2015-02-12', 4, N'Its really good, but sometimes I get a little dizzy playing it. Adds to the realism though.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Sullivan', N'shirley.sullivan1138@example.com', '2015-02-12', 5, N'Got this for my son and he loves it thank u'),
(N'Eric', N'Ferreira', N'eric.ferreira4860@example.com', '2015-02-12', 4, N'thought i was getting four games have to dowload full game of liberation thats my only problem with it'),
(N'Robert', N'Chavez', N'robert.chavez1827@example.com', '2015-02-12', 4, N'Download was flawless. Multiplayer rocks. Code is saved permantly by Orgin. Price was great'),
(N'Emily', N'Gray', N'emily.gray1717@example.org', '2015-02-12', 1, N'Don''t support this, piece of crap'),
(N'Alexander', N'Ortiz', N'alexander.ortiz5725@example.org', '2015-02-13', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Anthony', N'Thomas', N'anthony.thomas9159@example.net', '2015-02-13', 5, N'awesome game'),
(N'Samuel', N'Castillo', N'samuel.castillo7234@example.net', '2015-02-13', 4, N'The rating is based on the actual game itself and the improved graphics. Though unlike the ocarina of time remake Majora"s Mask offers no other neat features such as hero mode,boss rush no extra content it''s basically the same game you''d get on the wii virtual console only on a handheld and better graphics. Not going to lash out on this game because despite the extra content that it''s lacking that could have given this a 5 star rating it still shines. If you have the money I''d def buy this game it''s a must have for any Nintendo 3Ds'),
(N'Christina', N'King', N'christina.king1445@example.net', '2015-02-13', 4, N'PLEASE NOTE: Most of the following is a review of the 3DS version and its added features/changes from the original N64 release, and not for the actual game itself. Majoras Mask, what else can I say? Its a classic. One of the best games for the N64 gets a nice little upgrade. Its similar to the treatment that Ocarina of Time got a few years ago, complete with optimized 3D and bumped up graphics. These are definitely nice and welcome, and both new players and returning fans will surely appreciate the makeover. The new graphics are crisp, bright, and well-detailed. Its jaw-dropping to compare this to the original N64 version, its truly night and day - seriously, youll find yourself stopping many times throughout the adventure to just sit in awe. However, unlike the very faithful and mostly unchanged Ocarina of Time, Nintendo also made some revisions to the core gameplay a bit. There are 2 main differences that *might* turn off a few of the Majoras Mask purists out there: 1) There are...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Garcia', N'ravi.garcia9058@example.com', '2015-02-13', 5, N'have used it for months, works as described, so rreally good.'),
(N'Steven', N'Hill', N'steven.hill8301@example.net', '2015-02-13', 4, N'It plays out a lot like the godfather but I think that it is better in my opinion.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Wright', N'nicholas.wright6499@example.net', '2015-02-13', 5, N'It''s such an awesome game!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Butler', N'jeffrey.butler1045@example.net', '2015-02-13', 5, N'Great Product'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Mendoza', N'jeremy.mendoza3345@example.org', '2015-02-13', 3, N'Was very excited to get keyboard but so far not going well. PRO''s 1-Good looking keyboard 2-Awesome wrist rest 3-Incredibly customizable keyboard. 4-Great software 5-Fantastic keyfeel for a membrane keyboard However there are some SERIOUS cons at the moment. I will change my rating if i can resolve them. 1-The feet used to raise the keyboard are INCREDIBLY WEAK and unstable. 2-The keyboard is a bit expensive for being membrane considering its rgb mechanical competition is only 60-70.00 more 3-The compatability with Alienware Fx software is nonexistant. Drivers were updated on both sides,keyboard and alienware'),
(N'Pamela', N'Ali', N'pamela.ali9903@example.net', '2015-02-13', 4, N'Keeps my wife and son busy for hours. ThankYou!'),
(N'Jerry', N'Hill', N'jerry.hill5562@example.com', '2015-02-13', 3, N'I bought this for my little sister as a Christmas gift, it was cheap for it''s class. It arrived quickly and on time. It runs well and all but the problem I encountered with it was that the screen was scratched up but nothing to bad, and it was missing a stylus. The biggest problem was that the mic for recording didn''t work, which was very disappointing.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Hill', N'jerry.hill5562@example.com', '2015-02-13', 5, N'Works exactly as it should. And since the charging cable is a Micro USB it can be used to charge some phones which is very helpful if you need a longer cable. The battery life on the Pack is rather long too which is really nice. Very satisfied with this purchase!'),
(N'Debra', N'Young', N'debra.young2433@example.com', '2015-02-13', 5, N'This is one of the best games I played when I was 12, I''m 21 now and now since I got a PS2 I am absolutely psyched I got my hands on this!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Reyes', N'mateo.reyes8232@example.net', '2015-02-13', 5, N'Very fun, ages well'),
(N'Tyler', N'Turner', N'tyler.turner2517@example.com', '2015-02-13', 4, N'Super fun, classic Mario gameplay.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Fisher', N'nicole.fisher9048@example.com', '2015-02-13', 5, N'Nice bundle! Im loving the game!'),
(N'Betty', N'Richardson', N'betty.richardson1792@example.net', '2015-02-13', 4, N'Classic game!'),
(N'Laura', N'Fisher', N'laura.fisher7767@example.com', '2015-02-13', 4, N'The Corsair Vengeance Headphones are of nice and sturdy construction and the sound quality is adequate. I really liked the simulated Dolby surround sound simulation as it made gaming and movies seem much more real. Today however I would not buy headsets like these but rather buy studio quality headphones and a mic separate as you would get much better quality. If your looking for a simple all in-1 then this is it however if your looking for perfection look elsewhere. Do not recommend for purists and Hi-Quality seekers.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Flores', N'timothy.flores1447@example.net', '2015-02-14', 5, N'Fun. So fun.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Baker', N'melissa.baker5105@example.net', '2015-02-14', 5, N'My main concern when buying these was the "Buzzing" in the right ear with the PS4, as I use PSN chat several hours a day. So it was these "A50''s" or the SteelSeries H Wireless to replace the Sony Pulse Elites. I also own corsair vengeance 2100''s for my PC gaming and wanted to trim my collection to one headset. From what I read, I was willing to sacrifice the range and battery advantage of the steels, for the louder a50''s and the over ear cups that looked much more comfortable to me. So I took the gamble on the A50''s and so far the chats audio has been crystal clear with the 2 weeks of heavy use. My friends have commented on improved mic quality. The a50''s replaced the pulse elites recently after the charge port failed 3 months later though sony''s had an amazing warranty service and turn around time, but that''s what prompted this purchase. Versus the sony Pulse elites and the Corsair Vengeance 2100''s the Astros are louder, clearer, more comfortable, battery is 2x-3x longer, and the...'),
(N'Laura', N'Collins', N'laura.collins7922@example.net', '2015-02-14', 4, N'Disc 1 wouldn''t load and would freeze my PC. However there''s a code you enter to download the game as well. Fortunately my internet speeds are 150mbps but if my internet was the average att crap this would have sucked. So buyer beware. Other than that issue I''m running this game on an Asus q550lf, windows 8.1 with optimal settings.'),
(N'Charles', N'Reed', N'charles.reed5473@example.org', '2015-02-14', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Jacob', N'Davis', N'jacob.davis8063@example.com', '2015-02-14', 5, N'son love it!!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Brooks', N'deborah.brooks6888@example.org', '2015-02-14', 5, N'For all of you who liked Test Drive Unlimited 2 with finding wrecked cars to be built into one pristine car again, this is a great game. The wrecks can be hard to find yet, unlike Forza Horizon and Horizon 2, but in this case they are worth getting, Once you get used to how the online player vs. player is set up, it is a lot of fun. Also fun to drive around and show off the cars you have and what you did. There are 5 classes you can get. From stock to street-rod, if you have a muscle car or pickup, to dirt racing, to performance classes, to circuit. The great thing is, you don''t have to buy a different car for each, you can buy one car and buy the tuning specifications to make a car into a dirt track car, American style, not the Euro. races, or performance which gives a supercharger, even some have screw superchargers with the blowers through the hood on your Muscle Cars. Just have to go through the campaign, also you can invite a friend to your crew and do a campaign mission...'),
(N'Jack', N'Carter', N'jack.carter4788@example.org', '2015-02-14', 4, N'It ok'),
(N'Christine', N'Baker', N'christine.baker9674@example.com', '2015-02-14', 4, N'great for on the go'),
(N'Mary', N'Brown', N'mary.brown9271@example.net', '2015-02-14', 4, N'Great game. They achieved the realism of the real-life competition of Ford and Chevy. The way the cars handle could use some improvement.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Lopez', N'jeffrey.lopez6996@example.com', '2015-02-14', 5, N'fast shipping. Great product a+'),
(N'Patricia', N'Bell', N'patricia.bell2769@example.org', '2015-02-14', 4, N'Ok'),
(N'Ivan', N'Ali', N'ivan.ali4384@example.org', '2015-02-14', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Nadia', N'Lewis', N'nadia.lewis6544@example.net', '2015-02-14', 5, N'its just what I expected'),
(N'Nadia', N'Lewis', N'nadia.lewis6544@example.net', '2015-02-14', 3, N'when they stay on they work well but they fall off a lot'),
(N'Kathleen', N'White', N'kathleen.white3369@example.org', '2015-02-14', 5, N'great'),
(N'Karen', N'Brown', N'karen.brown4410@example.net', '2015-02-14', 5, N'Game is awesome!'),
(N'John', N'Mendoza', N'john.mendoza4876@example.org', '2015-02-14', 5, N'its in great condition'),
(N'Andrew', N'Gomez', N'andrew.gomez5025@example.net', '2015-02-14', 5, N'Top notch service and video game in great condition!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Stewart', N'pamela.stewart2762@example.net', '2015-02-14', 5, N'For the first 20 or so years of my video game-playing existence, I was a Nintendo man through and through. Yet, when the Wii (as fun as it could be) moved in a direction I didn''t want to go, I bought in on the XBOX 360. For the next 5-6 years, I had a lot of fun with this console...enough for me to put to rest the notion of "brand loyalty" to one gaming company forever. I am not a hard-core gamer by any means, but during the time I played on this console it offered me what I wanted...mainly sports sims and multi-player action. I no longer have the patience (as I once did as a child) for campaign modes, and I''ll not into the culture of online gaming. No, I mainly bought an XBOX 360 because I didn''t want to give up my Madden football and whatever the newest baseball sim was. Along the way, I had tons of fun with a few other games such as the NBA2K franchise and WWE2K''s. The time I spend bonding with family members over these games is invaluable to me. In terms of the system itself,...'),
(N'Anna', N'Phillips', N'anna.phillips2891@example.com', '2015-02-14', 3, N'Nothing impressive graphics are ok running around game shooting bad guys, gets old after a while a $30.00 worth of a game not $60, videos on youtube look more fun than actual game so pretty disappointing. Assassin Creed in Malaysia imagine these two and you have this game in mind.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Garcia', N'sandra.garcia7249@example.org', '2015-02-15', 5, N'Great game with plenty of play time. I haven''t tried multiplayer yet, but talking with my friends it sounds like it will be plenty of fun once I''m finished with the main storyline and side quests. I''m sure this game might not be for everyone, but if you are into RPG''s and if you enjoyed previous Dragon Age games, most likely you will enjoy this one. Graphics are as good as my computer and runs very smooth with no stutters.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Gomez', N'kathleen.gomez9409@example.net', '2015-02-15', 3, N'They don''t play this much. I think it was a bit complicated and it lost their interest.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Paul', N'Ward', N'paul.ward3009@example.org', '2015-02-15', 5, N'Fun and challenging.. this game is a definite winner! Lego video games are very entertaining and Lego Indiana Jones 2: The Adventure Continues... measures up! It''s a great way to enjoy family time together as kids and adults alike work to solve puzzles, collect artifacts and defeat the enemy! Highly recommended for hours and hours of terrific game play!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Morgan', N'nicole.morgan7002@example.com', '2015-02-15', 4, N'Fun if you come at it not hyping it up it was a fun game but not as good as brotherhood so i was a bit sad about that but is was fun and enjoyable experience'),
(N'Ivan', N'Lee', N'ivan.lee2672@example.com', '2015-02-15', 4, N'The mouse itself? Fantastic. I have never seen a better mouse in my life. Fantastic construction, sensor is dead-on every time. No hardware issues even after having the thing for a year. The Logitech Gaming Software, however, is god-awful. It constantly crashes, and it only starts up and works properly about 25% of the time. This wouldn''t be a problem if I hadn''t configured the mouse using the software. The people at Logitech who develop this software should be fired, hired back, and then fired again.'),
(N'Jose', N'Ali', N'jose.ali6179@example.net', '2015-02-15', 5, N'Pretty easy, but fun. If you like the Clone Wars show this is a good game to have some fun distraction with.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Price', N'hannah.price9022@example.org', '2015-02-15', 2, N'I feel the need to address something right off the bat. My review has nothing to do with DLC. I''m not dismissing those reviews that talk about the DLC, but I think it''s best if I don''t beat a dead horse. I''m not the first person to say "I really wanted to like this game", but the truth is I REALLY wanted to like this game! Here''s proof: In addition to pre-ordering the game; I bought the $25.00 season pass and the $25.00 strategy guide. Yeah, I was taking this seriously. Days prior to Evolve coming out, I found out that my favorite monster (Kraken) would have to be unlocked, before playing as him. I thought that was asinine, but I overlooked it. The premise of Evolve is a ''hide and seek'' type of formula, but I didn''t have much fun with it. Below, I''ve listed the reasons why I decided to part ways with Evolve, after owning it for only a few days. - You''ll start the game with only one monster. That makes zero sense to me. If you''re looking forward to playing as Kraken and Wraith, too...'),
(N'Omar', N'Rogers', N'omar.rogers3672@example.com', '2015-02-15', 3, N'Great fun game , but honestly it looks like it was meant to be a PS2 release the graphics look like a PS2 title and play as such, also the game play is repetitive . The game plays like a dynasty warriors game you fight hoards of enemy than a boss than move on to next stage . Its a slasher , but the story is rather different and interesting, well it was to me enough to keep playing see what happened .'),
(N'Adam', N'Walker', N'adam.walker4568@example.com', '2015-02-16', 4, N'Pretty fun to use and I really love Wii Fit U so this goes without saying!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Hughes', N'jacob.hughes8326@example.org', '2015-02-16', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Brian', N'Cruz', N'brian.cruz1443@example.org', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Great price, great product fast delivery'),
(N'Olivia', N'Mitchell', N'olivia.mitchell5845@example.com', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Love my 3DS and love the Yoshi titles. This is a great game. The kids and I love playing it.'),
(N'Jason', N'Coleman', N'jason.coleman8050@example.com', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Nice game...amazing graphics ...nice open world..kinda looks like brazil in a way....i like the parkour movement and detailed world..runs smoothly..but u might get this and the call of duty controls mixed up ftom time to time..i recommend buying this s***... well worth the money...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Hall', N'nathan.hall6240@example.com', '2015-02-16', 1, N'Make the controls better and I would give it a 3, maybe a 4. Remove the cheap deaths that suck all the fun out of the game and I would give it another star. Or, just let me save wherever I want. I really wanted to like this game. As to the first, game design has moved to the point that terrible controls are no longer acceptable. Ten years ago we accepted such things because we didn''t know better but now we do. As to the second and third. I can imagine someone defending the game and saying "if there weren''t cheap deaths, if you could save when you wanted to then you wouldn''t have tension in the game". Or something to that affect. Unfortunately, if I have to play the same 10 minutes over and over again, it is NOT fun. At all. It becomes boring work, and that isn''t why I play games.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Perry', N'tomasz.perry6315@example.net', '2015-02-16', 3, N'need to double check when purchasing used games, sometimes tiny flaw but still worked'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Perry', N'tomasz.perry6315@example.net', '2015-02-16', 5, N'good purchase'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Williams', N'jonathan.williams6287@example.com', '2015-02-16', 5, N'New and on time. This game was awesome story and co op.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Allen', N'ivan.allen6458@example.com', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Great service and fast delivery, the m65 is working super cool , i loved, and i recommended to any gamer this mouse.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Russell', N'yuki.russell1090@example.net', '2015-02-16', 5, N'EXCELLENT'),
(N'Brandon', N'Baker', N'brandon.baker1127@example.com', '2015-02-16', 5, N'This is a really fun, family friendly game for the Xbox One & Kinect. My kids have as much fun playing this as my wife and I do watching each other try to dance! The Xbox One Kinect is incredibly responsive in this game. For those who haven''t played it, you are basically dancing while facing a game character. The point is to mirror their every move, and you gain points for how accurately you are able to do so. Out of the box you get 40 songs, which are detailed on this page under "Product Description." On top of that there are many additional songs you can download as Downloadable Content (DLC). At the time of writing this (Feb. 16th, 2015) there are 23 DLC songs that can be purchased for around $2-$3 a song. It''s generally a lot of fun. You do need, like all Kinect games, a good 6 feet of space between your body and the sensor. Good light doesn''t hurt either. And if you really put the effort into doing the moves like you''re supposed to, it is quite the workout!'),
(N'Karen', N'Nowak', N'karen.nowak1942@example.com', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Robert', N'Hernandez', N'robert.hernandez7355@example.net', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Samuel', N'Robinson', N'samuel.robinson7672@example.org', '2015-02-16', 5, N'fantstic!!! works like new! I actually just kept the old pin connector, if you bend the pins back a little so it gets a tighter connection it should work fine, but ill keep the connector as a backup. the cleaning solution worked wonders. im so excited this worked so well :)'),
(N'Olivia', N'Bennett', N'olivia.bennett1141@example.org', '2015-02-16', 5, N'broken front plate but its the inside that counts it plays games like a champ'),
(N'Maria', N'Walker', N'maria.walker5037@example.org', '2015-02-16', 4, N'Awesome'),
(N'Ethan', N'Martin', N'ethan.martin4556@example.org', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Great movie with lots of action. Aside fro the superhero aspect, it depicts many of the typical everyday problems that a person would actually encounter in his particular situation.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Martin', N'ethan.martin4556@example.org', '2015-02-16', 5, N'Did exactly what it was supposed to. Saved an amazing number of games for my kids.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Martin', N'ethan.martin4556@example.org', '2015-02-16', 5, N'I bought this at another store, but it worked great - right up until 10 days after the warranty expired. Still, my son got a lot of use out of it before it died.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Lewis', N'kyle.lewis8798@example.org', '2015-02-17', 5, N':)'),
(N'Kelly', N'Jimenez', N'kelly.jimenez2020@example.org', '2015-02-17', 3, N'Sound quality and comfort can''t be beat at this price point. Very satisfied so far after using them for about 2 months now. Update: After about 4 months the sleeve around the cable started to rip in multiple places and the sound occasionally cuts out and requires me to unplug the device and plug it back in. I think the cable may have a short in it somewhere.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Howard', N'nathan.howard3791@example.net', '2015-02-17', 5, N'This game is awesome. I played constantly when I first got it and have a couple Amiibos to go with it. Very good game.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Jimenez', N'rachel.jimenez1766@example.com', '2015-02-17', 5, N'There is a great disparity in opinion over Evolve. Some loathe the game simply because it launched with a plethora of DLC, and some loathe the game because they feel there isn''t enough value packed on the disc worthy of their $60. There is also a community of folks who love Evolve for bringing a specific type of multiplayer game to consoles, successfully. After spending a week with Evolve I find myself in the latter camp. To quickly address the elephant in the room, yes there was/is DLC available from day 1. Doesn''t every new release launch with DLC nowadays? I''d like to receive a total package game as much as everyone, but when DLC is minor things such as skins for monsters and color schemes for weapons, I''m not as deeply affected as others. I would fully support arguments against not purchasing Evolve if the DLC consisted of Hunters and Monsters available for purchase on day 1, but that''s not the case. So let''s move on? What works? Just about everything Evolve set out to do...'),
(N'Betty', N'Henderson', N'betty.henderson3207@example.org', '2015-02-17', 1, N'Best deal ever! Get one for the price of three!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Davis', N'douglas.davis4455@example.com', '2015-02-17', 2, N'I was disappointed. I liked the idea of new twists on old games, but for the most part, this game consists of playing one or two stages from each of the games it "remixes". There were a few that were fun, such as the Super Mario Bros level where Mario runs continuously to the right and you can only control the jumping, but overall, I didn''t find this game worthwhile. If you''re interested in new takes on old games, I would recommend the "Donkey Kong Country Returns" series instead.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Sanchez', N'jonathan.sanchez2671@example.com', '2015-02-17', 5, N'absolutely fast shipping.'),
(N'Angela', N'Clark', N'angela.clark4922@example.org', '2015-02-17', 5, N'I love this adapter. I always use it to play and watch tv. And I also use it to chat and hear the game with my stereo headphones with mic.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Khan', N'hannah.khan7323@example.net', '2015-02-17', 1, N'Super boring!! Solo mode, boring! Multiplayer mode, boring! Had it for one day and traded it back in. Only 5 modes to play which pretty much seem all the same. Nobody plays as a team unless you actually have 5 friends playing at the same time. Game is just crap!'),
(N'Amara', N'Gomez', N'amara.gomez2756@example.net', '2015-02-17', 5, N'Bought this to replace my logitech g5 which had fraying cables, eventually failing. I really loved the grip of that thing and prefer it to this one, but it is the same shape so I adjusted. I haven''t had any tracking problems.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Webb', N'nathan.webb2237@example.net', '2015-02-17', 5, N'Purchased for my son and he loves it.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Roberts', N'cheryl.roberts5711@example.com', '2015-02-17', 5, N'Good product.'),
(N'Mark', N'Smith', N'mark.smith4414@example.org', '2015-02-17', 4, N'Shadow of Mordor attempts to be many things, but when it really comes down to it, it is one thing....and that is an orc-killing simulator. 90% of your time spent playing this game will be spent spontaneously killing orcs, or going on specific missions to kill an orc or orcs. This is both Shadow of Mordor''s greatest strength and greatest weakness. Thankfully, the excellent gameplay makes the orc-killing process an almost-always enjoyable task, yet at the same time, the lack of variety in missions can make the proceedings drag at times. What really saves Shadow of Mordor from being a merely mediocre open world rpg-lite action game, and nearly propels it into the category of greatness, is its emergent storytelling, which the development studio refers to as the Nemesis system. This is truly a breakthrough and separates Shadow of Mordor from the rest of the pack. To start, Shadow of Mordor is a big-budget AAA video game, and it shows. Bringing a new perspective to the Lord of the Rings...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Reed', N'ravi.reed3044@example.org', '2015-02-17', 5, N'Great product!!!'),
(N'Scott', N'Rodriguez', N'scott.rodriguez1175@example.net', '2015-02-17', 5, N'This comes with a steam key, this steam key can be used to download the game without ever needing to touch the game disc. So it''s cheaper then the download.'),
(N'Adam', N'Jimenez', N'adam.jimenez7685@example.net', '2015-02-18', 5, N'Great game. The open world together with the great characters in the storyline make this one of the games of the year for me. Make sure you have a fairly decent PC to run it on though.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Kowalski', N'kofi.kowalski3674@example.net', '2015-02-18', 4, N'Great final collection, plays beautiful at 1080p, 60 frames. One tip, if you''re transferring DLC from PS3 to PS4, make sure you have the latest update on your PS3 of ultimate edition, I traded in mine, so core fighters will also work.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Hill', N'sarah.hill7110@example.org', '2015-02-18', 5, N'all good, 100% recommended'),
