(N'Megan', N'Kelly', N'megan.kelly4341@example.net', '2015-02-18', 4, N'After playing Mass Effects, and loving it. I thought to try Dragon Age. I''m just starting out, but I love the EA signature RPG feel to this game I.e custom character, character upgrades, weapon upgrades, flowing story line and multiple locations to explore. I can see many hours and multiple play throughs of this game.'),
