(N'Betty', N'Cruz', N'betty.cruz4260@example.com', '2015-02-19', 4, N'a good controller'),
(N'Mei', N'Jenkins', N'mei.jenkins7871@example.com', '2015-02-19', 5, N'The game works great and is a ton of fun thank you for the great game;)'),
(N'Mei', N'Jenkins', N'mei.jenkins7871@example.com', '2015-02-19', 5, N'My mom love it'),
(N'Shirley', N'Tanaka', N'shirley.tanaka5441@example.net', '2015-02-19', 5, N'I love it. The sound quality is as good as it gets - not very different from Turtle beach, deep bass and great sounds. What I like best is the looks and feel of it and mainly the fact that it is lightweight. My ears get very hot on most other headsets (I never really used a headset for gaming before but for listening to music, and my ears get hot in about an hour, plus the bulkiness gets to me) But not this one - its light and actually looks better than in the picture, the blue is a deeper shade. And the earpads are very soft. I can hear every sound in the game but I can also somewhat hear if someone next to me says something (which is good for me bcos otherwise I would never hear my phone ring)'),
(N'Marcus', N'Tanaka', N'marcus.tanaka3064@example.org', '2015-02-19', 3, N'Good classic game to play when you are bored'),
(N'Marcus', N'Tanaka', N'marcus.tanaka3064@example.org', '2015-02-19', 3, N'Not the best of the resident evil series'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ferreira', N'ethan.ferreira6878@example.org', '2015-02-19', 5, N'Son loves this game.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Gomez', N'rachel.gomez5663@example.net', '2015-02-19', 5, N'It''s hard to feel like you didn''t get your money out of this package. The last two games alone have thousands of hours of fun to offer, whether you keep the first three for playing or for history. ;)'),
(N'Ravi', N'Gomez', N'ravi.gomez9539@example.net', '2015-02-19', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Julie', N'Diaz', N'julie.diaz2908@example.com', '2015-02-19', 5, N'HORI always have the best accessories set for video game consoles and handhelds.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Peterson', N'tomasz.peterson1937@example.com', '2015-02-19', 5, N'My kids are in love with this video game!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Johnson', N'kelly.johnson7707@example.net', '2015-02-19', 5, N'System Bundle was exactly as described and works great!'),
(N'Judith', N'Nguyen', N'judith.nguyen9850@example.org', '2015-02-19', 5, N'If you already have a ps4 or a xbox one, or both consoles, the wii u have too many titles today to get fun from it for a long time. Super smash bros, the legend of zelda, The mario games. Its the perfect time to buy a wii u'),
(N'Edward', N'Edwards', N'edward.edwards5179@example.net', '2015-02-19', 2, N'I really liked this mouse at first although the side buttons are a bit small but now after a month of use the mouse has failed. It disconnects from USB and will not reconnect. So far - no luck getting a response to emails for warranty service.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Butler', N'thomas.butler5493@example.net', '2015-02-19', 5, N'Awesome way to save money.'),
(N'Emma', N'Perry', N'emma.perry9678@example.net', '2015-02-20', 5, N'I bought this for my Brother for Christmas because I own this as well and kept telling him about it! He loves it and so do I! A must have for Diablo III owners!'),
(N'Amy', N'Murphy', N'amy.murphy6958@example.org', '2015-02-20', 4, N'Combat system is fun. Characters and graphics are very well done. Achievements however will take a while to get since its a very long game.'),
(N'Linda', N'Kowalski', N'linda.kowalski7497@example.net', '2015-02-20', 5, N'VERY GOOD'),
(N'Christine', N'Cook', N'christine.cook5900@example.net', '2015-02-20', 4, N'It''s a very fun and interesting game. Very different from other Kirby models because of the lack of powerups and the fact that food does not equal health. As always it is a very cute environment and Mass Attack brings a lot of new elements to the game because it is based solely on the use of the DS stylus system. My only complaint was the fact that certain levels require a certain amount of Kirbys and, this sometimes required you to go back to an older level to get the number that you needed. Also, so many Kirbys on the screen can sometimes be much too overwhelming, especially when you cannot get them all in one place. I think it is a good game for older children, but younger kids would have a very hard time playing this I think. However, as a long-time Kirby fan, I enjoyed it very much.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Butler', N'jacob.butler7856@example.org', '2015-02-20', 5, N'Great birthday gift for a child who has everything.'),
(N'Mary', N'Evans', N'mary.evans3468@example.net', '2015-02-20', 5, N'Super fast shipping! Awesome game, and it works perfectly! Would definitely recommend this to a friend!!'),
(N'Lisa', N'Clark', N'lisa.clark3309@example.net', '2015-02-20', 5, N'GRACIAS'),
(N'Eric', N'Watson', N'eric.watson1287@example.org', '2015-02-20', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Foster', N'kenneth.foster1362@example.com', '2015-02-20', 5, N'Excelente!!!'),
(N'Paul', N'Ward', N'paul.ward3009@example.org', '2015-02-20', 5, N'Wonderful! Love how the developers tied this into one of the great American classics! The storyline flows as you seek and solve ~ all to the tune of fabulous period piece music! Wish it was longer, as you can finish it in a few hours. However, you can play it again with a different profile name and receive new object searches. Enjoy!'),
(N'Larry', N'Coleman', N'larry.coleman6771@example.com', '2015-02-20', 1, N'I have to agree with the rest of the negative reviews this game is just not worth the money! I am so sick of the marketing rip off that I am considering waiting to buy used games verses new games, at least then I can return them and get a full refund if they are not worth the money!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Tanaka', N'marcus.tanaka3064@example.org', '2015-02-20', 4, N'Pretty good game, season interface is fun, and challenging enough to play many times over'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Scott', N'kathleen.scott6415@example.com', '2015-02-20', 5, N'was looking for a headset that would not disconnect due to wireless interference since i DID NOT have any luck with the Turtle Beach z300''s. This however has been perfect since I got it a few months ago. Not a single disconnect. Worth every penny'),
(N'Ravi', N'Reyes', N'ravi.reyes2330@example.com', '2015-02-20', 5, N'Solid game!'),
(N'Joan', N'Gonzalez', N'joan.gonzalez6705@example.org', '2015-02-20', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Yuki', N'Jones', N'yuki.jones6427@example.com', '2015-02-20', 5, N'This device operates exceptionally well, and when coupled to an SNES, is exactly like having an NES console! I have the NES-001 aka the ''toaster'' model, and NES-101 top-loader model, as well as the Retron 1 - which, incidentally, is a very good, bargain-priced unit; However, at this price, I simply could not resist adding still another back-up, one that can utilize the many NES games in my library. This adapter will enable you to take advantage of the superior performance capabilities of the SNS-001 original or the SNS-101 aka the mini, and makes it rather convenient to switch between the differing NES/SNES game formats. All in all, this item is a very capable addition, that will certainly complement any collection of Nintendo accessories. Note: A ''modded'' version of this product can be utilized in conjunction with a Nakitek Game Saver Plus to save many NES games too!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Evans', N'tomasz.evans3306@example.net', '2015-02-20', 5, N'The best of the best. I Love It.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Scott', N'tyler.scott4553@example.net', '2015-02-20', 5, N'very good.... need xbox driver'),
(N'Dee', N'Mendoza', N'dee.mendoza6506@example.org', '2015-02-20', 5, N'Still working nicely and working great'),
(N'Dee', N'Mendoza', N'dee.mendoza6506@example.org', '2015-02-20', 1, N'Returned for official this was junk the from the start'),
(N'Luis', N'Castillo', N'luis.castillo7620@example.org', '2015-02-20', 5, N'A great deal & hours of fun'),
(N'Heather', N'Walker', N'heather.walker5833@example.org', '2015-02-20', 5, N'This is the greatest game ever made, for rhythm games, Nintendo games, Wii games, and all around most feel good game. Please, buy this game and play it, so many underused Wii''s are out in the world, and so many can be playing this fantastic game! Buy it now!'),
(N'Larry', N'Martinez', N'larry.martinez7233@example.com', '2015-02-20', 5, N'We are a family of gamers. You name the game system and we have it. From an early age, my kids have had game systems in their hands. They both have the DS XL systems and we''ve had many other DS systems over the years. I actually still have a DS Lite that I love playing my choice favorites on. This Carrying case is hands down top of the line for protection of my gaming systems. You can see from the pic above that the DS XL fits in there nicely and is secured by the mesh pouch. The middle piece is padded on one side that brushes up against the gaming system and the other side has little mesh pockets to hold games. There is a zipper that goes around 3 of the sides, securing it. The other mesh pouch is perfect for holding the included shoulder strap while you are not using it. I attempted putting my DS charger in there but it was way too bulky and did not fit. The outer case is hard with a textured feel to it. I feel very confident in it''s sturdiness. Let''s face it, kids are not gentle...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ortiz', N'rachel.ortiz6754@example.com', '2015-02-21', 5, N'This game is amazing, the new weapons and armors will keep you playing for hundreds of hours. If you are into this kind of game, beware, this game is only for those who do not mind farming a particular monster over and over for parts for weapons and armor. If that doesn''t sound fun, then you won''t like the game. If, however, you have played the previous Monster Hunter games and loved them, then you will love the improvements they put into the new game. The felyne companions are waayyyy better than the shakas, you can gear them in armor and give them different weapons, they gather for you and help you out in fights, sometimes even saving your life. They''ve also upgraded the amount of armor sets you can save, increasing it to 40 sets from the 20 in MH3U. There are also new monsters and monster types in the game, so think of all the monsters you fought in MH3U and add 20 more monsters. So if you spent hundreds of hours in 3U like I did, you will easily be putting more than that in...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Gomez', N'benjamin.gomez7942@example.net', '2015-02-21', 5, N'Product excellent 100% recommended'),
(N'Jose', N'Torres', N'jose.torres4186@example.net', '2015-02-21', 4, N'Good set up. No real feed back, but still a good set up.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Gomez', N'deborah.gomez1244@example.net', '2015-02-21', 5, N'good'),
(N'Charles', N'Kim', N'charles.kim5946@example.org', '2015-02-21', 5, N'So much fun. Somehow it''s better than Far Cry 3.'),
(N'Richard', N'Lopez', N'richard.lopez4226@example.com', '2015-02-21', 5, N'Definitely deserves the Ultimate moniker.'),
(N'Amara', N'Martin', N'amara.martin2152@example.org', '2015-02-21', 3, N'cute'),
(N'Megan', N'Williams', N'megan.williams3162@example.net', '2015-02-21', 5, N'This is the second purchase of 3 of these rpgs . The quality of sound and game play is fantastic. The worlds are so vast that you can discover new scenes every time you play. I will not tire of Oblivion or Skyrim.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Nguyen', N'stephen.nguyen8176@example.com', '2015-02-21', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Angela', N'Young', N'angela.young6015@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Kevin', N'Ramos', N'kevin.ramos7587@example.org', '2015-02-22', 3, N'Good nough'),
(N'Joshua', N'Ross', N'joshua.ross9111@example.org', '2015-02-22', 5, N'This is easily one of the best RPG''s I''ve played in a long time! Kudos to Amazon for having this hidden treasure in stock. Thanks again Amazon!'),
(N'Christina', N'Gonzalez', N'christina.gonzalez4295@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'This is a very exciting game and great successor to . Legend of Zelda ocarina of time would buy a Zelda game again.'),
(N'Dee', N'Hernandez', N'dee.hernandez6018@example.net', '2015-02-22', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Anthony', N'Fisher', N'anthony.fisher2650@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'Fun Fun Fun-- those are the only word''s I can think to use when trying to describe this game. I bought this version of the game because I wanted both the Japanese and English Audio, but I wasn''t expecting what arrived! Not only does the game come with dual audio, but it also comes with: Double sided cover art (which says Resident Evil on one side, Biohazard on the opposite side), Two Instruction manuals (one in English, the other in Japanese), full PS3 Trophy support, Wesker Report 1 & 2 (in Japanese, not English Dubbed), and this game even comes with the BSAA Costumes for Chris/Jill. Although I''ve played the original RE1 on the ps1, and the Gamecube rendition after that.....this game feels....great. I honestly feel as though I am playing it for the first time. Maybe it is due to the updated graphics, or perhaps I feel this way because the controls are vastly different that the original....I don''t know...either way it''s great. I recommend it to die hard fans (like myself) and to...'),
(N'Christine', N'Moore', N'christine.moore7161@example.net', '2015-02-22', 5, N'Love this game so much'),
(N'Walter', N'Ruiz', N'walter.ruiz9338@example.org', '2015-02-22', 3, N'Pros: - Very creepy atmosphere. - Highly psychological horrific story. Cons: - Controls are clunky. Especially in combat, I feel more like I''m fighting the controls than I am the monsters. - Cameras are way off. Half the time, when the character is looking right at monsters, I can''t even see them. - Feels like the challenge of the game comes not from the enemies and obstacles actually being tough, but from the game actually handicapping me, the player. - Doesn''t work well on a 360; lots of broken textures in certain locations. - Load times are atrocious. I love this game for the story. It''s a horrific tale told from the perspective of James, a man who received a letter from his wife asking him to meet in Silent Hill. The only problem is that she''s dead. What James encounters in Silent Hill instead is something of a personal hell for him. The atmosphere is very creepy; the darkness and fog, along with the noise, make for a very tense and scary environment. It''s a very well crafted...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Roberts', N'ethan.roberts6560@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'like it wish you can do more thing with it'),
(N'Sofia', N'Sanchez', N'sofia.sanchez7674@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'AAA+++'),
(N'Gary', N'Jimenez', N'gary.jimenez5226@example.net', '2015-02-22', 5, N'Very Nice Game, i enjoyed playing it a lot'),
(N'Kyle', N'Williams', N'kyle.williams9948@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'Happy kid shipped fast!'),
(N'Richard', N'Jackson', N'richard.jackson8473@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'I bought this because I saw the $200 price tag(probably changed now) and I have been without a 360 since my launch 12 gb model gave up 3 years ago and I wanted to relive my long night during the weekend playing halo, forza, etc and I just had to pick it up. It''s a good deal considering you pay an extra $10 for the 500GB model. It definitely doesn''t make as much noise as the original one but it does get loud if you''re playing a game you don''t have installed and it''s standing on its side. Laying it flat gets rid of 90% of the noise made by the optical drive so keep that in mind. I installed every game I have so I can have it on its side(saves space and looks good) and not have that loud noise going and also to justify the large HDD. It''s just a great deal if you''re moving from the pre slim 360 to this the Xbox 360e model. It comes with an amazing game and a sucky game(guess which one is which) the sucky game comes with a download while the great comes with a voucher code. I read some...'),
(N'Judith', N'Powell', N'judith.powell5086@example.com', '2015-02-22', 4, N'So I have to confirm what everyone else has been saying about this game regarding the saving and cloud based issues. They are there, and you will not be exempt. I thought I may be. However, it is not as bad as I thought it was going to be. Granted I''ve only had the game for a couple days now, the problems haven''t been too terribly off putting. In fact, the first day I ran into no issues what so-ever. But today I hit almost every problem mentioned here. 1. Midway through doing well in a race, the connection gets lost and has to perform "host migration". Annoying... 2. Randomly the map screen will come up while you''re driving even though you did not hit the start button. 3. Randomly your camera will shift to a backwards view which completely throws you off when you''re going 180mph. 4. And last but not least, I just encountered the non save issue. A chunk of money is gone, and Im on an old set of objectives that I already completed. It''s annoying for sure. But the gameplay and fun is...'),
(N'Diane', N'Moore', N'diane.moore7156@example.org', '2015-02-22', 1, N'Giving I sill can pass Day One on the Nintendo 64 Version I give this an don''t buy even if you are an shitendo fan boy.'),
(N'Justin', N'Lewis', N'justin.lewis9270@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Ashley', N'Roberts', N'ashley.roberts1781@example.com', '2015-02-22', 2, N'I''ve used a lot of different gaming mice, most of them from Logitech (including the high-end G9x), and I feel like I''ve got a lot of insight into them as a result. Particularly as a demanding user for competitive FPS titles like Counter-Strike, Battlefield, CoD, etc., I''ve chewed up many a mouse, or discarded them due to a lack of quality or function. Unfortunately, it seems like I''m likely to get getting rid of this one, as well. I''ve been using the Sensei RAW for months now, and it''s got some good features; unfortunately, these are outweighed by some problems. The good features include a nice matte finish, dedicated RAW input, quality braided cable, and simplistic/minimalist design (which too many companies are getting away from . . . Logitech and Razer, I''m looking at you!). At the $20 or so price point, this mouse would be a contender. However, there is a significant problem with the scroll wheel that seems to be experienced by many of the Sensei owners . . . within a month or...'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'James', N'elizabeth.james2059@example.net', '2015-02-22', 4, N'Pretty good - not too hard. Beautiful art & good voice-overs. No maps - most things to find were only a screen or two away. Hints just point you in the right direction - weren''t really needed. Sudden ending. Didn''t take long to finish.'),
(N'Frank', N'Evans', N'frank.evans4455@example.net', '2015-02-22', 5, N'does it job beautifully, I just needed an adapter for my headset (y type one with a mic and headset combining jack)'),
(N'Justin', N'Gutierrez', N'justin.gutierrez9832@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'wonderful, love it'),
(N'Victoria', N'Khan', N'victoria.khan7784@example.com', '2015-02-22', 5, N'very fun'),
(N'Yuki', N'Young', N'yuki.young4743@example.com', '2015-02-23', 1, N'Item arrived in a white box with a small instruction booklet. The instruction booklet says it''s supposed to come with a USB cable, but that item couldn''t be found (and it''s not even written what the cable is for...) I plugged the item into my PS2 and connected it via HDMI to my monitor. Nothing. I left the HDMI cable plugged into my monitor and swapped my PS2 out with a Wii U so I could check that the HDMI cable works - and it did. The PS2 also outputs through component cable connection just fine. The item arrived in packaging looking nothing like the product image, and it wasn''t cheap...I''ll be pursuing a full refund.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Reyes', N'kimberly.reyes9639@example.com', '2015-02-23', 1, N'2/23/15 Skinomi I have to say that you have one of the most difficult skin protectors to install. I got mine for the New 3DS XL " Majora''s Mask Limited Edition" and it didn''t fit quire right. In top of being difficult, the cuts are wrong. You miss a noticeable cut on the top left when face is close, Your inside skin cover the IR eye sensor of the New 3DS XL, The edges of the face over lap with the other side of the skin and there is no way it could be done right even tho I tried and I''m very good at it. I hope this protector of yours doesn''t mess up my Majora''s Mask 3DS since is extremely limited! This is the second time I''ve bought a skin from you and it was wrong too which was for my iPhone 6 Plus. Then you dare to send me a message saying that your cuts are precise and done right...its not. After 10 mins of being installed it bubble up. In this case, is quite difficult to just spray water in the device. I did use some and very little amount because I don''t want to have water or...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Evans', N'nathan.evans3395@example.org', '2015-02-23', 5, N'Exceptionally great. Been following this game since it first arrive on the seen, now look how far we come. Thank u so much for an extraordinary item.'),
