(N'Omar', N'Peterson', N'omar.peterson2769@example.net', '2015-02-23', 5, N'I love it, Thanks'),
(N'Donna', N'Jones', N'donna.jones2278@example.net', '2015-02-23', 4, N'I would love it if not for the tacky-looking plastic red accents. Otherwise, it''s a great keyboard for a really good price. It works a million times better than the G105s I paid more than twice as much for and had to send back.'),
(N'Jack', N'Thomas', N'jack.thomas4413@example.net', '2015-02-23', 1, N'Let me start by saying please save your money. I got this game day one preordered the collectors edition. I had all great hopes for this game. If this were a new CG animation flim, then yes i would have given a five but as a game no. There is no excuse for the poor game design and the extreme short length of this game. Wait till it goes down to bargin bin price. All these other people given it a 5 star rating I am calling BS on them.'),
(N'Mary', N'Hill', N'mary.hill2448@example.net', '2015-02-23', 5, N'Excelente producto!!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Wisniewski', N'pamela.wisniewski4808@example.net', '2015-02-23', 5, N'I purchased PS4 at GameStop on November 20 2014 and never any problems! My system smooth over 3 months now'),
(N'John', N'Mitchell', N'john.mitchell7061@example.net', '2015-02-23', 5, N'Great condition!'),
(N'Lucia', N'Rodriguez', N'lucia.rodriguez2454@example.net', '2015-02-23', 5, N'Great Nascar Sym'),
(N'Lauren', N'Rodriguez', N'lauren.rodriguez5756@example.com', '2015-02-23', 5, N'Nice. I like it . Husband likes it. So its win win. Buttons are not as mushy for me as it is for others. Hoewever it was a little difficult getting onto the controller because the piece was bent slightly'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Nowak', N'evelyn.nowak3282@example.com', '2015-02-23', 5, N'GREAT GAME'),
(N'Jessica', N'Young', N'jessica.young9819@example.org', '2015-02-23', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Kelly', N'Rodriguez', N'kelly.rodriguez8742@example.org', '2015-02-23', 5, N'I''ve heard countless times that this game didn''t meet expectations because it''s short. I haven''t heard anyone give props to the quality of the game! It''s flawless from cinematic switching to your control. The quality is great and in my opinion they definitely outdid Assassins Creed Unity quality. They paid a lot of attention to every little detail. Have you notice the wind blows his little hairs in different directions ? I feel as though they hyped up The Order way to much that when it actually came out- it left people going... That''s it? I''m still enjoying the game right now but so far so good. The statue included in the premium edition was amazing. They got every little detail and I wasn''t expecting it to be a full on "statue", (no game does that !) But it was very nice and a great addition to my collection. They tried really hard for this game, more on quality than story maybe, but we''re the one demanding quality- they want to deliver but it takes a toll on the story.'),
(N'Megan', N'Campbell', N'megan.campbell9040@example.org', '2015-02-23', 5, N'son loved it'),
(N'Dennis', N'Webb', N'dennis.webb2465@example.com', '2015-02-24', 3, N'It holds ok. Works as described.'),
(N'Christina', N'Anderson', N'christina.anderson6464@example.com', '2015-02-24', 1, N'Really disappointed to receive a completely scratched up copy when it was suppose to be in "very good" condition ! Game does not play at all! Hoping I get my money back or a copy that works!'),
(N'Diane', N'Kelly', N'diane.kelly7796@example.com', '2015-02-24', 3, N'Its a remake of Dead Island with parkour. After playing this game for about 10 hours ive decided to turn it back in. The overall game aspect is decent, graphics, gameplay and fun value. The weapons breaking and only being able to be repaired a limited time is pretty lame. Im sorry but If I had a lead pipe its not going to break after killing 5 zombies. I want to be able to enjoy killing zombies, not trying to avoid them and scavenging for weapon parts when I do have to kill them. When running around at night, you have no chance of taking on zombies, you''ll be caught and slaughtered. Takes some skill to get away and out of sight before they stop chasing you. Same old same old with fetching items and bringing them back to base. Melee if fun but they should have as least a pistols. Its pretty hard to kill anytning, even with a decent weapon with upgrades. Wait for a price drop on this one.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Reed', N'evelyn.reed8834@example.net', '2015-02-24', 1, N'VERY DISSAPOINTED. I WAS NOT ABLE TO JUST USE MY MICROPHONE TO SING WITH THESE TWO GAMES!!!! THE OTHER GUITAR HEROS LET YOU DO THAT BUT THIS ONE DIDNT. BOOO !'),
(N'Zachary', N'Webb', N'zachary.webb2088@example.org', '2015-02-24', 5, N'A+++'),
(N'Kelly', N'Lee', N'kelly.lee5460@example.org', '2015-02-24', 5, N'Fun, slightly short process'),
(N'Ivan', N'Gomez', N'ivan.gomez5522@example.com', '2015-02-24', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Judith', N'Anderson', N'judith.anderson7923@example.net', '2015-02-24', 2, N'works great but it falls off poorly designed not worth the money you can make your own better'),
