(N'Evelyn', N'Ali', N'evelyn.ali7077@example.com', '2015-02-24', 5, N'good game.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Gutierrez', N'zachary.gutierrez7347@example.com', '2015-02-24', 5, N'great on dilivery'),
(N'Mary', N'Foster', N'mary.foster1951@example.net', '2015-02-24', 5, N'Classic game'),
(N'Jose', N'Young', N'jose.young7022@example.com', '2015-02-24', 5, N'puzzling and challenging if you can go back to any level at a time it would be nice but you cant and upgrade it carefully it cant be undid you won''t get all upgrades but items yes i hate that part use this wisely or you cant beat the game its hard but i did'),
(N'Angela', N'Butler', N'angela.butler8624@example.com', '2015-02-24', 3, N'fun'),
(N'Joyce', N'Chavez', N'joyce.chavez9459@example.com', '2015-02-24', 5, N'good'),
(N'Tyler', N'Khan', N'tyler.khan7100@example.net', '2015-02-24', 5, N'Great game. It is about time we got a great horror game. Reminds me of the classics like resident evil and silent hill 2. Must have.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Khan', N'tyler.khan7100@example.net', '2015-02-24', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Long', N'marcus.long9766@example.org', '2015-02-24', 1, N'Cheap cheap one battery would not do anything and the other was ok the base is cheaply made.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Ivanov', N'andrea.ivanov1682@example.org', '2015-02-24', 1, N'Piece of garbage. Shocks me EVERY time i use it. I have always had problems with static electricity. Its also a pain in the butt to plug them in. Annoying LEDs that aren''t needed to indicate charging, while off, doing it, done, etc. If you have 2 controllers, my advice would be keep the one(s) plugged in you''re not using, and when you finish playing, put the console in rest mode, use a standard cable to just charge your one you just used. You''ll never have dead controllers except extended play sessions with others.'),
(N'Anna', N'Foster', N'anna.foster2886@example.org', '2015-02-24', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Gary', N'Williams', N'gary.williams9138@example.org', '2015-02-25', 4, N'People are giving the master chief collection bad reviews because of problems with multiplayer. Really! First of all, Halo is not about the multiplayer. It''s about the story and the single player campaign. The A.D.D crowd are trying to make Halo about the multiplayer just as they did with COD. Halo multiplayer is just a side piece to the single player campaign. Always has been and always will be. The creators are trying to tell a story through a game and you just can''t do that in multiplayer like you can do in single player. For those of you who need the interaction of multiplayer to make it through your sad lives, go play something else if you are not happy with this title. But don''t give this title poor scores because the multiplayer isn''t up to your standards. The four single player campaigns alone make this title a four or five star title. The developers are probably spending most of their time on the next Halo title as opposed to making patches for this title''s multiplayer....'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Parker', N'carolyn.parker6065@example.org', '2015-02-25', 1, N'So hard to install and register with Origin and all the other crap just to be able to play it. Good game, extremely long and plentiful load times, freezing during crucial moments. (Like at the end of character creation.)'),
(N'Debra', N'Sullivan', N'debra.sullivan3534@example.org', '2015-02-25', 5, N'My daughter loves this series of games.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Wang', N'stephen.wang9984@example.net', '2015-02-25', 5, N'Works perfectly, controllers and gamepad rest nicely into place without have to shove or squeeze them in at all. Bright large indicators (red and green) indicate when they are charged up. I''m really happy with all my Energizer game chargers, I have two ps3 ones and a ps4 one as well.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Anderson', N'tomasz.anderson1034@example.com', '2015-02-25', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Laura', N'Morris', N'laura.morris5655@example.net', '2015-02-25', 5, N'great game, tons of remixes to songs and stages improved and expanded on. Ton of fun as always!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Wood', N'jessica.wood3883@example.org', '2015-02-25', 5, N'LOVE this Block Case to store my son''s Mario figures, Mario Kart cars and toys. He loves to carry it around from upstairs to downstairs with his Mario collection inside. The inside of the case is really cute as well for any Super Mario Fan. I would not recommend this case to store your Amiibo figures in. There isn''t any dividers inside to protect each figure. I''d be too afraid each amiibo would hit each other or get damaged inside. Still a cute case, just NOT for what it''s supposed to be for.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Cox', N'daniel.cox2223@example.com', '2015-02-25', 5, N'Much better game than i expected. Picked it up cheap and got a lot of play out of it!'),
(N'Tyler', N'Hernandez', N'tyler.hernandez5695@example.org', '2015-02-25', 5, N'out standing job thank you its awsome'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Adams', N'stephanie.adams1810@example.com', '2015-02-26', 5, N'Amazing game, cant wait for PC version'),
(N'Luis', N'White', N'luis.white4814@example.com', '2015-02-26', 5, N'No issues'),
(N'Robert', N'Reed', N'robert.reed2811@example.org', '2015-02-26', 4, N'This is a great value for 350 dollars. This was a present for someone as I already own an Xbox One w/o Kinect. I also own a Playstation 4, so I can really give the pros and cons of the system so far as my experience is concerned. The UI has improved vastly since I purchased my Xbox One. The controller feels really good and is right with the PS4 controller, but the Lb and Rb buttons are a downgrade when compared to the 360 controller imo. The system games well and has had no crashes so far although Upload Studios still gives me some issues that require a cold reboot. For anyone that is on the fence, I would recommend getting the non-Kinect version because screenshot support and the xbox record that option of quick snapping has improved vastly. The Xbox One has improved over time with updates and has gotten to the point to where I feel that it is equal to the PS4 in some features despites some hardware bottlenecks. The most important thing is that people who might purchase an XB1 not...'),
(N'Angela', N'Ivanov', N'angela.ivanov1257@example.net', '2015-02-26', 5, N'Love the graphic quality. And the glacier white is nice in our game room.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Allen', N'amanda.allen8570@example.com', '2015-02-26', 2, N'all these verified purchasers here are helping those scalpers.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Ramos', N'samuel.ramos8855@example.net', '2015-02-26', 5, N'Fifa 14 is great! You can tell the difference when you play with different players. Messi is my fav. .'),
(N'Mei', N'Ramirez', N'mei.ramirez3672@example.org', '2015-02-26', 2, N'I have cheap Viewsonic membrane keyboard that I bought for $20 that has the same kind of feel & noise level. Maybe it''s the switches they use but it doesn''t feel like a mechanical keyboard to me & it''s not really that quiet. The other big problem that I had with it, was it was too tall. I have carpal tunnel in my right hand and the height was uncomfortable for me. It looked really cool but I think would go with one of their other models if noise wasn''t an issue for me.'),
(N'Jason', N'Barnes', N'jason.barnes5552@example.com', '2015-02-26', 5, N'I''ve been using this controller for a few weeks now and I mainly bought this controller for use with Smash Brothers for the Wii U. I must say that I am extremely pleased. It works perfectly and much easier to use than the nunchuks. Very comfortable and responsive. The controller plugs into the regular Wii U remote (not game-pad) so make sure you have one because this controller cannot be used alone. The colors are very nice and looks exactly like the picture. I highly recommend this controller to anyone who wants to play Smash Brothers a little bit more than casually.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Henderson', N'aisha.henderson3734@example.net', '2015-02-26', 3, N'I got this because I like Mario Kart Wii, so I wanted to try other racing games. I don''t love it, but it''s a good alternative if you want to try something new. The steering is a little different from MK, and the items are not really explained, so I''d recommend looking at them online.'),
(N'George', N'Roberts', N'george.roberts7812@example.com', '2015-02-26', 5, N'My kids just begged for this, but only played with it for a short time because Minecraft consumes them. I recommend you give them Minecraft and wait til they are bored of that before buying new games. However, I enjoy this game.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Kim', N'jeffrey.kim6379@example.net', '2015-02-26', 4, N'good'),
(N'Mei', N'Miller', N'mei.miller7763@example.net', '2015-02-26', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Hannah', N'Alvarez', N'hannah.alvarez6200@example.net', '2015-02-26', 4, N':)'),
(N'Nathan', N'Jimenez', N'nathan.jimenez8525@example.net', '2015-02-26', 5, N'this game is a must'),
(N'Peter', N'Suzuki', N'peter.suzuki3584@example.com', '2015-02-26', 2, N'Well...I''m a fan of the FF franchise and Squaresoft and now Square-Enix, but this game was HORRIBLE! The only reason I''m giving it two stars is because I feel like previous final fantasy games don''t deserve to have a 1 star on their team. But trust me when I say, this game is awful. I tried to like it, I tried to play it, but man.. I can''t even. I stopped on day 3...'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Kumar', N'evelyn.kumar1259@example.com', '2015-02-26', 4, N'Nintendo''s finest'),
(N'Anthony', N'Foster', N'anthony.foster1199@example.net', '2015-02-26', 4, N'My 11 year old son sold his Skylanders set to purchase this back in Sept. To date he has purchased every Marvel 2.0 figure, and also Dash Jack Sparrow and Mike Wazowski, and waits with bated breath for each new character. He enjoys playing with the figures and doing the missions, and just looking at the action figures. The graphics are nice and the dialog of each of the characters is entertaining. The missions are fun and he enjoys doing them. So far, I believe he has completed all of them (although I am not sure about the Avengers). While he enjoys the missions he wishes he could interchange the characters from other groups into the missions. Hulk can''t play in the Guardians of the Galaxy missions, and Groot can''t play in the Avengers missions. Part of the appeal of the Infinity set is the ability for different characters to interact with each other. Disney never mentioned this could only take place in the toy box. Speaking of the toy box, this is where my son spends most of his...'),
(N'Christine', N'Murphy', N'christine.murphy6953@example.org', '2015-02-26', 5, N'Condition was as promised. Only very minor wear to the disk. Works perfectly with my system.'),
(N'Emily', N'Garcia', N'emily.garcia8203@example.com', '2015-02-26', 4, N'Kids say they like it and played it a lot, was a good price also.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Jimenez', N'kevin.jimenez3713@example.com', '2015-02-26', 4, N'just what I expected'),
(N'Walter', N'Kowalski', N'walter.kowalski9008@example.com', '2015-02-26', 3, N'one battery is dead it last 2 time charge'),
(N'Ryan', N'Wilson', N'ryan.wilson6345@example.net', '2015-02-26', 4, N'The second game in the Neptunia series. This one focuses on Nepear, Neptune''s sister. The comedy takes a serious hit as a result. Nepgear just isn''t as good a character as Neptune. It''s still a very funny game, though, dealing with the usual topics of the series in it''s unique and humorous way. This game also has, in my opinion, the best combat system of the series. Many may think it''s convoluted as hell. While it does take some time to get used to, once you figure it out, it''s just fun.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Rogers', N'melissa.rogers9345@example.com', '2015-02-26', 5, N'good product good price'),
(N'Angela', N'Lewis', N'angela.lewis4727@example.com', '2015-02-26', 5, N'Fantastic game. Good story, enjoyable gameplay. I have actually gone back recently and started playing this again. Love it!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Boyd', N'marcus.boyd5959@example.net', '2015-02-27', 4, N'Its a very realistic thrilling game. You can olmos hear the aliens breath. Its a quite difficult game to play'),
(N'Ashley', N'Thompson', N'ashley.thompson9806@example.org', '2015-02-27', 5, N'Any Wii(U) owner should own his game, it is an awesome Mario game which introduces the character Rosalina.'),
(N'William', N'Reed', N'william.reed8751@example.com', '2015-02-27', 4, N'Classic. Wish you could move and shoot though.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Coleman', N'jonathan.coleman9977@example.net', '2015-02-27', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Donald', N'Torres', N'donald.torres3091@example.com', '2015-02-27', 5, N'Have been using this a lot lately. After the new year, time for a little exercise. You keep the pedometer part in your pocket and then at the end of the day, you sync if to your DS game card by aligning it to the back of the DS and pressing a button on the pedometer. The data is transferred to the game and a little mascot tells you have many steps you have taken and how many times you were inactive throughout the day. It keeps track of my steps quite well. I don''t notice any missing chunks when I review the days results. The calender that keeps track can get out of sync with the actual date if you don''t check in every single day. If you have data sitting on your pedometer from Monday, but you don''t transfer it until Tuesday morning, the steps will be right but the calender will add the data to the wrong date (well duh). So be aware of that. I would assume this would work with a 3DS, but I haven''t tested it. Just been using it on my old DS Lite.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Lee', N'amanda.lee8910@example.org', '2015-02-27', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Jason', N'Adams', N'jason.adams5485@example.net', '2015-02-27', 5, N'The best Fire Emblem game I had played.'),
(N'Jason', N'Adams', N'jason.adams5485@example.net', '2015-02-27', 5, N'Hours of fun. A must have for anyone in love with the beautiful game.'),
(N'Jason', N'Chen', N'jason.chen3196@example.com', '2015-02-27', 5, N'A life saver! Works perfectly'),
(N'Brandon', N'Sanchez', N'brandon.sanchez8387@example.net', '2015-02-27', 5, N'great wheel. worth every penny. used it in Forza three and four and its still going strong.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Khan', N'amanda.khan5366@example.com', '2015-02-27', 4, N'Works just fine.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Bennett', N'jeremy.bennett7783@example.net', '2015-02-27', 5, N'This is exactly what a great game should be. Great story, great action, perfect mix of movies and gameplay, open world, not too hard or too difficult. The graphics look great (although everything should look like this, it''s 2015 for Christ''s sake). I have had Zero crashes in 12 hours of play and I''m still eager to play more.'),
(N'Diane', N'Singh', N'diane.singh6291@example.com', '2015-02-27', 5, N'kids love it'),
(N'Donald', N'Martinez', N'donald.martinez3194@example.com', '2015-02-27', 5, N'As expected.'),
(N'Donna', N'Wright', N'donna.wright6968@example.org', '2015-02-27', 4, N'Great game for its day, as smooth as could be. If you like this one check out Rebelassault2. Both great SW titles'),
(N'Tyler', N'Richardson', N'tyler.richardson6372@example.org', '2015-02-27', 5, N'That classic that gave my childhood a battery-long fun pack, i simply love this console, it has some stupid and thrashy games, but it also has some invaluable jewells, specially remakes from old classics'),
(N'Noah', N'Smith', N'noah.smith2233@example.org', '2015-02-27', 5, N'We love these games!'),
