(N'Aaron', N'Harris', N'aaron.harris4930@example.org', '2015-02-28', 5, N'Perfect condition'),
(N'Brian', N'Mitchell', N'brian.mitchell9788@example.com', '2015-02-28', 1, N'Planned obsolescence, this just like many of the more expensive headsets designed, manufactured and sold by turtle-beech, was intended to break, deliberately manufacturing these with poor quality materials and numerous design flaws then never correcting the flaws after the enormous amount of complaints a product gets, it is obvious that this and many other models where intended to break and force you to buy another, making you complacent with the decent sound quality and ease of use, but turn you away with is great tenacity to brake and gradually fall apart with light use, my head set began to crumble at the five month mark; as the arch of the frame on both sides began to crack and warp from regular use witch with out warranty forced me to DIY my way to a fix; then after a good 11 months of use and significantly depreciated sound quality, my right speaker flickers and goes out. after carefully dissembling it with proper tools; i inspected the wires and speaker housing and...'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Evans', N'tomasz.evans2204@example.com', '2015-02-28', 5, N'This is my favorite game ever! And I own about a hundred PS3 games, a few ps4, and started with Nintendo in the 80s. This game is so deep and is extremely strategic if you want it to be. After 5 years of playing the series I''m still learning new things in it. Watching hundreds of ufc fights really helped me understand the sport. This is going to be the best ufc game for a long time, especially since THQ went out of business and EA took over UFC games, EA barely has any experience. It will be a very long time until EA will outdo THQ in the gameplay department. I wish THQ would come back. This is a very deep and complex game.'),
(N'Scott', N'Mendoza', N'scott.mendoza5970@example.net', '2015-02-28', 5, N'great'),
(N'Barbara', N'Wang', N'barbara.wang4699@example.org', '2015-02-28', 4, N'My cousin had this game back in the day. I used to borrow it all the time. I would love to play it again. :)'),
(N'Robert', N'Henderson', N'robert.henderson2938@example.org', '2015-02-28', 5, N'excellent game.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Reed', N'deborah.reed1798@example.com', '2015-02-28', 5, N'Love these games, beautiful and well worth the modest cost. For the price, I don''t expect 100 hours of gameplay. The puzzles are fun, the theme is awesome and unique. Great games.'),
(N'Scott', N'Raghunathan', N'scott.raghunathan4723@example.org', '2015-02-28', 5, N'"Satisfied"'),
(N'Mark', N'Ruiz', N'mark.ruiz6468@example.net', '2015-02-28', 5, N'Worked great - both sides charged and both batteries did too - all for a great price.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Hall', N'andrea.hall7737@example.com', '2015-02-28', 5, N'As described shipped fast'),
(N'Amanda', N'Ferreira', N'amanda.ferreira6647@example.org', '2015-02-28', 4, N'Fun game but wish it had motion plus.'),
(N'Heather', N'Garcia', N'heather.garcia1878@example.org', '2015-02-28', 4, N'PROs: 1. It uses an AC cord, so it frees up two USB slots on your PS4. 2. It''s Sony branded, so I have more confidence that it won''t break after a week. CONs: 1. It is very light, so it doesn''t stay where you place it very well. I''ve been considering either duct taping it to the table or putting a brick on the feet to weigh it down. 2. No status lights. I''ve used a controller for 7 hours, then plugged it into the charger. The controller will glow for 5 seconds and then go dark. I know that it certainly isn''t fully charged. It would be nice if it had lights (for each of the 2 controllers) so you know what state it''s in: red=not seeded correctly, green=connected but fully charged, yellow=connected and in the process of recharging.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Kim', N'kathleen.kim9920@example.org', '2015-02-28', 4, N'Ok.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Rogers', N'kofi.rogers9493@example.net', '2015-03-01', 5, N'I waited until this game was $30 to purchase and can say that it''s well worth the money, I can''t vouch for the season pass or dlc because I don''t own it. I was never big into lord of the rings by any means and I found this game thoroughly enjoyable, I might ho back and read some books and watch some movies now...but anyhow the controls take a bit to get used to I had to adjust the camera speed but after I got situated it was great. Yes it''s similar to AC and Batman, but I liked both of those games so this is awesome. Game can be a bit overwhelming at first but remember you can always run/stealth by some enemies. Overall great buy, no multiplayer other than leaderboards. If you''re looking for a game with an actual story and not this always online crap that videogames are becoming I highly reccomend this. My brother has it on PS4 and it looks slightly better than on my Xbox One but so do a lot of games, nothing that affects playability though, check it out!'),
(N'Judith', N'Rivera', N'judith.rivera5845@example.org', '2015-03-01', 5, N'Exactly as described'),
(N'Donald', N'Smith', N'donald.smith4854@example.com', '2015-03-01', 5, N'This model is new one of Sades headsets in 2015, it has two colors ,good for music and primary pc games and can be used for mobile phone too. The most importance is the price also nice. But this headset is not 7.1 sound channel , it cannot compare with models which are 7.1 sound channel with sades CD driver,that is why it is cheap in rang of Sades headsets. Any way , I also quite like this headset .'),
(N'Ronald', N'Boyd', N'ronald.boyd8636@example.com', '2015-03-01', 5, N'Who doesnt love the PS4? The system outcompetes xbox anyday of the week'),
(N'Mei', N'Edwards', N'mei.edwards5125@example.com', '2015-03-01', 1, N'It works but the game is Terrible and not next gen at all. Activision and Bungie ruined my opinion of videogames forever last game I will ever buy and you can take that to the bank.'),
(N'Diane', N'Sanders', N'diane.sanders7463@example.com', '2015-03-01', 5, N'2014 was a disappointing year in gaming. But this is was one the bright spots. Tons of content, over 50+ hours of fun. Great story beautiful graphics. This game has co-op which is very fun. The highlight of this game is the outposts which are always fun to takeover usuing different tactics. If you are a PS4 owner and you''re looking to get the bang for the buck this is your kind of game.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ruiz', N'andrew.ruiz3325@example.com', '2015-03-01', 5, N'All good.'),
