(N'Ethan', N'Gutierrez', N'ethan.gutierrez8401@example.org', '2015-03-03', 5, N'If you enjoy playing the lego games this is a must buy. The game plays like a movie and you won''t want to put it down. I still like lego Star Wars best because of the way they integrated the multiplayer and wish they did it for more lego games. This game like most lego games can be played coop after you beat a stage.'),
