(N'William', N'Collins', N'william.collins9140@example.org', '2015-03-03', 5, N'Not canon for the story but great fun. I love the Yakuza series and love zombies so if you are just like me you will enjoy this. If you haven''t tried the Yakuza series you should definitely try them main stories and then move on to this game.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Scott', N'mateo.scott6994@example.org', '2015-03-04', 5, N'Bought on the recommendation of a friend. He was right. This game is different and fun.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Baker', N'kathleen.baker4500@example.com', '2015-03-04', 5, N'One of my favorites'),
(N'Maria', N'Harris', N'maria.harris9337@example.org', '2015-03-04', 5, N'Oh.... too, too funny if you like the Three Stooges..!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ward', N'brandon.ward8832@example.com', '2015-03-04', 5, N'New. Fun. Interesting. Must buy for any Pokemon lover'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Campbell', N'cheryl.campbell2971@example.org', '2015-03-04', 4, N'Very good Item'),
(N'Anthony', N'Singh', N'anthony.singh5574@example.org', '2015-03-04', 5, N'I have used a lot of gaming peripherals over the years, and this is by far my favorite for games that use a 1-12 action bar setup. The pad on the side is compact enough that it is easy to use with my small girl hands. I found in the past that the traditional game keypads are very hard to use unless you have huge hands. this one is perfect. Only con is that it is extremely long and won''t fit in my keyboard tray. But so far that is the only con. I have been using this thing for about a year now and love it. The keys are great, and this thing gets used for hours every day. No problems yet.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Wilson', N'benjamin.wilson4128@example.net', '2015-03-04', 5, N'Real deal!'),
(N'Anna', N'Jimenez', N'anna.jimenez8062@example.org', '2015-03-04', 4, N'A very nice looking item with a full color manual & holographic cover. The game itself is a pretty simplistic combination of 3D platformer, side-scroller, run & gun & puzzle game, but it has it''s moments. All in all, grab it for your collection, just don''t get over-excited.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Long', N'aisha.long4621@example.net', '2015-03-04', 5, N'100% Excelente'),
(N'Susan', N'Wilson', N'susan.wilson6616@example.org', '2015-03-04', 5, N'worked great is what they say it is'),
(N'Brenda', N'Sullivan', N'brenda.sullivan1183@example.net', '2015-03-04', 5, N'I have not played World Of Warcraft since just after Cataclysm. After seeing good reviews for this expansion I decided to get back in. The reviews were right Warlords is worth coming back for. The big change is your own garrison. These are like your own small town. You can find many reviews that go into more details as a proper review would be too large to put here. Heads up, you do not need to buy Mist Of Pandaria it''s now free when you install Warlords.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Nowak', N'ashley.nowak3279@example.org', '2015-03-04', 5, N'Love the game. Have not had any lock-ups since started playing. Maybe we just got lucky.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Parker', N'jeffrey.parker5490@example.net', '2015-03-04', 4, N'i like the game as a whole, but there are a couple downfalls... the most irritating one is the "cinematic wide screen boarders witch are very large! i actually think they are larger than a DVD or what ever. this wide screen border makes it pretty difficult at times.'),
(N'Brian', N'Baker', N'brian.baker1498@example.com', '2015-03-04', 5, N'If you own FSX, you will be loving this product.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ramirez', N'sarah.ramirez4628@example.net', '2015-03-04', 3, N'goodjob'),
(N'Jerry', N'James', N'jerry.james1254@example.com', '2015-03-04', 5, N'good'),
(N'Nadia', N'Lewis', N'nadia.lewis9104@example.com', '2015-03-04', 5, N'So happy to have found one. It works great.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Cruz', N'nadia.cruz5165@example.net', '2015-03-04', 5, N'I got this as a Christmas gift and he loves it!! The Rayman games are a ton of fun. For the money, you get a lot of gameplay with Rayman games. If you''ve ever played a Rayman game before, and liked it, you''d love this game as well. If you haven''t played Rayman, but like platformers with a challenge, give this one a try and you''ll love it.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Coleman', N'jacqueline.coleman7663@example.net', '2015-03-04', 5, N'GTA !!!'),
(N'John', N'Gray', N'john.gray3323@example.org', '2015-03-04', 5, N'Best charging station for the PS4. Easy to use and does the job perfectly.'),
(N'Henry', N'Clark', N'henry.clark6570@example.com', '2015-03-05', 2, N'This mouse was really nice when it was brand new, but the real problems begins to show up after about a year of hard usage. I''ll keep this short but informative. The fancy looking housing of the mouse is made of weak plastic. Period. Over time, it begins to soften and warp to the extent where the side buttons begin to act out on their own if you grip the mouse just a bit too hard. They activate without actually pressing them. This problem becomes frustrating when playing online games, especially any type of FPS. You''ll find yourself activating a command you don''t want on the fly. Had the housing been made of stronger material, this problem would cease to exist. The fact is, the materials made to build this mouse in its entirety is CHEAP or no better than your cheap standard 10 dollar mouse. The technological features are great, but for the price tag...seriously... Logitech needs to step up their game with the durability of these delicate things. I mean it''s a gaming mouse. It...'),
(N'Samantha', N'Jimenez', N'samantha.jimenez6071@example.com', '2015-03-05', 3, N'Needs it''s own drivers. Feels cheaply made. Should have gotten the official microsoft one.'),
(N'Helen', N'Williams', N'helen.williams8061@example.com', '2015-03-05', 5, N'Play good'),
(N'Betty', N'Price', N'betty.price2965@example.org', '2015-03-05', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Donald', N'Torres', N'donald.torres3091@example.com', '2015-03-05', 5, N'This item is great for bringing new life to your old Gameboy games via your SNES. You simply pop in the cartridge into the super nintendo and then slide the Gameboy game into the cartridge. Now you are all set to play old school games with a gamepad on the big screen! You can swap color palettes for most of the games and have borders around the gameplay. No additional wires or batteries needed to power the game. Just plug in and play. You should be able to use this on modern HD tvs if you have a SNES2, which is slightly smaller super nintendo and uses composite cables. Obviously old games will look kinda crummy blown up on the screen, but the nostalgia should help.'),
(N'Frank', N'Wisniewski', N'frank.wisniewski9352@example.net', '2015-03-05', 4, N'The Order: 1886 is first and foremost made to be a beautiful, cinematic video game... the best looking graphics I have seen this side of a PC. I have played the whole game through multiple times and have gotten every trophy available, so I believe I am qualified to give a full opinion on this game. Sure, there are complaints about the length of the game and how many cut scenes there are, but it is still a good game to play. I would compare the style to Telltale type games such as The Walking Dead and The Wolf Among Us. There is less "action" than many first/third person shooters and the story is linear, but for all the people complaining about how the story leads you with no decisions, isn''t that exactly what Call of Duty and Battlefield games do? No, this isn''t an open world game that you can play for 50+ hours or explore to your hearts content. That is why it can be so graphically stunning, because they focused on the parts of the game that matter to the story line. I know some...'),
(N'Susan', N'Garcia', N'susan.garcia2506@example.net', '2015-03-05', 5, N'Many have complained about how short he actual gameplay was in this game, but overall I thought it was worth the admission. Replay ability is a bit low, but the design of immersing the player into a movie/game was fantastic. This game raised the bar on what is to come and I like it! The story was engaging and it left you wanting more. Now to the Premium Edition itself. All the extra goodies was fun and dandy but the real meat was the 11" model / Figurine which was fantastic. Worth the price of admission alone. The detail was incredible and was captured from a scene from he movie ... oops game. It really does feel like your in a movie while you play. Wasn''t cheap but most worthwhile things aren''t and the figurine and game was simply fantastic!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Edwards', N'nicholas.edwards8883@example.com', '2015-03-05', 5, N'Could be a bit longer but just what I was looking for. Great quality heavy material.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Green', N'aaron.green3386@example.com', '2015-03-05', 5, N'Bought this for traveling overseas to charge my 3DS and it worked fine using a universal wall plug adapter and my phone''s USB to wall plug adapter.'),
(N'Larry', N'Mitchell', N'larry.mitchell6300@example.com', '2015-03-05', 4, N'not bad. love hidden object games.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Tanaka', N'nadia.tanaka5541@example.org', '2015-03-05', 5, N'In great shape , massive memory for the older playstation games ,I will need to buy more , still . LOL essentially one per game , rpgs take alot of memory . It''s nice to have it.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Chavez', N'tomasz.chavez2693@example.net', '2015-03-05', 5, N'Great in its own right!'),
(N'Noah', N'Kelly', N'noah.kelly8079@example.com', '2015-03-05', 4, N'wonderful graphic and mechanical format'),
(N'Ryan', N'Lopez', N'ryan.lopez8715@example.com', '2015-03-05', 3, N'It does what it''s supposed to, hold my controller. My only issue is, i wish the bottom had a no slip materiel on it and that it was weighted so it won''t slide around, besides that, it''s a nice looking stand.'),
(N'Jason', N'Garcia', N'jason.garcia6775@example.com', '2015-03-05', 1, N'After installing this expansion pack and not really seeing much of a difference in the game like I had hoped, I completely uninstalled it and went back to the Sims 3 when FUN and excitement used to exist in the game. The Sims 4 reminds me so much of Sims 1 all over again that I won''t be playing Sims 4 anytime soon again. Majorly disappointed with Sims 4!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ross', N'andrew.ross3119@example.org', '2015-03-05', 3, N'After Initially Purchasing my PS4 and all the Retail Launch Titles being an utter disappointment....thanks Killzone. I was super Pumped that this was coming out and finally maybe have a reason to dust off my PS4. Game is ok but I love the first game so much that this was too much change for me to really enjoy like I wanted to. It is not a bad game but not what I was expecting from having played the previous games.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Rodriguez', N'kevin.rodriguez5137@example.org', '2015-03-05', 5, N'Amazing museum piece.'),
(N'Henry', N'Green', N'henry.green7063@example.net', '2015-03-05', 5, N'very happy'),
