(N'Adam', N'Johnson', N'adam.johnson3965@example.com', '2015-03-06', 5, N'Awesome, always liked the ps4'),
(N'Brenda', N'Morales', N'brenda.morales6848@example.org', '2015-03-06', 5, N'I''m actually shocked by the bad reviews. For the price, i think these are pretty amazing. The fit and feel aren''t the best, but I got used to them pretty fast and it''s not a deal breaker at all. The 7.1 surround sound, on the other hand, is fantastic. I could hear 360 degree sound. When I first put them on, I was playing Destiny and spun in a circle right as a ship happened to fly by and actually heard the sound of the ship travel in a perfect circle around my head as my character''s head spun in the game. It was awesome! Im shocked you can get that kind of sound out of a headset at this price point. The sound itself isn''t crystal clear, but it is very good. I even use it for listening to music off my phone and ipod when I''m home, though they are way to bulky to be considered portable, but thats not what they''re for. When I am in a chat party on my PS4 I can toggle the volume of the game sound or the chat sound independently of each other. That is a phenomenal feature. Overall, I...'),
(N'Samantha', N'Green', N'samantha.green3567@example.org', '2015-03-06', 4, N'I tried Forza when it came out way back on the original Xbox and it just didn''t click with me. Fast forward a few years, a few sequels, and a new console. I saw Forza Horizon on sale via Xbox Live for like $10 I was like ok I will give it a whirl. I have to say I am very impressed, the graphics are very good for the 360 possibly the best graphics I have seem in a racing game on the console. The radio plays the same 5-6 songs on each station which is kind of weak sauce but, if the sacrifice in tunes means I can race in this open world I can always plug my Zune in for my own beats. Overall I have to say I see why people have long touted this series now. I liked it so much I bought Forza 5 & Horizon 2 for Xbox One. I will review them later. My only gripe would be that after years on playing Need for Speed, DiRT, Grid, Blur & Split Second the handling was a learning curve but, after sticking it out you will get it. At first I thought it was the physics but, practice practice and you...'),
(N'Jose', N'Ortiz', N'jose.ortiz6730@example.com', '2015-03-06', 5, N'Love this item. Simplifies the charging process'),
(N'Christine', N'Henderson', N'christine.henderson8492@example.org', '2015-03-06', 4, N'The system is awesome. Unfortunately, the mic didn''t work. Zeld4life!'),
