(N'Joshua', N'Anderson', N'joshua.anderson2990@example.net', '2015-03-07', 3, N'Great game, I really enjoyed the whole game, however, due to the enormous amount of bugs, I cannot give this game 5 stars. There were days where I couldn''t save my progress, there are achievements that should have popped but did not (such as killing all 10 dragons but not getting the dragons bane achievement, very frustrating), and also instances where I had to unplug my Xbox one to be able to login into the game. All of these due tend to ruin the experience a little, but all in all, it is still a fun game!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Lopez', N'joshua.lopez9549@example.net', '2015-03-07', 5, N'Fun for a PS4 original'),
(N'Matthew', N'Patel', N'matthew.patel3913@example.net', '2015-03-07', 4, N'ITS A VERY nice PRODUCT... IT CAME AS I SPECTED I RECOMMENDED QUALITY 95%... WE ARE USING IT WITH NO TROUBLE AT ALL 100% OK'),
(N'Henry', N'Singh', N'henry.singh6909@example.org', '2015-03-07', 5, N'Contains games easily.'),
(N'Janet', N'Kumar', N'janet.kumar8837@example.net', '2015-03-07', 3, N'I had this on my XB360, and love it. My 2 sons and I all play guitar, and one of my sons plays base, so it''s fun to jam out to real songs with them. I picked the PS4 version up at christmas time because we got a PS4 from Santa, and I figured the XBox would get no love afterwards. I was right. We have been playing exclusively on the PS4 ever since. I knew going into this I''d have to repurchase any songs/albums we had from before, so no hard feelings there. The PS4 version seems to have a better tuner and fixes issues I had with the XB360 version picking up certain low toned chords. Basic review of the game is as follows: I have been playing guitar for about 8yrs, my sons for about 7. We are not Eddie Van Helen, but we can play some songs, know our scales and pentatonics plus some general progressions, and can generally figure most stuff out. You could call us casual players, perhaps. That said, the games are fun, and do help you beef up on your skills in a fun way. Unfortunately...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Anderson', N'amanda.anderson6394@example.com', '2015-03-07', 5, N'I got both the PS2 and Xbox brand of this cable. I use both to connected to my component to HDMI converter and also to my SDTV through component. I highly recommend both haven''t fails me yet and I''ve had them for a year.'),
(N'Janet', N'Perez', N'janet.perez6819@example.net', '2015-03-07', 5, N'love the game it came when they said it would'),
(N'Debra', N'Garcia', N'debra.garcia6289@example.net', '2015-03-07', 5, N'very happy'),
(N'Alexander', N'Gonzalez', N'alexander.gonzalez6909@example.com', '2015-03-07', 5, N'I have seen this game on the Xbox Live market place for months now and just didn''t give it much though, mainly because it is digital only and I prefer a physical copy of my games. I also took this game as a simple Independent developed game and to be honest I really could care less for most independent games that are released, because frankly they are usually out dated simple games that are similar to games released on the original Xbox or earlier. Well to put things simply, I couldn''t have been more wrong.. Story : This is a very interesting and immersive game that I simply can''t wait to get back to when I have to stop playing. When you find a game that can hook you like this you know you have found something great. I''m not going to spoil anything about this game for anyone so I will leave you with this , If you like a game with a great story there is definitely a great one here to be had. Gameplay : This is a third person stealth game, plain and simple.. Think of this game as you...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Cook', N'cynthia.cook9955@example.com', '2015-03-07', 1, N'One of the 4 codes is invalid, so 25% of the "included" product does not work.'),
