(N'Richard', N'Watson', N'richard.watson6337@example.org', '2015-03-08', 5, N'Perfect thank you'),
(N'Deborah', N'Chen', N'deborah.chen9488@example.org', '2015-03-08', 5, N'The story does a good job of bringing me back to this torture of a game,much like God Of War. Puzzles are an OMG sensation. I never thought I''d be so grateful for the web,so prepare to visit there OFTEN,especially during the sequel''s gameplay. Its a unique game for the PS1 and still rivals today''s games. Yes,I do mean PS4 and the X Box One''s games as well.'),
