(N'Justin', N'Coleman', N'justin.coleman7992@example.net', '2015-03-08', 5, N'My son uses this every day in his controllers. The batteries are still going strong and the charger is fast and works great. Much better than using regular batteries all the time.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Wisniewski', N'jessica.wisniewski4436@example.org', '2015-03-08', 5, N'thank you'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Murphy', N'nicholas.murphy4656@example.com', '2015-03-08', 4, N'This is a good game a few bugs here and there, some pop-ups, but nothing major, it ''s also kind of repetitive but thankfully not as brutal as Demon''s Souls.'),
(N'Eric', N'Wright', N'eric.wright5361@example.net', '2015-03-08', 5, N'love anything walking dead'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Torres', N'jeremy.torres6566@example.org', '2015-03-08', 5, N'Corpse Party has quickly become my favorite horror anime. I just found this gem last week and have already ordered the DVD set and a poster. I also bought a PS Vita just for these two games. Of course, being able to play Resident Evil 2 and other PS1 classics is a big bonus. I was hesitant at first as I wasn''t sure how the purchase and game voucher would work, but have no fear, it is painless, absolutely simple, and impossible to mess up. Amazon is a great place to purchase Vita games as both of these were $20 opposed to $20ea on the PSN. As for the game itself, I only ordered it yesterday and have had little hands on experience with the game but boy is it engaging and captures your attention right at the beginning. Before people purchase this unkowingly, I imagine the gameplay isn''t for everyone. It isn''t like your standard RPG. Its story driven and the original indie voice actors are amazing. You definitely do not need to be a fan of the series to enjoy this although if you are...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Collins', N'kathleen.collins9687@example.net', '2015-03-09', 5, N'Best COD yet. Haven''t played since Black Ops 2 which was awesome. Fell back in love with COD again!'),
(N'Larry', N'Torres', N'larry.torres9047@example.net', '2015-03-09', 5, N'FIRST let''s get this OFTEN ASKED question out of the way..." will it work....(( on Windows 7, 8, 8.1 ? " YES it will work, this ALSO works on MAC as well. With the experience I have gained over the last couple years playing Sims 3 (( an RECENTLY Sims 4 ((( BLEAH ! ))) I like Sims 3 much better )) I will try an cover as much as I can to HOPEFULLY help now, an future players to this game. GET THE STARTER PACK, it gives you 3 deasent add ons to start you off with. Just the BASE starter disk without highend loft, and nightlife, the game COULD get BORING. YES it will require logging an linking in to Origin-BUT DON''T FRET you CAN play offline. again it can get boring an lonesome if you do. There is what is called the Exchange, it is a webpage where other " Simmers " upload their Sims Creations they want to share with others, and their FRIENDS. Sims an other Creations will only be available ACCORDING to what YOU have in way of Expansion an Stuff packs. (( NO there are no SPECIFIC ORDER to...'),
(N'Adam', N'Ortiz', N'adam.ortiz7635@example.net', '2015-03-09', 4, N'Most of my review is comparisons with its predecessor, Tree of Tranquility (TOT). I can''t help it, since the similarities are striking. In fact, they are so strong that they even reused the same resources, models and gameplay from that game in this one. So what is the overall difference you ask? Actually, quite a lot. So let''s get down in depth with the changes. The first and most prevalent change is the overall layout of the island; it is no longer Waffle Island but Harmonica Island. It isn''t just a name change, it actually is a brand new island to explore and places to visit. The layout isn''t as circular as TOT''s was, it follows more of a hub-and-spoke pattern where your farm is at the center of the island with the other farm, town, and mining districts branching off from there. Makes travel a bit more tedious but you can open up shortcuts later on between a few of the places. The detail in each area is also noticeable with even the Wii slowing down as it tries to render some of...'),
(N'Katherine', N'Nowak', N'katherine.nowak2655@example.org', '2015-03-09', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Charles', N'Ferreira', N'charles.ferreira1393@example.org', '2015-03-09', 5, N'Perfect'),
