(N'Tyler', N'Ferreira', N'tyler.ferreira9756@example.net', '2015-03-09', 5, N'I love the Metropolismania games!! I wish they''d release the 3rd game in America. The second one is missing one major fun aspect from the first, which is advertising, but it''s got a lot more variety of buildings. The games do get old after a while, but seeing this makes me want to play them again!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Wang', N'elizabeth.wang2108@example.net', '2015-03-09', 5, N'This is the most fun wii game that is on the market! A must have if you own a wii or just like a great multiplayer game!'),
(N'Jack', N'Gonzalez', N'jack.gonzalez9163@example.net', '2015-03-09', 1, N'I have two wireless headsets that cover a wide range inputs, an Astro A50 and a Sony MDR10RBT. The sony uses bluetooth and the A50 uses a mixamp base station that can take 3.5 mm audio, optical, and usb inputs. Both of them provide wireless audio and chat when connected to PS4. To get the same on xbox one I have to: 1. Plug a stereo headset adapter into my controller 2. Plug a 2.5mm to 3.5mm adapter into the stereo headset 3. Plug a 3.5mm audio cable into the adapter cable 4. Plug the other end of the 3.5mm audio cable into the headset Even if you don''t mind being tethered to a mess of wires with 4 connections to dislodge, why the heck did they have to go with such an obscure audio cable standard. Standard 3.5mm would have been much better for the vast majority of people.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ferreira', N'ryan.ferreira7164@example.net', '2015-03-09', 5, N'It came as expected!!!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Henderson', N'brandon.henderson7332@example.org', '2015-03-09', 3, N'because i am a fan of final fantasy which the developer doesnt know the word final lol im gonna give a review. I bought this one recently i thought im gonna be enjoy the game but not the game is linear and the story is really twisted from the final fantasy xiii and xiii-2 well the graphics is awesome but gameplay is you have thirteen days to save the world but its just a hoax lol i thought it will affect the game but nope it is not really just gonna add days on the in-game basically so i just rated three stars for this game cause i always fell asleep whenever im playing this game oh maybe because of the in-battle ost so mellow for me making me fall asleep.'),
(N'Luis', N'Patel', N'luis.patel3671@example.com', '2015-03-09', 5, N'This has the best multiplayer ever!!! I love it I can play with my brothers and they can play single card play so they don''t even have to own the game! you can play with or without the stylist stick and the single players fun too I could never beat it because theres this one level I get to mad to finish it'),
