(N'Gary', N'Hernandez', N'gary.hernandez6153@example.org', '2015-03-10', 5, N'Quick shipping and great quality'),
(N'Melissa', N'Martin', N'melissa.martin5738@example.org', '2015-03-10', 5, N'It has the weight of a classic SNES controller. The buttons do not feel alien at all. Everything about it feels very normal and comfortable. I only wish I had found this brand before I purchased other retro controllers. Will be my go-to purchase from this day on.'),
(N'Amara', N'Green', N'amara.green1776@example.net', '2015-03-10', 5, N'My sons love it! They asked for it by name.'),
(N'Emma', N'Suzuki', N'emma.suzuki5875@example.net', '2015-03-10', 5, N'Very nice remote for your media center that is the Xbox One. Feels perfect in your hand, light glow for the buttons when you pick it up and works with about any HDTV. If you use apps with your XBO a lot this really is a good investment. High quality all around.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ali', N'jessica.ali2016@example.net', '2015-03-10', 1, N'Set it up, got it to connect and recognize the controller, but it never let me use the controller then the cord started falling apart. Wish I would of used it earlier so I could of sent it back'),
(N'Hannah', N'Howard', N'hannah.howard8653@example.net', '2015-03-10', 5, N'My oldest son loves this game. He says it is a good buy.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Alvarez', N'lucia.alvarez9738@example.net', '2015-03-10', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Steven', N'Rivera', N'steven.rivera6042@example.org', '2015-03-10', 5, N'Works great. I like that it can either charge while in the controller or just by setting the battery and cover on it.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Patel', N'jonathan.patel1429@example.org', '2015-03-10', 4, N'good'),
(N'Jacob', N'Torres', N'jacob.torres8369@example.com', '2015-03-10', 3, N'First off, I was very excited to get this game. It was probably my favorite game on the PC when it came out 2 years ago. I don''t know if the other guys who reviewed this didn''t play this the first time it came out, and maybe I''m just losing it, but something is missing from this game. Main issue? The Audio seems to be at a lower bit rate. But don''t get me wrong, it''s not "bad" I just am comparing to what I heard on the PC version. Call it too quiet, lack luster, what have you, but something is wrong the audio in this game. But it''s not bad, just I think because there was no install on this game (it seems to play right off the disc?) that they may have cut corners on the audio? I have a very excellent stereo system with great speakers and sub-woofer, but nothing is utilized in this game like I was wanting. But some may not care or notice. When I''m hacking and slashing at the enemies, it''s very dull sounding, I can''t put my hand on it, but the first time I played this (not the...'),
(N'Donald', N'Kim', N'donald.kim4882@example.com', '2015-03-10', 4, N'I just started playing but I like the way it is going'),
(N'Luis', N'Diaz', N'luis.diaz9610@example.com', '2015-03-10', 1, N'Let''s face it, Kinect wasn''t designed to be used in tight spaces. I went through three of these until I finally found one that worked. It''s not worth the gamble.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Perez', N'zachary.perez6939@example.org', '2015-03-10', 5, N'Plays just as good as my original SNES copy only it also has an option to play DS optimized (I''m playing on a 3DS XL) so the menus show up on the bottom screen and the top screen is free of clutter. A Super (NES) Value!'),
(N'Richard', N'Brown', N'richard.brown3913@example.org', '2015-03-10', 4, N'excelent'),
(N'Richard', N'Brown', N'richard.brown3913@example.org', '2015-03-10', 3, N'ok'),
(N'Richard', N'Brown', N'richard.brown3913@example.org', '2015-03-10', 3, N'good'),
(N'Richard', N'Reed', N'richard.reed5814@example.org', '2015-03-10', 5, N'Thank you!!!!!!'),
(N'Brian', N'Ramirez', N'brian.ramirez6861@example.org', '2015-03-11', 5, N'I''ve used many different brands of screen protectors over the years for various electronic devices and HORI, by far, makes the easiest to apply. They also happen to look fantastic on your screens, and by fantastic I mean invisible. The application process is incredibly easy. Be sure to clean your screen first with a gentle cloth and follow the order of the tabs. When finished, I actually used my finger to push out any air bubbles. The little cardboard thing is a little tricky for me to use and sometimes leaves little scratches on the screen protector. My New 3DS XL looks great and the screens are bubble-free. Fantastic item!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Sanders', N'jennifer.sanders9040@example.org', '2015-03-11', 5, N'It was amazing getting this game looking like it''s brand new!'),
(N'Emma', N'Ortiz', N'emma.ortiz7530@example.com', '2015-03-11', 5, N'I don''t play this, but my 11 year old grandson loves it. Of course he puts it on automatic to run up points to get the cars he wants, so I don''t know how he does with the actual game play.'),
(N'George', N'Ramos', N'george.ramos3467@example.com', '2015-03-11', 5, N'Another great and fun assassin''s creed game.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Parker', N'deborah.parker9610@example.com', '2015-03-11', 5, N'Still playing these. I don''t want to stop playing them.'),
(N'Paul', N'Reyes', N'paul.reyes7579@example.com', '2015-03-11', 4, N'It works and it''s not too flimsy'),
(N'Douglas', N'Alvarez', N'douglas.alvarez1964@example.net', '2015-03-11', 5, N'perfect product is excelent'),
(N'Emily', N'Garcia', N'emily.garcia8203@example.com', '2015-03-11', 5, N'Kids really like the game, no complaints'),
(N'Robert', N'Adams', N'robert.adams7715@example.com', '2015-03-11', 5, N'Great Product'),
(N'Mateo', N'Roberts', N'mateo.roberts6117@example.net', '2015-03-11', 5, N'I love this game it''s extremely fun and the graphics are mind blowingly very good! I highly recommend it people that really enjoy First Person Shooter games and to those that have played and beaten the last three Killzone games. Fans of the series will truly enjoy this game and truly appreciate it.'),
(N'Noah', N'Coleman', N'noah.coleman9747@example.com', '2015-03-11', 5, N'Son loved it. Great price'),
(N'Linda', N'Rodriguez', N'linda.rodriguez3503@example.org', '2015-03-11', 5, N'Great game thank you'),
(N'Hannah', N'Singh', N'hannah.singh1170@example.net', '2015-03-11', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ramirez', N'kenneth.ramirez9372@example.org', '2015-03-11', 3, N'OK'),
(N'Diane', N'Nguyen', N'diane.nguyen2818@example.net', '2015-03-12', 3, N'As stated by others, it will not charge the 3DS while the screen is on. Tried using a higher power brick but no luck. Works great if you are using it for an overnight charge though.'),
(N'Henry', N'Singh', N'henry.singh6909@example.org', '2015-03-12', 4, N'Wii Play offers several fairly simple games which look very nice graphically though. They''re fun to play and as designed show off what the Wii-mote can do. I think the difficulties are a bit unbalanced though in turns of trying to earn the medals - generally a bit too hard. Probably the best is the shooting game which actually works well with the Wii zapper. The shooting game has several distinct rounds you move through such as shooting balloons or cans. Each is basically a far nicer looking version of one of the early NES zapper game modes like Duck Hunt''s clay disc mode.'),
(N'Richard', N'Taylor', N'richard.taylor9451@example.org', '2015-03-12', 5, N'Gift for my grandson He loves these little guys'),
(N'Wei', N'Morgan', N'wei.morgan7560@example.org', '2015-03-12', 5, N'working alternative for Gamecube adapters, never had any issues with it.'),
(N'Mei', N'Young', N'mei.young4632@example.net', '2015-03-12', 5, N'Great console. Wish they would have put something into backwards compatibility instead of Kinect. Kinect works better than 360''s did. Still don''t us it for much.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Wright', N'yuki.wright8959@example.org', '2015-03-12', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Taylor', N'benjamin.taylor7926@example.com', '2015-03-12', 5, N'muy bueno'),
(N'Ryan', N'Johnson', N'ryan.johnson9042@example.net', '2015-03-12', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Andrea', N'Alvarez', N'andrea.alvarez3797@example.org', '2015-03-12', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Timothy', N'Powell', N'timothy.powell8051@example.net', '2015-03-12', 1, N'This controller, simply put, is not worth spending your money on. The top buttons, (L1, L2, R1 and R2) are hardly functional. The analog sticks function poorly, and are extremely tight, so it makes precision controls very hard to perform. Spend the extra couple dollars on the real PlayStation controller, which I am having to do now after wasting my money on this piece of crap.'),
(N'Joan', N'Hernandez', N'joan.hernandez3088@example.com', '2015-03-12', 5, N'Lots of fun!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Cox', N'jacqueline.cox9034@example.org', '2015-03-12', 3, N'Lightcore characters don''t impress me. On the portal, Hex doesn''t light up like I would expect. As a character, she''s okay at best.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Cox', N'jacqueline.cox9034@example.org', '2015-03-12', 3, N'I wouldn''t recommend this pack unless you needed both characters, the Forge doesn''t add anything past a few challenge levels.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Gutierrez', N'ronald.gutierrez7888@example.net', '2015-03-13', 5, N'works as advertised'),
(N'Dee', N'Harris', N'dee.harris4901@example.net', '2015-03-13', 2, N'Service fine, bad game.'),
(N'Donna', N'Turner', N'donna.turner5972@example.net', '2015-03-13', 5, N'Easiest plug into device plug I''ve ever used.'),
(N'Donna', N'Turner', N'donna.turner5972@example.net', '2015-03-13', 5, N'Love the music. Play the music.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Sullivan', N'anthony.sullivan8127@example.net', '2015-03-13', 5, N'Absolutely the best USB Genesis controller on the market. I can''t find a single problem with it...It feels exactly like the original Sega 6-button controller, including the start button and even the "mode" button on the top right. You MUST get this if you plan on using any Sega Master System or Sega Genesis emulator on your computer....You''ll be transported back to your childhood in no time flat...'),
(N'John', N'Anderson', N'john.anderson4683@example.com', '2015-03-13', 5, N'fun to play, have all three and they just keep getting better'),
(N'David', N'Torres', N'david.torres3517@example.com', '2015-03-13', 5, N'This controller in my opion is great The features on the item is also great. In my opion this item is the best of the best.and i would recommend this controller to ever one who is looking to buy a joystick for what ever reason.'),
(N'Wei', N'Bennett', N'wei.bennett3928@example.org', '2015-03-13', 5, N'It works.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Tanaka', N'kyle.tanaka2554@example.com', '2015-03-13', 5, N'Honestly i did purchase other types of cases for my New 3DSXL MM, but nothing was as good as this case. It is well made - the inside is very soft and stitching isn''t cheap. The overall case is light but sturdy. The hardness isn''t has hard as you think it would be .... it is semi- hard but trust me when I say that it is good enough. If you want something with a indestructible type shell then I recommend the Insignia universal portfolio case (i guess that is a preference, just know that case does not fit the NEW 3DS well when the system has a TPU or crystal casing). I do have the TPU HORI casing on my system and this case is the ONLY one that can actually accommodate the system with ease!! It is well made, holds more than 8 games (you can actually just pair them up in the slots) and also the strap is comfortable. As other reviews stated - no there is zero room for a charger. But i guess you can add more games if you want, AR cards, the strap it comes with, extra stylists, or a...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Davis', N'joyce.davis3376@example.org', '2015-03-13', 3, N'Not nearly as good as the first one, but some fun.'),
(N'Janet', N'Bailey', N'janet.bailey3809@example.org', '2015-03-13', 5, N'Really fun game, although the Wii U version is better for competitive play in my opinion. A word of advice to you smash lovers, don''t break your circle pad like me playing this game. Try and go easy on it since it''s not as durable as an actual controller.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Cox', N'jacqueline.cox9034@example.org', '2015-03-13', 5, N'Even thought the expansions are buggy as hell even long after release, this is one of the best games of all time. I true must-play if you are a fan of the FPS, RPG, and/or adventure genres. My only disappointment was too much time spent in buildings and underground. I like how New Vegas had a lot of wide open spaces. The game is a classic.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Edwards', N'barbara.edwards6549@example.net', '2015-03-14', 5, N'A good game if you are a Star Wars nut like me and I is easily playable.'),
(N'Maria', N'Watson', N'maria.watson9768@example.net', '2015-03-14', 5, N'Very awesome. Not a lot of games coming out that I want to play but its nice to have.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Martinez', N'anthony.martinez7214@example.org', '2015-03-14', 5, N'great product ontime perfect'),
(N'Karen', N'Ramirez', N'karen.ramirez2570@example.net', '2015-03-14', 3, N'Prefer the older version for the old 3DS XL. This is a glossy grip.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Campbell', N'kyle.campbell2789@example.net', '2015-03-14', 5, N'a great game,i love the fact that u can now run over the goalie.'),
(N'Linda', N'Rodriguez', N'linda.rodriguez3503@example.org', '2015-03-14', 5, N'Great game tx'),
(N'Lisa', N'Wood', N'lisa.wood7270@example.net', '2015-03-15', 5, N'Good product'),
(N'Aaron', N'Stewart', N'aaron.stewart2130@example.org', '2015-03-15', 2, N'Pretty boring. Open world doesn''t flow well. Nowhere near as good as the first two.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Brown', N'andrea.brown1850@example.net', '2015-03-15', 5, N'This keyboard is pretty slick. It seem well made and the light color is adjustable. Not a bad buy all-in-all.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Khan', N'ashley.khan2220@example.org', '2015-03-15', 5, N'Borderlands 2 on the PS-Vita is very cool never thought i could play that cool of in depth game on a portable gaming system. You can also cross save to and from the PS3!!'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Okonkwo', N'cheryl.okonkwo3334@example.net', '2015-03-15', 5, N'grandson loves it'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Gutierrez', N'jeremy.gutierrez8817@example.net', '2015-03-15', 3, N'The amiibo figures are okay and all.. but im more pointing out how this one is called "Seek" where the character''s name is Shiek... http://i.imgur.com/aqrkuLA.png in the event they update it based off of my comment here.'),
(N'William', N'Long', N'william.long9750@example.org', '2015-03-15', 4, N'i watched many videos on this game before buying it, and was sure that i wanted to within the first 20 minutes. this game contains so much content to play around with and is one of the funnest games since the n64. the only downside to this was that the seller took FOREVER to ship it'),
(N'Luis', N'Kelly', N'luis.kelly4618@example.net', '2015-03-15', 5, N'I have over 2k hours in this game. It is as good as any other MMO without the monthly price tag. The game like all of them has its flaws and the developers are pretty distant from the community but they patch regularly, constantly add new content and at the very least a person can get 100 hours out this game before getting bored. To me the gameplay is better than most MMOs as the combat is very dynamic and action oriented. If you like games where you press a series of buttons matching a long list of skills while you stand in one spot, this game is going to throw you as moving in this game is very important. Players drop fields that allow skills to have additional effects. For example, one player can drop ring of fire and if you leap, shoot, etc through that field your attack will have added bonuses. So team play is very important for many classes/builds allowing for some complex but dependent builds. It is a very deep game as far as character creation is concerned.'),
(N'Peter', N'Walker', N'peter.walker6899@example.org', '2015-03-15', 5, N'It works...what else?'),
(N'Yuki', N'Nguyen', N'yuki.nguyen2350@example.net', '2015-03-15', 5, N'I am satisfied with purchase'),
(N'Janet', N'Gonzalez', N'janet.gonzalez6102@example.com', '2015-03-15', 2, N'Touch screen has some problems, especially in the winter in China. It was completely out of my control when the temp was lower than 10.'),
(N'Joan', N'Perry', N'joan.perry4665@example.net', '2015-03-16', 5, N'Another fantastic game!'),
(N'Katherine', N'Myers', N'katherine.myers2642@example.net', '2015-03-16', 5, N'having fun playing'),
(N'Helen', N'Kowalski', N'helen.kowalski2739@example.com', '2015-03-16', 5, N'gundam beat''um up'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wang', N'rachel.wang7669@example.org', '2015-03-16', 5, N'yay'),
(N'Walter', N'Jackson', N'walter.jackson6108@example.org', '2015-03-16', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Linda', N'Taylor', N'linda.taylor4450@example.com', '2015-03-16', 5, N'I have been using the Hori Battle Pad Mario & Luigi versions for months now, ever since Smash Bros Wii U was released. I always loved those, so when I saw this Pikachu version announced, it was an easy pre-order. It''s the same as the Mario & Luigi Hori Battle Pads, other than it''s yellow with black accents and the Pikachu art in the center. Like the previous ones, it has the two sets of bumpers & triggers on top (ZL & ZR) instead of only the Z button on the right that the original Nintendo GameCube controller has. It also has a turbo feature, unlike the Nintendo & PDP offerings, which can come in handy once in awhile. The awesome thing about these is you don''t need to keep looking for one of the GameCube adapters to come in stock to play with this on your Wii U. Instead of the standard GameCube wire/connector, it connects to your Wiimote, similar to the older Wii Pro controllers. So it''s semi-wireless, which can be good if you have a long distance between you and your console. The...'),
(N'Lucia', N'Ward', N'lucia.ward1666@example.com', '2015-03-16', 4, N'This version of Ninja Gaiden is very different from every other version released. All other ones carry a very serious storyline with respective Heroes and villains. This version is more comical, and is more like arena challenge in each section of the stage. The game is still pretty challenging, and the comedy gives it a different feel that makes me enjoy it quite well. If you''re looking for a deep story that will last a long time, look elsewhere, as this game is only 7 stages long. Typical story involving zombies. Virus spreads or is being tested on the population, you''re sent there to test your new body after losing parts of from your fight with Ryu Hyabusa, while trying to get revenge on him. If you''re the type, like me, that doesn''t have much gaming time, and are looking for just some straight forward, linear zombie killing action, with no exploration, then this game is for you.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Foster', N'andrea.foster5263@example.org', '2015-03-16', 5, N'This is the most:Compelling, emotional, adventurous,exotic, enticing, engaging, all in a subtle way, game out there. If you haven''t played persona 4, play it. I Highly doubt persona 5 will live up to this masterpiece. It would take a miracle. The music, backgrounds, storyline , and characters are top notch. You will be playing this game endlessly because even the action/fighting is flawless. And the growth and character point system is great. I got the worst ending, won''t spoil it, but it makes me want to play it all over again just to fix that. Here are my stats Graphics: 8/10 graphics don''t matter at all Gameplay: 10/10 Story: 10/10 Superb, enthralling, sad, cheerful etc Caracters: 10/10 individuals you will care about Atmosphere: 10/10 overcast skys, dungeons etc sunny sky''s Etc Music: 10/10 The best scores I''ve ever heard in a game, thought/emotion provoking music'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Green', N'kathleen.green1686@example.com', '2015-03-16', 5, N'Fun games to play when waiting for appointment time, flight time or whatever timel Speedy service'),
(N'Omar', N'Barnes', N'omar.barnes6543@example.net', '2015-03-16', 5, N'I loved this DMC reboot. The combat is so fluid & now it just looks & plays even more amazing in this edition. "Hellblade" bring it on Ninja Theory.'),
(N'Eric', N'Bailey', N'eric.bailey1602@example.com', '2015-03-16', 4, N'Got this for our 9 year old who is a huge WWE fan and even after all the poor reviews and heavy skepticism from me our son LOVES it. The reason for 4 instead of 5 stars is because he says it''s a bit too hard from previous versions.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Green', N'daniel.green4815@example.com', '2015-03-16', 5, N'sweet game if u like turn baed games. get this version and save your self the time of playing the first one only to replay this one and find out it is exactly the same except for about 4 new units and 10 more projects.'),
(N'Henry', N'James', N'henry.james6762@example.com', '2015-03-16', 5, N'Great item!'),
(N'Carlos', N'Nguyen', N'carlos.nguyen7451@example.org', '2015-03-16', 5, N'Son enjoys this. Can play regular Wii games also (In SD). Too bad it doesn''t get the true praise it deserves from the gaming community. HD games look wonderful and play wonderfully also.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Allen', N'timothy.allen5255@example.com', '2015-03-16', 5, N'So much fun.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Sanders', N'victoria.sanders9948@example.org', '2015-03-16', 5, N'These little things are a must have for any controller. It adds so much more grip! Definitely worth it.'),
(N'Noah', N'Ali', N'noah.ali5917@example.net', '2015-03-17', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Dennis', N'Evans', N'dennis.evans4599@example.net', '2015-03-17', 4, N'For years, the Battlefield series has been military-based shooter after military-based shooter. Now, the Battlefield series has taken the series to the streets with Hardline, which eliminates the military-based theme and adds the theme of cops and criminals. Since I found out about this game, last year, I was intrigued with that idea. The game was eventually supposed to release in November, but got pushed back. Now, the wait is over... CAMPAIGN/STORY: The story features Officer Nick Mendoza, who not long after making detective, finds that the road to putting criminals away also has lead to him finding some criminals, who have badges. The campaign''s story is VERY good. Easily the best campaign of the Battlefield series, which offers a VERY immersive experience of being a part of the "boys in blue." The characters are memorable and the voice-acting is GREAT. As the story goes, the story gets more interesting, as the corruption gets deeper and deeper. Kind of makes you wonder if the...'),
(N'Marcus', N'Wilson', N'marcus.wilson6451@example.com', '2015-03-17', 5, N'love this game'),
(N'Aisha', N'Myers', N'aisha.myers9729@example.net', '2015-03-17', 4, N'I LOVED IT, THE STORYLINE WAS VERY INTRIGUING. I THOUGHT THE GAME WAS VERY GOOD.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Myers', N'lauren.myers7169@example.org', '2015-03-17', 3, N'Its an okay game but I like the raid mode best. I like the return of Claire and Barry but I don''t like what they took out from 6'),
(N'Ivan', N'Ruiz', N'ivan.ruiz7431@example.org', '2015-03-17', 5, N'i didn''t buy the physical disc but i bought episode 1 then the season pass witch is a cheaper method then buying the disc but the disc includes all the episodes plus the bonus 2 episodes, albert wesker and hunk in raid mode, and every costume pack, if you don''t care about geting albert wesker for raid mode and the costume pack it''ll be just about half price to buy it digitally by buying episode 1 then the season pass witch will only cost you $26 the game is really good playing it on the the xbox one and ps4 the game runs smooth 60 fps playing it on ps3 and xbox 360 it runs 30 fps the game is split into 4 episodes and two bonus episodes witch where released week by week but now that the disc is out all the episodes are included the story is doesn''t really tie into any of the resident evil time lines (based on the game''s lore it takes place after the events of resident evil 5) but with that being said you can get into this game without playing any of the resident evils two of the...'),
(N'Sandra', N'Ramirez', N'sandra.ramirez6735@example.org', '2015-03-17', 5, N'bien'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Edwards', N'nicholas.edwards8883@example.com', '2015-03-17', 5, N'Works'),
(N'Omar', N'White', N'omar.white6489@example.net', '2015-03-17', 5, N'Muh hockey'),
(N'Samantha', N'Green', N'samantha.green2122@example.net', '2015-03-17', 5, N'I recently just repurchased this due to my other one getting so badly scratched up- that I had major glitches, this one works like brand new even though I got a used one for cheaper- I''m happy to be reunited!');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Christine', N'Butler', N'christine.butler1128@example.org', '2015-03-17', 5, N'Gave it to my son for his bday he lives it'),
(N'Wei', N'Rivera', N'wei.rivera9912@example.com', '2015-03-18', 5, N'It''s funny & crazy'),
(N'Anna', N'Williams', N'anna.williams3319@example.com', '2015-03-18', 5, N'I loved this game as a kid and wanted to replay it on my wii but my original game was beat-up. However, when i received it, it would not play on my Wii for some reason. So just be wary of that. Maybe it was because it was a "Player''s Choice" version or something like that. Not sure. But if you intend to play it on a Wii, contact the seller and see if they know if their copy works on Wiis or not.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Hill', N'joyce.hill1483@example.net', '2015-03-18', 2, N'not really into it... kinda bullshirt...'),
(N'Noah', N'Jones', N'noah.jones9230@example.net', '2015-03-18', 3, N'As the PS3 generation of gaming started coming to an end last year to make room for the PS4, I started a mission to play through all the highlights of the PS3 (I still haven''t finished). The Final Fantasy games of yore were definitely on that list. I had played through most of FFVII back in the day and FFXIII more recently, so bear in mind that those are my two points of comparison while playing through FFX FFX has an intriguing story - without spoiling anything there are elements of time travel, world-ending monsters, and (of course) a damsel in distress. The story plays out with only minor exposition on the history of the world, though that is fleshed out as you progress. The battle system is similar to that of most Final Fantasy games with turn-based battles. My main issue with FFX is the pace of the story. It just feels so slooowwww. Maybe my view of older games is tainted by having played the newer open-world games? The gameplay is very linear in FFX, and I just found most of...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Powell', N'joyce.powell1549@example.org', '2015-03-18', 2, N'Don''t like this game at all lol'),
(N'Aisha', N'Evans', N'aisha.evans3448@example.org', '2015-03-18', 5, N'These get a 5 star review based on several factors. They are cheap. I''ve had sandwiches that cost more than this headset. The mic works great, it''s not overly sensitive or total crap sounding. The earpieces are okay, they feel a bit loose for my liking but sound satisfactory. I have a set of steel series, but they dissemble, and I''ve been having problems with loss of sound if they aren''t put together tightly. This eliminates that issue, though the sound isn''t QUITE as nice as the SS. I have a cobra E-Blue mouse that matches this nicely, the mouse is also very nice. Overall, for around 20 dollars, these are absolutely worth the money.'),
(N'Joan', N'Jackson', N'joan.jackson6114@example.org', '2015-03-18', 5, N'Pros: +Simple to set up +Very useful! +Love the added cradle to place it where ever I want +Very cheap! +Original Nintendo product Cons: -Does not come with actual charging cable. Make sure you have one, or buy one in addition.'),
(N'Justin', N'Evans', N'justin.evans7363@example.org', '2015-03-19', 5, N'This is the 3ds that should came n 2011.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Johnson', N'tyler.johnson2771@example.com', '2015-03-19', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Raymond', N'Raghunathan', N'raymond.raghunathan2731@example.com', '2015-03-19', 5, N'The Legend of Zelda is one of the most critically acclaimed video game franchises and this installment has to be seen to be believed. Originally released in 2000 for the Nintendo 64, Majora''s Mask is one of the darkest games in the franchise and is a fan favorite. This remastered version on the Nintendo 3DS will bring nostalgia to those who played the original game and give the experience to newcomers who haven''t played it. If you''re a 3DS owner and/or a fan of the Legend of Zelda, then you should definitely pick this game up.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Tanaka', N'jonathan.tanaka3139@example.net', '2015-03-19', 2, N'Very Laggy and boring storyline :L did not enjoy as much as intended to :c but had it''s moments'),
(N'Yuki', N'Barnes', N'yuki.barnes5773@example.org', '2015-03-19', 5, N'Xbox Live points useful for downloading add-ons such as games, wallpapers, avatar extras, DLCs, etc.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Morris', N'jacob.morris5398@example.net', '2015-03-19', 5, N'So far, I love this game. My only issue is running into Death after I''ve styed on floor too long. He is an overpowered opponent, so if you encounter him, run away immediately. Another problem, though it is not the game''s fault, is my reluctance to fuse Orpheus. Anywys, the price I paid was kinda insane, but totally worth it.'),
(N'Richard', N'Young', N'richard.young5045@example.org', '2015-03-19', 5, N'Love this game if you want to find out if people still play it look at the review https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QDOTRL0pygs on youtube.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Mitchell', N'brenda.mitchell3566@example.net', '2015-03-19', 4, N'I enjoy playing games that require thought and strategy, this does it.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Hill', N'christopher.hill4846@example.com', '2015-03-19', 5, N'Love this game. Keeps me entertained for hours on end. You can play it over and over and it''s a different score all the time because it''s up to you to beat your previous score. The games are fun and relaxing. I recommend this to anyone who likes hidden object games.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Campbell', N'thomas.campbell5265@example.net', '2015-03-19', 1, N'This is a huge scam, *DO NOT PURCHASE*'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez2456@example.com', '2015-03-20', 5, N'this is a good game I love to play and it relaxs me'),
(N'Sofia', N'Thompson', N'sofia.thompson5713@example.net', '2015-03-20', 5, N'great gift for guitar-playing father trying to get back into it'),
(N'Alexander', N'Mendoza', N'alexander.mendoza1938@example.org', '2015-03-20', 5, N'cool game'),
(N'Helen', N'Gomez', N'helen.gomez3988@example.com', '2015-03-20', 5, N'awesome! now my xbox1 looks bigger and the batteries have a long life!'),
(N'Helen', N'Gomez', N'helen.gomez3988@example.com', '2015-03-20', 5, N'not problems!'),
(N'Anita', N'Parker', N'anita.parker4727@example.org', '2015-03-20', 5, N'I got this game for my kid twin cousins. They love this game every chance they get they play it. They love Shadow and Sonic along with the various courses they get to race on. I thought it was neat that some Sega game characters were included in this game. It came packed brand new and it works fine.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Lee', N'barbara.lee3471@example.net', '2015-03-20', 5, N'Works great.'),
(N'Megan', N'Scott', N'megan.scott5125@example.com', '2015-03-20', 5, N'This is pretty great. I preordered this and waited around six months, which was worth it. Graphics are splendid, especially during those more critical cut scenes, background music is suspenseful, and the environments are thrilling. I''ve never been so intensified by a Resident Evil game, until I played this. The story unfolds during the whole game, leaving the boss of the game a big mystery, though this game has a better, more "Resident Evil" type story and such than 5, 6, Revelations and maybe even 4, it seems that Cap com finally made the perfect game, even if it wasn''t high budgeted like 6. The game does include new things, the stealth is similar to the way The Last Of Us is, and the gameplay sort of reminds me of Tomb Raider, which is pretty stellar. The game all together is sort of short, but the raid mode has so much features, and it''s a game where you''d probably want to play the campaign mode over and over because it''s so good. And yes, it actually is sort of scary, the...'),
(N'Sandra', N'James', N'sandra.james5356@example.org', '2015-03-20', 1, N'I could not get it installed. It was bought when I had an old account. PC was not good enough at that time. EA took over the old account and switched it over, memory loss on the name, and the install will not recognize my log in and hence will not install. It basically is telling me that it is owned by someone else. I never got to play it. Have no clue what the game is like.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Nguyen', N'daniel.nguyen7036@example.org', '2015-03-20', 5, N'Better game than I thought it was going to be. Though it still is not a true basketball sim, the game is manageable.'),
(N'Christine', N'Williams', N'christine.williams9809@example.org', '2015-03-20', 5, N'Pretty legit! Good storage and protection.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Kowalski', N'christopher.kowalski9068@example.org', '2015-03-20', 1, N'Got it in the mail with no problem, the case was in great shape along with the direction booklet too, but when I loaded the disk into my ps2 I discovered the disk was blank and there was no data at all on it. My system works fine btw, I just finished playing Silent Hill 2 with no problems at all. Better make sure you check your games (used at least) right away from them!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Cooper', N'benjamin.cooper2986@example.org', '2015-03-20', 5, N'son loves it'),
(N'Joyce', N'Ramos', N'joyce.ramos3643@example.net', '2015-03-21', 3, N'Fun game.'),
(N'Mark', N'Morales', N'mark.morales9329@example.net', '2015-03-21', 5, N'good'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Gray', N'hiroshi.gray6278@example.org', '2015-03-21', 5, N'Perfect thanks.'),
(N'Mei', N'White', N'mei.white2620@example.org', '2015-03-21', 5, N'got wrong product, I need Mac games, NOT Pc. Since I can''t use Pc version games, they are now sitting on a shelf waiting to be donated since I can''t even resell these, no one wants them!! Hate being stuck with an item.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Carter', N'aisha.carter6703@example.com', '2015-03-21', 4, N'good game..'),
(N'Aisha', N'Carter', N'aisha.carter6703@example.com', '2015-03-21', 4, N'Its a fun game..'),
(N'Eric', N'Powell', N'eric.powell1511@example.net', '2015-03-21', 5, N'Very fun'),
(N'Richard', N'Young', N'richard.young6927@example.net', '2015-03-21', 5, N'Great item. U live buying these and selling then to autistic children for x5 times price I paid. They love Mario and Me a lovee the money'),
(N'Daniel', N'Kelly', N'daniel.kelly3976@example.com', '2015-03-21', 5, N'works. I like it.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Cox', N'cynthia.cox7433@example.org', '2015-03-22', 3, N'It''s an XBox 360 with 500GB HD. I got this because it looks pretty cool in the picture. In real life, it''s dark blue on the middle, but light sea-foam blue on the sides. The Controller matches this color style: Dark Blue on the top half, and light, powdery blue on the bottom. Not cool looking by any means. Also, the ON/OFF button is different then the SLIM. The SLIM had an ultra sensitive power button. You get your hand anywhere near it, and BLOOP. This one, is much better/worse (you decide). You have to put some pressure on the Button to get it to react. Power cable is also different then the SLIM. It has a single tube, instead of the double, that the SLIM has. The Vents on the top and sides are smaller then the SLIM. This may let in less dust, but I''m guessing it lets in less air as well. It''s still an XBox, and nothing inside has changed enough to notice, but the Lt Blue sides on this, stand out. If you are going for an ocean theme in your room, go for it. WARNING!!!! Microsoft...'),
(N'Victoria', N'Brown', N'victoria.brown2174@example.com', '2015-03-22', 5, N'Having this game made our house the go to cool place for kids of all ages. It''s pretty awesome when you have 8 players ranging in age from 8 to 18 battling it out. This game was totally worth the money. They got it in 2014 and it is still their favorite!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Scott', N'mateo.scott8034@example.org', '2015-03-22', 1, N'wouldn''t work...free or not there should have been something there.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Harris', N'kathleen.harris1783@example.org', '2015-03-22', 5, N'All ok'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Morales', N'kathleen.morales1383@example.org', '2015-03-22', 5, N'Played this game years ago. Bought the download for my new computer running Windows 8.1. Works almost perfect. It froze up once and had to restart. Great game. My 8 yr old son also loves to play this'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Hughes', N'carolyn.hughes5372@example.org', '2015-03-22', 4, N'Drakengard is a game that requires determination in order to have fun. The graphics and sound are meh, the controls and camera are difficult to get used to, and it requires a guide to get the most out of it. The creativity and grimness of the storyline and the flaws of the main characters are the real reason to play. Things are bad in the world of Drakengard, and the game shows you how worse things can go from there. At first it seems like a generic hack and slash fantasy where the hero makes a pact with a dragon to fight an evil empire. Things are fairly straightforward even thought things seem off, somehow. Beating the game unlocks branching paths in the main story, and you can go back and meet the requirements to get the next of the five endings. After the first ending is where things go off the rails, with the game getting darker and more insane with each ending you unlock. Unfortunately the game did have some censorship, leaving me scratching my head at the actions of the...'),
(N'Jose', N'Hughes', N'jose.hughes3812@example.org', '2015-03-22', 4, N'Nice'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brooks', N'katherine.brooks8235@example.org', '2015-03-22', 4, N'When I purchased my PS3 I always had a charging system that allowed me to fill the batteries during periods of non-use. It was stylish and worked well. This is pretty much the next evolution of that. I really enjoy the standalone system as it''s better to display the controllers/keep them in one spot. The only thing I don''t care for is the way they are sat down into the dock. It doesn''t always feel intuitive and you may have to engage it again to activate the charging. That being said, it definitely fulfills my need for a standalone charger and would still recommend it.'),
(N'Larry', N'Okonkwo', N'larry.okonkwo2850@example.org', '2015-03-22', 5, N'A++++'),
(N'Thomas', N'Ruiz', N'thomas.ruiz8617@example.net', '2015-03-22', 5, N'good prices'),
(N'Carlos', N'Nguyen', N'carlos.nguyen2960@example.net', '2015-03-22', 5, N'excelent'),
(N'Diane', N'Stewart', N'diane.stewart4054@example.net', '2015-03-22', 4, N'Pretty good, good story line, changes a lot, like it pretty much up to the airport, then same old Dice vehicle bull where you hit them and yet you die....just like having to shoot somebody five times before they die and the fact there are always 20 to one odds and 700 bullets hitting around you.....just Dice garbage....other than that it would be a 5....kids love the multiplayer options.....only one save issue this time, when he got the computer out of the trunk it attempted to save and froze, but no progress was lost on restart....for Dice that is great. Played it through three times and what I really detest is you don''t get your weapons until later in the game, it keeps dribbling them out and it seems they are always different and when I used the really good rifles I would hit guys three times in the head and leg and grown at less than 100 yards...they on the other hand can use a shotgun at that range and do damage to me or obliterate statues, statues my rifle won''t do the same...'),
(N'Marcus', N'Mendoza', N'marcus.mendoza2141@example.org', '2015-03-23', 4, N'The cable worked, but using this with a 2.1a charger didn''t seem to work as well as the OEM charger. In the end, I only use this in a pinch.'),
(N'Robert', N'Ross', N'robert.ross2600@example.com', '2015-03-23', 5, N'These games are incredible and this 2 disc set makes it easy to play them(you only need to download MGS1 &VR from the PS store with the included code. I had never played these games before but they hold up incredibly well. The Bluepoint hd remakes of 2 and 3 are exceptionally well done. Hats off to Kojima Productions and Bluepoint for this stellar collection. It allowed me to play MGS1-4 and I''ll be messing around with Peacewalker as MGSV TPP approaches'),
(N'Angela', N'Ivanov', N'angela.ivanov1257@example.net', '2015-03-23', 4, N'This was a gift, husband seemed to like it!'),
(N'Janet', N'Hughes', N'janet.hughes8975@example.com', '2015-03-23', 5, N'Fantastic Game if you are into the story. PC is the platform to play it on, unless you have the XBOX ONE to play the Master Chief collection. If you have windows 7-10 you may need to update Games for Windows Live'),
(N'Adam', N'Chen', N'adam.chen6256@example.com', '2015-03-23', 4, N'My 5 and 7 year old love this game. Yikes! Yes, I let my 5 and 7 year old play video games...in fact, my oldest started playing when he was 4. FOR SHAME!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Price', N'brandon.price9458@example.org', '2015-03-23', 4, N'Just Dance 2015 is a great game to play with friends. It is not as fun single player but when you have more people this game is great to play. The songs are up to date and popular but not all songs are free and you have to buy some of them whereas others rotate every few weeks. Recommend if you have friends and children over frequently.'),
(N'Donna', N'Butler', N'donna.butler2866@example.net', '2015-03-23', 4, N'Kid loves it...'),
(N'Diane', N'Reed', N'diane.reed9799@example.net', '2015-03-23', 5, N'I obsessed over this game for a few months with 3 friends and nearly 100%''d it. People complained that it wasn''t a true MMO or you didn''t have enough options for accessories, but i thought it was fine.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Evans', N'lucia.evans2414@example.net', '2015-03-23', 1, N'garbage'),
(N'Olivia', N'Bailey', N'olivia.bailey3842@example.net', '2015-03-23', 2, N'Well, if all you want to do is race other people online then buy it,but if you are looking forward to some type of A.I. play or story line....stay away.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Smith', N'joseph.smith8735@example.net', '2015-03-23', 5, N'Great game Thank you :)'),
(N'Joyce', N'Collins', N'joyce.collins7169@example.com', '2015-03-23', 4, N'Didn''t save, and I realized this after my brother got to Violet City. Though I was expecting for it to not save, I installed the battery and then it was able to save his adventures. Though, at one point, the game malfunctioned and he made the terrible decision to save in a glitchy state and he lost his Ho-Oh, Lugia, and Feraligatr... It was a goft from me to him, I was going to go through Gold to find all the Pokemon I couldn''t find in Silver, but he wanted my 2nd Pokemon Silver copy, so I killed two birds with one stone and gave him Gold.'),
(N'Larry', N'Kelly', N'larry.kelly9709@example.net', '2015-03-23', 5, N'Cool game'),
(N'Noah', N'Wright', N'noah.wright2789@example.net', '2015-03-24', 5, N'yes. i love it. thank you.'),
(N'Frank', N'Ortiz', N'frank.ortiz7919@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'Great product.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Castillo', N'ethan.castillo9250@example.net', '2015-03-24', 5, N'I love this game! This game is a challenge and to me a challenge is what you want in a good game! I am telling you this Do not look at the bad reviews! This game is totaly awesome and is so much fun!! Only a loser that can''t play video games gave this game a bad review!!!!! Grow up and learn to play video games, and shut the blank up!!!!!!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Perry', N'jacob.perry3879@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'gave as a gift'),
(N'Ashley', N'Thompson', N'ashley.thompson9806@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'The super Mario bros Luigi amiibo is a lot better than the smash one and bigger too!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Price', N'tomasz.price5816@example.net', '2015-03-24', 4, N'This was a gift for a 12 year girl that had live hamsters at the time I bought this for her. She was a hamster-aholic. The game was fun and lasted a few years before she outgrew it. We gave it to my niece and she used it for a couple of years on and off.'),
(N'Dee', N'Long', N'dee.long9532@example.org', '2015-03-24', 3, N'Remote works fine and is pretty good quality. My only complaint would be that the joysticks seem to get a little more loose than I would like for having such minimal wear on them. Edit: The joysticks get more loose with more wear, and I more more so than you would expect from something of better quality. The remote still works alright, but more precise tasks can be very difficult and annoying.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brooks', N'katherine.brooks8235@example.org', '2015-03-24', 4, N'Lego games of late have been quite enjoyable. I really like the fact that they keep adding new franchises and ways to play that is fun for all ages. This time we get to use the massive roster of Marvel Characters. Spider-Man, Wolverine, Dead Pool, Iron Man, Hulk, and many others are present. One of the aspects I like is how diverse the ability set of each character is. In addition to this you can also explore new york as any of the unlockable characters to find new items to unlock and areas to explore. Each mission features a wide variety of marvel heroes and villains to include classic pairings from multiple series. Boss fights are fun and unique as is common in most LEGO games. It is fun to play by yourself or locally with a friend through a variety of stages that seem well thought out. The graphics are also pretty nice and represent each character well. The voice acting is really good as well. They seemed to have used the actors who play them in animated series and others to...'),
(N'Eric', N'Peterson', N'eric.peterson6044@example.com', '2015-03-24', 5, N'Awesome deal at $329. Best Xmas present from my wife.'),
(N'Eric', N'Peterson', N'eric.peterson6044@example.com', '2015-03-24', 5, N'A must-have for any Borderlands fan. The cost of the DLC included on disc is well worth the price. 2 awesome games that I plan on wasting a few hundred more hours of my life playing.'),
(N'Amara', N'Hill', N'amara.hill8383@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'Excellent!!!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Wood', N'kevin.wood7876@example.net', '2015-03-24', 5, N'great'),
(N'Brandon', N'Cox', N'brandon.cox2641@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'James', N'Stewart', N'james.stewart6111@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'The PlayStation 4 is a great console. Last gen I was a big fan of the Xbox 360 because it was cheaper, the games looked better, the online service was better, and the constant addition of apps like Netflix and Hulu were awesome. This time around, the PS4 seems to have that going for it. As I write this, the PS4 is 16 months old, and already we''ve seen the addition of apps and features that weren''t present at launch, like YouTube, HBO Go, and Share Play. And there are more on the way. I haven''t personally compared the graphics between the PS4 and it''s rival the Xbox One, but from what I''ve read on gaming sites like IGN and GameSpot, cross-platform games like Dragon Age or Assassin''s Creed run at a native 1080p resolution on the PS4, whereas they run at a slightly lower resolution (typically 900p) on the Xbox One. As time passes, we may see this discrepancy disappear, but as it stands now, the PS4 has a slight edge over Xbox One in graphics. The PS4 controller is also much better...'),
(N'Charles', N'Campbell', N'charles.campbell2814@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'It just works. Pros Works as advertised Keeps the kinect mounted Great deal Overall it works just fine'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Clark', N'kathleen.clark4358@example.com', '2015-03-24', 5, N'10 points!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Young', N'ashley.young8700@example.com', '2015-03-24', 4, N'Good game. Had good mechanics, fun aspects from the book, and I enjoyed it to the end.'),
(N'Judith', N'Rogers', N'judith.rogers9538@example.org', '2015-03-24', 4, N'gift for friend which they have enjoyed'),
(N'Peter', N'Ross', N'peter.ross4131@example.com', '2015-03-24', 5, N'Amazing headset, since I wear glasses they don''t press against my ears and they''re very comfortable even after hours of game play. Sound is amazing and people can heart me clearly!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Barnes', N'tomasz.barnes2696@example.com', '2015-03-24', 5, N'item as discribed'),
(N'Lucia', N'Moore', N'lucia.moore4484@example.net', '2015-03-24', 4, N'For the first time in a Sherlock Holmes game, I felt like I was doing the actual detecting. Pouring over clues and crime scenes and arriving at my own deductions. Just like Sherlock, I was figuring out, whodunnit! Sure, the puzzles can be bad! They weren''t horrible, but a few of the puzzles seemed "Forced", for lack of a better word. Still, it didn''t impact my level of enjoyment! Not even in the slightest! In fact, I would say that this title is the best Sherlock game released(With the Awakening coming in a close second!). Everything about this game, from it''s beautiful locals and stunning graphics, to the amazing voice acting. It all piles together to create the most incredible Sherlock Holmes gaming experience to date.'),
(N'Mark', N'Nelson', N'mark.nelson8934@example.com', '2015-03-24', 5, N'i miss when they called them Microsoft points :''('),
(N'Ivan', N'Chen', N'ivan.chen1438@example.org', '2015-03-24', 5, N'My biggest fear with purchasing an ''off-brand'' mouse was the hardware quality. My second biggest fear, which I wouldn''t blame most people for ignoring outright, is the quality of the software that drives the mouse. Redragon nails both sides of the equation with great care. [Hardware] Materials - The internals are top of the line; you are getting OEM parts for other high end mice in this unit. There''s no disputing the raw performance power of this mouse. There''s no glitchy movement, staggering, lag, or lift jitter. Under the hood, this mouse is incredible. - The external materials don''t compare to the quality of the internals, but they aren''t terrible in any way. Right off the bat, I can tell you there are no defects with the plastic. You won''t find any injection points that leave a rough edge. Care was taken to make this mouse feel premium, not just look it from afar. You''re getting barebones plastic for the red decals -- that means no shiny clear coat that we always take for...'),
(N'Amy', N'Myers', N'amy.myers8974@example.com', '2015-03-25', 5, N'Best game, but similar to Mario Kart 7, only i say the DLC are the best new stuff for a Mario Kart Game'),
(N'Richard', N'Lewis', N'richard.lewis1810@example.net', '2015-03-25', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Ashley', N'Thompson', N'ashley.thompson9806@example.org', '2015-03-25', 5, N'This is such an amazing case!! The NES controller is so awesome!!!! It is a rubberized stamp type thing that they glue onto the case, as opposed to a picture printed on it(like the HORI retro Mario & Luigi cases we own). Very durable and easy to open/close. Fits the MM New 3DS XL perfectly! The Black and Gray look so nice together. This is a must have to protect and compliment any New 3DS XL!!'),
(N'Michael', N'Patel', N'michael.patel3489@example.net', '2015-03-25', 3, N'Has its problems, the ear piece is too tight and hurts my ears. The mic doesn''t work and the arc on the top cracked too easily.'),
(N'Robert', N'Ramos', N'robert.ramos3827@example.com', '2015-03-25', 5, N'This has to be one of the best deals in gaming, ever. Five great games, all the DLC, hundreds and hundreds of hours of game play - for less than half the cost of a new game. In fact, this collection - this anthology - was cheaper than buying the complete version of the newest game in this series! Meaning it was cheaper for me to buy all 5 games, than just one. And, yes, the Anthology had everything the newest game had to offer. The Elder Scrolls franchise is one of the best RPG series ever. Search Twitch for Skyrim, read the reviews for Skyrim, Oblivion, and even Morrowind. You will be hard pressed to find a bad review for any of these games. Two things you need to know before buying this collection. 1. The first two games - Arena and Daggerfall - are both available for free on the Elder Scrolls website. You do not have to buy anything to get those two games. The company is giving them away. It''s not a limited time offer, either. (At least as far as I can tell - it''s been going on...'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Hernandez', N'rebecca.hernandez4031@example.com', '2015-03-25', 5, N'When I said "gettin rid of it" meant for fighting games like skullgirls/street fighter/ blazblue etc and "lookin at the gun" shooters. For games like kingdom hearts, rpgs in general there''s still a use for it :/ Those games use 2 analogues, which can be done on a keyboard/mouse too but seriously prefer gamepads for that type of game. These are the sturdiest default gamepads I''ve seen tbh. Wiimotes pretty sturdy too but that''s a different topic. Not too sure on the third dualshock but the 2nd and 4th dualshocks are very sturdy too. Rechargeable batteries recommended since those last a looong while before permanent discharge.'),
(N'Donald', N'Richardson', N'donald.richardson1078@example.org', '2015-03-25', 5, N'Fits well. Makes the 3DS a little bulky, but that''s why I got this. My hands would hurt/cramp after 10minutes of using the DS.... I don''t have extremely large hands. This works & feels great!'),
(N'Henry', N'Price', N'henry.price2013@example.com', '2015-03-25', 5, N'I never liked games like Gran Turismo before I bought this, now I love them.'),
(N'Donna', N'Martinez', N'donna.martinez7038@example.com', '2015-03-25', 5, N'Amazing!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Bell', N'christopher.bell1022@example.org', '2015-03-25', 4, N'I absolutely love this game. It''s my second copy of this. I enjoy the RTS aspect and the LOTR setting. Sometimes my game has a habit if freezing a couple of frames when I issue a command. The units also don''t do the action sometimes in large battles. Also, when you try to position the units it''s a bit clunky and akward. Other than that, it''s a hell Lotta fun I can play it and never get bored!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Henderson', N'andrea.henderson6938@example.org', '2015-03-25', 4, N'This one is ok....pretty fun. Seems like less good songs than #4...but satisfactory.'),
(N'Charles', N'Turner', N'charles.turner5755@example.org', '2015-03-25', 5, N'Arrived on time and was what I exactly excepted!!'),
(N'Charles', N'Russell', N'charles.russell3078@example.com', '2015-03-25', 4, N'Great game overall as the variety of the mini-games is quite impressive (although some get old very quick) and it''s easy to play (especially if you have kids as I do). The use of the gamepad is quite good when it comes to Bowser and we had quite some laughs with it. The graphics are great and quite a step up from previous Mario Party games. Everything is crisp and clean and the animations are very good too. All in all, Mario Party 10 continues the legacy of the series without trying too many new things but the game wasn''t that broken to start with. The core is basically the same with a few bells and whistles thrown on to shake up formula. If youve been enjoying Mario Party games then this is definitely the game for you. However, if it has been getting stale, or you''re looking for a more skill-based experience, you might want to look at other games. When it comes down to it though, youll rarely have a better time with a few of your friends then when you''re playing.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Ferreira', N'jonathan.ferreira2722@example.org', '2015-03-25', 5, N'Another great addition to the Mario series. Had a lot of fun playing this one.'),
(N'Laura', N'Moore', N'laura.moore1365@example.net', '2015-03-25', 5, N'Game works perfect. I didn''t have any issues with it skipping because not once did it skip while playing. Also, it was professionally cleansed. I appreciate that.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Reyes', N'cynthia.reyes8320@example.com', '2015-03-26', 4, N'it''s ok'),
(N'Kofi', N'Perez', N'kofi.perez7845@example.net', '2015-03-26', 5, N'Amazing game. Great remake. Fast shipping.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Russell', N'jacqueline.russell4392@example.com', '2015-03-26', 3, N'I recently felt the urge for some old school Nintendo games. After seeing how expensive N64''s and SNES consoles and games were, I learned that I could play some old games on the Wii U virtual console. On top of that, it plays the original Wii games and this bundle is only $350...a great deal for what you are getting. However, now is where my problem fits in. The virtual console only has a select few NES, SNES, and GBA games. On top of that, it seems you really have to do your homework on which controllers go to which games. I assumed the gamepad and an additional Wii U pro controller would allow me to play any games. Wrong. To play original Wii games you need a Wii mote, but the good news is your old Wii motes work on the Wii U. Finally, the biggest flaw with the Wii U and the straw that broke the camels back and made me send this bundle back was the lack of games. I''m 22 years old keep in mind, so while I enjoy the nostalgia of playing a few Mario games, it seems like there was no...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Phillips', N'ronald.phillips5673@example.com', '2015-03-26', 5, N'very good!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Hernandez', N'aaron.hernandez2277@example.com', '2015-03-26', 4, N'son likes it'),
(N'Nicole', N'Barnes', N'nicole.barnes1725@example.org', '2015-03-26', 5, N'it works i guess lol'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Henderson', N'jacqueline.henderson1160@example.com', '2015-03-26', 4, N'Great Hori product. My only compliant is that the case is larger then necessary by about a half inch all around. Pictured is the standard Hori case and the NES case side by side.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Allen', N'kevin.allen2351@example.com', '2015-03-26', 4, N'It''s hard to describe Mario Party 10. I used to play Mario Party 1-3 a lot and this game is clearly different. To play this game you need a Wii Remote per player and an Amiibo per player if you are doing Amiibo mode. Mario Party mode is supposed to be the main mode for 1-4 players. It seems cooperative instead of competitive when you ride around together and collect just one thing, ministars. As you travel around the board you will fight a couple of bosses which is a fun thing to do together but you don''t get much of my favorite thing, the mini games. In classic Mario Party you would get a mini game after everyone''s turn. In this new Mario Party mode you only get a minigame if you happen to land on the right spaces. By the end of the first game I was really let down. It wasn''t super fun and we barely played any mini games. I gave it another chance though and we had more fun on the Chaos Castle map but overall the level of fun the board offers seems to highly depend on which spaces...'),
(N'Donald', N'Roberts', N'donald.roberts3047@example.com', '2015-03-26', 5, N'Great game got for my son and it arrived fast!'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Ortiz', N'carolyn.ortiz1489@example.com', '2015-03-26', 4, N'I love all of these complainers. People hated Sims 2 when it first came out. People hated Sims 3 when it came out. Now people hate Sims 4 and say how much better Sims 2 and 3 are. Folks, don''t you think that maybe the problem isn''t the game that it is YOU???'),
(N'Edward', N'Watson', N'edward.watson1767@example.org', '2015-03-26', 4, N'I Much rather have 1st party for this device, but they are a rarity at the moment. As advertised this works and looks identically to the Nintendo brand. The only issue I''ve had thus far with this device is having 4 wave birds plugged in and and being used at the same time. A couple of the wave birds started to stutter (is was very obvious when holding the thumb stick to side). At first i thought it was an issue with frequencies and spaced out all controllers further out. but still had the same problem. I eventually unplugged the 4th receiver since it wasn''t being used, and it seemed to have corrected the problem. Once i realized this i plugged the fourth back in and it seems as if adapter could not handle powering all 4 controllers (this was evident as the receiver light would flicker instead of staying permanently lit when a button on the wave bird is held down). For this reason I will not give it a fifth star. I''m not sure if this is just a defect, or if it just can''t handle...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Taylor', N'joshua.taylor4966@example.org', '2015-03-26', 3, N'quick short review.... if you play games on normal/medium... you will hate this. challenging game that makes you constantly start from the begining of the chapter every time you die. there is no difficulty setting. its basically just one and its set to hard. i put in 8hrs into this game. i started off dying instantly. but the more i played the further i would get. if you are the type of person that plays games on normal difficulty like me you will hate this. no this is not a hack and slash game. it requires quick timing and skill. i did take my time but still got my ass handed to me. starting all the way back at the begining checkpoint which let me tell you are far and few between gets annoying as hell. having to refight every enemy you already patiently took the time to beat. yes you will get to bosses and if you die well.... reload way back to your starting checkpoint again.... you won''t even restart at the begining of the boss battle so keep that in mind and remember all the...'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Morgan', N'jacqueline.morgan8063@example.net', '2015-03-26', 5, N'This product has excellent response, feel, look, and functionality! I have used this for years on every racing game I have and it''s amazing! No regrets!'),
(N'Lisa', N'Cruz', N'lisa.cruz6672@example.net', '2015-03-26', 4, N'One of my favorite hidden object games, it is very original and beautiful to play, the puzzles are not too hard and not too easy. The story is cool leaves you with a sense of nostalgia. The only reason I didn''t give 5 stars is the graphics could be better on the cut scenes, which are a bit dated.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Cruz', N'lisa.cruz6672@example.net', '2015-03-26', 4, N'Fun game to pass the time. Good story line with nice scenery, not too hard or too easy.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Roberts', N'cynthia.roberts5259@example.org', '2015-03-26', 5, N'Works great! Fyi: you might need to set your component input type in the ps2 menu. It''s in the list where you set your clock. If you have no component cable, Google exactly what buttons you need to press to change the setting.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Wright', N'nancy.wright8211@example.net', '2015-03-27', 5, N'Worked like a charm'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ramos', N'dennis.ramos4705@example.org', '2015-03-27', 5, N'I used to own World Heroes Jet for the Neo Geo AES and enjoyed playing that game but overall I can''t say I am a huge fan of the World Heroes series. But regardless this is a nice complete collection of the World Heroes franchise originally released for the Playstation 2 which includes World Heroes 1,2,Jet,Perfect. The games control well and remind me of the old days on the Neo Geo with the big, colorful and goofy sprites. These compilations were pretty common during the PS2 days but unfortunately we don''t see much of it on the newer consoles(now it is mostly single game downloads of the retro games). When I bought this years ago it was only about nine bucks brand new on Amazon, what a great deal for four complete Neo Geo games.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Jimenez', N'rachel.jimenez1766@example.com', '2015-03-27', 4, N'It''s obvious reading the one star reviews that a high percentage of the reviewers are just trolling. There is no way that this game deserves a one star. Of course this game is hard. This game is frustrating, hair pulling, scream at the tv, show some restraint before whipping your controller off the wall- HARD. But that''s what keeps bringing me back for more! Aside from obvious troll reviews that are knocking "30-40 second load times" (untrue), I think the honest to goodness negative reviews of Bloodborne are due to folks not understanding what they were buying. Everyone is eager for something new to play on PS4 and along comes a nice new next gen title that has monsters and bloodshed in a Victorian setting. I believe that people who bought in were expecting a sexy new God of War hack and slash type of action game, yet what they got was an insanely frustrating and confidence debilitating test of will. So, most players pop the game in, get their butts whipped for an hour and then...'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Tanaka', N'elizabeth.tanaka1154@example.org', '2015-03-27', 4, N'There okay few things I noticed though 1. The joysticks squeak a lot which they shouldn''t be. 2 the controllers have a weird texture to them but I think its normal its just my older ones are smooth and not rough'),
(N'Julie', N'Wood', N'julie.wood2369@example.com', '2015-03-27', 5, N'First off the gravity abilities are awesome and hoping that this game gets integrated onto its big brother. The story starts off with this girl that could control gravity and from there the story never fails. The visual effects and graphics are cool looking and its worth the admission. My only complain is that there''s no targeting button just a auto-lock which helps 80 percent of the time. I love open world games and Gravity Rush is a worthily play on your portable PS Vita.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Clark', N'timothy.clark9049@example.net', '2015-03-27', 2, N'This game has to many problems. The load times are to long,the check points are far and you have to fight everything again when you die. The weapon upgrades are also bad. And anytime you want to get new stuff you have go through like three load times. The game is hard and you die a lot so whats fun about that. People with out a life will love the game but video games are suppose to be fun, this is not. Save your money and wait for witcher or a game that is worth your money. Unless you want to play the same level over an over again.'),
(N'Amara', N'Wang', N'amara.wang1585@example.net', '2015-03-27', 1, N'Bad game. As everything Capcom is doing lately.'),
(N'Omar', N'Wright', N'omar.wright4849@example.net', '2015-03-27', 1, N'Not what is expected'),
(N'Samantha', N'Okonkwo', N'samantha.okonkwo2018@example.org', '2015-03-27', 5, N'For over 14 hours I tried uploading an 87mb video on this product and it still has not completed the process. Darn it, I hate DSL upload speeds! Unfortunately you will have to look elsewhere for a looks at the mouse and it''s software. Now for the mouse. I love it. Ergonomically it''s very comfortable and the 6 buttons are in the exact places need them. I do not have large hands so how it fits you may be different. The buttons click very nicely. The color scheme with its 16.8 billion different colors is an attractive addition but matters little. All surfaces are smooth, meaning no rubber covering or textures. Under heavy play those with sweaty hands may have issues. The pixart 3366 laser chip is the most accurate laser on the market so the speed and accuracy is the best you''ll find. I have the Logitech G5 gaming mouse (an awesome mouse) and this much less expensive G303 is just as fast if not faster. The interactive software (which you can download from their website product support...'),
(N'James', N'Alvarez', N'james.alvarez5710@example.net', '2015-03-27', 5, N'Nephew loves it.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Cruz', N'elizabeth.cruz6764@example.org', '2015-03-28', 5, N'There are many features I don''t use on this mouse, but as a high precision mouse, it is the cats meow. One niggle is that some windows boxes (like the amazon search box) don''t like for you to select things with it. I usually have a cheap dell connected for that. Very precise though.'),
(N'Daniel', N'King', N'daniel.king7040@example.org', '2015-03-28', 3, N'It could have better game play and the non-reflective and non-transparent windows knock my game review down by two stars. Also, the nearly constant suggestions to hack phones, security cameras, traffic lights and door locks is demanding and problem solving is linear but on the lighter side, the vehicle driving physics is excellent. The huge open world mapping in near future Chicago is pretty accurate. No glitches to report yet.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Jenkins', N'tomasz.jenkins5322@example.com', '2015-03-28', 4, N'Shadow of the Colossus is an extremely hard game to judge for me personally. It basically does everything I dislike about games, but somehow, miraculously, I''m able to ignore most of these personal issues I have and enjoy the game. Seriously, this is incredible! I''m giving this game a high rating based on one or two amazing features. I feel guilty for doing so too. This game relies entirely on a murky, desolated but surprisingly realistic-looking outdoor environment. It takes the exploration emptiness of many famous Zelda games (at the time of this games release in 2005 however, the only logical comparison would be Ocarina of Time even though Twilight Princess and Skyward Sword definitely feel closer to Shadow of the Colossus''s gameplay in my opinion) and the entire concept of Shadow of the Colossus is to defeat gigantic stone-shaped colossal-sized creatures roaming around. These creatures are downright frightening, realistic and intense. I LOVE them! To an extent, they basically...'),
(N'Patrick', N'Murphy', N'patrick.murphy8834@example.org', '2015-03-28', 3, N'This is one of those products that seems to fit a need, until you realize the number of faults that the overall design of the unit itself has. Anyone who had an Xbox 360 knows about overheating issues. They happened fairly often and at times the results were bad, very bad. The Xbox One is designed to have better cooling, air flow, etc - but Antec is playing off of past generation concerns here. That''s not entirely bad, a cooler console is never really a bad thing. Set up is easy, it comes with a 4" USB cable, rests on top of the Xbox One and plugs into the back USB port for power. Easy peezie to set up. There are even little rubber soles to prevent the unit from scratching the actual console. Now the not so good stuff. First off if you can not look down at your console, you will have a difficult time reading the temp as it is displayed ontop of the actual unit. Second, it blows the hot air out the back of the unit. Depending on where you have your console set up, and what type of...'),
(N'George', N'Allen', N'george.allen7946@example.org', '2015-03-28', 5, N'This is how a remaster is done, it has all 4 halo games on one disk. Halo 2 is completly redone from graphics to sound, and all games are smooth 1080p 60fps. The multiplayer is just pure heaven. U have all the dlc thats ever came out. Dont listen to the ppl that are saying the muliplayer is still broken, bc there lying or most likey sony fanboys trying to get attention. Do yourself a favor if you have nevrr played halo or just a long time fan of the series, go out and get this game! Worth every penny.'),
(N'Karen', N'Ortiz', N'karen.ortiz1728@example.org', '2015-03-28', 4, N'My SON loves this game! Ok, I like it too. I wish it were 2 player Coop tho. But the medieval sword, shield and bow action is pretty darn fun with the move. The shurikens? Not so much.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Jackson', N'nancy.jackson6887@example.org', '2015-03-28', 5, N'what can I say about this its just so great me and my friends gamed with it super smash bros and it was awesome must buy'),
(N'Mark', N'Tanaka', N'mark.tanaka3012@example.net', '2015-03-28', 3, N'good'),
(N'Mark', N'Tanaka', N'mark.tanaka3012@example.net', '2015-03-28', 3, N'okay'),
(N'Mark', N'Tanaka', N'mark.tanaka3012@example.net', '2015-03-28', 3, N'Okay'),
(N'Patrick', N'Moore', N'patrick.moore2852@example.com', '2015-03-28', 5, N'Good Bundle, and now with the latest update the Borderlands 2 game runs good.'),
(N'Scott', N'Adams', N'scott.adams4173@example.org', '2015-03-28', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Green', N'rebecca.green7369@example.org', '2015-03-28', 5, N'Perfect. If you haven''t played yet - you need to. If you have - come back for more. I don''t miss the original Borderlands in this package because 2 was by far a better game. I tried playing TPS on PS3, but after playing PS4 games for a year prior, the framerate and performance (especially out on the surface of planets) just seemed awful and unplayable. Perhaps that was a function of being "spoiled" by next gen performance. But the game performs great on PS4. I''m eager to dump a ton of hours into both games, even after getting a platinum for B2 on PS3. Heck, there''s always new character to play. In summary: So value. Very goodness. Such smooth.'),
(N'Jose', N'Hughes', N'jose.hughes5304@example.com', '2015-03-28', 5, N'Skyrim, in my opinion, is the best game ever made. It is easy to play, yet hard to conquer and it is HUGE. You can easily play it for hundreds of hours, which makes it a great deal, especially at this price. Now originally, I bought the standard edition when it first came out. I always wanted the three add-on''s for this game, but didn''t want to pay the additional price. So imagine my ecstasy when I realized that I could re-buy the Legendary Edition for a mere $20, and get all three add-on''s WITH it (as verses paying $50 for those three add-on''s purchased individually). That was a bargain, and I could not resist. Installation was simple as can be. This is a Steam Powered supported game. If you have the original standard edition installed, you do not even have to put in the CD/DVD that comes with this box. All you have to do is go to Steam and enter in the registration code inside the cover and bingo, it automatically upgrades the entire game with all the add-on''s. How simple is THAT????'),
(N'Amanda', N'Green', N'amanda.green5148@example.org', '2015-03-28', 3, N'Cool game but tedious!!..I''m stuck and can''t progress further!!..Makes me a bit dubious of trying the other Batman games!!..Sorry!!...'),
(N'Megan', N'Bennett', N'megan.bennett2747@example.org', '2015-03-29', 1, N'I wanted to like this game, I really did. First off, I have played the original Majora''s Mask and loved it, still do, but this is the "for Dummies" version of that game. There are unnecessary, and unwanted, tips and notices for the game every time you talk to someone or do something even remotely related to an event, courtesy of the Bomber''s Notebook they force on you. To make matters even better, the bosses were dumbed down so that even the greatest of morons could beat them while sustaining little to no damage, isn''t that fun? There were a lot of changes that seem to serve no actual purpose, like allowing ice arrows to work only on shiny patches of water. One of my bigger gripes is with the movements of the Zora and Goron that were changed. First off you have to spend magic to get the Zora to move at it''s original speed. That is bad enough on its own, but doing so uses the magic shield and can be distracting because rather than paying attention to where you''re going you get to...'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Taylor', N'stephanie.taylor3360@example.org', '2015-03-29', 5, N'Good game, thanks'),
(N'Wei', N'Edwards', N'wei.edwards6836@example.com', '2015-03-29', 5, N'Awesome expansion!'),
(N'Charles', N'Richardson', N'charles.richardson6267@example.net', '2015-03-29', 5, N'GREAT ITEM'),
(N'Robert', N'Patel', N'robert.patel2305@example.org', '2015-03-29', 1, N'Little about this game made any sense to me. They wanted an intricate, cinematic experience... but the story is lousy, slapdash and cut short, it ends in a completely senseless location. Also, why pick a cover shooter as opposed to making something more suitable for telling a story when gameplay isn''t that important to you? It''s a really poor cover shooter at that. REALLY stilted, broken up action, bad set pieces, a few good guns but they''re short lived, etc. On the plus side, the technology and aesthetic direction, while a bit... stiff at times, is very impressive overall... but that''s really all there is on display here. You likely won''t enjoy the plot, you likely won''t enjoy the few moments of stilted gameplay... it''s just not a good title.'),
(N'Wei', N'Powell', N'wei.powell9736@example.net', '2015-03-29', 5, N'great game for anybody who loves the Scribblenauts series.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Moore', N'barbara.moore5530@example.com', '2015-03-29', 2, N'Don''t waist your money. This game has no resemblance of sonic of past. The control of the character is hard. Plus the game is boring.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Rodriguez', N'cheryl.rodriguez1150@example.net', '2015-03-29', 4, N'Good so far.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Sanchez', N'rebecca.sanchez1295@example.com', '2015-03-29', 5, N'Great game. Still sealed, came with all downloadable content.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Taylor', N'hiroshi.taylor3615@example.net', '2015-03-29', 4, N'OK game, very scripted.'),
(N'Amara', N'Miller', N'amara.miller6889@example.net', '2015-03-29', 5, N'Great Game!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Baker', N'deborah.baker9681@example.net', '2015-03-29', 5, N'This grandma loves call of duty and this one was a great game , did not disappoint'),
(N'Judith', N'Khan', N'judith.khan4004@example.com', '2015-03-30', 5, N'Fun game. Kids have played it over and over. Got it for a good price and works very good.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Kim', N'ashley.kim8783@example.org', '2015-03-30', 4, N'What is that you say? Someone you know keeps saying how this game is like some "right of passage" for an adventure gamer? Well yes and no. For 2015 standards and in comparison to DarkSouls 1 and 2... the years are starting to show in some of the smaller details for poor demon souls. But that is also the hook, its like taking on Zelda 2, MegaMan or Metroid. There are few minor flaws in Demon Souls, but that is part of the experience. Edit: Forgot to clarify that world and look/graphics of this game are NOT something that has aged. Its like nothing else out there (that I know of anyway) Stingray graveyard? The biggest castles in any game EVER and poison swamp level that it more oppressively hostile than ANY other swamp level ever. I could go on and on but some of the levels are hard to describe. The levels could all be re released, as is, in a PS4 game as is and they would still stand up today. If you can get past the "farming" for upgrades and oppressively annoying "carry weight"...'),
(N'Carlos', N'Thomas', N'carlos.thomas6359@example.com', '2015-03-30', 4, N'good'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Clark', N'jennifer.clark4609@example.net', '2015-03-30', 5, N'Works Perfectly!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Cox', N'melissa.cox1520@example.org', '2015-03-30', 5, N'Excellent.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Bell', N'shirley.bell2938@example.net', '2015-03-30', 5, N'Awesome game, great fighter game.'),
(N'Scott', N'Wisniewski', N'scott.wisniewski8781@example.com', '2015-03-30', 5, N'I love the bundle it''s worth the price, don''t lisen to the 1 star review, they''ve just PlayStation fans trying to mess with your mind'),
(N'Linda', N'Sanders', N'linda.sanders7183@example.com', '2015-03-30', 5, N'I was iffy about this but it did what it needed to do. I wanted to start streaming my video games until I got a PC that was strong enough to do it. This worked perfectly in the meantime.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Jenkins', N'ryan.jenkins8781@example.com', '2015-03-30', 5, N'My son loves this game.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Brooks', N'sharon.brooks4416@example.com', '2015-03-30', 4, N'Ive had this headset for awhile now. So far they have held up well and for the most part work great. They don''t hurt my ears with my glasses on. The only drawback about the headset is the mic. Sometimes other people can''t hear me as well.'),
(N'Heather', N'Martinez', N'heather.martinez8776@example.com', '2015-03-30', 1, N'Purchased to refresh my memory. I use one star because to identify that I bought this item from Amazon and not to review.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Ramos', N'shirley.ramos9655@example.com', '2015-03-30', 5, N'Protector was very easy to install unlike other protectors that bubble up.'),
(N'Mei', N'Edwards', N'mei.edwards5125@example.com', '2015-03-30', 3, N'Better on p.c. but fun as a co op game'),
(N'Amara', N'Miller', N'amara.miller6889@example.net', '2015-03-30', 5, N'Nice!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Phillips', N'jacqueline.phillips3618@example.net', '2015-03-30', 5, N'great game!'),
(N'Matthew', N'James', N'matthew.james5606@example.com', '2015-03-31', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Christina', N'Fisher', N'christina.fisher5403@example.com', '2015-03-31', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Sharon', N'Khan', N'sharon.khan8171@example.net', '2015-03-31', 4, N'The initial Call of Duty: Advanced Warfare takes up Size: 48.97 GB and Call of Duty: Ghosts Size: 42.21 GB (not including DLC maps) Also I prefer the original hard-copy game disc rather than one-time-use-only download code. so I can resell the hard-copy disc later on. The basic Halo: The Master Chief Collection download will take up Size: 59.11 GB per the xbox.com store: store.xbox.com/.../f33009f4-14ff-4821-94e3-c3573c868c2e Now if you add Halo 2 plus add in every single map from all the DLC maps from all the Halo games plus download the new digital series, Halo: Nightfall, and access to the Halo 5: Guardians Multiplayer Beta and bump up the resolution and graphics the memory storage might be at least take up another 20-30GB. Also the Halo Collection disc Has A 20 GB Day-One Update. Makes it so the regular 500GB Xbox One Console will only hold like 10 games. Makes the 1TB hard drive a requirement or get The 2TB My Passport X portable hard drive ($85 Amazon) offers enough storage...'),
(N'Helen', N'Long', N'helen.long2357@example.net', '2015-03-31', 5, N'BOUGHT IT FOR MY GRANDSON AND HE LOVED IT'),
(N'Lucia', N'Mitchell', N'lucia.mitchell7913@example.net', '2015-03-31', 5, N'Wow just wow just like harvest moon but not the new harvest moon that sucked this store of season is amazing game and i will be playing all day love it'),
(N'Angela', N'Jimenez', N'angela.jimenez4754@example.org', '2015-03-31', 5, N'Finaly we have a final fantasy that has a similar feel to all the older ones graphic wise, game and story wise, they just seems to keept alot of tradation in this one more then there others. Hard to belive this was made after 13, mostly because 13 was so different and didn''t have alot of the elements we like about final fantasy. This game brings alot of it back and more with a awesome combat system that is slighly flawed by the camera and lock on system. Also had alot of great orignal characters. Story different then they usally. Alittle confusing at first. seems more like how there taking the story in final fantasy 15. I know alot of people are bothered by the graphics but come on its a psp remake its gonna look old they cant remake the game from scratch. It honesty amazing to me they can even do that sorta stuff. And if you look at the psp graphics the change is immense like one of the biggest diferences. If i had to have one complaint it be that the voices mostly just the...'),
(N'Amara', N'Richardson', N'amara.richardson7758@example.com', '2015-03-31', 3, N'Judgment is mediocre. It tries new things, some of which work and some of which don''t. The real problem here is Gears trying to be something it isn''t, what with various tweaks to gameplay, such as classes. And because it precedes the others chronologically, the narrative has no jeopardy, since all the main characters are certain to make it out alive. Just go play Gears 3; it''s a better game.'),
(N'Wei', N'Gutierrez', N'wei.gutierrez8229@example.net', '2015-03-31', 5, N'The best baseball game year after year'),
(N'Daniel', N'Phillips', N'daniel.phillips9807@example.net', '2015-04-01', 5, N'Absolutely love this PS Vita. I have owned a PSP, 3DSXL, Gameboy and Gameboy Advance - this one is definitely a PSP on roids. Very elegant The screen is amazing - large and clear (I did not see the original one with the OLED so cannot compare) The button placement and sizes are perfect for a handheld, it fits well in your hands, although I would recommend the Comfort Grip accessories if you were planning on playing for a long time in one setting (my thumbs get a little sore without one) Both the front and back touch screens are responsive and crisp Sound is not out of this world, but definitely on par. My only complaint about this is the Wifi - it does lose connection every so often even though it will show Full bars and 90% connectivity and I can be right next to my router. My 3DS never had this problem or any of my other wireless devices. It happens intermittently, but that''s too often if you play online a lot (I do not). OK - one other complaint - the Proprietary memory card...'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Evans', N'jeffrey.evans9557@example.com', '2015-04-01', 5, N'great game but requires very powerful computer'),
(N'Megan', N'Lewis', N'megan.lewis7927@example.org', '2015-04-01', 4, N'As an 18 year old, this was my first Rune Factory/Harvest Moon game. I haven''t beaten it, but I''m enjoying it well enough so far. I don''t really understand the comparisons to Animal Crossing, but on its own the game is definitely a game I''m happy to play. Story''s not horribly interesting past the first few hours and overall I find myself doing the life-simulator aspects more than I feel I should, but still. It''s cute and fun, I''d recommend it for anyone under 13 and anyone over that looking for nostalgia or a cute little timewaste.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Richardson', N'stephanie.richardson4584@example.org', '2015-04-01', 5, N'The G303 is an optical (not laser) mouse with an insanely accurate sensor. The design is symmetrical, although the forward and back buttons are on the left side of the mouse. I play a lot of FPS, especially Team Fortress 2, and I found this mouse easy to adjust to after using a much heavier, asymmetrical G5 for the past few years. The box contains only the mouse. Logitech no longer includes a driver or software in the box. If you want to use all of the mouse''s features, you have to go to Logitech''s website and download their latest gaming drivers and software. As for features, the mouse is straightforward. You have the obvious left and right buttons along with a clickable scroll wheel. This scroll wheel does not use the Logitech technology that lets it spin freely -- it is a click wheel with a definite feeling of resistance between each click. There are forward and back buttons on the left side of the mouse. Below the scroll wheel is a button that allows you to switch among four...'),
(N'Laura', N'Thomas', N'laura.thomas7435@example.org', '2015-04-01', 4, N'I had this game for both Xbox 360 and Nintendo Wii the Xbox/PS3 version is great but the Wii/PS2 version is ok I recommend for the 360 and PS3 more than the Wii or PS2'),
(N'Henry', N'Patel', N'henry.patel4771@example.net', '2015-04-01', 2, N'Best handheld MLB game isn''t here... it''s on Android/iOS it seems. We''ve got RBI 15, and it looks to be an improvement over this sloppy mess on Vita. Sony ONLY cares about the PS4 version, and that''s a total mess at this point, same things as the last several years, just with new textures/skins.'),
(N'Henry', N'Patel', N'henry.patel4771@example.net', '2015-04-01', 1, N'Being the only M.L.B game out this year , Sony could have just put out a new roster and slap some nice graphics and save some money , and release mlb 2015, but they didn''t and you can see they went all out this year, improving every aspect of last year game. Kudos for Sony , i love to see a game get the proper treatment it deserves, The Show 2015 is great for beginners and advance players , so if you like baseball even a little you will enjoy this game , This game really shows off the power of the playstation 4 im glad its exclusive. <3'),
(N'Brandon', N'Fisher', N'brandon.fisher3673@example.com', '2015-04-01', 3, N'Old game still runs on Win 10!'),
(N'Helen', N'Ortiz', N'helen.ortiz3147@example.org', '2015-04-02', 5, N'Excellent product at a great price. Thanks Amazon.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ramos', N'rachel.ramos9996@example.org', '2015-04-02', 5, N'great'),
(N'Betty', N'Foster', N'betty.foster1884@example.net', '2015-04-02', 5, N'This is an awesome game with more depth than final fight. The spries weren''t as screen filling as final fight but it still looked good and still does i my opinion. The scale of the characters and background make you feel like your fighting on the streets in the open and final fight although a great game I always felt like you fighting in a crowded hallway. SOR has awesome game play the game play here is the basis for SOR2&3 so I find it hard to believe anyone would have difficulty. You got punch, jump, jump kick, grab, throw, grab and attack, you can also reverse throws and flip over an enemy and slam them into the ground, and a special move which is a policeman with a rocket launcher that damages all enemies. The gameplay is simple yet slightly deep. It flows very well. It is reminiscent of double dragon with some final fight with a badass sound track that ruled the 16bit scene. Sure you may be spoiled by its sequels but there is something to be had here. I am a fan of 16bit...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Chen', N'brenda.chen2275@example.com', '2015-04-02', 5, N'This game is not for casual gamers . This game is not for run n gun call of duty people . Ok the visuals are top notch game play is so smoth ..this game is hard but it''s a challenge with lots of rewards . Take time get used to controls mechanics then you will be fine . Remember the 1st level is the hardest . You will die a lot at first . But once tou get a hang of it wow . One of my favorite games . Enjoy !'),
(N'Robert', N'Alvarez', N'robert.alvarez1587@example.com', '2015-04-02', 5, N'Great deal and fast shipping.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Cruz', N'jessica.cruz1317@example.net', '2015-04-02', 5, N'Work well'),
