(N'Nicholas', N'Green', N'nicholas.green9526@example.org', '2015-04-02', 5, N'Received it sealed. Brand New and no scratches on the discs. Very happy with it.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Morgan', N'zachary.morgan5599@example.com', '2015-04-02', 5, N'One of the most successful computer games every written. It is still played and online players still exist to keep this great game alive after twelve years.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Fisher', N'pamela.fisher6355@example.org', '2015-04-02', 5, N'This was one of the first games i got for the xbox one, and it was a great choice. I really like how you can go around killing mutant zombies with your own character you made. And their is cool guns and the gameplay overall was good. I think this is a great buy.'),
