(N'Jacob', N'Foster', N'jacob.foster8305@example.net', '2015-04-04', 5, N'Very Good'),
(N'Kofi', N'Williams', N'kofi.williams8672@example.com', '2015-04-04', 3, N'Currently can''t get a TV to use the guns with it so...that sucks. Oh wait I have two guns and an old TV but it won''t let me use the jap gun! WHY?? Maybe if I turn the controller on it''s side it will seem like I''m using a gun...NOPE!!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Garcia', N'kathleen.garcia9380@example.net', '2015-04-04', 5, N'THIS IS DONKEY KONG! I THINK THIS GAME REPRESENTS WHAT OLD SCHOOL GAMES ARE ALL ABOUT. IT`S FUN, IT`S CHALLENGING AND IT TAKES TIME TO MASTER. THIS GAME IS VERY IMPORTANT AND HAS ALOT OF HISTORY IN IT. AFTER ALL, MARIO`S FIRST APPEARANCE IS IN THIS GAME. YOU WORK YOU WAY UP FLOOR BY FLOOR JUMPING OVER BARRELS THAT DONKEY KONG IS ROLLING IN YOUR DIRECTION. ALSO, WATCH OUT FOR THE FIRE BALLS AND IF YOU GET A HAMMER YOU CAN MASH THE FIRE BALLS. MEANWHILE YOU`RE JUMPING OVER STUFF AND TRYING TO CLIMB UP TO THE TOP TO RESCUE THE GIRL. OVERALL, A FUN CLASSIC GAME. JESUS IS THE ANSWER AND GOD BLESS YOU. ROMANS 10:9,10 :)'),
(N'Brenda', N'Baker', N'brenda.baker3201@example.com', '2015-04-04', 5, N'Just what I expected ! (I Love It.) JL'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'White', N'jacqueline.white8765@example.net', '2015-04-04', 3, N'Works well. It''s a little smaller so it fits my son''s hands. However, I wish it didn''t have to be plugged in all the time. I thought it would be like our other one that, once charged, can be wireless.'),
