(N'Jeremy', N'Morgan', N'jeremy.morgan5971@example.org', '2015-04-04', 3, N'I found this game on Amazon for $11.99 and have played it through to the point where I feel I got my money"s worth. The story and gameplay are solid and kept me interested. Three Stars.'),
