(N'Andrea', N'Jones', N'andrea.jones3690@example.net', '2015-04-05', 5, N'we loved it!!!!'),
(N'James', N'Gomez', N'james.gomez4917@example.net', '2015-04-05', 4, N'Fantastic graphics, but ultimately lacking in some areas such as gameplay and game depth.'),
(N'Steven', N'Nowak', N'steven.nowak6369@example.net', '2015-04-05', 5, N'Best game.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Butler', N'olivia.butler3376@example.org', '2015-04-05', 5, N'Despite my title, I am giving this game 5 stars. As an overall gaming experience, it''s excellent. But a weaknesses keep it from being in the top 5 of all time. These aren''t game breaking, or super frustrating, it''s just that you know this game could have been so much better than it was with just a few improvements. So what to expect? First off, if you didn''t play the first two Dragon Age games, you should. This game just jumps right in with no exposition, and carries over much of the story. The basic plot is simple, an evil force threatens the world and you, the hero, are tasked with stopping it. But there is so much lore and so many characters here, that it if you go in blind, you will really be missing out (not to mention, it will spoil the earlier games if you haven''t played them). Secondly, the tactical combat menu is a great innovation that really makes the game more enjoyable to play. Bioware introduced the "play and pause" style of RPG way back with their first game Baldur''s...'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Hall', N'jacqueline.hall7623@example.com', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Paul', N'Butler', N'paul.butler8868@example.com', '2015-04-06', 3, N'Good game, good controller, large hhd. Bad final model of the PlayStation 3. What ashame. THE best one will be the one before this'),
(N'Shirley', N'Young', N'shirley.young6588@example.org', '2015-04-06', 5, N'It''s link and that''s always a 5-star thing.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Baker', N'kathleen.baker4500@example.com', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Great series. I have them all'),
(N'Sarah', N'Nelson', N'sarah.nelson3167@example.com', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Sarah', N'Nelson', N'sarah.nelson3167@example.com', '2015-04-06', 3, N'Base game is bad but the doc improved the game imo'),
(N'Sarah', N'Nelson', N'sarah.nelson3167@example.com', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Great game my goy'),
(N'Sarah', N'Nelson', N'sarah.nelson3167@example.com', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Great worked perfectly'),
(N'Zachary', N'Scott', N'zachary.scott1890@example.org', '2015-04-06', 5, N'very good, Thanks'),
(N'Julie', N'Russell', N'julie.russell8430@example.org', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Amazing game start to finish. Must buy for all PS4 owners.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Castillo', N'jennifer.castillo6415@example.net', '2015-04-06', 5, N'EXCELLENT. FAST SHIPPING. MY SON LOVES IT.'),
(N'Debra', N'Long', N'debra.long3309@example.com', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Very pleased with my purchase got this for my sons bday he loves ice age and loves this game it came as described in good condition and in the case! Fast shipping as well'),
(N'Helen', N'Barnes', N'helen.barnes4132@example.net', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Hard and punishing, but not unfair. My first two hours in this game were absolutely brutal. Thrown into a dangerous world with little preparation and tough enemies, you are forced to learn on the go, no hand holding, you must learn from your mistakes. A stark contrast from the swarm of AAA titles these days with the "no gamer left behind" mentality where checkpoints are frequent, and you respawn with a full magazine of bullets/grenades. Bloodborne is something different. Dying in Boodborne has meaning. You don''t respawn where you died. You respawn back at last Lantern you lit. These can be few and far between, and you may have had to fight through tough situations to get where you were. However don''t be too hard on yourself when you die. During the 45 seconds or so while you are looking at the loading screen, reflect on why you died. Was I too agressive and overreach? Were my attacks effective against that enemy type, or should i try other methods (molotov, throwing knives etc)....'),
(N'Luis', N'Robinson', N'luis.robinson2660@example.com', '2015-04-06', 5, N'THIS IS A GOOD GAME. IT DO NOT GIVE YOU A HARD TIME WHILE PLAYING THE GAME. JUST DON''T RUN INTO THE BACK OF ANOTHER RACER AT FULL SPEED AND YOU WILL NOT FALL OFF YOUR BIKE. I LIKE TO STAY IN THE MIDDLE OF THE PACK UNTIL THE 3RD LAP , THEN I''LL TAKE THE LEAD TO THE FINISH. THE GRAPHICS ARE GOOD AND YOUR BIKE IS LARGE IN RELATION TO YOUR T.V. SCREEN , WITH A NICE FAT BACK TIRE LIKE A REAL BIKE. THIS GAME IS WELL WORTH THE MONEY , GET IT BEFORE THERE ARE NO MORE TO BUY FOR THIS PRICE. SOMETHING ELSE I WANTED TO SAY , BUT I FORGOT. ANYWAY DON''T PASS THIS UP , IT''S GREAT TO PLAY. YOU WILL LIKE IT.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Collins', N'sarah.collins6682@example.net', '2015-04-06', 5, N'Sweet Game! Thanks Alot!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Reed', N'stephen.reed4199@example.net', '2015-04-06', 3, N'This product will charge your controller but it will not charge your controller will charging it self like it says it does. I had a hard time even getting it on my controller. You have to charge your controller, then charge the battery itself, then when your controller gets low, you press the button to turn on the battery to charge your controller. There has been some people saying it interferes with the R2 and L2 triggers, it doesn''t really interfere for me and doesn''t bother me that much. I just wish you could charge both the controller and battery at the same time.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Gutierrez', N'ronald.gutierrez9987@example.net', '2015-04-07', 3, N'The style is that of Grand Theft Auto, but very badly designed. It does have GTA quality graphics, and the main plot line is pretty cool, but the problems with the game FAR outweigh the positive aspects. The first problem is the vehicle control system. When you''re driving one direction it''s fine, controlled exactly like GTA, but god help you if you need to do a 3 or more point turn. The left/right vehicle controls are relative to the direction the vehicle is facing, meaning they''re reversed when you back up, and they don''t change when the camera rotates around the car. The real problem with this is the really dumb logic they put into the camera. Unlike GTA which forces you to move the camera by hand in these situations and provides a button to quickly reverse the view to look behind you (useful for checking if someone''s following you), the camera automatically tries to rotate to look behind you as soon as you start backing up and has to be fought to keep a consistent view. The...'),
(N'Emma', N'Bailey', N'emma.bailey4142@example.org', '2015-04-07', 4, N'Very fun game ! Especially coop ! I''ve always enjoyed the Lego games.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Torres', N'andrea.torres5423@example.net', '2015-04-07', 2, N'Bought this game digitally and can''t stand it( this coming from someone who plays all kinds of games and one of my most favorite is Minecraft) I wish I could have got my money back, I played it for a few hours to hopefully make myself like it, but I couldn''t.'),
(N'Emma', N'Ramos', N'emma.ramos8878@example.com', '2015-04-07', 5, N'Very good, nice product and good seller'),
(N'Sharon', N'Cook', N'sharon.cook7258@example.org', '2015-04-07', 5, N'I read that this game was extremely difficult, but after not being able to kill the first enemy for about 2 hours I knew something was wrong. As it turns out hand to hand combat is not very effective in this game. After restarting the game I was able to pick up a melee weapon and a gun and it made the game so much more playable. I still haven''t figured out if I missed picking up the weapon the first time or if it was an issue with the game. Either way, now I am absolutely hooked to Bloodborne. This game is really addictive. Failure only makes you want to play more. It is a very unique experience and I highly recommended it. Just remember to pick up a melee weapon and gun before you move forward!!!'),
(N'William', N'Okonkwo', N'william.okonkwo2034@example.org', '2015-04-07', 2, N'At a weight of 250 lbs, this is basically useless. Also, unless you have fairly good coordination, I think it will be difficult to utilize. I had hoped to use it in conjunction with my weight loss program. Not a chance! First off, I''m too awkward to do much of what it is set up to do, and secondly I think I will need to lose the weight first and then try the board again. Other family members tried it and had some success with different games, but none of them had much interest in getting it out of the closet again. So it sits...and sits...and sits. Someday perhaps I will try it again, but that is about 50 lbs away.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Gomez', N'ivan.gomez2628@example.net', '2015-04-07', 5, N'I really enjoyed this game, even though I haven''t played any of the previous Tomb Raiders all of the way through. You''ll love it, so buy it.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Reyes', N'amanda.reyes3178@example.net', '2015-04-07', 5, N'I grew up in a small suburb in Michigan. I spent my youth there. I knew all the streets, could get around easily on a bike. I was familiar with the couple restaurants and shops in the town. I left and eventually my parents moved out of the town. There wasn''t any reason to go back, and for years I didnt. Over the past year Ive gone back a couple times to try out a new restaurant that opened, visit a friend coming back into the area who was staying with his parents for a week, or walk along the river that runs through the town. The big things are largely the same. The roads aren''t going to change. There aren''t suddenly going to be highrises in a small Midwestern suburb. But the little stuff is different. A lot of the shops have changed. Small, mom and pop restaurants have been replaced by high end dining and breweries as the area has become wealthier. I don''t know the people when Im walking the street. An old factory was turned into a small shopping center that wasn''t very appealing...'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brooks', N'katherine.brooks8235@example.org', '2015-04-07', 4, N'Zone of the Enders was a favorite of mine, moreso the 2nd Runner than the first game but both are solid titles. The HD remaster makes the game look quite nice and the fast paced mech action is still in place. ZOE1 is a decent but very short title that lays the foundation 2nd Runner which is a much better game. If you like fast paced action games set in a sci fi universe, this is worth the shot as you get 2 iconic games for a low price! If you played them before then you know what you are getting, as this is a solid package with upgraded visuals.'),
(N'Amara', N'Morales', N'amara.morales5386@example.net', '2015-04-07', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Donald', N'Perry', N'donald.perry9948@example.com', '2015-04-07', 3, N'Product was in great condition. It is a decent game. Not as much fun as the original though.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Turner', N'nicholas.turner2807@example.com', '2015-04-07', 5, N'Worked as usual. I prefer this to using a subscription.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Thomas', N'rachel.thomas3751@example.com', '2015-04-07', 5, N'Great, great fun series of games!'),
(N'Donna', N'Brooks', N'donna.brooks9258@example.net', '2015-04-07', 5, N'Sexy gorilla remote. Play nintendo smash In style. Bare chested in high heels with a dk remote.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Ferreira', N'nathan.ferreira6414@example.org', '2015-04-07', 4, N'I am not going to write a lengthy review but I will tell you that this game was pretty good. It was frightening and had a great story line. The graphics were pretty solid and Sega has rebounded nicely with this game. You have to use stealth and thought for most of the game, you feel like it will never end as you go from one tragedy to the next and just when you its over, you end up in an alien nest. The only reason I''m going 4 stars is because the ending was very brief and honestly a letdown. Overall though, definitely a really fun and scary game!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Martin', N'olivia.martin6532@example.org', '2015-04-07', 4, N'good'),
(N'Olivia', N'Martin', N'olivia.martin6532@example.org', '2015-04-07', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Ravi', N'Richardson', N'ravi.richardson8058@example.net', '2015-04-08', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Ravi', N'Richardson', N'ravi.richardson8058@example.net', '2015-04-08', 5, N'Loved it!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Cook', N'andrew.cook8652@example.org', '2015-04-08', 5, N'Best EVER! Take that XBOX One!'),
(N'Diane', N'Campbell', N'diane.campbell8997@example.org', '2015-04-08', 5, N'Skyrim is one of the best games I''ve ever played. The Legendary Edition content is much better than the original game. Basically, you have to buy it: 1. This is cheaper than buying DLCs seperately 2. The missions are much better. The story lines are much better. They seemed to spend a lot of time on the actual gameplay in these DLCs 3. Want to build a house? Become a vampire or werewolf? These small parts of the original game are expanded on immensely in the expansion. 4. These expansions were really well made. They didn''t seem to rush it like some parts of the game feel like. There is also less monotony in the missions which is #1 key for those who''ve played this game 40+ hours My girlfriend may have more of a connection with a character from the expansion pack than me. If you want a game to play for 12 hours straight this is the one. If you own Skyrim, you CAN''T be without this. If your significant other has a habit of leaving you for NPCs. This game is not for you.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd1353@example.com', '2015-04-08', 5, N'This game is simply awesome, if U like the Monster Hunter games U love this game, I was a little frustrate with MH3 for 3DS because sometimes was difficult to find someone to play locally even got the WiiU version of the game to play online, well if U played this game U know that some monsters rank hight or G are very difficult to defeat just by yourself, but MH4 for 3DS has on-line multi-player so, I can find some other hunter on line (friend or not) to face this greats foes, other plus in this game was the new weapons, one of that weapons allow U to do amazing moves (I talking about the Insect Glaive but my personal favorite weapon are hammer and dual blades) and finally the new specials moves, attack while you are jumping or scaling and mount a monster while deliver several more attacks until your character is bucked off. MH4 is so great than even make me play again MH3 for 3DS :D'),
(N'Emily', N'Chen', N'emily.chen6109@example.net', '2015-04-08', 1, N'Not good please to buy game no more I don''t have game with me'),
(N'Brian', N'Bailey', N'brian.bailey2286@example.com', '2015-04-08', 5, N'After losing our charger we bought this one. It was cheaper than buying a name brand and works just as well. No complaints.'),
(N'John', N'Hernandez', N'john.hernandez6355@example.org', '2015-04-08', 5, N'Couldnt''s ask for more. Fits perfectly, good quality. best Mount you could get for your Xbox one kinect PLUS a camera cover.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Hernandez', N'rebecca.hernandez4031@example.com', '2015-04-08', 5, N'Reviewing this version since steam reviews only for steam versions but the same thing applies to fighters on all consoles, same controls. Gameplay:One of the hardest 2d fighters available. Incredibly deep combat system that merges tekken and street fighter''s mechanics into one hybrid system. Playing this game automatically makes you better at other games, that''s how hard it is. It is very easy to get into, but hard to master let alone be adept in compared to other games. 10/10 Graphics:looks exactly like anime. 9/10. Story:did not look into the plot just practice mode, arcade mode and online. However it does look decent enough for those interested in the tournament fighters plotline. 7/10'),
(N'Carol', N'Nowak', N'carol.nowak6717@example.com', '2015-04-08', 1, N'I bought this for my Sister and all was fine however then Sony released a firmware patch and It bricked the console. Now it won''t even turn on. The only fixes that Sony offers are not safe which I don''t trust myself doing. I''m at a loss as to what I should do.'),
(N'Charles', N'Johnson', N'charles.johnson7544@example.net', '2015-04-08', 5, N'i freaking love it! there are no words to describe it Rune Factory YAY'),
(N'Brian', N'Powell', N'brian.powell4909@example.com', '2015-04-08', 1, N'Replacement arrived, and everything works...as well as it can given this poor build quality. Check other reviews and you will see the same issues of feeling cheap and bad button presses. The stock controller is better. Original review : Possibly poor quality or I have bad luck. Left direction doesnt work on the D-pad. All other buttons work correctly, same results on both Xbox One and 360. Just submitted a return/replacement and it is back ordered 2 weeks. Will update rating when replacement arrives.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Miller', N'brandon.miller3784@example.net', '2015-04-08', 5, N'Pokemon Ruby and Sapphire are one of Nintendo''s best pokemon games. There are some who love these games,yet hate these games. I love them,one of the most deepest RPGS in existence. I have Sapphire,and it''s a great game. Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire already came out,but the classic Ruby and Sapphire games are the best. Way back in 2002,pokemon Ruby and Sapphire were announced. They came out of fall of that year in Japan. In March of 2003,these games hit the market in America. Sure it was popular,15 million copies were sold,which is the best selling Nintendo GameBoy Advanced game,but it wasn''t huge. Red and Blue were much more popular,and so was Yellow,Gold,Silver,Stadium,Snap,and so on. These games were overrated with hatred,and people grew out of pokemon. Many younger gamers were starting to get into pokemon and these were many first pokemon fans game. Very few older fans still liked it. Despite it not being very popular,it was a great game. First,let''s look at the sales of...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2015-04-09', 1, N'Can you say cash-in? The devs changed two textures by one hundred pixels and put a 60 dollar price tag on it. If you didn''t get these games when they came out and now think they''re good you are a moron. I would rather a new Metro game as I played and enjoyed them when they came out. This product sucks!'),
(N'Carlos', N'Cooper', N'carlos.cooper7010@example.com', '2015-04-09', 5, N'Thank You'),
(N'Kofi', N'Wood', N'kofi.wood8516@example.net', '2015-04-09', 4, N'My husband found this game for me used at GameStop - it cost around $12. The price Amazon wants for it is insane. Shop around some and you should be able to get a better deal. That said, I legitimately enjoyed this game. I have heard all the criticism of it. No, your choices don''t matter. Yes, the story is cheesy. And yes, there are a few frustrating button press sequences which are solved through trial and error. But I found the story entertaining enough, the characters likeable, and the various dinosaur-related deaths pretty cool. You can easily play through the story in less than a day, and there is no real skill involved in anything. If you''re in it only for the gameplay, you shouldn''t be playing any of Telltale''s make-your-own-choice games anyway. This is more of an interactive story than a game. Take it for what it is and enjoy it.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Walker', N'elizabeth.walker7922@example.net', '2015-04-09', 4, N'A good second entry in the Nintendo DS Castlevania series! I''ve been a fan of the Castlevania series since Symphony of the Night on PS1 and I really enjoyed the GBA and DS entries of the series. In Portrait of Ruin, you play as both Jonathan Morris (son of John Morris from the Genesis Castlevania game Bloodlines) and Charlotte Aulin to stop the resurrection of Count Dracula after the legendary Castlevania appears after WWI. Konami tried to mix it up this time by having players use both characters to solve puzzles and defeat enemies. It works to a certain degree, but honestly, it''s not utilized all that much. For example, there''s a section where you have to switch between the two to get past a motorcycle section as you have to make them duck to miss walls or jump to get over obstacles. That''s about as much thought as you''ll need to get past any of the teamwork based puzzles...Another thing I have a small gripe with is that this game is suppose to follow the Sega Genesis game...'),
(N'Frank', N'Green', N'frank.green9512@example.net', '2015-04-09', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Frank', N'Green', N'frank.green9512@example.net', '2015-04-09', 5, N'great'),
(N'Frank', N'Green', N'frank.green9512@example.net', '2015-04-09', 5, N'cool'),
(N'Frank', N'Green', N'frank.green9512@example.net', '2015-04-09', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Eric', N'Gonzalez', N'eric.gonzalez4448@example.com', '2015-04-09', 5, N'A great product officially licensed by Nintendo. Works with US New 3DS XL in case anyone was worried about that. You simply plug your AC adapter into the charging stand and you can then set your New 3DS XL on the stand to charge without the need to plug anything else in. Fast and easy charge and sturdy, so when your 3DS is in the stand there is no chance of it tipping over. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Raghunathan', N'nicholas.raghunathan3346@example.org', '2015-04-09', 4, N'this mouse is incredibly well made, which is something you notice right out of the box. the box has the mouse and a quickstart guide, that''s it. there''s 3 "zones" of lighting; the DPI light, the logo, and the scroll wheel. you can almost completely customize these lights separately. another thing about this mouse that impressed me was the sniper button; a button on the thumb position of the mouse that, when held down, slows the DPI (which can be changed, as well as the DPI for 5 DPI profiles, which can be turned on or off). when it comes to using the mouse, i''ve noticed a few issues. the back and forward buttons are a little difficult to press on the go, so if you have any shortcuts you want set to your thumb, you can set them to the sniper button, which i would recommend. the scroll wheel is also a little hard to click in, as it''s a little far forward. there''s noticeable issues when trying to take a screenshot with puush, as the cursor becomes floaty at resolutions greater than...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Bell', N'jeremy.bell1632@example.com', '2015-04-09', 4, N'its a good Mario game but it is getting get repetitive is design.'),
(N'Joan', N'Gray', N'joan.gray1458@example.org', '2015-04-09', 5, N'So nice to have all 3 together. I love these games.'),
(N'Emily', N'Jimenez', N'emily.jimenez4093@example.com', '2015-04-09', 5, N'excelent game'),
(N'Brenda', N'Wilson', N'brenda.wilson8012@example.net', '2015-04-09', 5, N'excellent your product'),
(N'Donald', N'Hill', N'donald.hill6832@example.com', '2015-04-10', 3, N'I am a PC gamer and games these days are just too expensive. Microsoft should have a library that allows cheap and free indie games. Steam is still the best place to buy games for PC.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Roberts', N'tomasz.roberts4889@example.com', '2015-04-10', 5, N'My daughter and I play this together. It''s challenging but fun. Love that you can play different characters and not just Link.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Jimenez', N'dennis.jimenez5675@example.net', '2015-04-10', 5, N'This is the best controller charger for the X1 on the market. It is unfortunate because of the outragous price. I have purchased the Nyko batteries and chargers for the X1, and they last nowhere near as long as an official X1 battery, I end up charging the Nyko 3 times before the MS battery needs to be charged. It''s a shame, but this is worth the money'),
(N'Gary', N'Butler', N'gary.butler4529@example.net', '2015-04-10', 5, N'Being one of those who missed out on this title for the Wii years ago, I was in great anticipation for this dedicated release for Nintendo''s New 3DS. The wait to play this game was well worth it. Having received my copy of the game early this morning (April 10, 2015, the day of release), I''m about 8 hours into the gameplay. From what I can tell, and through what I have experienced thus far, the story, characters, world, and general gameplay promises hours of engaged journeying through what is definitely the most beautiful world crafted specifically for the New 3DS yet. For those of you who have already purchased your New 3DS, and if you''re a fan of the RPG genre, I would give this game a "must buy" recommendation. For those of you who do not yet have the New 3DS, but the original 3DS, is it worth upgrading *for this one game alone*?! My opinion, for any upgrade, is never for just one game. However, I have compared a few games (Bravely Default, The Legend of Zelda: Majora''s Mask,...'),
(N'Joseph', N'Sullivan', N'joseph.sullivan7473@example.org', '2015-04-10', 5, N'Excellent! Look amazing and isn''t a cheap material'),
(N'Joyce', N'Evans', N'joyce.evans6159@example.com', '2015-04-10', 4, N'To say I was hyped for this is an understatement. I bought a PS4 primarily with the intention of owning and loving Bloodborne. I now own it, but I can''t say I love it. If I had to rate this game solely based on its own merits, I''d give it a 90/100. However, based on my expectations after playing and loving Dark Souls 1 and 2, I rate Bloodborne at a 3/5. My first play through went about how I expected; I''m a Souls vet and am familiar with the notorious difficulty and obscure game mechanics. My first play through took about 21 hours to hit the main bosses and most of the optional bosses. I was able to coop successfully on several occasions, never got invaded and never invaded anyone myself. I beat (what for me) was the final boss and intended to immediately start a new character and play a different style. I''m 4 hours into my second play through and feel like I''m forcing myself to play this game because I feel like I should after all I spent in order to play ($400 PS4, $50 PS Plus,...'),
(N'Scott', N'Davis', N'scott.davis5552@example.org', '2015-04-10', 5, N'Everything works as expected'),
(N'Jacob', N'Murphy', N'jacob.murphy4206@example.net', '2015-04-10', 4, N'Great on your first playthrough. Killing uruks and bosses is fun, but no replay ability. One and done and on too the next game. No Co op which would help.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Robinson', N'nicholas.robinson6145@example.net', '2015-04-10', 5, N'Sent earlier than expected. Item as described thank you! A++'),
(N'Amy', N'Gomez', N'amy.gomez8525@example.net', '2015-04-10', 2, N'Did not meet my expectations it had no port for mic'),
(N'Samantha', N'Gomez', N'samantha.gomez3665@example.org', '2015-04-10', 5, N'This is one of the best games I''ve played on the ps2 it''s so fun i can never get bored of it'),
(N'Rachel', N'Reed', N'rachel.reed4193@example.org', '2015-04-10', 3, N'Little hard to put and and take off. Material seems rather cheaply made. Sadly my PS3 died and the fan just didn''t keep it from breaking down. I do recommend you buy this fan because it doesn''t need any external power supply just USB connection. Anyone looking to keep their phat PS3 working buy a fan. This fan is just ok tho but worth a buy at the right price.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Fisher', N'amanda.fisher4068@example.com', '2015-04-11', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Cox', N'kimberly.cox8222@example.com', '2015-04-11', 5, N'Great Product, the item was way better that expected specially the quality.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Jenkins', N'alexander.jenkins4964@example.org', '2015-04-11', 5, N'Improvements over last years game. Play it a few days to see new animations and improved game play. The players are more realistic when it comes to going after a baseball.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Hill', N'kelly.hill8429@example.org', '2015-04-11', 2, N'useful'),
(N'Steven', N'Ivanov', N'steven.ivanov3759@example.org', '2015-04-11', 4, N'I recently bought this game off of STEAM and I have to say. This game is awesome! I''m over halfway through the campaign now and have logged around 12 hours in multiplayer and I love it. It''s not a historically accurate game. but it''s a fun game set in a setting that is very underused. If they added more historical accuracy they would have gotten a 5 in my review. That is a little matter however, considering how bad-ass this game is.'),
(N'Eric', N'Brooks', N'eric.brooks9212@example.net', '2015-04-11', 5, N'good'),
(N'Amanda', N'Chavez', N'amanda.chavez7245@example.org', '2015-04-11', 5, N'Bought this to replace my old Corsair M95. Though this only has 2 side buttons, the mouse is overall, much better. All buttons have a very satisfying click to them, and the software makes configuring different profiles for different games a breeze. The sensor is very accurate but the best part of this mouse is how comfortable this is. I have very large hands and finding mice that don''t give me cramps is a PITA. This mouse handles things beautifully since it fits in my hand perfectly. The lights are awesome and allow me to match all the lights from my devices, I usually leave it in Teal since its my favorite color. If you''re on the fence about this, pull the trigger, you won''t regret it.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Lee', N'ravi.lee4186@example.com', '2015-04-12', 3, N'My son is a big fan of skylanders, we have every single skylanders game out there... The game is self is great and action pack adventure for boys (possibly for girls if they are into this type of stuff) this game is def not a disappointment n does what it say with no issues or problems..'),
(N'Lucia', N'Cook', N'lucia.cook9972@example.com', '2015-04-12', 5, N'This expansion was worth the wait. I feel so immersed in Sims 4 again. I adore the photography skill and many of my household''s walls are covered already in family photos. I appreciate the addition of the photo studio too where you can change the backdrops to liven up your pictures even more. While I would change how many times the game allows you to get abducted and I also wish they added more animations for the retail aspect such as customers holding shopping bags and also using the cash register to ring up products, this expansion is solid. It is fun changing up the workplaces in build mode too, such as the hospital, with the cheat "bb.enablefreebuild". I am very looking forward to future content for Sims 4. They keep adding free stuff such as basements, pools, and so forth so the game is definitely a constantly evolving organism that you can get hours of play out of. Great job sims team!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Garcia', N'jeremy.garcia2057@example.net', '2015-04-12', 4, N'Its sa me, Luigi! Buy my twice for more amiibo fun. I can only be as used in Mario Party 10 on Wii U.'),
(N'Robert', N'Price', N'robert.price8266@example.org', '2015-04-12', 5, N'I haven''t played a Mario game this good since Galaxy. This is now my second favorite Mario game of all time, after Super Mario 64. Everything about this game is just perfect. The music, controls, visuals are amazing and the game can even be quite challenging. Star World and the bonus world are AWESOME!! There are tons of stars and stamps to collect, and some levels even require other characters to for certain rewards. There is a ton of replay value here. I thought New Super Mario Bros. U was good, but this one takes the cake.'),
(N'Debra', N'Hill', N'debra.hill7197@example.com', '2015-04-12', 5, N'Bought this for about $5.00, and it is just as epic today as it was 20 years ago. The first night I couldn''t put down the controller for hours into the night playing a new season and using a roster I found online to edit the teams. I play MLB14 The Show for PS4 quite frequently and I can tell you without a doubt, this game has better gameplay and is much more enjoyable, especially with friends. The games are very fast paced and extremely satisfying to play and keep on going, not to mention the simplicity of the stat record keeping and the color shades depending on the players skill. 10/10 this is a Nintendo gem in the peak of Nintendo''s genius.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Long', N'nathan.long3846@example.org', '2015-04-12', 2, N'Not good! Single player game is poor and felt just added in. Just do not buy used... there is a online code needed and if already used (99% sure will be used) you will have to pay 10 bucks to buy new code so to can try to play this online. Also you''ll need the added code for the DLC and free ps1 warhawk game and that code will set you back 30 to 40 bucks.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Singh', N'alexander.singh2025@example.com', '2015-04-12', 2, N'It wants to be a game, except it''s really just some quicktime events and a few poorly done shooting arcades. It wants to be a cinematic experience, except the story is incomplete, unresolved, and has consistency errors. So what is it? It looks beautiful, but since it can be played in a day I suggest you just rent it instead of paying so much for it. Some of the guns are fun, except that you only get to use them a few times.'),
(N'John', N'Parker', N'john.parker6338@example.net', '2015-04-12', 4, N'The packaging made the cover a little loose around the top of the tablet, but I was still pleased with the durability and quality of the cover. Very good case.'),
(N'Christina', N'Perry', N'christina.perry3212@example.net', '2015-04-12', 5, N'game worth the buck, like being there in war.seeing what hell our guys went though to keep our freedom'),
(N'Lauren', N'Robinson', N'lauren.robinson8448@example.org', '2015-04-12', 3, N'It is what I wanted but one of the connections is difficult to engage.'),
(N'Richard', N'Brooks', N'richard.brooks1685@example.com', '2015-04-13', 5, N'My kids love this game.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Torres', N'gregory.torres9520@example.org', '2015-04-13', 5, N'Excellent.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ruiz', N'jeremy.ruiz8844@example.org', '2015-04-13', 5, N'Ordered this for a friend. He loves it and plays ever day. He is ten by the way.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Collins', N'ashley.collins8139@example.org', '2015-04-13', 5, N'I''m not even that great at these games but they are still treasured classics. Playing them now with a nice filter on ePSXe could not be more fun. Pick them up however you want but don''t forget these treasures exist. And my oh my do they look fabulous with an xBR or xBRZ filter through emulation. Don''t miss out! You can give yourself as many credits as you want and you will need them. This is not an easy game.'),
(N'Emily', N'Anderson', N'emily.anderson6024@example.org', '2015-04-13', 1, N'Pretty good game for children to play who have a lot of anger but too weak to do nything'),
(N'Linda', N'Carter', N'linda.carter4670@example.net', '2015-04-13', 5, N'Tried this game on a whim and I am so glad I did. It is an excellent game with great graphics. I love the color scheme they have with the black and red on the areas under nazi control. Plus you get to sabotage nazi equipment, what''s not to love about that?'),
(N'Frank', N'Brown', N'frank.brown6182@example.com', '2015-04-13', 2, N'over extensive ,non simplistic on controles'),
(N'Lisa', N'Kim', N'lisa.kim5361@example.net', '2015-04-13', 3, N'I find this game to be more for children. not a lot to do really.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Chavez', N'rebecca.chavez6047@example.net', '2015-04-13', 1, N'well, good job, china. you have now taken the confidence out of anything remotely electronic. this thing worked for just a bit longer than the return policy. has to be a fake because if sony themselves flooded the world with unreliable crap like this we would all be buying xboxes. so. $35 gone down the toilet. ill have to go to a brick and mortar store and hope that they get theirs from sony. don''t do it unless you have money extra, to burn, in which case ill give you my address and you can mail me a check and ill send you the same crap youll get from this order.'),
(N'Joan', N'Rodriguez', N'joan.rodriguez1136@example.com', '2015-04-13', 3, N'son like it'),
(N'Henry', N'Richardson', N'henry.richardson7379@example.net', '2015-04-13', 5, N'Loves it'),
(N'Charles', N'Nelson', N'charles.nelson3696@example.net', '2015-04-14', 5, N'Works great! Lots of memory! Lucky to get that!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Cooper', N'amanda.cooper8191@example.org', '2015-04-14', 5, N'exelente'),
(N'John', N'Gomez', N'john.gomez2913@example.net', '2015-04-14', 1, N'I bought item on 3-4-15 and it ceased working completely on 4-13-15. Amazon says I can''t exchange or refund because time period for that ended on 4-4-15. I think I got totally ripped off. Its not my computer. I tried to run the setup DVD and run the mouse on other computers and nothing would run it. A computer nerd with an MA in Computer Science tried to get it to work on his computers and it would not respond. Now I''ve got a dead mouse and no way to return or exchange it.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Scott', N'jacqueline.scott1739@example.org', '2015-04-14', 5, N'I have to give this 5 stars to offset for those morons that gave this 1 star for no reason or nonsense reasons'),
(N'Ryan', N'Jimenez', N'ryan.jimenez8499@example.net', '2015-04-14', 4, N'This was my first Diablo game, though I knew the mechanics from watching people play the PC versions over the years. Believe it or not, two games made me buy this: Destiny and Borderlands. The original Borderlands made it known that they were a Diablo game molded in a shooter game and after playing Diablo III, I totally get it and it makes me appreciate the franchise more. As for Destiny, I got bored with the game''s loot system and wanted a game to give me something more rewarding. Diablo definitely does this better than Destiny in a lot of ways. Example: The variety of rifts and bounties to keep you seeking out better items. It''s much better than wasting several hours doing a hard raid in Destiny and having nothing to show for it in the end other than shards. I do think the game could do better with its story (it is very predicable) and maybe it could use more enjoyable Acts, because the game''s length is pretty weak. The game is about its loot though and it does a great job with...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Lewis', N'rachel.lewis1170@example.com', '2015-04-14', 1, N'WARNING: This game DOES NOT have tag team mode in it (aka 2v2). There is no way to play WITH your friends in this game, only AGAINST them. Unlike Mortal Kombat 9 where you could play with your friends, you can only play 1 v 1 in Mortal Kombat X. DO NOT GET THIS GAME if you want it to play with other people, unless you like playing by yourself all the time.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Nelson', N'victoria.nelson9085@example.com', '2015-04-14', 5, N'This is the best game on the market and the word PHENOMENAL is not enough because GTA 5 is so much more. The PC Edition is out now and although there are some improvements not for one moment I regret buying this game for PS4 a second time. ( I used to play it on PS3 ) In my opinion the biggest difference is from PS3 to PS4 not from PS4 to PC. I won''t buy it a third time and spend additional money to upgrade my pc. Of course if you do so great, but the PS4/XBOXONE give you a solid and amazing experience.'),
(N'Mary', N'Wright', N'mary.wright5372@example.org', '2015-04-14', 5, N'This game is beyond excellent. I began playing mine a couple hours ago and so far it''s a very fluid, crisp game that was worth the wait. The new characters are wow... The soundtrack is awkwardly good... The old characters are just back with a vengeance.... Classic Kombat at its best... I love it. I hope you guys enjoy it as much as i do....I''d suggest doing single battles and actually take time to play with your favorite characters fighting styles as they do have 3. All which allow them to summon different fighting techniques and powers. Ive always been the die hard scorpion user but this year,kenshi has really elevated (lol little pun there)one of his techniques is the "possessed " and wow the combos and demons he withdraws from himself with make u sit there with the shock and awe face . As for the new characters, ones that really stick out are Erron Black and Cassie Cage, daughter of Johnny Cage. Erron black is the ultimate gunslinger, something you don''t often find in MK games....'),
(N'Joyce', N'Clark', N'joyce.clark9983@example.net', '2015-04-14', 5, N'Works as expected. Nothing more'),
(N'Amy', N'Boyd', N'amy.boyd9132@example.com', '2015-04-14', 5, N'Incredible game that oozes atmosphere and that it''s tough enough to test players to their maximum abilities! Recommended! Gorgeous graphics (no The Order 1886 level but still) and amazing soundtrack and surround sound. Amazing overall!'),
(N'David', N'Nelson', N'david.nelson4010@example.com', '2015-04-14', 5, N'Great item Love it.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Myers', N'kofi.myers9911@example.org', '2015-04-14', 5, N'Gonna make it short and sweet. Graphics are amazing. From the stages to the characters. The Fatalities go to 30fps to make them more cinematic and the camera angles make it better. And the best part to me is the characters. 25 years are the last MK. The old school fighters have aged! NO OTHER FIGHTING GAME HAS DONE THIS YET (Street Fighter cough cough)!!! And the new comers are are awesome. This is a must have for fighters. Net code will be worked on in due time. Anyone with common sense would know that when a game is released its gonna have a bug or two. And how about the VERY informative training mode. Next gen fighters better step their game up because MKX has set the bar. Must have...... Yea, I know.... This wasn''t very short lol!! #MustBuy'),
(N'William', N'Okonkwo', N'william.okonkwo2034@example.org', '2015-04-15', 5, N'As a family I believe we have the world of gaming systems covered. We have XBox360 & XBox1, PS3 & PS4, Wii & Wii2, along with other assorted older game systems. My son and myself are mostly into shooter games. Our middle son is into role playing and the youngest is a Mario addict. Unlike previous reviews that I have read we do not use ours for music listening although that certainly will be done soon. For games like Call of Duty and miscellaneous other war and shooter games it is Fantastic! We''ve only had inexpensive headsets and mics before. The difference is astounding. Commands I have never heard before while playing are as clear as day. Speech that seemed to be mumbled or said in a whisper are clear and concise. The group I play with says our new mic makes it easier to hear and understand us. I am super impressed with the quality, the results and the ease of set up! We had the role player try it, but he only uses PS3 & 4, and is not at all into shooting games, so he was not...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Campbell', N'ravi.campbell9873@example.net', '2015-04-15', 5, N'I love these!! They make my controller look so cool! And they''re cheap!!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Hill', N'amanda.hill6414@example.net', '2015-04-15', 5, N'it charges just like its suppose 2 whats more 2 say'),
(N'Susan', N'Hill', N'susan.hill4604@example.com', '2015-04-15', 5, N'No big scratches, nothing that prevented it from playing just fine.'),
(N'Wei', N'Rivera', N'wei.rivera8082@example.net', '2015-04-15', 5, N'I loved it .'),
(N'Debra', N'Edwards', N'debra.edwards6790@example.com', '2015-04-15', 4, N'Good stand, nice brand name that was designed and made for the exact system itself, very solid and stable, gets the job done, a nice purchase.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Young', N'jennifer.young3591@example.com', '2015-04-15', 5, N'good'),
(N'Stephen', N'Gonzalez', N'stephen.gonzalez9484@example.org', '2015-04-15', 5, N'Daughter loved it'),
(N'Omar', N'Campbell', N'omar.campbell6675@example.org', '2015-04-15', 5, N'As a fan of the metal gear games, I absolutely loved this. It was fun, looked great, and felt good to play a metal gear game again. There isn''t much else to say really. I beat it last night and I''m going to play all the side ops and deja vu missions later. If you''re a metal gear fan and you haven''t play this yet, stop waiting. If you aren''t a metal gear fan, stay away from this. I seriously don''t get why non metal gear fans bash this game. This game is for fans, not people who have never played a metal gear game before.'),
(N'Donald', N'Kelly', N'donald.kelly3930@example.com', '2015-04-15', 3, N'I got the game and it is awesome. But the when I got it in the mail, I didn''t get my cards. But I already order the whole tarots cards so I''m happy with what I got.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Bailey', N'ashley.bailey4339@example.com', '2015-04-15', 3, N'a bit short'),
(N'Linda', N'Bennett', N'linda.bennett1320@example.com', '2015-04-16', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Lucia', N'Long', N'lucia.long6585@example.net', '2015-04-16', 5, N'I love this game. Constantly looking around, having zombies pop up out of nowhere, especially as night falls. It gets my adrenaline rushing and so much fun. Lots to explore and do.'),
(N'John', N'Howard', N'john.howard5979@example.net', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Everyone knows about this game by now, and you''re crazy if you honestly don''t. This game dignifies--and exemplifies--what a true life or death, horror simulation is like. It''s SO different from what you''d normally think about this genre. And for only five dollars, it''s SO worth trying out, at the VERY least. You might watch videos of gameplay, but the actual experience is absolutely terrifying; and that''s what keeps me so interested.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Fisher', N'amanda.fisher4780@example.org', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Grandson loves this game.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Campbell', N'victoria.campbell5410@example.net', '2015-04-16', 5, N'These games are a wonderful blast of nostalgia. This package was extremely convenient so I could get both games at once and 200 free potions!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Parker', N'patrick.parker4144@example.com', '2015-04-16', 5, N'I give it 5 star. Can''t stop playing.'),
(N'Helen', N'Perry', N'helen.perry5569@example.com', '2015-04-16', 4, N'Bought for relative, worked.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'James', N'evelyn.james5617@example.net', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Came DOA, but game itself is still very good'),
(N'Melissa', N'Ross', N'melissa.ross1064@example.org', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Excellent seller, everything perfect I recommend it!'),
(N'Katherine', N'King', N'katherine.king7774@example.org', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Nicole', N'Perry', N'nicole.perry2622@example.org', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Niece was happy to get this game, she plays it quite a bit.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Perry', N'nicole.perry2622@example.org', '2015-04-16', 5, N'I got for one of my best friends and his daughter to get some daddy daughter bonding time. They play it quite a bit and its such a great game to bridge generations.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Perry', N'nicole.perry2622@example.org', '2015-04-16', 5, N'This is a fun game, reminds me of playing mario as a kid'),
(N'Katherine', N'Phillips', N'katherine.phillips6849@example.org', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Excelect product thanks alot'),
(N'Brenda', N'Bailey', N'brenda.bailey6014@example.com', '2015-04-16', 5, N'Great product and and arrival time was perfect and would buy again'),
(N'Matthew', N'Raghunathan', N'matthew.raghunathan9692@example.com', '2015-04-17', 5, N'Everything is great. Looks great, plays great. Couldn''t be happier! Thank you!'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Rivera', N'rebecca.rivera4820@example.org', '2015-04-17', 5, N'Good product Good supplier,Good price.'),
(N'Scott', N'Kumar', N'scott.kumar3862@example.net', '2015-04-17', 5, N'game of gods! very nice'),
(N'Julie', N'Ivanov', N'julie.ivanov7876@example.com', '2015-04-17', 5, N'Awesome game Def a must have !!!'),
(N'Heather', N'Collins', N'heather.collins6448@example.org', '2015-04-17', 5, N'I bought this for around $30. I already had the 2.0 Marvel starter pack but wanted to get the Monsters University, Incredibles and Pirates of the Caribbean world that comes with this set. For the price I figured why not buy this set, after all you need the 1.0 game to be able to access the 1.0 worlds. However any 1.0 character can play in the 2.0 toy box part of the game. I find this plates to be more appropriate for my 6 year old and a little easier for him to know how to play and get through the boards. Because this is a started pack and I already owned another starter pack I ended up with an extra base, but oh well the figures are usually around $10 each so i figured to get 3 guys and a game was worth the money.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Scott', N'anthony.scott7121@example.com', '2015-04-17', 2, N'Same old song and dance everything is getting smaller and cheaper these days. I purchased these about a year ago to use on my PS4 controller analog sticks to fix the rubber problem a lot of release controllers were experiencing and loved the product. Those came packaged on a card inside a plastic bubble and held up all this time. One has started tearing so I ordered a new set to replace them. Received the new version of these Grip-iT and they come with the rubbers and a business card inside a tiny stapled zip-loc baggie. The grip-iTs themselves feel exactly the same but are physically smaller than the old ones. They still fit the PS4 but are super snug and stretched out to the max. No way these will last over a year like the old ones. Your product was to good I guess they cheapened it to sell more. Oh well i''ll use these and then move on to a different brand next time.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Alvarez', N'zachary.alvarez8477@example.org', '2015-04-17', 5, N'THIS WAS A GIFT TO MY COUSIN SHE LOVED IT'),
(N'Mary', N'Bell', N'mary.bell5469@example.com', '2015-04-17', 4, N'Very cool SIM game. easy to play. One of my favorites,'),
(N'Heather', N'Wilson', N'heather.wilson8367@example.com', '2015-04-17', 5, N'Very fun game! Can''t wait till I get more time to play this!'),
(N'Scott', N'Turner', N'scott.turner3712@example.net', '2015-04-18', 5, N'Get the official stand, it''s so awesome. The fake ones are not good, this one is super well made.'),
(N'Charles', N'Ivanov', N'charles.ivanov6967@example.com', '2015-04-18', 3, N'THIS IS NOT AN AUTHENTIC NINTENDO PRODUCT! The joysticks are stiff compared to real Nintendo controllers. Spend the extra $10 and get Genuine Nintendo controllers'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Williams', N'jonathan.williams6287@example.com', '2015-04-18', 5, N'Another great good game. I like story and gameplay.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Edwards', N'anthony.edwards6036@example.net', '2015-04-18', 5, N'Reading a lot of, "wah, wah, wahhhhhhh" over piddly s***. Stop one star whining lol. Your expectations are way too high.'),
(N'Megan', N'Harris', N'megan.harris4757@example.net', '2015-04-18', 5, N'They love it'),
(N'Megan', N'Thomas', N'megan.thomas7487@example.org', '2015-04-18', 5, N'I had to buy 3 of these games, one for each of my boys. They are all obsessed with this game and have played it almost excessively over the past month taking over from their Pokemon obsession. I have never played it, but based on their happiness I would have to recommend it for any children ages 6 to 10 who like Pokemon style games.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Martin', N'nathan.martin9069@example.org', '2015-04-18', 5, N'great buy.. thanks..'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Cox', N'hiroshi.cox3087@example.net', '2015-04-18', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Betty', N'Boyd', N'betty.boyd2920@example.net', '2015-04-19', 5, N'Feels great in your hand and lets your thumbs rest more naturally on the controls. The extra compartment to store two extra cartridges is also very nice and out of the way. For this price and quality, a must buy.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Sanders', N'gregory.sanders3931@example.com', '2015-04-19', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Ashley', N'James', N'ashley.james1461@example.com', '2015-04-19', 4, N'Very solid take some time to get use to it. Then the game opens up'),
(N'Betty', N'Smith', N'betty.smith4359@example.org', '2015-04-19', 5, N'Cute little game I love easy games lol.:)'),
(N'David', N'Richardson', N'david.richardson7193@example.org', '2015-04-19', 5, N'Great game...combat is awesome...Played about 15 hours and only half through the main story...still have dlc content to play as well. It is a Steam game so you will need account to play. I have a gaming computer and I run at about 85fps on highest settings, great graphics, lots of open world fun.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Robinson', N'aisha.robinson9337@example.com', '2015-04-19', 5, N'I bought this on Steam and have tried it out in various stages of early access. I really like this game a lot. I know it''s still in Early Access, and there will be a lot of changes still upcoming (the story mode is the one I am most looking to personally), but the game in its current state is still absolutely a ton of fun. You basically crash land in an Arctic area, that was previously inhabited but now abandoned (I expect the reasons for this will be revealed through the story mode). You are woefully unprepared for the weather conditions and have to find better clothing, equipment, food, and water in order to survive another day...and more days beyond that. The environment is reasonably vast. You can definitely explore all the areas the game has to offer, but since you also have to manage your food, sleep, water, and so on...it will take a while or many playthroughs to do so. The character management is pretty simple and yet clever. You basically monitor your calorie count, which...'),
(N'Megan', N'Wilson', N'megan.wilson7488@example.net', '2015-04-19', 4, N'Here are my complaints: You cannot shut off the controller when watching a movie. It has to stay on. The controllers'' battery drains quickly and have to keep charging it. My console heats up pretty quickly so I had to get a cooling fan. Other than that, I am satisfied with my console. I wish people would post what they didn''t like so others can make more informed purchases.'),
(N'Diane', N'Rogers', N'diane.rogers4261@example.org', '2015-04-19', 4, N'good'),
(N'Paul', N'Sullivan', N'paul.sullivan2322@example.com', '2015-04-19', 5, N'Great game, highly recommend it if you''re a souls fan.'),
(N'Karen', N'Singh', N'karen.singh6378@example.net', '2015-04-20', 5, N'This case has PLENTY of room and it has the ability to store games and styluses it also is built very well, it looks better than the picture provided on the product''s profile page.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Ramirez', N'joshua.ramirez9073@example.org', '2015-04-20', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Wang', N'cynthia.wang3800@example.com', '2015-04-20', 4, N'This game has good pinball action and feel.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Russell', N'jonathan.russell1093@example.com', '2015-04-20', 5, N'Sounds great on PC and for the price I highly recommend this headset if you''re looking to save some money. They also work in my PS4, however I couldn''t get them to work on my XB1.'),
(N'Debra', N'Hill', N'debra.hill7197@example.com', '2015-04-20', 4, N'Does a great job converting s video from my retro video game consoles to vga on my 19 inch dell, looks great. Although my LCD with an actual Svideo input does look better still, not sure if its the tv or the direct connection. But this is worth your money if you make use of it. Also, also CRT SDTV''s are ideal for older consoles and rca connection, the ability to conver to the vga is much better for your eyes than a sdtv especially for rpgs are any games your going to be playing for more than an hour. Im happy with my purchase here.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Gomez', N'jonathan.gomez5921@example.com', '2015-04-20', 5, N'Came brand new in the box and was wrapped exactly as shown in the picture. Works like new and does the job perfectly! I''m so happy I got this for my DS Lite!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Harris', N'sofia.harris6848@example.net', '2015-04-20', 5, N'Very Good!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Harris', N'sofia.harris6848@example.net', '2015-04-20', 4, N'Good!'),
(N'Emily', N'Rivera', N'emily.rivera9416@example.org', '2015-04-20', 5, N'Fairly comfortable, all of the buttons work, doesn''t have any deadzones in the sticks despite what some reviewers have claimed. No complaints at all'),
(N'Donald', N'Kelly', N'donald.kelly7980@example.org', '2015-04-20', 5, N'A must play. One of the best games I''ve ever played. Very emotional and cinematic,'),
(N'Ashley', N'Kowalski', N'ashley.kowalski3174@example.org', '2015-04-20', 5, N'I haven''t played the original Thief games, so I can''t tell you how it compares, but I found this game highly enjoyable in its own right. A quality stealth game.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Robinson', N'brandon.robinson4865@example.net', '2015-04-20', 4, N'I will rate this with 4 stars only because there''s missing stadiums and also a few more leagues'),
(N'Jessica', N'Robinson', N'jessica.robinson8118@example.com', '2015-04-21', 4, N'This game is definitely challenging. If you''re looking for a fast paced action game, this might not be for you. But if you love dark souls then this is perfect. It''s faster paced than dark souls using the dodge mechanic instead of a block speeds everything up making it a little more intense. 4 stars just because it might not be for the casual gamer so if you''re looking for something to jump into once a week, this isn''t for you.'),
(N'Diane', N'Nguyen', N'diane.nguyen7912@example.net', '2015-04-21', 5, N'Nievly done figure'),
(N'Lucia', N'Price', N'lucia.price1059@example.org', '2015-04-21', 5, N'Fits great. Looks nice too!'),
(N'Linda', N'Sanchez', N'linda.sanchez6440@example.com', '2015-04-21', 4, N'This is an awesome game and a lot of fun if you have friends who also play. You either need a group size of 2 others for basic teaming, or five others for raids. Also the game becomes limited if you do not have the DLC(s). Prepare for tons of repetition to get the items and gear you want, like any other RPG...'),
(N'Emma', N'Johnson', N'emma.johnson6744@example.org', '2015-04-21', 5, N'This game is solid, if you like the other ones you will love this. Personally my favorite is the original, but this is second. You no longer have to go to benches to make combo weapons you do it on the spot, you get to pick which skills you want to upgrade with attribute points, even once you reach max level you continue to get attribute points so eventually you can max everything out. There are no more loading screens and those were the worst part about the older games. The graphics are good, and they Psychopaths aren''t as cheesy anymore. I haven''t had the time to beat it, but the apocalypse version has all the DLC and is worth picking up especially $30 and under.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Powell', N'anthony.powell6061@example.org', '2015-04-21', 5, N'This game is a lot of fun! I love it! It has beginner, intermediate and advanced dances rated by stars. The more stars... the harder it is but it''s a lot of fun. You''d break a sweat lol. If you''re going to use it to introduce yourself to working out. I highly recommend to warm up and strech. If I were to lose this game, I would buy another one, no doubt about it.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Foster', N'rebecca.foster9107@example.com', '2015-04-21', 5, N'I like this be use as classic controller instead of the others but still good'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Hernandez', N'carolyn.hernandez7729@example.net', '2015-04-21', 5, N'If you have already played Persona 3, you must buy this updated version. If you have never played Persona 3 you can still jump right into this game. This game provides plenty of hours of extra game play and is definitely worth every penny.'),
(N'Brian', N'Reed', N'brian.reed8315@example.org', '2015-04-21', 1, N'Game is complicated, boring and requires lot of controller types'),
(N'Joshua', N'Henderson', N'joshua.henderson3759@example.net', '2015-04-21', 5, N'perfect goes with my keyboard'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Campbell', N'cheryl.campbell2971@example.org', '2015-04-22', 5, N'Very Good Item and Good price..'),
(N'Michael', N'Kowalski', N'michael.kowalski7695@example.com', '2015-04-22', 5, N'i could not sleep for days after playing this game. I stayed in bed for the fear that some kind of creepy monster of doom is lurking under my bed. sssssshhhhhhh i hear them now and my 2 liter is full.'),
(N'Peter', N'Kowalski', N'peter.kowalski8697@example.com', '2015-04-22', 5, N'Works as intended, random power discs for Infinity.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Baker', N'nicholas.baker7550@example.com', '2015-04-22', 3, N'Slowing declining franchise'),
(N'Thomas', N'Jackson', N'thomas.jackson6973@example.net', '2015-04-22', 5, N'great quality, very fast shipping! awesome!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ward', N'brandon.ward2391@example.net', '2015-04-22', 5, N'This game had my palms sweaty the entire time. This was a very unique game in terms of gameplay and art style. They absolutely nailed the look of the ship and computers and everything else. The smoke and lighting make creeping around in this game very tense. The sound is also amazing in this game its best played with headphones and no distractions around. I was drowning in the atmosphere of this game the entire time. The character Amanda Ripley is portayed well here but we aren''t really given to much story on her, but really feel with a little more expansion on her story and background would have really kicked this game to a whole other level. Even with the said I still believe this game belongs in series cannon and am really excited about its potential to add to the Alien franchise. Only real complaint is what seemed like somewhat rushed ending with a pretty open ending. I would have preferred a little more resolution. I don''t want to go too far into the story to avoid spoilers...'),
(N'Joan', N'Chavez', N'joan.chavez6539@example.org', '2015-04-22', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Aisha', N'Edwards', N'aisha.edwards5248@example.net', '2015-04-22', 5, N'Does the job.'),
(N'Mary', N'Taylor', N'mary.taylor8487@example.org', '2015-04-23', 5, N'Very Good!!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Ali', N'kyle.ali2117@example.org', '2015-04-23', 5, N'Really fun game! Brings back the good old times! It''s really cool to see the old classic halos come back in a new fresh remastered version wile still having the same feel as the original! I like that you can change from the classic graphics to the remastered graphics with the press of a button! Online has been fine for me so far! I know there have been a lot of problems with it in the past but it is working as it should now!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Baker', N'kyle.baker6846@example.net', '2015-04-23', 5, N'original product and works with my N3ds XL and my old 3DS as well . its F#@%ING stupid from Nintendo not including the charger in the 1st place in the New 3DS line .'),
(N'Kyle', N'Ramirez', N'kyle.ramirez8474@example.com', '2015-04-23', 5, N'Absolutely fun to play and many, many gaming hours. For those that love RPGs and action games, this is perfect.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Bell', N'jeremy.bell1632@example.com', '2015-04-23', 4, N'Good copy of minecraft. It has good instruction to tell you how to play. It has a good crafting system so don''t need notes on how to craft stuff. I found it OK it wasn''t a game for me but if you won''t to play minecraft on your ps4 than this a game port.'),
(N'Justin', N'Lee', N'justin.lee2200@example.net', '2015-04-23', 1, N'sucks'),
(N'Janet', N'Perez', N'janet.perez6819@example.net', '2015-04-23', 5, N'worked great just as it was posted.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Henderson', N'christopher.henderson3999@example.com', '2015-04-23', 4, N'fine'),
(N'Henry', N'Reyes', N'henry.reyes4909@example.org', '2015-04-23', 4, N'good'),
(N'Steven', N'Lewis', N'steven.lewis6846@example.net', '2015-04-23', 4, N'Good game my 14 yr old likes it'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Raghunathan', N'cynthia.raghunathan4507@example.com', '2015-04-23', 5, N'One of the best and most functional consoles, it still makes a weird ticking sound when powering down much like the ps3 did, but this is no big deal. Functions as intended and I could not be happier.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Sanchez', N'jerry.sanchez2574@example.net', '2015-04-24', 5, N'Thanks!'),
(N'Carol', N'Reyes', N'carol.reyes8649@example.net', '2015-04-24', 3, N'Just got done passing this games campaign. This games is overhyped, overpriced and conflicted. As a stand alone game it''s good, story''s clich but it has its fun moments of gameplay. As a battlefield game I think it''s underwhelming. The campaign mode moves at a very slow pace up until episode 5 of the 10 episodes it has. it''s something new to the fps genre but it''s definitely not groundbreaking. I did enjoy the campaign more than advanced warfare. The visuals aren''t on par to those of battlefield 4 in campaign mode, but I think the multiplayer is spot on. The multiplayer mode is where I had the most fun. it''s more what I have come to expect out of the battlefield series than the campaign gets close to. This game was being pushed as a cops and robbers story, it''s not. you don''t choose sides in campaign, and you don''t get to rob banks. you''re a cop. most of the game is stealth based. I passed it on the hardest mode and I don''t know if it''s because of this that the ai partners I get...'),
(N'James', N'Richardson', N'james.richardson8046@example.org', '2015-04-24', 4, N'great'),
(N'Kofi', N'Ferreira', N'kofi.ferreira4489@example.com', '2015-04-24', 4, N'They''re actually really nice, it''s just the tall ones are too tall for my liking. The short ones are really nice though.'),
(N'Robert', N'Brooks', N'robert.brooks9132@example.com', '2015-04-24', 4, N'been playing this game past 2 days after reading so many horrible reviews on it I decide to play The Order 1886 for myself. I''m happy I did now I can''t stop playing this game. its real good! the action smooth and fluid the shooting mechanics feels good nice deep story 8.5 out of 10 from me this my opinion.'),
(N'Amy', N'Walker', N'amy.walker9489@example.org', '2015-04-24', 3, N'Okay game, if you like being slaughtered and like having a million buttons and options.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Mitchell', N'katherine.mitchell9264@example.net', '2015-04-25', 5, N'Another excellent limited edition from xseed. This is the latest released Ys game and really works well on the vita, especially if you''ve played the previous games on the Psp. The extras in the silver edition are pretty nice as well. If you are an Ys fan, you know what to expect from the game. The silver edition just adds some nice packaging and extras for collectors. Well worth the price, even now that it''s more rare and expensive.'),
(N'Carol', N'Reyes', N'carol.reyes8649@example.net', '2015-04-25', 3, N'Netherealm took one step forward with the fighting mechanics and actual gameplay, and two steps back in terms of story. With the previous mk game, they simplified the mythology and focused on the core of what makes the series great. With this entry, well let''s just say it''s all over the place. The fatalities are fresh and very brutal, the graphics are top knotch, the controls are fluid, and the combo system works. The krypt has been revamped, they''ve also brought back the towers from the old mk days which all come with their own character stories. Each character has 3 fighting styles which alter the move set and appearance. I loved everything about this game except for what should have been one of the best things about it, the story. Without giving too much away, the story is corny and seems to aim at a younger audience. this makes no sense to me for two reasons, this game has a mature rating, and targets long time fans primarily. You have great graphics and brutal fatalities and...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Gomez', N'benjamin.gomez7942@example.net', '2015-04-25', 5, N'excellent 100% recommended'),
(N'Hannah', N'Castillo', N'hannah.castillo8314@example.net', '2015-04-25', 5, N'Works like new.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Gray', N'zachary.gray7443@example.com', '2015-04-25', 5, N'physical quality of the disc is fine, music is awesom'),
(N'Marcus', N'Kim', N'marcus.kim9569@example.net', '2015-04-25', 5, N'is very very good'),
(N'Douglas', N'Scott', N'douglas.scott5056@example.org', '2015-04-25', 5, N'The main reason I bought a Wii U was to play this game and I have not been disappointed in the slightest. The combat is thrilling and over the top in the best ways you can imagine. Boss fights are nothing short of exciting. The characters are a lot of fun as well with how they interact together. This game is a good reminder that creative ideas in gaming still live. I hope for a third installment to this franchise. If you own a Wii U I suggest picking up this game. If you do not, it''s well worth buying the console for like I did. As soon as I finish this I will start the first game. I was expecting it to be a downloadable copy, but was pleasantly surprised to see it''s on disc. Extra points for that.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ortiz', N'tyler.ortiz7483@example.net', '2015-04-26', 5, N'This is a review of what is included in the retail PC DVD version of the game. It has a special edition packing slipcover with a hologram of Sebastian''s face screaming with barbwire on it. The cover on the case is the same but with a cover on the back of the asylum in black with a blood red sky with a outline a the main character with a gun. Inside is a Steam code for the Fighting Chance Pack digital upgrade and a actual full game manual with the Steam activation code on back. The game is on 4 dvds. Update All the codes work on steam but even after installing from the dvds you will have to download updates that will take awhile to download.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Richardson', N'aaron.richardson3272@example.com', '2015-04-26', 5, N'FUN!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Richardson', N'aaron.richardson3272@example.com', '2015-04-26', 5, N'Call of duty Awesome'),
(N'Jessica', N'Gutierrez', N'jessica.gutierrez6563@example.org', '2015-04-26', 5, N'love peggle? you will love this game. very fun'),
(N'Paul', N'Clark', N'paul.clark8499@example.org', '2015-04-26', 1, N'Very silly emo-drama. Game play is limited to looking around and feeling sorry for the protagonist.'),
(N'Jack', N'Garcia', N'jack.garcia8166@example.com', '2015-04-26', 5, N'Although I don''t intend to open the packing because its Limited. I can say I did get a "Limited edition" and i''m very very happy with this buy!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Ward', N'kevin.ward9165@example.com', '2015-04-26', 5, N'great product!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Cruz', N'kyle.cruz3904@example.net', '2015-04-27', 5, N'very nice'),
(N'Rachel', N'Reyes', N'rachel.reyes9455@example.org', '2015-04-27', 5, N'the kids love it lots of fun'),
(N'Hannah', N'Thomas', N'hannah.thomas8298@example.net', '2015-04-27', 5, N'Pink pink pink. what girl doesn''t like pink ?actually probably a lot of girls don''t like pink but I love it and I love this controller.'),
(N'Priya', N'Richardson', N'priya.richardson7847@example.net', '2015-04-27', 3, N'I ordered these thumb grips hoping they would provide more of a grip on my controller for me so my thumbs don''t slip off. I used them for about an hour and a half and the studs just started making my thumbs hurt so bad that I had to take them off. They were nice but they don''t really provide too much grip but the studs will stop your thumb from slipping off if they are sweaty. I want to like this product but since I can only use it for an hour and then have to take it off because it hurts, I would not recommend this but if you are able to keep your finger directly in the middle of the analog cap, you won''t have this problem but for a game like Call of Duty, for me, that is just not possible. Overall this is a nice product but I can only give it 3 stars because I can''t use it very long and it won''t improve your aim on Call of Duty.(If that''s what you were expecting.)'),
(N'Betty', N'Butler', N'betty.butler9005@example.com', '2015-04-27', 5, N'OLD SCHOOL'),
(N'Betty', N'Butler', N'betty.butler9005@example.com', '2015-04-27', 5, N'COOL'),
(N'Betty', N'Butler', N'betty.butler9005@example.com', '2015-04-27', 5, N'GREAT GAME'),
(N'Douglas', N'Campbell', N'douglas.campbell7727@example.org', '2015-04-28', 5, N'Took a long time to get in but worth the wait. I needed an extra cord when I''m in the car or on the go this one is handy cause everything is starting to have a usb port.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Peterson', N'ronald.peterson7293@example.net', '2015-04-28', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Adam', N'Rivera', N'adam.rivera7591@example.com', '2015-04-28', 5, N'One was OK other was to loose. Reorder second set were good must have got got a bad oe first timr.'),
(N'Justin', N'Sanders', N'justin.sanders9001@example.org', '2015-04-28', 5, N'If you have a New 3DS or even the older model, this gives you every type of charging you could need. I leave the cigarette lighter attachment in the car, and keep the wall attachment at home at my computer desk ready to charge the 3DS anytime. Never had a problem!'),
(N'Carlos', N'Thomas', N'carlos.thomas2159@example.net', '2015-04-28', 5, N'GOOD'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Bell', N'kenneth.bell7551@example.org', '2015-04-28', 1, N'The cash grab that never was'),
(N'Tyler', N'Collins', N'tyler.collins6028@example.com', '2015-04-28', 4, N'Bought this for a family member, he has no complaints and is enjoying the game.'),
(N'Priya', N'Webb', N'priya.webb1639@example.org', '2015-04-28', 5, N'Great Survival Game, is the RE we deserve actually'),
(N'Olivia', N'Henderson', N'olivia.henderson8345@example.com', '2015-04-28', 5, N'eh'),
(N'Larry', N'Harris', N'larry.harris9413@example.org', '2015-04-29', 5, N'This game is simply amazing. Road to the Show mode is the most addicting sports game I''ve ever played. It looks, sounds, and plays just like you''re actually in the game. Love it!!!!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Sullivan', N'jeffrey.sullivan1908@example.com', '2015-04-29', 5, N'Outstanding!! Great Seller!! Highly Recommended!! Thank You!!!'),
(N'Walter', N'Ferreira', N'walter.ferreira3801@example.com', '2015-04-29', 4, N'I finally gave in and picked up TEW digitally the other day when it was on sale for $30 (the physical copy is much cheaper too). Its a pretty intense game, has some good combat mechanics, kinda creepy and keeps you on edge - try playing at night with all the lights off and the sound up! :) Basically this plays out like a greatest hits kinda game for Shinji Mikami (the guy behind Resident Evil), and by that I mean he uses all his great tropes and character ideas to make a chilling and bizarre game that you will enjoy and keeps you tense. Expect grotesque horrors, chainsaw wielding madmen, and zombish fiends from all angles not to mention a few puzzles and traps! The core game-play is very similar to previous Resident Evil games, its a third person over-the-shoulder shooter and will have you sneaking about, searching for supplies, and taking on frightening monsters. Theres a good use of a simple stealth mechanic that will allow you to take-down some of the regular enemies which is...'),
(N'William', N'Henderson', N'william.henderson9817@example.com', '2015-04-29', 5, N'Amazing'),
(N'Barbara', N'Hill', N'barbara.hill6322@example.net', '2015-04-29', 5, N'Diablo III got a lot of flak at launch and rightfully so. But it has undergone so many changes since then that if you are buying the game now disregard any reviews older then the last eight months or so. The one big drawback this game does still have is the same one all new Blizzard games share; you have to have an internet connection to play this game and you can not buy or sell "used" copies due to the nature of the drm. If you can live with that, this is an immensely fun title. As someone who prefers single player I''m not a huge fan of post game, but getting several of the classes up to level seventy has provided more than seventy hours of entertainment and counting. I really like how the leveling system allows you to change your build on the fly and really experiment. My only slight beef is that much of character building at higher levels at least is centered around equipment which while considerably easier today still isn''t easy to get.'),
(N'Eric', N'Ali', N'eric.ali8035@example.org', '2015-04-29', 4, N':)'),
(N'Lauren', N'Patel', N'lauren.patel3454@example.org', '2015-04-29', 5, N'This is simply the best thing you can get on PS3. Only complaint I have is that mgs1 is a download code. Other than that just awesome.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Patel', N'lauren.patel3454@example.org', '2015-04-29', 5, N'So far this game has been awesome. If you were a fan of mk9 like me you will like this game. The new characters I was skeptical at first but a few of them are my favorite to fight with. There is also a lot to do in this game and the story mode is great.'),
(N'Priya', N'Roberts', N'priya.roberts1893@example.com', '2015-04-29', 5, N'Works great! I like to scatter cords through the house so we always have access!'),
(N'Emma', N'Allen', N'emma.allen1637@example.org', '2015-04-30', 1, N'Doesn''t work for me anymore. I plugged in my controllers, charged them once, went to play a game and the controllers were fine. Was done playing, reconnected the controllers, no charge at all. Was trying to play Mortal Kombat and the controller kept dying on me. Was trying to plug it in during game play which sucks because it defeats the point of a wireless controller.'),
(N'Brian', N'Scott', N'brian.scott2502@example.net', '2015-04-30', 5, N'One of the best fighting games in history no doubt, hence one of the most popular around the globe for arcade fighting.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Webb', N'nicholas.webb5318@example.com', '2015-04-30', 5, N'This is just awesome! It''s like a puzzle piece game with a lot of gore and tits. My friend recommended it, now I see why! Favorite game by far of the year!'),
(N'Jason', N'Lewis', N'jason.lewis1809@example.com', '2015-04-30', 5, N'loved that toy..'),
(N'Jason', N'Lewis', N'jason.lewis1809@example.com', '2015-04-30', 5, N'classic still have it..'),
(N'Brandon', N'Webb', N'brandon.webb9944@example.net', '2015-04-30', 5, N'best yet :-)'),
(N'Debra', N'Rogers', N'debra.rogers1429@example.org', '2015-04-30', 5, N'product as described - supplier ships promptly'),
(N'Sandra', N'Cruz', N'sandra.cruz1484@example.org', '2015-04-30', 5, N'I had previously purchased the t100 steering wheel before purchasing this one only to realize that wheel just wasn''t going to live up to my expectations. I needed something more advanced, more serious and the T300RS wheel is just what I was initially looking for and more! Main Points: - The steering wheel itself, not including the base, has some nice weight to it and it feels like it''s about the same weight as a real detachable racing wheel. It''s covered by rubber which makes it very easy to grip onto during some hard racing, even with sweaty hands. The wheel base is very nicely made out of smooth, but tough plastic. I think it will last for quite a long time as the motor works very well and efficiently. The fan kicks on rather quickly, about 20-30 minutes depending on your in-game force feedback settings, albeit quietly, to prevent overheating. You won''t hear it over your racing setup. Tip: This may be going over the top, but I usually have a house fan running in the room that I''m...'),
(N'Anita', N'Morgan', N'anita.morgan3461@example.com', '2015-04-30', 4, N'Once in a while, a game that shouldn''t be that good really suprises me (like Deadly Premonition, Toy Story 3, Earth Defense Force games, etc.) I can''t remember having this much fun for $16. Truly a fun and amusing game all around. I had never even heard of the original and I regret that now. I love humor in games and his name is Lo Wang for crying out loud. There are limitless giggles from that alone. And a lot of the fortune cookies are classic. Truly some unique twists on a ''gonzo'' fps with the sword and powers. Story is actually pretty interesting. The graphics are kinda ugly but do not take anything away from the experience in my opinion and this was a budget game. There are no maps and I think the controls were very touchy when trying sword special moves or heals but, nothing major on the negative side. All in all, I am enjoying the game as much as I enjoyed Wolfenstein new order. It''s a different tone and obviously the production values are a lot lower but, fun-wise it''s...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nguyen', N'benjamin.nguyen5413@example.org', '2015-04-30', 5, N'I brought this set as the chance to play some RTS Star Wars appealed to me a bit. I was a bit worried about my OS as I''m running Win 8.1 on a new i5 system and was worried about the games not running well on it. This turned not to be a problem at all. First the installation went mostly smoothly. Both games have a code that is entered to install both games. It''s a bit confusing if your are only installing the base game as the expansion pack item won''t be available unless you selected the center item that installed the WHOLE gold pack. If you install both items (the base game and expansion), you first enter the base game number which then installs and then the installer asked for the expansion pack number and after you enter it, it installs the expansion pack. After you''re done the install item becomes the play item and you select what you want to play. I have Win 8.1 and decided to play the sample mission to see how well the game would run on my system. The game started up with no...'),
(N'Nicole', N'Jimenez', N'nicole.jimenez9514@example.net', '2015-04-30', 5, N'Cool game'),
(N'Diane', N'Khan', N'diane.khan4792@example.org', '2015-04-30', 5, N'a great game from amazing series. this will have you afraid to turn off the lights to play it'),
(N'Diane', N'Khan', N'diane.khan4792@example.org', '2015-04-30', 5, N'amazingly fun game'),
(N'Diane', N'Khan', N'diane.khan4792@example.org', '2015-04-30', 5, N'fun game, but you need paid XBOX live gold subscription to enjoy the game'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Wood', N'kimberly.wood8172@example.net', '2015-04-30', 5, N'Gran Turismo 5 XL Edition is AMAZING. I love Gran Turismo and this game makes me love it even more'),
(N'Aisha', N'Hall', N'aisha.hall7944@example.com', '2015-05-01', 4, N'it''s a great item'),
(N'Priya', N'Howard', N'priya.howard5192@example.net', '2015-05-01', 5, N'Great game.. Great story.. Great art Still enjoying it'),
(N'Christopher', N'Walker', N'christopher.walker4808@example.org', '2015-05-01', 5, N'Thank you I love it.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nelson', N'sandra.nelson2065@example.org', '2015-05-01', 3, N'I''m not sure I am the best person to review a console since I bought it solely for one game. I wish I could say I was more impressed but it''s just not what I really want to play my games on. Graphics for the games aren''t that great and the PS4 can only just keep up. "Next Gen" is so 5 years ago.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Donna', N'Jones', N'donna.jones8942@example.net', '2015-05-01', 5, N'Good fun, as advertised'),
(N'Samuel', N'Fisher', N'samuel.fisher6236@example.com', '2015-05-01', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Jason', N'Chavez', N'jason.chavez9331@example.org', '2015-05-01', 4, N'A fun iteration in the Sims franchise, and a good way for console gamers to get into the Sims. My only real complaints are - A lack of content compared to the PC version - Over priced DLC that adds little to the overall experience of the game. If you have a PC then I recommend getting the Sims for PC but if not then be sure to give this a try on console.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Sanders', N'stephanie.sanders7643@example.org', '2015-05-01', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Victoria', N'James', N'victoria.james1648@example.org', '2015-05-02', 5, N'The best vita cases out there.trust me when I say that I have tried them all.they fit the games perfectly snug and I received each specific design that I ordered,that of which I can only say for myself as some of the other reviews claim they did not recieve the exact design they ordered? I was and am more then impressed with the quality of these cases. My only gripe is that it took several weeks to arrive? I''m not sure why there is such a wait time,but after receiving the merchandise I can say that These cases are well worth the wait and turn out to be quite the cool collectibles if not the greatest vita cartridge case on the market!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Harris', N'nancy.harris9928@example.net', '2015-05-02', 5, N'So far I''m very happy with these. They are comfortable, sturdy, and sound great.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Cook', N'jacob.cook8620@example.org', '2015-05-02', 4, N'Good game!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Boyd', N'sofia.boyd5311@example.net', '2015-05-02', 3, N'Not bad'),
(N'Jack', N'Jimenez', N'jack.jimenez5549@example.org', '2015-05-02', 5, N'Good product, fast delivery.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Hughes', N'olivia.hughes9373@example.com', '2015-05-02', 2, N'1>graphics is so so. i thought i was playing ps3 version. 2>camera angle sucks. the fact they place character near center in third-person view sucks.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Stewart', N'jacob.stewart5078@example.net', '2015-05-02', 4, N'best franchise ever but doesn''t seem to transfer very well to the small screen. This is one of those games where your hand gets cramped on a big controller. Imagine it on a somewhat cramped 3ds. Plus it is hard to see on the small screen, where your character is at especially.'),
(N'Wei', N'Powell', N'wei.powell1469@example.com', '2015-05-02', 5, N'Great for an older game.'),
(N'Donna', N'Jimenez', N'donna.jimenez5947@example.net', '2015-05-02', 4, N'I''d you enjoy the middle earth look and feel, then you should give this game a try. I found the game very entertaining, and the graphics are great!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Phillips', N'kofi.phillips1822@example.org', '2015-05-03', 3, N'gift item'),
(N'Henry', N'Ross', N'henry.ross8379@example.org', '2015-05-03', 4, N'MLB 14 The Show was a good PS4 game. It was the first on the new generation. It definitely looked nice, but overall changed very little. Road to the Show, Diamond Dynasty, Franchise- they were all good, but to say they were new would be a lie. 15 is a version of 14 that, while not changing the game completely, makes improvements that are definitely worth the $60 upgrade. Diamond Dynasty is the online portion that lets you customize everything from uniform to roster to name and logo. It''s very deep, allows you to create exactly the team you want, and unlike 14 it actually works. 14''s was a mess. Too complex with contracts and training and the points system, online games lagged to the point of unplayability. But 15 allows you to collect and keep cards forever. It also introduces a RTTS-like character for your team. The online portion is not laggy and works. Overall, this is the big game mode for this game. RTTS is a fan favorite, of course, but it''s getting repetitive. It''s still...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Clark', N'aisha.clark2145@example.com', '2015-05-03', 5, N'Ok let me put it to you like this guys,I bought mine in Feb 2014 so as you can see,I spent a lot of time enjoying my ps4 that I forgot to write a review so i decided to do it today because I was looking at for some new games to buy. Graphics are totally AMAZING,and the console is absolutely beautiful & worth really the price. Im a PS & a SONY fan since day one but I had play Xbox at my friends & cousins house but never got one because I don''t like it. You won''t regret a thing about this console check it out'),
(N'Donna', N'Ali', N'donna.ali9209@example.net', '2015-05-03', 5, N'Fun game. Brand new. No problems and it shipped quickly.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Diaz', N'nicole.diaz9855@example.org', '2015-05-03', 5, N'Good! highly recommended'),
(N'Judith', N'Bailey', N'judith.bailey9264@example.com', '2015-05-04', 5, N'awesome so easy'),
(N'Frank', N'Brooks', N'frank.brooks6986@example.org', '2015-05-04', 5, N'I purchased this along with redbull and a hat that holds beer cans, for extended playing sessions!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Powell', N'elizabeth.powell1228@example.net', '2015-05-04', 2, N'Gift.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Evans', N'gregory.evans1254@example.com', '2015-05-04', 5, N'good'),
(N'Janet', N'Flores', N'janet.flores6971@example.net', '2015-05-04', 5, N'great'),
(N'Ashley', N'Jimenez', N'ashley.jimenez2981@example.net', '2015-05-04', 5, N'fantastic'),
(N'Alexander', N'Bennett', N'alexander.bennett6615@example.net', '2015-05-04', 1, N'This cable broke on me recently despite me taking good care of it. I will need to find a different brand to buy a 3ds USB charging cable from.'),
(N'Joan', N'Morris', N'joan.morris7453@example.org', '2015-05-04', 4, N'Enjoy the game'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed5142@example.org', '2015-05-05', 3, N'Was plug and play and worked great with Windows 7, but you WILL NOT get this to work on Windows 8. I spent about 2 hours searching for drivers for this product and similar products on the net, but there are no fixes. Hopefully Windows 10 resolves the issue, but I''m not very optimistic.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Nelson', N'anthony.nelson3380@example.net', '2015-05-05', 5, N'As described, fast delivery.'),
(N'Justin', N'Edwards', N'justin.edwards7041@example.org', '2015-05-05', 5, N'Was fantastic... until ME3 came out, which was more fantastic. Would highly recommend.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ross', N'aisha.ross6162@example.net', '2015-05-05', 5, N'Bought this as a gift for a friend and they love the game. He plays it all the time.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Reed', N'amanda.reed9602@example.net', '2015-05-05', 1, N'Wow, I don''t know what to say. I originally gave this thing a 5 star rating, but somehow overlooked a glaring problem with it. The mouse is inaccurate, laughably so. To drag the mouse from right to left in a somewhat straight line, is nearly impossible, the mouse randomly jerks and twitches. I don''t know if this is an outdated software issue (The company was merged with another company so I couldn''t find any software support that helped) or the mouse being poorly made, either way It started out annoying, became unusable, avoid this mouse.'),
(N'Julie', N'Harris', N'julie.harris5945@example.com', '2015-05-05', 5, N'very fun and great characters to play'),
(N'Wei', N'Brown', N'wei.brown3817@example.org', '2015-05-05', 5, N'great product ,'),
(N'Julie', N'Cox', N'julie.cox7880@example.net', '2015-05-05', 5, N'For me, this is a great fightstick. All Sanwa parts, easy to mod/upgrade. There aren''t many options for X1 fighsticks currently, but it''s good to know you''ll be getting a quality product if you go with this. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Richard', N'Robinson', N'richard.robinson5636@example.net', '2015-05-06', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Ronald', N'Bennett', N'ronald.bennett1511@example.net', '2015-05-06', 5, N'this is my favorite super smash bro.s game period and i got lucky buying it with a amazon gift card and it''s now a rare and high priced game.'),
(N'Henry', N'Long', N'henry.long9638@example.com', '2015-05-06', 3, N'I liked it ... not much replay value with these games though.'),
(N'Henry', N'Tanaka', N'henry.tanaka1807@example.org', '2015-05-06', 3, N'I''ve been a long-time Battlefield player, stretching all the way back to BF 1942, but this game just misses the mark that made Battlefield what it was. The departure to a cops and robbers game-play was an interesting idea, but comes off as forced. Trying to make a military shooter fit into this theme really left the designers in a corner and it shows in failures to adapt the basic fundamentals into something more than a reskinned Battlefield 4. The single-player campaign is interesting and engaging, but can at times be incredibly frustrating, as some bugs continue to persist. There is enough AI variation to make things occasionally interesting, but even then, the AI doesn''t always actually capitalize on the variation. I''ve walked straight into AI characters I wasn''t expecting (because they shifted patrols), but the AI didn''t read me and I made it back around a corner. The multi-player will be a foreign world to the Battlefield veteran. Unlike the old progression system where you...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Sanders', N'michelle.sanders8690@example.org', '2015-05-06', 5, N'Amazing'),
(N'Sharon', N'Gutierrez', N'sharon.gutierrez3768@example.org', '2015-05-06', 4, N'Great! Just wish it had a on/off switch. If its charged, itll keep on charging your ps vita no matter what. Even if its full charged'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Long', N'carolyn.long1955@example.org', '2015-05-06', 5, N'Purchased for my husband he loves the game.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Patel', N'joshua.patel8666@example.com', '2015-05-06', 5, N'Amazon needs to remove people that make 1-star reviews if they''re obvious troll reviews. If you liked the previous Wolfenstein, it''s more of the same. I loved the previous installment so I consider this one just as great. But mostly, this review (currently) is to cancel out those stupid 2-star reviews.'),
(N'Maria', N'Kelly', N'maria.kelly3352@example.org', '2015-05-07', 5, N'good fifa game on the go'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ramos', N'jessica.ramos7174@example.com', '2015-05-07', 4, N'Controls can be obtuse at times, but a unique experience. Genuinely original and I can''t believe that I am saying that about a Capcom product.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Baker', N'kyle.baker6846@example.net', '2015-05-07', 5, N'i bought this to give my MM N3DS XL a cozy home with a special design that makes the pouch more elegant the new updated 3DS fits perfectly in this 3DS XL pouch and it has good material feel with 6 slots to put your DS \ 3DS & N3DS cartridges and a styles holder in an organized divider . and the 8Bit mario design on top makes and old school gamer feel happy worth the purchase'),
(N'Sofia', N'Foster', N'sofia.foster3650@example.org', '2015-05-07', 3, N'gift'),
(N'Emily', N'Ramirez', N'emily.ramirez8760@example.com', '2015-05-07', 3, N'This headset could have quite possibly been one of the best that I had ever used, if it weren''t for a few of the overwhelming flaws of this headset. What sold me on the Elite 800s to begin with was it''s bluetooth functionality. It''s surprising that so many of the competitors have not implemented this technology in their headsets, it boosts the value of the set so much to be able to seamlessly transition between your PS4, PC, and Phone with the push of a button. Some of the EQ presets sound amazing, The Advanced Warfare Multiplayer preset was perfect for Call of Duty, and the Super Human Hearing was a nice touch as well. Sadly, that''s about where the pros end, and the list of cons SEVERELY outweigh the pros. CON 1) The headset looks and feel very sturdy and well built at first glance, but unfortunately that''s not the case. After about 3 days of use, the plastic in the headset began to creak and crack with every subtle movement. Not only that, but if I applied slightly more force...'),
(N'Ashley', N'Evans', N'ashley.evans1201@example.com', '2015-05-07', 2, N'Just not my taste.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Baker', N'tomasz.baker2257@example.org', '2015-05-07', 1, N'nice game, just wish one that the publisher would actually make a western port of this game so I can try to understand what the story is all about, but very flashy combat. This game has some of the worst boss battle concepts I''ve seen in 28+ years of playing video games'),
(N'Angela', N'Powell', N'angela.powell6037@example.com', '2015-05-07', 5, N'Anyone Having Trouble With These Is An Ape Like Human Being. BEST PURCHASE EVER, STOP THINKING AND BUY IT'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Jackson', N'jonathan.jackson1872@example.org', '2015-05-07', 2, N'Not much game here. Fighting was repetitive and the landscapes were bland. Game was boring after a couple hours. Not sure it was even worth $20.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Suzuki', N'gregory.suzuki9253@example.net', '2015-05-07', 5, N'This game is in great condition, Ive had no problems and I love this game! I would recommend this game and seller to anyone. Thanks!'),
(N'Jose', N'Hall', N'jose.hall9581@example.net', '2015-05-08', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Paul', N'Watson', N'paul.watson3310@example.com', '2015-05-08', 5, N'Very comfortable.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Chavez', N'jeremy.chavez3675@example.com', '2015-05-08', 3, N'I die a lot'),
(N'Scott', N'Lewis', N'scott.lewis7437@example.org', '2015-05-08', 5, N'it was great i like the game'),
(N'Sandra', N'Bell', N'sandra.bell3837@example.net', '2015-05-08', 5, N'I grew up on the Serious Sam games and remember having to ask my dad''s permission to play the original. They were always a blast to play, but I never played the HD remasters before now. They are all included on the disc, as well as Serious Sam 3 (and DLC,) as well as DDXL. There isn''t much to say about the games that hasn''t already been said: For an old-school, hilarious, and challenging first person shooter, look no further. The gameplay is repetitive, sure, and there isn''t always a variety of enemies, but bang for buck, it''s hard to find a more fun game. The level design is incredibly linear and beginning to show its age, but the secrets and hidden items prove to be rewarding. Co-op is fun if you can find servers. Consider how much of a bargain this collection is: If purchased individually on the Xbox marketplace, this collection would cost you upwards of $40, but for $10, it''s hard to find a better deal on such fun games. Altogether, while the game lacks proper narrative and...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ortiz', N'ethan.ortiz7087@example.org', '2015-05-08', 5, N'This controller is a perfect addition to the original one that comes with the console. You can''t go wrong with this one (and the pink is a nice colorful touch).'),
(N'Stephen', N'Price', N'stephen.price2175@example.com', '2015-05-08', 3, N'love the game, don''t like the 22 days to ship it.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Hall', N'rebecca.hall9323@example.org', '2015-05-08', 5, N'All time favorite Tetris. Better than any Tetris. Though I do miss the NES Tetris music. I wish the version of Tetris let you listen to that catchy Russian tune.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Gomez', N'lucia.gomez3146@example.com', '2015-05-08', 5, N'one of best game ever made !!'),
(N'Betty', N'Jones', N'betty.jones5933@example.org', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Linda', N'Taylor', N'linda.taylor4450@example.com', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Like many people, I have been trying to collect every amiibo. But I actually enjoy using them, rather than keeping them indefinitely trapped in their plastic prison. So these Japanese and EU region amiibos are great for me, since they are usually cheaper than North American ones, and only the box is different, which I open anyway. I also like the option of having one come in two days with Prime rather than waiting forever on an eBay option. So while it is regrettable that they are still higher than MSRP here, it''s still better than nothing. As you can see in my photos, the physical amiibo figure is literally the exact same across all regions, including the writing on the bottom of the platform. And they are all region free and will work an any region Wii U. Wii Fit Trainer doesn''t have any unique unlocks or games special to her. Just the respective Smash Bros character and generic unlocks from other games (Hyrule Warriors, Mario Party 10, etc). It''s too bad the supply issues are so...'),
(N'Yuki', N'Taylor', N'yuki.taylor3806@example.com', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Its a good game love it'),
(N'Omar', N'Collins', N'omar.collins3093@example.org', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Katherine', N'Jones', N'katherine.jones3156@example.com', '2015-05-09', 5, N'This is a really neat game, but there is a pretty steep learning curve. There are a lot of courses, different riders that you can select, and many other options. You can also play two players racing against each other. My two grandsons had a ball with it.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Nelson', N'kimberly.nelson6011@example.org', '2015-05-09', 5, N'This game is difficult. However, it is perhaps one of the most nostalgic games that i can remember. I spent hours on this game trying to learn how to play it and understand it. Sure, there are some cheap mechanics that serve only to prolong the game. But those are mechanics i have come to love. Overall, this is a fun game, but is certainly not for everybody. Be prepared for an immense challenge.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Nelson', N'kimberly.nelson6011@example.org', '2015-05-09', 5, N'It is what it is, a nice replacement batterypack for a 360 controller. I had to replace my stock one because it kept loosing contact with the controller and would shut off the controller while i was playing. This replacement fixed that issue, and now that controller is working great. The only issue i had was that it shipped out of china (?) and took almost a month to get to me. But i cannot complain, because the shipping was cheap. Overall a great buy.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Gutierrez', N'carlos.gutierrez7157@example.com', '2015-05-09', 1, N'Didn''t work waste of time and money'),
(N'Karen', N'Fisher', N'karen.fisher4235@example.net', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Item as described. A pleasure to do business with !!!'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Rogers', N'hiroshi.rogers2403@example.net', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Good game, but where is the story line......'),
(N'Rachel', N'Diaz', N'rachel.diaz7609@example.org', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Kids love the game'),
(N'Stephen', N'Cook', N'stephen.cook2041@example.com', '2015-05-09', 5, N'Its a good silly game'),
(N'Nathan', N'Gomez', N'nathan.gomez6611@example.com', '2015-05-10', 5, N'Just wanted to do a quick review. I think the graphics are top notch for its time. It''s got a battle system that felt intuitive but not too simplistic. Not the best RPG ever but a highlight in the series.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Ramos', N'amanda.ramos3141@example.com', '2015-05-10', 5, N'Great wheel, especially at this price. I received this wheel in a trade and have no complaints. You will probably need to turn down the sensitivity by hitting the triggers and X, B buttons at the same time. Definitely takes a little getting used to but don''t give up because when you got it down it adds a huge level of immersion to any driving game (Im on Forza Horizon 2). There isn''t any force feedback but in my experience those wheels actually overdoo that feature and it gets in the way of the experience. This one uses a bungee system and it mimics power steering really well. All in all a great deal. If you DO want a wheel with feedback you''ll be spending waaay more.'),
(N'Maria', N'Ruiz', N'maria.ruiz1206@example.net', '2015-05-10', 5, N'Rainbow Six 3 review 1. Graphics: 10. Great for an 03 title, overall very solid. 2. Story: 10. Easy to follow with the commentary of your commander. 3. Voice Acting: 9. Team, enemies, overall well done voice acting. 4. Sounds/Music: 10. The sound is GREAT on this game, and I found myself humming the music more than I normally would from a game''s soundtrack. 5. Guns/gadgets: 10. Amazing selection of guns, many options for gadgets. One Of the best weapon/gadget selections on the original xbox. 6. Difficulty: 6. Down point of the game, very difficult, could take several attempts at certain areas before you master it and can beat it without taking too much damage. 7. Loadout options: 10. You can choose 3 guns and a grenade, 1 gun and 3 grenades, 1 gun, 1 grenade, 2 breaching devices. The options are plentiful for an original xbox title. 8. Level design: 10. All of the levels are interesting, many ambushes can happen if you''re not careful and always check above you, the enemy loves the...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Bell', N'ravi.bell2303@example.org', '2015-05-10', 5, N'Great fun. Disclaimer, I bought the XBox for my boys and just started playing a bit myself, I''m in my late 40''s. So, all these older games are new to me. HOLY COW!! I"ve bought quite a few older games and blown away by the details. This one is loads of fun. What''s not like? Rummaging around a beautiful island wasting everybody that crosses my path searching for my lost friends? Only into it for a total of about 3-4 hours and can see that this thing is massive.'),
(N'Emma', N'Martin', N'emma.martin9843@example.org', '2015-05-10', 5, N'Stick with the Sony controller, off brands just aren''t the same its worth the extra money'),
(N'Nicole', N'Bailey', N'nicole.bailey5792@example.com', '2015-05-10', 5, N'I am reviewing this after a couple years and I still use this controller to this day. All official Sony PS3 controllers are great, and the Candy Pink starts a conversation.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Phillips', N'joyce.phillips5897@example.net', '2015-05-10', 5, N'Received this cable in unofficial packaging but it does have the Sony logo so it is official. Works just like it should. Be warned it COMES ONLY WITH THE CABLE NO AC ADAPTER. Good for a replacement or duplicate item. I have no idea whether it was intentional or not but my package came with a bonus item and for that I am very grateful even if it was potentially an order mistake. Definitely would recommend this seller. Official Sony product for a low price with a bonus item that is always a plus in my book'),
(N'Wei', N'Green', N'wei.green3555@example.org', '2015-05-10', 5, N'great seller, highly recommend'),
(N'Ashley', N'Richardson', N'ashley.richardson3419@example.net', '2015-05-11', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Sandra', N'Morales', N'sandra.morales5404@example.net', '2015-05-11', 5, N'This is a Hori screen protector, branded under the Nintendo DSi name/packaging. Many consider Hori to be the best, I find it tied with Martin-Fields Overlay in the screen protector department category. I bought a Nintendo branded third-party screen protector in their "clean and protect" kit, and it was AWFUL--very difficult to apply, and not as effective. Other third-party screen protectors have left a film/residue, that is why I say brand matters. My experience with the Hori/Nintendo co-branded product was smooth and easy and it''s been quite effective on my DS Lite and DSi. A good tip for the application process is to have a credit card or something similar handy, and press gently down and forward simultaneously as you peel it off, because if you don''t "smooth it out" you will end up with air bubbles, or particles of dust which create visual imperfections. The reason I give this 4 stars instead of 5 is, while this does provide excellent screen protection, the glare reduction...'),
(N'Tyler', N'James', N'tyler.james1836@example.org', '2015-05-11', 4, N'Great tem , my son love this carcter Of the Skylanders. Same price as the Store sended directly to my house'),
(N'Anthony', N'Scott', N'anthony.scott9010@example.org', '2015-05-11', 5, N'Awesome game for my collection'),
(N'Dee', N'Hernandez', N'dee.hernandez3682@example.org', '2015-05-11', 5, N'I love this game. It''s extremely fun and it''s just as good as the other Sly games in my opinion. I really hope they make a 5th one on next gen'),
(N'Raymond', N'Lopez', N'raymond.lopez1084@example.org', '2015-05-11', 5, N'A fun golf game.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Lopez', N'raymond.lopez1084@example.org', '2015-05-11', 5, N'Really fun and enjoyable Sprint Car racing game.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Lopez', N'raymond.lopez1084@example.org', '2015-05-11', 5, N'An Excellent Tom Clancy game for PSP.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Morgan', N'brandon.morgan6792@example.com', '2015-05-11', 5, N'Stil using it'),
(N'Jessica', N'Chen', N'jessica.chen6110@example.net', '2015-05-11', 5, N'Great game. F 1 race lovers will enjoy it, Very realistic.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Phillips', N'ivan.phillips7030@example.com', '2015-05-12', 5, N'This screen protector is really nice. It fits the Vita slim perfectly and has a really effective application system. Definitely a great purchase.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Evans', N'amanda.evans8365@example.com', '2015-05-12', 5, N'On the box, this collection is described as an "HD remaster." I cannot think of a better term for this package. This definitely had more work put into it than your run-of-the-mill HD port collection , and I don''t just mean visually too. Overall, I''m pretty impressed by the amount of upgrades these games received. For those who are already familiar with the original Final Fantasy X and X-2 and want to hear about the enhancements/changes the games have in this package, skip my mini-reviews of them. If you''re new to the FFX/X-2 saga and want to know a little bit more about those games, then I''ll try to sum them up in a concise manner. *Should you even bother getting the PS4 version of these games?* Note: I bought and played the PS3 version of this remaster back in the day and loved it. If you haven''t played these games, whether in their original OR PS3 remastered forms, then I highly recommend getting this version of them. The PS4 version is the definitive one by a large amount as far...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Flores', N'ethan.flores6118@example.net', '2015-05-12', 5, N'Great product for the value. Very happy with purchase.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Cruz', N'carolyn.cruz1652@example.com', '2015-05-12', 5, N'I wrote an entire review of this game, and then had to delete it when I realized after more play that I understood nothing about it. I don''t think I can really be blamed for this though, as this game is nothing but a tutorial until you reach level 20, at which point you are fully able to play the game. If you approach this game as a single player campaign, you are going to be disappointed. It''s frequently overly difficult, and there''s no local co-op play. Worse, the environments are all very bland in appearance, and retread the same worlds over and over again. When I first tried this game out a few days at a time here and there (checking out at the library), I would play for a day or two and then get bored, or frustrated, or both (repeating the same levels over and over and over again get tiresome, and several times I felt like giving up). But then, a friend of mine started playing with me, joining my fire team, and I discovered what this game is supposed to be. Many have pointed...'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Chavez', N'jeffrey.chavez4441@example.net', '2015-05-12', 5, N'Is a case, fits 3 games, a usb charging cable (but not a wall wart for it), and the new 3ds xl if you pack it all in right.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Clark', N'matthew.clark7093@example.net', '2015-05-12', 5, N'Kids love this figure, infinity figures are not as sturdy as Skylanders, break off bases easily.'),
(N'Emily', N'Flores', N'emily.flores8484@example.net', '2015-05-12', 5, N'*Stupid giggling* Friggin'' love it.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Nguyen', N'lucia.nguyen6807@example.net', '2015-05-12', 5, N'isk isk baby !'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Patel', N'evelyn.patel8827@example.net', '2015-05-12', 5, N'The package is sealed nicely, and delivery was speedy. Graphics look great on PSP!!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Patel', N'evelyn.patel8827@example.net', '2015-05-12', 5, N'Wow! Really good game with good graphics. I recommend!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Clark', N'amanda.clark6110@example.com', '2015-05-13', 4, N'Works great and looks great.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Lopez', N'andrea.lopez9530@example.org', '2015-05-13', 3, N'I have had my Razer Blackwidow keyboard for about two years. The "A" key sticks a few times per hours caaausing (this). It is annoying when typing and annoying when playing games as well. The keyboard works good for the first year and a half. Overaall (again) I love Razer products. I have a Razer mouse, keyboaard (again), headset, etc.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nelson', N'sandra.nelson3770@example.com', '2015-05-13', 1, N'Good graphics, but this game is not as good as budokai tenkaichi 3 or raging blast 2. It simply does not have the same mechanics and it feels like they downgraded with this game.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Khan', N'jennifer.khan4227@example.com', '2015-05-13', 5, N'good'),
(N'Noah', N'Ramirez', N'noah.ramirez3334@example.org', '2015-05-13', 1, N'Loved Dragon Age: Origins; Liked Dragon Age II; detest Dragon Age:Inquisition. To begin with the Character creation/editing module is buggy, so I gave that up and accepted one of the standard character models. The basic design of the game has some significant changes from the previous version, and they aren''t good. Movement is awkward, battles seem pointless, voice acting seems wooden, animation is crude, and I quickly decided I just don''t care about the characters or the plot (which looks like a direct ripoff of the MMO Rift). Can''t believe Bioware would blow it this badly, but after about an hour''s play I uninstalled the game. I play a LOT of PC games and I can''t be bothered with this one.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Smith', N'matthew.smith6016@example.org', '2015-05-13', 5, N'Awesome game. A must-have for any Wii U owner.'),
