(N'Tomasz', N'Russell', N'tomasz.russell7188@example.org', '2015-05-14', 4, N'well this is a great game for any die hard fan but the reason it only gets 4 stars the gold scorpion code that we receive doesn''t work. the game play is great but they shouldnt have changed some peoples moveset who learned the combos from the previous mk game. this a worth buy for xbox one or playstation 4 the last gen consoles get this game next year.'),
