(N'Samantha', N'Ward', N'samantha.ward4112@example.net', '2015-05-15', 4, N'Intricate, great visuals, FAST action, no complaints!'),
(N'Jack', N'Allen', N'jack.allen6703@example.net', '2015-05-15', 4, N'I sounds great but came used :('),
(N'Kimberly', N'Robinson', N'kimberly.robinson2077@example.com', '2015-05-15', 5, N'Awesome game my son loves it he is 6 years old'),
(N'Emily', N'Cooper', N'emily.cooper6473@example.net', '2015-05-15', 5, N'Probably one of my favorites titles on the PS4.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Thomas', N'mateo.thomas9848@example.org', '2015-05-15', 5, N'Lego Games Always The Best'),
(N'Aisha', N'White', N'aisha.white2860@example.com', '2015-05-15', 1, N'I guess I should say I''ve never played a Devil May Cry game before. I played for 10 minutes before turning it off. Main character is a snotty kid with a 6pack who opens the door naked after having a 3some with strippers? Who @ Ninja studio''s or whatever is trying to compensate? Horribly annoying music that blares as you fight? Nothing but button mashing combat? Oh man this was brutally bad, maybe the worst game I''ve ever played. I''ve never played a game with such boring and nonsensical combat. The buttons involve ''smash triangle repeatedly every fight, with some circles peppered in''. This is arcade-button mashing at it''s finest, and apparently its not my style whatsoever. To shoot you don''t even aim, it just finds the target for you and you press square. Oh so boring. I was trying to fill in this gaming void between Bloodborne/DS2 being released and the Witcher, glad it comes out on Tuesday, because there''s been some -bad- stuff in April/May so far.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wood', N'nathan.wood4853@example.com', '2015-05-15', 2, N'This game is the definition of a grinder. At first I loved it after the first week it was only okay, after he second week I wanted to trade it in. The only reason I still have it is because no place will give me more than $10 for it. Maybe if the game wasn''t hyped as much people wouldn''t be so down on it. I wish blockbuster was still around this was a perfect game for it or you can gamefly it. Enjoy the fun while it lasts.'),
(N'Luis', N'Collins', N'luis.collins3532@example.org', '2015-05-15', 5, N'Stunning scenery and amazing updates to the storyline! Fantastic gameplay and well worth the buy!!!'),
(N'Carlos', N'King', N'carlos.king7990@example.org', '2015-05-15', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Lauren', N'Alvarez', N'lauren.alvarez4568@example.net', '2015-05-16', 4, N'Revisiting my child hood. I remember this was one of the first ps2 game I ever purchased. The vita version has FFX on psvita card, and a download voucher for FFX2. This was a bit disappointing since FFX2 takes up a lot of space. IMPROVEMENTS: --The game has sharper textures --Slightly enhanced/different character models --Reworked/enhanced Music (FFX only, FFX2 still uses ps2 track) --both titles are the international version + last mission editions, never before released in america. this adds hours of new content --audio drama tells a new story that connects FFX to FFX2 CONS: --FFX2 uses old ps2 track --While certain graphics are slightly improved, still looks extremely close to ps2 version, HD remaster is an over statement, at least on vita version. FFX2 is download only, make sure your vita card has at least 6gb'),
(N'Heather', N'Patel', N'heather.patel4928@example.com', '2015-05-16', 5, N'Yes this mouse is a bit pricey but it changes colors and lights up a dark room while in an extended gaming session light night style! A very well constructed mouse -- as you would expect from Razer. Exceptionally responsive and contributed to me being accepted by MLG recently.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Sanders', N'timothy.sanders2445@example.net', '2015-05-16', 5, N'it''s fine'),
(N'Kyle', N'Myers', N'kyle.myers8419@example.org', '2015-05-16', 3, N'I''m hoping the second time I try this (already used up the first one) that there won''t be as many bubbles. So many bubbles, I had to take it off so I could see the screen.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Nguyen', N'michelle.nguyen2257@example.net', '2015-05-16', 4, N'Nothing wrong yet'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Watson', N'jennifer.watson1928@example.com', '2015-05-16', 5, N'Great game lots of fun'),
(N'Joseph', N'Allen', N'joseph.allen2502@example.org', '2015-05-17', 5, N'inmejorable'),
(N'Karen', N'Martinez', N'karen.martinez8442@example.net', '2015-05-17', 5, N'Very good and as expected. Recommended !'),
(N'Aisha', N'Stewart', N'aisha.stewart9837@example.com', '2015-05-17', 5, N'one of the greatest games i''ve played in years who doesn''t love lord of the rings? the hobbit still sucks though (the movies)'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Jackson', N'jennifer.jackson6515@example.com', '2015-05-17', 4, N'It''s a pretty okay game with a nice twist.'),
(N'Jason', N'Martin', N'jason.martin4846@example.net', '2015-05-17', 3, N'I thought I was going to like this game, however I feel like is too repetitive for my liking, although this is ENTIRELY my personal opinion. The controls are wonky and the fighting is very rehash from other titles. This is certainly not a "GAME changer". I thought that out of all my Purchases this would be the one I would play the most but overall I''ve only played sporadically.'),
(N'Julie', N'Morgan', N'julie.morgan4511@example.com', '2015-05-17', 4, N'This Sades (model SA-738) comes in a nicely designed box but has no instructions other than a small piece of paper that has an illustration telling you where the volume control is located (as it is a bit small and hard to locate at times). Not that this headset is complicated but I would like a set of instructions to detail the features of the set and warranty information, of which there is no warranty indicated. The headset is made of white plastic and comes with an attached cord that is approximately 6 feet 5 inches in length and has a connector for USB and for separate microphone/headset jacks. The USB plug only powers the blue LED lights on the headset which unfortunately limits it flexibility in use (such as my PS3). The USB light really isn''t something I really value in a gaming headset. These gaming headphones are a budget level headset but that doesn''t necessarily make it a bad thing. Connecting to my Windows 7 computer was no issue and I was actually quite surprised at the...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Thompson', N'kenneth.thompson4305@example.com', '2015-05-17', 4, N'Had a bit of trouble getting this to work, but it eventually worked.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Turner', N'rebecca.turner1924@example.com', '2015-05-17', 3, N'huge game really fun'),
(N'Tyler', N'Collins', N'tyler.collins9143@example.org', '2015-05-17', 5, N'Thank you'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ferreira', N'victoria.ferreira9941@example.org', '2015-05-18', 5, N'LOVE MKX!!'),
(N'Brian', N'Coleman', N'brian.coleman7750@example.net', '2015-05-18', 5, N'Fun game'),
(N'Stephen', N'Collins', N'stephen.collins6629@example.org', '2015-05-18', 5, N'it is a really great game'),
(N'Heather', N'Wilson', N'heather.wilson5772@example.com', '2015-05-18', 4, N'Very good sniper game. Holds up to the original'),
(N'Stephen', N'Jimenez', N'stephen.jimenez8292@example.org', '2015-05-18', 5, N'Fast service and fun game thx'),
(N'Stephen', N'Jimenez', N'stephen.jimenez8292@example.org', '2015-05-18', 5, N'Awesome game great edition'),
(N'George', N'Roberts', N'george.roberts6562@example.org', '2015-05-18', 1, N'I got something completely different than is listed here, on the box and in the directions, the base that I have does not have any lighted controller symbols or lights to show it has power, I also left both controllers in the base all night and neither charged, very disappointed.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Carter', N'michelle.carter4617@example.org', '2015-05-18', 4, N'Fun game. Pretty crazy stuff. I like how you can turn off the gore and swearing.'),
(N'Mary', N'Chavez', N'mary.chavez8260@example.org', '2015-05-18', 1, N'I bought an Xbox during the holidays. The fan makes this rattle noise and I sent it back. Got another one and the power brick whined uncontrollably. Went to buy another one and got the green screen of death. I went through 6 Xbox one. I bought a ps4 since launch and hasn''t given me problems. I put a 1tb hard drive and have almost 15 games on it and it still not full.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Foster', N'joyce.foster9556@example.org', '2015-05-18', 5, N'It Contains Voices in Spanish, English and French, as if you have difficulties can add subtitle, voices PS4 configuration according to what seems very normal, but it would be good this wing available to the user and not the console. Full HD graphics and a storyline that love, murder in slow motion great, Super Recommended. ____________________________________________________________________________________________________________ Contiene Voces en espaol, Ingles y Francs, al igual si tienes dificultades pueden agregar los subtitulo, Las Voces se configuracin segn la PS4 lo que me parece algo muy normal, pero seria bueno que este ala disposicin del usuario y no la consola. Grficos Full HD y una trama que encanta, asesinatos en cmara lenta geniales, Super Recomendados.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Ramirez', N'melissa.ramirez3979@example.net', '2015-05-18', 4, N'Despite the other bad reviews, my wife and I decided to buy this game. We are glad we did. We are both monopoly fans and love the graphics this game provides. The only down side is you can''t really seem to customize game rules. You can pre select one, that is it. Example is you can choose to get $1000 when getting snake eyes OR get the money in free parking when landing on it. Not both. It would have been nice to have a list of options to truly customize the game rules. Other than that, the game runs well. We have played a few games so far w/ no issues at all. No lock ups or anything. Great game. Lots of fun.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Williams', N'lisa.williams3836@example.net', '2015-05-19', 5, N'This game...IS SO SICK! Take the bad 4ssery or Resident Evil vs. Jurassic park and make it a playstation game and this is it. Yes it does go off the Survival horror track a bit in favor of action but the game is SOOOOOOOOOO FUN! There''s also obvious influence in the future Resident evil 4 to be seen in this release. The whole ammo and weapon purchasing for instance, The 2 weapon attacks as well. But i have to say the coolest aspect to this game is the aquatic segments....SOOOOOOOOOOO COOOOOOOOOOOOL! Why hasn''t this been remade? Either way you owe it to yourself to check this out.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Stewart', N'lisa.stewart8612@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'excellent I recommend it 100 %'),
(N'Mary', N'Ward', N'mary.ward3168@example.org', '2015-05-19', 5, N'This game has had me since the moment I turned it on'),
(N'Nadia', N'Boyd', N'nadia.boyd7151@example.net', '2015-05-19', 4, N'This a good game but not for someone who does not like a challenge'),
(N'Anna', N'Richardson', N'anna.richardson6976@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'for my son, and he loves it'),
(N'Brandon', N'Powell', N'brandon.powell6103@example.org', '2015-05-19', 3, N'I was looking forward to this game more than about any other this year.... until just recently when I found out they GREATLY downgraded the PC graphics to cater to the lowest common denominator (underpowered consoles). See this site for the gory details: http://www.gamezone.com/originals/the-witcher-3-wild-hunt-betrayed-by-ambition-jtq9 The developer is also on record from the end of last year claiming that the PC version would not suffer any graphical downgrades. We were blatantly lied to. I am going to be demanding a refund from Steam for this false advertisement. Also, the controls on the keyboard and mouse are unnecessarily complex. If you buy this game understand that you will need to use a gamepad. Another sign of consolitus.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Coleman', N'tomasz.coleman4570@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'These headphones are lightweight, making them comfortable when it comes to long gaming sessions. They cushion your ears, adding to the comfort level...and they adjust for a perfect fit. But the biggest draw is how cool they look. And under twenty five bucks? That''s a steal! GREAT gift for teens. Sound is fine for kids and teens. DISCLOSURE : Product received to test with the option to review. No financial compensation is EVER accepted, and vendor may request that item be returned.'),
(N'Julie', N'Kim', N'julie.kim3229@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'welcome to the best game in the world'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Lewis', N'jeffrey.lewis7294@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Peter', N'Lopez', N'peter.lopez3156@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'First things first, this mouse looks even cooler in person. The pictures don''t do the colors justice. They are bright and colorful. It''s a great conversation starter. And the first question I''m always asked is "Can you choose the color it shows?" Unfortunately, you can''t pick your favorite color. The mouse changes color about every 10 seconds. It''s not an abrupt change; it''s more of a slow fade in and out which is nice. If you''re like me and can''t fall asleep unless it''s completely dark in your room, then don''t leave your mouse plugged in. It will continue to change colors. Maybe adding a way to choose colors as well as turn the colors off should be considered in the next version. There are four DPI settings which is plenty for me. However, there''s no way to tell which setting your on except for moving your mouse around. It''s not a big deal, but I''d like to have a pop up icon that tells me which setting I''m on currently. Or perhaps redesign the button as an up and down version. The...'),
(N'Nathan', N'James', N'nathan.james2824@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'Great game 200 plus hours worth of content before the free dlc. This game looks and plays great.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Johnson', N'daniel.johnson9720@example.com', '2015-05-19', 5, N'Masterpiece!!!!!!'),
(N'Maria', N'Turner', N'maria.turner9952@example.org', '2015-05-20', 5, N'I really like it, and it uses the contacts on the bottom of the controller instead of the usb connections like cheaper docks, which is much safer for the controller. Cheap docks that use the usb port, could damage the port over time.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Wang', N'ravi.wang5641@example.com', '2015-05-20', 4, N'I grew up playing the first sims & loved it. Don''t know for sure if The Sims 1 works for newer Windows operating systems because it was originally made for Windows XP which is so obsolete it''s no longer supported by Microsoft. Seems to work great on Windows 7 in my experience. It performs great on my laptop which has a basic HDMI/VGA video card & 4 GB of RAM. It lags sometimes but lagging is very rare. I get the occasional rendering error where the textures look god awful like grass changes to textures from other objects occasionally. The graphics are somewhat better than 1 but my only gripe is the lack of items. But to get any real joy out of variety in items you gotta get expansion packs. Just wish they made an edition of 2 that included all expansion packs. The Sims 1 did that and it provided allot of in game extras. The menu is very user friendly and easy to figure out. Switching from live mode to build mode is very easy & fast. Building houses is allot of fun & making &...'),
(N'Megan', N'Rodriguez', N'megan.rodriguez1545@example.com', '2015-05-20', 5, N'son loves it'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Sullivan', N'benjamin.sullivan4999@example.net', '2015-05-20', 5, N'Fun game'),
(N'Patricia', N'Perry', N'patricia.perry6841@example.com', '2015-05-20', 3, N'I''m a little picky when it comes to survival horror games. It takes more than gore and jump scares to get me. Evil Within does a lot to raise your pulse, but the main problem is it actually tries to too much. The gameplay is disjointed, jumping from locations and mechanics like it''s channel-surfing cable. The story is near-impossible to follow. A consequence is that I never really cared about anything or anyone in the game. And The Evil Within is long. Like twice as long as I expected. Some people will love that. Me, I was almost begging it to be over so I could have closure and move on. When you''re not engaged in the gameplay or story, it can get boring. Maybe I''m off base here, but I''d recommend passing on this unless you get a great deal or *really* love survival horror games.'),
(N'Christine', N'Jenkins', N'christine.jenkins4098@example.com', '2015-05-20', 4, N'The Good: Fantastic visuals, fun and satisfying combat, huge open world that is fun to explore, many different weapons and ways to mod them The Bad: Despite huge world it feels empty due to lack of lore and great characters, story gets interesting and then turns cliche, characters are not interesting Zombie games are everywhere now, but they have also gotten better over the years. Zombies are probably the most iconic horror character ever, and mostly everyone is fascinated by them. However, a new fascination has started coming around: What would happen if we truly and honestly were hit by a zombie apocalypse? Gone are the campy days of old horror films where zombies were just scary and cool. People are even getting down to the nitty-gritty science of zombies and its now showing up in video games. Dying Light is probably of the better zombie games out there, and for sure the best open world one. You play as a man named Kyle Crane who is working for the GRE, a group tasked with...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Baker', N'kimberly.baker9251@example.org', '2015-05-20', 5, N'All Ok'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Ward', N'jacqueline.ward4739@example.org', '2015-05-20', 3, N'The dialogue sometimes is out of place, but the story and graphics are OK at best'),
(N'Karen', N'Gutierrez', N'karen.gutierrez8320@example.org', '2015-05-20', 5, N'Awesome headset - easy to set up and can hear sounds perfect when I multi-play video games.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Richardson', N'kyle.richardson3983@example.net', '2015-05-20', 5, N'Perfect game'),
(N'Victoria', N'Castillo', N'victoria.castillo8116@example.com', '2015-05-20', 5, N'great color and glow, functional'),
(N'Sofia', N'Green', N'sofia.green8656@example.com', '2015-05-21', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Sofia', N'Green', N'sofia.green8656@example.com', '2015-05-21', 4, N'Very good game but very very sort of a game 2 and half hours of game play and it''s over but very good game must buy if it''s on sale'),
(N'Jessica', N'Reyes', N'jessica.reyes1371@example.net', '2015-05-21', 4, N'We hate the short cords that come with the controllers so this has been very useful. It charges and holds the controllers well. No complaints.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Tanaka', N'katherine.tanaka6250@example.com', '2015-05-21', 5, N'I haven''t played previous Diablo games - starting fresh with Reaper of Souls + Diablo 3. Coming from a regular Starcraft 2 player, I wanted to explore what this game was all about. I have to say that, initially, I didn''t understand what the challenge of the game was if all I''m doing is left-clicking. Simply put, its all about running through maps and building up your character to efficiently slay whatever comes at you. I play in my free time so its been about 3 weeks going through the campaign. I''m just now touching on Adventure mode and Seasonal characters to see where it takes me. My daughter and I are having a great time going through the campaign together. I love the graphics, the cut scenes, the different monsters and demons, and all the details that Blizzard has put into this game. Great work Blizzard! Keep it up!'),
(N'Shirley', N'Torres', N'shirley.torres1719@example.org', '2015-05-21', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Campbell', N'hiroshi.campbell4564@example.com', '2015-05-21', 5, N'Full of relaxing puzzle games and peaceful music. Just what i needed!!'),
(N'Brian', N'Young', N'brian.young7429@example.org', '2015-05-21', 5, N'Kids love the 500GB they can have all their games on it'),
(N'Mary', N'Bell', N'mary.bell5469@example.com', '2015-05-21', 4, N'This is such a cool game. More people should play it.'),
(N'Mary', N'Bell', N'mary.bell5469@example.com', '2015-05-21', 4, N'Super joystick. Does everything!'),
(N'Laura', N'Kelly', N'laura.kelly5648@example.org', '2015-05-21', 5, N'Definitely worth owning even if you own the ps3 version. I own both.'),
(N'Mark', N'Brown', N'mark.brown3288@example.com', '2015-05-21', 5, N'I bought this along with the Lego Indiana Jones 2 game. Both are great fun contain hours of fun!'),
(N'Mark', N'Brown', N'mark.brown3288@example.com', '2015-05-21', 5, N'This was a gift for our grandson who just turned 11. He loves it and all the lego games. I also have played it and it is enjoyable for all ages.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Richardson', N'nicole.richardson8350@example.org', '2015-05-22', 1, N'Stopped working after a week. You get what you pay for... Doesn''t consistently charge the 3DS. It flashes jolts of "charge" at it. Instead of a solid orange "charging" light, it keeps going off and on. That can''t be good for it at all.'),
(N'Nathan', N'White', N'nathan.white7891@example.net', '2015-05-22', 5, N'nice game to put into my collection. This version has a lot of extra. The story is engaging and you don''t feel you are re-playing an old game at all.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Cruz', N'ravi.cruz9706@example.com', '2015-05-22', 3, N'When the Nintendo DS was released to the public in 2004, Rayman DS was one of the first games to grace the portable console. This is an exact port from the Nintendo 64. Poor Rayman and Globox are kidnapped by Razorbeard and taken onto the Pirate Ship; it''s up to Rayman to get all of his powers back with some help from Ly! He needs to collect 1,000 Lums and the 4 Masks if he ever has any hope of stopping the Pirates and saving the universe! Rayman will have to traverse through 20 candy coated worlds and break/rescue all of the cages. Bonus: If you collect all of the Lums/Cages within a level, you will get a chance to race Globox''s offspring to the top of the hill, where a fairy can extend Rayman''s life bar! It requires a lot of button mashing, so you''d better be good at that! Sadly, there are some obvious flaws associated with this port. The play control is dicey (and the circle pad doesn''t help either), not to mention the choppy animation frame rate. I find that Rayman 3D for the...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Martin', N'nathan.martin7614@example.org', '2015-05-22', 4, N'Is ok'),
(N'Timothy', N'Bell', N'timothy.bell3087@example.org', '2015-05-22', 5, N'My 7 year old daughter loves this game!'),
(N'Linda', N'Anderson', N'linda.anderson1989@example.net', '2015-05-22', 5, N'Bought this for a friend, they seemed to really like it and they didn''t have any problems with it'),
(N'Maria', N'Harris', N'maria.harris2759@example.com', '2015-05-22', 5, N'Got this for my new 3ds xl. The charger works like charm its good Nintendo quality you can trust. Just make sure if you buy this its from a good seller so you don''t get a crappy charger.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Thompson', N'sofia.thompson4307@example.org', '2015-05-23', 5, N'This is another must have game if you still enjoy playing PS1 games. I couldn''t stop playing once I got this game. It reminds me of the Burnout games for the PS2. It''s obviously not as great a those games but Demolition Racer is awesome for the PS1. I definitely recommend this game.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Collins', N'melissa.collins8119@example.org', '2015-05-23', 5, N'i love this game so much its so cute and fun'),
(N'Kevin', N'King', N'kevin.king2064@example.com', '2015-05-23', 5, N'You can use bluray, onedrive , Hulu plus, netflix, vine, youtube, Upload studio, WWE network, ufc, and more Take good qauilty video of yourself to do blogs, and edit into video gameplay Use all kinds of commands Online play is smooth, and very reliable. Outstanding smooth touch controller, really comfatable playing. Easy bottoms'),
(N'Kevin', N'King', N'kevin.king2064@example.com', '2015-05-23', 4, N'It''s made for Xbox one, but the headset sounds alot better on my mobile devices. I quest I was using it wrong and I sent it for replacement got it back and playing call of duty advanced warfare, I could hear footsteps, and explosions seperately, but volume is still too low and not enough impact in sound qauilty , it''s dull sound till I use the youtube app, and than it sounds good again (any help?) But even with that, it''s a good buy , cause the headset is a nice and laid back material and feels very comtable and not so tight. Sounds great and everything but xbox one games lol if you know how to fix problem , tell me'),
(N'Kevin', N'Hall', N'kevin.hall2026@example.net', '2015-05-23', 5, N'This is an awesome game so far. The first few hours I had a hard time enjoying the game but now that I have unlocked more of the game, upgrades, and weapons I really enjoY it. I am 25% complete with 16 missions and quite a few side missions done. a great open world and first person shooter game.'),
(N'Emily', N'Parker', N'emily.parker8871@example.com', '2015-05-23', 5, N'Puzzle and Dragons Z is a Pokemon-like game where "dragon tamers" fight each other and other dragon monsters. You play as a dragon tamer "ranger." If you''re familiar with Pokemon, you''ll find this game very familiar but with a P&D twist! Puzzle and Dragons Super Mario Edition is a version Super Mario Brothers where combat is done through P&D orb battles. All the "dragons and monsters" in this game are Super Mario characters. I am a huge fan of both P&D and Nintendo games. I just got the game yesterday and so far I am enjoying both games immensely.'),
(N'Susan', N'Wood', N'susan.wood3586@example.net', '2015-05-24', 5, N'I really don''t know why but I really like this game. It''s very simple and the story is the typical cliche anime kind. I guess I just really like the simplicity and classic RPG style.'),
(N'Larry', N'Kim', N'larry.kim4624@example.org', '2015-05-24', 5, N'While I have read many negative reviews of this product, I should note that the one provided to me not only displays battery status but has also lasted through three charge cycles in as many days. If the battery fails during its one year warranty, I will attempt replacement and update this review.'),
(N'William', N'Hughes', N'william.hughes7055@example.org', '2015-05-24', 3, N'verygood'),
(N'Yuki', N'Barnes', N'yuki.barnes3427@example.org', '2015-05-24', 5, N'This game is insane. I''ve never played it before, and at first it can be overwhelming due to the sheer amount of stuff in it. Not only maps are immense, the amount of skills and weapons to unlock is huge. Collect plants, loot, skin animals, craft stuff, disable towers, remove propaganda posters, I mean... there''s so much stuff to do, I think this game is endless offline, and it''s probably mind boggling online (I haven''t even tried yet). Drive trucks, ATVs, fly delta wings, walk, run, grapple, swim, there are endless ways to go places and achieve objectives which are, of course, dynamic depending on what you chose to do. For the price, this is the cheapest price per hour of entertainment you can get from a game, if shooters is your preference, with a hint of puzzles and a steady learning curve. Enjoyable so far, I had to stop playing after getting sick of wandering around villages in some 3rd world hell hole, but that''s the way the game is. Very well made, fun to play and it keeps...'),
(N'Gary', N'Thomas', N'gary.thomas2725@example.net', '2015-05-24', 3, N'The game arrived very dirty. Had to take it apart and clean all the connections. After that, worked fine. Not a great game, but my kids like playing some games I played growing up.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Evans', N'kenneth.evans4779@example.org', '2015-05-24', 5, N'Just as fun as I remember it being!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Evans', N'kenneth.evans4779@example.org', '2015-05-24', 4, N'Gameplay is a little wonky if you''re more used to EA Sports. Still fun though.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Harris', N'kelly.harris6100@example.com', '2015-05-24', 2, N'Thought it was going to be a wild west version of Borderlands FPS play. Aiming is too slow for high speed fights for my taste. Yeah, there is a slow mo mode for precision shots over multiple targets which takes more practice than I have patience for. I also compared it to Borderlands as far as the open world aspect, but I can''t say it''s even comparible. Maybe the HD version coming to Next Gen consoles and PC will have better controls. Otherwise, get Borderlands or Borderlands 2. I bought Borderlands 2 on release day and have been playing it for 3 years and still haven''t completed everything. Best to get the GOTY edition with all the cool content. So pass on this game.'),
(N'Debra', N'Nguyen', N'debra.nguyen3109@example.com', '2015-05-24', 4, N'Activision has made the Light and Dark expansion packs more or less necessary with the Skylander #4 game, Trap Team. In previous Spyro, Giants and Swap Force versions, the expansion packs were cool but not really a must. Right up front in Chapter 1 of Trap Team, you''ll have 4 different Element Trap Master games to play (Water, LIfe, Unknown, Tech) in order to get the Magic Hats, etc The "Unknown" Element gates throughout the game can require either a Light or Dark Trap Master. The expansion pack pieces are nicely done, the Light moreso than the Dark. However, do not pay more than the $29 manufacturer price. Plan accordingly on how much you want to spend to play this game. ;-) For this reason, I give the Dark Expansion Pack and the White one a 4-star, instead of 5. Ethically, I can''t give a effusive rating to a corporation that so obviously has begun to gouge parents over a kid''s toy, knowing that 3rd party sellers will stick it to the parents again. While we bought most of the...'),
(N'Megan', N'Smith', N'megan.smith4931@example.net', '2015-05-24', 5, N'Fun Game'),
(N'Jerry', N'Baker', N'jerry.baker8154@example.org', '2015-05-24', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Sullivan', N'kathleen.sullivan8089@example.org', '2015-05-25', 4, N'nice game, gets you a good feeling of surviving'),
(N'Eric', N'Bell', N'eric.bell7859@example.org', '2015-05-25', 1, N'Stopped working after only a few uses'),
(N'Katherine', N'Jones', N'katherine.jones7502@example.org', '2015-05-25', 4, N'Fun game. Graphics are great and story mode is interesting. New clan idea is interesting as well. Definitely a good addition to the series.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Kowalski', N'anthony.kowalski7236@example.org', '2015-05-25', 5, N'i do enjoy the game play. some issues since i have have a mouse wheel use for scrolling.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Russell', N'amanda.russell8242@example.org', '2015-05-25', 5, N'This mount fits all my new console camera''s with a little fabrication. To mount my Xboxone Kinect, I use black zip ties to hold the Kinect. Didn''t need it, but I have the mount on a downwards angle. The PS4 camera I use velcro just to hold in place just in case, and the wii just fits in place without any mod. I will try to take an photo to show how this mount works for me - GREAT ! !'),
(N'Sharon', N'King', N'sharon.king2766@example.net', '2015-05-25', 5, N'It seems today that most video games have an end game or some mission you are trying to accomplish. But in the early days of video games, most of them featured the same idea repeated in multiple levels of increasing difficulty with the real goal being getting the highest score possible before dying. Does that make some of these game repetitive? On the contrary, some of them are highly addictive, as Asteroids for the Atari 2600 proves. The premise of the game is very simple - you are in a ship in space that has been surrounded by giant asteroids. You have to blast them all out of the sky before they run into your ship. Each level starts with a bunch of large asteroids. When you hit those, you get two medium size asteroids. Hitting those turns them into one small asteroid that disappears when you hit it. As you can well imagine, those when the asteroids start multiplying, it can get chaotic quickly. While you only start with four big asteroids in the first level, every one after that...'),
(N'Mark', N'James', N'mark.james9824@example.net', '2015-05-25', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Nathan', N'Sanchez', N'nathan.sanchez3188@example.com', '2015-05-25', 4, N'My son loves his headset except that it is a little tight on his head.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Kumar', N'nadia.kumar6121@example.net', '2015-05-25', 5, N'A really fun game with a world so big you''ll "keep on keeping on" to discover so much. It''s a lot like FC3 but introduces a lot of new, amazing, stuff.'),
(N'Linda', N'Kowalski', N'linda.kowalski1250@example.com', '2015-05-25', 4, N'Great puzzle game. Instead of the typical drag and drop "match 3" formula that a lot of popular games present you with, this one has you dragging your orbs around to move others on the board in a short period of time. You have to use skill on this, and there is a tiny bit of luck involved. If you want to know if this is for you, there is a great demo. It only lets you do the Mario side of the game in the demo, and there are 2 full games in this package. The Mario game is what I''ve been playing the most to learn the basics. I started on the Puzzle Dragons Z portion, and it''s awesome as well. Since I got this game on the eShop I get a different bonus than what you get on Amazon, but either way I think that''s a cool addition to buying the game. Anyone that''s into puzzle games and wants a choice between just playing the game on the Mario side quickly or playing through a story on the Puzzle Dragons Z side will find this to be very enjoyable.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Richardson', N'kyle.richardson3983@example.net', '2015-05-25', 5, N'YOU WILL DIE. Battlefiedl 4 is a game where there is a steep learning curve. It will take a while to understand how to be successful in the game.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Rogers', N'joseph.rogers3325@example.com', '2015-05-25', 5, N'I enjoyed this game. It was not quite what I was expecting but proved to be very enjoyable. Has several rooms to go into and solve the puzzles. Some of them easy some of them need some thought. But was well worth the purchase.'),
(N'James', N'Mitchell', N'james.mitchell8107@example.net', '2015-05-26', 5, N'WOW. First of all, this game plays like Red Dead Redemption crossed with Skyrim and with the fighting of Batman: Arkham City only with swords and spells and whatnot. so if you like any of those games then you WILL enjoy this game which is a LOT larger than both of those combined. This is a 9.5 out of 10 game and a MUST OWN if you are an Xbone owner and/or a fantasy/rpg lover. What''s wrong with this game? Well, Geralt (the main character) walks/runs around a bit awkward (almost fluid but just not quite,) there''s some minor clipping when riding around corners, but not much (just double tap A and your mount takes over the riding and steering for you keeping to the roads until you decide to veer off), and because the game is so in-depth it will take one awhile to learn all of the crafting and whatnot. BUT those are all minor things that can always be fixed with patches/updates-and they will. The game is HUGE, your decisions actually matter, and there is a great story (i''m someone who...'),
(N'Ashley', N'Flores', N'ashley.flores5112@example.net', '2015-05-26', 5, N'Good performance and really good price.'),
(N'Robert', N'Anderson', N'robert.anderson9250@example.net', '2015-05-26', 5, N'This is hands down the best game I have played in YEARS. I am huge fan of Fallout and Elder Scrolls, but heard tremendous things about Witcher and secretly envied PC gamers. I''ve been playing it since launch, and I can only speak in superlatives about my experience - breathtaking graphics, mature content, layers of combat and upgrades, unbeatable exploration, superb sidequests, and cinema-esque characters/dialogue. I have lost countless hours just exploring and finding enticing new quests, weapons, or scenery. I don''t feel like I am playing a game, I felt like I was living an adventure'),
(N'Lauren', N'Scott', N'lauren.scott7605@example.org', '2015-05-26', 5, N'This game is badass. I enjoy it way more than Dark Souls 1+2, but not quite as much as Demons Souls.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Torres', N'jacob.torres8369@example.com', '2015-05-26', 5, N'Yaaay, pinball for your ps4. While I enjoy Zen Pinball, for realism and nostalga, you can''t go wrong with this. These are the best representation of ''REAL" PINBALL MACHINES. And that''s quite a feat. They meticulously cloned the real thing and put them on your TV screen. The controller works well, the physics, spot on, the audio, accurate to the real thing. Some of the pinball boards are certainly better than others, I love the board "Arabian Nights" I think that''s the name, is addicting. and my first time playing, I ended up playing for 2 hours. The game plays very realistically, you''ll think you''re playing on a real board, so you don''t ever feel like you''re getting ripped off, although sometimes I get frustrated because I go in the gutter within seconds! Again, some boards are for more fun than others, some are a bit lame, some I played once and won''t play again, but most of them, have their own strange addiction that will make you want to play more. I reccomend this game 100%,...'),
(N'Judith', N'Ross', N'judith.ross1827@example.net', '2015-05-26', 5, N'fun but scary game...hubby loves it...plays it alot'),
(N'Justin', N'Kelly', N'justin.kelly2405@example.org', '2015-05-26', 2, N'I don''t have a yellow option on my tv plus I purchased the hdmi connector which I like much better'),
(N'Adam', N'Raghunathan', N'adam.raghunathan8264@example.com', '2015-05-26', 5, N'Excellent , it''s just what I expected'),
(N'Jerry', N'Hall', N'jerry.hall7961@example.org', '2015-05-26', 5, N'em arrived in perfect condition, is what is described in the purchase, thanks'),
(N'Brian', N'Cox', N'brian.cox2450@example.net', '2015-05-26', 5, N'This game is great. Worth the money!'),
(N'Mateo', N'White', N'mateo.white7332@example.net', '2015-05-26', 5, N'Great graphics, fantastic story, tons of stuff to do. Really the only gripe I have is about the interface. It could be updated a bit to make it easier to loot. As well as when using the shop keeper interface switching between your inventory, and the shop is harder than it should be.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Williams', N'patricia.williams6681@example.org', '2015-05-26', 5, N'Very fun!'),
(N'Richard', N'Kim', N'richard.kim6271@example.com', '2015-05-26', 5, N'One of the best Marvel Comics videogames out there, this game has it''s own story, it''s not a simple videogame version of the movie. I was already fan of the developer WayForward cause of their previous titles Bloodrayne: Betrayal and Aliens: Infestation and this game did not disappoint, I just wished they added more exploration rather than linear stages could have been an epic metroidvania game.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Lewis', N'douglas.lewis4381@example.org', '2015-05-27', 5, N'Great product, it is new, I enjoy this game, I recomended this seller 100%'),
(N'Steven', N'Castillo', N'steven.castillo9223@example.net', '2015-05-27', 5, N'10/10 Charges controllers fast and the batteries last a long time'),
(N'Steven', N'Castillo', N'steven.castillo9223@example.net', '2015-05-27', 3, N'Ok game, very linear'),
(N'Andrew', N'Raghunathan', N'andrew.raghunathan2296@example.net', '2015-05-27', 5, N'excellent game'),
(N'Nathan', N'Patel', N'nathan.patel8918@example.org', '2015-05-27', 4, N'I have been wanting this game for like a few years now&finally bought it off this seller on Amz last week. I almost bought it on the Psn store for $20 ovr a month ago but glad I waited&snagged it for Only $4-ish! If you like zombie type games you''ll enjoy this fun crazy game. It''s simply out of control with tons of zombies everywhere lol. Its shame Sega doesn''t produce many games like they used to. The Japanese game developers have been hit very hard. Many have closed their doors or been bought/merged into a bigger co. I have always loved/had a thing for japanese game developers,if it wasn''t for them we wouldn''t have had the 2nd coming of the games industry true??So when I see games like this&YakuZa 4 I grab em''simply to collect them,as you never kno what Co.will disappear right?I''m having a blast-blasting zombies in this game! It looks pretty good also. It had been awhile since I played Ps3,but this made me want to play it more lol. Zombie games are Stress relievers I''ll say so...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Kowalski', N'michelle.kowalski2963@example.org', '2015-05-27', 5, N'Like many I was anticipating and waiting for the release of this game since the first mention of it over a year ago. There was so much hype in the 6 months leading up to the release that my expectations for what the game would look like were over-inflated. I make a big deal out of video games that have high definition and high resolution graphics, one of the main reasons why I loved Witcher 2 Assassins of Kings was because of the mind blowing detail in its graphics. One of the reasons why I loved Middle Earth Shadow of Mordor is because of the graphics that unfortunately has this new Witcher game beat. With that being said, CD Projekt Red has delivered on almost all of their promises. This video game is extraordinarily large, like the other reviewers mentioned; it looks like you could spend hundreds of hours just playing side quests. The way the stories and characters are developed for both the side quests and main quest are an improvement on RPGs. The character and story...'),
(N'Andrew', N'Hughes', N'andrew.hughes2227@example.net', '2015-05-27', 5, N'Grandson can''t stop playing, he loves it.'),
(N'Justin', N'Richardson', N'justin.richardson3119@example.net', '2015-05-27', 5, N'I can lay from the wii to my bed with an entire food to spare! Simply amazing, no lag,no cutouts,no instability issues, its perfect! My room is very very large so to give you an idea im over 15ft away in bed! Must buy! I give it 5/5'),
(N'Anita', N'Fisher', N'anita.fisher9634@example.net', '2015-05-27', 3, N'good'),
(N'Lauren', N'Jones', N'lauren.jones6911@example.com', '2015-05-27', 5, N'i love Sims'),
(N'Andrea', N'Ramos', N'andrea.ramos7230@example.com', '2015-05-27', 5, N'Best controller charging solution for the Playstation 4 on the market. Controllers fit snugly, no complaints at all. I had been using really long USB cables to be charging/using the controller while playing games, but I noticed after a while the controller would drain down anyway, because of extra strain on the USB port on the controller getting fatigued by the weight of a USB cable weighing it down 24/7. Recharging would become tenuous at best, I thought I was going to need to replace my controllers. This was the solution, no charging issues since I "cut the cord", so to say. Definitely the best accessory you can purchase for your PS4. Inexpensive and reliable, I''ve been putting it through its paces now for almost three months. Friends that have seen it have gone home and ordered this for their systems as well.'),
(N'Henry', N'Watson', N'henry.watson8592@example.org', '2015-05-28', 5, N'I got sunscraper spire and the midnight museum level pack for 29.99 each and they were neat'),
(N'Anthony', N'Alvarez', N'anthony.alvarez1114@example.com', '2015-05-28', 3, N'hard to play but ok game'),
(N'Sharon', N'King', N'sharon.king2766@example.net', '2015-05-28', 4, N'I normally don''t do movie based video games, but I am hooked on the Lego series. They are way too much fun and contain so many levels you can spend hours playing them. And thats one reason why I don''t get through them very fast since my time spent playing the Wii is sporadic at best. Recently, Ive been making my way through Lego Star Wars: The Complete Saga, and Ive been enjoying it. For those who aren''t familiar with the Lego series, they recreate movies, but with Lego characters and sets. So in this case, you are playing through all six movies from the Star Wars franchise. Each of the six movies gets six different levels. The game is designed for one or two players, and you must work your way through collecting Lego pieces (called studs) and solving puzzles by building or destroying things. Occasionally, one part will require a certain character to get through (some doors can only be opened by R2-D2 or C-3PO, for example, while other places require a Jedi). You can switch to that...'),
(N'Scott', N'Garcia', N'scott.garcia9311@example.net', '2015-05-28', 4, N'3DS can play Ds 3Ds Dsi and make a mii like on the wii! So kids can take it anywhere! So much fun and nice.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Hernandez', N'stephen.hernandez3215@example.net', '2015-05-28', 5, N'i wish we get games like this on Xbox One !'),
(N'Stephen', N'Hernandez', N'stephen.hernandez3215@example.net', '2015-05-28', 5, N'Xbox One, (Best exclusives) Available now for purchase :exclusives Dead Rising 3 HALO MCC Sunset Overdrive Ori and The Blind Forest Forza Horizon 2 Super Time Force Ryse son of rome Forza Motorsport 5 Killer Instinct classic TitanFall Project Spark Kinect Sports Rivals Kalimba Dark Dream D4 State of Decay Zoo Tycoon Killer Instinct s1&2 ScreamRide Happy wars Neverwinter Fantasia: Music Evolved Forza Horizon 2 Fast & Furious and alot of exclusives indie games and exclusives Contents (some of them timed) etc..... U will play this list next 1-6 months 2015: Halo 5: Guardians Forza Motorsport 6 Fable legends Tomb Raider (Timed exclusive, most likely 1 year) Gears of War remaster Killer Instinct sn3 Smite Gigantic Inside Cuphead Below Super Hot Elite Dangerous Blues and Bullets World of Tanks and maybe more.... 2016 exclusives : Scalebound Quantum Break Gears of War 4 Rare new ip Phantom Dust Crackdown Forza Horizon 3 Alan Wake 2 Halo Wars Undead Labs New IP Twisted Pixel New IP Lift...'),
(N'Angela', N'Wood', N'angela.wood1470@example.org', '2015-05-28', 4, N'Loved the edition. The game... not too much.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Lopez', N'barbara.lopez2632@example.net', '2015-05-28', 5, N'Turtle Beach absolutely nailed the texture for this mouse. Its smooth, rubbery (but not sticky or slippery), and feels excellent when gripped. The downloadable software was easy to find and get installed, and once added makes the mouse extremely configurable. As with every gaming mouse Ive owned, I spend some time using it to get it just right. Ambidextrous construction is great; righties and lefties will both enjoy the Grip 500. Illumination: LED colors on the scroll wheel can be fine-tuned based on what you''re doing. This is just awesome! Play: the fine-tuned control over things like DPI on a per-axis basis, the (very decent) optical sensor, button placement (including a change-profile button!), etc. all made the mouse an absolute joy to game with. Extremely nice touch: The mouse has a memory! Once you set the macros the way you want them, it will remember them even if you switch between computers (which I often do). I also spend a ton of time in Photoshop, and even though there...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Garcia', N'ronald.garcia3972@example.net', '2015-05-29', 5, N'good'),
(N'John', N'Brooks', N'john.brooks2164@example.net', '2015-05-29', 5, N'the most engaging series i''ve ever experienced in gaming and i''ve played hundreds of video games.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Robinson', N'kofi.robinson5215@example.net', '2015-05-29', 1, N'The Biggest Disappointment. I hope they don''t screw up Mass Effect this way ! Gameplay - Slow Graphics Scene changes - Slow Battle Controls - HUH ??? BRING BACK THE GAME PLAY and FUN OF DA2 !!!'),
(N'Lucia', N'Anderson', N'lucia.anderson1585@example.org', '2015-05-29', 5, N'Fantastic. The game is fantastic. This ranks up there with Smash bros. as one of the best games on the Wii-U. This game is extremely addicting and very challenging with a fantastic online element. I extremely recommend this game to those who are fans of the FPS genre who are looking for something fresh. Here''s why you should own it. 1. The gameplay part A. You control weapon wielding squid person. Sounds cool doesn''t it? I thought so. You are armed with the mission to cover everything with your ink! Sounds easy right? WRONG. There exists others who have a different color of ink. These people also have the same mission. This conflict creates an all out WAR! You can also turn into a squid and move very quickly. People will try to surround you with there horrid ink! If those people succeed, you are forced to move back to the beginning. At the end of the game, whoever has the most ink coverage, wins. 2. The gameplay part B. The first part of the game describes the online multiplayer....'),
(N'Brenda', N'James', N'brenda.james8734@example.com', '2015-05-29', 5, N'They are skylanders, they work in the game, my son loves them, need I say more?'),
(N'Amanda', N'Perry', N'amanda.perry8436@example.net', '2015-05-29', 5, N'I''ve played several hours now and can say it''s one of the best new Nintendo IP''s in many, many years. Beware, though. It''s a little barebones out of the gate, but has free DLC coming. So, I''d advise maybe waiting. Still, what''s here is very fun and enjoyable. I''d rate it (as it is now) an 8/10.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Moore', N'cheryl.moore8313@example.net', '2015-05-29', 2, N'I am so disappointed with Sea of Darkness. I have played all 30+ ND games and have enjoyed them so much over the years. What was most frustrating about this production was the complete absence of joy and fun. Instead we have one soduku-like puzzle barrier after another with a thin plot in between and way too serious adult themes. I would like to remind HER about the classic ND that I know and love. Remember in the Haunting of Castle Malloy when you gave Nancy a Jetpack? It was so much fun making rocket fuel to fly the jet pack around the castle. Or, in the Phantom of Venice, where we learned about the Italian game of Scopa? Or, the simple pleasure of making sea shell necklaces in the Creature of Kapu Cave? I can think of many more. The whole point was the games were creative, light-hearted, educational and fun for all ages. The content was rich with many places to explore. The characters and storyline were also very engaging. There are many game publishers out there who are...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Diaz', N'rachel.diaz6724@example.org', '2015-05-29', 1, N'This game is horrible. This is why the wii u is dying. This game is straight dumpster drippings.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Sanchez', N'jonathan.sanchez2704@example.com', '2015-05-29', 5, N'Great game, great graphics, great storyline, great combat mechanics, pretty much the best game I have ever played, I highly recommend this game!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Evans', N'sharon.evans7497@example.com', '2015-05-29', 5, N'Well made'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Hall', N'cynthia.hall2662@example.net', '2015-05-29', 1, N'While I 100 percent agree with people on the scalping side, what choice does one have if they really want them? Nintendo isn''t going to remake more than the initial production run of some these amiibos, thus again leading to the scalpers. It really does suck to have to pay more for them, but what choice is there?'),
(N'Linda', N'Young', N'linda.young3296@example.net', '2015-05-29', 2, N'Shortest game ever. And the graphic looks bad on my PS3 versus the Xbox 360 version.'),
(N'Linda', N'Young', N'linda.young3296@example.net', '2015-05-29', 4, N'Pro -Full story mode COOP -A definite must play FPS classic for Playstation -Interesting bosses and enemies Con -Not much of a upgrade from Resistance 2 -A coherent story line, but the story never has a conclusive ending'),
(N'Linda', N'Young', N'linda.young3296@example.net', '2015-05-29', 3, N'Pros: -A different game play from the usual first person shooting genre. Cons: -Graphic is a bit outdated compared to contemporary game. -Fighting style feels repetitive after a while Neutral: -A game that you would expect on the Nintendo Platform -Gory game play'),
(N'Ravi', N'Myers', N'ravi.myers5214@example.org', '2015-05-29', 5, N'Wonderful game with a good challenge. It positively oozes atmosphere and a near constant feeling of dread (which is good). Every corner feels like it has something new to throw at you, and it usually does. This game is a bit different from the Souls series of games but still feels very similar. No more cowering behind a shield with the toughest armor you can find, this game relies more on dodging and evasion than blocking. Also the new way you counter an enemy by blasting them in the face with a sidearm to throw them off balance feels refreshing and VERY satisfying when you do it correctly. If you''re looking for a challenging game or enjoyed Demon''s Souls / Dark Souls games then you''ll love this too.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Martin', N'ethan.martin7644@example.net', '2015-05-29', 5, N'Awesome new IP. This game has a tremendous gameplay and a unique style as the own shooting type game. So colorful with great graphics. The maps are well made and I did not found yet a single glitch or issue. The online is great having not issues yet. I really recommend this game!!!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Ali', N'barbara.ali5948@example.org', '2015-05-29', 5, N'EXCELENTE'),
(N'Stephen', N'Singh', N'stephen.singh6721@example.com', '2015-05-29', 5, N'FUN GAME'),
(N'Kevin', N'Hernandez', N'kevin.hernandez5955@example.net', '2015-05-29', 5, N'Excellent game..'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts1962@example.org', '2015-05-29', 5, N'*spoiler alert* Just to clarify, there''s is a sequel, but you''ll need a wii (or wii u) in order to finish Travis'' other story. Either than that, higher quality graphics and more weird moments in the house (I mean my actual home) than usual, lots of action.'),
(N'Eric', N'Tanaka', N'eric.tanaka3626@example.com', '2015-05-30', 5, N'my son loved this skylander'),
(N'Douglas', N'Lewis', N'douglas.lewis9876@example.com', '2015-05-30', 5, N'great'),
(N'Henry', N'Clark', N'henry.clark4443@example.org', '2015-05-30', 5, N'I bought this game after watching some youtube videos of it! Looked fun and well, it is! I bought this to play by myself, and it is fun, I haven''t played much of it, so I''m not sure what all is available for single player, but the game that I wanted to play was single player, so I''m happy! I''m glad Nintendo is watching out for the single loner people out there!'),
(N'Donald', N'Jimenez', N'donald.jimenez2380@example.net', '2015-05-30', 5, N'This came as part of a bundle with my PS4 that I only recently acquired from Amazon. It is an excellent game, if a tad short. It is lacking in that department and it has no multiplayer, but otherwise it is a great, and gorgeous game. Highly recommended. Especially if you haven''t bought your PS4 yet. If you can find this bundled with the PS4 that includes The Last of Us Remastered you have hit serious paydirt.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Sullivan', N'ronald.sullivan3189@example.org', '2015-05-30', 5, N'EXCELLENT'),
(N'Julie', N'Morgan', N'julie.morgan9914@example.org', '2015-05-30', 4, N'as advertised'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Murphy', N'nicholas.murphy1738@example.org', '2015-05-30', 5, N'This game is awesome!!! Long time gamer and it''s great that Nintendo is finally giving us a new IP! It''s really fun, extremely unique! Such a breathe of fresh air in a game market that full of fps war games! I honestly went in to play a few games and ended up playing for hours and hours! The single player campaign is fun, the bosses are fun, the online is fun! With the shortest loads times I''ve experienced the during online play! The net code is also great! I''ve experienced no lag so far! Don''t mind the hate comments; bunch newbs if you ask me hahaha'),
(N'Susan', N'Kowalski', N'susan.kowalski2108@example.org', '2015-05-31', 5, N'All good'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Khan', N'cheryl.khan3116@example.net', '2015-06-01', 5, N'Haven''t played it myself, buy my fiance has played all of the series thus far and this is her favorite one.'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2015-06-01', 4, N'Awesome game from the past.'),
(N'Dee', N'Russell', N'dee.russell4497@example.net', '2015-06-01', 5, N'Better than vortex FPS FREEKS hands down and 1/3 the price with an extra set. tsatisfied'),
(N'Adam', N'Ferreira', N'adam.ferreira2182@example.org', '2015-06-01', 1, N'Decent graphics and good story line (PS4) but too much human-on-human violence, brutal at times, avoid if that kind of thing troubles you. We ditched it after about 1-2 hours of play time. A bad influence on your kids behavioral syndromes, and certainly would not be recommended for below 18''s, or people who get too immersed in games, or suffer even slightly from day-to-day reality disconnects.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Barnes', N'amanda.barnes8493@example.net', '2015-06-01', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Henry', N'Boyd', N'henry.boyd9311@example.com', '2015-06-01', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2015-06-02', 5, N'harry potter and the order of the phoenix video game is the greatest video game in the universe a true classic the best of the best harry potter and the order of the phoenix video game rocks'),
(N'John', N'Miller', N'john.miller7373@example.net', '2015-06-02', 4, N'Owned the first Xbox, didn''t feel the need to buy a 360 (I still do a lot of PC gaming). Installed great and was a blast to play with the revamped graphics. Very reminiscent of the college days of stringing a bunch of Xboxes together and blasting each other away at friends''. Also, since I didn''t pick up a 360, now I can finish 2 and catch up on 3 and 4! :)'),
(N'Sofia', N'Morales', N'sofia.morales6652@example.org', '2015-06-02', 4, N'Solid FPS. Hardly anyone plays multilayer anymore though, and the single-player is super boring.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Allen', N'amanda.allen8570@example.com', '2015-06-02', 5, N'the gameplay is good and its a spin off, so its ok'),
(N'Kevin', N'Baker', N'kevin.baker8688@example.org', '2015-06-02', 5, N'This game is bad for business, do you know why, in the past I have purchased 3-5 games per years, all kinds of games now I am not going to buy any more games except playing this wicher 3 over and over again until CD Project make wicher 4. if i had to give up all the games i had purchased in the last 15 years, this is the only game i would keep for good. The best of the best. tell you the true, if this game sold for 150$ I would still buy it. no joking.'),
(N'George', N'Sullivan', N'george.sullivan2842@example.org', '2015-06-02', 5, N'Despite the negative reviews this game is well worth it with a long story mode that most games don''t have you will be on this game for at least 30-40 hours so if you want a engaging story being as quiet as possible will help!'),
(N'Omar', N'Wisniewski', N'omar.wisniewski4601@example.com', '2015-06-02', 4, N'It''s a fun figurine, opens solo play challenges for new wearable gear. I would recommend being patient and getting one from a local store, don''t pay the scalper mark-up.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Tanaka', N'nathan.tanaka6572@example.org', '2015-06-02', 5, N'Disc has some small scratches, but works perfectly.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Raghunathan', N'jonathan.raghunathan2794@example.net', '2015-06-02', 5, N'Doesn''t come with cap, but still fully charged.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Raghunathan', N'jonathan.raghunathan2794@example.net', '2015-06-02', 5, N'I dislike the clips on the side.'),
(N'Donna', N'Martin', N'donna.martin7463@example.net', '2015-06-03', 4, N'not bad. I wish you could listen to the game not just the other players.'),
(N'Heather', N'Collins', N'heather.collins6448@example.org', '2015-06-03', 4, N'it was so awesome playing all the old games again!! However I was under the impression I would be playing all the old games in the original state, while the games are the same the objectives have changed. You get a quick goal to complete, you don''t get to do while boards. I was disappointed by that, but still fun.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Howard', N'sofia.howard5041@example.com', '2015-06-03', 5, N'this game is awesome if you like turn based rpgs this was my first final fantasy and i was so happy playing it to me the best final fantasys are 7 8 9 and 10 simply because they are turn based'),
(N'Richard', N'Kowalski', N'richard.kowalski1685@example.org', '2015-06-03', 2, N'Did not work for android tv at all. Bad interface and terrible to use for emulators as said it would. Makes for a good back up ps3 controller. Might be better for computers but not android tv or as an OTG toggle on phone.'),
(N'Christina', N'Cooper', N'christina.cooper2054@example.net', '2015-06-03', 3, N'ok game'),
(N'Henry', N'Castillo', N'henry.castillo4393@example.org', '2015-06-03', 1, N'The worse game ever. Bungie let everyone down with this crap. I gave it a chance but never received and decent weapons. House of wolves was the biggest rip off of the decade.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'James', N'kathleen.james8758@example.com', '2015-06-03', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wood', N'nathan.wood4853@example.com', '2015-06-03', 5, N'My favorite NBA game to date'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wood', N'nathan.wood4853@example.com', '2015-06-03', 4, N'My son loves this game (as well as the movie) he can actually play by himself a little bit which is fun to watch. I like that this game has it''s own story not just a previous movie franchise made into Legos (like avengers, or soon to be Jurassic park.) The price is so cheap right now it''s a must buy if you have kids (also pick up the movie it''s really funny love Will Ferrell and Morgan Freeman).'),
(N'Linda', N'Peterson', N'linda.peterson7830@example.com', '2015-06-03', 5, N'Graphics remind me of my young years with Atari but the young generation loves it. I guess the youth are reversing back to 8bit graphics and away from quality gaming! Hey it keeps them quiet and entertained, who am I to complain! :)'),
(N'Anita', N'Kowalski', N'anita.kowalski8143@example.com', '2015-06-03', 5, N'Nice Game'),
(N'Amara', N'Ward', N'amara.ward8081@example.net', '2015-06-03', 5, N'this game is a real treat for anyone who enjoyed the alien movies, forget every other alien game ever made where you can be the aliens, the marines.. predator.. forget all that.. they were just filler for a real game, one that is fun, intense and will keep you coming back. On the XboxOne you have some really neat features with kinect that I have thoroughly enjoyed like the sound detection when you are trying to hide and the peek head movement following option.. I just literally look around when I need to peek somewhere with my own head, it is really well done. A gorgeous game with some slick gameplay, just.. don''t get too infurated when the alien humps your face.. it can be difficult.. especially on higher difficulty'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Sanders', N'cynthia.sanders1890@example.net', '2015-06-04', 5, N'Just got it and love it'),
(N'Linda', N'Russell', N'linda.russell5239@example.net', '2015-06-04', 3, N'hack and slash combat is ok . i don''t hate the game , but i sure don''t love it , you have to spend money to get the jap voice pack , rpg mechanics are there , but thats about it .'),
(N'Katherine', N'Lewis', N'katherine.lewis9252@example.com', '2015-06-04', 3, N'The game is gorgeous and the game is a vast improvement over the previous titles when it comes to the mechanics and visuals. The story is boring and not compelling in any way, shape, or form. Pros: -Graphics -Gameplay -Co-op Cons: -Story -Characters It is simply an average game. Vaas from Far Cry 3 was a great antagonist, but sadly there is no one like him in this game or anyone even slightly as compelling as he was.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Sanders', N'ravi.sanders4085@example.com', '2015-06-04', 5, N'Good product. Good price. Fast shipment. Thank you!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Baker', N'daniel.baker1399@example.org', '2015-06-04', 1, N'This is for the "classic Wii (not the U) as far as I can tell... It''s a good price for the number of stations per unit and batteries provided but that value drops exponentially I''d you CAN''T get units to actually charge. Even with the remotes stripped down (even removing the safety wrist tie each time you want to charge) you are unlikely to get ANY "drained" remote to sit on the station and stay lit as charging. If you enjoy building Houses of Cards with peanut butter on your fingers, you MIGHT enjoy getting these to work.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Reed', N'dennis.reed2018@example.org', '2015-06-04', 5, N'Works great in good shape'),
(N'Daniel', N'Walker', N'daniel.walker7174@example.com', '2015-06-04', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Patricia', N'Morgan', N'patricia.morgan3193@example.com', '2015-06-04', 3, N'It''s alright. I should have probably bought an ergonomic keyboard. My wrist hurts after playing on this for an extended period. I do like the key layout. I love the left side keys there although I could go without the bottom one as I sometimes get it confused with the ctrl key. You have to press a little bit harder than I''d like too. I don''t hate this keyboard, but I don''t love it either.'),
(N'Scott', N'Scott', N'scott.scott7798@example.org', '2015-06-04', 5, N'I''ve been enjoying it quite a lot.'),
(N'Mary', N'Adams', N'mary.adams4620@example.org', '2015-06-04', 5, N'Best game since long time... Kids can have fun and be creative! I very often even hear them discussing new things to build with Minecraft.... I am satisfied with this game at all!'),
(N'Mary', N'Adams', N'mary.adams4620@example.org', '2015-06-04', 5, N'Our son (9) loves it..... as he loves all pokemon Nintendo games! He can''t wait until the next one is on the market!'),
(N'Anita', N'Russell', N'anita.russell1925@example.com', '2015-06-04', 1, N'Nintendo is a kids company on the level of leap frog and Splatoon just reinforced that fact. Good for children bad for real gamers.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Walker', N'jeffrey.walker6304@example.org', '2015-06-04', 5, N'Excellent !!!'),
(N'Henry', N'Thomas', N'henry.thomas9630@example.org', '2015-06-04', 4, N'Pretty good, of course it doesn''t feel like a real n64 controller but it''s close enough to get the job done.'),
(N'Anna', N'Williams', N'anna.williams6415@example.org', '2015-06-04', 4, N'I''ve purchased a couple this year. Maybe this is an older model? Not quite the same as the others, but seems to work fine'),
(N'Betty', N'Hall', N'betty.hall4897@example.net', '2015-06-05', 5, N'Given as a gift.'),
(N'Lauren', N'James', N'lauren.james3525@example.org', '2015-06-05', 5, N'The best amiibo out of my collection so far he is a beast!!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Gutierrez', N'michelle.gutierrez5861@example.org', '2015-06-05', 5, N'this is very neat its kinda like the Kinect it allows you to do a lot of extra things on the ps4 black track your movement or take video'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Anderson', N'kimberly.anderson9444@example.net', '2015-06-05', 4, N'The Clip does barely fit my iPhone 6+ WITH Mophie juice pack case, but I have to really pull the clip as far as it will go. Plus there is high risk of the iPhone popping out if you have any bump or if someone pushes the iPhone edge while you are clipped in, SO I would not recommend using the clip with a bulky case on the iPhone 6+. The naked 6+ phone fits fine and is secure though. The rest of the controller is fine. I wish the thumb controllers felt less "plasticy" though, and it would be nice if there were more of a rubbery grip to it. The weight seems good, and is very similar to the Xbox controller if you are used to this.'),
(N'Donald', N'Cox', N'donald.cox5289@example.com', '2015-06-05', 4, N'the game is fine the graphics are so so the storyline is fair it is fun to play I will give it that'),
(N'Joshua', N'Anderson', N'joshua.anderson2990@example.net', '2015-06-06', 1, N'If I had received a wireless controller (vice the corded controller with the cord cut off that I received) I would have given this product 5 stars, however, since I could not use a wireless corded controller for anything but a paperweight, I had to give it 1 star, owell...'),
(N'Emily', N'Chen', N'emily.chen6109@example.net', '2015-06-06', 5, N'I love'),
(N'Michael', N'Scott', N'michael.scott2283@example.com', '2015-06-06', 5, N'Thanks!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Stewart', N'ryan.stewart8801@example.net', '2015-06-06', 4, N'Its a good game, but I think I liked Goldeneye better.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Howard', N'elizabeth.howard1001@example.org', '2015-06-06', 5, N'great product, thank you'),
(N'William', N'Hill', N'william.hill1451@example.org', '2015-06-06', 5, N'best transformer game ever'),
(N'Yuki', N'Ramirez', N'yuki.ramirez5286@example.com', '2015-06-06', 3, N'ok'),
(N'Zachary', N'Wilson', N'zachary.wilson3142@example.org', '2015-06-06', 4, N'Being MS brand and make it works the same as all the other factory controllers, but has a pleasing digital camo hydrographic exterior with a matt finish. I bought this to replace my Day One edition because too much time spent playing Destiny killed the left thumbstick. Constantly having to down click and press forward to sprint basically ground the parts to failure. Though in my opinion, it shouldn''t have failed that quickly. One, I''m not that rough with my equipment, and two I didn''t use my Xbox ONE much during the first year I owned it. Of course, the original power supply also failed just after the warranty period also. Never experienced these issue with the 360 or the original Xbox. Build quality of external components seems to have taken a serious hit this time around. Overall, nice looks and performs as expected and is currently holding up. I put a PE soft grip cover over it and am using Foamy Lizard control stick covers for enhanced grip. All three make a nice combo for...'),
(N'Richard', N'Wang', N'richard.wang8693@example.org', '2015-06-06', 4, N'rip in corner.. untested.. but still. Came with box and I''m just gonna leave it wrapped up as this is now my collectible game item. Hope it works in the far future.'),
(N'Richard', N'Wang', N'richard.wang8693@example.org', '2015-06-06', 4, N'Untested, but good as far as I can tell. I will leave it in it''s wrapper as a collectible.'),
(N'Amy', N'Watson', N'amy.watson4812@example.net', '2015-06-06', 5, N'l love it man'),
(N'Ethan', N'Martin', N'ethan.martin4556@example.org', '2015-06-06', 5, N'Doesn''t perform or last as long as the "real" GameCube controllers, but they''re a good value for the money.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Jimenez', N'cynthia.jimenez1552@example.com', '2015-06-07', 3, N'The game is fun the game could have been better but to ps2 standards it was fine but if your looking for action games skip this one and get the next 2 alot better in every way :-)'),
(N'Anthony', N'Wilson', N'anthony.wilson2587@example.org', '2015-06-07', 5, N'Love all the colors'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Evans', N'stephanie.evans5367@example.net', '2015-06-07', 5, N'works great thank you'),
(N'Heather', N'Khan', N'heather.khan3147@example.com', '2015-06-07', 4, N'Haven''t branched into anything other than the Road To The Show mode, but I really enjoy that mode. The games can take place quick so it doesn''t require a full afternoon to sneak in a few games. Can be challenging but not so far as to take away from the fun of smacking a homer every so often. Definitely fun and entertaining and helps me get my baseball fix.'),
(N'Dee', N'Parker', N'dee.parker7371@example.com', '2015-06-07', 4, N'good'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Adams', N'carolyn.adams9477@example.com', '2015-06-07', 1, N'OK, I run an emulated drive on my computer to use ISOs along with a regular one for discs. When I bought a physical copy of this game, I installed it fine, but when I tried to run it it told me I had to disable virtual drives or any emulation software. So I disabled PowerISO (The program I use) and the virtual drive I created with it, then I restarted my computer and went to run the program. It gave me the exact same message. After trying other methods of getting the game to work I just decided to uninstall it (Which you can only do from the disc, by the way) and return it to the store. I then just bought it off of Steam, and now it currently runs fine. Side note: If you alt-tab out of the program for a while and go back in, it will crash. But that might just be me,'),
(N'Joshua', N'Thomas', N'joshua.thomas7332@example.org', '2015-06-07', 3, N'It''s fun, but it can be really glitchy'),
(N'Dee', N'Wood', N'dee.wood7825@example.org', '2015-06-08', 1, N'It''s call of duty with another name'),
(N'Amanda', N'Carter', N'amanda.carter2789@example.net', '2015-06-08', 5, N'this is my first mechanical keyboard so i do not have anything to compare with but the green switches are extremely clicky and the tactile feel is really good i can no longer go back to the membrane world'),
(N'Joseph', N'Young', N'joseph.young1674@example.com', '2015-06-08', 5, N'Works perfectly'),
(N'Noah', N'Gomez', N'noah.gomez7278@example.net', '2015-06-08', 5, N'Excellent game, great graphics, cool story mode. Fun all the way !!!!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Parker', N'nadia.parker8222@example.com', '2015-06-08', 5, N'Fun game to play on Nintendo 3DS for any Pokemon Fan'),
(N'Nathan', N'Brown', N'nathan.brown4244@example.net', '2015-06-08', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'James', N'White', N'james.white2170@example.net', '2015-06-08', 5, N'Works well for charging your magical controller'),
(N'Joshua', N'Raghunathan', N'joshua.raghunathan5096@example.com', '2015-06-08', 5, N'I love the ps2 reminds me of my childhood also my girls love playing it as well'),
(N'Omar', N'Okonkwo', N'omar.okonkwo5302@example.net', '2015-06-08', 4, N'I enjoyed this game'),
(N'Jacob', N'Evans', N'jacob.evans4894@example.org', '2015-06-08', 3, N'not worth 24 dollars.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Cooper', N'tyler.cooper4276@example.org', '2015-06-09', 5, N'awesome game, love the whole series!'),
(N'Noah', N'Gomez', N'noah.gomez7278@example.net', '2015-06-09', 5, N'Love this game. Great addition to the series.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Torres', N'alexander.torres5481@example.org', '2015-06-09', 3, N'Fun, but not as good as the new one. My boy play for 2 weeks, then never touch it.'),
(N'Joan', N'Flores', N'joan.flores6890@example.com', '2015-06-09', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Debra', N'Wang', N'debra.wang6220@example.com', '2015-06-09', 5, N'Love the Dead Space series! Always have and more than likely always will. It has great atmosphere, great shooting/controls, definitely a game that any sci-fi/horror game pick this up ASAP!'),
(N'Jason', N'Webb', N'jason.webb6238@example.org', '2015-06-09', 5, N'Present for my grandson''s B-Day! He LOVES it! He is happy, so I am happy! Got download code. His console disc tray is broken. Since he wants to upgrade, no need of fixing...so, he is "good" with codes for now! Quick and easy process too.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Anderson', N'brenda.anderson4410@example.org', '2015-06-09', 5, N'Compared with the Ps2 versions, marked improvement on graphics but not worth it I reckon if you already ended it on the system. Still really nice as I experienced these for the first time.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Stewart', N'ethan.stewart5610@example.com', '2015-06-09', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Linda', N'Wilson', N'linda.wilson3658@example.org', '2015-06-09', 3, N'yet another great Lego game, however the game just didn''t click with me like the others. it seemed to be missing something, it could just me, used to the newer Lego games but nevertheless i just did not find the game to be worth my time and returned it. would i recommend you get this? it depends, if you really like Lego games and all of their silly humor and simple game play then this is fun and you should probably give this a shot. but if you want to get a better experience from a Lego game i would recommend a console or PC Lego game, those seem to have more content. i hope this review helped your buying decision'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Chavez', N'elizabeth.chavez8275@example.com', '2015-06-09', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Nathan', N'Tanaka', N'nathan.tanaka8488@example.com', '2015-06-09', 5, N'i love it'),
(N'Alexander', N'Rodriguez', N'alexander.rodriguez1185@example.org', '2015-06-10', 5, N'I was looking for a pair of grips for my Wii U Gamepad since the right joystick started to wear off (Thanks Smash) and I found these, they fit tight and perfect when comparing to other options, also, its a soft material, like the in your earbuds, which makes them feel awesome. I tried other brands, but they were made of hard plastic and they kept felling off. If you want to use this for the Wii U Gamepad or the ProController, go for it! Totally worth it. I bought only one set, but already orderer 4 more, for my other controllers.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Gray', N'lauren.gray2799@example.com', '2015-06-10', 4, N'Went to try it out at BestBuy. Pros: Quiet Cons: The space bar is surprisingly loose for a mechanical keyboard. The overall keyboard size feels small. Expensive.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Kelly', N'marcus.kelly9214@example.net', '2015-06-10', 3, N'Art official entertainment on youtube...shows you this game is not a 5 ...i almost could not believe the glitches in this game...watch the review..art official entertainment on youtube....enough said!!!!!....'),
(N'Jack', N'Boyd', N'jack.boyd7148@example.net', '2015-06-10', 5, N'item received'),
(N'Samuel', N'Brooks', N'samuel.brooks7619@example.org', '2015-06-10', 4, N'I have played a couple of MMO RPGs on PS4 and PC, but I''m not a huge fan of this kind of games. However, as a long time gamer, I think I need to write a short review for gamers like me who would like to know how this game works. Well, approximate wait time till the review is 1 second... That''s the message I get every time I try to play the game. I connect to U.S north servers( which are located in Texas, and that''s where I live), but I''m very angry at the fact that I have to wait till I can play the game. If you have a busy life, this can be a very negative aspect of the game; in fact I have my Ps4 logging in as I''m writing this review. For those who say this is normal for MMO RPG, I like to bring up Final Fantasy 14( a realm reborn), I have played that game since its lunch on PS4 and never had an issue with logging in or disconnection. Just so you know, FF14 is a multiply platform game which PS3, PS4 and PC players, play together. My 2nd problem with the game is that, there are so...'),
(N'Betty', N'Singh', N'betty.singh4349@example.net', '2015-06-10', 4, N'daughter loves it'),
(N'Deborah', N'Boyd', N'deborah.boyd4919@example.net', '2015-06-10', 5, N'nice game'),
(N'Kofi', N'Parker', N'kofi.parker8640@example.org', '2015-06-10', 5, N'I have owned a number of gaming mice for both Windows and Mac over the years, mostly from Logitech due to a more positive experience with the brand''s hardware and software. Not to say I haven''t given Razer products a chance. At one point or another, Ive owned the Orochi, Imperator, Mamba, and original DeathAdder, all of which Ive returned or resold due mostly to shoddy software. Heaven help me, I cant resist colorful and/or shiny things. So with the preponderance of RGB-backlit mice and keyboards making their way to market, I had to jump on board. Due to the aforementioned good luck with Logitech products, I wanted to get the G303 Daedalus Apex, which incidentally sounds like the title of a Tom Clancy novel/video game. My sole computer is a MacBook Pro that dual boots between OS X and Windows 8.1. This is about as far removed from a gaming rig as you can get, but it does what I need. At the time I was interested in the G303, however, Logitech had not updated its Mac OS X gaming...'),
(N'Angela', N'Brooks', N'angela.brooks6186@example.net', '2015-06-11', 2, N'I am not pleased with these headphones at all. I ordered them for my son for his xbox. They worked as they were supposed to for the first month and then my son noticed they would short a bit. Now, less than two months in they have completely stopped working. No pulling, no tugging was done to them. My son is older and takes care of his things. We brought them out to the kitchen and opened them up to determine the issue. When opened we noticed the wires inside had come apart. They were only connected with masking tape???? I''ve seen them done with electrical tape or solder, never this way. Extremely bad construction. Poor quality. I only gave them 2 stars because they did sound clear until then.'),
(N'Carol', N'Davis', N'carol.davis6461@example.net', '2015-06-11', 5, N'this is the greatest series since final fantasy.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Wang', N'dennis.wang4475@example.com', '2015-06-11', 1, N'Shipping was quick, item was completely defective and was not responded to at a reasonable time'),
(N'Christina', N'Lewis', N'christina.lewis9792@example.net', '2015-06-11', 5, N'awesome!'),
(N'Anna', N'Alvarez', N'anna.alvarez7939@example.org', '2015-06-11', 5, N'This is my kind of game! Unlimited free roam with tons of different things to do in a vast landscape. I can play however I want to play and develop the character to suit my playing style. No required missions, no unlock-able areas on the map, everything is wide open to you from the very beginning. There is, of course, the main storyline missions, but you don''t have to do them, and if you decide to you can complete them at your leisure. This is an all-round perfect game!'),
(N'Maria', N'King', N'maria.king3585@example.org', '2015-06-11', 5, N'This is a feature rich gaming mouse. It has a great fit, finish, and feel. I have used a Logitech G5 for years and it finally died. I''m a big Logitech fan, but I really like the value/price of the Uranus... Would have preferred a name with less comedic oppurtunity, but I''m not complaining. The control in the mouse''s setup menu is a gamer''s dream. Too many buttons for my taste but you can disable or reassign anything. Had to lower the DPI bigtime...you breath and it moves, but after the adjustment it is excellent. As long as it holds up over time it is easily the best mouse I''ve used. Very highly recommended.'),
(N'Donald', N'Powell', N'donald.powell5947@example.org', '2015-06-11', 5, N'I don''t have this item.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Wang', N'douglas.wang6146@example.net', '2015-06-11', 4, N'great gift'),
(N'Nathan', N'Long', N'nathan.long3846@example.org', '2015-06-11', 1, N'Boring! I Bought for my 4 yr old and he was bored with the game after a day. I ask his if he wants to pay again and he tells me "its boring... we play Lego game!" (LEGO STAR WARS) So with that answer from him, I''m 100% sure he does NOT like this game. I tried to play it and I can see what he is saying. During my trial, I felt as if I was trying to waist some time while waiting to see the doctor. Verdict: This "Game" should have stayed a app for my phone and definitely no one should pay more than 5 bucks for this app on a ps3 disc.'),
(N'Wei', N'Carter', N'wei.carter4081@example.com', '2015-06-11', 4, N'Awesome game! Love playing with my friends. However I give it 4 stars because no matter my internet connection status because the game is cloud run it keeps disconnecting me from my friends.'),
(N'Adam', N'Anderson', N'adam.anderson8823@example.com', '2015-06-11', 5, N'just as described.. thank you!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Lopez', N'dennis.lopez7101@example.net', '2015-06-11', 5, N'The best outstanding part Home Alone Classic VG on SEGA Genesis World Console & even better than on SNES Nintendo Version Type'),
(N'Dennis', N'Lopez', N'dennis.lopez7101@example.net', '2015-06-11', 5, N'Very Rare & Unique Amiibo for Robin Amiibo(Reflet)'),
(N'Matthew', N'Diaz', N'matthew.diaz7373@example.net', '2015-06-11', 5, N'Awesome puzzle game. I love how this game delivers to PS3 gamers. The moving blocks to blocks to climb up to survive from Vincent''s nightmare after meeting Catherine as he has a committed serious girlfriend already, namely "Katherine." The game is really hard, I meant HARD even in easy mode. Take me lots of tries to pass the stages, lots of fun & stressful mind sometimes how to get through each level. In terms of animations, voice acting, & many endings depends on how you choose the answers really make you think twice. I would recommend this to any puzzle lovers out there.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Kim', N'daniel.kim6617@example.org', '2015-06-12', 5, N'This game is so great, I bought it twice. One on the 3ds and one on the Vita.'),
(N'Amara', N'Morris', N'amara.morris8045@example.org', '2015-06-12', 1, N'don''t care for it.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Flores', N'jerry.flores7535@example.com', '2015-06-12', 5, N'Fantastic classic, love it!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Davis', N'jacob.davis1491@example.net', '2015-06-12', 3, N'I like it but I had to trim a lot of silicone off around the thumb sticks because it was preventing full range of motion.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ward', N'michelle.ward3549@example.com', '2015-06-12', 3, N'Not as good as the old school Call of Duty games but it''s okay.'),
(N'Eric', N'Garcia', N'eric.garcia2003@example.net', '2015-06-12', 3, N'I found B/W to be a step backwards for pokemon games. It plays like your average pokemon game, but I just found this generation''s pokemon to be a tad bit uninspired and odd. Also, in a first for me, I actually found myself wondering what I was supposed to do next. Usually pokemon games are pretty straightforward but I did not find that to be the case for this game. Also, the save times are unbearably long. I''d be willing to bet money that R/B/Y saved faster on a gameboy color than this game does.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Wang', N'thomas.wang5440@example.org', '2015-06-12', 4, N'A little time consuming to set up but once you do you won''t have any problems. Works as it should'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Adams', N'benjamin.adams8230@example.org', '2015-06-12', 5, N'Just what i needed'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Roberts', N'jonathan.roberts5961@example.net', '2015-06-13', 5, N'I like this game very much,fast delivery thank you.'),
(N'Anita', N'Richardson', N'anita.richardson5940@example.net', '2015-06-13', 1, N'Bought when it came down to $2. Still feels like I wasted my money. Aliens still glitch like crazy, going through walls/physical objects.'),
(N'Emily', N'Alvarez', N'emily.alvarez1650@example.org', '2015-06-13', 5, N'my husband adore this xbox'),
(N'Anthony', N'Jones', N'anthony.jones7284@example.com', '2015-06-13', 5, N'Work good.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Butler', N'elizabeth.butler8079@example.org', '2015-06-14', 2, N'Lifeless world, lack of freedom, boring main character and story, weak gameplay. There are countless open world games that are better than this over hyped title.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Miller', N'melissa.miller3426@example.net', '2015-06-14', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Mateo', N'Boyd', N'mateo.boyd2864@example.com', '2015-06-14', 4, N'long gone'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Price', N'cynthia.price3262@example.net', '2015-06-14', 5, N'Was a wonderful gift for a teenage boy. He loves playing this game'),
(N'Karen', N'Khan', N'karen.khan1456@example.com', '2015-06-14', 1, N'I am super frustrated with trying to log on to the North America Mega Server to play this game. Now I see why so many people gave it a crappy review. I''d love to review the gameplay and graphics but I can''t get on. I am writing this review while I continuously wait my turn. How can you hype up a supposed to be awesome game but half of the gamers who have it can''t play it? My system has been saying 92% update for the last 45 minutes. I hope I can come back soon and give this game a better review based off of actual gameplay...SHM This is just terrible and to think I traded in a good game for this crap.'),
(N'Paul', N'Garcia', N'paul.garcia3348@example.org', '2015-06-14', 5, N'What can I say? I''m a huge Sonic The Hedgehog fan, and when I first saw the screenshots of this game coming to Wii U, I knew it had promise. My opinions started to sway once reviews started pouring in, but thank God I didn''t listen to those people. This game is exactly what I wanted in a new Sonic game. Great gameplay, a colorful soundtrack, secret hidden collectables, and a truly great and funny story. The only part of.the soundtrack I didn''t like in the whole game is unfortunately the title screen music which happens to be the main theme. It mainly just keeps looping and I get bored of it very quickly. Besides that one song, I thought the soundtrack was phenomenal and genuinely got me pumped to play the game every time I turned it on. The gameplay greatly reminded me of Super Mario Galaxy, and even though they weren''t able to achieve the same level of perfection that it has, they still did a dang good job. There are a few missteps in the gameplay like bad camera angles, but I...'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez4601@example.org', '2015-06-15', 5, N'I''ve bought this game digitally off the PS Store. The gameplay is cool and fun. The graphics look very good. One con was the story which I hope it was longer making you get into the characters of the game more because once you''ve beat the story it becomes Delsin (the protagonist) on his own. I would still definitely recommend this game for PS4 owners.'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez4601@example.org', '2015-06-15', 5, N'After around 1.5 years of playing this game''s story and multiplayer I''ve got to say this is the best investment you can make when buying a video game. The story is great, well scripted and big. The best thing about this game is open world. Even when you''ve beaten the story you''ll have many other things to do : Strangers and Freaks, Sea,Land Races, go to clubs.. And most importantly the online. Imagine playing GTA in a 30 player lobby all filled up with friends? Up top Rockstar!'),
(N'Linda', N'Foster', N'linda.foster3167@example.net', '2015-06-15', 5, N'grandson loved it'),
(N'Andrea', N'Smith', N'andrea.smith5095@example.com', '2015-06-15', 5, N'great'),
(N'Anna', N'Jimenez', N'anna.jimenez8062@example.org', '2015-06-15', 5, N'Fixes every issue the original has. Shadow of the Templars tends to have a lot of lagging, overlong loading screens & cutscenes that begin to loose any suspense or drama they might have had because it sends you into another loading screen every time you change camera angle. Not only does the sequel fix all of this, but there are several new game-play elements, logic puzzles are just as well thought out, if not more so, than in the original & the animation is a lot more fluid, bright & in-focus. Not to mention lots of little things on the side that most people wouldn''t really notice anything beyond the fact that they''re just plain enjoyable. Also remade with the first game as ''Broken Sword: The Director''s Cut.'''),
(N'Anna', N'Jimenez', N'anna.jimenez8062@example.org', '2015-06-15', 5, N'Game kind of has a slow start, but gets progressively harder & more enjoyable as you play. Kind of a standard, almost Pokemon-style RPG with characters getting randomly attacked in the field & learning specific new moves as you level up. Great sense of humor, & legitimately challenging logic puzzles as well. Excellent find.'),
(N'Brian', N'Allen', N'brian.allen4542@example.com', '2015-06-15', 1, N'This game actually turned me off from gaming on the Xbox One I sold my system after playing this. I watched videos of gameplay of this game for a few days before buying it as I always do. The graphics looked pretty great on the videos. When I actually got it and ran it on my new 1080p led TV it looked way worse than the videos. Actually it was the worst looking game I have played on my Xbox One...the other games I played being Mortal Kombat X, Evolve, COD Advanced Warfare and Forza Horizon 2. Also the jumping system is terrible in this game. You have to look at the ledge you want to jump to then click in the left thumbstick and press the right bumper. It would have been much easier to map this to a button like every other game ever made. Overall the graphics were terrible and the controls were awful. Zero stars.'),
(N'Michael', N'Sullivan', N'michael.sullivan1182@example.com', '2015-06-15', 5, N'So glad I didn''t listen to the bad reviews. Do yourself a favor and watch videos of gameplay instead of reading all the negativity. I love the game!'),
(N'Megan', N'Foster', N'megan.foster5852@example.net', '2015-06-15', 5, N'Awesome quality. However, if left idle for too long it will shut off. Just pop the batteries out, wait about 5 to 10 seconds, and turn it back on. Alternatively you can just press start'),
(N'Samuel', N'Jackson', N'samuel.jackson3961@example.com', '2015-06-15', 1, N'I got this guitar and it was not working. They did not even checked the guitar. If they did, they would noticed that the batteries ran out. The battery holder is completely full of asset. The spring that holds the batteries is worthless. The guitar is broken and not working at all. I''m really disappointed.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Ramirez', N'anthony.ramirez5470@example.org', '2015-06-15', 5, N'Probably one of my favorite seek and finds. Where else could you find stuff to sell, and then go on a shopping spree to outfit a broken down, old barn and all from the comfort of your home? I have 3 perfectly outfitted barns that a person could actually live in if they wanted! My grandchildren even play it when they visit! Simple, yes...Fun, definately yes!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Howard', N'aaron.howard8749@example.com', '2015-06-15', 5, N'It''s The PS4. It''s Awesome. What More Can I Say.'),
(N'Eric', N'Howard', N'eric.howard3827@example.net', '2015-06-15', 4, N'good'),
(N'Lucia', N'Lewis', N'lucia.lewis5001@example.com', '2015-06-15', 5, N'Easy to set up, great integration with my cable subscription and use in my entertainment center. Great voice recognition and solid full body control. Kinect just keeps getting better...'),
(N'Eric', N'Torres', N'eric.torres8656@example.com', '2015-06-15', 4, N'I changed my last post because I had made an error but just for the record these are pretty nice they do work'),
(N'Omar', N'Lee', N'omar.lee9682@example.com', '2015-06-16', 5, N'Still a great game miss the endurance races, unless I haven''t found them yet. Having to work for your rewards in the game is the only way to go.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Morales', N'tomasz.morales7091@example.org', '2015-06-16', 5, N'If anyone thinks you''re picking up Skyrim 5.5 you''ll be greatly mistaken but it doesn''t mean the game isn''t any good. Actually both of my boys are having so much fun with it, much to my dismay, cause that means now I have to buy two more copies so we can all play together. And that''s the whole point of this game. Borderlands, Dying Light, Diablo 3. What makes those games so much fun is playing with others and that''s this game. Graphically speaking, this game isn''t great. The gameplay isn''t nearly as smooth or fluid as Skyrim but that''s ok. I''m not expecting it to be. Right now my son and I are finishing up The Witcher 3 and soon after we''ll all play ESOL which I''m sure that''ll keep us busy throughout the summer months ***Update: Well, it''s official. I bought my elder son a copy about a week ago and he hasn''t played The Witcher 3 since he picked up this game and started playing with his brother. They are having soooo much fun. My younger son just became a werewolf. Now they''re...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Raghunathan', N'ryan.raghunathan2455@example.net', '2015-06-16', 3, N'The nicest product Ive seen ever!'),
(N'Judith', N'Ross', N'judith.ross1827@example.net', '2015-06-16', 5, N'Highly recommended for fan of Wolfenstein pc games.'),
(N'Jack', N'Morris', N'jack.morris7073@example.com', '2015-06-16', 5, N'Great Buy!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Edwards', N'jennifer.edwards7897@example.net', '2015-06-16', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Barbara', N'Edwards', N'barbara.edwards5637@example.com', '2015-06-17', 4, N'Bravely Default is a great rpg game. There were times near the ending when it was really repetitive but the ending and the overall gameplay made up for it. The game introduces a new battle system and the visuals in this game is stunning. Great game to add to your 3ds collection if you are on the fence.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Hall', N'shirley.hall8570@example.net', '2015-06-17', 5, N'I downloaded this collection from the Microsoft Store, and I like it immensely. Why? I like old school gaming, that''s why. I like games that are simple and fun. And this collection delivers. Perfectly.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Price', N'pamela.price9795@example.net', '2015-06-17', 3, N'Like any other guitar for the game'),
(N'Kyle', N'Coleman', N'kyle.coleman9054@example.net', '2015-06-17', 5, N'Kids had no complaints'),
(N'Kyle', N'Coleman', N'kyle.coleman9054@example.net', '2015-06-17', 5, N'The kids enjoy it'),
(N'Lisa', N'Turner', N'lisa.turner6622@example.com', '2015-06-17', 5, N'With xbox one backwards compatible Skyrim made it to my collection again!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Rogers', N'joyce.rogers4825@example.net', '2015-06-17', 2, N'KATHLEEN RICHARDS'),
(N'Heather', N'Rivera', N'heather.rivera3883@example.org', '2015-06-17', 5, N'One of the best in the Lego series of games with new ways to open doors and figure out puzzles. Great job following the movies and bringing it to a level that is even good for a 5 yr. Old. Very impressive. Love these games.'),
(N'Laura', N'Sullivan', N'laura.sullivan7619@example.org', '2015-06-17', 5, N'awesome game! zombies meet GTA.'),
(N'Carol', N'Wisniewski', N'carol.wisniewski2305@example.com', '2015-06-17', 5, N'I am very satisfied with this product'),
(N'Noah', N'Butler', N'noah.butler4085@example.com', '2015-06-17', 5, N'Great game good shipping time works very good'),
(N'Joshua', N'Gonzalez', N'joshua.gonzalez7929@example.com', '2015-06-18', 5, N'very good shap and I use to play this game as a kid so it was super fun'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Mendoza', N'stephanie.mendoza1882@example.net', '2015-06-18', 5, N'I love this controller! Already have a few and I want them all. Samus'' it''s really shiny.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Jenkins', N'alexander.jenkins6063@example.net', '2015-06-18', 5, N'Engaging and expansive world. Large starting pokedex means lots of potential team choices. Some references to black and white 1 but does not diminish gameplay. Extensive post game.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Okonkwo', N'nicole.okonkwo5806@example.com', '2015-06-18', 5, N'If you are like me and just never got around to sleeping dogs and you didn''t want to break the break the bank on dlc..... This is beyond an excellent deal for you Full game. All dlc. Upgraded HD grapgics. PS4. At an insane cheap price. Can''t beat it.'),
(N'Gary', N'Kumar', N'gary.kumar8112@example.net', '2015-06-18', 5, N'item as described,exellent service.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Okonkwo', N'ravi.okonkwo6797@example.com', '2015-06-18', 3, N'Finished this quicker than I do my girlfriend most of the time. Glad I got this at a low price, it''s not a bad experience but I would''ve been pissed if I spent a higher amount for such a short experience. In the end I''d recommend aiming to spend $10 or less for this. Even with the objectives and bonuses and this and that, its core is too short.'),
(N'Heather', N'Rogers', N'heather.rogers2009@example.net', '2015-06-18', 5, N'Xbox broken'),
(N'Amanda', N'Carter', N'amanda.carter4443@example.net', '2015-06-18', 4, N'Very good!'),
(N'Scott', N'King', N'scott.king7706@example.net', '2015-06-18', 4, N'The game still needs work. If you read the reviews already, then you know how the gameplay is. It is very buggy in most cases. The fight mechanics are pretty bad. There is too much delay when I have to block or swing my sword. Most of time, it is frustrating going against the griffin or tough enemies. More likely, you have to use your potions. Other than that, the storyline is UNBELIEVABLE! I can never put down the controller because the story and how everything is going grabs my attention very quickly. The environment is just fantastic to be in. So much effects in the game like raining, storm, etc. I am happy that the developers look into the effects of the outdoors. Skyrim, Red Dead Redemption, and little bit Halo (music background) kind of fits into this game together, It is great that they made huge map where you can roam around and do quests just like Skyrim''s open world. Red Dead Redemption kind of like fits in here because of the horse, Cantar is the term when you hold the...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Anderson', N'benjamin.anderson7763@example.org', '2015-06-19', 5, N'Nice free dlc'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ward', N'aisha.ward7088@example.com', '2015-06-19', 2, N'The game play is nothing like the other Metroid games and it is too dark to actually be able to see what you are trying to see. It may just be me but I am not a huge fan of this game.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Chen', N'olivia.chen5949@example.com', '2015-06-19', 5, N'Great price and the charge the controllers just fine. Turn blue when fully charged. Excellent price! Highly recommend this one.'),
(N'Luis', N'Long', N'luis.long3810@example.net', '2015-06-19', 4, N'Ok,'),
(N'Debra', N'Ramos', N'debra.ramos4863@example.com', '2015-06-19', 5, N'This is one of the best games I have ever played. I really do not understand why more people don''t play this game. The gameplay is so satisfying and it leaves you wanting more. slow motion sniping is totally awesome. the surrounding architecture of Berlin is absolutely stunning. One of my favorite things about the game is how you have to really make use of your surroundings and limited materials. This is one of those games that is worth playing again and again to see if you can get a better score. I cannot wait to play the third one. PS Sniping Nazis in the balls is the bomb. This game really is the dog''s bollocks.'),
(N'Adam', N'Lopez', N'adam.lopez2723@example.com', '2015-06-19', 2, N'i have to say this product is bad when i first got it it was good but after few months battery life is like 5 hours with controller turned off here and there not to happy with this battery maybe few bucks cheap but its not worth it might as well get the xbox batterys not sure how long they last but probably more than this one'),
(N'Amanda', N'Price', N'amanda.price8782@example.org', '2015-06-19', 5, N'An under-rated and excellent platformer game. Super Mario Sunshine provides a breath of fresh air by mixing the classic Mario play style and adding the new element of water spraying to make an interesting platform. Good story, excellent gameplay. music, and graphics for the time. It''s a must have for anyone who wants a completely different Mario experience.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Butler', N'ashley.butler8855@example.net', '2015-06-20', 5, N'GOOD'),
(N'Ashley', N'Butler', N'ashley.butler8855@example.net', '2015-06-20', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Gary', N'Jimenez', N'gary.jimenez5226@example.net', '2015-06-20', 4, N'good game, a bit short! my code didn''t work so i had to return the game.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Kowalski', N'ronald.kowalski1761@example.com', '2015-06-20', 4, N'Wish the throttle didn''t click in the middle position... besides the plastic feel... it works amazing! GET IT!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Moore', N'patricia.moore3415@example.org', '2015-06-20', 5, N'This is my third Lego game. Other two were on the 360. This is by far the hardest. Lego star wars and Lord of the rings were very enjoyable for my three yr old. This is, too, except it is also more frustrating due to added complexity. Still fun for me lol.'),
(N'Justin', N'Cook', N'justin.cook4809@example.net', '2015-06-20', 5, N'(1 star for scalpers, tho) Hey, don''t buy these from scalpers! Just go to Game Stop, I''ve been at two different stores, and there are tons of em.'),
(N'Walter', N'Gomez', N'walter.gomez8673@example.com', '2015-06-20', 1, N'DO NOT buy this game. Your game progress will not save. Look it up. We are all having issues where, you play all night and get to level 17 or 19, and the next day, your back to level 3. All your cars are gone and all the races or rapid response, is gone. Nothing is there. Like you never played. There is not a save option. I have looked. I have tried all the options online, and nothing seems to help save my progress. No one is doing anything to fix this issue. It has been going on, since the game came out. Maybe the other consoles, data, is being saved. Just not on the 360 or the one. The game was fun, and I would of loved it, I think. However, no save, no play. Wasted money.'),
(N'Megan', N'Richardson', N'megan.richardson9730@example.net', '2015-06-20', 5, N'Bought it for my son and he gives it a 10/10.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Walker', N'nicholas.walker6673@example.org', '2015-06-20', 5, N'Very good prducto , sealing and stand very new, thanks'),
(N'Brenda', N'Ramirez', N'brenda.ramirez5912@example.org', '2015-06-20', 5, N'I purchased this game for my son and instead I end up playing this game more. It has a huge variety or marvel characters and the gameplay is quite fun. I thought it would have been aimed intentionally for children but this game is fun. As you progress through the story, you unlock more marvel characters and eventually you will want to unlock every single one.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Wang', N'ashley.wang2730@example.net', '2015-06-20', 5, N'Ok'),
(N'Nancy', N'Sanders', N'nancy.sanders5721@example.org', '2015-06-20', 5, N'Love love love it. I''ll be honest, I thought I was going to get an opened box from the seller. Yet it was all brand new and box was never open. Item was easy to set up along with paddle sync. Very excited for this system and can''t wait to get more games & such. The $281.11 xbox one is well worth the price and even more amazing I got $70.00 or so as stores in my area retail them for $350.00'),
(N'Walter', N'Turner', N'walter.turner6870@example.com', '2015-06-20', 5, N'Finally after years have gone by got myself the Pokemon Colosseum bonus disk. Very rare it is a product that came with a prepurchase, nice how you see a couple of trailers, but better to be able to get a Jirachi which is not obtainable during regular gameplay. This product would be for people who play the Pokemon game series, or collect Nintendo and/or Pokemon products.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Jackson', N'lucia.jackson8954@example.com', '2015-06-21', 3, N'It''s a misogynistic game from Japan. It tells girls and boys that girls can''t become successful making a lot of money. Other than the misogyny, it''s a fun game. It''s a sequel to Style Savvy that was on the DS. You run a clothing boutique and compete in fashion shows. It has added minor social aspects to the game play which was missing from the original, but it seems tacked on and doesn''t add much value to the game. It has improved graphics and more items. Now your blue bra strap won''t show when you wear items like tube tops, strapless dress, etc. It add more make up options and ability to furnish your apartment. It adds men''s fashion to the game. I would have preferred it if they added lingerie to the mix instead. The boring blue bra and panty is boring. At least let us pick different colors. It''s like wearing the same underwear 365/24/7. EEEEEEEEWWWWWW!!!! It still has the annoyingly low $99,999.90. You can''t even make $100,000, let alone a million dollars. It''s shocking...'),
(N'Carol', N'Wang', N'carol.wang7923@example.org', '2015-06-21', 5, N'I don''t have a Xbox One, but I buy it for my laptop, works perfect, nice product'),
(N'George', N'Sullivan', N'george.sullivan2842@example.org', '2015-06-21', 1, N'Bought the xbox one and got the controller It fails to connect wirelessly it does not stay turned on even though charged batteries and a charged play charger battery pack, Needed to get replacement from microbot.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Cook', N'yuki.cook3709@example.net', '2015-06-21', 4, N'very inclusive kit, has a lot of the needed tools. only reason I can''t give it 5 start is this kit has 1 plastic tool in it. its very brittle and the tip broke off with zero effort. if that one tool was made of metal this would be a 5star kit!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Garcia', N'kyle.garcia4585@example.com', '2015-06-21', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Ethan', N'Parker', N'ethan.parker8572@example.net', '2015-06-21', 5, N'good , it is OK'),
(N'Douglas', N'Russell', N'douglas.russell6765@example.net', '2015-06-21', 4, N'Great!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Russell', N'douglas.russell6765@example.net', '2015-06-21', 5, N'Awesome!!!'),
(N'Mary', N'Bell', N'mary.bell4682@example.org', '2015-06-21', 4, N'doesn''t transmit game audio just online co op with friends. but good item'),
(N'Justin', N'Jones', N'justin.jones8135@example.org', '2015-06-21', 5, N'Came with 40+ GB. Was not dissapointed.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Thomas', N'rachel.thomas5321@example.org', '2015-06-22', 5, N'VERY GOOD GAME TO PLAY'),
(N'Hannah', N'King', N'hannah.king1165@example.org', '2015-06-22', 3, N'This game pales in comparison to the new order. Perhaps thats why it gets a lot of mediocre reviews. Folks expect a certain level of enjoyment and its easy to disappoint if you have created something great before. I payed $10 for it on steam and while this game was fun, i beat it in under 10 hours while almost completely exploring my surroundings and doing all the nightmare missions. And that was with occasionally starting over chapters to try stealthing through them. Honestly If I had just run and gunned through I probably would of beat it in 6 hours or less. This is in comparison to the 136 hours in Witcher 3 before finishing (also lots of exploring and side stuff). So The Old Blood is short. But there are other issues to. One prime example is that the AI is stupidly easy to fool or sometimes buggy. They mostly have set pathing which is ok, except that i can just stroll around them in circles sometimes without a reaction... and if they see you (even on the harder difficulties),...'),
(N'Eric', N'Chavez', N'eric.chavez1144@example.org', '2015-06-22', 4, N'Finally, I''m glad to see NINTENDO is coming out with more radical designs for there Wii and Wii U remotes. As I stated in a review of another Wii remote with the popular introduction of SUPER SMASH BROS. Nintendo has been re-releasing GAMECUBE controllers with cool new re-designs...I only wish they would put that much creativity in their Wii and Wii U remotes. The good news is that this item "does" come with MOTION PLUS installed (I would hope so, considering what I paid for it). However, therein lies the double-edged sword...1st this item is not available in the U.S. 2nd with what it cost I would think it should come with a nunchuk or other accessory, or even better a lower price...'),
(N'Debra', N'Wilson', N'debra.wilson2303@example.net', '2015-06-22', 5, N'good'),
(N'Deborah', N'Raghunathan', N'deborah.raghunathan7073@example.net', '2015-06-22', 5, N'great games, great memories'),
(N'Deborah', N'Raghunathan', N'deborah.raghunathan7073@example.net', '2015-06-22', 5, N'wow, very surprised with this game, should have known about it sooner, oh well. superb PS3 Racer.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Reed', N'jerry.reed5167@example.com', '2015-06-22', 5, N'#NAME?'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Lewis', N'kenneth.lewis2960@example.com', '2015-06-22', 4, N'Decent golf game. Graphics could use some polishing.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Rebecca', N'Robinson', N'rebecca.robinson7160@example.com', '2015-06-22', 4, N'I don''t think any game has ever seamlessly captured hip hop on a console more than Def Jam Vendetta. Such a good game that I wish had been improved upon later on (Def Jam Icon was mediocre at best). Loads of great characters, interactive battle stages, great soundtrack, great general sound (punches, kicking, weapons, etc), and a nice storyline. The only flaws I would say this game had was that the create-a-fight wasn''t very deep, and the fact that even though there were 45 playable characters, a good portion of the characters had similar move-sets. Still, this game was probably the apex of hip hop in the mainstream, and captured everything that was good at the time.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Robinson', N'rebecca.robinson7160@example.com', '2015-06-22', 5, N'EASILY a top 5 wrestling game ever. One of the best & deepest rosters at the time, deepest CAW mode, fairly deep story mode, and overall a great wrestling game. The last game that had a lot of wrestlers at their peak ability....Edge, Eddie, Brock Lesnar, Benoit, Angle, Kane, Rob Van Dam, Goldberg, Thuganomics Cena, and a host of others. If you don''t have a single wrestling game, THIS is the game to have. A MUST have.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Brown', N'christopher.brown1737@example.org', '2015-06-22', 5, N'I have quite a few PS2 games and this card has come in handy. I have noticed that some titles, Manhunter for instance, won''t recognize this card..Most games however work just fine, good purchase if you are still an avid PS2 gamer like myself!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'King', N'benjamin.king3382@example.net', '2015-06-22', 5, N'I would vote against this game. Mr. Bubbles haunts my dreams. I find myself endlessly wandering bohemian landscapes searching for the Vigors of my youth. Little girls taunt me in the clouds of faith. The unjust haunt me. I will escape.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Lee', N'brandon.lee5181@example.org', '2015-06-22', 4, N'This is a really good game... but it is also extremely difficult. For those that aren''t really gamers or have a good amount of experience playing games, this game is going to be really hard. It''s also not for the young. There is some serious amount of blood and gore in the game, with a lot of slow motion kills. All that being said it''s a truly amazing game with a good story and good graphics. Just prepare to be frustrated as you have to continue to do certain things over and over and over again, unless you''re just an amazing gamer and can fly through it without difficulties. I don''t know many that have. But they''ve all had fun trying.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Thomas', N'matthew.thomas1621@example.org', '2015-06-22', 1, N'Don''t do it. SE''s system is the same ---- that always has been. Pre-order issues and no world issues ranging from log in to restricted access because their servers aren''t able to handle too many players. This time it''s worse because they''ve since condensed the worlds to a few due to so many dropping out on 1.0 release. I highly suggest avoiding this game and the expansion until servers and issues are resolved. See photo for the announced issues; these are just the announced. And before you request for help, it''s never going to happen. Their billing and CS is beyond stupid. The link for the pre-order to sign-in doesn''t even work. Thankfully I can use the regular account login to enter the code. How''s that in your face? I honestly don''t know why people are so desperate and so willing to let a company screw them time after time.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Sullivan', N'sofia.sullivan2682@example.org', '2015-06-22', 5, N'great gift'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Lewis', N'elizabeth.lewis5601@example.com', '2015-06-22', 5, N'Ordered my copy. It got here pretty fast, and it works and is in great shape. Thanks for the fast delivery.'),
(N'Judith', N'Bennett', N'judith.bennett4405@example.org', '2015-06-22', 3, N'Not as good as the Assassin''s creed franchise but still fun.'),
(N'Helen', N'Diaz', N'helen.diaz6077@example.org', '2015-06-22', 1, N'Not what I expected I wanted one like they use to make on the older playstaion But can''t find anymore.'),
(N'Donald', N'Lee', N'donald.lee7430@example.net', '2015-06-22', 4, N'Really fun, I don''t understand why so many people felt mad, after all the patches and with the season pass I clocked in about a good 300 hours of game play for this. Though some achievements are annoying and the secret online tailing mission is impossible unless you get help from a fellow player.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Okonkwo', N'brandon.okonkwo7799@example.org', '2015-06-22', 4, N'OK I''m not really sure why I''m reviewing this as its been sufficiently reviewed and I will be burried deep beneath all of the all ready great reviews for the 3ds but oh well hear it goes! I promise to be fairly brief here most of my reviews go on and on but with this I''m just gonna be brief. OK I have one have owned a great deal of handheld gaming systems through the years a game gear, Gameboy color and advanced a bunch of psps a vita and now a 3ds that''s not even counting all the android and apple devices if you wanted to go there. Any ways mobile gaming tends to be a mixed bag most of the time the hardware is great but these systems live and die by there content that''s all there is too it! To me the psp is the greatest portable gaming system there has ever been to date. There was a game for any mood or test the graffics were quite good I thought and when the go came out it became even more portable. Most people hated the go but I love it, I still play it all the time. So I...'),
(N'Jerry', N'Boyd', N'jerry.boyd8646@example.net', '2015-06-22', 4, N'Good Product'),
(N'Anthony', N'Harris', N'anthony.harris4496@example.com', '2015-06-22', 1, N'A foolish purchase---It was a USED copy and the Authentication Key was already used. I could not play the game..'),
(N'Thomas', N'Patel', N'thomas.patel3389@example.org', '2015-06-23', 2, N'meh'),
(N'Priya', N'Ross', N'priya.ross4838@example.net', '2015-06-23', 5, N'Great mouse. Honestly, I never expected such a good mouse within a reasonable price. It looks great and works great too. Love this mouse.'),
(N'Steven', N'Ivanov', N'steven.ivanov6012@example.com', '2015-06-23', 5, N'I think this Yoshi looks better than the Yoshi amiibo from the smash bros series of amiibo.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Singh', N'joyce.singh1645@example.org', '2015-06-23', 5, N'Great game , great graphics , it was worth waiting so long to have this master , many hours of exciting game play.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Bennett', N'ivan.bennett4625@example.org', '2015-06-23', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Linda', N'Tanaka', N'linda.tanaka8322@example.com', '2015-06-23', 5, N'What can I say about my favorite video game ever! Did you know I liked this game more than Super Maro Bros. when it came out for the NES in 1984? Man, oh man, when I played this I wondered why they even bothered to make other video games. I loved it! I like it even more than Fallout 4. Bethesda is failing in making their franchise available online for online gameplay like Happy Wars. When Bethesda figuires this out, Fallout 4 will have a good chance of beating the COD franchise and with any luck even Happy Wars and that''s saying a lot. Titus Flavius! If I have not paid for this game full retail price several times including one special edition, I have not paid ever for it. It''s that good and I''ve used, broken, sold it, re-sold it so many times! I finally got the digital copy AND a disc copy just in case. By the way I do have ALL DLCs for this game. They''re all decent, except maybe for Mothership Theta, but since I like the game so much I still got it.'),
(N'Brian', N'Allen', N'brian.allen4542@example.com', '2015-06-23', 5, N'So I have tried the PlayStation T.V. the Razer Forge the Nvidia Shield console and the Mad Catz Mojo and the PlayStation T.V is by far the best of the bunch. It has a huge library of games available for download including all the latest games and a ton of classic PS1 and PSP games. It comes with an 8 gig memory card and a dualshock 3 controller which is a far and away better controller than what comes with the systems listed above. The Mad Catz controller feels cheap and is glossy...glossy is terrible for a controller. The Razer controller is very cheap and the joysticks are terrible and they are charging 80 dollars for one...wtf? The Nvidia controller is pretty good except it is a little big and the Dpad is terrible. The Playstion controller is the only real game controller out of all of them and they are cheap now if you want to do some multiplayer. Overall the PlayStation T.V. is a great purchase even more so if you have a PS vita and games already. Some games do look better...'),
(N'Alexander', N'Kowalski', N'alexander.kowalski4939@example.org', '2015-06-23', 5, N'This is an enjoyable game. Once again it''s pictures of items you find and you can re play a level to better your score. When you have played all the levels you can play them again or leave it for a while and come back to it and it will be like playing a new game. It''s one the whole family can play without danger of objectionable items.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Rodriguez', N'sandra.rodriguez7272@example.org', '2015-06-23', 4, N'Fun to play.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Cook', N'shirley.cook4424@example.org', '2015-06-23', 4, N'fits good'),
(N'Brenda', N'Flores', N'brenda.flores5485@example.org', '2015-06-23', 5, N'Received on time and according to advertised.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Barnes', N'barbara.barnes2671@example.net', '2015-06-23', 5, N'Really GREAT GAME. I worried that IGN wouldn''t do what they sad and wouldn''t hve Robin in it but it DID have Robin in it and I was like drivin my Batmobile around! Cause it''s supposed to be Batman & ROBIN, like it is with Garlfield and french. Was worried that they''d make Robin look bad and not armory like Batman but they gave Robin red armor and a cool hood which was awesome! Sure it has some glitches but only that complian about it is fanboys so let them smooth out the first errors in a month and just play the game!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Murphy', N'sharon.murphy2429@example.net', '2015-06-23', 5, N'Great Game!!!!!!! I Have Great 2015 Pc Games Titles, Windows 8.1 pro Keys, Xbxox One cards, All On Sale PayPal Accepted!! www.buypckeys.com Pre Order Fallout 4 Now'),
(N'Sharon', N'Murphy', N'sharon.murphy2429@example.net', '2015-06-23', 5, N'Great Game!!! 11/10 I Have Great 2015 Pc Games Titles, Windows 8.1 pro Keys, Xbxox One cards, All On Sale PayPal Accepted!!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Patel', N'thomas.patel3389@example.org', '2015-06-24', 5, N'I loved this game! I played a Warrior with the Brawler spell set and it rocked. I love playing heavy warriors with massive armor and huge weapons, and this game delivered. The graphics are great. The monsters and opponents are nicely detailed and terrific. I liked the atmosphere of the whole game world. The world is not the biggest, but there are many locked doors and passageways to be discovered. The music is awesome! I especially LOVE the track for the credits - listening to it play now! The whole game has great sound. Metal on metal, soft boots are different from metal boots when you move. wow. Again, the music track is one of the best EVER in a game. Play - wow. Just stunning. I''ve played Demon''s Souls and both Dark Souls games. This game is fantastic! Fighting is so much fun. Armored opponents dueling it out. Almost all of the enemies can be fought toe to toe. For those that can''t, magic worked really well for a warrior in this game. There are several healing methods and all...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ward', N'ravi.ward3929@example.net', '2015-06-24', 1, N'Unplayable at anything above low settings. This was a cash grab by WB and they released an unoptimized pos. 4790 with a gtx-980 and run like crap. This is unacceptable.'),
(N'David', N'Stewart', N'david.stewart4761@example.org', '2015-06-24', 5, N'One of the greatest FF games.'),
(N'Debra', N'Martinez', N'debra.martinez7425@example.net', '2015-06-24', 1, N'They look great, feel great, battery lasts a long time, and lag is minimal. HOWEVER... There are two serious problems with these (and I''ve tested several of them on a variety of XBoxes in multiple environments). Firstly, at seemingly random times controllers will get "mixed up". You''ll be playing a game and suddenly controller 1 becomes controller 2 (or 3, or any other one plugged in). So you have to switch controllers. You can imagine the chaos this can cause in the middle of a multiplayer game. Secondly not every button combination can register at the same time. This won''t affect most games, but some that require several buttons pushed together to perform a move (such as Mortal Kombat games) are impossible to do. Not difficult, IMPOSSIBLE because the controller is incapable of that many simultaneous button presses. I wanted to love these, but the above problems made me finally sell them and stick with my wired MS Controller S gamepads.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Brooks', N'kevin.brooks1727@example.org', '2015-06-24', 5, N'I didn''t expect much from this cheap controller, but it has been absolutely great. Not only does it play every (controller-compatible) steam game with no issues, but it''s durable and accurate too. I''ve had this one for over three years, and it''s only now starting to show some wear (mostly because my daughter plays rough with the analog sticks). Highly recommended for the price. (Note: If you''re looking to play extremely precise games (think Dark Souls) the analog sticks are not as sensitive as a name brand Microsoft or Sony controller. So if you have the money, it could be worth it to get one of those or a more expensive Logitech model.)'),
(N'Rachel', N'Green', N'rachel.green9321@example.org', '2015-06-24', 1, N'Doesn''t work right, choppy, stuttering. DO NOT BUY IT. WB Games should be ashamed to release an alpha product. If you already bought it demand a refund and dispute with credit card company.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Henderson', N'jacqueline.henderson1160@example.com', '2015-06-24', 4, N'Love these stylus and the screen protector was easy to install. The "wipe" could have been better quality and have some type of branding on it.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Lopez', N'timothy.lopez5016@example.net', '2015-06-24', 5, N'Good Game at a Good Price.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Nelson', N'christopher.nelson4221@example.org', '2015-06-24', 3, N'flat out crap, i should have spent a few more dollars and got the set by nyko. don''t waste your money. they charge, they fit, but not allowing controller to sync. update: 06/29/2015: i got these to work in one of five controllers. im not sure why it won''t work in the others but it does work in the one. still not worth it, go with the nyko set and save yourself a headache ltr.'),
(N'Donna', N'Jones', N'donna.jones8942@example.net', '2015-06-24', 3, N'Ok game'),
(N'David', N'Cook', N'david.cook9688@example.org', '2015-06-24', 5, N'Game is a classic and you can update with DLC new missions etc.'),
(N'Julie', N'Green', N'julie.green5109@example.com', '2015-06-24', 5, N'was a gift for grandson. all I have heard that is is exactly what he wanted'),
(N'Michelle', N'Martin', N'michelle.martin8867@example.com', '2015-06-24', 2, N'The Souls franchise branches off to make a new game...another souls game with different weapons and enemies. The mechanics are the same; You attack and dodge, though, you are supposed to be more aggressive in this game. I''m not a fan of it since, to me, you get stuck in the attack animation, causing you to be unable to dodge, and the audio as a strange echo that just got agitating after a while. Fans of the Souls games seem to enjoy it, but it''s not my cup of blood.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Nguyen', N'deborah.nguyen3250@example.org', '2015-06-24', 4, N'Protects controller. Fits perfectly. The one flaw is that if the case gets squeezed with the controller inside the PS button will get pressed and the controller will turn on. This can easily happen in a bag. Depending on your setup you might end up pairing the controller to your system and not realize it which will kill the battery. I use a PS4 controller with my Surface Pro 3 and that happened to me recently. They should modify the case so that if it gets squeezed the PS button won''t get pushed. They could do that by raising the little area between the sticks to the height of the sticks.'),
(N'Paul', N'Carter', N'paul.carter7373@example.net', '2015-06-24', 2, N'The analog stick depends on what game you use it for. It''s fine for most games. For a competitive player I would not recommend it. The analog stick and c-stick do not match the original nintendo gamecube controller and wave bird controller. If you look the picture displayed. The original gamecube controller and wave bird controller sticks are on the right. These replacement caps are on the left of the photo. You can see the difference. The replacement cap holes look like cylinders while the actual controllers have a dreidel shape. These different shapes prevent your controller from functioning at the correct time. So for Smash bros or any other competitve game these analog caps will not be effective. I suggest you just buy the screwdriver for your controller and use the old parts from your other controllers or just buy a new controller.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Turner', N'yuki.turner4183@example.org', '2015-06-24', 5, N'Excellent Seller and excellent piece of advise everyone by this seller and give it the full five stars of a well worth it'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ivanov', N'aisha.ivanov5323@example.net', '2015-06-24', 3, N'Too realistic, making it not as fun as it could be.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Gomez', N'melissa.gomez3554@example.net', '2015-06-25', 2, N'I don''t personally like this game and should have researched it before buying it.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Hall', N'kimberly.hall3044@example.org', '2015-06-25', 5, N'No scratches and came with box manual and 3d glasses thanks'),
(N'Kelly', N'Barnes', N'kelly.barnes4110@example.com', '2015-06-25', 5, N'It''s my favorite game love the metal box if u love halo as much as me you would buy this instead of the standard copy trust me its worth it!'),
(N'Dee', N'Kelly', N'dee.kelly6855@example.net', '2015-06-25', 5, N'as described'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Hughes', N'jacqueline.hughes8746@example.org', '2015-06-25', 5, N'So far this has been a good game to play. The graphics are good and you''ll love the analog computers just like in the real movie. Now be forewarned this game will scare you and the colonial Marines are not coming to the rescue. Plus there''s no M-41 pulse rifle or smart gun to use in this game. You only have your wits to survive.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Martinez', N'thomas.martinez6213@example.org', '2015-06-25', 5, N'Product received as advertised :)'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Roberts', N'stephanie.roberts9213@example.org', '2015-06-25', 5, N'In my experience Mayflash is pretty much the only way to seamlessly use your ps3 controller on a PC. Ive tried motion joy, and other home brew methods to get the drivers working with no success. Mayflash, along with games that support the use of a game controller is pretty much the solution. It just works... wireless, wired; it just works. I tried the xbox 360 adapter but does not work as well.'),
(N'Donald', N'Ward', N'donald.ward9785@example.org', '2015-06-25', 5, N'So here''s my lineup of mice I currently own and use: MX518 (4/1) G400s (2/0) G502 Proteus Core (1/0) G302 Daedalus Prime (2) G303 Daedalus Apex (5/4) G300s (1/0) Yes I own five and regularly use four 303 Apex mice: my MBP, work PC, work MAC, and bedroom PC (The living room PC still uses a 518). I have been a true believer in Logitech mice since the MX510 came out and wow''d me with its perfect contours, accurate tracking, and perfect glide on a standard poly fabric mousepad. This was back in Quake 2 / Unreal / Q3 / UT / MOH:AA days, so lots of FPS experience with that mouse, which is why I still use it''s successor for that purpose to this day. The only minor nit-pick I''ve ever had with the design is that occasionally the left button would develop a slight crunchy feel, like a grain of sand got in between the button, but I suspect a minor design flaw in the way the contact was built. Luckily, it usually went away with enough time and click spamming trying to get rid of it. Logitech...'),
(N'Matthew', N'Flores', N'matthew.flores8662@example.com', '2015-06-25', 5, N'I bought these as a gift also, was didn''t know what i was buying really. I read the reviews and chose from there, well I am glad i chose these. He loves them, no I don''t have to listen to him play games all night anymore. Win win. They sound crystal clear and loud in the phones, so you can turn down you tv. It was worth the money, and I am glad I didn''t shell out over 100 for a pair when these are awesome for a reasonable price.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Morgan', N'kyle.morgan9072@example.net', '2015-06-25', 4, N'It is better than any of the Black Ops but I expected better.'),
(N'Eric', N'Davis', N'eric.davis9567@example.net', '2015-06-25', 5, N'Such a fun game to play. I like that there is no violence or anything along those lines in the story. I like that you can rearrange and build little pens for the animals. I like the variety of colors the animals come in. I do not like that there are no cats in the story, only bobcats but still, it''d been a nice feature to have a tabby cat in it. I also noticed that if you had a say, a corgi and a doxie, they''d not ever have puppies, I thought that was a strange thing to add in the game. I also liked that you could complete the game without having to take any animals down to the meat market.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Roberts', N'jeffrey.roberts1357@example.com', '2015-06-25', 3, N'needs up grade from internet'),
(N'Michelle', N'Boyd', N'michelle.boyd3138@example.net', '2015-06-25', 5, N'As one customer stated "It''s Pac Man on steroids." Yes, but what fun to be had. Sooner or later I''m going to buy the add ons. Most enjoyable, replayable game. Ultimate Pac Man.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Lopez', N'marcus.lopez7459@example.net', '2015-06-25', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Jonathan', N'King', N'jonathan.king2588@example.org', '2015-06-25', 5, N'Greninja is really acool looking Pokémon. The details on the tongue is very smooth.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Lewis', N'patricia.lewis2793@example.com', '2015-06-26', 5, N'There are a million reviews for EOS, so I won''t add much more here. If you loved Skyrim, you will love this. If you loved Skyrim and World of Warcraft, you will love this. I''m not sure this is the best MMORG out there, but it is Tamriel. I go there for hours and hours because I love the world in which the Elder Scrolls is set. Sharing that world with millions of other players is a treat.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'James', N'cynthia.james9661@example.org', '2015-06-26', 5, N'I really have no idea where these bad reviews came from. Maybe that so many people tried playing the game when it first came out it had issues. However, I just got this game 2 days ago and had no problems at all. This is one of the best games I have ever played. I say it beats GTA V, only because I haven''t had any issues with staying online. Not even once! I get kicked off GTA V every few hours or so. This the best Elder Scrolls game so far! I felt I had to write this because the first raters didn''t give the game time before they rated it. They probably rated it while they were still downloading. Don''t have any worries.....buy this game!'),
(N'Judith', N'Murphy', N'judith.murphy5409@example.net', '2015-06-26', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Joyce', N'Sanchez', N'joyce.sanchez4564@example.org', '2015-06-27', 1, N'I''m disappointed cause the game isn''t working can''t send it back cuz I work aboard a ship so have no time to return it. Was really looking forward to playing it cuz its my favorite game.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Cooper', N'ashley.cooper5767@example.com', '2015-06-27', 5, N'Grand Theft Auto V is simply the best overall adult digital interactive entertainment ever created. An amazing achievement! It is so incredibly awesome; the only way to ensure this review could possibly do justice, is to advise buying it, put stereo headphones on, unplug yourself from this world and enter that one! [Los Santos] perfect; 5 stars! NOT FOR THOSE UNDER 18, ADULT THEMES, ADULT CONTENT.'),
(N'Christine', N'Coleman', N'christine.coleman7180@example.net', '2015-06-27', 5, N'Fits good, works greay'),
(N'Douglas', N'Nowak', N'douglas.nowak6668@example.net', '2015-06-27', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Eric', N'Ali', N'eric.ali2190@example.net', '2015-06-27', 4, N'This game still holds that memory in a way (especially when single player) The mechanics are much simple like to jump, freeze cars, etc. theres no special combination for that like the past games (I praise this) the controls are much like the past ones only that youll use the analog stick to steer. As for the main story mood this is where the game is much different. The game doesnt offer many characters (Only 4) Sweet tooth, Grime, Dollface and that preacher person or whatever. The story is more in depth kinda like the past ones with cutscenes. the cutscenes are pretty darn good honestly and makes up for it. The gameplay is fair. the AI is tough for one main reason... All AI bots only attack you and that honestly doesnt feel like a free for all or anything. This game isn''t a sequesl or anything.. its more like a different dimension of twisted metal black minus the dark shade colors and numerous characters. There are cars to choose from instead along with skins and paint color....'),
(N'Mei', N'Thompson', N'mei.thompson1250@example.net', '2015-06-27', 4, N'Thin plastic kinda turned me off but the stick was fine not perfect but it''s how all my old controllers used to be. Worn in, and all buttons are responsive'),
(N'Mei', N'Thompson', N'mei.thompson1250@example.net', '2015-06-27', 5, N'Everything works like brand new. It was only the system so I bought an A/V cord and power supply, controller and 5 games and everything works like a charm. While reading the reviews I see a bunch of people are either really unlucky or just really picky. I either got lucky or have low expectations cause everything works like the day it was first bought.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Nguyen', N'andrew.nguyen4811@example.net', '2015-06-27', 2, N'I had enjoyed Bohemias early iterations of this game, even though they were fraught with glitches, bugs, and broken campaigns. Arm III went on sale on Steam, so I thought Id give it a try to see if Bohemia had fixed some of the issues that have constantly plagued their games. Arma III looks pretty good until you go prone and start crawling around on the ground. For some reason the vegetation and solid ground seems to flow and move away from you in a really weird way. It completely kills any sense of emersion the game is trying to achieve and just looks like bad programming. I also ran into the hallmark graphical glitches where the screen will go completely grey or black when the camera is moved up or down. Graphical glitches aside, I found that after only about 3 hours of game play, I was ready to tear my hair out. The game realism requires you be able to discern a target 1000 meters away and be able to shoot it. If you actually manage to do it, the NPC will wobble, but not die...'),
(N'Steven', N'Jackson', N'steven.jackson1164@example.com', '2015-06-27', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Sarah', N'Torres', N'sarah.torres8051@example.net', '2015-06-27', 5, N'I love this product! :)'),
(N'Nathan', N'Young', N'nathan.young3469@example.com', '2015-06-27', 5, N'The price was cheap for what was inside. The games is good, fast and beautiful. Highly recommend this for fighting game fans.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Davis', N'benjamin.davis4621@example.net', '2015-06-28', 5, N'girls play it a lot'),
(N'Peter', N'Okonkwo', N'peter.okonkwo1322@example.net', '2015-06-28', 5, N'I am 69 and really enjoy match three and other simple puzzle type computer games. I have not been able to successfully even begin with "live action" type. The Big Kahuna games are ones I turn to regularly. This has the best graphics of the three versions. The relaxed play is the only method I use. After all, this is for fun, relaxation and keeping my brain exercised. I especially like that the fish skeletons are not used as frequently as in version 2. Even the music and sound effects are fun and relaxing. Of course, the most fun is when I get one of "bomb deluge" puzzles. Watching all those explosions and chain reactions is a delight. You can''t go wrong with this for simple fun.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Allen', N'amanda.allen8570@example.com', '2015-06-28', 5, N'Its a great amiibo for US buyers right now but once release in US it might be a problem with store exclusives'),
(N'Michelle', N'Cruz', N'michelle.cruz3537@example.net', '2015-06-28', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Donna', N'Morris', N'donna.morris4266@example.net', '2015-06-28', 5, N'huge improvement over my last mouse'),
(N'David', N'Bailey', N'david.bailey7299@example.org', '2015-06-28', 5, N'Works and is cheaper than local stores'),
(N'Lucia', N'Peterson', N'lucia.peterson7333@example.net', '2015-06-28', 5, N'Timeless classic, what more can be said?'),
(N'Olivia', N'Hughes', N'olivia.hughes9373@example.com', '2015-06-28', 1, N'these are game breaking. broken game deserves 0 star. 1>very very very bad control 2>tiny ant size font.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Smith', N'gregory.smith2930@example.org', '2015-06-28', 4, N'THIS IS AN ATTACHMENT FOR A WIIMOTE! Just so you guys don''t foolishly think it plugs into the Wii u as i once did. You need a separate WIIMOTE which I had to go out and buy. That being said, it works great, though less responsive than a normal GameCube controller.'),
(N'Laura', N'Adams', N'laura.adams6151@example.org', '2015-06-28', 4, N'It is really really easy to put together! Simple steps and all components helping it making it not problematic. Only advice is to make sure that there is nothing on the screen before you put it on. There was a tiny hair I was not able to clear and it left a bubble on the corner. I guess it would be my bad :/. Overall really excellent item!'),
(N'Henry', N'Long', N'henry.long2376@example.net', '2015-06-28', 5, N'excellent game'),
(N'Christina', N'Chavez', N'christina.chavez2150@example.org', '2015-06-28', 5, N'Excellent product'),
(N'Amy', N'Johnson', N'amy.johnson4590@example.org', '2015-06-29', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Anita', N'Clark', N'anita.clark2785@example.com', '2015-06-29', 4, N'excelent'),
(N'Christopher', N'Howard', N'christopher.howard7310@example.net', '2015-06-29', 3, N'This game was not worth 50 bucks. all characters play basically the same just with different skins and your custom character won''t end up being too different from one of the z-fighters or a saiyan'),
(N'Diane', N'Rodriguez', N'diane.rodriguez3347@example.com', '2015-06-29', 5, N'There is a lot of great content in this season pass'),
(N'Mark', N'Castillo', N'mark.castillo9334@example.org', '2015-06-29', 5, N'I hate shooters, but this game is just amazing. I fell in love since played for the first time.'),
(N'Donna', N'Powell', N'donna.powell7218@example.com', '2015-06-29', 5, N'Like one of the top games on the Wii. Too bad it''s on the wii.'),
(N'Frank', N'James', N'frank.james1174@example.net', '2015-06-29', 3, N'The game is ok. I bought it and received a pretty good deal on it, so it''s not bad for the money. The story is fine and seems to follow the movies mostly. Game play is decent and the controls are nice. However, there is no dialogue, which makes it slightly less fun. I was expecting something similar to Lego Marvel Superheros which has great dialogue. There are a few other things about the game which annoy me, but it''s mostly a personal thing. Like, every time you''re character dies and you lose around 4k of pegs. It makes it difficult to collect them. My son enjoys playing it and likes the game, but even he mentioned it would be better if the characters talked. So, overall I give it a meh.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'King', N'jonathan.king2588@example.org', '2015-06-29', 5, N'Looks pretty good.'),
(N'James', N'Rivera', N'james.rivera1389@example.net', '2015-06-30', 4, N'If you don''t mind a bit of load time, this is actually an excellent port of everything provided, which is a TON. Knights of the Round, King of Dragons, all the Makaimura (Ghosts ''n Goblins) titles, faithfully reproduced for the TINY screen. Pretty hard to find stuff in here! Solid collection, great price. For $16, the PSP doesn''t get much better than this!'),
(N'Lucia', N'Nowak', N'lucia.nowak3898@example.net', '2015-06-30', 5, N'High quality overall, much better than my prior ones. Sound quality is great, mic quality is as expected. Not crystal clear perfect like my old G330''s where people constantly asked me what I was using, but the mic on the PX22 is not bad. Biggest thing is comfort. Once adjusted I can barely tell they are on. No pinching my ears or behind my ears, no pinching my glasses when I wear them, none of that. The mic even folds out of the way if you want. Works well. Read the instructions when setting this up for PC, takes a few minutes at most if you follow the instructions. Once done all the controls work as they should, if you don''t just one acts as a general volume control. Back to sound quality, best I have seen in a sub-$150 headset. To get any better you will have to shop for ones made specifically for audio quality, and those likely won''t have a microphone. I got mine for less than $60, that is a steal for what you are getting especially compared to other brands. These things sound...'),
(N'Richard', N'Sullivan', N'richard.sullivan5020@example.org', '2015-06-30', 5, N'really like them for the price. On top of that it prevents your controller from natural wear and tear'),
(N'Noah', N'Patel', N'noah.patel2873@example.org', '2015-06-30', 5, N'The Xbox will always hold a special place in my heart. At the time of its release, Xbox was the most powerful home console we had ever seen. In addition to its great & unique library of games, it allowed games to display in native 480p and 720p via component cables for games that supported it. I remember being a kid and first seeing the Halo Special Edition Xbox at an EB Games and instantly loving the way it looked. I eventually got one but sold it because I was once a kid with no money and more important things. Nowadays, though, I have a few of these consoles and enough money to buy them, just not enough time to play & enjoy them. That said, I''m glad to have them. If you like the old school Xbox, like Halo, and dig the look of this console, get it.'),
(N'Eric', N'Adams', N'eric.adams2141@example.net', '2015-06-30', 5, N'at the moment these amiibos are the best on the side of the quality so COOL or should I say....... Fresh?'),
(N'Kofi', N'Garcia', N'kofi.garcia6300@example.com', '2015-06-30', 5, N'My son loves this game'),
(N'Barbara', N'Jackson', N'barbara.jackson4308@example.net', '2015-06-30', 1, N'This game is totally monotonous. It has great graphics, uses a Sinatra song as a lead in, and starts off real well. THEN...the game takes the player to a tank battle which is endless because the controller on my PS4 doesn''t respond as it should. The tank battle goes on and on and on and on...... ADDENDUM: THE PRIMARY PROBLEM SEEMS TO BE THAT NO DOCUMENTATION (INSTRUCTIONS) ARE PROVIDED WITH THE GAME. IF YOU FOLLOW THE GAMEPLAY VIDEO PROMPTS, YOU END UP IN THIS TEDIOUS TANK BATTLE. AS A RESULT OF THIS, I FOUND THE GAME TO BE BORING AND MONOTONOUS. OTHERS APPARENTLY DISREGARD THE IN GAME PROMPTING AND ENJOY IT ALOT. I THINK THE PACKAGING IS EVENTUALLY AT FAULT FOR IT''S LACK OF USEFUL INSTRUCTIONS.'),
(N'George', N'Jackson', N'george.jackson6496@example.net', '2015-06-30', 3, N'I wanted to love The Order, after all all the right elements seem to be there from the steam punk, lycan, alternate London history... It had a lot of potential but come on... For a next gen PS4 game there was tech here that was last last gen. On one end you get ultra real textures but on the other- barely interactive environments. There would be tables and elements that could move and were physics based but most of the world wasn''t and you couldn''t tell the difference between the two except by running into them to see what was interactive and not. That was an immersion breaker for me... It felt half baked. It was like playing Myst in a lot of ways. Still going to finish the campaign but this game needed at least one more year of development time to add more destructible and interactive environments and gameplay that goes beyond Beyond:Two Souls gameplay. Multiplayer would''ve been nice. I suppose we''ll have to wait for the sequel.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Anderson', N'jerry.anderson9492@example.org', '2015-06-30', 5, N'PS4 is awesome! Pros and Cons: PROS - Run 2 apps at once, that''s right. - Quick and responsive - Clean interface - Rad controller CONS - Controller battery life is not so great - maybe 4 hours of use before it needs a charge. If you are watching Netflix or something, it lasts longer. Last of Us was awesome. If you want more review, there''s plenty to check out. I bought this before an XB1, but I''ll pickup and XB1 later this year.'),
(N'Megan', N'Chen', N'megan.chen3694@example.net', '2015-06-30', 5, N'Husband was very happy with this product.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Cook', N'amanda.cook2540@example.net', '2015-06-30', 4, N'The graphics are outstanding. A worthy upgrade from the Wii console. Would recommend it to any family.'),
(N'Julie', N'Boyd', N'julie.boyd9557@example.org', '2015-06-30', 3, N'Its not worth it Unless you want the Challenges It unlocks.'),
(N'John', N'Howard', N'john.howard4754@example.com', '2015-06-30', 5, N'What''s to say. It''s an x-box one (xbone). It''s louder than the xbox 360. That can be annoying when I let it annoy me. The Wifi works well - I am not using a wired connection. My main uses are netflix, youtube, and watching 3D movies. It does these things nicely and I''m pretty happy about that. As for the call of duty game. The single player mission is mostly fun. Lots of fun. No need to describe it here because, if you''re curious, go look at the run-throughs on youtube. I do get annoyed with those parts of the story line where you just mash a button as fast as you can. Boring. Other than that, this is call of duty. Need I say more? I will be adding a kinect and stuff. Sometime. When the content makes me really want to add a kinect. has yet to happen...'),
(N'Frank', N'Mendoza', N'frank.mendoza9058@example.org', '2015-07-01', 5, N'good game. funny.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Suzuki', N'jonathan.suzuki4499@example.org', '2015-07-02', 4, N'This is a solid little Bluetooth controller that has some great fit and finish and feels very sturdy. It connected easily to my LG G3, and stayed connected through playing game apps and emulators alike. The analog sticks worked fantastically as well. This has also sucessfully connected to my pc and ps4. Bottom line: get it.'),
(N'Omar', N'Ali', N'omar.ali2078@example.org', '2015-07-02', 5, N'another great borderlands adventure! would recommend!'),
(N'Stephen', N'James', N'stephen.james1269@example.net', '2015-07-02', 5, N'Bought this just for the perks. Code worked backwards and forwards. +8 character slots per server, maxed out bank slots, founder status, founder mount, lioness mount, 2 emeralds, and a few other odds and ends I wasn''t really paying attention to as I mostly was interested in the bank expansion and mounts. Worth the cost of the game. Heads up that the founder mount is account wide, but you have a single claim to the lioness mount. They''re the same speed, so if you are form over fashion - I suggest selling the lioness mount skill.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Long', N'hannah.long8400@example.com', '2015-07-02', 5, N'Best game of 2014! Hands down! Love it! Sometimes, after a long day, I just go kill the s*** out of orcs for an hour two just to unwind!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Roberts', N'jessica.roberts1869@example.net', '2015-07-02', 5, N'This was a replacement for my aging Logitech M518. Its feels great and works perfectly. I highly recommend it. The only thing I don''t necessarily care for is the "G" on the mouse slowly pulses blue. I could have done without that "feature," but its a gaming mouse, so its a requirement to have some sort of unnecessary lighting.'),
(N'Helen', N'Collins', N'helen.collins3139@example.org', '2015-07-02', 5, N'Got it quick works fine'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Ferreira', N'jacqueline.ferreira5100@example.org', '2015-07-03', 5, N'Thank you. Had to buy new ps2 because I still have my old games. my old ps2 stopped working a while ago. I recommend seller.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Walker', N'lauren.walker5265@example.com', '2015-07-03', 4, N'A surprisingly entertaining part of the Call of Duty collection. A much needed change from games of the past, great story, gameplay, and hours of entertainment.'),
(N'Julie', N'Wood', N'julie.wood2369@example.com', '2015-07-03', 5, N'I really love the first one multiplayer with its tactical and team based gameplay and this second installment improves it with the story, terrorist hunt, and the all so great multiplayer. Its seems they won''t make a third but I''m really looking forward to Siege and The Division.'),
(N'John', N'Ramirez', N'john.ramirez1640@example.com', '2015-07-03', 5, N'nice to hold and the led is so elegant'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Hill', N'jonathan.hill8079@example.com', '2015-07-03', 3, N'Unlike Crysis 1 and 2 which let you quicksave, this one has a checkpoint system and I found very often the checkpoints were too far apart. This was practically a game killer for me because I had to play a bunch of sections over and over again on veteran mode. Not fun! Graphics are pretty sweet and the story wasn''t bad. But for the checkpoints I would''ve given it 4 stars.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Ward', N'mateo.ward9528@example.net', '2015-07-03', 5, N'Works great! Amazingly good accuracy! Does not fit well on old white 360 controllers. The plastic rubber on the analog sitick is too thick. Requires modification. NOTE: USPS delivers this, so they will mess up your order by not putting it in your mail box'),
(N'Barbara', N'Lewis', N'barbara.lewis3809@example.org', '2015-07-03', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Olivia', N'Bell', N'olivia.bell7206@example.com', '2015-07-03', 5, N'Fits great. Well made. Feels very nice in your hands. Does not cover over needed ports/no adjustments needed. I have already ordered another one.'),
(N'David', N'Khan', N'david.khan1262@example.com', '2015-07-03', 5, N'That''s right pittoo rises from the darkness as an Amiibo! As soon as I saw the imported versions on sale for prime on here, I thought I''d thought I would just buy it it anyway I bought 2 of em. One for me and another for my sister since she is madly in love with Dark Pit since the Uprising game. And I only spent $50 total ($25 each) which in all honesty $25 is nothing to me anyway as long as it doesn''t exceed $50. I''m still waiting on the American versions to come out since it should be released some time this month along with Lady Palutena (which I''m going after her next... Lol) It came quicker to me as fast as it did. Since I use Prime. And I really love how they notify me saying that it should be on my door step. And it was!! Now that I am using this Amiibo on my Smash game this sucker really became tough after level 45! The best way to train em is to fight against it! They learn a lot from losing to you or any of the CPU players. And feed these guys as much as you want so that...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Perry', N'aisha.perry8489@example.org', '2015-07-03', 5, N'I love this game'),
(N'Laura', N'Rivera', N'laura.rivera5771@example.net', '2015-07-03', 5, N'I Have RayMan Legends And I Just Got Done Playing Some Of This One Tonight Keeps You Playing Luv It'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Hernandez', N'cheryl.hernandez1103@example.org', '2015-07-04', 2, N'I would not recommend this game unless you are willing to pay out an additional hundred bucks for all the DLC you need in order to complete this game and keep it relevant. Video game creators are releasing games that are incomplete and make you purchase add on items in order to complete the game. Here''s an idea, don''t release a game until it is fully finished. Instead they give us an incomplete game that we have to pay extra for in order to get its full potential'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Nguyen', N'cheryl.nguyen2811@example.net', '2015-07-04', 3, N'its ok,'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Martin', N'carolyn.martin9505@example.org', '2015-07-04', 5, N'This won''t get you ripped like Shaun T or jacked like The Rock, but it is fun and it is a great way to get sedentary people to exercise. The balance exercises are the best imo because of the feedback you get. Cant believe the whole bundle is cheaper than a regular WiiU title...great value.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Adams', N'elizabeth.adams4283@example.net', '2015-07-04', 5, N'pretty fun game'),
(N'Ronald', N'Kim', N'ronald.kim7653@example.org', '2015-07-04', 2, N'Boring game.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Gutierrez', N'jacqueline.gutierrez4655@example.net', '2015-07-04', 5, N'Full disclosure here, I am not a huge fan of shooting games; first or third person does not make a difference. I don''t have anything against them in particular; my preferred genres simply lie elsewhere. So when Splatoon was announced, I was a little more reserved than excited. This was Nintendos first in-house big IP in years, and they had chosen a third-person team shooter? I didn''t think Splatoon was going to be a cup of tea I would drink from. Then Nintendo did something I hadnt seen them do in years, even for the Wii U itselfit advertised the living HELL out of this game. In retrospect this makes sense, as it is, again, Nintendos first major new IP in years. It is clear Nintendo wants to make Splatoon into more than just a one hit wonder. They want to make it an established franchise. So the biggest question in my mind is not whether Splatoon is worth buying (it is), but whether it has the potential to be Nintendos next Mario, or Zelda, or Pokemon. The short answer to this, in...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Kowalski', N'carolyn.kowalski8448@example.net', '2015-07-04', 5, N'Must get if you need the 2 10k gold champions and the exclusive mount.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Henderson', N'cynthia.henderson7232@example.com', '2015-07-04', 5, N'Great game, lot of fun, excellent graphics.'),
(N'Janet', N'Green', N'janet.green9951@example.org', '2015-07-04', 5, N'Goodfinally I have it, this is a real classic no PSN download or DLC garbage. A physical DVD as it should be. I can have it for years, unfortunately I can not say that for PSN or Xbox online DLCs once Sony stops supporting PS3 PSN then you online games will got to a trash bin...but not my good old PS2 DVD.'),
(N'Janet', N'Green', N'janet.green9951@example.org', '2015-07-04', 5, N'This works, I have widows 8.1. I am able to use emulators and it is recognized. Highly recommended! Mame, Znes, and PC games works fine!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Cook', N'nancy.cook1363@example.org', '2015-07-05', 3, N'Overall: 3 Graphics: 3 Controls: 5 Sound: 3 Extras: 1 I bought this for the simple reason that I like scrolling shooters, ever since I was a child at the Arcades, and have specifically enjoyed the "Manic Shooter" games over the years. I''ve played the big names of R-Type and Gradius, and have also played and own many others, from multiple sequel releases like Contra, Raiden, Dodonpachi, Touhou Project and Metal Slug, to those that are unique releases or only have a single sequel like Einhander, Gunstar Heroes, Space Harrier, Ikaruga, Tyrian, Sin and Punishment, and Deathsmiles. I''ve played enough of these games to have a good reference of what makes them great, and what should be better. This game says right on the box that it was inspired by the Gradius series, but that''s not quite accurate. This is a game series that is actually a parody of Gradius, just like Parodius, a previous parody series that was also produced by Konami. This is somewhat obvious by the ship design and the...'),
(N'Patricia', N'Webb', N'patricia.webb6332@example.org', '2015-07-05', 4, N'Great fun game continuing the line from Black Flag! They streamlined a few things and tightened up others. Overall its a very polished AC game and turning out to be one of my favorites! I don''t like the weapon and character powerup as well as others like BF or Unity. But it really does not take away from the enjoyment of this fine game. Looks great on PC, I''m having no issues so far on gaming laptop, it does cause the video card to heat up a bit so make sure you have decent cooling for desktop or laptop.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Kumar', N'zachary.kumar5391@example.com', '2015-07-05', 5, N'Fun one of the best games I played on the 3ds'),
(N'Shirley', N'Jenkins', N'shirley.jenkins3849@example.com', '2015-07-05', 5, N'Finally. I''ve been wanting this amiibo for a while now and i got it. The box looks great and has very little damage. Now, I''ve been training him and he was able to kicked my ass, only once though. But that means progress. Right?'),
(N'Anita', N'Stewart', N'anita.stewart7505@example.net', '2015-07-05', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Diane', N'Brown', N'diane.brown7879@example.org', '2015-07-06', 5, N'I thought this game was meant for another system so when I saw it was for my play station I almost cried. The game is amazingly fun and if I remember right from my childhood you get to choose who you''d like to play as. I remember the ooey-gooey world game and the bumper cars game in there too! The whole goal of the game is to save the princess but you have to earn the golden tickets to buy the reptar helmet so you can control giant robo-reptar and fight robo-snail! It''s so much fun, I recommend this game to any age, I''m 20!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Torres', N'sarah.torres9384@example.com', '2015-07-06', 5, N'It really helps me with precision tactics in games, but it does take some getting used to.'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2015-07-06', 4, N'A really good portable LBP game.'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2015-07-06', 4, N'Fun game, as all the SMB games are.'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2015-07-06', 4, N'Good case, but I can''t seem to fit the insanely long power cord in the mesh pocket.'),
(N'Charles', N'Martinez', N'charles.martinez1335@example.net', '2015-07-06', 5, N'very happy with it'),
(N'Priya', N'Cox', N'priya.cox8862@example.com', '2015-07-06', 3, N'Its a good game with you play with another player, but you need to keep buying the addon''s for it to be worth it so it is an expensive game.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Parker', N'jennifer.parker9903@example.org', '2015-07-06', 5, N'Great game and story!!!'),
(N'Jerry', N'Boyd', N'jerry.boyd5353@example.com', '2015-07-06', 3, N'Meh.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Diaz', N'brenda.diaz9124@example.com', '2015-07-06', 4, N'Microphone you speak into is fuzzy for others listening. The sound quality of incoming voices is great though.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Hernandez', N'patricia.hernandez2937@example.org', '2015-07-06', 5, N'The added ergonomics are worth the price alone. Doubling the battery life of the Vita is just icing on the cake, Delicious butter-cream icing the way your grandma made it. Toss this bad boy in your backpack and your Vita in a case and you are good to go. One thing is it does take a good amount of time to charge, but its such a minor gripe that its almost not worth mentioning, let alone taking a star away. My large adult hands are thankful for the grip, my small adult brain is thankful for extra game time. Win/Win.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Nowak', N'christopher.nowak6551@example.org', '2015-07-07', 5, N'Thanks!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ramos', N'ethan.ramos1160@example.org', '2015-07-07', 5, N'good'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ramos', N'ethan.ramos1160@example.org', '2015-07-07', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Betty', N'Price', N'betty.price2497@example.org', '2015-07-07', 5, N'Sonic Heros for the Gamecube is such a good game. it has great graphics and colorful too. it''s one of the best Sonic titles available for the Gamecube even though it''s been out of style for eight years now. i so wish they would make a Sonic heros two with more teams added in the mix. you get four teams in this one. Team Sonic, Team Dark, Team Rose, and Team Chaotix. all with thier own unique actions and combos. the Chaotix gameplay is a little different as it''s misson based. i won''t spoil it for those that haven''t played it yet. but it''s still great title. i still have it actually. would totally recommend this to anyone who has a working gamecube or any other system that it''s on.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Martin', N'sharon.martin2503@example.net', '2015-07-07', 4, N'Price was good, but came in 1 day late'),
(N'William', N'Rogers', N'william.rogers8813@example.com', '2015-07-08', 5, N'Works great. I''m using it with a Sega Genesis/Saturn Pad pad converter on my Xbox now, and I have no problems at all. Very inexpensive as well.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Collins', N'barbara.collins3650@example.net', '2015-07-08', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Olivia', N'Lopez', N'olivia.lopez2531@example.net', '2015-07-08', 5, N'Classic and a "must have" for any PC Gamer(s) collection.. The Best of the Best! King of all RTS games...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Wright', N'joyce.wright6274@example.org', '2015-07-08', 5, N'As listed.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Wright', N'joyce.wright6274@example.org', '2015-07-08', 5, N'Had some errors in the guide, but was as listed.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Wright', N'joyce.wright6274@example.org', '2015-07-08', 1, N'Wrong region, and smashed on delivery.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Jenkins', N'lisa.jenkins8924@example.net', '2015-07-08', 5, N'Excellent product. Thank you very much.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Fisher', N'kimberly.fisher7272@example.org', '2015-07-08', 4, N'Its a classic melancholy story wrapped in a beautiful world. Child of Light is a wonderful side scrolling RPG that everyone should enjoy.'),
(N'Linda', N'Howard', N'linda.howard9899@example.net', '2015-07-08', 4, N'Easy yet not without its challenges. A good game.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Sanders', N'ronald.sanders9618@example.org', '2015-07-08', 5, N'I was a happy camper. Everything was in excellent condition & we''ve enjoyed the game very much. Thank you.'),
(N'Donald', N'Peterson', N'donald.peterson4051@example.org', '2015-07-08', 5, N'One of the best WWII Medal of Honor games.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Mendoza', N'sarah.mendoza6619@example.net', '2015-07-08', 4, N'Batman: Arkham Knight is a great superhero action game made by Rocksteady for the Playstation 4, Xbox One, and PC. However, as I bought the game for the PS4, I can only speak on that version of the game. Also, I won''t rehash the story here or put spoilers in my review, simply how I perceive this last entry in the Arkham franchise. BAK is fast-paced, well-thought out, and is a hell of a lot of fun to play. However, it feels shorter than Asylum or City. Also, a good portion of this game involves the Bat-Tank (I call it that because that is what it is, essentially). Is that part of it fun? Sure, but it kinda distracts from the overall Batman theme, ironically. I enjoyed Batman: Arkham Knight from start to finish, and feel I got my money''s worth, but it was not as good as Arkham City, IMO.'),
(N'Anita', N'Myers', N'anita.myers6117@example.org', '2015-07-08', 5, N'Minus the art book the game isn''t bad !'),
(N'Deborah', N'Moore', N'deborah.moore9706@example.org', '2015-07-08', 5, N'Great game !'),
(N'Zachary', N'Anderson', N'zachary.anderson5047@example.org', '2015-07-08', 2, N'What a great mouse. It has a setup software to customize color and map your buttons the way you like it. Solid reading from the laser too. It meets all my expectations. 1 year later: It''s a good mouse but it suffer from the Double click issue. Something I though would never happen to me because I don''t play games as much as I used too. If you plan on purchasing this mouse I hope you''re aware of said issue regardless of purchase.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Gutierrez', N'sharon.gutierrez3768@example.org', '2015-07-08', 5, N'If your a sub zero fan, this is a must have! Im a scorpion fan but if you ever wanna try sub zero, do it with style! Lol'),
(N'Ryan', N'Khan', N'ryan.khan2613@example.com', '2015-07-08', 5, N'They love it!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Adams', N'tomasz.adams3905@example.net', '2015-07-08', 4, N'It is educational game.'),
(N'Angela', N'Williams', N'angela.williams4726@example.org', '2015-07-08', 3, N'It''s not what you''re hoping for, but it kinda works...I found what I was looking for by using a redesigned REPLACEMENT joystick. Trust me on this one, I bought like 3 of these controllers and they all do that thing where the joystick flicks around and makes it impossible to aim or navigate a menu.'),
(N'Anna', N'Ruiz', N'anna.ruiz7138@example.org', '2015-07-08', 3, N'Pros: Product is good in theory. Works great for sound and shooter games,especially call of duty. Amazing with what you get for price,game mode/movie mode/bluetooth/etc. Cons: Horrible for chatting,interrupts with internet connection. Poor made material,feels as if it would break easily. Bottom Line: If you can do without chatting to your friends and don''t have anyone else in the house that will need internet then this headset is for you. I feel if it would''ve been made with a boomstick mic that the headset would have been good overall. Would''ve been better if it would have been built more durable as well.'),
(N'Scott', N'Mendoza', N'scott.mendoza5104@example.com', '2015-07-09', 5, N'So fun!! Perfect family game!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Webb', N'melissa.webb3227@example.com', '2015-07-09', 5, N'great game. Had a wonderful time with the characters. You engage with them as if they are beside you.'),
(N'George', N'Walker', N'george.walker8125@example.org', '2015-07-09', 5, N'It was packaged well and works perfectly'),
(N'Priya', N'Boyd', N'priya.boyd4263@example.com', '2015-07-09', 5, N'The controller works great, but every now and then it shuts down and I have to press the power button again to get it to work. I just assumed that might be a power saver or something (thinking the controller isn''t in use or something). The description says it takes two double A batteries but it takes triple A so to let others know. Overall, I''m pretty satisfied.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Hernandez', N'timothy.hernandez9383@example.net', '2015-07-09', 4, N'I did not receive mine from Amazon, but directly from PDP''s website. Ever since I purchased their first generation, universal, wireless Afterglow headset back a couple years, I have been hooked on by some of their products. The Afterglow Karga is a solid headset. It doesn''t have a built-in battery like the Kral or the AGUs, and uses the power directly from the Xbox One''s controller. The sound quality (which is adjustable) is great and feedback is very minimal. There is also voice feedback which is a good addition. The headset itself is light and comfortable. However, there are some things about the headset itself that kinda disappointed me coming from the AGU. First off, the headset isn''t wireless, so I can''t leave the TV without my controller in hand. Next, PC function is very limited. While I have never used the Kral, I suspect that the wireless use of the Bluetooth dongle allows for utilitarianism for PC users. The Karga does not have such luxury since it cannot power itself and...'),
(N'Emma', N'Kumar', N'emma.kumar4540@example.org', '2015-07-09', 2, N'I loved the first Resident Evil Revelations game when I played it back in 2013. It took me by surprise how awesome the whole game was. The graphics and soundtrack were great, the plot was interesting and I ended up finishing the game 3 times. I was really hyper for Revelations 2 when it was announced last year, but after playing the game I sadly have to say that the game was big let down for me. The graphics doesn''t look as good as the first game. Everything just looks really blend and not interesting. The ship and back tracking on the first game brought atmosphere and tension to the game, while the level design of Revelations 2 is remarkably uninspired an lack the creativity from the first game. I also didn''t really enjoy the co-op in the game. You have to keep baby sitting your partner the whole game, and even though the AI is not as bad as in RE5, it is still really annoying. I would much rather prefer if you partner AI was exactly like in the first Revelations game. Overall I...'),
(N'Jessica', N'Martin', N'jessica.martin7620@example.org', '2015-07-09', 5, N'Captain Falcon is hard to find, and the Japanese one works identically on the US WiiU'),
(N'Raymond', N'Phillips', N'raymond.phillips6378@example.net', '2015-07-09', 5, N'Son loved it, came quick, fun game. With 2 motion controllers it was even better.'),
(N'Debra', N'Hill', N'debra.hill7197@example.com', '2015-07-09', 5, N'I just started disc 2. The event that unfolded before my eyes, to me is nothing less than a tragedy that occurred in another dimension, like a dream. I don''t understand what it is about this game and how it was perfectly developed and presented to the player, but it will leave an impression on you that no other video game can, most movies can''t either. This is an example of amazing story telling, genius manga art style from the peak in the 1990''s of the style, and a phenomenal game play battle system. 10/10.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Walker', N'jerry.walker1800@example.com', '2015-07-09', 4, N'I really like this grip. It essentially turns your 3DS into a pro controller....or at least makes it feel like one. It is comfortable and fits snug....let''s summarize! Pros: -Makes your 3DS XL/NEW!3DS XL feel like a controller -Makes you grip the device better -Has a kick stand...for...some...reason... -Doesn''t obstruct much* (see cons) -Removable if you ever want or need to remove it Cons (AKA why this only gets 4 stars) -Makes the device BULKY. (It no longer fits in it''s case.) -*Blocks the cartridge port, you cannot change games with this on. -*Sort of blocks the sylus port -*Makes it difficult to press the power button if you don''t have tiny fingers The design is NOT perfect, but it''s close. I recommend.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Reyes', N'cynthia.reyes2649@example.org', '2015-07-09', 5, N'This game is so much fun. There is a whole world for you to discover and explore. The fighting is fun and different from most rpgs, and each character is very interesting. This game also has many, many hours of gameplay. There are so many quests and ways to increase or decrease affinity between players, that this game is definitely repeatable. The only downsides would be the fact that all the graphics aren''t as crisp as the Wii version. But there is not way to get that "crispness" in the 3ds, so it''s not worth taking a star away. The other downside would be the 3d effect really doesn''t look at that good. It just looks crammed in.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Bailey', N'lucia.bailey7458@example.org', '2015-07-09', 5, N'Great price'),
(N'Mary', N'Allen', N'mary.allen6555@example.net', '2015-07-09', 1, N'The graphics are a joke first of all. Feels like a PS2 game. The player movement is unbelievably unrealistic and slow as if he''s lame. And lastly, the upgrades to health are too few and far between. Wasted money on yet another disappointing title for PS4!'),
(N'Susan', N'Barnes', N'susan.barnes4245@example.com', '2015-07-09', 5, N'Works great.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Gonzalez', N'jonathan.gonzalez2613@example.com', '2015-07-09', 5, N'A bunch of cars, a ball, and two goals. It''s a recipe for chaos and it''s also Rocket League. It''s a multiplayer arcade style soccer game that is a surprising hit among gamers. It''s a pretty simple game, so let''s take a quick look at Rocket League in this game review. You compete in a stadium with up to 4 on 4 teams where you try to push a ball in to the opposing goal. Cars have a lot of maneuverability with powersliding for control, boosting for catching up speed, jumping to reach the ball and even dodge rolling. You use all of these moves to take control of the ball and score when you get the right chance. There''s small boost pads around the map which give you a 10% boost and then a big boost ball to max out your speed. There''s a tutorial mode, but it''s not even really necessary to run. The game is designed to be a pick up and play fun multiplayer battle and that''s exactly what it is. It doesn''t take very long to learn the controls and start bashing with other cars online. There''s...'),
(N'Samuel', N'King', N'samuel.king6498@example.com', '2015-07-09', 3, N'I have the Niko 360 base charger and I''ve had it now for 2 years. Still works perfectly and batteries still last me a full day of game play (10-18hrs). I''m only saying this cause it''s what I was expecting when I bought the xbox one version. It''s definitely useful and it works, but it''s NOT great. Batteries don''t show up as fully charged on the xbox one home screen, even after the x1 charging base is done charging, and it doesn''t last 10 to 18hrs like it''s previous version... more like 8hrs. Not sure if it''s the batteries, my expectations, or the charging base. Maybe I got a faulty model/batteries, but it serves it''s purpose. The fact it brings two battery packs makes it "not really a mayor concern".'),
(N'Kevin', N'Diaz', N'kevin.diaz7318@example.net', '2015-07-09', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Anthony', N'Diaz', N'anthony.diaz3690@example.net', '2015-07-09', 5, N'I have never been a "Tomb Raider" / Lara Croft fan. None of the previous titles appealed to me. Enter the reboot & now I can''t get enough. First & foremost Lara Croft is actually human. Developers brought her down to Earth, gave her vulnerabilities and flaws. She''s more than a pair of pistols & breasts. Now we can participate in her growth; there is an emotional stake involved which makes for some awesome game play. The game mechanics are solid, although some of the QuickTime scenes come at you pretty fast - expect to see Lara die in some brutal ways. Navigating the world is relatively easy while not being so obvious as to be boring. Combat is well designed & challenging; the puzzle levels fun & satisfying. The leveling system simple but not dull. And the story is worthy of any Hollywood production. Whether you play on the PS3 or PS4 you should have a thoroughly enjoyable experience.'),
(N'Joan', N'Torres', N'joan.torres9544@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'The New Nintendo 3DS XL was definently a step-up from the 3DS (XL) and the Wii U. I am sure many of you who read this will have one of those systems whenever you read this and you are most likely very satisfied, because the DS series and the Wii series have very good consoles. But we know that the 3DS doesn''t have very stable 3D, and the Wii U is (theoretically) the next Virtual Boy and/or Dreamcast (for more information, go to https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FS1p7W5dmBE and http://www.explosion.com/30989/why-the-wii-u-is-destined-to-become-the-next-sega-dreamcast/?utm_source=zergnet.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=zergnet_57717.) But how is the New 3DS XL better? Ummm... let''s see, how about... every way? Yup, that''s right. This is not the only but some of the New 3DS''s improvements: Super stable 3D: often, people who had the 3DS complained about it not having that much (by that I mean no) 3D when you look away. Nowadays, two words: problem solved. C stick/ZL and ZR: fans of...'),
(N'Dee', N'Ramos', N'dee.ramos2253@example.net', '2015-07-10', 5, N'Amiibo for the super smash brother series. Nice to have if you want it. Not needed though.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Butler', N'shirley.butler1284@example.net', '2015-07-10', 2, N'Game sucks and has many glitches.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Taylor', N'kyle.taylor9454@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'A Collection of:80s,90s,and early 2000s Videogames in their Entirety! Comment:"This Collection is Safe to Buy..your getting Complete Videogames".'),
(N'Kyle', N'Taylor', N'kyle.taylor9454@example.org', '2015-07-10', 2, N'For Ages 5yrs. to 10yrs."They''ll like it"..'),
(N'Henry', N'Clark', N'henry.clark4443@example.org', '2015-07-10', 4, N'Great little case, seems sturdy. So far I have bought 3 of these and the only problem I have encountered is, they tend to scratch up kind of easy, which I don''t like. But still all in all a good case!'),
(N'Henry', N'Clark', N'henry.clark4443@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'Well, what more can you say.... It''s LEGO''S!!!! One of the best games out there from Lego! Huge open world, so much to do and explore, and of course the comedy is there!! The only reason I stopped playing this was because I had gotten Lego City Undercover for the Wii U. I will be back to playing this one real soon!!!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Ortiz', N'joshua.ortiz3174@example.net', '2015-07-10', 5, N'My son absolutely loves this game!'),
(N'Christine', N'Clark', N'christine.clark1772@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'a good game'),
(N'Christine', N'Clark', N'christine.clark1772@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'I really like this item'),
(N'Brian', N'Long', N'brian.long3900@example.com', '2015-07-10', 5, N'It''s noticeably faster than my old 3DS XL and the camera tracks your head now so you don''t have to keep it perfectly still to see the 3D effect properly. I''m happy with it but I can''t really justify spending the money on this new version since my old one was perfectly fine.'),
(N'Charles', N'Ruiz', N'charles.ruiz7776@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'This mouse is amazing and fits my hand perfectly, unlike the other tiny ones around.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Thomas', N'tyler.thomas7914@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'Outstanding Seller that delivers high quality items!'),
(N'Larry', N'Jackson', N'larry.jackson9745@example.net', '2015-07-10', 5, N'this cable makes it possible to use your psp 3000 on your tv. really great product.'),
(N'Larry', N'Jackson', N'larry.jackson9745@example.net', '2015-07-10', 5, N'this system is awesome. it plays your retro games. I bought this over the retron 5, simply because you can play flashcarts on it. the retron 5 can not do that. highly recommend this product.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Henderson', N'ethan.henderson7046@example.com', '2015-07-10', 5, N'I love the Vita, it''s a great console. Some people may complain about the lack of exclusives but it compensates it with PSX and PSP emulation. If you get a Vita not thinking about the exclusives but about how great it is to have a lot of not-exclusives games in a portable I guarantee you that you will not regret buying it. If you want recomendations for the console send me a message and I will give you some.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Ward', N'zachary.ward5512@example.net', '2015-07-10', 4, N'Work flawlessly'),
(N'Robert', N'King', N'robert.king7366@example.com', '2015-07-10', 5, N'As expected.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Morgan', N'joyce.morgan6917@example.org', '2015-07-10', 5, N'very comfortable mouse and the buttons are perfect! My new favorite mouse! Great for gaming!'),
(N'Michael', N'Coleman', N'michael.coleman6619@example.org', '2015-07-11', 4, N'Pretty decent controller which is close enough to the real thing. Don''t be afraid to buy. FYI might take over a week getting to you because it ships from China but not too long a wait.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Butler', N'thomas.butler1252@example.com', '2015-07-11', 5, N'i put them on and the have like a more griper feel makes me feel like i have more control over the games'),
(N'James', N'Baker', N'james.baker8577@example.net', '2015-07-11', 5, N'Just what I wanted!! Thanks!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Young', N'tomasz.young3022@example.com', '2015-07-11', 5, N'Great seller, very happy'),
(N'Walter', N'King', N'walter.king5714@example.org', '2015-07-12', 4, N'Fun, but the combat controls can be a bit clunky.'),
(N'Dee', N'Khan', N'dee.khan6506@example.com', '2015-07-12', 5, N'I love this game. It''s very difficulty and challenging.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Campbell', N'andrew.campbell1362@example.net', '2015-07-12', 5, N'My kid loves these xbox one controller covers. I would have liked to have purchased the solid colors but he''s 7 and thinks these look cool. They fit the cover perfectly. The headset took a little stretch to get it on but it did. The thumbs pads were a great addition as well. He likes to mix the colors. My biggest concern was that I wouldn''t be able to charge them but they fit perfectly fine on my Energizer 2X Charging System. And my kid has finally stopped sweating while jumping around and playing. Great purchase!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Allen', N'samantha.allen3904@example.org', '2015-07-12', 5, N'use all the time'),
(N'Henry', N'Flores', N'henry.flores2174@example.net', '2015-07-12', 5, N'Fantastic all bearing the word Thanks very much'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Ali', N'tomasz.ali6718@example.org', '2015-07-12', 3, N'So far it''s kinda fun. But nothing new and a little boring. Good for the price. It installed easy and played som on it. BUT then..I went to play again and it kept saying wrong disk..put in # 2 this is oddly the disk you need to run the game. BUT still wouldn''t work. Had to read files about "secure rom"..then go download that program. It was hard finding the right file to put into the program. Finally got it,ran it and now can play . One star cause it''s mediocre off, one for hassle of secure rom junk.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Bennett', N'jessica.bennett3493@example.net', '2015-07-12', 1, N'violent'),
(N'Jessica', N'Bennett', N'jessica.bennett3493@example.net', '2015-07-12', 2, N'ok'),
(N'Jessica', N'Bennett', N'jessica.bennett3493@example.net', '2015-07-12', 1, N'yuck'),
(N'Eric', N'Myers', N'eric.myers4946@example.org', '2015-07-13', 5, N'The best of the year so far.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Wisniewski', N'olivia.wisniewski6397@example.com', '2015-07-13', 5, N'no review needed'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Wood', N'cynthia.wood1843@example.org', '2015-07-13', 5, N'love this it feels great and superior quality'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Myers', N'jennifer.myers8462@example.org', '2015-07-13', 5, N'Great game!! Lots of speed and takes Sonic back to his roots. Once completed you''ll be wanting more!!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ramirez', N'sarah.ramirez3738@example.org', '2015-07-13', 5, N'Thank you!'),
(N'Steven', N'Garcia', N'steven.garcia9871@example.org', '2015-07-13', 4, N'I''ve been using this controller on my Windows tablet for MAME games. Although this controller is quite small, it''s fairly comfortable. The joypad and button placement is exactly where you would expect them to be. The construction is top notch. The controller housing doesn''t flex at all if you''re a bit rough with it, and it''s covered with a rubber matte paint for grip. My only complaint is the D-pad. It requires some finesse to point it in diagonal directions. Caveats: If you have large hands, you''ll probably find this controller uncomfortable. Imagine something a little smaller than a NES controller, but with six more buttons and knobs. If your hands aren''t cramping at the thought of this, you might be okay. This is a solid controller that''s well worth the $25 asking price. You''ll be hard pressed to find something on par at this price.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Campbell', N'jennifer.campbell1670@example.net', '2015-07-13', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Castillo', N'patrick.castillo1133@example.net', '2015-07-13', 5, N'I don''t game a whole lot, but this has instantly become not only my favorite game, but one of a few that I actually invest time into playing! For me, it''s mostly the pirate theme that makes it exciting, but given that it''s also part of the Assassin''s Creed series makes it even better.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Russell', N'brenda.russell5753@example.org', '2015-07-13', 5, N'Works as good as the more expensive Nintendo brand adapter.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Lewis', N'melissa.lewis8005@example.com', '2015-07-13', 5, N'Items purchased were exactly as described! Great Seller!!'),
(N'Eric', N'Jenkins', N'eric.jenkins2947@example.net', '2015-07-13', 5, N'awesome game!'),
(N'Angela', N'Chen', N'angela.chen1492@example.org', '2015-07-13', 5, N'this one is an important product for every 3ds fans'),
(N'Debra', N'Martin', N'debra.martin1355@example.com', '2015-07-13', 5, N'my son loves it'),
(N'Jacob', N'Powell', N'jacob.powell7937@example.com', '2015-07-13', 1, N'the cord is already pulling out after just a couple months of light use. DO NOT BUY DO NOT BUY DO NOT BUY DO NOT BUY DO NOT BUY DO NOT BUY DO NOT BUY. This thing is the worst pos i have ever owned.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Khan', N'deborah.khan7774@example.net', '2015-07-13', 5, N'excellent, I PURCHASE ALL'),
(N'Sharon', N'White', N'sharon.white7098@example.org', '2015-07-14', 5, N'my cousin loved it'),
(N'Zachary', N'Castillo', N'zachary.castillo6785@example.com', '2015-07-14', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Nancy', N'Wisniewski', N'nancy.wisniewski2151@example.net', '2015-07-14', 5, N'perfect conditions thanks'),
(N'Janet', N'Ruiz', N'janet.ruiz8784@example.org', '2015-07-14', 4, N'I prefer 1 and 2 over LBP3, but this is still a very fun game!'),
(N'Janet', N'Ruiz', N'janet.ruiz8784@example.org', '2015-07-14', 4, N'Enjoyable game, beautiful visuals. We did have some glitchy problems part way through the game that have stopped us from completing it.'),
(N'Emma', N'Ruiz', N'emma.ruiz2376@example.net', '2015-07-14', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Zachary', N'Webb', N'zachary.webb9255@example.net', '2015-07-14', 3, N'I''m not particularly disappointed with this game, as far as gameplay. I am truly disappointed in the lack of courses mainly because I think EA will try to charge for the ones they release post release date. They said there would be free content but they never mentioned what that content would be. If I know EA they will try to squeeze a few more twenties out of each of us. I hope Not! The first game for next gen is understandable to lack some content but they did have an extra year to work on this. I do hope they give us more on the create a player front. It is about as bare bones as you can get. I''m going to hold off final judgment until I see how much support and free content we get. I had read somewhere that these games are not going to be released every year and that there would be support for the same game for the future. I hope! Finally I like Rory but I think the future Phenom is going to be Jordan Spieth! He is Awesome! EA should have gotten him for the cover boy.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Thompson', N'barbara.thompson3341@example.com', '2015-07-14', 5, N'i am totally satisfied. good doing business with you'),
(N'Barbara', N'Thompson', N'barbara.thompson3341@example.com', '2015-07-14', 5, N'excellent service. excellent product'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Wilson', N'tomasz.wilson4037@example.com', '2015-07-14', 1, N'I generally love the EA PGA Tour games, but this one is a real standout for all the wrong reasons. I can''t play more than 3 holes without having a game-ending crash or freeze. - In an hour of playing, I had to reboot 4 times because the game would freeze and not allow me to hit a shot. It always occurred when I was about to take a shot, and when I''d try to hit, the sticks and buttons no longer worked. The guide button was all that remained functional. - I''ve also had several freezes (similar to above) when zooming to the ball landing area. Again, all buttons stop working. - Very limited number of courses. Clearly they put a lot of effort into Chambers Bay, but they kind of missed the timing on that. - No combination of swing styles, even if you use the ''customized'' setup. I like the stick for swings, and 3-click for putting. Not possible. + The graphics are pretty nice.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Martinez', N'jerry.martinez9485@example.org', '2015-07-14', 5, N'I really love this controller, however, my only complaint is how the bumpers feel compared to the 360 controller. I sometimes feel like I have to go out of my way to make sure they''re pressed. Other than that, it''s really comfortable and a great successor to the 360 controller.'),
(N'Christina', N'Jackson', N'christina.jackson4766@example.com', '2015-07-14', 5, N'Great game for the whole family! Everyone has a blast when we play together.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Chavez', N'alexander.chavez5502@example.com', '2015-07-14', 5, N'Amazing'),
(N'Susan', N'Wood', N'susan.wood3586@example.net', '2015-07-15', 4, N'EDIT: I decided to change it to 4 stars. Not because of the replies I got, but because I thought it over. I still stand for what I say. Also, I have over 90 hours in because I mostly play it as I do my daily exercise on my stationary bike. I hate exercising, but playing keeps my mind entertained and really helps make time go real fast. Fire Emblem games are great when it comes to saving/bookmarking right away. ------- It actually pains me to give it 3 stars instead of 5. I''ve been a Fire Emblem fan since FE6 (the first FE for us outside of Japan). There''s way too much fan service for me to fully enjoy the game. Not to mention, grinding. So much grinding. Fire Emblem didn''t used to include these things (or at least not heavily). For fan service, there''s coupling. I was never interested in lovey-dovey stuff. Though it is pretty cool that you recruit new characters by marrying couples, it really doesn''t add much to the story. In fact, the dialogues from the characters interacting from...'),
(N'Diane', N'Thomas', N'diane.thomas6850@example.org', '2015-07-15', 5, N'Sony brand, new in package, what more do you need. To my surprise I ordered Friday evening and had it by 10am Sat! Only $4 for overnight shipping!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Chavez', N'jacob.chavez2412@example.org', '2015-07-15', 4, N'Great!!!!!!!!!!!'),
(N'Susan', N'Howard', N'susan.howard3718@example.net', '2015-07-15', 5, N'Loved it, great single player story'),
(N'Betty', N'Green', N'betty.green7742@example.net', '2015-07-15', 1, N'What is the deal with this company completely stripping games of the modes/courses/characters out of almost all of their games? They really angered me with NHL 15 to the point I demanded a refund, now they did the same thing with this game??? No reason whatsoever to see a release this poor unless they are trying to get more money out of the customer as DLC later. EA is at the forefront of destroying the video game industry with their greedy practices. The online play in this game is atrocious, buggy and filled with lag. The gameplay is what you would expect out of a golf game, nothing terrible to say about the controls they work fine. Thank god I rented this. Save your money and get Tiger Woods 14 instead a MUCH better experience and actually has all of the modes and courses. Lesson learned from NHL 15, do not pre-order EA games until hearing the reviews.'),
(N'George', N'White', N'george.white8900@example.com', '2015-07-15', 5, N'MY DAUGHTER LOVES IT. THAT''S ALL THAT COUNTS !!!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Edwards', N'marcus.edwards4068@example.net', '2015-07-15', 5, N'I play destiny and had been using the original CQC Green kontrol freeks and was playing on a 3 sensitivity. As soon as I got these I moved up my sensitivity to 7 and its so much better'),
(N'Ryan', N'Lewis', N'ryan.lewis4904@example.net', '2015-07-15', 5, N'good game. hard game'),
(N'Ryan', N'Lewis', N'ryan.lewis4904@example.net', '2015-07-15', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Ryan', N'Lewis', N'ryan.lewis4904@example.net', '2015-07-15', 5, N'good product. I use it with an android TV stick'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Martinez', N'carolyn.martinez8050@example.net', '2015-07-15', 5, N'This was cheaper than what my local games tore had it at and that game store usually has pretty low prices! As for the game itself it is amazing. The extras that they put in from the original are worth picking it up if you played the first one and were ever thinking of re-playing it. If you like persona games this is a great pick and a lot of people''s favorite persona game. If you have yet to get into persona this game or persona 4/persona 4 golden is a great game to start with. Happy playing!'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Torres', N'cheryl.torres5071@example.net', '2015-07-15', 3, N'One of the less impressive games in the suikoden series.'),
(N'Donald', N'Allen', N'donald.allen5649@example.org', '2015-07-16', 5, N'Okay, been playing this now for 3 days and whew, it is hard, leveling, I''m only at 5 now, my buddy has 150 hours in it and he just hit level 30. Think Skyrim but much harder, you see a monster with a red icon, RUN AWAY. No really, just run away. I thought after playing dark souls this would be a piece of cake as a level 4 I could take on level 15''s with no problems, just dodge, roll and strike. No, those monsters are quick and it only takes 1 to 2 hits and your dead. Even at a distance with a cross bow and unlimited bolts, you just get tired after shooting the same monster for half hour and the health hardly drops. When you get a quest and they suggest a level, believe it, and do not try taking on the monster if its more than 5-10 levels about you. The nice thing is plenty of other monsters for you to take out at your level and lower. You like RPG games, then get this, it is worth it, right up there with skyrim, oblivion, red dead, fall out, to name a few classics.'),
(N'Susan', N'Nguyen', N'susan.nguyen6239@example.net', '2015-07-16', 5, N'Keeps ''em charged taking up little space. Energizer PS4 charger glows blue when finished, XB1 charger glows green - nice nod to corporate colors.'),
(N'Judith', N'Diaz', N'judith.diaz8205@example.org', '2015-07-16', 5, N'Awesome. It has great colour, works first try no problem, and it looks great. But it has the mild annoyance of new shoes. Because it''s not broken in yet, it''s slightly stiff when it comes to movement. But works flawlessly.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Williams', N'evelyn.williams1376@example.org', '2015-07-16', 5, N'Makes it very fun to play my racing games, especially little big planet cart....Loving this!'),
(N'John', N'Harris', N'john.harris5673@example.com', '2015-07-16', 1, N'Avoid. It''s pay-to-win and it eats time like nobody''s business.'),
(N'Laura', N'Williams', N'laura.williams1427@example.org', '2015-07-16', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Paul', N'Powell', N'paul.powell1372@example.net', '2015-07-16', 5, N'It works very well in playing The Twilight Princess in Wii mode on my Nintendo Wii U system.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Foster', N'anthony.foster5730@example.net', '2015-07-16', 5, N'I felt that I really needed to review this game.. it is by far one the best well written games that I have ever played.. It is an open world game that offers players options to seek out adventure on their own or to seek fame and glory with others... You can pass the time fishing, blacksmithing, make cloth armor, building weapons, going through dungeons, horseback riding, PVP, and many other things... The lore of the story which is the background is present in several books that you might find lying around or by talking to NPC who could even open up areas that you didn''t know were there.. You can become a werewolf increasing your stamina and attacks but make you weak to poison and silver bolts.. you can become a vampire increasing your magical abilities but make you weak to fire.. It is truly a game of checks and balances. I have played this game since being a beta tester a year ago and it has been one of the best games I have ever played.. It did have some hiccups at the beginning...'),
(N'Emily', N'Thomas', N'emily.thomas5513@example.org', '2015-07-16', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Edwards', N'kenneth.edwards5202@example.net', '2015-07-16', 3, N'Took EA/DICE way too long to get the game into a playable state. And now continued support on the 360 seems to be waning just like the player base. Premium was a complete waste of money. BF is a great game, but because of all the problems with this release I''m actually considering going back to CoD if and when I go next gen. At the very least I''m looking for another MP shooter to get in to.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Edwards', N'kenneth.edwards5202@example.net', '2015-07-16', 3, N'Great game but mostly because EA has zero competition in the NHL arena. This game will suck if you foolishly throw money at EA and buy it every year. My last one was NHL13 and the improvements were good enough for me. Still, as usual, EA is resting on its laurels. However, well known bugs continue to plague the game like with Be A Pro (Live The Life) crashing if you start your player in the CHL. This has been a problem since at least NHL10 and EA should have fixed it by now. IMHO EA would better serve the franchise and their customers if they switched to a three year development cycle for their sports games and charged people a modest fee for season roster updates.'),
(N'Justin', N'Walker', N'justin.walker6158@example.net', '2015-07-16', 2, N'But does not working! No sounds? I tired find the settings on xbox 360, but NONE!!'),
(N'Justin', N'Walker', N'justin.walker6158@example.net', '2015-07-16', 4, N'A very cute keyboard and this for "xbox 360 live" that can use for the chat or the application and games.'),
(N'Helen', N'Watson', N'helen.watson3272@example.net', '2015-07-16', 5, N'I love this game. Although I can''t say it''s up in my favorites it''s definitely a good game full of adventure with a nice story line--definitely underrated.'),
(N'Betty', N'Wang', N'betty.wang9928@example.com', '2015-07-17', 5, N'great game and it works perfectly. Thank you'),
(N'Mary', N'White', N'mary.white4040@example.com', '2015-07-17', 3, N'While this condition was new, packaged well, delivered well, the controller''s joystick occasionally does not work correctly. Even without moving it, the cursor on ye television will move a direction (usually up) which causes issues when playing games, as steering/directing characters is then highly difficult. As I mentioned, it is occasional and also happens to some other controllers which I bought (new); older controllers which I have had for years do not have this issue. I don''t know what to do about it. /: Three stars for acceptable packaging, shipping time, visible condition. Minus two stars for fully-working condition.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Jackson', N'patrick.jackson4270@example.org', '2015-07-17', 5, N'Boyfriend loves this game. I think the gameplay is pretty repetitive after a while. NOTE: There are multiple timelines to this game so playing through the first timeline is not the end and is not satisfying. Need to play all endings IMO for it to be a good game. The TRUE/last ending is beautiful, but super impossible to beat though.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Nelson', N'andrew.nelson9278@example.com', '2015-07-17', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Jacob', N'Thompson', N'jacob.thompson2849@example.com', '2015-07-17', 1, N'This game DOES NOT have COOP Multiplayer On-line!!! This was the only reason we bought NHL14 !!! What a crock!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Alvarez', N'jeremy.alvarez9411@example.org', '2015-07-17', 2, N'This is just like the reg 3DS really Nintendo. After the crap you pulled with the Wiiu selling it with a new name and a bulky remote and now your selling new hand helds with nothing new to them for full price. This will be our last one. The kids would rather play the Nexus 10 thats 3 years old now than these things. Sorry Nintendo i stayed a fan for years but you don''t even try to hide the fact your screwing us anymore. Update this thing deleted all my game saves. I keep starting the games over but they get deleted again. NEVER AGAIN Nintendo. Il stick to my PS4'),
(N'Deborah', N'Flores', N'deborah.flores8515@example.com', '2015-07-17', 5, N'it''s ok'),
(N'Sofia', N'Jackson', N'sofia.jackson9226@example.org', '2015-07-17', 5, N'I bought this game for my grandson. He loves playing the lego games.'),
(N'Luis', N'Kelly', N'luis.kelly7970@example.org', '2015-07-17', 4, N'As has been pointed out, they do not work on the PS3 as advertised. They are for the PS4 only. There is a separate audio cable that goes into microphone in and headphones out of a PC. When I use that, I get sound in one ear only, so not recommended for that purpose. I''m dinging it one star for lack of PS3 support. They are very comfortable, and both the headset and sound quality are excellent. Plug them in and the system immediately recognizes them. I needed to go into the accessories menu and lower the volume, because the mike pickup is very good, and I''m excessively soft spoken, The poor guy at the deli has to practically lean over the counter to hear me. These were popping into the red zone for me. They could easily pick up someone calling in from the next room. The cable is very long, enough so that you can put the controller off to the side without taking off the headset. This would be useful for a game like Final Fantasy: A Realm Reborn. You could talk to your friends, while...'),
(N'Lucia', N'Lewis', N'lucia.lewis3324@example.org', '2015-07-17', 5, N'Awesomeness awesome cool'),
(N'Katherine', N'Khan', N'katherine.khan3106@example.org', '2015-07-18', 5, N'Just buy it already!..you know you want to! :)'),
(N'Anita', N'Wright', N'anita.wright1874@example.org', '2015-07-18', 5, N'I bought this game for $8, and to be honest I didn''t really expect much. Boy was I wrong! I just can''t stop playing this game. I loved the WarioWare games and this reminds me a lot of those games - it''s easy to play but difficult to master, and it''s a great game to play just a bit of if you don''t have much time. You really need a good sense of rhythm to excel in these minigames, but you don''t have to be a musician or anything to just get by. You unlock minigames one row at a time, with each row containing 4 minigames and 1 remix that combines all games in that row using a different song. Beating all games in that row unlocks another and so on. If you do well enough in a game, you get a "superb" rating - this gives you a medal. Accumulating medals unlocks "rhythm toys" and endless "rhythm games" where you go for a high score. All in all, there''s more to this game than meets the eye. It''s surprisingly deep and will take a while to master all the minigames! I highly recommend this if...'),
(N'Priya', N'Wang', N'priya.wang9723@example.net', '2015-07-18', 3, N'ok for me..'),
(N'Henry', N'Rogers', N'henry.rogers8717@example.com', '2015-07-18', 5, N'Grandkids love it'),
(N'Michael', N'Perez', N'michael.perez3211@example.com', '2015-07-18', 5, N'This is simply the greatest Sports video game ever created.....leaves "NBA2k" and "Madden" FAR in the dust......I have been playing regularly since the 2007 edition and it just keeps getting better and better...........'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Boyd', N'jacqueline.boyd5115@example.org', '2015-07-18', 4, N'This is an example of Sega trying to one-up Nintendo''s hugely popular Super FX chip. And they did a decently good job. It plays fairly well, despite looking somewhat unattractive now. If you like racing games, I''d recommend it.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Thomas', N'cheryl.thomas6537@example.net', '2015-07-18', 5, N'Husband loves this game!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Morales', N'sofia.morales8959@example.org', '2015-07-18', 5, N'Good Job! Thanks!!!!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Cook', N'yuki.cook7844@example.com', '2015-07-18', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Christine', N'Mitchell', N'christine.mitchell7184@example.net', '2015-07-18', 5, N'Awesome game!'),
(N'Noah', N'Suzuki', N'noah.suzuki3460@example.com', '2015-07-18', 1, N'Lots of folks game as an escape from the necessity of constantly interacting with others. This is not the game for those people. Destiny forces you into lots of purposeless contact with other players. There is no storyline to speak of and you can''t play it in true campaign mode. There are always other players shooting at your targets. It cannot, repeat cannot, be played offline. The producers present this as an anti-piracy device, that you must always be connected to their servers. The truth is it''s just a massive rip-off that allows them to skimp on content. Don''t buy this dog.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Cruz', N'marcus.cruz8050@example.com', '2015-07-19', 1, N'I bought two and at this point both are broken. They were good for about two months. Cheap'),
(N'Walter', N'Barnes', N'walter.barnes7144@example.net', '2015-07-19', 4, N'Who doesn''t like Final Fantasy games'),
(N'Walter', N'Barnes', N'walter.barnes7144@example.net', '2015-07-19', 5, N'Kid loves it.'),
(N'Amy', N'Sanchez', N'amy.sanchez1179@example.net', '2015-07-19', 5, N'Works with my ps2 slim. I bought a second one too.'),
(N'Jack', N'Okonkwo', N'jack.okonkwo8386@example.org', '2015-07-19', 1, N'I had heard that this game was one of the hardest video games ever released. Hoping for a challenge and in an attempt to test my gaming might I purchased a copy to see for myself. The reason that this game is so difficult is not that has puzzles that stretch your mind to the limit or even dynamic enemy creatures to defeat which require skill or dexterity. Dark Souls is an unforgiving torturous game because the creatures not only do ludicrous amounts of damage to the player, but the player does ridiculously low damage to enemy creatures. Imagine a game where a basic common skeleton can kill a player in 3-5 hits, but a player needs to do 6-10 hits to the same skeleton to kill it. Now multiply this skeleton by 6-10 and surround the player with them in a graveyard which is not even that far into the game. If you can imagine the agonizing pain of such a situation, then you have just imagined what it is like to "play" Dark Souls. I would not advise purchasing this game unless you want to...'),
(N'Robert', N'Rivera', N'robert.rivera4760@example.net', '2015-07-19', 5, N'thank you! :3'),
(N'Kevin', N'Edwards', N'kevin.edwards1252@example.net', '2015-07-19', 5, N'I finished my first play through of The Witcher 3 right at about 100 hours with all bounty quests accomplished and a guess-timate of approximately 75 percent of side quests completed. Having completed the game once, I can say that TW3 met my expectation as it is an awesome and worthwhile addition to the open world action RPG genre. Not since the original Gothic 1 and 2, or Morrowind, did I thoroughly enjoy an open world game this much. The following are some aspects of the games that I''d like to discuss in further details: GRAPHICS/SOUND/MUSIC Sound is well done and appropriate. Music is very done albeit a few reused (good) soundtracks from the previous games. Although I am not a graphics prostitute, I readily admit that good graphics can certainly enhance gameplay and boost the total experience - and The Witcher 3 has graphics in spade. The game is simply beautiful to look at on the high settings that I run on my mid-range PC. In brief, TW3''s combination of excellent graphics,...'),
(N'Walter', N'Morris', N'walter.morris4369@example.net', '2015-07-19', 5, N'I thought I would miss the Xross Media Bar from the previous generation, but the new UI layout is fair. Does get a little hot, the new version is supposed to improve heat generation.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Allen', N'ivan.allen8085@example.com', '2015-07-19', 4, N'I love the Hyperdimension Neptunia franchise. That been said, I will say I''m a tiny bit disappointed in the lack of content in this game. In term of gameplay, it''s really is similar to Dynasty Warriors. But each characters has her own unique combo combination. Luckily the combo list can be quickly display by pressing left on d-pad. Stages are short n small, and you will be revisiting the same stages. Enemies are easy to beat, but still can KO you if you''re not careful. Now my biggest complain is the lack of content. HDN has a rich cast of characters. There are 10 playable characters. I don''t mind that number. But these characters are the only ones you''ll see in the entire story. No Compa, no Iffy too T.T I kinda wish they added some more characters. There are also no CG artwork pass HDN games are known for. The game itself is fun to have on the go. This game does have potential. Here''s hoping for more HDN beat em up games.'),
(N'Karen', N'Gonzalez', N'karen.gonzalez2017@example.net', '2015-07-19', 5, N'Two thumbs up.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Jenkins', N'cheryl.jenkins5568@example.org', '2015-07-19', 5, N'great'),
(N'Paul', N'Henderson', N'paul.henderson3878@example.org', '2015-07-20', 5, N'Great Game!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Young', N'timothy.young9666@example.com', '2015-07-20', 4, N'PRO: Fun, lots to do and worth the buy. CON: Making weapons is kind of hard, tedious, will try to find a hack for this because the game takes a long time to play. OTHER: LONG GAME, takes a very long time to play through. Will try to play it more, IF i have time.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Powell', N'daniel.powell1114@example.org', '2015-07-20', 3, N'Not my favorite game in the Zelda franchise, but enjoyable as a time waster.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Hill', N'patrick.hill1396@example.net', '2015-07-20', 3, N'A good game. The third one on ps1 is better. My main complaint is that you play two separate story lines that don''t converge, yet you play them simultaneously. On top of that, it was too short. Good replay value, though. Amazing graphics and game play. The music is okay. The voice acting is pretty good.'),
(N'Charles', N'Williams', N'charles.williams6772@example.com', '2015-07-20', 5, N'This console is amazing. It is so fast and easy to navigate. It has a huge collection of games to play and more coming. Also, Call of Duty has switched to earlier dlc with the ps4 and not the xbox one starting with the release of Black Ops:3. Also, the beta for that game will come out earlier on the playstation4 than the xbox one.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Cox', N'aisha.cox7814@example.com', '2015-07-20', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Andrew', N'Cruz', N'andrew.cruz3670@example.net', '2015-07-20', 5, N'Spring loaded to charge and the lights go off when done. Simple and easy to use! Highly recommended!'),
(N'Linda', N'Ramos', N'linda.ramos2510@example.org', '2015-07-20', 4, N'Awesome console and game, but it took FIVE days to arrive instead of the TWO I was promised as a Prime member.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Ivanov', N'kofi.ivanov1101@example.org', '2015-07-20', 5, N'My son wanted this and there is nothing negative I can say. Everything worked fine, the exclusive pet that he got because of it was interesting and he is a happy customer!'),
(N'Rachel', N'Hernandez', N'rachel.hernandez8092@example.com', '2015-07-20', 5, N'Only bought it because of the prime day sale and i don''t regret it 10/10'),
(N'Rachel', N'Hernandez', N'rachel.hernandez8092@example.com', '2015-07-20', 5, N'For 15$ this is VALUE at its finest.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Thompson', N'aisha.thompson4912@example.org', '2015-07-20', 5, N'This angel from the skies above joins my Amiibo tournaments! Providing an OP side b move to block all hopes of survival. Other than that, the figure looks great and have had no issues thusfar!'),
(N'Jack', N'Cook', N'jack.cook7136@example.net', '2015-07-20', 3, N'I had taken a few years off from Tiger Woods games so I wasn''t too concerned with all the bad reviews I was reading here about this version. I was looking forward to getting back into the series again on my Xbox One as this is the first golf game I have tried on a next gen system. I opted to buy from the online store and download it. Overall, I am enjoying this game. However, I do have some issues with it which a lot fo people have mentioned in their reviews. here are my main issues 1. Characters - creating your player is way more limited than I understood when reading people''s reviews. There really isn''t a lot to customize here. 2. Putting - Missing dead straight putts because you barely overhit it is not like rel life. I have missed so many putts where it magically rolls over the cup rather that bounce or go in. Its like the hole has glad wrap over it. In real life, as long as it''s back of the cup, it will go in more than not. 3. It seems that ever shot I get is a flat lie. Maybe...'),
(N'Linda', N'Hernandez', N'linda.hernandez8827@example.net', '2015-07-21', 2, N'Didn''t fit my Xbox Slim. The adapter is square but the Xbox has a rounded trapezoid shape. I needed to file down the plastic to get it to fit. It is super cheap so I gave it an extra star.'),
(N'Noah', N'Myers', N'noah.myers1154@example.com', '2015-07-21', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Young', N'jennifer.young9137@example.com', '2015-07-21', 5, N'very nice movie'),
(N'Nadia', N'Hughes', N'nadia.hughes5503@example.com', '2015-07-21', 5, N'I bought this to reclaim a lost collection of games I owned in the past except I only owned the allied assault version and the rest were simply part of the deal to sweeten it. this is great for anyone who is looking to reclaim a collection of old games they missed from times past.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Jackson', N'aisha.jackson9118@example.com', '2015-07-21', 4, N'as advertised'),
(N'Julie', N'Ross', N'julie.ross5035@example.net', '2015-07-21', 4, N'I finished this one fairly fast (only took me about 2 days) but it was fun none the less. You get to learn about Scandinavian life, sailing, and various other things.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Castillo', N'rachel.castillo3560@example.org', '2015-07-21', 5, N'Great game. Online is even better. Doesn''t really get old.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Chavez', N'patrick.chavez6403@example.com', '2015-07-21', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Susan', N'Sanders', N'susan.sanders4497@example.com', '2015-07-21', 4, N'works well'),
(N'Mei', N'Boyd', N'mei.boyd1543@example.org', '2015-07-21', 5, N'Out of all the COD games, this one is my favorite. I love nazi zombies.'),
(N'Paul', N'Perry', N'paul.perry6596@example.com', '2015-07-21', 1, N'Very, very hard. Even on "easy" I barely made it through the first campaign mission. First mission they throw tanks, armored cars, half tracks etc. at you. You have no bazookas. Just mines. But the engies get nailed laying down mines. When engies lay mines or put dynamite on things they just stand there afterward instead of running a safe distance away. AI is dumbest I''ve ever seen. You run into a crowd of enemy and you have to click on every enemy to kill them. Not sure if I will continue to play. I''m sure playing online will be painful because of hacks. Glad I waited for the price to come down. Wish I went out an had a steak instead :-('),
(N'Amy', N'Mendoza', N'amy.mendoza6065@example.net', '2015-07-21', 4, N'Not a great game, but a good one. if you like the XCOM series and can get it on the cheap give it a try. Fairly underrated game in my opinion'),
(N'Katherine', N'Mitchell', N'katherine.mitchell9264@example.net', '2015-07-22', 5, N'This is a very good way to protect your umd games during vacation or business trips. I specifically bought this prior to a business trip and my game were in perfect condition in my backpack waiting for me to play when I got to the hotel room each night. They take up a lot less space in this than the multiple game cases normally would. It does what it''s supposed to perfectly. The magnets hold the games in place very well too, they simply drop into place and are lined up perfectly.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Barnes', N'gregory.barnes8349@example.org', '2015-07-22', 1, N'This game Ai are complete bitches, every damn play they hit the wr and intercept every damn time i just broke the game in pieces if you the type of gamer that rages over video game like me please don''t buy this game because you will break it'),
(N'Frank', N'Morales', N'frank.morales6576@example.com', '2015-07-22', 5, N'WE MOSTLY PLAY BOWLING AND WE LOVE IT! THE GROUP OF US PLAY EVERY WEEK.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Flores', N'sandra.flores9583@example.org', '2015-07-22', 5, N'One of the best games I have ever played! Allows you to build a civilization from pre-historic times straight into the future, There are multiple victory options including domination, time, culture, diplomatic, and a few others. The gameplay is similar to board game where you can move units around the map on "tiles". Each player including AI players take turns moving/building/fighting. You are not only a commander of an army but also a politician, economist, merchant, diplomat, etc. You decide how you want your civilization to grow. There is a small learning curve, if this is your first time playing a civilization game (like myself). But, once you learn how to play.... its lots of fun!! Highly recommended'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Reed', N'evelyn.reed8834@example.net', '2015-07-22', 5, N'FUN FUN FUN ! THATS IT, That''s my review .... LOL'),
(N'Eric', N'Richardson', N'eric.richardson7579@example.net', '2015-07-22', 4, N'Excelent'),
(N'Linda', N'Coleman', N'linda.coleman9818@example.org', '2015-07-22', 4, N'Well, three of us put this SteelSeries Siberia headset through it''s paces against a Turtle Beach Ear Force, a Corsair Vengeance and a previous, but similar, Steel Series headset. Overall, the results were the P300 was comparable to the revious Steel Series and we liked it but it lacked the sound quality and ear comfort of the Corsair and to some extent the Turtle Beach headsets. It''s definitely light weight although it fit snugger over the head than the other headsets. The light weight made it comfortable to wear for hours and the cushions fit tight to the ear so it blocked sound well. One teen liked that the mic on/off is on the actual headset instead of on the wire (less fiddly and straightforward to turn on or off). I miss a volume control like on the Old Steel Series model we own. I use a headset for work all day just listening to audio and I like having another volume control in addition to the screen control and my laptop volume control. The sound quality itself is good, and...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Foster', N'nathan.foster5344@example.org', '2015-07-22', 5, N'son loves it'),
(N'Mary', N'Adams', N'mary.adams1683@example.org', '2015-07-22', 4, N'Not a us model but works like a charm.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ramirez', N'ravi.ramirez5019@example.net', '2015-07-22', 4, N'This one came in handy just when I needed it. What a saving!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Hughes', N'aisha.hughes9709@example.net', '2015-07-22', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Kyle', N'Butler', N'kyle.butler5062@example.org', '2015-07-22', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Diane', N'Evans', N'diane.evans5102@example.com', '2015-07-22', 5, N'better than first tetris!'),
(N'Brian', N'Baker', N'brian.baker9220@example.org', '2015-07-22', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Douglas', N'Williams', N'douglas.williams3183@example.net', '2015-07-22', 4, N'Just as it should be.'),
(N'Heather', N'Murphy', N'heather.murphy3380@example.net', '2015-07-22', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Henry', N'Jackson', N'henry.jackson3229@example.net', '2015-07-22', 3, N'The Run was complicated. I was expecting a NFS game where I would do the usual like in past games of the series. Just as soon as I started playing it, I was in a long road trip speeding through a trail that would lead me to NYC (one of my favorite cities and states ever). This NFS - in terms of music and sound volume - is very loud than previous games. While playing it, it''s like watching a movie in a movie theater but actually playing it. The game itself comes off like a high-adrenaline action movie and it ends like a high-adrenaline action movie. The Run can be tough in some areas though. There were some races that were linear for me to beat. Like I just said It is very different from previous entries. It''s good but it wasn''t really all that great. This felt like I was playing a Fast and the Furious game than a Need for Speed one. It barely acts and sound like it. Heck, it''s like EA just blended elements of Forza Motorsport - if that Xbox exclusive racing franchise actually HAD...'),
(N'Samuel', N'Perez', N'samuel.perez4103@example.org', '2015-07-22', 5, N'good'),
(N'Tyler', N'Bell', N'tyler.bell8554@example.com', '2015-07-22', 5, N'Excellent product quality and durability.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Lopez', N'anthony.lopez7260@example.org', '2015-07-23', 5, N'Read the other reviews for instructions on how to get it to work. It won''t work out of the box without the community input but once it''s working it works as expected. I am using it on Windows 10.'),
(N'Paul', N'Hughes', N'paul.hughes7584@example.net', '2015-07-23', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Pamela', N'Turner', N'pamela.turner5155@example.org', '2015-07-23', 4, N'The delivery was great. The game itself is a little bit of a let down. Limited features but cool graphics.'),
(N'James', N'Foster', N'james.foster2178@example.org', '2015-07-23', 5, N'Great product!! Excellent quality!!'),
(N'Judith', N'Khan', N'judith.khan4271@example.com', '2015-07-23', 5, N'well worth the price difference'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Powell', N'stephanie.powell1339@example.com', '2015-07-23', 4, N'I purchased as a gift, he loved it!'),
(N'Peter', N'Gonzalez', N'peter.gonzalez9776@example.net', '2015-07-23', 5, N'Such a fun game.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Jones', N'ivan.jones1436@example.com', '2015-07-23', 5, N'All you want to do is just stare at it because it''s so pretty! Great controller! I bought the red and gold chrome from Amazon as well and love all 3.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Cook', N'pamela.cook1818@example.org', '2015-07-23', 5, N'Love ND games so what else can I say!!!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Fisher', N'sarah.fisher7588@example.net', '2015-07-24', 5, N'I passed it since when i got it before :) when i was working with my dad but i oder nee cuase i haded a digital copy from the xbox store'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Nguyen', N'evelyn.nguyen7387@example.org', '2015-07-24', 5, N'The Lego series Video Games are my absolute favorite in the Wii games line up. When you hear that Indian Jones theme song start playing I knew I was in love. To this day I still play this game and get a kick out of how cute and fun it is...And Yes, I am 42 years old! Great Game! Great Product!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Green', N'ethan.green8471@example.com', '2015-07-24', 3, N'Wow this game is so overrated on here. First of all the "banana split" dlc is ridiculously skimpy. Literally a banana as a panty and two nipple covering strawberries. Yes, the perverts will love this game. Aside from that, actually gameplay is similar to devil may cry or bayonetta with the killing. FOR SOME REASON the rest of this review got cut off, ANYWAYS, the game has been out for a while now and after that ONE time of me playing it, I never put it back in the system. Problems with the game: Scenes where you''d have to put in input, like where time slows down and you have to mash a series of buttons don''t work.. The instructions are awful and not clear and so are the objectives. The game doesn''t have any idicators as to where you should go so you can literally be slashing an army of zombies for hours and not realizing that you''ve got somewhere to go because zombies WILL endlessly reappear. Nice things about this game are the actually fighting is fun, getting to switch between...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Rivera', N'stephen.rivera3312@example.org', '2015-07-24', 4, N'Like the game and thousands of hours of online fun'),
(N'Stephen', N'Rivera', N'stephen.rivera3312@example.org', '2015-07-24', 3, N'Great game but lacks content.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Wisniewski', N'hannah.wisniewski5590@example.org', '2015-07-24', 5, N'Nice game!'),
(N'Emma', N'Phillips', N'emma.phillips9350@example.org', '2015-07-24', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wood', N'nathan.wood4853@example.com', '2015-07-24', 2, N'The Tiger versions were way better. How do you create a new game but yet have less stuff (players & courses)? Don''t get this game just get last years version for less money and more content.'),
(N'Emma', N'Johnson', N'emma.johnson6276@example.com', '2015-07-24', 5, N'One of the best games'),
(N'Dee', N'White', N'dee.white8603@example.com', '2015-07-25', 1, N'Be aware, this is just the music disc.'),
(N'Dee', N'White', N'dee.white8603@example.com', '2015-07-25', 1, N'Couldn''t get it to work with my pc. Hopefully that''s just me..'),
(N'Gregory', N'Barnes', N'gregory.barnes8349@example.org', '2015-07-25', 5, N'Even though it looked beatup, it''s play perfect'),
(N'John', N'Smith', N'john.smith6440@example.org', '2015-07-25', 2, N'This is ok'),
(N'Angela', N'Jones', N'angela.jones4721@example.net', '2015-07-25', 5, N'I am a Mom who plays Skylanders with her eight-year-old and Scarlet Ninjini is one of my go-to favorites! I usually proudly represent the women of Skylanders and she is great! I use her for the magic areas and for the hardest battles - and of course just because she really is a lot of fun! I started playing Skylanders as a way to spend time and connect with my kids but now I really enjoy it!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Walker', N'ethan.walker1404@example.org', '2015-07-25', 5, N'Amazing collection... I personally haven''t played any game of the series before, and was surprised with the beautiful final product! Specially the first game, updated and remastered with HD graphics. The interface to choose the games is pretty straight forward. All 4 games are there, ready to play. No extensive loading times to change from one game to another.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Martinez', N'samantha.martinez4540@example.net', '2015-07-25', 5, N'I LOVE THIS GAME, EVERYONE BUY IT'),
(N'Dee', N'Russell', N'dee.russell4497@example.net', '2015-07-25', 1, N'Bad product'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Sanchez', N'nicholas.sanchez6024@example.com', '2015-07-25', 4, N'Batman Arkham knight is a great game to close of the series.;'),
(N'Justin', N'Baker', N'justin.baker4877@example.org', '2015-07-25', 4, N'Poor Olaf, he just doesn''t get as much love in this house. Not exactly their favorite game, they say "it''s just ok". Olaf gets stuck in a snow blizzard and he can''t find Anna. You are supposed to help him along the way. Don''t get stuck, too, or you''ll lose Olaf!'),
(N'Ravi', N'Murphy', N'ravi.murphy7082@example.com', '2015-07-25', 1, N'I will never buy another Microsoft gaming system again. I bought this today for my two kids and I to play. We have had the Xbox 360 for year. I thought it was time to upgrade. Setting up was easy. Understanding profiles was tough. I had to setup my kids with there own Microsoft account and outlook emails to get it to work. We have been waiting 6 hours for the halo game to download. It 40% now and somehow 200gbs on storage has disappeared. I went out to the store to buy another game on cd thinking we could play that but it is lock until we are able to complete the halo download. The user interface is lacking serious features. Finding settings is a hard task in and of itself. The Microsoft store is terrible. There is no way to easily search. Microsofts continued investment is a poor UI is disappointing. I didn''t realize that this halo collection that came with the bundle did not include halo 5. We already have all of these games. I feel I was ripped off and I would have not bought...'),
(N'Adam', N'Gray', N'adam.gray2443@example.org', '2015-07-25', 5, N'It works and my sister loved it.'),
(N'Scott', N'Brown', N'scott.brown3946@example.org', '2015-07-25', 5, N'You''ll be hard pressed to find many games that beat the sheer randomness of Lollipop Chainsaws storyline. The game arrived on schedule and was undamaged.'),
(N'James', N'Bailey', N'james.bailey1667@example.com', '2015-07-26', 5, N'The Sentey Nebulus: The best gaming mouse you can buy for under $25. I recently purchased a FinalMouse 2015 model back in late April. They offer a 3 year warranty on their products so they would replace it being as it wasn''t that old, but I had a CS GO tournament the day after my FinalMouse broke so I decided to order this Nebulus as a temporary replacement for my FinalMouse. I only used the Nebulus for 5 days and I have to say I am quite impressed and I''m glad to have it as a backup mouse. It''s very comfortable to use, the lighting on it is great looking, and the customizable weight are hard to find in a budget mouse. Pick up a Nebulus! Great product!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Gray', N'joyce.gray8470@example.org', '2015-07-26', 4, N'not bad'),
(N'Mei', N'Raghunathan', N'mei.raghunathan3714@example.com', '2015-07-26', 3, N'It''s ok.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Russell', N'brenda.russell3022@example.net', '2015-07-26', 5, N'Absolutely love this. Great price for this game plus the two expansions. Only $15!! While some people and/or places are selling Sims 2 for $30 still. I have to say that Sims 3 is my favorite. I have tried Sims 4 but 3 is so much easier.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Brown', N'kimberly.brown7682@example.com', '2015-07-26', 5, N'The title speaks for itself. This game is still very much a super fun & enjoyable game. The nostalgia is so real. Literally worth every penny.'),
(N'George', N'Johnson', N'george.johnson1809@example.net', '2015-07-26', 5, N'My daughter loves this game. She is always playing out the movie in her room with this. There are different modes, she likes the story mode because it follows the movie.'),
(N'Diane', N'Williams', N'diane.williams6901@example.com', '2015-07-27', 4, N'Though this game is fun, you must be prepared to sit down for a few hours at a time to play. This game is nearly impossible to play for less than an hour here or there.'),
(N'Henry', N'Morgan', N'henry.morgan9717@example.org', '2015-07-27', 5, N'Special product for PSP 3000 ... And very good quality ... Thanks'),
(N'Kyle', N'Watson', N'kyle.watson1514@example.net', '2015-07-27', 4, N'product arrived on time and as described.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Jenkins', N'alexander.jenkins6063@example.net', '2015-07-27', 4, N'Very unique platformer that is mixed with a connect-3 type puzzle game. Unique enemies and art design, but the game suffers heavily from a massive difficulty spike in the last few levels.'),
(N'Barbara', N'King', N'barbara.king4900@example.com', '2015-07-27', 4, N'OLD VERSION, NO RCA PLUG. GOOD PRICE FOR THE COMBO AND GREAT SUPPOT FROM SELLER.'),
(N'Omar', N'Gomez', N'omar.gomez7596@example.org', '2015-07-27', 5, N'I got a Genesis to relive some nostalgia. I remembered a weird Jurassic park game with a raptor & useless dart gun. After playing, I remembered how fun this game is. You can play as a guy, using a dart, laser, machine gun, or grenades. Or a raptor with a Jackie Chan complex. You have a pretty basic platform/ side scroller. But, it''s a real trip. The graphics are pretty good, the music fits the gameplay. I love 16 bit music. You can play as the raptor & collect boxes to go "rampage mode" your screen goes red, and you are briefly invincible. In one stage, your guy can ride on a fast dino across the desert. If you played it in the days of Old, definitely add it to your collection. If you''re new, you really need to try this one out. It''s unusually hard. But, you will eventually master it. My cartridge was in great shape & runs smooth. Pro tip: hold up/right or left for a speed boost. Especially for your raptor.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Smith', N'sharon.smith7498@example.org', '2015-07-27', 5, N'The Wii system itself is very basic, but all that I need. I don''t have reliable, or fast, internet so picking up this basic console worked out really well. For the system, 5 stars. I love Mario Kart, so that''s a win-win. Considering the game sells for at least $30, I''d call this a great deal. I knocked off 2 stars because the wiimote does not function properly. I tested a second wiimote and had no issues. The red wiimote that came with the console must have an issue with its sensor, because it jumps all over the screen and disappears frequently. It worked well enough to play some New Super Mario, but when it comes to using the motion sensor? Forget it. Hopefully I can contact the seller and work out a replacement remote. I really don''t want to have to pack up the whole system and ship it back or have to purchase a new remote for an additional $30+. Buyers in the market for a Wii - Please note, this system does NOT come with internet connectivity. If you''re looking for something...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'King', N'jonathan.king2588@example.org', '2015-07-27', 5, N'It actually works well. I love it.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Edwards', N'tomasz.edwards7039@example.net', '2015-07-28', 4, N'Fun game and was delivered within the time frame stated.'),
(N'Megan', N'Gonzalez', N'megan.gonzalez8765@example.net', '2015-07-28', 4, N'It works, does it''s job, but the PSP plug and the wire itself feels like it could break at any moment. The PSP plug feels like it''ll fall out.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Walker', N'rachel.walker4099@example.org', '2015-07-28', 5, N'Best Simcity Game of all time in my opinion. I liked this game and I bought a copy some time ago. It may just be nostalgia but it is a good game with a map editor. You can build water works and power plants with police stations, hospitals, museums, schools and collages. The arcologies are the main way to make money in the game. They hold tens of thousands of residents but are unlocked by population. This worked fine on windows 32 bit systems on xp. But the game is getting outdated for graphics and some operating systems. But other than that it is still my favorite sim city of all time. I just wish they made a up to date version of this call simcity 3000.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Ramos', N'kyle.ramos9921@example.com', '2015-07-28', 5, N'Bought this as a gift for my husband. He loves it. Said it''s nice and relaxing to play when he''s not in the mood to play shooter games.'),
(N'Julie', N'Adams', N'julie.adams9883@example.net', '2015-07-28', 4, N'good game'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Ivanov', N'tomasz.ivanov5318@example.net', '2015-07-28', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Omar', N'Gomez', N'omar.gomez7596@example.org', '2015-07-28', 5, N'I got this a while back. My old controller was acting funky. It works great on my original PS2. No issues with stuck buttons or vibration feedback. Just plug and play some Need for speed or James Bond. It feels like a brand new ps2 controller from the box. This is about a year in I think.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Flores', N'marcus.flores5123@example.org', '2015-07-28', 5, N'Wow great deal but package damaged everything'),
(N'Eric', N'Williams', N'eric.williams3978@example.net', '2015-07-28', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Olivia', N'Coleman', N'olivia.coleman6994@example.net', '2015-07-29', 4, N'Not as challenging as Far Cry 3, but still a good game---lots of various adventures and people to kill (although once you figure out the right weapons and always take the high ground, the fortresses and camps are pretty well toast). I like the game and have played it several times on the various levels...keeps my interest and provides a good long playtime. Lea'),
(N'Nicole', N'Kumar', N'nicole.kumar8718@example.net', '2015-07-29', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Paul', N'Sanchez', N'paul.sanchez4599@example.com', '2015-07-29', 3, N'The pad is no response like the original one'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ortiz', N'kenneth.ortiz8153@example.com', '2015-07-29', 5, N'Hold in place great product'),
(N'Mei', N'Hall', N'mei.hall6538@example.net', '2015-07-29', 5, N'Very happy with product. packaged very good.'),
(N'Diane', N'Richardson', N'diane.richardson5999@example.org', '2015-07-29', 5, N'a lot fun little violent'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Nowak', N'jonathan.nowak9883@example.net', '2015-07-29', 5, N'I will be the first to admit Xilla is not the greatest of the Tales of Stories to be told, still as a fan of this series of games, I fell in love with the story. It also has the gameplay you come to expect form this series and even a few new features. Overall this is a great game and I highly recommend this to any fan of the Tales of games.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Hernandez', N'evelyn.hernandez2184@example.com', '2015-07-30', 5, N'Game worked and it got here fast'),
(N'Edward', N'James', N'edward.james9934@example.org', '2015-07-30', 5, N'Awesome mouse, button for easy changing of dpi to allow easier maneuverability.'),
(N'Adam', N'Barnes', N'adam.barnes3063@example.org', '2015-07-30', 5, N'Soccer meets kart racing in an amazing hybrid. One of the best games I''ve played in terms of fun factor. Rivals Mario kart 64 while holding serve as a competent sports title.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Chavez', N'yuki.chavez5640@example.net', '2015-07-30', 5, N'EXCELLENT'),
(N'Gary', N'Alvarez', N'gary.alvarez5494@example.com', '2015-07-30', 4, N'Bought from GameStop not Amazon. Used store card and my fiance tested it. He liked it mostly. The wireless capabilities are awesome and it was wonderful on the range. The sound coming through the headset was very good, but the mic was a little too short for a avid gamer that talks to friends in a party or online gaming. It sounds as if you are using a Pringles can to talk or in a tunnel to others. If you are going to use it for just hearing the game and such not chatting, it is perfect for the range and versatility. If you also want to chat with your parties or online, it might be better to get another headset or wait for a improved model of the headset.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Hughes', N'katherine.hughes2383@example.org', '2015-07-30', 5, N'Great, challenging'),
(N'Carlos', N'Ortiz', N'carlos.ortiz2116@example.com', '2015-07-30', 4, N'The thumbsticks are the best part of the Xbone controller, and here are 4 more. You can use them are replacement parts if your thumbsticks wear out, or you can do what I did and replace the terrible thumbsticks of the PS4 controller. It''s pretty easy, and doesn''t take that long. Look up a tutorial though. These sticks are textured around the edge of the thumb pad, which feels good.'),
(N'Christina', N'Gomez', N'christina.gomez2020@example.org', '2015-07-30', 4, N'Okay'),
(N'Lauren', N'Singh', N'lauren.singh8116@example.net', '2015-07-30', 5, N'What can I say...worked great. The fact that the slide pad is on the left side is smart as well.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Nelson', N'michelle.nelson9371@example.org', '2015-07-30', 5, N'I have played this game on the Sony PSP and I am looking forward to Playing this version of it.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Gomez', N'lucia.gomez3580@example.com', '2015-07-31', 5, N'It''s Toad!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Robinson', N'patricia.robinson9630@example.net', '2015-07-31', 4, N'Prepare for a challenge but don''t lose heart. Once you get the hang of the gameplay, you will really enjoy the challenge it presents.'),
(N'Anna', N'Cruz', N'anna.cruz1634@example.com', '2015-07-31', 1, N'Not the best game for the price. Nice cover art though.'),
(N'Karen', N'Watson', N'karen.watson6824@example.net', '2015-07-31', 5, N'These are great for pairing with your PS3. These aren''t 7.1, but as 5.1, they are top notch. I wish they were a little bit less plastic-e, but that''s the design they made. I do wish it could be louder.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Lopez', N'timothy.lopez5016@example.net', '2015-07-31', 4, N'Not an Xbox controller but works like one.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Evans', N'joyce.evans6159@example.com', '2015-07-31', 3, N'If you played Dragon Age Origins when it came out, you''re likely to be disappointed by this. Game offers a good one-time experience but I''ve had zero interest in replaying it. Each to their own, I''m sure some people will love this game, not me.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Martin', N'melissa.martin8243@example.com', '2015-07-31', 5, N'Great game! Since it''s a prequel of The New Order, I miss Anya Oliwa.'),
(N'Judith', N'Ali', N'judith.ali7254@example.net', '2015-07-31', 4, N'Pretty damn close to the original and awesome value.'),
(N'Emily', N'Brown', N'emily.brown7292@example.org', '2015-07-31', 5, N'I really have no idea why this game is so compelling. All you really do is drive a truck. Sure, there are additional things to do like by garages, hire drivers, expand your fleet, etc, but this game is all about the driving. And it does that really, really well. For a game released in 2013, the graphics aren''t really anything to write home about. It looks like a PS3 game released in 2009. It''s not a bad thing, just a thing. I assume this is because the developers are an independent studio without the resources of a developer with publisher backing. Don''t expect great textures, but again, you don''t need them. The driving is really, really fun. I really don''t know why. You just drive. Pick a job off the job board and drive. All the jobs require you haul some specific product or resource from point A to point B. You can gain extra XP by transporting fragile or explosive payloads. You also have to drive carefully. Failure to follow the rules of the road will result in penalties and/or...'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Kowalski', N'elizabeth.kowalski4200@example.org', '2015-07-31', 5, N'he love it'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Clark', N'jeffrey.clark9894@example.net', '2015-07-31', 5, N'Easy as plug and play.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Edwards', N'tyler.edwards6252@example.org', '2015-07-31', 5, N'Loved it'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ortiz', N'rachel.ortiz6754@example.com', '2015-08-01', 5, N'Worth the price, even though we can''t use them in the US yet, they are my center piece of my amiibo collection. They are region free, so if anyone is curious, yes you can use them on the NA version of the game once it hits our store shelves.'),
(N'Wei', N'Russell', N'wei.russell6511@example.net', '2015-08-01', 4, N'I only paid 45 bucks for this and it was a returned item to Amazon. I would give it 5/5 stars if it had English as a language option. It only has Japanese which makes it very unique and I was able to update it to fw version 4.5 and get it configured exactly the way I want it. So I can play games on this without worrying about the region. It is a really cool device and unique since they didn''t come out with this in white in the USA and probably never will since the New 3DS XL is already out. I have wanted a white handheld nintendo system for years and this was a really excellent deal. Menus in this are in Japanese but they are really easy to navigate since I''m used to the US version and I can get tutorials on youtube or just power on a US console if I want to figure out where specific things are. Everything works great. I haven''t checked out the power supply but if it isn''t compatible with the US wall socket, it doesn''t matter since power supplies for these are cheap and I already...'),
(N'Anthony', N'White', N'anthony.white8212@example.net', '2015-08-01', 4, N'one of the better classics of the ps2 era. even though used it is a good controller for the ps2.'),
(N'Anthony', N'White', N'anthony.white8212@example.net', '2015-08-01', 5, N'kingdom hearts is always amazing. this was a gift to a friend and he enjoys it thoroughly. i also love kingdom hearts as it creates a great atmosphere and universe full of disney classics and even the newer disney installments with a clash of square enix and their memorable final fantasy charachters. if you love rpgs and idsney this is a great series for you.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ortiz', N'rachel.ortiz6675@example.net', '2015-08-01', 5, N'I''ve had issues with it shutting itself off...but I think that could be a problem with my battery packs, I''m not entirely sure. Either way, it does what I want it to do, so full stars :-)'),
(N'Laura', N'Ross', N'laura.ross6870@example.com', '2015-08-01', 5, N'It''s the standalone game with all the extra DLC crap bundled in. What''s not to like?'),
(N'Paul', N'Wang', N'paul.wang2815@example.net', '2015-08-01', 5, N'awesome open world game with lots and lots of side missions and things to do and collect you wouldn''t get bored with this game :D'),
(N'David', N'Kowalski', N'david.kowalski8045@example.com', '2015-08-01', 5, N'I thought I would wait to play this until it got more toward Christmas but I ran out of HOB games to play so I broke it open. I LOVE this game. Yes, I admit I love the whole Christmas atmosphere but it more than that for me. I love the story line, I loved the graphics, puzzles and there just seemed a lot to do in every scene. This is one I will keep loaded and play again in the really hard mode - at Christmas. I guess I should state I am a adult for a penchant for these kinds of games. Out of about 22 I have played this ranks 5 or 6 for me.'),
(N'Anna', N'Suzuki', N'anna.suzuki4837@example.net', '2015-08-02', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Mei', N'Ruiz', N'mei.ruiz3590@example.org', '2015-08-02', 5, N'My favorite mouse for about a year. The shape causes the mouse to move back with your hand, so there''s less strain when moving the cursor downward. Side buttons are intuitively placed and respond well. The tracking of these mice is flawless on any shiny surface like finished wood, but deteriorates on fabric mousemats over a few months. No amount of trying to clean the mousemat seems to help the issue, but my bare desktop now proves better for it than any mousemat. Not having to have a mousemat and still being able to aim well in FPS games is nice. The mouse remembers your firmware settings. If you program the DPI settings on one computer, you can plug it into another and it will keep working the same way. I set the colors all to the same DPI so I can just pick whatever color I want at a given time for aesthetics. And the light''s why I''m really writing this review. The LED controller''s behavior lets you know, at a glance, what''s happening with your computer. It will shine bright...'),
(N'Megan', N'Brown', N'megan.brown9268@example.org', '2015-08-02', 5, N'You shouldnt have to be using any type of double A batteries in controllers these days. Buy this and it''ll help you out big time!!'),
(N'Christina', N'Sullivan', N'christina.sullivan3873@example.com', '2015-08-02', 5, N'This is a must buy I mean two games for the price of one? Who can beat that. I only played bo2 and so far I''m loving it. It a lil bit of a learning curve for me. Mainly because I''m coming from playing ghost. =0 she played ghost! Yep and tbh it was good but got boring after while. I wanted a new experience for once. Bo2 is very different (well for me) I now own four cod series, mw3 (which is ok) ghosts (I use to love but like now) bo1 ( never played yet but probably will in the future) bo2 ( so far I''m learning but may be my top pick now). Zombie mode seems ok like I said I''m still learning, so don''t judge me lol. But here is my review :) Update: finally getting into bo1 and i love it but zombies i just not into that much but play once in awhile'),
(N'Joyce', N'Alvarez', N'joyce.alvarez4662@example.org', '2015-08-02', 5, N'My son loves Mario and this is so nice. The screen is big. Only the bottom is touch screen. I have Wi- Fi on it for him with You Tube, it has a Home screen button you add Apps to it from Nintendo E shop. came with charger and stylus.'),
(N'Carol', N'Davis', N'carol.davis6461@example.net', '2015-08-02', 1, N'I bought this game new and they sent me a game without any instructions or even the Nintendo warning of seizure in it. Nothing in the game but the game!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Okonkwo', N'kathleen.okonkwo5385@example.net', '2015-08-02', 4, N'I bought this to use with my Shield Pro Android TV for when I stream PC games that require a mouse. It works as it should, and I''m satisfied with the purchase. It''s by far a much better mouse than a non-gaming Bluetooth mouse (I have a Logitech Bluetooth mouse that doesn''t track well). You do have to use this with a PC and install software in order to customize the button layout and change the sensitivity, as it was too sensitive with my application.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Wang', N'thomas.wang6890@example.com', '2015-08-02', 5, N'Everything as advertised. Works well, good sound and mic quality. Is very durable and has survived several falls.'),
(N'Debra', N'Henderson', N'debra.henderson8778@example.org', '2015-08-02', 5, N'Solid design, held my DSi XL and games with no issues. Survived a 3 year tour overseas in military and had no signs of wear. Would definitely recommend.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Mitchell', N'elizabeth.mitchell2996@example.com', '2015-08-02', 3, N'I like that the weather adds some realizum to the game,it adds holidays,festivals,slow dancing,which I love the slowdancing.what I don''t like even when I disabled winter,it rains every day,I disabled rain,it still rains every single day,that gets tireing.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Mitchell', N'elizabeth.mitchell2996@example.com', '2015-08-02', 2, N'I got mine free from ea as a VIP gift,it''s ok,if you want new items,but if you paid more than ten dollars you paid too much,not worth more than that,I would suggest you get free stuff legally from TSR,the stuff is nice and free.'),
(N'Debra', N'Alvarez', N'debra.alvarez4522@example.net', '2015-08-02', 5, N'Coming from the DS Fire Emblem games, at first I didn''t enjoy the 3D much... it made things harder to see, but the story is so good it quickly fixed that.. It really was a great game, my only complaint would be that the english actors are pretty bad, like really bad.... Does it exist with Japanese voice and English subs?'),
(N'Debra', N'Alvarez', N'debra.alvarez4522@example.net', '2015-08-02', 3, N'I started playing this after the first game and it is too similar (like more acts in the first one pretty much) and since the first one was not THAT special... I moved on to another game for now. I''m sure I''ll play that later but not for now.'),
(N'Debra', N'Alvarez', N'debra.alvarez4522@example.net', '2015-08-02', 5, N'If only for the voice acting and the music, the game is awesome! The game starts a bit difficult but once you get a proper gun, it actually becomes really easy... It''s more of a fun game to play every now and then than something that you''ll play non-stop for weeks, but that''s all good. I am happy with it.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Nelson', N'dennis.nelson9001@example.org', '2015-08-02', 1, N'This is the WORST game of this genre,that I have ever played. Most people complained about the annoying commentary throughout the game. But the game itself as a whole is the most lacklustered,uninspiring game I have ever played. Even the old Gauntlets are better than this.'),
(N'Mark', N'Raghunathan', N'mark.raghunathan9016@example.net', '2015-08-02', 5, N'Love this game, came on time , works perfectly on my n64..no glitches no freezes..just great play..i recommend'),
(N'Mark', N'Raghunathan', N'mark.raghunathan9016@example.net', '2015-08-02', 5, N'Works great in my N64. No freezes or glitches. Shipped on time'),
(N'Frank', N'Henderson', N'frank.henderson3784@example.org', '2015-08-02', 3, N'So I am going through my backlog of 360 games. Finally got around to playing this. I won''t do my normal review. I am going to just squeeze in my thoughts about this game overall. The story is pretty deep and I like how there are factions that you come across. You play as 3 different characters starting from very humble beginnings to actually being a prince. I know I can write some spoilers as this game is old but I prefer to leave some things out in case people haven''t played it yet. From that point on, whoever you choose, you start in different places on the map. This game really follows a Dungeons and Dragon approach to its style. There really isn''t any exploration as it is not open world. It is more linear than anything else that allows you to see what is around you in a corridor. The way it leads up to the end is okay but there are some boss battles that you need to be well informed about before you battle them. But the way that Bioware brings the 3 kinds of races together is...'),
(N'Lisa', N'Phillips', N'lisa.phillips5359@example.com', '2015-08-03', 5, N'My 5 star rating is for the actual cable itself not its functionality. The materials used to make this all feel very high quality. The rubber feels thick and easily bends unlike other harder type rubber which tends to crack with use. Now let move on to the functionality. I honestly see no difference at all from this and the standard cables. 480I and 480p to my naked eye look identical in every manner. I still after all these years why in the world Nintendo would release this as a SD console. It is painful to try and go back and enjoy old titles at times because of how terrible the pixels look. Anyway, this is a great cable and for the price why not upgrade? I just question if it is really an upgrade from the original.'),
(N'Debra', N'Henderson', N'debra.henderson8778@example.org', '2015-08-03', 4, N'This is the first game of the Mass Effect series. A heads-up, it does start off a little bit slow. However, the story eventually picks up and the way they introduce the story up until the end of the game is amazing. Mass Effect 2 and Mass Effect 3 just jump right into the action, which I appreciate. I would definitely recommend this game!'),
(N'Frank', N'Cooper', N'frank.cooper8229@example.com', '2015-08-03', 5, N'its pokemon nuff said'),
(N'Mei', N'Howard', N'mei.howard2506@example.net', '2015-08-03', 4, N'Controller is very light and analogs, triggers, and XYBA buttons very responsive. Only draw back are D-pad and both bumpers which are a little slow. D-pad may input diagonal instead of exact direction. Overall it''s good for its price.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Wood', N'jacob.wood3898@example.org', '2015-08-03', 1, N'Always getting an error when I try to use it.'),
(N'Joan', N'Cruz', N'joan.cruz6458@example.net', '2015-08-04', 4, N'a great game. I recommend it. Great graphics and the tutorial goes right along with your gameplay.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Price', N'kevin.price1723@example.org', '2015-08-04', 5, N'Excellent game for my son. Graphics are great.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Patel', N'cheryl.patel6449@example.com', '2015-08-04', 5, N'Good product. Make sure you have plenty of these around if you have several kids and Xboxes.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Rivera', N'kofi.rivera4407@example.net', '2015-08-04', 5, N'Product was as described. Very pleased with service.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Suzuki', N'deborah.suzuki6935@example.net', '2015-08-04', 5, N'Good Communications. Great Product. Quick Service. Rated AAA+++. Thank You. BEG'),
(N'Matthew', N'Hughes', N'matthew.hughes5837@example.com', '2015-08-04', 5, N'Excellent deal'),
(N'Heather', N'Torres', N'heather.torres3034@example.com', '2015-08-04', 1, N'I owned this game a few years back. I had totally forgotten about it until I saw it while looking for some new games to get. Well, I have pretty much nothing positive to say, much like many of the reviewers here. It sucks. It really, really sucks. The first thing I noticed was the horrible controls. I don''t even remember what they were, but I remember wuite clearly that they felt unnatural and the game didn''t respond well to them anyway. I remember that I had no clue what to do. I know that the game is all about exploration and such, but you have to give me some sort of idea about what to do. Even playing something like Fallout New Vegas, I know what I''m supposed to be doing, even if I get horribly lost on the massive map. Here, they just kind of toss random stuff at you and expect you to know what to do. Pretty annoying. I personally rarely use the 3d on the 3DS. Sometimes, I''ll turn it on while playing just to see how something looks, but it gets pretty impractical during real...'),
(N'Walter', N'Kim', N'walter.kim6276@example.net', '2015-08-04', 5, N'Perfect!!!'),
(N'Mark', N'Wisniewski', N'mark.wisniewski9959@example.com', '2015-08-04', 5, N'EXCELENT'),
(N'Michael', N'Robinson', N'michael.robinson9969@example.net', '2015-08-04', 4, N'Great purchase'),
(N'Patrick', N'Mendoza', N'patrick.mendoza8904@example.com', '2015-08-04', 4, N'Works very well for an Xbox controller, as it raises the normally-pitted analog sticks to a flat surface. For PS3, it bows outward a bit. Both are comfortable but this is a product that would benefit from being less "universal."'),
(N'Carlos', N'Young', N'carlos.young5736@example.com', '2015-08-04', 3, N'DLC was awsome and so was the the gameplay. The graphics was better than the graphics on console like alway but that is where you run into problems. I have suffer from 10 crashes within 5 minutes and I have a very high end spec. Of course games from Bethseda are known to be very glitchy, especially with something big like fallout New vegas. So far I have manage to reduce the crashes to 2-3 crashes every 30 minutes. Still trying to fix the kinks in this game'),
(N'Justin', N'Butler', N'justin.butler5370@example.net', '2015-08-04', 4, N'Well ! ! Great service.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Cook', N'amanda.cook2540@example.net', '2015-08-04', 5, N'The whole family loves it.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Walker', N'mateo.walker5982@example.com', '2015-08-04', 5, N'This game is Epic. No need to say more..'),
(N'Anita', N'Chavez', N'anita.chavez9398@example.com', '2015-08-05', 3, N'Good shipping. Slow game'),
(N'Melissa', N'Ramos', N'melissa.ramos3107@example.com', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Game came out of the shadows (hey look, a pun) and took everyone by surprise with how great it was. Before this game I can''t think of one great Lord of the Rings video game. So when this game came out and all of a sudden people were giving it glowing reviews I was intrigued. And I did something I rarely do. I bought a video game I didn''t know anything about. And I had a great time with it. So let''s complain first shall we? Negatives: The main character is utterly forgettable. It''s weird. Everyone else in the game is modeled so well and look like they fit the Lord of the Rings universe. But the main character (whose name I can''t even remember) is forgettable and really just looks like a cheap imitation of Aragorn. He looks like how the main character of a game that was bastardizing The Lord of The Rings would look like. It''s easy to get overwhelemed with how much there is to do in the game. I found myself just going after captains every time I sat down to play. And then I forgot...'),
(N'Robert', N'Jenkins', N'robert.jenkins8915@example.org', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Ashley', N'Walker', N'ashley.walker9734@example.org', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Excellent product'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Khan', N'jennifer.khan8462@example.net', '2015-08-05', 5, N'This game is very fun playing on easy mode is just that easy but as you progress in the difficulty settings the game is very challenging and even more fun. I really enjoy this game.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Kim', N'carolyn.kim1521@example.net', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Gutierrez', N'carolyn.gutierrez3834@example.net', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Brandon', N'Miller', N'brandon.miller3784@example.net', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Pokemon all started in Japan,in 1996 as Pocket Monsters Red and Green. Then followed by Pocket Monsters Blue and Pocket Monsters Yellow. All these games were hits,and made it to the US. Red and Green only came out in Japan. Not the US. The graphics are much worse then the Red and Blue graphics. Many pokemon looked ugly,and stupid,so Nintendo made Pocket Monsters Blue. There Blue is our Red and Blue. The graphics for Blue,is the same as the graphics in Red and Blue. Some glitches were also fixed in Blue version,and was passed over to R/B versions. The only differences is the language. That''s it. Pocket Monsters Red and Green are different from Red and Blue. Pocket Monsters Red is like pokemon Red,but different. Different dialogue,glitches,and graphics. The games became successful,and Nintendo released more games. On TV TOKYO,pokemon became a Anime in 1997. It became a hit,and was followed by Pocket Monsters Yellow in 1998. Electric Solider Porygon came out in December 12,1997. The...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Tanaka', N'kyle.tanaka2554@example.com', '2015-08-05', 4, N'Don''t forget to take off the circle pad cover when you close your system. It adds height so it closes awkwardly. Other than that they are worth it'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Kumar', N'jacqueline.kumar2676@example.org', '2015-08-05', 1, N'all the Disc''s wasn''t there'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Kumar', N'jacqueline.kumar2676@example.org', '2015-08-05', 5, N'none'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Kumar', N'jacqueline.kumar2676@example.org', '2015-08-05', 2, N'I never get to used it because the damn Atari system don''t work. And about to throw it away.'),
(N'Mark', N'Rodriguez', N'mark.rodriguez9241@example.net', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Grandson loves it. Best price anywhere.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Chavez', N'timothy.chavez5238@example.com', '2015-08-05', 5, N'Must have game. Very fun ecspecially if you are an rpg open world kind of gamer.'),
(N'Brian', N'Ross', N'brian.ross4734@example.com', '2015-08-05', 5, N'For good story and lots to do');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Nadia', N'Jones', N'nadia.jones4584@example.org', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Great tools'),
(N'Heather', N'Chavez', N'heather.chavez6640@example.com', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Pros: Very low profile as compared to the Energizer brand. I appreciate the fact that there is no stress put on the controller as its charging. My controllers are charged very quickly and the spring loaded "engaging" action lets you know that you have it seated correctly. Been using it for months and haven''n had a complaint yet. Cons: None to speak of.'),
(N'Kevin', N'James', N'kevin.james6300@example.org', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Works perfect for my needs, great replacement to xbox360 controller'),
(N'Amy', N'Sanchez', N'amy.sanchez1179@example.net', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Classic great game. I am used to the tank controls. If this is your first play through you may not like the controls.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Flores', N'deborah.flores4636@example.org', '2015-08-06', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Walker', N'elizabeth.walker6255@example.com', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Best Batman game ever!!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Foster', N'patricia.foster5523@example.org', '2015-08-06', 5, N'good buy'),
(N'Nicole', N'Wood', N'nicole.wood8667@example.com', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Its a razor product, need I say more?'),
(N'Sofia', N'White', N'sofia.white3235@example.org', '2015-08-06', 3, N'Fun for a day then boring'),
(N'Mary', N'Henderson', N'mary.henderson8276@example.org', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Bought this for my wife and I to play together. Super fun when playing with other people single player is ok but not as good as playing with people in same room'),
(N'Scott', N'Sullivan', N'scott.sullivan3109@example.org', '2015-08-06', 5, N'This game is a classic'),
(N'Ashley', N'Garcia', N'ashley.garcia1745@example.net', '2015-08-06', 5, N'Work better than I ever suspected.'),
(N'Robert', N'Ferreira', N'robert.ferreira6557@example.net', '2015-08-06', 4, N'I was happy to find this game still available for purchase, considering it''s immense popularity. I recently acquired the New Nintendo 3DS XL in Feb. 2015, and I needed to add this to my collection of must-have games. It plays great on the new handheld, and I recommend it.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Taylor', N'andrea.taylor1268@example.org', '2015-08-07', 5, N'dsgsdgsgsgsdgsgs great game'),
(N'Brian', N'Reyes', N'brian.reyes4845@example.org', '2015-08-07', 4, N'good graphics for ps2'),
(N'Anthony', N'Tanaka', N'anthony.tanaka5469@example.org', '2015-08-07', 4, N'This stick right now is the best stick on PS4. Mad Catz used what they have learned and also took some cues from it''s competitors to make what I consider their best stick ever. Let''s start with the good. It is a lot easier to open this stick now. The button opens it up and you are quickly able to have access to the inside of your stick. That''s right, no more having to carry around an allen wrench to open it up. Speaking of opening it up, you are now able to use this as storage also. It comes with a tool and you are able to store extra parts in their as needed, there is even room to put a game in their. They got these design cues from Razer, but I feel that they made it better with the extra room they have in there and with the compartment of the cord. Customization, looks like it was a big focus with Mad Catz with this stick and they made sure that anyone could join in the fun for a cheap price with this stick. Panel are is easily added into this stick, all you need to do is print...'),
(N'Peter', N'Butler', N'peter.butler2657@example.org', '2015-08-07', 4, N'Awesome game but was way too quick.'),
(N'Adam', N'Edwards', N'adam.edwards7800@example.net', '2015-08-07', 1, N'Skin didn''t look like the pic, the buttons on the psone skin went down the sides of the console instead of on top of the ps4 like in the description picture. It was easy to put on and did arrive on time, but i was overall very disapointed. And don''t even get me started on the controller skins!'),
(N'Donald', N'Nowak', N'donald.nowak2955@example.org', '2015-08-07', 5, N'It gets the job done. There are a few steam games I just like to play with a controller like this. Risk of Rain and The Binding of Isaac. There isn''t many buttons to works with so sometimes you have to get a little creative to get things to work. I know there is software that can help you make your button layout more adequate too.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Castillo', N'timothy.castillo1933@example.org', '2015-08-07', 5, N'It worked and arrived on time.'),
(N'Mary', N'Morgan', N'mary.morgan2367@example.net', '2015-08-07', 5, N'Great +++'),
(N'Sarah', N'Diaz', N'sarah.diaz8950@example.org', '2015-08-07', 5, N'Fantastic seller! Game in great working condition!'),
(N'Jason', N'Cruz', N'jason.cruz9101@example.com', '2015-08-08', 2, N'Well'),
(N'Nathan', N'Alvarez', N'nathan.alvarez3627@example.net', '2015-08-08', 5, N'This was a gift to my son for his birthday. He likes it.'),
