(N'Joan', N'Powell', N'joan.powell4549@example.net', '2015-08-08', 5, N'Great item battery holds really good charge.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Powell', N'lucia.powell1012@example.net', '2015-08-08', 4, N'Disc was in good condition, the game was a gift'),
(N'Lucia', N'Powell', N'lucia.powell1012@example.net', '2015-08-08', 5, N'This game is something else, very different. Love the music'),
(N'Lauren', N'Wisniewski', N'lauren.wisniewski2495@example.net', '2015-08-08', 1, N'Game came scratched wouldn''t play on my console.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Jones', N'cynthia.jones7135@example.net', '2015-08-08', 4, N'Nice gaming mouse. Very affordable and responsive mouse, I also like the fact that it fits my hand perfectly.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Ali', N'joseph.ali7410@example.org', '2015-08-08', 4, N'Work great, the blue one ripped the first day but only a little. It''s held up since so I like it.'),
(N'Christine', N'Kowalski', N'christine.kowalski7001@example.org', '2015-08-09', 4, N'good for the most part, missing some good wrestlers tho! very enjoyable to play'),
(N'Shirley', N'Young', N'shirley.young9515@example.org', '2015-08-09', 5, N'you still need batteries'),
(N'Steven', N'Castillo', N'steven.castillo9223@example.net', '2015-08-09', 2, N'They arnt conferrable.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Rivera', N'nancy.rivera5280@example.net', '2015-08-09', 5, N'I received the Mario Kart 8 Bundle for Christmas in 2014. The Wii U has had horrible sales and skepticism. But I must say it is another great Nintendo platform. Nintendo games in 1080p look amazing and the improved online just works. Unlike other platforms where games are buggy, un-optimized, unpolished, cash grab $60 DLCs, Nintendo does it right. Even if games are $60 longer than other platforms, the games are quality. They always deliver polished, quality games that are fun. While the game pad is something different, Nintendo games play great on it and it is much better than the WiiMote in my opinion. I would give this platform a 9/10. For $300, it''s a great deal with 2 games and loads of fun.'),
(N'Richard', N'Lewis', N'richard.lewis2894@example.org', '2015-08-09', 5, N'I purchased this product about six months ago. The right analog stick broke on the fifth month, it''s always pointing down and there''s nothing I can do about it, So far I have tried shaking it, turning it off and on again, turning the system off and rotating the analog sticks then turn it on. The problem becomes quite troubling when I try to play Freedom Wars, Soul Sacrifice, or any other game that uses the right analog stick. If anyone one knows anything about fixing this problem, please contact me via comments or email me at Haoqilol@yahoo.com Edit: contacted Sony about it, shipped the item to them, got it back in two weeks and it is working like new.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Howard', N'hannah.howard8766@example.org', '2015-08-09', 2, N'Seller was great but didn''t like game'),
(N'Robert', N'Ali', N'robert.ali1146@example.net', '2015-08-09', 4, N'reminds me a lot of the last of us but with a mixture of dead island so its a great in between game its not as funky and dead island but also not as serious and beautiful as the last of us and lets be honest here the last of us was a work of art but nevertheless this game was great, is great and fun to play I''m not in love with this game but i actually beat it so thats a start. i didn''t like the all the balancing your character parts cause i would always fail but has a lot neat things in it like booby traps for zombies customizable weapons. not to mention fun glitches but then you always have your not so fun glitches. In conclusion great game at night it could get jumpy depending on you''re tolerance on zombie jump scares. i recommend this game very fun'),
(N'Patricia', N'Rogers', N'patricia.rogers9806@example.org', '2015-08-09', 5, N'very fun and challenging game. very reminiscent of the dark souls series.'),
(N'Priya', N'Patel', N'priya.patel1150@example.net', '2015-08-09', 5, N'awesome!!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Myers', N'kelly.myers5986@example.net', '2015-08-09', 3, N'Kind of pointless, but oh well. Maybe it''ll be good for something some day.'),
(N'Priya', N'Gutierrez', N'priya.gutierrez5470@example.net', '2015-08-10', 5, N'great deal'),
(N'Joyce', N'Johnson', N'joyce.johnson3376@example.com', '2015-08-10', 1, N'I didn''t really care too much for this game. its a decent game, but its not a game I would pay more than 10 dollars for. I thought modern warfare 2 was a whole lot better.'),
(N'Donna', N'Powell', N'donna.powell9735@example.net', '2015-08-10', 5, N'I needed a case to hold all my vita cartridges and sony''s case seemed a bit expensive. I decided to use nyko''s case and it was perfect. It can hold all my cartridges securely and even has 2 spaces for an extra memory cards. It was a little hard to open at first but don''t be afraid to use a bit of force! It also fit in the pouch of my Eva case with my vita inside. I can take all my games with me on the go no problem!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Walker', N'sarah.walker4188@example.org', '2015-08-10', 5, N'No problems. arrived on time'),
(N'Sarah', N'Walker', N'sarah.walker4188@example.org', '2015-08-10', 5, N'cool'),
(N'Rachel', N'Diaz', N'rachel.diaz6724@example.org', '2015-08-10', 1, N'No really good.'),
(N'William', N'Hill', N'william.hill1349@example.net', '2015-08-10', 5, N'Great game... What else could i say. I played the first and second titles... so there was something incomplete if i didn''t play this one.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Torres', N'anthony.torres7605@example.net', '2015-08-10', 5, N'Sometimes you just want a game you can goof off in.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Wisniewski', N'yuki.wisniewski1526@example.net', '2015-08-10', 5, N'Been trying to find this for a while. Love the game.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Singh', N'jacqueline.singh5714@example.com', '2015-08-10', 3, N'It definitely works for a PSP but the video output ratio isn''t that great, but it''s larger than on the PSP system itself! That''s the reason for the 3 stars! Not because it doesn''t work great.'),
(N'Charles', N'Davis', N'charles.davis2664@example.net', '2015-08-10', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Emma', N'Hill', N'emma.hill3929@example.com', '2015-08-10', 5, N'I got these purely to FIX my ps4 analog sticks. The rubber had been coming off of them. What I did was rip all the remaining rubber off the sticks. I then put these on and they fixed the problem completely. Not only do they provide a grippier feel with less slippage (then a new controller) but the extra height gives a little better leverage for aiming in games. I didn''t see this addressed too much in the reviews here. Important to note one thing though. If you have uneven rubber on your analogs, from wear, you may need to rip the rest off for it to fit on properly. If the rubber is uneven before placing them on they won''t fit right. I had this issue until I ripped all the remaining rubber off. This shouldnt be an issue if your controller is already worn out, since these are a permanent fix and WILL fit tightly without coming off, in my experience. They are very cheap and you get 4 of them, so its very easy to replace them but they seem like they will last a very long time. Wasnt...'),
(N'Emma', N'Hill', N'emma.hill3929@example.com', '2015-08-10', 5, N'Arrived in the shape advertised. The game is incredible though. I did see a gamespot review of a 9 a long time ago, but often assume certain games get overrated so I didn''t pick it up right away. It is actually a first party sony game, which sony puts out the best games on its system. This game is easily on the level of the best games on the system, without a doubt. The presentation (sound and visuals, art style) is one of the best Ive seen, especially for a mostly side scroller type of game. Boss fights are some of the most entertaining Ive played in any game , despite genre. They are fleshed out like something youd see in a god of war game, not a side scroller. Way above and beyond what youd see in any mario game as far as bosses. The traversal is very creative too and the game constantly switches up the environments and style of gameplay to keep the pacing constantly fresh. Mastering that type of pacing is something very few games achieve. The game is nonstop and never drags....'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ross', N'andrew.ross3119@example.org', '2015-08-10', 4, N'Much better than Black Ops overall with both Single Player and Multiplayer. Reminded me more of Call of Duty 4 Single Player.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Brown', N'jacob.brown5108@example.com', '2015-08-10', 4, N'[Update: I''ve also used this controller with the new 4th generation AppleTV, and it''s fine for playing such games as Asphalt Airborne 8]. I''ve many gamepad style controllers around the house, and I''d say these are the most comfortable with lightweight smooth grips. I could see playing with them all day long. They are very specific in their usefulness, though. While they claim Mac support I was not able to get them to work with my 2012 Mac Mini (although they did pair) even after installing the downloadable software pack. I''m sure there is some voodoo you can do to get it to work, but it isn''t idiot proof by any means. And my iPad 3 wasn''t on their list of compatible hardware so it didn''t work, but my iPad Air 2 wasn''t on the list either, but did work. And then you have to find a compatible game. When I first paired with my iPad Air 2, the operating system put up an alert saying software was associated with the device, and tapping on that brought me to an App Store page with a...'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2015-08-11', 5, N'activision is the greatest video game company in the universe there true genius''s the best of the best activision rocks all the games activision made over the years are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best all the games activison made over the years rocks'),
(N'Maria', N'Stewart', N'maria.stewart8349@example.net', '2015-08-11', 5, N'excellent very happy purchase'),
(N'Victoria', N'Rogers', N'victoria.rogers1997@example.com', '2015-08-11', 5, N'Tcmax'),
(N'Noah', N'Hall', N'noah.hall4251@example.org', '2015-08-11', 5, N'THIS WORKED OUT GOOD'),
(N'Janet', N'Wang', N'janet.wang2775@example.net', '2015-08-12', 5, N'rating this 4 stars as the price is about $10. As long as you get it for this price, you are golden. The large world they created is nice, but not close in size to gta5. It''s similar though and I''m not sure all that extra ''unvisited space'' matters for most people. They do have a very nice and tight story to the game. I enjoyed the combat more over the combat in gtaV. The story is also better in my opinion. It''s well worth $10 and if you haven''t picked it up, do so. I wouldn''t give the same recommendation at $60, $50 or even $40, but this is a good game at a now bargain price. I played on ''easy'', and loved it... as I generally ''suck'' at these type of game, but wanted to enjoy the story. You veteran shooters will obviously choose a higher difficulty level. It''s a great game, though it does have it''s flaws.. however, for $10, I think you can overlook them.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Long', N'kofi.long3297@example.org', '2015-08-12', 5, N'like'),
(N'Matthew', N'Lee', N'matthew.lee7921@example.net', '2015-08-12', 5, N'As expected, thanks!'),
(N'Walter', N'Henderson', N'walter.henderson2313@example.org', '2015-08-12', 3, N'My family has owned a G27 wheel for about five years. It has worked well for my purposes on my PC (and on my son''s PC, as he is the primary user of it now). On it''s own I would rate this product 4 1/2 to 5 stars. However due to Logitech''s poor support I have to downgrade this product significantly. - While the wheel was in storage for about a year, a large plastic screw that helps to hold the shifter in place was lost. After contacting Logitech for a replacement (which I was perfectly willing to pay for) I found that Logitech offers *no* replacement parts whatsoever for the G27 except for the power supply. (I was able to work around this particular issue.) - The wheel is now reaching the point where the potentiometers in the pedals appear to be wearing out, and the accelerator and brake are starting to act unreliably. The wheel is out of warranty, but I would be happy to pay for replacement pots or to have Logitech perform this service. However, Logitech does not sell this part...'),
(N'Walter', N'Henderson', N'walter.henderson2313@example.org', '2015-08-12', 2, N'The Logitech G29 Driving Force Race Wheel is a solid product. I say this as an owner of the previous Logitech G27 Racing Wheel for over five years. From all indications the G29 is built to the same standards as the G27 and I would expect the lifespan and reliability to be similar. Now that said, the two wheels are not *exactly* the same - the differences I am aware of are: - The G29 costs about $80 more than the G27 when it first came out. Value wise the G27 is better. - The G29 does not come with a shifter like the G27 does, instead it is a separate purchase. Another plus for the G27, though I will say this isn''t a big issue for me as I use the paddle shifters on the wheel almost exclusively. - The G29 is built to be compatible with the Sony PS4, while at this time the G27 cannot be used with the PS4. - Though this can be used on both the PS4 and a PC, the button layout obviously lend itself to PS4 use. (I am using it on a PC, mainly for iRacing.) - The brake pedal has been...'),
(N'Anita', N'Sanchez', N'anita.sanchez8349@example.com', '2015-08-12', 1, N'The consoles interface is irritating and the games are a little to focused on sales. One game I baugt actually had like 700+ dlc that the game actually makes commercial inside the game. Sold it and baught a Wii U instead and couldn''t be happier.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Kowalski', N'tyler.kowalski1551@example.org', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Addictive, never-ending adventure, play alone or with groups of people. The things to do are endless!!! This game has no competition. It is without doubt the best game of 2015!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Chavez', N'sharon.chavez8837@example.com', '2015-08-12', 3, N'Have played better pc games. This game can get pretty boring really quick. It''s nothing special, but it''s not bad either.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Mendoza', N'sandra.mendoza9307@example.org', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Great item'),
(N'Ravi', N'Green', N'ravi.green6019@example.org', '2015-08-12', 5, N'This is a bit tough to review, since it''s a compilation of games from rare library. For every battle toads and killer instinct, to some questionable games like jetpac, Banjo and kazooie nuts and bolts. First lets get the easy ones out of the way. Conker''s Bad Fur Day, is in the original N64 uncensored! Praise the sun! Jet Force Gemini again, in the original n64, however, in the original version was plagued with camera control issues and manual aiming was terrible. They fixed it, though slightly. It still an issue but not as bad at the original. The arcade Battletoads is amazingly fun! Enough said. Everything else is to your liking, for 30 bucks for 30 games, that''s a really good value a dollar a game. Definitely a compilation worth getting!'),
(N'Megan', N'Martinez', N'megan.martinez7326@example.org', '2015-08-12', 4, N'Gameplay is much like assassin''s creed. Very violent though.'),
(N'Justin', N'Scott', N'justin.scott6345@example.org', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Might Go Back 2 It Hearing There''s New DLC & All!'),
(N'Heather', N'Reed', N'heather.reed8133@example.net', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Best price for xbox live'),
(N'Heather', N'Reed', N'heather.reed8133@example.net', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Awesome Game'),
(N'Heather', N'Reed', N'heather.reed8133@example.net', '2015-08-12', 5, N'This case worked beyond my expectations. Very happy with the quality!'),
(N'Lauren', N'Walker', N'lauren.walker3331@example.com', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Omar', N'Patel', N'omar.patel9497@example.net', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Really great mouse. Really sturdy. The aluminium under body gives this mouse a high tech look. I actually prefer this mouse over the new RGB version. My only gripe that I could not get this mouse in military green.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Coleman', N'raymond.coleman5871@example.com', '2015-08-12', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Amara', N'Gray', N'amara.gray6055@example.net', '2015-08-13', 2, N'The Batmobile, the Batmobile, the Batmobile. It''s like they took everything great about Arkham City, took half of it away, and added in the Batmobile which is REQUIRED for a good portion of the game. Takes out the idea that you have options at your disposal, which should be Batman''s forte. That''s the main complaint with the game. Other than that, it''s just uninspired. The story has little to no draw and feels more like filler. I mean, after Arkham City it is obviously hard to make a decent follow up but still. The game is okay as a mediocre action game but it isn''t really an Arkham game. Just doesn''t have the feel anymore.'),
(N'Steven', N'Henderson', N'steven.henderson9816@example.com', '2015-08-13', 5, N'I don''t really play MMOs but I loved the idea of having all of my number keys within reach of my thumb for quickly selecting items and weapons in games like Garry''s Mod or Terraria so I decided to try this mouse out. This mouse is actually much smaller than I expected; I can use it easily on a rather small mouse mat. It feels comfortable, though a bit strange at first, in the hand. All of the buttons click nicely and the tilting mouse wheel is a neat feature that I actually find myself using quite a bit for various key bindings. But the reason you''re buying this mouse is for all of those numbered side keys. It took me a few days to get used to using them properly, and even now after a week I''m still not completely there. It will take you a while to acclimate your hand and fingers to a mouse like this especially if you''re coming from a simple mouse with five buttons like I am. That said, I''m already seeing the benefits of all of those side keys. In games like Dishonored I''m able to...'),
(N'Mei', N'Murphy', N'mei.murphy1525@example.net', '2015-08-13', 5, N'my 10 year old daughter loves this game.'),
(N'Maria', N'Garcia', N'maria.garcia4724@example.net', '2015-08-13', 5, N'What is there to complain about? Nothing, it''s a nice case designed to showcase your favorite amiibo.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Castillo', N'samantha.castillo2480@example.com', '2015-08-13', 5, N'A great game, great story, one of the best games to come out in a long time. It lives up to all the hype.'),
(N'Amara', N'Coleman', N'amara.coleman3462@example.com', '2015-08-13', 5, N'This product meets all expectations that I needed. I like the state as arrival at their destination. Brand new. I recommend this game for its magnificent history, verbal content, sound, graphics and environment in which it develops. RATING 90 points'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Cook', N'nicholas.cook6816@example.org', '2015-08-13', 3, N'Bought this at full price, which was probably not the best idea. Storyline is shaky at best, but if you ever enjoyed mech warrior games and FPS you''ll definitely enjoy this. It is pretty fast paced and there are lots of strategy that can be used between your titan and being on foot. Probably much more fun and easier to win matches if you are playing with a group of friends. When compared to a lot of FPS games these days this game doesn''t have too large of matches (8 people per?). It was entertaining, but as time passes this will probably be a small blip in the xbox one game library.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Reyes', N'thomas.reyes9676@example.net', '2015-08-13', 5, N'It arrived earlier than expected, good to use, and colorful! Definitely recommend this mouse!'),
(N'Dee', N'Patel', N'dee.patel2466@example.net', '2015-08-13', 1, N'HATE IT'),
(N'Nicole', N'Kowalski', N'nicole.kowalski2586@example.org', '2015-08-14', 5, N'okey'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Morales', N'tomasz.morales1268@example.org', '2015-08-14', 5, N'This was my first mechanical keyboard and let me tell ya, I wish I would have spent the money sooner. Typing is faster, more crisp with MUCH less spelling errors. The mechanical switches not only last forever, but they actuate faster than standard keyboards, they spring back harder, and have gold contacts that make missed keystrokes just short of impossible. Additionally, you don''t need to take advantage of the micro keys for it to be an exceptional keyboard.'),
(N'Carol', N'Wisniewski', N'carol.wisniewski4430@example.org', '2015-08-14', 5, N'Kinect is an amazing piece of technology and a great point of difference to consider when considering the various game systems. The kinect has amazing applications outside of gaming. Search the web and check it out!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Harris', N'kenneth.harris5324@example.net', '2015-08-14', 4, N'This is a great game, but to be honest, I couldn''t get into it. My son, however, has devoured it. He''s actually played through multiple times and is now attempting to achieve all the trophies and special achievements. I''m sure he would give it five stars, and he is much more in the target demographic than I am. I''ve watched him play some of the higher levels and the game truly is frightening. Extremely well done graphics, but the sound design is probably even superior to that.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Webb', N'jacob.webb9566@example.com', '2015-08-15', 5, N'awesome.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Howard', N'nicole.howard1709@example.net', '2015-08-15', 5, N'Great Madden very easy and like playing it because it has Jake ''The Snake'' Plummer before he retired. Fun game. Just real easy and brings back good memories of football back then. Easy to play and most all football fans will enjoy this game.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Scott', N'samantha.scott8249@example.net', '2015-08-15', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Emily', N'Parker', N'emily.parker7595@example.com', '2015-08-15', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Linda', N'Coleman', N'linda.coleman3103@example.com', '2015-08-15', 5, N'Great gift!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Morgan', N'jeffrey.morgan5040@example.org', '2015-08-15', 5, N'VERY FUN FOR MY 4 YEAR OLD This is very well made. It''s almost all live action Sesame Street characters interacting with the child playing the game. Mostly it watches like a normal episode of Sesame Street, but the characters ask you to do things. It starts off with Elmo throwing you a ball then asking you to throw it back. The game is full of things like that. And it works! The Kinect picks up my 4 year old and lets her play the game easily. What I can''t fully express in a review is my unbridled joy that was on my kid''s face as she played this game. She was beside herself with joy to have Elmo talking to her.'),
(N'Scott', N'Hall', N'scott.hall1232@example.org', '2015-08-15', 5, N'Switch to av to hdmi so i had a old tv sharp i use av plug plug only my tv had hdmi because all the input was use but the hdmi plug i but this product its awesome i set wii to 480p sed of 480p use 720p i don''t get 480p i just clean it up at least put graphics in it sed clean it up upgrade the poduct a bit'),
(N'Christina', N'Clark', N'christina.clark3230@example.org', '2015-08-15', 5, N'A nice and fun game for kids. Both my kids love playing this!'),
(N'Lauren', N'Henderson', N'lauren.henderson8491@example.com', '2015-08-16', 5, N'I am VERY much enjoying this game. I played it for over 6 hours the other day. Great strategy, endurance test, and first and foremost great hack and slash. Highly recommended : )'),
(N'Rachel', N'Suzuki', N'rachel.suzuki1669@example.net', '2015-08-16', 4, N'Good set but I wish they would put games that would load up and play'),
(N'Anita', N'Cooper', N'anita.cooper1167@example.com', '2015-08-16', 5, N'Played this game in the arcade at a Putt Putt before playing the home port. This game deserves a release on the Nintendo e-Shop.'),
(N'Debra', N'Thompson', N'debra.thompson7415@example.org', '2015-08-16', 5, N'This is by far the best headsets I have seen in my life, the sound is excellent and the 7.1 works flawless. Works on Windows 7(did not test on 8),10 and Mac. For the price, this is AWESOME. It very cheap, when you compare it to other headsets. This is definitely worth 6 stars.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Singh', N'olivia.singh3114@example.org', '2015-08-16', 5, N'gift'),
(N'Joan', N'Allen', N'joan.allen9397@example.com', '2015-08-16', 5, N'everything it''s OK'),
(N'Adam', N'Martin', N'adam.martin4055@example.com', '2015-08-16', 4, N'I love amiibos. They are so small and cute. However, I found my self an exact same one for retail price days after I bought one for 40 dolars. If you have time, I recommend going to retail and buy them. You will find more there. Also, if you have friends on retail that sell these, tell them to call you back so you can go buy it for retail price and sell it to a sucker on internet for a higher price.'),
(N'Megan', N'Webb', N'megan.webb1027@example.net', '2015-08-16', 5, N'Excellent service!! excellent product, very funny, very amused .. fast shipping'),
(N'Kevin', N'Smith', N'kevin.smith1016@example.com', '2015-08-16', 5, N'Good afternoon, good job.'),
(N'Steven', N'Moore', N'steven.moore7403@example.net', '2015-08-17', 5, N'Great artwork and engaging gameplay make this game really fun to play for a few minutes or lose several hours.'),
(N'Heather', N'Khan', N'heather.khan3147@example.com', '2015-08-17', 5, N'Just a fun, affordable game. Can really keep you entertained for quite a while. Although it can be a bit difficult for someone who doesn''t play many video games.'),
(N'Helen', N'Walker', N'helen.walker9816@example.net', '2015-08-17', 5, N'Awesome game, awesome price, nuff said'),
(N'Raymond', N'Butler', N'raymond.butler6687@example.org', '2015-08-17', 5, N'LOVE IT. My 6 year old son loves it so much he wants to replay the whole thing after we won every level and found all the minikits.'),
(N'Jason', N'Nelson', N'jason.nelson2764@example.com', '2015-08-17', 5, N'REALLY good for the price, but only defect is how the mouse is colored (not like the picture)'),
(N'Joseph', N'Perez', N'joseph.perez9864@example.org', '2015-08-17', 2, N'It should be a great game for family. The "zoo limit" ruined everything.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Edwards', N'cheryl.edwards1691@example.net', '2015-08-17', 1, N'These things literally came right off the PS4 thumbsticks after using them for about 30 seconds. They slide right off whenever you push hard against them. Complete waste of money.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Chen', N'ryan.chen4471@example.org', '2015-08-17', 5, N'goooddd'),
(N'Shirley', N'Barnes', N'shirley.barnes6380@example.net', '2015-08-17', 4, N'Since the playstation branded charger has disappeared I needed a replacement when the little modules were snapped off by my idiot children who don''t take care of things I purchased this one as it looked pretty child proof. This works well, it has little caps that plug into the mini usb port on the back and then it just drops into the charger. Have had no issues with it and worked well. Best charger I''ve been able to find for the PS3 controllers.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Davis', N'andrew.davis9627@example.net', '2015-08-17', 5, N'This T8 security tool did exactly what I needed it to do. It''s also magnetized making handling of the tiny screws easier. This was a solid purchase and worked well for taking apart my xbox 360 controller for cleaning.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Wilson', N'andrew.wilson2230@example.net', '2015-08-17', 5, N'Just might be the best Kingdom Hearts game. Ever. Made. There are 3 different characters & storylines to play through, the new gameplay mechanics are fun and the graphics are great! The multiplayer arena is a blast with friends and it''s nice to see some older protagonists come into play. It had me going for a 100% completion rating. Classic.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Green', N'amanda.green5148@example.org', '2015-08-17', 5, N'Great game!!..Can''t go wrong with any of the Medal Of Honor PC games!!...'),
(N'Carlos', N'Brooks', N'carlos.brooks5814@example.net', '2015-08-18', 1, N'I just bought this from game stop for $36 this is way over priced'),
(N'Henry', N'Reyes', N'henry.reyes3526@example.net', '2015-08-18', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Jack', N'Singh', N'jack.singh6062@example.com', '2015-08-18', 5, N'Great cable now I can play original xbox games in HD the cable is thick and very good quality Just remember to turn on HD settings on your original xbox or it won''t work Highly recommended'),
(N'Andrea', N'Singh', N'andrea.singh2733@example.net', '2015-08-18', 5, N'I love this game.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Ivanov', N'thomas.ivanov2545@example.net', '2015-08-18', 5, N'This is a great mouse. You can tell it''s a chinese brand but the quality is good, and it is very inexpensive; so if it breaks I''ll just buy another one. The weights are a nice bonus. I wish you could turn the LED at night, it can be a little bright. Other than that great mouse, great quality.'),
(N'James', N'Sanchez', N'james.sanchez1255@example.com', '2015-08-18', 3, N'Was almost on the verge of sending it back when I got it to work. While the system. Has the power on. You have to slam the Gba game into the top in order for it to work. At least that''s how it was for me.. Not the best product but the only of its kind. For now.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Diaz', N'kelly.diaz2059@example.org', '2015-08-18', 5, N'Best motocross game on the market'),
(N'Jessica', N'Collins', N'jessica.collins7749@example.net', '2015-08-18', 4, N'great case'),
(N'Kelly', N'Cox', N'kelly.cox1533@example.com', '2015-08-18', 4, N'Meh, buttons are somewhat stiff'),
(N'Hannah', N'Morgan', N'hannah.morgan9244@example.com', '2015-08-18', 5, N'As someone who is a big fan of the Revolutionary War era in America, and pirates, this collection is perfect. I haven''t had much of a chance to play Liberation or Black Flag, but Assassin''s Creed 3 is a lot of fun. I''m a huge fan of the series, and look forward to completing the games. I love it when a company packages a few games in their series together for a bargain.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Ortiz', N'carolyn.ortiz8679@example.com', '2015-08-18', 5, N'awesomeness so far.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Richardson', N'carlos.richardson1467@example.org', '2015-08-18', 3, N'5 Stars when the game came out, after completing the first few raids my friends and I all gave up. To much milking the consumer for just not enough content. I feel like developers are trying to find this balance of getting the most while doing the least and Destiny went way to far in one direction. It was worth playing to level up and enjoy the experience with my friends but not to keep paying a developer who thinks I am to stupid to know better.'),
(N'Charles', N'Wilson', N'charles.wilson1712@example.com', '2015-08-18', 5, N'Not much to add that hasn''t already been said, but I thoroughly enjoyed this game. Not only was the main story and gameplay entertaining, but the item collection was fun and added some replay value. I''m looking forward to the sequel coming to the PS4 in 2016.'),
(N'George', N'Robinson', N'george.robinson6163@example.com', '2015-08-19', 5, N'Dude, it''s lego and Marvel. Of course it''s great. Buy it man, buy it.'),
(N'Scott', N'Scott', N'scott.scott4462@example.net', '2015-08-19', 5, N'Great game for a fantastic price!!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Gutierrez', N'jacqueline.gutierrez1466@example.com', '2015-08-19', 5, N'Thanks for speedy service , and game came better than described'),
(N'Jerry', N'Boyd', N'jerry.boyd6354@example.org', '2015-08-19', 5, N'Danganronpa is something of a love letter to point-and-click adventure games, social sims, and the Ace Attorney games all at once. You play as a High School Freshman by the name of Makoto Naegi, who receives an invitation to attend the elite high school Hope''s Peak Academy. But before he even steps into his first class, he suddenly finds himself in a bizarre prison version of Hope''s Peak. Makoto and the other fourteen students are forced by the despair-obsessed Monokuma to participate in a Killing Game, where the only way to leave the school is to kill without getting caught. There are plenty of twists and turns in the plot, but they are all predetermined. You, like Makoto, don''t have much control over who lives and dies, as failing to determine the real killer in the Class Trial sections will net you a game over. So whatever you do, do NOT read anything about this game''s story anywhere! In fact, stop reading these product reviews and go play it!'),
(N'Emily', N'Ward', N'emily.ward4368@example.com', '2015-08-19', 5, N'Fun game, has a good learning curve and has kept me invested for days of racing'),
(N'Pamela', N'Richardson', N'pamela.richardson5106@example.com', '2015-08-19', 5, N'Great quality, and definitely a great product. A must have for any Amiibo collector!'),
(N'Scott', N'Hughes', N'scott.hughes2245@example.com', '2015-08-20', 5, N'This stand not only keeps my PS4 fairly cool, but it charges the controllers automatically while the PS4 is off. I''m especially pleased with this purchase.'),
(N'Noah', N'Gomez', N'noah.gomez2131@example.org', '2015-08-20', 5, N'Why wouldn''t you invest in the two upcoming expansions for the greatest game ever made? And at half the price of the lame Arkham Knight season pass, you''d be foolish not to.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Bell', N'sandra.bell1979@example.net', '2015-08-20', 5, N'Excellent product fast shipping! very good craftsmanship and worth more than paid. i Will definitely buy more from this seller. It was hard to get a copy of this game as it''s one of my favorites and i love it. They should make a second as i enjoy this more than the wwe 2k games'),
(N'Judith', N'Adams', N'judith.adams4624@example.org', '2015-08-20', 5, N'havent had a problem yet. been using it a couple weeks now. fits in good, doesnt shake around, and works great. JUST BEWARE that is drains the hell out of yourr batteries with the headset and mic attatched'),
(N'Alexander', N'Myers', N'alexander.myers4905@example.org', '2015-08-20', 5, N'It''s got all the classics. It was defiantly a different time in gaming.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Barnes', N'alexander.barnes2492@example.org', '2015-08-20', 1, N'My my opinion this game its ok but its not worth 59.99 !!!'),
(N'Gary', N'Anderson', N'gary.anderson1470@example.com', '2015-08-20', 4, N'My son likes this game and says that everything is good about it except there''s only 9 different guns that you can use.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Morris', N'jeremy.morris9187@example.com', '2015-08-20', 1, N'awful'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Morris', N'jeremy.morris9187@example.com', '2015-08-20', 3, N'not much of a challenge, but kirby is still lovable.'),
(N'Omar', N'Cooper', N'omar.cooper9356@example.net', '2015-08-20', 5, N'Great game. Extremely underrated. One of the best games I''ve played in a long time. Highly recommend. The more you play the more you learn to appreciate all the details, etc. Hint: use stealth in last section. Be patient while playing. Enemies can be tough. I recommend playing it on easy the first time through to learn the enemies and the mechanics. I would also recommend using the default abilities and build those up the first time through as well. Good graphics, story, exploration and gameplay. Reminds a bit like darks souls believe it or not. There is a ton of replay value, and there are different outcomes based on your decisions. This game is excellent.'),
(N'Omar', N'Cooper', N'omar.cooper9356@example.net', '2015-08-20', 4, N'One of the best survival horror of late. Second being Alan Wake.'),
(N'Jose', N'Jackson', N'jose.jackson6068@example.net', '2015-08-20', 3, N'I suggest that if you want to buy this product, get it at the lowest price possible. Contains standard characters that don''t have a high resale and the special item just becomes a big bomb and magical attack in the newer Skylander''s games.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ward', N'jeremy.ward5196@example.org', '2015-08-21', 5, N'Good game was fun so far :)'),
(N'Brian', N'Lee', N'brian.lee9346@example.org', '2015-08-21', 5, N'great'),
(N'Tyler', N'Singh', N'tyler.singh7841@example.org', '2015-08-21', 5, N'At its core, Rocket League is a pretty simple game. You have two teams of cars. They play soccer. They also have rockets that let them boost. That''s the game. From this simple setup comes a nearly infinite amount of strategies and possibilities, which adds a surprising amount of depth to the game. The controls are spot-on, allowing extremely precise plays and the physics feel natural, despite the bizarre scenario the game presents. The gameplay is fun and addictive, creating a "just one more game" mentality. Everytime you hit the ball feels satisfying and powerful. In terms of features, the game allows 1v1, 2v2, 3v3, and 4v4 matches, with both ranked and unranked play. The splitscreen mode is a welcome offering and something not seen often on PC. There are also training modes to help you practice shooting and protecting your goals, which is nice. There could be some more variety in the arenas (all of them are functionally identical) and some more game modes, such as a demolition...'),
(N'Jacob', N'Alvarez', N'jacob.alvarez6116@example.com', '2015-08-21', 1, N'Seller failed to disclose that the use of the controller was cutoff by a patch to the PS3''s firmware (yes, this patch came out long before the controller was purchased, which I found out after researching why I was having issues). It''s basically a paperweight now.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Miller', N'dennis.miller9564@example.org', '2015-08-21', 5, N'Great gaming mouse for the price. Did not think I would like a wired one. I am very suprised at how comfortable it is. The wire is very high quality and made to last. Now I no longer deal with constantly having to change batteries or rechargeable ones. So far this is the best one I have used yet.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Thompson', N'brandon.thompson3306@example.com', '2015-08-21', 3, N'Decent overall, but it slides around because it has no grips of any kind on the bottom, and it also does not support mouse keys. Only keyboard. The excessive size also makes it difficult to activate keys in succession. Seems it''s supposed to be designed to just place your foot on it and rock it in different directions to activate keys. But due to the sheer size, I have to lift my foot and press it down directly on one of the four sides to activate a key. Finally, the software supposedly has a function to automatically switch profiles based on the active program, much like razer synapse. In reality though this feature just does not work.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Garcia', N'kyle.garcia4560@example.org', '2015-08-21', 5, N'free game twice a month how can you go wrong ;-)'),
(N'Kyle', N'Garcia', N'kyle.garcia4560@example.org', '2015-08-21', 3, N'loved the sims 3 but it locks my cpu up all the time'),
(N'Melissa', N'Price', N'melissa.price4859@example.org', '2015-08-22', 3, N'The controller actually uses the mic to pick up the clapping you make with your hands. Not recommended to be played in loud environments. Your hands may hurt after playing for a while. Beating on the controller does feel nice. They should have made these drums larger'),
(N'Shirley', N'Wright', N'shirley.wright4199@example.org', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Resident Evil Revelations 2 has brought back the fear that the earlier Resident Evil games once had. There seems to be more mystery to it and they really intensified the gore in this one. It''s a lot better than some of the latest Resident Evils. I feel like they did a good job with the storyline as well. I highly recommend this amazing game.'),
(N'John', N'Adams', N'john.adams3243@example.org', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Kevin', N'Morales', N'kevin.morales8813@example.com', '2015-08-22', 5, N'good'),
(N'Aaron', N'Hughes', N'aaron.hughes2955@example.org', '2015-08-22', 4, N'When I wanted to buy a gaming headset I was looking for 3 things 1. Comfort- they had to feel great on my head because I would use them for hours at a time, and 2. A good mic- I had to be able to speak clearly, while I play. and 3. They had to look stylish. Well these headsets pass the style mark. In the day, they''re just cool to look at. But when It lights up, you''d better prepare for max levels of sexiness because that''s just how they look. They are very comfortable, with the memory foam in the ear padding the head rest. The sound quality is great. Also they have some noise cancelling features due to the ear padding. By themselves they reduce a pretty good amount of noise, and with other audio, they reduce a lot more. I was able to drown out my roommates guitar playing using these, and he''s using an amp. They are very large, in fact they cover my entire ears which is very nice, and way better than pressing down on your ears. I''ve heard time and time again, that the mic is amazing...'),
(N'Daniel', N'Sanders', N'daniel.sanders1887@example.com', '2015-08-22', 4, N'I have never played the ones on PlayStation but this one is good.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Walker', N'kevin.walker4894@example.org', '2015-08-22', 4, N'The mouse has been working well for the last year or so. It''s super accurate and responsive. It''s kind of a hassle to remap buttons, and it regularly forgets the mappings I stored in it, but I can live with that. The battery life isn''t great when you''re using it wirelessly, expect to recharge it after ~10 hours of continuous use, so every few days more or less.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Walker', N'olivia.walker7868@example.com', '2015-08-22', 1, N'Dead save battery'),
(N'Samuel', N'Barnes', N'samuel.barnes4043@example.org', '2015-08-22', 4, N'Per my teenaged children: packaged well --instructions clear --cord was good and it seems sturdy (my daughter runs cross country and uses this while she runs) --totally soundproof (believe me, I''ve yelled within three feet of my daughter to get her attention) --good sound quality --it''s a bit overpriced (my son said he would not buy this unless it was $50-75) --used with phone, computer and xbox with no problem --mike quality is very sensitive (my son''s friends could hear me fussing at him for not taking out the garbage) --wireless is not the best and breaks up after about four hours.'),
(N'Joan', N'Nguyen', N'joan.nguyen3513@example.net', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Nintendo, you did it this time. You really did make the BEST POKEMON GAME EVER! The gameplay, the music, the level design, and most of all, the storyline, is all incredible and way beyond anything I''ve played before. The game is actually quite sad toward the ending, but it gets way better. The replay value is incredible, you will want to keep coming back for more! I''ve spent 72 hours playing this game, and I haven''t touched it for a year (because I lost it). Please, buy this, you will not be disappointed.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Kumar', N'alexander.kumar7120@example.com', '2015-08-22', 5, N'great'),
(N'Kevin', N'Foster', N'kevin.foster7369@example.org', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Easy fast set up. Very quick delivery.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Foster', N'brandon.foster6073@example.net', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Great gaming mouse, I bought it to play world of warcraft'),
(N'Anna', N'Reyes', N'anna.reyes5397@example.com', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Aaron', N'Collins', N'aaron.collins8297@example.com', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Been playing this game since 1998 when I was 7. Thanks :)'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ramirez', N'michelle.ramirez7242@example.com', '2015-08-22', 5, N'Worked Great!!! BADASS game!!!'),
(N'Adam', N'Reed', N'adam.reed2733@example.net', '2015-08-23', 2, N'Intellivision ported over to the ds simply does not work.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Reed', N'patricia.reed8135@example.net', '2015-08-23', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Anderson', N'yuki.anderson8307@example.com', '2015-08-23', 5, N'Love it. Good style of gameplay for a series that is traditionally encapsulated and turnbased combat system. the realtime mechanics are very interesting.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Anderson', N'yuki.anderson8307@example.com', '2015-08-23', 5, N'One of my fave ps2 titles. Classic RPG.'),
(N'Richard', N'Coleman', N'richard.coleman4215@example.com', '2015-08-23', 4, N'little touchy but still works so im satisfied.'),
(N'Richard', N'Coleman', N'richard.coleman4215@example.com', '2015-08-23', 5, N'game was cool but i didn''t play it i bough it for my ex so the game is cool so im giving it a 5 star but i wish i didn''t waste the money now lol'),
(N'Ashley', N'Martin', N'ashley.martin3052@example.net', '2015-08-23', 5, N'Top of the line bag'),
(N'Brian', N'Brown', N'brian.brown5821@example.com', '2015-08-23', 5, N'I love these. Better grip for all size hands to keep from dropping slippery Xbox controllers. Grandsons like that I bought different colors to define ''their'' controller.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Parker', N'cynthia.parker7871@example.net', '2015-08-23', 5, N'LOVE LOVE LOVE IT!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Wang', N'kathleen.wang6123@example.com', '2015-08-23', 5, N'I was a little hesitant to get a 3DS. I hadn''t necessarily heard the greatest things about any of the DS versions, but this thing is awesome. As a Nintendo kid it''s just a nice thing to have when you want to play the newest versions of Nintendo''s updated classics without having to depend on whatever console(s) you have; as someone who likes video games, it''s nice to have just for a quick bit of playing to get out of your head and enjoy some moderately challenging, but very addicting games. The overall 3D aspect of it is rather funky, but it doesn''t really take away from anything, because you can turn the 3D on and off very easily. Also, it''s about as stupid as anything can get that the charger doesn''t come with it, and you actually have to either order it separately or get this bundle. But I guess it just wouldn''t be Nintendo if there wasn''t some kind of terrible product marketing!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Wang', N'kathleen.wang6123@example.com', '2015-08-23', 5, N'I mean, if you have to get another controller, there''s nothing better than one with Toad on it. The only thing I don''t like is that it''s mostly just white so it kind of just looks like a standard Wii controller.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Brooks', N'raymond.brooks6441@example.com', '2015-08-23', 1, N'Did not like this game. Too many updates. Never had a chance to play. Wasted 3 days waiting for it to update/upgrade. When it finally did come up it was so difficult to figure out I just traded it.'),
(N'Christine', N'Wisniewski', N'christine.wisniewski5694@example.com', '2015-08-23', 1, N'I purchased this hoping to replace my current amazon fire stick with a beefier device (xbone). I mistakenly assumed that this would be wireless/bluetooth, not IR. In 2015 I would hope we would no longer need to point a remote directly at a console for it to function, but I guess Microsoft disagrees. Pros: * Looks nice * Functions * Volume controls work with TV, which is nice Cons * IR, not bluetooth/wireles. In my case, while I can see the xbone there is a table in front of it that often blocks this remote from functioning half the time. * Very heavy - I''d guess 3x as heavy as the fire stick remote * Very thick - Again, easily 3x as thick as the fire stick remote Conclusion: For an extra ~$10, get a fire stick. Don''t bother with this thing.'),
(N'Priya', N'Watson', N'priya.watson1222@example.org', '2015-08-24', 5, N'Very good game, excellent graphics....'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Flores', N'kenneth.flores7414@example.org', '2015-08-24', 5, N'Thank You'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Ferreira', N'kathleen.ferreira9668@example.org', '2015-08-24', 3, N'product is as described'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Nowak', N'kenneth.nowak2392@example.com', '2015-08-24', 4, N'Love the feeling of it an all, but both controllers have a little annoying problem. On the blue controller, I have to push the X and Triangle button a bit harder for them to respond, at least on the red controller it''s just the Triangle button that needs to be pushed a bit harder'),
(N'Samuel', N'Jimenez', N'samuel.jimenez9445@example.net', '2015-08-24', 3, N'not liking it as much as Sims 3. Limited play options.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wright', N'kelly.wright6706@example.com', '2015-08-24', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Ronald', N'Richardson', N'ronald.richardson5992@example.org', '2015-08-25', 5, N'no issues'),
(N'John', N'Khan', N'john.khan3535@example.com', '2015-08-25', 1, N'Didn''t care for'),
(N'Yuki', N'Okonkwo', N'yuki.okonkwo8189@example.org', '2015-08-25', 4, N'My son says its pretty fun. You can play many, many characters.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Tanaka', N'victoria.tanaka4740@example.net', '2015-08-25', 4, N'Very nice sensor and surface finish. Side grips are very nice. Not a lot of options for color customizing. Cheap feeling materials, but it makes the mouse lighter. Thumb buttons are very tactile and just the right amount of pressure for clicking. Right mouse button is very very easy to press, and I find myself accidentally clicking it when games get more intense. Edit: I have had this mouse for 2 months now. It is still working great, but it has some creaking in the mouse shell now. Edit (6 months): Forward side button is uneven and shell feels creaky. Braided cable has no frays! If razer only did one thing right, it would be the cord'),
(N'Debra', N'Williams', N'debra.williams5187@example.com', '2015-08-25', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Edward', N'Garcia', N'edward.garcia8696@example.org', '2015-08-25', 5, N'My old 360 finally got the RROD and I used this to replace it. Pretty much all I had to do was to replace the hard drive with my original hard drive.'),
(N'Angela', N'Flores', N'angela.flores4380@example.net', '2015-08-25', 5, N'Very good game'),
(N'Jacob', N'Torres', N'jacob.torres8369@example.com', '2015-08-25', 5, N'Had 10 hours to paly this bad boy before the release today so I thought I''d give my two cents. First of all, I usually go with ps4 games, but I couldn''t resist having the ability to play it for 10 horus before release with EA access. EA access basically lets'' you play games early, which is a good thing. And I have to say I''m very pleased with the XBONE Version of Madden. Madden took years to come to form. I''ve played it since it''s first arrival on the beloved Sega Genesis and look what we got now? It''s had a rocky road here and there, and I understand it''s been under heat for being too much like the previous years game, but no worries, they give you just enough to make it feel new. Madden 16 is the first game to utilize penalties to their potential. We finally have them and they work! Pass interference calls? Yep sure are. Holding? Yep. Defensive holding? Sure thing. Late hits penalty calls? You bet! This makes the game feel more like a real game. I haven''t decided if they''re over...'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ali', N'jessica.ali4578@example.net', '2015-08-25', 4, N'Great game for gamecube'),
(N'Mark', N'Parker', N'mark.parker9660@example.net', '2015-08-25', 2, N'Having enjoyed Sniper Elite 2 and 3 very much, I was anxious to get my hands on this title. I gather that prior to the advent of XBox One, it was only available "out of region." At any rate, the things that appealed to me about Sniper Elite were the opportunities to deliberate, plan, and execute. Lots of stealth, taking on challenges sensibly, in a reasoned order, more or less at my own pace, and being rewarded for such deliberation and care. If that''s what you liked about this company''s products, throw your expectations out the window. Zombie Army is basically a twitch fest, where the "game" rapidly becomes surviving hordes of enemies thrown at you incessantly. There is zero opportunity for deliberation or strategy. You might as well go play Call of Duty or Halo, since there''s no functional difference. Fans of stealth, deliberation, strategy and care: stay away.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Campbell', N'patricia.campbell1678@example.net', '2015-08-25', 5, N'This was probably one of the best buys I''ve ever done - value wise. I mean, you can wither get a 500gb version for $345 or pay the extra $45 and get 1TB (double the storage?) The 500gb console can probably hold like 20 games while this can hold a ton. I have both Halo and Far Cry 4 on this beautiful disaster and I have only used 11% of the capacity. Being Far Cry is like 20gb and MCC is like 60gb. Not to mention the operating system and files for the console take up more space than the games. You can''t go wrong with the 1TB. There is no reason to get 500G now this model is out. Unless you''re seriously strapped for cash it''s a harder decision, but if your so strapped - don''t buy a console. As for Halo bundled with it, the game is actually not very good. It''ll take you ages to get into a lobby and the single layer campaigns are just plain boring. I only play co-op on the story for this reason. It seems like the stories are all there to just grind out the 6k achievements you get for...'),
(N'Jason', N'Morales', N'jason.morales4535@example.org', '2015-08-25', 1, N'i wish i never bought this game. This game is the biggest disappointment i have ever felt with a game. You can''t do meat shield, grenade tag a wall,or two piece. If anybody sniped you, is an automatic headshot. I feel tricked into thinking that i would get every gears of war collection, but all i get is the first Gears of war. Why would a company even make the first Gears of war when in reality Gears of war 2 was the best seller out of all the series. i wish i could get my money back but i bought the digital copy of this game, never again will i buy a digital copy of any game (unless is "the last of us 2") .'),
(N'Julie', N'Rivera', N'julie.rivera9878@example.net', '2015-08-25', 4, N'Keys are a bit sticky but obviously need to be broken in. Keyboard is fantastic for the most part. For anyone not able to find out, FN + Scroll Lock key changes the color of the keyboard. The mouse is great, only complaint being you have no control of the color. It cycles, which is still pretty cool. The mouse pad is very large and works well with the mouse. For gaming, I definitely recommend this keyboard. Especially for those of us who love to game and don''t want to spend a lot of money on a keyboard. This is a great buy as far as quality and as far as the price goes.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Garcia', N'joseph.garcia3367@example.net', '2015-08-25', 4, N'I didn''t believe the negative reviews about this when I bought it, it is an excellent game, and gives you more covert operations type missions, one that Navy SEALs actually participate in.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Fisher', N'jeremy.fisher4833@example.com', '2015-08-25', 5, N'So far I have 5 Amiibos (yes, amiibos with an "s", I don''t care if the plural is amiibo), Palutena, Pit (J), Dark Pit (J), Yoshi and Link. Palutena is my favorite by far, she''s heavy so it give the impresion of being sturdy and the details in her ornaments and clothes are amazing. My only complaing is that her eyes are the wrong color, blue and were suppose to be green, which is weird considering how detailed everything else is, but I''m not to take away a star for something so small. Totally worth the $13 I paid.'),
(N'Noah', N'Ferreira', N'noah.ferreira8861@example.com', '2015-08-25', 4, N'I don''t know why this didn''t get more mainstream attention. Have you ever watched a campy horror movie like Friday the 13 and yelled at your tv because of stupid choices the people make...if so until dawn is perfect. Instead of tellin at the tv you will be yelling at yourself. First off let me start by saying the opening scene is straight up awesome it sets the tone for the whole game. The graphics are what truly stands out as it are probably the best out there on ps4 right now. Gameplay is like heavy rain sort of... So if you''re thinking you''re in control the whole time you''re not. It''s very cinematic that''s why it''s an interactive game. The characters are likable and some dis likable and you can improve or decreases stats like humor, honesty, relationship, trust, and stuff like that. It will help shape out the character or characters fate. The game also has great variety in horror, nearly every element in the horror genre is in this game and there are some plot twists that...'),
(N'Joan', N'Kim', N'joan.kim7274@example.com', '2015-08-25', 4, N'I really wish Amazon would let us do half stars in reviews because 5 out of 5 is too high but 4 out of 5 is too low, but to me the game is closer to 80 than 100, so I wanted to keep the rating realistic. Each year of the PS4 / XB1 era, Madden has continuously improved in many areas, but still lacks in the additions on the CFM side; which keeps it from reaching a perfect score. The area they have best excelled in is gameplay, and it has come a LONG way since it''s current gen debut. The great part of the gameplay comes with a new wrinkle of the WR/DB interactions. It feels like there is a true jostling between the two players with true results. Not only do you get true results, but the animations and look and feel are fresh with every pass attempt. Speaking of the pass attempts, you can do a lot with QB to get it to the WR in the best possible way from holding down the button for a bullet pass, double tapping the button for a touch pass, or tapping the button once for a lob. You can...'),
(N'David', N'Wood', N'david.wood4857@example.org', '2015-08-25', 1, N'Terrible, the 1TB hard drive is nice, but i still have the same problems as the other xbone models. The system looks like an 80s oversized VCR, the system overheats every 15 minutes, and the UI is ugly. Save your money and get a ps4!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Jackson', N'nadia.jackson2788@example.org', '2015-08-25', 3, N'I bought this as I use my XBONE for other things in addition to games. I bought this to navigate easier than a controller. HOWEVER, all the onscreen options have corresponding xbox button choices (A, B, X, Y) and there are none letter options on this remote. That''s pretty annoying. Other than that, it''s alright.'),
(N'Robert', N'Morgan', N'robert.morgan6977@example.com', '2015-08-26', 1, N'Does not run on windows 7. Warning on disc states may take several minutes to load. Yes it does than does nothing. Don,t waste your money'),
(N'Jerry', N'Richardson', N'jerry.richardson5507@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'Great game. Madden just keeps getting better every year.'),
(N'Richard', N'Coleman', N'richard.coleman7515@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'Works well!'),
(N'Charles', N'Anderson', N'charles.anderson1260@example.net', '2015-08-26', 5, N'gift for my daughter to add to her collection'),
(N'Matthew', N'Kumar', N'matthew.kumar2036@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'Shipped through Itembazaar and came in great condition, even though I had to clean it, it works great. The gameplay is fun and addicting. Anyone starting an NES must get this classic title.'),
(N'Debra', N'Chen', N'debra.chen2738@example.net', '2015-08-26', 1, N'Terrible. i got these and within one hour, boom, they don''t work. i setup everything the way they were supposed to be, but it just won''t put any sound through at all. Not worth your 40$'),
(N'David', N'Martinez', N'david.martinez7830@example.net', '2015-08-26', 5, N'This needed to be done - both games, one price, for the "next gen" consoles - very nice'),
(N'Eric', N'Bennett', N'eric.bennett8113@example.org', '2015-08-26', 5, N'Code worked perfectly. I have always loved this series. For $10 I could not pass up owning it on PC. Very satisfied.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Phillips', N'ronald.phillips5673@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Patrick', N'Singh', N'patrick.singh1928@example.com', '2015-08-26', 3, N'I found this game to be quite a let down. I had expected an open wold Simpsons game, it wasn''t what I got. The camera movement and controls were hard to use. The saving grace for this game does have to be the animated cut scenes and the humor. None the less this game was a pain to play!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ali', N'jessica.ali2016@example.net', '2015-08-26', 4, N'The actual in game play is amazing, the best Madden has ever been! They really went all out fixing in game mechanics here, the fight for the ball while it''s in the air feature is amazing, and unlike Maddens of the past, this one actually got the defense right! No longer can a rated 70 tackle block a rated 90''s defensive end perfectly, or an offensive line block for ten seconds every play (it happens, but like in real life, it doesn''t happen often), meaning you have to keep a tight end or a halfback in to block if your line isn''t very good. The entire physics of the game is just amazing, and it takes strategy to win a game, not just chucking the ball on a post route every other play to get massive yards, the defense will stop things you do often, like in real life they adjust as the game goes on. The offense also has a few new pocket and qb features that make things feel much more real. 5 stars for that. Now onto why I gave it 4 stars instead of 5. Franchise mode is pretty much how...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Robinson', N'joyce.robinson3300@example.org', '2015-08-26', 5, N'great value and excellent product'),
(N'Jose', N'Singh', N'jose.singh8445@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'Works great. Does what it is designed to do. However, makes you look like a mega-nerd wearing a hat with a visor clip with 3 reflective tips on the bill. Make sure to lock your doors and board up the windows when using this. You DO NOT want people seeing you wearing and using this. That would almost guarantee you living a life of loneliness and solitude. However, that may not be a bad/big tradeoff since you can play Euro Truck Sim 2 and War Thunder and a variety of other "vehicle" type games with full control over looking around. But really, don''t get caught wearing this. 10/10 product. Thanks TrackIR!'),
(N'Peter', N'Young', N'peter.young4525@example.org', '2015-08-26', 1, N'What another waste of time thanks Sony just keep bringing the garbage. Just and another cinematic game .'),
(N'Ethan', N'Martin', N'ethan.martin2733@example.net', '2015-08-26', 5, N'This is the best Tower Defence game I have played since Pixeljunk Monsters. The fact you can switch from Tower Defence into first person shooter really pushes this game over the top. As others have mentioned the characters on the front from Assassins Creed, He-Man, G.I. Joe, and Cobra are DLC but if you buy the disc version you get a code that unlocks them. Standard armies are fun enough if you don''t want to spend the extra. This game is addictive and super fun, for this price it''s worth every cent!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Cruz', N'pamela.cruz2736@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'The game is improved in every way, though not leaps and bounds over Madden 15 because that game was good in itself. More realistic football situations are included this year -- ie. penalties, big time catches (focus is definitely on WR/DB matchup). Graphics (particularly player face scans) & overall presentation (more realistic crowds) are also slightly improved. If you''re a die hard football fan, then upgrading to Madden 16 is worth it due to it''s upgrades /improvements. Worth noting that Prime members get $10.00 off ($49.99).'),
(N'Jack', N'Ivanov', N'jack.ivanov8309@example.com', '2015-08-26', 4, N'Is a great keyboard, simple design and nice feel. My only complain is that the caps led wasn''t working, I had to disassemble it to repair it but that was a quick fix.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Alvarez', N'hannah.alvarez8114@example.net', '2015-08-26', 5, N'This game is a lot of fun and my son really loves it! I love how realistic it is in that it takes a lot of time to complete tasks just as it does on the farm.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Kelly', N'kathleen.kelly5227@example.net', '2015-08-26', 1, N'The review for this game is the same for all others: same game with updated rosters. Nothing new regarding menus, gameplay, etc. I should''ve just updated my rosters in my previous Madden game. Don''t waste your money.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Stewart', N'gregory.stewart6275@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'ps4 game'),
(N'Timothy', N'Russell', N'timothy.russell8079@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'I''ve bought this game, like, 3 times now. It''s that good!'),
(N'Eric', N'Ward', N'eric.ward7816@example.com', '2015-08-26', 5, N'Its Yoshi, and he is made out of yarn. You know you want it.'),
(N'Julie', N'Chen', N'julie.chen9870@example.net', '2015-08-27', 5, N'great mouse, smooth scrolling and mouse sailing. clickers are nice haha love the mouse by far.. I can only complain about the price. other then that, I love it!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Wisniewski', N'christopher.wisniewski3222@example.net', '2015-08-27', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Nathan', N'Brown', N'nathan.brown5680@example.com', '2015-08-27', 5, N'The Playstation TV/Vita is amazing! works great too! using my ps3 controller to control the ps4 system through this. *Note: a fast router is recommended.'),
(N'Jason', N'Ramos', N'jason.ramos2005@example.org', '2015-08-27', 5, N'Love the series'),
(N'Helen', N'Hall', N'helen.hall5515@example.com', '2015-08-28', 5, N'Works great!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Walker', N'elizabeth.walker1339@example.com', '2015-08-28', 1, N'Press F to Pay Respects'),
(N'Zachary', N'Sanchez', N'zachary.sanchez5219@example.org', '2015-08-28', 5, N'Better than last years and I thought last years sucked compared to M25 . Worth the money.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Adams', N'raymond.adams3368@example.net', '2015-08-28', 5, N'Fits under my ps4 seamlessly and you can''t even hear it running. The additional usb slots are a terrific addition.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Mendoza', N'jerry.mendoza9758@example.com', '2015-08-28', 5, N'This game is cool for kids because they get to see what people do at work. This is what my grandsons told me because I bought it for them to enjoy. They play it a lot and get excited at the interactions and communication between the individuals. It''s fun to watch and listen to the boys playing the game because of their reactions to the romance life of their characters. Sometimes it''s incredibly shocking to them! For instance, unlikely people end up marrying!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Sullivan', N'aaron.sullivan6120@example.org', '2015-08-28', 5, N'My favorite gaming mouse so far, been using it for a long while now and it''s still going strong. Definitely would recommend as a budget mouse if you don''t wanna splurge on high quality. Mouse is overall comfortable to use though, and the double-click button definitely comes in handy.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nelson', N'sandra.nelson6281@example.com', '2015-08-28', 4, N'I''m satisfied with the PS4 camera''s function overall, except the camera''s field of view is slightly narrow. But other than that it''s a great peripheral.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Baker', N'kevin.baker2185@example.net', '2015-08-28', 5, N'My xbox has never been cooler, I can feel the warm air leaving the system and the system box itself is cool to the touch. Great investment for the longevity of my system. Well worth the purchase.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Torres', N'kelly.torres9138@example.com', '2015-08-28', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Jose', N'Thomas', N'jose.thomas9884@example.com', '2015-08-28', 5, N'Love this game and it came with extras :)'),
(N'Gary', N'Adams', N'gary.adams6651@example.com', '2015-08-28', 5, N'This game is totally comparable to The Legend of Zelda in its constant action and nonlinear progression. I would consider it even better in a couple of ways; for example, you can equip multiple different weapons/armor/shields/spells and rotate them out at will depending on the situation. You have to figure out which combo to use for different opponents. It also has a leveling system, an EXCELLENT save system (you can save/load anywhere on the map except for certain hostile zones). The combat system is also a precursor to The Secret of Mana and I would even say Secret of Mana ripped this off a bit. The music is irresistible after a few listens, the controls are snappy, and the graphics are colorful. I am really surprised this isn''t more famous. CHECK IT OUT!'),
(N'Mary', N'Mendoza', N'mary.mendoza7616@example.net', '2015-08-28', 5, N'really like the series'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Price', N'carolyn.price3233@example.net', '2015-08-28', 5, N'Arrived on time and was easy to put on. Exactly what I was expecting'),
(N'Robert', N'Wisniewski', N'robert.wisniewski7931@example.net', '2015-08-28', 4, N'Excellent product and seller!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Ortiz', N'evelyn.ortiz4768@example.com', '2015-08-28', 5, N'Ok, countdown is a pretty cool character. Better once he''s upgraded of course. I prefer rocket path over bomb buddies. The big bonus of getting kick-off countdown over reg. Countdown is he is a special version (generally a stat boost for special skylanders).. but the big bonus of special swap force skylanders such as kick off countdown, Easter version of trigger happy & Jolly bumble blast is that their stat boosts come in the form of a hat u can use on any skylander. That''s a huge improvement from previous game offerings. These guys r worth it for their fabulous hats & good news is, they''re generally very inexpensive, as opposed to some other special versions like nitro or legendary which do not give u special hats. I got kick off countdown new for $1.99. Jolly Bumble blast pre owned for a few bucks & same w/ Easter version of trigger happy. So that adds to the beauty of these 3 special guys. I use kick off hat & jolly hat the most. Great stats. Triple boost from all 3 hats. I know...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Henderson', N'olivia.henderson5977@example.net', '2015-08-29', 2, N'I don''t care about covers or that they added videos to their commentary or that they highlight what buttons to press or the camera view I care most about the gameplay itself and its the same as last year. The speed is still not up to par every other thing to do they want you to sign up for PS plus the in game commentary is still the same as last year, same exact playbook that they''ve been using for the last 20 years bottom line is, don''t waste your money!!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Sanchez', N'joyce.sanchez4564@example.org', '2015-08-29', 5, N'One of my favorite years of FIFA football for Xbox. Thanks alot!!!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Martin', N'amanda.martin6025@example.org', '2015-08-29', 4, N'I am a fan of open world games, but missed playing this one on the PS3. I decided to try the PS4 version and while I found it enjoyable, it''s not among my favorite open world games. I found the learning curve in the beginning to be a little steep. I never could quite get down the mechanics of fighting. Sometimes Wei would just stand there as I was hitting the buttons to get him to move. I''m not sure if it was because I was mashing the buttons too hard or if it was a glitch. Luckily, you can buy upgraded outfits that come with weapons. The game became much easier once I had a sword and a gun. Still, there were little bugs where my gun would randomly disappear or Wei wouldn''t pick up a knife that was dropped by another enemy. I was able to overlook the glitches because this game is fun overall. I loved driving around the open world of Hong Kong. It was fun to play a game that wasn''t set in the U.S. The game features lots of side missions that I enjoyed playing. My favorite side...'),
(N'Larry', N'Smith', N'larry.smith4648@example.com', '2015-08-29', 5, N'$30 is fair and the game is great.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Johnson', N'gregory.johnson7708@example.org', '2015-08-29', 1, N'Same s*** every year.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Ramos', N'samantha.ramos9965@example.com', '2015-08-29', 1, N'I bought a "brand new" version of this system and it brought up a system error. Three days and five separate phone calls with xbox later (to try and solve the issue) the final guy I talked to said "it shouldn''t be doing that, it must be a faulty xbox. Send it back and I''d suggest buying one in a store." Which is what I did- the exact same thing for the exact same price, except THAT one worked right away. As far as this actual product, I''m enjoying it so far but I''m skeptical about game systems from here now.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Garcia', N'kenneth.garcia6667@example.net', '2015-08-29', 5, N'This thing is awesome. It is also a lot larger than I thought it was going to be by looking at the pictures. I am a 50 year old truck driver, and games runs in my veins. Instead of fumbling with different wires and configurations, I just take this with me in my semi when I am on the road. It''s very easy to set up, and I can move around with it in my truck, not nailed down to one spot. All I have right now is a slim 360 but even it looks really nice. If there was any downfall, I wish they could have added a little bass, it sounds too trebly but hey the speakers are tiny so I get that. I am very happy I bought this!'),
(N'Steven', N'Murphy', N'steven.murphy5396@example.com', '2015-08-29', 3, N'pretty cool game if you love shonen anime'),
(N'Patricia', N'Hernandez', N'patricia.hernandez4973@example.net', '2015-08-29', 5, N'Funny video game, but difficult levels lol'),
(N'Samantha', N'Kumar', N'samantha.kumar9982@example.com', '2015-08-29', 5, N'If you have the old versions you''ll appreciate this system so much. It''s so much faster than the previous model. Graphics are great. 3D is great when I use it. C stick is pretty great for games like Smash Bros or Monster Hunter. Only con is the game cartridge spot is kind of in an odd spot. My fingers rest there when I hold the device so I get a little worried I''ll pop the game out by mistake.'),
(N'Justin', N'Nguyen', N'justin.nguyen1635@example.net', '2015-08-30', 5, N'One of the greatest controllers of all time and the blue swirl looks better than the orange one...It''s my second favorite controller only behind the Super NES ones.'),
(N'Donna', N'Wood', N'donna.wood1754@example.org', '2015-08-30', 5, N'Great price point and excellent quality!!!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Chavez', N'evelyn.chavez1168@example.org', '2015-08-30', 5, N'Must have classic RPG.'),
(N'Larry', N'Jones', N'larry.jones3900@example.net', '2015-08-30', 5, N'if you like the tracklist you''ll love it'),
(N'Adam', N'Nowak', N'adam.nowak9010@example.com', '2015-08-30', 5, N'This review is based on the game, not the contents (Boba Fett, etc..) I''ve been a fan of this series since the original (1.0), and if you go for the the 3.0 starter set on any platform, you will soon find out just how well your money was spent. With each release, Disney manages to stuff their game with so many things to do, and 3.0 takes this further with a mind-boggling amount of content to tackle. Long after many AAA hardcore games are completed, Disney Infinity will keep chugging along with something new to find. Having Star Wars to bring in their latest series was a no-brainer for Disney - and everyone predicted it would happen. I''m happy to say, Disney went into overdrive with this release as they have done the Star Wars license mighty justice. The gameplay is spot on this time with fun quests and tons of side missions. Unlike the previous Marvel Super Heroes, Star Wars''s missions vary from ground to space, keeping the adventures fresh at all time. The combat is highly...'),
(N'Betty', N'Allen', N'betty.allen6549@example.org', '2015-08-30', 5, N'great!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Lewis', N'nadia.lewis5378@example.net', '2015-08-31', 4, N'My reviews are mainly focused on core gameplay mechanics, so that''ll be my focus here. For the longest time, I''ve been saying that Madden needs a definitive turnkey/pivotal title that''ll be the true platform to continuously build the game up from. Madden 16 to me is definitely that benchmark title as the feel of football is true and completely undeniable regarding what''s going on here for sure. Let me get into this a bit deeper. WR/DB Interactions: Out the box, you had a good number of people on the EA access 10 hour trial screaming out how catching was OP (overpowered), and were getting caught over end over end on deep balls in 1 v 1 situations mainly. That''s just the issue there though, people needed to learn how to use the new in game mechanics. The days of just pressing Y or Triangle are gone. You must learn to press A or X and play the receiver, spotlight the receiver if your secondary isn''t great, assign the extra man or adjust your playcalling to have that safety over top to...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Peterson', N'jeremy.peterson5928@example.com', '2015-08-31', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Bell', N'michelle.bell7219@example.org', '2015-08-31', 5, N'Amazing game'),
(N'Michelle', N'Bell', N'michelle.bell7219@example.org', '2015-08-31', 4, N'The game is amazing, if you aren''t into intense dungeon grinding or semi lack of story, this isn''t for you'),
(N'Michael', N'Nelson', N'michael.nelson6465@example.net', '2015-08-31', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Mateo', N'Fisher', N'mateo.fisher6010@example.com', '2015-08-31', 3, N'Honestly I didn''t notice too much of a difference going from 480i to 480p (which is not HD btw) and I was a little dissapointed. Still it provides if anything a bit of a clearer picture and its as if youve gone from 30 fps to 45. Not noticeable unless your looking for it. Also its a good thing I had one of those old awkward CRT tvs with the green and blue cable inputs and white because in my experience those were expensive hard to find tvs in the 90s before HDMI.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Green', N'evelyn.green3898@example.net', '2015-08-31', 5, N'FINALLY! I used to have a 5 button mouse back in the early 00''s, and loved it. Since then most gaming mice have come with a bunch of extra features, a 6th button or extra macro buttons, and missed the mark, as far as I care. This mouse is perfect. It is a 5 button mouse with a DPI switch just below the scroll. The buttons are all easily reachable, and there are no extra macro buttons. The coloration of the mouse lights look really great, and it responds really well. The side buttons are click buttons, not plastic domes. The middle mouse does not have a left/right scroll function, which was annoying me about other mice that I have been using in this class. A feature that''s not really displayed very well here is on the underside, there are some small glide feet right around the sensor that help keep junk away from the lens, which is pretty nice in a house with shedding pets. This mouse is KISS through and through, and has great style with it. I recommend this to anyone looking for a...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ruiz', N'ryan.ruiz7234@example.net', '2015-08-31', 5, N'Works great and has no scratches, like new.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ruiz', N'ryan.ruiz7234@example.net', '2015-08-31', 5, N'Works great and has no scratches, Thanks'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Nowak', N'stephanie.nowak8429@example.org', '2015-08-31', 3, N'The only plus to having this is the Lithium Battery, and the 9 foot cable. Other than that, any phone-charger cable will do the exact same service. I play with my phone charger plugged into the Controller. I noticed they tried to patch this recently with the most recent controller update. All you have to do to get around it is have a set of batteries in the controller, dead or charged, as long as it has batteries in it it should turn on, and get its power from the charger cable.'),
(N'Amara', N'Patel', N'amara.patel3111@example.org', '2015-08-31', 5, N'A great open world experience with lots to do and a lot of hunting. The story is amazing and the characters are stunning.'),
(N'Amara', N'Patel', N'amara.patel3111@example.org', '2015-08-31', 5, N'I haven''t found too muvh use for it but it works perfectly fine and as intended. It has a few cool features too.'),
(N'Amara', N'Patel', N'amara.patel3111@example.org', '2015-08-31', 4, N'It isn''t as impressive as the next gen version but it''s still a good time.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Howard', N'ronald.howard6597@example.com', '2015-08-31', 3, N'great one i like it'),
(N'Olivia', N'Morgan', N'olivia.morgan6635@example.org', '2015-08-31', 5, N'this series is so good'),
(N'Pamela', N'Lopez', N'pamela.lopez8848@example.org', '2015-09-01', 5, N'Keeps them thumbs on them pads Super grippy Fit well on ps4 and xbone controllers'),
(N'Donald', N'Ruiz', N'donald.ruiz2766@example.org', '2015-09-01', 5, N'Mass Effect is the best video game trilogy of all time. It has an amazing story that could rival Star Wars itself maybe even better. The characters are all very complex and very well written. Graphics and cinematics are great. The 2nd and 3rd games have really good combat. This is your story. You will have countless choices to make and you will have to face the consequences of your actions. You can play these games in so many different ways and you will have a completely different experience each time. This trilogy is a dream come true for sci-fi fans like me. It doesn''t get any better than this.'),
(N'Christine', N'Sanders', N'christine.sanders1408@example.org', '2015-09-01', 4, N'I like it a lot!'),
(N'Donna', N'Campbell', N'donna.campbell6238@example.org', '2015-09-01', 5, N'Love this psp whish I can get it to work with mt internet but all in all works good'),
(N'Olivia', N'Carter', N'olivia.carter2569@example.com', '2015-09-02', 5, N'good game good price'),
(N'Patricia', N'Perez', N'patricia.perez9015@example.org', '2015-09-02', 5, N'Steins;Gate is a visual novel game. When you buy this game, please know what you are getting yourself into if you do not know this genre. With that said, what it sets out to achieve, it accomplishes. As a fan of the anime, I was so glad to have seen this game getting a stateside release, though it is exclusive to Amazon. I have never read the manga so I only know the story though the anime. I enjoy this game, and so far am several hours into the game. I wish to give what I currently am playing a review, but so far I am happy to say, so great! If you have only seen the anime as I have, you''ll begin to immediately notice the addition scenes of that which may have been included in the manga (or so I have heard so far). This is great news as I love being able to get a full fleshed out experience. I have always loved sci fi stories and science, and the concept of time travel it introduces, the way it introduces it as a possibility, really makes you think of such possibilities even if...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Jenkins', N'kelly.jenkins2341@example.com', '2015-09-02', 5, N'Excellent gaame it will swallow your time because the game is long and it has plenty to do.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Morgan', N'katherine.morgan1080@example.com', '2015-09-02', 5, N'Makes playing the games easier.'),
(N'Priya', N'Nowak', N'priya.nowak8337@example.com', '2015-09-03', 5, N'As expected'),
(N'Scott', N'Nelson', N'scott.nelson9806@example.com', '2015-09-03', 2, N'I didn''t like it. I played it for like 2 days then quit. It is a very slow, boring game, where you run around pushing the same buttons doing the same attacks on the same exact monsters with the same exact graphics. I wasted $30. I wish I could return it. As a LOTR fan/fanatic, I am disappointed in not having fun on this game.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Kowalski', N'aisha.kowalski7347@example.com', '2015-09-03', 5, N'I used to have this game when I was growing up and I loved it and played every song out every chance I could and as I got older and brought the game again, nothing changed and I still love this game as much as I did when I was younger. I love to sing! the product even showed up earlier than expected.'),
(N'Justin', N'Wright', N'justin.wright4737@example.org', '2015-09-03', 3, N'the game is very fun, no question about it. However i feel like they didn''t improve the graphics at all. you would wait till its $20 because even at 40 its not worth it. the only definitive edition that made great improvement was tomb raider'),
(N'Marcus', N'Fisher', N'marcus.fisher1308@example.net', '2015-09-03', 3, N'I am glad I bought this game, thought I am still not sure what the difference is between the regular version and the Legendary version??? I would love to rate higher, but the game can be beat in 8 hours. I wanted more! Plus there is no real exploration here. There are a few things to find if you wonder a few feet from the beaten path, but that''s it. AND if you want to go back to see something, often times, you can. A door will close, or something will prohibit you from jumping/climbing over the object you just jumped/climbed over. That is disappointing. I think the story could also have been better. Don''t get me wrong, it is a very good story with very good acting, but when it was really getting good, it finished up rather quickly while I wanted to know more about the character and how he develops. The cut scenes, while beautiful, there is no way to skip them. And if you are in a pickle and having a difficult time passing a sequence, and must replay it a bit, you also have to keep...'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Gomez', N'nicholas.gomez5202@example.net', '2015-09-03', 5, N'I own both versions of Spider-Man Vs the Kingpin for the Genesis version and Sega CD. I love the Genesis game, but the Sega CD took it to a whole new level of New York exploration doing side missions, facing enemies such as Electro,Vulture, Venom, Dr. Octopus, e.t.c... The soundtrack is mind blowing and got that NY city atmosphere/Comic book feel to It.....Overall graphics is superb......This to me is truly the Spider-Man game that resembles to the comics coming to your living room TV screen.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Kim', N'joseph.kim1790@example.com', '2015-09-04', 5, N'It works! No complaints yet. Now excuse my while I replay 007 Nightfire.'),
(N'Paul', N'Sanchez', N'paul.sanchez9978@example.org', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Awesome headphones, just be gentle with them, the plastic pieces just above the earphone likes to crack.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Suzuki', N'amanda.suzuki4171@example.com', '2015-09-04', 5, N'I have had fun playing this game when I can. Has more dynamics than previous versions. Also play online sometimes. My son, nephew and their friends also play. I wish I had more time to get at it. Married with kids, job, school, and house makes finding play time tough!!! But at least that will give me long play time for the story mode when I do get my chances.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Ward', N'ivan.ward2599@example.com', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Here we go! Straight outta my childhood.'),
(N'Ryan', N'James', N'ryan.james9116@example.net', '2015-09-04', 5, N'I got exactly what I paid for. Good quality case and game disc.'),
(N'Peter', N'Martin', N'peter.martin3975@example.com', '2015-09-04', 5, N'One of my favorite pokemon games by far since red and blue.'),
(N'Mark', N'Turner', N'mark.turner4380@example.com', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Loved it'),
(N'George', N'Coleman', N'george.coleman4634@example.org', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Amazing price and saves when wanting to play multiplayer.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Perez', N'joseph.perez9864@example.org', '2015-09-04', 2, N'The low picture quality really hurt my passion to play this game'),
(N'Amy', N'Green', N'amy.green3078@example.net', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Awesome game! Came quick too!'),
(N'Anna', N'Edwards', N'anna.edwards9902@example.org', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Bought this for my nephew. Thank you'),
(N'Anna', N'Edwards', N'anna.edwards9902@example.org', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Very nice'),
(N'Stephen', N'Bennett', N'stephen.bennett4045@example.net', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Beautiful morf'),
(N'Nathan', N'Taylor', N'nathan.taylor8096@example.net', '2015-09-04', 5, N'Even if you aren''t a fan of fighting as Samus, this controller is 100% AWESOME!!!! The metallic look of the plastic casing both on the front and the gold-toned underside are really unique and impressive-looking. That combined with the metallic aqua cross pad make this the best wired fight pad for SSB4.'),
(N'Jack', N'Diaz', N'jack.diaz9693@example.org', '2015-09-05', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Sharon', N'Brown', N'sharon.brown5765@example.org', '2015-09-05', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Angela', N'Chavez', N'angela.chavez9426@example.net', '2015-09-05', 1, N'Game is good, but the case is empty without game card inside. Can''t believe it. Waiting for the refund.'),
(N'Omar', N'Raghunathan', N'omar.raghunathan8297@example.net', '2015-09-05', 5, N'I love this game and I got all the dlc for free on orgin. I would not recommend buying this game at full price because there aren''t a lot of people playing online now in days. Last I check there were less than 1000 people playing online.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Castillo', N'mateo.castillo3676@example.net', '2015-09-05', 5, N'Halo. What more do I need to say.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Castillo', N'mateo.castillo3676@example.net', '2015-09-05', 5, N'Awesome remote. Great for when you don''t want to turn on the controller to navigate through the Xbox menus.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Jenkins', N'nicholas.jenkins3247@example.com', '2015-09-05', 5, N'Honestly this product works !! Anyone who uses their ps4 for any extended period of time will attest to how hot it runs . Keeps my system running cooler and the bonus is the charging dock. Ps4 will still be quite warm but I assure you not as hot as before .'),
(N'Walter', N'Boyd', N'walter.boyd4755@example.org', '2015-09-05', 5, N'beautiful game .. (on a ps4) .. going by the specs .. u have/had a very good 25 % degraded version .. enjoy guys'),
(N'Emily', N'King', N'emily.king9832@example.com', '2015-09-05', 5, N'It''s like a wacky mix between Saints Row and Jet Set Radio. Funny, colorful, smart and just plain fun. One of my favorite titles on Xbox One.'),
(N'Robert', N'Flores', N'robert.flores1909@example.org', '2015-09-05', 3, N'only works if I have speaker and a mic plugged in'),
(N'Edward', N'Cox', N'edward.cox3321@example.net', '2015-09-05', 1, N'Wow. This game is so bad, it made me write a review. This is not a battlefield game.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Flores', N'aaron.flores8268@example.net', '2015-09-05', 5, N'All controllers need these!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Flores', N'aaron.flores8268@example.net', '2015-09-05', 3, N'Graphics aren''t really changed, but the game is excellent and glad I have it in my collection! If you have this on another console, pass up on this!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Jenkins', N'patrick.jenkins3463@example.net', '2015-09-06', 5, N'This is a must have for any person that likes RPGs. I give this game a 10/10. Everything in it is awesome: music, characters, graphics (for a game made at its time), story/plot, battle system, controls, enemies. It even has 15 endings. I''m looking forward to get the soundtrack of this game, its music is unique. A must have.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Khan', N'patricia.khan4239@example.net', '2015-09-06', 5, N'I was a bit skeptical before I used these. After several weeks of use, I put them on all Xbox controllers. I no longer have thumb fatigue after 6 hours of intense gaming session play Destiny. These thing are a must for FPS games. Just remember to put the low ones for left thumb stick, and the tall ones for right thumb stick.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Torres', N'tomasz.torres7191@example.com', '2015-09-06', 5, N'This is a must have for any and all Call of Duty game fans. My son plays this a lot with his friends. Out of all of his games the Call of Duty franchise is his absolute favorite.'),
(N'Donna', N'Young', N'donna.young2594@example.com', '2015-09-06', 5, N'Love my Folio! However I purchased mine elsewhere ($20.00 flat) but I do love it!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Moore', N'patricia.moore3415@example.org', '2015-09-06', 5, N'I would agree with most of the other reviewers, however, for this price point I would ask for superhuman mode (you know, where you can hear footsteps and direction of bullets). I thought it was a feature, although not mentioned, and was disappointed. One thing for installation is to make sure you are logged in to your xbox live account.'),
(N'Debra', N'Kim', N'debra.kim6772@example.net', '2015-09-06', 5, N'as promised'),
(N'Joan', N'Collins', N'joan.collins3192@example.org', '2015-09-06', 5, N'We have been using rechargeable amazon ni-mh batteries for 2 years for our controllers and while the still work well, having to take them in and out of the controllers to charge them, often times left the batteries dead. This charger is very simple to use and the batteries popped in easily. If you are looking for a nice compact charging system, I recommend this one.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Khan', N'lauren.khan3890@example.net', '2015-09-06', 2, N'I got this product a few much back and now it keeps turning off and screw with my other logitech gear'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Jimenez', N'jacqueline.jimenez8120@example.org', '2015-09-07', 5, N'I don''t even like Batman or DC. I just love knowing I have one and a real Batman fan doesn''t. Probably won''t ever sell it either.'),
(N'Mei', N'Henderson', N'mei.henderson5684@example.net', '2015-09-07', 1, N'Horrible not sure what''s going on my friends game plays amazing on my Xbox so I decided to get my own it says it needs to download a HD pack but needs space so I deleted space then it asked that I have the wrong sick drive so I need to connect one before starting so how come my friends CD works without any hassle on my console but not this one? Worthless games I do not recommend it l, just a waist of money and time'),
(N'Debra', N'Reyes', N'debra.reyes2248@example.org', '2015-09-07', 5, N'Worked great used it at my bachelor party hooked up 4 controllers, no problem.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nelson', N'benjamin.nelson5020@example.com', '2015-09-07', 4, N'Call of Duty: Ghosts isn''t a reinvention of the franchise, but proves there''s still room for innovation within its existing formula. Though at the risk of over-complicating things at times, its robust multiplayer gameplay, surprisingly fun co-op modes, and lengthy, challenging, and varied campaign makes Ghosts one of the best Call of Duty games to date'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nelson', N'benjamin.nelson5020@example.com', '2015-09-07', 2, N'Mario & Sonic at the Sochi 2014 Olympic Winter Games has some of the best online capabilities on the Wii U, but it unwisely forces use of poor motion controls in almost every mode. For all its competitive elements, including leaderboards, online multiplayer, and downloadable ghost competitors, Sochi 2014 is just too unpredictable to make good use of any of them. There is some fun to be had in both local and online multiplayer, but half of that is the comedy of playing with terrible controls.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Thomas', N'elizabeth.thomas4418@example.net', '2015-09-07', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Samuel', N'Long', N'samuel.long4868@example.com', '2015-09-07', 1, N'dont download it'),
(N'Megan', N'Thompson', N'megan.thompson4954@example.net', '2015-09-07', 3, N'Everyone''s complaining about price and such, but nobody''s talking much about the actual play set or anything. We started out playing the Star Wars playset that came with the main set, and that one at least let both people wander around, and you had full camera control. This one really limits that. You have to stay on the same screen. The good? No split screen squeeze, you each see the full screen. The bad? No wandering off, you have to stay by each other. And it''s all forced perspective. You can''t pivot the camera to see things at all, you''re stuck looking at it like a picture, moving through it but without any real control over your view. I hate this. Some parts of this are side scroller sets like Mario or something, others are more 3D-ish but still forced perspective. The graphics are alright, the diversity of characters is alright, but the play set itself is just quite a letdown from a game play perspective.'),
(N'Julie', N'Sullivan', N'julie.sullivan8702@example.net', '2015-09-07', 5, N'Fast shipping. Item as described. Highly recommended. Great seller'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Perez', N'hiroshi.perez3888@example.org', '2015-09-07', 5, N'It''s great'),
(N'Henry', N'Cruz', N'henry.cruz7272@example.com', '2015-09-08', 5, N'Great seller, Highly recommend.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Walker', N'kenneth.walker6593@example.com', '2015-09-08', 5, N'Here''s a little perspective from my end. I am not a horror game/movie fan, although I don''t mind scare-based entertainment, the wife is the farthest thing from it lol. I bought this off strong review and user impressions on NeoGaf and honestly, couldn''t be more satisfied. I''m sure there''s enough pros/cons reviews so I''ll try to make my reviews about the heart or spirit of what the developers were trying to achieve, and what I feel is the connection they want to make with their consumers. So Until Dawn is a love-letter to 90''s era teen horror stories like Scream or I know what you did Last Summer, In fact, many fans of slasher type movies will probably breeze through a lot of the "correct" choices based on there knowledge with the genre. But, that doesn''t matter, because the game is a title that allows you to make those decisions yourself. Ever wonder why a certain character chooses to investigate something that is obviously dangerous? Well, you now have the choice to make that...'),
(N'Carlos', N'Moore', N'carlos.moore4270@example.net', '2015-09-08', 1, N'I bought these from Amazon. I used these for both PlayStation 4 and Xbox One. When I got these, right off the bat there was an issue with the AG1 chat cable for Xbox One. There was a popping sound every time I tried to use it and I had to literally scream for anyone to hear me. So I contacted Astro support, and they sent me a replacement one. That took about a week. Then, I got it and that fixed the popping sound, but I still had to scream to be heard. Then, last night I was playing on my PS4 and my team mates wanted to take a break so I put the headset on the charger. When I took it off there was a loud persistent buzzing/static noise. It never did stop. So, I got fed up and returned them. I paid $327, with tax included, for this headset and it literally wasn''t worth $10. With all of that aside, my only other gripe is that a $327 headset should not need a wire to the Xbox One controller. Turtle beach makes 100% wireless controllers for under $80. Get it together Astro. In...'),
(N'Linda', N'Brown', N'linda.brown4233@example.org', '2015-09-08', 5, N'have this game for PC an xbox one.. PC cost me a fortune xbox one only 20$ an i got all the maps for free....'),
(N'James', N'Collins', N'james.collins8632@example.org', '2015-09-08', 5, N'Iron Man for the PSP is another one of the great movie tie in video games. This title plays very much like the hit Robert Downey Jr. film--his voice is heard in the game. Every element of the game is high quality; from the graphics to the controls....Worth it. The sequel game Iron Man 2 is an even better title.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Walker', N'andrea.walker8063@example.net', '2015-09-08', 1, N'I don''t think you can hit Play and enjoy an instant, easy, stress free racing game. Game forces you to join a team and forces play through pre-determined not-very-much-fun challenges. I''ve tried playing this a few times and quit after 10 minutes each time.'),
(N'Michael', N'Ali', N'michael.ali1719@example.org', '2015-09-08', 5, N'OK'),
(N'Michael', N'Robinson', N'michael.robinson4494@example.net', '2015-09-08', 3, N'Flawed, repetitive, and full of bugs. The same suffers from frame rate issues later in the game. Everything is easy to beat once you figure out the moves. I can take down a convoy in seconds and Top Dogs are laughable.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Sanchez', N'aaron.sanchez8487@example.net', '2015-09-09', 5, N'thanks!'),
(N'George', N'Henderson', N'george.henderson9824@example.com', '2015-09-09', 5, N'Great!!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Thompson', N'nicholas.thompson9260@example.net', '2015-09-09', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Katherine', N'Chavez', N'katherine.chavez9682@example.net', '2015-09-09', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Frank', N'James', N'frank.james4796@example.com', '2015-09-09', 5, N'A mix of new and old school rpg elements, if you''re good at strategy you''ll find yourself enjoying this game a lot! If not, grinding until you can brute force your way through it is also a viable strategy if that''s what suits you.'),
(N'Henry', N'Jackson', N'henry.jackson3229@example.net', '2015-09-09', 4, N'Since Saints Row 1 isn''t/wasn''t on PS3 (though I heard it was only released on Xbox 360), I decided to get the sequel game, originally released in 2008, and see what the game and its overall series is like. Sure yes these games is like the ever recognizable and popular Grand Theft Auto series but when I played Saints Row 2, I had somewhat of a vibe of playing a particular game I once played and loved back in my PS2-playing haydays, that game being Tony Hawk''s Underground 2. I haven''t played a game this out-of-whack before since that or any of the following GTA titles that was released in the PS2 era of gaming (Vice City, San Andreas) but now things are a whole lot different since I got my PS3 over 3 years ago. I purchased this game back 2 years ago in 2013. I really liked SR2. There was some really good stuff in it. From the characters (including your custom character to be the Saints'' "Boss"), to the free-roaming open world atmosphere, to the variety of main and side...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Lewis', N'kyle.lewis4769@example.com', '2015-09-09', 3, N'Is good for leveling up your characters and getting more sidekicks'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Young', N'benjamin.young2565@example.net', '2015-09-09', 5, N'Best rpg in a loooooooooong time'),
(N'Edward', N'Sanders', N'edward.sanders8821@example.com', '2015-09-09', 4, N'good product'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2015-09-10', 5, N'capcom is the greatest video game company in the universe there true genius''s the best of the best capcom rocks 2015 is the greatest year for video games a perfect year the best of the best 2015 rocks all the video games that the video game companies made from the 70s 80s,90s 2000s 2010s and 2015 are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best all the video games that the video game companies made from the 70s 80s 90s 2000s 2010s and 2015 rocks ^_^'),
(N'Brian', N'Edwards', N'brian.edwards5285@example.org', '2015-09-10', 5, N'Amazing game. Endless fun and action. Nice long story and great graphics I recommend it'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Raghunathan', N'cynthia.raghunathan5876@example.org', '2015-09-10', 5, N'a classic'),
(N'Paul', N'Mendoza', N'paul.mendoza3736@example.org', '2015-09-10', 5, N'Awesome graphics and game play. Players look real especially on a 4k tv.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Phillips', N'lisa.phillips7930@example.com', '2015-09-10', 5, N'I am new to playing the Telltale Games. I usually play the hardcore major stuff like Dying Light. I recently got my first Platinum trophy in Watch Dogs, just to name a fewhowever, Im totally stunned by the amazing games series that Telltale Games has produced! The Walking Dead (season 1), is absolutely mind-blowing. This is a different kind of next gen game, thats more like an interactive cinematic comic book. I am taken aback by the hypnotic captivating detail of an interactive comic-book anime style for a video gameshockingly good! The concept is absolutely brilliant and entertaining! I found this game more entertaining and fun to play more so than major games like the Dying Light. The story line in emotional, brutal, bloody, gruesome and gorylove it! But moreover, as a player, this game is interactive so you control the outcome of the game by the choices you make. The story will draw you in and keep you on edge with every decision you make keeping you in a constant state of...'),
(N'Samantha', N'Parker', N'samantha.parker6046@example.net', '2015-09-10', 4, N'The game is very fun with a lot to do, but if you have played FarCry 3, then you have already played this game.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Fisher', N'katherine.fisher6222@example.org', '2015-09-10', 5, N'Finally caved and bought my avid little gamer the One to replace the 360 (which had gotten glitchy). Excellent machine; no problems whatsoever. He uses it for game play, Netflix, Amazon Video, etc with no issues.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Adams', N'douglas.adams4196@example.com', '2015-09-10', 5, N'LOVE IT'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Jones', N'tomasz.jones7950@example.net', '2015-09-10', 3, N'It''s a good keyboard, for the keyboard parts. They feel nice, and the lighting is okay. Having some trouble making it change the colours, but that is to be expected. The extra buttons, however, are... interesting. It has G1-G4 on the left side are nice, are set up to Ctrl 1-4 and work great... but the ones on top, L1-9 are kind of really messed up. They start at L5 and then goes to L1 then hits L6 and goes on to L9. It makes no sense! But I love the keyboard regardless, but it really could use some work... paid $60 for it and not really sure it''s worth it. Unsure if I want to send it back or not.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Khan', N'jennifer.khan8462@example.net', '2015-09-10', 5, N'This game follows all three of the lord of the rings movies. In my opinion this is one of the best Lego games and the most challenging as well although this game is challenging it is also very fun as well'),
(N'Carol', N'Hill', N'carol.hill7860@example.com', '2015-09-10', 5, N'It''s summer, it is hot as s*** in my room and this thing is on cooling my xbox that is not on lol. This thing works'),
(N'Jerry', N'Howard', N'jerry.howard7992@example.org', '2015-09-10', 5, N'I''m upgrading from Xbox 360 s 250Gb to this Xbox One and it''s fantastic. After using for about four hours now, I don''t regret buying. I''ll just to get use to the different OS. I am somewhat a football and it''s a great game to play. I highly recommend this if your a Xbox fan. ! TB is plenty of space for games and apps.'),
(N'Anita', N'Collins', N'anita.collins5440@example.com', '2015-09-10', 5, N'Before getting rid of PsP I''ve played this game twice. First starting a simple new game I finished it quite easily and enjoyed the story, characters, progression system and even side activities. Second run I started a new game+ but with a new character t make it harder. Ifrit was pretty hard to deal with on that difficulty but eventually I managed to get past that point. Ultimately I''ve gotten to about 80% story completion before giving up, because without perfect dodging skills and stamina to fight for 3-5 minutes non-stop I couldn''t make it. Regardless, that was a good experience. Bottom line: casual gamer or not you should get this game because it is a good game.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Morgan', N'kofi.morgan7413@example.org', '2015-09-10', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Patricia', N'Evans', N'patricia.evans7246@example.com', '2015-09-10', 5, N'Amiibos! Come on Nintendo keep up with supply and demand. My kids loves them and you can train them for you Wii.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Garcia', N'sandra.garcia7249@example.org', '2015-09-11', 4, N'Be Careful buying these controllers as Logitech seems to only make these controllers compatible with only current generation consoles, then they will want you to spend another 400 dollars when the ps5 and next xbox comes out. Logitech has quality hardware, but they don''t really care about making their customers happy'),
(N'James', N'Raghunathan', N'james.raghunathan8585@example.net', '2015-09-11', 5, N'I played this on a PC and had to pick it up for my PS3. You are on an island where a Soviet experiment with a (then) newly discovered element went crazy wrong around 50 years ago, and you use a time shifting device (along with your guns) to save the world. For a shooter, it''s got a pretty decent story, with some humorous moments (I love the 50''s styled Russian film clips at the beginning of the game) and a couple jump scares. Very nice graphics and good use of the DualShock''s rumble feature. Typical variety of upgradable weapons for a shooter, but the time control aspect adds another level of interest to the game in that it''s used in a variety of clever ways to support the story , and yet it''s not bogged down with too many controls to learn.'),
(N'Judith', N'Davis', N'judith.davis1803@example.org', '2015-09-11', 4, N'Wish the mesh part would be a little bigger but besides that it is great.'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2015-09-11', 5, N'I loved it. If you want to play through a horror movie, with a choose your own adventure style, this is the game for you.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ross', N'kimberly.ross3108@example.com', '2015-09-11', 1, N'Won''t install correctly!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Rivera', N'marcus.rivera5055@example.com', '2015-09-11', 5, N'working perfet and you not need cd to install'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Rodriguez', N'jeffrey.rodriguez1243@example.org', '2015-09-11', 5, N'Very quiet, smooth operation and slowly blows hot air from the XBOXONE. Recommended'),
(N'Nadia', N'Kowalski', N'nadia.kowalski8500@example.com', '2015-09-11', 5, N'Great quality and reliability.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Powell', N'joyce.powell1549@example.org', '2015-09-11', 5, N'Awesome best naruto game for ps3 100% worth the money for all you naruto fans out there like me.'),
(N'Omar', N'Campbell', N'omar.campbell6675@example.org', '2015-09-11', 5, N'Works exactly likes its supposed to.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Martin', N'sarah.martin3353@example.org', '2015-09-11', 5, N'Cute and well done product. Now just need a Captain Toad one :)'),
(N'Kofi', N'Torres', N'kofi.torres9909@example.com', '2015-09-11', 5, N'My favorite game plus it comes with all the dlcs'),
(N'Christopher', N'Henderson', N'christopher.henderson7058@example.net', '2015-09-12', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Allen', N'cheryl.allen6714@example.net', '2015-09-12', 1, N'did not work'),
(N'James', N'Lewis', N'james.lewis7004@example.org', '2015-09-12', 5, N'Awesome product'),
(N'Paul', N'Torres', N'paul.torres5065@example.com', '2015-09-12', 5, N'great game...'),
(N'Julie', N'Khan', N'julie.khan3698@example.org', '2015-09-12', 5, N'Yoda is awesome. The character design is awesome. The way he plays in 3.0 is great.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Anderson', N'thomas.anderson1030@example.org', '2015-09-12', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Daniel', N'Ward', N'daniel.ward1792@example.com', '2015-09-12', 5, N'It came to me in perfect condition and has been tested to work. Thanks!!'),
(N'Jerry', N'Martin', N'jerry.martin9061@example.com', '2015-09-12', 5, N'This is another necessary accessory.i hate how the xbox1 have the vents on top which allows for debris and dust to get inside there.the fan prevents this.dont know if it keeps it cool.i think they advertise to just redirect the air.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Price', N'jerry.price6008@example.net', '2015-09-12', 5, N'Makes for a much better picture on hdtvs.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Price', N'jerry.price6008@example.net', '2015-09-12', 5, N'Great set of games. Gets the kids moving!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ortiz', N'ethan.ortiz7389@example.org', '2015-09-13', 2, N'It''s terribly boring.'),
(N'Luis', N'Powell', N'luis.powell7531@example.com', '2015-09-13', 2, N'warning! I have not bought one of these, but I have bought several of this brand''s xbox controllers, as well as an mp3 player, and they all fell apart. do not buy from ''generic'' unless you are ok with chinese-made crap.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Perez', N'barbara.perez8611@example.com', '2015-09-13', 5, N'All good thank you'),
(N'Mark', N'Reed', N'mark.reed3517@example.net', '2015-09-13', 5, N'I love it, but wish the silicone sleeve was a different color (it''s white). Came on time and as described, works with my gen1 wii and accessories.'),
(N'Peter', N'Long', N'peter.long9185@example.com', '2015-09-13', 5, N'Pros: Comfortable Mic is good quality adjustable Cons: The mixer doesn''t change much (other than mute mic) The "Chat Volume" doesn''t work in some games (Including csgo)'),
(N'Samantha', N'Green', N'samantha.green3567@example.org', '2015-09-13', 3, N'Grand Theft Auto San Andreas was the first GTA I ever played to completion so seeing it available for 360 brought on a wave of nostalgia, plus for $20 it''s a steal. I thought, the game looks great, all the tunes are still there but, the controls are not very good which makes a fantastic game terrible. I have been told that the game has option to play with older control scheme but, thus far this just feels broken from the game I remember. Maybe I have been spoiled by GTA IV & V not to mention the Saint''s Row series but GTA:SA feels just not right. Maybe I will retry it again after I finish Halo 4. I will update this review after I play it again. Have a good day.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Wood', N'carlos.wood2321@example.com', '2015-09-13', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Debra', N'Cooper', N'debra.cooper3258@example.com', '2015-09-13', 4, N'Mouse shapes are personal preference.. This is something a lot of people for some odd reason on the internet does not understand. So it something you''ll like or hate right away. I have medium size hands and probably leaning more towards smaller side of things. I also like to collect PC mice for some odd reason... My favorite style has been the Naga Hex for some time now. I mainly play single player action RPGs and MOBA''s. So my needs are different from what this mouse is offering up. PRO; - 3366 sensor. One of the better optical sensor out on the market ATM. No acceleration and very raw in its inputs.\ - The spring loaded Left and Right mouse buttons are way cool. They don''t feel lazy at all like their just sitting on top of the switch and has a nice force push back when you click on them. I wish all manufactures would do this. CON; - Really try this thing out. The shape really pisses off a lot of people. Its not the shape of G100/DeathAdder/etc. So yeah its a new direction that...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Nguyen', N'stephen.nguyen1151@example.net', '2015-09-13', 1, N'Too expensive'),
(N'Laura', N'Edwards', N'laura.edwards1811@example.com', '2015-09-13', 5, N'I like a lot to take my owns decisions'),
(N'Emma', N'Singh', N'emma.singh7069@example.com', '2015-09-14', 5, N'was very happy with every thing I received great looking game!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Morales', N'nadia.morales9096@example.net', '2015-09-14', 3, N'Too similar to its predecessor, LoZ Phantom Hourglass. It''s still a good enough game, but if you already own Phantom Hourglass, you''re not missing ANYTHING at all.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Nelson', N'samuel.nelson2047@example.org', '2015-09-14', 3, N'This is a great game.'),
(N'Justin', N'Edwards', N'justin.edwards6843@example.com', '2015-09-14', 1, N'I got this game for free with my playstation 4 purchase and after playing the first 2 this version really sucked. I still don''t like that they don''t allow you to skip the dialoge. Also the graphics are decent but theirs definatley some jumping around and glitches. The game is super anoying also that they respon the people near you after you killed them.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Hall', N'jessica.hall8041@example.com', '2015-09-14', 3, N'This was the worst campaign of all the CoD games, and I''ve played all of them (I don''t do multiplayer). The missions are absolutely linear. You cannot do ANYTHING other than exactly what the writer and level designer intended or it''s a fail/respawn. And, when I say exactly, I mean, you can''t even take a step out of bounds from what the scripted gameplay requires or you have to do it over. The scripted action is so bad that there are moments when an NPC will start moving, and if you''re in the way, he''ll push you (like a crate) completely ignoring the fact that you''re standing there. This has been problematic in all of the CoD games, where A.I. friendlies will walk through you, shoving you out of the way like Ezio through a crowd, but in this game it''s the worst I''ve seen yet, where you will actually get stuck in the small corridors (is that how the graphics look so great, because the levels are tiny?) until the guy pushes you, crate-style, out of his range or make a turn down a...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Murphy', N'ryan.murphy9670@example.com', '2015-09-14', 5, N'Very good..'),
(N'Jack', N'Foster', N'jack.foster5673@example.org', '2015-09-14', 4, N'Awesome game. Very similar to Blackflag, which is what I was hoping for. I will say that this game has more glitches than any game I have ever played. Seems like they just rolled it out and didn''t care since Unity on Xbox one was their main priority. But regardless, if you liked Blackflag and the sea battles, than you will like this game.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Coleman', N'kenneth.coleman5183@example.net', '2015-09-15', 1, N'First of all, if you don''t have access to internet and/or ability to download 8GB patch don''t even bother buying this title because whatever Ubisoft shipped on the disc is borderline unplayable !!! Besides that this is the worst Creed game I''ve played so far, runs like crap on PS4. Prolong framerate issues during gameplay, and cut scenes. Multitude glitches, npcs are rendered 3 feet in front of you, game has really hard time figuring out what sex or clothes they should be. Story line is really short and the rest of the game is padded with chests opening mechanic. There is a free DLC which was a part of "We are really sorry for shipping unfinished game" but I can''t force myself to play it because of all the technical issues and abysmal performance.'),
(N'Brian', N'Edwards', N'brian.edwards5285@example.org', '2015-09-15', 5, N'Love this game. Cool graphics and story. Plenty of missions to play. Great action and gameplay I think it''s a great purchase'),
(N'Nadia', N'Phillips', N'nadia.phillips4429@example.com', '2015-09-15', 5, N'Very handy little item for traveling. And the seller was very quick in delivery'),
(N'Peter', N'Martin', N'peter.martin3975@example.com', '2015-09-15', 5, N'I bought this for 40 bucks and don''t regret it. Decent amount of gameplay, can reply on a "hard" mode when you beat it but never bothered. It is a total remake of the classic link to the past with an interesting twist, similar bosses and a lot of new ones. Uses the 3d concept well. Very easy however and it''s simply a fun game to play and not much of a challenge. There is a side quest to collect items and you can upgrade weapons which is neat too.'),
(N'Larry', N'Bell', N'larry.bell2360@example.org', '2015-09-15', 5, N'I don''t want to give too much away in this review. Needless to say, this is a weird, intense, constantly-changing title. It is a narrative-focused game, with a lot of story elements paced out by interesting puzzles. The puzzles range from straightforward to downright weird, but are only occasionally unfair. They do a good job overall, in other words, with the puzzles. But the narrative! The story in Virtue''s Last Reward is weird, absorbing, and downright addictive. A friend and I have poured about 50 hours into the game, and are just now figuring out what is happening. Sort of. The voice acting ranges between pretty good and legendary (you''ll know when you hear the bunny). And the pacing, the reveals, are consistent and just-about-right. Wonderful storytelling, wonderful gem. If you have any interest in stories in games, buy this immediately.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Powell', N'lucia.powell2850@example.org', '2015-09-15', 2, N'This game is a joke. The amount of additional story content while much better is no where near the price of the game. A lot of the features should have been added a long time ago and any new player is going to have a difficult time playing the 2 older raids and the prison with any consistency. There is also no reason to play them. A large part of the old gear is useless which is what you get from year one content. When you buy this as a new player or old you are getting a gymped game that is DLC driven. Plus a lot of the DLC in year one has changed from what it was when we originally played it. I would recommend avoiding this game at all cost.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ortiz', N'jessica.ortiz3535@example.net', '2015-09-15', 5, N'This Destiny PS4 bundle features a nice glossy white design with gold and silver design elements from the game. Improvements on this PS4 model include the Power and Eject buttons - they are snappier and work much better being mechanical and not touch sensitive as previous PS4 models (I recall hitting the eject button by accident as it is so sensitive to touch). The Destiny PS4 console really is an elegant looking PS4. Take a look at the unboxing pictures I''ve included to see what is in the package. The bundled Destiny: The Taken King game (physical disc) also includes DLC codes, being the Digital Deluxe version. Note that a white stand is not included, something that can be a bit deceptive in the product pictures posted here.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Kim', N'jerry.kim9910@example.com', '2015-09-15', 5, N'Just got these so, not a whole lot to report, but I do find that they fit a bit tight on my head and are a bit less comfortable than my old Turtle Beach headset for the 360. The telescoping mic is pretty legit.'),
(N'Paul', N'Patel', N'paul.patel1263@example.org', '2015-09-15', 1, N'Destiny is heading in it''s right direction - but faaaar from being there yet. Story is finally kinda present which is good. None of the old story issues were fixed. Few strikes and one raid ... other tweaks are totally cosmetically pleasing but irrelevant to the gameplay itself. What is upsetting - its not enough content to justify $40. They changed the game - and made everything u did for the first year totally irrelevant. Also, I paid 60$ for the game + 35$ for season pass (plus tax). So I''m more then 100$ deep, and now they are asking me to re-buy the same content I already bought, for $45... y? Story... I was done with the story in 45 mins. I went from lvl 34 to lvl 38 in 15 mins, and from 38 to max lvl 40 in less then an hour. I went from light 178 to 250 in 5 hours... and I''m totally pissed that all the grinding you did for them Exotics which Bungie promised us - never going away, we want you to be proud earning them blah blah blah... now some of them are not even available...'),
(N'Patrick', N'Martinez', N'patrick.martinez5111@example.org', '2015-09-15', 4, N'I''ve had my xbox one since a few months after launch. Right after I got my ps4. Honestly, neither system has had too many games and they are both underpowered. This was done so both companies could make a profit on the actual console sales, instead of before where they took a loss, then made it up in software sales. Both consoles have been rough, the poor xbox one in particular. I''m going to list the cons first, then the pros. Bad part is the devs basically having to downgrade their games because the consoles are so weak. Examples are destiny, watch dogs, assassin''s creed, Witcher 3 etc. The good news is future games from now on should not see this downgrade simply because the devs have had the console for two years and know what they have to work with. Second, the library has sucked. I play mostly on pc the past two years, where before I was mainly a console gamers on 360 and ps3. This is changing this holiday with a killer lineup this fall including forza 6, halo 5, tomb raider,...'),
(N'Emma', N'Reed', N'emma.reed5232@example.com', '2015-09-15', 5, N'You''d be a fool not to buy this. For what you pay, you get a ton of value and quite frankly, some of the very best video games ever made by one of the best, imaginative development companies around. I''m not gonna go into details other than to say that while a couple of the games are admittedly a bit archaic, you are bound to get your money''s worth with many of the titles here. Banjo-Kazooie, Banjo-Tooie, Perfect Dark, Grabbed by the Ghoulies, RC Pro AM 1 & 2... just those games alone are worth the cost of admission. A perfect compilation for old school gamers and newbies alike.'),
(N'Joan', N'Baker', N'joan.baker8706@example.org', '2015-09-15', 5, N'Good price.'),
(N'Robert', N'Singh', N'robert.singh8360@example.org', '2015-09-15', 4, N'One step to Perfect. Just make the characters'' face more alive.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Brooks', N'ryan.brooks2125@example.com', '2015-09-15', 5, N'i had it on the 360 so i had to get it on the next gen im very pleased 5 stars'),
(N'Anita', N'Ortiz', N'anita.ortiz2329@example.com', '2015-09-15', 1, N'Just as boring as real soccer. No shots. No goals. Yeah 0-0 tie!!! Control setup is GARBAGE as is typical with most Japanese games. The controls are also delayed. When you pass, expect your guy to wait 1 second for no reason and then pass. Same when shooting. Of course in that 1 second, the ball is usually stolen from you.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Wood', N'daniel.wood3995@example.com', '2015-09-16', 5, N'This was they only birthday present my grandson asked for along with the Super Hero Spider Man play set. He is going to love them!'),
(N'Anthony', N'Hernandez', N'anthony.hernandez9375@example.net', '2015-09-16', 5, N'Cant stop playing. Great characters.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Gonzalez', N'ivan.gonzalez8244@example.com', '2015-09-16', 4, N'Perfect'),
(N'Patricia', N'Okonkwo', N'patricia.okonkwo1693@example.net', '2015-09-16', 4, N'Great value for newcomers to the series! Veterans might be a tad disappointed. BUT there is a lot of content in a single package regardless of where you lie in the player-base. Destiny offers polished 1st person combat with RPG/MMO mechanics. If you are interested in a moderate amount of depth in a FPS this is a good buy. While the story and presentation is better in the new content, the older missions still feel primarily lackluster. It is best played with a few friends, and shouldn''t be taken too seriously.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Green', N'tyler.green5137@example.com', '2015-09-16', 5, N'they work great for the ps2 controller'),
(N'Joshua', N'Davis', N'joshua.davis2557@example.net', '2015-09-16', 5, N'I hate doing non-verified reviews but I bought my copy off the PSN store, and post reviews here regularly on other things. In fact, I have been a staunch hater of this game for a long time, and I will illustrate why. Please read in it''s entirety. The original game was a complete mess. Content was most DEFINITELY cut from the game and piece mealed together for DLC. Resulting in a discombobulated story, a horrible leveling system, itemization was poor, and the fact that the loot system was also coupled with an RNG system based on pure luck could leave you wondering why you just played 3-4 hours for NO advancement what so ever with your character. The voice acting was bad and aside from the gun play mechanics, there were free to play games better than this. And it stayed this way, until last week when Patch 2.0 was launched, and against better judgement after hearing the story was a lot better and the progression system had been revamped, I ended up giving it ONE last shot. Now I am...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Powell', N'carolyn.powell8661@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Delivered on time and no damage.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Lopez', N'nadia.lopez4379@example.org', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Very good, I gave it to my friend, he likes it (very much)'),
(N'Peter', N'Nguyen', N'peter.nguyen9087@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Good protective case for your vita. Quality is acceptable, place for game storage and regular earbuds. Also non bulky. There isn''t room for a charger, Bluetooth earbuds and ,at my age, I need reading glasses and can''t get them to fit in here. That however is not a problem because, that would make it bulky. The elastic that holds the vita in place is probably unnecessary. It would be nice to be able to play with the system in a cover of some kind without having to remove it, but this is the next best thing It works well, 9.99 is definitely a good price too, I can''t imagine you will find something better for that price.'),
(N'Jason', N'Foster', N'jason.foster1014@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Good Game works perfectly.'),
(N'Peter', N'Ramirez', N'peter.ramirez7864@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'not bad for a reliable gaming console. lets me play at my best!'),
(N'Peter', N'Thompson', N'peter.thompson1896@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'I''ve been playing more and more games on PC and this stick fits the bill perfectly. Compact enough to sit on my desk or my lap yet this is still a pretty solid and large piece of kit. It was a snap to configure. It wasn''t plug and play on Windows 7, but a quick install of the Xbox 360 controller drivers and it was working perfectly. This controller acts as a Wired Xbox 360 controller, so just go ahead and download the drivers from Microsoft.com then assign the controller in your games. Here''s the link if you''re too lazy to Google: https://www.microsoft.com/hardware/en-us/d/xbox-360-controller-for-windows The fit and finish of this controller are beautiful. I love the mirror finish of the kanji logo and the subtle yet striking lines (the actual colors of the gray design have less contrast on the actual product). Functionally, this controller is perfect. All the buttons are solid and extremely responsive, the stick is also the best I''ve ever used. No complaints at all. Perfect for...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Clark', N'kyle.clark2437@example.com', '2015-09-17', 4, N'not bad and we have fun when we play it but does get boring after a while like all mmo''s'),
(N'Olivia', N'Thomas', N'olivia.thomas1561@example.net', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Nice. Look and sound good. Holding up to alot of use. Would buy again.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Hall', N'gregory.hall5079@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Great Sonic game.'),
(N'Edward', N'Johnson', N'edward.johnson4639@example.org', '2015-09-17', 5, N'One of the best games ever made. Fallout Tactics is OK but it can get boring as it doesn''t have that much you keep my interest on and the missions get repetitive (find a good tactic and apply it ad-infinitum) but the other 2 are classics that should be played by anyone calling themselves a gamer. If you find the resolution way too low there are high-resolution patches that make it look great even on modern computers.'),
(N'Priya', N'Moore', N'priya.moore2970@example.net', '2015-09-17', 4, N'Lovely FPS!'),
(N'Michael', N'Sullivan', N'michael.sullivan1182@example.com', '2015-09-17', 1, N'The controls are terrible!!! I don''t know how anybody likes this game!! Graphics are crappy as well.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Powell', N'jonathan.powell3149@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'This is the greatest psx game ever made lol. I''ve gone through like 4 copies of this game cause I play it so much'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Powell', N'jonathan.powell3149@example.com', '2015-09-17', 5, N'This game is okay. It''s kind of repetitive, kinda like the Anime is. It follows the first (and I think Second) season of Bleach, starting when Ichigo and Co go to rescue Rukia'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Cruz', N'carolyn.cruz8894@example.org', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Bought it to play Jungle Beat, did not regret.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Cruz', N'carolyn.cruz8894@example.org', '2015-09-17', 5, N'Works great.'),
(N'Larry', N'Kelly', N'larry.kelly8393@example.org', '2015-09-17', 4, N'its a cable, as long as it keeps working I am happy'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2015-09-18', 5, N'The best first person shooter since the original Halo! Absolutely first-class lads. I haven''t had this much fun in a game since I first played Halo on the Xbox. This really is the best. The graphics are the best we''ve ever seen almost like real life and the sound made me think I was outside with all technological crap going on in the sky and gems everywhere. This is absolutely fantastic. No one has the right to say anything bad about Destiny The Taken King Legendary Edition!'),
(N'Carol', N'Morris', N'carol.morris5785@example.net', '2015-09-18', 5, N'I love DC Comics and Lego. I collected all 147 characters and the 250 gold bricks. I enjoyed the funny plot and the side quests. Even the racing tracks and VR tracks. I did encounter some glitches but nothing that made it more frustrating or prevented me to completing this game. I had lots of fun playing this game!'),
(N'Charles', N'Flores', N'charles.flores3911@example.net', '2015-09-18', 4, N'pretty good. Protects it if ever dropped. Just hard to plug in mic, ended up stretching mine out'),
(N'Christopher', N'Ramirez', N'christopher.ramirez9675@example.com', '2015-09-18', 5, N'nothing bad to say, easy to use, easy to tell when controllers are charged'),
(N'Helen', N'Murphy', N'helen.murphy5048@example.net', '2015-09-18', 5, N'Exactly what i needed, shipped on time'),
(N'Walter', N'Turner', N'walter.turner6870@example.com', '2015-09-18', 5, N'I like how you can sit on your couch or bed and play games compatable with the GameCube controller instead of grabbing a chair or sit on the floor closer.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Hill', N'jeffrey.hill2893@example.com', '2015-09-19', 5, N'it was great new just like advertised'),
(N'Joyce', N'Lopez', N'joyce.lopez7894@example.net', '2015-09-19', 2, N'This was what I taught was a great sounding headset I had it since February if this year and I was fine until I decided to take out and old turtlebeach tango and give it a try but before I even got into the wireless world of headsets I had an Audio Technical ATH M50 paired with a DSS from turtlebeach and I can tell you that there is no better sounding than that combined to my knowledge but after my son destroyed my M50''s I ventured in the world of the wireless. Now that i''ve compared both the corsair and the turtlebeach I trust turtlebeach to deliver a much better audio experience, the corsair sound is really muddy and choked the positional audio of the TBeach is way more accurate with crispier highs and better footsteps for FPS games As I said before it is a good headset but only if you never heard anything better'),
(N'Michael', N'Alvarez', N'michael.alvarez4782@example.org', '2015-09-19', 4, N'sounds good, can be used with PC with a few adapters and the wireless box. This thing will eat your AAA batteries though. hell not even my rechargeable batteries stand a chance. I would find my self at the time using the cheap 20$ Microsoft headset more than this head set at times. but for great in game sound and decent voice chat, it only loses 1 star.'),
(N'Joan', N'Parker', N'joan.parker7520@example.com', '2015-09-19', 5, N'OMG This game is awesome! Before arkham city there was Spider-Man 2. The controls are somewhat easy to pickup. Swinging around new york city is great. The graphics for this game are pretty decent except for the pedestrians walking around the street. Aside from that this game is great!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Diaz', N'daniel.diaz5817@example.net', '2015-09-19', 5, N'Great title, love it---- fits my collection right!!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Collins', N'kelly.collins9080@example.net', '2015-09-19', 4, N'solid game'),
(N'Ravi', N'Raghunathan', N'ravi.raghunathan4300@example.com', '2015-09-19', 5, N'My child Loves It !'),
(N'James', N'Ivanov', N'james.ivanov5788@example.org', '2015-09-19', 4, N'I like the game very much it was a lot of fun it was difficult but I will get better at it and I will find woody can''t wait'),
(N'James', N'Ivanov', N'james.ivanov5788@example.org', '2015-09-19', 5, N'I enjoyed playing the Green Lantern game it felt good to be Lantern'),
(N'Richard', N'Mitchell', N'richard.mitchell4290@example.net', '2015-09-19', 5, N'This is a great piece of equipment to have, the battery lasts for quite long and the cable it comes with is very lengthy, when it is charging, you won''t even notice it''s there, not to mention this will save you lots of money on disposable batteries.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Powell', N'sharon.powell2871@example.net', '2015-09-20', 5, N'Bought this as a present and she loved it.'),
(N'Michael', N'Phillips', N'michael.phillips5404@example.com', '2015-09-20', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Peterson', N'benjamin.peterson2344@example.org', '2015-09-20', 1, N'#$%# this game'),
(N'Anita', N'Mendoza', N'anita.mendoza7431@example.org', '2015-09-20', 5, N'Great classic game!'),
(N'Debra', N'Wood', N'debra.wood5333@example.org', '2015-09-20', 2, N'This game is definitely not worth $40. The original version was annoying and frustrating and the "Ultimate" release is just as frustrating and annoying. This game is NOT fun nor is it amusing to play. The boss battle is still impossible to get through, yet every nerd online can upload getting by him with 1 shot. There is no upgrade system nor improvements in order to get through the game. The box says there are 5 new campaigns in this version, and they are JUST as annoying. Of course the XBox One autosave feature is utilized, which enhances the frustration factor.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Murphy', N'alexander.murphy6751@example.org', '2015-09-20', 5, N'My original joystick covers were wearing down fast, this is an inexpensive way to extend their life. Feels good, no issues whatsoever using them.'),
(N'Susan', N'Young', N'susan.young4301@example.org', '2015-09-20', 5, N'Bought for a family member and they loved finally having their own copy of it. Absolutely loves the game.'),
(N'Janet', N'Ramos', N'janet.ramos2310@example.net', '2015-09-20', 5, N'Loved this game, I played revelations 1 and its not a continuation - sequel. Its a different story and its also great. A must play if you are a Resident Evil fan!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Barnes', N'barbara.barnes2671@example.net', '2015-09-20', 3, N'OKAY game but too hard to make games. I got this gamr and went out with fam to get some Taco Bell chalupos which was awsom. Plus need more content like a I want make flying taco that come out brick I hit ad maybe taco suits so can fly with shell flap likewings. Or even make my own tacos like in tacomaker dnow that a good game.'),
(N'Justin', N'Nowak', N'justin.nowak2051@example.net', '2015-09-21', 5, N'Microsoft has done an excellent job with their controller designs'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ramos', N'brandon.ramos7372@example.org', '2015-09-21', 2, N'To start, I play Destiny every day and have from day one. I have the game for xbox one and playstation 4. I bought Destiny + the season pass on release for the xbox one and plastation 4 and played the game on both consoles. When I heard about the DLC I pre-ordered the collectors edition for both the xbox one and playstation 4. I am giving the DLC a two star review on the xbox one and a three star review on the PS4. The Taken King content is short and not really all that interesting and the price is way to high. I do not know why but playing on the xbox one you get less in game currency and weapon/armor drops when killing enemies.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Gray', N'andrea.gray5641@example.com', '2015-09-21', 1, N'The cords were for the X-Box 360 instead of the original X-Box. I did get a refund, though.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'White', N'kathleen.white6165@example.com', '2015-09-21', 4, N'Little expensive but still work!'),
(N'Jose', N'Myers', N'jose.myers6664@example.com', '2015-09-21', 5, N'Little short, but my kids love it'),
(N'Carol', N'Ramirez', N'carol.ramirez7016@example.org', '2015-09-21', 5, N'This is very sturdy and works better than I''d expected. Converting the setup to GT style was tricky, but overall the experience wasn''t off-putting, and it''s the most realistic pedal setup I''ve used. I''ve put about 34 hours of hard use into this thing and hasn''t shown any signs of wear so far. Totally worth the price for me.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Butler', N'gregory.butler3068@example.org', '2015-09-21', 1, N'This is important due to all the bugs, and freezes. Press the + button and click Options and change either the sound or brightness a click or two, ''Accept'' will appear at the bottom of the list. Click ''Accept'' game saved! So why one star? Because the glitches and game killing bugs ARE THE SAME as in years 1-4! Totally unacceptable. I only paid $5 for this game and still feel ripped. There seems to be more animation than game play, and more ''traveling'' from gaming spots. For example to continue the game from ''return to Diagon Alley'' requires traveling the full length of Diagon Alley, entering the Leaking Cauldron, London, Train station, Hogwart''s station, long dirt path, another long dirt path, Hogwart''s dirt court then you get to travel all the long halls in the castle. Years 1-4 you continues the game from where you left off! No continuity! Castle is different, spells are missing, spells aim is off. This is suppose to be Harry Potter not the Death Eaters. It''s a downer to abandon...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Diaz', N'rachel.diaz6724@example.org', '2015-09-22', 1, N'This console is ugly. I returned it immediately and bought a PS4 with Drive Club, much better option.'),
(N'Priya', N'Hughes', N'priya.hughes6045@example.net', '2015-09-22', 2, N'Not a fan of subscription service games, especially where you continue to pay to do extra stuff. (Why I never got into world of Warcraft). I miss the stand alone Stronghold games, still play Crusade today.'),
(N'Helen', N'Richardson', N'helen.richardson7017@example.org', '2015-09-22', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Sharon', N'Mendoza', N'sharon.mendoza9664@example.org', '2015-09-22', 5, N'Not only is the cable for the PS3 but it works very well with a PS2 as well. When it comes to ordering component cables, it''s best to order an official license product like the Sony A/V Component Cable - PS3. Never order a made-in-china component trash cable cause it won''t work and can show a bad color image. This cable is legit and I recommend it to anyone that just want it for either a PS2 or a PS3, or get two for both PS2 and PS3.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Clark', N'yuki.clark2318@example.org', '2015-09-22', 1, N'Bought one pair and they made the controller feel so much better that I bought another pair for my second controller. Not even 3 months have passed and they are developing a horrendous stink. I had to remove them both yesterday. These are definitely not a long term solution for a better grip on your controller. I would not recommend them. The foam material absorbs sweat.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Lopez', N'evelyn.lopez2078@example.net', '2015-09-22', 5, N'my son loves it'),
(N'Joyce', N'Garcia', N'joyce.garcia7766@example.net', '2015-09-22', 5, N'Madden feels the same as ever but this is a good deal especially with the EA Access 1 year deal. The fact that you can get BF4 among several of the EA sports titles is a nice added bonus. Also nice to get the 1TB HDD vs the 500 GB HDDs we saw in the launch versions of the XBone and PS4. While I still prefer my PS4 overall I have both and they each have their pros and cons.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Patel', N'kelly.patel9887@example.org', '2015-09-22', 5, N'While searching for Spore, Since the stores no longer carry it and i needed to replace my daughter''s missing game, i came across the expansion pack. My daughter who loses interest in things quickly still loves this game after a few years of having it so while i was replacing her game i picked up the expansion pack as well. To see she loved was ecstatic when she got it is an understatement. She was also glued to the computer for two full day''s playing it before i had no other choice but to give her a time limit so her sister could get a turn,'),
(N'Thomas', N'Taylor', N'thomas.taylor8796@example.com', '2015-09-22', 5, N'This is a review for the Japanese version of the Mii Brawler amiibo. I love it! You can actually set a Computer to be a Mii, and have the full challenge of a amiibo! I''m bought several of these to make my Mii Army of amiibos! I definitely recommend you get one right away! P.S. Every amiibo will look the same, so if you want to make sure you can tell them apart, put a small identity sticker on the bottom.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Peterson', N'victoria.peterson9891@example.org', '2015-09-22', 4, N'You need friends that play this also to make it really fun, but that is expected for Smash'),
(N'Nathan', N'Sanchez', N'nathan.sanchez9510@example.net', '2015-09-23', 4, N'It did as advertised.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Carter', N'kenneth.carter3592@example.org', '2015-09-23', 4, N'Great graphics,but i stick with need for speed,dont like the fact the the race goes on in a circle type of street'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Carter', N'kenneth.carter3592@example.org', '2015-09-23', 2, N'Too hard stupidly hard,i trust me i tried hard to beat but just gave up don''t buy,matter of fact don''t take it as gift'),
(N'Helen', N'Cook', N'helen.cook8169@example.net', '2015-09-23', 2, N'Day of Reckoning is a far better designed game than the SvR series. SvR is absolutely awful.'),
(N'Helen', N'Cook', N'helen.cook8169@example.net', '2015-09-23', 3, N'It''s a good game that I like with a great story, it''s just kind of tedious and tiring to play.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Christina', N'Richardson', N'christina.richardson3117@example.net', '2015-09-23', 5, N'It is a much better build quality than any actual GameCube controller, the D pad is bigger The left and right triggers are digital input which is good for the game this controller is meant for smash brothers but can be used with any game that uses the classic controller it is a much better option than the classic controller. The only catch is that you need to plug the controller into a Wii remote.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Nguyen', N'daniel.nguyen7036@example.org', '2015-09-23', 5, N'Black Flag Redux!'),
(N'Paul', N'Edwards', N'paul.edwards8633@example.org', '2015-09-23', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Larry', N'Bennett', N'larry.bennett8685@example.org', '2015-09-23', 5, N'Love this game'),
(N'George', N'Hernandez', N'george.hernandez1685@example.com', '2015-09-23', 5, N'Very pleased. Some people complain about the tool it comes with to remove the originals snapping, but this is a very minor issue. There are tons of items you can use to pry them off. Great feel, great look. I just ordered another.'),
(N'Susan', N'Reyes', N'susan.reyes5064@example.org', '2015-09-23', 5, N'exactly as described good job'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Rivera', N'jonathan.rivera7852@example.org', '2015-09-23', 5, N'This game was fun, and my son was able to beat it pretty easy!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Watson', N'evelyn.watson3093@example.org', '2015-09-24', 5, N'Love it, it''s like Peace Walker on steroids, I just liked action-oriented ones more, like Snake Eater, than RPG-like. I''m still less than halfway through the game, if this changes I''ll update.'),
(N'Edward', N'Thomas', N'edward.thomas7003@example.com', '2015-09-24', 3, N'Nice game, but I''ve seen better... 1. The fights with the werewolfs are very disappointing. 2. There are too many videos in and the actual game play is very short.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Jimenez', N'cheryl.jimenez9532@example.net', '2015-09-24', 5, N'Finally! We have a digital code timecard available on Amazon! This has long been waited for! The Blizzard Entertainment World of Warcraft Game Card is a prepaid game card that will give you 60-days of subscription time on World of Warcraft. This allows you to use your Amazon account or Amazon gift cards to gain time in WoW, without ever having to give Blizzard your credit card information directly! Once purchased, it is very easy to load the card for your account balance. The code is available instantly for use on your Battle. Net account. Once loaded, you can play your game care-free for the next 60 days!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Richardson', N'samuel.richardson8354@example.com', '2015-09-24', 5, N'this doesnt have any glitches and works great'),
(N'Diane', N'Hernandez', N'diane.hernandez7122@example.net', '2015-09-24', 5, N'Amazing. They did one hell of a job remastering this. The PS4 itself is very well done but It took the better part of a day to download the game...My twis actually could not play anything on their birthday and that was annoying. Bundles sound great until their is no CD/DVD to install.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Robinson', N'hannah.robinson8954@example.com', '2015-09-25', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Thomas', N'Jenkins', N'thomas.jenkins3390@example.com', '2015-09-25', 5, N'Got this for playing Call of Duty online with friends on the Wii U. Works great!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Jenkins', N'thomas.jenkins3390@example.com', '2015-09-25', 5, N'These things are overpriced, so it was nice to get a decent deal one one. It''s been fun to have for Smash Bros and Mario Kart.'),
(N'Michael', N'Walker', N'michael.walker2585@example.com', '2015-09-25', 4, N'Cool game and great to play in Tolkein''s world. Game can seem a bit overwhelming and repetitive at times, but that can usually mean you haven''t progressed enough to take control of enemies and maybe you''re not using the nemesis system to your full advantage. Final boss fight was a missed opportunity, unfortunately.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Sanchez', N'sofia.sanchez5237@example.net', '2015-09-25', 4, N'Gundam breaker is a fun experience, if you like playing missions, destroying your enemies, and taking their parts to augment your mecha. If your a gundam fan and like building exotic mecha from the universe than you should like this game. I like the different weapons choices, And varying terrain to play on.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Morales', N'matthew.morales6153@example.org', '2015-09-25', 5, N'Great game and slightly difficult puzzles at times but it keeps trying to figure it out.'),
(N'Peter', N'Suzuki', N'peter.suzuki9730@example.net', '2015-09-25', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Robert', N'Raghunathan', N'robert.raghunathan8323@example.com', '2015-09-25', 5, N'I love this game! Need I say more?'),
(N'Paul', N'Torres', N'paul.torres9769@example.org', '2015-09-25', 5, N'all good'),
(N'Dennis', N'Tanaka', N'dennis.tanaka4709@example.org', '2015-09-25', 5, N'If you are a serious gamer like me who enjoys winding down the day with a session of Boarderlands 2 with a few of your friends, you know for a fact that the flimsy mic and headphone set that came with that expensive game system isn''t going to cut it. To all gamers, I would whole-heartily recommend that you upgrade to any headphones from Turtle Beach, the leading manufacture of gaming headphones. They offer a wide ride of models designed to fit your budget. Instead of gaming, I use the Recon 50 headphones for all of my computer tasks, like video/sound editing and chatting. It''s lightweight design and padded ear pieces makes it possible to wear these headphones comfortably for extended periods of time while offering reasonably clear sound quality. For the price, the Recon 50 is a versatile set of headphones that will not disappoint you.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Garcia', N'jeremy.garcia4731@example.org', '2015-09-26', 4, N'Works good.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Garcia', N'jeremy.garcia4731@example.org', '2015-09-26', 4, N'fun games'),
(N'Jose', N'Powell', N'jose.powell8910@example.com', '2015-09-26', 5, N'nice game'),
(N'Jose', N'Powell', N'jose.powell8910@example.com', '2015-09-26', 5, N'nice controller'),
(N'Donald', N'Robinson', N'donald.robinson9983@example.com', '2015-09-26', 4, N'Also plays 3d'),
(N'John', N'Chavez', N'john.chavez6849@example.com', '2015-09-26', 5, N'These guys work fine which is great because being a collector I buy alot of used ps3 games that don''t have cases and such and the discs fit fine and the covers fit fine in these.'),
(N'Susan', N'Garcia', N'susan.garcia2506@example.net', '2015-09-26', 3, N'Not as high of quality as my skin "Painted Faded and Cracked USA American Flag by Matrix". Matrix quality & color edged it out. Look at my review for the matrix skin and you''ll see why.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Lopez', N'carolyn.lopez5632@example.com', '2015-09-26', 3, N'Not comfortable on my ears. I gave these to my brother.'),
(N'Jason', N'Davis', N'jason.davis9198@example.net', '2015-09-27', 5, N'This game is an absolute delight to play. You gotta own.'),
(N'Janet', N'Morales', N'janet.morales8087@example.org', '2015-09-27', 4, N'Destiny was a very OK game for me when I first played it. I traded my copy in to take advantage of the recent deals to get The Taken King at a discount and I''m glad I did. TTK fixes many of the issues found in the base game, adding more story and depth, better quest tracking and is an overall better version of the game. If you didn''t get Destiny a year ago now is definitely the time to buy. If you''re a dedicated Destiny player you likely already have this, but if you don''t its worth a look.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Bennett', N'kenneth.bennett2931@example.net', '2015-09-27', 5, N'excelente producto'),
(N'Angela', N'Collins', N'angela.collins6720@example.net', '2015-09-27', 4, N'Nice graphics, nice gameplay, but the campain is really short'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Gomez', N'carolyn.gomez9084@example.com', '2015-09-27', 5, N'This game controller works pretty well overall. In the past, I''ve played games that would have been better with a controller with just my keyboard and often the games put very little effort into correctly mapping the controller to the keys. This controller works with many games, even some ancient DOS games will identify this as a "joystick" and allow me to use it! If you want to play games on your PC this is a good investment. I have not had any issues and it has made games like Final Fantasy VII more fun than they were before.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Howard', N'hannah.howard8766@example.org', '2015-09-27', 3, N'its ok'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Reed', N'cynthia.reed1845@example.org', '2015-09-27', 5, N'If you are a fan of these franchises you can''t go wrong. I''ve played for about 7 hours now and love it. I got the starter kit, The Scooby Doo pack and the Back to the Future Pack.....will definitely get a Ninjago fun pack tomorrow. The presentation and sound is fantastic. The gameplay is really fun and if hearing things like Batman say, "We aren''t in Gotham anymore.", when he lands in Oz just thrills you to the core, this game is for you. I had Scooby Doo in the Oz level and the Wicked Witch threatened to get me and my "giant" dog too. Can I tell you The Horse of Many Colors even had a cameo? Lots of movie references----Scooby Doo hums the batman tv theme periodically! The Scooby Doo world is even "drawn" or shaded to look like the cartoon so whatever characters you take there look as if they are part of the cartoon. You get to play through the game and glimpse worlds but to visit the actual worlds such as DC World, Scooby Doo, Ninjago, and take on various missions in those huge...'),
(N'Mary', N'Ivanov', N'mary.ivanov5021@example.net', '2015-09-27', 5, N'My son loved this game! Thank you!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Butler', N'sharon.butler8186@example.org', '2015-09-27', 1, N'I forgot how terrible this game was. It has a nice roster, but the moves are terrible. For gba, the graphics are okay but the sound, not good.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Moore', N'stephanie.moore4884@example.net', '2015-09-27', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Jerry', N'Nelson', N'jerry.nelson2507@example.net', '2015-09-27', 3, N'Not as good as the Nintendo model as you may get a few dead spots on the outer edges, but once you figure that out, it works and for a lot less money.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Wood', N'tomasz.wood3611@example.com', '2015-09-27', 5, N'Awesome helmet must have for every Halo fan even if you don''t have a 360 it''s good to have the helmet for display.'),
(N'Brian', N'Ross', N'brian.ross6535@example.org', '2015-09-27', 3, N'wtf is this'),
(N'Brian', N'Ross', N'brian.ross6535@example.org', '2015-09-27', 4, N'better than 9'),
(N'Hannah', N'Williams', N'hannah.williams4799@example.com', '2015-09-27', 5, N'LOVE IT enough said'),
(N'Hannah', N'Williams', N'hannah.williams4799@example.com', '2015-09-27', 5, N'Wife loves it, i''ll take her word for it :)'),
(N'Janet', N'Green', N'janet.green9951@example.org', '2015-09-27', 5, N'Love my PS3 and even more my PS4. If you can get this for less than 150 is a good deal!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2015-09-28', 1, N'Phantom Pain is the best game ever lads! I''ve never been able to tie balloons to enemies before in a concept stolen from Pixar''s Up. You will stealth your way into the amazing levels which are all modern works of art that should be inside gaming museums in the future, all the same levels but different guys in different hats! You can ride a white horse and ride into the enemy base as no one can see you on a white horse. It''s amazing conceptually. Absolutely amazing, a marster-piece of the mind.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nguyen', N'sandra.nguyen1034@example.org', '2015-09-28', 5, N'Bien'),
(N'Pamela', N'Rivera', N'pamela.rivera1837@example.org', '2015-09-28', 5, N'Nice game, it was a really good purchase.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Rodriguez', N'jerry.rodriguez4675@example.org', '2015-09-28', 5, N'Excellent Product...100% recommended'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Ward', N'jennifer.ward1191@example.com', '2015-09-28', 4, N'Fun game to kill time with, but I can''t shake off the feeling that this game is nothing but Far Cry 3 with just different numbering and different environment. 3 was phenomenal, this one is just meh.'),
(N'William', N'Cox', N'william.cox1493@example.com', '2015-09-28', 5, N'Excellent article, I recommend it 100%'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Mitchell', N'benjamin.mitchell4948@example.com', '2015-09-28', 1, N'I would not recommend this product. I bought it to chat with friends online and record audio while capturing video game footage. The mic quality is very poor, it records a static or a buzzing after about seven minutes of recording which I can''t find the cause of and there is also a very faint, odd low tone that is picked up in recording about every other second when my voice is not buzzing. I know the price is tempting (it''s why I bought it) but just save yourself the hassle and AVOID THIS HEADSET. There have been multiple folks on the internet that have all had the same issues I''ve had, so don''t just take my word on it, do some research. (Like I SHOULD have done.) The only positive thing I can really say about this is that the sound quality from the headphones was pretty good for the price.'),
(N'Steven', N'Kim', N'steven.kim6319@example.net', '2015-09-28', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Brian', N'Clark', N'brian.clark6698@example.net', '2015-09-28', 1, N'Went short in 3 days'),
(N'Samuel', N'Cooper', N'samuel.cooper1112@example.com', '2015-09-28', 3, N'The game itself is alright, but it''s most definitely not an "Animal Crossing" game. I''m not really sure as to why they even named it animal crossing instead of say, "Nook''s Happy Home Designer." Like I said the game itself is fine, but in no way is it really an Animal Crossing game aside from having the characters from Animal Crossing. As far as I can tell, there''s no fishing, bug catching, or open world exploration really. It''s just a game about designing homes, fun if you like that kind of thing, not so great if you''re expecting Animal Crossing. If you like decorating homes, get it. If you want an actual Animal Crossing game, this is not the game for you.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Bell', N'carlos.bell1326@example.net', '2015-09-28', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Pamela', N'Castillo', N'pamela.castillo8089@example.com', '2015-09-29', 1, N'Not ready for prime time. First unit fit and looked fine. But didn''t work. Received replacement. That one was dead too! Both sent back for a refund.'),
(N'Helen', N'Patel', N'helen.patel5725@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Kids love skylanders and thsee traps are a must. Just don''t be caught paying someone more than the value.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Campbell', N'lisa.campbell2115@example.org', '2015-09-29', 5, N'way cool game fun never ends with mario levels'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ross', N'patricia.ross1134@example.net', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Great Product Thanks for the fast shipping and product as described'),
(N'Henry', N'Clark', N'henry.clark7917@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Got this as a gift for my dad. He loved it'),
(N'Ryan', N'Garcia', N'ryan.garcia3612@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Dead Space Is One of the greatest Action Horror games to come out in 2007 and one of the most beautiful of the last generation I enjoyed and love this game the only downside is the stopping sometimes doesn''t work the way you want to and the space scenes of gravitity are sometimes problematic'),
(N'Ryan', N'Garcia', N'ryan.garcia3612@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'NinJa Gaiden Sigma Was A Great Game And is still A Great Hack n slash Game made similar to resident evil meets devil may cry was originally on the xbox in 2004 and on Nintendo at first and this is an awesome Game and always will be one of my favorites in my collection'),
(N'Ryan', N'Butler', N'ryan.butler5965@example.com', '2015-09-29', 4, N'this mouse looks and feels amazing I have never had a bad experience with Sentey I recommend their products to everyone who is looking for a good gaming equipment'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Carter', N'kenneth.carter3592@example.org', '2015-09-29', 3, N'Not as good gaming as the graphics,the fighting mechanics aint,my 6 year old beat me just pressing one button back to back lolll i couldn''t beliece it'),
(N'James', N'Reyes', N'james.reyes6221@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'good'),
(N'Steven', N'Rivera', N'steven.rivera3679@example.org', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Still the best'),
(N'Larry', N'Ramirez', N'larry.ramirez6673@example.net', '2015-09-29', 2, N'These are tough games to review because, as others have pointed out, the games themselves are fantastic, which solid graphics, fun gameplay, and a good soundtrack. However, trying to get help from customer support is like asking a clown car for a ride to the airport. OK, imagine a Venn Diagram with Talesworld, Avangate, and one or two other companies all intersecting. All these companies, retailers, developers, etc. are associated with the games in one way or another, yet none seem knowledgeable about the others'' part in the process, meaning that if you have any problem whatsoever, you''re pretty much out of luck. In my case, I had both a financial (overbilling) and a technical support question; I contacted pretty much every company associated with Mount and Blade to try to get my questions addressed, and I either received no reply, or a form letter response directing me to another company, which in turn directed me to yet another company (or back to the original company)....'),
(N'Noah', N'Rogers', N'noah.rogers2883@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'The greatest game I played when xbox one game out.'),
(N'Heather', N'Price', N'heather.price1487@example.com', '2015-09-29', 4, N'Great ;)'),
(N'Lisa', N'Wright', N'lisa.wright3112@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Gutierrez', N'cynthia.gutierrez3443@example.org', '2015-09-29', 5, N'So cool! It even makes sounds haha'),
(N'Angela', N'Morris', N'angela.morris9187@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'I can break it! Ralph is a great addition to our set. I slightly wish I could''ve bought he and Vanelloppi in a set, but that''s okay. His special feature of breaking things is fun for my 5 year old. Overall, the figure is A+ quality, and a nice part of our infinity toy box.'),
(N'William', N'Reed', N'william.reed6921@example.net', '2015-09-29', 5, N'the standard in golf games'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Parker', N'elizabeth.parker4439@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Perfect revival of the first gears of war with some added very worthwhile can content'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Morris', N'jennifer.morris1756@example.com', '2015-09-29', 5, N'Link is my favorite Nintendo character. This amiibo has a great attention to detail, as most do.'),
(N'Anita', N'Morgan', N'anita.morgan3461@example.com', '2015-09-29', 4, N'I have all 3 Dinsney infinity games and this is the best campaign I''ve played in any of them. 2.0''s campaigns were horrible but they really redeemed themselves this time. It''s a lot of silly fetch quests so far but it''s a lot more interesting than battle these frost giants, save these people, etc over and over again. Theres a lot of humor in it as well. Even a skyrim joke when talking to a townsperson and Jar Jar Binks in carbonite. Since the price is $25, I''d say it''s worth it. Any Star Wars fan will have a good time with it. Plus the playset unlocks tons of the original trilogy ships and toys. I bought infinity 3.0 as a download since I did not want the figures/playset that came with it. I''ve watched the gameplay of it on youtube and I was less than impressed in the least. Also not a fan of the prequel/clone wars stuff at all (with exception of Darth Maul). I feel this one is tons better and more varied. UPDATE: I''m about 2/3 the way through the campaign and it''s crazy fun. It''s...'),
(N'Zachary', N'Thompson', N'zachary.thompson7299@example.org', '2015-09-30', 5, N'My 9-year old son loves Disney Infinity and this edition is the best one yet!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Adams', N'michelle.adams8885@example.net', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Exactly what Destiny needed. It doesn''t really address the story concerns of Year 1, but introduces a new, interesting storyline. Plus there is so much to do, I don''t even know where to begin!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Johnson', N'dennis.johnson3072@example.org', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Great game. Period! Being able to make your own levels is truly satisfying. Waiting for all the pieces to show up is not so fun, but it eases you into the creation process, for sure! Worth every penny! Plus it comes with quite the instruction manual.'),
(N'James', N'Diaz', N'james.diaz7181@example.org', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Great game! Thank you!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Myers', N'kathleen.myers9421@example.net', '2015-09-30', 5, N'It is a very engrossing game/story. I''ve been thinking getting this game for a while and i am really glad i did. The story is deep and interesting. I am not familiar with the anime/story so i really don''t know what to expect. It has humour behind the heavy serious storyline lightening things up. Characters are likeable. The game itself is very easy to play. Like other VN type games, each response leads to a different outcome. The difference is how the choices are given how you are going to react react on them with the use of your customizable in game cellphone(reply to an email, answer a call, open an attachment)which i find cool. Anyways, this a a very good game and in the same time a good read. I am really enjoying this game. '''),
(N'Amara', N'Alvarez', N'amara.alvarez1529@example.com', '2015-09-30', 4, N'Just a warning to others, as it states in the description, there isn''t anyway to hook up your mic. I fortunately have a wireless headset (http://amzn.to/1Gj6EV3) so it doesn''t affect me as much. I gave it one extra star because it works as my pc controller and installed super easy on windows 8.1.'),
(N'Richard', N'Hernandez', N'richard.hernandez7705@example.net', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Classic games, this version is a digital version, you must be careful.'),
(N'Richard', N'Hernandez', N'richard.hernandez7705@example.net', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Shocked the game screen, sound good, the gameplay enjoyed.'),
(N'Richard', N'Hernandez', N'richard.hernandez7705@example.net', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Sound great, the color is very beautiful, small noise, bargain price.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Wang', N'carolyn.wang5208@example.org', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Omar', N'Thompson', N'omar.thompson8220@example.org', '2015-09-30', 5, N'I''ve played both of these on the 360 and loved them, note they are upgraded for the One and at a steal of (currently) $15?! Yes. The series is fantastic and I''ve been meaning to grab the books as well. If you''re a fan of horror, post apocalyptic shooters, with little secrets therein in for you to find, customizable guns, a great story with consequences, this is the deal for you. 100% recommended.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Jones', N'sarah.jones2091@example.net', '2015-09-30', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Nicole', N'Patel', N'nicole.patel6915@example.com', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Good Game'),
(N'Dennis', N'Singh', N'dennis.singh9464@example.org', '2015-09-30', 5, N'Not bad'),
(N'Tyler', N'Smith', N'tyler.smith8831@example.org', '2015-09-30', 4, N'Happy Home Designer lacks the depth of a full Animal Crossing release. There are no bells to collect. You have no house of your own. There is no realtime day/night cycle. Some will be turned off by this. The good news it is still a very fun game. It also encourages playing at your own pace. I can hop in and design a house or two and be satisfied with the experience. It''s a great game while relaxing and you''re not in the mood for something that takes 100 % of your attention. There is little in the way of feedback as far as your interior decoration goes. The animals seem content with whatever you decide to give them. There is some online feedback, but all of the options are positive. Designing homes in AC has never been this deep or easy. In fact, the game handles more like a simplistic Sims game than a traditional Animal Crossing title. Hopefully, some of the features of this game will make their way into future titles. Having the ability to design homes from the ground up, from the...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Bailey', N'kathleen.bailey6347@example.com', '2015-09-30', 4, N'So I have spent a good amount of time now playing both Fifa and PES. until now, I was 100% a Fifa only person. But this year''s PES changed my mind on that. This review will be broken into a few categories. Graphics, Gameplay, and presentation. Graphics: Graphically, both Fifa and PES have their spots where they shine. For Fifa, it is the stadiums, at some points the grass, the crowd, and some players. PES also shows its strength graphically on the stadiums, player models, and the grass, but there''s some room for improvement. Gameplay: Gameplay is where this game blow FIFA out of the water. I have played the demo for FIFA 16. The game plays very slowly, and the passing/shooting seems so slow that it looks unrealistic. longer shots seems like they are floating into the net rather than being the hard shot that you took. PES blew me away here. Gameplay is smooth, it is a good pace, and the shots and passes feel more legit and real. this is definitely a better representation of soccer...'),
(N'Christine', N'Butler', N'christine.butler1128@example.org', '2015-09-30', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Justin', N'Harris', N'justin.harris2632@example.org', '2015-09-30', 3, N'Glitch after playing for a while. case damaged a little'),
(N'Kyle', N'Flores', N'kyle.flores1885@example.org', '2015-10-01', 5, N'People rating the game 1 star either don''t like strategy and depth, or never put the effort into understanding how to play the game. You can have all the experience in the world, but if you''ve never been part of an MMOFPS genre before then you''re going to 100% be required to suffer trial and error. Common complaints - people can''t find the action. The hex map tells you how many friendlies and enemies are in that area. You can hit U to redeploy and go anywhere your faction has control of. You can hit I and deploy to instant action, which will take you to where you''re most needed for backup. So you have base spawn and orbital drops. You can join and leave squads at will, and the community is the best. They''ll teach you everything you need to know. Youtube has tutorials for the rest, and the net has plenty of info about which guns are the best to buy. You can test them out first in the practice range all you want. There''s also attachments, and several types of infantry with different...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Harris', N'nathan.harris2060@example.com', '2015-10-01', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Tyler', N'Bennett', N'tyler.bennett5962@example.com', '2015-10-01', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Pamela', N'Gomez', N'pamela.gomez5742@example.net', '2015-10-01', 5, N'As a Uncharted fan. This game was fun & amazing to play on the PS Vita :) All i can say it is worth every penny. I could not stop playing once i started. I had to force myself to take it slow to enjoy it for a longer time then to beat the game right away like i always did. I wish Sony would pay attention to retail games for the ViTA cause they are really slacking on this for USA users :( I would luv to see Uncharted Golden Abyss part 2 , or just another Uncharted. XD'),
(N'Daniel', N'Young', N'daniel.young6682@example.org', '2015-10-01', 5, N'great way to have fun with family and friends'),
(N'Daniel', N'Young', N'daniel.young6682@example.org', '2015-10-01', 5, N'great graphics'),
(N'Robert', N'Bailey', N'robert.bailey8424@example.com', '2015-10-01', 1, N'If you want a game with characters you won''t be able to remember, controls that are frustrating, a story-line that (never mind, there is no discernible story-line), a linear game wrapped in a 3D world, and that oh-so-wonderful feeling of, "oh wait, I just beat the boss, but I was randomly pushing buttons like I''ve done a thousand times before, and now I advanced...dumb-luck", then this game is a must-have! Don''t simply take my word for it, check out a much better drafted review: http://kotaku.com/the-evil-within-the-kotaku-review-1649303587 Honestly, I was so excited to get this game, even purchased a new graphics card to drive it! I thought maybe I was becoming immune to games while playing this because I felt mixed emotions of boredom, frustration, inability to follow the characters or story-line or controls or levels, but then I searched for more reviews and found that many gamers expressed the dismay, although much more eloquently.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ferreira', N'aisha.ferreira1086@example.com', '2015-10-01', 5, N'great'),
(N'Priya', N'Garcia', N'priya.garcia2026@example.com', '2015-10-01', 5, N'Work perfectly. Delivered fast'),
(N'Raymond', N'Flores', N'raymond.flores4785@example.net', '2015-10-01', 4, N'great game'),
(N'Jessica', N'Russell', N'jessica.russell2493@example.com', '2015-10-01', 5, N'A very good Pokemon, and definitely a must-have for Pokemon fans. This game definitely brought the Pokemon games up into the modern era with all the new designs and graphics.'),
(N'Angela', N'Howard', N'angela.howard7978@example.com', '2015-10-01', 1, N'Was extremely excited about this game, being that I loved halo forward unto dawn. I played 1-2 and they were okay, so i was really excited to see what they did as I missed it on the playstaytion 1 when it first came out. First off, the story is insane. You play as a dolphin who is trying to escape a bomb shelter that he was trapped in after the coming of world war 2. Upon leaving the shelter, you are greeted by a Golf club named chuck who shows you the art of murdering humans with a pencil. I am sorry but this is just...insane. I got 12 hours into it fell asleep, worst game every made.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Flores', N'cynthia.flores4388@example.org', '2015-10-02', 1, N'This is a one player racing game. I believe you can turn it into a two player game if you purchase the helicopter, but honestly with skylanders, I am never certain anything will work. We too own all the other Skylanders etc. etc., but honestly I am so sick of buying new characters just to make a game function. It is so frustrating. This is just a racing game. How can it not be multiplayer full functionality?'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Sanchez', N'jonathan.sanchez2704@example.com', '2015-10-02', 5, N'Great game, great story, LOVE the martial arts and firefight game play, highly recommended!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Gomez', N'jacob.gomez5929@example.com', '2015-10-02', 5, N'EXCELENT'),
(N'Hannah', N'Thomas', N'hannah.thomas2170@example.com', '2015-10-02', 5, N'Item was just as described and in great condition. thank you! Can;t wait to play it!'),
(N'Zachary', N'Young', N'zachary.young4658@example.com', '2015-10-02', 4, N'A fun game and it runs great one the xbox 1...'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Jackson', N'jennifer.jackson1486@example.org', '2015-10-02', 5, N'Fun game'),
(N'Dee', N'Brown', N'dee.brown4024@example.org', '2015-10-02', 5, N'Great Game!!!'),
(N'Judith', N'Bennett', N'judith.bennett5650@example.net', '2015-10-02', 5, N'I haven''t played 3 yet, but 1 and 2 are wicked fun games to play, can''t wait to play 3'),
(N'Edward', N'Roberts', N'edward.roberts9058@example.org', '2015-10-02', 5, N'Delivered exactly as said it would be. However, the game itself is not for everybody'),
(N'Lucia', N'Fisher', N'lucia.fisher3562@example.org', '2015-10-03', 1, N'I love sports simulation games (ironically, as I''m not much of an athlete in real life situations). Wii Sports Resort hit it out of the park, and I''ve been looking for a worthy follow-up since. As another reviewer stated, THIS IS NOT IT. I found it cheap in a secondhand store and thought I had nothing to lose by trying it. Well, not paying full retail is about the only thing I had going for me. I tried to give it a fair shake, but all the negative reviews are absolutely correct: Poor recognition, ridiculously short games (which is a blessing since trying to get the game to see you is such an exercise in frustration, who wants to draw that out longer), in most sports really unclear what you''re even supposed to be doing. Really nothing at all to recommend it. I wish I could be more detailed, but I just realized that I haven''t gotten around to selling it back yet, but do remember hating it enough to never want to try it again. Kinect Sports 1&2, heck even MotionSports Adrenaline are...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Rivera', N'pamela.rivera1837@example.org', '2015-10-03', 4, N'I liked this game. I played first the PC version, and this PSP version has a lot of changes. It''s fun, but I definitely prefer the PC version.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Rivera', N'pamela.rivera1837@example.org', '2015-10-03', 3, N'I''ve played several Resident Evil games before, and this one is good, but not great.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Rivera', N'pamela.rivera1837@example.org', '2015-10-03', 2, N'When I bought this game, I thought it was going to be fun, but the truth is that is not. Usually everything with Iron man is cool, however, this game is the exception to that rule.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Rivera', N'pamela.rivera1837@example.org', '2015-10-03', 4, N'Both games are great. This package contains 2 discs, and 1 paper card with the serial code for Assassin''s Creed II.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Rivera', N'pamela.rivera1837@example.org', '2015-10-03', 5, N'This was a gift for my sister, she loved it. The first 3DS came in a "aqua blue" color, I didn''t like it, so I bought the purple one, and it''s beautiful.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Rivera', N'pamela.rivera1837@example.org', '2015-10-03', 4, N'I bought the red version, and despite how it looks on the picture, believe me, it really is red. My only issue with this protector is that came folded in the box, and when I put it on my Wii U Gamepad, its fold marks has not disappeared yet.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Lopez', N'jonathan.lopez5702@example.org', '2015-10-03', 5, N'Criminally underrated game. It''s like parappa the rappa mixed with professor layton. It gets a little challenging near the end. Music is obviously top notch and memorable. I''m pretty sure it was a low print run. I would recommend picking it up now if you''re a collector otherwise you might just want to download it.'),
(N'Julie', N'Kowalski', N'julie.kowalski2680@example.com', '2015-10-03', 5, N'Really cute game, not like the other Kirby classics but still a fun game overall.'),
(N'James', N'Mitchell', N'james.mitchell5765@example.net', '2015-10-03', 5, N'Obviously I love this game. No problems here :)'),
(N'James', N'Mitchell', N'james.mitchell5765@example.net', '2015-10-03', 5, N'My husband loves this game!'),
(N'Mark', N'Barnes', N'mark.barnes1158@example.com', '2015-10-03', 4, N'Really enjoyed playing the game.'),
(N'Larry', N'Nguyen', N'larry.nguyen4315@example.com', '2015-10-03', 5, N'Can''t give and in depth review because we bought this for my father in law. He''s been a pc gamer and absolutely loves it.'),
(N'Maria', N'Barnes', N'maria.barnes1543@example.com', '2015-10-03', 5, N'A lot of people didn''t like two. We loved it. We thought it did a great job of continuing the story, bringing in new mechanics and characters, and keeping the horror and suspense.'),
(N'Richard', N'Lewis', N'richard.lewis1050@example.net', '2015-10-03', 5, N'Fun game me and my family play this game together every Sunday love the fact that it doesn''t require all pro controllers because i only have 2 but you can use the old Wii remote.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Jenkins', N'jessica.jenkins4232@example.org', '2015-10-04', 5, N'Came in perfect condition thanks!!'),
(N'Joseph', N'Torres', N'joseph.torres5611@example.net', '2015-10-04', 5, N'I have a Majors mask New 3ds and i wanted to keep the paint job protected while still being able to enjoy it. This case seemed like what I was looking for and for a good price so I gave it a shot. I have had it for a few weeks now and I can''t really complain one bit, it does just what I wanted it to. It takes a little pressure to put it on but nothing I wouldn''t expect seeing as I don''t want it falling off of the thing. Pro''s: - Sturdy - Snaps on securely - Lightweight - Can still enjoy your special New 3DS without scratching it! Cons - Doesn''t come with the New 3ds from the start.'),
(N'Susan', N'Hernandez', N'susan.hernandez3568@example.org', '2015-10-04', 5, N'works as it should and quick shipping'),
(N'Linda', N'Morris', N'linda.morris3932@example.org', '2015-10-04', 3, N'game works fine, haven''t played it enough to speak to how much fun it is'),
(N'Katherine', N'James', N'katherine.james8200@example.org', '2015-10-05', 5, N'this was perfect... I didn''t actually get it for a PSP I got it to hold my E Cig gear and it works great!'),
(N'Mary', N'Ward', N'mary.ward6789@example.org', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Charges works what else can I say'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Adams', N'stephanie.adams1810@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Very fun game.'),
(N'Edward', N'Torres', N'edward.torres3897@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'It''s not as pretty as the standard PlayStation 2 8MB memory card but that is one massive memory card :3'),
(N'Diane', N'Thomas', N'diane.thomas1533@example.net', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Thank you for the prompt service. The item was just as expected. I will order from you again. I am 100% satisfied.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Morris', N'hiroshi.morris5773@example.net', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Just recently bought this after eyeing for a while and I cursed myself for waiting so long. I had the original model, and after having compared the two, the newer version is definitely better. It is much lighter than its predecessor, as well as having a better screen and much better battery life (was able to get in 6 hours of constant gameplay before I had to charge, much more of course if you''re not using it). Really great work on Sony''s part.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Gonzalez', N'kofi.gonzalez9962@example.org', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Kids love it'),
(N'Maria', N'Nowak', N'maria.nowak4972@example.org', '2015-10-05', 5, N'not much to say. my 250GB hd was full.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Cook', N'sofia.cook2093@example.net', '2015-10-05', 5, N'So much fun. There are so few Xbox One games appropriate for kids. This game fits the bill perfectly. It is a great adventure. You do not have to have any knowledge of the movies to enjoy the game but if you have seen Jurassic World then a lot of scenes will be familiar. The game is great for all ages and genders.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Hall', N'kevin.hall2026@example.net', '2015-10-05', 5, N'I love madden. It''s the only sports game I truly enjoy. NBA 2k is good but too complicated control wise I feel I have absolutely no control over my player. MLB the show is awesome but with a 180+ game season you feel like you never get to enjoy it. Rtts is awesome but takes forever to get anywhere. I''ve had my nit picks with madden over the year but I feel they truly did a great job. It''s not a lot different than 15 minus the new passing and catching additioms. These add so much to the game to me. I hated deep passes in past maddens they were so hit and miss. Now if I see one on one coverage on the outside I''m not afraid to throw it up and let my receiver go get it. Some reviews say this mechanic is over powered. I feel you just have to get used to body position of the db. Its much more over powered for higher rated players. But when you throw high and deep like that, you have to switch to the db and get in front and try to break up the pass. I have done this with mixed results so...'),
(N'Melissa', N'Long', N'melissa.long4473@example.org', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Awesome.'),
(N'Joan', N'Lee', N'joan.lee4973@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'I liked the quality of my purchase. Fast shipping also. Thank you.'),
(N'Gary', N'Barnes', N'gary.barnes9829@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'good'),
(N'Emma', N'Adams', N'emma.adams3985@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Had a lot of fun with this one. Tons of loot,tons of quests,cool story,and possibly the coolest villian in any game. Well worth the price of admission!'),
(N'Anthony', N'Thomas', N'anthony.thomas7676@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Its Amazing'),
(N'Frank', N'Cruz', N'frank.cruz2920@example.org', '2015-10-05', 1, N'Looks too fake!'),
(N'Edward', N'Scott', N'edward.scott6183@example.org', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Great headset , works perfectly on my ps4!'),
(N'Amara', N'Butler', N'amara.butler4183@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'cool'),
(N'Amara', N'Butler', N'amara.butler4183@example.com', '2015-10-05', 5, N'very nice'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Chen', N'kathleen.chen6746@example.org', '2015-10-05', 1, N'The flaws in this game are myriad in number. The most prominent is that you can pay $100 and not be able to come close to completion. You only get three characters and you cannot even complete ANY of the free play with these characters. All you get is story mode, three miserable adventure worlds, and only three red bricks. This games is not even really that much bigger than all the other Lego games that have come out in the past 3 years, and I have played all of the them so I know what I''m talking about. The worlds on Lego Dimensions are so small that Minas Tirith is only about fifty feet away from Hobbiton in the Lord of the Rings world! To those who are wondering if they should buy this game, I would say that you can buy three or four other really good and enjoyable LEGO games for less than the price of this partial game. Lego Batman 2 has a Gotham City free world which is much larger than any world than this game has. The Middle-Earth of Lego The Lord of the Rings is at least...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Watson', N'kimberly.watson1637@example.net', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Awesome gameplay and genius story. Great game to play if you want to experience an immersive storyline!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Watson', N'kimberly.watson1637@example.net', '2015-10-05', 5, N'Second set that I have bought since the first work perfectly on my PS4 controller!!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Wilson', N'melissa.wilson1881@example.net', '2015-10-06', 5, N'Transformers Devastation is basically thee Transformers game I have been dreaming about for many, many years! It is based on the 80''s/G1 Transformers animated series (and toyline). The sounds are amazing! Almost all of the original voice actors have came together to replay the roles of this iconic franchise. Obviously Chris Latta had passed away years back. But the voice actor replacing him as Starscream is nearly perfect to what Chris did for the character. The musical score is great too. And of course the sound effects are perfect! The graphics are a awesome and well fit for the game. Cell shaded style graphics give it a cartoony feel which resembles the animated series well. Controls are pretty simple and easy to remember. Devastation is a 1 player game with no online play. Which is actually nice in this day and age. Gives it a old school feel too, lol. Many classic characters are present in Devastation. The only few things I dislike about this game is that it so far from what I...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Fisher', N'ronald.fisher3526@example.net', '2015-10-06', 5, N'Now I can tell which ten year olds have slept with my mom.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Cook', N'pamela.cook2863@example.com', '2015-10-06', 3, N'I went with the MJ edition, thinking I''d get some special version of Mike. Not really, just coins and some small posters. The game itself- keeping in mind it''s still very early - needs a roster update. Player ratings are very, VERY off and lower than ever due to them wanting this to be graded against "all-time" players. So basically, everyone''s roster is mid-low 70s and a bunch of mid 60s players. Yes, you can edit the roster, even download a player created roster, but I didn''t appreciate this "angle" on things. As for game play, it''s just as good as last years, bit better, but the commentary is almost exactly the same as last years, just swap Kerr for Greg Anthony. Awful, I turn it all the way down. Hoping that some things get fixed, but a lot is great that needs work, like create your own court/jersey, it''s awesome but it feels very much like a beta version. Maybe next year they''ll fix it. Go with the cheapest version of the game because if you know 2K, you can get coins just by...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Wright', N'brenda.wright2095@example.org', '2015-10-06', 4, N'Not a bad game, the children love it.'),
(N'Amy', N'Myers', N'amy.myers2122@example.com', '2015-10-06', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Clark', N'cheryl.clark5527@example.org', '2015-10-06', 5, N'Excellent ! On time and works perfectly. Will do this again.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Wood', N'sarah.wood6527@example.org', '2015-10-06', 4, N'yea love it yea'),
(N'Peter', N'Garcia', N'peter.garcia1713@example.org', '2015-10-06', 5, N'I''m a FPS SINGLE PLAYER JUNKIE on PC''s ! And this game is just My cup of tea. I love COD(ALL GAMES), MOH, FARCRY, HOMEFRONT and any other FPS - "SHOOTERS" I can get My hands on !!! I wasn''t sure if it would work on Windows 10 - 64 bit ? But it works "GREAT" on Both My 7Win 7 Pro and Win 10 Computers !!! This Game works GREAT as a FPS and the Stealth ways are GOOD too. SO JUST BUY IT !!!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Bell', N'olivia.bell4901@example.org', '2015-10-06', 5, N'Just by comparing this game adapter to the EMS USB 2, this Mayflash Gamecube controller adapter is a better product mainly for support on Windows 7 onward, and for dance mat support on games like DanceDanceRevolution PC Edition, in the groove, osu! and StepMania. The EMS USB 2 is mainly optimized for Windows XP, has bad support on the 32-bit versions on Windows Vista & 7, and has no support for Windows 8 & 10. Be glad Mayflash made this Gamecube controller adapter as the ultimate product, because EMS is just too lazy to not support the EMS USB 2 recently. Another thing is that this adapter works on PLAYSTATION3 systems, as long as the switch is on the "PC" mode. It works pretty well with many games, but keep in mind that some games just don''t work with the Gamecube controller. For example, Destiny has the Ghost button mapped to the SELECT button, and the Gamecube adapter has no SELECT button command. Pretty much reviewing objectives, summoning the Sparrow vehicle and escaping to...'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Turner', N'elizabeth.turner6316@example.org', '2015-10-07', 5, N'I got this for AMERICAN version at Gamestop. Pre order came with free GOODIES from GAMESTOP!! LIKE WHATT!!! GAMESTOP!!! lol, anyways overall this game is extremely fun, its beginner friendly and everyone can become good at this game with just more practice and effort. Playing online is extremely enjoying, players are kind and everyone is good! Finally a good fighting game for the ps vita! definetly worth a buy if you''re a huge fighting fan and LOVE anime! LONG LIVE ANIME LOVERS!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Bennett', N'andrew.bennett8525@example.org', '2015-10-07', 5, N'Awesome!!!! Would buy from again 100%'),
(N'Ronald', N'Kumar', N'ronald.kumar3408@example.net', '2015-10-07', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Dee', N'Gray', N'dee.gray5633@example.com', '2015-10-07', 1, N'dum things to do make face but doesn''t everybody dies'),
(N'Stephen', N'Perry', N'stephen.perry3965@example.org', '2015-10-07', 5, N'Classic fun game. Great music.'),
(N'Christina', N'Wright', N'christina.wright9355@example.org', '2015-10-07', 5, N'If you have two pro controllers, then get this.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Cook', N'kimberly.cook8416@example.net', '2015-10-07', 3, N'Works fine, but the microphone stopped working properly after a while.'),
(N'Edward', N'Sullivan', N'edward.sullivan1168@example.net', '2015-10-07', 5, N'Great mouse!!! I didn''t expect one of this quality for such little money. Easy to use software makes this a joy to use for the beginner or pro gamer!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Harris', N'barbara.harris3752@example.com', '2015-10-07', 2, N'EA is definitely going into the right direction, but it''s still a long way there. The graphic is definitely better, most of the players look like the players, and some don''t really. They made the body of the players a little realistic, because last year everyone is jack up on steroids. I really love the shot meter, it''s simple, and it follows your jump shot, instead of 2k stupid meter that''s on the player feet. The Pro Am was really fun, it''s quick, simple, not too much waiting. The EA sever was really good, not too much lag, and control was responsive, its literally day and night compared to 2k. However despite all this great things, the game is really lacking in gameplay. The animation is choppy, and the game feels choppy. The AI is really dumb, and a lot of recycled animation. When player drive to the hoop they will do the same dunk and the same crazy hook shot that magically goes in. Stealing the ball is impossible, no matter how much I swipe at the ball, I end up with nothing,...'),
(N'Richard', N'Price', N'richard.price2287@example.com', '2015-10-07', 4, N'This is a great set! Excellent quality and great in the game. I purchased it at another retailer for half the cost the scalpers are charging here. I pays to shop around.'),
(N'William', N'Okonkwo', N'william.okonkwo2034@example.org', '2015-10-08', 3, N'A little bit tinny on the sound when used with my Xbox 360, but it does allow me to play online with my friends. These add a new dimension to gaming in my brief experience. Friends say they here mean loud and clear. From my end, they have less than superb sound.'),
(N'Peter', N'Chen', N'peter.chen7789@example.net', '2015-10-08', 5, N'Good!'),
(N'Edward', N'Brown', N'edward.brown8852@example.com', '2015-10-08', 4, N'I was excited to try a new gamepad but this is not keeping me excited. Please note this is a wired pad, so you lose some convenience but It will save replacing batteries until you try using it. Oh and no you won''t be talking to your friends with this pad. On the plus side, despite previous reviews, we''ve had no problems with the buttons. It looks like whatever issue was resolved. The controller handles nicely and is a fighting pad for different hand use, thus the size. The line up of the buttons is spot on. The controller is slightly different than pictured. The logo is an image in the plastic, not metal nor does it look metal. Also the surface is smooth and does not feel or resemble leather grain. Other than that, we are happy with it!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Ross', N'nathan.ross3059@example.org', '2015-10-08', 5, N'Great! All the best! Thank you!!!'),
(N'Wei', N'Nguyen', N'wei.nguyen8818@example.net', '2015-10-08', 5, N'Easy to install and just what we needed. Plenty of GB for my son!'),
(N'Frank', N'Lewis', N'frank.lewis1904@example.net', '2015-10-08', 4, N'Toy story 3 the ps3 version is the best one wii and ds versions suck in comparison i have no idea why the wii version was dumbed down so much the wii is capable of better than that like the godfather,scarface, rune factory plus many others are great for the wii back to the review at hand toy story3 is definitely what licensed games need to mimic there are alot of movie based games hardly any are good scarface godfather king kong and over the hedge and the bee movie toy story has a short but challenging story toy box mode is definitely the best part of the game 100+ challenges exploring an open world finding prize capsules for customizing town folks, buildings great multi player fun I''m 34 years old I''m not afraid to admit I play toy story plus lego games i also play mature and adult only games.also make sure you buy the American game imports don''t have all the customization options'),
(N'Andrew', N'Chen', N'andrew.chen6145@example.net', '2015-10-08', 5, N'This headset is the real deal. I''m a heavy online gamer, and the sound quality is pretty awesome. Inside of the box, it has the headset and the adapter for the 3.5mm headphone jack, so there''s no need to go out and spend $25+ dollars for the Microsoft Xbox One headset adapter. You can adjust the game volume (enviornment) and the chat volume which are both located on the Turtle Beach adapter. There is also a bass button which adds a little more kick to the game volume. I play a lot of FPS games, and these are very legit. Have you ever played Call of Duty or Battlefield and wondered "how did this person know I was there?" or "how did they kill me when i''m using a stealth perk?" .....They were most likely wearing a Turtle Beach headset lol. I could hear every little thing in the environment, and could clearly hear enemy footsteps and movements that are nearby. This headset or any Turtle Beach headset gives you a major advantage over the enemy team, because they pretty much directs you...'),
(N'Frank', N'Fisher', N'frank.fisher9945@example.org', '2015-10-09', 5, N'Great case, No scratches, and all the manuals. My money has never been spent better. I love this game!'),
(N'Frank', N'Fisher', N'frank.fisher9945@example.org', '2015-10-09', 5, N'Everything I expected it to be!'),
(N'Anthony', N'Bennett', N'anthony.bennett4281@example.com', '2015-10-09', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Victoria', N'Tanaka', N'victoria.tanaka4740@example.net', '2015-10-09', 5, N'Best $70 dollars I ever spent. Good quality material and braided cable. Mechanical keys are great for typing and I can never go back to membrane'),
(N'Larry', N'Brooks', N'larry.brooks7307@example.com', '2015-10-09', 1, N'I will never understand why Microsoft made the choice to eliminate the standard headphone jack in the xbox one controllers, in favor of a proprietary connector. Granted they have since seen the error and released an adapter and a new controller that has a standard jack. However, I already own four controllers and do not want to replace them in order to get one that has a jack. As for the alternatives, they have issues. When in game/party chat you can tell if someone is using a headset connected to one of these other options as it will either produce echo or a ring within the party that everyone but the user producing it can hear. Finally, I could live with the proprietary connection, if the product provided was a quality product. This product is poorly made with the thinnest possible wire, which breaks easily. I am now on my third headset and have done nothing with them that was abnormal. Infact I did purchase one of the adapters, which comes with a dongle to connect a standard...'),
(N'Barbara', N'Reyes', N'barbara.reyes5898@example.com', '2015-10-09', 5, N'Best action RPG on the vita I put in 50 hours to beat it with a lot of side quests done. iF you have a Vita and like Rpg''s especially action rpgs then BUY this! For twenty bucks new it is a GREAT DEAL! i never played any other YS games so you don''t need to know about the others to still have a lot of fun'),
(N'Katherine', N'Smith', N'katherine.smith1977@example.com', '2015-10-09', 5, N'perfect!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Jackson', N'ryan.jackson3465@example.com', '2015-10-09', 5, N'Excellent Quality, Great Value'),
(N'Ryan', N'Jackson', N'ryan.jackson3465@example.com', '2015-10-09', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Robinson', N'jacqueline.robinson4342@example.com', '2015-10-09', 1, N'Warning: You need to purchase the newest version of the game, The Taken King, for an additional $60 for you to take part in most of what the game has to offer. If you don''t have this you won''t be able to play most of the competitive modes or get any good gear. I am very unhappy about this.'),
(N'Heather', N'Wood', N'heather.wood4322@example.org', '2015-10-10', 4, N'The kid said this game was a lot of fun and followed the lego games well'),
(N'Carol', N'Gomez', N'carol.gomez9894@example.net', '2015-10-10', 2, N'I hate to be the dissenting opinion, but I find that this game isn''t very fun. I enjoy Resident Evil 4 to a great extent but this game is not the same quality. The enemies are not difficult to outwit but they are difficult and frustrating to do away with. The bosses are goofy and complicated. The weapons are strange and hard to get used to. The environment cannot decide if they want to set this in a ruined city or a European village. And yes, I know the game takes place in a psychological nightmare world, but why is the nightmare in a European village? It makes no sense? And why are there chainsaw dudes from Resident Evil 4? And why does blowing the head off an enemy just annoy them? I''m pretty sure you can''t do much without a head! And why do I have to use a bolt gun? Why can''t I craft shotgun shells? And don''t say realism because making a bolt with an electric charge is stupid. For all the talk of realism with this game, I can''t help but feel that it is unrealistically hoisted to...'),
(N'Barbara', N'Campbell', N'barbara.campbell2488@example.net', '2015-10-10', 1, N'BEWARE IT DOES NOT COME WITH A WII U CONSOLE! DO NOT BUY!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Morris', N'brandon.morris5339@example.org', '2015-10-10', 2, N'I forced myself though 13-1, which has an overly-complex story, poor combat mechanics, and uninteresting main character (Lightning). I then had a blast with 13-2. It''s not as good as some of the best in the FF series, but fixed all of the issues I had with 13-1 and had a very well put together time-traveling story. Then we get 13-3, which changed everything up. We get Lighting again, with her emotion removed. Unsurprisingly, I didn''t even notice this until the story points it out since, she''s normally fairly emotionless to begin with. And we get to play dress-up with Lightning. I feel like I''m forced to put teenager/raver clothes onto a mean, scowling 45 year old woman. Doing this with Serah from 13-2 would have been much more appropriate and appealing to me. A large part of the combat mechanics revolves around putting Lighting in different sets of clothes, three of which can be used during battle. Yes, you can change through a selection of three different outfits during each...'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Gray', N'hiroshi.gray6477@example.com', '2015-10-10', 5, N'These are nice enough headphones for being lower priced. They''re from Turtle Beach, who does make a good headphone, but you can''t expect $40 headphones to sound and feel the same as ones that cost $200. Be that as it may, they are an affordable way to get decent headphones going. They sound nice, if not the most spectacular sound you could get - but then you''re talking $200+ headphones. For this price level, they''re very nice. They cover both ears, and while not sound removing, do tend to keep most of the external world out of your ears and your hearing on what''s coming out of the speakers. A word of warning though. I wear a size 7 3/4 fitted baseball cap. I have a somewhat large noggin. While they did fit my head, I did stretch them out almost to max. It didn''t hurt at all, but I get the impression if I wore them for like six hours in a row, thye could, because they were snug. Not obscenely snug. I tend not to have marathon all day gaming sessions anymore (parenthood tends to...'),
(N'Shirley', N'Anderson', N'shirley.anderson8494@example.com', '2015-10-10', 5, N'Best single player game I''ve ever played personally. I have never played a Witcher game before but this game had a great story and the combat is frickin amazing.'),
(N'Frank', N'Sanders', N'frank.sanders8422@example.com', '2015-10-10', 5, N'a1'),
(N'Ronald', N'Brown', N'ronald.brown7083@example.com', '2015-10-10', 5, N'This game is amazing. I never got a chance to play these games on PS3, so this is a great collection for players that missed out like me. This game plays just like the new Tomb Raider (or I should say Tomb Raider plays just like Uncharted). Fun adventure, with a solid story. What happened to the days when video games had a solid story campaign mode, everything is all about multi player now. So if you like solid campaign games with a great story, and fun gameplay this is for you. And if you played and liked Tomb Raider, don''t even think twice. Don''t pass up this gem!'),
(N'Scott', N'Tanaka', N'scott.tanaka8676@example.org', '2015-10-10', 2, N'I returned mine. That''s too bad, because I really wanted to like this keyboard. It''s beautifully lit, and the Cherry MX Blue switches are....well, they''re Cherry MX Blues. But cheap construction kills this for me. Another reviewer noted that the wrist-rest -- which is a must for me -- is cheap and bows in the middle. I wrote off that review as someone who just got a wonky or warped piece. But no: he''s right. The wrist-rest is cheap, and uneven, and when you type, it will tap against your desk. Repeatedly. Maddeningly. Also, the space and backspace keys are maddeningly loud. This is because they use a wire suspension, instead of a full set of keys under them. So, when you work: it''s click click click BANG click BANG click click BANG. The software blows, but nothing is worse than Corsair, so for me, this wasn''t the worst. If you need a cheap mechanical, and crummy construction isn''t a deal-breaker, it''s fine. The rubberized surface is nice, and better than plastic, and the switches...'),
(N'Andrew', N'Lopez', N'andrew.lopez2810@example.org', '2015-10-10', 5, N'Another masterpiece by Hideo Kojima!!!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Khan', N'pamela.khan7890@example.org', '2015-10-10', 5, N'Great buy'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Ramirez', N'hiroshi.ramirez3613@example.com', '2015-10-10', 5, N'a+'),
(N'Carlos', N'Phillips', N'carlos.phillips9062@example.com', '2015-10-10', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Joshua', N'Ramos', N'joshua.ramos1082@example.net', '2015-10-10', 5, N'My 4 year old LOVES Golden Mario'),
(N'Susan', N'Myers', N'susan.myers9877@example.org', '2015-10-11', 5, N'Good ship'),
(N'Megan', N'Brooks', N'megan.brooks6594@example.org', '2015-10-11', 5, N'A very well-designed case. Plenty of padding, room for 2 extra bluray cases. Able to fit all my cords, 2 controllers and accessories. HIGHLY recommended.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Gonzalez', N'samuel.gonzalez3438@example.net', '2015-10-11', 1, N'1. It dose not mount like in image. 2. The usb wire is placed for pc useage Cant physicality mount it or use it in the image. 3. Works great on my PC, not so well in my PS4'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Walker', N'jacqueline.walker1139@example.net', '2015-10-11', 5, N'One of my favorite games. Great music. I bought this for my son''s xbox 360 but we played this game as a family and had a great time playing it. We have purchased all of the Just Dance games and they are all super fun and will make you sweat! Worth the price. It was shipped and arrived on time.'),
(N'Judith', N'Thompson', N'judith.thompson2911@example.net', '2015-10-11', 5, N'A hard double sided keyboard that is easily cleaned? And its made of metal? The hell more could you need?'),
(N'Katherine', N'Johnson', N'katherine.johnson5339@example.com', '2015-10-11', 3, N'The game get stuck in the first mission.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Lopez', N'brenda.lopez5511@example.org', '2015-10-11', 5, N'Legendary game'),
(N'Brenda', N'Lopez', N'brenda.lopez5511@example.org', '2015-10-11', 5, N'it works but is really slow'),
(N'Brenda', N'Lopez', N'brenda.lopez5511@example.org', '2015-10-11', 2, N'If you get this game make sure you get it for a good price'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ross', N'patricia.ross5350@example.com', '2015-10-11', 4, N'Where to begin? Even though i''m familiar with the gameplay of the original Chibi Robo, this is my first actual Chibi Robo game. Now most people were ranting saying things like "This is not the Chibi Robo we know!" and "It''s just another stupid platformer." Although yes it is a platformer, it''s quite unique. You use your trusty whip to defeat enemies and go through obstacles. I will admit the only thing that caught my eye with this game was the Amiibo that came with it so I decided to try it. But i''m glad I tried it. I give it a 4 out of 5 star rating because the game itself is fun, unique, colorful, and kind of cute. However, the gameplay is quite repeating. If you ask me, I consider this game as a "Super Mario Bros in a nutshell." That isn''t a bad thing though. I recommend this game for anyone who is looking for a platformer with a little twist. If your not into the basic, somewhat repeating platform action, then this isn''t the game for you.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Perry', N'samuel.perry5612@example.net', '2015-10-12', 5, N'These fit perfect and did the job.'),
(N'Anna', N'Webb', N'anna.webb2989@example.org', '2015-10-12', 1, N'Doesn''t work with my PC'),
(N'Anna', N'Webb', N'anna.webb2989@example.org', '2015-10-12', 2, N'I don''t use it as much as I thought I would. Keys are spongy...not as well designed as I would have thought.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Martin', N'melissa.martin5738@example.org', '2015-10-12', 5, N'There''s nothing to say about this.. it''s game time. . . OH and it cures Cancer!'),
(N'Jerry', N'Morris', N'jerry.morris5973@example.net', '2015-10-12', 4, N'Good product and great workout if you keep at it.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Bennett', N'gregory.bennett4059@example.com', '2015-10-12', 5, N'Very useful for modifying saves pretty straight forward, Im slowly becoming the pokmon master'),
(N'Gregory', N'Bennett', N'gregory.bennett4059@example.com', '2015-10-12', 5, N'Great product, recommend it for any gamer.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Howard', N'ivan.howard9121@example.com', '2015-10-12', 5, N'I think this might just be favorite wii game. It''s beautiful- the graphics, the music, the story line, the characters, the gameplay! It''s absolutely everything you could want in a game. It reminds me alot of Super Mario 64. I dare say this might even be better than Super Mario 64. I love it and I think it''s a game pretty much anyone of any age can love.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Cooper', N'ronald.cooper7990@example.net', '2015-10-12', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Charles', N'Nowak', N'charles.nowak5686@example.com', '2015-10-12', 1, N'The instruments don''t even work right out of the box. You have to use a PC to update the firmware and then it''s not even guaranteed that they will register properly. For ps4 users you have to connect to a pc via Bluetooth and then update the firmware but when I tried to update through bluetooth it asked m for a Pairing code which is non existent so it''s impossible for me to even get them working properly. Way to go Harmonix on getting your game out before guitar hero and selling a 250$ product that doesn''t even work. Was excited and now I''m just super pissed off. On top of all that all of the options you had to customize on the previous titles is just completely gone. When you pause the game or go to the options menu there is only a few options to mess with unlike the previous titles where there was a ton of features. Waste of my time and money. Returning this as of tomorrow. Save your money! We need to quit giving company''s our money for unfinished products. I''m so sick of this...'),
(N'Adam', N'Webb', N'adam.webb9008@example.org', '2015-10-12', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Anna', N'Mendoza', N'anna.mendoza3642@example.org', '2015-10-12', 5, N'The complete uncharted trilogy from ps3 brought to ps4 and upgraded to 60 fps and at 1080p, and improved textures to boot. This series is my favorite from the past decade. Uncharted is an exciting and enjoyable action game with amazing characters, story, graphics, and set-pieces. This package cannot recieve enough praise from me, if you never played it before or just cant wait till uncharted 4 you need this collection.'),
(N'Robert', N'Taylor', N'robert.taylor6764@example.com', '2015-10-12', 5, N'Great game if you like battlefield.'),
(N'Larry', N'Martin', N'larry.martin9867@example.com', '2015-10-12', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Ashley', N'Rodriguez', N'ashley.rodriguez1167@example.com', '2015-10-12', 1, N'Again only for serious gamers and not the majority of just regular people. A game that the gated all your experience from before with this new expansion pack as if one part of the gaming that no one had to play you now have to play to expand yourself which is player against player in the crucible. Forcing a failed part of the game to become required as the people that live closest to the server that you play in the crucible will have a timing sequence advantage over you and that''s when you shoot them they don''t die but you will because they''ll see you first.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2015-10-12', 4, N'Bodycount is a very strange animal put out by Codemasters and THQ This game has more Codemasters hands all over it THQ may have had it''s ups and downs but, they would not have put out a game with this type of mediocrity The idea behind it is dare i say it refreshing It''s a old school Arcade FPS on home console this game was made for Arcade cabinets (but, since Arcade here in the states are dead we get home console versions of it) Graphics they are in the middle they are not terrible they are not awesome it''s average at best the environment being destructible are a bit of a fib It''s nowhere near what you could do in the last two Red Faction titles The Controls are the true downfall of this game the controls are off and don''t feel right (keep in mind you should go into settings and change things) the auto-aim should Not be in this game I can''t help but, think this game was made with a light gun in mind (but, during the xbox360 & PS3 era light guns were going the way of the...'),
(N'Christina', N'Fisher', N'christina.fisher7116@example.com', '2015-10-12', 5, N'grandson loves this game'),
(N'Brenda', N'Sanchez', N'brenda.sanchez5322@example.com', '2015-10-12', 5, N'Fast shipping, brand new in case. Manual included. Very pleased.'),
(N'Jason', N'Cox', N'jason.cox4405@example.net', '2015-10-13', 5, N'1'),
(N'Joan', N'Green', N'joan.green8261@example.net', '2015-10-13', 1, N'Origin... I was unaware that this required that Origin program. Stay away!'),
(N'Joan', N'Green', N'joan.green8261@example.net', '2015-10-13', 3, N'I purchased the SILVER version because the ear piece that comes with the PS4 works *ok* for what it is (a cheap earpiece), but I wanted stereo and a good mic. The sound is good for a $20 headset and the mic (I am told by everyone I have played with) picks up my voice well. The only reason I would caution anyone from buying the SILVER version of these Sony wired headphones is that they feel VERY hard on your ears. It almost feels as if another person is standing behind me, squeezing them onto my head. The padded portion that sits on your ear (ON, not over!) is a hard plastic mesh and I have to constantly readjust them due to pain. Pros: Good sound for the price (currently $20 I believe on Amazon) Mic sound (I am told) is clear light weight the mic has a flip-to-mute function similar to what Astro uses, and it''s useful! The cord is long (14 feet) Useful volume adjustment toggle on the cord (mic and game independent!) Cons: Even on my small head they are absurdly tight. The mesh...'),
(N'Hannah', N'Castillo', N'hannah.castillo9472@example.org', '2015-10-13', 4, N'Pretty good ahape'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Thomas', N'benjamin.thomas4405@example.org', '2015-10-13', 5, N'Great games.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Henderson', N'deborah.henderson2950@example.org', '2015-10-13', 5, N'ok 100%'),
(N'Carol', N'King', N'carol.king2628@example.org', '2015-10-13', 2, N'its ok'),
(N'Carol', N'King', N'carol.king2628@example.org', '2015-10-13', 3, N'Previous Mario Party games were alot better. This game makes you ride along with everyone instead of your own. Not such a great idea.'),
(N'Carol', N'King', N'carol.king2628@example.org', '2015-10-13', 5, N'A Hideo Kojima game'),
(N'Andrew', N'Cook', N'andrew.cook1914@example.com', '2015-10-13', 5, N'CORPSE PARTY BLOOD DRIVE- EVERAFTER EDITION IS SO COOL & AWESOME PSVITA VIDEO GAME :) & IT IS HORROR. I''M BIG FAN OF HORROR :) PS. ( TRY TO SURVIVE CORPSE PARTY BLOOD DRIVE EVERAFTER EDITION OK ) ( PSVITA )'),
(N'Julie', N'Allen', N'julie.allen1749@example.org', '2015-10-13', 5, N'My son loves it'),
(N'Jason', N'Watson', N'jason.watson5351@example.com', '2015-10-14', 3, N'EA''s attempt at redemption has been a let down. Good graphics with horrible mechanics....'),
(N'Brandon', N'Foster', N'brandon.foster4977@example.org', '2015-10-14', 5, N'Glad I purchased this backup controller. Works better than I thought.'),
(N'Mei', N'Ramirez', N'mei.ramirez5479@example.com', '2015-10-14', 5, N'I haven''t completed Gradius IV yet, but it is really awesome. The graphics are very reminiscent of the ones found in Gradius Gaiden. In my opinion there is no bad Gradius game, and this one is worth getting for fans of shmups or the Gradius/Salamander series.'),
(N'George', N'Sullivan', N'george.sullivan3331@example.com', '2015-10-14', 4, N'I''ve used this product for about a week and works well. I found my ps4 controller was wearing out and used this over my existing knobs. I did notice some slipage last night when using it but otherwise it seems to wrk well. Takes a little bit to get it to stretch over it but once its on it seems to stay on except for the slight movement I saw. If the grip to the knob can be tweaked a little more I would give it 5 stars.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Gray', N'sofia.gray8860@example.org', '2015-10-14', 1, N'Everytime I tried to down load the disc it would show up off centered on the screen and then my mouse would freeze up and I would have to shut the computer down, I have Windows 10. I can''t use it!!'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Richardson', N'carolyn.richardson8614@example.org', '2015-10-14', 4, N'Interesting game - especially in the early days of testing the motion mechanics! Cartridge arrived in good condition and operable, and works on my old Gameboy Advance SP as expected.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Rogers', N'jessica.rogers9173@example.com', '2015-10-14', 4, N'Works as it should. But cable not very long.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Walker', N'cheryl.walker1572@example.com', '2015-10-14', 4, N'This is a great game. Updated graphics, better controls and faster load times. Head down to the Twin Pines Mall and pick up a copy!!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Gray', N'brandon.gray9109@example.org', '2015-10-14', 5, N'This was gift'),
(N'Joan', N'Davis', N'joan.davis5777@example.net', '2015-10-14', 3, N'Same old thing just a different skin. quite frankly the game is boring'),
(N'Shirley', N'Sanders', N'shirley.sanders6020@example.com', '2015-10-14', 1, N'This game is a bootleg copy! When you close the ds the pause function doesn''t work right... I have recently realized that my copies of pokemon diamond, pearl, and platinum that I bought were all fake.. I am a collector who collects videogames.. To spot a fake is easy even with the 4th and 5th gen games.. Look at the back under some bright light and the real ones tend to have shiny red bits underneath the plastic, also the real pokemon ds games rattle when shook, but the most damning evidence of all? The pause function does not work properly when you close the ds.. I curse the idiot who sold me this piece of garbage! Some bootlegged games don''t try to hid the fact that they are in fact bootlegged, but then there are the deceiver grade bootlegged games which makes the rest of us think that they are in fact real when they are in fact fake..'),
(N'Ravi', N'Adams', N'ravi.adams3937@example.com', '2015-10-14', 5, N'Worth. Every. Penny'),
(N'Tyler', N'Kim', N'tyler.kim9265@example.com', '2015-10-15', 2, N'This game''s gameplay is chore heavy. Travelling is done using a vehicle with not so great physics and in my experience those physics have gotten me killed falling off bottomless pits. Combat is done in third person with the expectation that you coordinate groups of your own to fight in some "arena" area, which is as I said "chore heavy". Story is decent and the main antagonist is rather smart unlike other antagonists in other games.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Kim', N'tyler.kim9265@example.com', '2015-10-15', 4, N'This games story is told rather well for your typical time travelling science fiction world. Gameplay is pretty good and has a neat gimmick of using a device to solve a few puzzles here and there. Combat is fairly entertaining given the wide variety but I mostly used the Valkyrie so I will need to play a bit more using other weapons to have an idea what they''re like. Pistol bites with how limited I can carry ammo for it. I would like for the world to be more open instead of having one pathway to go through.'),
(N'Debra', N'Harris', N'debra.harris1432@example.net', '2015-10-15', 4, N'Very fun to have an AI that you train to be better, and once they get to a certain level where they start beating you you almost feel proud like "My pupil has learned and surpassed the master, go on to do great things my child!"'),
(N'Anita', N'Singh', N'anita.singh9633@example.org', '2015-10-15', 5, N'Wheel looks great, leather feels of high quality. Makes Driving in games like Forza 6 way more fun than using the remote. I bought this to go with my PlaySeat Challenge (foldable racing seat Playseat Challenge ) because I knew there was no way to sit properly on the couch, and still get the feeling you are racing. Pros + Great feeling wheel, feels almost as good as the perforated leather wheel on my real car :D + Looks good! I know it doesnt mean as much as how it performs but there are some hideous wheels out there! + 3 Pedals, In case you want to learn how to drive manual. Good feedback, although some have complained that the brake takes strength to push. + Makes Racing games a blast! Even my young kids were playing on it and having fun. + Best wheel in this price range. + Works with PC Cons - Expensive. Have to think long and hard on whether you want to spend the same amount of money on a wheel that your console costs. Sweet spot for a wheel should be $250, not $400. - Shifter...'),
(N'Omar', N'Edwards', N'omar.edwards9278@example.org', '2015-10-15', 4, N'Thought it would add lots of versatility and be like a real drum however I did not get what I expected. If the product was built to last and set up more efficiently I believe that it would create wonders, however it is not therefore you will only get some expansion to what you already do. On rock band two it just makes it so you hit the cymbals with the respective color compared to adding another line to play. But it still will improve skills for a real drum.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Sullivan', N'jonathan.sullivan3813@example.com', '2015-10-15', 4, N'Great game, great buy! Came on time and packaged well! Just disappointed that it was longer! Other than that! It was worth the buy! Love the story line! It made me tear up lol'),
(N'Barbara', N'Brooks', N'barbara.brooks6844@example.net', '2015-10-15', 4, N'Love this playing in HD but realized after i bought it I don''t have a VGA port on my TV oops XD'),
(N'Henry', N'Flores', N'henry.flores2174@example.net', '2015-10-15', 5, N'good 100%'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Morris', N'cynthia.morris4036@example.org', '2015-10-15', 5, N'This game has become such a huge and wonderful part of my life. The fun quests, interesting characters, immense lore, and depending on the server, the great community. Nowadays it''s definitely not the same game it used to be but that''s not enough to make me stop playing.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Morris', N'cynthia.morris4036@example.org', '2015-10-15', 5, N'It astounds me to see how far these games have come. These games prove that even perfection can be improved. I''ve been a Pokmon fanboy for 16 years and X and Y have to be the best games since Gold and Silver'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2015-10-16', 5, N'ubisoft is the greatest video game company in the universe there true genius''s the best of the best ubisoft rocks all the games ubisoft made over the years are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best all the games ubisoft made over the years rocks ^_^'),
(N'Michelle', N'Hall', N'michelle.hall2908@example.com', '2015-10-16', 5, N'I have played Ninja Gaiden on the XBox and Ninja Gaiden Sigma on the PS3. It''s amazing what the Vita could do with such a graphically demanding game like Ninja Gaiden. The right analog button on the PS3 version was a little bit of a pain in the neck to use when adjusting the camera but not on the Vita version. That really impressed me. If you have any issues with the Vita''s button layout, fear not since this game can be played on the Playstation TV with a Dualshock 3 or 4 controller. The same goes for Ninja Gaiden Sigma 2 as well. You might as well not buy the PS3 version and go with the Vita/PSTV version instead since you can take it on the go. I was one of the people who thought the Vita would be a waste of money and boy I was wrong. The Vita & 2/3DS are holding up against their console brothers pretty well. I''m even amazed that Nintendo is releasing Hyrule Warriors (Zelda game) for the 2/3DS in 206 and it is a Wii U game. People are really underestimating those handhelds these...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Brooks', N'kelly.brooks9171@example.net', '2015-10-16', 3, N'one of my son''s favorite series of games for the 360 he''s got all of them now this one will be used for Christmas'),
(N'Kyle', N'Diaz', N'kyle.diaz5836@example.org', '2015-10-16', 4, N'The detail on Olimar & the Pikmin look great. However, Olimar''s antenna and the pikmin are noticeably fragile. Minor pokes causes them to shift slightly'),
(N'Justin', N'Reyes', N'justin.reyes3819@example.org', '2015-10-16', 5, N'Awesome! I love it! It''s great!!'),
(N'Megan', N'Moore', N'megan.moore4908@example.com', '2015-10-16', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Patrick', N'Jones', N'patrick.jones4033@example.org', '2015-10-16', 4, N'This is a great game If you like the Lord''s of the rings movies I didn''t like the game story tho but the gameplay is really cool, hack and slash with stealth parts also you can ride those beast that are in the lord of the rings really cool Also you can decapitate orks also I like those parts when you were going to fight the warchief and the warchief gang chears the warchief name so he can kill you Edit: I hope the next game will have nazguls dragons and you can ride those that will be cool'),
(N'Victoria', N'Nowak', N'victoria.nowak1113@example.com', '2015-10-17', 4, N'A little tight for an adult for any longer than an hour, but they work great on the xbox 360'),
(N'Karen', N'Myers', N'karen.myers6082@example.net', '2015-10-17', 5, N'This review is a bit late. But I love this amiibo to death. Robin''s my main in SSB4. Glad I got it ordered before he got into the USA, this guy''s really, REALLY hard as balls to find.'),
(N'Amara', N'White', N'amara.white7328@example.com', '2015-10-17', 5, N'INCREDIBLE! First off, you''re getting a real deal on these games. Not a bad price at all. Second, this thing is the coolest? The coolest thing ever? I mean, look at it. I thought for sure it would be, like, as small as possible. No. No, it''s HUGE! Like a foot tall I think? The paint job is spot on, the material sturdy, and the games and inserts are lovely and high quality printed. If you''re a fallout fan, let this masterpiece grace your shelf. You won''t be sorry you did.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Wilson', N'brandon.wilson3946@example.net', '2015-10-17', 3, N'While there would be times where one would look at a popular franchise''s success and go "Hey, I wanna do that too!", I honestly don''t understand what caused anybody to conceptualize and release a kart-racing game with BEN 10 of all things! I mean, I would probably tolerate it more if it was a crossover with Cartoon Network characters like in Cartoon Network Racing for the DS and PS2, or if it was a show starring a character in the caliber of, say, Spongebob. But no! We get a Mario Kart-ish game based off of......Ben 10. What''s next? Is there going to be a Samurai Jack Team Racing? Joking aside, this plays the rules of Mario Kart like a fiddle. You have a selection of cups (Though this time, you have to play each one in order), and you must play through the tracks of each cup, ranking in the Top 3 (Later Top 2 and 1st). The three-lap-long tracks themselves are laid out in the typical racing fashion, and items are available for the using. The controls are switched around a bit, but...'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Morris', N'hiroshi.morris2120@example.com', '2015-10-17', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Amanda', N'Gutierrez', N'amanda.gutierrez8590@example.net', '2015-10-17', 3, N'Does it''s job but is never used. Not enough reason to buy one yet. I heard Just Dance (I think, whatever game is on PS4) is awful but I don''t think it''s the camera''s fault. Apparently the Kinect for Xbox works way better but I wouldn''t know as I''ve never owned one.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Ramirez', N'ashley.ramirez4086@example.com', '2015-10-17', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Brown', N'kathleen.brown3971@example.net', '2015-10-17', 3, N'I bought 2 of these after reading the reviews (one for me, one for my boyfriend). The first headset (mine) was defective. It heated up at the inline controls, and if I moved my head in particular directions it would make a loud screeching/squealing noise in my left ear. The color the headset was displaying would also change to green or red depending on what color I had it currently set to. The second headset did not do this, but after several uses, I noticed the inline controls starting to over heat as well. I could not get the size small enough to fit my head comfortably, my boyfriend didn''t like how tight it was on his head. The ear pieces are incredibly comfortable. I did not like the blinking lights and wished that I could either turned them off, or they could just stay on without blinking. I did enjoy using it for the time being, but when the opportunity arose where I could get the Logitech G430 and G230 for my boyfriend and myself, respectively. I jumped on it.'),
(N'Richard', N'Lewis', N'richard.lewis1682@example.com', '2015-10-17', 4, N'does what it is supposed to do, but more expensive than it should be.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Morales', N'katherine.morales7363@example.org', '2015-10-17', 5, N'It is a memory unit and does exactly what it is meant to do.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wilson', N'kelly.wilson4634@example.net', '2015-10-17', 5, N'These work so great with my PS4 controllers. They plug into my charger without needing to be removed. Great product.'),
(N'Frank', N'Ross', N'frank.ross9464@example.org', '2015-10-17', 5, N'very good buy crazy game to play'),
(N'Scott', N'Perry', N'scott.perry3972@example.com', '2015-10-18', 1, N'Bought this Xbox 360 500GB bundle for $199 sale from Walmart Wow! 1 BIG mistake I mean it looks nice till I turned it ON then it went HOT and LOUD and the rechargeable USB to play it without the batteries is not even included .. Going back to Walmart tomorrow and get PS4 that I should have gotten it the first time at least Sony got rechargeable inside the console itself !! Dont waste you money on Microsoft Xbox they just want every nickel and dime'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Reyes', N'kimberly.reyes9639@example.com', '2015-10-18', 5, N'Love the game and one of the best Yoshi games out there, Defenetly get the Amiibo fro this one. The game is so good and the amino is adorable!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nowak', N'benjamin.nowak4679@example.org', '2015-10-18', 5, N'Great Guitar and fun game!'),
(N'Noah', N'Collins', N'noah.collins6596@example.com', '2015-10-18', 5, N'I bought a set of these for my xbox one and xbox 360 controllers and it made a world of difference! My 360 controllers were trashed at the joysticks, but I didn''t want to do the tedious mess of replacing them and who wants to buy new controllers for a system that is outdated. Here come the Grip-its to the rescue! Controllers play like new and have lasted heavy gameplay (about 3-4 hours a day) for almost 6 months now. Incredible products and I''ll be sure to get more when the time comes to replace the old ones.'),
(N'Noah', N'Collins', N'noah.collins6596@example.com', '2015-10-18', 5, N'I have to remind myself I''m not reviewing the game. As far as the actual product, it was what is expected. Excellent condition, at a better price than stores were offering refurbished at the time. As far as the game, it was horrible and I traded it in days after getting it. I think they got together and asked, how can we make the multiplayer more annoying for adults to play with kids online so we can stand out and that is how they came up with advanced warfare.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Sanchez', N'aaron.sanchez8487@example.net', '2015-10-18', 2, N'Just another JRPG.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Sanchez', N'aaron.sanchez8487@example.net', '2015-10-18', 3, N'Kinda choppy, combat is ok.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Sanders', N'joshua.sanders9626@example.net', '2015-10-18', 5, N'Let''s be honest: we all knew it was coming, but we didn''t know when and still didn''t expect it. When I heard the announcement of the third generation Ruby and Sapphire remakes, I was ecstatic. I''ve played Pokemon since the start with Red and Blue, but Ruby and Sapphire were by far my favorites so I had high hopes for this remake. I was not disappointed. Travel the Hoenn region like you never have before, in beautiful 3D. Seeing some of my favorite cities like Fortree and Mosdeep with the graphics update had me grinning from ear to ear, and with the features from Pokemon X&Y like Passerby along with the awesome other online functionalities made this the perfect way to play in Hoenn. Secret bases make a return as Super Secret Bases where you can customize your own room in different parts of the environment and also share you base with others as well as visit other people''s via QR code sharing and scanning. Other tweaks from the original as far as story are made and it made for a...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Bennett', N'olivia.bennett9898@example.org', '2015-10-18', 5, N'great'),
(N'Steven', N'Ward', N'steven.ward9563@example.net', '2015-10-18', 2, N'This game is very hard to recommend unless you''re a dedicated Godzilla fan as there is a lot of level grinding just to unlock characters and upgrades. The story mode in this game is horrible. Every level is the same as there are similar objectives in each: take out the generators. You just have to trudge through this mode multiple times just for unlocks which is a real pain as it is very repetitive Seeing that it''s after launch, you barely stand a chance online as the Kaiju (monsters) you select is totally dependent on level upgrades in the story mode. There is no match making so you can be squared off with someone with 100s of wins with a full decked out Kaiju able to defeat you in less than 30secs without a scratch on them. There is also no local play which is a big disappointment, essentially your friend have to purchase the game also just to play the together. Graphics are a mixed bag. The characters themselves looks nice, but the environment is horrible and have low resolution...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Davis', N'kyle.davis9625@example.org', '2015-10-18', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Christine', N'Carter', N'christine.carter7799@example.com', '2015-10-18', 5, N'This game is a pleasant surprise. It like The Walking Dead mixed with Dungeons and Dragons (Baldurs Gate style games). You have a group of customizable survivors in a post apocalyptic setting where you explore and battle. Battles are in tactical board game style where you have squares to move around on and you can use cover to evade enemy fire, you can ambush enemies, sniper rifles, pistols, rocket launchers, this game has it all. Each weapon has advantages and disadvantages. There is much more to this game than I can put into a short review but my first sentence sums this up... The Walking Dead mixed with Dungeons and Dragons and a little Mad Max.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Carter', N'samantha.carter9366@example.net', '2015-10-18', 5, N'great'),
(N'Nancy', N'Kim', N'nancy.kim2634@example.org', '2015-10-19', 4, N'Kind of short but overall a great game'),
(N'Richard', N'Lopez', N'richard.lopez8919@example.net', '2015-10-19', 5, N'Does what it''s description states, I''m satisfied with it. Works with the US wii u version.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Okonkwo', N'hannah.okonkwo9275@example.com', '2015-10-19', 5, N'Great game. Loads if fun. Looks great on the new Gen consoles'),
(N'Nancy', N'Wang', N'nancy.wang9176@example.com', '2015-10-19', 4, N'I must confess: Hotline: Miami delivers a fun, arcade-style diversion for the 8 or so hours of gameplay necessary to get the platinum (or Steam achievements). But I do not get the love of the story. Initially, Hotline: Miami is awesome. A dude gets a phone call, and goes to kill bad guys. What''s not to like? I''ve heard the developers were influenced by the movie Drive, and it shows. As the game progresses, the character starts to lose his grip on reality, but never his grip on his duty. I don''t really care about much else here. Once again: guy gets call, guy kills bad guys. It''s like I''m standing in Bumpers Junction, the old arcade in Smyrna, Georgia. Control is tight, and gameplay is fluid. You can build high scores through massive combos, and scores are the name of the game. Everything is perfect for a 5-star review. So, what is this stupid backstory that is given after I complete the main levels, and play as the biker? A group of patriots are controlling people''s minds? It...'),
(N'Sharon', N'Adams', N'sharon.adams9506@example.net', '2015-10-19', 5, N'Loved it!'),
(N'Dee', N'Ross', N'dee.ross5324@example.com', '2015-10-19', 5, N'Great game! Love the twists and turns and for once can be a cop. Decent story and online!'),
(N'Amara', N'Reyes', N'amara.reyes1571@example.org', '2015-10-19', 5, N'GOOD'),
(N'Pamela', N'Kowalski', N'pamela.kowalski4603@example.net', '2015-10-20', 3, N'fun games, but some don''t work and close out game. No support from Phamtom'),
(N'Brandon', N'White', N'brandon.white3601@example.net', '2015-10-20', 5, N'Great'),
(N'David', N'Parker', N'david.parker5143@example.org', '2015-10-20', 3, N'It works fine as PS4 remote, set up was easy, but I do have a couple issues. No batteries included, which maybe that was a silly thing to expect. But the biggest problem for me is no button works to change the HDMI source on my TV. Volume/channel up/down and power on/off work perfectly fine but it defeats the "universal" aspect if I have to dig out the old TV remote to switch back to the PS4 source.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Stewart', N'nadia.stewart9153@example.com', '2015-10-20', 1, N'Deez nutz.'),
(N'Richard', N'Lee', N'richard.lee5498@example.org', '2015-10-20', 5, N'Now that the patch is out i loved the game'),
(N'Lauren', N'Young', N'lauren.young3662@example.net', '2015-10-20', 3, N'A good game but the second is WAY better.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Phillips', N'olivia.phillips3143@example.net', '2015-10-20', 5, N'Good game for my child'),
(N'Donna', N'Raghunathan', N'donna.raghunathan5756@example.org', '2015-10-20', 5, N'Great limited edition and good deal of the price. I love it!'),
(N'Amara', N'Okonkwo', N'amara.okonkwo3691@example.org', '2015-10-20', 5, N'I''ve had this game since tis release and I **still** Play it. Fantastic RE release that goes back to the "roots" of what makes RE so much fun.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Ward', N'carlos.ward6318@example.org', '2015-10-20', 5, N'Very nice cables and HDMI 2.0 ready are great for the price'),
(N'Brenda', N'Sullivan', N'brenda.sullivan1183@example.net', '2015-10-20', 5, N'Bought this for a laptop as I hate the track pads on laptops. This has been working well so far and several people said they liked how it looks.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Roberts', N'jessica.roberts5615@example.net', '2015-10-20', 4, N'An incredible value for fans of this series. My only complaint about the product is that the the first Metal Gear Solid isn''t included on the disc.'),
(N'Carol', N'Green', N'carol.green1442@example.net', '2015-10-20', 5, N'I game too hardcore and I gotta stay mlg so I bought this amazingly fast charging station. I switch between controllers and it''s great because they are fully charged within an hour. Wouldn''t it be ridiculous if someone had bought 2 of these charging stations for 4 controllers? Now that''s too mlg. But hey the more mlg the better right? Anyways all an all this dual charger station is pretty legit works perfectly. I thought it wouldn''t work once I had received it from the mail dude. But it works. It may look a bit flimsy but it''s pretty stationary once you put your controllers on them. And don''t be afraid to jam the controller in the port...I actually thought I broke the port of the charger but I didn''t so it''s all good. You should buy it. The price keeps dropping and it might go back up to 30. Peace'),
(N'Jason', N'Kumar', N'jason.kumar5282@example.net', '2015-10-21', 5, N'The hate for this game makes me question if people play games to have fun or stare at every pixel they can until they find something out of place to complain about. I''ve moved past the the bandwagon of blind hate and purchased the game. I might have about one gripe with the game and that''s the turning is much slower than it used to be, I can get over that though. The graphics are completely fine and do not ruin anything about the game. You people expected photo realistic from a TH game? Stupid skate fanboys. I Skate as well but TH is NEVER going to be like Skate, so stop complaining. The physics are fine and the tricks are completely fine. I''m thinking that the people who rated their score low have never played a Tony Hawk game. If you loved the Ps2 Tony Hawk games then I''m more than sure you''ll love this one. Tons of fun and if you have friends, then It will be that much better. I would say, don''t trust any of the user reviews on here and try it for yourself. You might end up...'),
(N'Zachary', N'Adams', N'zachary.adams6741@example.org', '2015-10-21', 5, N'Eat it Spartan Locke. This controller wins.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Miller', N'samuel.miller9911@example.net', '2015-10-21', 3, N'More of the same. If you''ve played the previous two, you know what to expect. For all the marketing ''new and improved'', nothing is really different, just different toys to buy. Daughter (10) loves the create your own little world side of the game, she''s really gotten into minecraft, so makes sense that she''d like this aspect as well. Got the bundle that came with the 2 star wars playsets and the extra figure in the base game, have the ''inside'' playset set aside for xmas :) She already asked santa for that one.'),
(N'Luis', N'Fisher', N'luis.fisher4791@example.net', '2015-10-21', 5, N'Smiley face xD'),
(N'Lucia', N'Williams', N'lucia.williams9502@example.org', '2015-10-21', 5, N'Great game came as expected'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Smith', N'benjamin.smith1606@example.org', '2015-10-21', 4, N'Great product for the price. Works fine. Only 4 stars because they hurt your ears after a while.'),
(N'Paul', N'Sanchez', N'paul.sanchez4605@example.com', '2015-10-21', 5, N'The Legend of Zelda: Majora''s Mask for the Nintendo 64 has always been one of my all-time favorite Legend of Zelda titles and this 3D Remakes improves on everything that made the original version great. They''ve added Fishing Holes, like the one from Ocarina of Time, while also making it so you can save your game at Owl Statues instead of just having a Temporary Save through them, no longer needing to play the Song of Time to save the game (and undoing most of your Progress in the process). The Song of Double Time was improved as well. Now instead of just fast forwarding you to the next night or day, you can choose any time in your current day to warp to or warp to the Dawn of the next day, which is very helpful for the myriad of side-quests in this game since you no longer have to wait around until they begin. The addition of Gyro Controls for your Bow and Hookshot also make things more fluid and easier while the additional button for inventory and the Ocarina having its own button...'),
(N'Mei', N'Fisher', N'mei.fisher8125@example.com', '2015-10-21', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Melissa', N'Bennett', N'melissa.bennett5435@example.com', '2015-10-21', 4, N'These are solid gaming headphones for the price. The cushions are big enough that they can go around your ears, so you won''t get pinched ears after long gaming sessions. The sound quality is decent, and the detachable mic works great. I don''t think I''d recommend these to audiophiles, but if you just want a comfy, inexpensive headset for gaming, these are a great option.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Perez', N'kyle.perez7521@example.com', '2015-10-21', 5, N'Plays great. Excellent product. Very satisfied.'),
(N'Christina', N'Moore', N'christina.moore6669@example.org', '2015-10-22', 5, N'One of the best game on the wii u'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ward', N'kimberly.ward3824@example.org', '2015-10-22', 5, N'I love getting to play Smash on the go'),
(N'Nadia', N'Price', N'nadia.price5219@example.org', '2015-10-22', 1, N'worst purchase ever i already have this on ps3 all 3 games no multiplayer don''t waste your money you can get all 3 ps3 games for 30 bucks! this is so not worth it what a rip off if only games offered money back after opening i got tricked.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Cruz', N'carlos.cruz6470@example.org', '2015-10-22', 5, N'Great game specially being the last 7th generation Assassins Creed game, if you reader loved AC4 Black Flag, this is a Most and specially if you love Connor from AC3, this game close the gaps between those games and of course open the doors for AC Unity. full open exploration sea/land east crafting mechanics and of course being able to play as the bad guys... priceless.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Rogers', N'aisha.rogers4339@example.com', '2015-10-22', 5, N'product was just what expected in good condition'),
(N'Brian', N'Edwards', N'brian.edwards5285@example.org', '2015-10-23', 4, N'Awesome graphics Too cinematic tho Good fighting scenes just not enough of them For 20 dollars not too bad It''s like watching a movie at times'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Perez', N'stephanie.perez3556@example.net', '2015-10-23', 5, N'I purchased an XboxOne and went through most of the games unimpressed. I was growing tired of my X1 and was playing my PS4 much more, so I was getting ready to repackage my X1 and post it up on eBay. I completely forgot about even adding this game to my Gamefly Queue, so when it showed up at my house I set it aside for a few days, not really expecting much. I finally opened and installed the game, it went faster then most the other instals I noticed. Then I began to play... I didn''t sleep for the first 2 days. I couldn''t put the controller down. This game blew my mind so much I immediately went online and ordered the Day One Edition as well as a Season pass. They took everything that is fun about a video game and put it together in one huge beautiful world. With a Ratchet & Clank type of weapon leveling system, mixed with Tony Hawk''s Pro Skater type of grinding, plus the wall walking, challenges, and even the storyline is nothing short of amazing. Even the sounds they use in this...'),
(N'Paul', N'Gutierrez', N'paul.gutierrez3053@example.com', '2015-10-23', 5, N'Works great as intended. Would not use as main controller but when friends come over and we want to get a 3rd or 4th for a splitscreen game then these are perfect. I would guess that if used every day they wouldn''t last nearly as long.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Jackson', N'jacqueline.jackson6810@example.net', '2015-10-23', 3, N'I suppose it was alright as a ''mini'' game set. But after getting into the games only one or two were appealing to me. But I suppose that my fault for not researching the games more. Mainly the truck game was the one played the most. The demolition one was interesting though, but not much of a game in my opinion.'),
(N'Dee', N'Tanaka', N'dee.tanaka4584@example.net', '2015-10-23', 1, N'My collectors edition arrived and I could not wait to get it opened. Glad I did, because it was clear it needed to be returned ASAP. See my photos for clarification. Bottom line, the figurines that are included are fragile (obviously) and care should have been taken in the design of the packaging. In my first photo, you can see where Spartan Locke''s head has come off his figure and rests behind Master Chief''s head. The second photo is a close-up of Spartan Locke''s headless character and shows the muzzle of his gun is bent up and to the left. Amazon estimates I will receive a new one in a couple of days, but I am afraid this will be a common problem. Also, since I cannot ethically use the included codes, I am being forced to hold off on downloading the actual game until this situation gets resolved. I will update this review after I receive my new collector''s edition.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Torres', N'sarah.torres7160@example.net', '2015-10-23', 5, N'First off: In order to use these, you must have an XBOX ONE controller with a headphone jack. Second, if you are new to XBOX ONE, you could think that this headset is not loud enough, which is wrong. In order to adjust the headset/mic volume, go to the XBOX LIVE DASHBOARD. Press START SETTINGS DEVICES & ACCESSORIES XBOX ONE CONTROLLER VOLUME (This is where you can adjust the sliders.) The headset comes with TWO AAA Energizer batteries in order for you to activate the "afterglow." However, note that you DO NOT need batteries in order to use the headset. The batteries are there for the afterglow light effects. If playing alone, you will probably turn it off as it has no affect on your gaming. It is simply for show when you are with others, but yes, it does look great! This headset holds up well versus mid-range Turtle Beach headsets. Low hiss, comfy swivel ear cups and a microphone that can be adjusted upright when it gets in the way. It weighs about 10 ounces, so it did not weigh me...'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nowak', N'sandra.nowak8408@example.com', '2015-10-23', 5, N'Great mouse!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Myers', N'nicholas.myers2595@example.net', '2015-10-23', 4, N'game was eh, shipping was fast'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Myers', N'nicholas.myers2595@example.net', '2015-10-23', 3, N'they aren''t the most comfortable headset, nor the prettiest, and they are pretty fragile, but it provides everything you''d expect from $40. If they do break, logitech has great customer service and will send another to you.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ward', N'michelle.ward4084@example.net', '2015-10-24', 4, N'I played this game for about an hour, cheesy story dialogue, lots of yelling characters. Definantly not what I expected. I was hoping for a The legend of zelda game but this is more online orientated, in solving dungeons with a group or solo. Acquiring loot at the end of the dungeon to make new armors. The game has levels and is instance based rather than being open world. Each level you''re given a certain item "bow, bomb, etc". You have to complete the level using teamwork of your team, solo seems very tedious. Although tossing your friends off a cliff maybe fun you all share the same hearts. If you''re looking for a game like the past legend of zelda this isn''t it. Personally I''ll be returning it because WiFi connection is horrible while playing with others and solo play is not what this is meant for. The game cover says there''s 32 dungeons I did 5 in less than an hour this in theory is a rather short game. But by collecting items and building new attires it Definantly expands the...'),
(N'William', N'Young', N'william.young1810@example.com', '2015-10-24', 5, N'great game. love the jokes..easy game to beat but fun'),
(N'Nancy', N'Boyd', N'nancy.boyd1417@example.org', '2015-10-24', 3, N'Updated review: The space bar started to give out halfway through Mass Effect 2. That''s the middle of my favorite series. I was not happy. Also, the company that made the keyboard offered me a second keyboard if I wrote a review for the product and sent them the link. I did the review and sent them the link but they never got back to me. That wasn''t cool.'),
(N'John', N'Bennett', N'john.bennett1242@example.com', '2015-10-24', 4, N'I have been a Gears fan since day 1, and this remaster is pretty awesome. If you play it before Dec 2015 you get access to the other Gears games also once the Xbox One gets it''s backwards compatibility.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Chen', N'joyce.chen1606@example.net', '2015-10-24', 5, N'Excellent ! Thank you for your help (^_^)'),
(N'Aisha', N'Phillips', N'aisha.phillips1212@example.net', '2015-10-24', 4, N'Was fun. Loved every aspect of the game. But once i knew how to dupe.. it got boring real fast. I guess there is no way around hacks and dupes on the console versions..'),
(N'Raymond', N'Green', N'raymond.green1654@example.org', '2015-10-24', 5, N'My son loves this game! No problems!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Mitchell', N'stephen.mitchell6681@example.net', '2015-10-24', 4, N'We love it, just what we ordered.'),
(N'Karen', N'Sanders', N'karen.sanders6614@example.net', '2015-10-24', 5, N'Awesome in every way!'),
(N'Emma', N'Harris', N'emma.harris7696@example.com', '2015-10-24', 5, N'I''m kind of back into the PlayStation gig since I got a PS Vita. My first PlayStation, the first edition, is no more, but I wanted to experience this Sony product again for the sake of memories, downloading PSOne Classics from the PlayStation Store onto my Vita, but was hungry for more. So, now that I have a Vita, which I got several months ago, I decided to download this title. I got more than what I paid for. Be aware of this: I was never into the Ratchet and Clank games, probably because I didn''t have a proper console for them. Now I have a new obsession. One enough to make me buy a PS3 alone. I was blown away from this series (pun intended). The graphics, the humor, and the controls were awesome. But what makes it a Ratchet and Clank Collection is the number of weapons and gadgets throughout the games. This is what this series is about, and what made me a fan, besides the humor and graphics. I thought Rayman Origins was my favorite game (and my favorite series), but now I have...'),
(N'Yuki', N'Moore', N'yuki.moore1191@example.net', '2015-10-25', 4, N'Fun game.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Sullivan', N'lucia.sullivan7602@example.net', '2015-10-25', 3, N'It works ok. Air still feels warm but not hot. It snaps on over the stock AC prongs and is tight once on. Would have preferred it was powered separately or via USB. Fans are noticeable when running. This could have been alleviated with fewer larger fans instead of the tiny ones provided. It works, but not that well.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Fisher', N'brandon.fisher3259@example.net', '2015-10-25', 2, N'Not that good unless your a big fan of 2d jrpg. Personal I am not with the whole first person view and feels like an old pc game with good art work but that''s all its going for it. As close can get to persona like game without being a persona game. Characters same old in all these type games but feel less fleshed out. It feels like half product with low budget that was rushed. Had some potential but maybe never had budget to make it what could have been. Very over priced and maybe at 10 dollars be worth it. funny enough I bought original persona 1-2 on vita and games that with older quality from many years ago felt like they were a still a few levels above this. Imo just better games of this genre out there worth price and time. But like mention above if fan of jrpg 2d art with same like story as persona then ya could enjoy it.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Gray', N'pamela.gray8402@example.com', '2015-10-25', 2, N'As someone who truly loved Assassin''s Creed Black Flag, I came back to find a game that''s still at it''s core a fun experience. But there''s an unsettling irony here, that will leave you feeling hollow as you traverse London. For a game that can be construed as an allegory of the occupy wall street movement, and a timely release to seize on the hearts of millennials who may be moved by the words of Bernie Sanders and Elizabeth Warren, it''s unabashedly and grossly greedy. For a specific example, The Secrets of London and the Helix Glitch maps. Once just part of the original game (Black Flag is the last I played). Helix Glitches have now been transformed into In-Game-Currency. Secrets of London are similar to the Mayan fragments you would find and solve in Assassin''s Creed Black Flag. While those fragments in Black Flag were never given a map either, there were only 16 of them, and they were picked up easily as the islands are quite small, with generally one synchronization point. If...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Morales', N'kathleen.morales1383@example.org', '2015-10-25', 5, N'Ordered this a few weeks ago, since I was sure it would sell out closer to Christmas.. I love the changeable faceplates. Well, I like the Isabel one, but I like having the option to change them.. (I found a pretty pink plaid one on ebay)..The battery lasts longer than my 3ds xl did, as well as improved charging time. The 3d face tracking is MUCH better than on the old 3ds. Great system. great deal. the happy home designer game is fun. I thought it was going to be a time waster game- play for 20 min when I''m bored, but this is quickly becoming my favorite game! about 350 characters houses to design, and redesign.. I''ve played for hours and hours, and only have about 40 houses done.. love the amiibo card option also. I held off on buying the cards, but I did buy a pack yesterday and was pleasantly surprised. all in all, this bundle is a great deal!!!!!!'),
(N'Jack', N'Baker', N'jack.baker2750@example.net', '2015-10-25', 3, N'As a expert level player of these games since the original GH game from 2005, this game has potential to be really great. Unfortunately, the shortcomings are a huge impediment to enjoying the game: 1 - Calibration is not ready for prime time. I spent hours adjusting settings and it still does not feel right. 2 - Sometimes, the notes don''t seem to match up with what you are supposed to play or the timing is weird or something. But you miss notes that you know you are playing along with soundwise. You''d have to have experienced this to understand, I guess. But it just sometimes feels very off. There are also times that you can''t even hear the guitar. 3 - Sticky fret buttons. I''ve had this happen many times: you are playing chords on black and strumming while holding the first and second black frets. Then you have to switch to black fret two and three but the first fret doesn''t "let go" when you lift your finger so you break your combo. 4 - The guitar is poorly made. The first one I...'),
(N'Mateo', N'Ruiz', N'mateo.ruiz1907@example.net', '2015-10-25', 3, N'no comment'),
(N'Sharon', N'Webb', N'sharon.webb7266@example.net', '2015-10-25', 5, N'Broken don''t buy!!'),
(N'Joseph', N'Coleman', N'joseph.coleman9542@example.org', '2015-10-25', 4, N'Well after getting this game at launch, just like I did with Rock band 4, here are my impressions. I like the new button layout of the guitar. Instead of 5 buttons in a row, it''s basically 3 black buttons and 3 white buttons. One row on top of the other. This allows quite a few different button combinations depending on the skill level you are set to. It takes a little bit to get used to after the normal Guitar Hero and Rock band Guitars. Having the Dongle was a bit of a surprise to me. I''m not sure what they went this route, but it seems to work all right. I just plugged it into the side of my Xbox One. Now the Music, the LIVE part of it is great! I really like it. It''s really like you are standing there as part of the band, with Real People!!! They''ll talk to you, give you the thumbs up when doing good, and give you that look when you''re doing poor!!! It''s really pretty cool. The down side, there wasn''t enough of it!!!! I went through all the songs. I''ll keep playing and try the...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Myers', N'kathleen.myers9421@example.net', '2015-10-26', 5, N'Story development progresses nicely. Characters are loveable. Art is beautifully drawn and simply amazing. One of best love story adventure i ever read.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Myers', N'kathleen.myers9421@example.net', '2015-10-26', 5, N'Collector''s box is numbered which is pretty cool. I am glad they included an outer plastic layer to protect the box itself like they did on the tales of symphonia box. The retro key chains/charms are so uniquely adorable. Steel case is really awesome resembling the celestial records in the game. Chibi kyun chara figures are cute as always. Also included are the selected music cd inside the steel case, DLCs inside the game box w/instruction manual, artbook, and the 30min bluray disk. I got mine in prestine and complete condition which is pretty awesome. This is a very cool addition to any "tales of" fan. Anyways, game wise, different from tales of xillia, zestiria resembles more of the classic "tales of" game in a 3d environment which i love. It has that same magical world adventure feeling unfolding before your very eyes theme which i love from older "tales of" series. Controls are very easy to learn and pretty much the same with some additions/changes on the battle system....'),
(N'Lauren', N'Patel', N'lauren.patel8274@example.net', '2015-10-26', 1, N'didnt work'),
(N'Nathan', N'Chen', N'nathan.chen5069@example.org', '2015-10-26', 5, N'They worked great on my N64 console and games.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Cook', N'nicholas.cook4189@example.org', '2015-10-26', 5, N'Works great and I love the game. I used to spend a lot of hours as a kid playing this game and I finally got it again. The cosmetic wear on the label is almost non-existent. So excited!!!'),
(N'Victoria', N'Nelson', N'victoria.nelson9085@example.com', '2015-10-26', 1, N'After 3 days of use I am disappointed. Unlike the Samsung remote there isn''t a big button to "go back" and the vast majority of the commands are small to the point that the Playstation dualshock controller is better so why buy this one ? I am seriously considering shipping it back.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Bailey', N'joyce.bailey5113@example.org', '2015-10-26', 3, N'Not as good as previous versions. Did not contain any in-game codes (Such as Papa Hummels Pet Biscuits, which are normally located in the pack of cards) like previous versions. They charged more and provided less.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Campbell', N'gregory.campbell6079@example.com', '2015-10-26', 5, N'These work great. No issues'),
(N'John', N'Bell', N'john.bell7014@example.org', '2015-10-26', 4, N'The Witcher 2: Assassins of Kings is a marked improvement over the original. With a much more interesting story, better battle mechanics, and characters with more life than cardboard cutouts, it is an improvement in every way. As always my reviews are split into 3 categories: Story, Gameplay, and Characters with the Story getting the most weight. Story 8/10 The story in the second witcher game is very well written. You pick up right after the end of the first game protecting King Foltest. Soon after you are on the run from the law and are trying to clear your name. The story does a good job of building up over time until the ending which is fabulous. Overall the story suffers the same issue with timing as the original witcher. In both games, the story struggles to get going in the first chapter. Also, in many parts, the story is just difficult to follow. The game is another example of the writers assuming the player knows a lot about the lore of the witcher universe, or the...'),
(N'Amara', N'Murphy', N'amara.murphy3181@example.com', '2015-10-27', 2, N'The game had a bit of a learning curve and you die a bunch of times at the beginning until you realize you can run away from fight early on. Sometimes when you get three captains on you things get rough. Once you complete some missions and fights it becomes a bit easier. After the first hour or two you really pick the game up and things get much easier. The game is entertaining. The story lacks pull and I didn''t care much for the plot line. The coolest aspect of the game is the nemesis system that is a unique feature. It was a fun game at first, but then it became repetitive in my mind. I tried putting it down and coming back to it. I did that on two occasions, but never found the drive for the game. The repetitive nature reminded me of the first Assassins Creed where you repeat the same thing in a different location. I just couldn''t suffer through it for a weak story line. Maybe when I have more time I will be inclined to finish the story, but I just don''t think the game was for...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ramirez', N'kenneth.ramirez9968@example.com', '2015-10-27', 5, N'So cool can''t wait to try out the terminator in this game.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Taylor', N'stephanie.taylor3360@example.org', '2015-10-27', 5, N'Great FPS alien game series!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Brooks', N'aisha.brooks9772@example.net', '2015-10-27', 5, N'This is one of my favorite games to play.'),
(N'Carol', N'Lewis', N'carol.lewis9696@example.net', '2015-10-27', 5, N'Nice pouch.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Clark', N'carolyn.clark3639@example.com', '2015-10-27', 5, N'Very addictive game which doesn''t take much brainpower, so it''s perfect when you''re bored and don''t feel like concentrating. Fun way to pass the time, some new levels which give it variety are cool. Can''t beat the price either!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Okonkwo', N'timothy.okonkwo4394@example.net', '2015-10-27', 1, N'It''s BO1 and 2 discs in a bundled case with absolutely no new features at all. Just buy BO2 for $10 and BO1 for $5 on eBay.'),
(N'Henry', N'Jackson', N'henry.jackson4163@example.net', '2015-10-27', 3, N'It falls somewhere between 2K14 and 2K15 in quality. It has about 50% more creation tools than last years entry, but those of you (like me) that have been with the series for YEARS know that isn''t saying much. Custom soundtracks are STILL missing - inexcusable. No NXT first ladies - inexcusable. New kick out system - dreadful. New submission system - horrendous. If it weren''t for the games fairly respectful roster and attention to detail on most of the superstars this would be a 2 star review.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Patel', N'jeffrey.patel2770@example.org', '2015-10-27', 5, N'I really like the pad for my niece. She really loves Peach. And now I have the ones I love the most for Mario Kart: Peach and Yoshi.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Green', N'aisha.green6305@example.com', '2015-10-27', 2, N'Glad I only rented this game. Buggy with flaky control scheme that arbitrarily changes during some fights and you have to figure it out through trial and error. Ever since Unity this franchise has gone in the toilet. Strongly recommend you rent this one before dropping $60 on it.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Coleman', N'kenneth.coleman5183@example.net', '2015-10-28', 1, N'I almost bought it, then read on various message boards all the dlc,patches need to be downloaded from PSN ! Basically this is a repackaged game from last year with vouchers. Very misleading and lazy on EA''s part. I thought the whole f***** point of GOTY edition was to include everything one one disc.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Raghunathan', N'deborah.raghunathan3646@example.net', '2015-10-28', 4, N'At the time of writing this, I have played the first episode, the only episode currently released. I wasn''t expecting much from a Minecraft/TellTale mashup, but I was pleasantly surprised by the game. The designers did a really good job of incorporating Minecraft elements, like directing me to craft a bow and arrow to solve a particular puzzle, and giving me a choice of speed vs. aesthetics when building a shelter for the night. I''m looking forward to the subsequent episodes.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Campbell', N'jerry.campbell2821@example.net', '2015-10-28', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Brian', N'Mitchell', N'brian.mitchell7844@example.net', '2015-10-28', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Lucia', N'Wright', N'lucia.wright7406@example.com', '2015-10-28', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Noah', N'Davis', N'noah.davis7486@example.net', '2015-10-28', 5, N'Given Assassin''s Creed stumbled last year, and the rather lame marketing from publisher Ubisoft for their latest: "How will you travel around London, by boat, train or horse carriage?" AC Syndicate is a very refreshing surprise. This is an excellent game, and one of my favorites in the franchise. There are a few graphics lapses or bugs, but we haven''t had the ceremonial Ubisoft patch that usually arrives after 4-6 weeks of an AC game. If you have played Far Cry 3 or 4, Splinter Cell Black List, or some recent AC games - much of the format of the game will be familiar - taking out bases, bad Templar bosses in between 9 Sequences(with several missions a piece) that are satisfying, but oddly, not as challenging later on once your dual characters get loaded up with skills, weapons and defenses. This is the best AC game since the vastly underrated AC Revelations(finish all of the levels, and you get to enter a crypt inside the Hagia Sophia, a series pinnacle), along side the excellent...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Johnson', N'cynthia.johnson5174@example.org', '2015-10-28', 5, N'my son loves playing it'),
(N'Betty', N'Ward', N'betty.ward9276@example.net', '2015-10-28', 2, N'Had bad experience with 3 bundles including chu 1200 models, they won''t play blue ray disc movies. Even sent to Sony for repair and, no luck this is 3rd bundle although got game hope console works and can play it?'),
(N'Deborah', N'Suzuki', N'deborah.suzuki7376@example.net', '2015-10-28', 5, N'To the people complaining. All you have to do is run your software updates and Windows gives you the drivers. No sense in giving negative reviews because you didn''t run your software updates. After Windows installs the drivers just press and hold the button on the receiver until the light comes on.... power on the controller then press and hold the link button on the top... they sync in less than 5 seconds. It''s NOT hard. Everything works as it should.'),
(N'Laura', N'Foster', N'laura.foster4464@example.net', '2015-10-28', 5, N'Steins;Gate is a classic VN that stands out as one of the best (if not the best) Visual Novels ever. There''s not much else I need to say, just be prepared for some tears.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Scott', N'brandon.scott8371@example.net', '2015-10-28', 4, N'This is somewhat better than 2k15 it''s not going to have the stuff mention cause it''s for next generation consoles ps3 and 360 are old systems . I am glad see alot of wrestlers are add to this years the austin showcase is fun a great trip down memory lane . This is a continue from wwe 13 attitude era with wrestler we wanted new and old haku ,rikishi , savio vega , mikey whipwreck, brian pillman the nation are new and ken shamrock and shane mcmahon are a welcome back . it has custom soundtrack back but no finisher or enterences . The wrestler looks better than 2k15 normal and annoucing is good and gameplay the same the new way looks hard on ps4 and xbox 1 . looking foward to dlc stuff like samoa joe and hall of fame showcase and ledgend pack . down fall is not enough diva to play with sasha banks was huge disappointment along with other horsewomen too bad no dudleys or road dogg why so many repeats of ledgends and others in diffrent eras just gives their attire instead .'),
(N'Angela', N'Ivanov', N'angela.ivanov3097@example.net', '2015-10-28', 5, N'One of the best games on the N64!'),
(N'Christina', N'Collins', N'christina.collins5374@example.com', '2015-10-29', 4, N'Good graphics and really immersive gameplay!'),
(N'William', N'Russell', N'william.russell9636@example.com', '2015-10-29', 1, N'It should be called world of something else, that cant be said here. waist of time and money.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ramirez', N'brandon.ramirez1486@example.org', '2015-10-29', 5, N'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU5MimsH6GWghWziXBlwAw My detailed review of Hideo Kojima''s last Metal Gear! Amazing Gameplay with flaws in the story.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ramirez', N'brandon.ramirez1486@example.org', '2015-10-29', 5, N'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU5MimsH6GWghWziXBlwAw My detailed review of the controller!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Mitchell', N'christopher.mitchell4565@example.net', '2015-10-29', 5, N'Works exactly as expected, plug and play with Windows 10. The best part is that it worked right off the bat with Steam games, just as the XBox 360 wireless adapter did.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Mendoza', N'christopher.mendoza4535@example.net', '2015-10-29', 5, N'If you''re someone like me who played the original PC versions of these two games you will probably enjoy playing them again. This appears to be a direct port of the original game - same graphics and controls. One thing does seem to be different is the method of saving your progress - it''s now done automatically when you hit certain spots in the game. Something else that is new are different levels of play - the easier ones guide you through the narrative. The game if you haven''t played it before, is basically an interactive story. You walk around and talk with people to get information that helps you on your mission, and you collect items to be used to accomplish tasks. There is an element of puzzle solving. The first game can be a bit frustrating at the beginning, but it gets going once you get to the factory. I''m enjoying being able to play these games again after so many years, and hope that they bring back some of the other the Adventure Company titles.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Nguyen', N'raymond.nguyen4487@example.net', '2015-10-29', 5, N'halo 5 is awesome :) i love this it sticks to the original feel of all the Halo games and sure brings back awesome memories of the original Halo .'),
(N'Joseph', N'Walker', N'joseph.walker2908@example.com', '2015-10-29', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Barbara', N'Allen', N'barbara.allen9928@example.com', '2015-10-29', 2, N'Here is a quick summary. Multiplayer is ''fine'' you have modes you would expect to see in a halo game. However, the maps are kinda bleh and not memorable, you also have less modes than other halo games. Warzone is.... Boring... It reminds me a lot of how 343 hyped Spartan Ops and it ended up falling flat... Yeah that''s Warzone. I much rather have Big Team Battle. That was at least fun. Single player is cookie cutter storyline and you okay 80+% as Spartan Locke''s team... AI is pretty dumb too. Detailed. Multiplayer. I would have to say with any Halo game I spend most of my playtime on multiplayer. I am always happy to see not only competitive modes, but also fun modes like Griffball or infection. This game just has your standard multiplayer options with an additional mode new to the series called Breakout. It''s kind of fun, you have a team of 5 each with one life. As for the other modes they all fall flat since it is just a few of 343 maps which each one lack creativity. They don''t...'),
(N'Judith', N'Young', N'judith.young1247@example.org', '2015-10-29', 5, N'Need I say anything?'),
(N'Nadia', N'Bennett', N'nadia.bennett1348@example.net', '2015-10-29', 4, N'After a tumultuous first year, Destiny is now an actual game. It took about $130 on the part of loyal customers to get it there, but I guess progress is progress. Coming from a year one/week one player, there are many ups and downs to the progress from The Taken King. In year one, I saw it all. Down''d Atheon. Solo''d Crota. Shattered Skolas and then went to the Lighthouse. Now, having just finished HM King''s Fall and run through a new Iron Banner session to rank 5, I''m just about to hang up my hat on this until the next update so some thoughts are in order. Pros: PvP Thorn is dead. New subclasses are all fantastic, even if my Titan is broken, overpowered broken. The story questing is a very good idea. Boss/Strike endgame is pretty darn good. Much improved. Court of Oryx makes you wonder why you suffered through Prison of Elders so long. King''s Fall is both challenging and fair, a good deal of fun. Hard Mode isn''t cheap like Crota HM back when level 33 enemies were rough. No Time To...'),
(N'Jack', N'Suzuki', N'jack.suzuki1024@example.com', '2015-10-30', 5, N'A great mouse for gaming or everyday use. Buttons on the sides can be mapped to various functions such as forward and back, and you will find yourself trying to use your mouse at work in the same way once you get used to it.'),
(N'Jose', N'Turner', N'jose.turner6706@example.net', '2015-10-30', 4, N'This is a great set of headphones, I think they work really well, a step above others I have used. The quality of the sound and mic is great. To be used with Xbox One gaming system. We have tried several and this is the best pair so far.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Stewart', N'jacqueline.stewart5712@example.net', '2015-10-30', 5, N'Nintendo did it again, this game is just so much fun... no story, no streamlines, no boundaries but so much creativity, must have for any wii u owner.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Brooks', N'douglas.brooks9447@example.net', '2015-10-30', 2, N'Probably the biggest annoyance of the PS4 is the lack of good remote control options for dvd/bluray watching. Sure, you can use the dualshock but good luck trying to remember the button functions and by all means, avoid bumping it causing unintentional skips and spoiler alerts. This PS4 remote somewhat solves those dualshock problems. Negatives: -No backlighting. Good luck trying to use this in a dark room. -Remote is not "always on". Requires you to push the ps4 button before it can send commands. After a certain period of time, the remote turns off and you must push the ps4 button again. Very annoying I use the Logitech Harmony Ultimate for all my devices but it does not work well with the PS4 because it can''t turn it on and it can''t do most standard movie functions (fast forward, reverse, skip, etc.). For some reason, the Harmony works perfectly with the PS3 but not the PS4. Hopefully, it will get updated to work with the PS4 someday. Until then, I''ll maybe use this PS4 remote...'),
(N'Henry', N'Thomas', N'henry.thomas7944@example.com', '2015-10-30', 5, N'Great condition, one of the greatest DBZ games ever made NO DOUBT not to mention top 3 best fighting game for wii in my opinion. Great game, came with instruction booklet and original case.'),
(N'Frank', N'Wilson', N'frank.wilson9677@example.org', '2015-10-30', 5, N'thank you!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Ramos', N'mateo.ramos1200@example.com', '2015-10-30', 4, N'Worked as advertised, no complaints'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Walker', N'cheryl.walker9150@example.org', '2015-10-30', 4, N'It''s Halo 5 with an awesome statue and other extra goodies. Multiplayer is great, story line in campaign could be better, but not that bad. Overall a great game, just wish it was available on the PC.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Collins', N'rebecca.collins9671@example.net', '2015-10-30', 5, N'one of my favorite games to play when I was younger great to finally have it again 5/5 :D'),
(N'Marcus', N'Myers', N'marcus.myers3798@example.com', '2015-10-30', 5, N'amazing! love it! fast prompt! amazing, must buy, 6 stars all the way golwing review!~ buy from this seller and the items from them!'),
(N'Charles', N'Hill', N'charles.hill7977@example.net', '2015-10-30', 5, N'Turtle Beach makes excellent budget gaming headsets and the Recon 60P is no exception. I have always been impressed with their products in the past, and this set seems thoughtfully designed and well-constructed. PROS: -USB and 3.5mm connectors allow for versatile usage: you can connect it to your PS3/4 via USB, your PC or mobile devices via 3.5mm, etc -Great quality audio, similar in quality to the mid-range $99-149 headsets. -Good mic with minimal background noise, distortion on Skype, Mumble, Ventrilo, XBOX Live -Mic audio monitored in headset (you can hear yourself, if you choose, to avoid shouting) -Over-ear design is comfortable and blocks ambient noise. Ear cups are soft. -Extra long cord (13) reaches completely across the room -Volume control/mute functions on cord Possible CONS: -The extra-long cord is a bit of a trade off. If you are using this at your desk, youll have a tangle of cords at your feet. -Microphone does not retract, however it can be removed completely. -Im a...'),
(N'Henry', N'Stewart', N'henry.stewart1715@example.net', '2015-10-30', 5, N'Kill them North Koreans, fun game'),
(N'George', N'Okonkwo', N'george.okonkwo4342@example.org', '2015-10-30', 5, N'Soon loved it. Many multi level to this game. He likes the cartoon and he enjoys playing this game. It''s kinda quirky funny as well.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Walker', N'brandon.walker2837@example.net', '2015-10-31', 5, N'I purchased this item used, it arrived quickly and worked well. Kirby is awesome!'),
(N'Jason', N'Morales', N'jason.morales4290@example.net', '2015-10-31', 5, N'After what I would call a few misses for the AC series, Assassin''s Creed Syndicate brings the game back in line to greatness. The graphics are top notch, and the game again allows you to be as stealthy as you want to be, or take the more "hack and slash" approach of some of the RPG''s take. Although I''ve only been on it for a few hours, it has grabbed my attention (more than I can say for the last few in the series" and makes me want to keep coming back for more. I like the ability to play as additional characters, with separate abilities and movement...that only adds to the desire to keep coming back. And then there is the rope/zip line aspect...I''ll let you enjoy that one on your own.'),
(N'Megan', N'Martin', N'megan.martin1492@example.org', '2015-10-31', 5, N'Great product will buy again! Works great for what I needed A+'),
(N'Alexander', N'Murphy', N'alexander.murphy6751@example.org', '2015-10-31', 1, N'Disappointed with this remote. I pre ordered it due to being officially licensed by Sony for the PS4. The remote does not work on all apps, specifically YouTube which I use a lot and was a very big reason for the purchase. I would have thought that having dedicated PS4 buttons it would send the same signals the controller does, but apparently not. It''s a hit or miss, somethings work, others don''t, unlike with the dualshock controller. Now I have to keep using the dualshock for media which is what I was trying to avoid with this half functioning remote. Edit: Well it keeps getting worse. Now it does not work at all, the only function that works is volume, cannot connect to the ps4. The light on the remote stopped working. Tried everything on the instructions at nothing works.'),
(N'Mei', N'Jones', N'mei.jones3330@example.net', '2015-10-31', 5, N'I bought this for my sons birthday. He has put it thru a heavy gaming test and it works great very life like. A bit pricey but worth the money'),
(N'Andrew', N'Kelly', N'andrew.kelly4846@example.net', '2015-10-31', 3, N'To hard im stuck on the first level and i cant beat it!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Kim', N'jacqueline.kim8128@example.com', '2015-11-01', 5, N'Fun! Similar to other Far Crys... open world, explore.... and participate in different quests througout.'),
(N'Angela', N'Rivera', N'angela.rivera1369@example.org', '2015-11-01', 5, N'The product was great. It was delivered on time.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Gonzalez', N'alexander.gonzalez6909@example.com', '2015-11-01', 5, N'This game has proven to be a very controversial game, some love it, some hate it, some are middle road. I am on the LOVE it side of things, yes there are some unanswered questions in the game, yes there isn''t the character development you might want, BUT if you play through the game slowly, listen to the squad banter while playing and pay attention to the cut scenes you will see the excellent story that 343 has crafted. You could blow through the game in quick order and at the end think, dang what happened and I was a little like that until I began playing the game on Legendary, playing very slowly ( because that''s the only way to survive on Legendary difficulty ), and really started listening to what was being said by each squad member. I know some people have no idea where the Master Chiefs team members ( Kelly , Linda & Frederick ) came from since you have always known the Master Chief as the lone hero. The game expects you to already know the background of these people and why...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Ali', N'aaron.ali1520@example.org', '2015-11-01', 5, N'Great deal'),
(N'Aaron', N'Ali', N'aaron.ali1520@example.org', '2015-11-01', 5, N'No problems at all.'),
(N'Diane', N'Ali', N'diane.ali6711@example.net', '2015-11-01', 5, N'the best videogame'),
(N'Frank', N'Fisher', N'frank.fisher9945@example.org', '2015-11-02', 4, N'While I love the actual figure the box came and was very messed up. Oh well not like I am keeping him in there.'),
(N'Heather', N'Ivanov', N'heather.ivanov6283@example.org', '2015-11-02', 5, N'Not a whole lot to say. It''s easy to setup and works as it should. It''s nice that it comes with a USB extension so you can place it in an optimal position.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ross', N'dennis.ross4778@example.net', '2015-11-02', 5, N'Beautiful, even though I don''t own a ps4 yet, I''m stocking up on my favorite games and I love collecting limited editions'),
(N'Peter', N'Thompson', N'peter.thompson7019@example.net', '2015-11-02', 5, N'Nothing bad to say here.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Morales', N'aaron.morales2363@example.org', '2015-11-02', 5, N'i love it'),
(N'Omar', N'Jones', N'omar.jones7186@example.com', '2015-11-02', 2, N'At first I liked this game, for the first few chapters, but God does it get boring. The story and characters are pretty thin so that isn''t much of a motivation to push through the arduous tedium that all the battles become - it''s awful. I just can''t play it anymore, it feels like a chore to play now'),
(N'Yuki', N'Chavez', N'yuki.chavez6052@example.com', '2015-11-02', 5, N'Awesome game! Feels just like playing a horror movie. The gameplay involves some wandering and exploring, some decision making, and some quick-time events. Overall, even an inexperienced gamer can play through it, they just need to familiarize themselves with (X O) for the quick-time events. Great for playing a group, where you can take turns, play as different characters, or just have fun watching someone else play. The graphics are perfect. The environments are somewhat confined, but beautiful. They really use every pixel. The story starts out as a typical slasher flick, but introduces another sinister element and so many awesome twists'),
(N'Thomas', N'Webb', N'thomas.webb5127@example.com', '2015-11-03', 5, N'great mouse, it took a bit to get used to it but now am running smoothly on the games i play. the colors costumization is awesome and you can make it look as you want. button configuration is also quite easy. Is a must buy for gamers.'),
(N'Christina', N'Flores', N'christina.flores8984@example.com', '2015-11-03', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Patricia', N'Robinson', N'patricia.robinson9630@example.net', '2015-11-03', 1, N'To begin with, if you get the one ordered which I''m pretty sure I did not, good luck getting it to work.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Scott', N'tomasz.scott4414@example.org', '2015-11-03', 4, N'They could have put some more interaction with the the villagers.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Diaz', N'rachel.diaz6724@example.org', '2015-11-03', 1, N'More milking from Nintendo. This game got boring after ten minutes. Returned it immediately.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Khan', N'ryan.khan2200@example.net', '2015-11-03', 5, N'really fun game. and because the PlayStation 4 came out I had to buy this game for that console and it is very fun game'),
(N'Mateo', N'Cruz', N'mateo.cruz2390@example.net', '2015-11-03', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Wei', N'Coleman', N'wei.coleman6420@example.org', '2015-11-03', 5, N'EXCELLENT!!!!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Flores', N'michelle.flores7129@example.org', '2015-11-03', 5, N'Overall it''s a pretty solid game. The handling mechanics are smooth and predictable. Takes a slight learning curve to get used to it, but it''s operating under the same engine as previous Need for Speed games. The graphics are awesome and vivid - exactly what you''d expect from a next-gen release. The sounds are pure and crisp and complement the actions of your car accordingly. The story is pretty much the same as other Need for Speed games (you race different characters in different race events and progress with money and through the story). The cars obviously get better as you progress and customizing them can be really fun. I''ve been playing it for a few hours now and really enjoy it. I''ll update once I get online and experience that as well.'),
(N'Mary', N'Ruiz', N'mary.ruiz5070@example.org', '2015-11-03', 5, N'So I just started playing, normal difficulty on steam, this game provides a fun and unique challenge. Without worrying about it being a traffic simulator, roads are mainly for just linking structures. Think water pipes almost, but cars use them and there is plenty of fun aspects of the game. With a few negs. Fantastic design that is true to anno 2070. It is a visually intense game with some strategy, at first, I sat down and consigned it to be a fairly simple game of just managing resources and keeping your company running at peak efficiency. Then I got to antartica. Spent 10 mins trying to figure out why I couldn''t build outside of the thermal zone. Well turns out you have to mix your industrial with ur residential, otherwise it won''t grow, suffice it to say overcoming this challenge was no small feat. Each scenario, Earth, Moon and arctic provides 3 completely different maps. Although this could be seen as a negative, the fact this game with all the elements incorporated is a...'),
(N'Katherine', N'Cruz', N'katherine.cruz6276@example.com', '2015-11-03', 3, N'Not sure what the hype is all about with these pedals, but the throttle resistance is terrible, the clutch is ok, and brake is sub par at best even with the included brake mod. However the responsiveness and resolution of these pedals is a step up from the g27 pedals I have been using. You can get alot more accurate with throttle control, and braking etc with these pedals over some others. They perform well, but just don''t feel very realistic. I drive a manual car in real life every day, and this just isn''t very realistic. I may invest in some pedals with load cells but Im not sure yet.'),
(N'Emily', N'Kumar', N'emily.kumar4932@example.org', '2015-11-03', 5, N'Seems to work alot better than the ones made in taiwan'),
(N'Paul', N'Wright', N'paul.wright6561@example.org', '2015-11-03', 5, N'A must have game for XBOX owners. Can comparison shop by price/service since the game is the same everywhere!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Taylor', N'douglas.taylor9320@example.org', '2015-11-03', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ramirez', N'kenneth.ramirez8275@example.com', '2015-11-04', 4, N'This is one of the more involved RPG''s that I have played in a while. That''s not a bad thing. I like games with more depth. Lots of customization as far as equipment, powers, potions, skills, etc. Although, one thing missing is character customization. You play the main character (on the box), the Witcher ,and that''s it. Like most RPG''s of today, there is the main story and many side missions. You can explore around on your own and earn some money/experience, then get back to the main mission as you please. One thing I need to bring up though, it''s hard. This game can be punishing at times. Death is frequent in the early stages. I''ve had to start over from scratch a few times already. Many of the encounters you will face in the wild will be a lot more than you can handle. They also threw in the dreaded equipment maintenance nonsense. Your armor/weapons will degrade with use and will need repair. That costs money. Yup, you guessed it, money is scarce. So, you really have to play...'),
(N'Shirley', N'Martin', N'shirley.martin7942@example.com', '2015-11-04', 4, N'The sound and comfort of the LVL3 exceed what I expected for a headset at this price point. The bass seems very apparent to me, and the headphones cup over the ears, offering a very immersive sound experience. The actual construction is solid and tight enough that it doesn''t feel like it will fall off your head as you move around your gaming space. I like that the microphone lifts up and out of the way when not in use, and the in-line controls are functional and well designed. Yes, it will only work with the second generation Xbox One controllers via the 3.5mm headphone jack, or with the add-on adapter. PDP offers and adapter for $19.99, but includes a $10 gift card with each set of LVL3''s...BUT they''re also sold out! Heads up if you only own the older style controllers.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Lee', N'douglas.lee5642@example.net', '2015-11-04', 5, N'This controller is super cool, I love the transparent case and the lights. Since the last Afterglow controller for the Xbox 360 this has come a long way as far as lights. In the Xbox 360 controller (which I also own) the lights were super bright and if you were playing in the dark they would be very annoying. This one on the other hand is very comfortable to use while in the dark. You can change the brightness of the prismatic light, and the red lights that flash when it vibrates are not that bright. I love that this controller has programmable keys, although I haven''t used them that much, it''s nice to have the option. I also love that it is wired, not many people will probably agree with me here, but I hate having my controller die on me halfway through a match or dealing with buying new batteries or keeping them charged. My only minor complaint is the way that the triggers are shaped, I wish they were more curved instead of cornered. Not a huge issue, just a slight complaint. But...'),
(N'Maria', N'Collins', N'maria.collins9763@example.com', '2015-11-04', 3, N'11/04/2015 Review: The Logitech G402 Hyperion Fury FPS Gaming Mouse has proved to be a reliable tool in my gaming arsenal. I''m curious to see how long this device will last, thought the build quality seems solid enough and the texturing around the grip and surface is very comfortable. The extra buttons are reachable and tactile but not excessive, the scroll wheel is comfortable to use, and the on-the-fly dpi shifts and programmable macros is a nice touch. The mouse alsoof courseis excellent for casual internet browsing sessions or getting any work done on a computer or laptop. My only complaint is that it a wired mouse, however the cord is plenty long (I''ve actually placed cable ties on it to shorten it) however is not braided. Games Mainly Played: Counter Strike: Global Offensive, TERA, CoD:WaW Update 08/09/2016: The sensor on this mouse has begun to skip on several different surfaces and after multiple attempts to calibrate it in software. Another aspect that has started...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Nguyen', N'olivia.nguyen5301@example.net', '2015-11-04', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Melissa', N'Clark', N'melissa.clark2345@example.com', '2015-11-04', 5, N'My 8 year old boy loves Avengers....and Olaf. Now he can play with all of them in the same game. I can''t wait to see what Infinity does next.'),
(N'Peter', N'Brown', N'peter.brown7219@example.org', '2015-11-04', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Christopher', N'Butler', N'christopher.butler4661@example.net', '2015-11-04', 5, N'Tough case, easy to insert and remove the game cartridges, and the clear case means I can see what I have in the front or back easily. I love it so much that this is my second case.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Chavez', N'rachel.chavez5473@example.org', '2015-11-04', 4, N'Shovel Knight is a retro indie platformer, merging the best elements from classic NES games like Mega Man and Duck Tales while staying current in its presentation and handling. Gameplay is traditional 2D sidescrolling with plenty of platform hopping and sub-items to defeat the enemies with. A unique checkpoint system allows you to tailor the challenge: you can either continue normally, restarting at a checkpoint when you die, or destroy the checkpoint for a boost in money. It''s a risk/reward system that really helps the game stand out. As a game I give Shovel Knight a 5/5. If you grew up on 8-bit or 16-bit games, and heck even if you didn''t, Shovel Knight needs to be in your library. On the downside, the retail edition is $10 more than the digital edition and the PS4 version isn''t crossbuy. You receive a code for the soundtrack, valued at $10, with a new copy and the free Plague Knight DLC is on the disc. There''s also a 42 page, full color manual in the style of old games. It''s...'),
(N'Andrea', N'Davis', N'andrea.davis5948@example.org', '2015-11-05', 3, N'The Afterglow LVL 1 Chat Communicator for Xbox One is a good value for a budget gaming headset. Sound quality is acceptable, and the microphone clarity is very good. The main selling point is the compact and lightweight build of this unit. The headband is somewhat no-frills, which may lead some to complain of an uncomfortable fit. But for this picky reviewer, the fit seemed fine. There are some cheesy details included right alongside some cool features. But given the value, I think this unit will be a decent option for some. PROS: ++ Decent value for a compact and functional headset ++ Microphone sound quality is above par for a budget headset ++ Convenient microphone boom arm can be adjusted or folded out of the way ++ Inline volume dial and microphone mute are super convenient ++ Compatible with standard 3.5mm aux ports (such as on the 2nd generation Xbox One Wireless Controller; adapters are available for other controllers / devices) ++ Ear piece is adequately comfortable ++...'),
(N'Justin', N'Nguyen', N'justin.nguyen1635@example.net', '2015-11-05', 5, N'I enjoyed the straightforwardness and simplicity of this MOH game. It is probably my favorite MOH game of all time; tied with MOH Frontline and Airborne. I prefer it much more than the original...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Howard', N'benjamin.howard1827@example.com', '2015-11-05', 5, N'Great buy. Product as shown'),
(N'Kevin', N'Kowalski', N'kevin.kowalski8729@example.net', '2015-11-05', 5, N'Great game. But if I''m being honest, the antagonist is the reason I can give it five stars instead of 4. With it being made clear, unlike in 3, that there is no "right" side, since this time it''s a true struggle for a nation, this game make you actually feel guilty, even if you think you''re making the right decisions. I highly recommend the secret ending of the game, but if you actually go through the game, you''ll be faced with two possible people to support the decisions of. Both are good people, see a future for the nation, and truly believe in their nation and what it could be. But both would never agree. And both show you that good things have a price...and sometimes even good rulers can be horrid.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Ramirez', N'carolyn.ramirez9530@example.net', '2015-11-05', 5, N'Great product, great price.'),
(N'Susan', N'Mitchell', N'susan.mitchell7304@example.org', '2015-11-05', 4, N'The last couple of years has proven that the isometric RPG is not only far from a relic of the past, but alive and well. However, it usually shows up on PC, as Wasteland 2 originally did last year. Those who enjoy the genre should rejoice then, as Wasteland 2: Director''s Cut faithfully brings the genre to consoles and does so in fantastic fashion. It is impossible not to immediately recall the Fallout games of old when firing up Wasteland 2: Director''s Cut. The isometric view, tons of customization options for your characters and the post-apocalyptic setting all harken back to those old RPGs on the PC. Without a doubt, there is inspiration to be had here drawn from those titles and more, but Wasteland 2 is also its own game. The story is first presented in very effective full-motion video explaining how the world fell into its current state. Equal parts science fiction and western, there is a distinctive vibe to Wasteland 2 that immediately resonated with me. If you are not used to...'),
(N'Andrew', N'Chen', N'andrew.chen2193@example.com', '2015-11-05', 5, N'i will have to say this is his masterpiece'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Barnes', N'hiroshi.barnes1639@example.org', '2015-11-05', 5, N'great action game for anime lovers'),
(N'Marcus', N'Myers', N'marcus.myers3798@example.com', '2015-11-05', 5, N'Amazing'),
(N'Jacob', N'Howard', N'jacob.howard6926@example.net', '2015-11-05', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Gray', N'cheryl.gray3711@example.com', '2015-11-05', 5, N'Amazing game. Spend hours and hours trying to complete all 450 cars!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Morris', N'patrick.morris6072@example.com', '2015-11-06', 5, N'Love all the hunting unlimited games but they do repeat. Just buy 10 and 11'),
(N'Nancy', N'Boyd', N'nancy.boyd1417@example.org', '2015-11-06', 3, N'It''s a fun game but unless you have The Taken King then it''s a super bare experience that just leaves you wondering how they considered it finished. Overall, good but needs more content without having to pay an extra $50'),
(N'Brenda', N'Chen', N'brenda.chen2275@example.com', '2015-11-06', 5, N'This game is awesome .best call of duty in years .'),
(N'Christina', N'Young', N'christina.young9341@example.org', '2015-11-06', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Shirley', N'Martin', N'shirley.martin7942@example.com', '2015-11-06', 4, N'My favorite entries in the Assassin''s Creed series are still AC II and AC IV. It''s a series that seems easy to dip in and out of, based on interest in the setting and location. Seeing that Assassin''s Creed: Syndicate was set in 1868 London made me VERY interested in trying the game. Think Gangs of New York, Oliver!, Sherlock Holmes, Jack the Ripper, etc. Gritty, but lively stories from a city drenched in underground gangs and lively violence. I''m happy to say that ACS nails the feeling of that era. You''ll ride a train around London, over the Thames, through rundown cluttered neighborhoods and even right past Big Ben. You''ll meet up with Dickens, Alexander Graham Bell, Darwin and Churchill during your adventure. Yes, its a little shoehorned in, but the level of humor seems a bit turned up on this entry in the series, similar to AC II. The overall gameplay is the same tried-and-true formula. Scale stuff, sneak around, collect this or that, plenty of side missions and a decently...'),
(N'Angela', N'Raghunathan', N'angela.raghunathan8892@example.net', '2015-11-06', 5, N'OK'),
(N'Ronald', N'Anderson', N'ronald.anderson8927@example.com', '2015-11-06', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Lucia', N'Chen', N'lucia.chen9325@example.net', '2015-11-06', 3, N'Excellent wires'),
(N'Janet', N'Lopez', N'janet.lopez4547@example.net', '2015-11-06', 3, N'Zombies: I play CoD Zombies just to purely kill zombies and to give you an idea I don''t like playing tranzit on BO2 but I do very much so enjoy playing the map Farm. I''m really not into the story (or any story) of it at all so their only map available to everybody, "Shadows of Evil" really disappointed me. It''s basically tranzit. Campaign: I''m already bored of it but it might turn out to be awesome since I''ve only done a few missions but I''m going to play through it because of the easter egg. If you complete the campaign and get pass through all of the credits at the end then you get an option to play the whole campaign again but in zombie mode with a different storyline. Multiplayer: 8.5/10'),
(N'Aisha', N'Martinez', N'aisha.martinez4374@example.net', '2015-11-06', 4, N'I''ve liked other people''s PS3s and PS2s, but never got around to setting up this one. I may just get a PS4 instead. Is there any reason to keep this one?'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Brown', N'nicholas.brown3869@example.com', '2015-11-06', 5, N'It is a good game'),
(N'Joyce', N'Campbell', N'joyce.campbell1926@example.org', '2015-11-06', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Joshua', N'Powell', N'joshua.powell7574@example.com', '2015-11-06', 5, N'bien'),
(N'Michelle', N'James', N'michelle.james2197@example.org', '2015-11-06', 1, N'Save your money. Awful game.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Martinez', N'deborah.martinez6687@example.org', '2015-11-06', 1, N'I hate this game. It''s not fun to play and I wish I never bought it.'),
(N'Justin', N'Richardson', N'justin.richardson3119@example.net', '2015-11-06', 5, N'Wins: Roster Cage match animations Barricade slams Irish whip animations Unbreakable weapons Title match animations New seated grapples Working holds Lighting effects Apron slam Animations Steel post animations Strikes in general Faster pace Suicide spear omg moment Every attire from 2k15 in custom attires Soundtrack and superstar music Create an arena stage construction option More vocal taunts and finally the ability to turn off limited reversals. Fails: Stone cold only showcase Custom attire invisible wrestler glitch No song skip like last gen No infinite finishers like last gen No shinning box art like 2k15 Universe mode My career mode without divas Major superstar and diva exclusions No inferno match like last gen No I quit match like last gen No match creator like last gen No superstar heads No caw feature morphing slider No classic steel cage Less arena logos than last gen Less arena templates than last gen Sloppy character selection menu Complicated create an arena saving...'),
(N'Christine', N'Williams', N'christine.williams9809@example.org', '2015-11-06', 5, N'Pretty dang hard lol but it''s a grand ol'' time anywayz'),
(N'Barbara', N'Barnes', N'barbara.barnes2671@example.net', '2015-11-06', 1, N'Enough.... THE BUNNYHOPPING! THE END!'),
(N'Carol', N'Lee', N'carol.lee5113@example.org', '2015-11-06', 5, N'As advertised. Timely delivered,'),
(N'Luis', N'Nowak', N'luis.nowak2476@example.org', '2015-11-07', 5, N'Again, a great game for teenagers who love football & X-box!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Raghunathan', N'kofi.raghunathan7144@example.org', '2015-11-07', 4, N'Mostly mindless fun. Decent platforming that doesn''t get old.'),
(N'Mei', N'Parker', N'mei.parker4627@example.com', '2015-11-07', 5, N'Great amiibo figure!! I love pac-man'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Anderson', N'kenneth.anderson5346@example.org', '2015-11-07', 2, N'It was a little bulky. It wasn''t comfortable to wear. It squeezed and did not have an adjustable width. The ear pieces were too small, so not only was it squeezing, but it pressed on earlobes as well. Sound quality was awesome, of received audio. The microphone, like many of these headsets, people were saying it transmitted like I was in another room. It was still to quiet for use in multiplayer games. Being able to chat is a huge feature of headsets and the quality of the microphone really was not good, which is why 2 stars.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Howard', N'christopher.howard9334@example.com', '2015-11-07', 5, N'This product is awesome! I have my Xbox in a tight shelf with little room to breathe and my console gets so freaking hot that it turns itself off mid games. This product has fixed that issue and redirects all the heat and hot hair towards the front and my console is so much cooler. For those saying its loud, I don''t even know this thing is on. It''s not loud at all. Very pleased with my purchase! Also forgot to mention it''s so sleek'),
(N'Luis', N'Gray', N'luis.gray7421@example.org', '2015-11-07', 5, N'This is a spectacular game. In my opinion no AC game will ever top Assassin''s creed 2, but this comes very close and is my second favorite game in the series with Black Flag coming in third. The character development of Jacob and Evie Frye was great. Jacob is a combination of brash hilarious and idiotic roled into one. Evie is smart and likes to go into a mission with a plan. Jacob is more of a shoot first and ask questions later kind of Assassin. Jacob is my favorite out of the two because he is hilarious and a big smart alec sometimes. He reminds me of myself at times. Jacob is better in combat, while Evie is better in stealth. However, it really doesn''t matter who you play as. Both Assassin''s are very good at pretty much everything. They each have their own missions in the main story line but I played as both in the open world pretty evenly and enjoyed both character''s throughout the game. Plus, I would say that neither assassin is really better than the other when it comes to...'),
(N'Michael', N'Cook', N'michael.cook6394@example.org', '2015-11-07', 5, N'This is a fantastic and well made keyboard. I wasn''t expecting much when I bought it, but figured I wouldn''t be out too much if it turned out I didn''t like it. I was pleasantly surprised when I got it out and started using it though. It''s heavy, feels quality, and the keys have just enough of a click and resistance when you type, something I''ve returned a few keyboards for lacking. The braided fabric cord is fantastic and very well made; it''s easier to move around without risking damaging the cord than plastic coated cords, although I could do with it being a bit longer. I really like the seven different backlight colors, but the red is a bit lacking if there''s light in your area other than monitor glow. The breathing and color cycling effects are really well done, though I am not personally fond of using it unless I''m letting it "idle". Speaking of letting the keyboard idle, however, there is one thing I am not the biggest fan of when it comes to this keyboard: the backlight...'),
(N'Robert', N'Smith', N'robert.smith5751@example.org', '2015-11-07', 5, N'I''ve always enjoyed designing things and a game that allows me to do this is amazing! I love the added bonus of being able to use the Animal Crossing Cards to summon up new neighbors to design for. Nintendo''s hit it out of the park with this design game!');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Brian', N'Kowalski', N'brian.kowalski3824@example.net', '2015-11-07', 1, N'The controls are absolutely garbage. The graphics are bug filled and the environments not only lack originality but are very bare and bland. Such a big chance to reboot the series and it was such an epic fail. Don''t even bother buying, It''s truly not worth it.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ramirez', N'dennis.ramirez5371@example.net', '2015-11-07', 1, N'No different from the last 2 games. Just as bad as the last 3. Zombies is insanely difficult and dumb with aliens. Multiplayer is still terrible. So much swaying and recoil. Dumb spray and pray mechanics. Story is just as boring and unrelated to the last 2 BO games. Another do not buy COD.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Johnson', N'mateo.johnson4774@example.com', '2015-11-07', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Mateo', N'Johnson', N'mateo.johnson4774@example.com', '2015-11-07', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Karen', N'Ramirez', N'karen.ramirez8198@example.org', '2015-11-07', 5, N'This game was good on PC it runs on windows 8.1 but ever since windows 10 come out Microsoft has been sneaking in windows 10 features into Windows 8.1 it will not run the game so if you''re buying this for Windows 8.1 or if you have it don''t buy it because Microsoft put that Windows 10 no piracy feature in it all I''m saying it used to run on it windows 8.1 so yeah but still good game to that''s why I give it 5 stars'),
(N'Michael', N'Sullivan', N'michael.sullivan1182@example.com', '2015-11-07', 1, N'Terrible game!! The guns sound ridiculous and what''s with all the futuristic junk?!?!?'),
(N'Aaron', N'Lee', N'aaron.lee8947@example.net', '2015-11-07', 4, N'Faithfully done remake of 3 classics; games all fit on 1 disc,'),
(N'Robert', N'Wisniewski', N'robert.wisniewski9321@example.com', '2015-11-07', 5, N'Graphically this is the best-looking Halo game ever released. I realize that sounds a little obvious considering that it''s the first game in the series designed for this generation, but it''s also the best looking game I''ve seen on the XBONE. Developers routinely struggle to pull off 1080p on the XBONE (HD remakes of older games notwithstanding), let alone 60fps at the same time, but 343 managed to make it look easy. Every scene, every background, everything was polished and razor sharp. The controls in Halo have always been particularly good, but this felt like a cut above the rest. Aiming felt intuitive - the aim assist features were subtle enough to convince you were doing all the work while still being effective. The campaign, while a good length for a Halo game, still felt short - it took around 8 hours on normal difficulty (admittedly I should have been playing on a higher difficulty if I wanted a longer experience). Another standout is the story. Halo 4''s story was...'),
(N'Marcus', N'Phillips', N'marcus.phillips1521@example.net', '2015-11-07', 5, N'I have call of duty 1,2 now i have number 3 i love playing this game it''s a great game'),
(N'Carol', N'Turner', N'carol.turner9410@example.net', '2015-11-07', 5, N'Imagine, you''re a fairly typical high school girl obsessed with taking photographs. You moved from a rather hip and happening city to go to a school back in your boring little hometown just because your favorite photographer is now a teacher there. Your life is more or less a day to day repeat of Degrassi High without Drake. Until one day you happen to be in the right place at the right time and discover you''re a living time machine. Welcome to Life is Strange, an episodic "interactive movie" as I''ve started to call them. It''s pretty similar to TellTale''s recent adventure games where you control a character to explore your environment, interact with other characters, and make major story affecting decisions such as whether you want to eat waffles or eggs and bacon for breakfast. Okay, it does sound rather silly. And the first episode DOES give off a pretty bad impression. As previously mentioned, it starts off almost like a 2015 High School simulator. But by the end of episode one,...'),
(N'Priya', N'Wright', N'priya.wright1298@example.com', '2015-11-07', 1, N'I purchased this in 2013. By 2014 they were broken. The muffs are on a swivel and the swivel broke. This is made with cheap plastic. I paid the same price that they go for now. Was a rip-off then and a rip-off now. The audio also produced a hiss. Very poor investment.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Chavez', N'nancy.chavez1449@example.net', '2015-11-08', 5, N'Hooked up my V Moda headphones with them and it works flawlessly. I hear the game audio and party chat in my headphones. WHAT INVENTION IS THIS, THIS IS LIFE CHANGING. I''m still blown away. I was on the fence, due to reviews but pulled the trigger.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Martin', N'tomasz.martin9698@example.org', '2015-11-08', 5, N'If I could vote 6 stars on a item, this would be one of them. It has flawless quality sound even at maximum volume.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Butler', N'jennifer.butler7631@example.org', '2015-11-08', 4, N'Fun to play'),
(N'Patricia', N'Tanaka', N'patricia.tanaka3603@example.com', '2015-11-08', 5, N'Great game so far. The boy and I are having a blast. This is a great game for all ages. This is our first toys to life game and I was worried it was going to be a money grab hard selling me into buying all the other toys. It isn''t. Buy the toys you want and have a blast. Even just the toy box offers endless fun. I do also suggest the Inside Out play set.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Coleman', N'cynthia.coleman3883@example.net', '2015-11-08', 2, N'I bought these to protect it from my kids always throwing things around. It ok, except the moudling around the analog joysticks overlap a bit and you have to push the stick really hard. It''s kind of a deal killer. I wouldn''t recommend it.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Price', N'hiroshi.price9674@example.net', '2015-11-08', 5, N'The first jackbox party pack is a great time. Even though by now I''ve played the first one enough where ive burnt myself out, I loved it before then and by now the second one is out and Im hooked on that. I had to get the physical version because I''m a collector and I love this game. While I only love two of the games, the amount of good times brung by those two games are amazing. So let me break it down game by game. Ydkj 2015: You don''t know jack fans will like it, I find it fine but its not fun for parties. Fine for single player. 3.5/5 Drawful: Funnest game in the pack. Its a whole lot of fun, and ends up with everyone drawing the big D, but actually seriously playing it is fun too. 5/5 Word Spud: Its bad, boring and pointless. 0/5 Lie Swatter: Its bad boring and pointless, but at least it has actual game to it unlike word spud. 1/5 Fibbage: Its a whole lot of fun, and enjoyable to laugh with. 5/5 So despite 2 trash games, it is absolutely worth picking up, and you would be a...'),
(N'David', N'Morris', N'david.morris3631@example.org', '2015-11-08', 1, N'Nothing special. I''m wondering if this is the kids edition. Yes, that is sarcasm. No need for stealth here. Go in, take what you need or kill your target. Fights are nothing. Missions over before you know it. Way too easy. No fun. Music is horrible with singing...ugh! No exploring. No finding your way through the land to get to a location. No exploring of anything necessary. Fast travels to all the land can be had very quickly. Small area of land. I have just been spending the week finishing up achievements...nothing else to do. A child could get 100% sync achievement on this one. Hope the dlc''s are better. Guess I''ll go back to riding around smashing things to get 5000 destructible achievement. Like I said nothing else to do. Why is everyone bashing previous games such as Unity. That was 100% more of a game than this. Nothing to like here. This is not enjoyable. Worst one yet.'),
(N'Gary', N'Mendoza', N'gary.mendoza5028@example.net', '2015-11-08', 5, N'My Grandson tells me this is a great game!'),
(N'Anna', N'Ward', N'anna.ward8390@example.com', '2015-11-08', 5, N'Works perfect!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Cox', N'nathan.cox9039@example.net', '2015-11-09', 5, N'love the game ultimate fave serious'),
(N'Eric', N'Rivera', N'eric.rivera3007@example.org', '2015-11-09', 4, N'It''s Ok, Would recommend to a friend...'),
(N'Joan', N'Hill', N'joan.hill1027@example.org', '2015-11-09', 2, N'This game is disappointingly casual. It boasts 200+ monsters, but a very large percentage are just recolors of the same creature. Worst of all, for me, was the game''s combat, which was essentially a few Warioware-like microgames; you also spin a wheel "strategically" to heal when your hit points are low. The battles are extremely passive and simplistic. The music wasn''t very catchy, and frankly, a lot of the yokais themselves are ugly. To be fair, it''s not that terrible. Its bright colors are certainly appealing. Still, only the youngest of 3DS players will enjoy this. If you''re looking to buy a 3DS game for a preteen, teen or adult, I''d really recommend looking elsewhere.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Cruz', N'ivan.cruz5828@example.net', '2015-11-09', 4, N'To sum up my thoughts, I''m actually happy I purchased the game. I''m heavily entertained by it even though essentially "more of the same" which has been the same for most CoD games. Its just in this case, they do it really well and some of the new things they''ve added actually do enhance the experience (like running along walls). Pros: -Very fun game mechanic where you can run along walls -Nice amount of destructible objects in the environment -Tons of options for multiplayer and I am definitely enjoying the different specialist classes -Scorestreaks seem fair and I haven''t observed them unbalancing any game yet -I love that they included splitscreen -Getting into a multiplayer match is very quick, easy, and the time between matches is JUST right. Farcry 4 for example, sometimes it seems to take forever in between matches due to the ridiculously long countdown timer which gets even more ridiculous when it resets after people leave. -Gorgeous graphics -Camping isn''t as safe of a...'),
(N'Anita', N'Coleman', N'anita.coleman6674@example.net', '2015-11-09', 4, N'Good game but when going through the arcade mode subtitles are in Japanese but other than that it''s perfect. Classic fighter a must buy.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Jones', N'ravi.jones1899@example.com', '2015-11-09', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Shirley', N'White', N'shirley.white4008@example.net', '2015-11-09', 5, N'excellent product, I am very satisfied and happy, I recommend'),
(N'Angela', N'Evans', N'angela.evans9730@example.org', '2015-11-09', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Joseph', N'Allen', N'joseph.allen3691@example.com', '2015-11-09', 5, N'Very functional. Works as described. Great price.'),
(N'Frank', N'Gonzalez', N'frank.gonzalez4301@example.com', '2015-11-09', 5, N'fast shipping and product was rapped well in package'),
(N'Victoria', N'Suzuki', N'victoria.suzuki5703@example.com', '2015-11-09', 5, N'great game ! delivered on time !'),
(N'Brian', N'Reed', N'brian.reed5532@example.net', '2015-11-09', 4, N'Digital Deluxe version purchased through the Microsoft Store (not through amazon). I''ve read through quite a few of these reviews and it looks like most (not all) of the negative reviews were written by CoD haters who''ve never played, the game, have no intention of playing of the game, and are upset that someone could find enjoyment in a game they pre-decided they weren''t going to like. Which bothers me. Black Ops 3 is a great game. I enjoy it more than Advanced Warfare (which I am a fan of), way more than Ghosts (a game I really hated), and I find it more playable than Halo 5 (I''m a huge Halo story line fan, not so much of the multiplayer). The storyline isn''t as good as the original Black Ops storyline, but is better than the Black Ops 2 (or at least it has been so far, I haven''t finished the entire story line) and I would put it on par with the Modern Warfare story telling. Zombies is by far the best of the bunch (more challenging, be ready, its not easy fighting the hordes of...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2015-11-10', 1, N'The whole experience is totally ruined by a stutter bug which sees your frame rate drop to 0fps! We tried this on two Xbox Ones and the same result. In 2015 this sort of thing is really UNACCEPTABLE. It totally ruined the experience for me, especially as it appears there is zero stuttering in the PS4 version. In 2015 we pay this money for a game we waited for since 2008 and we get the worst performing version of the game. Well Bethesda have lost a long-time fan with this and to hell with their future products because I am done with them. Your priority is shipping the game in a workable condition so we can all enjoy it and we get this bug? This is totally unacceptable and I just want the game to work but it stutters all the damn time, its just unplayable! How did this get past testing? You pay people to test the game and they missed this? Then employ people who aren''t fricking idiots. I hope all the Xbone One users cause some stutter to Bethesdas income because they totally trashed...'),
(N'Ivan', N'Scott', N'ivan.scott4047@example.org', '2015-11-10', 1, N'The left click start create some strange noise after 3 months.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Powell', N'andrea.powell3267@example.org', '2015-11-10', 5, N'BEST GAME OF THE YEAR! So far, (and by far I mean after about 3 hours) the game has lived up to by expectations! The graphics are perfectly and fitting for the current gen consoles. Story is a lot of in-depth than Fallout 3 and SOOOO much nostalgia. Unfortunately, the game really doesn''t even hold a candle to its predecessor though still a 5 out of 5 game!!'),
(N'William', N'Carter', N'william.carter6093@example.com', '2015-11-10', 5, N'My boys love this game they play all the time'),
(N'Luis', N'Morales', N'luis.morales1431@example.com', '2015-11-10', 5, N'This is perfect. The 24 month membership allowed us to budget for this in advance. Will buy again!'),
(N'Carlos', N'Campbell', N'carlos.campbell8860@example.org', '2015-11-10', 1, N'Already broke and I have to send it back to sony. I went through 5 PS3s. I hope that''s not the case with the PS4s'),
(N'Aaron', N'Gray', N'aaron.gray1048@example.org', '2015-11-10', 4, N'great game. suffer from slowdown once in a while but not enought to affect overall experience. this editions came with sound track cd and artbook which is pretty much just a glorified instruction booklet. but cool game.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Rivera', N'sarah.rivera4288@example.com', '2015-11-10', 2, N'This game is not good. As a shooter it is on par with Halo but as a game experience it is like any other MMO that forces you to redo tasks. I''m sure it''s fun with others but none of my other friends had it at launch so I was forced to play by myself. Once they started buying it I was already over the game entirely. I''m sure the game is playable for a longer period of time now that there are a few DLC scenarios out. I can''t recommend it.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Rivera', N'sarah.rivera4288@example.com', '2015-11-10', 3, N'I liked this controller but the newer ones with the audio jack that allow for third party headsets are way better. If you''re wanting to buy a new Xbox One controller get a newer one, it''s worth the money. Comparing it to the original xbox 360 controller however: It takes everything that was good about the 360 controller and improves upon it. It''s light weight and micro-usb compatible.'),
(N'Jason', N'Turner', N'jason.turner8288@example.org', '2015-11-10', 5, N'One of the best games I ever played exploring the wasteland has never been so entertaining'),
(N'Mateo', N'Khan', N'mateo.khan5359@example.net', '2015-11-10', 5, N'Youngest son loves this game! His sister does too.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Jenkins', N'alexander.jenkins2208@example.net', '2015-11-10', 5, N'good'),
(N'Joyce', N'Butler', N'joyce.butler9219@example.net', '2015-11-10', 5, N'The graphics are amazing, didn''t notice any problems with frame rates, very smooth experience overall, the story it''s one of the best in the series, but more importantly gameplay and survival skill are improved in every way compared to the last entry, so I think this is probably the BEST Tomb Raider of all time, or at least one of the better entries in the series, if you like Tomb Raider this is a must buy, and if you haven;t play them before, I think this a good game to start, any xbox one owner should at least give this game a try, 100% recommended.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Nguyen', N'shirley.nguyen4344@example.net', '2015-11-10', 5, N'Many people says this tittle isn''t even great but I finished the game and can say for sure ''''this is a new breeze for Tales of games'''' haven''t feel so centered in the history since ToA, Graces was good and Vesperia amazing but both of them brights because of the gameplay not story THIS is compared (my opinion and many friends who ended the game) to ToA which was my favorite of all. ToZ has the gameplay the story the feelings this is just a master piece, maybe they could do better with the system but the games is as good as the other I did mention before. If you are looking for a good Tales of this is the right choice.'),
(N'Adam', N'Wisniewski', N'adam.wisniewski5113@example.org', '2015-11-10', 5, N'Good price, got it on time. Working as expected as all MS hardware I have. Got tired of buying rechargeable battery packs'),
(N'Katherine', N'White', N'katherine.white7668@example.net', '2015-11-10', 5, N'In my opinion this is the best call of duty since black ops 2. Way to go Treyarch for bringing us a great running call of duty that the franchise really needed. This game is a lot of fun to play, in multi player or campaign. This is way better than advance warfare in my opinion. The thrust jump that black ops 3 has is no way shape or form over powering, it''s just the right amount of thrust you need to get into a second story window or doorway. The specialists and wall running are great additions to the game and also neither are overpowering. Being able to have 4 player co op on the campaign makes the campaign extremely fun. This game is just what the series needed to get them back on track.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Patel', N'lisa.patel2069@example.net', '2015-11-10', 5, N'Love the Industrial Revolution? Love Steampunk''s influence? Love the nitty-gritty London scene? Want to rescue children from forced child labor? Like Penny Dreadful mysteries? Like trains? Carriages and horses, anyone? Know what I''m listing here? Don''t know what I''m listing here and still interested? Buy it. I can''t wait for the Jack the Ripper DLC.'),
(N'Adam', N'Rivera', N'adam.rivera8484@example.net', '2015-11-10', 4, N'The graphics are immense and the gameplay is so much fun! I would highly recommend this game to anyone, especially for this price!'),
(N'Mary', N'Garcia', N'mary.garcia3304@example.com', '2015-11-11', 5, N'Got the Sims 3 starter pack 3 in 1 today! Took me about 2 hours to download all 3 and install Love the game :D'),
(N'Zachary', N'Foster', N'zachary.foster9011@example.net', '2015-11-11', 5, N'Good.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Lee', N'douglas.lee5642@example.net', '2015-11-11', 5, N'And was the hype valid? It was! This game is great, they have added quite a few new aspects to the game so that it doesn''t just feel like a new story. It feels like Fallout, but at the same time it feels like a lot more. The graphics are fairly good, there are some things that look kind of old as far as graphics go, but overall it looks very nice (Note: This game has been in production for over 5 years, so it would make sense that the graphics might look slightly older). But this doesn''t take away anything from this awesome game. My only slight complaints are that I have had one crash, and sometimes there are graphic stutters, and the game will freeze for a couple of seconds. But I''m sure these will get ironed out and they aren''t too common so I didn''t feel like it warranted docking a star'),
(N'Jerry', N'Walker', N'jerry.walker1800@example.com', '2015-11-11', 5, N'Megaman in Amiibo form is... megaman in amiibo form. What more do you want me to say? I like it!'),
(N'David', N'Collins', N'david.collins4665@example.com', '2015-11-11', 5, N'GOTY. Period. And another big PERIOD to my first period after my GOTY period.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Russell', N'kelly.russell4699@example.org', '2015-11-11', 1, N'Works fine on my laptop with Windows 10, but does not work on my gaming rig with Windows 7. I think it is a huge flaw, intended or not, to release a product like this. It only hurts the consumer. My reading comprehension is fine, but I do feel burned by purchasing this device. Fortunately I can still return it to the Microsoft store - I want to use my controller on all devices, not just my laptop. The fact that it doesn''t also support Xbox 360 controllers is absurd. They could have added such a feature, especially considering that they long discontinued the official 360 receiver. Poor compatibility is the sign of flawed design. This product leaves a bad taste in my mouth. I''ve had a ton of trouble with Windows 10 on my laptop, and really don''t want to have that headache on my main work environment. Windows 10 simply is not compatible with a good chunk of my audio equipment.'),
(N'Joan', N'Kim', N'joan.kim1296@example.org', '2015-11-11', 3, N'This is one of those games that is based on the "Butterfly Effect". Where your decisions on conversations or your choices in the game itself can change the outcome/ending of the game - who lives, who doesn''t, etc. I thought the graphics were well done, the story line was pretty status quo for this type of "cabin in the woods" game. It reminded me of watching a movie of the same type - pretty typical storyline and wasn''t too scary, in my humble opinion. Don''t get me wrong - there are a few surprises along the way, just not too many of them. I played it twice, but realized the outcome was going to be fairly predictable once you played it through a time or two. That''s the only reason I gave it 3 stars. I like games which are just as enjoyable to play the 2nd or 3rd time around. Since this game is largely conversation driven with a few decisions on actions, it doesn''t offer the scary / different outcome I had hoped for in playing it more than once.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'King', N'benjamin.king1533@example.org', '2015-11-11', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Helen', N'Wang', N'helen.wang2250@example.net', '2015-11-11', 1, N'I loved the black ops series. The gunplay, the story, and the online felt so good. All of which I loved about the Black Ops series is changed here except for the gunplay and Story. The story and gunplay is amazing. It''s probably the best. It''s the Multiplayer that takes a huge hit. It''s unbalanced, servers don''t work, game doesn''t work, and it kicks you out of lobbies for no reason. I played zombies and story by myself and it still kicks me out because of an error. It is annoying having to restart the game again so that the mission works and then the same error happens in the next mission. Zombies is mediocre here. The environment and the atmosphere is beautiful. The zombies mode however is average. Again, they complicated stuff and made it worse in some aspects. I do like that you take 3 hits to die here and your knife actually hits them through window barriers. Finally. But do not buy this game.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Jackson', N'carolyn.jackson6145@example.com', '2015-11-11', 4, N'Great mouse overall. Definitely happy with the purchase. PROS: - Great cord. Won''t break on you or get tangled up. - DPI setting work well. The button is very out of the way so no worries about hitting it on accident. - Smooth moving and clicking. - Cool color, can adjust the pulsation of the lights. - Easy program installation Cons: - Personal preference but I like a bit taller mice. This one is low to the ground. - Can''t change light colors. Only light that changes is DPI (center) and only if you change the DPI.'),
(N'Janet', N'Green', N'janet.green9951@example.org', '2015-11-11', 5, N'The best 16 bits Batman. The music, the intro...this is good stuff!'),
(N'James', N'Taylor', N'james.taylor3118@example.com', '2015-11-12', 4, N'Granted, a lot of these problems may be far more muted on the PC, but overall, the game is wonderful, and following a handful of patches, it''ll be perfect. Based in Boston, you''re preapproved for entrance to Vault 111 based on your military service, minutes before the first nuclear attack. reaching the Vault, you''re [REDACTED] out of [REDACTED] until you wake and [REDACTED] before exiting Vault 111 into Wasteland Boston. Graphics and sound are wonderful and vibrant, and the normal grey brown color palette has been greatly expanded. Details are wonderful, and too the point that telling the difference between a lootable pile of junk and a pile of junk has become somewhat difficult. The gameplay is what you know and love. There are some gameplay issues, but 80% of your gripe with them will be the hundreds of hours of New Vegas and F3 you''re trying to unload. Conversations have the constant flow and instant walk away, but really shouldn''t have, as its caused a lot of apparent subtitle...'),
(N'Carlos', N'Sanchez', N'carlos.sanchez2037@example.org', '2015-11-12', 5, N'A perfect replica of the original. Works perfect. Delivery received on time.'),
(N'Christina', N'King', N'christina.king2450@example.com', '2015-11-12', 5, N'Perfect! Fast Delivery!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Brown', N'aaron.brown1480@example.com', '2015-11-12', 4, N'great game, but I don''t play it too much, since there are simply better games out right now.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Price', N'jonathan.price9663@example.org', '2015-11-12', 5, N'Great to see this game on PSP for the first time. Gran Turismo is arguably one of the most popular race car franchises in the gaming world. The game features enhanced graphics, new cars, and new music all over to give its players a new refreshing attitude to playing.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Cox', N'joseph.cox9065@example.com', '2015-11-12', 5, N'Works great! I had the new Xbox 360 slim Arcade and needed more storage! Had this almost two years now and it still works!'),
(N'Donna', N'Flores', N'donna.flores1385@example.net', '2015-11-12', 5, N'COME ON IT''S A TONY HAWK GAME!'),
(N'Megan', N'Bell', N'megan.bell4364@example.net', '2015-11-12', 5, N'so many hours of my life gone'),
(N'Walter', N'Jenkins', N'walter.jenkins1676@example.net', '2015-11-12', 5, N'Amazing. Wish there was a 500gb hard drive though.'),
(N'Mei', N'Tanaka', N'mei.tanaka3213@example.com', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Fast delivery and just as described'),
(N'Lauren', N'Long', N'lauren.long7815@example.net', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Just as described and shipped fast. Thank you.'),
(N'Walter', N'Mitchell', N'walter.mitchell3522@example.org', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Wang', N'brandon.wang2097@example.net', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Nice recomand this sellet'),
(N'Olivia', N'Young', N'olivia.young1615@example.org', '2015-11-13', 1, N'this cant be an official sony item it doesn''t hold charge dies as soon as its unplugged please do not buy just go to Walmart or best buy or elsewhere to get a knock off that works or an actual sony brand one that works this is my second one off of here and both died completely and now won''t turn on the light shined through the pink and I compared it to my black controller that came with ps3 and it super light that doesn''t seem right I even sent it to sony to get fixed few months back or soand it worked for a few weeks or so and now its gone again'),
(N'Kofi', N'Boyd', N'kofi.boyd2785@example.net', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Very excited re: game ! Our son loves Pokemon. Details are very good.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Moore', N'jerry.moore9069@example.net', '2015-11-13', 5, N'The price is kind of high but it worth it due to the amount of game you can carry in one single memory card.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Brown', N'marcus.brown8464@example.org', '2015-11-13', 5, N'This game is what Tomb Raider fans have been waiting for! The previous Tomb Raider game was great, but Rise of the Tomb Raider takes all of its success, improves it, and achieves a new horizon in Lara Croft''s legacy. The graphics are absolutely beautiful, and watching a woman battle nature and bad guys in a mountain tundra never looked more spectacular. The game play is perfectly formulated make Lara a bad-ass, but not giving her too much power to act as a one woman army. Perhaps the best part of the game (FINALLY) is the actual tomb exploration. They are a solid throwback to the golden days of Lara, and they feature an addictive puzzle element that makes you want to explore the secrets of the game. All in all, if you love a well-crafted video game, get this one. It has elements to suit everyone''s interests.'),
(N'Walter', N'Jenkins', N'walter.jenkins1676@example.net', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Looks great, plus you get Gears 2 and 3 for backwards compatability.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Khan', N'hannah.khan5362@example.org', '2015-11-13', 5, N'been using this every night for long play sessions and not a hiccup buy one'),
(N'Anna', N'Jones', N'anna.jones2823@example.com', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Waited almost a year to write this because I didn''t think it was going to last long... I was wrong, this thing works like the first time every time. Zero complaints'),
(N'Gary', N'Ivanov', N'gary.ivanov1278@example.com', '2015-11-13', 5, N'Excellent item!! Exactly what I needed & at a great price.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Sanchez', N'kevin.sanchez5532@example.net', '2015-11-14', 2, N'Not sure where they were going with this. I started the campaign then totally lost interest, and for the love of all that''s holy, YES we know "Train go Boom" you only hear that line 100 times, we get it. OK the story, you get your arms ripped off by a robot and they rebuild you, didn''t they have a TV show in the 70''s about this? So they stick crap in your brain so you can hallucinate with others in a dream world where you have guns. you start reliving someones dream or reality trying to learn what happened. The Windows 8 team strikes again! Way to mess this up as well. I''ve lost interest in the campaign, it is going no where for me and is so not fun. Let''s try multi player ........ What the #$%#@ is this? I''m some 14 year old with a bow? I keep hearing some 14 year old telling me things are ready, Is this Rugrats Hug time game or something? Your a kid with a bow, and as you level up you get a player that is slightly older, Till finally your a robot. I could not make this up if I...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Kowalski', N'kyle.kowalski5828@example.org', '2015-11-14', 5, N'My children''s favorite game. This is a multiplayer Crash Bandicoot game which makes it especially fun for siblings.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Edwards', N'sandra.edwards2314@example.org', '2015-11-14', 5, N'It is thinking. Bought this just to play Skies of Arcadia and Code Veronica. It plays nice.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Powell', N'daniel.powell5087@example.com', '2015-11-15', 5, N'Well made and very cute! This works like the regular Yoshi amiibo in games like Super Smash Bros as well.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ali', N'jessica.ali6734@example.org', '2015-11-15', 5, N'Nothng to complan...EXCELLENT PRODUCT..!! Works like a charm...!!!'),
(N'Rachel', N'Smith', N'rachel.smith8273@example.org', '2015-11-15', 3, N'Plays like the yearly fifa game. After you win the cup once you won''t play it again. No replay value.'),
(N'Heather', N'Watson', N'heather.watson4835@example.com', '2015-11-15', 1, N'Broken'),
(N'Brenda', N'Nguyen', N'brenda.nguyen5347@example.org', '2015-11-16', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Kyle', N'Walker', N'kyle.walker9898@example.com', '2015-11-16', 5, N'I did a full review for you guys to check out. The keyboard is amazing! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZVa4N-nZZI'),
(N'Diane', N'Hernandez', N'diane.hernandez3433@example.net', '2015-11-16', 5, N'Love this game, and with better and improved graphics'),
(N'Jacob', N'Hernandez', N'jacob.hernandez6313@example.org', '2015-11-16', 5, N'Great powerups for star wars infinity. All my kids love them. I like how the price is reasonable and you know which ones your getting unlike the previous series. Highly recommend.'),
(N'Christina', N'Nguyen', N'christina.nguyen8383@example.com', '2015-11-16', 5, N'Amazing :D'),
(N'Joshua', N'Brown', N'joshua.brown7209@example.com', '2015-11-16', 5, N'Great product, everything as promised'),
(N'Ashley', N'Green', N'ashley.green8235@example.net', '2015-11-16', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Heather', N'Reyes', N'heather.reyes7995@example.org', '2015-11-17', 5, N'I own the digital deluxe version, purchased through the Xone store. I participated in the beta and also own EA Access so I was able to play for 10 hours prior to launch. It is perfect for what I am currently looking for in a shooter. It is online only(Multiplayer Only) with some single player or co-op missions. Content wise, yes it is pretty much limited, and while i do think there should have been more at launch, it''s obvious they were "forced" to get the game out before the movie launches. I am giving this game 5 stars because personally it satisfies what I need right now. This is by no means a hard or stressful shooter. It''s very relaxed as far as shooting mechanics, and hell even flying is easy compared to most games. I can actually enjoy a shooter, without going into a Call of Duty induced rage, lol. The modes do require teamwork though, especially in walker assault if you are on the rebels. that game mode can really get away from you fast if you are not playing as a team....'),
(N'Aisha', N'Webb', N'aisha.webb5460@example.com', '2015-11-17', 4, N'Cannot use it on my current system; Still have windows XP'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Fisher', N'jonathan.fisher2850@example.org', '2015-11-17', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Joan', N'Turner', N'joan.turner3444@example.com', '2015-11-17', 5, N'The yarn Yoshi is so cool.'),
(N'Jason', N'Sanchez', N'jason.sanchez3663@example.com', '2015-11-17', 5, N'Simple yet very useful product. I had been balancing my Kinect on my tv and I was just waiting for it to fall with the slightest movement of the tv. This mount clip was easy to install and works great!'),
(N'Shirley', N'Bennett', N'shirley.bennett3613@example.com', '2015-11-17', 4, N'Overall, Star Wars Battlefront for me has just been an OK experience. The PROs: - Beautiful graphics and sound. - Vehicles can be fun and add another facet to master - Massive maps with a large multiplayer feel - Slit screen! - Seamless with very few apparent glitch or laggy areas even with the massive maps - Similar to original from the consoles - Cards and card upgrades are a decent idea CONS: - Repetitive: So far this game can be a bit repetitive with limited replay-ability you do play either rebels, alliance, and sometimes a hero as well as have maps with multiple types of vehicles. The deluxe ed comes with a few extra items but overall there is a slightly limited amount of weapons and gear at this time. Not much itemized progression or awards at this time either but Im sure there will be more additions soon. - Mechanics: Some of the mechanics are simple. In this game there are some maps with lots of AIs. There is no bullet drop (because they are lasers) or leading targets, or...'),
(N'Kofi', N'Brown', N'kofi.brown8836@example.org', '2015-11-17', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Megan', N'Edwards', N'megan.edwards9971@example.net', '2015-11-17', 3, N'meh....... even with the updated graphics, doesn''t seem to be as fun as it used to be. I played it for a few weeks and haven''t touched it since.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Wood', N'brandon.wood2543@example.org', '2015-11-17', 3, N'Darn thing wore out after 2 weeks. Put a lot of time in on Diablo 3. Pads usually last a few months'),
(N'George', N'Russell', N'george.russell3999@example.net', '2015-11-17', 5, N'This bag is really handy. It fits a ton of Skylanders, including Giants. It is pretty flexible so it expands a bit to fit more, but it is still sturdy. It has a nice zipper and velcro that keeps it extra secure. The clips on the strap are plastic, but they seem pretty secure and strong. The strap itself is adjustable and makes it easy to carry. There is a small pocket inside on the side for cards and a velcroed divider in the middle along the entire length of the bag. You can keep this in to organize and divide the figures or you can take it out. I love that it keeps all of the Skylanders together and in one place, no more lost figures and no more stepping on them late at night in the dark (they are worse than legos!) We are very happy with this bag.'),
(N'John', N'Perez', N'john.perez4101@example.org', '2015-11-17', 5, N'After playing through the game on the PS3 multiple times, I had to see what the PS4 port was all about, so I scooped it up post-haste. The game itself is a lot of fun. It would have been easy to just make a silly game adaptation and not take it too seriously. Well, it wasn''t taken TOO seriously but it still delivered a lot of action and it''s hard to put the controller down. Deadpool''s dialogue, whether with the other characters in the game or with the multiple voices in his head, is hilarious. The battles are terrifically gory. They don''t skimp on the adult content, whether it be sexual innuendos, some not so subtle and others not meant to be subtle in the least, language or some very dark themes. They really nailed the character and got the perfect voice-over actor. The PS4 version, if you''ve played the PS3 one, is pretty much the same. The graphics are improved and you will see less of the "transparent" Deadpool and some minor glitches and lag that older version had but other...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Singh', N'ethan.singh4722@example.com', '2015-11-17', 4, N'Good game but could be better. The new draft mode is pretty cool. It involves drafting a team like you do in fantasy football and then playing with that team. Pretty sweet. Especially if you want to play with a group of your friends in a league you all complete a draft and then play madden against each other with those players. Almost like an online franchise draft. The Ultimate Team is by far my favorite mode to play in any EA game and EA continues to make this mode better. I love it, it just plain awesome. Ti love the scenarios where you get to play certain scenarios of last years football season and complete them with your team. One thing I don''t like about it is that they give you random good players for like 2 weeks. They should just stop doing that. It makes no sense and since everyone basically gets that player it is really pointless. I also believe it is time for madden to institute and actually penalty system. It gets insane when you can take your DB and run into a WR and...'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Watson', N'jeffrey.watson7899@example.com', '2015-11-17', 5, N'This game isn''t perfect, but a five out of five stars doesn''t necessarily mean it is. Pros: GAMEPLAY CHANGES Currently, I have put about 40 hours into the game, and I honestly feel like it is just now opening up and showing me what it has to offer. In the beginning, it definitely starts out a bit slow as you are not strong enough to fight many different enemies. I like this progression, however, because it employs different tactics as you play the game. In the beginning you will likely run away and try to save ammo as often as possible. In the late game you are likely never sneaking around and spraying every enemy with bullets. LEVELING AND GUNS There is no level cap, which is awesome. I really hate how it has become a recent trend for games to cap out around 20 or even 30, especially when they offer over a hundred different perks. Fallout 4 offers over 250 different perks, and hundreds and hundreds of weapon customization options. I haven''t even started to meddle with these, but...'),
(N'Lisa', N'Cruz', N'lisa.cruz5463@example.net', '2015-11-17', 5, N'Hulk smash! Awesome game.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Flores', N'aaron.flores8268@example.net', '2015-11-17', 5, N'Best basketball game made yet. Tons of features, extremely solid game play and a lot of tweaks involving you to actually play basketball to score. The career story is a joke and if anyone was expecting Spike Lee to do something good, especially with a video game then you don''t know who Spike Lee is. Career mode is still there it just has a horrible story, but honestly what kind of story do you want for a sports game?'),
(N'Carlos', N'Barnes', N'carlos.barnes8687@example.net', '2015-11-17', 5, N'I got these because I needed to upgrade my headset for my ps4. After playing around with them for a bit, I quickly fell in love. There is so much power and clarity in these. Even though these are made for the previous gen consoles (ps3 and xb360) it is nice to see that they work with current gen and work rather well. I highly recommend these if you''re looking for superior quality and not trying to pay an arm and a leg to reach that. Turtle Beach is consistently providing excellent products.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Cooper', N'joseph.cooper6413@example.com', '2015-11-17', 5, N'Darth Vader themed PS4. Need I say more?'),
(N'Michelle', N'Cruz', N'michelle.cruz5518@example.org', '2015-11-17', 3, N'My son really likes this game.'),
(N'Joan', N'Ali', N'joan.ali7253@example.org', '2015-11-17', 4, N'These are Pretty Great but the stickers are just a wee bit small and don''t cover the entire light.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Martinez', N'jessica.martinez5014@example.com', '2015-11-17', 4, N'fun'),
(N'Mary', N'Nelson', N'mary.nelson2167@example.net', '2015-11-18', 3, N'I''m really glad I waited to leave a review for this. The first 90% of this game was one of the most amazing things I''ve ever played. Then the last 10% dropped it down to mediocre. I won''t ruin anything but if I were you I''d wait and see if they release a game of the year edition or something with all the to come dlc so you can get the full game.'),
(N'Mary', N'Nelson', N'mary.nelson2167@example.net', '2015-11-18', 5, N'Really fun game, a little perverted.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Thomas', N'patricia.thomas6949@example.org', '2015-11-18', 5, N'I bought this as a gift for my sister. She loves it! It''s incredibly cute.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Hernandez', N'mateo.hernandez4954@example.org', '2015-11-18', 5, N'Great Product! Loved it.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Coleman', N'tomasz.coleman9744@example.org', '2015-11-18', 1, N'But the controls are buggy. The character is slow and the play control is clunky. Would not buy this.'),
(N'Heather', N'King', N'heather.king5443@example.org', '2015-11-18', 5, N'great product'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wang', N'nathan.wang2621@example.net', '2015-11-18', 5, N'Gameplay Battlefront is the best multiplayer first/third person shooter that Ive ever played. Weapons feel great. They shoot and sound exactly like the weapons in the Star Wars movies. Contrary to some of the reviews Ive read, all of the weapons handle differently, and your choice of weapon will vary depending on the map you''re playing. Map design is brilliant, providing multiple flanking options with no choke points on any of the maps in any of the game modes. After 100 hours of playing the game, never once has a match or map felt unbalanced. The card system in which you choose three perks for your character, and the in-match power-ups which give you powerful weapons, explosives, shields, and allow you to play as a Star Wars hero or villain are both phenomenal ways to balance every game. In Battlefront, skilled FPS players will still do very well, but they will never run roughshod over less talented or more casual gamers. Battlefront rewards skill, but never does so at the expense...'),
(N'Marcus', N'Martinez', N'marcus.martinez5888@example.net', '2015-11-18', 3, N'I really, really, really wanted to absolutely adore this game. I was jazzed for it like the Trix rabbit at the prospect of getting a bowl of Trix. However, it fell a little flat of the hype I had heard about it. Now I am not a graphics guys. Several reviews I have state this. So the graphics did not bother me at all I knew it was a port and have 0 issues with that. The story while good didn''t really make me care enough about the characters. It starts out hard and hits you right in the feels and then starts to fizzle in the middle. I know a great many people disagree with me on that point but it is how I feel about it. The story was not terrible. It was not a disrespect to writers it just seemed flat. The twist and turns along the way were very cool but nothing really to write home about. Gameplay, this I actually enjoyed. How the different teams interact and the different combos with different characters is amazing. Some play slow. Some play fast. All are fun. There is a learning...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Thompson', N'ravi.thompson3883@example.com', '2015-11-18', 5, N'Buy this not the new one'),
(N'Mateo', N'Chen', N'mateo.chen6393@example.com', '2015-11-18', 5, N'I have hardly used this cord so far, and will update this further down the road, but so far, I have nothing but good to say about it. The connections are snug, and fit purposefully. The cord is long and thin enough to be flexible yet thick enough that I won''t need to worry about kinking it and tearing the wire inside. And it charges from a USB adapter in a power strip just fine. If everything works well after a few weeks of Splatoon, I will buy this for my friends, just so they can have something longer to keep their gamepads running than Nintendo''s original.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Thomas', N'lisa.thomas1835@example.org', '2015-11-18', 1, N'Remember when you bought a game, you took it home and played it with your friends, and there was no additional cost? Yeah this isn''t that game. No story mode. Just a sham of paying extra every month to play a game online with jerks and foul mouthed a-holes who take video games way to seriously.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Scott', N'sandra.scott6052@example.net', '2015-11-19', 5, N'I bought this for my girlfriend''s 3DS and I wish I would have kept it for myself. This thing is awesome.'),
(N'Adam', N'Green', N'adam.green9815@example.com', '2015-11-19', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Tyler', N'Sanders', N'tyler.sanders3884@example.org', '2015-11-19', 4, N'I will start by indicating that this is a far superior headset to the one that came with my XBox One. The included headset has very soft volume, even turned all of the way up. The Afterglow Level 3 wired headset is far more comfortable than than the one I got with my console. Not only are the ear speakers padded but the head harness is padded also. Like other headsets, the pads won''t stop your ears from hurting after extended periods of time because they''re still pushing on you. But it''s better than what is included with the XBox One. The microphone works well too. I put this to the test with Star Wars: Battlefront. When I played the beta, I used the old headset. Then I compared it with this one and it makes a world of difference. My teammates can hear me and I can hear them. The sound is quite crisp. It''s not as advanced as some of the more expensive headsets, but I''m not picky. Afterglow is a good brand and I have yet to try out a headset from them that I didn''t like so you...'),
(N'Jerry', N'Nguyen', N'jerry.nguyen5959@example.org', '2015-11-19', 4, N'Last year, the WWE 2K series made its debut on current-gen consoles with a heavy focus on realism. Not just graphically (although the visuals were much-improved compared to previous titles), but the gameplay also received a complete overhaul. All-new animations were created from the ground up, using authentic motion capture by actual WWE Superstars in a real WWE ring. Movement and combat felt much more deliberate, with more weight to them. A chain wrestling system and stamina meter added drama and helped matches feel closer to the product you see on WWE TV than ever before. While some fans may yearn for the days of arcade-style wrestling games like No Mercy and SmackDown! Here Comes The Pain, Visual Concepts and Yukes have doubled down on the realistic presentation for WWE 2K16, and the result is by far the most accurate representation of modern WWE wrestling yet seen in a video game. The developers have listened to fans concerns over last years product, and have restored a large...'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Watson', N'jennifer.watson4805@example.org', '2015-11-19', 5, N'They fit perfectly :)'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Adams', N'kimberly.adams6015@example.net', '2015-11-19', 1, N'As a fan of the old Battlefront, I''m nothing but insulted by this piece of s*** game. I waited for this game to be released, and preordered. Unfortunately, I played directly into EA''s hands; there is virtually nothing about this that is at all similar to the old games. Here are my pros and cons: Cons: -It is ALL centered around multiplayer. Unfortunately, the servers have been down for almost a week. I haven''t been able to connect to an EA server since the first few days after I received it. So, even if I wanted to play multiplayer to broaden the loadout I can use in the 4 singleplayer missions, I can''t. -Not at all similar to old Battlefront. There is no campaign mode. I suppose there''s an instant action mode in the form of 4 missions (Hoth, Sullust, Endor, Tatooine), and 4 survival modes. But basically there are only 8 maps if you''re playing singleplayer. -The training missions are great, but they don''t train you for anything. There are no singleplayer missions where you need to...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Thompson', N'michelle.thompson7993@example.com', '2015-11-19', 5, N'did the job!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Green', N'hannah.green5115@example.org', '2015-11-19', 5, N'Brings back a lot of memories when there''s no memory cards yet just passwords and your skill to defeat bosses.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Powell', N'melissa.powell1328@example.org', '2015-11-20', 4, N'What do you want? It''s a very polished fun game experience, with an extremely faithful usage of the Star Wars experience. This game is not the Battlefront you remember from PS2 and have had over a decade to let your expectations (and propensity for entitlement) grow into a Jabba-sized mass. DICE has done well here and delivered on some very key things around experiencing a Star Wars playground.'),
(N'Michael', N'Henderson', N'michael.henderson2077@example.com', '2015-11-20', 5, N'I like it'),
(N'Pamela', N'Flores', N'pamela.flores3520@example.org', '2015-11-20', 5, N'My favorite arcade game and more!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Watson', N'ryan.watson9280@example.net', '2015-11-20', 5, N'The first US release in what became the AKI N64 Wrestling game series. The N64 series were certainly improvements, however this is an excellent game for the time and blew my mind when I first played it when it came out. I am glad to own it again and highly recommend it for fans of WCW or the N64 line of AKI Wrestling games.'),
(N'Karen', N'Brown', N'karen.brown9382@example.net', '2015-11-20', 5, N'CoC: Dark Corners of The Earth should be more aptly titled "Dark Corners Of New England". But that aside from that, this is an EXCELLENT game. It brings Lovecraft''s story "The Shadow Over Innsmouth" into brillant gameplay!!! I have played this several times & I still love it!!'),
(N'Donna', N'Young', N'donna.young2594@example.com', '2015-11-20', 5, N'Will be buying another one - now that we have a 2nd vita! No issues with this one so far and have at least 30 games on it so far!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Webb', N'barbara.webb4134@example.org', '2015-11-20', 5, N'I don''t understand all the negative reviews for this item. I previously was using a charging station that came with it''s own rechargeable batteries. I ended up switching the charging station and of course it called for the play and play type of batteries for the controllers. After checking out all the prices and comparing them to the original Microsoft brand, this seemed to be the obvious choice. They have been working perfectly since day one. I ended up buying the second one after a couple of weeks of trying the first one because it worked fine. It holds a charge for about 5-7 hours of constant game play which is the average - all depending on the gameplay. When I need to recharge I just use my other controller while the dead one charges back up. I really have no use for the cables, but I will keep them stored in case I ever decide not to use a rechargeable station. This is a great price and I highly recommend it. Oh and in case you were wondering because I am a Top Reviewer, this...'),
(N'Lauren', N'Jones', N'lauren.jones9743@example.net', '2015-11-20', 5, N'The included REQ code worked for me, I recommend entering the code on the official Xbox website, rather than using the console interface. Since the November 2015 dashboard update made entering codes less straightforward.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Diaz', N'nicholas.diaz5085@example.org', '2015-11-20', 5, N'Cool that I can see temp readings. Got this when my xbox kept getting hot in the tight enclosure it was in. Runs a lot cooler now. Can get noisy when it starts up.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Allen', N'alexander.allen5313@example.net', '2015-11-20', 5, N'I love lego games. We have most of them. This one has certainly gotten use by my 6 yr old ( and sometimes 8 yr old) Besides when my husband and I got hooked by playing lego indiana jones from start to finish, this marvel legos has gotten the most use of them all. The only Con I can think of is, it bugs me how in the lego games the objective is sometimes so unclear. But you can get sidetracked doing a million other things to keep you busy until you figure it out. Anyways...highly recommend this one!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Murphy', N'amanda.murphy5074@example.com', '2015-11-21', 5, N'He looked it'),
(N'Amanda', N'Campbell', N'amanda.campbell8288@example.org', '2015-11-21', 3, N'comparing it to more recent games, it has a very retro feel. it feels like a ps2 game. Graphics aren''t that good. and it''s alittle slow.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Reed', N'stephanie.reed1985@example.com', '2015-11-21', 5, N'hubby Christmas gift'),
(N'Linda', N'Brown', N'linda.brown9012@example.org', '2015-11-21', 5, N'Adds more features/factions, new interactions with other Civilizations. This is also very nostalgic for me because I played Alpha Centauri, which Beyond Earth is a spiritual successor to.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Reed', N'ravi.reed6966@example.net', '2015-11-21', 4, N'These headphones are great for the price. I purchased them to use with my PS4. Sound quality is good, but headphones are flimsy so I do not expect them to last the lifetime of the PS4, but I think the amount of use will dictate how long they last. These headphones are a great buy if you do not have a 100 bucks to spend on a pair of nicer headphones. I compared them to my Turtle Beach P12 headphones that were 52 bucks, and they sound almost identical. These are great for a gamer on a budget. Also, four stars because the instructions suck and after a while i figured out I had to go into the playstation settings to get the headphones working for game volume They also plug into the controller instead of the usb like the turtle beaches, so you can sit further away from the console'),
(N'Anna', N'Long', N'anna.long4808@example.net', '2015-11-21', 5, N'Really handy and fast! you get what you pay for digitally! Saves me gas going to a gas station to buy one of these!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Jackson', N'kimberly.jackson9884@example.net', '2015-11-21', 5, N'Really nice game and a great addition to your Wii U library.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Sanders', N'ethan.sanders9157@example.com', '2015-11-22', 5, N'everything arrived as it was supposed to'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Khan', N'jacqueline.khan4946@example.com', '2015-11-22', 2, N'Hard to play'),
(N'Ivan', N'Webb', N'ivan.webb4327@example.com', '2015-11-22', 5, N'This is a GREAT device, My son needed a controller for his Computer and we had an extra Xbox One Controller laying around so it saved me from having to buy a controller. This thing works great, EASY set up, works right off the bat. Son LOVES it, no learning curve as he was born with an Xbox remote in his mouth. One unforeseen issue is now the boy is lost in game world and cannot seem to free himself due to the great joy he is experiencing from this device. Well I may have lost my son to the gamming world but on the bright side I guess there is no need for a sitter anymore. Seriously if your thinking about getting this go for it. Works great!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Anderson', N'stephanie.anderson4832@example.com', '2015-11-22', 4, N'Not the best assasins but not the bad of the series.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Anderson', N'stephanie.anderson4832@example.com', '2015-11-22', 4, N'tipically a MGS game , the history is everything.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Gonzalez', N'nicole.gonzalez3575@example.org', '2015-11-22', 5, N'Makes for a very nice Birthday gift or Christmas gift ( ^_^)b'),
(N'Samantha', N'Gonzalez', N'samantha.gonzalez6646@example.org', '2015-11-22', 4, N'Came in really good condition, played perfectly fine. I had tons of fun with this game, and I''d definitely recommend this if yore looking to have fun!'),
(N'Joan', N'Cox', N'joan.cox3897@example.net', '2015-11-22', 5, N'Just a beautiful, thorough game that gives you so much more than the average game for your $60 investment.'),
(N'Larry', N'Moore', N'larry.moore3491@example.com', '2015-11-22', 5, N'Again........Logitech, is superb. Quality and multi functions....Amazing. The Hubby was really happy again!'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Bailey', N'cheryl.bailey6134@example.org', '2015-11-22', 2, N'I hope Dice/EA see these reviews and do something about this. Battlefront two is by far a better game and it''s 10 years old. The only reason this got 2 stars is for the graphics. There is so little content to this game that it is clearly not a full game. You get only 6 heroes and 4 worlds. No space battles and the dog fighting is only in training and multiplayer. The dog fighting is just too busy. You die a lot...a lot. It''s almost not fun. I echo what most folks here say. The movement is clunky and uninspired. The content is more like a demo than a full game. I bought the ultimate pack. Really hoping I get a full game for the $130 I dropped. EA. You need to do right by your customers and fix this. You sold a demo as if it were a full game. Update March 2: So, they keep adding content and announced the DLC content. It''s all minimal and still won''t equal half the content in previous games. No space battles, almost no vehicles, the took existing characters and slapped different...'),
(N'Tyler', N'Flores', N'tyler.flores6179@example.org', '2015-11-22', 5, N'I bought this mouse a little over a year ago and it is still working like new to this day. I use it each and every day to play games, work in Photoshop, and surf the web. The amount of extra buttons on this mouse are enough for all the little shortcuts and things I like to do with them. The feel of this mouse in your hand is so comfortable to me. If you are a lefty, look elsewhere as this mouse is shaped for right handed people. The buttons are all very tactile and the left and right mouse buttons push fairly easy but not TOO easy to the point of pressing them accidentally while resting your hand on the mouse. The mouse itself comes with some weights to control how heavy your mouse is, a storage container for those, some software (on a tiny disc so make sure your PC can read those), some extra gliding pads for the bottom of the mouse if you ever need to replace them (I haven''t had to yet), and the mouse itself. This mouse features up to 16400 DPI which can be fully configured and...'),
(N'Debra', N'Roberts', N'debra.roberts9591@example.net', '2015-11-22', 5, N'good'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Rodriguez', N'jonathan.rodriguez4750@example.org', '2015-11-22', 5, N'Definitely a required accessory for any ps4 player'),
(N'Adam', N'Mitchell', N'adam.mitchell3476@example.net', '2015-11-22', 5, N'I had been looking at this sound bar basically since I bought my Xbox One 500GB Console with Kinect and recently pulled the trigger on it. I am very happy with the overall sound, ease of connection, and integration with my Xbox. I added a subwoofer to this bar through the sub out jack and the overall performance is just amazing compared to the TV''s speakers. The sound bar alone does add a lot of depth over the TV speakers, but a halfway decent subwoofer just completes the setup (without all the expense of a true surround sound set up). The tiny (almost credit card thin) remote control contains buttons for each "Mode." The Modes are marked by Halo (for shooters) Forza (for racing games) as well as modes for music and movies. Since I do have the Xbox with Kinect, however, I control the volume and on/off function through the Xbox One Media Remote or with my voice using the Kinect. Pairing this sound bar with the Xbox and Kinect was a breeze in the setting''s menu and took less than 1...'),
(N'Helen', N'Murphy', N'helen.murphy7275@example.com', '2015-11-22', 1, N'I have been playing for less than one day and already I am getting sick and tired over the ABSTERGO employee of the month telling her story of how a rotten the game is. HAHA! I hate the AGSTERGO nonsense.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Anderson', N'elizabeth.anderson1200@example.net', '2015-11-23', 5, N'Got this pre black Friday, and could not be happier! The console price is $50 cheaper than anywhere else. Rare collection is worth it alone (RC Pro Am, anyone?), Halo 5 is stunning, and well Gears is what you know and love.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Collins', N'kenneth.collins1908@example.org', '2015-11-23', 5, N'I can also defeat scalpers. Sturdy, detailed, and well painted.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Flores', N'raymond.flores9355@example.com', '2015-11-23', 5, N'this was a gift, the person who received it loves it'),
(N'Sofia', N'Edwards', N'sofia.edwards8762@example.net', '2015-11-23', 5, N'i love it great product'),
(N'Zachary', N'Sanders', N'zachary.sanders7781@example.net', '2015-11-23', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Joan', N'Baker', N'joan.baker3415@example.com', '2015-11-23', 4, N'These Just Dance games are great. Disney is great. Sounds like a great formula, and it is. The only problem is both me and my 15 year old didn''t know almost all of the songs. I think the target age for these songs is probably in the 8-13 range. In fairness, he does love disney songs. He loves the classics. He loves the High School Musical. So do I. but We don''t know Austin & Ally or Liv & Maddie or even Teen Beach 2. So my advice: check out the song list! If you like the songs, get this, you will love it so much. If you don''t know the songs but like the Disney style music in general, you will still like this game. If you like Just Dance but don''t like Disney songs, you probably won''t be into this. I gave it 4 stars only because to me the songs are fairly obscure. They could have thrown in a couple classics for the older kids and adults. Still, the game is fun and it''s great for the family to play. The songs are family friendly as well. Little kids especially will probably enjoy...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ramos', N'kimberly.ramos5888@example.com', '2015-11-23', 5, N'Very simple. Hassle free. But this mouse is not gamer''s rage proof. I strongly advise against getting this keyboard is you can''t handle your own rage. Or any rage. Other than that. Great mouse, worth your buy. It might take some getting use to if you''re new to gaming mouses. This is bigger than the average mouse.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ramos', N'kimberly.ramos5888@example.com', '2015-11-23', 3, N'This is OKAY but I was the unlucky being who got a mic that didn''t work. Nothing on the internet to tell me what my issue was. Thanks google. :/ Don''t even say bing. Bing was telling me to get a new one. Not like the mic mattered anyway. The mic quality sucks butt. And uhhh I mainly got these because they were in my budget & LED.'),
(N'Mark', N'King', N'mark.king4898@example.com', '2015-11-23', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Kevin', N'Okonkwo', N'kevin.okonkwo6888@example.org', '2015-11-23', 5, N'enjoyed it'),
(N'Mark', N'Morales', N'mark.morales6711@example.com', '2015-11-24', 3, N'Ok... just need the steering wheel only.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Howard', N'lucia.howard2174@example.net', '2015-11-24', 5, N'At last a rally game on the PS4 and it''s a good start. WRC 5 has all the stages and cars from the WRC, the career mode starts you in the WRC junior championship and you move up thru the WRC-2 and up to the main championship of the WRC. The graphics are good enough but not wonderful, sound is again good but not great, it''s the gameplay where this game shines. All the different surfaces feel different and have there own challenges, with Tarmac, gravel, mud, snow, ice and some rain and night stages there is the right balance of verity to keep the gameplay interesting. My only complain is the lack of split times and it would be nice if they added some classic rally cars but overall enough here of rally fans. Game currently has no wheel support but Dec 4th 2015 update due to add wheel support.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Kowalski', N'christopher.kowalski6269@example.net', '2015-11-24', 5, N'excelent product'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Carter', N'nicholas.carter7989@example.net', '2015-11-24', 3, N'It seems that your towns get out of control too quickly. I had a difficult time getting beyond the 3rd or 4th quest and gave up.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Kumar', N'jeremy.kumar6461@example.org', '2015-11-24', 4, N'Kids love it....'),
(N'Noah', N'Patel', N'noah.patel5314@example.net', '2015-11-24', 5, N'Superb product .. buy it for PC gaming. Over the ear design is great for glass wearing gamers of all ages. Not expensive and quality design.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Perry', N'aaron.perry5164@example.com', '2015-11-24', 5, N'you''re gonna only have luck finding them here for a decent price. happy hunting!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Wood', N'hannah.wood3632@example.org', '2015-11-24', 5, N'Awesome and it came on time!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Scott', N'jacqueline.scott7917@example.org', '2015-11-24', 3, N'Ontime, no hassles'),
(N'Ravi', N'Mitchell', N'ravi.mitchell8810@example.org', '2015-11-24', 5, N'Great priced bundle and a clean look for the ps4.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Cruz', N'patrick.cruz2359@example.org', '2015-11-24', 5, N'thank you'),
(N'Patrick', N'Cruz', N'patrick.cruz2359@example.org', '2015-11-24', 5, N'My granddaughter just loves Just Dance'),
(N'Victoria', N'Cruz', N'victoria.cruz7793@example.org', '2015-11-24', 4, N'Great for transferring data between older Xbox 360s. Nothing more needs to be said.'),
(N'Emily', N'Bailey', N'emily.bailey3158@example.net', '2015-11-25', 5, N'Incredible price!!! I bought this for my hongkong psn account without season pass. now come back to pick up 1 for my us psn account! Great!'),
(N'Debra', N'Smith', N'debra.smith7998@example.com', '2015-11-25', 5, N'nice item thanks'),
(N'Paul', N'Khan', N'paul.khan8661@example.com', '2015-11-25', 5, N'Purchased this for my daughter who is a huge hockey fan. She loves the game.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Cox', N'andrea.cox2909@example.net', '2015-11-25', 5, N'The new design of the guitar is great, easier to play. 3 on top, 3 on bottom although buttons could be slightly larger and whammy bar is in a bad spot.. Tend to hit pause or the guide button. The game is great. You can play in Live mode so it''s FP view and crows reacts to how you play as we as bandages. The TV mode you play channels or music and the music video is in background. There is leveling up, different game cards plus highways as well as leveling up guitar. All kinds of power UPS and on the channels you are competing against other players with scoring but not interacting. Songs are modern although after a month, we need some new songs. You earn plays, then buy with coins you earn from game. GH premium is the only spending cash to get Hero Cash. As a Guitar Hero since the start and never quit, I am quite pleased with this game as long as keep adding new songs.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Chavez', N'ronald.chavez3852@example.org', '2015-11-25', 5, N'One of the best pc stealth games ive ever played.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Miller', N'samuel.miller9911@example.net', '2015-11-25', 1, N'....from China parts maybe. Bought one a while back, stopped working after maybe a dozen charges, contacted support, they opened a ticket (online automated system) which said someone would get to me shortly. The next day i got another automated email telling me that my ticket was closed. All email contact since then has been ignored. Moved on to an Energizer charger, like the bunny, it keeps on working and working and...'),
(N'Christina', N'Wang', N'christina.wang4895@example.org', '2015-11-25', 5, N'This thing actually does work. It is not loud at all. Yes, you can hear it when you have no sound from anything else, but not while gaming.'),
(N'Emily', N'Kumar', N'emily.kumar4932@example.org', '2015-11-25', 5, N'Feels great, looks good and protects the outside my new 3ds XL. Back end (where you plug in the charging cable) doesn''t have a lot of protection but most of the time that''s not what the main concern is when buying something like this. This item is easily taken off and put on and not something that is time intensive to do so like most products. The clear see through TPU allows you to show off any limited edition 3ds designs or skins you might install on the 3ds.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Fisher', N'christopher.fisher8967@example.org', '2015-11-25', 3, N'ok'),
(N'Olivia', N'Garcia', N'olivia.garcia1465@example.com', '2015-11-25', 5, N'Love it.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Chavez', N'nicholas.chavez9703@example.net', '2015-11-25', 2, N'not impressed'),
(N'Christopher', N'Ferreira', N'christopher.ferreira3642@example.org', '2015-11-25', 5, N'These are perfect to be able to use in the car or at home since they have the USB end to plug into virtually all chargers. Great value since everyone in our house has a 3DS and they seem to all need charging at the same time... funny how that always seems to happen!'),
(N'Amy', N'Price', N'amy.price1407@example.net', '2015-11-25', 3, N'We played with these for a day or two but haven''t touched since. There''s no clear ''mission'' that we can tell and really never saw more than one or two different areas of play. Maybe we just don''t know how to find the ''amazing'' with Infinity...Wish I hadn''t spent the money on this.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Nguyen', N'evelyn.nguyen1125@example.org', '2015-11-25', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Larry', N'Singh', N'larry.singh7131@example.net', '2015-11-25', 1, N'I liked the gameplay but, this not a full game. It''s very light on content. Frankly, it''s a ripoff. The developer plans to release a lot of expensive DLC for this game. They have you paying $60 for half a game; and $60 again later for the other half. So, you can buy this game, but you won''t be able to play half of Star Wars Battlefront without buying something else, and that is where the fun abruptly ends. Getting gypped like this really makes the rest of the game hard to enjoy. Also the voice acting is painfully horrible.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Allen', N'kenneth.allen7991@example.org', '2015-11-25', 5, N'I love this thing. Works as both an input switch AND component cables. The picture quality is as great as you would expect of a component connection. The construction is very solid and the switches have a surprisingly smooth, solid action; they don''t feel cheap or hollow as I expected. The cable lengths for the systems could be a little longer, but they are JUST long enough for my setup as it is. If you have component inputs on your display or AVR and you have a combination of Wii/Xbox/PS2 systems, this is a no-brainer.'),
(N'Anita', N'Cox', N'anita.cox6061@example.com', '2015-11-25', 5, N'works fine and am very happy with it'),
(N'Alexander', N'Butler', N'alexander.butler9247@example.com', '2015-11-26', 4, N'I wanted to create a guide to help those interested in purchasing an Xbox One, since there are so many bundles, and offers change constantly. I''ll attempt to keep this up to date as the bundles change. This is NOT a comparison to Playstation 4 or Wii U. A short list of features that may interest you, shared by all Xbox Ones (more details can be found in product descriptions and Microsoft sites) - HDMI pass through. You can hook up an HDMI device to the back of an Xbox One to view the content from that device without changing inputs or leaving the X1 interface. This allows for split screen viewing and if a cable box or the official TV tuner, you can view the channel guide, watch TV, and set recordings. It is backwards compatible with some Xbox 360 games. This is great for those with backlogs (like me...) or those who want to revisit finished games without having another console plugged into the wall/TV. In the fall, owners of publisher approved disc or digital 360 games will be able...'),
(N'Jason', N'Torres', N'jason.torres7359@example.com', '2015-11-26', 1, N'Wait for next version to release. This one breaks off the port it plugs into. Microsoft won''t admit it but it''s defective. Do not buy. Same problem on 2 different purchases. If you do have it don''t ever remove it or it will eventually pull out the usb plug it''s connects into.'),
(N'Brian', N'Butler', N'brian.butler1674@example.com', '2015-11-26', 5, N'Awesome game! Great to have it as a handheld. Must have if you are a Zelda fan or old school gaming fan.'),
(N'William', N'Khan', N'william.khan4581@example.com', '2015-11-26', 4, N'My favorite RGB mouse! I really like the RGB lights it has on it the only thing that annoys me. Is that the profiles seem to keep resetting every now and then and it''s really annoying having to set them. The DPi settings always save but it seems to only be a bug with the RGB lights. Other then that if you really enjoy having the option to have many different DPi settings without the crazy buttons all over and RGB. This mouse is great the lights themselves are pretty bright to.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Hill', N'nicole.hill5061@example.com', '2015-11-26', 5, N'fits perfectly on my elite console for $20.'),
(N'Linda', N'Perez', N'linda.perez6780@example.com', '2015-11-26', 5, N'The dialog is not as good as Fallout 3 or New Vegas and the bugs are plentiful but the world is HUGE and the play is just fantastic. The frame rate on the PS 4 is not great and the load times are excessive compared to the PC version. So, if you are trying to decide between the PC and PS version get the PC version if your box meets the basic specs.'),
(N'Walter', N'Nowak', N'walter.nowak3971@example.org', '2015-11-26', 5, N'Cute fun game with charm and character out the wazOo'),
(N'Susan', N'Adams', N'susan.adams3748@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'Feel very heavy duty and work wonders compared to the 5 dollar cable I was using!'),
(N'Jose', N'Adams', N'jose.adams4919@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'I am loving Fallout 4. No disappointments here. Games take you on a journey throughout the wastelands. New enemies and twist around every corner. you never know what you are going to find as you wonder around.'),
(N'Emma', N'Allen', N'emma.allen1394@example.com', '2015-11-27', 5, N'You know you need it if you just got or plan to get a New 3DS XL. At this time, they come with no charger. I had to pick one of course.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Campbell', N'kelly.campbell2829@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Kelly', N'Campbell', N'kelly.campbell2829@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Kelly', N'Campbell', N'kelly.campbell2829@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'Really good now I can download a lot of games'),
(N'Ronald', N'Phillips', N'ronald.phillips5673@example.com', '2015-11-27', 5, N'Very satisfied!'),
(N'Maria', N'Campbell', N'maria.campbell8357@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'It''s basically the same as MH3U but with improved menu layouts and controls. Climbing on walls to jump on monsters is one of the most iconic features of the gameplay, since there aren''t any water battles. The charge blade and insect glaive, the new weapons, are flawless. So... it''s awesome. If you have no idea what this game is, PLAY THE DEMO FIRST. This game is ridiculously complicated and requires a ton of concentration to play. Not to mention it''s one of the longest games I''ve ever played.'),
(N'Megan', N'Lewis', N'megan.lewis7927@example.org', '2015-11-27', 5, N'I''ll never understand why the hype around Sleeping Dogs was so low in comparison to games like Call of Duty or its competitor GTA 5. I was not at all hyped and bought it long ago for PC while it was on sale and absolutely loved it. This version looks about the same as the PC version on Ultra to me, and the game is the same as expected but with all the DLC; I still love it.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Diaz', N'brandon.diaz5514@example.org', '2015-11-27', 4, N'I actually own the original Xbox controller usb and recently got hold of this one along with a Steam controller a friend didn''t feel comfortable with and I have to say out of the 3 this Xbox one controller gives the best overall feel especially when playing a game like Rocket League which required pinpoint precision at times. The way this controller sits in your hands really is comfortable and can see you playing for long periods without a wrist ache (Which is great if you just picked up something like Fallout 4) While it is annoying it doesnt come out of the box with this adapter here: http://amzn.to/1kKgiMn their are numerous plus points which warrant picking up the latest version of the controller especially if you are use to the older version or some kind of generic PC controller.'),
(N'Susan', N'Lewis', N'susan.lewis1955@example.org', '2015-11-27', 5, N'1v1 me'),
(N'Brenda', N'Jackson', N'brenda.jackson3546@example.com', '2015-11-27', 5, N'once again rockstar makes the best game ever'),
(N'Thomas', N'Thompson', N'thomas.thompson9746@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'Great system, I use it mainly for the ps4 link.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Scott', N'benjamin.scott5146@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'Very good quality. Perfect for gaming or even typing.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Howard', N'yuki.howard4654@example.net', '2015-11-27', 5, N'This game is what the original 3 Star Wars should have been (in terms of staying true to a great series or story). A great opening to a fantastic legacy. As I was born in the 70s, I grew to love the transformers. My son who is 6 cannot get over this game. He literally jumps up and down when he plays it. The movement is a bit too much for a younger kid along with the cartoon violence. If you get past that, it is a great game for adults in 30s or 40s who live for the nostalgia. It really has the potential to bring in younger players to the Transformers universe. If only other great 70s/80s series had this sort of connection! It is shorter, but I feel at $35 and under it is well worth a try.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Hall', N'christopher.hall3576@example.com', '2015-11-28', 5, N'Feels nice in my hands and works like a champ for Zelda and Mario Kart 8.'),
(N'John', N'Gonzalez', N'john.gonzalez8655@example.net', '2015-11-28', 4, N'The single player is really good. I love the inclusion of the Monkey Bowling mini game except that you have to hold the Vita sideways and use touch controls.'),
(N'Wei', N'Patel', N'wei.patel3648@example.net', '2015-11-28', 5, N'I love this game to death, it is very fun. I can spend hours on it, was worried about the cost, but it really was not that bad for what I got. I love it could not ask for better.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Price', N'lauren.price2405@example.com', '2015-11-28', 3, N'Full disclore here, I''ll admit l''ve haven''t played the first Mario & Luigi installments on the GBA and Nintendo DS. Dream Team for the 3DS seemed to be a good place to start. I heard wonderful things about the series, it''s humour and how it''s in some ways the successor of the cult classic Super Mario RPG Legend of the 7 stars for SNES. I was pleased to discover that it really is an rpg based game and that it also keeps element of Mario games and the Mushroom Kingdom intact. The 3DS doesn''t have a plethora of RPGs, Mario & Luigi Dream Tram is one of the few. The attacks are turn-based and the animation while not incredible suits the RPG mold and gives it a cool obscure game feel. The battles are a lot of fun and probably the best part of the game. It''s not terribly unique as an RPG in case you''re wondering, but it''s simultaneously unique to the Mario library and carries the torch for Super Mario RPG. In Dream Team you deal with XP points and level ups, buying clothes that provide...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Sanchez', N'kelly.sanchez1638@example.com', '2015-11-28', 5, N'Love'),
(N'Mei', N'Evans', N'mei.evans1645@example.net', '2015-11-29', 5, N'I was skeptical about buying this as large purchase prices always made me doubt if its worth it but after buying the product I am just angry at myself for not getting it long ago. It comes with the PS Vita, a 8gb Vita card, and borderlands 2 digital game with some dlc. It was very well worth the price as everything given should have been around $250 at least which make the selling price a good discount. The PS Vita provides many features like camera and internet and much more. The graphics on the PS Vita is just epic being able to play high quality games on the go. Overall, this product is being sold below its value and is well worth the price.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Sanchez', N'ashley.sanchez3447@example.org', '2015-11-29', 5, N'I love Chibi-Robo is a cute character in all his games'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Boyd', N'nicholas.boyd5657@example.net', '2015-11-29', 5, N'Still have the game!'),
(N'Noah', N'Ivanov', N'noah.ivanov1344@example.org', '2015-11-29', 3, N'Not as fun as the first Wii Sports but its ok from time to time'),
(N'Shirley', N'Ramos', N'shirley.ramos1345@example.net', '2015-11-29', 5, N'Received in time for Christmas. Exactly what they wanted,'),
(N'Christina', N'Cox', N'christina.cox6097@example.net', '2015-11-30', 4, N'Really love the large size of the mouse. Perfect for the palm grip type. The lighting is very neat, but doesn''t really "flow" well when changing colors. I would recommend keeping it at a solid color. The RGB is bright, unlike my dull K65 keycaps. It gets dirty every few days but it''s easy to clean.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Cruz', N'michelle.cruz3537@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd1353@example.com', '2015-11-30', 4, N'It don''t fix perfectly on the back of the PS4, but had 4 cooling fans, not 2 like the others my console temperature keep very low when I use this fan, it is very good recommended to keep low your console temperature, but not keep firm in the back of the console but it is not a big deal to me, while keep my PS4 temperature''s low I don''t care if it separate the console every time I move it because I don''t move my console very much'),
(N'Peter', N'Raghunathan', N'peter.raghunathan6598@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'Nice game'),
(N'Laura', N'Nguyen', N'laura.nguyen3405@example.com', '2015-11-30', 5, N'I love this item'),
(N'Raymond', N'Perry', N'raymond.perry6208@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'I am 100% sure that the bad reviews is by people who are accustomed to running with only one player full court. This game is only for true lovers of real soccer with passes, collective good plays and good strategy. It is not for children under 9 years who think scoring with a defense carrying the ball without going over. If you love the real soccer, please buy it. If you dont, please buy the COD black ops III.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Williams', N'nancy.williams2736@example.com', '2015-11-30', 3, N'just meh... not much challenge to the game or variety...'),
(N'Edward', N'Ruiz', N'edward.ruiz3538@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'Good game in general. Especially graphic in the village is superior compare to the previous serious. Play style changed more closer to common combat game as well. This can be controversial, but I like the change. Map graphic is kind of bad which is the con. And story.... well I choose not to enjoy the story because game based on something (like movie, game or book) does not show the story at all and have poor storyline but only gives the miniomal motivation and goal to play the game.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Murphy', N'pamela.murphy7858@example.org', '2015-11-30', 5, N'great controller , special design'),
(N'Mark', N'Carter', N'mark.carter8737@example.org', '2015-11-30', 3, N'might feel like a betrayal to longtime zelda fans, but you shouldn''t be stupid to just assume a game is gonna be a certain way. this is all public information. it''s like being disappointed mario kart 8 doesn''t look like galaxy'),
(N'Henry', N'Flores', N'henry.flores2174@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'good'),
(N'Marcus', N'Martinez', N'marcus.martinez5888@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'inFamous is back! Being a fan of the two previous inFamous games (full disclosure I did not beat inFamous 2) I was really looking forward to Second Son. Everything that you like from the previous to is back minus Cole and the gang. One thing that is not back is Cole. We have a whole new hero (or villain) in inFamous Second Son which I think is a good thing. The main reason being is Cole seemed to become a shadow of himself in inFamous 2. I much preferred the original Cole in inFamous 1. Which is not an issue here as we start off with our Native American hero Delsin. Delsin starts off a normal guy in the beginning. A rule breaker who cares about his people but also just wants to have fun. As fate would have it a jailbreak happens and Delsin''s normal life is about to fade away. The story I found serviceable. This is not going to re-invent the book. They still with the tried and true formula that we are all used to from previous inFamous games. At several points in the game you can...'),
(N'Scott', N'Adams', N'scott.adams4173@example.org', '2015-11-30', 5, N'My daughter loves this game'),
(N'Tyler', N'Hernandez', N'tyler.hernandez4587@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'And the game with shipping was less then 8 bucks. Thanks.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Ramirez', N'lauren.ramirez1705@example.org', '2015-11-30', 5, N'I''ve had these headphones for almost a year now (for my 360) and they''re wonderful. I was concerned about them not working for my XB1 but the newer/updated controller has a headphone jack. Simply unplug the headset from the amp and plug directly into the controller. As far as adjusting different volume levels, there''s a way to do it through Settings/Accessories. Game sound comes through the controller as well as chat sound. It''s great!'),
(N'Jack', N'Edwards', N'jack.edwards1550@example.org', '2015-11-30', 4, N'would be awesome if it updated automatically for the next day instead of manually doing it.'),
(N'Jack', N'Edwards', N'jack.edwards1550@example.org', '2015-11-30', 3, N'its good, just a bit boring?'),
(N'Stephen', N'Jenkins', N'stephen.jenkins2884@example.net', '2015-11-30', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Michael', N'Gray', N'michael.gray6754@example.org', '2015-11-30', 5, N'I lo es the first game, Love this one as well And it comes with the first bayonetta in An extra disc, awesome bundle'),
(N'Jack', N'Ruiz', N'jack.ruiz9469@example.com', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Hard to fun new PSP Go''s locally! This is new in factory packaging with all cords/booklets. Such a great pocket emulator!'),
(N'Lauren', N'Barnes', N'lauren.barnes6804@example.org', '2015-12-01', 3, N'I wanted to like this game. And I did, for the first half. But for me, personally, it just became a dull and boring experience. Didn''t finish the second half. It''s well made, the visuals are nice and draw you in, and the mechanics are sound. There is tension; albeit I was never actually scared as some reviewers claimed... There is challenge; some of the areas are very difficult to get through. But there is no real depth and the game play is just kind of meh. I just found the game boring. But that''s just my opinion, which differs from person to person... For the price, it''s definitely worth buying and trying, but I''d also suggest renting before buying because the game held around 10 hours of interest for me. At the current used price of $20 that''s a fair trade. If you do end up buying it, I hope you enjoy it!'),
(N'Scott', N'Rivera', N'scott.rivera6383@example.net', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Works perfectly how its supposed to, feels great using it for Monster Hunter.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Flores', N'jennifer.flores3590@example.org', '2015-12-01', 3, N'I owned a corded controller for my 360 and liked the fact that I never had to replace batteries. I was hoping to be able to do the same thing with a long USB cable since Xbox One doesn''t have dedicated corded controllers. I''ve tried on multiple occasions to use USB cables of various makes and price ranges with these Xbox One controllers and every time the same thing happens. The controller (while plugged in) inevitably gets knocked off of a chair or table onto the floor and the cable stops working. If it lands on the end with the plug the weight of the controller bends something inside the micro USB connector and the cable never works again. I bought this combo hoping that the OEM cables might stand up to a bit more damage. Nope. First time it fell off of a surface it stopped working. I should also mention that it was at most a two foot drop onto a carpeted floor. I''ve already returned one of these after getting at most a week out of it and am realizing it is pointless now that...'),
(N'Jack', N'Perry', N'jack.perry2903@example.com', '2015-12-01', 5, N'So this has been out for almost a month, and I am only half way through the actual story (by choice) as I like to find locations, and doe some side quests before completely the game, and the main story is kind of short, but all the extra stuff makes up fir it in a BIG way. The graphics are absolutely amazing, and they improved it in so many ways. *spoiler* i love how you start the game before the war *spoiler end* The companions don''t die anymore which is nice, they just go down until the fighting is over or you get them up with a stimpak. You get to create and manage settlements which is cool, can be a bit annoying at times. I''ve only ran into two major glitches, one has messed up a quest, that i won''t be able to complete as the person has completely disappeared mid quest and i can''t find her at ALL... and another kept messing up as i tried to complete it, luckly i finally got past it... check out this video i uploaded... https://youtu.be/bVVEmTbSqZ4 I like the new V.A.T.S system,...'),
(N'Mary', N'Cook', N'mary.cook3069@example.com', '2015-12-01', 4, N'Very good sound quality for the price. Great noise isolation. They could be a little more comfortable around the ears and the mic is a little too easy to move. I didn''t want to spend a lot of money, though, and I think these are the best it the price range.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Sanders', N'raymond.sanders6273@example.org', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Love having the option to purchase 60 days worth of WoW time and getting the code within minutes of paying. Very convenient and no need to head to a store to pick up a physical card. :)'),
(N'Samuel', N'Parker', N'samuel.parker1532@example.com', '2015-12-01', 4, N'I loved the long durable cord, as well as the controls on the cord itself. The mic takes time to get used to but is decent. Was plug and play compatible so I didn''t need to use the drivers that came with it. The lights on the head set do not turn off unless you unplug your headset.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Price', N'jonathan.price9663@example.org', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Two of the best action pack games on PSP. Twisted Metal is known for its intense, but yet, hilarious battles between cars equipped with guns trying to eliminate each other. In addition, this is an excellent value for two games with renowned titles.'),
(N'Adam', N'Green', N'adam.green6377@example.com', '2015-12-01', 4, N'Battlefront isn''t a perfect game. It has nowhere near the amount of fluff and content that Battlefront II did back in 2005. It doesn''t have a storyline, as many characters, main campaign other than a few fun training missions which you can play solo or with a friend, and has just a few vehicles in the game, pretty much staying strict to the ones shown in the original trilogy. All this taken into consideration, I really do enjoy Battlefront 2015. The graphics, sound and setting are fantastic and very true to the look and feel of the original trilogy. DICE used the Frostbite engine so it''s no surprise that it looks, feels and plays similarly to the Battlefield games on the surface, but the vehicle control, weapons, powerups and a few of the game modes have been crafted from scratch to emulate the more arcadey, simple shooting and combat from the old Battlefront games. Most guns play similarly with a few exceptions. There are heavier blasters which deal more damage at longer range but...'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Hill', N'jennifer.hill1164@example.org', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Buy it. Put it in your closet, put it on your desk, put it in your hands. Either way its great.'),
(N'Sharon', N'White', N'sharon.white7696@example.com', '2015-12-01', 3, N'Its a very good console. Please keep in mind Nintendo is likely to replace the WiiU as soon as next year. If purchasing now keep in my it will be obsolete in 1 year receiving little additional support. If you are fine with this by all mean grab this deal. The WiiU has a solid library of games to warrant its purchase.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Okonkwo', N'jennifer.okonkwo8182@example.net', '2015-12-01', 5, N'It was so EASY!! After reading many of these reviews, I was nearly too terrified to purchase this. I thought this was going to be extremely difficult. I will admit that I suck at placing on screen protectors, but I applied this one PERFECTLY. There were no bubbles, dust, or weird gaps. This application design allows you the flexibility to place the screen cover in the perfect position. Make sure you are not bouncing or moving around too much so you don''t make dust particles fly around.'),
(N'Helen', N'Wisniewski', N'helen.wisniewski5799@example.org', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Sanic can ride and stuff'),
(N'Helen', N'Wisniewski', N'helen.wisniewski5799@example.org', '2015-12-01', 2, N'I played this for 2 minutes then stopped. i use to play this so i only have it for nostalgia'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Baker', N'elizabeth.baker6616@example.org', '2015-12-01', 3, N'Fairly fun game, but did not live up to my expectations. Leveling up is a lot less customizeable than the second game.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Nguyen', N'marcus.nguyen6866@example.org', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Came sealed and new, too bad square is ruining the franchise'),
(N'Pamela', N'Johnson', N'pamela.johnson8433@example.org', '2015-12-01', 4, N'i like it ..'),
(N'Dennis', N'Diaz', N'dennis.diaz4100@example.net', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Great game, love the pace of play where each game is only a few minutes long. This is the perfect type of game of a handheld like the PSP.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Murphy', N'jessica.murphy7176@example.com', '2015-12-01', 5, N'I have no complaints, this Call of Duty is amazing.'),
(N'Donald', N'Morgan', N'donald.morgan1130@example.com', '2015-12-01', 5, N'Great gifts for a precious kids who has nothing thanks'),
(N'Lucia', N'Johnson', N'lucia.johnson8386@example.net', '2015-12-02', 5, N'Works great, have no major issues. My only minor issue is the fan noise, but that''s more or a personal issue.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Cooper', N'brenda.cooper6582@example.com', '2015-12-02', 4, N'Great. Couldn''t bet the price'),
(N'Marcus', N'Brown', N'marcus.brown4389@example.net', '2015-12-02', 5, N'The digital code arrived via e-mail instantly as I purchased. I recommend this game.'),
(N'Aisha', N'King', N'aisha.king8807@example.net', '2015-12-02', 5, N'If you enjoyed Lara Croft and the Guardian of light this one is the same style. Great couch co-op play with little puzzles to be solved throughout. I play this with my son and hope for more local co-op games of this style in the future.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Johnson', N'zachary.johnson7246@example.org', '2015-12-02', 5, N'The game we all have been waiting for. PS4 rocks!'),
(N'Jack', N'Martin', N'jack.martin8488@example.net', '2015-12-02', 2, N'The game was not a bad idea, but it lacks in play control much like every other Simpson''s game to come out during this time period. I was surprised Acclaim made this, They used to make a lot of decent and fun games but this is not one of them. You only get to play as Bart through the whole game and never as Lisa. That hurts the replay value right there. It is a basic side scroller about 4 or 5 stages long. You basically just jump and shoot bullies and objects from time to time. It seemed to me that you never have enough ammunition in the game so you have to guard it sparingly until you get farther in each stage. You are go around jumping over everything until you get toward the end of the stage. Bart is sluggish and can''t run like Mario the controls feel reversed from what is jump and shoot. The game is not very fun and has a very low replay value, After you beat the game it is not worth playing again. You would be better off borrowing the game from a friend for an hour, rather...'),
(N'Matthew', N'Wang', N'matthew.wang3548@example.com', '2015-12-02', 3, N'The game itself is kind of "blah". Its really neat, but really short. I beat it in about 6 hours. There is almost no reason to replay it unless you like to collect trophies. The collectors edition content is nice, but not worth retail. If you can get it on sale, its a good collectors edition to have.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Alvarez', N'sharon.alvarez6256@example.com', '2015-12-02', 5, N'my Boy loves it! Graphics are awesome... best looking game out!'),
(N'Jack', N'Edwards', N'jack.edwards2298@example.com', '2015-12-03', 5, N'Let''s me use my xbox one controller wireless on my computer. Definitely a must purchase if you want to use the xbox one controller on the pc. Works right out of the box on my Windows 10 machines.'),
(N'Frank', N'Adams', N'frank.adams9023@example.net', '2015-12-03', 1, N'free, but worth less than that'),
(N'Alexander', N'Smith', N'alexander.smith9048@example.net', '2015-12-03', 5, N'Great game! I would recommend that anyone who likes shooters and games with good story lines play this game!'),
(N'Victoria', N'Campbell', N'victoria.campbell5410@example.net', '2015-12-03', 4, N'This is a pretty good mouse for the price. Side grips are plastic, which isn''t great, but they still work fairly well. Mouse isn''t super heavy. Scroll wheel is super grippy and satisfying, but no infinite scroll which makes it not great for productivity. L&R Mouse clickers aren''t the best, middle mouse click is great, back/forward clicks are great. LED accent is nice. Non-removable cable, non-braided Dust/dirt/hair sticks to adhesive on bottom.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Jackson', N'carlos.jackson2330@example.net', '2015-12-03', 5, N'Great Game'),
(N'Edward', N'Garcia', N'edward.garcia2284@example.org', '2015-12-03', 5, N'I really debated getting this because I was holding out for the smaller version, but I finally gave in (about a month or two before the small one hit stores, but oh well!). I went ahead and got the black New 3DS XL, which is now my very first XL sized system ever. My very first impression of the unit is that it''s quite a bit larger than I''m used to, but that makes sense since it''s an XL unit. I got used to the feel of it after a few days. However, the graphics look worse, but I''m sure that''s entirely due to older DS games being stretched to fit on an XL screen. Of course, never having used an XL sized unit before, I can''t say for sure what is the effect of the larger screen or not. Still, things don''t look unplayably bad, just a bit pixelly and fuzzy at times. Strangely, my copy of the first Phoenix Wright game looked pretty bad, and I wasn''t expecting that since it''s just 2D flat anime-style graphics, and those tend to look nice even at low resolutions. Still, other games looked...'),
(N'Diane', N'Wang', N'diane.wang5514@example.net', '2015-12-03', 4, N'Great detail, bit smaller than Marth. My local Best Buy had lots of Dark Pit and Marth, as well as many others, in stock at regular retail of 12.99. Don''t support these scalpers and price gougers in Amazon Marketplace. Never support cable TV charging way above normal prices for stuff that used to be on free OTA TV. Cut your cable for a year and see how low the prices fall. We the consumers have the power to dictate price.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Howard', N'jeffrey.howard4311@example.net', '2015-12-03', 5, N'I''m a huge fan of the series and after playing this version of the first game I really hope they do the other two. For years I have had to turn to my PC in order to get the quality I wanted out of games and now consoles seem to be almost at that level, which is awesome! Gears Ultimate is fantastic, I played the original on my 360 not too long ago so it''s fresh in my mind and I can say that this is definitely a worth while purchase for the One whether you are a GoW fan or just looking for a great shooter. Besides the great engine it runs on and the graphics, the cut scenes are incredible to watch. They really did a great job on this game, I highly recommend it.'),
(N'Laura', N'Bennett', N'laura.bennett9596@example.org', '2015-12-03', 5, N'excellent product, I recommend it, it would buy'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Kelly', N'cheryl.kelly5243@example.net', '2015-12-03', 3, N'When I ordered this, I was not aware that you could only use it for certain games. I don''t have Mortal Combat and I couldn''t use it for any of the games I normally like to play My Son-in-law has Mortal Combat so I let him try it. The buttons are very sensitive which is nice once you get to know the controller. It takes some time to get used to this controller as opposed to the normal controllers that come with the Playstation. Knowing now that you can only play a few certain games, I would not have selected this controller. Why would anyone buy a controller they can''t use on all of their games? I can''t recommend this controller specifically for that reason. It seems like it would be a waste of money to me.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Clark', N'anthony.clark7719@example.com', '2015-12-03', 5, N'It was really straight forward. I got the steam code, logged in, activated it and it was added to my account. I even bought a few for friends. If you want a no-hassle dlc skyrim for steam, buy these.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Williams', N'melissa.williams8215@example.org', '2015-12-03', 5, N'Amazing blow stuff up game. If you want linear structure this game isn''t for you. If you like to play a games like Mercenaries and GTA you''ll love this.'),
(N'Peter', N'Ferreira', N'peter.ferreira8660@example.net', '2015-12-03', 5, N'Get what you ask for'),
(N'Angela', N'Cruz', N'angela.cruz4541@example.org', '2015-12-03', 5, N'Cheap and do what it have to do, the up-scaling is amazing, i dosn''t look great but for upscaling from 5 inches to 50 inches,'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Phillips', N'elizabeth.phillips8448@example.com', '2015-12-03', 4, N'When they say "Windows 10" they mean it! If you do not want to upgrade to Windows 10 (such like me, not wanting to lose Media Center TV tuner capability), do not buy this. I''m pretty sharp with computers and could not find a way to shoehorn the Windows 10 drivers in to my Windows 7. This also required me to fall back to using micro USB on my controller. I''m disappointed. However, it did connect to my work computer with no issues and the controller was paired and working in seconds.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Castillo', N'nadia.castillo3378@example.net', '2015-12-03', 4, N'The graphics is OK, not very good, to be honest.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Myers', N'rachel.myers7735@example.org', '2015-12-03', 4, N'Great sound quality with comfortable ear pieces. Use for long periods of time tend to get uncomfortable on the top of my head, not much padding on the top part. Mic has a feature so you can hear yourself speak and adjust your volume, very useful. I use it more for watching my favorite TV shows or movies when I need to turn the sound off rather than gaming, the removable mic makes this convenient. Works great with my Xbox One, iPhone, and iMac.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Wright', N'rebecca.wright2335@example.net', '2015-12-04', 5, N'Great product. It offers more space for saving games.'),
(N'Scott', N'Hall', N'scott.hall3487@example.net', '2015-12-04', 2, N'Aesthetically pleasing, heavy seems like it would be really good. Backlighting was pretty weak. Processed return mainly because the keys seem very low quality especially the spacebar and it''s not an issue with this single KB, the spacebar the way it''s mounted rocks side to side so when I tap it with my left thumb instead of going straight down it resist the motion, tilts a little and then goes down. Elected for a different mechanical KB.'),
(N'William', N'Wood', N'william.wood2850@example.org', '2015-12-04', 3, N'I miss the candle relax mode but the new mini games are a welcome addition. You get more of the same.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Roberts', N'stephanie.roberts9146@example.org', '2015-12-04', 5, N'Recibido'),
(N'Christine', N'Murphy', N'christine.murphy5285@example.com', '2015-12-04', 5, N'These were excellent and fit snugly on my worn PS3 controller pads.'),
(N'Janet', N'Gutierrez', N'janet.gutierrez7974@example.com', '2015-12-04', 3, N'Not really happy with the changes to the controller scheme it takes a lot of getting used to. While, you can eventually learn it the learning curve will turn off some fans. I would not but it again as I can just bring out my old systems and play the past ones. I do like the change where you are playing with a live band.and being able to play it in the next gen if you don''t want to use the extra space.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Reyes', N'pamela.reyes3182@example.com', '2015-12-04', 5, N'Love the game'),
(N'Melissa', N'Patel', N'melissa.patel9687@example.org', '2015-12-04', 5, N'Great game had to buy a spare in case someone wears theirs out fast shipping and great pricing'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Mitchell', N'jeremy.mitchell3013@example.com', '2015-12-05', 4, N'I was worried that the texture and the fact that these are metal, might ruin my thumbs after a long session of gaming. This was not the case! they feel great! No more sweaty thumbs slipping off the thumbstick. Fit was a little tight on installation, you really have to press them in, but nothing more than minor inconvenience really. After a number of months I thought my controller had broken, I just needed to pull the analog stick up so it wasn''t sticking. Again, another minor inconvenience. All and all, the best thumb sticks I''ve ever used.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Young', N'nicholas.young2591@example.com', '2015-12-05', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Brian', N'Turner', N'brian.turner8796@example.org', '2015-12-05', 5, N'good job thanks'),
(N'Heather', N'Hughes', N'heather.hughes9299@example.net', '2015-12-05', 5, N'These are truly excellent. I was skeptical they would fit my XBOX ONE controller thumb sticks AND my PS3, PS4 and XBOX 360 controller thumb sticks. If you haven''t noticed, the XBOX ONE thumb sticks are a little smaller in diameter. BUT they work perfectly for all the controllers, just as advertised. The textured surface feels just right, even after long sessions of game play too. I don''t want to go back to smooth surfaced controller thumb sticks ever again.'),
(N'Jason', N'Jones', N'jason.jones4367@example.org', '2015-12-05', 4, N'perfect'),
(N'Amy', N'Murphy', N'amy.murphy6363@example.net', '2015-12-05', 3, N'Good game but it won''t some time play on Xbox 360'),
(N'Ivan', N'Hill', N'ivan.hill3173@example.net', '2015-12-05', 5, N'grandson loves'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Sanders', N'kenneth.sanders4513@example.org', '2015-12-05', 5, N'FANTASTIC GAME'),
(N'Christopher', N'Jones', N'christopher.jones5179@example.org', '2015-12-05', 5, N'Ultron is a great edition to the 3.0 family! Cant wait for the new Avengers play set to come out in 2016'),
(N'Lisa', N'Torres', N'lisa.torres4409@example.net', '2015-12-05', 5, N'fits perfectly and was received quite quickly and am very happy with it.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Jackson', N'anthony.jackson2674@example.org', '2015-12-05', 5, N'Works well. This is the second part to complete my FPS setup. I bought this along with the AmazonBasics USB 3.0 Extension Cable. What I like most is that this setup saves on batteries and I don''t have to be in close proximity to my system. Being plugged in allows you to go without batteries and the 9 feet of the charging cable plus the 6.5 feet of extension lets me sit on the other side of room with cable length to spare. The two cables give you that millisecond or so less for communication between the controller and the system. Whenever you are playing a shooter and need an edge every second or millisecond counts. Especially that last second melee to the face you needed to get a kill. I am by no means a computer engineer or tech specialist, so I don''t have the gear that can actually measure the data speed that this cable travels at. However, in theory the idea is sound and some pro players prefer a cable connection with a controller than keeping the controller wireless.'),
(N'Richard', N'Ortiz', N'richard.ortiz6216@example.net', '2015-12-05', 5, N'I love strategy RPGs and the depths of Disgaea really allow you to get into the game. I''ve decided I wanted to play through each game in the series and I''m looking forward to how they improved the games as the go.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ivanov', N'ryan.ivanov3218@example.org', '2015-12-05', 4, N'I enjoyed it enough to play through till the end and do the extra boss dungeons after that no need to play mofe do to the aged nature of the game there are no PSN trophies to encourage more then one playthrough, item collections etc.'),
(N'Mark', N'Miller', N'mark.miller7672@example.org', '2015-12-06', 5, N'forever love Yoshi . great game and I am a adult lol'),
(N'Dennis', N'Wright', N'dennis.wright5727@example.com', '2015-12-06', 5, N'works perfect'),
(N'Lauren', N'James', N'lauren.james3525@example.org', '2015-12-06', 5, N'Top amiibo i terms of memorabilia!:)'),
(N'Christina', N'Adams', N'christina.adams1611@example.com', '2015-12-06', 5, N'Will be a Christmas gift to my grandson.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Williams', N'kelly.williams7898@example.com', '2015-12-06', 5, N'Have had this for over a year used daily and still looks and works like the day I bought it.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Flores', N'michelle.flores7129@example.org', '2015-12-06', 4, N'For $40, I can''t complain too much, but the ear covers are really uncomfortable compared to other headset models out there. The size is small and doesn''t fully cover your ear, making it not soundproof as well as uncomfortable. When attached to your controller, it also drains your battery pretty quickly. On a positive note, the sound is pretty decent and the mic has yet to give me any issues. I like hearing the game sound through my headset and it has a bass-boost toggle that definitely enhances my gaming experience. You can adjust the volume of your friends and your game sound with the push of a button, as well as muting the sound coming from the tv so you just hear everything through your headset - ideal for keeping it quiet!'),
(N'Charles', N'Ortiz', N'charles.ortiz6727@example.net', '2015-12-06', 5, N'Good game lead the way for many'),
(N'Gary', N'James', N'gary.james9966@example.org', '2015-12-06', 5, N'Excelente producto recomendado'),
(N'John', N'Bennett', N'john.bennett9221@example.net', '2015-12-06', 5, N'Excellent!!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Gray', N'ethan.gray8228@example.net', '2015-12-06', 5, N'was a great gift'),
(N'Frank', N'Ramos', N'frank.ramos8183@example.org', '2015-12-06', 5, N'Can''t beat Madden for gameplay. If I were to give it a negative comment it would be that the color commentary gets old pretty fast. Too repetitive.'),
(N'Anna', N'Patel', N'anna.patel5686@example.org', '2015-12-07', 5, N'thank for the game.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Baker', N'lauren.baker8534@example.org', '2015-12-07', 4, N'I can''t wait to play the 30th Anniversary of Back To The Future The Game. on Wednesday Decemeber 9 I''ll be turning 30 myself so actually I''ll be the same age as the Back To The Future Trilogy I was born in 1985 when Back To The Future first came to theatres. I''m excited to play it my 30th birthday this Wednesday.'),
(N'Jack', N'Ruiz', N'jack.ruiz9469@example.com', '2015-12-07', 5, N'First and foremost - this product would have been worth the money and the stars even if it weren''t a battery pack! I didn''t realize how uncomfortable the PSP Go was for my huge man hands until I got this thing! Much easier to hold on the the PSP, makes it bigger and more ergonomic. The battery back up has saved me on days when I played my Go a lot throughout the day and wasn''t around a charger! There are a few things that would make this product VASTLY better in my opinion - if it were more of a dock than having a cord, if there was a way to access the power/lock slider without taking the Go out of the grip, and if there was some sort of indicator in regards to how much power you had left in the unit. Even without these things, though, I would highly recommend this to anyone with a Go!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Garcia', N'thomas.garcia5592@example.com', '2015-12-07', 5, N'These headphones are extremely comfortable and have solid sound. I used these yesterday for 6 hours and they were still comfy. I forgot about this thing they call reality.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ramirez', N'kenneth.ramirez9968@example.com', '2015-12-07', 5, N'This game looks great so excited'),
(N'Michelle', N'Suzuki', N'michelle.suzuki2717@example.net', '2015-12-07', 5, N'What makes this shooter fun is that you really need to rely on stealth. So, it''s not a hard core first person shooter. Nice for people who want a nice relaxed pace rather than running from gun battle to gun battle. A few good "gotcha" moments to boot.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Peterson', N'jennifer.peterson3146@example.org', '2015-12-07', 5, N'This is the biggest and best Fallout yet. The open world is packed with locations, enemies, and quests. Fallout 4 has an insane amount of weapon, armor, and power suit customization.'),
(N'Amy', N'Stewart', N'amy.stewart5372@example.org', '2015-12-07', 5, N'100 hours in. Still lots to do. Who needs reality when you have Fallout 4? :) A perfect way to spend a dreary winter'),
(N'Rachel', N'Diaz', N'rachel.diaz6724@example.org', '2015-12-07', 1, N'Not a good game. Bad graphics and doesn''t use the Wii U controller properly. I returned this immediately after 2 hours of playing.'),
(N'Justin', N'Perry', N'justin.perry8210@example.net', '2015-12-07', 5, N'This game is a lot of fun. It''s not "run-n-gun 360* headshot" Call of Duty style action. It''s slower, tactical, and requires a lot of team communication and coordination. There are 10 single player situation "training" missions (each with 3 optional goals), a full PVP multiplayer mode (5v5 with 10 maps and multiple game modes), and then the Co-op mode called "Terrorist Hunt" which puts you and up to 4 other friends vs the AI. Terrorist Hunt is my favorite mode. I''m getting too old and slow to play vs younger gamers with their faster reaction times. But my friends and I are loving this co-op mode. You can choose what levels and game types you prefer in the options menu. Then, in game, you work with your friends to clear out a level, disarm bombs, or rescue/protect hostages. The AI is very good (not perfect), and there are 3 levels of difficulty to choose (which also awards you additional XP). XP is used to unlock new unique characters (called Operators) and also to upgrade weapons....'),
(N'Stephen', N'Brooks', N'stephen.brooks1078@example.org', '2015-12-07', 5, N'Product received in good condition'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Richardson', N'cynthia.richardson6797@example.org', '2015-12-07', 5, N'Super fun and fast delivery.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Gonzalez', N'kimberly.gonzalez7412@example.org', '2015-12-07', 5, N'My kids lost their original stylus so this was a great cheap buy! Works great.'),
(N'Joan', N'Edwards', N'joan.edwards3955@example.net', '2015-12-07', 3, N'This game is pretty straight forward. You complete one goal after the other like most rpg''s. You collect things in each area that goes into a museum of things you can view. As for charter and dialog its style is both informative on the missions at hand while also poking fun at some well known taboos at video games. It has some violence, no blood but you do get gnomes vomiting rainbows on many occasions. Altogether its a fairly well made game and worth a try with missions and goals to keep you busy.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Ruiz', N'hannah.ruiz5821@example.com', '2015-12-07', 5, N'Instant delivery, as it is an online code. As expected.'),
(N'Joan', N'Russell', N'joan.russell1737@example.com', '2015-12-07', 5, N'Bought for my daughter''s game for last Xmas because I could only find the super Mario edition of the console in stores and this covered it very well'),
(N'Ryan', N'Long', N'ryan.long1955@example.org', '2015-12-07', 5, N'This is, by far, my favorite set of cover plates so far. I actually get compliments on these occasionally, and they are very solid and feel great. The matte coating really goes a long way.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Cooper', N'sandra.cooper1998@example.com', '2015-12-07', 5, N'Amazing game.'),
(N'Priya', N'Tanaka', N'priya.tanaka2953@example.com', '2015-12-07', 1, N'No prequels, no space battles, crappy online customization, not enough maps, offline is a joke, the game lacs content and isn''t very fun.'),
(N'Larry', N'Kumar', N'larry.kumar1628@example.com', '2015-12-08', 5, N'Perfect for keeping my vita safe.'),
(N'Justin', N'Nowak', N'justin.nowak2080@example.com', '2015-12-08', 5, N'Xenoblade Chronicles X is a must have for the Wii U. There is so much customization and exploration that you can do, that it''s unfathomable that this game was created on the Wii U. The graphics are gorgeous, the music is fantastic, and the game play is much better than the original Xenoblade Chronicles X. Xenoblade Chronicles X''s game play mechanics is refined to near perfection! I''m not going to post spoilers, but to progress to Chapter 4, make sure that you have a survey rate of 15% on Primordia. Talk to the lady opposite of the blade barracks. The lady will inform you about blades, and you''ll complete a little mission to progress to Chapter 4. Afterwards, on the left side of you, go across and speak to another lady. That lady will let you find probes to collect and mine. That will allow you to start Chapter 4 in the blade barracks. The special edition came with a 800mb USB containing sample songs, very well done art book, art card of characters, and a reversible game cover. The...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Smith', N'carolyn.smith9172@example.com', '2015-12-08', 1, N'Doesn''t work on Windows XP'),
(N'Rachel', N'Coleman', N'rachel.coleman5022@example.com', '2015-12-08', 4, N'[Note: Purchased directly on Origin, not Amazon] Pros: - Incredibly good graphics, runs amazingly smooth and fluid. - The sound is some of the best you''ll ever see in a game, both effects and music. - Fast-paced, fun gameplay. Easy to pick up and feel like you''re competitive. Very accessible. - Incredibly immersive levels, really feels like you''re there in the Star Wars universe Cons: - Lack of variety of game play modes and levels. 5 "settings", with a handful of "levels" each. Modes feel the same. - Weapons are not well differentiated, with a few exceptions. Some equipment (Jetpack) feels mandatory. - Incentive to cooperate with your team is basically zero. Chat mostly consists of people crying "hacker!" or discussing other people''s mothers, basically par for the modern online FPS course. - Character customization is lackluster Overall what you''re getting is a fantastically fun game with mostly shallow game play. For your hardcore COD/BF player, it''s going to lack depth complex...'),
(N'Peter', N'Nguyen', N'peter.nguyen2455@example.org', '2015-12-08', 5, N'The Real Deal'),
(N'Scott', N'Scott', N'scott.scott3928@example.net', '2015-12-08', 5, N'This game has every Mega Man game a man could want!'),
(N'Paul', N'Rogers', N'paul.rogers1851@example.com', '2015-12-08', 5, N'One of the best tactical shooters in years. Best shooter of 2015'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Khan', N'jonathan.khan7009@example.org', '2015-12-09', 5, N'kids love this game'),
(N'Jack', N'Ross', N'jack.ross7627@example.net', '2015-12-09', 5, N'Excelent!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Wilson', N'yuki.wilson2646@example.org', '2015-12-09', 5, N'Awasome'),
(N'Emma', N'Allen', N'emma.allen1637@example.org', '2015-12-09', 2, N'Definitely not what I was expecting. It''s okay. But eh.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Scott', N'jacqueline.scott6465@example.org', '2015-12-09', 5, N'Love amiibo!'),
(N'Lauren', N'Roberts', N'lauren.roberts8763@example.org', '2015-12-09', 4, N'My kids live and breathe for this game after school. Parents beware: It is almost too easy for your kids to "accept" an online challenge where they are connected via video to a very random person that they perform against. I shouldn''t have to warn you about random video chat. Also it "saves" the dances your kiddos are doing, and it makes it very easy to accidentally "upload" those videos for anyone online to see. Great game, but definitely keep an eye on the options.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Khan', N'lucia.khan5105@example.org', '2015-12-09', 5, N'My son loves this game! He is a huge Mario and Sonic fan. It is fun and the games are easy to play, even for a five year old.'),
(N'Laura', N'Howard', N'laura.howard1236@example.org', '2015-12-09', 4, N'I have been sort of disappointed with the crop of shooters this year. Halo 5''s campaign was good, but the multiplayer drove me back to Reach, CoD has failed to seriously interest me since MW3, and SW Battlefront is very good, but feels like it''s lacking content and is somewhat difficult to navigate. Enter Rainbow Six: Siege. I played Rainbow Six: Vegas a few years back and enjoyed it, but my lingering memory was the extreme difficulty. And when I say ''difficulty'' I mean that stealth, cover and attention to detail played a huge role and foul-ups were immediately and brutally punished. So that was my expectation for the new game, as I did not have a whole lot of information on it. So I got the game. It is truly excellent. True to form, this game places emphasis on careful precision and stealth, rather than sprinting around a map with a grenade launcher. The player spawns with 100 health points, which can be taken down very quickly and do not regenerate. There are no health pickups....'),
(N'Jacob', N'Brooks', N'jacob.brooks9934@example.net', '2015-12-09', 5, N'thank you'),
(N'Noah', N'Bell', N'noah.bell4007@example.org', '2015-12-09', 3, N'Glitchy. servers keep going down for multiplayer.'),
(N'Justin', N'Lee', N'justin.lee2200@example.net', '2015-12-09', 1, N'Sucks'),
(N'Sarah', N'Evans', N'sarah.evans9844@example.net', '2015-12-09', 5, N'Play the old versions first, I made the mistake of playing the newest one first and it made the other ones look TERRIBLE'),
(N'Jacob', N'Phillips', N'jacob.phillips9608@example.org', '2015-12-09', 5, N'Great mechanical keyboard for the price. It''s no Filco, but it''s available. The actuation of the Cherry Brown switches are perfect, and the bottom out is the only click you hear.'),
(N'Donna', N'Murphy', N'donna.murphy5493@example.net', '2015-12-09', 5, N'Great game. It has nice graphics and fun features and fun multiplayer levels.'),
(N'Gary', N'Rivera', N'gary.rivera3433@example.net', '2015-12-09', 5, N'Works as described.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Bennett', N'nancy.bennett6737@example.net', '2015-12-10', 5, N'A big fan of the Disney Infinity system. Fun to play as a kid or an adult. DV in Rise of the Empire is a lot of fun. Having him run around and take on stormtroopers or run through the Hoth missions.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Cooper', N'yuki.cooper4137@example.com', '2015-12-10', 5, N'Awesome game!!!'),
(N'Richard', N'Patel', N'richard.patel3401@example.org', '2015-12-10', 5, N'Only had it for a day, but so far I love it. Only has one cord, as opposed to the two corded comparable turtle beach model that is 40 dollars, and is very comfy, and I usually cant stand most headsets. Great for fat heads, but is just barely small enough to fit well on my wife''s head. not for anyone who isn''t an adult I would say.'),
(N'Richard', N'Patel', N'richard.patel3401@example.org', '2015-12-10', 5, N'3DS is very fun for the whole family. I love the fire emblem and bravely default series for this. Cannot wait for the next ones to come out.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Perez', N'patricia.perez9015@example.org', '2015-12-10', 4, N'Minecraft Story Mode is fun and entertaining. Telltale does another amazing job with telling a story based on popular franchises. This game is actually a 5 star rating game. Unfortunately, this package and disk is more of a 2 star. It only comes with the first episode and a code to download the rest of the season. PLEASE BE AWARE OF THIS when ordering! If you do not have proper internet connection or wish to play this straight, more likely wait till the season is done or near completion.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Long', N'kenneth.long4197@example.com', '2015-12-10', 4, N'It''s a good basic headset. It hooks to the controller and the cord is the right length. The mike is easy to move up and down and it stays where you put it; it doesn''t fall down if you have it up. I like the volume controls a good bit- they work with a wheel dial and it has just the right amount of resistance. It''s also big enough so that it is easy to locate without having to pay attention to what you''re doing to find and use it. I''ve had headphones with smaller controls, and perhaps they look more ''techy'' but when playing a game they are pain because you have to feel so carefully around for them. These are much better. Voice sounds good on it. Primarily that''s the best thing about it - voice audio is quite clear and it is easy to hear friends and teammates. It''s comfortable overall and the earcuffs are big enough for adult men/grown teens. The Vinyl can get a bit sweaty if worn for a very long time, and the audio is decent but certainly not hi-fi. Still, at this price, I like...'),
(N'Lucia', N'Foster', N'lucia.foster5030@example.org', '2015-12-10', 5, N'DW Fan since 3. Awesome game. Although franchise is getting old lol'),
(N'Jerry', N'Khan', N'jerry.khan9963@example.com', '2015-12-10', 4, N'Great memories of playing this game when it first came out. Back then, it was a fresh take on dbz fighting giving the players a 3d environment for the first time. The graphics are great, fighting fun, soundtracks brilliant and different modes entertaining.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Perez', N'jacob.perez9232@example.net', '2015-12-10', 5, N'A great game to play even now, as I had never played before. The voice acting is terrible, but I was able to overlook that because the gameplay is quite fun, and the story interesting as well with some good twists and turns. I would definitely recommend checking it out, a Gamecube classic.'),
(N'Eric', N'Ali', N'eric.ali5139@example.com', '2015-12-10', 4, N'Amazing concept, very well designed, graphics are great. The only problem - the game is too short :('),
(N'Eric', N'Ali', N'eric.ali5139@example.com', '2015-12-10', 5, N'First couple times I played I wasn''t sure if I liked the game. But now I''m absolutely in love with it. The world, the graphics, the possibilities! It''s amazing!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Sanchez', N'kenneth.sanchez7862@example.net', '2015-12-10', 5, N'Can''t enjoy karaoke without mics!!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Chen', N'joyce.chen2663@example.net', '2015-12-11', 5, N'love this game survival mode kept me playing longest'),
(N'Joyce', N'Chen', N'joyce.chen2663@example.net', '2015-12-11', 4, N'great game although gfwl sucks'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Morales', N'kathleen.morales1383@example.org', '2015-12-11', 4, N'I really enjoy playing this game. I downloaded the demo on Christmas day last year, and then downloaded the full game a few days later. My son and I have a lot of fun making people and dressing them silly. He loves when I throw food to a mii, and tell them to pick it up off the floor. he''s silly. I had the game about 10 months, when my 3ds xl broke. I bought a new3ds in October, and didn''t do the system transfer correctly, so I lost all my save data. I had to start all over. This time around, the game is still just as fun. I can''t sit there for hours playing just this game; there isn''t that much to do with it. I check in daily, and buy new food and furniture. I will say this time around ,it is much faster paced. my first save game took forever to get one person married, and took forever to have a baby. I''m talking like 6 months. This time around, I have 3 couples married and 2 babies all in two months. It''s a fun game to play in short amounts of time.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Coleman', N'tomasz.coleman7192@example.net', '2015-12-11', 5, N'This is a surprise for my grandson, he loves his X box and all his tapes.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Henderson', N'jacqueline.henderson1160@example.com', '2015-12-11', 1, N'Wow, first time I''ve ever been let down by HORI...disappointed.'),
(N'Richard', N'Suzuki', N'richard.suzuki2295@example.net', '2015-12-11', 1, N'I didn''t buy this game here, but I will give my review of it. I was told by a friend that he heard there was no single player campaign. I read a story confirming that but there was gonna be some missions that a single player can play or co-op split screen play. I reserved the game at Gamestop with 4 days to go before it was released and just as I was picking it up the cashier tells me right on the spot that the entire game was online. I didn''t know that I told him & he says yes I have to be online to play it. So that made my decision to forget it because I didn''t want to be online just to play a game I thought would''ve been on the disc.'),
(N'Jason', N'Wisniewski', N'jason.wisniewski8826@example.org', '2015-12-11', 5, N'that''s great, nice product !'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Sullivan', N'carolyn.sullivan5822@example.org', '2015-12-11', 4, N'If you are old enough to want a little reality in your video games and aren''t into killing metallic space aliens with "Whomper-dazzler guns" and know the difference between killing people in a video game and killing people in reality, this is a pretty cool game. The menu/map system is typically Bethesda awkward, but the story line is pretty interesting. The game took me about 20hrs to complete over a couple days, but some basic mechanics of the game seemed to make it get easier toward the end, rather than more difficult. Figuring out how to ''beat the game'' rather than the enemy was pretty transparent. At the end you basically have a mini gun and a 100 shot automatic shotgun that are a little out of touch with reality. My connection is poor, so it took a little longer to download than to play out, but for $6 and almost instant gratification I thought it was a very good deal (somewhere around $0.34 an hour for entertainment) I like open world realistic games. You get to race and...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Singh', N'michelle.singh6427@example.org', '2015-12-11', 3, N'It''s kind of a fun game, but I only paid $10 bucks for it.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Singh', N'michelle.singh6427@example.org', '2015-12-11', 4, N'It''s nice to have a new PS3, so I can still play my old games, and even get some more. The Blue ray player works good, it only plays in wide screen and I''m not crazy about wide screen, but it''s nice to have the blue ray player on hand so I don''t have to go out and buy one right away, it works good on all the games I have played, good deal'''''),
(N'Scott', N'Morris', N'scott.morris3686@example.org', '2015-12-11', 5, N'Aweosme game, one of my playstation favorites of all time! The whole saga is incredibly well made and graphics are superb! Just get it and taste it for yourself!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Khan', N'jennifer.khan1939@example.net', '2015-12-11', 5, N'Amazing, still haven''t finished it but Amazing so far'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Miller', N'stephanie.miller5530@example.com', '2015-12-11', 3, N'Does not look authentic and it did not come in any kind of retail packaging. This was meant to be a Christmas gift for someone. I tested it and it DOES work, but I was dissapointed to get a loose adapter and folded manuals in a poly mailer. Hopefully it keeps working for a while. I will update this when he tells me it has died, so you know the life span.'),
(N'Peter', N'Ruiz', N'peter.ruiz1701@example.net', '2015-12-12', 4, N'Like a ridiculous over the top B action movie from the 90''s. Multi-player is addictive and fun. Hoping this comes back in stock, if not it is available in the eShop.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Rogers', N'hiroshi.rogers3509@example.com', '2015-12-12', 4, N'The only thing I don''t like is that it continuously runs. If there was an on/off switch, it would be perfect'),
(N'Jessica', N'Bell', N'jessica.bell4986@example.net', '2015-12-12', 5, N'A simple download game nothing required just direct x drivers and quick plug ins and your ready to play.'),
(N'Christina', N'Bennett', N'christina.bennett1036@example.org', '2015-12-12', 4, N'everything works nicely. fair price for all the items included.'),
(N'Christina', N'Bennett', N'christina.bennett1036@example.org', '2015-12-12', 4, N'I bought this primarily to play melee on netplay, and it works very well to that end. Native support for my gamecube controller and allows proper analog control of the shoulders and minuscule input delay as well as rumble support in dolphin.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Jimenez', N'kenneth.jimenez8474@example.net', '2015-12-12', 5, N'With the next generation of Gaming Godzilla games weren''t anywhere till Atari wanted their own Godzilla games for their own in which Both Xbox and the Nintendo GameCube were the next game systems as the PlayStation 2 release was cancelled. With that said lets begin this game story What theres a plot in this fighting Game? Anyway lets play the Xbox Version. Plot/Story: The plot involves an alien race known as the Vortaak invading the Earth and assuming control of the planet''s giant monsters, sending them to attack cities across the globe. One monster breaks free from the Vortaak''s control, and battles the other monsters in order to drive off the Vortaak. So a basic plot but not bad. Gameplay: The player plays as a one of several giant monsters (eleven playable characters: Anguirus, Destoroyah, Gigan, Godzilla 90s, Godzilla 2000, King Ghidorah, Mecha-King Ghidorah, Megalon, Orga, Rodan, and Mechagodzilla). Via punches, kicks, and limb attacks (usually a tail-attack), each monster can...'),
(N'Gary', N'Mitchell', N'gary.mitchell8899@example.org', '2015-12-12', 4, N'Pros: Looks good with amiibos A cool way to display amiibos A little more sturdy than other displays made like this one Cons: Pricey for the quality Topples over easily because it is made up of several pieces Overall, it is worth it to those who really like Nintendo and want to display their amiibos, but try to get it on sale.'),
(N'Diane', N'Gutierrez', N'diane.gutierrez7185@example.net', '2015-12-12', 4, N'We''re a very avid gaming household who tend to buy and cycle through a lot of different game controllers, so we''re always on the lookout to try out new models. We own an XBox One as well as multiple gaming computers. My current daily controller is the Air Flo Controller for Xbox 360 - Wired which I''ve been using for many years. Everything on the Air Flo controller still works perfectly, however I love testing out newer models of Microsoft''s controllers. So I decided to try out the Microsoft Xbox One Controller + Wireless Adapter for Windows 10. Here are my thoughts; Pros + Wireless adapter allows use with PCs, laptops, and tablets. + Easy to install and set up. Essentially plug and play. + Controls are exceptionally responsive. + Fits comfortably in your hand. Cons - Hands will still cramp up after extended use as with any controller. - No hand cooling fans, something I''ve grown quite accustomed to. - A bit on the spendy side. I''ve been very satisfied with the overall performance...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Wang', N'ronald.wang3716@example.com', '2015-12-12', 5, N'Phoenix Wright Ace Attorney is trials and tribulations is awesome'),
(N'Dennis', N'Khan', N'dennis.khan7030@example.org', '2015-12-13', 5, N'Bought the game 3 times. I just couldn''t get enough. This franchise is so important to me'),
(N'Jose', N'Gonzalez', N'jose.gonzalez3772@example.net', '2015-12-13', 4, N'I''m satisfied.'),
(N'Jason', N'Jenkins', N'jason.jenkins3009@example.net', '2015-12-13', 4, N'Works great, I added a sound card to my computer and needed the 3.5 jacks to attach the head phones to. This had them plus being Dolby 7.1 surround sound with the nice padding for over the ears. Terrific buy. It also came with the adaptor for usb but sound cards do not have that feature. I thought with the newer motherboards that have the 7.1 sound that a card would not make a difference. I was wrong. There are sounds I never heard before on games coming in clear. Like a radio playing, the sounds of the wind gusting, birds chirping and probably more.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Wilson', N'michelle.wilson3723@example.com', '2015-12-13', 5, N'Nostalgia baby...yeah'),
(N'Michelle', N'Wilson', N'michelle.wilson3723@example.com', '2015-12-13', 5, N'Nostalgia baby....yeah'),
(N'Aisha', N'Phillips', N'aisha.phillips1212@example.net', '2015-12-13', 4, N'This game isn''t for everyone. If your looking for gameplay and replayability look elsewhere! To be honest.. this game is alright.. not great. Its a good game to be played when you need a break from long serious games since its almost like a movie.. which isn''t nessesarily always a bad thing. If you were afraid of buying the game its def worth 20 bux!'),
(N'Luis', N'Harris', N'luis.harris5272@example.com', '2015-12-13', 4, N'This game is a nice change of pace from the norm, with a focus on atmosphere and tense encounters that will make you jump. The controls work as they should. The visuals are somewhere in between that of last gen and this, with a framerate that is rock solid. The real star of the show is the sound, which is some of the best use of surround in a game. Zombies easily heard through each and every speaker, allows you to pick out which direction they are coming from... Atmospheric sounds like birds, wind and rain, that surrounds you and makes you feel as if you are there. Sound like this makes a game, because it envelopes the player and helps work all of the senses. Giving scares even more intensity, as they come from every speaker and every direction... When you least expect them. While this game doesnt offer ground breaking, next gen visuals... it does offer fun, enjoyble gameplay. If you go into this game with an open mind and low expectations... You will likely be pleasantly surprised...'),
(N'Nancy', N'Chavez', N'nancy.chavez4108@example.com', '2015-12-13', 5, N'Gaming mice, they are an invaluable part of any PC gamers setup, often the quality of the mouse can spell life or death for the gamer. Often times PC gamers have to shell out an arm and a leg to get the best quality mouse out there. Everything has to be perfect, the DPI, the weight, the way the mouse is set up when you hold it, how many programmable buttons there are and most importantly, it has to feel right in the hands. Many times, the combinations of all of these things can bring hefty a price tag. Sentey is here to change all of that; as it brings a quality feel, programmable buttons, and changeable DPI settings all for under $20. This may sound too good to be true, but to me, Sentey has hit the sweet spot when it comes to affordability and quality. As many of my readers probably know already, Im primarily a console gamer. I have played on just about every console since 1993 but admittedly have never played on a computer until very recently. The mouse and keyboard setup always...'),
(N'Helen', N'Harris', N'helen.harris9103@example.org', '2015-12-13', 4, N'Amazing graphics, environments, sound and presentation. Multiplayer modes are fun, but the lack of a single player campaign is disappointing.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Kelly', N'brenda.kelly9374@example.org', '2015-12-13', 5, N'yes! i just received it and installed the software and am playing around with the mouse with all the weights in it and it feels marvelous!! i used to own the mx518 for about 4 years before it broke and i decided to buy this one and boy am i happy i did. if you''re into gaming and want to try out a mouse that looks sick, has weight adjustable function, that feels like the good old mx518, then i highly recommend you this buy. it highly unlikely that you''ll regret it!'),
(N'Eric', N'Brooks', N'eric.brooks8729@example.org', '2015-12-13', 5, N'This is the best sports game ever. I like how ever year there is something differet to expect while eeping the core aspec the same. I hope one day they can get back to NFL 2k cause they will blow Madden away'),
(N'Nancy', N'Reyes', N'nancy.reyes1481@example.org', '2015-12-13', 5, N'Highly anticipated & great gift idea!'),
(N'Peter', N'James', N'peter.james7532@example.net', '2015-12-13', 4, N'Awesome'),
(N'Helen', N'Nelson', N'helen.nelson4345@example.com', '2015-12-13', 5, N'Kids loved it. Christmas gift.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Smith', N'kofi.smith9599@example.org', '2015-12-14', 5, N'Good game I''m just alittle rusty with Madden since I been away from it for a few years'),
(N'Kofi', N'Smith', N'kofi.smith9599@example.org', '2015-12-14', 3, N'It''s a fun game but the maker missed out on the opportunity to make a great story mode. It had so much potential but they wanted to focus on the multi-player which imo is just a dumb down version of battlefield'),
(N'Deborah', N'Wang', N'deborah.wang5197@example.net', '2015-12-14', 5, N'The God of War series is probably one of the most memorable I''ve ever played... and now you can put it on your Vita XD (well... most of it anyway.... cmon Sony, time to port GoW 3..... even a dumbed down [graphically] version if you have to). There''s the GoW Origins Collection with Chains of Olympus and Ghost of Sparta, and now this collection of I & II all of which can go on the Vita.... I bought it today at Gamestop though...... for the first time I''ve ever seen (and it wasn''t a sale), Gamstop was cheaper then Amazon..... twenty bucks flat....'),
(N'Christopher', N'Webb', N'christopher.webb7597@example.org', '2015-12-14', 2, N'After having the game for about a month, I barely give it a two. It''s shallow, the DL-44 is the only worthwhile gun to use and the feeling of shooting a gun is so weak there''s no satisfaction defeating another player. All these problems don''t matter anyways as cheating has become rampant online and you can''t find a room without a guy having unlimited jetpacking and scan pulses anyways.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Martin', N'kofi.martin6652@example.com', '2015-12-14', 1, N'Free To Play. They''ve killed Guild Wars 2. This expansion and their rip off FTP scheme will be the end of Arena Net. I regret buying this, you can wait and they''ll give you what I paid for for free.'),
(N'Helen', N'Kim', N'helen.kim6460@example.org', '2015-12-14', 1, N'Bought this 1 year ago and felt I needed to write this review. This controller now gets super hot and you can even smell the electrical components getting hot inside. We''ve changed out batteries multiple times, tried different adapters and chargers. Not worth $75 if it''s going to burn your son''s hands and maybe worse.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Okonkwo', N'christopher.okonkwo4771@example.org', '2015-12-14', 5, N'Excellent product quality recommend it, very happy,.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Ivanov', N'elizabeth.ivanov1451@example.com', '2015-12-14', 5, N'No more looking for batteries! This thing is awsome...'),
(N'Barbara', N'Parker', N'barbara.parker1502@example.net', '2015-12-14', 1, N'Instruction & product are difficult'),
(N'Omar', N'Torres', N'omar.torres5013@example.org', '2015-12-14', 5, N'Excellent quality for the money!'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Young', N'jonathan.young6106@example.com', '2015-12-14', 4, N'Works better than some of the other ones we bought. Joysticks give out after a while.'),
(N'James', N'Russell', N'james.russell6471@example.org', '2015-12-14', 5, N'great game and fast delivery'),
(N'Emma', N'Williams', N'emma.williams5863@example.net', '2015-12-14', 5, N'loved it everything was there, played perfectly and will definitely buy more like it'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Boyd', N'carolyn.boyd8398@example.com', '2015-12-15', 5, N'excellent details. very successful'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Phillips', N'tomasz.phillips7618@example.com', '2015-12-15', 5, N'Good, sturdy case.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Rodriguez', N'christopher.rodriguez8444@example.net', '2015-12-15', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Karen', N'Parker', N'karen.parker1003@example.net', '2015-12-15', 4, N'The best version of the system that I''ve found so far, but you have to be careful with the model that you end up with. More on that later. In comparison, I have owned a 3DS, 3DS XL, two New 3DS XL''s, and a New 3DS. Everything works seamlessly, little to no lag loading games as is typical for a cartridge-based system. The C-Stick is generally useless except for the few games that actually require it, not really a reason to upgrade for most people. I consider the change from SD to Micro-SD a big improvement in terms of availability of cheap upgrades, but you might be disappointed with the extra work going into unscrewing the back cover instead off just popping it in and out. Now, on to the pros and cons of the New 3DS XL versus the following: Original DS + DSXL: Night and day, no matter which model you end up with for the N3DSXL, it''s a massive improvement unless you''re worried about keeping the system small for travel. More on that in the next section, but in general better viewing...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Peterson', N'kenneth.peterson5889@example.net', '2015-12-15', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Patrick', N'Scott', N'patrick.scott6374@example.com', '2015-12-15', 5, N'This game can look super intimidating when starting out. The setting is nerve-wracking and your character is extremely weak. It intensifies even more when the night approaches as you are hunted by predator zombies. Along with that, you have to loot for supplies and level up your character. A very daunting task, but rewarding if you stick with it. A game like this should not be judged by its story, but what it allows players to do. Players have freedom in an open world zombie environment to discover and do whatever they choose. Whether its just for completing missions, leveling up, finding secrets, or messing around. The game provides all of that along with a story. Plus you can do it with friends cooperatively. You can even expose some of the games design by discovering ways to level up faster. It doesnt really ruin the experience because its just one of the perks in discovering things if you dig deep into the game. Since its a big game, there are occasional bugs that creep in...'),
(N'Emily', N'Webb', N'emily.webb8351@example.net', '2015-12-15', 4, N'great game... i''ve played it 3 times'),
(N'Julie', N'Stewart', N'julie.stewart1200@example.net', '2015-12-15', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Andrew', N'Rogers', N'andrew.rogers4107@example.net', '2015-12-15', 4, N'It does what it supposed to do. My only complaint is how sensitive the clicks are, I am accidentally right clicking all of the time. I will probably get used to it eventually though.'),
(N'Nadia', N'James', N'nadia.james4903@example.net', '2015-12-15', 3, N'couldn''t get this game to work so can''t rate it properly'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Myers', N'carolyn.myers8019@example.net', '2015-12-15', 5, N'I really like it, it works very well, no issues and the lights look really nice!! very impressed and would HIGHLY recommend to anyone!!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Cruz', N'michelle.cruz5518@example.org', '2015-12-15', 4, N'I wish it was more like the old action replay.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Chavez', N'ethan.chavez5815@example.com', '2015-12-15', 5, N'Excellent Game'),
(N'Michael', N'Ruiz', N'michael.ruiz3708@example.net', '2015-12-15', 5, N'Son Loved it'),
(N'Christina', N'Johnson', N'christina.johnson5427@example.com', '2015-12-16', 4, N'Excellent gaming console'),
(N'Omar', N'Morgan', N'omar.morgan3374@example.org', '2015-12-16', 2, N'There''s not much content here. The main board game with amiibo figures is rather boring. Most of the amiibo card mini games are mediocre to bad. The only good part of this game is the Island Escape mini game. And it''s not worth $60.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Chavez', N'nancy.chavez4108@example.com', '2015-12-16', 4, N'Gaming headsets are an excellent way to listen to your PC, Playstation 4 or Xbox One at night while others are sleeping. Gaming with a headset makes it easy to get immersed in your game without paying enormous amounts of money for VR or a 4k tv. With just a few dollars, you can get the excellent sound that immerses you in that new Call of Duty. For $100 you can buy the AG 9 headset that grants you these innovations, but what about those times where you can really crank that surround system up and a game like a true king? However, that little headset that comes with your PS4/Xbox One isn''t the best. That is where the PDP LVL 1 comes in. The PDP LVL 1 is a chat headset that looks to bridge the gap between a premium gaming headset and a chat headset, did PDP complete this task? Lets take a look. PDPs latest line of headsets introduced a few headsets that are unbelievably good for their prices. However, I wasn''t too sure about the quality of the LVL 1 chat headset. At just $20 I didn''t...'),
(N'Mary', N'White', N'mary.white5161@example.org', '2015-12-16', 5, N'My little boy got this for Chanukah and he loves it! No complaints here!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ward', N'andrew.ward5998@example.com', '2015-12-16', 4, N'I don''t even know where to start here. I have been a huge Bethesda fan since Morrowind, and they have never let me down since. I consider myself fortunate to be one of the few who got a Pip boy (cause my wife is awesome and was watching amazon while i was at work). so i will break this down into two parts Game: the great is great, it keeps you drawn in (i have lost close to 40 to 50 hours thus far). The Xbox One did have some noticeable frame issues but it was nothing that completely ruined my fun. The only two issues i have with the game is the lack of quests compared to skyrim and the lack of meaningful different ending. the ending of the game seems to get dull as you have 3 major factions, but all three factions really end in a similar way, which really ruins the replay value in my honest opinion. Pip-Boy What can I say. this is one of the best gimmicks i have dropped money on. I had a Old Iphone 4s i used as a permanent screen., I tried using my Galaxy S5 but did not like how...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Garcia', N'kenneth.garcia6667@example.net', '2015-12-16', 5, N'Well worth the money, even if it quits in 6 months'),
(N'Jason', N'James', N'jason.james8921@example.org', '2015-12-16', 1, N'This game has no main game, just basic tutorials and online play against other players. At launch EA made it where you could buy their "standard" edition, but if you want the rest of the content, you will have to spend almost as much as you did originally making it a $110 game that isn''t even close to being worth it. EA no longer is a top tier developer, they are a bunch of money grubbing scumbags that are out to make a buck and nothing more. Do yourself and everyone else a favor and vote with your dollar, spend it on a company that deserves your hard earned cash for their hard earned efforts to produce a game that''s worth playing.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Sullivan', N'samuel.sullivan5826@example.net', '2015-12-16', 4, N'great game'),
(N'Peter', N'Hall', N'peter.hall2375@example.org', '2015-12-16', 5, N'Received what I wanted.'),
(N'Jack', N'Martin', N'jack.martin8488@example.net', '2015-12-16', 3, N'Wario Land is not a bad game. I actually really like the concept and thought the game was refreshing and original. I like how you get to be the villain who is a greedy little bastard and try and amass a fortune throughout the game. The treasure hunting is fun and reminded me a lot of Kirby''s Super Star for the SNES. That game was a blast and the best part was finding all the treasure pieces. But Wario''s play control does feel a little bit clunky. It would have been nice to have more variety of the mini games to get more coins. If they had a slot machine type of thing like Super Mario Bros 2 had that could have been really fun. The multiple ending sequences are nice and pretty cool enhancing the replay value of the game. Overall it is an enjoyable game for a few minutes but the farther you get in the game the coins seem to be fewer and fewer almost scarce. The game needed more cloud bonus levels like in the original Super Mario Bros where you could get a ton of coins in one shot. Or...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Ward', N'ronald.ward6366@example.com', '2015-12-16', 5, N'This game takes place after the first three Die Hard movies, so the plot will make more sense to you if you''ve watched them prior to playing the game. You play as the protagonist from said movies John McClain. The game does have its own plot, and as stated before, it will make more sense to anyone who watched the movies before playing the game. It''s not just the typical "shoot everything that moves" kind of game. There are certain situations where John needs to be careful, or civilians can die. If that happens, it''s game over. Controls may seem clunky at first but once you get a feel for them, there''s no problem you can''t overcome. One nice mechanic is the auto jump, where John will automatically jump over gaps. However, this can lead to frustration, since if you are crossing a narrow bridge and go too far to the edge, down you go. This can be turned off if you desire, but I prefer to leave it on. The game can get frustrating, since the levels can be long and there are not many...'),
(N'Megan', N'Ortiz', N'megan.ortiz1802@example.org', '2015-12-17', 4, N'Kids liked it'),
(N'Lauren', N'Singh', N'lauren.singh5035@example.com', '2015-12-17', 5, N'Dark Souls II is the sequel to Dark Souls, which is the spiritual successor to Demon''s Souls. Both of the aforementioned games were masterpieces in my opinion, so I had high expectations for Dark Souls II. Unfortunately, those expectations were not met when Dark Souls II was first released. What exactly were my expectations? I wanted a game that is challenging but fair, a beautiful world that you can explore freely (more or less), and a story line that makes one yearn for more. The original release of Dark Souls II was certainly not a bad game, but it felt hollow (pun intended) compared to the original Dark Souls. There were a lot of issues that made the "game feel "cheap" compared to the original. Fortunately, this updated version while still technically the same game is VASTLY improved! SINGLE-PLAYER EXPERIENCE ############################ Let me say that Dark Souls II has an amazing player-versus-player options. There are lots of "covenants" you can join to invade other players,...'),
(N'Paul', N'Powell', N'paul.powell8744@example.com', '2015-12-17', 2, N'This mouse didn''t work for me but it was quality and I think it will be good for a lot of ppl.'),
(N'Paul', N'King', N'paul.king8260@example.org', '2015-12-17', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Carlos', N'Castillo', N'carlos.castillo9100@example.net', '2015-12-17', 5, N'Excelente producto.'),
(N'Helen', N'Allen', N'helen.allen4056@example.net', '2015-12-17', 5, N'Nice.'),
(N'Anita', N'Young', N'anita.young8360@example.com', '2015-12-17', 3, N'It''s about as fun as a wet fart!'),
(N'Carol', N'Singh', N'carol.singh9394@example.org', '2015-12-17', 5, N'great for my game'),
(N'Tyler', N'Hughes', N'tyler.hughes7302@example.net', '2015-12-18', 5, N'At $10 on sale it saved me a few bucks on unlocks and I got that cool tiger mount and portrait. It''s first alternate color is jet black!'),
(N'Robert', N'Wisniewski', N'robert.wisniewski3517@example.org', '2015-12-18', 5, N'This is my 3rd set, not too high profile, just right. I notice they last for about 4-6 months before needing to be replaced.'),
(N'Amy', N'Wood', N'amy.wood7389@example.net', '2015-12-18', 5, N'My two teen sons liked this game a lot.'),
(N'Jack', N'Smith', N'jack.smith1792@example.org', '2015-12-18', 5, N'After being frozen in time for 200 years, I had a lot to catch up on! Super Mutants, talking robots and radiated animals, all helped me chart the seemingly endless wastlands. I love this game so much! After adventuring through ruined cities, I realized their was much more to life than finding my lost son. Picknicking off the carcasses of dead bloatflies, I often sniped at weary travelers from afar off. Taking what I want, I helped myself to other people''s belongings and supplies. After waking up out of cyrogenics, players can choose how they live their life in the nuclear wasteland. The main quest is finding your lost son, but it''s not a requirement. I spent about 30 hours just exploring the wastes before even touching the main story line. That''s the real "Jewel of the Commonwealth", exploring new places, finding loot and killing monsters. You might even find love too. After stumbling into another vault, I found a French robot, locked away for hundreds of years. I adopted her as my...'),
(N'Jack', N'Miller', N'jack.miller4456@example.org', '2015-12-18', 5, N'my kid love so much she started watching the old Perry Mason TV show,'),
(N'Larry', N'Jones', N'larry.jones2644@example.org', '2015-12-18', 5, N'The Kotion G2000 headphone is unique, it lights up with an LED glow. The headphone cord has 3 connectors on the end - Stereo audio and microphone as well as USB for power for the LED light. I was mistaken upon ordering, I thought this headphone could use audio through the USB port however this is not the case. You will definitely need to pay heed if this was your intention. The cool LED light is a great feature, however if the USB ports are full this feature is not needed to operate the headphones. Unlike some of the in-the-ear headsets I''ve used, these are over-the-ear which helps to block out extraneous sounds such as TVs, dogs barking, even other household members ;-) The audio quality is definitely on the higher end as compared to other headsets I''ve used previously. These headphones were provided free of charge for reviewing purposes, these are my genuine thoughts on the G2000 headphones.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Nowak', N'brandon.nowak9678@example.net', '2015-12-19', 3, N'macro software is crap. mouse itself is amazing'),
(N'Amara', N'Patel', N'amara.patel3498@example.net', '2015-12-19', 5, N'Man was this delivered quickly. The item is even better than we had imagined....thank you!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Castillo', N'michelle.castillo2358@example.com', '2015-12-19', 5, N'On eof the best zombie games ever'),
(N'George', N'Singh', N'george.singh7080@example.com', '2015-12-19', 5, N'I love this!! I hate wireless internet for streaming videos. We use our Wii for Netflix a lot and this helped speed it up and keep the connection without any issues.'),
(N'Betty', N'Wood', N'betty.wood5559@example.org', '2015-12-19', 1, N'Attempted to download multiple times with multiple issues arising, don''t own this much computer system to have to deal with this many issues, even attempted direct download from Hires, studios, still worthless.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Mendoza', N'jacob.mendoza2561@example.org', '2015-12-19', 1, N'Will NOT Work on windows 10!!!!! false ad!!!!'),
(N'Emily', N'Long', N'emily.long8211@example.net', '2015-12-20', 5, N'Best Christmas gift I ever got my mom. Also good for kids, I suppose.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Powell', N'nadia.powell3963@example.com', '2015-12-20', 5, N'There are gamers out there buying a game before they do any research and then rate it one star. I played all Telltale games and they rock. These are not your typical games so check you tube game play before you buy. This season pass gives you access to all 5 Episodes. Took me about 8-10 hours beating this game without rushing through the game. It has a great story and wonderful graphics. This is point and click with excellent cutsence. I recommend this game and for the current price it is great.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Sullivan', N'christopher.sullivan3821@example.org', '2015-12-20', 5, N'This game was SO FRUSTRATING until you messed around with the TONS of customization options, turned off the drift assist, tweaked the handling and just kept on trying everything out. Amazingly fun after you figure out your style, to get ahead of the pack and never...mess-up...once.. is very rewarding. It did bother me how fast you could get the very best cars. But i''m here to answer the main question asked about every video game; Is it worth getting for $60? Absolutely. HA! oh yeah the cinematic''s are hilarious because they try to be serious. Remember to Bump It!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Hall', N'ronald.hall6189@example.net', '2015-12-20', 5, N'This is an easy way to buy stuff on Nintendo eShop rather than putting in my credit card.'),
(N'Steven', N'Jenkins', N'steven.jenkins5068@example.net', '2015-12-20', 3, N'love it'),
(N'Robert', N'Hernandez', N'robert.hernandez7355@example.net', '2015-12-20', 5, N'Item as described'),
(N'Amara', N'White', N'amara.white2566@example.org', '2015-12-20', 5, N'Love the game'),
(N'Amara', N'White', N'amara.white2566@example.org', '2015-12-20', 5, N'love the game'),
(N'Justin', N'Jones', N'justin.jones8135@example.org', '2015-12-20', 2, N'This is the game that made me want to buy an X1. I ignored ALL media, marketing, and discussion and went in blind. Honestly, I probably wouldve bought this even if I already knew it was bad because I love Halo so much. Lets start with the MP Pros and Cons. CONS -Playing solo is a nightmare. Teamwork allows for easy power weapon hogging and steam rolling uncoordinated teams. -Slayer maps are badly designed. Too many long sightlines, paths, and not suited for dashes/clambering. Youll hardly ever get to see your attacker until its too late. -BR/DMR fights are nonexistent. Its whoever gets the jump on the other who wins, no more gun fights. -Weird weapon balancing. EVERY weapon is deadly barely any use for BR, DMR, or Carbine close up. -Maps have too many power weapons that spawn too quickly. Probably because they want fast paced matches similar to other fps. PROS -Warzone Assault is for the competitive players. Expertly designed and balanced. Very fair and not too crazy. Fun with...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Moore', N'cheryl.moore3071@example.org', '2015-12-21', 5, N'A most have for people that enjoy the other chroma products from razer. Great keyboard and great price.'),
(N'Diane', N'Thomas', N'diane.thomas1533@example.net', '2015-12-21', 5, N'The product is exactly the same look and functionality as the American version the only difference is in the packaging. A great buy for out of box collectors.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Garcia', N'yuki.garcia1567@example.net', '2015-12-21', 5, N'With the new Star Wars coming out, I wanted to play this game for a bit and it is awesome! I love the fact that this came with all the expansions and I love playing this game in my free time!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Williams', N'benjamin.williams4762@example.org', '2015-12-21', 5, N'is fun and cool'),
(N'Kofi', N'Kim', N'kofi.kim5189@example.org', '2015-12-21', 5, N'Haven''t had this much fun since black flag! Skipped unity after 15 minutes of playing, so I had pretty low expectations coming in, but that changed fast! The combat system is much improved, and reminds me a lot of the arkham series. I''m about halfway through and I''ve only come across a few tailing missions. Also, you can play how you want. You can either go in guns blazing, punching everyone you see, or sneak in the shadows; the latter usually gives you more points. Long story short, this game''s pure fun and has a good amount of variety. I got mine for $35.99 on black Friday, but it''s totally worth the full asking price.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Mitchell', N'nancy.mitchell9492@example.com', '2015-12-21', 5, N'Excellent! And fast shipping!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Wisniewski', N'kenneth.wisniewski4634@example.org', '2015-12-21', 5, N'witcher 3 is beast of a game im playing this more then fallout'),
(N'Olivia', N'Singh', N'olivia.singh3114@example.org', '2015-12-21', 5, N'bought as Christmas gift');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Henry', N'King', N'henry.king3918@example.net', '2015-12-21', 4, N'Very nice wireless mouse but not as precise as I would like for it to be. Maybe higher DPI, possibly 3000-4000 DPI, would be a better choice for this mouse. Very well built and feels solid in the hand. I like you can highly customize the buttons using Logitech''s software. Not a bad mouse, but still plenty of room for improvements if you want to use it for gaming. I think the Logitech G502 would be a better choice.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Jimenez', N'douglas.jimenez9857@example.com', '2015-12-22', 3, N'Sadly, I can only review this based on what I''ve been able to do with this game. I got the digital download from the estore, and if I can make any recommendations I''d strongly recommend against buying from the estore. There seems to be an issue with this game running from certain usb external drives, and while I have no problems what so ever with any other game on my external drive Xenoblade Chronicles X crashes every time I attempt to launch it after the initial logo shows. In trying to get a refund from Nintendo so that I could buy the physical copy they say they cannot offer refunds on digital purchases. So now I''ve been trying to have the credit card company deal with it, and at this point probably won''t be buying the physical copy even if I do get my refund. So I paid ~$64 on a game that crashes on a console. I expect problems with PC games, but at least Steam offers refunds if you find you can''t play it. Sorry for the one star, but I certainly hate my experiences associated...'),
(N'Kofi', N'Thompson', N'kofi.thompson7695@example.net', '2015-12-22', 5, N'my best'),
(N'Kofi', N'Thompson', N'kofi.thompson7695@example.net', '2015-12-22', 5, N'best'),
(N'Kofi', N'Thompson', N'kofi.thompson7695@example.net', '2015-12-22', 5, N'love'),
(N'Sharon', N'Richardson', N'sharon.richardson8153@example.com', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Best video game I''ve played in a while. The last one was Black Flag and I liked that one.'),
(N'Joan', N'Boyd', N'joan.boyd3056@example.net', '2015-12-22', 5, N'This is a perfect replacement for my aging MX518 which replaced my MX510 back in the day. The G400s is the exact same shape and seems a bit more sensitive which is great. It works perfectly with Windows 10. I hope Logitech continues to make this mouse. I''ve tried other mice but none of them fit my hand perfectly like this one.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Sanders', N'samuel.sanders3610@example.com', '2015-12-22', 4, N'My brother enjoys this game.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Campbell', N'carlos.campbell8860@example.org', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Love it. Not as good as 1 and 2 but still awesome'),
(N'Steven', N'Webb', N'steven.webb2674@example.org', '2015-12-22', 5, N'It plays like FC3 with a new story line and a couple added things so if your familiar with that you''ll love this one also (if ain''t broken don''t fix it ) Vehicles auto-drive , that''s kinda nice Graphics are really good if you have the power to run it PC gamer from way back so I LOVE story line games (campaign) more so than multiplayer UPlay works fine don''t listen to the negative people DRM''s are here to stay , granted UPlay is my least favorite of the 3 major ones I have a extensive library in all 3 with well over 200 games (user name in all 3 is same as user name here if you want to check my profile out) VERY rarely do I run into a game that won''t play MY RIG : EVGA Z87 FTW i7-4770k CoolerMaster EVO 212 (push/pull fans) 16gb of TEAM ram at 2133mhz Samsung 250gb SSD WD 10,000rpm Raptor 500gb EVGA 750w GOLD psu EVGA 780SC gpu Rosewill Super Tower Case BLACKHAWK-ULTRA WIN10 Acer K272HUL 2560x1440'),
(N'Andrew', N'Hall', N'andrew.hall6205@example.net', '2015-12-22', 3, N'Ok'),
(N'Christina', N'Jones', N'christina.jones7484@example.org', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Shooting at the slow walking snow monsters was a blast of the past, great fun to have!'),
(N'Eric', N'Kowalski', N'eric.kowalski6522@example.com', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Love this game!!!'),
(N'Donna', N'Flores', N'donna.flores2214@example.com', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel is set in a different part of the world as Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky. Players take on the role of members of the Thors Military Academy in the Erobonian Empire, a place where social status is everything. The turn-based combat system is similar to what was seen in Trails in the Sky, where every character''s actions appear on a list on the left side of the screen. You move your characters around the environment and take advantage of positioning and special attacks to battle multiple enemies at once or avoid incoming assaults. An important component of the combat system is your ability to manipulate the turn order. I have received my game a little in advance, so I have had time to experiment with many of the games mechanics, and so far I have been impressed with the amount of strategy involved. Moving before enemies has a number of benefits; if you''re smart about manipulating your turn order, you can go multiple times in a row....'),
(N'Andrea', N'Tanaka', N'andrea.tanaka4865@example.com', '2015-12-22', 4, N'I don''t know why this game gets a bad rap. It has flaws but is a nice addition to the Sonic series and quite fun to play'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Ramirez', N'benjamin.ramirez4566@example.com', '2015-12-22', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Deborah', N'Davis', N'deborah.davis9537@example.org', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Love it.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nguyen', N'benjamin.nguyen5413@example.org', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Another game I''ve played a bit of but really haven''t had a chance to get really into it yet. Installed under Steam with no problem and cranked up and ran right off the bat. The game looked very good. I went thru a bit of the intro and to the first part and then had to stop as time pressed me. Not a bad look and feel for the time I spent in it. Not Bad.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Richardson', N'kyle.richardson8349@example.org', '2015-12-22', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Noah', N'Bell', N'noah.bell7105@example.org', '2015-12-23', 5, N'Much needed. works perfectly'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Robinson', N'cheryl.robinson1428@example.com', '2015-12-23', 4, N'Just Dance has been a favorite in our house over the last several years. Not only does it encourage your children and sometimes adults to get up off the couch but they can dance along with their friends and even through come competition into the mix by seeing who can get the moves down correctly. Our 9 year old daughter enjoyed the Just Dance Disney Party 2 on the songs that she knew. Sadly, there are many songs that she did not know in the beginning. I think that if she had watched more of the movies and television shows, she would have enjoyed the dances more but she was so focused on learning the words she forgot to dance, at least for the songs she did not know before playing. She recently had a sleep over where they watched Descendants, again. Afterwards we put in the Just Dance game and off they went. Her favorites were the songs from the movie Descendants and luckily there were five on this game. There were also five move from the Teen Beach Movie 2. The rest of the songs...'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts4261@example.org', '2015-12-23', 5, N'Excellent game! Very Challenging.'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts4261@example.org', '2015-12-23', 4, N'Excellent game!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Morgan', N'stephanie.morgan7915@example.org', '2015-12-23', 5, N'These work well for the 360. Still haven''t tried it with the bluetooth, but can''t see any reason why it wouldn''t be fine.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Chavez', N'kimberly.chavez8322@example.net', '2015-12-23', 5, N'a+'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ferreira', N'kenneth.ferreira4056@example.com', '2015-12-23', 4, N'Very calming game, love exploring the ocean and seeing all the creatures! The music is amazing, the visuals are great for the Wii, and love just exploring at my own pace. It is slow, but this is not a fast game to play, its to relax and enjoy!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Richardson', N'andrea.richardson9565@example.net', '2015-12-23', 1, N'This is a complete fiasco. There are so many programming errors, glitches and problems that its not worth getting into all the details, but I''ll at least mention that there is a more or less complete lack of real random number generation. Some of the games actually simply do not work at all. I only still have this in my collection as an example of the worst possible programming you can find on the PS2.'),
(N'Judith', N'Robinson', N'judith.robinson7318@example.net', '2015-12-23', 5, N'thank you'),
(N'Mei', N'Ross', N'mei.ross7193@example.net', '2015-12-23', 5, N'Absolutely love the halo franchise! And this game lives up to the halo tradition of a great story and great multiplayer!'),
(N'Mei', N'Ross', N'mei.ross7193@example.net', '2015-12-23', 5, N'Brings back great memories! Love the gears of war franchise!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Gonzalez', N'tomasz.gonzalez7382@example.net', '2015-12-23', 2, N'Graphics are below standards for a Call of Duty game (having the hdmi connection helps a bit), but not the worst I''ve seen for a 2015 fps (Battlefield Hardline was horrible), lack of character customization, frame rate is sluggish at times, lack of campaign (if they could do it for advanced warfare then could have done it for black ops 3), constant server disconnection errors (appears to be a problem across all platforms), adding black ops 1 to this doesn''t make sense. The majority of COD fans already have the original and if not they could have easily bought it at GameStop for $10. I only bought it because it was on sale for $30. The came can be fun if you''re able to complete a match without getting disconnected. With what you''re given the msrp for the PS3 and Xbox 360 versions should be no more than $20-$25 max in my opinion. Half a game should be half the price. Obviously it''s an attempt to push the newer generation consoles onto consumers by stripping down the game.'),
(N'Joan', N'Wang', N'joan.wang7069@example.com', '2015-12-23', 5, N'amazingly fun and nostalgic'),
(N'Wei', N'Stewart', N'wei.stewart7874@example.net', '2015-12-23', 5, N'First off, the controller is worth every penny. Second, my Xbox turns on faster than my tv does now lol, lol. Merry Christmas to me.!!!!!!!!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nelson', N'benjamin.nelson7948@example.net', '2015-12-23', 5, N'Great gift for my nephew.'),
(N'Megan', N'Mendoza', N'megan.mendoza4956@example.net', '2015-12-24', 5, N'Exactly as described.'),
(N'Megan', N'Ortiz', N'megan.ortiz1802@example.org', '2015-12-24', 5, N'Works great. Kids use it all the time'),
(N'Megan', N'Mendoza', N'megan.mendoza3458@example.net', '2015-12-24', 1, N'Not that great when there are hardly any other people in this world besides the bad men'''', Gets boring quickly'''''),
(N'George', N'Cooper', N'george.cooper8090@example.net', '2015-12-24', 5, N'I love it. Best racing games for PS4'),
(N'Ashley', N'Sanchez', N'ashley.sanchez3447@example.org', '2015-12-24', 5, N'I like the fashion game it is very cool'),
(N'Debra', N'Ross', N'debra.ross9959@example.org', '2015-12-24', 5, N'I hate to sound like a fanboy, but the Razer Naga is the best MMO gaming mouse I''ve tried. I''ve tried alot of mice. This will be my second Naga. My previous one wore out after over 5 years of using it more than I should have. It''s only that the button under the scroll wheel wore out. I''m surprised that any mouse lasted as long as the Naga did. The buttons take some getting used to. It took me about a year to consistently use all of the side buttons. The last row always felt kind of awkward to reach. Those are buttons I rarely use anyways. One thing I noticed about this particular model of Naga is that my previous one had a switch that changed between the keyboard numbers and the number pad. This one has no switch and only functions off the keyboard numbers. The mouse is a good size and the buttons are responsive. My biggest gripe with other gaming mice are that they are often oddly shaped or way too large, and are made of cheap materials.'),
(N'William', N'Morales', N'william.morales7892@example.org', '2015-12-24', 4, N'I like thegmae, there are some parts that are hard to get past. The game runs faster than i remember also.'),
(N'William', N'Morales', N'william.morales7892@example.org', '2015-12-24', 3, N'Not what I thought it was, so it was returned the day it was received.'),
(N'William', N'Morales', N'william.morales7892@example.org', '2015-12-24', 5, N'Love Captain America. He is fun to play in the game.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Ward', N'samuel.ward7058@example.net', '2015-12-24', 5, N'Brand new, works perfectly, and a great new game that expanded on older games of its kind! It''s a fun, adorable, casual game to play, whether it''s single player, or if you play with another person.'),
(N'Omar', N'Long', N'omar.long6710@example.net', '2015-12-24', 2, N'My review is not for the game but the port. i get frustrated playing off line because the xbone says the dlc is not on the console but it is'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Martin', N'stephanie.martin1042@example.com', '2015-12-25', 5, N'No complaints'),
(N'Noah', N'Stewart', N'noah.stewart7192@example.com', '2015-12-25', 4, N'Since the recent game updates, the game has a majority of improvement, the Ai for racers is fixed to give a challenge and the cops...ACTUALLY CHASE YOU. And I love the new update for the decals, parts and Lights onto the cars, still, they just need to make it online as well, and I really wish they would add some new cars in soon.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Green', N'jerry.green6836@example.com', '2015-12-25', 5, N'Came quick in good condition. This is the most addictive game I''ve come across. Eating, sleeping, and fulfilling obligations take a backseat to playing Civ II.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Miller', N'dennis.miller9564@example.org', '2015-12-25', 5, N'These are perfect, easy to install add on''s for xbox one controllers. They greatly increase the grip and feel of the controller. Love these things!!!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Suzuki', N'daniel.suzuki9648@example.org', '2015-12-25', 2, N'game lacks graphics'),
(N'Katherine', N'Ortiz', N'katherine.ortiz6050@example.net', '2015-12-25', 1, N'Awful! Ridiculous! I bought this thinking that my girls would have fun playing in front of the camera. Unfortunately, there is no way to use this as a camera. No way. You can''t just turn it on and view the room. Okay, so I turn on the Dance Central Spotlight, we''ll just do it from within the game. Nope! Can''t be done. I couldn''t figure out how to see yourself. What is the point of a camera that can''t be used as a camera? Called customer service. He just kind of laughed. "No, you can''t use the camera as a camera." Do not buy.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Bell', N'matthew.bell5964@example.org', '2015-12-25', 1, N'A week and a half later still no answer from customer support. One stars due to software. Corsair forgot to put a option for press and hold key stroke! Huge problem for many games. Doesn''t adjust as much as I would like for thumb positioning'),
(N'Susan', N'Sanders', N'susan.sanders4497@example.com', '2015-12-25', 5, N'Although not a Black Ops fanatic, I bought this game per request of some close friends. I am Blown away with the content of this game! Although the graphics are fine (not ground braking), the campaign (although a little short) has been a blast. Even the story has a nice twist to it ;) I refinished the game in Realistic mode (insane!!) and that got me an extra 12/14h or so. I have not spend enough time online with it to foment, but the few hours I did play multiplayer where fun :) Definitely buy this people, a great step up from Black Ops II :)'),
(N'Laura', N'Okonkwo', N'laura.okonkwo6928@example.com', '2015-12-25', 5, N'I''ve played NFS since Underground 1. I have bought every NFS since Most Wanted hoping for another game that was just as good as it or Underground. This is it. I love the cut scenes, I can never wait to see what happens next. Unlike most games, my addiction to this game didn''t make it short lived. The game has a good amount of content to keep you busy, but not too much to make you grow tired and want to set it down. Customization is back! Gorgeous graphics, phenomenal car list, classic NFS arcade handling, more event modes, etc. I''ll admit, tuning and performance upgrades aren''t exact as they are in Forza, but for NFS, I am impressed. The characters are very likable. My only regret is the garage isn''t bigger. I want more than just 5 cars!! I love it, 10/10 would recommend to any car enthusiast. I hope they keep on this route and make more sequels to this.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Martin', N'sharon.martin8707@example.com', '2015-12-25', 5, N'Great product at a great price!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Ruiz', N'ashley.ruiz9368@example.com', '2015-12-26', 4, N'Not a lot different from the ps3 version, new difficulty is ridiculously hard. Still, a great game for the price.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Roberts', N'tomasz.roberts1844@example.com', '2015-12-26', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Linda', N'Nowak', N'linda.nowak5934@example.net', '2015-12-26', 2, N'Fan stopped operating after first use. Charge ports still operational. Would not recommend or buy again.'),
(N'Carol', N'Kowalski', N'carol.kowalski4885@example.com', '2015-12-26', 5, N'Another great Lego game at half the price of physical stores. Arrived sealed and brand new. My entire family, from 6 yrs to 36 yrs, enjoys playing this game.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Walker', N'samuel.walker4109@example.com', '2015-12-26', 5, N'Great game. Still playing the hell out of it a month and a half later. I think everyone expected the typical glitches these games offer, especially when they come out. Only big complaint I have is that I cannot kill or move Marcy and her husband (I think) Jun to another settlement. They are by far the games most annoying characters.'),
(N'Amara', N'Harris', N'amara.harris3281@example.com', '2015-12-26', 3, N'better deal than from their own website, but i didn''t cause it so i''m just going to protect her'),
(N'Joan', N'Martinez', N'joan.martinez8128@example.org', '2015-12-26', 5, N'all good'),
(N'Angela', N'Adams', N'angela.adams5035@example.net', '2015-12-26', 5, N'For all Mario fans, it''s addicting'),
(N'Zachary', N'Gonzalez', N'zachary.gonzalez6988@example.net', '2015-12-26', 5, N'I''m writing this review for a friend whom I have purchased this for and for the quality of the microphone. While I will not be able to go in depth in the quality of the sound, my friend who is using this has mentioned numerous times that I "Must have spend a lot of money to get these" and that they sound great. Sound stage is good, as he can pick me out on first person shooters and it''s a well balanced sound. Not too much bass, not too much tinny sound. Granted, for what you pay for, you shouldn''t expect audiophile audio, but it''s pretty good. As for the microphone, from what I''ve heard when we use steam and teamspeak, it''s amazing. The software has different sound types you can change your voice into, from high pitched, to low pitched, all the way to sounding like a monster. For our pathfinder groupings, this adds a whole new layer of dimension to the games., It''s fun, sounds good, and he likes it. The only downside is it heats up after 2-3 hours of continuous use according to him.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Martinez', N'amanda.martinez6069@example.net', '2015-12-26', 5, N'great'),
(N'Amanda', N'Martinez', N'amanda.martinez6069@example.net', '2015-12-26', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Stewart', N'nicholas.stewart6007@example.org', '2015-12-26', 5, N'excellent seller. 100% recommended'),
(N'Helen', N'Alvarez', N'helen.alvarez1175@example.org', '2015-12-27', 4, N'The Fallout series along with the Elder Scrolls series have been regarded as the top tier western style RPGs of the past 10 years. I have been moderately aware of Bethesda and their consistent critical praises from all of their games since The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion, but I have always been intimidated by the large scale of their open worlds, deep RPG mechanics and more specifically the amount of time I would have to invest in order to get the full experience. So I decided to take a leap of faith and purchased Fallout 4 for my PS4 in hopes that all the hype surrounding this series would take me under. I am currently 32 hours in and I have to say that I am rather impressed by the amount of depth and detail Bethesda has crammed into this game. The world of Fallout is set in a post-apocalyptic setting based in Boston, Massachusetts during the 50s. Personally I hate games that use the 1950s America aesthetic as part of the story, with Bioshock: Infinite being an example, however I...'),
(N'Mark', N'Ivanov', N'mark.ivanov4503@example.org', '2015-12-27', 4, N'Fun sassy shooter. Superior humor throughout game.'),
(N'Megan', N'Powell', N'megan.powell8587@example.net', '2015-12-27', 5, N'my son is enjoying this game'),
(N'Kyle', N'Walker', N'kyle.walker9898@example.com', '2015-12-27', 5, N'This thing is amazing, check up the unboxing and light review here guys! I am very happy with this purchase! You have to check out the review here to get the full understanding of just how many light combos this thing has! https://www.youtube.com/edit?o=U&feature=vm&video_id=UccV4MMN_2w'),
(N'Ronald', N'Chavez', N'ronald.chavez3852@example.org', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Takes a bit to get use to as expected. I cant go without it now.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Martin', N'yuki.martin1559@example.com', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Probably the best RTS today (i like the old SC as well) Great price for Battle Chest bundle'),
(N'Sofia', N'Adams', N'sofia.adams1857@example.com', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Old game but still fun to play.'),
(N'Wei', N'Sullivan', N'wei.sullivan2561@example.com', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Awesome game!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Barnes', N'ashley.barnes7470@example.org', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Been using it for for over half a year works great no problems no tears in the cord, like the game cube one i order from someone else.'),
(N'Angela', N'Okonkwo', N'angela.okonkwo8331@example.net', '2015-12-27', 5, N'... for some good old LAN fun.'),
(N'Angela', N'Okonkwo', N'angela.okonkwo8331@example.net', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Very fun game! Lots of funny emotes and actions, oversized weapons, and awesome robotic rides. I only wish this game had been more popular.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Raghunathan', N'ryan.raghunathan1169@example.com', '2015-12-27', 5, N'I have played for days on end and I am able to keep going'),
(N'Brian', N'King', N'brian.king1792@example.org', '2015-12-27', 5, N'12 year old was excited when it came. He purchase it with birthday money.'),
(N'Laura', N'Hall', N'laura.hall3235@example.net', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Came fast, great condition and good price. It is an amazing game! best I have played in a while.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Smith', N'sarah.smith3481@example.net', '2015-12-27', 5, N'Awesome game.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Baker', N'gregory.baker1531@example.com', '2015-12-27', 4, N'[Includes VERY MINOR SPOILERS for the first hour of the game, ONLY] I bought this for my little sister for Christmas, but luckily, we live together so I''ve been able to watch her play it. She''s still relatively early in the game, but so far it has been pretty spooky. It started slow... (I may have fallen asleep during the initial few minutes of the game) but once our main character Amanda (which also happens to be my little sister''s name, so that was a pretty neat turn of events) got to the ship where her mother mysteriously vanished 15 years before, it started getting spookier. There have been some weirdly difficult moments so far (we''re both veteran gamers, but she got lost trying to find a vent on the floor to crawl through) but the atmosphere is pretty awesome. For example, right before she came upon some body bags, there was a creepy sound (like a pterodactyl stretching, which is obviously the sound that aliens make, right?) and a shadowy figure running by in the distance. I...'),
(N'Donald', N'Ferreira', N'donald.ferreira5828@example.org', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Turtle Beach is a great company. The sound and voice quality are always amazing. I ordered 3 headsets and my kids love them. They were packaged well and arrived quickly.'),
(N'Steven', N'Jenkins', N'steven.jenkins6128@example.net', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Great family game. Has multiple player games such as tennis which can engage a family on family game night for hours.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Ali', N'sofia.ali3172@example.com', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Great Product'),
(N'Kofi', N'Baker', N'kofi.baker4323@example.net', '2015-12-28', 5, N'One of my kids favorite game...works well in their Wii..Arrived on time...excellent gift...'),
(N'Kofi', N'Baker', N'kofi.baker4323@example.net', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Worked great in my kids Wii...work as expected...'),
(N'Scott', N'Reed', N'scott.reed2244@example.com', '2015-12-28', 5, N'I''m a big Skyrim fan and had played "The Last of Us" until I could play it blindfolded, so I needed something new. A friend recommended the Uncharted series and I was not disappointed. Drake is droll and self deprecating and I fell in love with Sully right away. Good story, challenging enemies and levels and a rocking good story!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Sullivan', N'douglas.sullivan1664@example.com', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Perfect gift for my 4 and 7 year old! Great gift for the whole family as well. Love the new levels! Hours of enjoyment and family bonding time'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Kim', N'kathleen.kim1541@example.org', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Good buy'),
(N'Victoria', N'Jimenez', N'victoria.jimenez1033@example.net', '2015-12-28', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Miller', N'kathleen.miller3827@example.net', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Omar', N'Ivanov', N'omar.ivanov8375@example.net', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Richard', N'James', N'richard.james5109@example.org', '2015-12-28', 3, N'Easiest and best way I can describe this game to people who have played Dead Island, it''s a better looking, slower, more serious version of Dead Island, the game has tossed in aspects from other popular games..(Lockpicking from Fallout, running and climbing ala Mirror''s Edge, everything else Dead Island) Not a bad game at all, but way too familiar to be stand out much in this day and age.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Ali', N'stephen.ali5406@example.org', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Real simple. Code arrived in my email in minutes. I went into Steam, Games, Activate A Product On Steam, put in the code. Now we wait for some new content!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Roberts', N'cynthia.roberts1581@example.net', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Seasons are a lot different and make the game more difficult. Like it a lot.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Howard', N'kenneth.howard5754@example.org', '2015-12-28', 5, N'My favorite gaming mouse, hands down. I''ve had one for 3 or 4 years and bought this one for a second computer.'),
(N'Angela', N'Howard', N'angela.howard7978@example.com', '2015-12-28', 5, N'Amazing little device, if your not "computer capable" a 5 min youtube video will teach you whatever you need to know about the cronus and how to use it. the thing has so many capabilities its insane. i don''t understand all the 1 star reviews, you must be a complete idiot to not not look up a tutorial if your having trouble, and if the items defective, so what? this is amazon get a free replacement'),
(N'George', N'Morris', N'george.morris6532@example.org', '2015-12-29', 5, N'Any keyboard with a numeric pad can be used as a very basic gaming keyboard. People saying this product is trash shouldn''t have bought this simple keyboard in the first place. I actually wasn''t buying this for my gaming, I bought it for work at my office. I love backlit keyboards but honestly the ones I have at home that I game with are just not appropriate for a professional office so I wanted something more low key. This keyboard is great, I''m not experiencing any issues about the Enter key like some in the reviews. The keys are quiet and have a pleasing tactile response. There is no lame/useless or even questionable data that gets installed with this which is great, just simple plug and type. The red looks kind of orange, the blue is..blue, and the purple isn''t that vibrant, but again I wasn''t buying this keyboard to be very bright or loud. Overall I''m totally pleased with it. I also love that you can turn off the Windows key response since the base of my pinky finger tends to...'),
(N'Justin', N'Lopez', N'justin.lopez5015@example.org', '2015-12-29', 5, N'GOAT AS CAN BE. BRING BACK THE GREATEST GAME OF ALL TIME'),
(N'Kelly', N'Barnes', N'kelly.barnes4110@example.com', '2015-12-29', 2, N'Worked for about a week then broke'),
(N'Nadia', N'Boyd', N'nadia.boyd3658@example.com', '2015-12-29', 5, N'A must buy for R.E fans !'),
(N'Robert', N'Suzuki', N'robert.suzuki4859@example.com', '2015-12-29', 5, N'masterpiece'),
(N'Lisa', N'Hill', N'lisa.hill4380@example.net', '2015-12-29', 5, N'This was a Xmas present for my Grandkids.....they have a Xbox 360 and love using the Kinetic function that allows groups to play games rogether and have more fun. They love this game and specifically asked for this title as a gift.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Ruiz', N'olivia.ruiz9107@example.net', '2015-12-29', 5, N'Great design and it was shipped fast'),
(N'Olivia', N'Ruiz', N'olivia.ruiz9107@example.net', '2015-12-29', 5, N'Great price and it was shipped fast'),
(N'Yuki', N'Ramos', N'yuki.ramos1534@example.net', '2015-12-29', 4, N'This game is great for this kind of game. You go though many different kinds of boxes each with a different theme and new challenge to add to the game. Each box has levels which you earn stars to unlock the nest box. And you do not need to worry about getting stuck cause you cant do a level, you can just skip it and move on to the next but in order to get enough stars to move on you must do better on the others you do, if you skip one. But I would not worry about getting stuck cause you don''t have enough stars, it didn''t happen that much for me and if your patient enough to keep trying you will get it. And don''t expect to be able to do them all cause their are some that no matter how good you are you won''t be able to do, but that''s normal for this game. And don''t expect this game to be done in a day or two. It took me weeks to finish it and not because it was that difficult, but BEWARE no matter what other people say this game is stressful. This game is best fit for people who are...'),
(N'Deborah', N'Nowak', N'deborah.nowak4428@example.org', '2015-12-29', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Nathan', N'Roberts', N'nathan.roberts8517@example.org', '2015-12-29', 5, N'It''s super fun to meet and befriend with all these Yokais~the game is pretty addicting. I think I will watch the animation after I played this game!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Jimenez', N'kyle.jimenez2073@example.net', '2015-12-29', 3, N'its cool but a bit difficult for younger kids, my 10 year old says its really hard'),
(N'Angela', N'Morris', N'angela.morris9187@example.com', '2015-12-29', 5, N'My kiddo had never played Pokemon before, but she instantly LOVED this game. The graphics and story line were as expected. The difficulty was on par. All in all, good purchase and good value!'),
(N'Brian', N'Cruz', N'brian.cruz9750@example.org', '2015-12-29', 5, N'Great system. Fits nicely in my bag, great features with the Internet connectivity. My first handheld was a Nintendo DSi; feels about the same size despite the extra features. Would''ve been nice if Nintendo added a Bluetooth for wireless headphones, but that doesn''t detract from the system. The base system doesn''t come with a charger, so don''t forget to buy one! Learned the hard way and am mooching off my sister''s until mine comes in.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Walker', N'andrea.walker2015@example.com', '2015-12-29', 2, N'Take forever to charge. The charging station is kind of dinky.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Sanders', N'tyler.sanders1491@example.com', '2015-12-29', 4, N'Occasionally does not work unless you play with the plug ins but an excellent deal for a dual port that looks pretty cool.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Sanders', N'tyler.sanders1491@example.com', '2015-12-29', 4, N'Battery doesnt last near as long as the other controllers we have but decent price for an additional controller that works.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Gonzalez', N'kimberly.gonzalez7888@example.com', '2015-12-30', 5, N'I use these cables over the official charger. These work great. A little short, but I haven''t had any problems with these cables at all. Get these, and a regular USB charger. Much better overall value.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Kim', N'nancy.kim2634@example.org', '2015-12-30', 4, N'Great game, lots of length which is much needed in the Wii U''s starving library and game droughts. Will probably be playing this until Zelda U gets released!'),
(N'Peter', N'Cook', N'peter.cook2067@example.org', '2015-12-30', 3, N'I''ve owned the Xbox 360 Microsoft wheel and wanted one for my Xbox One to play Forza 6 and Horizon 2. Also just ordered F1 2016. In any case, I was disappointed that the shifter was a separate clamp on mechanism from the wheel as it took too much space for my set up. And the paddles seemed cheap being made of stainless steel in my opinion. Also, the USB cable that connects to the console was too short for me although an extender cable worked well. On carpet, the foot pedals didn''t slide as the flip anti-skid worked well. The instructions were so-so and had to look online for more info.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Evans', N'carlos.evans1883@example.com', '2015-12-30', 5, N'... or, almost. So this is the 2nd toybox expansion piece along side the toybox takeover. This one is about racing, and like takeover, you''re able to use all of your infinity character collection during gameplay. Speedway also adds any vehicle you''ve managed to unlock in your toybox to be used during gameplay as well. Yes, even the power disc only ones, granted you have the disc. So this opens up some truly quirky options: Venom in a teacup, Elsa in a snowmobile. You get the idea. Racing is done three different ways: Time trial, grand prix or single race, and a battle race. Different characters pose no advantage over another, but vehicles do handle differently. The exception here is any Cars figures you may have collected, being that they can be leveled up, gaining certain race affective abilities. Track diversity is decent, but there aren''t many, clocking in at 9 total. If you enjoy the driving and its somewhat wonky mechanics, youll have a blast with this.'),
(N'Frank', N'Rogers', N'frank.rogers4945@example.com', '2015-12-30', 5, N'Works perfect, nice upgrade to the PS3'),
(N'Angela', N'Sullivan', N'angela.sullivan2062@example.com', '2015-12-30', 5, N'Video games are everything to a kid, well I have two boys who enjoy playing games and when I was a kid I was the same way, to keep their entertainment going I always shop online for low ball prices and I am so glad I was able to find a bargain price with this seller. My kids were so excited when the games arrived fairly quickly in the mail. THe games played well as promised by the seller. Thanks for keeping my kids entertained.'),
(N'Betty', N'Henderson', N'betty.henderson3861@example.com', '2015-12-30', 1, N'Razer has the worst quality products of any gaming accessories I have ever used. I had the Onza TE and after less than two years the triggers had some issues when I pushed them down all the way it would only register as half a button press. So when I saw that Razer came out with the Sabertooth I thought maybe it was time for an upgrade anyways. After having the controller for about a year I had trigger issues with this two. This time even when the the RT button was released the button would pop back up all the way but on the game it would still react like the button was pressed until I pressed the button hard three times in a row to get it "unstuck" I of course wrote in to Razer simply to ask if there was any known problems or if there was anything that I could do to fix this issue. They told me to send in all this information to see if they would be able to send me a new controller... Of course there was nothing they could do for me. Luckily by the time I got that bad news I gave...'),
(N'Mary', N'Ruiz', N'mary.ruiz1108@example.org', '2015-12-30', 5, N'This is a must have for anyone who purchased the Infinity 3.0. It works with ALL of your characters 1.0, 2.0, and 3.0! Lots of fun. It''s sort of a daiblo style game with infinity characters. Pretty awesome!'),
(N'Susan', N'Mitchell', N'susan.mitchell7304@example.org', '2015-12-30', 5, N'Tales of Zestiria is the latest in Namcos Tales of Series to grace us with its symphony of characters that reach out from the abyss and try to maintain their innocence in the face of their destinies. Being special for more than one reason, this latest entry into the series is not only releasing on the 20th Anniversary, but has also broken a trend that it once had by simultaneously releasing on more than a single platform with Sonys PlayStation 3 and 4, as well as the PC. Taking on the role of Sorey, players will get to explore a brand new world in a manner that has not been done before with the series. Gone are the areas, the zones, and the sub-zones that all required their own loading times. Having moved instead and pushing the PS3 to its higher limits in which the PS4 easily followed, Tales of Zestiria takes a more open-like world approach in order to tell its tale. Having gone in this direction only enhances the experience to be had. Running through the wide open fields actually...'),
(N'Maria', N'James', N'maria.james1992@example.net', '2015-12-30', 5, N'My son is happy with this set. We bought it around Thanksgiving so we got a good deal.'),
(N'Amara', N'Coleman', N'amara.coleman3462@example.com', '2015-12-30', 5, N'This product meets all expectations that I needed. I like the state as arrival at their destination. Brand new. I highly recommend this product for its excellent quality. The quality and functionality of the item is much better than similar. Prevents fingers slide by mistake when playing.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Russell', N'nicole.russell6801@example.com', '2015-12-30', 5, N'Absolutely loved this game. Has great replay value and I imagine even more with the DLC''s (haven''t tried).'),
(N'Paul', N'Reyes', N'paul.reyes7579@example.com', '2015-12-30', 3, N'The game is enjoyable and stomping around in a Mech... err... Titan is fun but there''s nothing stand out or exceptional about the game. On the plus side they released all the DLC for free to get more people playing. If I''d actually paid for the DLC I would probably be upset at this move but I guess it gets more people playing which might have been the problem. It''s not bad for $5 but it''s online only and with the luke warm reception it received and the free release of all the DLC I suspect EA will probably ax the servers in a year.'),
(N'Jack', N'Gray', N'jack.gray4406@example.com', '2015-12-30', 5, N'On time and working perfectly who could ask for more'),
(N'Anna', N'Morales', N'anna.morales8740@example.com', '2015-12-30', 1, N'Wow what a repeat.'),
(N'Gary', N'Nowak', N'gary.nowak3799@example.org', '2015-12-30', 5, N'Fun game with a friend.'),
(N'Charles', N'Morris', N'charles.morris4884@example.net', '2015-12-30', 5, N'He maybe Bowser Jr. But its a great reminder of Super Mario World for SUPNES! The only reason I got this figure is because of the design and artwork.'),
(N'Ashley', N'White', N'ashley.white6779@example.net', '2015-12-30', 5, N'FOR MY GRANDSON, HE LOVES IT.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Adams', N'jonathan.adams2384@example.org', '2015-12-30', 5, N'This is a very convenient charging unit. I had a similar unit for the PS3 that has worked well for years. This one is just as nice, and is much easier than fiddling with PS4 USB connectors.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Cooper', N'mateo.cooper9435@example.com', '2015-12-31', 5, N'Got it as a present for my brother who loves it. Definitely will buy from this seller again :)'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2015-12-31', 5, N'every single james bond video game are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best every single james bond video game rocks tomorrow never dies video game for the playstation 1 is the greatest video game in the universe a true classic the best of the best tomorrow never dies video game for the playstation 1 rocks ^_^'),
(N'Wei', N'Taylor', N'wei.taylor2583@example.com', '2015-12-31', 5, N'OMG this game is so bad ass, I am 36 hours into it and I''ve barely scratched the surface.'),
