(N'Betty', N'Chen', N'betty.chen4600@example.com', '2015-12-31', 2, N'I don''t think this game is good it is I beat the game before and it was ruined for me the levels were empty feeling it was a crappy game I like about this game is the animals and the graphics. The Gnasty Gnorc boss fight was more like a chase instead of destruction I think this is a touch of old flights and bad name levels who could name a boss called Blowhard? I give this an above average 2 stars out of 5'),
(N'Betty', N'Chen', N'betty.chen4600@example.com', '2015-12-31', 1, N'I hate this game this is a hard game I played up to level 10 I cannot get the crystal from H2 OH NO I die a lot my brother cannot even get through it it is not fair that I get a game like this but I do like the graphics though. I give this an above average 0 stars out of 5.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Howard', N'hiroshi.howard2733@example.com', '2015-12-31', 5, N'Great game. I''m having a blast, solid gameplay, gorgeous graphics, interesting new Pokemon. Love the Poke Mon Amie and Super Training.'),
(N'Karen', N'Myers', N'karen.myers9592@example.com', '2015-12-31', 4, N'Worked well for modding 2 different ps2''s.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Evans', N'patricia.evans6730@example.org', '2016-01-01', 5, N'best characters and story ever'),
(N'Peter', N'Bennett', N'peter.bennett2438@example.org', '2016-01-01', 1, N'Nice graphics and good game play. The gore is a bit too extreme. The X-ray special move are just gore fest. When I bought it I knew there was some stuff locked behind DLC but I figured it won''t bother me. The problem is DLC stuff is right there on character selection screen. It reminds me my game is not complete every time on that screen. But that was still okay. I am stronger than their marketing team, I figured. But then I had friends over and some of them have already purchased some DLC. Some want to try out movie characters. Some even said they will pay for it. Yes $5 is not a lot of money but this is a shady practice. And I don''t want to support it. So sadly I am going to sell my copy and hope that SF5 doesn''t do this shady practice.'),
(N'John', N'Young', N'john.young5324@example.com', '2016-01-01', 5, N'Best teen shooter out there.'),
(N'Henry', N'Nguyen', N'henry.nguyen3274@example.net', '2016-01-01', 5, N'Wow, I haven''t used a Playstation since the first one. This is a great system, the graphics are unbelievable. I like how the game Uncharted is bundled with this. Uncharted is actually a Playstation 3 game that they have put on steroids for the ps4. The graphics are updated and the game makes use of the new gamepad area on the new controllers. Arrived quickly in perfect condition.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Edwards', N'kathleen.edwards4930@example.net', '2016-01-01', 5, N'These are for the NEW version 3DS XL by Nintendo. They work great and they actually do fit perfectly into the unit. Just like the one that came with it, perfect fit. These will work on all of the Nintendo 3DS family handhelds as far as the stylus and touch screen. However, the new 3DS XL stylus is a bit chunkier than the last few versions stylus'' were. This one will only fit properly in this intended system. That is not a fault of the product , that is how Nintendo built the unit. Many of the stylus sizes differ throughout the model types. That''s another reason i like these, the colors are pretty unique. That is usually how we tell ours apart at quick glance. Anyway , they work great, come quick, and are just as described. I would definitely recommend if you have the NEW 3DS XL system.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Young', N'zachary.young5786@example.com', '2016-01-01', 4, N'My niece seems to enjoy it.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Fisher', N'matthew.fisher3765@example.org', '2016-01-01', 5, N'I repurchased this game because my previous version got wiped off my hard drive when my husband took stupid windows 10 from my laptop. It works, but worked better with windows 10. With Windows 8, it isn''t expanding to full screen, the way I like, but I love this game pack, so I will live with it.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Gonzalez', N'shirley.gonzalez1978@example.org', '2016-01-01', 5, N'Can''t get enough of this game..... Really the best of the Batman Arkham knight series.....'),
(N'Emily', N'Stewart', N'emily.stewart7195@example.org', '2016-01-01', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Karen', N'Nguyen', N'karen.nguyen1789@example.org', '2016-01-01', 5, N'Great item'),
(N'Heather', N'Barnes', N'heather.barnes7914@example.net', '2016-01-01', 5, N'Great case for a 3DS. Fits 3 games inside.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Kim', N'daniel.kim4922@example.org', '2016-01-02', 5, N'This was a gift for my husband. He loves it. Works great! Control mapping is a really cool feature and he likes that he can save and share the mapping with the steam community. A con about the controls is that you have to remember to change them before you start playing a different game..if you try to change the controls after you''ve already started a game it will not automatically update and your controller will not function properly.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Webb', N'matthew.webb2924@example.net', '2016-01-02', 5, N'This box set is very amazing the dragon looks cool the art book artwork is awesome highly recommended to fans of the Elder Scrolls'),
(N'Carol', N'White', N'carol.white4997@example.net', '2016-01-02', 4, N'it''s mariolart. so it''s awesome'),
(N'Maria', N'Boyd', N'maria.boyd6056@example.net', '2016-01-02', 5, N'This is only a controller. But I love this brand, it''s bulkiness, and durability is what I love about it.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Wilson', N'thomas.wilson4853@example.net', '2016-01-02', 5, N'Skylanders is a fun game for adult and kids..this product was fine, no problems...what more can you say really'),
(N'Mary', N'Thomas', N'mary.thomas2546@example.net', '2016-01-02', 5, N'Good'),
