(N'Mark', N'Allen', N'mark.allen6086@example.com', '2016-01-03', 5, N'It is addictive and fun. Great game'),
(N'Jason', N'Scott', N'jason.scott4037@example.net', '2016-01-03', 5, N'works jus as well as the oem breakaway cables'),
(N'Jason', N'Scott', N'jason.scott4037@example.net', '2016-01-03', 3, N'It was a nice add on if you wanted to see alittle more of the new infamous series.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Singh', N'thomas.singh9650@example.org', '2016-01-03', 5, N'This game.....oh this game. This game will take over gaming system! As a fan of the series, this is everything I''ve wanted out of Fallout! The incredible graphics speak for themselves. The ability to create & maintain settlements is addicting. The crafting system is enjoyable. If you''re a fan of Fallout, and you haven''t gotten this game yet, you''re doing yourself a disservice. If you''re new to Fallout (what the heck have you been waiting for?!), it can be a bit daunting at first, but well worth the time & effort! Enjoy!!'),
(N'Luis', N'Diaz', N'luis.diaz9610@example.com', '2016-01-03', 5, N'As much as I wanted to get the Master Chief version this controller is just more appealing to me. Not to mention I picked up the Halo 5 console, so it''s nice to have two controllers that match. This one functions just like the one that came with the console.'),
(N'Jose', N'Jackson', N'jose.jackson6068@example.net', '2016-01-03', 2, N'Fun game and well put together. I would say it should not be rated mature because there is no nudity and the fight scenes are comical. Another issue is that the dialogue is only suggestive material, not obscene. A very miss leading title. I still have no idea why this game is rated Mature. I don''t recommend buying this game.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Cooper', N'jessica.cooper3836@example.net', '2016-01-03', 5, N'A decimate must have. Fun game'),
(N'Brian', N'Gonzalez', N'brian.gonzalez9067@example.net', '2016-01-04', 5, N'This is the best remote for the ps3, i own 2 of them. This remote is ultra sensitive, has a great radios and long battery life. It will turn on the Playstation with the press of any button.'),
(N'Richard', N'Khan', N'richard.khan5469@example.net', '2016-01-04', 5, N'Fantastic game'),
(N'Mei', N'Scott', N'mei.scott2951@example.org', '2016-01-04', 5, N'A great game, Blizzard does it again. This included the wings of liberty and zerg expansion (I don''t remember the name and am too lazy to google it) but doesnt include the protoss expansion. For $20 I think I got more than enough fun and gameplay to justify the purchase.'),
(N'Angela', N'Chavez', N'angela.chavez6988@example.org', '2016-01-04', 2, N'Fighting monster and humans so cool.'),
