(N'Brian', N'Watson', N'brian.watson4114@example.com', '2016-01-04', 5, N'Bought for my daughter...she loves it.'),
(N'Omar', N'Ivanov', N'omar.ivanov1370@example.org', '2016-01-04', 4, N'The kids loves the game'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Kowalski', N'cheryl.kowalski9993@example.net', '2016-01-04', 5, N'I have many things to say about this wonderful mouse. Firstly, if you don''t play MMO''s, it doesn''t matter. I do play WoW, but i also play Counter Strike and plenty of other Steam games. The button functions are editable, so the buttons can be used for spells, weapon switching, Macros, and basically anything you can think of. Check out YouTube videos to get the full effect of this mouse, because it can do whatever you want it to do. The packaging is pristine. The box it arrives in is honestly something I will keep for awhile. They include razor stickers to put on your computer or whatever you want. Razer Synapse is a great software that lets you edit the buttons, and it is constantly updated. You can change sensitivity and many other things I haven''t fully explored. If you''re looking for a gaming mouse this is it. If you want to edit pictures, use this. If you make computer graphics, buy this. Seriously, having all the options on your thumb makes a world of difference. I tried this...'),
(N'Emily', N'Rivera', N'emily.rivera6156@example.com', '2016-01-04', 5, N'made a great gift'),
(N'Timothy', N'Jimenez', N'timothy.jimenez5525@example.com', '2016-01-04', 5, N'Amazing game so beautiful'),
