(N'Brandon', N'Clark', N'brandon.clark9060@example.net', '2016-01-05', 5, N'Exellent'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Chen', N'kathleen.chen7269@example.org', '2016-01-05', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Luis', N'Sanchez', N'luis.sanchez6287@example.net', '2016-01-05', 5, N'This is not the Laura Croft I grew up with and I couldn''t be happier. She''s tough on a level the previous incarnations could never even come close to. The action sequences are incredible and if you like the Uncharted games, this is very much like those. The story is cool enough, though maybe a little formulaic, but it unfolds so well, and with such an adult approach, it''s miles ahead of most games of this sort. Most of all, you''ll really come to appreciate Laura, who is the utmost badass. I''m really glad they released this for x1. Its graphics are amazing and the gameplay is smooth as hell. Loved every second of it.'),
(N'Janet', N'Ivanov', N'janet.ivanov7300@example.net', '2016-01-05', 5, N'Fantastic game, works great on Playstation TV. Highly recommended if you are a fan of the other Legend of Heroes games, or just JRPGs in general. Check out the reviews, one of the best JRPGs to come out in the last few years.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Baker', N'michelle.baker2176@example.net', '2016-01-05', 5, N'Exactly as described.'),
