(N'Brian', N'Allen', N'brian.allen4719@example.com', '2016-01-05', 4, N'was hoping to find more color options. hoping this is the only controller type i''ll need for any of my games. if i have to buy the joy sticks too for some games im gonna be one unhappy pappy. The LED glowing ones are cool so i bought just one regular black style. theres a cheap white more bulky looking version too. which was less than 10 bucks so i got one of those too.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Edwards', N'jerry.edwards2256@example.org', '2016-01-05', 5, N'Simply put, it is the best version of Madden football since Madden 2005. Player ratings matter, and the offline single player franchise experience is the best it has ever been since Madden 2005. gameplay support post lauch has been outstanding (4 patches) and the gameplay has never been better. Seriously. A great return to form for Madden football. If you have been a long time Madden player and were turned off last generation. Welcome back. Madden 16 delivers the goods. I am now in year 3 of my offline CFM and am having a total blast. I employ 32 team control (owner mode) and have my own unique house rules and custom all pro sliders. Also there are some fantastic classic roster set''s out there for PS4 1986, 1990 and 1999. Which adds even more replay-ability to the game.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Coleman', N'timothy.coleman3084@example.com', '2016-01-05', 5, N'My kids love the WiiU'),
