(N'Mei', N'Scott', N'mei.scott5961@example.com', '2016-01-06', 5, N'Very sturdy cord. It''s holding up very good with my kiddo.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Cruz', N'nathan.cruz8377@example.net', '2016-01-06', 5, N'This is really a great mouse. The quality feels equal to more expensive mice from more well-known brands like Logitech or Razer. It has adjustable weights, braided cable, programmable buttons, programmable sensitivity. There really isn''t much more that you can ask from a gaming mouse. Fantastic quality!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Cook', N'kofi.cook4755@example.org', '2016-01-06', 5, N'it works great , thank you'),
(N'Eric', N'Flores', N'eric.flores7611@example.com', '2016-01-06', 2, N'Ive been going through a nostalgic phase lately and have recently hooked up all of my old video game consoles from when I was younger, and even picked up a few new games because my own collection wasn''t quite as extensive as I had remembered. I was actually really looking forward to playing Casper because to this day it remains one of my favorite movies and I feel no shame about that, lol. But, unfortunately, after playing and finally completing the game over the course of about three days, I have to admit that the other mostly positive reviews here have me baffled. First, my disappointment does not come from the general fact it hasn''t aged well no PS1 era game has, really because there are still things here to like. The graphics are actually pretty decent, the environments are whimsical and quirky, and the notorious PS1 loading screens, though frequent, are relatively short. But still, even after acknowledging the positives and trying to muster up the most objective rating I can,...'),
(N'Henry', N'Baker', N'henry.baker1910@example.net', '2016-01-06', 4, N'After a disaster that Skylanders Trapteam Kaos trap was last Christmas, I swore to stay away from Activision products, but my son received Skylanders Superchargers from another family member. I actually like this game more than previous versions of Skylanders, and my son with a friend are having lots of fun fighting and racing with various characters and vehicles from their combined collections. You really only need one vehicle of each element - water, air, and land to access various races. To "supercharge" you need to match a vehicle to a specific character, but "supercharging" is not necessary to race or to win.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Wright', N'joshua.wright5656@example.net', '2016-01-06', 5, N'New in package as described- son loved it.'),
(N'Emily', N'Morris', N'emily.morris3940@example.com', '2016-01-06', 5, N'A+++'),
(N'Rachel', N'Raghunathan', N'rachel.raghunathan5738@example.org', '2016-01-06', 5, N'Son plays it too much - we had to limit him. He''d sit there all day building levels if we''d let him.'),
(N'Steven', N'Jenkins', N'steven.jenkins6128@example.net', '2016-01-07', 5, N'An excellent and fun dance game. The series really does get better with every new installment. Better graphics more music, and more fun dances make this highly recommended.'),
(N'Steven', N'Jenkins', N'steven.jenkins6128@example.net', '2016-01-07', 5, N'Excellent graphics, fun fighting, and an interesting storyline. If you like call of duty or similar games than you will find this an excellent buy.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Hernandez', N'samuel.hernandez7676@example.net', '2016-01-07', 5, N'Works great and a great price.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Castillo', N'ravi.castillo1549@example.org', '2016-01-07', 5, N'Covers the main body of the game pad well, and does not get in the way for game play. The feel took some getting used to, but in a pleasant way. Still fits in the charge cradle well, and we like the fun look of it.'),
(N'Eric', N'Garcia', N'eric.garcia5654@example.com', '2016-01-07', 5, N'I really like these grips. I just installed them on my Xbox One controller. I expected them to be a little more unforgiving but wow. I followed the instructions but still had to readjust the left piece about five times to get them to accommodate my audio stereo adapter plug in. So, one piece of advice. Don''t put the badges on until your finished adjusting the fit. Once I had both grips in place and was finished adjusting them, I applied the badges.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Hall', N'yuki.hall2038@example.net', '2016-01-07', 5, N'really super fun'),
(N'Joseph', N'Bell', N'joseph.bell1401@example.com', '2016-01-07', 5, N'I went around for a week looking for a mouse that would fit my needs. I looked at the Naga, Redragon M901, and the Logitech G600 and I decided to go with this and let me say, it''s amazing. The buttons are perfectly placed so they''re easy to use. When I put my hand on it, it felt like home although I wish it were a little bit longer. Extreme customization and my favorite part is the fact I can turn the DPI down to 400, which I am used to with my Zowie FK1. Will definitely be getting this again if need be. LOVE IT'),
(N'Christopher', N'Allen', N'christopher.allen6300@example.org', '2016-01-07', 5, N'One of the Best Indiana Jones games!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Myers', N'evelyn.myers8300@example.org', '2016-01-07', 5, N'These wheels worked with WII U remotes great'),
(N'Justin', N'Suzuki', N'justin.suzuki6545@example.net', '2016-01-07', 5, N'Great gift.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Walker', N'ravi.walker9333@example.net', '2016-01-07', 1, N'There is no real online multiplayer so if you want to play with friends online it will not happen and it really kills most of the fun(Rock band at least said they will be adding it). If you are new you will get slaughtered on ghtv once you reach the higher levels since we all have everything unlocked. If you don''t at least spend your coins on star power you will not touch top 3(Coins are what you use to upgrade and buy song plays without spending real money each time you play a song). The guitar is fun though so there is that...'),
(N'Sarah', N'Martinez', N'sarah.martinez3014@example.net', '2016-01-07', 5, N'nice quick delivery..just what my niece wanted for Christmas!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Baker', N'nicholas.baker4667@example.com', '2016-01-08', 5, N'Fast Delivery and Just asI expected it to be'),
(N'Emma', N'Russell', N'emma.russell6931@example.net', '2016-01-08', 5, N'The combination of extra usb ports and a cooling fan is nice. Be careful if you have pets that like to run into things, they can easily tip this over.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Cooper', N'zachary.cooper8628@example.net', '2016-01-08', 5, N'Love this game...'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ortiz', N'tyler.ortiz6373@example.com', '2016-01-08', 4, N'The latest Mario Party games were received underwhelming reviews by critics, which I am totally understand. But for me, I am a long-time fun of the series since the N64, and I have own all 9 main games on home consoles. Mario Party 10 is the game I look forward the most, and I''m glad this game is fun. It''s not quite the best (which I am totally understand), but once I got into everything, this is exactly what I am asking for. Bowser Party: The best feature of the game! Playing as Bowser is actually chaotic and intense. The Bowser mini-games are solid and terrifying. Mario Party: The same basic rule as in MP9! New boards and mini-games are remain good and straightforward. Nothing''s wrong here! Amiibo Party: Require to have Super Mario Amiibo to play! It almost feels like the classic, but it''s very complicating and confusing. Overall, Mario Party 10 is a good multiplayer game. Don''t expect it to be good if you''re buying it for the Amiibo Party. If you''re a casual party gamer, then I...'),
(N'Omar', N'Suzuki', N'omar.suzuki6870@example.com', '2016-01-08', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wang', N'jacqueline.wang7214@example.com', '2016-01-08', 3, N'Good'),
(N'Carol', N'Ramos', N'carol.ramos3914@example.net', '2016-01-08', 4, N'i chose these because there green and green is my favorite color,you can hear people pretty good and they hear you just fine.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Chen', N'anthony.chen9524@example.com', '2016-01-08', 5, N'I bought this as a Christmas gift for my daughter and she absolutely loved it. I am a huge fan of Animal crossing as they are very kid friendly games. My daughter has grasped on to social skills better playing these games. Each game has taught her a new set of skills while having fun at the same time!'),
(N'Ravi', N'Walker', N'ravi.walker1432@example.net', '2016-01-08', 4, N'was what i expected and came on time'),
(N'Jacob', N'Morales', N'jacob.morales5567@example.com', '2016-01-08', 3, N'I was really excited for this since I played this on the ps2. I have to say it might have been better on the ps2. Now Im not done with it yet however I will say a few things. It was a bit glitchy for me which was not because of any type of system requirements. The missions were a bit meh. In the ps2 I remember creating a team on a cruise and you get washed up and do all types of cool things building your own shelter focusing immediately on creating a raft learning to fish and carve weapons. On this it feels like you buy some stuff here, buy some stuff there, explore and get lucky with finding people. I find the story-line so far to be uninteresting. If you want to play the story-line you cant design your own sims which kind of sucks. You can design them in the other ....free-play option? While the designing is cool its very boring. This is also a game I can see has little replay quality. Glad I bought it used for only 20 dollars and didn''t spend almost 100 on it.'),
(N'Kofi', N'King', N'kofi.king7708@example.org', '2016-01-08', 4, N'well, i get this in remplacement of another dock station, because the controllers doesnt fit well with the cord in the old one... it work good, but still you need to move them and make them fit... but work better that the old one'),
(N'Janet', N'Clark', N'janet.clark1428@example.net', '2016-01-08', 4, N'I like this mouse. Great for MMO''s, but I may get a different one for day to day use. Numbers on the side keybound to numbers on keyboard, and you can''t reprogram them. I would like that feature.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Jones', N'kathleen.jones1827@example.net', '2016-01-08', 5, N'kids are having fun dancing to the new songs.'),
(N'John', N'Rivera', N'john.rivera1780@example.net', '2016-01-08', 5, N'Works fine for the american version of the game. no issues at all.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Martin', N'michelle.martin1435@example.net', '2016-01-08', 5, N'Great game overall, the ability to play co-op during the campaign if awesome, and has some very cool "what-if" characters that only appear in this game.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Price', N'jessica.price2550@example.com', '2016-01-08', 1, N'Not worth the money! This thing worked for maybe a week. There seems to be a short in the wire or something.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Richardson', N'stephen.richardson7753@example.com', '2016-01-09', 3, N'Not bad, but not great. Better graphics sure, but enjoyed hollow fragment''s game play and exploration more. If you''re a fan of the show it''s still worth picking up.'),
(N'Diane', N'Kim', N'diane.kim9191@example.com', '2016-01-09', 5, N'Paints perfect, packaging was descent but not collecting NIB so he is perfect and content unlocks are really cool on various wii u games!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Singh', N'ethan.singh4722@example.com', '2016-01-09', 4, N'I like this game. I know a lot of people give this game bad reviews but in reality it is a lot of fun to play. I have fun every single mission I go out and do. The graphics are unbelievable, the way the missions are setup. They are very well thought out. I like how the gun layout is; where it lets you chose three different guns to use. The armor as well, where there are different types of armor which range from uncommon, rare, legendary. The one thing I do not like is how the game is kind of hard to play with yourself unless you''re doing matchmaking pvp. I don''t like the pvp either and it is pretty bland. You also need to be at least level 10 to start that anyway. Some of the missions are pretty tough that you need someone there to help you and if you don''t unless you''re a really high level you won''t be able to complete them. Once my friend and I starting playing together we zoomed right through them but by myself it was almost impossible. One other thing is how the orbit works...'),
(N'Frank', N'Johnson', N'frank.johnson5077@example.org', '2016-01-09', 5, N'the only game where pikachu walks around you outside of its ball.only game where you can collect all starters in game the forth game in kanto region no other remakes like it pikachu speaks just like in the show enough said'),
(N'Julie', N'Gonzalez', N'julie.gonzalez5545@example.com', '2016-01-09', 5, N'My 7 year old and 9 year old fight over who gets this game first. They both love it.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Sullivan', N'victoria.sullivan7557@example.org', '2016-01-10', 4, N'Great game! I would have easily given it 5 stars, but the makers short-changed the PC and Nintendo DS players. There are 2 DLCs available for this game only available to Xbox and Playstation systems. If you make a product, offer everyone the same content.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Torres', N'joseph.torres5611@example.net', '2016-01-10', 4, N'Alot of people have complained about this game for many reason but all and all I enjoy it when i am playing with a few other people. Pros - Easy to pick up and play - great for 2-4 people (solo no so much) - fun to throw new people and landmarks into the town to change up the events. - some fun mini games pro/con- It''s no over til it''s over... a lot of people have said that you can go from first by a lot to dead last at the drop of a hat ( mainly this happens in the last week) and it is true... an event can make u lose all you points at the last minute making you come in last, and while this sucks for the person in first it also gives hope for the other players that they still might win. Cons - - Character choice is limited Final thoughts- When it comes down to it, this is a virtual board game that you can tweek a little bit. It''s not soem great new animal crossing game, it''s just a board game on the tv. It comes with 2 amiibos (normally 12 $ each), some amiibo cards (a pack is...'),
(N'Omar', N'Jimenez', N'omar.jimenez1295@example.com', '2016-01-10', 5, N'Son loves his game! Purchased it for his bday. It arrived on time and as expected. Zero complaints and would recommend both product and seller.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Fisher', N'tyler.fisher8745@example.net', '2016-01-10', 4, N'Packed like the picture it would have been nice stoked the retail box. Too bad. Mostly clean but stains. Given that the sale will be satisfied.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ortiz', N'tyler.ortiz6373@example.com', '2016-01-10', 4, N'A game starring a princess might be an "emotional" roller coaster ride. Super Princess Peach is a surprisingly entertaining that Mario fans come to expect. Great touchscreen controls, cartoony graphics, simple difficulty, and fun platforming sections. Although, some levels might be too easy to figure it out. If you''re fan of Peach, then this game will be great to recommend.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Moore', N'mateo.moore4075@example.com', '2016-01-10', 5, N'I recently needed a new mouse and bought a Razer DeathAdder Chroma. That turned out to be a huge mistake, as Razor has gotten into the spyware business and you can''t even use their software/driver without giving them your email address, IP address, a list of all software installed on your computer, and more. Google for "Razer spyware" to learn more about that, or read the following article. http://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2012/11/why-the-hell-does-this-mouse-need-to-connect-to-the-internet/ Instead I bought a MIONIX AVIOR 8200 and a ROCCAT TYON to try them both out. In the past, Logitech software has been very weak and they have abandoned OS support for some of their products way too early, so I generally avoided Logitech and decided to try out some new brands. First, let''s talk about the Roccat Tyon, just to get that out of the way. It''s more expensive, has more buttons, and the software is definitely better. However, Mionix has the upper hand here on price, especially if you want...'),
(N'Matthew', N'Stewart', N'matthew.stewart5812@example.org', '2016-01-10', 5, N'My son loves this one, says sound is great!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Allen', N'pamela.allen5948@example.net', '2016-01-10', 4, N'Wonderful product. The keys feel nice and the keyboard itself has a nice weight to it. Back-lit keys look great although I would''ve loved more colors. Other than that I would definitely recommend this keyboard.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Rivera', N'lisa.rivera2663@example.com', '2016-01-10', 5, N'My 6 year olds got this from Santa and they''re thrilled! I can''t tell you anything about the game because I''ve never played it. My skills ended with the Super Nintendo. :)'),
(N'Joshua', N'Smith', N'joshua.smith5409@example.net', '2016-01-10', 5, N'My 7 year old son LOVES this game. So far he only has the starter pack, and he has been very content with the content available and he loved building the portal/Batmobile. He is a Skylanders vet, and has been saving his allowance to buy some extra stuff, but he is having fun playing just what is open with the Starter Pack and is used to not being able to play EVERYTHING. The game hasn''t glitched for us, maybe because we have a 32 gb flash drive for storage (4 GB model) plus an 8 GB one that we use just for XBox updates. Luckily I was able to get it at the $38 sale price, so far it has been totally worth the money.'),
(N'Mei', N'Tanaka', N'mei.tanaka5637@example.com', '2016-01-11', 5, N'All high quality figurines, so that even if you''re not interested in the game play aspects of the Amiibo, it''s still a nice collectible :)'),
(N'Heather', N'Davis', N'heather.davis8138@example.org', '2016-01-11', 4, N'I have a total of two of these! They''re reliable.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Allen', N'mateo.allen9100@example.com', '2016-01-11', 3, N'I''ve played a lot of stratgey games over the years and I have to say this game is solid but somewhat over-rated. Its not THAT great. I played about a little over half the game but got pretty bored with it. I found the story and especially the battles overly drawn out. Basically its a turn based game where each sides takes turns moving and attacking each other like older Fire Emblem games but for some reason this one was just way too long and.....boring. It has some cool little features but some of these can be flaws. Pros: - Its a turn based strategy game with no perma death. - A lot of characters can unite and help each other out or perform better together the longer they are used. - An interesting assortment of characters to choose from. - The gameplay is top notch, easy to get into and you can save and start again whenever you wish. Cons: - Weapons break in the middle of combat and you have no idea at what state they are at to remedy that before you get into battle. - More...'),
(N'Diane', N'Nowak', N'diane.nowak8591@example.org', '2016-01-11', 4, N'Works well for the most part, there has been two times were it was making this static noise but once we unplugged it and then replugged it in is had been ok.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Nelson', N'anthony.nelson6520@example.org', '2016-01-11', 5, N'If you are a gamer and haven''t played World of Warcraft then you must give it a go. It is one of the most fascinating and engrossing experiences you will have in a game. The world is immense and varied. The classes all offer unique and interesting play styles. The depth of the game mechanics takes months of play to realize its full potential. Be prepared to lose some of your free time because once you are hooked you will want to play every chance you can get. It can be ''turned down'' to run on low end systems or ''turned up'' to run on high end systems. Don''t hesitate if you haven''t tried it. If you get really involved in it, you won''t be disappointed. I give it 5 stars because its is the best game I have ever played for an extended period of time.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Cruz', N'aaron.cruz3201@example.net', '2016-01-11', 3, N'Nice components. But not good game quality. Especially Banana costums.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Wright', N'cynthia.wright7038@example.net', '2016-01-11', 4, N'Where to start with this game. I''ve been a big fan of the Rainbow 6 series since the beginning. The game itself is great. I really WANT to give it 5 stars. The gameplay is fun and pretty realistic. It can be challenging as well. There were some server issues when the game was first released, but I have not had any issues as of the last update. The game is broken down into 3 game modes. Situations, Muliplayer, and Terrorist Hunt (co-op). Situations: There are 10 situations that you play through solo and complete the task at hand. It can be eliminate all the terrorists, protect a hostage, or rescue a hostage. There are 3 challenges per situation, usually finish with 50+ health, then others like finish in a certain amount of time, kill 2 terrorists with frag grenades, etc. There are also 3 difficulty levels, Normal, Hard, and Realistic. If you complete all 10 situations (not all challenges, just all situations), a bonus 11th situation unlocks. To do that one you have to be online as...'),
(N'Walter', N'Okonkwo', N'walter.okonkwo9847@example.org', '2016-01-11', 1, N'Wish I would have kept my money. I paid 60.00 dollars to play 4 missions? I should have researched more, yes, anytime you purchase a game for $50 + you expect to get the ENTIRE game not to have to pay more to play it. YOU MUST HAVE A PLAYSTATION + account to play. I really have no clue if the multiplayer online game is awesome or not because I am not dropping more money to play a game I already dropped $60.00 on. There needs to be giant call out''s on these game "to play entire game you must have a PS+ account" I have never felt more swindled. I am done with EA, NHL 2015 was just as bad as this game was.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Mendoza', N'sharon.mendoza2188@example.org', '2016-01-11', 5, N'This game is the best rpg ever not to mention it is so sexy especially NEPGEAR.'),
(N'Angela', N'Wisniewski', N'angela.wisniewski7820@example.org', '2016-01-11', 5, N'game was new and worked'),
(N'Kevin', N'Ruiz', N'kevin.ruiz6183@example.com', '2016-01-11', 5, N'Amazing game. I''ve owned NFS Hot Pursuit 2 and compared to that game, This is on a whole new level. My computer managed to max out all the settings at stock clock speeds. Here are the specs: AMD A-10 7850K, Gigabyte GA-F2A88XN- Wifi Motherboard, Corsair Vengeance Blue 8gb 2133 ram, WD blue 500Gb Hdd drive and, Windows 7 professional 64 bit.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Gutierrez', N'cynthia.gutierrez3253@example.org', '2016-01-11', 3, N'Keep loosing the parts that plug into the controller and then had to crawl around and find them (small and not easy to find), not a great fit, now I have tape on the bottom of my controllers so they stop falling out, and no, the controllers were not old. This was installed on a brand new system. As far as the charging aspect, it does charge the controllers well and I like that it is a magnetic connection to the station so that part is very easy and convenient.'),
(N'Amy', N'Davis', N'amy.davis6571@example.org', '2016-01-12', 5, N'Cheap but good option. I bought this for my spare computer so I do not use it that often but it is holding up well. The blue LED matches most blue LED fans and other blue LEDs. The cord is black with lighter, aqua blue markings so it does not match the regular blue and kinda stands out.'),
(N'Amy', N'Davis', N'amy.davis6571@example.org', '2016-01-12', 5, N'Excellent quality and good brand mouse. It has lots of features but my only complaint is the LED light. The blue is more like an aqua blue rather than regular blue. It does not match the blue LED on my Logitech G105 keyboard or any of the blue LED fans on my case.'),
(N'Julie', N'Kim', N'julie.kim1898@example.com', '2016-01-12', 1, N'Pros: -Cheaper -Comes with built-in games -2 free wireless controllers (but they are probably very low quality and have too much lag to be useable) -Can play games loaded on an SD Card Cons: -Build quality is cheaper -No stereo sound (every official Genesis had that and this doesn''t include it without modding it) -No RGB output (again, every official Genesis could do that, and is way better than the composite (yellow plug) video you''re stuck with on this console without modding it) -Audio is distorted on top of being mono-only -No 32X compatibility -No Sega CD compatibility -Incompatible with a lot of standalone (non-Sega CD, non-32X) games -Can''t save games regardless if cartridge or SD card rom, so forget about playing RPGs like Phantasy Star -Can buy a cartridge to play games off an SD card for a real Genesis (it''s called an Everdrive. More expensive, but you can play the games on actual hardware) -This is just an emulator, and it''s a worse one than those you can download on...'),
(N'Henry', N'Martin', N'henry.martin3667@example.org', '2016-01-12', 5, N'AS promised. Great price.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Martin', N'jacob.martin7551@example.com', '2016-01-12', 1, N'Do Not Buy This Game. Total Disappointment. Alien is so Awesome, but every game they make about it sucks! I give up'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Raghunathan', N'jonathan.raghunathan3783@example.com', '2016-01-12', 5, N'Very Good'),
(N'Alexander', N'Brown', N'alexander.brown1398@example.net', '2016-01-12', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Emma', N'Henderson', N'emma.henderson6559@example.net', '2016-01-12', 5, N'looks really nice. and the functionality, it is just superb. what a great product indeed. i really like using i and i am having the best time of my life when i play dota.'),
(N'Gary', N'Ruiz', N'gary.ruiz1374@example.org', '2016-01-13', 5, N'I don''t use this for gaming. I use it as a productivity enhancer in my academic/writing environment. The build quality is excellent. I have medium size hands, and the mouse fits my right one just perfectly. I love the weights that can be added to the base. To me, the mouse glides across the surface of my adjustable standing desk. Every detail of this device has been well thought out. It tracks well on every surface I tested. Incredibly, I was able to use a hardcover book, including the full color book jacket, as a mousepad without jumping and skipping. I have had good experiences with Logitech in the past. They just keep getting better at engineering peripherals. The core of my experience is the sensor tracking. It''s just smooth and accurate beyond any other mouse I''ve used, including the recently reviewed SteelSeries Rival, which wouldn''t work on the surface of the same hardcover book. A few other observations worth mentioning: this mouse has numerous features I am not using, but...'),
(N'Charles', N'Suzuki', N'charles.suzuki9467@example.com', '2016-01-13', 4, N'This game was actually a lot of fun & very enjoyable. In terms of RPG''s on the Dreamcast, it''s no Skies of Arcadia or Grandia 2 but it''s far better than 7th Cross Evolution. This game is on par with Evolution: World of Sacred Device & Evolution: The Far Off Promise- a solid 7-7.5 out of 10. After completing this game, you can continue to play through dungeons, wander the world, search for hidden items, weapons, as well as capture enemies & have them join your party. You can even view any of the endings you''ve earned at anytime. There is also a nice variety of NPC''s, time zones (dungeons), & even engage in secondary quests in dungeons for money by placing a bet with Mr. Noiman or his wife. More playable characters unlock as you complete dungeons and each of them has an ending as well. Definitely worth playing but check online for walkthroughs because you will need some help here & there- it''s fun but it can be a bit treacherous at times.'),
(N'Brian', N'Lewis', N'brian.lewis3110@example.net', '2016-01-13', 5, N'This product is ok'),
(N'Anna', N'Khan', N'anna.khan1752@example.org', '2016-01-13', 5, N'These face plates came in pristine condition and I would buy another one if I had to :)'),
(N'Jessica', N'Khan', N'jessica.khan1537@example.net', '2016-01-13', 5, N'Arrived on time and exactly as described.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Brooks', N'hiroshi.brooks3694@example.net', '2016-01-13', 5, N'Amazing keyboard for PC Gaming. Solid and comfortable.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Martin', N'raymond.martin5729@example.org', '2016-01-14', 4, N'Great buy'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Rivera', N'rebecca.rivera5643@example.com', '2016-01-14', 5, N'I like the series but I think the older ones were better. I don''t know if it''s me getting older though but it is still a very fun game to play. The different modes are great because this way you can switch between them and don''t get tired. I personally like to try great escapes and share my replays, they are the most fun.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Lee', N'zachary.lee7892@example.net', '2016-01-14', 5, N'The game of the year, happy with it. It''s one box with the cd and the serial. (it''s the physical version you must wait to get the key.) About The Game: Betsheda changed a lot of stuff, personally i liked more the mute character of previous versions, the graphics are very pretty and deep, the freedom is unique, has some limits with some features, but there''s nothing than mods can''t fix. Worth it. PDT: The cd doesn''t arrive with the full game, it''s a part you must complete via Steam.'),
(N'Charles', N'Suzuki', N'charles.suzuki9467@example.com', '2016-01-14', 5, N'Great game that keeps your alert & on edge from start to finish. If you''ve played other entries in this series of have seen any of the movies, you know what to expect. The Dreamcast version is an excellent translation of the PS 1 title but has enhanced graphics, making the DC edition the one to own.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Johnson', N'elizabeth.johnson5174@example.com', '2016-01-14', 5, N'Arrived on time and got just what I expected.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Anderson', N'joshua.anderson5239@example.com', '2016-01-14', 5, N'Second time shopping your items, still very very happy, thank you.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Phillips', N'sarah.phillips4320@example.com', '2016-01-14', 5, N'best tennis game to date.it''s a shame smashcourt changed this game so much with smashcourt tennis 3,and copied topspin 3.players are incredibly slow in smashcourt tennis 3.in smashcourt tennis 2 the gameplay seems very fast at first.but once you get used to it you will find your timing improving just like with the snes super tennis game.only thing wrong with this game is no online play.and the tour mode doesn''t have 6 games a set unless you reach the final.but on exibition mode you can play 5 sets and 6 games a set.these are the things that should have been fixed for smashcourt tennis 3.but instead they totally changed the game and made it far worse.'),
(N'Jason', N'Ruiz', N'jason.ruiz4834@example.org', '2016-01-14', 4, N'Happy 1 year birthday to my M65! Anyways, it''s held up really well. Still looks great and performs great, but the cable is pushing through the braiding. Could be a defect, I dunno, but I''d really prefer this to not happen.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Fisher', N'brenda.fisher1655@example.org', '2016-01-14', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Diane', N'Wilson', N'diane.wilson4864@example.org', '2016-01-14', 5, N'Great purchase, fast shipping.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Bennett', N'nadia.bennett4023@example.org', '2016-01-15', 5, N'nice grip product. i was having comfort issues with 3ds when gaming long. this solved them. nuff said'),
(N'Nadia', N'Bennett', N'nadia.bennett4023@example.org', '2016-01-15', 5, N'love these online game codes and can send to friends and get instantly without leaving my house. have sent these as gift to friends, family members etc.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Smith', N'hannah.smith8206@example.org', '2016-01-15', 5, N'If you like fighters, this one is good and changes things up a bit.'),
(N'William', N'Anderson', N'william.anderson5158@example.org', '2016-01-15', 5, N'Kids love it'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Patel', N'elizabeth.patel2476@example.net', '2016-01-15', 5, N'Perfect for my game pad'),
(N'Ravi', N'Foster', N'ravi.foster5341@example.net', '2016-01-15', 5, N'nephew loved it'),
(N'Robert', N'Perez', N'robert.perez5975@example.net', '2016-01-15', 5, N'thank you great game for kids'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Edwards', N'kimberly.edwards1498@example.net', '2016-01-15', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Patrick', N'Morales', N'patrick.morales9374@example.org', '2016-01-15', 5, N'Charges as expected.'),
(N'Joan', N'Coleman', N'joan.coleman7390@example.org', '2016-01-15', 5, N'need a ps2 now'),
(N'Christine', N'James', N'christine.james9196@example.net', '2016-01-15', 2, N'I tried this to see if a decent shooter for wii U could be enjoyable, starting out there''s not really enough low level players to make up decent online play, a few dozen high level players, but they just mop up on new comers, so pretty much unplayable.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Lopez', N'jacqueline.lopez5667@example.org', '2016-01-15', 2, N'Was awesome for 15 minutes of second use. Until the right joystick became the dreary stick. broke loose. The first use was awesome, charged quickly responsive but I did not really use the right stick to much on Madden. But on Disney infinity when you have a flying character the right stick is critical for direction and aim and its BROKEN. My son and I had an awesome 15 minutes of playing coop and then he quickly traded me the broken controller.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Rogers', N'olivia.rogers2975@example.net', '2016-01-15', 4, N'Holds games snug and has been a perfect organizer for my Games...Would Def Recommend!!!!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Wisniewski', N'elizabeth.wisniewski4002@example.net', '2016-01-15', 4, N'Great Game. Wish I had more time to put into a game like this. Lots of fun though. But seriously way too much content.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Wisniewski', N'elizabeth.wisniewski4002@example.net', '2016-01-15', 5, N'What a crazy fun game. So fun. Most fun in small sittings. Not for kids or easily offended.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Wisniewski', N'elizabeth.wisniewski4002@example.net', '2016-01-15', 5, N'So much fun killing nazi''s. Great graphics and great fun'),
(N'Christina', N'Cox', N'christina.cox8225@example.com', '2016-01-15', 4, N'Good mouse feels very comfortable even tho i don''t like ambidextrous designed mouse this mouse felt really nice. Overall the performance and the quality of the mouse is top notch only thing I can say bad thing about the mouse totally personal is that the clicks are little hard to click the other mouse. I heard the 2016 model has easier clickable buttons so if you like the easy press buttons then go for the 2016 model'),
(N'Justin', N'Jones', N'justin.jones8135@example.org', '2016-01-15', 5, N'About as bad as I thought it was. Can''t bother to finish Silver''s ball puzzle. 5/5.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Rogers', N'ronald.rogers6278@example.net', '2016-01-15', 5, N'This is a good, solid keyboard. Nothing special besides that it does its job and it does it very well. It is very clicky but that''s because it''s blue switch. It isn''t cherry switch but I''ve been using mine for over a year and have no problems to report. Blue backlight only (or you can turn it off). I love that it''s a full keyboard but doesn''t take up much real estate on my computer desk. Yes it''s missing media keys, RGB lighting, programmable keys, usb pass through and a braided cable but those are things that most can live without. The price is great as well. Much cheaper now than when I bought it a year back. Can''t go wrong with this one.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Anderson', N'dennis.anderson3446@example.org', '2016-01-16', 5, N'Console works great and enjoying the system and its nice to be able to play ps 1,2 and 3 games on it and I can finally box the ps1 and 2 for safe storage.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Hall', N'jacqueline.hall2792@example.com', '2016-01-16', 5, N'a while back I played fallout 3 and I did not like it at all so I was not sure if I should get this or not but why not and im glad I did its a great game easy to learn but hard the master'),
(N'Christine', N'Gonzalez', N'christine.gonzalez2283@example.net', '2016-01-16', 1, N'Purchased for the wheel but haven''t had the chance yet but will update later. First 30 mns just boring. Controller play sloppy but just planning to play this on the light side no career etc. Navigator seems to be off and forgets to take a breath.i don''t know whats missing I guess as soon im healthy I need to grab the shifter / pedals etc and maybe it will be more fun. As for now the coolest part is the box art'),
(N'Marcus', N'Hill', N'marcus.hill1243@example.org', '2016-01-16', 5, N'Adapter works great. Rumble feature is present, with no noticeable lag.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Butler', N'nicholas.butler9040@example.net', '2016-01-16', 4, N'I picked this keyboard up after another accident with liquids and children. It it a nice keyboard and I enjoy the soft backlight since I tend to keep it pretty dark in my room. The only thing I dislike is the scrunchy layout.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Mendoza', N'nicole.mendoza7194@example.org', '2016-01-16', 5, N'USPRO Controller works great!!! Granddaughter and friends love it!! Thanks!!! Prompt delivery and great packaging also appreciated!!'),
(N'Frank', N'Hill', N'frank.hill4457@example.com', '2016-01-16', 5, N'My kids love all the new songs!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ramirez', N'patricia.ramirez5913@example.net', '2016-01-16', 5, N'Glad to have an extra.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Bailey', N'nicole.bailey3978@example.org', '2016-01-16', 1, N'didn''t need it'),
(N'Betty', N'Ivanov', N'betty.ivanov2312@example.org', '2016-01-16', 5, N'Get this and the USB Fighterstick. Durable and easy to use. Just plug in and go. So very happy about this. DOn''t let the plastic look dissuade you. The build quality is excellent.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Flores', N'samantha.flores3816@example.net', '2016-01-16', 5, N'My daughter wanted this for Christmas and I have to say, I watched her play, and it is scary! Also pretty graphic (there was one scene with a guy getting sawed in half I can''t un-see!) So get this game if you like horror movies, suspense and don''t mind graphic scenes! It''s got a good storyline that I guess can change depending on your choices. I think my daughter was a little freaked out after she played it because she hasn''t finished it and hasn''t played it since! Not for the faint of heart I guess!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Green', N'kimberly.green6927@example.org', '2016-01-16', 3, N'If you''ve played 1 Call of Duty, you''ve pretty much played them all. The main difference in this one is the ability to superjump and dash mid-air.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Green', N'kimberly.green6927@example.org', '2016-01-16', 5, N'This game is an amazing story-based game. It is more like an interactive movie than it is an action game, so if you need to constantly be shooting or punching something look elsewhere. The co-op experience in my opinion is very nice (and rare for a story-based game like this). This way if two people are together, you don''t have one person just sitting there only watching (which isn''t that bad since its very cinematic). The only complaint I heard about the co-op experience is that the player controlling Aiden doesn''t get as many opportunities to interact as the main playable character. While I would have to agree overall, I''d recommend simply swapping controllers with your co-op friend if he/she is getting a little bored. That way both players get to experience interacting with both playable characters anyway. Don''t forget that the main character can manually summon Aiden (the 2nd player) at almost any point in the game, and his powers/view can make it easier to find clues or...'),
(N'Kevin', N'Adams', N'kevin.adams5142@example.net', '2016-01-16', 5, N'Love this game'),
(N'Emma', N'Robinson', N'emma.robinson9912@example.com', '2016-01-17', 5, N'I bought 2 and I''m so happy with them!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Cruz', N'tomasz.cruz7870@example.com', '2016-01-17', 5, N'I just purchased this game 4 days ago and been playing crazily. its alot of fun if you like the DS series then give this a try. im a fairly new FROMSOFTWARE fan, but i love their games now ive been binge playing all the DS games so i had to give this one a try it has a little bit of a different feel to it but it typically a faster pace DS game. but i felt obligated to give a review to show my appreciation to the producers and the series. deffinitly recommend!!!'),
(N'Scott', N'Campbell', N'scott.campbell8409@example.org', '2016-01-17', 4, N'a neat take on some old classics, but i was hoping it would be more of each game rather than the 1 level at a time thing. still really cool.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Ali', N'nadia.ali8008@example.net', '2016-01-17', 5, N'At first this didn''t always work but several updates later its flawless, does the job well. I still wish it would have been intergrated into the controller at launch.'),
(N'Lucia', N'King', N'lucia.king6849@example.com', '2016-01-17', 5, N'This persona game is some what different from the others but it also has this world building option that my husband likes. The items that come with it makes it even better. It''s a great edition for any fan.'),
(N'Carol', N'Sanchez', N'carol.sanchez4535@example.com', '2016-01-17', 5, N'Great games and Christmas present.'),
(N'Carol', N'Sanchez', N'carol.sanchez4535@example.com', '2016-01-17', 5, N'Great deal.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Murphy', N'dennis.murphy8875@example.net', '2016-01-17', 5, N'an amiibo, what more to say'),
(N'Daniel', N'Kim', N'daniel.kim7707@example.com', '2016-01-17', 5, N'great game once again i love remasters of classic games that i played on PS3 and this one included all the dlc so it was a steal at the price'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Adams', N'carolyn.adams9477@example.com', '2016-01-17', 2, N'Game is pretty boring with minimal interaction. Basically all you do is roll a dice using your amiibo and make a decision every now and then. Graphics and tone are very nice though, and capture the feel of Animal Crossing very well. The amiibo it comes with also look amazing. Right now the price is about $33 on Amazon. The amiibo and cards it comes with are worth about $29 total, making the game $4. However, the price does fluctuate so it may be a better idea to get it when it''s at about $30.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Adams', N'benjamin.adams8230@example.org', '2016-01-17', 5, N'Exactly what i need since the last shell i had broke whn i dropped it so i have to get a replacement shell cause i needed it'),
(N'Douglas', N'Kelly', N'douglas.kelly4348@example.org', '2016-01-18', 5, N'I play Call of Duty with my friends online. Wanted to try a racing game with the leveling up feature. Nice game. Haven''t gotten too far into it. Worth the money for the game and expansion pack.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Collins', N'jennifer.collins3465@example.net', '2016-01-18', 5, N'Looks wonderful! I am not an amiibo fan so I don''t actually use the video game aspect of it But I am a big Earthbound (Mother) fan and was looking for a good figure of Ness. If you are an amiibo fan or a Earthbound (Mother) fan like me than it is a must buy.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Butler', N'jacqueline.butler9181@example.net', '2016-01-18', 4, N'These are really nice. The removable mic and inline volume control, with push to talk, are great features. I dinged them a star because the ear cups are kind of small. Quality.'),
(N'Megan', N'Stewart', N'megan.stewart2808@example.net', '2016-01-18', 5, N'great'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ortiz', N'cynthia.ortiz3249@example.com', '2016-01-18', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Cruz', N'carolyn.cruz1652@example.com', '2016-01-18', 5, N'I write this review partly as a public service. I see a lot of people are writing reviews saying that they are not audiophile. I thought maybe I could help shed some light on just how good the sound on these headphones is, because I definitely am an audiophile (literally translated "sound-lover"). No, I don''t own vacuum tube pre-amps, or even a surround sound receiver. I don''t have a power regulator hooked up to my refrigerator to keep it from putting distortion on the sound from my record player. But I HAVE received a ton of headphones good and bad (to the point where I often refer to myself as the "headphone king" these days. I just love great headphones, and I''m not ashamed of it. I came across this gaming headset when I visited my family yesterday. My sister (non-gamer) told me that she was shocked by the quality of this headset, and so was my father when they tested it out. Like me, they often get items like this for free in exchange for reviews. Being the resident headphone...'),
(N'Zachary', N'Peterson', N'zachary.peterson3772@example.org', '2016-01-18', 5, N'g kids like it'),
(N'Ethan', N'Cook', N'ethan.cook5997@example.com', '2016-01-18', 4, N'I''ve come back to play the game this past weekend, b/c I eventually want to be able to play the DLC. I read that if I try to play the DLC on New Game Plus, that it is excessively painful. Personally, I don''t care for the story, which is a bit convoluted, and the NPC''s, less interesting than other souls titles (at least for the main game), but the gameplay is alot of fun. I was supposed to do some work for the office this past Saturday, but instead, I made the mistake of popping in Bloodborne just to "play for maybe 30 minutes. 30 minutes become 10 hrs straight, until I basically passed out on the couch. It is not a game for everybody, but for others...there''s that hook that makes you want to come back and keep playing it, like a glutton for punishment. To become stronger, and overcome adversity. If there''s one thing to complain about (and for which I remove a star), it''s that the punishment of dying in the game is sitting through long load times...not nearly as bad as Fallout 4''s...'),
(N'Brian', N'Khan', N'brian.khan3496@example.net', '2016-01-18', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Brown', N'stephanie.brown7019@example.net', '2016-01-18', 5, N'Worked great arrived on time great buy.'),
(N'Walter', N'Johnson', N'walter.johnson1173@example.org', '2016-01-18', 5, N'Love this game!'),
(N'Justin', N'Jones', N'justin.jones8135@example.org', '2016-01-18', 5, N'Awakening was my first Fire Emblem and since then i''ve went on to play the rest of the series. If you play this and like it then you''ll probably become a fan like I did. Even after playing the rest of the series I still believe Awakening is one of the best in the series. Super accessible and, much like Pokemon, it can played in many different ways so skilled fans can find some challenge. This game does not restrict you and force you to play one way but instead allows you to be creative (similar to older games like FE3). Every playthrough of this game will be vastly different, and the fun is endless.'),
(N'Christine', N'Webb', N'christine.webb6085@example.net', '2016-01-19', 5, N'FUN FUN FUN'),
(N'Priya', N'Bailey', N'priya.bailey5659@example.net', '2016-01-19', 5, N'I love the fact that they opened up the customization back to the old Underground days. For the next installment, please keep all the customization the same. Keep the drifting mechanics the same, it took me a long time to get used to. But, please don''t make it just take place at night. What is the point of spending 3 hours making the perfect wrap for my car just to have it never be seen? It would be nice to be able to enter your car into "online shows" where you can either walk around and look at other players cars and maybe vote on the best one.'),
(N'Amy', N'Chen', N'amy.chen2722@example.net', '2016-01-19', 5, N'I''ve been a huge fan of Gundam for about 18 years now, collecting the models and watching the TV shows. This is my first Gundam video game since battle assault 1&2 on the original PlayStation. For starters, don''t panic when you open this game and everything is in Japanese. Most of the menus have enough English to navigate around them. As far as all of the stats of your mobile suit go, there are plenty of translation guides available thanks to the internet. Gameplay is pretty solid hack and slash style, so you''ll mostly be mashing triangle and circle while alternating between holding L and R. By about an hour into the game I''ve already figured the combat system out pretty well. Customizing your mobile suit is fun, and you can combine parts from a wide variety of units, though you have to unlock these parts by playing the game. Once you''ve gotten your perfect suit set up, take your creation to the paint shop and make it look unique. The sheer amount of possibilities in your mobile...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Diaz', N'kathleen.diaz4481@example.com', '2016-01-19', 3, N'Umm if great if you like pushing and pulling box puzzles...i do not...but its well rendered'),
(N'Mark', N'Kowalski', N'mark.kowalski9773@example.org', '2016-01-19', 5, N'This is a great keyboard for the money. It looks great with the light up keys. My son has a gaming computer and this works really well for him. I may even buy a second one for him for when this one dies.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Ortiz', N'deborah.ortiz4598@example.com', '2016-01-19', 5, N'It was a Christmas Gift for someone else.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Hill', N'patricia.hill5449@example.org', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Fast delivery & my son loves this game'),
(N'Patricia', N'Hill', N'patricia.hill5449@example.org', '2016-01-19', 5, N'It came fast & works perfectly.'),
(N'Carol', N'Henderson', N'carol.henderson7299@example.com', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Although I purchased this game through gold live store (I missed the 10 dollar gold deal from hesitating), I felt i should leave feedback for those curious about the game. First off, this isn''t COD. It''s a relaxing casual thinking game. This game kind of has a Veronica Mars vibe to it--at least to me. You investigate literally everything you see. You can go back in time to a certain point if you change your mind, need to give yourself extra time to finish (or find answers) a task. Every choice (and the way you treat people) from the very start of the game will impact events in the past, present and future. *Spoiler* The ending is something i need to address because it can become very hard and (dark) to make your final choice. I chose to Save Chloe for 2 reasons: saving the town means the game developers get the last laugh as literally everything you''ve done for 15 hours was for nothing and I developed a character bond with her.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Turner', N'jennifer.turner9250@example.com', '2016-01-19', 5, N'It fits and works perfectly.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Perez', N'jennifer.perez4276@example.org', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Needed it'),
(N'John', N'Gomez', N'john.gomez3934@example.org', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Are you a kid, or a squid....Or are you both at the same time (the illusive squidkid)! It should be noted that the player needs to grind to get to level 10, which is where the game -really- begins (going through the single player campaign DOES NOT add to that goal).'),
(N'Amara', N'Coleman', N'amara.coleman4500@example.com', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Great device with the added game bonus. My son loves it!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Morgan', N'benjamin.morgan5496@example.org', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Works amazingly. The package is covered in Japanese, but the remote is in English. I bought a cheaper knock off and had to return it because the joysticks wouldn''t function right. Do yourself a favor and buy this one! It''s flawless!'),
(N'Patrick', N'King', N'patrick.king9301@example.org', '2016-01-19', 5, N'I can honestly give it a 5 star. It''s got a nifty amount of room. I also have the Nerf Armor for my 3DS, and it fits in the bag with it and one of the 24 game official nintendo cases. Im sure it would fit even the 34 game case. I also carry a healthy amount of game booklets (not the cases) as well in the main pouch. The charger and accessories fit in the top zipper bag, leaving me the front pouch for any lose headphones and items if I have them. I have not tested the shoulder strap, but im giving this a 5 anyway because straps in general on any product like this or a duffle tend to give eventually and sooner than you want, so I didn''t purchase this one for the strap but for the space I was hoping it had and does. As a guy it would be sort of purse-y to use the strap. You would want more of a messanger bag look as a guy with a strap, for me anyway. I recommend this bag if your looking for a larger bag for all the DS/3DS components rather than the standard smaller official ones. As...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2016-01-19', 4, N'Defiance is a super strange animal It was built around a new SyFi series set in a massive online open world This game broke new ground for console gaming But, of course you had every attention starved YouTube star trash this title from the jump Gamers need to stop listening to so many jerk-off so called gaming channels TheAngryJoes, Boogie, etc. don''t pay for games or even hardware for that matter (Payola) is massive in the gaming press and youtube stars really can''t be trusted The game itself has been free to Play for a bit now (You just need a Premium account) and a good size amount of space on your HD Story: Is actually enjoyable if you watched the series it makes more sense (everything ties into the first two seasons) And it''s not overly complicated and lazy The V/O and Graphics are pretty good The Gameplay it''s like GTA/Saints Row meets Star Wars it''s a fun 3rd person open world shooter, etc. Just because you are on a online server doesn''t mean you have to play with others the...'),
(N'Judith', N'Cook', N'judith.cook4282@example.net', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Great Deals twelve games for download with this pass. Free Trials of new games like star wars battlefront and NHL 16. greatest product ever I love sports games i can play all last years games in one place without sweating the price right now I can play madden 25 FIFA 15 NHL 15 and titanfall as much as a want'),
(N'Brenda', N'Thompson', N'brenda.thompson6771@example.net', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Nice!'),
(N'Laura', N'Moore', N'laura.moore3261@example.com', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Great accessory for the PS4! Takes care of the system if it starts to produce a lot of heat because it''s running a higher end graphics game, doubles as a charging station for two controllers, and it is a slick, sleek way for you PS4 to stand up vertically without taking up much space! A must have accessory in my opinion.'),
(N'Robert', N'Ferreira', N'robert.ferreira6557@example.net', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Disney Infinity has done a wonderful job sculpting Luke & Leia in exquisite detail. I''m always impressed with these figures. My daughter proudly displays each and everyone of them in her room.'),
(N'Robert', N'Ferreira', N'robert.ferreira6557@example.net', '2016-01-19', 5, N'Disney Infinity has done a wonderful job sculpting Ultron in exquisite detail. I''m always impressed with these figures. My daughter proudly displays each and everyone of them in her room.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Harris', N'jennifer.harris3732@example.org', '2016-01-20', 5, N'Great purchase for my kid. The figure does what its supposed to do, the only downside is you have to unlock the character in game before you can use the figure and play as Darth Maul. Luckily he is one of the early characters you unlock if you get/have the Disney Infinity 3.0 Star Wars starter pack.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Parker', N'shirley.parker3036@example.net', '2016-01-20', 4, N'Okay....so it took me a year to finish the main story line quest on this game. I got into it last winter when I first purchased my Xbox One and enjoed it, but got sidetracked with life and ignored up until this last weekend. If you enjoyed Dead Island, then you will definitely enjoy this title. It''s probably what Dead Island should have been when it was released. The game itself is fun, fast paced and the story is actually semi-decent for what it is. Pros: Good main story line and side quests are well thought out Mechanics feel good after playing for a little while It''s just challenging enough Cons: Plagued with video tearing Loading times when entering and leaving areas can be long First person free running can induce motion sickness for some people. No 3rd person option.'),
(N'Anna', N'Thompson', N'anna.thompson3961@example.org', '2016-01-20', 5, N'my son loved it'),
(N'Janet', N'Ruiz', N'janet.ruiz6146@example.com', '2016-01-20', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Lee', N'ashley.lee1787@example.net', '2016-01-20', 5, N'Very happy with the item'),
(N'Amy', N'Adams', N'amy.adams9655@example.net', '2016-01-20', 5, N'Thank you Amazon works good it came when they said it would and I saved money!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Parker', N'aaron.parker7031@example.com', '2016-01-20', 5, N'A great add-on to a great game!!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Parker', N'amanda.parker1748@example.net', '2016-01-20', 2, N'Unless you''re a 13 year old girl or someone who just buys video games for the scintillating dialogue, don''t waste your money on this game. It''s a series of point and click vignettes following Maxine Caulfield as she learns that she has the power to rewind time. It''s a very juvenile story and it takes so long for anything to happen. The biggest part of the first episode is Max and her punk friend Chloe looking for bottles in a junk yard so they can use them for target practice. There is some deeper story of a missing girl and possible date rape drugging butA I was so bored with it by the end of chapter 2, I just couldn''t take any more. This Limited edition comes with a book of illustrations as well as a soundtrack CD neither of which add any value to the thing for me. I really just feel like I''ve wasted my money on this one.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Wood', N'amanda.wood7994@example.com', '2016-01-20', 5, N'I was really bored and wanted a new game so I picked this up since it was cheap. It''s very difference from what I''m used to. It''s slow and relaxing.. not like fallout 4 or witcher 3. It''s cool because the main character is 18 and a senior in highschool just like me. It''s a great game so far and it''s definitely worth it for 30 bucks.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Reed', N'nicholas.reed7820@example.org', '2016-01-20', 3, N'Works like a mouse should, no profile switching ON the mouse just the software which results in annoying and OFTEN buggy dpi switching after starting/ exiting a program.'),
(N'Robert', N'Barnes', N'robert.barnes1323@example.org', '2016-01-20', 5, N'item loaded and is working fine'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2016-01-20', 3, N'Life is Strange is barley a game It''s like every Telltale Games in the last 4 years This game would''ve fit in during the Sega CD era It''s a point and click slow burn that isn''t for everybody It''s the biggest problem with the 8th generation (Arcade titles are bad but, Indies are god''s gift) There''s been a handful of standout and incredible titles but, then you have the other side of the coin with Deer God, #Idarb, Super Time Force, Volgarr the Viking A game like this that can be played on smart phones and tablets should not be over priced at $40.00 bucks If it was Limited number and signed by the team behind it then that would make sense but, it''s not The Story is ok but, also very convoluted The Controls are stripped down and basic Graphics are a little above average (Graphics are Not a game breaker for me but this title could''ve easily been on the Sega CD or Dreamcast It''s nothing that pushes Next Gen hardware this title can run on a tablet I didn''t pay $400.00 buck to play $5.00...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Taylor', N'joyce.taylor2536@example.com', '2016-01-20', 5, N'airplane games? You need this. no question. just do it. its a no brainer.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Thompson', N'kelly.thompson3303@example.com', '2016-01-20', 4, N'If I could change anything on this it would be for the top keys to also light up and for the LEDs to be brighter. They are dull-ish and the letters are small so only a little bit of light gets through. Other than that this is a great keyboard for gaming and if you''re not ready to splurge on a mechanical.'),
(N'Dee', N'Wood', N'dee.wood7825@example.org', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Excellent sniper play with zombies'),
(N'Brandon', N'Rodriguez', N'brandon.rodriguez2616@example.net', '2016-01-21', 5, N'It is one of the best Wii games to get.'),
(N'Omar', N'Jimenez', N'omar.jimenez7175@example.com', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Parker', N'rebecca.parker7530@example.org', '2016-01-21', 4, N'The Corsair K30 Gaming Keyboard is another in a long line of high-quality Corsair electronics (many of which I own). In addition to the standard QWERTY key configuration, the K30 also includes six programmable "G" keys that allow you to program your favorite keystroke combinations into one button. With the addition of three memory keys, and 36K on-board memory, you have the capability to program 18 different keystroke combos - more than enough for even the most hardcore gamer. My only complaint on the "G" keys is that they are positioned on the left side of the keyboard and it took quite awhile for me to stop hitting the "G1" key rather than the ESC key. However, the left side placement is proper for easy left-hand access. Other keys included on the keyboard are volume controls, FFWD/REV/Play/Pause music controls, and a keyboard lock so that you won''t undo your keyboard presets. The keyboard is backlit with a red light which is adjustable to three different levels as well as...'),
(N'Jacob', N'Sullivan', N'jacob.sullivan8801@example.net', '2016-01-21', 5, N'bowser amiibo.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Sullivan', N'jacob.sullivan8801@example.net', '2016-01-21', 5, N'thanks for the pip boy. btw don''t touch that black, square button.'),
(N'Anna', N'Sanchez', N'anna.sanchez1951@example.com', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Not only is it a great ps4 game, it''s a great game in general. Awesome graphics and amazing story. A vast open world and you have superpowers! What more do you want?'),
(N'Timothy', N'Gomez', N'timothy.gomez5743@example.net', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Just as good as the US version. I take them out of the package so I do not care about the box. The actual amiibo is good looking, very quality even though these are less popular characters.'),
(N'Betty', N'Sanders', N'betty.sanders4475@example.org', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Prefect.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ward', N'victoria.ward7797@example.net', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ward', N'victoria.ward7797@example.net', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Great deal and Great ad on for PS4'),
(N'Lucia', N'Reyes', N'lucia.reyes6636@example.org', '2016-01-21', 5, N'i love this 3ds its is my first ds ever i love it highly recamended'),
(N'Paul', N'Ivanov', N'paul.ivanov9407@example.org', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Product as described with fast shipping and delivery! Good quality product.'),
(N'Paul', N'Ivanov', N'paul.ivanov9407@example.org', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Excellent game with killer graphics. Product as described with fast as hipping and delivery. Long game with kick ass gameplay!'),
(N'Paul', N'Ivanov', N'paul.ivanov9407@example.org', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Excellent game with killer graphics. Product as described with fast shipping and delivery. Long game with kick ass gameplay!'),
(N'Emily', N'Young', N'emily.young2603@example.com', '2016-01-21', 5, N'I play all the lego games with my children (5 + 7). They enjoyed the story which is a lego spin on the 4 jurassic park movies. Game play can sometimes be difficult for them to do missions themselves, because it''s puzzle based of having the correct character to move along. So for younger kids you should be prepared to hop in and help them, because it''s not always clear what to do.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2016-01-21', 5, N'If anyone was lucky enough to play the two play Arcade Cabinet of The Punisher This comes super close to that arcade version Graphics close to identical to the original (If you have a modded Sega Genesis and can get a RGB SCART cable to HDMI) I''m sure it will be a perfect arcade port) This is one of the best Genesis titles close to the end of the fourth generation I''m a bit shocked this title never ended up on the N64, Playstation, or Saturn Controls easy to pick up and play Better to play co-op in two player mode along Nick Fury Sound A+ a few of the sound effects are slightly off (but, if you never put time in at the Arcade and played this you''d never know) Fun factor/Story this is a side scrolling beat ''em up/hack and slash with guns and over the top arcade gun play It''s a little odd the Arcade/Genesis games were tame but, the later THQ''s Punisher for the PS2 & XBox were heavily censored/cut to not get a Adult rating This is bar far one of the best and most underrated 16 bit...'),
(N'Kofi', N'Wright', N'kofi.wright7449@example.net', '2016-01-21', 5, N'Great gift and it arrived on time. Works very well and no complaints.'),
(N'Larry', N'Martinez', N'larry.martinez7233@example.com', '2016-01-21', 4, N'I was offered a Kootek vertical stand to review, which I gladly accepted at no cost. We are a gaming family and our PS4 gets quite a bit of use. Up to this point, we didn''t have anything like this, so I was looking forward to trying it out. The stand allows your PS4 to sit in it upright. You take the USB cable and plug it into your PS4. That will give power to the charging ports and the fans. It will also give you two additional USB ports for you to use, expanding the two you normally have on the pS4 to 4 total. It can charge two PS4 controllers. They fit down into the base upside down. I really do wish though that it had some sort of indicator that the controllers are plugged in properly and charging, or an indicator that they are charged. You kinda just have to plug them in and go. I haven''t had any problems with keeping my controllers charged, since having this, since we keep them on the base while not in use. We have three controllers, so it works out great. It should be noted,...'),
(N'Luis', N'Walker', N'luis.walker9573@example.net', '2016-01-22', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Gregory', N'Miller', N'gregory.miller3209@example.net', '2016-01-22', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Joan', N'Jackson', N'joan.jackson1268@example.com', '2016-01-22', 1, N'Doesn''t work at all!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Thomas', N'kathleen.thomas1413@example.org', '2016-01-22', 5, N'have been playing non stop since it arrived.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Stewart', N'thomas.stewart6202@example.net', '2016-01-22', 5, N'The game is very well graphic for a Dreamcast game and is good at filling time. If you don''t like rpg games this isn''t for you but if you like a good story your best getting the first game before playing this one'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Thomas', N'benjamin.thomas9387@example.net', '2016-01-22', 5, N'This is truly amazing product it works flawlessly I use the xbox one elite and the razer wildcat controller on ps4 with a compatible usb hub and wow couldn''t be better this product is worth more than what it sells for! Please give this a Chance in was very skeptical at first I couldn''t believe it when I finally got everything they I needed to be if any one has any questions please ask I''ll do my best if I can''t help youtube has helped alot'),
(N'Anita', N'Powell', N'anita.powell4796@example.org', '2016-01-22', 5, N'As described. Fast shipping'),
(N'Joshua', N'Ramirez', N'joshua.ramirez1860@example.net', '2016-01-22', 5, N'Keep my interest'),
(N'Aisha', N'Anderson', N'aisha.anderson7802@example.org', '2016-01-22', 4, N'pretty much as expected coming from Fifa 15, the changes to midfield play is a welcome addition as its much more realistic'),
(N'Peter', N'Stewart', N'peter.stewart3640@example.com', '2016-01-22', 5, N'This game is so much fun'),
(N'Jose', N'Anderson', N'jose.anderson7264@example.com', '2016-01-22', 5, N'Item was as advertised and great price too. Would recommend to others.'),
(N'Megan', N'Bailey', N'megan.bailey5844@example.net', '2016-01-22', 5, N'great, fun game really funny at times'),
(N'Heather', N'Turner', N'heather.turner6657@example.com', '2016-01-22', 5, N'The best game of all time. I play this competitively and love it to death. It''s amazing! You NEED to have this game in your library. If you don''t, there''s something wrong.'),
(N'Michael', N'Wilson', N'michael.wilson9774@example.com', '2016-01-22', 4, N'Good product !!'),
(N'Heather', N'Phillips', N'heather.phillips2290@example.org', '2016-01-22', 5, N'Love this game. Last time that I played MGS was ps1 era. Yes, been a while there but this is way awesome due to graphic change and more'),
(N'Heather', N'Phillips', N'heather.phillips2290@example.org', '2016-01-22', 5, N'Awesome game.'),
(N'Omar', N'Morgan', N'omar.morgan2028@example.com', '2016-01-22', 2, N'Same as the other LEGO games only now you pay more $$$ for additional sets instead of earning them in-game. Went to take it back and was told NO since it is impossible to know if the 250+ pieces really are there. So no shops will take or sell these second hand. Lego is already making money hand over fist just another means of draining our wallets buy only buying new. Go with Disney Infinity. Can make your own Toy Box levels and figures are sold second hand everywhere.'),
(N'Robert', N'Howard', N'robert.howard4904@example.org', '2016-01-22', 5, N'Good product and prompt delivery service! I am a happy customer!'),
(N'Anita', N'Ruiz', N'anita.ruiz9438@example.org', '2016-01-23', 4, N'My grandson loves it'),
(N'Angela', N'Clark', N'angela.clark4096@example.com', '2016-01-23', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Aisha', N'Kumar', N'aisha.kumar5976@example.org', '2016-01-23', 1, N'Microsoft''s customer service is the worst thing ive ever had to deal with, ive had COUNTLESS problems ranging from console, controller, to even bullying on xbox, and they have NEVER solved one issue, or made ANYTHING BETTER. Be warned, if your bullied on xbox and you report someones, if they get their friends to report you more, you WILL GET BANNED. they take the side of the aggressors. Worthless purchase, same problems as 360 just with a different face, console issues, controller issues. They really upped the bar on terrible consoles with this paperweight.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Carter', N'amanda.carter2789@example.net', '2016-01-23', 3, N'3 Stars because of these following reasons - Not using SD or microSD, if you want the 32gb memory card, it will cost more than the system - Wireless controller (DS4 specifically) has random lags that makes it impossible to play games that require precise control - not enough compatible games, there is absolutely no reason for all the games to work with vita tv.. just remap all the buttons This system is only recommended if you already have a spare vita memory card, ps3 or ps4'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Morris', N'kathleen.morris4716@example.net', '2016-01-23', 5, N'One of my favorite games'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Morris', N'kathleen.morris4716@example.net', '2016-01-23', 5, N'This game is more or less a visual novel, has a great story. I really love the decision making aspect.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Rogers', N'alexander.rogers5323@example.org', '2016-01-23', 4, N'Good'),
(N'William', N'Patel', N'william.patel2602@example.com', '2016-01-23', 3, N'As much as I want to like this game, it killed the RPG aspects of Fallout and made it a grindfeast shooter with no real depth. I''ve played all the other games in the series for hundreds of hours, but I stopped when I beat this and haven''t wanted to play it again.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Castillo', N'marcus.castillo1431@example.net', '2016-01-23', 5, N'These four joysticks came in a small plastic bag inside of an envelope, so I was a little bit worried about potential damage; however, they arrived in great condition! Installation was a little bit of a struggle just because random small pieces fell out, but so long as you watch a YouTube guide and follow the instructions, installation shouldn''t take more than 3-5 minutes. I''ve had the new joysticks installed on both of my PS4 controllers for about a week now, and they show no signs of wear-and-tear after about 10-15 hours of use. The look great and feel great!'),
(N'Henry', N'Raghunathan', N'henry.raghunathan9449@example.com', '2016-01-23', 1, N'STAY AWAY IF YOU LIKE RACING. Most TERRIBLE Racing game in all aspects what I played (I played/completed almost them all). Not a 1 Star, but it deserves 0.01 Star. Graphics - blur, AI - completely stupid idiots(team AI), Traffic run on you most of times, AI also smash you all time(they simply don''t see You aroun), All time You will race at night, Story - completely stupid (looks story script was wrote by mental sick teen or kid), All races looks ~ same & in same places (rince and repeat) , 5hr or so You will watch only cut-scenes, Movie style with stupid & dirty teens. Customization for some cars very poor (for Lamborghini Aventador LP-700-4, which was my primary car - You can change ONLY wheels,splitter,spoiler,exhaust & change paint - "great"Customization. :( If You are Trophies or Achievements hunter - near the end game will made You insane, because terrible & broken gameplay (not a easy 100% completion) *AVOID*'),
(N'Katherine', N'Coleman', N'katherine.coleman1400@example.net', '2016-01-23', 5, N'Came in great. Thank you.'),
(N'Michael', N'Sanders', N'michael.sanders6455@example.org', '2016-01-23', 5, N'My son seems very happy with it, so far so good.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Bell', N'olivia.bell7206@example.com', '2016-01-23', 4, N'Works well. update controller after is easy with no issues'),
(N'Joyce', N'Foster', N'joyce.foster2876@example.org', '2016-01-23', 5, N'great!!'),
(N'Larry', N'Myers', N'larry.myers6645@example.com', '2016-01-24', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Ryan', N'Kumar', N'ryan.kumar4838@example.net', '2016-01-24', 5, N'Heavy and good quality with a retro look.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wilson', N'jacqueline.wilson5927@example.com', '2016-01-24', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Eric', N'Gomez', N'eric.gomez8681@example.net', '2016-01-24', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Castillo', N'elizabeth.castillo5057@example.net', '2016-01-24', 5, N'Works and looks great on my white Xbox one Lunar white controller'),
(N'Yuki', N'Kumar', N'yuki.kumar1428@example.net', '2016-01-24', 5, N'got this for the wife after i got one. she had gotten the fitbit and returned it because she didn''t like how it felt on her wrist. so my solution was for her to try one of these that i had gotten. she likes this much better. it can go in her pocket or clip onto it. syncs with the game just fine and she likes it. very neat to see these sync with the different things in the wii fit u game. these are very accurate and work well. the display is a nice size too. another plus is the cost, id much rather lose one of these than a $90+ expensive fitness tracker.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Mitchell', N'stephen.mitchell4813@example.com', '2016-01-24', 4, N'NOT FOR KIDS UNDER 18!!!'),
(N'Jason', N'Boyd', N'jason.boyd7860@example.org', '2016-01-24', 5, N'LOVE IT!!!!!!!!!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Phillips', N'joshua.phillips5914@example.com', '2016-01-24', 5, N'Great game! My 5 year old loves these movies, and loves this game. Great idea having both the first and last movies together in 1 game.'),
(N'Brian', N'Roberts', N'brian.roberts4072@example.com', '2016-01-24', 5, N'Best MMO EVER'),
(N'Kofi', N'Lewis', N'kofi.lewis5606@example.com', '2016-01-25', 2, N'Let me start by saying this was a good keyboard while it worked. My story: I purchased two of these last year at Christmas, One for me and one for my kid. A year or so later, Both of these keyboards on different computers died at the "exact same time" with the exact same symptom. We turned on the computers and the only keys that worked were some of the number keys (not num pad). I did some troubleshooting and investigative work but nothing worked. Very strange.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Sanders', N'victoria.sanders1289@example.net', '2016-01-25', 4, N'Disney has made a lot of emphasis on presenting Disney Infinity as a family game. Something parents can play with their children. In my (admittedly short) experience playing Infinity 3.0, this playset is probably the best example of that notion. Inside Out is straight-up platform game where you collect certain things (manual pages, idea bulbs etc...) and meet certain objectives (pop all the balloons, meet certain time requirements...) to finish the game. On top of that, some objectives require the specific ability of one of the characters (Joy, Sadness, Fear, Anger and Disgust) to achieve. Keep in mind though, you don''t need to buy all the Inside Out figures to finish this playset. The game cleverly works around this by allowing you to transform into other characters at certain times when needed so you can achieve 100% completion whether you have one or all the figures. I have 3 of them (Joy, Anger and Disgust) and I''m thinking of getting them all anyway as they are quite...'),
(N'Judith', N'Baker', N'judith.baker9260@example.org', '2016-01-25', 4, N'gift'),
(N'Justin', N'Myers', N'justin.myers2565@example.com', '2016-01-25', 5, N'I am a huge Animal Crossing fan, so when I saw the new Animal Crossing amiibo I knew I had to have all of them. (I am building my collection and will post pictures of all of them when I get them!) The Tom Nook and Mabel Amiibo are the ones I have gotten so far and they both live up to all my expectations and more! Their paint jobs are near perfect, and they look just like they do in Animal Crossing New Leaf and Happy Home! If you know any Animal Crossing fans I highly recommend purchasing these amiibo as they make an awesome gifts and are wonderful to display.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Torres', N'carlos.torres2531@example.net', '2016-01-25', 5, N'This was one of those games that I hadn''t really heard much about beforehand, but now after playing is in my top 10 list. Typically for games like this that have multiple episodes (like the Telltale games) I try to ignore them until they''re all available and can get them all at once. When I decided to check this out, I went for the limited edition just cause it had the extras for about $10 bucks or so more (and was under the new 20% off deal with Amazon). So I figured why not. I''m kind of obsessed with the soundtrack after playing through the game - I loved the music throughout it. So for me that was enough to make the limited edition worth it. If you don''t really care about that, then I suggest just buying the standard game. The art book has some cool art sketches in parts of it, however the book is nothing I''d really miss... I think they should of done some exerts of Max''s journal writings that we didn''t see in the game or maybe notes from Chloe ? Something to make it more...'),
(N'Steven', N'Wood', N'steven.wood9195@example.net', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Great product, fair price and fast delivery. Great seller.'),
(N'Melissa', N'James', N'melissa.james5273@example.com', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Ryan', N'Martinez', N'ryan.martinez3759@example.org', '2016-01-25', 5, N'if ur obsessed with the show such as I..perfect game for u..fun fighting too'),
(N'Paul', N'Perez', N'paul.perez1100@example.com', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Samuel', N'Flores', N'samuel.flores3765@example.org', '2016-01-25', 4, N'I''m a big Blizzard and Diablo fan, loved Diablo 1 and 2, this one is fun but I wish they would have kept more of the game play design from the first and second games. In this game, the magic users only seem to use their spells to attack even if they have a big club in their hand, and sometimes you just need to bash the creature instead of blasting it with a spell that is meant to take down much larger monsters. Still it''s fun to play, so far my favorite character to play is the Demon Hunter.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Torres', N'katherine.torres2889@example.net', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Price', N'yuki.price3509@example.org', '2016-01-25', 5, N'OK!!!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Turner', N'jessica.turner2893@example.com', '2016-01-25', 2, N'had to return it to gexchange it with one that worked'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Sullivan', N'jeremy.sullivan3286@example.net', '2016-01-25', 5, N'My daughter loved this bundle. I''ve never played but she seems to be having loads of fun.'),
(N'Robert', N'Wisniewski', N'robert.wisniewski6477@example.com', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Fast delivery accurate description.'),
(N'Wei', N'Stewart', N'wei.stewart7874@example.net', '2016-01-25', 5, N'this controller performs just like the original, we purchased it to use on the retron5 because the blue-tooth controller seemed to have some lag issues involved with it. ordered 2 of these from amazon and all the problems are gone. so far it is my educated opinion that Hyperkin makes some very decent equipment, and if you like to retro game they are the people to talk to.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Jackson', N'samuel.jackson2497@example.org', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Great case! It looks amazing and holds my 6 games, an extra stylus, and my New 3DS XL snugly without a big space imprint! Not sure how I''d feel dropping my system in this, but it''s great to carry my 3DS stuff around in a small package. Co-workers often compliment the retro Zelda look as well which is always nice! Can not fit a charger, but I''ve never understood the need as I''ll normally just pack it along with my phone charger. Snug fit, holds everything I need for a long bus/plane trip, and looks great!'),
(N'Helen', N'Green', N'helen.green1897@example.net', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Great for connecting any Xbox One wireless device to your PC for gaming use.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Fisher', N'olivia.fisher6233@example.net', '2016-01-25', 5, N'Awesome quality case thanks!!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Fisher', N'olivia.fisher6233@example.net', '2016-01-25', 4, N'The steel book is great, the game was just ok for me.'),
(N'Robert', N'Jimenez', N'robert.jimenez3324@example.com', '2016-01-26', 5, N'Thank. You'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Smith', N'kenneth.smith1392@example.net', '2016-01-26', 5, N'Typical madden.'),
(N'Jack', N'Ortiz', N'jack.ortiz8083@example.com', '2016-01-26', 4, N'This is a very nice Letton headset. I think it''s great that you can use this not only on a computer, but for a gaming console as well. I love using this with my Xbox 360 when I play my multiplayer games with my friends and family that live in other states. I didn''t realize I could use this with my 360 until it arrived and a small piece of paper inside, showed it being connected into a 360 controller. I was ecstatic, because I have an old generic, very plain headset with one earpiece and it has been going out for a while, so I''ve replaced it with this Letton headset now. I like the soft cushion at the very top of the headset that goes over the top of my head. It feels quite comfortable. I have no trouble wearing this for a long extended period of time. I haven''t had any trouble with the mic. My friends can hear me fine and I even went into the menu where you leave a voice msg for a friend, and I tested it out this way by recording myself talking into this mic and it played back...'),
(N'David', N'James', N'david.james7410@example.com', '2016-01-26', 5, N'Worked as intended.'),
(N'Donald', N'Henderson', N'donald.henderson8605@example.net', '2016-01-26', 5, N'great'),
(N'Jason', N'Allen', N'jason.allen9145@example.org', '2016-01-26', 5, N'TwT weight goal now a possible fun- thnk u so much'),
(N'Jason', N'Allen', N'jason.allen9145@example.org', '2016-01-26', 5, N'QwQ it''s so cute!!!- i cant stop playin'),
(N'Omar', N'Wisniewski', N'omar.wisniewski4601@example.com', '2016-01-26', 2, N'First and foremost, this game is NOT in 3D!!! Which makes me wonder why bother putting it on the 3DS in the first place? The graphics are cheap, designs even cheaper. Honestly, I think this was meant to be another game entirely and it got slathered in a Final Fantasy skin to try and help it sell. Plot is thin at best, repetitive quests, and did I mention the poor design and lack of 3D? If the graphics were better, than that alone would make up for it, but this game is just terrible all around, stay away.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Robinson', N'kimberly.robinson3085@example.net', '2016-01-26', 5, N'My son loves his wiiu all though if he could he would be playing any chance he could but I have a rule and time limit on the video game usage in my home. Was a great price and happy to buy for him. You can also play your wii games on this as well so we still get use out of the wii games and just gave the wii game to another kid.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Wood', N'tyler.wood2179@example.org', '2016-01-26', 5, N'This controller is SOO cool. I love it. The design is clean and really modern looking. It also feels sleeker, and more precise (triggers are more realistic and buttons are snappier) when you''re playing. I''ve had the controller for many months now (maybe a year? I honestly can''t remember. A long time) and I''ve never had a problem with it. Little tip, make your product sexier with Amazon rechargeable batteries (I don''t work for Amazon). These wireless controllers go through batters pretty quickly so I really would save yourself some money in the long run and buy a rechargeable battery of some brand or another.'),
(N'Linda', N'Walker', N'linda.walker1367@example.net', '2016-01-26', 5, N'Coolest and most interesting controller I ever had. I wish I could reskin my xbox one controller like this it''s also very durable and you can''t tell but the surface has a rough texture in places and actual scratches which adds to the cool factor quite a bit.'),
(N'Maria', N'Wang', N'maria.wang8535@example.com', '2016-01-26', 5, N'Great game and a really great price!'),
(N'Christina', N'Chen', N'christina.chen3493@example.net', '2016-01-26', 1, N'The game sucks. Absolutely horrible. Played it twice and never wanted to touch it again. $35 is a rip off for this. Wouldn''t pay $5 for it.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Wood', N'mateo.wood4055@example.com', '2016-01-26', 5, N'If you don''t know about Tetris, you must have lived under a rock for the last 30 years... No wait... even the rock people know about Tetris! This game is intuitive for the beginner, but is it really ever mastered? For me, this is the go-to version of Tetris!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Brooks', N'jennifer.brooks7662@example.com', '2016-01-26', 3, N'Lacks sorry individual of series'),
(N'Nathan', N'Garcia', N'nathan.garcia6010@example.com', '2016-01-26', 4, N'IMO get the one with 12 buttons on the side, same company, same mouse, more buttons.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Ali', N'anthony.ali7251@example.org', '2016-01-26', 5, N'This little guy is one of the best amiibo figures out there! Nintendo definitely stepped up the quality on the Lucas figure because it looks just about as good as he does in game! I''d hate to say it, but he puts the Ness amiibo to shame with his overall quality, vibrancy, and detail.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Moore', N'nicholas.moore5899@example.com', '2016-01-26', 4, N'Materials are very good, Overall quality is amazing. Cable is kind of short. Adequate just for to be near your computer but, if you expect to use it with your tv when sitting at the couch, you will need an extension cable. Bass is good.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Gray', N'stephen.gray4321@example.org', '2016-01-27', 5, N'The Sims 3: Master Suite Stuff This is a really nice addition to your sims 3!!!!!!!! You get a really nice repertoire of stuff! Stuff you didn''t even think you need too lol. indulge in relaxing and romantic evenings with their special someones. Refurnish the bathroom with a well-crafted vanity, and let your Sims take a load off with a bubble bath in a spa-worthy tub. Add classic style with a beautiful 40s-inspired chair. Get rid of the worn-down old cot that was in the bedroom, and replace it with an elegant canopy-style bed. Light a few candles, turn down the lights, spread rose petals across the bedroom floor and let the new intimate wear seduce your Sims for one red-hot romantic evening. Let your Sims let down their hair, and give them a fun new style. When you get home from work, you like to kick back and relax don''t you think your Sims would like that too?'),
(N'Emma', N'Ramirez', N'emma.ramirez7870@example.org', '2016-01-27', 5, N'works great');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Scott', N'Ortiz', N'scott.ortiz5178@example.net', '2016-01-27', 5, N'Blue switches makes much noise. Not problem for me. Light of keyboard is very strong. Thats the most part i love that keyboard.'),
(N'Karen', N'Peterson', N'karen.peterson6595@example.net', '2016-01-27', 5, N'Immersive at least'),
(N'Justin', N'Morgan', N'justin.morgan8814@example.com', '2016-01-27', 4, N'If you have a good internet connection, it works fantastic as a remote play device for your Playstation 4.'),
(N'Brian', N'Allen', N'brian.allen4542@example.com', '2016-01-27', 5, N'Hours of gameplay with all the different modes to play. The campaign has some of the best graphics by far on the PS4. Everyone giving bad reviews are just not good at the multiplayer aspect of the game. By far the best Call Of Duty yet.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Wisniewski', N'deborah.wisniewski6832@example.com', '2016-01-27', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Sanchez', N'nathan.sanchez3188@example.com', '2016-01-27', 5, N'My son loves this game and was happy with the special edition version.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Torres', N'amanda.torres7356@example.com', '2016-01-27', 2, N'I like it except for the fact only one of the controller charging parts work. I didn''t notice until today I''ve had it for about a week and I never tried to charge both controllers at once, but only one works. The fan works fine and keeps my system cool. Other than only one controlling charger working, it''s good.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Jenkins', N'hannah.jenkins2590@example.org', '2016-01-27', 3, N'A+++'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Parker', N'jeffrey.parker5490@example.net', '2016-01-27', 2, N'This product is under developed, trash! The trigger grips are very cheap and don''t feel good at all. do not waist your money on this one. instead purchace the nyko power grip, it hase a much more ergonomic grip.'),
(N'William', N'Ivanov', N'william.ivanov6336@example.org', '2016-01-27', 5, N'I grew up playing this game. Blizzard does an amazing job at creating memorable games and this is no exception at all. Star Craft is a true gaming classic and great. It is a Real Time Strategy game, meaning that you don''t take turns like you would in RISK but you have to manage your forces and be ready for the enemy forces at any time. The game puts the Terran vs the Protos, vs the Zerg. Each of the 3 races are 100% different and unique in their play style. If you haven''t played this before... WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR??'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Harris', N'jeremy.harris5323@example.org', '2016-01-27', 3, N'really liked it'),
(N'Amara', N'Moore', N'amara.moore7058@example.net', '2016-01-27', 5, N'Product arrived on time, as promised.'),
(N'Steven', N'Hall', N'steven.hall8927@example.com', '2016-01-27', 5, N'Fun game great graphics'),
(N'Amara', N'Torres', N'amara.torres2473@example.net', '2016-01-28', 1, N'VERY BORING WASTE OF MONEY'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Kim', N'jacqueline.kim2681@example.net', '2016-01-28', 5, N'good product'),
(N'Janet', N'Khan', N'janet.khan1147@example.net', '2016-01-28', 5, N'fast shipping, just as expected. Thankyou'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Foster', N'tomasz.foster3195@example.org', '2016-01-28', 5, N'I bought this game not expecting for it to be that great but I gotta admit that the gameplay blew me away and I got addicted to it pretty quickly! I was very impressed with the level of immersion and the change in graphics from Assassin''s Creed 3 to Assassin''s Creed 4! The one thing I didn''t care for too much was Edward''s character but... Overall that''s very easy to overlook and it''s a fantastic game!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Henderson', N'stephen.henderson8335@example.org', '2016-01-28', 5, N'I read good reviews about Infamous: Second Son and saw some gameplay online. It was the first game I bought for my PS4 when I bought it. I enjoyed playing the game from start to finish. The acting and storyline were great, and the graphics were pretty good. The Paper Trail mission was pretty unrewarding. You use the Internet and other resources to complete this optional mission. The main objective of the game is to absorb the power of "Conduits" to eliminate the antagonist and take her power to save the protagonist''s tribe. The character you''re tracking down in said mission has a specific power and doesn''t even bother absorbing it. That mission was not worth it. I wouldn''t mind if they made DLC for Eugene, Hank and even Augustine, like they did with Fetch. I''m sure the creators can make very good storylines with them. I felt the storyline wasn''t long enough. Still enjoyed it, though.'),
(N'Emma', N'Davis', N'emma.davis6637@example.com', '2016-01-28', 5, N'Excellent game, Steel case and like the price was great....'),
(N'Nicole', N'Tanaka', N'nicole.tanaka2917@example.com', '2016-01-28', 5, N'Excellent product!'),
(N'Zachary', N'Sanchez', N'zachary.sanchez5219@example.org', '2016-01-28', 1, N'What a waste. Sold it after a couple weeks I got so bored. Botched attempt. I''ll never pre order a game again without waiting for reviews.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Castillo', N'ethan.castillo8239@example.org', '2016-01-28', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Gutierrez', N'andrew.gutierrez6351@example.org', '2016-01-28', 1, N'No fun...'),
(N'Ivan', N'Peterson', N'ivan.peterson1709@example.net', '2016-01-28', 4, N'no comments'),
(N'Diane', N'Gutierrez', N'diane.gutierrez7185@example.net', '2016-01-28', 3, N'We''re a very avid gaming household who tend to buy and cycle through a lot of different keyboards, so we''re always on the lookout to try something new. My current keyboard is the SteelSeries Apex M800 Customizable Mechanical Gaming Keyboard which I''ve been using for almost a year now. Everything on the current SteelSeries keyboard still works flawlessly, however I love testing out new models from some of my favorite keyboard manufacturers. So I decided to give this Logitech G410 Atlas Spectrum RGB Tenkeyless Mechanical Gaming Keyboard a try. Here are my thoughts; Pros + Easy to install and set up. + Great response times, perfect for FPS games. + Sleek look with plenty of impressive RGB color schemes to choose from. + Rather quiet for a mechancial keyboard. + Mechanical keys are solid with some programmable options. + Very portable and extremely lightweight. Cons - Extremely pricey compared to other similar keyboards on the market. - Plastic construction feels cheap for the price...'),
(N'Debra', N'Morris', N'debra.morris7163@example.net', '2016-01-28', 5, N'I love the Cooking Mama series of games and I loved Gardening Mama even more! It''s such a fun little game! - As a wife and as a mom of 3 kids, I spend a lot of time shopping for deals on the best products out there for my family. It''s important to me that if we''re spending our hard earned money that we get a top notch product in return. I often rely on the reviews and opinions of others when contemplating purchasing a new product that I haven''t tried before myself. Because of that, any products that I buy (whether on Amazon or from a 3rd party) I always make sure to leave a detailed review of the product to help others when selecting items to purchase, as well. My family tests these products fully before forming a solid opinion and writing a review. When I write a review, I keep in mind that those reading are also looking for honesty about the product and want an unbiased opinion to go by. If my review has been helpful to you, please give me a "Yes" vote on my review. Thank you!'),
(N'Christina', N'Perry', N'christina.perry3212@example.net', '2016-01-28', 1, N'just a shooting game, its not like a war game like medal of honor or tom clancy games.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Roberts', N'joseph.roberts3384@example.com', '2016-01-28', 5, N'fun but hard for me to keep up, didn''t realize I was that awkward, lol'),
(N'Yuki', N'Ortiz', N'yuki.ortiz2487@example.com', '2016-01-29', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Paul', N'Hill', N'paul.hill6477@example.com', '2016-01-29', 2, N'Poorly animated. The animation is literally ps1 Era level. The graphics look OK, but not good. The voice acting is God - awful. Everything just seems so lifeless and the story is just not interesting enough to look past any of this. The combat system is interesting enough to give this +1 star, but I don''t think anything can save this game.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Ivanov', N'gregory.ivanov7782@example.com', '2016-01-29', 3, N'I''ve spent a fair amount of time on this game. It''s fun. But I called it average for a few glaring problems: -voice acting is just OK. -the game focuses too heavily on combat. -it''s still really, really glitchy. -stories are not personal or believable; you simply can''t feel for characters. Granted, I just came from playing Witcher 3, one of the best games ever made, which regularly tugs on your heart or forces glorious laughter from your chest. So knowing my bias, here''s what I like about fallout: -world is fairly detailed and fun to explore. -the crafting system can take up so much of your time, even in this currently limited time (mods are coming to console fallout sometime soon, so that will invigorate the crafting system). -combat feels correct for a shooter. -additions to the fallout back story are cool.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Lewis', N'michelle.lewis7636@example.org', '2016-01-29', 4, N'Wow. Just wow. This is my first mechanical keyboard. I used a Steelseries Apex http://www.amazon.com/SteelSeries-64145-Apex-Gaming-Keyboard/dp/B00DQ5RGOY/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&qid=1454116707&sr=8-1&keywords=steelseries+apex before this keyboard. It was an okay keyboard. I did not like the software very much. The keys were soft but the spacebar was a short wide shape, this was a little weird to adjust to. I liked the large rubber feet and it did not slide. The rear USB port was all but useless. It was hard to access and forced me to move the keyboard while flash drives were in use. This led to me not using it. The much smaller rubber feet on this G710 are amazingly effective. It also has a USB port on the rear. I will most likely never use this one due to the location. I really wish they would locate them on the left or front. It has this cool slot on the bottom which allows a small cable to run from the rear of the keyboard to the front. I love this for my headphones. I run the cord...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Lewis', N'michelle.lewis7636@example.org', '2016-01-29', 3, N'This mouse is very light. The sensor is awesome and the software allows for lots of fine tuning. For small hands or a claw grip I would recommend this mouse. The shape is unique but after about 8 hours of use I adjusted and fell in love. The side mounted forward and back buttons are easy to press. The left and right buttons have a nice light click to them with almost zero free travel and a short action travel. I disable the side lights. You can run no lights, all lights or either side or top G lights. The braided cable is nice and flexible, much more so than my old Logitech G500 and G9. The only thing I miss is the dual mode scroll wheel. If this mouse had that hyper scroll wheel it would be 4 stars.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Robinson', N'joshua.robinson8563@example.org', '2016-01-29', 5, N'like it.'),
(N'Noah', N'Jackson', N'noah.jackson7820@example.net', '2016-01-29', 5, N'I like this game a lot! I''ve now clocked in over twenty hours and I''m still having a blast playing with my friends. What''s with all the hate against this game? I think it''s a great looking game with tons of gamemodes and incredible controls and gameplay. I do agree, I want to see more content, but EA is now releasing monthly FREE DLC that anyone can download. Pretty awesome.'),
(N'Donald', N'Clark', N'donald.clark7182@example.net', '2016-01-29', 4, N'Quality product delivered quickly. Works as desired.'),
(N'Henry', N'Anderson', N'henry.anderson5569@example.com', '2016-01-29', 5, N'Gift, daughter loved it.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Green', N'zachary.green7296@example.com', '2016-01-29', 5, N'I really enjoyed this game. It is very close to the uncharted games as far as gameplay and graphics. It was a lot of fun and the bow and arrow is amazing. There is opportunities to upgrade both your character and weapons as you progress through the story. It saves frequently so you don''t have to back track too much when you die. I had a lot of fun playing this game. The story took me about 7-8 hours to play through. If you like uncharted or are a long time fan of Tomb Raider, you have to play this game!'),
(N'Janet', N'White', N'janet.white9080@example.com', '2016-01-29', 5, N'And a relatively long game on top of it. I loved the storyline and all the characters.'),
(N'Mei', N'Ali', N'mei.ali9502@example.org', '2016-01-29', 5, N'My son loves it!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ferreira', N'dennis.ferreira1426@example.com', '2016-01-29', 5, N'Amazing game! It''s a must have for any gamers out there who like first person shooting type of games. Graphics are amazing and so is campaign & zombie mode.'),
(N'Joan', N'Singh', N'joan.singh4974@example.org', '2016-01-29', 4, N'This was one of my favorite games grown up even though I could not get the hang of how to Drift.'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts1962@example.org', '2016-01-29', 5, N'legit.'),
(N'Megan', N'Thompson', N'megan.thompson8335@example.org', '2016-01-29', 5, N'GTA V one of the best games on Xbox 360 has gotten even better on Xbox One. The graphics are crisp and very realistic. I really like the first person view shooting, "catching a ride" and fist fights are so much better in first person. And there''s more tracks on all the radio stations. Weapons customization got even better. All in all its better to own this on Xbox One than Xbox 360. So many new features and adventures await.'),
(N'Heather', N'Wright', N'heather.wright4138@example.com', '2016-01-30', 5, N'kids liked it.'),
(N'Walter', N'Taylor', N'walter.taylor6241@example.org', '2016-01-30', 5, N'works just fine just got to take care of your stuff'),
(N'William', N'Nguyen', N'william.nguyen9886@example.com', '2016-01-30', 4, N'Great sound quality overall. Mic monitoring is a nice touch as well. The headset come with a turtle beach chat adapter so you won''t need one. The box is presented very nicely, with the headset front and center. Then there is a small cable to update your controller which I didn''t need to do. There is a quick start guide and a turtle beach sticker as well. Finally there is the chat adapter. The adapter is kind of tricky to get the hang of at first, but it gets easier as you use it. The headset is nice but feels cheap. It can get a little uncomfortable after a couple of hours of gaming, but I have smaller ears so it may differ for you.'),
(N'William', N'Baker', N'william.baker5232@example.org', '2016-01-30', 5, N'excellent product quality'),
(N'Andrea', N'Chen', N'andrea.chen6259@example.org', '2016-01-30', 4, N'Great'),
(N'Paul', N'Thomas', N'paul.thomas6881@example.net', '2016-01-30', 4, N'My grandson says this game is just ok or soso'),
(N'Paul', N'Thomas', N'paul.thomas6881@example.net', '2016-01-30', 5, N'My grandson said this game is great'),
(N'Ethan', N'Rivera', N'ethan.rivera3243@example.net', '2016-01-30', 5, N'it as fun playing it'),
(N'Marcus', N'Kowalski', N'marcus.kowalski5814@example.com', '2016-01-30', 5, N'I love the story. sister wanted it so she could get the story before 3 is ever released.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Henderson', N'tomasz.henderson3456@example.com', '2016-01-30', 5, N'I''ve always wanted to play this when it first came out, and that was when I was 10 or so.'),
(N'Karen', N'Thomas', N'karen.thomas2932@example.net', '2016-01-30', 4, N'Diablo 3 started off rough, but the expansion and its future updates - especially the removal of the stupid real money auction house - have rounded it out into probably the best loot-focused action RPG. Insane levels of replay value, but grinding out bounties and Greater Nephalem Rifts does get old after hundreds of times. They have continued to add gear, areas, and the seasons keep it fresh. Worth your time, especially at the current price.'),
(N'Karen', N'Rodriguez', N'karen.rodriguez9263@example.com', '2016-01-30', 2, N'Super light, perfect shape for my hand. Lightest mouse you can get with a great sensor like this. However: It has 2 flaws which made me return it. First: The LED is insanely bright and does not turn off when your PC is asleep like the LED does on a Deathadder for example. Second: The sensor glitches out randomly. This is apparently a known issue with the sensor used. It has to do with lift off distance. It was ultimately this that led to me returning the mouse.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Hughes', N'olivia.hughes9373@example.com', '2016-01-30', 1, N'sad console 1>internal hdd that cant be replaced 2>uses slow SATA2 3>controller has no rechargeable 4>weak hardware compare to ps4. it is really a 720p machine 5>most exclusive gone to pc'),
(N'Katherine', N'Miller', N'katherine.miller5003@example.net', '2016-01-30', 5, N'Great games and at a great price compared to other Big Box Stores. Really enjoyed the game and has been on list of items to play.'),
(N'Janet', N'Price', N'janet.price1715@example.com', '2016-01-30', 4, N'Its doing a great job its smaller then the first ps2 Is what i like the most size of a DVD players .'),
(N'Debra', N'Ali', N'debra.ali3696@example.com', '2016-01-30', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Noah', N'Miller', N'noah.miller2510@example.com', '2016-01-30', 4, N'Hasn''t really changed enough over recent years to warrant constantly purchasing the newest version whenever it first comes out, but still a good game diminishing fun factor noted since it''s becomes harder as the years elapse to introduce anything truly innovative to what is becoming a vintage platform.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Watson', N'kimberly.watson1637@example.net', '2016-01-30', 5, N'My daughters loves these two sisters and Disney has done a great job in adding them into the Infinity universe.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Cruz', N'tomasz.cruz7870@example.com', '2016-01-31', 2, N'Its aweful honestly. It doesnt light up in the dark and the buttons are silicone so it feels weird and it not responsive. Plus it connects via bluetooth so it disconnects when not in use, so when its time to use it you have to turn it on and off atleast 3 times before it reconnects i loved the concept but microsoft did it perfect on the 360. Id wait to see if Sony makes there own brand'),
(N'Dennis', N'Cook', N'dennis.cook4610@example.net', '2016-01-31', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Emma', N'Davis', N'emma.davis6637@example.com', '2016-01-31', 2, N'it was suppose to be new and it was an open box... I didn''t work and had to send it back for a replacement and wait 3 more days.... the replacement one was brand new, it worked great, it brought his on batteries.. the new one deserves a 5 star... but foe the delay and for sending a open box one I gave it a 2 star'),
(N'Joseph', N'Morgan', N'joseph.morgan1084@example.net', '2016-01-31', 5, N'I got a psp vita now it about time'),
(N'Emma', N'James', N'emma.james6338@example.net', '2016-01-31', 5, N'I bought this for my cousin because the games really good but the boss fights were so difficult'),
(N'Stephen', N'Robinson', N'stephen.robinson4796@example.com', '2016-01-31', 5, N'Grandson loves it'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Harris', N'jeremy.harris3627@example.net', '2016-01-31', 5, N'This DLC seems to add only a few things to the overall gameplay, but you would be surprised at how much of a difference it makes. On top of that, it''s pretty cheap so why not. One of my favorite games of all time just got a little better.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Myers', N'zachary.myers6409@example.org', '2016-01-31', 5, N'Great, instead of using AA battery this fixed my life, now i can play all day without any problems.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Lee', N'dennis.lee7721@example.com', '2016-01-31', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ward', N'michelle.ward3549@example.com', '2016-01-31', 5, N'My second favorite after Street Fighter II'),
(N'Emily', N'Brown', N'emily.brown7597@example.net', '2016-01-31', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Emily', N'Brown', N'emily.brown7597@example.net', '2016-01-31', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Hill', N'jacqueline.hill1987@example.com', '2016-01-31', 5, N'vary nice'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Hill', N'jacqueline.hill1987@example.com', '2016-01-31', 5, N'good'),
(N'Peter', N'Ward', N'peter.ward4534@example.org', '2016-01-31', 4, N'They look and feel great, it''s just that the D-pad feels a lot less springy/more mushy, so it kind of feels less responsive when using them individually. It might be advantageous for fighting game combos, however, as it allows for easier D-pad gliding. Thankfully the D-pad isn''t used very often in most games and I don''t really notice the mushiness during use. It should be noted that the mushiness might be a result of my installation (this was my first one on a PS4 controller) but I don''t think it is since there is a very slight difference between this D-pad and the stock D-pad. I received these buttons at a promotional rate for review purposes.'),
(N'Christina', N'Flores', N'christina.flores8910@example.com', '2016-02-01', 5, N'like it'),
(N'Betty', N'Garcia', N'betty.garcia8686@example.org', '2016-02-01', 3, N'I was hoping to like it, just not a lot of content. This game needs to cost about $30 for it to be worth it.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Moore', N'carolyn.moore6392@example.com', '2016-02-01', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Andrew', N'Lopez', N'andrew.lopez7367@example.com', '2016-02-01', 5, N'Great attachment for gamers who prefer using gamecube controllers in Smash Bros. Definitely recommended.'),
(N'Helen', N'King', N'helen.king7739@example.com', '2016-02-01', 5, N'Epic game'),
(N'Kofi', N'Phillips', N'kofi.phillips1822@example.org', '2016-02-01', 4, N'enjoyable'),
(N'Diane', N'Hernandez', N'diane.hernandez7122@example.net', '2016-02-01', 5, N'Wow, what a game...Gives Skyrim serious competition. Needs a beast of a PC to run with gorgeous graphics. My 3 year old i7 laptop with a 1Gb AMD 6700M video card can run with everything on low, but it still stutters quite a bit, not the easiest on the eyes. My desktop i7 with a 2Gb Nvidia 750 Ti runs it in full resolution with nary a skip and it looks fantastic. Interesting storyline, adult themes, but there are still the go and fetch missions that are hard to avoid in RPG''s but there are plenty of other types that keep your interest. I still have a long way to go to finish the game and I feel like I have barely scratched the surface. A good game...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Peterson', N'cynthia.peterson3161@example.com', '2016-02-01', 5, N'Great Game.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Green', N'zachary.green7296@example.com', '2016-02-01', 2, N'I tried it for a couple of hours and stopped playing it. I wanted to get into the series because of all the good reviews the 3rd one received, but I just couldn''t give this one anymore time. It''s boring, with a lot of backtracking to areas of the levels to complete the tasks.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Price', N'nadia.price5219@example.org', '2016-02-01', 1, N'horrible this game is seriously boring and linear and short don''t waste your money'),
(N'Lucia', N'Price', N'lucia.price2382@example.org', '2016-02-01', 4, N'Gift for my son . He seems to really like it'),
(N'Lucia', N'Price', N'lucia.price2382@example.org', '2016-02-01', 4, N'Was a gift he seemed to like it'),
(N'Melissa', N'Clark', N'melissa.clark8936@example.net', '2016-02-01', 3, N'Awesome but the sides of my mouse starts slipping off if your hands are sweaty alot.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Evans', N'christopher.evans7108@example.com', '2016-02-01', 5, N'What to say? It is a PlayStation! Very pleased with this purchase!'),
(N'Christina', N'Nelson', N'christina.nelson9529@example.net', '2016-02-01', 5, N'I like'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2016-02-02', 5, N'the nintendo ds is the greatest video game system in the universe a true classic the best of the best the nintendo ds rocks every single nintendo ds game are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best every single nintendo ds game rocks ^_^'),
(N'Samuel', N'Scott', N'samuel.scott5585@example.org', '2016-02-02', 1, N'Didn''t work'),
(N'Rachel', N'Richardson', N'rachel.richardson8486@example.org', '2016-02-02', 5, N'Packed with lots of fresh new content. Definitely will keep you busy for awhile.'),
(N'David', N'Mendoza', N'david.mendoza5457@example.org', '2016-02-02', 2, N'buttons wear out only after several months most notably the scroll wheel button must be pushed several times to work. one of the side buttons has the same problem, way less than a year after purchase. If anyone is reading this do yourself a favor and get something better.'),
(N'Laura', N'Boyd', N'laura.boyd9944@example.org', '2016-02-02', 1, N'Broke within a week! The analog came off. Piece of poop.'),
(N'Shirley', N'King', N'shirley.king8996@example.net', '2016-02-02', 5, N'Ah, Rise of the Tomb Raider when I first saw it I knew I had to have it... to bad I later found out it came out the same day as Fallout 4. I bought it a few weeks later and felt bad for not also being able to pick it up on the same day as F4. I will say it is a must own if you liked the reboot or if you enjoy third person action games in general. I played Tomb Raider Legend and Tomb Raider Underworld, enjoyed them well enough. Then the reboot came and I loved that game, bought it on 360 and upgraded version for Xbox One. So naturally after all the trailers I knew I was getting this game. The first thing about this game is it is GORGEOUS, all of it, everything. From Lara''s hair, to the facial detail and everything in between. The snow effects when you are walking through deep snow was also cool to see. The sound and voice acting is also top notch, especially Lara''s. Lara evolving as a character was a big part of the first game and she continues that evolution. If you played the...'),
(N'Edward', N'Webb', N'edward.webb8263@example.org', '2016-02-02', 5, N'great deal'),
(N'Mateo', N'Bailey', N'mateo.bailey4208@example.net', '2016-02-02', 1, N'Glue was too weak to actually hold the sticker on the controller, and the sticker was way stinky.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Green', N'zachary.green7296@example.com', '2016-02-02', 5, N'I''ve played countless hours of online multiplayer with this game. It is truly one of my most played games (up there with COD4). I like that it is futuristic and has cool weapons. It is also very fast paced, which keeps it exciting. Unlike COD (or real life), you get into little battles. It is not one shot and done, you have a chance to battle it out each time you come across a player. Everyone that enjoys shooters has to play this one for sure. This a great game that is very entertaining.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2016-02-02', 4, N'Mario Brothers was a somewhat over looked Arcade title by Nintendo Nintendo made massive money with The Donkey Kong cabinets Mario Brothers not so much I only seen the original arcade cabinet one time at a dump of a pool hall This is the first straight up arcade port of Mario Brothers and it''s one of the most impressive looking home console ports from the Atari 2600 era Controls are very good besides the terrible joy stick itself Fun factor: This is a simple early game it never really ends the difficulty increase every screen you pass It''s a essential 2 player game This game is a must have for Nintendo fans and Retro collectors it''s without a doubt worthy to be in any top ten list 9/10'),
(N'Walter', N'Smith', N'walter.smith2432@example.com', '2016-02-02', 5, N'I bought this amiibo and gave it to one of my brothers as a ''Thank You'' gift and he loved it.'),
(N'Justin', N'Bell', N'justin.bell7984@example.com', '2016-02-02', 5, N'It is a great game enough said. It has good humor, graphics, music, and combat. It is one of the more difficult games in the Mario and Luigi series.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Gutierrez', N'katherine.gutierrez5334@example.org', '2016-02-02', 5, N'Son loves it'),
(N'Katherine', N'Gutierrez', N'katherine.gutierrez5334@example.org', '2016-02-02', 5, N'Great graphics and sound effects'),
(N'Eric', N'Alvarez', N'eric.alvarez9060@example.net', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Excellent game! Love it!'),
(N'Laura', N'Castillo', N'laura.castillo6451@example.net', '2016-02-03', 3, N'The Pip boy itself is a plastic toy, the only functioning thing on it is a little light, I''m disappointed that I even spent $120+ on this. The game turned out to be pretty mediocre as far a fallout or RPGs in general goes. The ironic thing is the case in which the pip boy was in feels more high quality than the pip boy itself, it''s labeled vault 111, feels sturdy, and even has a nice matte finish.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Clark', N'kofi.clark7624@example.net', '2016-02-03', 3, N'So far I''m a bit disappointed in the fact that I followed the instructions, went to Logitech website and downloaded the Gaming software and related updates. Well the software still does not find the joystick, nor have I been able to play any of the on-line games that I play using the joystick. So in my opinion don''t waste your time or money on this!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Henderson', N'nicole.henderson6360@example.com', '2016-02-03', 4, N'I just got this set. I already had the pink one. I like the set. I mostly just got it for the lift for the wii board. The lift alone cost more than this set. So in my opinion it is worth it. The lift makes a huge difference even though it would not seem like it would. The socks, wii remote holder and wii silicone cover are basically just extra feebies in my opinion. Most of the lifts for the wii board range from $20-60. The socks fit fine and yes the silicone cover has nubs in it that some may fine uncomfortable. They do not bother me any.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Perez', N'thomas.perez9591@example.org', '2016-02-03', 4, N'Works great, as well as the original. However, the drivers are a little bit of a pain in the butt. It will only work with a specific version of the Official MS drivers, so make sure to review the instructions that come with it, or some of the details instructions provided in other reviews here. Overall, a good and affordable option to the MS official one.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Morgan', N'carlos.morgan5321@example.com', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Really cool game, never played anything like it. With that being said, I highly recommend you play it on EASY the first time you play it, it''s much more enjoyable.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Bailey', N'mateo.bailey4208@example.net', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Terrific game, everything about it is fun. Hope they''ll make a sequel to this.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Thompson', N'jeremy.thompson4240@example.net', '2016-02-03', 5, N'love it ty'),
(N'Larry', N'Carter', N'larry.carter9161@example.com', '2016-02-03', 5, N'This lights up nice and bright, allows you to see very well in the dark. I really like the way it looks. Works great! Would buy again.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ramos', N'ethan.ramos1160@example.org', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Nathan', N'Perez', N'nathan.perez5301@example.org', '2016-02-03', 4, N'Great little covers for the XBOX One controllers. Only complaint is that the disks come off easily. But it is still cool looking with out it. I have bought 3 of these in different colors, so my Sons can keep theirs straight and when one comes up missing they know who lost it.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Moore', N'joyce.moore4853@example.net', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Nancy', N'Smith', N'nancy.smith2478@example.net', '2016-02-03', 5, N'for a kids game, its actually pretty tough!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Young', N'samantha.young1494@example.org', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Play on ps4 with my xbox elite controller. Sooooo awesome AND i didn''t realize how awesome the game packs were, as they are universal. Easy set up if you pay attention to instructions. HIGHLY RECOMENDED if you hate the ds4 controller. . awesome product and support thank you CRONUSMAX!! Btw zero latency'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Mendoza', N'rebecca.mendoza6012@example.net', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Great amiibo undamaged. Perfect for collectors'),
(N'Brenda', N'White', N'brenda.white8562@example.net', '2016-02-03', 4, N'My kids always enjoy getting the newly released edition of Just Dance every Christmas. This was no exception however this year it did not hold their interest as much, the song choices seemed a little odd this time around......'),
(N'Jack', N'Rogers', N'jack.rogers7730@example.com', '2016-02-03', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Frank', N'Garcia', N'frank.garcia7354@example.net', '2016-02-03', 5, N'Awesome price and way easier to buy it online rather than going to the store. Would purchase again!'),
(N'Lauren', N'James', N'lauren.james7170@example.com', '2016-02-03', 5, N'This Skylanders SuperChargers: Racing Sky Pack is a great addition to the base Skylanders: Superchargers video game. If you own the video game, this pack is a must have. This pack comes with Light Element Figures Astroblast and the vehicle Sun Runner. The Sun Runner is a Sky Vehicle so if you need to buy a sky vehicle to complete the game, this pack has you covered. The trophy that is included unlocks the sky racing tracks in the game. Without this pack, the game is incomplete. The vehicle in this pack does not have moving parts on it like wheels that actually turn like the land vehicles, but such is that with most of the sky vehicles (though my Nitro Stealth Stinger has a moving propeller), so this vehicle is a bit more difficult to use for creative play outside of the video game. The land vehicles actually have wheels that move so you can use them just like a Hot Wheels car. The trophy also allows you to race as some Villans. Astroblast is a very cool figure, I really enjoy using...'),
(N'Wei', N'Turner', N'wei.turner2993@example.org', '2016-02-04', 5, N'Got this for my son for Christmas. He loves it.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Henderson', N'jeremy.henderson6607@example.org', '2016-02-04', 5, N'Wanted to complete my Mortal Kombat collection....this was absolutely crucial to helping me achieve that goal.'),
(N'Donna', N'Jackson', N'donna.jackson8727@example.com', '2016-02-04', 4, N'the graphics are awesome and the missions are coolbut some more difficult on hardand the game is very simple to get a handle on'),
(N'Alexander', N'Powell', N'alexander.powell3277@example.com', '2016-02-04', 5, N'I love it y''all it keeps my 3yr old busy end of the story'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Stewart', N'carolyn.stewart5794@example.net', '2016-02-04', 5, N'Wow - I''m so used to expansion packs being slight improvements, but that is not the case here! This is a massive improvement over Civ5!'),
(N'Wei', N'Rodriguez', N'wei.rodriguez3715@example.com', '2016-02-04', 4, N'Its free on playstation plus this month. Fun game, highly recommended for co-op'),
(N'Brian', N'Collins', N'brian.collins8786@example.net', '2016-02-04', 1, N'It''s unfortunate what happened to Halo 5, the game is a fractured hollow shell of what should have been. Who in their right mind made Locke the main protagonist in this game needs to be shot, The Master Chief makes Halo, its like they tried to reinvent the wheel but it just didn''t work. The only saving grace here is the multiplayer which is top notch. I''d only buy this if its in the bargain bin at this point.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Morris', N'gregory.morris9064@example.org', '2016-02-04', 5, N'I bought these to replace my Death Adder Chroma''s, bc I was lacking the buttons for playing League of Legends (the Adder only had 2 side buttons). The Naga Chroma does have a different grip, a lot of buttons to config, and extremely sensitive sensor. It took me a while to get used to the buttons, grip and adjust the speed of the sensor. But after I got it all down playing games is a lot more fun and less frantic on my left hand. I highly recommend this mouse to anyone who plays MOBA''s and MMORPG''s due to the abundance of macro buttons to bind keys to. It''s upped my level of play bc my left hand didn''t have to move around the keyboard as much and I could focus on playing the game than resetting my left hand from moving around the keyboard so much. The LED''s are great, you have a lot more settings than the initial chroma enabled mice like the Adder. I do wish they updated the Adder''s firmware so I could have some chroma features that the Naga has.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Roberts', N'hiroshi.roberts4854@example.com', '2016-02-04', 2, N'Does not stop the bubbles from appearing. Makes too many bubbles and a glare on the screen. Need to perfect this.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Turner', N'elizabeth.turner6316@example.org', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Got this as a christmas gift of 2015. Finally finished the game after 2months-ish. It is very fun. Im not usually a 3ds guy but i really enjoyed the hell out of this game. Gameplay is extremely fun. You can easily stack up hours because you do dungeon crawling and doing fun puzzles and let me tell you this. There are 5dungeons. Each with at least 4 floors except the last dungeon (9floors)). So many characters and personas and secret quests and bosses you can do. This game is full fledged a good gamr for what you''re paying for. You don''t even need DLC to enjoy the game. Heck i even enjoyed thus more than fire emblem because it was much longer and more satisfying. So many things to do!'),
(N'Katherine', N'James', N'katherine.james1650@example.net', '2016-02-05', 4, N'This is generally a very decent keyboard. Although it is made of plastic, I found it to have a well made feel to it. The response time for me was very high. I like the tactile feedback from the (G?) switches. The keyboard is pretty small and has no media switches. The keys are very close together but that is part of the design so keep that in mind. If you have large hands/fingers it may not work that well for you. Its great that it has 16.8Million Color LEDS but as others have posted you really need to download the software from Logitech to take advantage of that. Overall, its a good serviceable keyboard that works well.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Rogers', N'sarah.rogers9562@example.com', '2016-02-05', 4, N'Terrific disc if you want to level up your character quickly as it gives you extra sparks.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Taylor', N'elizabeth.taylor3454@example.org', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Great quality for a generic brand. Works just as great as the name brand. I highly recommend this controller!!!'),
(N'Janet', N'Myers', N'janet.myers3126@example.net', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Love this game !!! buy it if ur a JRPG fan!'),
(N'Paul', N'Cooper', N'paul.cooper5123@example.com', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Love it.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Thompson', N'sarah.thompson9518@example.com', '2016-02-05', 5, N'It''s the original Final Fantasy in all of it''s glory. Highly recommended for someone who is a fan of the series seeking a real challenge. This game is not for the faint of heart and is far less forgiving than its successors! Mine arrived in excellent condition and the battery was still able to save.'),
(N'Heather', N'Sanchez', N'heather.sanchez2929@example.org', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Growing up as a kid, I was originally, NOT a Zelda fan Safe, of course, A Link to the Past. I was more of (and still am to this day), a Mario fan. But now being all grown up, I have nothing but great respect and love for the Zelda franchise and games. In a nutshell (or rather Deku Shell), that this is easily the best of all the Zelda games. The graphics, gameplay and the like are magnificent, every time I pull out this game, I always have a great time. The seller was especially very sincere on selling their copy, so I''d like to thank them. Is Ocarina overrated? Sure, but that doesn''t stop it from being one of the best Zelda and Nintendo games ever created. If you have not yet played it, give it a shot and see what I mean.'),
(N'Noah', N'Mendoza', N'noah.mendoza4949@example.net', '2016-02-05', 4, N'So great until you hit max level. Then prepare to do the same exact thing for the chance at getting what you want. I say chance because almost everything worth getting is a random drop. You do work towards certain things, but a lot of it is left up to chance. Also, for a game that has such huge ambitions, there''s not enough variety in the armor and weapons. There''s also just plainly not enough armor and weapons. The settings are beautiful. You also learn everything so well over time that by the time you hit max level - which doesn''t take long - you know each planet like the back of your hand. The gameplay for a first person shooter is second-to-none. I''m so impressed by the feel of the game. But that gets old fast. They need to get the game a constant flow of new content that does more than just look different and have one or two attributes that separate guns from guns and armor from armor. I find that when an expansion comes out, I play it for three weeks, get my character up to...'),
(N'Priya', N'Moore', N'priya.moore2970@example.net', '2016-02-05', 4, N'Not bad story, love the weapons, zombies are fun!'),
(N'Mark', N'Price', N'mark.price7676@example.com', '2016-02-05', 4, N'I didn''t expect to like this game, but this game has been a revelation to me. I have put in hours and hours so far -- and most of it has been enjoyable. What I didn''t like so far has been the seamless "multiplayer" intrusions. They have served more as a distraction than an addition in my honest opinion. Luckily, you can turn it off which helps you concentrate on the game itself and the mini-games and side missions and you don''t have to constantly worry about the outside distractions. The presentation is top-notch, and gameplay as well. The gameplay is a bit of Far Cry, Assassin''s Creed and Splinter Cell put in the not-too-far future (I think). Unlike Grand Theft Auto and more in line with Infamous, the city is alive and reactive. There are street musicians and people randomly taking pictures and selfies near Chicago''s landmarks and such. The dialogue of the NPCs ultimately do go full-circle and gets repetitive. The plot of the game is definitely something predictable, but the...'),
(N'Alexander', N'Gonzalez', N'alexander.gonzalez9624@example.com', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Excellente.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Allen', N'jessica.allen7779@example.org', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Perfect condition and everything is wonderful, thank you very much!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Murphy', N'aaron.murphy5665@example.net', '2016-02-05', 5, N'Fantastic game. Firaxis has improved on the last title in replay-ability and the strategic development between boards. I''d also comment that the game, although brutally difficult, delivers an incredibly rewarding game which balances old elements while modifying just enough of it to make the game feel unique. In particular I''d emphasize that firaxis has done a great job at making the enemies diverse in the risks they pose to your squad so that squad tactics need to be modified significantly depending on the enemies approaching your squad. Further XCOM 2 permits a significantly improved weapon and gear customization function. All of these improvements clearly establish XCOM 2 as a fantastic next installment in the gold standard of pc strategy.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Hill', N'andrea.hill1711@example.org', '2016-02-05', 5, N'I''ve been expecting this sequel since I played XCom: Enemy Unknown in 2012 - it just was too good to not keep going. I didn''t expect them to go down the road of the aliens winning the first time around though - which definitely makes for an interesting and original story line. And again, this game is just too good to pass up. I purchased the Deluxe Edition, as 2K has already stated that they''re planning on making a bunch of DLC for this game, and with their native support for mods this time, third-parties will also have an easier time creating new and creative ways to keep this game fresh. The premise is pretty much that XCom: Enemy Within never happened, and that humanity lost the first war, in Enemy: Unknown. So the aliens have taken over, and are systematically rooting out all potential sources of resistance. A major plot has been discovered, and now it''s up to you to figure out the threat and deal with it before it''s too late. If you played the original XCom: Enemy Unknown, as...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Perez', N'cheryl.perez4111@example.com', '2016-02-05', 4, N'nice'),
(N'Alexander', N'Bennett', N'alexander.bennett6615@example.net', '2016-02-05', 2, N'This game is what many would consider a masterpiece. It certainly has alot of content to play with and is the ultimate party game. It is one of those games that feel fresh and not aged at all. As fun as this game is, there are allot of glaring flaws that are often overlooked. My issues with this game started well before it''s release date. The creator of Smash Bros had announced that they were taking away the story mode and cutscenes just because they were leaked online. It is clear to me that Masahiro Sakurai does not really care about the fans and are willing to make everyone suffer because of a couple of videos leaked. Another issue I have with this game is it''s punishing difficulty, certain characters they chose to have in this game, and DLC. This game is a challenge, it goes without saying. But this game comes off as being cheap and unfair. The "master fortress" is one of the worst ideas they have ever come up with in Smash Bros. At the very end of classic mode, you need to...'),
(N'Henry', N'Boyd', N'henry.boyd7625@example.org', '2016-02-06', 1, N'This was the greatest and most polished release of Super Smash Bros., and it''s portable! The last 3 DLC characters are a clear departure into "Pay more to win more" territory for Nintendo, however, and they completely break the graceful balance that made this one so good. It was before that any character would have a good shot at winning; even if there are tiered separations, nobody was ''bad.'' It''s incredibly disappointing to see this happening with Nintendo. As one of the best games on the 3DS (and the Wii U), it feels like a huge setback in how much I''ll like the systems as wholes. I felt before that I could safely buy a Nintendo game without deliberation because they would always do things properly, but I''m going to be much more cautious now.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ivanov', N'rachel.ivanov9844@example.net', '2016-02-06', 4, N'gift to grandson'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ivanov', N'rachel.ivanov9844@example.net', '2016-02-06', 3, N'enjoyable'),
(N'Diane', N'Cooper', N'diane.cooper5471@example.net', '2016-02-06', 3, N'At the time I bought the Frozen sisters I didn''t realize they are version 1 characters. For those of you new to the game, version 1 characters have barely any moves and no combo''s like most version 2 and 3 characters have. Elsa makes up for it a little because she can freeze enemies which is pretty over powered, but Nobody likes playing Anna; her moves are boring, all she can do is hit with a shovel and grapple hook (Where did they come up with that idea?!). She''s just not very fun, but I understand there are a lot of kids out there that are huge Frozen fans. It just seems like they could have been so much better. To make matters worse they don''t come with a play set piece, which makes no sense considering how popular the movie was.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Long', N'sofia.long5884@example.org', '2016-02-06', 5, N'Did what it was supposed to do. Has a fair amount of weight for it''s size. The one thing it is lacking is velcro pads to get it to sit where you want.'),
(N'Carol', N'Stewart', N'carol.stewart2660@example.org', '2016-02-06', 4, N'Ok'),
(N'Christine', N'Price', N'christine.price3105@example.net', '2016-02-06', 5, N'Works great. No buzzing noise or interference, when speaking to PS4 buddies all night long! Solid, lightweight and very comfortable. Good headphones and I wear them for extensive periods of time, without any discomfort.'),
(N'Gary', N'Carter', N'gary.carter1443@example.com', '2016-02-06', 3, N'it worked alright then a few minutes later its stuck on a red light for ever and will not connect to ps3 even with cord plugged in'),
(N'Alexander', N'Allen', N'alexander.allen6035@example.org', '2016-02-06', 5, N'Always a fan of Godzilla games, so this one was a must. Liked the fact that you can level up the monsters. Also love the fact you can play as the many of the not so poplar monsters i.e: the smog monster, batra, etc. Interesting control scheme too.'),
(N'Henry', N'Raghunathan', N'henry.raghunathan9449@example.com', '2016-02-06', 1, N'Cheap, Peace of junk with terrible control of PS3 controller. Looks easy Platinum for some, for some game''s terrible control will made You insane near the end.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Garcia', N'daniel.garcia7040@example.org', '2016-02-06', 3, N'dark souls is a hard game. Your going to dieeeeeeee alot and alot and its going to laugh at you'),
(N'Frank', N'Robinson', N'frank.robinson7720@example.com', '2016-02-06', 5, N'The ONLINE MULTIPLAYER IS THE MOST FUN I''VE HAD IN YEARS. The new Strongholds, Warzone, and Breakout mode also added more variety. If you''re looking for single player, you might not be happy if you''re looking for a 15+ hour experience. If you''re looking for amazing online multiplayer with dedicated servers, it''s here.'),
