(N'Judith', N'Wilson', N'judith.wilson9510@example.net', '2016-02-07', 5, N'Honestly my favorite of the Pokemon series currently - the new fairy type serves to make poison pokemon feel useful and also helps to tone down dragon pokemon''s ridiculous power. Has great graphics and the usual fun combat. Only real complaint is that battles can get a bit laggy in 3D'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Martinez', N'hiroshi.martinez8083@example.com', '2016-02-07', 5, N'This game was so underrated. My favorite game of 2015'),
(N'Anna', N'Roberts', N'anna.roberts9824@example.org', '2016-02-07', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Priya', N'Rogers', N'priya.rogers3178@example.net', '2016-02-07', 5, N'this is a good game. Bought for my son and he really likes it'),
(N'Sharon', N'Allen', N'sharon.allen3479@example.net', '2016-02-07', 4, N'I love that sense of adventure that creeps down your spine and urges you to explore even though there''s that voice in your head that telling you to U-turn. Playing this game with or without sound makes no difference, it''s scary more than I''d like to admit. The story compels you to find out what happened and to battle through hordes of monsters. You may be scared to the core but you''ll feel like the top dog if you finish it. There''s a reason why many don''t play it, it takes a special breed of gamers to take the challenge.'),
(N'Mei', N'Lopez', N'mei.lopez3275@example.net', '2016-02-07', 5, N'Just buy it. I don''t know what else to say... I have to get back to playing Fallout 4.'),
(N'Carlos', N'White', N'carlos.white5285@example.com', '2016-02-07', 3, N'Very flimsy...it doesn''t keep the figurines separated and protected very good...I''m always afraid they are going to break banging against each other..'),
(N'Maria', N'Chavez', N'maria.chavez4091@example.net', '2016-02-08', 5, N'Gave as a gift'),
(N'Christine', N'Tanaka', N'christine.tanaka1376@example.net', '2016-02-08', 3, N'Meh, Call of Duty is getting old and repetitive. This was the last version I bought a couple years ago.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Lewis', N'sarah.lewis7796@example.org', '2016-02-08', 5, N'Possibly the best game of the last few years. As epic and well done as GTA V. This game is an absolute pleasure to play. I''ve completed two play throughs and have found new side quests each time. I became a Fallout fan with Fallout II on the PC. It was an awesome game. Fallout 3 a disappointment and New Vegas only an average game. This one revives the series in a story line more in tune with the original. Yes, it is a slower type of game play but that is part of its allure. You can relax and simply enjoy the character story lines and just go exploring if you''re tired of the main quest. Even the side quests will peak your interest to see what will happen. It has multiple endings and each one different enough from the others to make them worth playing separately. Even building settlements is fun and can keep you entertained. An awesome game that is very well thought out and well done. The story line is truly awesome.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Kumar', N'michelle.kumar3776@example.com', '2016-02-08', 5, N'This is a great little gadget. It lets the gamer type in chat or search criteria. It snaps right in place beneath the controller.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Gray', N'nathan.gray7416@example.com', '2016-02-08', 4, N'Exactly what I needed, works well, charges quickly. Only downside is the LED lights are SUPER BRIGHT so I can''t charge overnight because it keeps me awake.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Ramirez', N'joshua.ramirez4494@example.org', '2016-02-08', 5, N'With over 200 Digimon and Digimon World 3 style fights I just couldn''t control myself from getting this. If you love Digimon and JRPGs you should own this game. The environments aren''t exactly the best but everything else makes up for that fact.:]'),
(N'Ronald', N'King', N'ronald.king2623@example.org', '2016-02-08', 5, N'First thing opened'),
