(N'Benjamin', N'Raghunathan', N'benjamin.raghunathan2430@example.com', '2016-02-08', 3, N'The only problem I''ve had so far is that the L+R buttons are really stiff to press. Edit: I''ve had to drop my review by a star due to more evident problems. After some daily use of about 4-5 hours a day for around a week and a half the analog stick completely gave out.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Thomas', N'gregory.thomas8278@example.org', '2016-02-08', 5, N'Great product. Love it.'),
(N'Emma', N'Bailey', N'emma.bailey1963@example.org', '2016-02-08', 5, N'The Last of Us Remastered - PlayStation 4 I heard this game is really good, and that''s the main reason I bought it. but as soon as I started playing I realized that this game was not for you. I don''t like sneaking around, walking slow and building things in a game.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Mitchell', N'tomasz.mitchell2413@example.net', '2016-02-09', 5, N'Works great with my XIM 3'),
(N'Victoria', N'Martin', N'victoria.martin6135@example.org', '2016-02-09', 5, N'Don''t believe people about the construction quality of these headphones -- they''re great for the price. If you expect $500 quality, you have to pay $500. These work, and work WELL. They hold a charge for so long that it''s never been an issue. I''ve put them on and played all day or night without any problems. Just throw them on the charger before you go to bed and you''ll never have any issue. The range is decent -- about 30ft in my experience. Plenty, if you ask me. Plus, it auto-negotiates when back in range so it''s almost a non-issue.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Williams', N'stephen.williams9726@example.com', '2016-02-09', 5, N'good!'),
(N'Eric', N'Ali', N'eric.ali2190@example.net', '2016-02-09', 3, N'Undercover doesnt seem to be fully great of a racing game as compared to underground or even hot pursuit for the ps2. I will give this game a thumbs up for being able to start with the nissan 240sx. From there the game has a curve downhill. For starters the game is a bit glitched. Pure white color road on the screen for a few seconds. Traffic can someimes pop out of nowhere and other minor glitches. Graphically the game is pretty good for a 2008 game. As for the scenes in the game its movie based using actors (i noticed maggie q) as far as the story goes I honestly have no clue what is really happening the game just kinda throws it in thinking you will understand on the spot. But the story isn''t so disappointing. As far as the gameplay the handling is okay. Much different from underground 1 and 2. It almost reminds me of Juiced 2. But with that game the truth is the turning and drifting does it a bit better. The main problem is that the game is unbalanced. As a gamer of racing...'),
(N'Mary', N'Thompson', N'mary.thompson2157@example.net', '2016-02-09', 5, N'timely delivery. exactly as described. was a gift for someone so I can''t comment on play value but this game gets good ratings.'),
