(N'Karen', N'Chen', N'karen.chen3847@example.org', '2016-02-13', 3, N'My brother was excited when he got it for Christmas. He finished it in less than a week. Never touched it again. Got bored.'),
(N'Karen', N'Chen', N'karen.chen3847@example.org', '2016-02-13', 5, N'Operates just as advertised. My nephews love the virtual console games I have. The only drawback is that the X Y letters rub off of the white buttons over time. Other than that, great buy. Also works with some of the wii games.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Harris', N'samantha.harris5668@example.org', '2016-02-13', 5, N'Worked perfectly!'),
(N'Sandra', N'Brooks', N'sandra.brooks4425@example.org', '2016-02-14', 5, N'love this game! Had it for ps2 but had to have it for my 360 system, and yes it plays on it even though it''s a Xbox game. Its lethal enforcers meet house of the dead meets evil dead games. Great thing about this game is it''s a 2 player co adventure game to. Or just play single player. The game last a long long time. Graphics and moveablity is great! Targeting is okay at first but then after a couple levels it comes naturally. Creepy sound effects as you wonder when the next creature is going to pop out at you. If your looking for a great 2 player co adventure game, this is it. So good I have it for 2 systems. 2/14/16'),
(N'Ronald', N'Brown', N'ronald.brown7083@example.com', '2016-02-14', 4, N'This game is very fun fun. Great for all Creed fans, or platform style game fan. The art style is truly amazing and original, each game has a different style. 3 games for 30$ is a steal. Don''t pass this game up, truly a great experience.'),
(N'Maria', N'Watson', N'maria.watson9768@example.net', '2016-02-14', 1, N'This product is a piece of crap. If the controller is moved in any way it loses connection and causes the controller to restart, losing connectivity to the console. Since the controller has to be moved to be used this is an issue. Never buy this unless you''re getting it for someone you hate.'),
