(N'Frank', N'Henderson', N'frank.henderson2678@example.org', '2016-02-14', 5, N'Received as promised...Thank you.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Gutierrez', N'ronald.gutierrez9987@example.net', '2016-02-15', 3, N'It does detect your hands, but the detection speed is a bit slow. The app market they provide is severely lacking unfortunately and unless you want the most limited use on a single screen, you have to get GameWave (a $5 cost on the app market) to get any utility out of it. It''s then up to you to add extra programs triggered by key combinations to perform the behavior you. If you''re looking at this for controlling games, it would work fine as a gimmicky controller for MMOs, but don''t expect rapid response controls. Even on powerful machines, the detection speed is slow enough, and the control motions spotty or overlapping enough that you can''t expect great control. If you''re a developer, by all means get this. It''s cool and has a free Dev Kit. I originally got this for a work machine hoping I could set it up to be able to use one hand to point at one of my 4 monitors, gesture to bring up a graphical list of windows on that monitor, and then flip through to select one of them to...'),
(N'Debra', N'Barnes', N'debra.barnes5547@example.net', '2016-02-15', 5, N'This Classic 8Bitdo NES30 Controller is one of the best i''m using. I use it more then my PS3 controller. the packaging and everything about this is very well done i could not recommend it more. A Big shout out to [...] they have some really nice gear there.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Boyd', N'ronald.boyd5965@example.com', '2016-02-15', 5, N'I have read all the books and played the 2nd & 3rd game. Did not have a good enough computer to play this 1st game back in 2008, but now I do. Runs great with a Pentium R, 8 GB RAM, and a 512 MB integrated graphics card. The game itself will tell you that the hardware does not support the game, but there is an easy, one time override that you can look up online to get past this. I can run the game with on max settings with zero lag, clipping, freezing. etc. Now, this game itself is a bit dated for many. Older graphics, clunky gameplay, lots of menus. I actually love that this game is more RPGish than the later games. I also think that Mass Effect 1 is the best game in that series for the same reasons just to give you an idea of where I am coming from. What are wonderful and timeless are the storylines. The Djinn expansion is fun as well as the main story and its various offshoots and sidequests. You can really appreciate the story (and the later games'' stories) if you read the...'),
(N'Thomas', N'Ward', N'thomas.ward2999@example.net', '2016-02-15', 3, N'The main part of the game is sort of like Mario Party, were you take turns going around the board and land on tiles. Better than Mario Party, you save your progress from game to game and it keeps track of things like your total earned Turnips (currency) and other stats, so there is kinda nice, makes it worth it to keep playing with the same character, which you need an Amiibo for. The game in cludes two, so if you want to play with more people, I think you need to purchase additional Amiibos. Overall, the game is kinda boring, with not much action other than the turnip stock market, which you need to play to try to earn the most money in the game. Buy turnips low and sell high, there is some risk to it, but its fun. I played it a few times, and was never really motivated to pick it up again. I used the Animal Crossing Amiibo cards with it as well. I never saw where you could use them during a game, but you can scan them to bring the charcter from the card into the lobby area where...'),
(N'Christopher', N'Howard', N'christopher.howard4331@example.org', '2016-02-15', 4, N'I don''t have time to unlock all the characters, so I found that kind of lame. But other than that the game is great! The Seller gets 5 stars in my book! Fast delivery and original packaging, never been opened, brand new!'),
(N'Aisha', N'James', N'aisha.james9987@example.org', '2016-02-15', 1, N'Dont waist to money it''s freaking crappie'),
(N'Stephen', N'Henderson', N'stephen.henderson8335@example.org', '2016-02-15', 4, N'The PS4 is a fun system to game on. As a casual gamer, I''m not really devoted to just any brand. I buy whichever console suits my needs in terms of game exclusivity. I have owned most brands of consoles, like Nintendo, Microsoft, etc. I am impressed with the graphics the PS4 displays. The detail developers spend their time and efforts on really shows in their work. The touchpad on the controller is, in my opinion, completely unnecessary. Most games I own use the touchpad for such small tasks that could be put in the Pause menu. Sony should have just not made any change to the PS3 controller. Other than that there really is no change to the controller other than the Share button and the change of the Start button to Option. The battery life on the controller is nothing to brag about. I find myself constantly charging my controller after just 3-4 hours of use. The User Interface screen really does not differ from the PS3 UI. There really is no huge change there. Overall, the PS4 is a...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Nelson', N'kimberly.nelson9808@example.org', '2016-02-15', 5, N'Son love it.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Wisniewski', N'brenda.wisniewski9412@example.org', '2016-02-15', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Patrick', N'Wisniewski', N'patrick.wisniewski7587@example.net', '2016-02-15', 5, N'My son loves this game.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Diaz', N'hiroshi.diaz7992@example.net', '2016-02-15', 5, N'I am so thankful I can still use my SNES!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Bell', N'jessica.bell7252@example.org', '2016-02-15', 1, N'Could not get this game to work on Windows 10'),
(N'George', N'Evans', N'george.evans8782@example.net', '2016-02-15', 5, N'Purchased as gift, recipient was pleased.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Bailey', N'daniel.bailey6152@example.net', '2016-02-15', 5, N'Fast shipping and works perfectly.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Perry', N'raymond.perry4649@example.net', '2016-02-15', 5, N'Hard to say much bad about this game. I think it is one of the best games in history. Great character customization. Enough story to keep you interested without getting boring. Combat controls are fairly intuitive and make use of the fact that we all have two (at least) mouse buttons. According to Steam, I played 300 hours over 2 years (some of that was my son but not much) so tremendous play value.'),
(N'Gary', N'Reed', N'gary.reed3147@example.com', '2016-02-15', 5, N'Really ilove game'),
(N'Lisa', N'Mitchell', N'lisa.mitchell5849@example.com', '2016-02-16', 5, N'My boys love it thanks'),
(N'Laura', N'Carter', N'laura.carter3339@example.net', '2016-02-16', 5, N'works great thank you'),
(N'Nicole', N'Hill', N'nicole.hill1395@example.org', '2016-02-16', 5, N'Tons of tracks and locations with many different views, including 2 in car views. Great job Maximum Games'),
(N'Henry', N'Ruiz', N'henry.ruiz3888@example.com', '2016-02-16', 5, N'Xmas gift, kids love it.'),
(N'Mark', N'Ward', N'mark.ward7975@example.net', '2016-02-16', 5, N'This game will forever hold a special place in my heart. If you love an amazing J-RPG with a mix of hack-and-slash adventure games, along with a killer plot to back it up, this is the game for you. IMPORTANT: I HIGHLY RECOMMEND PLAYING .hack//Infection and the original 4 games, THEN WATCH .hack//Roots the anime, THENNNNNNN play this game. If you don''t play the first 4 games then watch the Roots anime, this game will confuse the s*** out of you and you''ll have no idea what''s going on. Good luck, all! P.S. GOOD LUCK WITH CUBIA BOSS. FOR REAL.'),
(N'Priya', N'Singh', N'priya.singh3150@example.com', '2016-02-16', 5, N'When I ordered my original 3DS XL edition I knew right away that I would need a clear cover to protect it. Obviously, the bottom cover needs to be removed to allow for charging in the charging base, but that I already knew. Hori is my number-one manufacturer for Japanese console-related products, so I knew they wouldn''t disappoint when I ordered supplements for my 3DS XL. With this and their bubble-less screen protector, my limited edition XL was ready to hit the road. What I like most about this protective cover set is that there''s a little bit of flex. I knew that would mean it''s not completely transparent, but that''s fine for me. Honestly, considering the fact that it has some flex, I''m actually surprised by how transparent it is; I get to see the lovely touches of my Zelda XL edition in all its glory. After a couple of years of having it, however, I have noticed a slight yellow tint appear on the bottom cover. I imagine that''s from the many times I''ve had to remove it to charge...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Bell', N'aisha.bell9006@example.com', '2016-02-16', 4, N'This is a good case. It adds some grip to the 3ds. I didn''t give it five stars because it doesn''t cover any of the back edge, which is completely exposed to be dropped. Otherwise, it''s a good product.'),
(N'Christina', N'Richardson', N'christina.richardson9693@example.net', '2016-02-16', 5, N'Extremely exciting game! Definitely recommended!!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Jimenez', N'raymond.jimenez3178@example.org', '2016-02-16', 5, N'Fantastic game, brilliant story telling. Perfect.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Chavez', N'rachel.chavez5473@example.org', '2016-02-16', 5, N'Good quality Amiibo. Simple model but one of the better casts. Better pose than Ness.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'King', N'benjamin.king7824@example.com', '2016-02-16', 5, N'Simply worked. Using wii classic controller and wii motes on windows 10 as normal gamepad. update 2017 - almost 2 years later working great.'),
(N'Debra', N'Ivanov', N'debra.ivanov9883@example.com', '2016-02-17', 1, N'*****Update - Please respond. I now have ordered this 3 times. 3 different times and all 3 have been the wrong version. First time, it was platinum hits. Second time, it was a copy of NCAA 14 in the borderlands case. Third time, another platinum hits copy. Can someone just sell me a NON platinum hits version please? *original* i got the wrong copy. I have an xbox one and got this for the backwards compatibility. The only problem is I got a platinum hits edition, which isn''t backwards compatible. Luckily, amazon helped me out on the return even though it was after the time frame (which happened because of a move) If you are getting this for an xbox one, make sure it ISN''T PLATINUM HITS.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Sanchez', N'kevin.sanchez8681@example.net', '2016-02-17', 5, N'It was exactly as advertised.'),
(N'Christina', N'Fisher', N'christina.fisher8131@example.com', '2016-02-17', 3, N'Pretty fun game but gets annoying how easily you can abuse the % rng system.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Turner', N'katherine.turner4899@example.com', '2016-02-17', 5, N'56 character from your favorite comic book marvel heroes and capcom''s best character form your favorite capcom franchise''s all in one big fighting game BRAWL! I have this game for both the ps3 and xbox 360. Sandly there not downloadable anymore. I want a physical copy of this game and not sure when bur I will. This game is the best one out of all 3 mvc series hands down.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Chavez', N'thomas.chavez7974@example.org', '2016-02-17', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Ethan', N'Cox', N'ethan.cox8711@example.net', '2016-02-17', 4, N'You''ll most likely have to update to the latest Logitech Gaming Software (8.79.77) released February 10, 2016 since it added support for the G810. My other G-keyboards worked fine, but I was wondering why my G810 wasn''t showing up in the Logitech software when I plugged it in, and it was because I didn''t have that latest update. It also updated the firmware to v102.1.22 to add programmable keys. I previously reviewed the G410, which I wasn''t too impressed about; the keys on the G410 is very springy and cheap feeling to me and was quite disappointed with it (besides the advantage of being compact/light) However, the G810 is a quality keyboard. This is a very clean-cut keyboard. The G810 keys even have a lot more solid feedback feel to it than the G910. It''s like taking that satisfying solid true mechanical key presses of the G710, but making it just slightly mushier to minimize the sound. I think it''s appropriately named G810 because I feel it''s in between the G910 and G710, like...'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ruiz', N'victoria.ruiz9329@example.com', '2016-02-18', 5, N'Great price for an okay game. Love the steel case though.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Jenkins', N'elizabeth.jenkins7384@example.net', '2016-02-18', 4, N'Super repetitive. Then need to revamp their pvp and add something else to do other than greater rift.'),
(N'Justin', N'Gutierrez', N'justin.gutierrez4159@example.com', '2016-02-18', 4, N'it worked great for about 2 months then had to go back to batteries'),
(N'Michelle', N'Wilson', N'michelle.wilson9644@example.org', '2016-02-18', 5, N'This stand completely reduces my extremely load ps4 to an extremity quiet level when i play even the most demanding games!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Kowalski', N'ronald.kowalski4905@example.com', '2016-02-18', 3, N'Upon receiving it, the screen was doing funny things and the exterior had seen better days. Since I just needed the screen for a Gameboy Advance backlight mod, I didn''t really care about the cosmetics. I had to break it apart to get to the screen due to a stubborn screw but managed to safely get the ags 101 screen out of the housing and even salvage the motherboard. I am very happy that it worked the way it did just not happy that I had to literally crack the housing shell open to get to very delicate pieces, much more stressful than it could''ve been.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Raghunathan', N'kelly.raghunathan5239@example.org', '2016-02-18', 5, N'They worked fine for the DS Lite'),
(N'Samantha', N'Davis', N'samantha.davis4599@example.org', '2016-02-18', 5, N'Received it a hour ago. It came brand new and I had no issues at all.'),
(N'Laura', N'Reyes', N'laura.reyes4651@example.org', '2016-02-18', 4, N'Something short, but very nice'),
(N'Joshua', N'Kelly', N'joshua.kelly1654@example.net', '2016-02-19', 5, N'Works as great as the original controller that came with the Xbox.'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez2456@example.com', '2016-02-19', 5, N'good job and I got my item on time thank you again and good job'),
(N'Brenda', N'Long', N'brenda.long6294@example.net', '2016-02-19', 3, N'For people looking for a more difficult game this one is on the hard side because there is not a lot of color contrast between dark and light. I often play games at night in a dark room. This one is only a day game for me. It is also one that the Hint button was needed. I do like that there are more items hiding in the upper areas behind the cobwebs. It makes for a good challenge.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Kelly', N'rachel.kelly4584@example.org', '2016-02-19', 1, N'I would have gladly paid NIntendo for this wonderful special edition, but since I can''t even get a hold of one, despite my CONSTANT efforts, what does it matter how good it is? Maybe I''ll rate the better versions as a 4 or 5 star, considering I actually have a chance to pop them into my 3DS. Thanks, scalpers, and thanks Nintendo... Care about your customers a bit more next time.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Phillips', N'dennis.phillips1475@example.org', '2016-02-19', 4, N'Nice'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Jackson', N'tomasz.jackson8571@example.net', '2016-02-19', 5, N'Great Buy!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Boyd', N'yuki.boyd6300@example.org', '2016-02-19', 5, N'Wife loves it.'),
(N'Steven', N'Lewis', N'steven.lewis5666@example.org', '2016-02-19', 4, N'Works well, good addition to my Wii U setup.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nelson', N'sandra.nelson6281@example.com', '2016-02-19', 4, N'I like Batman Arkham Origins Blackgate, I''m playing it on my PS TV. It reminds me of an upgraded version of the classic sidescroller Batman games. Challenging and fun. If you own a Vita or PS TV you should seriously consider adding this to your game library.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Suzuki', N'kevin.suzuki5510@example.net', '2016-02-19', 5, N'awesome grip, perfect fit for my xbox 360 controller'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Cox', N'benjamin.cox4132@example.net', '2016-02-19', 5, N'grandkids liked playing with this'),
(N'Kathleen', N'White', N'kathleen.white6745@example.com', '2016-02-19', 4, N'o.k.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Nguyen', N'tyler.nguyen6133@example.net', '2016-02-19', 5, N'The game looks GORGEOUS! Truly deserving of being on the next gen consoles. if I had one complaint it would be that it kind''ve seems like they may have tried to update the charcters eyes to add more emotion to them, but it sort of justr sticks out compared to the rest of their face.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Garcia', N'zachary.garcia5419@example.net', '2016-02-19', 5, N'thanks you, excellent'),
(N'Nathan', N'Adams', N'nathan.adams5428@example.org', '2016-02-19', 5, N'the game worked like brand new'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ortiz', N'dennis.ortiz1347@example.com', '2016-02-19', 5, N'It works well. I don''t use it but my grandkids do and they like it fine. They are used to the old sticks though so they have to rewire their thinking a bit to use it. I think this kind of controller should be standard on the game. They are a bit pricey to buy after the initial investment in the game. And you will probably need two.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Tanaka', N'kelly.tanaka1343@example.com', '2016-02-19', 5, N'Amazing bundle. Well worth the $79.99.'),
(N'Donna', N'Foster', N'donna.foster7798@example.net', '2016-02-20', 5, N'Works fine'),
(N'Nicole', N'White', N'nicole.white1578@example.com', '2016-02-20', 5, N'Package was delivered on time and I was completely satisfied with the way you all handled everything thanks for everything'),
(N'Sofia', N'Diaz', N'sofia.diaz3645@example.net', '2016-02-20', 5, N'GREAT PROD.'),
(N'Christina', N'Foster', N'christina.foster7939@example.org', '2016-02-20', 4, N'As a lover of animal crossing since the GameCube edition, this was a fun change of pace. A big part of the games is the design of your house, and I personally think it''s awesome that they''ve expanded so much on that, even if you no longer get to do the other things from the main game. Once you finish the game, however, there''s not much to do short of restart or just look at your friends'' stuff. But restarting isn''t so bad.'),
(N'Larry', N'Moore', N'larry.moore7885@example.net', '2016-02-20', 5, N'I really like this game it was challenging enough and still fun'),
(N'Joshua', N'Rodriguez', N'joshua.rodriguez2931@example.com', '2016-02-20', 5, N'got this as a late valentine from my husband and it was just what i need since my other one broke'),
(N'Adam', N'Ortiz', N'adam.ortiz6312@example.com', '2016-02-20', 1, N'I was pretty pumped for this, as I loved the old mad cats SSF4 fight pads. Out of the box, buttons are nice, mine weren''t sticking...but the dpad is horrendous. You can''t fluidly go from one direction to another, you almost have to lift your finger to do a fireball motion. Also, if you are rocking back and forth, you will get a ton of random jumps or crouches. Absolutely unusable and will be returning this. Sad, because I''ve only had it for an hour.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Ramos', N'raymond.ramos8047@example.net', '2016-02-20', 5, N'good'),
(N'Scott', N'Lewis', N'scott.lewis7437@example.org', '2016-02-20', 5, N'I like the game'),
(N'Eric', N'Brooks', N'eric.brooks8729@example.org', '2016-02-20', 4, N'If you liked the first one you like this just the same great graphics and all but I give it 4 stars because nothing has changed besides the story which kinda gives me the old Assasins creed feeling but in a good way. You use bow and arrow kill deer all the same as before and most of the time you''re playing hurt because of falls and things like that but im.hoping it plays out in future installments of the game to where she is a pro and unlike the old TR on playstation these puzzles are easy and I remember having to buy a book just to pass puzzles. Great overall but same as before.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Hughes', N'raymond.hughes8046@example.org', '2016-02-20', 3, N'It died after a year, good while it lasted'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Martin', N'cheryl.martin9739@example.org', '2016-02-20', 2, N'Junk! I''m actually being nice with the rating. Covers don''t stay on.'),
(N'Christina', N'Ross', N'christina.ross1020@example.net', '2016-02-20', 5, N'Son loves game'),
(N'Donna', N'Jimenez', N'donna.jimenez5947@example.net', '2016-02-20', 2, N'This is my first fallout game, and I bought into the hype. Maybe I am missing a fundamental part of the game, but what is so fun about searching for scrap and repetivily killing boring enemies?'),
(N'Lauren', N'Ortiz', N'lauren.ortiz5561@example.net', '2016-02-21', 5, N'Game saves just fine, just be sure to stop at the Command Post if you''re a cop and we haven''t had any issues. We love this game overall. This is true speed and car racing, makes GTA 5 look like a slow paced role play game. The pace is exhilarating, the scenery breathtaking. Ive never experienced session addiction more than this game. You sit down and you don''t want to get back up or leave it, its a very addicting game.'),
(N'Megan', N'Russell', N'megan.russell2747@example.net', '2016-02-21', 4, N'it is exactly what i expected.'),
(N'Amara', N'Reed', N'amara.reed8704@example.org', '2016-02-21', 5, N'Great time killer. No bugs. Plays fine on windows 10'),
(N'Ivan', N'Webb', N'ivan.webb4327@example.com', '2016-02-21', 3, N'not for the DS lite'),
(N'Ivan', N'Webb', N'ivan.webb4327@example.com', '2016-02-21', 3, N'a bit boring'),
(N'Sandra', N'Allen', N'sandra.allen1730@example.net', '2016-02-21', 1, N'Buyers, be careful. I had Xbox One for a year and enjoyed it...however, there is an issue recently that you may want to know. My Xbox One worked 100% fine on 02/19/16. On 02/02/16 I downloaded a game from XBox Marketplace (CoD: BO3). After downloading the game, it refused to open. Then, all my digital purchased games on Xbox ceased working (My disks work fine). I contacted Microsoft support, and spent approx 6 hrs troubleshooting. It ended with "We don''t have a solution, sorry. Looks like the marketplace download broke your console. AT least you can use disks right? Tough luck on the digital downloads you paid for and can''t access anymore". Then they asked for 130 bucks for me to pay them to fix my Xbox, after their service caused the issues. This seems like being a car repair shop, changing my oil, dropping something into my engine while performing their service, then blaming me for it and demanding I pay so they can repair it. So, be aware that if you use their service and that''s...'),
(N'Priya', N'Ivanov', N'priya.ivanov9204@example.com', '2016-02-21', 5, N'Excellent mouse, great quality.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Johnson', N'olivia.johnson2925@example.org', '2016-02-21', 5, N'FREEEEEEEEE'),
(N'Priya', N'Williams', N'priya.williams3018@example.org', '2016-02-21', 5, N'Great graphics. still figuring stuff out though after I have submitted the redeem code though'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Hall', N'tomasz.hall6698@example.org', '2016-02-21', 5, N'thank you'),
(N'Christine', N'Boyd', N'christine.boyd8070@example.org', '2016-02-21', 4, N'Works well. Kid loves it'),
(N'Christine', N'Boyd', N'christine.boyd8070@example.org', '2016-02-21', 4, N'Does what it''s supposed to do'),
(N'Mei', N'Sanders', N'mei.sanders3300@example.com', '2016-02-21', 5, N'nice game'),
(N'Samantha', N'Long', N'samantha.long4791@example.com', '2016-02-21', 5, N'Great game for rpg fans, It can be pretty challenging with given in game options to level up difficulty.'),
(N'Laura', N'James', N'laura.james7859@example.org', '2016-02-21', 3, N'Destiny is one of those games that I love and kind of hate at the same time. There is no doubt that at its core Bungie has in fact created a good game, but I feel like in many ways destiny has numerous loose ends that need serious tightening. I won''t get into too much detail, but the taken king expansion definitely offers the best in game raid experience for destiny thus far. Factor the new raid in with the abundant amount of quest lines, along with the decent amount of story missions, and you have an expansion that has quite a bit of content to offer. But here''s the issue though, and why I mainly took away two stars. For newcomers what is being advertised with this product is misleading due to the fact that destiny''s base game, along with expansions 1 and 2, provides content that is mostly irrelevant at the time of this review. The taken king expansion, which is the most recent expansion, is the only expansion in destiny that holds relevance since the gear that you get from that...'),
(N'Linda', N'Turner', N'linda.turner8405@example.org', '2016-02-22', 5, N'I''ve actually purchased two of these now. They''re a great headset, they have great audio quality, and the mic quality is pretty good as well. I use these in tandem with a 3.5 to 2.5mm adapter to use with my VOIP headset at work as well. If you are thinking about getting these, do yourself a favor and do it! They''re definitely worth it.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Coleman', N'ronald.coleman2093@example.org', '2016-02-22', 4, N'Does exactly what it''s supposed to. Very sturdy. Quite attractive atop my LG flatscreen.'),
(N'Gary', N'Baker', N'gary.baker8041@example.net', '2016-02-22', 5, N'everything as advertised'),
(N'Jessica', N'Watson', N'jessica.watson4604@example.com', '2016-02-22', 5, N'cool'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Rogers', N'jonathan.rogers6540@example.net', '2016-02-22', 4, N'Fun as hell, great game. Not true to the originals, but a fantastic game nonetheless.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Hughes', N'brandon.hughes1759@example.org', '2016-02-22', 5, N'If you''re going to play an original xbox on any modern television, you should do yourself a favor and get this adapter. This adapter allows you to run games in higher resolutions, so the games can look as good as you remember. Most games support 480p, and some even 720p or 1080i! Even at 480p, the difference is HUGE going from 480i composite cables. Just plug it in and mark off the resolutions your TV supports in the video settings and go!'),
(N'Justin', N'Hall', N'justin.hall4583@example.org', '2016-02-22', 4, N'this is old school gamecube. it''s not the best controller but if you remember that feeling and want it back this is here and this is how you''ll get that. as with all controllers on this counsol some work with games and some dont. this is primarily for smash bros. fyi.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Perez', N'anthony.perez6194@example.com', '2016-02-22', 5, N'Excelente producto'),
(N'Joseph', N'Garcia', N'joseph.garcia3367@example.net', '2016-02-22', 5, N'It was as good as I remembered when I owned the original Xbox, works good with the 360, not sure about the Xbox One.'),
(N'Laura', N'James', N'laura.james7859@example.org', '2016-02-22', 5, N'This screen protector works well enough, but it is important to note that the screen protector itself does not technically cover the entire screen of the PlayStation Vita 2000. Instead this screen protector, in regard to the PlayStation Vita 2000 system, covers the area of the screen just above the "PSVITA" logo at the bottom of the system, and just below the "SONY" logo at the upper left hand corner of the system. This screen protector does cover the most important part of the screen for the PlayStation Vita 2000 system, but not the entirety of the screen itself. Nonetheless this is a very good product that I would highly recommend, since you get two screen protectors instead of one and the installation process is pretty simple and straightforward.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'James', N'tomasz.james7556@example.com', '2016-02-23', 4, N'Nothing to complain about yet. Have had it for almost 1 month, and nothing has broken or came out of sockets. I don''t have nearly 28 physical games, but good product overall.'),
(N'Steven', N'Gutierrez', N'steven.gutierrez5481@example.org', '2016-02-23', 4, N'Differences between Birthright and Conquest Slightly different storyline Different playable characters I have heard Birthright gives you more gold through its playthrough so is a bit easier Birthright you take the side of a Japanese style Army with Ninjas and Swordmasters Conquest has more Mages and Knights and is a very slightly darker twist to the game without getting into spoilers. After playing 90% of the game personally I found the Birthright characters strong but many of them have boring personalities which left the game feeling a bit flat at times in between the story itself. That is the only regret I have about the version I picked. Character unlocks. Ok this is why I am writing the review it is very confusing. In a way it is like Pokemon Each version has certain characters you can get and not get. But you can get most in different ways but none of the non exclusive character unlocks will have combo bonus, conversations, or kids Prison, You can unlock a few ''minor'' boss...'),
(N'Henry', N'Anderson', N'henry.anderson3038@example.com', '2016-02-23', 5, N'I have the USF4 TE2 stick and let me just say after playing with the SFV TE2+ fight stick it is night and day when comparing the two sticks, it feels much better and the response time when doing inputs for movement/controls is faster and quicker and the addition of the touchpad and R3/L3 buttons which gives your more options as far as setups to your stick that''s to your preference is a very nice touch as well. If this will be your first time getting a fight stick coming over from playing a controller a word of advice, please be PATIENT and keep PRACTICING because best believe there''s gonna be times when your gonna get so frustrated that you''ll want to stop and quit and say the hell with it but PLEASE stick with it because the payoff from your hard work and diligence will be worth its weight in gold when your in a match and you pull off a move so seamless and with ease that you might have struggled with trying to pull off with a controller.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Richardson', N'rachel.richardson8486@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'Been waiting for a price drop (got it when it was $27) because I already owned it on ps4 but traded it in because I wanted it on the main console I played on (Xbox One). This is a great edition the Assassins Creed genre. Great story and gameplay with solid graphics. The game is definitely not short and the season pass is worth it.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Richardson', N'rachel.richardson8486@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'If you have been an assassins creed fan from the start or just joining in this is a nice game to play. Great platforming and challenging. I still get that assassins creed feeling and stories are solid. This is definitely worth the purchase.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Martin', N'melissa.martin1376@example.net', '2016-02-23', 5, N'Perfect game in every way possible!'),
(N'Karen', N'Ramos', N'karen.ramos8375@example.net', '2016-02-23', 5, N'I went through a few different sets of headphones before settling with these. I tested 2 wired sets looking for that exact comfortable feeling as I was hoping to spend a little less money for a wired set. In the end, the fit and wire free 420X was the ticket. I really like the XO Seven wired unit but they are very tight and thick padded so I was sweating around my ears. So I settled on the 420X.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Suzuki', N'kelly.suzuki3234@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'fun game'),
(N'Christina', N'Cooper', N'christina.cooper3864@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'My Grandson was over the moon when Santa brought this !!'),
(N'Christina', N'Cooper', N'christina.cooper3864@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'My son was excited to get this as it had been on his wish list since it had came out. Great game !!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Scott', N'olivia.scott5948@example.net', '2016-02-23', 5, N'just as described. Very happy with this item'),
(N'John', N'Thompson', N'john.thompson2946@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'Classic Xbox 369'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nelson', N'sandra.nelson6281@example.com', '2016-02-23', 4, N'I had Toukiden: Age of Demons on the PS Vita, And when I saw Toukiden: Kiwami for the PS4 I knew it''d be good, and I was not wrong! It looks great on the PS4, and the same great gameplay along with crisper sharper graphics. If you liked Monster Hunter, you''ll love Toukiden: Kiwami'),
(N'Gary', N'Ivanov', N'gary.ivanov9632@example.com', '2016-02-23', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Price', N'elizabeth.price7450@example.net', '2016-02-23', 5, N'Perfect to show off my Xbox One Day One edition controller.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Wisniewski', N'kenneth.wisniewski2798@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'This game is just the best shooter I''ve played. I don''t like to write a lot but all l can say is that l just highly recomend it to you. Play it for yourself you''ll enjoy it alot.'),
(N'Edward', N'Ali', N'edward.ali6692@example.net', '2016-02-23', 5, N'Great quality, love the figure.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Walker', N'hiroshi.walker6354@example.org', '2016-02-23', 5, N'CAPCOM HAS DONE IT AGAIN! AWESOME ADDITION TO THE LONG LINE OF STREET FIGHTER. JUST HAVE TO RELEARN THIS NEW MECHANICS.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Ivanov', N'thomas.ivanov3653@example.com', '2016-02-23', 3, N'There are a lot of good things about The Sims 3 for PS3 - great graphics, easy-to-learn controls, quicker load times - but unfortunately this is a game that just doesn''t translate well to consoles. There are a lot of limitations in this version compared to PC (especially when building houses, my favorite part), and it tends to feel more like a demo version of a Sims game than the game itself. Bottom line: It''s fun for 20 hours of gameplay, but it can''t stack up to the 200+ hours of enjoyment I''ve had playing the PC version.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Murphy', N'pamela.murphy2136@example.net', '2016-02-24', 5, N'Great charger, essentially the same as your OEM charger. Works flawlessly.'),
(N'Christine', N'Morgan', N'christine.morgan9751@example.com', '2016-02-24', 1, N'really disappointed in this game. I only paid $20 for it and still felt ripped off.'),
(N'Karen', N'Thomas', N'karen.thomas9568@example.net', '2016-02-24', 5, N'LOVE IT'),
(N'Karen', N'Thomas', N'karen.thomas9568@example.net', '2016-02-24', 5, N'LOVE IT.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Clark', N'gregory.clark7004@example.net', '2016-02-24', 5, N'I have two of them and love both of them no issues!'),
(N'Gregory', N'Kelly', N'gregory.kelly9864@example.org', '2016-02-24', 4, N'I bought this charger just to free up the PS4''s USB slots for other stuff. It''s better than I expected. The dongles are small and do not interfere with the controllers at all. Dropping the controllers into the charger is nearly idiot-proof. I only have 2 minor complaints: 1. The lights on the front of the base are really bright. It''s a problem easily solved with electrical tape. 2. No included USB AC adapter to let you plug directly into the wall. I had a spare that works fine, but it just seemed like a cheap oversight.'),
(N'Heather', N'Singh', N'heather.singh2219@example.net', '2016-02-24', 4, N'Great.......Zelda is always great.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Thompson', N'jacob.thompson2849@example.com', '2016-02-24', 5, N'You will have loads of fun with this title, especially if playing in a squad with some friends. The Division combines RPG elements, where you can choose Healing / Damage / Defense capabilities in a leveling / looting atmosphere. Loot is similar to other RPG games ranging from gray / white, green / blue / purple / orange. This will acclimate everyone who is familiar with other RPGs pretty quickly. During the beta, the two main missions available were fun, the subway morgue scene was great showing all of the body bags piling up underneath New York! For the pvpers out there the dark zone is the ultimate test of greed and capability. Do you risk losing your loot in an attempt to take others'' and extract with more? Or should you band together and hunt down the rogue players and punish them for their betrayal to the Division? This free for all rogue type concept should really be a great testimony to the entire dark zone environment. Players can find better loot and work together or...'),
(N'Matthew', N'Coleman', N'matthew.coleman7820@example.org', '2016-02-24', 5, N'Really great to da collection or if he''s yer favotire'),
(N'Gregory', N'Brooks', N'gregory.brooks2044@example.org', '2016-02-24', 5, N'Fianc loved it!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Morgan', N'olivia.morgan7016@example.com', '2016-02-24', 4, N'i have not played call of duty since modern warfare 3. all i can say is that activisions needs to improve there servers and fix team balances but besides that its a good game.'),
(N'Brian', N'Ross', N'brian.ross1435@example.org', '2016-02-24', 3, N'This game was really fun for about a month. The first time I played Destiny was with this collection at the launch of TTK, and I had a friend who had played it since the original launch. It was fun, but at level 40 (max level) the game really got stale. It got boring running the same few strikes over and over. From what I heard, there were a lot more strikes in the game, but they didn''t update all of them to the new level cap. Oh well. It was enjoyable'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Hill', N'jeffrey.hill5776@example.com', '2016-02-25', 5, N'Great item.'),
(N'Wei', N'Nguyen', N'wei.nguyen9774@example.net', '2016-02-25', 5, N'Solid add to my collection!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Henderson', N'stephen.henderson8335@example.org', '2016-02-25', 5, N'This game is the epitome of my childhood. We grew up on Mario and Luigi. I am the younger brother, so you know exactly who I played as! But I don''t care. You know the storyline in this game, I don''t have to explain. But I will! Princess Peach of Mushroom Kingdom gets kidnapped by the evil Bowser, the offspring of a dragon and poor turtle. Mario, an overweight, Italian plumber with the speed of Usain Bolt, and hops of Allen Iverson, is in love with this woman and takes action, along with Luigi. Mario and Luigi go through treacherous obstacles such as, jumping across lava pits, jumping across what could be bottomless pits, and mutant turtles and Goombas, whatever those are. If you wait long enough, they end up committing suicide. #goombalivesmatter With the help of power ups, the odds can be ever in your favor. You can eat a mushroom and double in size, or flower power, where you can shoot fire balls from your nose! Come on, I know you noticed that too! A cape that lets you fly, a...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Richardson', N'ryan.richardson4071@example.org', '2016-02-25', 5, N'No cons.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Gray', N'sharon.gray8853@example.org', '2016-02-25', 5, N'I took thanks'),
(N'Ivan', N'Foster', N'ivan.foster1139@example.com', '2016-02-25', 5, N'I don''t understand all the hate for this game, I loved it! Pirates and Nobles is a great add on, it''s worth it in my opinion! There is a lot of folks rating it pretty poorly because their PC''s and their Mac could not handle it. My advice, don''t judge the actual game based on your computers poor specs. Also as a Windows pc owner that also owns a Mac, I would recommend not using a Mac for gaming - PC''s just do it better. When it comes to purchasing a good gaming PC or laptop don''t be tight. I currently own a gaming desktop, and a gaming laptop both were over a thousand and well worth it. Don''t let hefty price tags deter you, a PC with good specs will outlast any cheap dell.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Harris', N'marcus.harris1281@example.org', '2016-02-25', 5, N'one of the better Generic products such as the Generic Wii zapper gun.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Webb', N'douglas.webb9388@example.net', '2016-02-25', 4, N'very good'),
(N'Douglas', N'Webb', N'douglas.webb9388@example.net', '2016-02-25', 4, N'It''s excellent game'),
(N'Ravi', N'Long', N'ravi.long8013@example.com', '2016-02-25', 2, N'I received this game from Cartridges Galore, and when I put it in my GameCube it keeps telling me that it can''t read the disc. It worked for a while when I tried restarting the system a few times, but at certain points of the game it gives me issues. I would highly recommend not buying games that is lower than a "Good" condition or if the company hasn''t tested it properly it before putting it on Amazon.'),
(N'Larry', N'Young', N'larry.young3392@example.org', '2016-02-26', 5, N'Works great! Good to have if you enjoy playing games online with friends'),
(N'Mary', N'Campbell', N'mary.campbell3498@example.net', '2016-02-26', 3, N'Yea the graphics are nice, but it has some issues... First you cannot change the aspect ratio. I use a projector with a 1024-765 native resolution. My 360 was set up to wide screen, and thats what my home theater is set up for. The XBO reads my projector and projects a full screen picture which puts the picture above and below the viewing screen. There is no way to make it a 16X9 format. The sound MUST BE hooked up through the optical if you want digital 5.1 or 7.1. The HDMI cable loses the center channel, and you end up with no dialogue. The only work-around it to switch the XBO output to stereo, which defeats the purpose of digital 7.1. Noticed there is no Weather app. I used my weather app on my 360 every morning. Guess I''ll have to continue to. FOUR YEARS IN and these problems haven''t been addressed yet?? C''mon Microsoft - Get your poop in a group!!!!'),
(N'Ashley', N'King', N'ashley.king6638@example.org', '2016-02-26', 2, N'I''m editing my rating. I originally had it at a 4 star rating because it looked awesome AT FIRST. After about a few hours of play, the heat from the PS4 caused the skin to curl. Its really disheartening and yes I put it on correctly. In all honesty, I try and not be too crule when writing reviews but I must call out a bad product when I see it. I do not recommend this product.'),
(N'Diane', N'Sanders', N'diane.sanders7463@example.com', '2016-02-26', 5, N'Very fun game. IMO this is the best open world game this year. If you want to get every penny worth of your $60 this game is for you. You can easily spend hours crafting, gathering, taming animals, collecting artifacts, hunting doing missions, side missions or just exploring the land. Graphics are incredible. The natural landscape and animals to everything looks amazing. You can totally get lost in its world.'),
(N'Linda', N'Powell', N'linda.powell4976@example.com', '2016-02-26', 5, N'Very nice product. lots of fun.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Kumar', N'victoria.kumar2868@example.com', '2016-02-26', 4, N'Kung Fu Panda for the Xbox 360 is a fun game and I like it. Thanks for selling this item.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Phillips', N'joshua.phillips5914@example.com', '2016-02-26', 5, N'Kids loved this...an has since bought more characters an play often'),
(N'Eric', N'Campbell', N'eric.campbell8652@example.net', '2016-02-27', 4, N'not bad. as cheesy as i expected.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Morris', N'barbara.morris5074@example.com', '2016-02-27', 5, N'Awesome headset as always. This is the third time we have bought a turtle beach head set, ( Xbox 360 ones for two kids) and now this one for the Xbox one.. They sound great, easy on the ears and simple to use. Highly recommend.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Kowalski', N'joshua.kowalski7366@example.com', '2016-02-27', 5, N'great game, enjoyed every bit of it.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Thompson', N'rebecca.thompson2256@example.com', '2016-02-27', 4, N'This racing game is a bit different from my others in that it requires more attention to the driving. A decent game overall.'),
(N'Mark', N'Jackson', N'mark.jackson4226@example.com', '2016-02-27', 5, N'Excellent product, 10/10'),
(N'Daniel', N'Ward', N'daniel.ward4462@example.net', '2016-02-27', 1, N'Story mode for every character last 40 minutes max. Too many favorite characters from previous street fighters missing. Online play is not great collision seems worse then sf4 for ps3, there is lag from 4 and 5 bar connections. Strongest move in the game is jab it beats almost everything. Missing a ton of standard features in every other fighting game even SF4.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Okonkwo', N'nancy.okonkwo4281@example.net', '2016-02-27', 5, N'My son loves this controler. Thank you so much.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Johnson', N'zachary.johnson3030@example.net', '2016-02-27', 5, N'Awesome learning tool. Pretty decent track-listing. Jam Session is where its at.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Johnson', N'zachary.johnson3030@example.net', '2016-02-27', 5, N'Learn to go to work on 2 hours of sleep!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Bennett', N'aaron.bennett1753@example.net', '2016-02-27', 5, N'Great series. Good game'),
(N'Tyler', N'Webb', N'tyler.webb9521@example.com', '2016-02-28', 5, N'Fantastic game. But I think it''s pretty garbage that Nintendo is already stopping print on this game. From what I hear anyway. If you can get a copy with B1 and 2, do so. As it''ll save you space on the Wii Us already incredibly small HDD.'),
(N'Scott', N'Torres', N'scott.torres6337@example.org', '2016-02-28', 5, N'The Amiibo just looks amazing!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Rivera', N'olivia.rivera7641@example.org', '2016-02-28', 5, N'Really fun game. Same day shipping.'),
(N'Patrick', N'James', N'patrick.james6052@example.org', '2016-02-28', 1, N'Anyone who gave this a decent review wrote their review too soon. In less than 90 days my grips literally disintegrated. The logos fell off almost instantly, a few weeks later the antibacterial top separated from the foam bottom and a few weeks after that the thing just feel to pieces completely. Admittedly I use my PS4 more than the average person so you may get more time out of it then me, even still I now have to find another solution because of the residue left behind by this cheap product.'),
(N'Amara', N'Murphy', N'amara.murphy6662@example.org', '2016-02-28', 5, N'No issues what so ever. Worked immediately. Happy buyer.'),
(N'Adam', N'Sullivan', N'adam.sullivan8871@example.org', '2016-02-28', 5, N'Great game from my past!'),
(N'Mei', N'Williams', N'mei.williams8553@example.org', '2016-02-28', 5, N'This was a Christmas gift for my 15 year old son. He really enjoys it. I am not a gamer, but he seems to think this is a winner!'),
(N'Mei', N'Williams', N'mei.williams8553@example.org', '2016-02-28', 5, N'A great, fun game for any Zelda fans! My 14 yr old son LOVES it.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Phillips', N'joshua.phillips5914@example.com', '2016-02-28', 5, N'Its madden...enough said....great game'),
(N'Brenda', N'Patel', N'brenda.patel4502@example.com', '2016-02-28', 5, N'grand childs pleasure'),
(N'Nadia', N'King', N'nadia.king8183@example.net', '2016-02-28', 4, N'I had a lot more fun with this title than I expected. Luigi, unlike Mario, is allowed to have character development and it shows! You really come to enjoy him and his ghostly misadventures. Plenty of level replay value with so many macguffins to find.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Perez', N'jeremy.perez1687@example.net', '2016-02-29', 5, N'These work perfect with our wiiu. Only problem is that the kids took off one of the charging parts from the controller and have lost it.'),
(N'Amara', N'Kumar', N'amara.kumar7411@example.net', '2016-02-29', 3, N'Should be able to carry a larger variety of weapons. Some scenes are a little difficult to maneuver when using the rope. You have to be on a certain angle when climbing down or you will fall to your death.'),
(N'Megan', N'Hernandez', N'megan.hernandez4112@example.com', '2016-02-29', 4, N'UPDATE 4/22/16: Upgraded from 2 to 4+ stars. Here''s what happened: I sent these back. They were faulty. I didn''t like the volume issues with chat/phone calls. I was annoyed about having to charge them every day or more, etc. All detailed below. The fact of the matter is, however, that NONE of the other headsets could deliver what these could. Wireless, surround sound, with BIG immersive sound and compatibility with my entire setup (XB1, XB360, PC & phone). After trying everything else, I went to the local Not-the-worst Buy and bought another pair of these Astros. I have not had the same faulty volume control issue, going on almost a month and a half now. As far as the volume of chat, I found that if you do about a 80% chat to 20% game volume and turn the volume WAY up, you can get a good balance and be able to hear people. You also get a little bit more of the mic monitoring when doing this. Additionally, when using a TB 2.5mm to 3.5mm talkback cable in the left earpiece, I CAN...'),
(N'Steven', N'Gray', N'steven.gray9622@example.com', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Great game! This is my first assassin''s creed game and it''s awesome. It''s like playing a small scale of gta except you can''t interact with normal citizens but can kill people in very interesting ways~ The map is pretty large and the view is just beautiful!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Kowalski', N'andrea.kowalski5691@example.org', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Amazing headphones at a very good price.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Morris', N'jerry.morris7470@example.net', '2016-02-29', 4, N'Gears of War (Ultimate) is a good updated version of the classic 360 title. I''ve been playing the campaign co-op over xbox live with a friend and it''s fairly enjoyable. I''d rate it 4 out of 5 for graphics, gameplay and nostalgia factor. It''s not a masterpiece but it''s a fun game if purchased in the 20 dollar range.'),
(N'John', N'Thompson', N'john.thompson2946@example.org', '2016-02-29', 3, N'I don''t know if I like this game. Kinda boring.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Young', N'tyler.young9715@example.net', '2016-02-29', 5, N'10-Oct'),
(N'Mei', N'Morales', N'mei.morales7400@example.net', '2016-02-29', 5, N'So much better than a condescending guitar teacher. And, you can have it on your schedule'),
(N'Edward', N'Anderson', N'edward.anderson6825@example.org', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Closest thing to a SNES brand controller. I''ve purchased many crappy knock-off SNES controllers throughout the last 10 years and I have to say that this one has exceeded my expectations. The buttons just feel right when you press them. They respond instantly. The D-pad is a little firmer to press, but it works like a dream and pops right back into place like the buttons do. I love this controller. The only issue I had is when I 1st used it it felt like the B button was a little stiff. After pressing it about 10-15 times it feels like the rest of the buttons. Overall I highly recommend this controller if you need a replacement for your SNES. I have been playing SNES since it came out and this is the real deal.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Fisher', N'sharon.fisher6724@example.com', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Noah', N'Bennett', N'noah.bennett8368@example.org', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Good product would buy again'),
(N'Marcus', N'Clark', N'marcus.clark2744@example.com', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Performed well 5 stars'),
(N'Hannah', N'Foster', N'hannah.foster1126@example.org', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Had several people state they love the collectors edition. Has only a digital download of game though. That was disappointing'),
(N'Christine', N'Kowalski', N'christine.kowalski3122@example.net', '2016-02-29', 5, N'can''t imagine not playing in 3d now, master quest included'),
(N'Shirley', N'Kumar', N'shirley.kumar1957@example.net', '2016-02-29', 2, N'To be honest, while this product is great with a backlight, the duration in which this keyboard is usable is short. The print on the keyboard disappeared after a week of barely using it since i work and only use it time and time. I wouldn''t reccommend this keyboard. Buy one that is sturdy and doesn''t fade so easily. Made cheap it seems.'),
(N'Richard', N'Kumar', N'richard.kumar9635@example.net', '2016-02-29', 5, N'Just recieved this awsome amiibo and it is really working out well with super smash bros for 3ds and it came in before march 15 which surprised me. I recieved it on 02/29/16'),
(N'Nathan', N'Scott', N'nathan.scott9674@example.net', '2016-02-29', 5, N'The Pip-Boy is every bit as glorious as promised. It looks great displayed on the mantle, or worn proudly on my arm as I drive around town. I attract quite a bit of attention, yes sir.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Murphy', N'jacqueline.murphy2216@example.net', '2016-02-29', 4, N'the product overall has a really nice bolstered feel for big hands but it isn''t a perfect fit near the moving joint. I want to cut it off but i did that with some ps4 silicone grips for sub par results.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Ivanov', N'tomasz.ivanov1969@example.org', '2016-03-01', 5, N'Great game to play with my friends.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Roberts', N'ronald.roberts5129@example.org', '2016-03-01', 5, N'Just as described. Very nice!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Allen', N'brenda.allen8347@example.com', '2016-03-01', 1, N'DO NOT BUY unless you have an xbox one controller adapter OR a second generation controller.'),
(N'Luis', N'Robinson', N'luis.robinson3514@example.com', '2016-03-01', 5, N'Code worked instantly'),
(N'Michael', N'Coleman', N'michael.coleman9923@example.net', '2016-03-01', 5, N'Comes with a ton of songs that my kids love dancing to. You can also download additional songs to add to your list.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Russell', N'jonathan.russell6651@example.org', '2016-03-01', 4, N'Good GAME !'),
(N'Amara', N'Foster', N'amara.foster6074@example.com', '2016-03-01', 5, N'loved it!!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Khan', N'stephanie.khan3468@example.com', '2016-03-01', 2, N'Not what I expected. This doesn''t allow enough space for 8 like the description says. My youngest Son now uses it to carry his legos instead.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Okonkwo', N'cynthia.okonkwo8362@example.org', '2016-03-01', 5, N'Love this game, despite what everyone say a out it'),
(N'Andrea', N'Thomas', N'andrea.thomas3517@example.org', '2016-03-01', 3, N'It will be a while before I can see if I love it or not.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Foster', N'mateo.foster1835@example.org', '2016-03-01', 5, N'GRANDSON LIKED THIS GAME.'),
(N'Helen', N'Allen', N'helen.allen4056@example.net', '2016-03-01', 1, N'Total Crap........'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Walker', N'hiroshi.walker6354@example.org', '2016-03-01', 5, N'NICE'),
(N'Emma', N'Stewart', N'emma.stewart8108@example.com', '2016-03-01', 5, N'this is a awesome game. this game is fun and enjoyable to play. the characters are great and the story is good. fun game. if you have not played this game then I recommend you do'),
(N'Anthony', N'Davis', N'anthony.davis6377@example.net', '2016-03-01', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Paul', N'Robinson', N'paul.robinson9282@example.com', '2016-03-02', 5, N'love this game'),
(N'Brenda', N'Long', N'brenda.long6294@example.net', '2016-03-02', 5, N'New All Time Favorite Great game with many objects not seen in other $1.99 games. I expected to see lots of clutter in this one based on the title. It is not there. All levels are bright daylight which makes it easier to find objects. The objects are also spread out over the whole image rather than all clumped on the lower portions.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Walker', N'rachel.walker4099@example.org', '2016-03-02', 4, N'good game.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Lee', N'tyler.lee8295@example.com', '2016-03-02', 5, N'Great product, better than anticipated! My son LOVES it!'),
(N'Tyler', N'Lee', N'tyler.lee8295@example.com', '2016-03-02', 5, N'Great product, better than anticipated!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Ward', N'deborah.ward1148@example.net', '2016-03-02', 5, N'This is the first Fire Emblem game I''ve ever played (I''m a casual gamer, but have been playing various iteration of Pokemon/Zelda/Mario since the late 90s). I didn''t really know what to expect from it, but I love it! The characters are the big seller for me. The plot seems to have some nice depth to it, but the characters are what sell this game. They are fun and varied and, in my opinion, well-voiced.'),
(N'Dee', N'Howard', N'dee.howard4161@example.com', '2016-03-02', 4, N'Works fine'),
(N'Amanda', N'Martin', N'amanda.martin8364@example.net', '2016-03-02', 5, N'Everything perfect, excellent product, I recommend 100%. Thank you.'),
(N'Emma', N'Phillips', N'emma.phillips9267@example.net', '2016-03-02', 5, N'Best assassins creed in the series. Plenty of fun and good graphics. Story is amazing and will leave you with a very satisfied feeling at the end'),
(N'George', N'Mitchell', N'george.mitchell5408@example.net', '2016-03-02', 2, N'Save the Universe by regenerating the power in a star? Since when is a single star going out effect the entire Universe? Sorry, I know it is for kids, but there is nothing like confusing kids at such a young age. It leads me to believe that the creators of the game have no idea what the Universe is, let alone a single star! Well, off my soapbox...The game itself is definitely not as entertaining as I Spy Castle Kind of lame ...But Then I did not buy it ...my daughter did . We both played it and came to the same conclusion...very lame I SPY game. PS: We are both not kids ( She is 22, I am ...well, not 22) ...so maybe we are a little skewed in our tastes....but we still enjoy other I Spy Games.'),
(N'Heather', N'Fisher', N'heather.fisher4927@example.com', '2016-03-02', 4, N'its an ok bundle. price was good.'),
(N'Heather', N'Fisher', N'heather.fisher4927@example.com', '2016-03-02', 4, N'low price for an ok game.'),
(N'Dee', N'Anderson', N'dee.anderson3484@example.net', '2016-03-02', 5, N'It''s got a lot of Pikachus on it.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Green', N'ivan.green2109@example.org', '2016-03-03', 5, N'another one of my favorite games .. arrived very quickly thanks'),
(N'Charles', N'Miller', N'charles.miller4573@example.net', '2016-03-03', 4, N'Surprisingly fun addition to have the controller vibrate. Playing Rise of the Tomb Raider and when she falls into the water, you feel the shock! It''s a nicely made piece of equipment and an excellent price.'),
(N'Linda', N'Kumar', N'linda.kumar2445@example.com', '2016-03-03', 5, N'Love it!!'),
(N'Amy', N'Henderson', N'amy.henderson1944@example.org', '2016-03-03', 5, N'Great product, looks killer on the system.'),
(N'Michael', N'Coleman', N'michael.coleman9923@example.net', '2016-03-03', 5, N'Great game for kids. Can design their own layout.'),
(N'Michael', N'Flores', N'michael.flores4672@example.net', '2016-03-03', 5, N'Great product. Easy to use.'),
(N'Charles', N'Allen', N'charles.allen5138@example.org', '2016-03-03', 5, N'very pleased'),
(N'Yuki', N'Fisher', N'yuki.fisher2320@example.org', '2016-03-03', 3, N'was alright'),
(N'Yuki', N'Fisher', N'yuki.fisher2320@example.org', '2016-03-03', 2, N'didn''t like'),
(N'Yuki', N'Fisher', N'yuki.fisher2320@example.org', '2016-03-03', 5, N'preferred mouse affordable'),
(N'Noah', N'Thomas', N'noah.thomas2136@example.net', '2016-03-03', 5, N'I love this game! Buy it! So much fun to play! So much mission variety. You can''t go wrong with this game! Buy it!'),
(N'Samantha', N'King', N'samantha.king6695@example.net', '2016-03-03', 1, N'Im sure at the core this is, like every other FE game, a fantastic SRPG. However what we as gamers have to stand up against sadly is the butchering and censorship of their "localized" titles like this, and the many others tainted by NOA. The cuts and changes are clearly stated by Christopher C. in his review so I won''t repeat but please do not support this kind of censorship to our games.'),
(N'Maria', N'Williams', N'maria.williams5310@example.org', '2016-03-03', 3, N'Great headset but it hurts my ears if I wear it for too long. They sound fantastic though. Just wish they didn''t hurt so bad.'),
(N'George', N'Roberts', N'george.roberts7812@example.com', '2016-03-04', 5, N'I only got this because it was on sale and was cheaper than the regular controller. It works flawlessly.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Phillips', N'shirley.phillips5967@example.org', '2016-03-04', 4, N'Let me just start off by saying this is definitely not the best story the fallout series has offered. I really felt disconnected with the main storyline and even the characters. Most of the characters were great, but a lot of them were simply loosely connected to the overarching storyline. Most characters outside of the story were much more interesting too haha! Other than this one fault for me, this game is stunning. So much to do, hours to spend walking around and doing literally nothing productive! I don''t regret any of the hours I''ve spent on this game because I was having fun and that''s all that matters. Yes, there are bugs. Yes, You will occasionally lose minutes to hours of work from these bugs, but you should already expect that. Just keep quick-saving then problem solved haha! A must buy for any gamer interested in an rpg shooter. Much to do, great graphics, great characters, you can play in various styles, make different decisions, replay value, and most importantly so...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Myers', N'joshua.myers2695@example.com', '2016-03-04', 5, N'I bought this for a friend that I wanted to play with online. Much better than xbox.'),
(N'John', N'Sullivan', N'john.sullivan8588@example.com', '2016-03-04', 5, N'Good feeling and grip with the hands. Very easy to put on aside from the thumb grips. The thumbs grips will take a little bit to put on. Other than can''t beat the price!!!'),
(N'Emma', N'Stewart', N'emma.stewart8108@example.com', '2016-03-04', 5, N'this is a awesome game. lego made another great game with marvel characters. this one is based on the avengers movies. this is such a fun game to play. love it. the game play is really fun the characters are great love this game. if you have not played this game then I recommend you do'),
(N'Ryan', N'Wright', N'ryan.wright1749@example.com', '2016-03-05', 5, N'I love this game & it plays nice & smooth lol on ps4 the remake looks better for sure especially when actually in the game playing as compared to ps3. But as with many of the remasters go the ps4 could of made this game shine way way more if they took the time to do so & why 60fps was not added or atleast a option is beyond me ps4 & xbox one could handle this game while sleeping & breaking no sweat. But with all that said its still a great looking game & keeps a 30fps locked smooth ride mostly throughout. I will add iam one that actually love these remasters sure i want new experiences but their rolling out here n there. Anyhow back too remasters what they should all do though is nerd the s*** out of them shoot for overkill pack them goodies in there make them graphics sing i mean if its a remasterd version your doing thats what it should b about pack all the extra goodies & max the graphics & gameplay to best it can achieve'),
(N'Matthew', N'Cook', N'matthew.cook1690@example.net', '2016-03-05', 5, N'This game is the most badass, action-packed, awesome looking video game ever made. Played it over a span of two months. Absolutely loved every level and all the characters. Story is engaging. Voice acting top notch. Gameplay is the best. Scenery is gorgeous and nothing like I''ve seen before -- in sea of ohkotosk, cozumel, shanghai and a few other levels. Pulling enemies from under thin layers of ice, before doing that, just look at the graphics -- it''s incredible. You will want to replay those parts several times, just because of how awesome it is. So is swimming in water, the reflections and lighting are amazing (in cozumel, sea of okotosk (right before capturing the captain). You rappel off a skyscraper in Shanghai, this level is quite possibly the best in any video game. Not to mention the gadgets -- retinal scanners, laser microphones, finger print scanners, weaponry. Sneaking and interrogating the NPCs. 20/10.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Reyes', N'raymond.reyes6379@example.org', '2016-03-05', 5, N'I absolutely love these games. I played all three in 2 weeks and now there is an Uncharted hole in my heart'),
(N'Frank', N'Ruiz', N'frank.ruiz8618@example.org', '2016-03-05', 1, N'I bought this only because it was on sale. I wasn''t going to buy it because the multiple previous CoD''s have been quite bad, and this is worse. What an awful campaign. The story telling is spotty at best, and the cut scenes are unbearably painful to endure. The voice acting is no better. Supremely disappointed in this franchise once again. The graphics are good, but that''s it. I won''t waste any more money on these games.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Coleman', N'katherine.coleman1261@example.net', '2016-03-05', 5, N'Great game!!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Lewis', N'andrew.lewis7056@example.com', '2016-03-05', 4, N'I enjoy the Far Cry series. Some are a little redundant but I found this one less. There is a little story involved and you get lots of skill and craft points to do various tasks. This game is set in 10,000 BC, so everything is quite different than the other games of this series. I found the quests more interesting because I''ve never played a game set in that time. There is a lot to discover and do in the game. You will need certain levels and tools to do parts of the game which makes it a longer lasting game. The controls are easy and the game play is easy as well. Maps are good and the skill and craft menus are easy to understand. The only thing that I found a bit bothersome was that any dialects g is all subtitles because it''s all unknown languages. I get that it''s 10,000 b.c. But would like an option to just talk English. I know I''m being picky but it would be more enjoyable to me. If you like the Farcry series or are new to it this will be a fun game that will have lots of...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Gonzalez', N'carolyn.gonzalez1811@example.net', '2016-03-05', 5, N'My son loves it !'),
(N'Paul', N'Coleman', N'paul.coleman7416@example.com', '2016-03-05', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Adams', N'benjamin.adams5233@example.org', '2016-03-05', 5, N'just like the game'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Barnes', N'jonathan.barnes6193@example.com', '2016-03-05', 5, N'amazingly creative game. One thing I ***really like*** about if for the kids is that each part of the adventure is limited in time - there is a complete begin/end, you don''t have to spend an hour to get to a save point. You play through the game in "game days", I think they are about 16 to 18 minutes. Then you are done. You can, actually, get a half an hour of game play and complete one part of the game nicely.'),
(N'Anita', N'Wang', N'anita.wang8005@example.org', '2016-03-05', 5, N'Best tactical jrpg ever.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Cruz', N'benjamin.cruz7784@example.com', '2016-03-06', 3, N'This was going to be super awesome. Who doesn''t love a sim about the settlement of the Americas? I found the navigation tough and I had a hard time getting my guys where I wanted them to go. After I automated some of the tasks, it made some of it easier but I felt out of the loop the entire time, like the game was playing itself. Graphics are great though.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Lopez', N'kofi.lopez6055@example.com', '2016-03-06', 5, N'So far, very good. Updated from a five year old G500.'),
(N'Wei', N'Reed', N'wei.reed7253@example.net', '2016-03-06', 4, N'I received this mouse as a review sample, my review will be honest and non-bias, I will not sugar coat anything. The MS 745 is one of Havit budget mice aimed at the budget gamer. The mouse is a tad small in compare to my Primary mouse. The MS745 has 6 buttons including the left and right mouse buttons. The DPI speed setting button changes colors based on the dpi setting that you set, the mouse has leds which it glows to a breathing effect. The cable is on the short side so you may need to use an usb extension cable if your computer desk is large. The Mouse is plug and play and works without any software installed. You have to memorize the color of the dpi settings that you want to use. Lucky the manual does tell you. Green is 800Dpi, red is 1200DPI, Blue is 2000DPI and Purple is 2800DPI. The mouse alright in my hands, but Im not liking the shape of the mouse, other people may not have an issue with the shape of the mouse. The buttons are placed very well on the mouse, I had mice in...'),
(N'Alexander', N'Wang', N'alexander.wang5726@example.com', '2016-03-06', 5, N'wonderful controller. works great'),
(N'Brandon', N'Nelson', N'brandon.nelson9014@example.org', '2016-03-06', 5, N'Works Great,'),
(N'Brandon', N'Nelson', N'brandon.nelson9014@example.org', '2016-03-06', 5, N'Works Great'),
(N'Yuki', N'Williams', N'yuki.williams4630@example.com', '2016-03-06', 1, N'I just dissembled this controller to see how this company does a bad job. If you see my pictures, the buttons and joysticks here are almost the same. BLAME TTX TECH. (I THOUGHT IT WAS TEXAS TECH AND WAS MADE IN TEXAS, BUT IT WAS MADE IN CHINA INSTEAD.)'),
(N'Julie', N'Ortiz', N'julie.ortiz8306@example.org', '2016-03-06', 5, N'great game');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Dennis', N'Bailey', N'dennis.bailey8336@example.net', '2016-03-06', 3, N'Received this item along with TNT''s dual charger (which work great), but the battery fails badly. Brand new and it would never complete a charge, 1st two weeks it would get to about 1/2% charged over 12 hours on the charger, but after that it is getting less charge as time goes by even after trying for 48 hour. I had also brought an official Xbox battery at the same time and it performs great, but not this TNT brand, so buyer be wary of what you may be getting with this item. They seem to have had a bad batch of batteries. Customer service however is great and pleasant to work with and will contact you right away and they will try everything to solve the problems and replace the product to make you satisfied.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Cruz', N'kimberly.cruz2622@example.org', '2016-03-06', 5, N'good'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brown', N'katherine.brown2031@example.org', '2016-03-06', 5, N'perfect im so glad I bought this one.'),
(N'Adam', N'Stewart', N'adam.stewart3024@example.net', '2016-03-07', 3, N'Not a bad game, its not easy by any means the humor is lacking, the protagonist doesn''t talk, if you die you restart the mission from the beginning which can wind up being infuriating on the harder missions, you have to grind for respect to complete story missions. Compared to SR2 & SR3 its definitely lacking. SR4 & SRGOOH might as well be different titles entirely.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Boyd', N'sandra.boyd3076@example.com', '2016-03-07', 5, N'As Advertised'),
(N'Pamela', N'Hughes', N'pamela.hughes5611@example.org', '2016-03-07', 5, N'Excellent, as expected'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Watson', N'kimberly.watson4471@example.com', '2016-03-07', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Timothy', N'Nowak', N'timothy.nowak4527@example.net', '2016-03-07', 5, N'Very good, does the job!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Nowak', N'mateo.nowak9799@example.org', '2016-03-07', 4, N'I give this game 4 out of 5 not for gameplay because it''s a great game, just for the fact that this is not an American version of the game but a U.E.A/ Malaysia version hence the price because this game was around 80 to 90$ new here on amazon, even though it works on American wii consoles... but this should be in the description so people know what they''re getting.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Stewart', N'samantha.stewart3164@example.com', '2016-03-07', 5, N'son loves it'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Cook', N'jacqueline.cook8874@example.com', '2016-03-07', 5, N'I like this one best of the series, including the XBox One latest ones.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Miller', N'cheryl.miller1509@example.net', '2016-03-07', 5, N'Worth the money, it''s exactly what I wanted.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Miller', N'cheryl.miller1509@example.net', '2016-03-07', 5, N'Awesome control.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Russell', N'nicole.russell4732@example.org', '2016-03-07', 5, N'none'),
(N'Paul', N'Cox', N'paul.cox4294@example.org', '2016-03-07', 5, N'Admittedly this is the first force feedback wheel ive ever owned so I''m definitely not an expert. However I have been playing racing games for decades, and got an absolute kick out of this wheel. The force feedback isn''t some rumble effect it is actually responding to the on screen environment, and your inputs with the pedals/wheel. If you play racing sims on a controller please stop, and try and find one of these, and a copy of gran turismo 6. I should also mention I bought mine used, and at 10 years plus it is still extremely precise, and the motor runs smooth. The only time it makes noise I can hear over my surround sound is when I''m drifting. If you can find one for $50-$75 I''d buy it in a heart beat. In order to use it properly you need to have a study table, and an adjustable chair. You don''t need to go out and buy a thousand dollar rig to have some fun. My table cost around 20.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Kumar', N'ryan.kumar2194@example.com', '2016-03-07', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Wei', N'Taylor', N'wei.taylor9357@example.net', '2016-03-07', 5, N'Falco and the detail in his clothing are fantastic! His tail is soft compared to the rest of the figure. Couldn''t find any obvious seams or weird joints. Great job!'),
(N'Wei', N'Taylor', N'wei.taylor9357@example.net', '2016-03-07', 5, N'Bowser looks great and is actually heavy compared to the other fighters! The detail is amazing and the seam points blend into the character and his stance. Really good job from the design team. Just one slight imperfection would be found on his shell as some of the spikes are separate pieces and don''t sit flush with the rest. Not a huge deal, but worthy of mentioning.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Morris', N'jessica.morris9876@example.net', '2016-03-07', 5, N'14 hours to play...two days to finish!!! It is obvious from my rating and the opening sentence that I love this game. I won''t pontificate other than to say by the end my mind was thoroughly blown away. The main reason I recommend this particular version of the game is that it contains the original "Bioshock", as well. I got this version completely by accident, and seeing how I did not own either game, this was an outright steal and a pleasant surprise! Two of the highest-rated, most praised games of the seventh generation in one package! Mind blown again! Gameplay: 9 Story: 10 Graphics: 9'),
(N'Raymond', N'Watson', N'raymond.watson7076@example.org', '2016-03-08', 5, N'Charger works as expected, fits snugly into the port. Definitely worth the price.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Jackson', N'stephen.jackson7505@example.org', '2016-03-08', 1, N'There is no support for windows 10. Corsair says there is but they are deceiving you. The legacy support does not support the extra buttons or macro commands. it is a known issue and they seem to have no intention of fixing it as i have been waiting for a fix for over a year.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Raghunathan', N'barbara.raghunathan4873@example.com', '2016-03-08', 5, N'Perfect Christmas gift for my brother! He loves it.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Evans', N'lucia.evans8680@example.com', '2016-03-08', 5, N'One of the best N64 games of all time'),
(N'Lucia', N'Evans', N'lucia.evans8680@example.com', '2016-03-08', 5, N'Nothing beats The Sims!'),
(N'John', N'Morgan', N'john.morgan9378@example.com', '2016-03-08', 4, N'Good cable'),
(N'Joyce', N'Moore', N'joyce.moore4853@example.net', '2016-03-08', 5, N'Graphics are awesome.'),
(N'Richard', N'Henderson', N'richard.henderson4088@example.com', '2016-03-09', 4, N'works nicely'),
(N'Richard', N'Henderson', N'richard.henderson4088@example.com', '2016-03-09', 4, N'fun game'),
(N'Nancy', N'Fisher', N'nancy.fisher2873@example.org', '2016-03-09', 1, N'When I saw this game I got excited, "OMG! The Video Game industry has finally figured out what we want," but no, they did it. If imitation is the highest form of flattery, this these people obviously hate the Hitman franchise and here''s why. 1. Hitman allows you to use stealth or be bloody violent. In this game, it''s stealth or nothing, your character dies too quick if he starts shooting. 2. Putting a device on a phone to record a conversation is fun. Having to walk to a payphone to hear the conversation, and then having to kill one person AND beat up someone else (or use chloroform) another, but do not kill him, is not fun. 3. How can I use stealth to kill a Nazi scientists that always stays in the same area and has plenty of Nazis watching his back? That last mission was the one that made me give up and go back to Fallout 4. In conclusion, this game had a lot of potential but I should have listened to the negative reviews. Yes, killing people in exotic locations always turns me...'),
(N'Noah', N'Jones', N'noah.jones8890@example.net', '2016-03-09', 5, N'Game works perfectly and got it quickly'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Watson', N'tomasz.watson4345@example.com', '2016-03-09', 5, N'Best amiibo eva.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Kowalski', N'cynthia.kowalski7728@example.com', '2016-03-09', 3, N'ok'),
(N'Marcus', N'Garcia', N'marcus.garcia7045@example.net', '2016-03-09', 3, N'Not quite what I am used to based on previous Tom Clancy series. Wish they would have kept the same type of play for single player.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Walker', N'ravi.walker1099@example.com', '2016-03-09', 5, N'Absolutely fantastic. I can wear these for hours without any discomfort, and the sound is AMAZING. I actually wore these for a week playing World of Warcraft and commenting on how awesome the audio quality was, before realizing that I hadn''t even activated the 7.1 virtual surround yet.... Derp! Pressed the button on the USB controller, and was not disappointed. Seriously, do yourself a favor and get these headphones. They are worth far more than they charge.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Kowalski', N'joyce.kowalski7492@example.org', '2016-03-09', 5, N'Fit perfect, worked perfect, during one of our moves we lost our original cord, now we got to re-enjoy all of our old favorite games. Cable is great quality and so are the heads.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Kowalski', N'joyce.kowalski7492@example.org', '2016-03-09', 5, N'The game was amazing, the system is perfect, never a single issue with it. It weighs so little, and easy to hold.. Saying this, I must insist you buy the Nyko Power Grip for PS Vita (PCH-2000) gripper. It will help prevent hand cramping!'),
(N'Anita', N'Alvarez', N'anita.alvarez9446@example.com', '2016-03-09', 5, N'Product is solid. No issues.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Moore', N'olivia.moore8823@example.com', '2016-03-09', 5, N'great product'),
(N'Linda', N'Kowalski', N'linda.kowalski1250@example.com', '2016-03-09', 4, N'This mouse is great, even down to its packaging. The box, you have a piece of tape closing it and it looks like you may have to mess with that hard to open plastic, but that''s not the case. It just comes apart and you can get the mouse out with no cutting or anything, which is what all packaging should be like. The mouse has weights in it, and you are able to take or add more depending on what is comfortable for you. There are 5 buttons. The 2 on the left side let you go back and forth when using your Internet browser, there are the typical right and left buttons, and between those there is one that adjusts how fast your mouse cursor can move. It doesn''t come with software, so you have to search for it online. The software just lets you make the buttons work in various ways. There''s a list and it''s helpful if you don''t like the default settings. The cord for this mouse is my favorite part. It''s not plastic, its texture reminds me of a bungee cord. Plastic cords suck because they...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Henderson', N'kimberly.henderson7616@example.com', '2016-03-09', 5, N'FINALLY! Xbox One controller wireless for my PC.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Castillo', N'aaron.castillo8177@example.net', '2016-03-09', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Robert', N'Ferreira', N'robert.ferreira6557@example.net', '2016-03-09', 5, N'This is one of the best covers that I''ve ever seen for the PlayStation 3. Foamy Lizard has really set the standard for quality here. I''m thoroughly impressed at how snug this fits my console, with even the curve of the Slim model molded perfectly in the front. The quality of the fabric is great, with the stitching all the way around is well done too. I''m also impressed with the consideration for the cabling in the back of the unit, with it slightly cut out to compensate for that. Too many other covers are simply that, but this one fits exactly like a glove; Not too tight, and not too loose. I''ll certainly be purchasing covers from this company, and the quality alone was worth the price I paid for it. I highly recommend this cover to anyone looking for one. Two thumbs up!'),
(N'Helen', N'Johnson', N'helen.johnson4953@example.net', '2016-03-10', 4, N'Great grip and comfort. A little sloppy on manufacturing. L1 and r1 are slightly covered by strap and need constant adjusting to use buttons. Update: these covers are amazing. They really do help with gaming. They have relieved the annoying slick controller feel. The analog covers do get slick during intense play but overall do improve the feel of the orginal sticks'),
(N'Amara', N'Morales', N'amara.morales4945@example.org', '2016-03-10', 4, N'The one star scores really are ridiculous. The division does get a lot right, and the most import thing is its fun. The biggest complaints I''m seeing are character creation , where, OK yea it could have been somewhat deeper, as could the very repetitive AI one line speeches, and the most talked about issue, the spongy shooting. Personally I''m using single shot rifles with zoom so a couple of headshots on the standard enemies sorts them out, and withers the others down quicker'),
(N'Brian', N'Turner', N'brian.turner5488@example.org', '2016-03-10', 5, N'Excellent controller'),
(N'Carlos', N'Green', N'carlos.green1239@example.com', '2016-03-10', 5, N'Fabulous! I already own this game I needed another copy for a fair price and fast shipping and That''s exactly what I got.. Item is 100% as described!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Ferreira', N'marcus.ferreira3772@example.com', '2016-03-10', 5, N'If you are a fan of hunting games or extremely primitive environment games, this is likely literally the perfect game for you. Running around, hunting animals is pretty close to reality in this game. I didn''t like that when you spear some animals, the spear doesn''t actually enter the animal''s body like it would in real life. They kind of cheaped out and just added a blood effect. However the fact that the arrows stayed in the animals, and they responded based on where you hit them was a nice touch as far as realism goes. Some animals don''t die right away when you shoot them over and over again, so that can be frustrating. Overall running around, hunting animals, interacting with other primitive human-type creatures etc is pretty enjoyable. The storyline is engaging as well, although you do have to do a number of tedious tasks which can get frustrating. This game definitely doesn''t assume you have common sense.'),
(N'Jason', N'Khan', N'jason.khan9283@example.com', '2016-03-10', 5, N'Delivery was super fast. Excellent!! Item was just as described. Packaging was not what I have seen in the past, a bit cheap, but no damage. Will buy again!'),
(N'Mark', N'Edwards', N'mark.edwards3517@example.org', '2016-03-10', 5, N'I use these for Flight Simulator X. They fit comfortably around the ear and are pretty light. The only thing I wonder about is how easily the earpieces swivel when taken off the head. You have to handle them by the top overhead part to keep from losing your grip and dropping them. Other than that, I am satisfied with them and the sound. Also, the cord is very long so reaching the computer should be a non issue.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Wright', N'jeffrey.wright1378@example.org', '2016-03-10', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Gregory', N'Collins', N'gregory.collins3604@example.com', '2016-03-10', 5, N'Fast shipping, product as described.'),
(N'Paul', N'Tanaka', N'paul.tanaka5741@example.org', '2016-03-10', 4, N'great'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Fisher', N'carolyn.fisher9995@example.com', '2016-03-10', 5, N'got her easy and on time my kids love it'),
(N'Adam', N'Bailey', N'adam.bailey7811@example.com', '2016-03-10', 5, N'I have always loved this game. This one and Spider-Man 2 are the two best Spider-Man games. Very similar and yet very different. In this one you get a great sense of a young Peter Parker. And on the flip side, you get to play as Venom through half of the game. Well more like 30 to 35% of it. It is still Spider-Man''s game, after all.'),
(N'Mary', N'Lewis', N'mary.lewis4542@example.net', '2016-03-10', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Nancy', N'Anderson', N'nancy.anderson8991@example.com', '2016-03-11', 5, N'The item work just fine.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Adams', N'alexander.adams2751@example.com', '2016-03-11', 5, N'excellent quality'),
(N'Aaron', N'Ward', N'aaron.ward9511@example.com', '2016-03-11', 1, N'Bought from Wal-Mart because I didn''t want to wait 2 days......the game is so overhyped. Controls are aweful and gameplay is very mediocre. If I could go back in time and not buy it I would.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Evans', N'elizabeth.evans1652@example.org', '2016-03-11', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Barbara', N'Evans', N'barbara.evans5087@example.net', '2016-03-11', 4, N'All online activity. Nice game but I like to play scenarios alone.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Rodriguez', N'dennis.rodriguez4144@example.org', '2016-03-11', 5, N'i''m a skeereded'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Wood', N'kimberly.wood6870@example.org', '2016-03-11', 5, N'Very Good !!!'),
(N'Maria', N'Henderson', N'maria.henderson1760@example.org', '2016-03-11', 5, N'I enjoyed the game better then secret rings and enjoyed my time with it.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Gomez', N'ethan.gomez5947@example.org', '2016-03-11', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Ethan', N'Gomez', N'ethan.gomez5947@example.org', '2016-03-11', 5, N'what a great game, recommend it'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Sullivan', N'kenneth.sullivan1165@example.net', '2016-03-11', 5, N'Exactly what I expected when ordering. No complaints!'),
(N'Katherine', N'Thompson', N'katherine.thompson5845@example.net', '2016-03-11', 1, N'Dumbfounded by all the praise of gamers. I hated it. The combat is nothing special, and the plot is ludicrous.'),
(N'Amy', N'Mitchell', N'amy.mitchell4775@example.net', '2016-03-11', 5, N'Works like new!'),
(N'Gregory', N'Baker', N'gregory.baker1531@example.com', '2016-03-11', 4, N'I have a strange relationship with this game. I wasn''t exactly looking for a new game, but my dad suggested I buy it after he noticed I spent several weekends in a row bored out of my mind and spending most of my time complaining how bored I was. I purchased Trine 2 on Amazon for $10, and on the PSstore it was $19.95, so I was getting it ten dollars cheaper, so I figured why not. This is, in no way, my usual type of game. I AM into puzzle games, but with the exception of some Mario throwbacks, I''ve never been into the side-scrolling games (or at least, not since I was a kid), but I decided to try. Some people on Amazon say the puzzles were either way too hard or way too easy. I would say that 99% of the time, if a puzzle was too hard it was because of my own error. I knew what I HAD to do, but because I have less practice with Perfectly Timed Jumps that happen more in old, side scrolling games, I fought and fought with my own reflexes to get something to work. Likewise, I only...'),
(N'Jose', N'Cook', N'jose.cook5572@example.com', '2016-03-12', 4, N'I found this very boring of a game. Even my 6-8 yr old kids barely played it. Guess we expect way more from a game these days.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Green', N'nadia.green3556@example.net', '2016-03-12', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ramirez', N'stephanie.ramirez2997@example.com', '2016-03-12', 5, N'Game arrived in perfect condition. Many people dislike this SH game just because it used some things from the movie. I say give it a chance if you''re thinking of getting it. The game has a great atmosphere, amazing music and bosses, and cool enemies.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Jones', N'andrew.jones2109@example.com', '2016-03-12', 5, N'For the money, I can''t believe the sound quality these produce. Super awesome TRUE 7.1 surround sound. These match or even exceed most any of the overpriced brands.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Barnes', N'alexander.barnes2230@example.com', '2016-03-12', 5, N'thanks son will enjoy it thank you'),
(N'Jose', N'Tanaka', N'jose.tanaka9792@example.org', '2016-03-12', 2, N'The program this Item requires (DEMANDS) the DOWNLOAD OF SPECIFIC CODES FROM AN ASSOCIATED WEBSITE And does NOT INCLUDE MANUAL CODE INSTALLATION ON YOUR OWN WITHOUT DIRECT MANUAL IMPUT of the DS screen. I will Definintly recommend AVOIDING THIS SPECIFIC MODEL AT LEAST.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Lopez', N'benjamin.lopez5193@example.com', '2016-03-13', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Lopez', N'benjamin.lopez5193@example.com', '2016-03-13', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Megan', N'Rivera', N'megan.rivera8748@example.org', '2016-03-13', 5, N'Wonderful'),
(N'Mei', N'Sanders', N'mei.sanders3300@example.com', '2016-03-13', 4, N'exciting game for the grandkids'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Garcia', N'kimberly.garcia6323@example.org', '2016-03-13', 4, N'While I really like kitchen themed packs for Sims games, I was a bit disappointed to see that this pack only included one style of modern kitchen appliances and counter/cabinets. I really wish it would have also included either a retro, rustic, or traditional style as well. The premium content, ice cream machine, is pretty cool and some of the special flavors have some funny side effects on our sims.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Price', N'ethan.price2416@example.com', '2016-03-13', 5, N'Really great game!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Flores', N'hannah.flores7662@example.org', '2016-03-13', 5, N'I like it a lot it is very good!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Carter', N'joyce.carter3011@example.com', '2016-03-13', 2, N'This review summarizes all three games in this set. In short, this collection is worth picking up solely to play the first game (Jak & Daxter: The Precursor Legacy). The first Jak game is absolutely fantastic! Jak 2 and Jak 3 are just terrible games. ------------------------------------ 1) Jak and Daxter: The Precursor Legacy A close comparison for this game could be Super Mario 64. Jak & Daxter need to explore various regions and collect power cells (similar to Mario''s stars). Each level has a number of power cells, as well as power orbs (like coins), to collect. Unlike Mario, though, the overworld and levels all blend together, creating a seamless adventure with logically connected areas of exploration. Add that to the fact that there really aren''t any loading scenes and you have quite an innovative game for the time period. The levels have similarity, but they were different enough to keep me interested. The levels mostly have similar elements to interact with, but the actions...'),
(N'Priya', N'Nelson', N'priya.nelson3433@example.net', '2016-03-13', 5, N'Verey good'),
(N'Sarah', N'Kim', N'sarah.kim6329@example.net', '2016-03-13', 4, N'The game didn''t work at first but after cleaning the contacts it''s done fine ever since.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Castillo', N'joyce.castillo3124@example.com', '2016-03-14', 4, N'I had a small issue when I first started playing. There is a point where you have to log on to a computer so you can sign in your agent credentials. Well they made it so only one person can do it at a time. In a room of 30 people it got frustrating real fast. 30 minutes later I could finally do it. Since then I haven''t had any real issues aside from the game crashing every now and again. It''s fun. If you like games like Destiny you''ll like this game too.'),
(N'Mei', N'Robinson', N'mei.robinson2093@example.org', '2016-03-14', 5, N'I only made it through about the first hour of the original on 360. It was a good game, but at the time, I had a lot going on in school and just didn''t devote any time to it. I decided I''d give this version a shot after seeing the upgraded visuals. I''m liking it a lot so far. I''m a little over half way done with the story and it''s been a great game so far. The shooting and cover system is very satisfying. Once I finish this one, I want to play GoW2 now that it''s backwards compatible. This is an older game but it holds up.'),
(N'Betty', N'Perez', N'betty.perez7049@example.com', '2016-03-14', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Adams', N'jeremy.adams6979@example.net', '2016-03-14', 4, N'This game captures the challenges of the in characters in the movie! Although, you cannot play as any of the lead characters, you get be a part of the story. It might be disappointing for fans of Lasky and the original book series that this is even more loosely based off the book than the movie, but it still has the right idea. The controls are simple and easier to use than I ever thought they''d be. VANQUISH EVIL!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Ruiz', N'kevin.ruiz2312@example.com', '2016-03-14', 4, N'Kids loved it.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Foster', N'ronald.foster1776@example.org', '2016-03-14', 5, N'My favorite also works great'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ali', N'brandon.ali5546@example.com', '2016-03-14', 5, N'Upgraded from regular XBox, great graphics'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Hall', N'rebecca.hall9879@example.com', '2016-03-14', 5, N'Box had a tear on it but everything inside was fine. This console works great. I haven''t noticed any audio distortion or anything. Graphics look accurate. The controllers aren''t the best but function fine.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Cooper', N'samuel.cooper1112@example.com', '2016-03-14', 3, N'Basically an action RPG with elements of skill leveling and... yea. Anyhow, it''s fun, but know that if you want good equipment, you''re going to have to take a LOT of time to grind out your skills and changing to the respective "life" to gain its respective bonuses and just to officially level it up. That''s right, instead of a more intuitive skill system, this game has different "lives" which you must switch to, but they''re basically skills like Carpentry, Smithing, Berzerker (Basically large swords), Paladin (Basically small swords and shields), hunter (basically bows), and Cooking. You also level up your skills by completing certain objectives and turning in quests after changing to the respective life. Now the nice thing is you don''t necessarily have to be in the respective life to complete quests for it, but still, changing to a different life just to craft something is boring and unneeded. I''m not sure why they designed the game the way they did because it''d be much better if...'),
(N'Nicole', N'Perry', N'nicole.perry9989@example.com', '2016-03-14', 5, N'Love this game. I''ve always wanted to check it out and I finally did. If you''ve seen the movie and are in the mood for more Deadpool, I would highly recommend checking this game out!'),
(N'Angela', N'Powell', N'angela.powell6037@example.com', '2016-03-14', 3, N'makes hitting the buttons harder than they should be. would recommend a grip.'),
(N'Jack', N'Wilson', N'jack.wilson8425@example.net', '2016-03-14', 4, N'Decent racer for it''s time.'),
(N'Jack', N'Wilson', N'jack.wilson8425@example.net', '2016-03-14', 3, N'Meh this game is alright. The previous Hot Pursuit was better in my opinion.'),
(N'Carol', N'Collins', N'carol.collins6332@example.net', '2016-03-14', 5, N'Very happy with game. It was everything as described.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Phillips', N'olivia.phillips5023@example.net', '2016-03-15', 5, N'My wife and I use these every time we play WoW together. Super comfy and amazing build quality.'),
(N'Luis', N'Ivanov', N'luis.ivanov1074@example.org', '2016-03-15', 4, N'yay'),
(N'Jacob', N'Hughes', N'jacob.hughes4144@example.org', '2016-03-15', 3, N'Looks nice. Looks even better on the Xbox One. Just in my case, it would not work. Left it plugged in for hours and it never turned on. So either my Xbone never got hot enough (so I really didn''t need it) to switch on or it just didn''t work. Anyway I sent it back to amazon with no problem. Thx Amazon!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Cook', N'stephen.cook5384@example.net', '2016-03-15', 5, N'Fun expansive best game in it''s field. One of my favourite games. Hours and hours of fun. Well written and executed story. Game play is easy to master but is deep.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Carter', N'raymond.carter4277@example.org', '2016-03-15', 3, N'Plain and simple. False advertisement. They made it sound like it was going to be a show down between the two Spartan teams, and other than one small cut scene mid way through the game it wasnt. It wound up being a rescue mission with the Chief being a minor foot note in the game. To make matters worse Lock''s Armor is WAY too form fitting. Really all the new armor is. Where all the old Spartan armor from the Bungee days looked like it belonged on the battlefield all this crap 343 is giving us now for their new wanna-be''s is formfitting crap that perfectly fits the shape of their ass. Then, to make it up to us for "killing" Cortana in Halo 4, they bring her back in 5 only to make her a power mad would be empress and our next villain. Great guys. Thanks for that. I think ill pass on Halo 6, seeing how 343 plans to keep their heads firmly shoved up their asses.'),
(N'John', N'Ross', N'john.ross4107@example.net', '2016-03-15', 5, N'Excellent meets all my expectations'),
(N'Sandra', N'James', N'sandra.james8122@example.com', '2016-03-15', 5, N'for the price my kids got a toy gun and the game is not bad kids like it. over all great deal.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2016-03-16', 5, N'sega is the greatest video game company in the universe there true genius''s the best of the best sega rocks all the games sega made from the 80s,90s,2000s,2010s,2015 and 2016 are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best all the games sega made from the 80s,90s,2000s,2010,2015 and 2016 rocks,2015 and 2016 for sega are the greatest years for sega there perfect years the best of the best 2015 and 2016 for sega rocks ^_^'),
(N'Paul', N'Brown', N'paul.brown8591@example.org', '2016-03-16', 3, N'Honestly, for the price, this headset is not bad. By my own mistake, I purchased these expecting much better quality. The build is all plastic, but sturdy. The sound is underwhelming, but clear. The mic works great and the inline volume control/mute feature is a plus, but I don''t like the fact that you can''t slide the mic upward and out of your face when not in use. They just didn''t meet my standards and I shouldn''t have settled based on trying to be cheap. So, all in all, these are a "good" headset. I just needed a little more sound quality and features. If you are an FPS gamer like me and you depend on excellent sound quality, look else where. If you just need a headset to stay quiet at night, as not to disturb family/roommate, then these will be perfect for you. Good price for what they are. I, myself, returned these and plan to purchase the PlayStation Gold wireless headset. Hope this review helps. I just hate to see people make the same mistake I made with the same...'),
(N'Timothy', N'Taylor', N'timothy.taylor8584@example.org', '2016-03-16', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Larry', N'Ward', N'larry.ward6939@example.com', '2016-03-16', 5, N'good'),
(N'Nicole', N'Ramirez', N'nicole.ramirez6835@example.com', '2016-03-16', 5, N'My son loves this. Collected all of the PS4 games, controllers, etc., into one neat place.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Ramirez', N'nicole.ramirez6835@example.com', '2016-03-16', 5, N'Fantastic, solid bracket that''s very secure and invisible. Makes my Star Wars edition PS4 look great floating on the wall. Note that you''ll still have the cables coming from the right side of the PS4, unless you route them into the wall, in which case the cables are hidden by the angle of the PS4.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Smith', N'andrew.smith6206@example.org', '2016-03-16', 5, N'Bought this to store a tiny stop sign. Did not disappoint.'),
(N'Mary', N'Thomas', N'mary.thomas2546@example.net', '2016-03-16', 5, N'This bluetooth gamepad connected to my Samsung Galaxy S5 easily. I use it with the VR Kix virtual reality headset and Google Cardboard. So far, no complaints. Charged 100% and is still going strong. I''m not an endless user... just occasional, so I have no review on longevity of battery or controls sticks/buttons. Everthing seems well made and worth the money. I''ve operated this controller for about 3 hours, and after the initial learning curve, it''s good enough for light gaming.'),
(N'Eric', N'Hernandez', N'eric.hernandez1180@example.com', '2016-03-16', 5, N'Daughter loves it'),
(N'Megan', N'Reyes', N'megan.reyes7280@example.com', '2016-03-16', 5, N'If you liked the 1st one, I think you''ll like this one more.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Wisniewski', N'kathleen.wisniewski4720@example.net', '2016-03-16', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Sofia', N'Okonkwo', N'sofia.okonkwo8390@example.org', '2016-03-17', 5, N'He looks Fantastic and works in both Smash and Fire Emblem Fates without needing to erase any data.'),
(N'Walter', N'Ferreira', N'walter.ferreira3801@example.com', '2016-03-17', 5, N'Pure simple fun for all ages, free DLC from beginning to end, quick and snappy updates/patches. Game work flawlessly compared to the typical new releases these days. Theres single player, co-op modes, online multiplayer, and even some good split-screen! As well, you will have ages to unlock the thousands of in-game items, collectibles, abilities, new character etc! And priced at under $40 its a steal.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Campbell', N'andrew.campbell1362@example.net', '2016-03-17', 3, N'My little dude enjoys Sonic a lot and this seemed like the best Wii U Sonic game out there. But it is a little boring for him and at places a bit hard to figure out what to do to get past the level. For the price it was worth it but not the best Wii U game out there.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Price', N'cheryl.price4470@example.org', '2016-03-17', 5, N'Great game, now if only I could remove stars off of Nintendo of America for not releasing the physical copy. I wold buy it again if they did.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Howard', N'hiroshi.howard2651@example.com', '2016-03-17', 5, N'A+'),
(N'Deborah', N'Miller', N'deborah.miller2432@example.com', '2016-03-17', 2, N'once you get use to the controls, its a decent game. the graphics are great on certain maps and horrible on others. small glitches here and there but doesnt ruin the experience overall. if you''re a Hitman fan, you can clearly see this game is a bite off of that series....but its nowhere Near as fun as Contracts, Blood Money or the new HITMAN. its a 1 Time Game. you play through it, you put it away and never play it again after that, which is sad because this COULDVE been a really neat little game. if they stuck to maybe 5 maps overall and a strong story based around those 5 missions, it couldve been a Great Downloadable game for 20 bucks....but the maps here are mostly uninspiring and i personally only liked the Hotel map and the Omerta mansion map. wait until the price drops to 20 bucks.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Gonzalez', N'kofi.gonzalez8463@example.com', '2016-03-18', 4, N'Get used to seeing that headline. This is a game that tolerates few mistakes and expects you to quickly learn the rules and get better. Despite it being more frenetic and offensive than Dark Souls games, it is not a hack-n-slash, and if you don''t learn to balance offense with defense and know when to fight vs when to run, you will die, and die, and die, until you get frustrated and give up. If you do this, it would be a shame because the atmosphere and design of Bloodborne is unlike anything I''ve seen in a long time. If you''ve been longing for a new Castlevania game, this is it just under a new name.'),
(N'Kofi', N'King', N'kofi.king3965@example.net', '2016-03-18', 4, N'A bit noisy but overall good.'),
(N'Anna', N'Hall', N'anna.hall9344@example.com', '2016-03-18', 5, N'Great game interactive game with fun puzzles and an innovative sense of story.'),
(N'Anna', N'Hall', N'anna.hall9344@example.com', '2016-03-18', 4, N'my kids love playing with them'),
(N'Raymond', N'Green', N'raymond.green7993@example.net', '2016-03-18', 5, N'THIS IS THE BEST GAME THAT WAS EVER MADE FOR SPLIT-SCREEN GAMERS. Thank you guys soon much!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Foster', N'tomasz.foster3195@example.org', '2016-03-18', 5, N'Sniper Elite 3 is by far one of the funnest sniper games I have ever played to date! The gameplay is excellent, the comtrols are pretty good but can be a little hard to get used to at first, and the storyline is great! My only complaint is the graphics. They are not very optimized for the PS3 and it''s a little hard to play but not so much that it takes away the gameplay value! I highly recommend this game to anyone who likes sniper games with a basic stealth mechanic added into it!'),
(N'Shirley', N'Kumar', N'shirley.kumar4970@example.net', '2016-03-18', 5, N'Since Amiibo festival sits idle on my shelf, I have no real use for this. But the double character Amiibo is definitely one of the cutest ones yet! I love the design. If you''re collecting all the Amiibos, this is one to get, but if you''re only collecting useful ones, you can skip this one. It looks like they didn''t print as many as other Animal Crossing Amiibos, so get it while you can. But remember that retail was $13--stinks that the scalpers want more!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Wright', N'andrea.wright4650@example.net', '2016-03-18', 5, N'No issues.'),
(N'Priya', N'Chen', N'priya.chen2931@example.net', '2016-03-18', 4, N'I got the product business wise 5 stars. Game play men just doesn''t fell as hard as the older ones but if u want ninja gaiden and more ridiculous enemies then sure. beginning/starting pace is slow. Always fighting qwith the camera @__@'),
(N'Nancy', N'Gutierrez', N'nancy.gutierrez2740@example.com', '2016-03-18', 5, N'One of the best Zelda games'),
(N'Noah', N'Bell', N'noah.bell3313@example.com', '2016-03-18', 3, N'Dying Light is pretty, sounds amazing and the new parkour works very well. The combat took a big hit though, the removal of racism or the B movie flair makes the atmosphere way too boring (crazy hm?) and the game is just one fetch quest after another so i hd to give up on the game as co-op proved to be frustrating too. Let''s see how the troubled Dead Island 2 will fare.'),
(N'Noah', N'Bell', N'noah.bell3313@example.com', '2016-03-18', 4, N'Guilty Gear Xrd got cheap enough to import (Europe didn''t get a boxed release) and i am only a casual GG player. The graphics are well done despite the PS3 roots and the score rocks but i was left a bit disappointed as this first entry is clearly feature incomplete and slower than before. The series should be fused with the slightly better Blaz Blue and be freed of the nonsensical narrative for me to come back as i gave Arc System enough money for borderline patches. 7,5/10'),
(N'Christopher', N'Fisher', N'christopher.fisher8967@example.org', '2016-03-18', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Patricia', N'Parker', N'patricia.parker4697@example.org', '2016-03-18', 5, N'Really great for transport, and has room enough for about everything!'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ivanov', N'victoria.ivanov8620@example.org', '2016-03-18', 5, N'Got at discounted price of $19.99 really to play the 2 MSX Metal Gear Solids in Metal Gear Solid 3. The other games are awesome in this collection also as you probly already know. Four is my least favorite because of the long cut scenes but I knew that already having owned it.'),
(N'Henry', N'Butler', N'henry.butler7046@example.net', '2016-03-18', 5, N'Generic xbox controller, works like a charm!'),
(N'John', N'Williams', N'john.williams3858@example.org', '2016-03-19', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Robert', N'Nowak', N'robert.nowak3400@example.com', '2016-03-19', 1, N'Aw man this game is bad, Didn''t come with original case but thats fine. Condition was alright. Good seller.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Lewis', N'kofi.lewis3220@example.com', '2016-03-19', 5, N'best damned scren preotector iv''e used in ages. No bubbles nothing, everything is perfectly awesome .Only thing is the bottom screen seems to scratch easily and all hori products seem to ahve thi where they have mini-scratches on it which is anoying but it''s not amazingly bad anyway.'),
(N'Jack', N'Brown', N'jack.brown8215@example.com', '2016-03-19', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Joan', N'Murphy', N'joan.murphy6407@example.com', '2016-03-19', 4, N'For me personally I really like this game. For a handheld I think the graphics are really nice and the controls are spot on. This is great game to play when your killing time at the airport or sitting in the hotel room with nothing to do.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Smith', N'katherine.smith5562@example.com', '2016-03-19', 5, N'Most of the negative reviews complain about the roster..which I personally like! My only complaint was that they used Braixen instead of It''s final eveloution Delphox but it''s really a minor nitpick. Other than that we have a neat cast of characters from Machamp(the grappler), speed types like Pikachu, power types like Gengar and Sucuine to more balanced types like Lucario each one with their own uses and play styles. Besides the playable characters we also have support Pokmon that can give boosts like HP recovery, change the synergy gauge (super meter) or even pull off a short attack. As a beginning figher most of the moves are easy to pull off but the game can get complex with counter moves and throws. To change things up the perspective shifts from a 3d Fighter to something like a 2d one at times. When this happens the moves change and if you are the one who changed the mode you''ll recover some of the red HP bar. The online works pretty well and I''ve only had one really laggy...'),
(N'Maria', N'Watson', N'maria.watson4781@example.org', '2016-03-19', 4, N'My son loves this game. He was upset that you can''t play 2 or more players on the same XBox. Big downside though.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Price', N'douglas.price2222@example.org', '2016-03-19', 5, N'I''ve had many different models of gaming headsets(wired and wireless) in the last 6 years. With more then one at a time, so I''ve got plenty of experience. I''ve tried more Turtlebeach then the other brands, but I''ll break them all down. I take great care of my headsets, and even made stands for those which didn''t come with: Tritton 720 plus - good all over sound, including footsteps(no presets)were the best 7.1 wired I had. After 4 years the plastic broke where the earcup attaches. I spent $145 I got my money''s worth. Turtlebeach XP510 - 7.1 surround sound and 7 mic and 7 headset presets(footsteps etc). I like these features of turtlebeach and they are built okay,(they feel cheap)plus they all have a design flaw which causes the plastic above [the 4 (2 over 2)hex bolts] to crack just above them bolts. Squaretrade took 2 pairs back, and gave me my money back. .Then on the PX51 headset, they broke the other side, then claimed they were damaged so they didn''t have to pay out. I''ve got...'),
(N'Brandon', N'Nowak', N'brandon.nowak4417@example.net', '2016-03-19', 5, N'Excellent keyboard. Read the instruction manual for tips on how to change the color layout and settings. I''ve had this for a while now, and I am in love with this thing. Yes, it is mechanical, so it will be louder than a soft key keyboard; however, it''s not super loud and I don''t have to worry about making too much noise with it. The keys have a crisp, tactile feel to them, and to date have shown no signs of wearing down. The extension plate for the wrist guard takes a minor amount of fiddling to get seated properly, but once it''s seated it''s not likely to come off unless you manually remove it. The colors are pleasing, and if you leave your PC on overnight like I do (the white noise helps me sleep - long history of sleep issues), there''s a setting to turn the lights off if you so choose - again, in the owner''s manual. I paid full price for this and was not disappointed, but I hear it goes on sale from time to time for ~$40ish so you may want to wait to get it if you''re on a...'),
(N'Jerry', N'Martinez', N'jerry.martinez9485@example.org', '2016-03-19', 5, N'My old one broke for no reason at all so this one worked out of the box. I just hope it lasts longer than my last one.'),
(N'Omar', N'Kowalski', N'omar.kowalski6965@example.net', '2016-03-19', 5, N'good'),
(N'Daniel', N'Hall', N'daniel.hall6686@example.com', '2016-03-19', 1, N'My controller worked fine for two days and began going haywire afterwards. Not pleased with the purchase. The item has since been returned.'),
(N'Luis', N'Flores', N'luis.flores5197@example.com', '2016-03-19', 4, N'If I was able to survive the first game, I am surely able to survive this sequel.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Jimenez', N'cynthia.jimenez8489@example.net', '2016-03-19', 1, N'Only worked for a short time'),
(N'Mary', N'Ramos', N'mary.ramos8625@example.com', '2016-03-19', 1, N'too big'),
(N'Amara', N'Torres', N'amara.torres2473@example.net', '2016-03-20', 2, N'3 HRS OF UPDATES HAD TO SHUT IT DOWN RAN ME OUT OF GIGS, I JUST WANT TO PLAY THE GAME, CAN''T PLAY UNTILL EVERY LAST LITTLE THING ROBS ME OF MY DATA, WHATEVER HAPPENED TO INSTALLING A GAME AND PLAYING, UPDATES AND PATCHES WHERE OPTIONAL. IT JUST TAKES ALL THE FUN OUT OF PLAYING. HAVEN''T EVEN PLAYED YET SO IT MIGHT BE ONLY 1 STAR'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Robinson', N'elizabeth.robinson2621@example.com', '2016-03-20', 5, N'Love it!!!!! OMG!! I went off the rockers with Supernatural love the touch of fairies it was so cool. I don''t regret buying it,but I do wish it had a dueling arena like the Sims Making Magic,but other than that its very very cool.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Evans', N'tyler.evans8122@example.net', '2016-03-20', 5, N'Got this for my husband. He loves it. the forza game is a download. which is fine with him. came with one controller.'),
(N'Karen', N'Kelly', N'karen.kelly4572@example.com', '2016-03-20', 5, N'Very cheap.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Ramirez', N'matthew.ramirez3308@example.com', '2016-03-21', 5, N'Love this thing, i''ve had it for 2 months, much nicer than my old razer naga that stopped working.'),
(N'Larry', N'Anderson', N'larry.anderson4290@example.net', '2016-03-21', 5, N'Uncharted is all Nathan Drake games into one great game. All three different games come together into this game and make it excellent. It follows a nice story throughout the entire game. If you like Nathan Drake games, you''ll love uncharted.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Walker', N'nicholas.walker5368@example.org', '2016-03-21', 5, N'Great Buy Great Product'),
(N'Jacob', N'Campbell', N'jacob.campbell5837@example.com', '2016-03-21', 5, N'Played for the xbox 360 and now for the ps4 for the price its a good buy.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Perry', N'ronald.perry4335@example.org', '2016-03-21', 5, N'It''s a cool game'),
(N'Katherine', N'Webb', N'katherine.webb6293@example.net', '2016-03-21', 5, N'Awesome mechanical keyboard. I used a Corsair Red keyboard for a while, and it was great, but VERY clacky, even after putting damping gaskets on it. This keyboard feels just as good as the Corsair keyboard but is significantly quieter out of the box. This is good for me because I work in a small office with a couple other people, and they definitely appreciate how much quieter this keyboard is. It''s not a whisper by any means, but it''s quiet and soft enough that it doesn''t stand out from the background noise. The LEDs are really cool, each key can be an individual color, so if you want to set it up for shortcuts or something, it''s easy to do with the included software. So in addition to looking neat, there is some possible functionality boost there. I plan to use it in AfterEffects and SolidWorks, which I always have trouble remembering hotkeys for! The big volume controller wheel is pretty cool, especially in a work environment when people start talking to me when I have my...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Hughes', N'nathan.hughes5146@example.org', '2016-03-21', 5, N'Arrived quickly and as described!'),
(N'Wei', N'Price', N'wei.price3869@example.com', '2016-03-21', 2, N'Assassin''s Creed was a great gaming series through Revelations. After that they went downhill so badly and have so many bugs and glitches. This game was very disappointing overall---not good gaming controls. It was almost painful playing through it. I had to take many breaks from the frustration of the controls and glitches. And yes, I could quit---but I bought it so I played it. I hear the newer one--Assassin''s Creed Syndicate goes back to the original format. Sure hope so. Assassin''s Creed was what sold me on the ps3 back when. Sorry, I can''t recommend this one for those of you who have played the first Assassin Creed games and loved their game controls.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Gomez', N'deborah.gomez9969@example.net', '2016-03-21', 3, N'The good is Logitech has a great warranty and they do stand behind their product. I''m glad as everyone of these I own break within 4 months of arriving. Yes, we use them daily from say 1 hour to up to 14 hours per day, but still with a multiple year warranty they should stand up to normal Final Fantasy XI (FF11) play. I''d give it a 5 star, if the controller would last because while Logitech stands behind the product it is still time consuming. I''m sure they''re not happy replacing our 3 units 3 to 4 times a year, each - especially given the low price. What typically breaks? Well, one of the RB or LB keys or in the latest the A (FFXI Confirm key).'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Campbell', N'hiroshi.campbell8784@example.net', '2016-03-21', 4, N'Great for holding games but it feels cheap but you get what you pay and only holds 22 game and even with the 2 used for SD cards only holds 24 so a little false on holding 28'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Patel', N'kathleen.patel3832@example.org', '2016-03-21', 5, N'My son is thrilled!'),
(N'Katherine', N'Sullivan', N'katherine.sullivan1496@example.org', '2016-03-21', 5, N'I got the Supernatural expansion pack along with all of the other expansion packs, and absolutely loved it. I missed having the special Sim types from Sims 2, and wanted to have werewolves back. This along with Seasons, Late Night, and University runs really well on my computer, which has pretty average specs. If you''re less interested in new furniture and clothing and looking more for new features and activities, Supernatural is probably what you''re looking for.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Tanaka', N'andrew.tanaka2020@example.com', '2016-03-21', 5, N'I love this wheel and pedal set. I''ve played with the toy wheels for a while (Microsoft wheel on xbox 360 and logitech wheels on pc before) but this is the first time I''ve had the real deal. I''ve used it in about 60 hours of Dirt Rally and maybe 10 hours of Project Cars on the PC. I have not used it on an Xbox One. It has been 100% trouble free, and mounted great on the wheel stand pro I bought to go with it. If you are going to try rally, you will definitely want the shifter. For road racing the paddle shifters seem to be OK. I especially love having the clutch pedal.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Cox', N'stephanie.cox4833@example.org', '2016-03-21', 2, N'Should''ve read some reviews before buying this game. I like all the other GTA games, but this kind of sucked. That''s too bad.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Adams', N'aaron.adams6033@example.net', '2016-03-21', 5, N'In 1996 I was absolutely dazzled when I first saw a Super Mario 64 demo at Electronics Boutique and I had to own the system. The game did not disappoint and to this day I still distinctly remember levels like Jolly Rogers Bay, Tall, Tall Mountain and Tick Tock Clock. There were only 15 levels and each needed to be revisited up to seven times but they were cleverly designed and created a sense of scale I had never before seen in a video game. Other N64 games like Banjo Kazooie carried on the tradition of levels with majestic scale and I expected things to only get better. Although Mario Sunshine received some criticism I adored it and it improved considerably on the visuals and sense of grandeur. In this case there were only seven Locations but this may be my all-time favorite Mario game. Sometimes less is more. Mario Galaxy saw another leap forward in graphics and a nuclear explosion in the number of levels and I barely remember any of them. Rather than go bigger Nintendo decided...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Murphy', N'kathleen.murphy6057@example.net', '2016-03-22', 3, N'Not a fun game. But it has excellent and realistic graphics..'),
(N'Mary', N'Ortiz', N'mary.ortiz9912@example.com', '2016-03-22', 2, N'ea doesn''t support the game the servers are down'),
(N'Sarah', N'Rogers', N'sarah.rogers9562@example.com', '2016-03-22', 3, N'Not much to say here. This guy is pretty much run of the mill when it comes to abilities as compared with other jedi figures. The light up lightsaber is nice.'),
(N'Priya', N'Jenkins', N'priya.jenkins3946@example.net', '2016-03-22', 5, N'It lets me play Megaman Zero on my 3ds, the games are pretty much direct ports AFAICT, they look and play exactly like the originals, with some extra little features added outside of the games in the menu.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Morgan', N'victoria.morgan2679@example.org', '2016-03-22', 5, N'A must have for zelda players'),
(N'Diane', N'Nowak', N'diane.nowak9077@example.org', '2016-03-22', 5, N'I"ve been schooling the Bears daily. Also the Vikings finally won a Super Bowl. Anything can happen in video games.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Mitchell', N'jonathan.mitchell8394@example.com', '2016-03-22', 5, N'I got the Samsung Gear VR (virtual reality headset) and many of the games require a controller to move around in addition to your head looking around. This controller was recommended by many gaming sites for bluetooth connections. This controller will connect to bluetooth and wireless connections (with a dongle). My son and I downloaded a Super Nintendo emulator for my phone and use the included attachment to mount the phone onto the controller. It is exactly like having a pocket video game system. The bluetooth connects quickly and easily and it''s nice that it''s rechargeable as well. I haven''t tried it wireless lyrics as I didn''t purchase it for that, but the controller is extremely similar to a Playstation controller in functionality and form. Well worth the money. If I had a use for another one I would buy it in a heartbeat.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Parker', N'samuel.parker5360@example.com', '2016-03-22', 3, N'Cute jokes, but feels like you''re playing through the same level over and over again. Remember that game that you''d always play when you were home sick with a fever and you felt out of it? This game makes me feel like that.'),
(N'Anita', N'Peterson', N'anita.peterson1751@example.net', '2016-03-22', 4, N'I was offered the chance to review these and I was wanting a new set of headphones for my computer so I jumped at the chance. Fit: These headphones are very comfortable and I have worn them for many hours straight without and discomfort. I have a fairly large head and I would say that these are not tight even to the point of being a little loose so if you have a small head they could be loose. It also could be the particular unit I received. Mic: I like the placement of the MIC, it is close enough to my mouth to provide very good sound but not intrusive. I have talked to several people and they have said that I sound very clear. The MIC fold up so when you are not using it you can have it out of the way. Headphones: The sound from these is good. They have a reasonable amount of bass and are clear sounding. The foam on the headphones is comfortable for long wear sessions. They are kind of long and skinny and for me they sit more on ear and not over. They do not have a lot of sound...'),
(N'Debra', N'Sanders', N'debra.sanders8726@example.org', '2016-03-22', 4, N'I used it to plug another turtle beach headset into it since my controller did not have a headphone jack. Works normally.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Allen', N'douglas.allen5868@example.org', '2016-03-23', 5, N'I just love this game. My only complaint is that it is taking too long to load on my PS3. I don''t know if it''s like that for everyone, but I spend probably about 5 minutes waiting for the game to boot and load. Once it loads, there is virtually no load screen, non at all, the draw distance is AMAZING, the quality on PS3 is amazing, the whole thing is just great. I don''t care about the story, people say the story is lacking, but I don''t find it lacking at all, it''s great and the open world, and selective mission system worked extremely well in this game.'),
(N'Diane', N'Kumar', N'diane.kumar8668@example.org', '2016-03-23', 5, N'works fine'),
(N'Christopher', N'Adams', N'christopher.adams4818@example.org', '2016-03-23', 1, N'Did not like this.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Lopez', N'pamela.lopez8848@example.org', '2016-03-23', 5, N'Something different in the Pokemon series especially with the hands on fighting control'),
(N'Pamela', N'Lopez', N'pamela.lopez8848@example.org', '2016-03-23', 5, N'Best of the best and the most classic of classic. Doesn''t get much better than this'),
(N'Aisha', N'Johnson', N'aisha.johnson7405@example.com', '2016-03-23', 5, N'Amazing game'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ortiz', N'kimberly.ortiz6384@example.net', '2016-03-23', 4, N'Great value gaming mouse. HD Video: In the Comments Section On the mouse, you''ll be able to select 750, 1500, 2500, or 3500 DPI settings using the button. There is software that will allow you to be more specific, and we''ll go over that later. With that being said, let''s take a look at the actual mouse. On the left side, you''ll notice that we''ve got 3 programmable buttons as well as some grippy texture for your thumb to rest on. I could easily reach the forward and back buttons, but the 3rd button was completely unreachable. This is probably because I''ve got some really small hands, but is something to keep in mind if you''re like me. On the back of the mouse is where you''ll be able to customize the palm rest. 2 are included, so if you''ve got bigger hands then me, I''d suggest using the one labeled "high". Aside from the normal buttons on top of the mouse, there is an on-board DPI button to quickly switch DPI settings without using the software. On the bottom of the mouse you''ll find...'),
(N'Laura', N'Jenkins', N'laura.jenkins8309@example.org', '2016-03-23', 3, N'Bought this as a collectible, but the seller semi-destroyed the box. There''s a big crease down the side of the cardboard backing, and I was very disappointed to pull it out of the box that way. Otherwise, Samus is the best and the figure looks good. Don''t want to spend hundreds on a statue or other figure, so this will have to do for now.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ruiz', N'jacob.ruiz2205@example.org', '2016-03-24', 5, N'This ps4 stand is good it does help keep my game system kool down and it keeps the dust out I''m glad I got one thanks again to you an your employees an to Amazon'),
(N'Anita', N'Reyes', N'anita.reyes3453@example.net', '2016-03-24', 5, N'I love it. Thank you.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Jones', N'aaron.jones3147@example.net', '2016-03-24', 1, N'Terrible game.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Clark', N'ronald.clark4567@example.net', '2016-03-24', 5, N'Fun game. Not too easy not too hard. Multiplayer on the mercenaries would be awesome. We need a new resident evil game! Amazing graphics on the gamecube.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Thomas', N'sandra.thomas1608@example.net', '2016-03-24', 1, N'Give me a "Point anywhere remote" like the Roku and I may order one in the future. The interesting part is that this is not the first remote for the xbox and still Microsoft is using an outdated technology.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Taylor', N'stephanie.taylor8239@example.org', '2016-03-25', 1, N'Felt awkward and unnecessary'),
(N'Sarah', N'Howard', N'sarah.howard3620@example.org', '2016-03-25', 1, N'This is not a good game. I played it for about a half hour and trashed it. It moves too fast and the controls suck.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Tanaka', N'raymond.tanaka9699@example.com', '2016-03-25', 3, N'Do not buy this if you have a original 3DS/3DS XL/2DS, straight up do not bother. The unit count is 1/4th the WiiU version (worse than WiiU in co-op even) and the framerate seems to hold 15 normally and dips down from there, it''s not worth it to get this game on anything less than the New 3DS models. Seriously, don''t bother. Here''s a vid to show just how different it is [...] Textures and effects are also improved in the n3DS, this honestly should have been an exclusive because the old 3DS just cannot run this game. I cannot stress this enough, avoid if you have a old 3DS/3DS XL/2DS they just can''t handle it. On the new 3DS however it runs really well, action is smooth and while there''s slowdown it seems to run just as well as the WiiU version minus the hideous load times. More characters, ability to switch between characters that you bring with you (you go to their location too making navigating better) and being able to tell them where to go makes the game easier to manage vs...'),
(N'Raymond', N'Johnson', N'raymond.johnson9425@example.net', '2016-03-25', 5, N'One of the greatest games on the next gen consoles, no matter what anyone says this game is worth your money. Great gameplay and the story while confusing is still a great story with a great ending in my opinion this is definitely worth your money'),
(N'Jason', N'Scott', N'jason.scott4037@example.net', '2016-03-25', 1, N'Another piece of razer garbage. I''m not a fan of razer do to the lack of Quality Assurance Testing on all of their products. The fight stick market is small though, and this was the first of its kind to be able to open up for easy modifications. The early moments of me having this stick, I loved it. Felt great. Great spacing and everyone loves the feel of a genuine Sanwa Parts. Here''s their fatal flaw. They made their cable proprietary and don''t sell other cables! Their female connector itself is very flimsy, if any pressure is put against the cable towards the stick, you risk pushing in the female connector further back into the stick (cheap glue). Due to their POS connectors, the sticks can randomly be disconnected! As seen in Evo, Capcom Cup, AND final round. The drivers are also wonky and sometimes try to take over my audio or disconnect and won''t connect without rebooting the system! I''ve had several matches in USFIV and SFV where I''m playing ranked games, the stick...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Green', N'kyle.green3640@example.org', '2016-03-25', 5, N'Really enjoyed doing business with you. Item was received before the date of was supposed to get here and I thought that was cool. Item works great!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Boyd', N'jacqueline.boyd6808@example.org', '2016-03-25', 5, N'I know the designated role of grandpa is spoiling grandchildren and I am proud of how well I do just that. Well, okay, I don''t really spoil them, but I do try to do all I can to make their visits with us enjoyable and memorable. And since grandpa is a gadget freak . . . Now both kids have Apple products. He has an iPod Touch and she has an iPad. And I have an iPad Mini 2 and several iPhone 4s tha I use for video production. Which brings us to our first lesson: make sure your Apple devices are compatible with Nimbus! The iPhone 4 is not, nor are iPod Touch units before 5th generation. Im not all that much a game player, though I do admit to getting sucked in from time to time. And the Nimbus makes it far more likely that Ill get sucked in a lot more. In fact, it already has me thinking of buying an iPad for myself. For video and audio production, of course. Not for the sheer fun of playing games with this. Oh no, not me. Uh huh. I have a Wii and a PS3, purchased when the kids were...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Roberts', N'ethan.roberts4789@example.net', '2016-03-25', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Bennett', N'jonathan.bennett2739@example.org', '2016-03-25', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Bennett', N'jonathan.bennett2739@example.org', '2016-03-25', 4, N'They are a good value for the money.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Adams', N'jeremy.adams6979@example.net', '2016-03-26', 5, N'This NASCAR game introduced many new things, with an enormous and crafty career mode, tons of unlockable content, and a more interactive approach to what racing is. In career mode, you must start from scratch to make something of yourself by finishing well, which is quite the true rookie season. As time goes by, you''ll have the equipment needed to drive as well as the other drivers do. The unlockables are Busch Series cars, legend drivers, fantasy drivers, custom-car schemes, custom-car sponsors, special schemes for other drivers, fantasy tracks, pole race starts, and special events. There are also some extras you can get by winning multiple championships in career mode. A grudges and alliances feature was added in, which requires you respect the other drivers or to be ready for payback when you do want to play nice. If they get disappointed, they''ll block a lot... a lot more than usual. If you have them on fire, they''ll try make you become-one-with-the-outside-wall; unforgettable...'),
(N'Emma', N'Foster', N'emma.foster9647@example.net', '2016-03-26', 5, N'Awesome Game. Great for your collection.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Smith', N'joseph.smith1152@example.com', '2016-03-26', 5, N'Everything ok'),
(N'Jacob', N'Martin', N'jacob.martin7551@example.com', '2016-03-26', 5, N'Post Apocalyptic GTA. This is one of my favorite games ever. If you are a fan of the movies you should definitely get it. This game is Huge.'),
(N'Helen', N'Robinson', N'helen.robinson3921@example.com', '2016-03-26', 5, N'Works fantastic as a game controller. Great design to add some style to the plain black ones I commonly see.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Hernandez', N'jacob.hernandez6597@example.org', '2016-03-26', 5, N'I am so addicted to this game. I love everything about it. The graphics are amazing, the characters are fun and the world is breathtaking. I can get lost in the world for hours and not even realize the time. I love how you can change out the characters you take on your campaigns and that you can control any of the characters you take with you. I enjoy travelling to the different parts of the world to complete quests. I like that you can ride a horse to get places quicker and that the horse disappears when you are fighting. I really dislike it when a game kills off your horse, so I am pleased that has not happened yet. I love the conversations and banter between the players. I also enjoy the puzzles. I wish there were a few more puzzles to solve along the way, but you can''t have it all. I am so very, very happy that I purchased this game.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Morgan', N'ryan.morgan1279@example.net', '2016-03-27', 5, N'Halo MCC is a beautiful and amazing disaster of a game(s). To say it had issues at launch would be the understatement of the century. That said, you are getting one heckuva deal for some awesome games, and some awesome MP that people are enjoying a lot more in 2016 than they did when this title launched. And as a fan of Halo since before I had Internet myself, its awesome playing MP from Halo 1 and 2 that I could never have done before! And to think I though online gaming was a passing fad when Halo 1 and 2 hit LOL. if you love Halo, get this game. Its amazing. And last I checked, Reach is now backward compatible with Xbox one'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Sanchez', N'kathleen.sanchez6314@example.org', '2016-03-27', 3, N'Its dynasty warriors but with your favorite Legend of Zelda characters. It''s a decent game but no Multi-player support nor does it have anything connect feature for the wii u. It''s good for mindless hack and slash without getting too in depth in the story.'),
(N'Mary', N'James', N'mary.james2789@example.org', '2016-03-27', 4, N'awsome'),
(N'Donald', N'Baker', N'donald.baker6992@example.net', '2016-03-27', 5, N'Very intense, Will teach you patience'),
(N'Ashley', N'Sanchez', N'ashley.sanchez3447@example.org', '2016-03-27', 5, N'I like this James Bond'),
(N'Diane', N'Powell', N'diane.powell9806@example.net', '2016-03-27', 5, N'kids love this game. onlydraw back is its a 1 player game and 12 person multiplayer on a network.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Ivanov', N'kyle.ivanov3668@example.com', '2016-03-27', 1, N'Not that great. Aiming is way off. Very hard to play. It''s more aggravating than its worth. Would not recommend.'),
(N'Donna', N'Sanders', N'donna.sanders3150@example.org', '2016-03-27', 5, N'What can I say about Amiibo, They work exactly as they should and its good quality. I look pretty much as shown but as with any mass produced toy it isn''t exactly like that but I love them anyways! A worthy addition to anyone''s collection!'),
(N'Donna', N'Sanders', N'donna.sanders3150@example.org', '2016-03-27', 5, N'What can I say about Amiibo cards, They work exactly as they should and it''s good quality. They hold up well and haven''t noticed too much wear on mine. Recommend getting a book to keep them in. A worthy addition to anyone''s collection!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Rodriguez', N'ryan.rodriguez5935@example.org', '2016-03-27', 5, N'Castlevania and 3D have never gotten along...until now. This game is just fun and the cutscenes do provide a very cinematic experience. If you want Castlevania gameplay, then go back to the 2D Castlevanias, but as far as a 3D one that is actually good, this was the first.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Ramos', N'patrick.ramos9435@example.net', '2016-03-27', 5, N'Exactaly what our kids wanted:)'),
(N'Barbara', N'Powell', N'barbara.powell1989@example.org', '2016-03-28', 3, N'I love the game, especially the CHAO. But I''m not getting very far. I''ve only got one Chaos Emerald. This is definitely a game for advanced players.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Diaz', N'rachel.diaz6724@example.org', '2016-03-28', 1, N'Just awful. I suggest a ps4 and SFV'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Morales', N'kathleen.morales8210@example.com', '2016-03-28', 5, N'Still in the original package lol. After a few years i bought it,hopefully it will work like "new" lol'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Morales', N'kathleen.morales8210@example.com', '2016-03-28', 5, N'Love this game since i played it the very first time,still get pissed off when i get stuck on some missions but still play it!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Sanders', N'ronald.sanders9618@example.org', '2016-03-28', 5, N'Despite being used the game was in excellent condition. Very satisfied to say the least'),
(N'Samantha', N'Long', N'samantha.long4791@example.com', '2016-03-28', 5, N'Great fighting game with a lot of depth.'),
(N'Steven', N'Jimenez', N'steven.jimenez7614@example.org', '2016-03-28', 4, N'After seeing both critic and personal reviews on the net I was a little worried about this title. Those worries were alleviated upon loading it up. I don''t know how this runs on the old 3DS but it runs very nicely on my New 3DS. A lot of fan service and the music is fantastic. The graphics aren''t the best out there but they get the job done considering how much is going on. They are colorful and stylized. The 3d is hit and miss. It will chug in crowded areas. I find my self toggling it for cinematic scenes and switching it off in the heat of battle. The amount of content is huge. All in all if you have a New 3DS i definitely recommend it.'),
(N'Gary', N'Flores', N'gary.flores3979@example.org', '2016-03-28', 5, N'As described. Good replacement for my psp.'),
(N'Donna', N'Brooks', N'donna.brooks9258@example.net', '2016-03-28', 1, N'This is not a game. It''s a proof of concept on something that if Capcom focused development on could be completed in a year from now. I''ve written Sony and they have refused to give me my money back. This is the biggest waste of money I''ve ever seen on a PS4.'),
(N'Donna', N'Martinez', N'donna.martinez7038@example.com', '2016-03-28', 4, N'The actual gameplay is fantastic even though the content is a little light.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Chavez', N'tomasz.chavez2548@example.com', '2016-03-28', 3, N'Game was just okay. Nothing new or groundbreaking here. Game freezing bugs are annoying.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'White', N'jacqueline.white2645@example.com', '2016-03-28', 3, N'Pro: UFC 2 has the best character creator of all the sports games I ever played. Truly stunning. Game face works flawlessly for the first time (I tried it in many games). Amazing strike feedback (what was missing in EA UFC) - you see fighter face deform in real time. Great knockouts. I just love them. Ground game got so much better. No need to twist thumbsticks anymore. Cons: Horrible Career mode (the reason I bought UFC 2) - I wish they would have made it similar to Fight Night Champion or better to UFC 3 for THQ. I didn''t get past my 10th fight in a career mode because disk started spinning and game stick in the same place. Tried deleting it but it gets stuck in the same training session. I can''t talk about online portion because I have no interest in online.'),
(N'Jose', N'Coleman', N'jose.coleman2669@example.org', '2016-03-29', 5, N'Fantastic!'),
(N'Larry', N'Moore', N'larry.moore9873@example.com', '2016-03-29', 4, N'At first I was frustrated because the headset''s mic is extremely awful when you plug it directly to a PC. But then I got my Xbox One controller and I plugged the headset into controller, and plugged the controller into my PC (by using a USB cable). By doing this I was able to record my voice with it on my PC. The quality of the voice is outstanding for this price. I do not like the headset and I don''t use it or even put it on my head, I just use the mic.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Campbell', N'ashley.campbell3441@example.com', '2016-03-29', 1, N'Returned, due to bad display and description I returned the item. It was sent for a PS4 and I have a PS3.'),
(N'Heather', N'Henderson', N'heather.henderson5935@example.com', '2016-03-29', 3, N'Led light doesn''t quite work or it has issues trying to charge'),
(N'Nancy', N'Evans', N'nancy.evans5838@example.org', '2016-03-29', 5, N'Underrated and fun game, often described as Mario Kart for adults.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Cook', N'jacqueline.cook8874@example.com', '2016-03-29', 5, N'Fun shoot em up.'),
(N'Justin', N'Powell', N'justin.powell1348@example.net', '2016-03-29', 2, N'This game is a waste of money. No arcade mode, no real story mode, no meaty content. You get a stripped down "story mode" that you can beat in less than an hour, which is also supremely easy. You get online battles and lobbies, etc, but that''s pretty much it. The only good thing about the game is that the fighting is highly polished, but there''s little reason to keep coming back. Some would argue that the online battles is what the game is truly all about. Maybe so, but it''s hard to believe that NetherRealm managed to ship a complete Mortal Kombat X, with tons of modes and variety, on launch day while Capcom launched an incomplete game with promises of more to come. After over a month, Capcom finally released tutorials and trials, plus the eShop that should''ve been there day one. At this point, with all the great games releasing in the next few months, any excitement I had for Street Fighter V is long gone. Capcom really dropped the ball with this one. This type of model for...'),
(N'Luis', N'Cruz', N'luis.cruz6855@example.org', '2016-03-29', 5, N'good stuff'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2016-03-29', 4, N'The Dead to Rights game have been ambitious to a degree The first two were average but, the 3rd Retribution is where Namco found the right formula The game is without a doubt a homage to the original Max Payne games along with elements from True Crime: Streets of LA It does Max Payne better then Max Payne III did but, what do i know The Controls: Easy to pick up and play (The QTE''s are gone previously used in the other games The fighting at first might seem a bit wonky once you get the hang of how to play it Your feel at home within less then 15minutes You also get to play as the dog Shadow (Which I honestly don''t remember if the dog was playable in the previous games) The dog controls very good unlike in Call of Duty: Ghost where the dog was a gimmick This while not perfect works once you get the hang of Shadows movements and adds a vast different element to the game play The game play solid if you ever played any 3rd person action titles you''ll feel right at home While it doesn''t...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Chen', N'michelle.chen2897@example.com', '2016-03-29', 1, N'Buyer Beware... they say certified new just means that it works... one of my controllers looks like it went through a blender'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Walker', N'hiroshi.walker6354@example.org', '2016-03-29', 5, N'The kids love it and it seems to be doing what it is supposed to be doing. Letting a kid enjoy a game. No complaints'),
(N'William', N'Walker', N'william.walker3299@example.org', '2016-03-29', 5, N'fun game'),
(N'Richard', N'Evans', N'richard.evans1792@example.com', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Best controller I''ve ever had, and one of the cheapest I''ve ever had. Feels more like an Xbox One controller, which is my favorite controller. I had not realized how EXTREMELY easy it is to interchange parts. I will likely buy a red one next time and mix the parts up, because I love the feel and I would like to be able to customize the look as well. Definitely worth more than $20. I''m not sure if you''ll be able to use an Xbox 360 headset with it, but it comes with an adapter to use a PC headset.'),
(N'Frank', N'Sanchez', N'frank.sanchez6330@example.org', '2016-03-30', 5, N'This is an awesome Amiibo for any Street Fighter fan or Super Smash Brothers Wii U player!!! I don''t play Smash Brothers, but it''s still an awesome collectible!!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Reyes', N'raymond.reyes6379@example.org', '2016-03-30', 5, N'I loved this game! I can''t wait for the new one'),
(N'Lauren', N'Walker', N'lauren.walker5265@example.com', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Works with Apple TV, iPad, iPod and everything apple, makes gameplay much easier and better with this controller, like an Xbox controller for your apple devices, pretty cool!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Flores', N'brenda.flores8656@example.net', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Love this game. I love star wars and everything I can do in it.'),
(N'Gary', N'Brooks', N'gary.brooks6628@example.net', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Rivera', N'jeremy.rivera2449@example.com', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Ok'),
(N'Ethan', N'Stewart', N'ethan.stewart8107@example.org', '2016-03-30', 5, N'With the current updates this is a solid fighter. Still takes a little too long to load at the title screen but once you get to the game it''s all good.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Williams', N'ashley.williams8099@example.net', '2016-03-30', 5, N'My son and I love it. The keyboard works great and it looks very nice! The red back light LEDs are really cool.'),
(N'Linda', N'Chavez', N'linda.chavez6097@example.org', '2016-03-30', 4, N'It''s working good.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Sanders', N'ravi.sanders3997@example.com', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Great controller and at a reasonable price'),
(N'Zachary', N'White', N'zachary.white8467@example.com', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Great game especially for 20 bucks'),
(N'Scott', N'Sanders', N'scott.sanders2642@example.net', '2016-03-30', 5, N'Works great. Glad I got this at a good price.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Parker', N'shirley.parker3036@example.net', '2016-03-31', 5, N'TL;DR Some server issues and minor adjustments/fixes need to be made, but this is one hell of a beautiful MMORPG shooter that will keep you occupied for a very long time. If you like 3rd person shooters with loot progress and you like post apocalyptic lore, get this game. I''m now invested over 100 hours into this game from the open and closed beta all the way up to final release. The developers did a fantastic job recreating NYC and it shows in all the little details you''ll find along your journey to save humanity. The visuals are absolutely beautiful on all platforms, even if they aren''t up to the 2013/2014 E3 trailers. PRO TIP: On the Xbox One go into the "Visuals" menu under settings and turn Neutral Lighting to Yes, then adjust your brightness up to about 60% or so....thank me later (This may work on PS4/PC as well).. They really shine on the PC if you have the right hardware. I purchased this on my XO solely because of peer pressure, but I don''t regret it. This game pushes...'),
(N'Steven', N'Martinez', N'steven.martinez7124@example.com', '2016-03-31', 5, N'EXCELENETE'),
(N'Donald', N'Long', N'donald.long2243@example.com', '2016-03-31', 3, N'GOOD'),
(N'Helen', N'Ruiz', N'helen.ruiz7598@example.net', '2016-03-31', 5, N'Stinking dog chewed up our old cord, this cord works and was a good price. I seriously cannot say more or less. This is a good buy.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ramirez', N'aisha.ramirez5513@example.net', '2016-03-31', 5, N'I love these amiibo; they''re so cute, very detailed (much more than any of my Smash ones), and I got them for only $20, which is a steal since amiibo are usually $12.95 each. I love all the new challenges they unlock in Splatoon--I was pleasantly surprised by the number of challenges each one has (27!). Would definitely recommend.'),
(N'Laura', N'Moore', N'laura.moore1365@example.net', '2016-03-31', 5, N'i had to use my other laptop to play because my dell laptop d630 didn''t meet minimum requirements but after i got it to work for my toshiba laptop it was great! it didn''t freeze nor skip'),
(N'Timothy', N'Morales', N'timothy.morales8005@example.net', '2016-03-31', 5, N'I absolutely love this game. It is a fun adventure for the mysterious girl. She is trying to discover herself, along with dealing with the world around her. She quickly learns she has the ability to manipulate gravity. The story is really fun. The graphics are very nicely updated to the PS4. The controls have been improved. All around it is a better game. A must buy!'),
(N'Laura', N'James', N'laura.james7859@example.org', '2016-03-31', 5, N'This power cable worked perfectly for my "PlayStation 3 60GB FAT model." Please do not purchase this power cable if you are looking for a replacement power cable for your PlayStation 3 slim or super slim, it will not work. Otherwise this is an all around great product, and I would recommend it to anyone looking for a replacement power cable for their FAT PlayStation 3.'),
(N'Amara', N'Lee', N'amara.lee1853@example.org', '2016-04-01', 5, N'Works fin, awesome graphics and gameplay.'),
(N'Noah', N'Scott', N'noah.scott9646@example.com', '2016-04-01', 5, N'Love the feel of a new controller.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Morris', N'jerry.morris7470@example.net', '2016-04-01', 5, N'Great game. I''ve got about 12 hours in so far and am really enjoying it. I mostly play solo, only co-op with random folks for the larger missions. People have compared this game to Destiny, but it''s way better in my opinion. I really enjoy the atmosphere, customization, number of weapons and so forth. Other complaints have been about how many bullets it takes to kill the bad guys, but making this a "realistic" shooter wouldn''t work. The bad guys would be too easy to kill, and conversely it would be really rough if the player character could only take 1-2 hits. I''ve had no issues with the servers or otherwise. A few minor glitches in-game where I got stuck on things and one occasion where I fell through the ground, but this is few and far between (and fast travelling fixes the "stuck" condition). Overall I''d give this about a 9 out of 10, rounded up to 5 stars here. I''m sure the game is even more fun co-op with RL friends or family, so I''m hoping to talk a few into getting it. PS--...'),
(N'Brian', N'Baker', N'brian.baker1999@example.com', '2016-04-01', 5, N'my boyfriend said this game looked interesting and and this I like what going on it good to level up create weapons and give people stuff to create your owe charater and throw stuff at enemies. we play together hacking it. I seem to lioke getting the memories of what happened phone echos and everything else. I tell ya I love this game enough to recommend it.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Williams', N'jennifer.williams9052@example.net', '2016-04-01', 5, N'Product was new and perfect. The game so far is incredible. Thank you for your wonderful service.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Thompson', N'aisha.thompson2842@example.com', '2016-04-01', 5, N'This game is a lot like the WiiU version but has its own little things that make it stand out. It has the same story as the WiiU versions BUT they added new chapters that go with the new characters. This game has a total of 5 new playable characters that you can unlock in the 3DS version by playing the new chapters in story mode as well as playing the adventure mode. These characters include Tetra, Toon Link, King Daphnes, Skull Kid, and (the female version of Link) Linkle. You also unlock a new weapon that Ganondorf can use and its just as good as his duel swords. The new characters and Ganondorfs weapon can be transferred over to the WiiU version with a code that is included with each copy of Hyrule Warriors: Legends and will be available from the moment you turn on the game. There is more DLC being made for these games and you can buy a bundle pack for both consoles which is cheaper then buying them individually. If you were wondering about the previous DLC characters they are...'),
(N'Sarah', N'Alvarez', N'sarah.alvarez3170@example.com', '2016-04-01', 5, N'EXCELLENT'),
(N'Steven', N'Davis', N'steven.davis3222@example.org', '2016-04-02', 1, N'I purchased this so I could play GTA5 on my PC the same way I play those games on consoles. There are no mapping for this controller in the various games premade to be usable. In fact if you want to have the same controls on the controller as you do on consoles for GTA you have to HACK the steam controller software with 3rd party plugins that change your steam installation. (ahhhh NO!) I may be naive but I would think that if Steam has a game on there system, they would make sure it works with their own controller. Very disappointing This has some serious potential but it needs another thumb stick (the dual touch pads are nice but a touch pad is no substitute for a thumb stick. A charging dock also would have been nice.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Reyes', N'thomas.reyes5806@example.org', '2016-04-02', 5, N'A+....'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Ward', N'hiroshi.ward8850@example.org', '2016-04-02', 5, N'Makes the kid happy. I wish the game that came with it had better language for kids, but oh well. It is fun.'),
(N'Susan', N'Morgan', N'susan.morgan5219@example.org', '2016-04-02', 3, N'Best COD in a long time. Hardcore fans may not like it. The zombies portion however is aweful. If you never played zombies before the experience this game gives you would make you wanna never even think about playing it ever again. Its difficult and complicated, even for the seasoned zombie players. Story is crap. Multiplayer is good.'),
(N'Debra', N'Kowalski', N'debra.kowalski3988@example.org', '2016-04-02', 3, N'Item arrived quick, works well, the games play fine. However the games are very hard to remove from the nes. My daughter used a pliers to remove the cartridge.'),
(N'Mei', N'Wang', N'mei.wang7113@example.com', '2016-04-02', 1, N'in regards to the steel series, it was about - the 3rd mouse i tried for a few days prior to buying a new in my search for the best FPS mouse. I would give it a 2/10 overall. The plastic gets dirty quickly (this was a prominent issue with this mouse) it didn''t feel MUCH better than a random mouse you would buy for every day use. The cable was "ok", not as bad as many other mouses i have tried however not particularly good. I''ve tried: Logitek proteus core (5/10)(The main reason i give this mouse only a 5 is because of the braided cable. otherwise an excellent mouse. Worth stating, the cable is so terrible that i would not utilize ANY logitek mouse until they change this design) Logitek g502 (4/10 the thick logitek "braided" cable gets heavy and remembers its position, meaning each time u go left or right u will have to move the heavy cable, making precision really difficult over time and the cable gets stiff, the extra clicker and buttons on the side combined both make it really...'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Cruz', N'evelyn.cruz6185@example.net', '2016-04-02', 1, N'Terrible, repetitive, depressive, violent game. Makes me wonder if the whole ps4 system is worth it. Every mission is identical. Really wrecked my weekend. Was looking forward to a new game and got this piece of lousy garbage.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Jimenez', N'timothy.jimenez1697@example.org', '2016-04-03', 5, N'A change in the pairing system, no durability for weapons (still have durability for staves) and a nice base/castle area to create and admire your work. (A small copy of my Conquest review)'),
(N'Shirley', N'Myers', N'shirley.myers4675@example.net', '2016-04-03', 5, N'Bought this for my gf for her birthday as she is really into animal crossing. Figure is of good quality and they look excellent.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Gray', N'lisa.gray5707@example.com', '2016-04-03', 1, N'cover didn''t keep dust from getting into the usb or the the side of the ps4 holes...buy it on your own risk!'),
(N'Judith', N'Hill', N'judith.hill2923@example.com', '2016-04-03', 4, N'Redundant game. Series is great though!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Rivera', N'daniel.rivera4679@example.org', '2016-04-04', 4, N'The game arrived on time and plays flawlessly thanks Atari Inc'),
(N'Ronald', N'Perry', N'ronald.perry4335@example.org', '2016-04-04', 5, N'Like'),
(N'Daniel', N'Barnes', N'daniel.barnes5791@example.org', '2016-04-04', 5, N'Thank You every thing were on time.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Smith', N'nicholas.smith4665@example.com', '2016-04-04', 5, N'just what my grandson wanted'),
(N'Carlos', N'Okonkwo', N'carlos.okonkwo6805@example.org', '2016-04-04', 2, N'I got this to replay Morrowind. It is a great (but older) open ended game. I give the game itself 5 stars. I am giving this 2 stars. I am disappointed with this version. It requires Stream. I have no interest in using Stream. This should be stated in the summary.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Peterson', N'ethan.peterson3321@example.net', '2016-04-04', 5, N'This is one of my first mechanical keyboards, and after using this for just one day, I don''t think I''ll ever go back to regular old chicklet keyboards. This thing is seriously awesome, the build quality is fantastic, and the typing experience is orgasmic. I have always been thinking about buying a mechanical keyboard, since I always hear that they are far superior, but I used to think that I would have to spend at least $100 for a decent one. When I saw that this was both mechanical and backlit, I was very interested, but also skeptical because of the $40 price tag. When I read some good reviews, I decided to take the plunge. I am sure glad that I did. I am writing this review on this keyboard, and it is just so wonderful, so much better than my old keyboard. There probably are better keyboards than this one out there, but this is definitely the best keyboard that I have ever owned. Funny story, I actually spilled some soda on the keys while writing this; but it''s easy to clean...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Martin', N'brenda.martin1195@example.com', '2016-04-04', 1, N'Disappointed. You need a large amount of space on your Xbox hard drive to download the game'),
(N'Linda', N'Rodriguez', N'linda.rodriguez1444@example.net', '2016-04-05', 1, N'Just 5 rally cross tracks to race online, no online stages on multiplayer. No replay value online.'),
(N'Mary', N'Green', N'mary.green4722@example.com', '2016-04-05', 5, N'Quantum Break isn''t just the best game I''ve played It''s one of the greatest games I''ve played in years.story is amazing gameplay is 10/10 a most buy this year'),
(N'Tyler', N'Watson', N'tyler.watson5680@example.org', '2016-04-05', 5, N'Love it----my very first game. Gonna learn it then buy another'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ramirez', N'sarah.ramirez5690@example.com', '2016-04-05', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ramirez', N'sarah.ramirez5690@example.com', '2016-04-05', 5, N'Grandson loved it'),
(N'Sharon', N'Reed', N'sharon.reed7124@example.net', '2016-04-05', 3, N'Aliens: Colonial Marines was my most anticipated game of 2013. But when I popped it in and played it, I was underwhelmed. It''s not horrible as most people make it out to be but nevertheless I was disappointed. Graphics were sub par (I had the PS3 version), the AI was weak and overall, was not a very fun game to play. It had it moments but it came out as a mess. If you have $5 dollars around, pick it up and give it a shot but don''t expecting anything more than an afternoon waster. Author''s Note: Very recently, there''s been a mod released called "Overhaul". It rebalances the aliens'' AI, human AI, weapons ballistics and mechanics, lighting, you name it. I have heard a lot good things about it so I decided to order the PC version from Amazon.com for my laptop. I''ll do a review of that as soon as I try it.'),
(N'Anita', N'Long', N'anita.long9979@example.net', '2016-04-05', 1, N'The price was great and with reasonable reviews , so I gave it a shot and bought it as a replacement for an original PS 3 controller . It worked fine for exactly 6 months , then it does not charge anymore . Great product if you want to use your PS 3 for the next 3 or 4 months or so , then move to another system . I would not recommend it otherwise . Learn from my experience and try something else. Best of luck to you !'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ramirez', N'andrew.ramirez4461@example.org', '2016-04-06', 5, N'Perfect.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ramirez', N'andrew.ramirez4461@example.org', '2016-04-06', 5, N'Very happy. Great gift.'),
(N'Michael', N'Garcia', N'michael.garcia6241@example.com', '2016-04-06', 5, N'I swear, the red color makes me like it 10x more.'),
(N'Michael', N'Garcia', N'michael.garcia6241@example.com', '2016-04-06', 5, N'Yeah buddy!'),
(N'Michael', N'Garcia', N'michael.garcia6241@example.com', '2016-04-06', 5, N'Amazing value!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Suzuki', N'samuel.suzuki4739@example.org', '2016-04-06', 5, N'I love Mario Kart. The controls with the wii controller suck though.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Ward', N'carlos.ward9278@example.org', '2016-04-06', 2, N'Case came looking as if stepped on multiple times'),
(N'Barbara', N'Singh', N'barbara.singh9491@example.com', '2016-04-06', 5, N'Syncing with the system was a little tricky, but once you get it hooked up with your console it works really well.'),
(N'Walter', N'Raghunathan', N'walter.raghunathan8536@example.net', '2016-04-06', 5, N'A very slick toy, happy to have it. Wish I saw it before I got the green one, but not so much that I didn''t run out and get this too.'),
(N'George', N'Nowak', N'george.nowak5453@example.net', '2016-04-07', 2, N'Far Cry Primal is a decent extension of the Far Cry franchise to new territories however I think it falls short on many levels. The game feels more like it should be called 10000 BCE which is more accurate than saying primal. I say this because its basically a new IP with just the Far Cry name on it to try to get more people interested. Instead of having shooting elements and weapons and such everything is just reskinned as a bow and arrow, club, with some other non original items for the period. That isn''t to really ding it but it is to say it is not really a refreshing experience. I also think the decision to go to this territory could have been a bit better if they left the "far cry" name. Far Cry at least has some cinematic storytelling to it, this does too but again its been reskinned for the period and unfortunately kind of done in an awkward manner. I think having them speak english would have made for a better game than going for a period based original language. I just...'),
(N'Omar', N'Martin', N'omar.martin2163@example.org', '2016-04-07', 4, N'It''s very comfortable. The tension is just right; stays securely on my head without crushing my skull. I''ve had headsets that give me headaches after a few minutes. The cushions are velvety and plush. This lets the ears breath a bit, so you don''t get sweaty ears as quickly. I like the removable microphone. I can wear these cans around while listening to music. They''re not the best for music, but I find myself using this often. They''re very sterile sounding, like monitors. Accurate, but no "character." The superior comfort makes this my favorite for listening to music for focus. I can wear them for hours. And as an added perk, they work with my cellphone and the clarity is excellent on both ends of the conversation. I''d give it 5-stars if they sounded better, but for the price, this is an exceptional value. I''d like to rate this 4.5 stars if it were possible.'),
(N'Janet', N'Bailey', N'janet.bailey3877@example.com', '2016-04-07', 5, N'OEM item, works as Nintendo designed it to!'),
(N'Jason', N'Hernandez', N'jason.hernandez6389@example.org', '2016-04-07', 1, N'These things are absolutely worthless. They break if you sneeze on them. I have had to literally replace this thing 8 times in the past year. The sticks go bad on them quickly, the buttons stop working. Don''t waste your money Microsoft builds these things to break on purpose so you have to keep buying new ones over and over and over. I''m selling my Xbox on Craigslist and never buying another crappy Xbox again. Save your money and you sanity this thing is utterly worthless.'),
(N'Henry', N'Brown', N'henry.brown1636@example.com', '2016-04-07', 5, N'works really well, thank you very much!'),
(N'Emily', N'Jimenez', N'emily.jimenez3086@example.org', '2016-04-07', 5, N'Came brand new, no scratches'),
(N'Raymond', N'Thomas', N'raymond.thomas6513@example.org', '2016-04-07', 2, N'After going back and forth between deciding whether or not to purchase 2DS to play the new Pokemon game, I ended up deciding to purchase one through Nintendo''s refurbish program. I''m not a kid and I purchased the unit for myself, so my perspective may be different from the younger crowd. I would recommend purchasing a refurbished unit through Nintendo if you aren''t going to buy a new unit. They have a very strong refurb program and the device I received seemed to have a completely new exterior. Given that the majority of the people who own these handheld systems are very young, you don''t want to end up purchasing a grimey device or ones with buttons that aren''t fully functional. While your phone will likely have much better performance and a higher quality screen, it also costs $300-600. The 2DS isn''t breaking any technological grounds in terms of its power. Its designed to be affordable, which is why I''m baffled by the price of the games for the system. One new game costs almost...'),
(N'Heather', N'Martin', N'heather.martin4275@example.com', '2016-04-07', 3, N'The combat wasn''t fluid. Also hated the cover system a lot. They should have just made it like gears of war cover. Instead, he ducks every time you get near something. The whole thing felt sort of half baked and rushed. They had some awesome ideas. I got past act 3 and couldn''t play anymore.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Gomez', N'olivia.gomez7028@example.com', '2016-04-07', 5, N'neat game, but I just got to much on my ps4/xbox1 plate to get back into it'),
(N'Charles', N'Bailey', N'charles.bailey5100@example.com', '2016-04-07', 5, N'Trackmania Turbo is a fun arcade racing game, full of stunts, jumps and fast speeds. The game features a wealth of content, there are about 200 tracks to race on in single player. These 200 tracks are spread across 4 completely different locations, each offering a different environment and style of gameplay. There is 4-player split-screen co-op, which is rarely seen in modern games, and the game is really fun to play with friends. Additionally, there is a multiplayer mode of up to 100 players at a time, and it can get really crazy sometimes. The game features nice graphics and the locations are quite beautiful to look at, there is also a high level of detail on everything in the game, from environments to cars. Trackmania Turbo puts a lot of emphasis on leaderboard competition, and for many people that might be exactly what they would be looking for; a lot of fun can come out of competing with your friends if thats what you''re looking for. The tracks in single player are quite...'),
(N'Barbara', N'Hall', N'barbara.hall9564@example.net', '2016-04-07', 3, N'With the exception of some bugs and minor glitches, this is a great game. Also, Activision needs to stop with their greedy pay-to-play black market. If I spend $60 on a game and another $50 on the season pass, I should not need to purchase new weapons or other add-on items.. EVER. Activision is alienating their fan base and destroying this series out of greed. On top of it, the game developers (Treyarch) take the heat for the nonsense Activision is forcing them to put into the game.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Raghunathan', N'sandra.raghunathan5866@example.net', '2016-04-07', 1, N'Not a very fun game. Sims 2 pets was fun so I thought I''d try this one. The controls and mini games are a bit weird and hard to figure out, and the tutorials are almost nonexistent. Waste of money if you ask me...'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Wisniewski', N'rebecca.wisniewski4905@example.net', '2016-04-08', 5, N'This is the best working wireless controller for the classic Xbox. I use constantly and the control has been impeccable!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Ruiz', N'timothy.ruiz4674@example.net', '2016-04-08', 3, N'This isn''t going to start as a full detailed review, just something quick I''d like to touch on, and I may elaborate my review in the future. First I just want to say, it seems like this may be a good game. Seems like the story will be good, good graphics too. But my problem so far is, any game I play, I always put the aiming sensitivity at the highest. But even so, with this game, it''s not sensitive at all. You should be able to barely move the stick and have your character''s aim move. But with this, even at 100% sensitivity, you have to move the stick past a certain point just for the aim to move, which ruins the game by far.'),
(N'Jack', N'Gonzalez', N'jack.gonzalez6311@example.com', '2016-04-08', 5, N'Works awesome!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Henderson', N'barbara.henderson6256@example.net', '2016-04-08', 5, N'I bought 2 one for me and one for my step daughter'),
(N'Yuki', N'Khan', N'yuki.khan3858@example.org', '2016-04-08', 2, N'Still the worst in the series and a steaming turd.'),
(N'Omar', N'Cook', N'omar.cook1547@example.org', '2016-04-09', 5, N'I was on the fence about this game, I must have looked at it a hundred times before I purchased it, and I''m really glad I did. I read all the bad reviews, I even watched some on the big websites. I''m not sure what those peoples expectations were, but they are missing out on a great experience and game. This is what video games are all about. They tell a great story and they do it in a completely refreshing way. Are the live scenes award winning? No, but they really do add new dynamic to the game. In fact, I found they gave me a break from the gaming and let me sit back and enjoy the story. So, if you don''t like the game, fine. I will challenge you to think about how much it took to make a game like this? It would be easy to continue to make the fetch quest, loot driven big FPS game we have seen for years lately. Great job remedy, thank you for your hard work and free game!'),
(N'Victoria', N'Richardson', N'victoria.richardson9705@example.org', '2016-04-09', 4, N'This was fun for the whole family'),
(N'Jose', N'Richardson', N'jose.richardson9506@example.net', '2016-04-09', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Joseph', N'Jackson', N'joseph.jackson8854@example.org', '2016-04-09', 4, N'Not bad. Meets the need for the game. Would not recommend for professional use'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Brown', N'rebecca.brown6993@example.com', '2016-04-10', 5, N'A good game I was able to immerse myself in. Reminds me of the old Tomb Raider games.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Taylor', N'barbara.taylor8910@example.org', '2016-04-10', 5, N'My husband is pleased with the new mouse. He especially likes the corded wire, it''s added protection against little kitten teeth! I would buy from this seller again. It arrived intact, in the original box.'),
(N'Linda', N'Ali', N'linda.ali8765@example.com', '2016-04-10', 5, N'Love the game. Has hours and hours of gameplay. Best Far Cry To Date.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Morris', N'jeffrey.morris6416@example.com', '2016-04-10', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Morris', N'jeffrey.morris6416@example.com', '2016-04-10', 2, N'I don''t like this game.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Taylor', N'kofi.taylor4947@example.net', '2016-04-10', 3, N'I really admire UbiSoft for coming up with a new concept for a game that takes place in pre-history. It''s quite a departure from the most popular genres. While the weapons are from the Stone Age, the bow is a nice ranged weapon so you''re not limited to arm''s length. Your owl is your eyes in the sky that can inflict damage while you hide. You can also sic your saber-toothed tiger on enemies and even ride the animal later in the game. I loved stealthily taking down enemy camps from a distance with the owl and then dispatching the heavies with my spear. The scenery is beautiful and the audio effects were so good that after a while I could recognize all the animals by sound alone. The stereo sound was so accurate I could usually tell the direction and distance of allies and enemies like I was really there. This also was true for Far Cry 4. Unfortunately, the game became entirely too repetitious. Despite the unique content and beautiful landscape, I grew bored with the game from just...'),
(N'Jason', N'Garcia', N'jason.garcia1375@example.org', '2016-04-10', 1, N'I didn''t mind the motion stuff. UNTIL IT TOTALLY QUIT ON ME!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! It worked fine on the wii, but on the wiiu it kept un syncing! Every twenty minutes or so Link doesn''t respond then this stupid screen comes up saying the controller isn''t responding! What''s worse is that you can''t just press the A button. Nope. You have to get up and sync the controller again. After all that, you have to calibrate the controller again and point at the screen and all that crap. Then (in my case) it un synced less than a minute later. I''m soooooooooo upset. Everything else about this game was great EXCEPT that glitch or whatever it is. I''m so sorry Nintendo, you lost me on this one.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Lopez', N'timothy.lopez4050@example.org', '2016-04-10', 5, N'Amazing game'),
(N'Dennis', N'Stewart', N'dennis.stewart5797@example.net', '2016-04-10', 2, N'Coming from a Logitech M510, this mouse was a very bulky upgrade, even with my big hands. I was expecting an RGB model but received a blue-only device. It might work for you and your situation, but I couldn''t keep this one.'),
(N'Mary', N'Ortiz', N'mary.ortiz6842@example.com', '2016-04-10', 5, N'Good stand. Fits perfect and charge the controllers.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Powell', N'nicholas.powell5711@example.org', '2016-04-10', 4, N'I had to struggle a little bit to get the XBOX One to recolonize the HDD properly. There was very little guidance included with the product to solve the issue. Fortunately, I was able to figure it from other sources. It will be helpful if you have a Windows 7/8/10 computer nearby to use the Disk Management tool. Once I figured it out, I''m quite pleased with how it looks. Adding an extra 2 TB of storage means I can download lots of games.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Mendoza', N'andrea.mendoza7005@example.com', '2016-04-10', 5, N'Great game, fast shipping, very happy.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Sanders', N'nadia.sanders1500@example.org', '2016-04-10', 5, N'I just wanted to update my gaming mouse.. I love the razer brand and it has not failed me yet'),
(N'Nadia', N'Sanders', N'nadia.sanders1500@example.org', '2016-04-10', 5, N'ALL THE RAZER STUFF IS OFF THE HOOK; i''V BEEN BUYING AND USING THESE GAMING PRODUCTS OVER THE YEARS AND THEY HAVE NOT FAILED ME .. I JUST LOVE KEEPING UP TO DATE AND MY SISTER LOVES MY HAND ME DOWNS....'),
(N'Lisa', N'Phillips', N'lisa.phillips5359@example.com', '2016-04-11', 1, N'Not sure why they are remaking this garbage when it was already in hd and had a terrible reception from real capcom fans. COD fanoboys go back to your own franchise and leave our horror games alone!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ivanov', N'ethan.ivanov9172@example.org', '2016-04-11', 5, N'Halloween is my favorite holiday of the year. So of course I bought the stuff pack when it came out for the Sims. Sims 4 is still boring as hell and I can''t say that this stuff pack was worth the money. I would definitely buy for the costumes and the Halloween parties you can throw in the game. I''m just saying if you can get it on sale, I would wait.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Peterson', N'rachel.peterson8157@example.org', '2016-04-11', 5, N'pretty good keyboard for its price. I like how I can easily pull out the keys and clean it. Im always using the calculator hotkey and sleep button, has a few extras. Practical and cheap'),
(N'Priya', N'Green', N'priya.green2198@example.com', '2016-04-11', 5, N'Fast Shipping and Great Quality.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Kowalski', N'yuki.kowalski8896@example.org', '2016-04-11', 5, N'I love it! Very good game, excellent packaging to send'),
(N'Justin', N'Wood', N'justin.wood7496@example.org', '2016-04-11', 5, N'Nephew loved it'),
(N'Wei', N'Morris', N'wei.morris5692@example.org', '2016-04-11', 5, N'Great game but only if your into this type I was going to rate it at 4 four because its not the best looking game I also new what I as purchasing so it didn''t seem since it basically did what I expected it to do.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Hughes', N'brenda.hughes1237@example.com', '2016-04-12', 5, N'Just came in today! Love them so far. Only issue is I have no idea how the warranty works IN CASE something happens ya know? This may not be top dollar but for someone who has kids and limited money, I like to know it''ll be backed by support. The lights on the sides are awesome, headband is super comfy, It''s sleek, sexy, and the cord is quite long. Works with a single USB port, sound takes a tad of tweaking but it comes with an awesome app for that. I suggest this headset for anyone who likes to game! Oh, and the mic is great so far. Seems flimsy but fold UP rather than IN. Which I like.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Chen', N'yuki.chen9259@example.org', '2016-04-12', 1, N'The c stick doesn''t work and it malfunctions'),
(N'Timothy', N'Jenkins', N'timothy.jenkins4715@example.net', '2016-04-12', 5, N'Works perfectly so far! Not much else to say!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Sanders', N'sarah.sanders8238@example.org', '2016-04-12', 5, N'Futbol at it''s Fifinest!'),
(N'Rachel', N'Kim', N'rachel.kim3972@example.com', '2016-04-12', 2, N'What a disappointment. I was really looking forward to a new Digimon game, but instead we get: ........................... + Visuals are fine + Digimon follow you and there''s lots of variety ........................... - board requests feel grindy and empty - you level too fast. Weird criticism right? But it''s a problem. Your digimon level so fast and evolve so often you just don''t care about any of them. You can barely keep track of moves as they come and go. Which really feeds into the next item... - welcome to auto battle the game. You have so little reason to be playing it other than turning auto battles on for almost all the fights. Switch the difficulty to hard and let the game play itself. It''ll choose the best moves against the best types as you would have anyway. The only situation it differs are some of the boss fights where you just stack status effects and win. - all other functions are surprisingly limited and small. Digifarm is barely anything you touch once a few...'),
(N'Dennis', N'Bell', N'dennis.bell7246@example.net', '2016-04-12', 5, N'Got this game so we could bowl in our living room, hours of fun.'),
(N'Anita', N'Gomez', N'anita.gomez6692@example.net', '2016-04-12', 3, N'It''s ok..... Graphics are nice but it''s no dirt 2 or 3those games are way better!!!! Play dirt 2 or 3 and you will know what I''m talking about...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Perez', N'ryan.perez7010@example.org', '2016-04-12', 5, N'Great game system. Better graphics than PS3, in my opinion. I would pay up to $80 for a used xbox 360 250GB Console'),
(N'Diane', N'Raghunathan', N'diane.raghunathan2465@example.com', '2016-04-13', 4, N'My son love this Halo Xbox 360 game. Hours of playing, from start and finish.'),
(N'Priya', N'Jenkins', N'priya.jenkins3946@example.net', '2016-04-13', 5, N'I ordered the Pearl White PSP Go from Amazon Warehouse Deals for ~$100, listed as ''Like New'' condition. Seems like the price on these has gone up since they''ve been discontinued. The one got was in its original box, but it was obviously used, possibly refurbished. The box was faded and scuffed up, and there were some light scuff marks on the PSP and USB cord but otherwise the device was in amazing condition, truly was almost like new. The box also included the original printed materials, some of which was still in the original plastic wrap, and the USB data/charge cable. Looks like the AC adapter and AC cable (to plug into the wall) were missing but it''s not a big deal since USB chargers are plentiful. Oddly, the device was already turned on and fully charged right out of the box. It must have gone through some QC testing, since there was no setup involved. Also, it came with a 4GB M2 memory card installed (in addition to the 16GB internal); I am guessing this was a fluke and not...'),
(N'Kevin', N'Evans', N'kevin.evans4156@example.org', '2016-04-13', 5, N'Absolutely satisfied!!! Thank you Amazon!'),
(N'Adam', N'Webb', N'adam.webb9322@example.org', '2016-04-13', 2, N'Wasn''t in English like they said it was'),
(N'Zachary', N'Henderson', N'zachary.henderson1594@example.com', '2016-04-13', 3, N'I''ve had this game for YEARS and I haven''t gotten half way through... I don''t know why. I seriously don''t know because it''s fascinating and really unique, but I just can''t get into it, and the biggest struggle is the fact that the game ''rewards'' you for playing stealthy with as few kills as possible. This is very difficult for people who are used to just understanding bad guys+kill=win. Clear out the threat, danger''s gone. This game doesn''t want you to clear out the threat, it want''s you to momentarily hide it, do your business and move on. For a completionist like me that likes to explore every nook and cranny, that doesn''t sit right with me! So, I''ll try again someday, but if you prefer to play stealthily, you''ll enjoy this game.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Price', N'jerry.price6008@example.net', '2016-04-13', 5, N'The absolute best football game of the 8 & 16-bit era. Hut hut hut hut...'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Torres', N'evelyn.torres3097@example.com', '2016-04-13', 5, N'I for one actually liked this game. It gets a bad wrap but I can''t see why. It''s got a good premise. Price on Batman''s cowl. Villains behind the scenes. Wintery and cold night. The combat is great. Improves on Arkham City. The Batcave is a great addition as is actually being able to work with Alfred a bit. I do miss Oracle''s guidance on some stuff and other characters. Again, don''t pay full price. Catch it on Steam or Humble Bundle sale. But still get it.'),
(N'Justin', N'Bell', N'justin.bell7012@example.org', '2016-04-13', 5, N'The game was kept very clean and almost no scratches and the case was like new. I am very happy with this classic game and I know that me and my friends will have a blast tackling each other to our hearts content.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Rodriguez', N'melissa.rodriguez5537@example.org', '2016-04-14', 4, N'Fun game for a first gen'),
(N'Kevin', N'Carter', N'kevin.carter9945@example.com', '2016-04-14', 5, N'My son had gotten a pair of 100 dollar headphones from a local store from his Grandpa. Well, those broke (no fault of ours) because the microphone stopped working. We were about to purchase another pair when the man working stopped us. He told us we were going to be back in a month because that brand also had been returned a lot for this same issue. So we asked what he recommended and this is what he suggested. At first they were hard to set up. They came with parts besides the headset themselves. One for charging, one for wired, and a third was the mic. Also a usb stick to plug into whatever you plan on using it with. We use them with our Xbox One. They took almost 36 hours to charge, which was weird. The pamphlet said they will turn green when they are charged and they were red for the longest time. The cord had come unplugged during charging. So the very first thing we did was charge them. They have to be plugged into the wall, not an extension cord, otherwise the cord gets very...'),
(N'Marcus', N'Allen', N'marcus.allen2166@example.com', '2016-04-14', 5, N'Great Game! Kain and Raziel''s epic quest unfolds simultaneously in this title and... do I really need to describe this game? It is a third person action/adventure game. Very fun to play with a great, dark story.'),
(N'Larry', N'Torres', N'larry.torres2303@example.com', '2016-04-14', 5, N'gold'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Myers', N'kenneth.myers9271@example.net', '2016-04-14', 4, N'Okay has a lot of glitches'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Peterson', N'jonathan.peterson9134@example.net', '2016-04-14', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Pamela', N'Kumar', N'pamela.kumar8234@example.com', '2016-04-14', 3, N'Well received on the specified date. I will use well. Then also I would like to use.'),
(N'Carol', N'Wright', N'carol.wright2423@example.net', '2016-04-14', 4, N'I''m so happy this got an HD edition. Minus some control quirks with combat, the price was worth every penny. I honestly wish the game had more side quest, while LOOKING full and alive it''s hardly so.'),
(N'Debra', N'Miller', N'debra.miller6752@example.com', '2016-04-14', 5, N'This seller is great. I received exactly what was promised. And my game came complete and works perfectly. It was on time or arrived early. Great experience!'),
(N'Maria', N'Williams', N'maria.williams5310@example.org', '2016-04-14', 5, N'Fantastic! I ordered this for my ps4 because I have the special edition darth vader controller. These sound amazing and the mic works very well. I love how comfortable they are! Also, the mic is removable and it is flexible so you can move it around. I can wear these for hours and they don''t bother my head or ears at all. I have read some reviews saying that the headset was too quiet or that the mic doesn''t work. You have to make sure to plug the mic and the other cord into the correct hole. The mic has to be plugged into the deep hole. It fits perfectly and isn''t wobbly at all. I have no complaints and I would definitely recommend this headset.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Moore', N'ravi.moore9172@example.org', '2016-04-14', 5, N'Best headset I''ve ever listened too. I love all of it''s many many features!'),
(N'Adam', N'Stewart', N'adam.stewart3024@example.net', '2016-04-15', 5, N'It''s amazing.'),
(N'Adam', N'Stewart', N'adam.stewart3024@example.net', '2016-04-15', 5, N'Love it.'),
(N'Adam', N'Stewart', N'adam.stewart3024@example.net', '2016-04-15', 4, N'Gets repetitive but I enjoyed it.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Johnson', N'kelly.johnson2107@example.net', '2016-04-15', 5, N'It will save money on batteries and the is that of a standard controller.'),
(N'Luis', N'Wilson', N'luis.wilson3915@example.com', '2016-04-15', 5, N'Not much to add to the other reviews. Like another person said, I''m not a big fan of zombie games (I think I was scarred for life by the original PS1 Resident Evils and their infamous "tank controls," lol). I didn''t get this until the 2nd Edition because I figured it was a stealthy ultra-hard kind of game and not my thing. But I really love open world games, and when I saw how beautiful the graphics were I had to try it. Summary: great controls, great action, a cool world and story. One of my fave games of this gen thus far. I''m not really into multiplayer, but even as SP only this game is a blast. The only complaint I have is that, early on, there''s a couple jumps you have to make on story missions that were just too damn hard (and oddly later missions never require that kind of precision again... I''m thinking of setting the one light trap near the train station, and getting into the house of the insane dude who wants the video and chocolate for his dead mom. Both of those drove...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Gray', N'pamela.gray8402@example.com', '2016-04-15', 5, N'Played On: Haswell Core i7 - No overclock, 16GB of ram, SSD, GTX970 on my TV with an Xbox Gamepad. Performance: Good. With up to date drivers, I am getting a constant 60FPS with settings on MAX. I do get weird hitches when selecting bloodstains and text. Some late game areas can hitch a little bit. No crashing, and very few bugs that I can think of. Lots and lots of summon failures however. Clearly the servers are extra busy. Game? Terrifying, crawls under your skin and refuses to leave. It''s not so much a throw your controller at the wall difficulty (there is still some of that), but a suffocating presence that haunts you to your core. The boss battles are not cheaply tuned crap you might find with a AAA competitor that drives up health points and makes bullet sponges out of everything. They are events, they are accompanied by a full orchestra soundtrack, and they test not only your abilities as a gamer but your very comfort. Are you someone who puts a lot of faith in a trusty...'),
(N'Peter', N'Gomez', N'peter.gomez3255@example.net', '2016-04-15', 5, N'new in box, perfect item, awesome seller'),
(N'Melissa', N'Khan', N'melissa.khan2505@example.net', '2016-04-15', 5, N'Great Game!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Sanchez', N'ashley.sanchez9545@example.org', '2016-04-15', 1, N'Censorship is TERRIBLE. Their Localization team should be fired. Down with the Treehouse. If you don''t know what I''m talking about, go to google and search for "Bravely Second Censored" and click on the images. Or read all the thousands of articles.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Hernandez', N'douglas.hernandez5041@example.net', '2016-04-15', 5, N'This is an amazing mouse. I am not a hard-core gamer, and I play most of my games on the X-BOX ONE. On my PC I play a few games, but only World of Tanks and Armored Warfare really require the sort of precision aiming that a mouse like the Razer Ouroboros provides. Once I began to understand the role of DPI, I began to see how some players could get such great results in those games. With my regular old mouse I could not snipe as effectively because I could not isolate the area into which I was firing with the precision of those other players. As the saying goes, my eyes are wide open. But as to the mouse, it''s surprisingly light-weight. I was amazing when I took it out of the box after being so used to my Microsoft Sculpt. I use a Fingertip Grip with my mouse and so the Adjustable Palm Rest featured by the Ouroboros is not a big deal to me, though I can see where it would be to those who use a Palm Grip. Then it''s a fantastic feature and easy to adjust upward or downward by way of...'),
(N'Scott', N'Thomas', N'scott.thomas9041@example.com', '2016-04-15', 5, N'After playing skyrim on ps3 and being unable to play because of so many game breaking glitches, I was hesitant to buy this. I bought this because I have not seen many options for the xbox one in this open world rpg/shooter hybrid game. I have to say that I have thoroughly been enjoying this game! I can see myself playing this for years to come as I am the type that collects everything I find in a game with loot. The only glitch, in over 40 hours of gameplay, has been the settlers, somehow, getting on top of this one house in the first settlement. It is more funny than anything as I have to sort of herd them down after building stairs for them.'),
(N'John', N'Castillo', N'john.castillo6647@example.com', '2016-04-15', 5, N'ok. (i can not speak english. )'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Turner', N'jeremy.turner1741@example.com', '2016-04-16', 3, N'i missed the boat on pikmin 3 the first time it was released for the wii u. i didn''t actually come to own a wii u until late 2014. when mario kart 8 came out earlier that year, nintendo was doing a promotion for a free game with the purchase of mario kart. a lot of people ended up picking pikmin 3 and it ended up selling out. used copies were selling for $60 and the price for a new game was off the charts. i was getting ready to bite the bullet and purchase the digital copy of the game for $60 when luckily, I saw that nintendo was re-releasing it for $20. i bought it the day it came out, just in case it sold out again. i always thought nintendo deepened its bench when it made pikmin for the gamecube. and now that it''s reached its third installment, pikmin stands shoulder to shoulder with other great series in the nintendo catalog. affordability aside though, the game needs a much more interesting story/premise. the story from the original pikmin: you crash land on a planet and use...'),
(N'Samuel', N'Scott', N'samuel.scott2077@example.net', '2016-04-16', 5, N'These actually work really great. Sweaty thumbs make them slippery though'),
(N'Noah', N'Scott', N'noah.scott7984@example.com', '2016-04-16', 5, N'We love this game as a family. So much fun!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Butler', N'benjamin.butler3809@example.org', '2016-04-16', 5, N'[NO SPOILERS HERE] I''ve been waiting for this game since it''s initial release in Japan over a year ago and so far I have not been disappointed. I fell in love with the Bravely series because it seemed to bring back a lot of what made Final Fantasy successful originally. I''m not talking about the jRPG style, job classes, and crystals (although those are some fun throwbacks to a time long gone), but in the quirks of the characters, the goofy situations, and the ability to put the story first. No spending 45 minutes hammering buttons for 10 minutes of story. Now I get 45 minutes of story and hammer buttons for 10 minutes. In that, a lot of the positives from the first game come to the second game. Here are my list of pros and cons. Please note, t''s actually difficult to write a review for this game since it borrows so many elements from the first one. City building, the job system (along with skills and abilities), magic scrolls, and even the graphics engine and parts of the...'),
(N'Brandon', N'Wilson', N'brandon.wilson3946@example.net', '2016-04-16', 3, N'Before Konami flipped the bird against the video game industry to humiliate themselves with pachinko machines, they handled the Castlevania franchise like Sega has been with Sonic the Hedgehog; on handheld systems, the games consistently follow a formula for quality gameplay, but on consoles, it''s one experiment after another. If you find that hard to believe, you can direct yourself to Castlevania Judgment, which is most likely the result of a drunken employee asking "Y''know what the Castlevania series needs? A FIGHTING GAME!" Without beating on the game itself, I honestly have to state that I have no idea how an entire company thought this was a good idea. Was the Castlevania lineup of characters that memorable and appealing that there needed to be a fighting game featuring them? The game doesn''t seem to give me a clear answer, because I for one can recall Simon Belmont from the top of head, but in this game he looks more like a stripper than a vampire hunter. That said, I''m not...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Ortiz', N'olivia.ortiz4529@example.net', '2016-04-16', 4, N'great controller. one of the best looking controllers imo. would have liked the xbox button to light up the same blue color on the controller though.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Moore', N'michelle.moore9795@example.com', '2016-04-17', 2, N'Both the mouse and keyboard felt a bit awkward in my hands.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Gonzalez', N'evelyn.gonzalez7121@example.org', '2016-04-17', 5, N'Awesome Skylander'),
(N'Karen', N'Lewis', N'karen.lewis7779@example.com', '2016-04-17', 2, N'While the grip function for the controller itself is actually not in any way negative, the thickness surrounding the buttons make pressing anything too much of a task. The action buttons (triangle, square) are level with the rubber, so while you can feel them, they don''t have height to stand out for your fingers, making a fumble of an otherwise good play. The START button is BELOW the rubber, which is just the worst when needing to pause in a critical moment. The sticks move around find as is, but if you have any thumbstick grips or FPS extensions, it is prevented from moving to it''s maximum pitch (i.e., cannot run, only jog). If this were only concerning the wings, it''s a solid fit (hence the 2*). But the entire result is such a downgrade for the controller, as well as the constant feeling that the few thins parts keeping it all together are going to snap upon application and/or removal, I would not attempt this again.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Walker', N'christopher.walker4808@example.org', '2016-04-17', 5, N'My child love it thanks.'),
(N'Anita', N'Ward', N'anita.ward4070@example.org', '2016-04-17', 5, N'Works well, 0 complaints.'),
(N'Mary', N'Kim', N'mary.kim4972@example.org', '2016-04-17', 5, N'Eh, I wouldn''t have bought this as just a controller; I''m not a fan of the 360 design or the lack of mic support, though I am starting to appreciate wired controllers again. Otherwise, it''s all right but feels wide to me. However, as a physically disabled person, turbo functionally is essential to many games which require mashing buttons these days, and I would highly recommend this controller for that. This is the cheapest/only non-modded PS4 option that I found, which is silly, but it is what it is! For me, this got me through some annoying parts in Resident Evil 6 and got me to stage 7 in Mortal Kombat X''s Test Your Might tower. I was disappointed, however, that it didn''t take me all the way in MKX, but ah well. I only got this to help me pass necessary parts---not so much mini-games or to cheat. As of today (4/17/2016), the market for 3rd party controllers for the PS4 is lacking, so you have to take what you can get!'),
(N'Charles', N'Brown', N'charles.brown7776@example.com', '2016-04-17', 2, N'This game is all about expectations TES fans looking for the next Oblivion of Skyrim will be disappointed. Single player RPG fans will be disappointed. MMORPG fans might be adequately pleased. The game world is a gorgeous and varied expanse covering all of Tamriel and, like other TES games, the best quests are the ones you just stumble upon. However, too often the experience was broken by its online elements. There was nothing more frustrating than following the steps of a quest while other online players are a few steps ahead of and behind me. Playing solitary quests in full view of other players made the game feel less like an epic adventure and more like an elementary school scavenger hunt. People also act like idiots in towns casting spells at each other and ruining the frame rate for everyone. The game is far too easy many quests contain a "Look for clues" or "Find the suspect" step, but the quest marker will point you straight to the cleverly hidden clue or person. Also, the...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Morris', N'nathan.morris1273@example.net', '2016-04-18', 1, N'I might think better of this game IF I COULD ACTUALLY PLAY IT! Apparently, the seller made ZERO effort to determine if the person they acquired this game from had deleted the product key from Steam. Because of this, they included key is ABSOLUTELY WORTHLESS and the game is, therefore unplayable.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Martin', N'pamela.martin8287@example.net', '2016-04-18', 5, N'Worth every penny and gets it''s daily use. A body in motion tends to stay in motion, this is great for any family and helps keep up a productive life style.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Walker', N'sharon.walker5454@example.com', '2016-04-18', 5, N'Quite possibly the best looking and funnest game this gen and for a great price! If you enjoyed this series on the PS2 & PS3, there''s no reason you won''t enjoy this one. The gameplay alone makes this game worth buying.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Smith', N'marcus.smith9650@example.com', '2016-04-18', 5, N'Thanks it is a great system! We love it!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Ramirez', N'elizabeth.ramirez6710@example.com', '2016-04-18', 4, N'I was on the fence about this one, but amazon prime''s 20% off and Ashmedia''s character design made me click pre-order. I am a sucker. And I came away satisfied. 75 hours so far, I feel I kind of got lucky in that I played this game the almost ideal way. 30 hours in I beat Trillion on my last overlord on my last move by the slightest of margins and got the base ending. Played in a casual fashion, completely unaware of the tricks to become overpowered, I experienced the full spectrum of grim emotions as it felt like I trudged to my certain doom, only to spartan out a bitter victory. Had I read the boards or a guide at the get-go, I probably would have beat the game on the first overlord and missed 90% of the story and 99% of the emotional experience. 45 hours of new game plus has gotten me 5 other endings, and a mastery of the game, but now it''s so easy diminishing returns is really setting in. A traditional SRPG this is not. I''m not going to get out of this 300 hours like Advance...'),
(N'Henry', N'Raghunathan', N'henry.raghunathan9449@example.com', '2016-04-18', 1, N'As Pro Racer in Video Games and Real Life (more then with 25 year experience in Real life sport racing and Sim. Racing in Video games) Only can Say ---- Avoid this one better. Play Dirt and Dirt 2 - they were Awesome Rally Games. Or old Colin McRae Games ( Colin McRae 3,4 and 5 ). This Dirt Rally Unfortunately Not so Good like some mentioned in some Reviews. Visually - so-so, Handling - bad, gameplay a little boring. Menus - poor. Loading times - very slow. I not saying what it is Extremely & stupidly hard. If you like enjoyable Game - Stay Away. If you like waste a lot of your time & Nerves with some Stress - then this is one for you.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Bell', N'joshua.bell5010@example.com', '2016-04-18', 5, N'Definitely an upgrade from White. I was skeptical because I really wasn''t a fan of the original, but this one really made me like Unova. Definitely get the second version if you''ve only played the first one.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Ali', N'mateo.ali2761@example.org', '2016-04-18', 4, N'Good game. Nothing spectacular. Same old stuff from this franchise.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Fisher', N'andrea.fisher9729@example.com', '2016-04-18', 4, N'It is an Xbox One Controller, what can I say? It works well and my kids love it. I took away a star because I wish that it was less expensive.'),
(N'Steven', N'Khan', N'steven.khan1976@example.com', '2016-04-18', 5, N'Very durable and an awesome case, very stylish!!!! I love it thanks so much!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Powell', N'stephanie.powell3716@example.net', '2016-04-18', 5, N'This mouse pad is FREAKING awesome! It has a solid, smooth, wide surface form easy mouse placement and movement. The ambient lighting is simply beautiful and has countless color schemes. I have zero regrets purchasing this item--gamers can stop searching for gaming mouse pads because THIS IS IT!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Robinson', N'patricia.robinson7104@example.org', '2016-04-19', 4, N'I''ve used this for years, and it''s good. It''s hard to find good tenkeyless keyboards. The font looks really goofy, though (e.g. look at the "A"). And I do wish it had some basic, user-adjustable (in hardware not software) backlighting.'),
(N'Emily', N'Bell', N'emily.bell4331@example.com', '2016-04-19', 5, N'Rally is the hardest Motorsport in the world. It''s supposed to be hard! It''s supposed to be unforgiving! You''re not supposed to finish first in every stage! This game is the best a capturing all of this in a way that is entertaining, stressful, challenging, and beautiful to look at. The graphics are top notch and the sound is absolutely amazing on my home theater system. If you are a fan of sim racing, you should already have this game as it is an instant CLASSIC!! Codemasters should be commended for giving the true fans of rally what they really deserve. Bravo Codemasters!!!'),
(N'Susan', N'Mitchell', N'susan.mitchell7304@example.org', '2016-04-19', 5, N'Death. This is generally one''s first thought when it comes to the Souls series. Dark Souls 3 is no different. To start, you wake up from a coffin and explore your starting zone. Going through it, you will learn the controls and discover how much enemies can and will hurt you. Depending on which path you take, you will find out just how much this game wants you dead. If you have never played a Souls game before, each of these titles is a gauntlet of enemies, with a struggle to get to the next bonfire - your safe haven. The first thought to a new player in the series would probably be something along the lines of This is unfair. It may seem like that at first, but as you improve and learn, you will realize just how much you can do to tip the scales in your favor. Between healing, buffing, rolling, shielding and farming just to get higher stats that all work together to help you survive. Enemies are fair even if they do not always feel like it at first, with move sets that will throw...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Nowak', N'rachel.nowak4186@example.net', '2016-04-19', 5, N'This is a good product.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Henderson', N'daniel.henderson3724@example.com', '2016-04-19', 5, N'This is my first Dark Souls game but I (like many players of DS3) am coming from the amazing experience I had with Bloodborne. If this is the case with you, you should love this game and I wouldn''t hesitate to purchase it. It really feels like an extension of Bloodborne (or more accurately, Bloodborne is likely an extension of Dark Souls) so it has be a real delight jumping into this world for a second time around. The graphics and environment are spectacular in this game, everything from the stunning mountain vistas to the wails and moans of the creatures around the corner all add to a really profound sense of emersion. If you have any experience with FROM SOFTWARE games, these are very challenging experiences but that is truly what makes them special. I am not a "gamer"; intact, I scoff at that term. So I am not hardcore into this hobby by ANY means. I simply like to play a game hear and there and, enjoy the experience and then more on to other hobbies that are more fulfilling....'),
(N'Ashley', N'Edwards', N'ashley.edwards4793@example.net', '2016-04-19', 5, N'**Update Dark Souls III currently is my game of the year. Playing this game at 4k with my Titan X is a dream and it is buttery smooth. No lags or dips or problems of any kind. That being said there is some issues with the game in the form of glitches. As good as my Titan X runs the game, it runs as bad on my Fury series card at 4k and under. Also the summoning system works about 75% of the time. The other 25% you will get trapped in the wrong world, or people will float slightly off the ground and the bosses won''t attack. But don''t let those things fool you - this is very much a flawed masterpiece. It''s the Mona Lisa with a coffee stain in the corner. RPGs just don''t have this kind of depth and challenge anymore. Think about how you can play this game for a minute. You can be like me a Covenant of the Sun (Sun Bro) and help people kill bosses all day long. In theory you can get to a point and stop advancing and farm metals all day long. You can join a covenant where you invade...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Perry', N'jonathan.perry1629@example.com', '2016-04-19', 1, N'I ended up getting 3 of these as each one buzzed loud, got incredibly hot and died within two weeks, so they sent me a new one each time without even asking for the others to be returned because they know these things are garbage.'),
(N'Peter', N'Suzuki', N'peter.suzuki6032@example.net', '2016-04-20', 4, N'I like this game quite a bit. I was a huge fan of Skyrim, played that thru several times and without cheating for the most part. Elder Scrolls though is quite a bit different. Its more complicated than Skyrim, so for me I''ve only figured out less than half the things. I''m at level 11 yet I still can''t figure out how to do a lot of things yet like magica and enhancing armor which were so simple to do in Skyrim. Also at level 11, I still feel like Skyrim level 2 where every little thing can easily kill you. Some things I don''t like, first you can''t hardly get thru any quests without adding several more quests, then when you think your done with one it continues as well to something else. So I have a million open quests. Its much more difficult to figure out where to go and the maps are clunky. I would say thats my biggest gripe is figuring where to go and how to go there so that part is frustrating. In Skyrim you had roads for the most part, in ES you basically have to wonder around...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Roberts', N'kyle.roberts4281@example.com', '2016-04-20', 5, N'It is a really fun game and it seems the body tracking is more consistent than the previous title.'),
(N'Edward', N'Miller', N'edward.miller4106@example.org', '2016-04-20', 5, N'Great product charges my new lg g5 just fine. Seems really durable. Only thing is which is my doing is I lost it already lol so another in the cart I guess!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Young', N'aaron.young9705@example.com', '2016-04-20', 5, N'Fun blow them up game.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Fisher', N'kimberly.fisher7272@example.org', '2016-04-20', 5, N'Fun for the whole family .'),
(N'Dennis', N'Miller', N'dennis.miller9564@example.org', '2016-04-20', 5, N'Really like this product, I follwed the instructions. Cleaned the triggers with alcohol, before applying these to the controllers. So far they are still firmly attached and have not tried to slip or move at all. As for use, they to me give a huge upgrade to the grip of the triggers. In all games racing, or otherwise. I like them so much, I would super glue them on if they do ever try to slip off. I have ordered more of these, so I can put them on all controllers for the family.'),
(N'Anita', N'Morris', N'anita.morris6655@example.com', '2016-04-20', 5, N'The DLC thus far: Automatron and Wasteland Workshop already are outstanding. They add lots of gameplay and are perfect for people who love the crafting mechanism in FO4. Can''t wait for Far Harbor!'),
(N'Matthew', N'Flores', N'matthew.flores8662@example.com', '2016-04-20', 5, N'Bought this game for my boyfriend and I. I have not played that much yet, but he loves it. I have to yell at hime to get off the game lol. It is fun and open world. He said there is always things to do and he will never get bored of it. It is worth the money, and it is a game that will last a long time for sure. It took a while to beat the actual campaign mode, and there is a whole lot more to do on top of that.'),
(N'Michael', N'Hill', N'michael.hill2970@example.net', '2016-04-20', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Wisniewski', N'kathleen.wisniewski4720@example.net', '2016-04-20', 5, N'Awesome game....love the Dark Souls series...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Martinez', N'kelly.martinez2268@example.net', '2016-04-21', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Michelle', N'Mendoza', N'michelle.mendoza5798@example.net', '2016-04-21', 5, N'We live in a dark day: where mega-corporations excrete re-hashes of the same trite concepts, spending untold millions (nay, billions) on bloated franchises that are sustained only by the undiscerning consumer/fanboy. These "games" are padded with sickening amounts of DLC, and provide little to no entertainment. (Unless you like playing in the slums that is the worldwide multiplayer ghetto.) Oh, dark days. Now, let us recall a better time. Where there was more than just a handful of studios controlling every game we see! When DLC was often either free or totally optional! When game-developers still gathered with innovation as their goal; and quality entertainment as their result. I present to you, Star Wars Bounty Hunter. Or, The Only Reason To Buy A PS4! With relish do I play this game- even 14 years after it was first sold. It brings more white-knuckle action to my calloused fingers than the entire Call of Duty franchise has ever done for me. The pure Star Wars feel makes the...'),
(N'Mark', N'Ruiz', N'mark.ruiz3889@example.org', '2016-04-21', 5, N'2nd best Ace Combat game, great storyline, beautiful and fun game.'),
(N'Donald', N'Perez', N'donald.perez1245@example.net', '2016-04-21', 5, N'Very good game'),
(N'Donald', N'Perez', N'donald.perez1245@example.net', '2016-04-21', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Aaron', N'Mendoza', N'aaron.mendoza1069@example.com', '2016-04-21', 5, N'I love this game'),
(N'Diane', N'Garcia', N'diane.garcia7180@example.org', '2016-04-21', 2, N'Sorry, I just cant stand the future aspect of these last two COD games. The bright colors and all the robotic stuff is just a turn off for me. My 11 year old son loves it, I guess that is the aim for the developers. He is a squeaker for sure. He is good at it though. I will stick with BF4.'),
(N'Adam', N'Morales', N'adam.morales2795@example.com', '2016-04-21', 4, N'Very good case, hard to close sometimes but other than that very good case and defends the Vita well. Wish there was more game slots. Worth the money!'),
(N'Noah', N'Wood', N'noah.wood7637@example.org', '2016-04-21', 5, N'So far I am in love with this. This made playing games on Steam easier!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Butler', N'evelyn.butler3983@example.net', '2016-04-21', 5, N'The best GTA game of all times!!! I just wished they had San fierro, Los venturas and gambling like San Andreas did.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Phillips', N'kimberly.phillips1254@example.com', '2016-04-21', 1, N'Game is free on Xbox and on pc. It has been since the start don''t waste your money.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Perry', N'tomasz.perry9267@example.org', '2016-04-21', 4, N'Nothing could ever hold up to the original Super Mario Brothers, but this game gives it a good shot and mostly hits the mark!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Williams', N'benjamin.williams8505@example.net', '2016-04-21', 2, N'I pay $60 a year to use my own Internet on the Xbox One, and yet I still get advertisements. Complete waste on money and console is unstable beyond belief. Just build a PC and play with a controller...'),
(N'Ashley', N'Robinson', N'ashley.robinson5115@example.org', '2016-04-21', 1, N'Does not stay on'),
(N'Kyle', N'Perry', N'kyle.perry8647@example.net', '2016-04-22', 5, N'The game was awesome'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ramos', N'patricia.ramos2291@example.net', '2016-04-22', 5, N'This is a great case with lots of room. In even comes with a small inner case for your 3DS.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Carter', N'kenneth.carter3592@example.org', '2016-04-22', 5, N'Hooked hooked hooked! The graphics are awesome the story its beyong any other,the tv episodes are very cool and connected to the game story,i haven''t beat it yet but i know the story has two sides so you will beat twice no matter what,jack joyces powers are off the hook,love this game,this is the type of game that beat over and over again,now thats your moneys worth,good job remedy studio,more games like this are needed"this a living proof that frame rate has nothing to do with how much fun you can have with a game"'),
(N'Ivan', N'Hill', N'ivan.hill3173@example.net', '2016-04-22', 5, N'A'),
(N'Barbara', N'Singh', N'barbara.singh9491@example.com', '2016-04-22', 5, N'I absolutely love this game. It has so much to unlock and can be played solo or with up to 4 players. We have run into some game glitches, but re-running through the level has perks and usually resets the problem.'),
(N'Omar', N'Turner', N'omar.turner3527@example.com', '2016-04-22', 5, N'Awesome keyboard! I wanted to find a nice back lit keyboard to match with my mouse, and this is working out fantastically! I''ve had to for about 2 months now and it''s really enjoyable. I love how you can not only change the colors of the backlights, but how bright they are! My only minor issue is that the backlights go to sleep after being AFK for about 10 minutes, but it''s a really superficial issue and feel that it doesn''t/shouldn''t count against this keyboard.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Rogers', N'evelyn.rogers2679@example.net', '2016-04-22', 3, N'My son wanted this to go on his portable game system. He uses it to help with cheat codes in Pokemon games on his Nintendo 3DS. This thing was great in the beginning. It worked for about 3 weeks and he was having a blast using it, but then it stopped working and was basically just trash. I would say I did get the money worth use out of it before it broke. I think this item was made poorly. In my opinion I think it is done on purpose so parent will shell out more money to get their children a new ones once the first one breaks.'),
(N'Angela', N'Harris', N'angela.harris5958@example.org', '2016-04-22', 4, N'was hard to navigate for my 7yr old; ;lost interest but my 19yr old love it'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Peterson', N'hiroshi.peterson5734@example.com', '2016-04-23', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Matthew', N'Ward', N'matthew.ward8911@example.net', '2016-04-23', 5, N'Got as a gift. Never saw them again.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Coleman', N'kathleen.coleman1418@example.com', '2016-04-23', 3, N'I really want to shower this game with praise, since I''ve been a fan of Ratchet & Clank since the beginning. Sadly, except for the updated visuals, this game felt flat and uninspired. First, the good points. As others have said, it looks beautiful. It has the polish you''d expect in a modern game, and I personally loved seeing old favorites redone in gorgeous new colors, lighting, and detail. The colors are especially vibrant, sometimes almost over-saturated. Insomniac has polished Ratchet''s movements to perfection. His pace and the ability to turn him exactly the amount you want are excellent, so you''re not always taking an extra step and stumbling off ledges because your foot went one pixel past the touchpoint. OMG, I''m so glad the hoverboard races have been trimmed to three levels, bronze, silver, and gold, and are actually winnable for once. Also, controlling your ship during the few flying parts is much improved. I like this system for weapons upgrades. That''s it. Here, then,...'),
(N'Wei', N'Patel', N'wei.patel3648@example.net', '2016-04-23', 5, N'REALLY great HD, just as good as the old one BUT BETTER, the amiibo is super cool'),
(N'Noah', N'Patel', N'noah.patel2873@example.org', '2016-04-23', 4, N'I''m not really understanding some of the hate this game is getting. While I was skeptical of the motion controls and use of both the TV and the Gamepad, switching between the two to play, I must say that it''s not really a hindrance to enjoying the game at all. Quite honestly, I''m actually digging the controls quite a bit. That said, there is some patience and learning required when controlling the different forms. I''m seeing some people criticize the graphics, however I must disagree with the notion that the graphics are bad. Are they realistic? No. Are they amazing? No. Are they vibrant and detailed enough? Definitely. Personally, I think Star Fox Zero is a nice looking game. It''s not striving for realism, nor should it. Could some textures and ground surfaces use some more detail? Sure. But that doesn''t make this game bad looking, in my opinion. As I said, I think it''s a nice looking game and think people just expect way too much nowadays. Gameplay, as stated, does take some...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Young', N'joyce.young7059@example.org', '2016-04-23', 5, N'As a grown man, this is one of the greatest games I''ve ever played. Too many great things to list. Seriously, treat yourself to this incredible adventure. Also, give the mini card game Gwent a chance while playing The Witcher 3. Once you get into it, you get hooked! I love the music in this game too, it''s memorizing in the best way possible. Cheers, happy gaming. God Bless.'),
(N'Emily', N'King', N'emily.king9832@example.com', '2016-04-23', 5, N'Great StarFox game! Motion controls take some getting used to, but allow for creative and accurate shooting. Framerate is super smooth. Overall, highly recommended unless you couldn''t handle Splatoon''s motion controls.'),
(N'Maria', N'Wilson', N'maria.wilson3887@example.net', '2016-04-23', 5, N'very nice game, love the rally cross'),
(N'Paul', N'Singh', N'paul.singh4706@example.com', '2016-04-23', 4, N'I can completely understand people''s frustrations with this game. But let me just put in a plug for this being a really fun game to buy if you have someone who can play it with you. In co-pilot mode one person pilots the aircraft (with a pro controller or remote + nunchuck) and the other person aims and fires the aircrafts weaponry with the gamepad. The pilot gets to dodge and evade enemy fire and objects; while the gunner gets the satisfaction of taking out enemies that are above, below, and on either side. It also requires a lot of communication between the two because the gunner may not know why the pilot had to turn a certain direction or that there are enemies on particular side of them. In this mode of play, it seems to also have a lot of replay value because you get better at communicating and identifying targets as you play more. You can beat a level by the skin of your pants, but coordinating how you maneuver and how you take out enemies to perfection seems like it would...'),
(N'Andrea', N'Bennett', N'andrea.bennett9032@example.org', '2016-04-23', 5, N'I like this game. Me and my brother played Star Fox 64 for an insane amount of hours to unlock everything we could, always trying to beat our previous high scores. This game feels fairly similar with the addition of the motion controls and a few different vehicles. I''m not a fan of some of the new vehicle sections as they seem to take away from what I really enjoyed from the franchise - the on rail shooting. The motion controls are a bit strange to get used to at first but I don''t find them distracting or horrible. Moving the Arwing also aims so trying to move and motion aim never really works for me. Occasionally the TV view will switch to a cinematic "lock on" mode while you still have control via the game pad and this can be awkward looking back and forth to watch what''s happening but also see where you are going. At the same time you can manual lock on to find your objective while still aiming with the game pad and I love that feature. It has the laser upgrades, gold rings,...'),
(N'George', N'Perez', N'george.perez8909@example.org', '2016-04-23', 3, N'Had high hopes for this game but walked away mostly disappointed. The large cast of characters with varied move sets and styles was fun for a short while but grew tiresome with the lack of goals to work towards. Most of thr characters I did not even reckonize. DBZ, Yuyu, and kenshin (basically Toonami) were ones I was really interested in. Could have used a Gundam to spice it up.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Wilson', N'rebecca.wilson2391@example.net', '2016-04-23', 5, N'great'),
(N'Charles', N'Smith', N'charles.smith3316@example.net', '2016-04-23', 1, N'S*** next gen controller around, breaks down very quickly, joystick doesn''t work, batteries don''t energize it, d pad registers multiple clicks, bumpers require very hard pressing; ****y controller. 360 controller is wayyyy better. Somehow they took a classic and spent 100 million turning it into a pile of crap.'),
(N'Heather', N'Wood', N'heather.wood1012@example.com', '2016-04-23', 5, N'In truth this is the best expansion I''ve ever played on any game. It''s not a tiny DLC. I would say I put probably 2/3rd if not the same amount of time into this as the original game. Unlike the original, tightly controlled city, this is wide-open and I''ll admit at first it introduced some annoyances for me. Most glaringly: night time is truly dangerous this time. In the main city, in the first game, grappling hook allowed escapes from volatiles at night. Not possible in the woods. And when you''re in your car these volatiles go way faster than when on foot. However, in time once the car is faster, has UV light upgrade 2 (crucial!) and electric cage, the car becomes a true safe haven. By the end of the game I was able to navigate at night without issue--outrunning/stopping any volatiles that came along. As for the story, to be honest, who cares. It''s thin, but this is an open world game and they are always light on story IMO. The new driving skill rank and legendary points are...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Lewis', N'stephen.lewis2932@example.org', '2016-04-23', 5, N'Game in perfect condition'),
(N'Sandra', N'Bennett', N'sandra.bennett9883@example.net', '2016-04-24', 1, N'Bought this in 2016, Around April (so just over a year ago.) And about a month ago it just stopped working, I kept receiving an error that there was corruption on the hard drive, and needed to reset it. However every time i tried the system crashed, and failed to boot. After switching the power off/on it restarted up. I ended up sending it in, and having it returned with a "Sorry nothing we can do". I got my little brother one of the first Xbox One console, came with a day one silver card dated in 2013 and everything. His works fine and hes constantly moving! Mine stayed in the same spot for 11 months and broke.'),
(N'Luis', N'Chen', N'luis.chen1312@example.com', '2016-04-24', 1, N'Does not work'),
(N'Dennis', N'Coleman', N'dennis.coleman2375@example.com', '2016-04-24', 5, N'feels just like a PS3 controller, but has the appearance of the xbox 360 controller. Pretty good quality and it rumbles too!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Davis', N'sofia.davis6417@example.net', '2016-04-24', 5, N'great'),
(N'Brenda', N'Russell', N'brenda.russell3022@example.net', '2016-04-24', 5, N'Super fun.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Sanders', N'ethan.sanders9157@example.com', '2016-04-25', 5, N'As good as shown'),
(N'Amara', N'Castillo', N'amara.castillo4400@example.org', '2016-04-25', 4, N'Its a good game and I thought all the new features added to the depth of the games, and this is a great entry point to the series. However if you are a long time fan like me you will notice that the game is extremely easy, not even the elite 4 or champion felt like a challenge, i breezed through this game and still had fun but i feel it''s a bit to easy even though the series is target towards younger players. I also thought that the story was meh, and your three rival characters were just stereotypes and lacked any personality but its still a good game and I recommend it to fans.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Wright', N'tyler.wright1212@example.com', '2016-04-25', 5, N'very good.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Perez', N'amanda.perez5617@example.com', '2016-04-25', 5, N'This game was really Great on Pc now i can play it on console once it arives cant wait ^.^'),
(N'Victoria', N'Turner', N'victoria.turner1111@example.net', '2016-04-25', 5, N'Great system. This is what the PS3 should have been. I really love the rest mode feature.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Myers', N'alexander.myers4905@example.org', '2016-04-25', 3, N'For a game based on a movie that I''ve honestly never even seen I spent a lot of time as a kid playing this. It''s got its quirks but it''s a pretty solid game. Everything from vampires to one on one martial arts to shooting up various places in fire fights.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Morris', N'hiroshi.morris5776@example.org', '2016-04-25', 4, N'Product very good condition . good game.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Lopez', N'barbara.lopez9985@example.com', '2016-04-25', 1, N'THE FORCED MOTION CONTROLS ARE HORRENDOUS. You wait eons for Nintendo to make a Star Fox game and you''d think they can''t go wrong with Platinum and when it''s finally here, they had to shove those awful MANDATORY motion controls JUST to make a point the Game Pad wasn''t a complete failure. Well it is Nintendo, and can''t you at least say it with an option. Your pack states the Pro Controller can be used .. but NOh, it''s not Mario, it''s not Zelda. Well, not expecting a lot from who insist on Fedration Force. I mean you''re Nintendo, you''re above listening to fans .. pff. Also, the explosion effects were cheap.'),
(N'Michael', N'Nguyen', N'michael.nguyen6712@example.net', '2016-04-25', 4, N'This is a great game. I really enjoy it overall. I like that you can speed up and slow down the time, so you don''t have to wait forever for crops and various things, but you don''t have to always speed through it either. I like the new additions they have added in the equipment aspect also. Still could use some updating in that department though. The graphics are ok. My only complaint is multiplayer. It is fun, but still very glitchy. Hopefully that can be straightened out soon. Great game to pass time while enjoying life on the farm.'),
(N'Helen', N'Coleman', N'helen.coleman2916@example.org', '2016-04-25', 5, N'What is a Souls Game and how does it compare to the others? The Dark Souls games, and Bloodborne were created by a Japanese company called From Software. The Souls series is an extremely challenging action RPG series set in a horror fantasy universe. You have a small health bar and several hits from just about any enemy will kill you. This forces you to learn the attack patterns of all of the enemies, use the environment to your advantage, and look for weaknesses in their defenses. So, every encounter and boss fight in the game is like a puzzle. You''ll take hits and die a few times trying to figure out the enemies, but once you do, you''ll take them down like a pro. Playing Dark Souls is both a punishing and rewarding experience, that you won''t find anywhere else. Dark Souls 3 plays very much like the previous Souls games, and less like Bloodborne. The ramp up seems better in DS3. The beginning levels are pretty easy and youll get a few hundred souls. The later levels are much more...'),
(N'Sandra', N'Boyd', N'sandra.boyd8533@example.com', '2016-04-25', 4, N'It''s great. It''s fun. It plays games with fantastic head-tracking 3d. But there is no charger in the box. I had to go to the store the day after this arrived and buy one used. Also the top scratches really easily. So protect it well.'),
(N'Amara', N'Price', N'amara.price6799@example.com', '2016-04-25', 5, N'I''ve been a Fire Emblem fan for years. I love the latest releases and am glad they had these DLC as options instead of buying the game for full price. I, unfortunately, missed out on the special releases for this one so this was a nice fill in on the price break.'),
(N'Dee', N'Nelson', N'dee.nelson1957@example.com', '2016-04-26', 5, N'Works great.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Powell', N'zachary.powell5808@example.org', '2016-04-26', 3, N'My daughter played with it till almost the end - then she got kind of bored with it. It was good for a few weeks. I say borrow and get another game to purchase.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Tanaka', N'evelyn.tanaka4855@example.org', '2016-04-26', 5, N'Very good sim...waited years to fly these older aircraft.'),
(N'Charles', N'Peterson', N'charles.peterson2940@example.com', '2016-04-26', 5, N'This game is the sole reason I bought a Wii U. Even in my mid 20s, I play this game with coworkers and friends regularly. If you have a Wii U already and don''t own this game, buy it. You won''t regret it.'),
(N'Susan', N'Scott', N'susan.scott5427@example.org', '2016-04-26', 3, N'It''s more of the same. I expected something different and exciting but it''s more like an expansion for X/Y.'),
(N'Jose', N'Kim', N'jose.kim6999@example.net', '2016-04-26', 5, N'Nice!'),
(N'Amara', N'Clark', N'amara.clark7706@example.org', '2016-04-26', 1, N'the game didn''t work but seller did give a full refund.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Bell', N'dennis.bell7246@example.net', '2016-04-26', 5, N'Got this new in box works good'),
(N'Debra', N'Rivera', N'debra.rivera3088@example.com', '2016-04-26', 5, N'Great game that keeps on getting better with the addition of free updates from EA!'),
(N'Donald', N'Singh', N'donald.singh5582@example.org', '2016-04-26', 3, N'It''s a nice game in the series but the thing which bothers me the most is how small the towns are they''re probably the smallest towns in the series and there''s only 4 fossils you can dig up a day which is annoying when you depend on them for bells when you''re trying off the cheap-skate Tom Nooks'),
(N'Kyle', N'Anderson', N'kyle.anderson5051@example.com', '2016-04-26', 5, N'Great game! I have bought it twice on different systems and loved playing them! I have beaten these games multiple times and it never gets old!'),
(N'James', N'Torres', N'james.torres2019@example.com', '2016-04-26', 5, N'I''ve already clocked about 4 hours into Quantum Break, and I am loving the ride so far. I didn''t expect to like the TV show portion of the game, but I think it''s absolutely fantastic. The acting, story, and writing are all top notch. And as good as the TV show is, the gameplay in Quantum Break is even better. The time-stopping mechanics are a blast, and they''re handled very wel'),
(N'James', N'Torres', N'james.torres2019@example.com', '2016-04-26', 5, N'i love this game i may be young but i have collected and played a lot of games in my time this game out of all of them is the most heart touching game i have played while getting you connected with the characters there is enough mix of happy moments/sad moments that both make you cry yet enough action/story telling to keep you on your toes you don''t know what''s going to happen next or how it is going to happen this game is a perfect mix of everything'),
(N'Henry', N'Robinson', N'henry.robinson8778@example.org', '2016-04-26', 4, N'works, but I found out I did not neec the batteries because my solar torches are out of commision'),
(N'Christina', N'Barnes', N'christina.barnes7605@example.org', '2016-04-26', 4, N'These are nice grips but the options button is hard to press and the joystick gets stopped short a bit.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Carol', N'Kelly', N'carol.kelly6474@example.net', '2016-04-27', 3, N'Works, but it did take a chunk out of my controller as the 3.5mm can change its angle and mess things up.'),
(N'Amy', N'Russell', N'amy.russell4071@example.net', '2016-04-27', 5, N'great old classic video game. very enjoyable'),
(N'Alexander', N'Brooks', N'alexander.brooks3785@example.com', '2016-04-27', 4, N'Disclosure: I am not a long time fan of the Dark Souls series, but really enjoyed Bloodborne so I wanted to try it out. This game is great. It gives much of the same challenge and elation that players of FromSoftware titles have been known for and looks really good while doing it. I found it very easy to get hooked into this game, always wanting to progress further to the next bonfire or boss battle. I died quite a few times but kept wanting to go back again to get through it by planning my attacks more carefully or bypassing certain enemies. After putting many hours into the game I had beaten all bosses and most of the smaller enemies... except one. Most of the bosses were somewhat challenging for me even after coming fresh off of my first Bloodborne play-through. This challenge was seldom any more than a little bit frustrating due to the fact that I knew I could beat the enemy since tactics became clear through repetition. I played through the whole game and found the last two...'),
(N'Jessica', N'Bailey', N'jessica.bailey8510@example.org', '2016-04-27', 2, N'First, I realize many here love this mouse and I''m just going to give my personal opinion. By no means am I a fanboy of any vendor in any way. Whoever make the best gets my business. Ive been using the Logitech G502 for a few weeks and wanted to compare them to see if I would like the Razer better. If it was, I would switch. What I found was there really is no comparison. The Razer feels like a toy compared to the latter. The buttons feel cheap and the mouse feels hollow. As soon as my hand perspired playing Black Ops 3 it became very slippery. It was a little lighter which was welcomed since the G502 starts off at what I consider borderline heaviness for me. When I tried to install the Razor drivers/software I was forced to create an account and "Log In". Whats even worse is I had to log in each time I tried to run the Synapse. I don''t know about you, but I''m not comfortable with software that makes me sign in every time I want to use my mouse. If you don''t run the software you...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Morales', N'rachel.morales1135@example.org', '2016-04-27', 5, N'I have gaming headphones that cost $15 and a set that cost me over $300. It is fair to say that I have not expected to ever have a set of headphones even come close to the $300 pair, but these far exceeded my expectations. Due to having a toddler who was curious, my $300 pair broke and I needed new ones. This set of headphones have honestly blown me away. It is truly a fantastic set that does compare almost equally to the $300 pair without costing even near as much. . If you will simply be using these for music and sound, there is no need to install the software. The plug is a USB plug that fit right into my computer. If you want to use the microphone however, you do need to install the software. The directions in the booklet are not translated to an understandable level, but the software disk was easy to install. I simply clicked through the set up and within minutes was gaming in no time. At no point was I confused. The design makes these headphones extremely comfortable to wear....'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Richardson', N'jeffrey.richardson4603@example.org', '2016-04-27', 4, N'The wheel and pedals work very well, as they should. The steering wheel has very good feedback and it is very responsive. The paddle shifters work exactly as they should and they feel pretty seamless in game. I would prefer it greatly if the paddles did not click so loud when pulled, but that''s a personal preference. The pedals are a bit of a letdown, as they do not stay still on the floor, and the base will lift up if you accidentally press too quickly on the brake in a panic. I wish that there was a better way for the pedal board to be made, but it would require a larger base, taking up more packing and shelf space. The steering wheel MUST be mounted on a table, game cockpit, or something of that nature. The force feedback is strong enough that the steering wheel WILL lift off the table if not secured. I mounted the wheel to a wood TV tray, and it worked pretty well, although it is slightly unstable due to the weight on one side of the table. You can counter that by putting some...'),
(N'Donald', N'Kumar', N'donald.kumar2820@example.net', '2016-04-27', 5, N'I played the original on Vita, and this remaster is better in every way.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Ross', N'lucia.ross6150@example.com', '2016-04-27', 4, N'It''s July, 1951. An alien race known as the Chimera have taken over Europe. This bizarre alien race has moved westward to infect the entire European continent with a virus that transforms its people into ugly gun-wielding monsters. World War II never happens in this story but humanity''s cities still fell. In the midst of this, players assume the role of Sergeant Nathan Hale, a tough-as-nails American soldier that joins Britain''s final defense effort. That''s where your story begins. At first glance, you''d be forgiven for thinking this game was a Medal of Honor or Call of Duty game. The land you see before you looks like something out of those games with rubble and steel littered everywhere around you. That''s where it ends. When you face your first enemy, you realize it''s something quite different. The atmosphere in the game is what makes it so special. At times, it''s can be extremely creepy, especially when you''re going through dark corridors amd maze-like tunnels. When you think...'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Turner', N'stephanie.turner7472@example.com', '2016-04-27', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Richard', N'Barnes', N'richard.barnes9009@example.net', '2016-04-27', 4, N'Fun times once again'),
(N'Michelle', N'Wright', N'michelle.wright5324@example.net', '2016-04-27', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Cox', N'ethan.cox8711@example.net', '2016-04-27', 5, N'This mouse looks really, really cool. Quite possibly the coolest looking (wireless) mouse ever? It really looks like it''s a living thing, advanced alien technology. It looks like a transformer/alien bug or something, but one that looks very sleek at the same time. The packaging is nice and I felt like I was opening a jewelry when I first opened and saw the mouse in the flesh. It''s a sexy mouse! But it doesn''t just stop there with the aesthetics. The engineering design and performance of this mouse really impressed me even more. What surprised me the most was how you can actually detach the side buttons completely and put on a cover for a more minimalist standard mouse; or if you''re left handed, attach the side buttons just on the right side; or have just keep both of them on! What''s even cooler and fantastic is how those buttons attach magnetically, so very convenient to put them on and off easily; I can see this being a really cool feature/technology where you could replace and...'),
(N'Andrea', N'Allen', N'andrea.allen4621@example.org', '2016-04-28', 3, N'I realize that I''m in the minority but I thought that the game really suffered from a disjointed and ambiguous story, the Achilles heel of the Metal Gear series. The gameplay is polished and flawless, and allows for much enjoyment.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Ferreira', N'marcus.ferreira3772@example.com', '2016-04-28', 5, N'From the first few moments I used this keyboard I could tell it was going to be one of my favorites. The keys are loud when you press them, but move so smoothly, requiring almost no effort to push down each key. The overall board is heavier in weight, but solid-feeling. It was really surprising to experience the ease of pressing each key considering its density but I''m very happy with it. I''ve used keyboards that cost similar amounts and while they have common features, this one is simply easier to use. In other words, better than the competition.'),
(N'Emma', N'Murphy', N'emma.murphy5590@example.com', '2016-04-28', 5, N'Good for the price!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Chavez', N'aisha.chavez6625@example.com', '2016-04-28', 5, N'All good...fast and easy and works as advertised'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Sullivan', N'jeremy.sullivan7264@example.net', '2016-04-28', 5, N'IMO, best game i''ve played on xbox one so far ! I''m not for writing out long reviews, just know this game is gorgeous and is a load of fun, i''ve been playing for around a month now and i''m still having tons of fun !! Get it.... you won''t regret it !!!!!'),
(N'Maria', N'Evans', N'maria.evans6452@example.net', '2016-04-28', 5, N'I have only played through the first one so far but it was already worth it.'),
(N'Amara', N'Phillips', N'amara.phillips3115@example.net', '2016-04-28', 5, N'Everything is good'),
(N'Daniel', N'Turner', N'daniel.turner1412@example.net', '2016-04-28', 5, N'Great game. A must play.'),
(N'Charles', N'Suzuki', N'charles.suzuki6286@example.org', '2016-04-28', 5, N'nice product, thank you'),
(N'Sandra', N'Adams', N'sandra.adams5232@example.org', '2016-04-28', 3, N'The game was ok kind of hard to play the 2 player on it.'),
(N'Laura', N'Sanders', N'laura.sanders6566@example.net', '2016-04-28', 5, N'This controler is better then there first design buttons feel tighter. 3.5mm plug is nice with on screen settings for mic. The only thing I don''t like is that it feels heavier but that might be in my head. Overall very good controller.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Powell', N'sofia.powell3570@example.org', '2016-04-28', 5, N'Good rpg'),
(N'David', N'Khan', N'david.khan1262@example.com', '2016-04-28', 5, N'Back when I first played this in 1999 it became a "must have" game for my super Nintendo library game collection. At that time I was too young to have the money to buy it but to this day I have a job and still love playing retro video games, so it took me eons to get this game cause of the rarity and the ridiculous amount they charge just for this game. But because I wanted it so bad I didn''t care if I spent $75 for it. Cause I don''t have much bills to pay. But anyway this game happens to be my all time favorite side scrolling sock em games compared to Battle Toads and Spiderman: Separation anxiety. if your a die hard ninja turtles fan, BUY IT!! you won''t be sorry and the sound track of the game has amazing funk :)'),
(N'Timothy', N'Sanchez', N'timothy.sanchez6735@example.net', '2016-04-28', 5, N'It''s a pretty fun game. The zombie map is insane'),
(N'James', N'Foster', N'james.foster7024@example.net', '2016-04-28', 5, N'This is a great expansion and well worth owning. As a matter a fact, if you are a true Sims 3 fan and you don''t own this one, well you must have a fever or something. Seasons is my favorite expansion because of the weather and holidays, but World Adventures seems to be synonymous with the base game itself. It offers 3 new worlds, but you can''t get to them from a new game stand point. Just like "In to the Future", you have to be in a game already started in order to play this one. Once you master enough Visa points to stay in one of the three worlds, you can only stay for 2 weeks or 15 days and then you have to return home for 2 days, refresh and come back. It''s kind of crazy the way EA makes these conditions. I like the new lifetime reward "never have to pay bills again" After you earn 15000 lifetime points, this becomes an option. The first I always go for.'),
(N'Anna', N'Lewis', N'anna.lewis8439@example.com', '2016-04-29', 5, N'Yes, this is a worthwhile game to buy if you''ve played Black or White. It''s a direct sequel to those games, which is unusual in the Pokemon game universe. The story line is very different, so it''s not a repeat of what you did in Black or White. All in all, I enjoyed it very much.'),
(N'Henry', N'Gomez', N'henry.gomez7069@example.org', '2016-04-29', 5, N'Great alternative to using the NCsoft website. Wish it was still active.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Roberts', N'kyle.roberts4134@example.com', '2016-04-29', 5, N'It was an amazing controller that made a great gift.'),
(N'Christopher', N'White', N'christopher.white9980@example.net', '2016-04-29', 5, N'Even if I don''t really understand what these are for apparently they are awesome. My kids have to have them and everytime I find a good set at a good price I get them. These are disks for vehicles or clothing or decor etc in the Disney infinity game. This set only works on 3.0 so have to have the newest game. I don''t know what exactily these all do yet as I wasn''t in there when they tried them but my kids thanked me several times so must be pretty good!!'),
(N'Anita', N'Coleman', N'anita.coleman6674@example.net', '2016-04-29', 4, N'This is my first wheel, It works really well I haven''t had any problems with it, my driving using a regular controller was already good this has made it even better. It''s worth it if your looking to improve your driving skills in game, it does not have force feedback I am looking into getting one with feedback to see the difference if there is any. This wheel is very sturdy it can be mounted to a flat table easily, the pedals are good sometimes it will slide even on carpet other than that it''s good.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Kumar', N'deborah.kumar6379@example.com', '2016-04-29', 5, N'love it great for the price'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Wood', N'evelyn.wood5164@example.org', '2016-04-29', 5, N'Working great. ... very good price. ..'),
(N'Maria', N'Evans', N'maria.evans7247@example.com', '2016-04-29', 5, N'Works great!'),
(N'Scott', N'Gray', N'scott.gray6693@example.com', '2016-04-29', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Scott', N'Gray', N'scott.gray6693@example.com', '2016-04-29', 5, N'I like it'),
(N'Ravi', N'Foster', N'ravi.foster6458@example.com', '2016-04-29', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Myers', N'nicholas.myers5937@example.org', '2016-04-29', 5, N'Good, this support Chinese.'),
(N'Justin', N'Fisher', N'justin.fisher2372@example.net', '2016-04-30', 5, N'excellent game, I loved it.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Nowak', N'jerry.nowak4521@example.com', '2016-04-30', 5, N'About 30% done with the game but I can honestly say I love it! The storyline is very well thought out and allows the gamer to explore the surrouding areas and actually think about what they are doing. Can''t wait for the next installment!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Lewis', N'jacob.lewis7109@example.com', '2016-04-30', 5, N'A classic made better, the extra classes, the fixed dialog, and the fact that Ramza can be a Dark Knight making him the hardest hitting member in your party make this game totally worth playing.'),
(N'Christina', N'Mendoza', N'christina.mendoza3523@example.net', '2016-04-30', 3, N'couldn''t keep it- made my ears too hot'),
(N'Frank', N'Lee', N'frank.lee5251@example.com', '2016-04-30', 5, N'You know what makes this game so great is it is different. It is unlike anything you have ever played on a console before. I don''t know whether to describe this experience as a two hour movie that affects a video game, or a video game that affects a two hour movie. Either way it is a great story and a great twist on time travel. Very few games out there have it all and this game pretty much has it all. Great story Great acting....good Lord is there a better game with better acting in it? Great graphics. This game is absolutely gorgeous in every way. Great game play. Hard enough it is challenging and fun, but not too difficult that you are curing your dead grandmother. If you own an Xbox One this is a must play.'),
(N'Wei', N'Allen', N'wei.allen2685@example.com', '2016-04-30', 2, N'A really good fighting game untill you get to the tougher bosses. The difficulty spikes to infinite with a massive green giant named the big zam who covers have the screen, has lasers & missiles, its freaking feet can hurt you... How is this fair? He destroys you But it gets harder Another green giant with no legs. But giant booster rockets, arms that stab & fires at you. Finaly is physco gundam I never got that far but omg its too much'),
(N'Nicole', N'Young', N'nicole.young8918@example.net', '2016-04-30', 5, N'Sturdy and amazing quality. So far had no problems with them.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Roberts', N'deborah.roberts3559@example.org', '2016-04-30', 5, N'Useful for Xbox'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Jackson', N'hiroshi.jackson4222@example.org', '2016-04-30', 5, N'You can play original Game Boy games on a SP or Game Boy Advance.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Raghunathan', N'kimberly.raghunathan6733@example.org', '2016-04-30', 5, N'I absolutely adore the Legend of Zelda series. I have loved all of the games. The reason I''ve waited this long to write out my opinion of this Zelda game is because I am often guilty of being "blinded" by initial hype. I make it clear that there is no "bad" Zelda game, I have enjoyed them all through and through, but I often let my initial excitement of playing a new game, Zelda or not, cloud my judgement of its flaws. This happened with "Skyward Sword" back in 2011. Now that I have looked at Skyward Sword more critically, I am definitely aware of its flaws, such as its unnecessary fetch quests and more cumbersome than necessary companion. Furthermore, it is arguably one of the most "linear" Zelda''s to date. Even with that said, I still love Skyward Sword, it is a flawed game, but a great one none the less. The reason I bring that up at the start is because I have had time to think about this one Zelda game over the past few years, and have heard the endless praise of it being...'),
(N'Frank', N'Gomez', N'frank.gomez2105@example.org', '2016-04-30', 5, N'And it works. Not much else to say. Good build quality.'),
(N'Mary', N'Raghunathan', N'mary.raghunathan5273@example.com', '2016-04-30', 5, N'This Collection is Excellent, the Kratos Statue has good details and he look like he''s ready for battle, i like that, and the Steel Case is nice to ^_^'),
(N'Andrea', N'Taylor', N'andrea.taylor1268@example.org', '2016-05-01', 4, N'easy set up and cheap mic if you need a mic but don''t care too much about quality this is for you'),
(N'Frank', N'Patel', N'frank.patel4536@example.com', '2016-05-01', 5, N'Fire Emblem: Awakening was an epic adventure even before the glut of DLC became available. Thanks to its undeniable global success, Nintendo has made it one of their key Intellectual Properties (a bit late, considering the hugely loyal fanbase after Rekka no Ken was released for the GBA. Awakenings was the first English language Fire Emblem to allow players to insert themselves in the game. To make the immersion more complete, players could marry and have children with the comrade of their choice, taking shipping to a whole new level. The player''s avatar had a role in the plot of Awakenings, and this is taken to 11 here in Fates. After a few introductory missions to ease players into the game, the player must choose whether to side with Nohr, their adopted family, or Hoshido, their country they were ruthlessly kidnapped from. There is also another choice, Revelations, DLC only, where you attempt to forge an independent path. Birthright is a gentle way to ease new players into the...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Campbell', N'kelly.campbell2829@example.net', '2016-05-01', 5, N'I love this game'),
(N'Jason', N'Johnson', N'jason.johnson1325@example.org', '2016-05-01', 4, N'The game is free now I bought this product two months before the expansion so no real complaints'),
(N'Jack', N'Okonkwo', N'jack.okonkwo7120@example.com', '2016-05-01', 3, N'One of them fit properly and didn''t receive the full set. They look great though and I understand mistakes happen as to why I''m not giving a worse review!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Brooks', N'douglas.brooks8733@example.org', '2016-05-01', 5, N'Grate!'),
(N'Robert', N'Garcia', N'robert.garcia5804@example.com', '2016-05-01', 5, N'Works well. Easy to get up and going'),
(N'Robert', N'Garcia', N'robert.garcia5804@example.com', '2016-05-01', 5, N'Love this game. I was lucky enough to get this version'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman3266@example.com', '2016-05-01', 5, N'I got this for my bf for all of his random gaming needs and it works with pretty much all the games he needs it to be used for ...for the pc.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Miller', N'ivan.miller7117@example.com', '2016-05-01', 5, N'I was very pleased with this product. It arrived on time and the games were great. A very good buy for those who love games.'),
(N'Priya', N'Hall', N'priya.hall5534@example.com', '2016-05-01', 5, N'I love this game.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Anderson', N'lucia.anderson7443@example.net', '2016-05-02', 5, N'We love the infinity toys (Adults and Kids). Can''t beat Amazon''s prices.'),
(N'Angela', N'Sanders', N'angela.sanders3674@example.net', '2016-05-02', 3, N'WORKS GOOD'),
(N'Carlos', N'Hall', N'carlos.hall5131@example.com', '2016-05-02', 5, N'Great! As described! Thanks'),
(N'Paul', N'Diaz', N'paul.diaz1311@example.com', '2016-05-02', 5, N'No where else will you find a deal like this!'),
(N'Omar', N'Boyd', N'omar.boyd7747@example.com', '2016-05-02', 5, N'excellent mouse'),
(N'Robert', N'Evans', N'robert.evans4012@example.org', '2016-05-02', 5, N'Perfect product'),
(N'Melissa', N'Chen', N'melissa.chen8702@example.com', '2016-05-02', 1, N'Bad quality sounds like listening through a tin can, just one of the worst microphones I''ve vever used'),
(N'William', N'Lee', N'william.lee2420@example.net', '2016-05-03', 5, N'exactly what i needed'),
(N'Ravi', N'Bell', N'ravi.bell5885@example.net', '2016-05-03', 5, N'greatness awaits'),
(N'Pamela', N'Turner', N'pamela.turner7776@example.net', '2016-05-03', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Andrew', N'Cook', N'andrew.cook8735@example.org', '2016-05-03', 5, N'This is my first FarCry game ever. I wish I were home playing now. It is similar to a lot of other games with the way you collect items, complete missions, similar to SkyRim, Shadow of Mordor, Assassin''s Creed, etc. I however enjoy the Primal aspect without firearms, it gives a great twist to the usual paradigm.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Taylor', N'benjamin.taylor2024@example.org', '2016-05-03', 5, N'I love all the just dance games and I love that every so often it adds a new song and dance to the mix!'),
(N'Alexander', N'Parker', N'alexander.parker6599@example.net', '2016-05-03', 5, N'Everything he has gotten from you works great except one controller but it''s no big deal he has three still!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Edwards', N'ashley.edwards4793@example.net', '2016-05-03', 5, N'I am 36 years old and I only like multi player aspects with friends or co-op in a campaign setting with a story and player vs environment focus. So when Overwatch was announced that it was multi player (PVP pretty much only) it was disappointing. I understand Battleborn and Overwatch are not even close the same game. I also understand Overwatch has no MOBA elements and it is just a team shooter. But the reality is they feel close to the same art style and people will compare them. They are even launching around the same time. Once in awhile I play MOBAs and think, "How cool would it be to have a campaign and story set around a MOBA? Where you were offered both sides instead of just a toxic multi player experience?" That is what Battleborn does and does well. At the begining of the year nobody said the were hyped for Battleborn (Obviously some were but it flew under the radar for a lot of people - including myself). It was also very quietly advertised and when you think of the games...'),
(N'Patricia', N'Moore', N'patricia.moore9317@example.net', '2016-05-03', 5, N'Awesome!!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Moore', N'patricia.moore9317@example.net', '2016-05-03', 5, N'This is amazing! but the 3ds will not fit if it has a case.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Okonkwo', N'kyle.okonkwo1850@example.com', '2016-05-03', 4, N'Got this mouse about 3-4 years ago. Still works well, but I think it''s on it''s way out. All the buttons still work fine, but I think the laser is starting to go. When moving the mouse around, the cursor seems to get "caught", as if it hit''s the edge of the screen, yet it can happen anywhere on the screen. While very annoying, it doesn''t happen often. The right-click LED light is also having issues, but this doesn''t effect the usability of the mouse. I bought this mouse originally to play World of Warcraft with. Going from a 2-button mouse to this was an experience and took some learning to get used to, but I love it. Now that I no longer play WoW though, I don''t really need all the button options. Ideally I''d like something with 4 programmable buttons, but with the shape of this mouse. Such a mouse doesn''t exist, as far as I know. Because of this, I might end up buying this one again.'),
(N'Amara', N'Raghunathan', N'amara.raghunathan6804@example.org', '2016-05-03', 5, N'A game with a lot of heart and humor which doesn''t take itself too seriously. It''s a great game that gives you the depth of MOBA elements such as progression trees, turret building, escort based objectives (ect.) but mixed with the FPS perspective. I usually only play FPSs but this is one ''MOBA-esque'' game I can get behind! (And just to state: this game is completely different and unique from Overwatch) The list of characters all have their own unique sense of personality and back story which really makes you want to try everyone at least once. With so much to unlock (skins, battle titles, taunts, characters, ect.) it''s a game that ''s so re-playable! I honestly bought this game simply for the PvP play but the story mode is truly fun and arcadey in it''s own right. Highly highly recommended for a good time!'),
(N'Dee', N'Lopez', N'dee.lopez1725@example.com', '2016-05-04', 3, N'Save your money and buy it used. Its a good time - but not worth $60.00. Gameplay could use some tweeks to make actually playing the game more fun. The acting and voice acting are excellent! And the breaks in the game for the Tv show are interesting, but it really, really breaks any immersion in the game.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Peterson', N'elizabeth.peterson7842@example.org', '2016-05-04', 5, N'Excellent Controller'),
(N'Jose', N'Kim', N'jose.kim7658@example.com', '2016-05-04', 5, N'Updated mechanics, updated story, 14 weapons to fully upgrade and unlock. Boss fights are fun. Very enjoyable game. Insomniac needs to make another Ratchet & Clank game after this.'),
(N'Richard', N'Kumar', N'richard.kumar6887@example.org', '2016-05-04', 5, N'The best mouse I have ever owned. Would highly recommend this for FPS games such as counter strike.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Howard', N'benjamin.howard6844@example.org', '2016-05-04', 2, N'Same problem as most other no-name controllers: analog sticks are trash. Huge dead zones, saturate almost immediately. Might as well be using three d-pads.'),
(N'Adam', N'Garcia', N'adam.garcia4068@example.net', '2016-05-04', 5, N'This is outstanding'),
(N'Frank', N'Khan', N'frank.khan3538@example.com', '2016-05-04', 4, N'Works great. Feel cheaply made.'),
(N'Frank', N'Scott', N'frank.scott9494@example.org', '2016-05-04', 2, N'I have been using this keyboard for roughly a year.. sadly im forced to report that the keys are starting to become glitchy, sometimes throwing commands out to the computer that are not being triggered by me. I am also having issues with their utility drivers. RGB lighting tool is starting to break my profiles, causing random colors to be stuck on my keyboard until im able to shut down the application . I tried fixing this by reinstalling the drivers using the corsair install tool since it contains an uninstall option, which in turn shut down my audio on my computer, all of the drivers were uninstalled not just for the keyboard, but for all sound devices on the pc. im now in a limbo where I can barely use my keyboard and I have to figure out how to fix my pc.'),
(N'Judith', N'Suzuki', N'judith.suzuki5885@example.com', '2016-05-04', 5, N'My son stay on this game. He is in love.lol'),
(N'Julie', N'Sullivan', N'julie.sullivan3362@example.org', '2016-05-04', 3, N'not the most comfortable mouse for mouselift, tapering sides inward hurts lift grip. slimy rubber material, not a true tactile rubber. indents in middle of mouse buttons, can''t utilize entire mouse button. pretty design logo, cant see it with my hand on the mouse. side front button requires huge shift in wrist, bad spot. not enough arch towards rear of mouse, common trend in current mice, hand palm contacts nothing, leaving only thumb and ring finger, and pinky finger on mouse mat as a drag link stabilizer. the side buttons are to lowthey are positioned in a sense where the left side of my right thumb always drags on surface on mouse mat. small mouse feet, but they slide well. good balance, center of gravity. to heavy, added weight from rubber, lights, rubber on scroll wheel. stiff middle mouse button click, stiff scroll, slippery mouse wheel rubber, grooves in mouse wheel rubber don''t feel like they actually help.'),
(N'Mary', N'Chavez', N'mary.chavez6384@example.net', '2016-05-05', 5, N'The game was developed on the PC using the communities involvement. I was one of the guys involved in the Alpha/Beta testing... And though I gave little feedback, many many folks did. This game is SPOT ON for a player with a wheel... I use the TX wheel for XBone and it''s perfect. Of course you have to tweak the settings to your liking, but after doing so it''s an awesome game. Graphics, Physics, and Audio are all fantastic! I mean FANTASTIC too! The game also offers many driving view options from Bumper, Hood, Dash, Cockpit, and all rear views (which I never use). The FFB for the wheel is also Fantastic, again set up you wheel and the FFB game settings to your likings. If you ever liked driving games, especially dirt rally/Rallycross type games, this one is Hands down better than any thing else out today for XBone and PS3 IMHO. So if you tried some of the other rally games out today for XBone, you need to give this one a try..... SIMPLY AWESOME!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Campbell', N'ashley.campbell3441@example.com', '2016-05-05', 1, N'YOU CAN''T CONTROL YOUR MOVE!!!!!! THIS REALLY EATS IT!!!!! Now I am stuck with a game and money lost! The company that makes this game should just give up and go out of business. Please, nobody out there buy this crap of a game!'),
(N'Carol', N'Peterson', N'carol.peterson6624@example.org', '2016-05-05', 3, N'Good fighting gameplay, but story mode and overall production cheaply made. They could have made it a lot better. If you don''t care about the story mode you will still like it. The fighting gameplay is actually good.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Collins', N'pamela.collins5119@example.org', '2016-05-05', 3, N'It''s an OK game. It didn''t really hold my interest past about 2 hours. In it''s defense though, I feel like the older I get the better a game needs to be to really suck me in. I loved Farcry 3, Blood Dragon, and 4. For me, the removal of guns kind of ruined the experience. My favorite part of Farcry was always sneaking up on an outpost and taking out all the enemies stealthily with my favorite sniper rifle. This is definitely not a BAD game and I don''t blame other people for liking it. The fact that you can tame animals to fight with you is really cool and almost makes up for the absence of guns. It''s a decent game, but I quit playing about probably 2 or 3 hours into it and I haven''t been motivated to put the disc back into my PS4 yet.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Bennett', N'alexander.bennett1365@example.org', '2016-05-05', 3, N'So let me start by saying, I love the wood grain look. It has a nice visual to it sitting on my desk. My only qualm with this, is that the different panels didn''t match up exactly to my Ps4 dimensions, from a distance it looks great, but when you get close you can see that there are gaps on some of the edges that are not covered. Not a terrible thing, but for someone like me. If I can see it it bugs me. For some thing that is supposed to add a pleasing visual to your console, it equally adds a not quite right look and feel. You get what you pay for I suppose.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Mendoza', N'jessica.mendoza7341@example.com', '2016-05-05', 2, N'I''m a long-time fan of the Wolfenstein games as far back as the original and the series just hasn''t aged well. The New Order feels like a cash grab using a familiar title. The game has many disappointing features that really have no business being in a modern title. Problems such as no physics being applied to environmental objects and generic AI behavior. When the player shoots a drinking glass on a table, it doesn''t move, it doesn''t break, nothing. Documents on tables are flatly plastered on the table texture and provide no feeling of realism or depth. Overall, the game feels out-dated and a half-hearted effort.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Torres', N'sharon.torres8615@example.org', '2016-05-05', 5, N'Nice headphones.'),
(N'Debra', N'Ferreira', N'debra.ferreira4913@example.org', '2016-05-05', 2, N'poor graphics, game seems so buggy, that I decided to resell it in less than 48 hours'),
(N'Emma', N'Hughes', N'emma.hughes5500@example.com', '2016-05-05', 5, N'Awsome game'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Young', N'evelyn.young1433@example.org', '2016-05-05', 5, N'My son loves'),
(N'Donald', N'Chavez', N'donald.chavez7156@example.net', '2016-05-06', 4, N'really fun game & even better if your familiar with the characters'),
(N'Mei', N'Diaz', N'mei.diaz1148@example.org', '2016-05-06', 5, N'Cute and adorable!!!!! It works with the game perfectly :D!'),
(N'Peter', N'Nelson', N'peter.nelson6413@example.org', '2016-05-06', 5, N'Adds more to a Great Simulation what more can I say.'),
(N'Mary', N'Lee', N'mary.lee4586@example.com', '2016-05-06', 5, N'Of course my kids love it!'),
(N'Brian', N'Stewart', N'brian.stewart2931@example.org', '2016-05-06', 5, N'I went through a couple of high bass headphones before I found these. I was looking for something to use with "Battlefield 4" when I was broadcasting to my Twitch. TV Channel. These were the first pair I could clearly hear shell casings from the "AWS" LMG hitting the ground just as cleanly as the rounds leaving the barrel. Most of the headsets had great bass, but weak or muffled treble. These were the first pair that let me hear every without loosing any detail or treble. I can hear the every shell casing hit the ground even as I lay down suppresing fire on the RPGs flying past my head in the tower on "Op Locker" in BF4!!! ^o^ I now use them exclusively when I''m broadcasting. I can keep them on for a 4 hour broadcast and they''re still comfortable!!! @_@ What''s more now that the "Simple Background Music" App is out for my XBOX ONE I''ve had a chance to hear my Twitch. TV playlist through my BF4 matches. With the audio balanced just right the sound is crystal clear and every round...'),
(N'Nadia', N'Richardson', N'nadia.richardson8277@example.com', '2016-05-06', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Helen', N'Jones', N'helen.jones6810@example.net', '2016-05-06', 2, N'Heavy rain it has spanish but beyond doesn''t'),
(N'Christopher', N'Barnes', N'christopher.barnes9026@example.org', '2016-05-06', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Sandra', N'Smith', N'sandra.smith6967@example.com', '2016-05-06', 4, N'good game, but I fried my hard drive and haven''t gotten it reinstalled, hopefully it lets me'),
(N'Ronald', N'Peterson', N'ronald.peterson6082@example.org', '2016-05-06', 5, N'Worth every penny. Great game and add on for those who haven''t played it.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Webb', N'jessica.webb5381@example.net', '2016-05-07', 5, N'Cheap but good'),
(N'Peter', N'Nguyen', N'peter.nguyen9087@example.com', '2016-05-07', 5, N'Dejavu, I am sure I reviewed this already. It may have been the other Black Ops. This is so much more violent than the games of my day, It is also void of puzzles or any real tactical thought provoking decision making but, oh so much fun. It apparently reduced teen pregnancy by a record able amount given it''s following among otherwise bored teens.'),
(N'David', N'Young', N'david.young7216@example.net', '2016-05-07', 2, N'They don''t seem to fit my 360 controllers. This is the second set I have ordered. Same problem again.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Jones', N'jeffrey.jones7959@example.org', '2016-05-07', 2, N'It''s ok. Works but there are better products out there'),
(N'Priya', N'Green', N'priya.green2198@example.com', '2016-05-07', 5, N'Arrived fast and safe.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Cooper', N'kevin.cooper4002@example.org', '2016-05-07', 4, N'Very good, they wear out after awhile due to the soft plastic. Would buy again.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Brooks', N'tomasz.brooks1161@example.org', '2016-05-07', 1, N'No arcade mode and low character list not worth the money'),
(N'Kofi', N'Roberts', N'kofi.roberts6663@example.org', '2016-05-07', 5, N'My 6 year old loves this game, its very easy for kids to play and the graphics look great. I think this is a really nice game.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Nelson', N'joyce.nelson8513@example.org', '2016-05-07', 4, N'i bought this elsewhere, but love it, i would like a better mounting system(these are plastic and may strip)'),
(N'Victoria', N'Green', N'victoria.green3223@example.com', '2016-05-07', 5, N'1st party controller'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Boyd', N'cynthia.boyd3372@example.org', '2016-05-08', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Stephen', N'Castillo', N'stephen.castillo5660@example.net', '2016-05-08', 5, N'More fun than I expected considering how old these games are. Even my kids, 13 and 17, who scoffed at first, ended up having a blast playing. Well worth the low price.'),
(N'Dee', N'Wisniewski', N'dee.wisniewski6468@example.net', '2016-05-08', 5, N'fishing in Kuwait'),
(N'Aaron', N'Johnson', N'aaron.johnson5762@example.net', '2016-05-08', 5, N'Super fast shipping just disappointed in controls of the game'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Richardson', N'kenneth.richardson9412@example.net', '2016-05-08', 4, N'I found it a little too hard for what the franchise used to be. Not as ''casual'' as the previous versions. Great graphics and playability though.'),
(N'Paul', N'Smith', N'paul.smith7924@example.org', '2016-05-09', 3, N'This game has sucked up more than a few hours for me --but only when I''m playing multiplayer with my brother and nephew. I don''t really have very much bad to say about the gameplay itself, but there are a few things that I want to mention. This game is stuck in being a grinder. It''s the biggest detractor that I have to say for this game. You''re given realistic weapons --but the weapons have levels so you can have a M1911 pistol at level 5 and you could have one at level 25 and the difference in damage is obscene. So you''re constantly having to look for new weapons to keep up with the enemies as you progress through the game. When you are putting out a realistic game like this one portrays itself --this is disappointing. I would have preferred that they did away with this leveling up weapons crap and put more content in the game like more encounters or mission types. Now it makes sense for armor because you do have different levels of quality in real life. But for the weapons it...'),
(N'Amara', N'Castillo', N'amara.castillo3816@example.org', '2016-05-09', 4, N'If you ask me about Halo 3 then I would say. "My favorite Halo game for the entire Halo series" forget number 6 whenever that comes out. Pros- Duel Wielding: (Was introduced in Halo 2 and is a great feature). Cool New Equipment: (Automated Turret). Saving the galaxy: (For the third time). Multiplayer just great: (Able to be Elite). Cons- Only getting to play as the Arbiter in Co-Op. Gravemind defeated (waiting for his return hopefully Halo 6). I would suggest this after you have played Halo 2, just so you know what is going on in the story.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Adams', N'jerry.adams7406@example.com', '2016-05-09', 5, N'I think I bought something that is OP, and is over my level, this Joystick is so good! Since this I had start buying a lot of games just to be use my awesome Thrustmaster.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ferreira', N'ethan.ferreira2161@example.org', '2016-05-09', 5, N'Shipping was fast and product exceeded expectations. Thank you so much!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Phillips', N'dennis.phillips1475@example.org', '2016-05-09', 5, N'It was cool!!!!!!'),
(N'Dee', N'Johnson', N'dee.johnson9851@example.com', '2016-05-09', 4, N'Great sound, but they''ve changed the ear cover material. Was softer before. Still good.'),
(N'Dee', N'Johnson', N'dee.johnson9851@example.com', '2016-05-09', 5, N'I had no expectation that this game would be as good or pretty as it is. A must have for Wii U owners.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Tanaka', N'kathleen.tanaka2344@example.net', '2016-05-09', 4, N'I have only had this mousepad for a few months now, and it is already showing big signs of wear. The backing on it isn''t great and it slides around quite frequently, but I think that has more to do with my desks. Overall, its massive and can hold my K70 RGB and Deathadder Chroma with no problem whatsoever.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Ramirez', N'samantha.ramirez6338@example.org', '2016-05-09', 3, N'Broke Very easily'),
(N'Noah', N'Cruz', N'noah.cruz9335@example.net', '2016-05-09', 5, N'Only thing that would make this mouse better is if it were rechargeable like the g700s.'),
(N'Donald', N'Okonkwo', N'donald.okonkwo8158@example.com', '2016-05-09', 5, N'Were are all good.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Chen', N'sarah.chen6359@example.com', '2016-05-09', 2, N'ONLY plays if online. That should definitely be spelled out clearly before we buy these things.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Russell', N'nancy.russell3070@example.com', '2016-05-09', 4, N'My copy of PS3 Scholar of the First Sin was the red box PS3 Greatest Hits edition, there was no voucher and the 3 DLC keys are added to your inventory after loading up and installing. Important to note that although you have to install the game over (>3 GB''s), even if you have the DS2 installation, you CAN use your DS2 saves, even though you are loading up DS2 SotfS, and this is key considering that all 3 DLC locations are only accessible around mid-way through the game, I suggest you play or get to a point when these locations are available and then get this for the DLC. I entered all three DLC locations and as of May 2016 I was invaded in Sunken King, and I was summoned in Iron King, so there is at least still some multiplayer activity. The difficulty is quite high but the experience is fun and tense just like the base game. Final point: this is a better deal than digital keys if the cost of this disc is actually lower than the PS3 store.'),
(N'Megan', N'Reyes', N'megan.reyes5769@example.net', '2016-05-10', 5, N'Best game of this console generation, from story, to characters, to gameplay, to graphics. Uncharted 4 is a true system seller that no gamer should miss.'),
(N'Betty', N'Alvarez', N'betty.alvarez5825@example.net', '2016-05-10', 5, N'Ignore the trolls giving this game a 1 star. It''s disrespectul to one of the best game developers of all time. Naughty Dog put a lot of love and care into this game and it shows. This game is a masterpiece and it deserves all of the positive review scores. Game of the year, and possibly game of the generation.'),
(N'Wei', N'Campbell', N'wei.campbell8399@example.net', '2016-05-10', 4, N'good'),
(N'Priya', N'Wisniewski', N'priya.wisniewski4958@example.com', '2016-05-10', 5, N'Thank you Naughty Dog for the Closure. Nathan Drake and Sully and the gang have been a part of my life for so long. This Alone is enough for any gamer to buy a PS4. I am still in the beginning of the game but it looks amazing so far. It''s on the thin line between reality and gaming. I mean the story, the characters and the soundtrack. It''s all perfect.'),
(N'Jose', N'Chen', N'jose.chen3879@example.org', '2016-05-10', 5, N'I am please.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Young', N'joyce.young7059@example.org', '2016-05-10', 5, N'I sold my Xbox One just to get money to buy this game from GameStop and I''m SO glad I did. I never played my Xbox One anyway because it''s really more for watching TV than gaming, but it was worth selling because Uncharted 4 rocks! This game has great graphics, very smooth fun gameplay, cool music, awesome voice acting, beautiful scenery, and a intriguing story. There is both a solo campaign and online multiplayer. I personally think games like this don''t need a multiplayer mode because it ''usually'' just takes away from the length of the story, (like in the case with God of War Ascension from what I hear, it was way shorter then GOW3 because of the multiplayer) but thankfully that doesn''t apply in this case! Even though I got both "next-gen" consoles at launch, I never played the other Uncharted games because like many people I switched over to the PS4 from the Xbox 360. As far as Uncharted 4 is concerned... it''s a true master piece. Well done Naughty Dog, now just remake all the...'),
(N'Gary', N'Adams', N'gary.adams7187@example.net', '2016-05-10', 5, N'+ Makes you think hard, how to approach enemies, which character to level up, Decide to whether attack of defend. + Characters are enjoyable and loveable, but i still prefer the ones from awakening - Just my opinion. + If you want enjoy the game to it fullest, you need to play it on Classic. This game is more dedicated to fans, which love the unforgiveness and difficulty of fire emblem and this one make a damn good job on that (limited xp and gold). So if you are new to Fire emblem i highly recommend The sibling - Birthright, which is by no means less fun. + More than 40+ hours in your first playthrough ( counting all the reset and repetition) - There are some part of the story that i find stupid and incoherent. 9.5/10 , even though the graphics are still old school and not pretty as Disgaea the game is still the deepest in the strategy Rpg genre. And that is what really matters.'),
(N'Jason', N'Boyd', N'jason.boyd5677@example.net', '2016-05-10', 5, N'Phenomenal. The gameplay is so fluid and responsive with very tense moments that are broken up with strong story segments. The battles with enemies don''t feel like fish barrel segments like some of the previous games could fall into. Everything is so refined and displays the best of what Naughty Dog has to offer. Every gamer owes it to themselves to play it.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Davis', N'timothy.davis6851@example.com', '2016-05-10', 4, N'You can''t deny the overall excellent quality of this game. The combat and controls needed a little bit more fine tuning but did not detract from the experience. Voice acting is excellent! Side quests can be a little tedious but they added a lot of depth. Absolutely recommend if you have 60-80 hours of free time. Took me 2-3 months to finish playing casually on the weekends. DLC is also excellent. Can''t wait for blood and wine. Respect to CDPR for delivering a quality game.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Webb', N'joshua.webb2634@example.com', '2016-05-10', 5, N'Best deal you ever gonna get for skylanders worth its price of 23.00$$$'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Gray', N'carolyn.gray9286@example.com', '2016-05-10', 5, N'its a game'),
(N'Anna', N'Smith', N'anna.smith8022@example.org', '2016-05-10', 5, N'This set sounds very good, with deep bass and good tone throughout the frequency spectrum. I do kind of like how it lights up and all but personally I am getting a little bit tired of everybody sticking LED lights into literally everything nowadays. ;) Anyway, the construction is good quality and for the price point these are a good buy if you''re looking for a basic set of gaming headphones that are fairly durable, sound good, work good, are quite comfortable, adjustable and all at a good price. You can do much worse than this set. It is a good choice. I find no flaw in them that would make me want to deduct a star, so I wont. 5 stars. By the way, I received this set for evaluation and honest review and that''s exactly what I have done.'),
(N'Wei', N'Nowak', N'wei.nowak6716@example.net', '2016-05-11', 5, N'works great i ended up returning mine because i couldn''t get used to it after having played the mmorpg i was playing for a few yrs using a keyboard very hard to adjust'),
(N'Deborah', N'Powell', N'deborah.powell6078@example.net', '2016-05-11', 2, N'One day they might get this technology right. The supplied cord just isn''t as responsive as you would hope for. And I tried using it on my new Ibanez electric a couple of times. I''ll stick with YouTube videos to help me further my playing.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Murphy', N'samuel.murphy1960@example.net', '2016-05-11', 5, N'fun game to play. I get bored easily though...'),
(N'Mateo', N'Perez', N'mateo.perez9322@example.com', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Awesome! Thank you!!!!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Sanchez', N'aaron.sanchez8487@example.net', '2016-05-11', 1, N'Crap JRPG.'),
(N'Michael', N'Flores', N'michael.flores8525@example.com', '2016-05-11', 3, N'The previous Battlefronts were much better. The single player is very limited and pretty lame. The multiplayer isn''t bad but very repetitive because how there aren''t many maps.'),
(N'Christina', N'Jenkins', N'christina.jenkins3095@example.com', '2016-05-11', 4, N'After spending about seven months with the NVIDIA Shield Android TV, I''ve decided it''s finally time to review it. First a brief history of my experience with TV based Android devices. Before taking the plunge and buying this device, I had an Ouya, which I preordered before launch (which I liked a lot, despite all the haters) and a year after that I purchased a Mad Catz MOJO (which I loved other than its terrible controller). The Ouya had its own custom interface. The MOJO ran standard Android and you could easily modify it with custom launchers and the like, which made for a great full Android experience. The Shield TV on runs Android TV which itself is... not so great. Let''s start with the Android TV OS itself. This flavor of Android is essentially gimped. Many apps that would run fine on devices such as this one are simply not available in the Android TV version of the Play Store, even if you''ve already purchased them in the standard Play Store. The Android TV play store keeps...'),
(N'Richard', N'Cook', N'richard.cook8546@example.org', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Arrived promptly. Works great!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Carter', N'aisha.carter5768@example.org', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Before I purchased these guys on Amazon, I checked with the local store, and the gentlemen behind the counter looked as if i had twelve heads. Apparently these aren''t common to people. I purchased these to remove a screw on my roomba, and it worked flawlessly. I cant comment on the longevity of the item but I have 5 of them for the next x amount of years.'),
(N'Jack', N'Miller', N'jack.miller4142@example.net', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Very happy with order will by from again'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Price', N'carolyn.price7398@example.org', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Excellent!!'),
(N'Judith', N'Smith', N'judith.smith5594@example.net', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Haven''t played it yet, but I am such a Halo fan, I''m sure it''ll occupy a lot of my time.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Ruiz', N'aaron.ruiz8942@example.org', '2016-05-11', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Joyce', N'Harris', N'joyce.harris7605@example.com', '2016-05-11', 4, N'a change from moral kombat'),
(N'Joyce', N'Harris', N'joyce.harris7605@example.com', '2016-05-11', 5, N'love the feel of this skin'),
(N'Justin', N'Harris', N'justin.harris1281@example.net', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Looks like the PS4 fire sale has begun, guys. Similar to what Microsoft did with the original Xbox One, Sony is trying to get rid of all remaining original PS4 consoles and bundles to make way for that PS4 Slim version that has leaked online a few days ago. Remember, when this bundle came out only a few months ago, it was $450. I would not be surprised if this came down to $300 once the Slim comes out, since it has already dropped $20 from $370 since the first markdown just last week. My prediction is the PS4 Slim 500GB without any games will be selling at $300, and the PS4 Neo will sell at $400. Since the Xbox One S is selling at $300 for the 500GB, this price model would make sense, since the Neo will be more powerful. I predict Sony will throw in a few surprises for the Slim as well, so don''t be surprised if the hardware is upgraded a little bit, or at least refreshed with 2016 technologies. As for this bundle itself, this is a great deal considering you get a PS4 with custom...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Thompson', N'pamela.thompson1073@example.com', '2016-05-11', 1, N'cannot get it to recognize joystick or keyboard therefore cannot play that blows!!'),
(N'Adam', N'Garcia', N'adam.garcia1556@example.net', '2016-05-11', 3, N'no split screen for a friend to play alongside you at all!! Huge HUGE mistake on 343''s part!!!'),
(N'William', N'Ali', N'william.ali7795@example.net', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Fantastic installment in the series (i really do hope this isn''t the last one.) I have made comments in the past to friends that Uncharted isn''t simply a game, but an entire entertainment experience. Think more like a playable movie. The cut scenes are great and the narrative is engaging. The gameplay is challenging but simplistic. The graphics are stunning. It really shows what the PS4 is capable of doing. Don''t worry about these 1-star reviews. They are most likely xbone fanboys that are bashing it because they can''t have it.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Rivera', N'joshua.rivera9225@example.net', '2016-05-11', 5, N'Awesome Game. I play at 4k resolution''s and get roughly 50-60 fps (generally 57) with no stuttering. The great thing is that there are so many mods to help enhance this game. I Highly Recommend.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Chavez', N'sofia.chavez1207@example.com', '2016-05-12', 5, N'boyfriends item'),
(N'Sofia', N'Chavez', N'sofia.chavez1207@example.com', '2016-05-12', 4, N'boyfriends item he liked this version better'),
(N'Michael', N'Flores', N'michael.flores8525@example.com', '2016-05-12', 3, N'It''s another decent expansion, I feel like the game gets watered down more and more as these expansions come out. Starting to be for younger crowd. Too easy to hit level cap, too easy to get good gear, not much challenging about the game, just time consuming.'),
(N'Edward', N'Brown', N'edward.brown8852@example.com', '2016-05-12', 5, N'Pretty decent mouse, I''m really liking it for MOBAS and MMO because I can easily map my action bar in game to several of the buttons on the mouse. The Mouse is feels like its really good quality with a nice braided cable, overall its a great mouse'),
(N'Angela', N'Kowalski', N'angela.kowalski2844@example.org', '2016-05-12', 5, N'Great games. Fast shipment. Thanks.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ramirez', N'jessica.ramirez4928@example.org', '2016-05-12', 5, N'Great system. The 3D is so much more stable and fun to use. If you already own a 3DS, I definitely recommend upgrading to this new one. Definitely worth it. Just sucks Nintendo has decided to screw its customers by not including the charger. Otherwise a great product. Games load faster and also look better on the new 3DS'),
(N'Katherine', N'Williams', N'katherine.williams2320@example.net', '2016-05-12', 3, N'Not happy with this product. They do not keep a charge as long as the ones manufactured by Xbox 1 Microsoft.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nowak', N'benjamin.nowak1788@example.net', '2016-05-12', 5, N'Cheap good mouse that works.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Hughes', N'kimberly.hughes7276@example.com', '2016-05-12', 5, N'excellent price and good product'),
(N'Walter', N'Smith', N'walter.smith2432@example.com', '2016-05-12', 5, N'I am a huge ''Ghostbusters'' fan. Slimer is one of my favorite ''Ghostbusters'' franchise characters. This fun pack is one of the best.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Rodriguez', N'jacqueline.rodriguez6540@example.org', '2016-05-13', 5, N'I haven''t even finished this game yet, and I have to say that I''m in absolute love. Graphics are phenomenal, as expected. Gameplay is top-notch, also something I was expecting. But, what makes Uncharted 4: A Thief''s End so outstanding is the story. The story is very much enjoyable, comical and interesting. I would definitely recommend this game to people who loved previous Uncharted titles, as this one, in my opinion, is the best.'),
(N'Amara', N'Rivera', N'amara.rivera3237@example.com', '2016-05-13', 5, N'I am surprised that thy have not worn this out already. it has seen many hours of play.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Clark', N'yuki.clark7479@example.com', '2016-05-13', 5, N'Great item and super fast shipping, thanks.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Wright', N'aisha.wright1791@example.com', '2016-05-13', 5, N'Its a great violent game.'),
(N'Laura', N'Sullivan', N'laura.sullivan7619@example.org', '2016-05-13', 3, N'Game is fine, but it gets a little too booring after a while cause its just the same after the same... I wouldnt pay a lot for it.'),
(N'William', N'Cooper', N'william.cooper3970@example.org', '2016-05-13', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'George', N'Butler', N'george.butler5589@example.net', '2016-05-13', 4, N'6yr old likes it but finds it confusing at times'),
(N'Pamela', N'Phillips', N'pamela.phillips3754@example.org', '2016-05-13', 5, N'As someone who''s played Doom since Windows 95 was popular, I was more than skeptical when I heard about the reboot. I decided to take a chance, and I was not disappointed! Doom is an over-the-top, fast paced first person shooter that allows combat to flow together seamlessly, cycling between blasting demons with futuristic weapons and brutal melee finishers. Rooms are huge, encouraging exploration through the massive levels to discover keycards, weapons, upgrades, and other secrets. The environment captures the sci-fi feel with hissing steam escaping pipes, catwalks over molten lava, and a terrifying Hell world. Enemies swarm in massive waves, ensuring there''s never a dull moment. The SnapMap is a powerful tool for creating new levels for both single and multiplayer experiences that is easy to use, featuring tutorials on how to successful piece together your maps. You can explore, modify, and download other user-created content.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Wisniewski', N'kevin.wisniewski8800@example.net', '2016-05-13', 5, N'awsome game, can not stop to play this game'),
(N'Anna', N'Turner', N'anna.turner2701@example.org', '2016-05-13', 5, N'Such an outstanding story, enjoyable gameplay and fun multiplayer. A must have for PS4!'),
(N'Jerry', N'Ortiz', N'jerry.ortiz6743@example.com', '2016-05-13', 4, N'Lots of fun, cool graphics.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Suzuki', N'jeremy.suzuki9591@example.com', '2016-05-14', 5, N'Our CoD lovers really got excited about this controller for Christmas. We had to order 2 more to keep them happy! We are very pleased with this OEM controller.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Foster', N'joyce.foster5422@example.org', '2016-05-14', 5, N'a'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Johnson', N'cynthia.johnson7429@example.org', '2016-05-14', 4, N'Campaign: There is a variety of demons to kill as you stomp your way through some massive levels with plenty of hidden secrets to discover. The gore is over the top in a good way. Multiplayer: Fast paced, action packed. Leveling system in place similar to Call of Duty. Loadout system similar to Call of Duty. Multitude of game modes and levels.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Evans', N'kevin.evans4156@example.org', '2016-05-14', 5, N'Amazing Game!!! Must buy PS4 title!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Garcia', N'jacqueline.garcia4528@example.com', '2016-05-14', 5, N'Great classic game. It felt like it was a crime to open this up from orignal packaging but it''s just that good of a game! Great for children and adults. Genius.'),
(N'Megan', N'Ramos', N'megan.ramos2360@example.com', '2016-05-14', 4, N'Plays well if using the Nunchuck with the Wii remote. Fun to smash cities. Some of the controls are a little flaky even with the Nunchuck. Also, I expected many more cities, than what was available (only 7). Unlocking monsters is a little flaky as well. Sometimes I don''t know what I did and I get a new monster or try to get a new monster unlocked and can''t seem to get it no matter what I do. Lot of monsters to choose from after they have been unlocked.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ruiz', N'kimberly.ruiz4626@example.net', '2016-05-14', 5, N'Really fun shooter, very close to a perfect game!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Jenkins', N'samantha.jenkins9619@example.net', '2016-05-14', 2, N'Not my type of game. Controls and game play are extremely difficult to get use to. Steep learning curve.'),
(N'Christina', N'Cooper', N'christina.cooper1086@example.net', '2016-05-15', 4, N'This was the first "new" Nancy Drew game I''ve played in a looong time. The newest I''d played to date was Shadow at the Water''s Edge and that was like a year ago, so to say that I was pumped about The Captive Curse would be an understatement. I didn''t really have any expectations going into this game, I was just excited to play something new. But I really loved it and had a blast playing it. I''m going to split my review up into different sections so I can give the game a more accurate rating. PLOT - 4.5/5: In this installment our favorite sleuth finds herself in a German castle to solve a centuries'' old mystery involving a monster with a penchant for kidnapping young women and taking them to his forest lair never to be seen again. As far as plots go, this one wasn''t super creative. It was executed very, very well and the lore surrounding the monster at Castle Finster was interesting but the plot premise as a whole was less than exciting. Also, it got off on kind of a fumbling start...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Hill', N'kenneth.hill3860@example.com', '2016-05-15', 5, N'Ok'),
(N'Sofia', N'Cook', N'sofia.cook2093@example.net', '2016-05-15', 5, N'This is a huge benefit over batteries. Batteries are expensive and run down quickly. With this it is plug and play. The unit can be used for charging the controller when the controller is not in use. And, the big plus, you can use the controller while it it charging. It has a long cord and gives one plenty of distance from the tv to use while charging.'),
(N'Heather', N'Cook', N'heather.cook7491@example.com', '2016-05-15', 5, N'Dark Souls III is one of the best games to come out this year. A fitting swan song to the Dark Souls series and a challenging but rewarding time to be had. It''s dark and atmospheric world sucks you in and makes you want to explore and piece together the mysteries of its setting. The world is so creatively put together. Creature designs are excellent and often unsettling. Characters are completely insane. Driven mad by the unending apocalypse they live in. Every defeated boss is a true accomplishment you earned. Nothing is handed to you but if you have the willpower you can overcome even the cruelest of enemies this game has to offer. If the game proves too much, however, you can call in help to get you through it. This is probably the easiest out of the Souls games but its still really fun and worth your time. If you weren''t a fan of the first two or were intimidated by them I''d say give this a try. I never could get into the first two myself and didn''t really come to like these...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Bennett', N'jonathan.bennett4128@example.com', '2016-05-15', 5, N'Awesome shooter game no regret'),
(N'Anna', N'King', N'anna.king7480@example.org', '2016-05-16', 5, N'THE BEST "BLACK OPS" VIDEO GAME OF THE PS2 ERA. GREAT STORY, GREAT GRAPHICS AND A GREAT VIDEO GAME ! I HOPE ONE DAY THEY PUT THIS ON PS3 OR PS4 !'),
(N'Angela', N'Walker', N'angela.walker1293@example.com', '2016-05-16', 5, N'Love it!'),
(N'Heather', N'Ramos', N'heather.ramos2945@example.net', '2016-05-16', 5, N'I have enjoyed this game very much. Some courses are very challenging but still fun. I purchased the wheel accessory for the controller and that helps a lot. Makes the game easier to play. I still haven''t been able to get my kid to play with me yet but I''m work''n on it!'),
(N'Dee', N'Hernandez', N'dee.hernandez3682@example.org', '2016-05-16', 5, N'It''s like Bloodborne and Dark Souls had a baby. This game is amazing even if you didn''t enjoy dark souls 1 and 2, if you liked Bloodborne you''ll like this as well'),
(N'Peter', N'Morgan', N'peter.morgan9127@example.com', '2016-05-16', 5, N'100 bucks steam card. Got it cheap when I signed up for the amazon chase card. I buy EVERYTHING on amazon so why not get points back.'),
(N'Sandra', N'King', N'sandra.king6432@example.org', '2016-05-16', 5, N'Great game. wish i got the case for it but i am not complaining.'),
(N'Gary', N'Flores', N'gary.flores3979@example.org', '2016-05-16', 5, N'Psp worked great. Had little to no scratches. Played games well, all the buttons worked. No issues. Great product.'),
(N'Steven', N'Diaz', N'steven.diaz7339@example.net', '2016-05-16', 5, N'I LOVE THESE. I was so paranoid about my Pokemon 20th anniversary cover plates getting scratched that I bought these. They match the white well and the silver metallic finish is gorgeous.'),
(N'Anna', N'Edwards', N'anna.edwards8769@example.com', '2016-05-16', 5, N'Beautiful graphics, great story.....SO MUCH FUN to play!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2016-05-17', 1, N'Tales from the Boarderlands. I bought this thinking it would be like the other games in this series. However there''s no crosshair, your view isn''t first-person and there''s very little actual shooting you can do. They really dropped the ball on this one and it''s fair to say that I will not be buying another product from these developers. To switch the genre of game when your previous games were so much fun is a massive mistake. I really hope the developers have a word with themselves and they lose lots of income with maybe a few redundancies because I lost out big time paying them for this abortion.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Hall', N'jeremy.hall7161@example.org', '2016-05-17', 5, N'This is just a standard PS3 6 axis controller all done up in digital camo pattern and it is very nice yet different. The game play is unaffacted by this controllers unique look. Everything you expect from a good PS3 controller with a look that is really nice. I just happened to see this when it was cheaper than the basic versions elsewhere so I brought two of them. I have had this controller for going on a few years now and they have served me well. Still using both to great effect.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Evans', N'kathleen.evans3342@example.net', '2016-05-17', 5, N'He loves challenges'),
(N'Maria', N'Chavez', N'maria.chavez7877@example.org', '2016-05-17', 5, N'Wow, this is an instant classic. Every Uncharted games rolled into one. Stunning graphics, exceptional shooting mechanics, great camera work, solid story, stellar acting and great action. My only complaint is I was wanting more gunplay, but I do understand this is not a shoot''em up game. Buy this game now!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Walker', N'kevin.walker4894@example.org', '2016-05-17', 4, N'Surprisingly good! The sound quality is surprisingly good, and the headset looks pretty cool and fits well. The only problem is that mine shipped with a defective microphone. I pried the cover off, since my family lost the box immediately and I didn''t want to go to the trouble of getting it exchanged, and sure enough they just hadn''t bothered to solder a microphone wire on correctly'),
(N'Katherine', N'Wilson', N'katherine.wilson6502@example.com', '2016-05-17', 4, N'Great single player. Pretty fun mulitplayer. Best in the series. LOTS of throwbacks to previous games. Looks stunning. Docking a star because we have to wait on Co-op.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Ramos', N'anthony.ramos8081@example.org', '2016-05-17', 5, N'Worked without any issues.'),
(N'Edward', N'Morgan', N'edward.morgan9756@example.net', '2016-05-17', 4, N'Take the fun exploration, base conquering, and skills/weapon progression systems of the FarCry games and infuse them into the Stone Age. Props to Ubisoft for trying something different and somewhat unique, and if you want a truly exploratory and caveman-esque experience, turn off most of your HUD elements!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Wisniewski', N'samantha.wisniewski8850@example.com', '2016-05-17', 4, N'Good enough'),
(N'Sharon', N'Thomas', N'sharon.thomas7416@example.net', '2016-05-17', 3, N'I returned mine after a few weeks. Pros: Works very well as a stand and the cooling fans are a nice feature. Cons: 1) Only one of the chargers worked on mine (the rear one), and with no light to show the controller is charging it took me a few weeks to figure that out; 2) Inserting the controller into the charger must be done just right, with fiddling, for it to charge (this only applied to the one charger in the rear that was actually working in my case -- again, took a while to realize); 3) The thumb add-ons for the controllers are softer than others out there such as Kontrol Freaks, with a bit of play in them (new controllers in my case), so they didn''t feel right and kept falling off. Zacro offered to send another one and address any problems I had, but I just decided to return it and get something different.'),
(N'Michelle', N'King', N'michelle.king1123@example.com', '2016-05-17', 4, N'If you liked Castle Crashers, while this is not quite as fantastic, it is a very similarly-styled game that is actually pretty funny, has co-op, a handful of different characters w/ unique attacks, and a number of weapons/runes from which to chose. It DEFINITELY could have used some more polish; there are a number of glitches that I''ve came upon while playing (for example, a certain side quest asks you to find something related to a Hamlet verse; we found ''it'' (to avoid spoilers) but regardless of how many times we brought it to the guy, it never registered as being completed, and we were therefore unable to unlock the weapon we would get. Also, one character can freeze people, but if you freeze a certain enemy it freaks out and shoots off the screen. Definitely worth the low price; like I said, a full co-op game in the vein of Castle Crashers can''t not be fun (unless you really butcher it).'),
(N'Tyler', N'Webb', N'tyler.webb3051@example.org', '2016-05-18', 2, N'After inserting the batteries, the red lights turned on, and the fan starts to spin. Not even a hour later the fan no longer spins, and the lights stay solid red. I tried removing the batteries, re-inserting them, different batteries, and nothing. I will be contacting Amazon about this and requesting a refund. Very disappointed in the poor Q/A of this product. EDIT: After contacting Amazon, the customer support helped by sending me a replacement. Thank you Amazon. EDIT Again: I decided to give this product a 2 star review instead of 1 since the game itself is actually very good. Bethesda managaed to make DOOM more modern, but keep all the things for the most part that made DOOM great. Good job.'),
(N'Christine', N'Rivera', N'christine.rivera8996@example.com', '2016-05-18', 5, N'Games great, i own the PS3 about 8 years back and this remastered version does everything right. Not only that but the limited edition case is amazing as well. But what makes this game great isn''t just how pretty it is, and it is really pretty, it''s the amazing complexity of the level design. Some levels seem to stick me in a fight that i barely win, and feel that i did the best that i could. then I''ll watch a YouTube video of a person simply going about it in a totally different way. Furthermore the story is on of the few that really challenges the taboos of gaming, stories of racism and the actual horrors of war. even though it over arching subject matter is a little heavy the game itself keeps a nice light ton. I recommend this game to anymore looking for a nice complex srpg, or after playing banner saga needed to get their fix until July. I hope this game does well, they announced Valkyria Chronicles 3 for Japan and I''m hoping it makes it way to the west. Though there is a part...'),
(N'Peter', N'Brooks', N'peter.brooks1492@example.org', '2016-05-18', 1, N'THIS IS SAD JUST SAY NO TO DRUGS WEED KILLS WAKE UP FOOLS'),
(N'Joan', N'Garcia', N'joan.garcia6743@example.com', '2016-05-18', 5, N'I bought this specifically to learn to make pot brownise but no recipe exists in the game , momma seems to have emotional issues cause she cares way to much about simple mistakes.'),
(N'Amara', N'Richardson', N'amara.richardson2080@example.org', '2016-05-18', 2, N'I waited for this one eagerly,even splitting the price with a friend. I own the bfg edition,which I thought was terrific. Finally,the game released. My first impression was how gorgeous the graphics were. That was on the 13th. Now,5 days later,and having seen and played more,I realize this remake''s biggest flaw:gameplay. It lacks the addictive action and pacing of the first 3 games. The developers deviated from the originals. Instead of a fun or scary action game,I get a pretty version of wandering in large levels hungry to fight something,or jumping around platform to platform like an idiot trying to figure out where to go next. Cmon! I just want big guns and non stop battles like the originals. How hard can it be?Don''t believe the hype. Rent before you buy. In my view,another great series butchered by a weak remake.'),
(N'Luis', N'Chen', N'luis.chen8716@example.org', '2016-05-18', 5, N'Great gift for the grands'),
(N'Katherine', N'Alvarez', N'katherine.alvarez8153@example.net', '2016-05-18', 5, N'Reached my mailbox on time which is good, packaging was on point and so far I haven''t regretted buying this call of duty, still wish I didn''t purchase ghosts tho , so overall great packaging, awesome game, fast delivery'),
(N'Amanda', N'Allen', N'amanda.allen8570@example.com', '2016-05-19', 5, N'best ps4 system'),
(N'Shirley', N'Kumar', N'shirley.kumar4970@example.net', '2016-05-19', 4, N'My kids really like Pokemon Art Academy. They like it so much that we bought two copies of the game and they want a third (you can only save one copy of each drawing and they didn''t want their siblings to erase their drawings). They also really like Disney. So this seems like it should be a match made in heaven. But it really took them a while to get into it. I think the main problem is that the tutorials are a real slog. The tutorials are slower and there are a lot more of them than in Pokemon Art Academy--and a lot of them are boring and slow. "ok, here''s how to draw the irises", and then "now draw the pupils". Not only is it boring, but I think the Disney characters are more simple line-work. The Pokemon version had some pretty complex characters that you were drawing/tracing. You don''t have to do every tutorial, but I''m not sure how many you can skip and still move on to new things. The tools are better here than the Pokemon Art Academy. In this Disney game there are more sizes...'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Cooper', N'elizabeth.cooper1993@example.org', '2016-05-19', 5, N'Fight the power- battle for all you''re worth and your character just may survive-and you''ll have fun doing it because you get all the thrill and none of the danger of real horror.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Murphy', N'sarah.murphy2935@example.net', '2016-05-19', 3, N'I''ve had many issues with Xbox over the years and I''ve had enough. Mainly its been the Xbox One server outages and others have been the remote play. It will play games fine but don''t expect to access Xbox live often. This has been a problem for many people and it caused me to jump to PS4. I still use it but not as much because I hate dealing with sh*t services for a high price.'),
(N'Edward', N'Brown', N'edward.brown8852@example.com', '2016-05-19', 5, N'Corsair has really taken a lead in producing world class keyboards and mice. This mouse is no exception. Though I wouldn''t say this is abnormally light it is fairly lightweight compared to my high end Logitech work mouse. This is really optimized for gaming which needs all the edge you can get with games these days. The build quality on this is superb with a great material feel. The button clicks are great and the lighting is a very nice touch. The precision of the mouse is a standout point, being able to handle up to 10,000 dpi which certainly feels much more precise than a regular mouse. Finally the price...what? This is a bargain. I''ve paid 3 times that for a mouse. Game on!'),
(N'Christina', N'Russell', N'christina.russell1515@example.net', '2016-05-19', 5, N'I brought this game for my Grandson, he love it.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Kowalski', N'nadia.kowalski2407@example.net', '2016-05-19', 5, N'this is also a great game'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Flores', N'nicholas.flores2379@example.net', '2016-05-19', 5, N'You can''t find a better deal then this! Love it!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Hernandez', N'andrew.hernandez2785@example.org', '2016-05-19', 1, N'I could not load the game from the cloud. I have not been able to play...'),
(N'Patricia', N'Okonkwo', N'patricia.okonkwo1693@example.net', '2016-05-19', 5, N'Enjoyable for any hardcore gamer, with a lust for challenge and medieval combat.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Okonkwo', N'patricia.okonkwo1693@example.net', '2016-05-19', 5, N'As a diehard Starfox 64 fan, I love this game. It screams Starfox. Characters, feelings, and action. The controls do take some getting used to, and can frustrate, but the hurdle is minor once you are accustomed to it, and worth it for some arcadey-space dogfights.'),
(N'Jack', N'Webb', N'jack.webb4416@example.net', '2016-05-19', 3, N'Great head set cheap production why why why Sony used to be the best? Well not any more and it''s very sad guess I''ll have to go the warranty route wonder if the gold are better made cause the sound is awesome except the cheap plastic that cracks in half up top dead center wow'),
(N'Laura', N'Jenkins', N'laura.jenkins8309@example.org', '2016-05-19', 4, N'Cheapest most reliable headset that my wife loved. I wasn''t going to spend almost double the price for a wireless headset so many people had trouble with. These are comfortable, and the sound quality is alright (still can''t beat my $20 Senheisers though) and my wife complains about the sync losing connection (flip the switch on the receiver and back, then reapply settings and fixed) but still better than the $80 pairs out there.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Morgan', N'patricia.morgan8726@example.org', '2016-05-19', 5, N'love the game'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2016-05-20', 5, N'Great FPS, loved it from the moment I stepped into the world. The game looks good and runs at a steady 50fps. The storyline is unique, where US and Korea fall out and both use some crazy weaponry against each other. It took someone a long time to think of this so kudos to them, I''ve never heard this storyline before. It''s open-world for one, the enemy AI is as intelligent as the army with the ability to flank.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2016-05-20', 1, N'DooM! Click and collect!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Henderson', N'barbara.henderson5808@example.org', '2016-05-20', 5, N'This is a super fantastic great product at a great price. I''m very happy with it and glad I made the purchase. You will be too, so don''t wait until they are all gone. Trust me, if I didn''t like it, I wouldn''t say that I did. I like it a lot.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ruiz', N'patricia.ruiz1779@example.net', '2016-05-20', 5, N'Fun fun fun. Yep, that is what you wanted.'),
(N'Michael', N'Flores', N'michael.flores8525@example.com', '2016-05-20', 5, N'This game is so fun. Whether you are a fan of Lord of the Rings or not, this game is a must play! The graphics are fantastic and you can play this game for endless hours.'),
(N'Justin', N'Hughes', N'justin.hughes7795@example.org', '2016-05-20', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Barnes', N'cynthia.barnes6199@example.org', '2016-05-20', 5, N'Nice product. My kids love the game. It''s a fun activity building the characters during game play. The base is big enough to keep the characters upright but small enough not to require a lot of space.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Edwards', N'timothy.edwards6258@example.org', '2016-05-20', 5, N'Love this program, many add-on products to enhance your experience, most are freeware and really make flying fun! This was a replacement DVD for an old one that was cracked.'),
(N'Angela', N'Powell', N'angela.powell7260@example.org', '2016-05-20', 5, N'Tremendous. the Time Tower opened a whole new level and my kids love it!'),
(N'Anthony', N'Evans', N'anthony.evans6793@example.net', '2016-05-21', 5, N'This is a nice keyboard. I''ve been using Cherry blue switches for a while now, and it''s great to see then in a Razer keyboard. In addition to gaming, I do a lot of typing, and they feel great no matter what I''m doing on the keyboard. The backlighting is nice, there''s a lot of customization features, and it''s easy to switch between them. All in all, I have yet to find anything I dislike about this keyboard, aside from wishing it had the full chroma spectrum available. Long-term reliability might be an issue for the keyboard so I''ll continue to use it and see how it lasts.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Butler', N'patricia.butler8446@example.org', '2016-05-21', 5, N'2008 was a pretty good year for video games. Games like Metal Gear Solid 4, Fallout 3, LittleBigPlanet and Grand Theft Auto IV hit store shelves. But those were games that everyone was well aware of and were destined to be the successes they were. Throughout 2008 there were other games that got overlooked. Among them was Valkyria Chronicles, a unique strategy RPG that was mixed with third person shooter elements. The hybrid didn''t seem like it would work at at first, but it''s one of the most unique gaming experiences around. Though it was largely ignored upon its initial release, it eventually found its audience and became a cult classic thanks to good word of mouth and a release on the PC. I''m tired of seeing a lot of games getting remastered from the previous generation. Not because they aren''t good games, but because they''re the games that everyone already managed to play. Games like The Last of Us and Tomb Raider are certainly fine games, but they were not overlooked games the...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Bennett', N'aisha.bennett6509@example.com', '2016-05-21', 5, N'Game time at a great price.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Ramos', N'thomas.ramos3789@example.org', '2016-05-21', 5, N'Excellent! What an amazing fourth entry in this series. Highly recommend.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Martinez', N'kenneth.martinez8575@example.org', '2016-05-21', 4, N'Once you start playing you will fell the touch of Alan wake and Max payne, it''s well developed, the game mechanics are perfect, graphics are good but the resolution isn''t, characters look real, the game is overall great don''t listen to the media'),
(N'Priya', N'Sullivan', N'priya.sullivan6169@example.net', '2016-05-21', 5, N'Great product works'),
(N'Mei', N'Bailey', N'mei.bailey2180@example.net', '2016-05-21', 4, N'Worked great but now its broken already got in January just stopped working'),
(N'Sofia', N'Kumar', N'sofia.kumar1632@example.net', '2016-05-21', 5, N'This is a wonderful game lots and lots and lots to do'),
(N'Justin', N'Ramos', N'justin.ramos8935@example.com', '2016-05-21', 5, N'This game sets new standards. It is awesome and that is an understatement. The graphics are the best in any console game. I''m a 40 year old gamer who has been playing since the Atari days in the 1980s and I haven''t seen anything like Uncharted 4. Incredibly detailed world in which you can go almost anywhere in each level and see almost anything in 3rd person view. Feels almost like a real life adventure! In real life I''m afraid of heights and this game made me nervous when climbing high up mountains and platforms because it seemed so real! I was surprised that there was no more loading time in each level after the initial loading of the levels. Fast paced action at 60 FPS and 1080P resolution. Story is good and characters are well developed. Scenery is each area is incredible as well. Lighting is true to life as well as weather effects. Gameplay is fun and there is a variety of different things to do so each level is not repetitive. It is action packed. It was a relatively long...'),
(N'Robert', N'Walker', N'robert.walker2432@example.com', '2016-05-22', 1, N'I hate suspense story.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Adams', N'patricia.adams5313@example.net', '2016-05-22', 5, N'It works perfect'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Martinez', N'nicholas.martinez6264@example.net', '2016-05-22', 5, N'Works. Great'),
(N'Heather', N'Ivanov', N'heather.ivanov6283@example.org', '2016-05-22', 5, N'Overall I''d give these 4.5 stars considering looks, fit, comfort, and price. I thought the thumb sticks would be too slick but it''s not a problem and they feel very solid and just the little difference in weight makes them feel better than stock. The D Pad also feels very nice and solid. The right side buttons could be bigger to fill their holes, but being that they''re mimicking 9mm rounds, including their size, they wouldn''t be 9mm if they enlarged them. My only real nitpick is that since I''m anal I wish the etching on the bullet buttons was symmetrical. I couldn''t get them all facing upright with "9mm" at the bottom or facing inward. The center of one of the bullets looks a little rough around the edges and the hole for two are a little off center. Still nothing to cry about. Installation wasn''t bad at all. Search online for videos if you get stuck. You will need a #0 Phillips screwdriver.'),
(N'Betty', N'Chavez', N'betty.chavez4727@example.net', '2016-05-22', 3, N'was hoping for more... not a bad deal though for a fan'),
(N'Amy', N'Thompson', N'amy.thompson3122@example.org', '2016-05-22', 5, N'The Steelseries Rival 300 has recently become my daily driver after testing the following mice and rejecting them for various reasons indicated: Asus Gladius (didn''t like the "Republic of Gaming" illuminated logo), Corsair M65 RGB (distracting sniper button; back too narrow and low), Cougar 550M (smooth plastic gets sticky with brief use), Ducky Secret Mouse (too slippery), Gigabyte XM 300 (sticky surface), Kensington Pro Fit Full Size (great size and shape, but smooth surface gets sticky), Mionix Castor (a bit too small), Mionix Naos 7000 (too slippery), Razer Deathadder Chroma (noisy scroll wheel), Razer Mamba Tournament Edition (laser sensor; prefer optical sensor), Roccat Kone XTD Optical (sticky plastic used for LED stripes), Thermaltake Ventus X (laser sensor; body of mouse makes creaking noises in use), Zowie EC1-A 2016 version (a bit too slippery; somewhat noise scroll wheel). The "rejects" are mostly high quality, and my favorites among them were the Razer Mamba TE and...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Okonkwo', N'brenda.okonkwo9186@example.net', '2016-05-22', 5, N'Works as advertised and does its job. Good Product.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Jackson', N'ivan.jackson2663@example.org', '2016-05-22', 1, N'Sminiker Wireless Bluetooth 6Axis Dualshock...;'),
(N'Mary', N'Morris', N'mary.morris5425@example.org', '2016-05-22', 5, N'I have a Thrustmaster T300 and a T150 and the TMX seems almost identical to the T150. The pedals certainly seem the same and the feedback and steering are pretty much the same. So my guess is that the internals are the same but the interface is customized for the XBox One. What this means is that for the price this is one hell of a good steering wheel. I plugged it into my Xbox one and I was really pleased at how well the two integrate. The TMX just shows up in the menus as another device in all the racing games I tried. The feedback is very quiet yet powerful. If you have ever used a T150 you will know exactly what you will be getting. To compare it with my T300 would not be fair since the T300 is double the price, but I can say that it does not feel like I am getting half of the performance, it''s really just a close second. Overall very happy with it, I love how it has all the buttons that I would have on the controller, the pedals are stiff but not overly stiff. The wheel itself...'),
(N'Mary', N'Sullivan', N'mary.sullivan6555@example.net', '2016-05-22', 5, N'Excellent.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Flores', N'joseph.flores8712@example.net', '2016-05-22', 4, N'I like it but it ended too soon.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Henderson', N'amanda.henderson7492@example.com', '2016-05-22', 4, N'Solved the problem of bad original charger adapter for Wii U.'),
(N'Megan', N'Brown', N'megan.brown8183@example.org', '2016-05-22', 5, N'I''ve been using Razer mice for a few years. I''ve recently replaced my old Razer mouse with this new DeathAdder Chroma. I like the software that allows met to customize my DeathAdder for each game (different calibrations). It feels solid and chunky in my big hand. It is very sure footed and brilliantly accurate. Would buy again.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Anderson', N'ronald.anderson8927@example.com', '2016-05-22', 5, N'Exelent'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Jackson', N'benjamin.jackson2445@example.org', '2016-05-22', 3, N'I no longer have a Xbox 360'),
(N'James', N'Ward', N'james.ward1290@example.net', '2016-05-22', 4, N'This is a fantastic game that will keep you playing for hours! It has a solid story and also has fantastic online features.'),
(N'Debra', N'Torres', N'debra.torres2903@example.org', '2016-05-22', 5, N'it was great'),
(N'Richard', N'Murphy', N'richard.murphy6649@example.net', '2016-05-22', 5, N'Graphics and playable are good'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Tanaka', N'tomasz.tanaka9412@example.com', '2016-05-22', 5, N'Great way to end series. I loved everything about this game. The game play, story, visuals are all top notch. If you have a PS4, you should play this game, its amazing.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Clark', N'ashley.clark6925@example.com', '2016-05-22', 5, N'This charging station works great and is a much cheaper option than some of the others chargers on the market. Not only does it function as a charging station but also a place to store controllers without the fear of overcharging them because you have to snap them down in order for charging. This is a great piece of equipment and a must have for anyone with a PS4. It frees up a USB slot on the system so you don''t have to be slowed down by a dead battery. If for some reason this ever broke, I would buy this again in a heartbeat.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Johnson', N'sarah.johnson5311@example.com', '2016-05-23', 1, N'The language, every other sentence. Spend your profits on this game in hell. The action was great, but, I could not even get thru the first scene and listen to the garbage. Sure these games have violence, etc, but to hear that coming out of a game , every other sentence is too much. Worst I ever heard, in any game. Parental control or better yet a filthy language block would have been nice. Parents BEWARE.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Stewart', N'zachary.stewart7113@example.com', '2016-05-23', 3, N'I love Animal Crossing. I think it''s fabulously fun. My issue with this purchase was that my CD didn''t work and unfortunately I was unable to ship it back to the sender within the time allotted. It''s fine, I''ll end up buying another CD and at that point will update my review with more information.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Watson', N'samuel.watson5028@example.org', '2016-05-23', 2, N'This is a good looking gaming headset with orange-lit earcups that can also have its mic retracted. Unfortunately I found the sound, cable, and fit to be quite bad and cannot recommend them. First off the pros: - They look great without being gimmicky looking - Even with the lighted earcups on - Love the pull-out mic Now the cons: - Very loose on head - Terrible, tinny sound - Heavy, short USB cable'),
(N'Wei', N'Hughes', N'wei.hughes7892@example.com', '2016-05-23', 5, N'My boy loves it, enough said'),
(N'Patrick', N'Brown', N'patrick.brown6429@example.org', '2016-05-23', 5, N'great'),
(N'Christine', N'Gonzalez', N'christine.gonzalez2283@example.net', '2016-05-23', 1, N'Steel book looks great. However a stripped screw like they others waiting for replacement than we can update their stars Update 1. Plastic and stripped screw didn''t stop me. I prayed and dug it out. Also there power switch hidden. Although got a replacement coming just had to see it work anyway. Go grandpa update Doom is doom but freaks out the 4yr old spoiled grandchild. Cons. 3rd one on the way. Fan stopped working. Before that lights quit. Would had the standard version if had a decent cover.'),
(N'Gary', N'Clark', N'gary.clark8040@example.net', '2016-05-23', 1, N'i got it for a friend of mine i do not know nothing about it cause i have Xbox'),
(N'Dee', N'Ivanov', N'dee.ivanov1317@example.net', '2016-05-23', 5, N'Great remake looks good for an hd update'),
(N'Ivan', N'Okonkwo', N'ivan.okonkwo4937@example.net', '2016-05-23', 5, N'really does the job'),
(N'Sharon', N'Hill', N'sharon.hill9799@example.org', '2016-05-23', 3, N'Nice mouse overall. Comfy and responsive. Would be 5 stars but it makes a fairly audible squeak when I left click. It''s sad but I honestly regret buying it because it is so annoying. Just not worth the effort to return. Definitely won''t be buying from Logitech again if this sound doesn''t go away.'),
(N'Adam', N'Martin', N'adam.martin3702@example.org', '2016-05-23', 5, N'This remote works so well for my Xbox. Favorite thing about it is the backlight for the buttons when just moving the remote. Can see what to do in the dark!'),
(N'Scott', N'Miller', N'scott.miller7880@example.com', '2016-05-23', 5, N'This is an excellent collection to buy! It has all the Metal Gear and Metal Gear Solid games except for 5.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Rivera', N'sharon.rivera7544@example.net', '2016-05-24', 2, N'The cable worked fine for about 5 months then shorted out. I fixed it temporarily by finding the area where the cable wore out and re-spliced it back together. These low durability cables just aren''t strong enough for gaming cables. I''ve been through a couple different vendors for these cables and they all seem to have durability issues.'),
(N'Michael', N'Kumar', N'michael.kumar5417@example.com', '2016-05-24', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Katherine', N'Kim', N'katherine.kim4059@example.com', '2016-05-24', 1, N'Thus game is garbage, I couldn''t play for half an hour without glitches to the point where it spawned me to a location that repeatedly killed me no matter how many time I reload. Simply put this game is full of bugs and not worth your time or hard earned money.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Green', N'nicole.green9917@example.net', '2016-05-24', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Dennis', N'Garcia', N'dennis.garcia6182@example.org', '2016-05-24', 5, N'Cheaper than my local game store and works perfectly'),
(N'Deborah', N'Jackson', N'deborah.jackson4683@example.com', '2016-05-24', 3, N'I bought this game February of 2016 I think. I played it for about 2-3 months. I would say that this is a shallow game. There''s not REALLY that much you can do. I would say there is enough to keep a younger person entertained, or maybe a casual gamer, but it''s honestly a kid game. There is not really any depth, or any story. The WiiConnect has also been turned off, so you can''t play friends online either. The things you can do are done with pretty quickly. I would say keep this one for kids.'),
(N'Priya', N'Mitchell', N'priya.mitchell9585@example.net', '2016-05-24', 5, N'Amazing and fun to play!'),
(N'Helen', N'Bell', N'helen.bell9117@example.net', '2016-05-24', 4, N'Yeah meh.'),
(N'William', N'Henderson', N'william.henderson1332@example.com', '2016-05-24', 5, N'NEED IT'),
(N'Timothy', N'Morales', N'timothy.morales8005@example.net', '2016-05-24', 5, N'Where to begin? First, this game is a TEAM based shooter. You won''t be doing well if you run in solo and try to rack up the kills. The purpose is to complete the OBJECTIVE! I know it''s still early, but a lot of players are just going for the most kills. While kills do help, the game is not about how many. Now that I have cleared that up, let me get into it. This game is a lot of fun! The matches last anywhere from 4 minutes to 10 minutes, depending on how well your team does. Playing with friends is even better! Each map is very well created, and all of the characters are very unique. If you are struggling in a match, then try changing out your character. Sometimes a swap will change the flow of battle. To further support the concept of focusing on the objective, the ultimate skill auto generates at a slow rate, and the value doesn''t decrease when you die. Ultimate skills can potentially change the battle. So know your heroes, and which one is best for which situation. The game...'),
(N'Eric', N'Gomez', N'eric.gomez5234@example.org', '2016-05-25', 5, N'Excellent game. Fun, Challenging . You''ll never want to put it down. The voice acting is great so is the story and if you''re a history buff, you''ll enjoy it even more because the story is based on actual characters (more or less).. The graphics are gorgeous and beautiful. Music is done so well. It''s like you are in a movie. The puzzles are not hard but not easy. Later on, you have to think on how to complete it in order to proceed. Naughty Dog has stated that this is the final game (as far as they are concerned.. SONY owns the game) and it wraps up pretty nicely... With a twist. I can''t recommend this game enough. You will enjoy this and the time will go by very quickly.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Martin', N'christopher.martin5822@example.com', '2016-05-25', 5, N'This is a damn fine game, and I am just scratching the surface. I don''t get a ton of gaming time, but the way this game details every little thing you do makes it easy to go back and recall what I was up to last time I ventured out to do some daring deeds and seek treasure. It is the closest I have come to playing a pen and paper RPG on a console, and the game mechanic of having your fellow party members disagree with each other about how to approach things occasionally is awesome. I will probably be picking up the sequel if it makes it to consoles, but if not I guess I will be upgrading my computer in the future so I can keep living in this world.'),
(N'Betty', N'Rivera', N'betty.rivera2556@example.com', '2016-05-25', 4, N'Better than some of the reviews I''ve read. It''s a hard game, true. But once you survive the first few areas, the game gets really interesting. It''s scary too.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Myers', N'stephanie.myers5350@example.com', '2016-05-25', 5, N'great product loved them'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Barnes', N'cynthia.barnes6199@example.org', '2016-05-25', 5, N'Great game even better that it comes with 3 and for the price it is perfect. Kids love these games'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Barnes', N'cynthia.barnes6199@example.org', '2016-05-25', 5, N'Great game son Loves spongebob and and wanted this for Christmas and got it at a great price'),
(N'David', N'Rodriguez', N'david.rodriguez9677@example.org', '2016-05-25', 5, N'This is a great remote for the Wii U, and a cool design you can''t find in stores'),
(N'Steven', N'Ward', N'steven.ward9563@example.net', '2016-05-25', 4, N'Snoppy''s Grand Adventure is a beginner platformer can caters to young children. My 5 year old nephew is able to beat the first few levels of this game on his own as oppose to not being able/or barely able to beat the first level of any Mario game. The main game is very easy to beat if you''re an average to experienced player. It''s your basic point A to point B type platformer. They do introduce new elements here and there to switch things up such and gravity manipulation and trampolines. Also unlockable costumes for Snoppy which has different power ups such as busting through walls or ability to jump higher which is required if you want to get all the collectables. Enemies in this game faint or get dazed for a few seconds when jumping on them instead of get squashed or killed so it''s very kid friendly. After you beat the main game, there''s an unlockable world where you can play through several SHUMP (Shoot ''em up) levels. So keep in mind there''s a post game after the credits. Story...'),
(N'Charles', N'Okonkwo', N'charles.okonkwo9543@example.net', '2016-05-25', 5, N'After playing the beta for this, I was still on the fence. It seemed scattered and just not something I could see myself dropping many hours in. However, a gut feeling told me to preorder it (best buy for the rewards certificates) and I am so glad I listened to my gut! This game has so many cool maps and with all the characters, you really have so much to choose from. It couldn''t possibly ever get boring because of the types of people (i pick my characters based on the people i''m playing against so it''s always fresh). The graphics here are really awesome and the sound makes you feel not only like you''re actually in a badass firefight...but the commentary from your characters are hilarious! I very much look forward to the DLC that will be coming for this one.'),
(N'Larry', N'Parker', N'larry.parker7386@example.com', '2016-05-25', 4, N'First let me say I loved Uncharted 1 & 2 but hated 3. This game is what number 3 should have been. As always graphics, story and characters are amazing. I always thought the combat and controls in the series were clunky. That hasn''t changed in the 4th game. It''s still fun to explore the beautiful world they created though. Game play is pretty straight forward, explore, run, jump, fight and climb. There are a lot of cut scenes and times when the game can drag a bit. If you''re a fan this is a must buy. If you never liked Uncharted then it''s still worth a rental.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Jackson', N'jerry.jackson4618@example.com', '2016-05-25', 5, N'It what it is!'),
(N'Donna', N'Castillo', N'donna.castillo5196@example.com', '2016-05-25', 1, N'this game is straight garbage water and no one will read this review'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Webb', N'evelyn.webb8688@example.net', '2016-05-26', 5, N'One of the best mice I have ever used. Hands down.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Stewart', N'pamela.stewart3978@example.com', '2016-05-26', 5, N'Great game, very good story line'),
(N'Noah', N'Wang', N'noah.wang7635@example.org', '2016-05-26', 4, N'As a long time Assassin''s Creed fan, the only time I had doubts about the next game was with Black Flag. After the death of Desmond Miles in Assassin''s Creed III, it was hard for me to believe that they tried to continue the series. But it turned out to be my favorite game out of the franchise. That being said, I had doubts again hearing that one sequel was on Last Gen and another sequel on Next Gen. After reading the reviews and seeing that it had a majority rating of 5 stars, I couldn''t help to check into it. Now being the smart person I am, I wasn''t just about to drop $30 on a game I was still skeptical about, so I looked up a Playthrough on YouTube. I got to the part after Shay leaves the Assassins and joins the Templars. At that point, I was completely sold. After finishing Unity, it was the only one that really disappointed me (aside from Revelations, that game was just kinda boring to me). The story was hard to follow, and combat was a little too difficult even for me, and...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Mendoza', N'aaron.mendoza1069@example.com', '2016-05-26', 5, N'I couldn''t wait to play it'),
(N'Scott', N'Russell', N'scott.russell6207@example.net', '2016-05-26', 5, N'Thanks great condition!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Campbell', N'christopher.campbell8447@example.com', '2016-05-26', 5, N'Got these for aesthetic reasons. They look amazing on the controller and are technically reusable, but you have to be careful not to bend them. Once they bend even a tiny bit, you pretty much ruin the form and it becomes noticeable even when it''s on the controller. However, if you''re careful and do not bend them, you can definitely reuse them.'),
(N'Donna', N'Raghunathan', N'donna.raghunathan3488@example.net', '2016-05-26', 5, N'good'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Garcia', N'jeffrey.garcia8128@example.com', '2016-05-26', 5, N'fun classic game that still holds up to day. never stop going fast.'),
(N'Noah', N'Powell', N'noah.powell7743@example.net', '2016-05-26', 5, N'Not much to say. This is a great port! They refined the graphics a bit and the controls work great. If you played either of these games in the past & want a little shot of nostalgia, this is perfect!'),
(N'Paul', N'Hill', N'paul.hill5235@example.org', '2016-05-26', 1, N'I pre-ordered this as I was expecting more a multi-player game. The original Homefront was NOT a good game but it could have been. It had a ton of potential but was poorly executed. I was smart enough to not open the game until I read the reviews. It had zero PvP just a co-op option to replay missions. The reviews were universally bad so I returned it. It seems that whenever a game is in development limbo for years it turns out poorly. I guess I will have to wait for Battlefield 1'),
(N'Kyle', N'Raghunathan', N'kyle.raghunathan6076@example.org', '2016-05-27', 5, N'I love NCIS and when I saw they had a 3DS game I flipped out! I loved playing it. I wish there was more than one story but it was fun finding the clues and figuring out who the killer was. The dialogue between the characters fits them perfectly. Seriously it is a great game to play if you love NCIS or solving mysteries.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Collins', N'tyler.collins5094@example.com', '2016-05-27', 5, N'My review of Valkyria Chronicles Remastered for the PS4 Pro Beautiful graphics & Art Style - One of the many things that stands out in Valkyria Chronicles is its visuals. I love how they went with a anime/manga style with the game. It shows (and proves) that art style is important and that (to me that is) art style can more then make up for the lack of fancy graphics that the majority (but not all of them) of triple A have (or push). Solid gameplay - While it was difficult the first time I play this (gotten use to it now) I like how Valkyria Chronicles combine three different style of gameplay. First you have your RPG part in which after each battle you earn experience points to level up your class (scouts, shock troopers, lancers, engineers and snipers) and money to upgrade your armor, weapons and your tank. Then you have your strategy (turn base strategy that is) part in which you move your troops to attack or move them to a certain spot (if an enemy is moving towards you your...'),
(N'Julie', N'Adams', N'julie.adams6686@example.org', '2016-05-27', 3, N'It works good and it doesn''t take up to much space.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Castillo', N'daniel.castillo5222@example.org', '2016-05-27', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Ethan', N'Wright', N'ethan.wright6402@example.org', '2016-05-27', 5, N'love it ty'),
(N'Joseph', N'Thompson', N'joseph.thompson1081@example.com', '2016-05-27', 4, N'TMNT Mutants In Manhattan is a charming single player family friendly game by Nickelodeon and PlatinumGames. The artistic style and solid gameplay combine for a memorable experience. I couldn''t stop laughing at Michelangelo''s comments. Children, teens and adults alike will enjoy the humor in TMNT Mutants In Manhattan. My only real complaint (besides some generic music) would be the lack of local co-op, otherwise it''s a fun game. Single player is good but online is the best way to play in my opinion. Cowabunga! :)'),
(N'Megan', N'Collins', N'megan.collins4371@example.net', '2016-05-27', 5, N'One of the best games I have ever played. The guns, story, graphics, missions and side quests were all fantastic. Great work from UbiSoft, and I hope their next versions are just as good.'),
(N'Megan', N'Collins', N'megan.collins4371@example.net', '2016-05-27', 1, N'Hated it. Awful graphics, story, gameplay. Couldn''t even finish it.'),
(N'John', N'Powell', N'john.powell6425@example.net', '2016-05-27', 5, N'Really enjoyed it!'),
(N'Richard', N'Kumar', N'richard.kumar2562@example.net', '2016-05-27', 5, N'I go through computer mice like no one''s business. I can''t even tell you why they all seem to fail, but this one is by far one of the best mice I have ever bought! It fits in my hand very comfortably, is very sturdy and works extremely smoothly.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Ramirez', N'jacqueline.ramirez4679@example.com', '2016-05-27', 5, N'Fun to play'),
(N'Emily', N'Edwards', N'emily.edwards1598@example.com', '2016-05-27', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Brenda', N'Edwards', N'brenda.edwards2781@example.com', '2016-05-27', 5, N'Good product'),
(N'Heather', N'Wisniewski', N'heather.wisniewski7593@example.org', '2016-05-27', 5, N'Fun game'),
(N'Henry', N'Barnes', N'henry.barnes3989@example.net', '2016-05-27', 5, N'It looks cool. It fits the Xbox One controller and iPhone 6. Audio wise, I can hear the audio input coming from the other end clearly with good function. I can talk into the microphone and leave a clear voicemail. When phone call ends, the audio for music continues soon after. Aerofti Ear Cushions is comfortable and Comfort Tech Fit system works great. Cushions keep outside sounds somewhat filtered out. I don''t wear glasses so I can''t say but relief system from cushion not compressing glasses into skin would make playing games enjoyable. Detachable microphone and wired cord are plus. The speakers deliver great sounds from iPhone and Xbox One platform I''ve tested. Controllers were wireless. Black plastic body and frame is luxurious black that matches the finishes on the Xbox One controllers (Black). Particularly, I enjoy the rotating ear cushions that helped adjust the position of cushion over my ears without putting high tension on the head or ears. Definitely worth naming Elite...'),
(N'Joan', N'Cooper', N'joan.cooper6221@example.org', '2016-05-27', 4, N'It''s a Wii game, so expect unnecessary motion controls.'),
(N'Jason', N'Ortiz', N'jason.ortiz4228@example.com', '2016-05-28', 4, N'Way overpriced but sometimes when you miss the boat you just have to pay the piper...! Still its one of my sons favorite Skylanders out there. Its just a shame its horded by greedy people just to make a few extra bucks. After all these were supposed to be for kids not collectors but what can you do? If it wasn''t this it would be something else and it probably is something else on top of this which makes it worse and these $ dealers should feel ashamed for doing this to the kids.'),
(N'Jason', N'Ortiz', N'jason.ortiz4228@example.com', '2016-05-28', 5, N'I love this game and its my second favorite game after the first one of course. Never played the MP but then again that''s not my cup of tea. I''m a lone Gunman LOL'),
(N'Ivan', N'Anderson', N'ivan.anderson1919@example.org', '2016-05-28', 5, N'I purchased Skylanders Super chargers for my grandson. I am sure it enjoy them!!!'),
(N'Priya', N'Powell', N'priya.powell1593@example.org', '2016-05-28', 5, N'Bought a K70 with red keys for work. Probably should have gone with the browns since they feel like they actually take a little less force. Not a real problem otherwise, and I''d suggest just about any mechanical keyboard over the cheap OEM keyboards most PCs are supplied with'),
(N'David', N'Hughes', N'david.hughes7109@example.com', '2016-05-28', 2, N'I somewhat enjoyed his game while I was leveling. It was, however, EXTREMELY repetitive. Each safehouse had the same missions with the same dialog. I reached level 30 in almost no time. After that, there is literally nothing to do. You can replay missions to get better gear so you can replay other missions to get better gear to replay missions.....you get it. There''s the pvp dark zone but that''s not for everyone. On top of me not being good enough to compete with some players, there are many who cheat through exploits or just hunt people down with their large groups. Also, all you can really do there is......get better gear. Overall I feel I wasted money on this game since there is no true ending or main purpose for the character. I''ll be trading it in for sure.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Campbell', N'daniel.campbell6644@example.net', '2016-05-28', 5, N'100% satisfied'),
(N'Joyce', N'Jackson', N'joyce.jackson6272@example.net', '2016-05-28', 5, N'As a fan of RPG and Slice of Life games, I was excited to find a game that combines both, and that was downloadable to my 3DS using Amazon digital credits (had to use them somewhere!). Fantasy Life is a great combination of both these genres. As a Slice of Life game like Harvest Moon or Animal Crossing, you don''t have to follow the main story line and you can spend time leveling up your character''s skills as a craft builder or gatherer. You interact with NPCs and can run errands for them, explore, or level up your character''s skills. There''s also a house decorating feature, fishing, cutting down trees, mining, weapon building, furniture building, cooking and potions making options open to you as well. For those looking for a more story based game, you can stick to the main story line and fight as a swordsman, wizard, paladin, or hunter (although you can still fight as the other job classes as well). Each job class has its own challenges to complete to achieve "Legendary Level". For...'),
(N'John', N'Wang', N'john.wang5571@example.com', '2016-05-28', 5, N'Graphics look better!'),
(N'Mei', N'Kumar', N'mei.kumar9483@example.net', '2016-05-29', 5, N'After testing the Apex M500, I must say that I am very satisfied with it. Here''s some of the qualities that I thought were good: 1. You can disable the windows key. This, for me, is extremely helpful, since I tend to brush the key on accident, so disabling it by default helps a lot. 2. The red cherry switches in this keyboard are extremely satisfying to use, and they are not very loud at all, which is a plus for me. 3. The keyboard is very easy to customize. 4. There is anti-ghosting in the keyboard, which means that it will never skip keys. 5. The keys can only be set to one color: blue.'),
(N'Jose', N'Murphy', N'jose.murphy3658@example.net', '2016-05-29', 5, N'So far so good. It is having good battery life but only time will tell if it will last but for now love'),
(N'Robert', N'Young', N'robert.young6054@example.com', '2016-05-29', 1, N'It was great when it first came out. But is broken now and is unplayable once you hit lvl 30.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Hughes', N'mateo.hughes3131@example.org', '2016-05-29', 4, N'When you get this, expect long hours of game play.'),
(N'Mary', N'Scott', N'mary.scott8134@example.com', '2016-05-29', 5, N'I was looking for AD&D games for the XBox. I used to play them, on the computer, when I was younger, and loved them. Sadly, there are only a few old games for the original XBox, and one for XBox 360 (Daggerdale). There is a new one coming out, for XBox One, called Sword Coast Legends (looking forward to it). That is slated for Spring of this year. Granted, it''s almost (officially) Summer, now. Anyway, I heard good things about Divinity Original Sin, and decided to give it a shot. Although it can be frustratingly slow, and take a long time to make progress in the game, I think it is very reminiscent of the old, computer based, AD&D games. Overall, I like it a lot.'),
(N'Donna', N'Hernandez', N'donna.hernandez2343@example.com', '2016-05-29', 5, N'Great shooter game for Dreamcast!'),
(N'Noah', N'Tanaka', N'noah.tanaka3303@example.net', '2016-05-29', 5, N'How did they pull off a better D-Pad than Nintendo is beyond me,. Awesome for MAME and Sega on the Nvidia shield with the proper layout for Retro gaming. The cord is light and doesn''t get in the way'),
(N'Sofia', N'Howard', N'sofia.howard7102@example.com', '2016-05-30', 3, N'it has better gameplay considering it''s on the ps4 but is it worth the money and not getting dlc ?probably not'),
(N'Charles', N'Scott', N'charles.scott4330@example.com', '2016-05-30', 1, N'The audio for the left ear cup for the Razer Carcharias went out within just 2 days of usage. I do find this highly unacceptable & would like to receive a replacement if due possible asap!'),
(N'Megan', N'Russell', N'megan.russell6333@example.org', '2016-05-30', 5, N'Seriously underrated series of games. 100s of hours of fun to try to complete. 4 classes to plat, and 802 weapons to randomly unlock. You can farm extra armor (health) pretty much forever, as there''s no cap. If you played 2025, this is what 2025 should''ve been. 2025 was 4.0 in Japan. This is virtually the same game, with most missions improved on, better load times, and great performance. You can really only feel a framerate drop when you knock down multiple big buildings at once. 89 missions offline (splitscreen available), 98 online (no splitscreen), and nearly 50 more available via DLC in 2 packs. The DLC missions have some crazy new mutants including green ants, red flying vehicles, purple retarius, and silver king spiders. DLC has some insanely difficult missions, and it''s really worth it even just for armor and weapon farming alone.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Howard', N'carlos.howard8956@example.com', '2016-05-30', 5, N'arrived as described'),
(N'Alexander', N'Webb', N'alexander.webb2086@example.com', '2016-05-30', 5, N'This game is hilarious. You can make them do some weird stuff. The songs they can sing can be hilarious. I could never do this game justice. I recommend looking up some videos on it.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Mendoza', N'nathan.mendoza9849@example.net', '2016-05-30', 5, N'Very fun game'),
(N'Nathan', N'Sullivan', N'nathan.sullivan1194@example.com', '2016-05-30', 1, N'It broke after the first use sadly. I can''t say much more about it aside from that.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Jones', N'aaron.jones3147@example.net', '2016-05-30', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Steven', N'Coleman', N'steven.coleman8797@example.net', '2016-05-30', 5, N'Great game,'),
(N'Nathan', N'Thompson', N'nathan.thompson8279@example.com', '2016-05-30', 5, N'This is my updated review of Destiny The Taken King as of 5/30/16 The game has improved significantly since it first released. The most notable improvements are in weapon balancing, player economy, loot aesthetics, user interface and pvp networking. There are also new activities to enjoy. Still plenty of fun to be had.'),
(N'Omar', N'Wilson', N'omar.wilson4514@example.com', '2016-05-30', 5, N'Works great, plug and play on both Windows and Android. If you really want that authentic SNES feel, take out the circuit board and replace an SNES controller''s circuits with this. Fits perfectly and you will get a perfectly authentic SNES experience on PC and Android.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Bell', N'stephen.bell3644@example.com', '2016-05-30', 5, N'Good.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Howard', N'ravi.howard7502@example.net', '2016-05-31', 5, N'Very cool game.'),
(N'Christina', N'Kelly', N'christina.kelly2561@example.com', '2016-05-31', 5, N'Awesome deal!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Barnes', N'cynthia.barnes6199@example.org', '2016-05-31', 5, N'Nice starter pack with hours of fun and entertainment.'),
(N'Steven', N'Bennett', N'steven.bennett3072@example.com', '2016-05-31', 3, N'If ever there were a game I wanted to happily give 5 stars and love it was Batman: Arkham Knight. I grew up reading the comics, and was absolutely blown away by Arkham Asylum when I first played it. I liked Arkham City even more, in a casual-gamer-meets-comic-fan way. I have been a Batman fan for probably 25 years now, give or take, and have been grateful to the efforts and creations, for better or worse, put into the Arkham series - including Origins, though I didn''t take to replaying that one much. Alas, I have to say I simply think AK is indeed just "ok." I was very disappointed in this game considering the previous two main ones. I beat the main storyline - not at 100% because I got sick of the Riddler Batmobile challenges - and found myself happy it was over and have not picked the game back up in about five months (I got it fall of last year). I actually bought a PS4 initially so I could play Arkham Knight (and a couple other games that weren''t coming out for the PS3)....'),
(N'Emma', N'Patel', N'emma.patel1742@example.net', '2016-05-31', 2, N'My son''s old ones stopped working. He is autistic, so we needed these in a hurry! He had a meltdown when his old ones conked out on him. He chose these and loves them. They arrived on time and my son is back to himself. Update - My son has had these just under 4 months and he went to put them on yesterday and they fell apart. He didn''t abuse them, handle them roughly, etc. So, after this being his 2nd pair, he won''t be getting a 3rd one.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Russell', N'jessica.russell2493@example.com', '2016-05-31', 5, N'A classic, hopefully these remain somewhat easy to find. The game itself is great.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Sullivan', N'alexander.sullivan1506@example.com', '2016-06-01', 2, N'Played it maybe 5-6 times, didn''t care for it because they changed too much from the previous versions of this game that I had. Guess I''m old school when it comes to gaming.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Cooper', N'kofi.cooper4693@example.net', '2016-06-01', 5, N'Thanks!'),
(N'Mei', N'Coleman', N'mei.coleman8409@example.net', '2016-06-01', 3, N'the packaging and goodies that come with SFV''s collectors edition are nice, so if anything, the collector''s box is worth picking up just for the stuff that comes with the game. The game itself I have many qualms with, since I picked it up around release time. The game itself at release time was empty of content outside of playing online (if you paid for PSPlus), survival mode, and then story modes and other things were patched in as things went. This distribution model is probably a sign of how games will be in the near future but for something that came in a collector''s box, it felt sorta incomplete. If your goal is to play SFV competitively and you really just care about playing online or against other ppl, then fine, SFV is perfect, a barebones package for exactly this kind of consumer. if you wanted it for content or something like somebody more casual would want a game for, then SFV is pretty disappointing to say the least.'),
(N'Emma', N'Lewis', N'emma.lewis8410@example.org', '2016-06-01', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Julie', N'Murphy', N'julie.murphy9993@example.com', '2016-06-01', 5, N'Excellent. Great game all around. Blizzard knows thier stuff. Shout out to amazon for saving me 24$ for pre ordering. Amazing. I''m 30 now and not as good as I was 10 years ago but this is the first game I''ve thoroughly enjoyed since mw2.'),
(N'Wei', N'Scott', N'wei.scott6296@example.org', '2016-06-02', 5, N'I love the feel and look of these grips, I had a minor issue during installation but very happy with this product.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Ward', N'samantha.ward4112@example.net', '2016-06-02', 5, N'Exactly what I wanted, perfectly packaged, all 3 add-on''s. This is a backup for my original disk as I''ve taken to modding with the game''s Creation Kit. Now every time I play it''s a whole different world and I wanted a true back up in case I lose the original.'),
(N'Walter', N'Hill', N'walter.hill9868@example.net', '2016-06-02', 3, N'either nintendo doesn''t care about these Old games or this is a repacking. this case is not durable it''s tough but you can feel how cheap it is by comparison to original ds cases. There was no manual at all, and soon as I opened the case the game popped out. this is terrible I wanna buy a used one at gamestop just for the case at this point. at least the game is good. I''m just angry about the case I got stuck with. game is 5/5 star. this bs case compared to original release is 2/5 which is why I''ll give the purchase a 3'),
(N'Jack', N'Cruz', N'jack.cruz3673@example.net', '2016-06-02', 5, N'Great game. My teen loves it!'),
(N'Dee', N'Nelson', N'dee.nelson8049@example.net', '2016-06-02', 5, N'AWESOME'),
(N'Joseph', N'Clark', N'joseph.clark2809@example.org', '2016-06-03', 5, N'Just get normal edition'),
(N'Brenda', N'Phillips', N'brenda.phillips2938@example.org', '2016-06-03', 5, N'fast shipping A+++++++++'),
(N'Patricia', N'Smith', N'patricia.smith1723@example.org', '2016-06-03', 5, N'A+'),
(N'Brian', N'James', N'brian.james9206@example.com', '2016-06-03', 4, N'Bought for both PS4 and PC It''s hands down better on PC! Does it look better on PC? Of course that''s shocking to most I know why would a $1000 video card have the unfair advantage of producing a better image than a hybrid on board video card like what''s in the $400 PS4 right? Makes no sense. Would it look better on a $400 PC? Yeah! Of course ...but only for taking still screen shots wouldn''t actually be playable. All that aside the game looks and runs amazing on PS4 my choice for keeping it on PC has nothing to do with the visuals it''s the controls this is one of those games that''s just meant to be driven with a keyboard and mouse hell for whatever reason the ps4 controller on my steam link is more responsive and smoother playing this than it was playing the ps4 version! The controls for this game on ps4 and I''d assume xbone just aren''t very good. It''s not polished and responsive like COD even though I hate that game. Buy it on PC stream it to the big screen and play with your dual...'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Morris', N'hiroshi.morris2120@example.com', '2016-06-03', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Steven', N'Gutierrez', N'steven.gutierrez4163@example.org', '2016-06-03', 5, N'A must have for both Uncharted fans and PS4 owners! This 4th installment in the series takes just the right amount of steps forward without straying too far from what made the series so successful. In terms of action adventure titles, this is the best currently available on 8th gen consoles. Beautiful graphics, intense action gameplay and an engaging story with beloved characters. To be fair, if I had to name a single con to this game, it would be the pacing. The pacing in this 4th installment is the one major factor setting it apart from the previous 3. If you''re the impatient type, take warning that this game takes a bit to really get going. I''d personally encourage you to hang in there, as it''s well worth it.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Patel', N'ethan.patel9420@example.org', '2016-06-03', 5, N'This game is every bit the gem that others have mentioned, but it has perplexed many as to how to get it to run in Windows 7/8/10. I just got it to run in Windows 8.1. This is the one game that I absolutely need, now it''s alive again! It''s worth taking the chance to get it to work. The game play, the sound and dialog, the training missions, are all well done. I''m sure that I''ll be playing this game regularly for many years to come. Graphics lose a little luster in Windows 8.1 from way back in the day on Windows ME, but still holds up. Get the t4ckl3b3rry patch from [...] Install USAF from the disk Run the patch 1.02 fileplanet used to have it, may not need it with the tackleberry patch Get the t4ckl3b3rry patch (the tackleberry patch) JU102W7TP.exe put it in the USAF folder and extract Set USAF.exe compatibility to XP SP3 Run USAFconfig.exe and set to your video card Run USAF.bat which will close explore.exe, itll start again when you quit the game to windows There is a pitching...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Chen', N'cynthia.chen7676@example.org', '2016-06-04', 5, N'We like the game! My boy don''t like the Shyguy tho! haha!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Adams', N'jessica.adams2628@example.com', '2016-06-04', 1, N'I finally caved and picked up this title for $25. It still feels pretty barebones. Problems: The fighting system is pretty good, but it seems off. I think they should have went the route of a fighting system like SFIII. They are trying too hard to reproduce SFII. The graphics are pretty, but deep down I feel like they threw a fresh coat of paint on the SFIV models. The story mode is garbage. Four to five 1 round super easy matches? You have to play the tutorial before you can even get to the main menu? Wow. Key missing characters at launch? They are coming soon as free DLC, but why? No arcade mode........ It is 2016, but not everyone wants to play online, or people that still don''t have internet access.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Cooper', N'yuki.cooper1731@example.net', '2016-06-04', 5, N'Now I can play Majora''s Mask.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Gomez', N'lisa.gomez3205@example.com', '2016-06-04', 5, N'Awesome!!!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Myers', N'stephanie.myers9164@example.net', '2016-06-04', 4, N'To bad it''s not 2 player...'),
(N'Nicole', N'Okonkwo', N'nicole.okonkwo3060@example.net', '2016-06-04', 4, N'Not as good as understare'),
(N'Janet', N'Miller', N'janet.miller8590@example.com', '2016-06-05', 5, N'Works as it should and the extra long cable is welcomed heavily.'),
(N'Janet', N'Miller', N'janet.miller8590@example.com', '2016-06-05', 4, N'A great game thats a bit too large to handle. The quality of the game stands up to its former full platform release but becuase of its long story and leveling system it can be a lot to take in even for experienced players of similar games.'),
(N'Megan', N'Patel', N'megan.patel1629@example.com', '2016-06-05', 5, N'Awesome game we love'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Bailey', N'carolyn.bailey1872@example.net', '2016-06-05', 3, N'Looks GREAT just doesn''t hold my interest.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Price', N'thomas.price5869@example.com', '2016-06-05', 5, N'I made sure to wait afew months before making my review usually around this time you see the first sign of failure in the product. FIrst of never heard of KingTop and I tend to stay away from lesser known companies that quickly went out the door when my microsoft stereo headset started to fail after just afew months. I decided to give this headset a chance, THE BUILD so far the build quality of this headset is top notch, the design is great with the tube headband making it very confortable and very flexible. I feel little to no pressure on my ear, with some headsets you get that sourness after just afew hours but I have gone multiple hours and thanks to how they designed the headband it put''s no pressure to your ears what so ever. A nice thick microphone that goes up and down, sound output is nice and clear everyone could hear me pretty good and I them. THe one thing that really caught my eye was the extra cording wrap around the cord. I love that they did that making the cording...'),
(N'Laura', N'Gray', N'laura.gray2595@example.net', '2016-06-05', 5, N'This game also replaced an old favorite that got scratched. Rainy and/or hot summer days will be much more bearable now. This game was reasonably priced and was shipped quickly. Who could ask for more?'),
(N'Adam', N'Harris', N'adam.harris5960@example.org', '2016-06-05', 5, N'Great game. Big fan of Telltale.'),
(N'Susan', N'Robinson', N'susan.robinson2717@example.com', '2016-06-05', 5, N'How to pay help'),
(N'Mark', N'Rivera', N'mark.rivera1702@example.net', '2016-06-05', 5, N'This is a good game. Unlike the others, you get drive in vehicles, swing on ropes like Indiana Jones, and Nathan Drake and Elena Fisher are married (I never thought that would happen). One thing that''s special about this game is because it involves in going after pirate treasure which I always loved since childhood. What really makes this game so great is it has more booby traps than Uncharted 2 had and at the final battle you fight the enemy in a sword fight. The best thing about this game is the ending, but I don''t want to spoil it. The ending really surprised me.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Garcia', N'jeremy.garcia4526@example.net', '2016-06-05', 4, N'These are nice controllers, the player indicators really don''t help as 2 light up together always. Buttons and joysticks feel just like a standard xbox 360, triggers are maybe a little less smooth. Definitely a better solution than buying a xbox wireless adapter, those disconnect so frequently it ruins the gameplay.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Thomas', N'raymond.thomas6513@example.org', '2016-06-05', 4, N'This unit is definitely an improvement from the used x52 that I had previously. I think that the buttons on the unit are designed and laid out in a way that makes more sense. I constructed a stand for this and the throttle out of PVC, and adhered the stick to a piece of wood using velcro. The feel of the stick is smooth when in flight. However, when I am testing it out of flight and focused entirely on the joystick, it feels a bit disjointed. The stick is designed with something that feels like a two-lever system, one for X and one for Y. The stick design hasn''t changed in years, so I''m sure there are resources around that have taken it apart and documented it. Overall everything has felt smooth in-game and I can land the notoriously difficult P-51D from DCS. However, if you look at the joystick, you can see that there is some input jitter. Its not enough to effect the flight. This is not the case for the throttle, which the jitter causes problems with the input. You can fix it...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Allen', N'brenda.allen2426@example.org', '2016-06-05', 5, N'I bought this game recently after finishing the story on the PS3 version. I also have been playing online but most of my friends were no longer playing GTA Online on the PS3 due to the fact Rockstar stopped giving out updates to the PS3 and Xbox 360. I have to say after playing it on the Xbox One, I was blown away just by the beauty of the game. Everything looks alive and colorful. Plus, Rockstar added some new features in single player like the ability to duck in your car, first person mode, more songs, and other content exclusive to returning players. I haven''t dabbled in online yet on the Xbox but I''ll update the review when I do.'),
(N'Janet', N'Singh', N'janet.singh9748@example.org', '2016-06-05', 5, N'Some things to note right off the bat:Informational LEDs(battery power, DPI, Sleep Mode, awesomeness), has forward and backward buttons, DPI adjustment is instant, has a rechargeable battery, Plug and play worked like a charm(no haggling), the plastic the mouse is made of feels very nice- not to mention very ergonomic looking and feeling- the plastic feels like rubber yet is hard and doesn''t get indented while providing good grip. First Things First. The Box The box was really cool, and in all Chinese. Not a big problem for me, because the manual in the box was English and very detailed. The manual quickly answered any questions I had about the mouse. The box was not damaged when it arrived and had no signs of misuse or cheap packaging. The LEDs why would you buy a cool mouse? Well a seller is always the lights (ohh shiny!) There are a couple of LEDs on the mouse. The first Id like to talk about is the scroller. It pulsates about every other second with either a red light or a...'),
(N'Gregory', N'Lewis', N'gregory.lewis8885@example.com', '2016-06-05', 3, N'don''t remember what I did with this game,but I think it worked and I played it some and got bored with it and lost it in the trash some how,may find it later.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Hill', N'jennifer.hill5141@example.com', '2016-06-05', 5, N'Awesome, Awesome game. Although I''ve already beaten Dead Island on PS3, this will probably be the third time of me purchasing this game. I won''t get into the specifics but coming back to this game on the PS4 is a plus. Remastered visuals, although I wish they had left some of the objects moveable (like the beach balls), the controls are definitely cleaner and I don''t know if anyone remembered back in 2011, the save feature was messed up at launch (later on patched and fixed), no problems here - the save icon actually moved from the right to the left. I''d like to try out multiplayer to see how it does. I put probably about 60 to 80 hours into this game, trying to get trophies and want not and I had some of the best memories doing so. Its a fun game. It''s a good fill in until Dead Island 2 or Dying Light 2 comes out. My favorite character is Mai cause she''s the best at swinging sharp objects and kicking zombies with heels on!! Definitely a game to try out if you haven''t already...'),
(N'Sharon', N'Johnson', N'sharon.johnson4717@example.net', '2016-06-06', 5, N'Vita is so superior over other handhelds and your options aren''t limited. I don''t know why it gets a bad wrap but there are still a lot of good games on it. Remote play, Cross buy, Cross save, Share play, the list goes on. The only problem and reason why this system gets flak isn''t doing better is because of proprietary memory cards from Sony. $100 for a 64GB card is insane. All this just to "stop" hacking. Either way it''s worth the investment these days. The price even with the memory card is worth it these days. Especially if you are on the go a lot or just like playing on the toilet. Keep the Vita alive!'),
(N'Frank', N'Khan', N'frank.khan3001@example.com', '2016-06-06', 5, N'this is a great fighter game. i definitely you should get this game. you will have fun'),
(N'Amy', N'Price', N'amy.price2601@example.net', '2016-06-06', 1, N'I have been playing GTA for years, but this one just doesn''t feel different enough from the last ones. I know, it has variations and they can only do so much but I really didn''t care for this. Glad I got it on sale. I almost would prefer it just be free roam and everything unlocked from the beginning.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Roberts', N'jacqueline.roberts9462@example.net', '2016-06-06', 1, N'These worked fine for sound but 6 months later the china built headset broke on the right side were the headset flexes and have to tape it together to be able to use them now my sony headset held up about 2 yrs before having issues and cost the same price...The left side of this headset are cracking as well lol All i do is set the headset on my deck after done so I guess china didn''t do a very good job making these flimsy headsets which will crack right above the ear muffs. Sent headset back and got a new one from Turtle Beach and now it snapped same as the other headset so two headsets break in a year and a half will never buy these china made junk that Turtle Beach sells so terrible. Basically if you buy these expect them to last six- eight months than have to send them out to Turtle Beach and have to pay shipping on a defect that they should take responsibility for and pay the shipping.'),
(N'Peter', N'Watson', N'peter.watson3706@example.org', '2016-06-06', 4, N'good game came in two days game is ok'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Nowak', N'elizabeth.nowak9182@example.com', '2016-06-06', 5, N'I PLAY MANY RACING GAMES , THIS IS THE BEST I HAVE EVER PLAYED , EVER !!!!!!!'),
(N'Emily', N'Scott', N'emily.scott1124@example.net', '2016-06-06', 5, N'got it as a gift to my Girlfriend who plays Lucina.'),
(N'Emma', N'Hernandez', N'emma.hernandez6315@example.com', '2016-06-06', 5, N'This is a surprising good game. It is better than the original in every way. It has better graphics, beautiful colorful maps, more maps and more characters that it''s predecessor. If you like the first one, you are going to love this one. The only complain that I have is that you need to put a lot of time to unlock the characters. The game comes out of the box with one character of each type. Like one Engineer, one Scientist, one Chomper, etc.,but you can unlock like 5-6 more Chompers. Each of those Chompers is unique. For example, one spit lava, another one regenerate health when you eat, another gets faster when you eat and so on. The same goes for all the other characters. To be clear, I love that you get to unlock a lot of characters. I just wish it was a little faster for you to unlock them. On average, I think that you need to spend around 1:15hrs to get enough game coins to buy one. Still, for me this is a very good game worth buying.'),
(N'Judith', N'Wisniewski', N'judith.wisniewski7006@example.com', '2016-06-06', 4, N'Love the game it came brand new no defects'),
(N'Michael', N'Sullivan', N'michael.sullivan1182@example.com', '2016-06-06', 5, N'For 20 bucks this game is pretty sweet. I haven''t gotten far at all but felt like I should rate it rather than give it a full review. I love that your actions cause different things to unfold and I love that you can reverse your actions and choose what you want to do. So far there''s no action in the game but that''s ok with me, I like to explore and sorta chill out while a story is unfolding. I''m sure something crazy is going to happen. So I''m adding on to this review after finishing the game and the story is AMAZING! I want to replay it and see what other actions do! I''m very glad I bought this game.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Reed', N'kathleen.reed2883@example.org', '2016-06-06', 5, N'the game sucks but the shipping and price was awesome!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Young', N'jacob.young8438@example.net', '2016-06-06', 5, N'Bought this for my nephew over the holidays, he says its fun.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Torres', N'brenda.torres1069@example.net', '2016-06-06', 5, N'Really great rhythm game, LOVE vocaloid, and my favorite song is in it--world is mine.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Torres', N'brenda.torres1069@example.net', '2016-06-06', 5, N'Better than the wii release.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Young', N'christopher.young9135@example.org', '2016-06-07', 5, N'If you never played this game on the Nintendo Gamecube when it came out, you missed out on a lot. This is the second or third best Zelda game out there, depending on your tastes. And having it in HD quality makes it that much better. The story is great, the characters are nostalgic, and while it''s no Dragon Age or Assassin''s Creed, it has a whimsical feel few other games carry nowadays. And hey, it comes with a toy/ Amiibo that you can use in the game. That''s always fun.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Miller', N'ryan.miller9304@example.org', '2016-06-07', 5, N'Pleased with product.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Wilson', N'rebecca.wilson7246@example.com', '2016-06-07', 3, N'****I am ranked #6 in the world on this game. With that said. This game is good except that. On 6vs6 mode, you can only get a good game maybe 1 out of every 5 you play without a troll or some idiot playing out of position, or the goalie coming out of the net for no reason. (Alot of NON TEAM PLAYERS on this game) And the 1vs 1 mode is so bad i literally ace almost everyone i play but , it makes my passes cross crease not connect constantly , and i get lag. during KEY moments like when i clearly should get the loose puck or i am going to score. (not my connection) basically i am an ALL STAR and it makes me play like a rookie only during key moments. I believe this is programmed into the game so a select few players do not dominate and those that are not good will still buy the game.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Rodriguez', N'kathleen.rodriguez3137@example.net', '2016-06-07', 5, N'best mouse i have ever had.. Love it'),
(N'Joyce', N'Cook', N'joyce.cook9614@example.net', '2016-06-07', 5, N'I love amiibos. Great details and quality.'),
(N'Eric', N'Gonzalez', N'eric.gonzalez1012@example.net', '2016-06-08', 4, N'good game'),
(N'Jose', N'Chen', N'jose.chen3879@example.org', '2016-06-08', 5, N'I was please.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Gonzalez', N'dennis.gonzalez5961@example.org', '2016-06-08', 5, N'This works great, I like this case'),
(N'Anna', N'Kelly', N'anna.kelly6906@example.com', '2016-06-08', 5, N'I am not going to buy this for the PS4, as I already own it on PS3; but I want to chime in and say this was the best game ever released for PS3... this coming from a guy with a collection of around 60 games. I am hopeful that people who have never played it purchase this remaster and show Sega what a mistake they made not bringing the sequels to console. The game''s story is, in a word, magical. It draws very obvious parallels to WW2 and the Holocaust, and does so in a respectful and unique way. The gameplay is just the best gameplay of any game I have ever played since NES. It never gets old. I still, 8 years later, will pop in the game just to play a couple maps. I just wish there were more, as I have played through them all so many times. You have to buy this game, if you''ve never played it.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Collins', N'victoria.collins8022@example.net', '2016-06-08', 5, N'Got my code and received full balance, as expected.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Kowalski', N'brandon.kowalski9665@example.net', '2016-06-08', 5, N'I love The Legend of Zelda, and I was brought up on the first game, so this retro pouch was totally for me. This is a hard shelled case with a hard rubber exterior. The inside is a soft fabric texture, with six elastic pouches for storing six 3DS/XL game cartridges, which can be doubled up to twelve gamesif you''re willing to stretch the elastic [see photos]. You get another elastic holder to store an extra stylus. It fits a larger 3DS XL just right, and can fit all the previous portable systems before that as well. This is the sturdy case for retro Zelda fans. Recommended.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Cooper', N'aisha.cooper9985@example.com', '2016-06-08', 5, N'Love it. Amazing game and came in perfect condition. Would absolutely recommend.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Khan', N'mateo.khan5359@example.net', '2016-06-08', 5, N'My kids love this game!'),
(N'Amara', N'Gomez', N'amara.gomez5575@example.com', '2016-06-08', 5, N'Excellent video game'),
(N'Richard', N'Reed', N'richard.reed4031@example.net', '2016-06-08', 5, N'my most prized games'),
(N'Richard', N'Reed', N'richard.reed4031@example.net', '2016-06-08', 5, N'looks like a wonderful game'),
(N'Lucia', N'Mitchell', N'lucia.mitchell5165@example.com', '2016-06-08', 5, N'Awesome mouse. It is a massive step up from my previous $30 cooler master mouse. The color configuration on the mouse is very attractive. The mouse did take about a week to get used to in gaming but afterwards I loved it. The design fits your hand very well. The mouse clicks are loud and responsive. Great mouse for gaming and the price can''t be beat'),
(N'Yuki', N'Parker', N'yuki.parker2074@example.com', '2016-06-08', 5, N'In late 2008, EA released Dead Space and then a couple weeks later they released Mirror''s Edge... two of the best games that came out that year. I was afraid I''d fallen into the Twilight Zone. Dead Space went on to become a kick ass trilogy, while Mirror''s Edge seemed to immediately fall off the face of the earth and become a forgotten footnote. I thought there would never be another Mirror''s Edge, but here we are! It''s true that Catalyst is very very similar to the original game in many ways. I haven''t played the original in years, but playing through Catalyst I recognize several of the beats, mainly in game play events and set pieces. It absolutely maintains the clean and vivid futuristic visual design of the original, and the ethereal techno ambient style of the soundtrack. But it''s not what you''d call a remake, not even close. It improves upon the original by providing three different progression trees to unlock with earned points, and being open world, which is something I...'),
(N'Dee', N'Gutierrez', N'dee.gutierrez6646@example.org', '2016-06-09', 4, N'This is a good game with plenty to do and plenty to explore, but it''s no Skyrim. It''s best played with friends exploring dungeons, questing or battling other players in the PvP area. That being said, it''s very difficult to play with friends if your player levels are vastly different i.e, sharing quests, but it''s possible if your friends don''t mind doing quests or fighting enemies that may be a few levels above them since you would have probably already done their lower level quests and thus, won''t be able to share them. On the flipside playing by yourself can get kinda old after awhile and is part of the reason I traded this game in the first time I owned it because it just felt like a watered-down version of Skyrim. Another reason I traded it in is as I got to the higher levels, around 40 or so, it became harder and harder to find quests and the game became an exercise of exploring every nook and cranny on the map trying to find some. On the PvP side it has it''s moments but...'),
(N'David', N'Sanders', N'david.sanders2928@example.org', '2016-06-09', 4, N'When Mega Man Anniversary Collection came out in 2004, it was a stupidly-awesome deal. 10 games, two of which were previously unreleased, for 40 bucks? You kidding me? 12 years later, however, one might confuse this with the just-released Mega Man Legacy Collection. While I''ll buy anything with that goofy robot mug on the cover, the Legacy Collection actually features much less content, for the price of a modern game. If you''re unfamiliar with Mega Man in general, and you''ve still got a ps2/xbox/gamecube kicking around, then the Anniversary Collection is a great and cheap way to get familiar with one of the most important video game franchises in the last 30 years. It features Mega Man 1-8, as well as two arcade beat-em-ups called Mega Man: The Power Battles 1 and 2. Any fool with an emulator can play most these games, so you''re probably wondering, "What makes this package stand out?" Features. A smorgasbord of wonderful features. One can now save in any of the 8 main games,...'),
(N'Brandon', N'Gomez', N'brandon.gomez1873@example.org', '2016-06-09', 5, N'Does the job. That''s all it has to do.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Ramos', N'stephanie.ramos5027@example.net', '2016-06-09', 5, N'Not as good as 4 and 6 but a beautiful, great game nonetheless. Possibly one of the last greats of the series. Wonderful remaster!'),
(N'Linda', N'Howard', N'linda.howard4048@example.org', '2016-06-09', 3, N'For some reason I thought this is Capcom vs. Street FighterThat was my mistake But my husband really liked it.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Sanders', N'hannah.sanders6742@example.net', '2016-06-09', 5, N'I was hesitant to buy this controller but I''m glad that I did. It''s hard to lump it in with other controllers as it is so much more! I didn''t open Steam and right away I was able to use my controller to navigate my HTPC without a mouse. The right pad felt like an actual scroll wheel/ball due to the haptic (vibrations indicating a response to your touch). I was amazed at how they accomplished this as it was fun and allowed me to use it to surf the web or play my games. Keep in mind, there is a learning curve but it''s like anything else...the more you put into it the more you get out of it! I''ve not had a chance to do extended gaming yet but I''ll update my review as soon as I do. I included a couple shots of the back as I didn''t see a lot posted. Pros: Acts like mouse/keyboard/scroll wheel and controller Cons: No rechargeable battery option'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Kumar', N'jennifer.kumar7843@example.com', '2016-06-09', 4, N'Good game.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Young', N'joyce.young7059@example.org', '2016-06-09', 5, N'I never played the original but I picked this up from GameStop and I''m so glad I gave it a try. This is one of the coolest games I''ve ever played. Odin Sphere Leifthrasir is a brilliant side-scrolling adventure mixed with traditional RPG elements, it blends together perfectly. The graphics are some of the best I''ve ever seen, it has beautiful lush environments, rich vivid colors, and fluent 60fps animations... it''s like looking at a living HD art masterpiece. Everything about the game is well made and just gorgeous. There is a perfect mix of deep captivating story and buttery smooth action packed combat. There are some crazy awesome special attacks and abilities that really go all out! You can create your own potions with alchemy and there is a wide variety of spells to make. 5 unique playable characters and thus 5 different stories to be told. There is a new game plus mode, and for those wanting a real challenge... there is a unlockable "Heroic" difficulty mode that keeps your max...'),
(N'Joseph', N'Rogers', N'joseph.rogers1351@example.org', '2016-06-09', 4, N'Not a bad remastering but not the best either. The developers opted to develop the game with the Dying light engine which definitely makes the game look a bit better. The biggest issue I have with the graphics involves the hazy nature by which light reflects off of surfaces. Also, there are some indoor sections where the texture ripping is just terrible. The game runs at 30fps which seems inexcusable but its so smooth you could mistake it for 60 at times. The resolution also has been bumped up to 1080p and the game looks really sharp because of it. From a gameplay standpoint, its a gigantic compilation of fetch quests and zombie murder, and thats fine because the game is a blast to play. Gaining experience, leveling up, and utilizing a wide range of melee and ranged weapons makes Dead Island Definitive a good value. It comes with Dead Island Definitive, Dead Island Riptide Definitive and a Dead Island arcade game. For 40 bucks, Id say pick it up, just don''t expect a perfect...'),
(N'Julie', N'Okonkwo', N'julie.okonkwo1952@example.net', '2016-06-09', 5, N'that was a very good game, like it'),
(N'Ivan', N'Brooks', N'ivan.brooks3002@example.com', '2016-06-09', 5, N'love it love it.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Castillo', N'douglas.castillo4885@example.com', '2016-06-10', 2, N'Childish and not much variety. Not much fun'),
(N'Christina', N'Sullivan', N'christina.sullivan3873@example.com', '2016-06-10', 4, N'Disc was loose and came a lil dirty but i cleaned and it work fine. Pretty good so far alot of learning but im getting the hang of it.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Rogers', N'brenda.rogers8317@example.org', '2016-06-10', 5, N'10 year old grandson picked this out. He loves it!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Khan', N'patrick.khan5902@example.net', '2016-06-10', 5, N'Baldurs gate fan. So I had to have them all.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Sullivan', N'deborah.sullivan8013@example.org', '2016-06-10', 5, N'It''s the original game in all it''s 8 bit glory. It''d be great if they could make use of the rest of the screen (letterbox bars), but that''s really not all that practical with a port.'),
(N'Judith', N'Hughes', N'judith.hughes2310@example.org', '2016-06-10', 5, N'Works perfectly. Playing through, currently!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Price', N'timothy.price3687@example.org', '2016-06-10', 5, N'Great game. Great for all ages.'),
(N'Karen', N'Thomas', N'karen.thomas2932@example.net', '2016-06-10', 5, N'We have over 60 amiibo and we just couldn''t pass up the deals Amazon has had lately on them, with many of them being four to six dollars. We used the super slow saver shipping to get a one dollar credit for digital stuff and it''s even better. I''m looking forward to see what Nintendo does with them on the NX and in the future.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Bailey', N'andrew.bailey4767@example.com', '2016-06-10', 5, N'You can''t beat this HOTAS for the price. This is my second one (purchased it for my kid). I''ve had my original for almost 1.5 years and it still works almost like new. I do find that the throttle isn''t as stiff as I would like after all the use, but it still holds its position. I bought this for Elite Dangerous and it''s perfect for the game.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Ramirez', N'samuel.ramirez1236@example.org', '2016-06-10', 5, N'I loved this game !! It was super fun and a great experience for a first time Far Cry player. The story is fun and the characters are interesting, especially Pagan Min. Overall, this game packs a lot of action and fun (plus there is lots to do). I would recommend this game to anyone who prefers single player open world games (and those who like a little co-op too).'),
(N'Nicole', N'Ortiz', N'nicole.ortiz7835@example.net', '2016-06-10', 4, N'I love the looks but i haven''t tried it out as of yet'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Suzuki', N'cynthia.suzuki9540@example.com', '2016-06-10', 4, N'Great game nice X-ray action'),
(N'Kevin', N'Khan', N'kevin.khan9093@example.net', '2016-06-11', 5, N'Amazing. Buy this game, now. You will have no regrets.'),
(N'Michael', N'Morales', N'michael.morales8921@example.com', '2016-06-11', 4, N'Compared to the previous Pokmon games, I didn''t particularly like X. The graphics and Pokmon battles were new and innovative compared to older games. The cities and Pokmon had a more 3-Dimensional look to them and that looked amazing. The ability to be able to connect to the internet and trade/battle with people world wide was also a great feature integrated into the game. I also enjoyed the little things that they include into the game. Such as being able to take pictures in front of landmarks. The reason I didn''t like it was because of the new generation of Pokmon that you could catch in the game. They were kind of awkward to me and too weird compared to older generations. I think they had more of a Digimon feel to them, but that just my opinion. Other than that, the game was very nice. The story was also good. The protagonist goes against a large group with the intention of doing something extreme. These kind of stories are a staple in the Pokmon world, but I never get tired of it.'),
(N'Helen', N'Gomez', N'helen.gomez4842@example.net', '2016-06-11', 5, N'Just another great Razer product'),
(N'Dennis', N'Raghunathan', N'dennis.raghunathan1043@example.org', '2016-06-11', 5, N'FAVORITE BASEBALL GAME TO DATE-EVER! WANTED TO HAVE BACK-UPS FOR WHATEVER REASON'),
(N'George', N'Nguyen', N'george.nguyen4717@example.com', '2016-06-11', 4, N'No complaints....'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Robinson', N'evelyn.robinson3613@example.com', '2016-06-11', 5, N'Works for the game my son plays'),
(N'Timothy', N'Watson', N'timothy.watson5726@example.com', '2016-06-11', 5, N'Works perfectly with American consoles. I had been using a Smash Bros Fight pad (the one that has button layouts like the GameCube) But playing SNES games on the Wii was a pain as the button layout didn''t quite mesh. Purchased this and now I can enjoy the SNES Games without having to contort my fingers to hit the right buttons. Very comfortable compared the the Classic controller that doesn''t have the protruding hand grips.'),
(N'Walter', N'Wisniewski', N'walter.wisniewski7591@example.org', '2016-06-11', 5, N'I love how detailed Baloo is. Got him on sale and he is a welcome addition to my disney infinity collection. He is perfect for any disney or jungle book fan even if you don''t play the game. Being a fan of the game is an extra bonus!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Nguyen', N'samuel.nguyen6155@example.net', '2016-06-12', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Yuki', N'Ross', N'yuki.ross5426@example.com', '2016-06-12', 5, N'A must have if you are a destiny fan! Otherwise it''s a standard console with a cool design on it. It''s a great system.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Carter', N'marcus.carter3945@example.net', '2016-06-12', 4, N'My son loves this game. And as an old guy that remembers these games, I''ll admit, it''s pretty cool.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Carter', N'marcus.carter3945@example.net', '2016-06-12', 4, N'Great collection of rare games.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Anderson', N'zachary.anderson6259@example.org', '2016-06-12', 3, N'Bottom line: Buy it on sale. I wouldn''t pay more than $20 for everything from this game [that includes the base game and all DLCs]. Pros: 1. Excellent writing and voice acting. After the snooze-fest script that is the Witcher 3, having dialogue that is consistently engaging delivered with convincing voice actors is a breath of fresh air. 2. Geniunely dramatic moments. Seeing the airships at the end of Act I was a sight to behold. 2. Excellent combat. The meat and potatoes of this game. The VATS system is astounding, and after 30+ hours of gameplay, it is still very satisfying to gun down mercenaries, mutants, bugs, and all manners of creatures with the trademark targeting system of Fallout. 3. Level progression. Intuitive and gives you incentive to press on. Cons: 1. Time consuming, and not in the good way. I would say that around 70-80% of what you do is filler in this game. Traveling from place to place, while initially exciting, can be a drag after a few hours due to the lack of...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Edwards', N'cheryl.edwards1691@example.net', '2016-06-12', 3, N'After only a few months they started to tear pretty badly. Had to buy a different brand. For the few months before the tearing happened, they had great grip.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Edwards', N'cheryl.edwards1691@example.net', '2016-06-12', 5, N'Was easy to install on my PS4 controllers. Get a good grip and so far have zero tearing issues.'),
(N'Christine', N'Martin', N'christine.martin9061@example.net', '2016-06-12', 5, N'loved it'),
(N'Scott', N'Morales', N'scott.morales4450@example.com', '2016-06-12', 4, N'This game came out with many bugs, but they have fixed up most problems and I got this at $5, so can''t complain, its well worth that.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Tanaka', N'cheryl.tanaka7103@example.com', '2016-06-12', 5, N'Excellent Game with great graphics and deep gameplay, arrived on time and in near perfect condition.'),
(N'Mary', N'Butler', N'mary.butler9621@example.net', '2016-06-12', 5, N'product description was excellent and I would gladly do business with this seller again.'),
(N'Scott', N'Alvarez', N'scott.alvarez9889@example.com', '2016-06-13', 2, N'I find myself getting up to turn this sensor bar off more than I do turning it on. It seems like the more batteries you put in it the faster it dies. It works, but not for long.'),
(N'Robert', N'Price', N'robert.price8266@example.org', '2016-06-13', 4, N'Not nearly as comfortable as my Sony PS4 Gold Wireless Headset, but I guess it does the job for the Xbone. Since Microsoft is too lazy to make a great 7.1 headset like Sony, this Turtle Beach stereo headset will have to do. It is almost impossible to get a 5.1 or 7.1 simulated headset for the Xbone without paying an outrageous triple digit price. My only complaint about this headset that deserves one star subtracted is the fact that the earmuffs are way too small. If they were even slightly bigger this headset would be much more comfortable over longer periods of use. Even with average sized ears, my lobes get folded in a bit and it''s not very comfortable. The sound quality for this 2.1 stereo headset is great. Can''t complain about that. Also, the microphone is crystal clear when chatting. However, I did notice my friend''s voice went from normal to robot sounding (think Crysis) after a little while, and couldn''t fix it. All in all, this is probably the best stereo headset for the...'),
(N'Helen', N'Myers', N'helen.myers8507@example.net', '2016-06-13', 4, N'this is perfect for protection. Its great for travel. and it feels awesome. it takes a little bit to reach the touch pad on the back but thats ok because no one ever uses that. I would have given this item a glowing 5 stars review if it weren''t for one issue. i use my ps vita for remote play often. and this works well with remote play. but there is one problem. if you are playing a game like destiny and trying to sprint. then you have the plastic in-between the analog stick and the d pad that makes sprinting more difficult. other than that one issue this is a 5 star item. protects. its comfortable. its cool. my hands feel WAY BETTER in this grip. so if you plan on playing your ps vita often then get this. but if you play a lot of fps games. ESPECIALLY if you play them remote play. spend your money on the trigger grip. other than that one caveat this item is the best by far.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Wilson', N'aisha.wilson9291@example.com', '2016-06-13', 2, N'absolutely horrible, could barley play 2 hours before shutting the game off, even if this wasn''t a resident evil game it wouldn''t even succeed as a good action game, random qte all over the place cut scenes every 5 to 10 mins and horrible gameplay elements that make this game a glorified shooting gallery , Other than that please don''t be tricked with these reviews saying its a good game , for the first time take meta critics score and run with it!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Wilson', N'aisha.wilson1402@example.net', '2016-06-13', 5, N'This truly is a primal farcry !!'),
(N'Christine', N'Ramirez', N'christine.ramirez7828@example.org', '2016-06-13', 5, N'If you''re deciding on which version to get then you only need to ask yourself one question. "Do I care about updated rosters and kits?" Because aside from that, every game from this 2012 version to 2015 is exactly the same. The only difference is the price and the question you internally asked yourself. Oh also they took out features in the later versions like online play and some career modes. Get this game instead of the "newer" ones. Trust me broski.'),
(N'Christine', N'Ramirez', N'christine.ramirez7828@example.org', '2016-06-13', 5, N'I played China on my pc but when I got the vita I decided to get this since I needed to play the other 2 in the series. I''ll say this: on the smaller screen, the 2.5D and the colors look great. This isn''t a full on AC open world game so if you know that going in, you''ll enjoy these games. Each game took me close to 8 hours to beat, longer if you wanna get the best scores/medals. It''s 3 games with same gameplay but different stories and main characters so each game feels different. The physical copy costs more than the digital so if you have a bigger memory card, get the digital version and same some money. If not, it''s still worth the buy.'),
(N'Amy', N'Edwards', N'amy.edwards9943@example.org', '2016-06-13', 5, N'Arrived as described'),
(N'Gregory', N'Jones', N'gregory.jones5419@example.com', '2016-06-13', 5, N'It always seems that CD Projekt Red the developer of of the Witcher series always seems to over deliver, you think you are getting extra DLC nope your are pretty much getting a whole new game. The info claims that it''s just about 30 hours of content and I think I''m closer to 60, I still have things to do. They kind of fool you in thinking ok the game is over but they pull you back in with more. The game is just gorgeous and the story line has more twists and turns then a roller coaster. The fixed some things that I kind of complained about, you finally have a base of operations and something that you can use on all of the gold you collect. Just about every quest gives you the options on how you want to handle it, do you kill the monster or allow it to live and you get to see what happens depending on your choices.'),
(N'Debra', N'Martin', N'debra.martin7485@example.org', '2016-06-13', 1, N'U cant create players n play season all the new sports games all suck ps2 was way better'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Russell', N'jeffrey.russell3809@example.net', '2016-06-13', 5, N'Great product, and great seller!'),
(N'David', N'Ward', N'david.ward1681@example.com', '2016-06-14', 5, N'Worked amazingly');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Michael', N'Morales', N'michael.morales8921@example.com', '2016-06-14', 4, N'After playing Awakening, I was excited to hear about Fates. I rally enjoyed everything that Awakening had to offer and I couldn''t wait to see how Fates would be. I also liked that you could different paths in the game. Should you go with your adopted family, Nohr? Or your birth family, Hoshido? Or should you wait for Revelations to choose your own path? I bought birthright first because I heard that the story mode was easier than Conquest and I honestly just wanted to play through the game first and experience the story. That''s usually what I do my first time playing a game anyway. In Birthrights, you make the choice to side with your blood related family, the Hoshido. The classes available for this game are different and have an Asian theme to them. Jobs such as ninja or oni chieftan. Fates also includes the partnership system, same as Awakening did which I was happy to find out. The battle system was almost exactly like Awakening with a couple more features. Unlike Awakening, in...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Morgan', N'ravi.morgan7172@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'My 9 year old likes to take walks around to see how many play coins he can make'),
(N'Ravi', N'Morgan', N'ravi.morgan7172@example.org', '2016-06-14', 4, N'If you like boho fashion this is the pack for you, has some great items, not much movie stuff tho, popcorn maker and a new screen tv with movie options.'),
(N'Janet', N'Lee', N'janet.lee1089@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'This game may just be the best in the series. It''s fun, hugely interactive and really well put together. They have built on the success of their more recent kirby games, and made something that feels entirely new while maintaining the same structure of all kirby games. As a long time fan, I highly recommend this game! Not only does kirby get a mech, his mech gets powers too!'),
(N'Jerry', N'Ali', N'jerry.ali7237@example.net', '2016-06-14', 5, N'It worked when I bought it and it still functions as it should.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Roberts', N'kyle.roberts3320@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Peter', N'Gomez', N'peter.gomez3355@example.org', '2016-06-14', 4, N'I''m a mark for this series so I don''t even know that I can do an unbiased review. I''ll give it a shot anyway. This is your typical DR fare, you''ll wander through hoards of zombies looking for new and interesting ways to kill them, with other non-zombies to interact with. Some of the controls are slightly different than past games, (like inventory system.) but it''s still the same awesome zombie game that many have learned to love over the years. Most certainly a killer app. If you don''t have an XBOX One, you buy one for this game.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Thomas', N'thomas.thomas4649@example.net', '2016-06-14', 5, N'great for any mulan fan that plays Infinity!'),
(N'Gregory', N'Hernandez', N'gregory.hernandez3354@example.com', '2016-06-14', 5, N'Works great!'),
(N'Jason', N'Bennett', N'jason.bennett7952@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'IM ADDICTED!! GAME PLAY IS FUN AND MULTIPLAYER IS EVEN BETTER!!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wilson', N'jacqueline.wilson7993@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'Good price for a good game. Arrived sealed as expected.'),
(N'John', N'Wood', N'john.wood6047@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'good'),
(N'Amara', N'Reyes', N'amara.reyes1571@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'I am very happy with this product and I recommend service'),
(N'Diane', N'Davis', N'diane.davis9473@example.org', '2016-06-14', 5, N'Everything ok'),
(N'Ivan', N'Wood', N'ivan.wood4516@example.net', '2016-06-15', 5, N'great fun'),
(N'Amara', N'Kowalski', N'amara.kowalski3391@example.org', '2016-06-15', 5, N'good'),
(N'Ravi', N'Reed', N'ravi.reed3218@example.com', '2016-06-15', 5, N'Good game great shape'),
(N'Nicole', N'Suzuki', N'nicole.suzuki9924@example.net', '2016-06-15', 1, N'Siberia 200 The most uncomfortable headset I have ever bought. and I have bought a lot. Buy the V3 instead. They are virtually the same headset but the v3 is like a pillow.'),
(N'Amy', N'Garcia', N'amy.garcia6549@example.com', '2016-06-15', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Amy', N'Garcia', N'amy.garcia6549@example.com', '2016-06-15', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Gregory', N'Webb', N'gregory.webb7914@example.net', '2016-06-15', 5, N'Add another skylander to our growing collection. Yes, this whole game is a money scheme. I enjoy the game and so does my four year old. If it can be enjoyable for us both, why not?'),
(N'Hannah', N'Ross', N'hannah.ross3279@example.com', '2016-06-15', 1, N'Thought this game would be hot but its not'),
(N'Diane', N'Ali', N'diane.ali6711@example.net', '2016-06-15', 1, N'this controller never worled very good, the commands weren''t synchronized each other'),
(N'Mei', N'Garcia', N'mei.garcia2250@example.net', '2016-06-15', 4, N'Very good product and service also.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Fisher', N'joshua.fisher3655@example.com', '2016-06-16', 5, N'Great add to my collection'),
(N'Ryan', N'Brooks', N'ryan.brooks8736@example.net', '2016-06-16', 5, N'Great gaming mouse. 3200 DPI works good and clicks wthout lag. Ima order another one. Amazing for under $20'),
(N'Mary', N'Roberts', N'mary.roberts6137@example.com', '2016-06-16', 1, N'My statue came broken!!! Her hand was broken off. The game is amazing but I paid the extra $100 for the statue which was a HUGE let down'),
(N'Donald', N'Watson', N'donald.watson5263@example.org', '2016-06-16', 5, N'fantastic, love it, everything as described and delivered in a timely fashion'),
(N'Laura', N'Fisher', N'laura.fisher6777@example.com', '2016-06-17', 5, N'Bought this game for my guy, he loves it! Now I go to bed alone most nights while he kills demons.'),
(N'Karen', N'Bailey', N'karen.bailey4957@example.net', '2016-06-17', 3, N'I give this game a 4 Star rating out of five, but I don''t think that it is entirely honest. I don''t think it earns the full 5 stars, but it out paces a 4 star rating. I would like to give it an 90 of 100. It is a good game. I need to stress that here, because I am going to tear into it now. Uncharted 3 is an attempt to Out Indy the Indiana Jones stories. Where the first Uncharted was an homage to Raiders of the Lost Ark, Uncharted 2 was a kind of remake of Kingdom of the Crystal Skull(Chasing a Russian army to a mythical city while dealing with a past love interest that re-enters your life). Uncharted 3 is Last Crusade. Starts with the flash back to being a kid and Drakes first adventure. You are accompanied by Drakes father(figure) of Sully, Templars and Crusades and then off to the desert! That being said, I freaking love Indiana Jones, so the story wasn''t my gripe. The Controls and Gameplay are dragging this game down. I said it. The desire to give a Cinematic Game Experience...'),
(N'Thomas', N'Clark', N'thomas.clark9343@example.com', '2016-06-17', 5, N'Good Stuff'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Murphy', N'rebecca.murphy3007@example.net', '2016-06-17', 1, N'NO DISC'),
(N'Richard', N'Brooks', N'richard.brooks2628@example.com', '2016-06-17', 3, N'Pretty nice for the price.'),
(N'Peter', N'Mitchell', N'peter.mitchell2972@example.net', '2016-06-17', 5, N'PERFECT CONDITION'),
(N'Alexander', N'Rodriguez', N'alexander.rodriguez5891@example.net', '2016-06-17', 1, N'This is the first title I''ve tried in the series. I play PC games and this is a good example why. Console games are terrible. They are terrible because the pseudo computer systems they are played on are weak and there are huge differences between what a $300 machine can do vs a $3000 machine. Still, it is shocking the low quality that the console fanbois have convinced themselves is worth their time. Unfortunately, part of the delusion is writing fabulous reviews about incredibly inferior products like Dark Souls and outright lying about it. This is NOT an RPG. It does not even bother to provide a cogent backstory. In true testament to the delusion, there are hours of youtube video by some people with really vivid imaginations that make up what would have been a great story....but nowhere in the game is any of their fantasy more than hinted at. Unless there is a manga out there with hundreds of pages of fiction this game is based on, the devs were incredibly lazy and did not bother...'),
(N'Victoria', N'Campbell', N'victoria.campbell5410@example.net', '2016-06-18', 5, N'DOOM is a fantastic reboot and tribute to the original franchise. RIP AND TEAR The soundtrack is amazing, the gameplay is fun, epic, and visceral. The controls feel surprisingly tight and responsive, and the graphics are wonderful as well. The singleplayer story is a BLAST, though multiplayer is a bit... meh. They tried to integrate too many elements of other shooters (CoD, Halo) to appeal to a mass audience and it didn''t work out well. To be fair, it was developed by Id - Id''s multiplayer team was busy working on the new Quake. Id''s multiplayer team has come back to patch up the game, so multiplayer may improve.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Torres', N'sandra.torres6737@example.org', '2016-06-18', 5, N'Very good game, interesting plot, I don''t really understand all the hate about it. Would reccomend!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Reed', N'ryan.reed8459@example.com', '2016-06-18', 5, N'This game is so much fun! Hack and slash all the way! What could make that better... add Samuel Jackson''s extremely funny dialogue to it and you are in for a wonderful afternoon of gaming fun! If you can find a copy of the game with the slip cover jacket (Like I did)... get it. They are becoming more rare to find and a must for any collector!'),
(N'Amara', N'Patel', N'amara.patel5034@example.net', '2016-06-18', 4, N'This game is good and worth the buy'),
(N'Aaron', N'Sanders', N'aaron.sanders5778@example.org', '2016-06-18', 3, N'Short game with marginal appeal.'),
(N'Noah', N'Watson', N'noah.watson8503@example.net', '2016-06-18', 5, N'A breathless joy from start to finish: Naughty Dog (potentially) closes out its flagship action-adventure series at the top of its game. Excellent set-pieces, fluid gameplay, bar-none wit, and unmatched confidence in storytelling secure Uncharted 4 a place in the pantheon of exemplary games.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Watson', N'hiroshi.watson4848@example.org', '2016-06-18', 5, N'This game is exceptional and exceded my expectations, the story is great and possibly the best graphics to date on any system.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Cox', N'rachel.cox6427@example.net', '2016-06-18', 4, N'Nice game. Servers are very slow for updating the game'),
(N'Rachel', N'Cox', N'rachel.cox6427@example.net', '2016-06-18', 4, N'Ok. Use cable is so short!! But 10$ after all I would recommend buying one with 2 usb expention'),
(N'Ronald', N'Lewis', N'ronald.lewis6606@example.com', '2016-06-18', 5, N'Its a hit with my grandson its just what he wanted for his birthday....'),
(N'Ravi', N'Lopez', N'ravi.lopez8727@example.org', '2016-06-18', 5, N'Challenging game with a lot of stages'),
(N'Ryan', N'Robinson', N'ryan.robinson9982@example.net', '2016-06-19', 5, N'Love playing this game! Thank you!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Parker', N'joshua.parker1669@example.com', '2016-06-19', 1, N'Graphics weak, movement nauseating.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Reed', N'ryan.reed8459@example.com', '2016-06-19', 5, N'Simply one of the best games ever made for the Nintendo DS gaming system. Ahead of its time... and alot of fun to play. You battle with the stylus on the touch screen while battling on the upper screen with the D-Pad and buttons! Makes for an exciting game! A must for any gamer out there! Very fast paced and a great storyline as well.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Chen', N'olivia.chen9213@example.net', '2016-06-19', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Donna', N'Howard', N'donna.howard5715@example.net', '2016-06-20', 3, N'It works like its suppose to but doesn''t include the mute and chafe volume switch'),
(N'Aaron', N'Smith', N'aaron.smith2431@example.com', '2016-06-20', 4, N'Do I keep them on my controller full time? Yes. Have they helped my K/D? Maybe? The taller grip takes about 30 mins to get used to it and now I just leave it on. The grip feel is perfect and I only use the tall grip on my aiming stick. It was affordable enough to give it a shot, I''m just not sure that it is helping my game all that much. I just split this with a friend and we both got 2 sets (no need to have 4 pairs)'),
(N'Janet', N'Reyes', N'janet.reyes5711@example.net', '2016-06-20', 5, N'I have experienced no issues with lag or anything dumb. would buy again.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Martin', N'nancy.martin8131@example.net', '2016-06-20', 5, N'I''ve had a few days with this mouse and I like it a lot. My two favorite features would be the nearly silent clicking and the DPI buttons. With the nearly silent left and right click buttons, it''s perfect is you play a lot of games like League or Legends, Diablo, or even a first person shooter. This does require some getting used to. The buttons are so soft and clicks so effortlessly that it almost feels like you''re not even pressing the buttons down. The DPI buttons were super helpful when I tested out Battlefield 4. By increasing DPI, I as able to look around faster. When decreasing DPI, I was able to be more precise with my long distance shots.'),
(N'Larry', N'Richardson', N'larry.richardson3846@example.net', '2016-06-20', 2, N'Everything I get from amazon warehouse seems to be defective. first a monitor now this. it started disconnecting randomly from my computer. frustrating'),
(N'Pamela', N'Evans', N'pamela.evans9366@example.org', '2016-06-20', 5, N'very fun game for a $2.00 download just screwed up when I ordered the controller'),
(N'Megan', N'Bailey', N'megan.bailey5844@example.net', '2016-06-20', 5, N'just as great as the original'),
(N'Patrick', N'Campbell', N'patrick.campbell7878@example.com', '2016-06-20', 5, N'Guys always love games!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Lee', N'ronald.lee5443@example.org', '2016-06-21', 5, N'The fastest way to burn though 30 hr. Love it.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Tanaka', N'nicholas.tanaka1550@example.org', '2016-06-21', 5, N'THE EASIEST SCREEN PROTECTOR TO APPLY EVER! I WISH THEY COULD DO THIS FOR PHONES AND TABLETS!!!'),
(N'Adam', N'Morgan', N'adam.morgan5396@example.net', '2016-06-21', 2, N'Flexes and creaks quite a bit, I feel like I might break it anytime although I haven''t. The lock mechanism covers the charging port. The plastic has an ok texture. The handles could be larger, I have relatively small hands and it''s still too small for me.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Rogers', N'jacob.rogers5402@example.org', '2016-06-21', 5, N'I almost returned this when I read it didn''t come with a disc. But I opened it and it DOES include a game disc and the soundtrack stacked on top of each other. People should really delete those misleading reviews.'),
(N'Patricia', N'James', N'patricia.james3567@example.com', '2016-06-21', 5, N'Just as good as the Metal Gear Solid V from Japan.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Robinson', N'olivia.robinson4729@example.com', '2016-06-21', 5, N'Console, all cables, headset, and external drive all fit in this bag perfectly. If you take your Xbox anywhere this is perfect.'),
(N'Michelle', N'James', N'michelle.james3382@example.net', '2016-06-21', 5, N'I bought this for my son who plays a lot of video games & has been asking for one for some time. It works great and he can still plug his headset into the headphone jack!! Would highly recommend this to anyone who wants one or that games a lot. A reliable product at a reasonable price. You can look around (I did) but you won''t find the same product at this price. (Look at the features, not all chat pads have the same features)'),
(N'Mateo', N'Jenkins', N'mateo.jenkins9473@example.net', '2016-06-21', 5, N'I will cherish this game forever. Until the next Bethesda miracle comes around. I''m hooked for life!'),
(N'Donna', N'Singh', N'donna.singh8825@example.net', '2016-06-21', 5, N'big mouse buttens are feel great soft where that comes with is ez to use'),
(N'Douglas', N'Johnson', N'douglas.johnson9196@example.net', '2016-06-21', 4, N'I found it really fun, but don''t expect much from the story or characters. I think it''s more competitive than what most people think, but I don''t have much credibility cause I only play Smash (not even Melee). I highly wish that this game could possibly get DLC for future characters in the future and any sequels in the future as well.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Butler', N'elizabeth.butler8079@example.org', '2016-06-22', 2, N'For starters the game isn''t immersive in the least. It''s just another 3rd person casual small minded release. Sure the powers are kinda cool but the initial interest wears off fairly quickly. And to me this whole live action nonsense is a gimmick and clearly made to cash in on this whole TV series craze and appear innovative with it''s story telling. Personally I don''t like it. I mean why do we need real actors? What''s the point of doing this in a game? We should be focused making games innovative but instead with this live action junk it''s essentially this game/movie FMV hybrid. Games have come a long way in recent years so why do this? The whole live action thing here is terrible. If this were an actual show on TV I would never watch it. Moving on I found the gameplay to be lacking. The movement in the game sucks, it''s buggy, the powers are inconsistent, and once again we are stuck going down this linear path doing generic tasks. And also a lot of the back story and world building...'),
(N'Barbara', N'Edwards', N'barbara.edwards6549@example.net', '2016-06-22', 5, N'Easy hook up and easy to use just need to watch for what buttons I am pushing.'),
(N'Steven', N'Suzuki', N'steven.suzuki4332@example.net', '2016-06-22', 5, N'I love whoopin'' my friends in this game. So awesome.'),
(N'Steven', N'Suzuki', N'steven.suzuki4332@example.net', '2016-06-22', 3, N'Not nearly as good as the first but still good.'),
(N'Steven', N'Suzuki', N'steven.suzuki4332@example.net', '2016-06-22', 5, N'Great game. Graphics are amazing, entertaining dialogue, good story, funtastic gameplay!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd1353@example.com', '2016-06-22', 4, N'I never beat this game in the 80''s (or 90''s ''cause was launched in 1989) now I had the resmasterized version, I got it in a offer al $6.00, I brougth it just by price (had to be honest), but this game is really good like it was before, now i feel it so much easy than 20 years ago, and I advance more that then :P. The game looks great, sounds great, the story oviously is not great but is somo funny, after all it is a good game, the dificult level is not great, but hard mode is ok May be is not a good game for all this rocky palyers that call him/her self "hardcore" ''cause the old school gamer are real hardcore games.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Morgan', N'zachary.morgan8901@example.com', '2016-06-22', 5, N'This thing is awesome. Due to its shape, it''s probably the most durable amiibo ever.'),
(N'Mei', N'Gonzalez', N'mei.gonzalez4539@example.com', '2016-06-22', 3, N'This model that I purchased had severe issues and, now owning a Xbone, I can say that the controller would have worked flawlessly. I cannot wait until the new Xbone S controller has come out with that console for the better review.'),
(N'Henry', N'Peterson', N'henry.peterson1852@example.org', '2016-06-22', 4, N'This is a good game, and I didn''t really want to dock it a star, but this is probably the worst version. Just get it for something else.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Moore', N'lucia.moore4484@example.net', '2016-06-22', 4, N'I bought this mainly for my 3 favorite arcade games. PittFighter, Rampage and NARC.....The rest were bonus games! All of which were rather nice...especially the Mortal Kombat games. If you are a fan of classic arcade fighters, then you will no doubt find a lot here to interest you!'),
(N'Rachel', N'Baker', N'rachel.baker9825@example.net', '2016-06-22', 5, N'if you are debating on getting this or the mayflash one get this one i read on reddit that it has less input lag'),
(N'Aaron', N'Diaz', N'aaron.diaz5048@example.org', '2016-06-22', 4, N'Came in early looks ok'),
(N'Samantha', N'Reed', N'samantha.reed2196@example.org', '2016-06-23', 5, N'This made the system worth it.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Martin', N'hannah.martin2497@example.net', '2016-06-23', 5, N'So much on one disc it''s amazing. A must buy for Metal Gear Solid fans.'),
(N'George', N'Reed', N'george.reed4015@example.org', '2016-06-23', 4, N'No issues. Quality isn''t amazing but, should you really expect it to be at this price? It gets the job done.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Tanaka', N'raymond.tanaka9699@example.com', '2016-06-23', 5, N'I got this to replace my PS4 controller on my PC, which was having a bunch of lag issues on bluetooth noted by the software I was using and this has proved to be a far better experience. I miss the trackpad of the PS4 controller which let me manipulate windows just fine but now I have no lag and the controller is solid. I was worried about the dpad being crap since microsoft has never gotten one to be good, they''ve all been crap from the first Xbox to the 360, now? The dpad worked fine for me in a playthrough of Mega Man X, good enough for me. The buttons feel nice, the sticks feel solid and this must be a newer model since the bumpers are fully clickable and not ''hinged'' like the launch version was. As I said the dpad is nice and clicky and feels solid. The controller in general feels really solid, better than the 360 and PS3 pads I''ve had the pleasure of using. It''s been a solid experience, the battery life with a set of enloop batteries has been great, haven''t had to charge them...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Chavez', N'michelle.chavez8649@example.net', '2016-06-23', 5, N'GREAT GAME LOVE THE MADDEN FOOTBALL GAME SERIES!!!!'),
(N'Emma', N'Scott', N'emma.scott1839@example.com', '2016-06-23', 1, N'This is a soulless game compared to all of the other Heroes. I''ve been playing this since Heroes 2 and a huge fan of the series. After playing this I believe I am ready for this series to stop. Such great potential but terrible dynamics, game play, and annoying cut scenes. Get Age of Wonders 3! Really great strategy game if you liked previous versions of this game.'),
(N'Olivia', N'James', N'olivia.james4195@example.net', '2016-06-23', 5, N'Awesome to have on the pc and ps3. I personally like the differences of consoles and PCs. Even if you get the same game, it can end up different. And with a console, you can be more social (play along with buddies).'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Nelson', N'benjamin.nelson6543@example.com', '2016-06-23', 5, N'they loved it'),
(N'Olivia', N'Singh', N'olivia.singh3114@example.org', '2016-06-23', 5, N'Purchased as a gift'),
(N'Patrick', N'Jackson', N'patrick.jackson5090@example.org', '2016-06-24', 3, N'Cool!'),
(N'Mei', N'Diaz', N'mei.diaz4605@example.com', '2016-06-24', 4, N'These are amazing headphones. The only thing is that the padding for the ears are a little too small, so if I wear them for a couple of hours my ear will start hurting. But, other than that, they are great!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Walker', N'kenneth.walker7634@example.org', '2016-06-24', 5, N'Riddick game is the best'),
(N'Mark', N'Alvarez', N'mark.alvarez6375@example.org', '2016-06-24', 5, N'Works well and did not have to do anything special to set it up. One thing that isn''t made completely obvious is that plugging in both USB cables is necessary for the controller to have full functionality. One controls the input from the buttons and the other controls the vibration. I have tested it and it works with Dolphin without any issues or driver setup needed.'),
(N'Michael', N'Evans', N'michael.evans2362@example.com', '2016-06-24', 5, N'As my children expected'),
(N'Amanda', N'Garcia', N'amanda.garcia7955@example.com', '2016-06-24', 5, N'Very fun little game. It had Mario on the cover so that''s why I got it and im not disappointed in it. It is a board game like monopoly but not also has a lot of little side games that kinda remind me of Mario 3 for nes. Anyway its worth a buy and it has Mario so im sure it will not lose its value too much.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Gonzalez', N'hannah.gonzalez9644@example.org', '2016-06-24', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Sullivan', N'cheryl.sullivan6350@example.net', '2016-06-24', 5, N'Worked perfectly. :)'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Garcia', N'nicholas.garcia2526@example.org', '2016-06-24', 3, N'Ok fun beat kinda fast story was decent'),
(N'Omar', N'Russell', N'omar.russell4065@example.org', '2016-06-24', 5, N'Halo is why I got an Xbox way back when. This did not disappoint.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Jones', N'andrew.jones6130@example.org', '2016-06-24', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Helen', N'Evans', N'helen.evans5061@example.com', '2016-06-25', 5, N'This game is amazing from start to finish....I''ve played uncharted 4 before playing this game and I can tell you this game is much better overall...I highly recommend this...it''s simply amazing!!!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Young', N'nicole.young1294@example.com', '2016-06-25', 3, N'Great Product Great Seller'),
(N'Jessica', N'Evans', N'jessica.evans9531@example.net', '2016-06-25', 4, N'game is so fun...HELL IN THE CELL!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Kelly', N'nicholas.kelly7040@example.net', '2016-06-25', 4, N'Body/Build/Feel: 5/5 Sensor: 5/5 Accuracy: 5/5 Weight: 5/5 Scrollwheel: 4/5 Rubber Grips: 4/5 Side Buttons: 4/5 Buttons: 3/5 Mousefeet: 1/5 Basically, the overall build quality of the mouse is amazing and the texture is nice; it''s not quite smooth, as it looks in the pictures (of course) and has somewhat of a bumpy feel. The side buttons have a smooth texture on them and isn''t quite something I like, mainly next to the "bumpy" texture of the mouse, which is quite grippy. They''re very clicky and take a fair bit of extra pressure to activate. The sensor has never started to be glitchy, and is generally very accurate. I play CSGO and I had SMFC and had played a couple of matches against professionals without doing too shabby and can say with certainty that this mouse definitely has the accuracy to hold up against the precision of a professional player (not claiming I am near the level). The scrollwheel is kind of poor, to be honest, as both my and a friend''s scrollwheel have started...'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Stewart', N'jacqueline.stewart2279@example.net', '2016-06-25', 5, N'Pretty cool mouse pad! Has a rainbow wave look as shown in the picture, or the ability to change the color to whatever you want. You do have to install software from Razer to use customize any settings (as well as sign up for a free Razer account to use it which is actually stupid and annoying. Yay, one more account and password to be compromised. Thanks. Not.) How I was able to live without this, I''m not sure!'),
(N'Jack', N'Cooper', N'jack.cooper8731@example.org', '2016-06-25', 1, N'Awful controllers, the 3 prong plug will get stuck in your Nintendo 64. I ended up separating the wire from the plug and had carefully use pliers to avoid damaging my N64. Just buy the original controllers to avoid damaging your retro system.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Tanaka', N'cheryl.tanaka7103@example.com', '2016-06-25', 5, N'Arguably my favorite game of all time, no complaints about the game, came on time and as described.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Peterson', N'cheryl.peterson9907@example.com', '2016-06-25', 4, N'Work well with our Wii controller. You can barely even tell the difference from the actual Wii brand wheel.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Jones', N'nathan.jones1754@example.net', '2016-06-26', 5, N'family loves this game'),
(N'William', N'Perry', N'william.perry7233@example.org', '2016-06-26', 5, N'It''s about the same as the PS3 version.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Howard', N'michelle.howard5430@example.com', '2016-06-26', 5, N'Censorship is not an issue, to be honest, they still show plenty for you people who like that kind of stuff. Besides that, the gameplay is great and the visuals are good as well. I am very happy that the turn based battle system works so well. The only issue could be the jpop stuff but it''s easy to look past.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Russell', N'cheryl.russell2068@example.com', '2016-06-26', 1, N'This game sucks.'),
(N'Justin', N'Brooks', N'justin.brooks2878@example.net', '2016-06-26', 4, N'Its as fun as I remember.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Stewart', N'jonathan.stewart8666@example.com', '2016-06-26', 4, N'Cool game even outdated'),
(N'Barbara', N'Allen', N'barbara.allen9928@example.com', '2016-06-26', 5, N'This is clearly the best shooter experience I have played by far! Everything about this game in phenomenal! Definitely buy it! I myself bought it twice, once on PS4 and again on PC'),
(N'Patricia', N'Wilson', N'patricia.wilson3543@example.net', '2016-06-26', 4, N'love it!'),
(N'David', N'Kowalski', N'david.kowalski4919@example.org', '2016-06-26', 4, N'hardcore game and story pretty good and graphic smooth especially on the game .'),
(N'Anna', N'Barnes', N'anna.barnes4058@example.org', '2016-06-26', 5, N'What an incredible deal this pre-order was. Considering that you get 20% off for prime, and you deduct about $12 for the included Amiibo (which I would''ve bought anyway), you''re essentially paying $36 for a newly released (albeit not new) game. As for the game itself, it runs buttery smooth, and has the graphics it should''ve had from day one. Much of what dogged down the gameplay in the original has been resolved, leaving a near perfect game for the Wii U. Part of me hopes at some point that they do the same with Skyward Sword.'),
(N'William', N'Jackson', N'william.jackson7792@example.org', '2016-06-26', 3, N'The game is OK. You can change the controls (which are weird at first). There''s no storyline and the stupid cop cars keep hitting me and starting persuits!!! But hey, at least the persuits are fun...'),
(N'Julie', N'Scott', N'julie.scott4219@example.org', '2016-06-27', 5, N'Great headset I use it for my PS4 and it works perfectly. The volume is a little on the quiet side, but I''m also used to massively loud headphones. It has a good volume though. Not too quiet.'),
(N'Carol', N'Nguyen', N'carol.nguyen7023@example.org', '2016-06-27', 4, N'Pretty cool game, not without it''s flaws...camera angles are really bad, control handling could also be better at least it''s a huge improvement over the Dark souls series of games...a lot of the same here just different worlds\etc.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Long', N'victoria.long1810@example.com', '2016-06-27', 5, N'Loved it!! Great Job Thanks by Game Play USA!! Ship faster!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Morales', N'aaron.morales2363@example.org', '2016-06-27', 5, N'ii loved it.'),
(N'George', N'Watson', N'george.watson5557@example.net', '2016-06-27', 5, N'It''s Kirby, so it''s automatically cute. My daughter loves it, so, what else is there to say?'),
(N'George', N'Hernandez', N'george.hernandez3274@example.net', '2016-06-27', 5, N'I like it because of the songs'' variety and dance features.'),
(N'Jack', N'Nowak', N'jack.nowak5378@example.org', '2016-06-27', 4, N'so yeah i kinda enjoyed it'),
(N'Kofi', N'Ali', N'kofi.ali9857@example.com', '2016-06-27', 5, N'Good working condition'),
(N'Andrew', N'Collins', N'andrew.collins5395@example.org', '2016-06-27', 5, N'Loved the bonuses you can only get with the collectors edition!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Collins', N'andrew.collins5395@example.org', '2016-06-27', 4, N'Works like a dream, wish it was slightly bigger. Needs buttons to be a bit more spaced or a tad bigger as well. After some getting used to, its everything you hope for. You probably won''t use all 12 buttons. Even for an mmo, youll probably be better off with the Naga Hex.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wang', N'rachel.wang9795@example.net', '2016-06-27', 4, N'Did you like Sports Champions? Did you like the archery? The disc golf? The swordfighting? Want an actual game built around those three mechanics (and I mean literally just those mechanics)? That''s this! Truth be told, it''s pretty fun! Was it amazing when it was new? No. Is it amazing now? Of course not. It''s fun, though, so if you have a couple Moves lying around, grab them, grab this, and have a blast chucking throwing stars at everything!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Walker', N'kenneth.walker6593@example.com', '2016-06-28', 5, N'Very very cool title with tons of depth. Will satisfy that classic JRPG itch. Welcome back Japanese games!! Full review coming soon, this is just a shout of praise because I''m exciting that games from the land of the rising sun are coming back to us, and yes they are QUALITY. Check this one out if you love good JRPG stories with deep strategic mechanics.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Martinez', N'rebecca.martinez7892@example.net', '2016-06-28', 5, N'All things considered, this is a great keyboard. I''ve used it for about a month now and I think this is the best value in a mechanical keyboard anywhere at this price point. But it does have one wart of a minor nature, that of the font they used for the key tops. It''s as though they wanted to go with an old military stencil kind of font but which they only partially implemented. It''s hardly a show-stopper because the action of the keyboard is near flawless, unlike the AZIO mechanical keyboard it replaced. The AZIO had sticky keys and uncertainty in actually getting the letter you thought you pressed. Not this keyboard though, the SADES K10 has been flawless in use. But because I occasionally actually look at the key tops to be sure I''m getting the right key, the key top font throws me off a little. Not enough to be a problem but just distrcting as you do a double-take to make sure your hands are lined up correctly. Another slight issue is the illumination brightness but that is...'),
(N'Matthew', N'Cooper', N'matthew.cooper5795@example.com', '2016-06-28', 5, N'Great price, fast delivery.'),
(N'Julie', N'Morgan', N'julie.morgan4511@example.com', '2016-06-28', 4, N'This review is for Far Cry 4 complete edition for the PS4. I started playing the Far Cry Series after grabbing the Far Cry Collection that included Far Cry 2, 3 and Blood Dragon. The series itself has been a bit hit and miss to me. I thought Far Cry 2 was ok but had its quirks that annoyed me, such as the lack of saving anywhere and being an older game, the gameplay was not as smooth as I would have like. I loved playing Far Cry 3 as it was both fun and action packed with a good storyline but Blood Dragon was a bit of a letdown. Granted it was meant more as a bonus game and even though it had similar game play to FC3, the cheesiness and subpar graphics made this less enjoyable to me. Hoping that FC4 would return with the elements that I enjoyed in FC3, I grabbed the complete edition after the price dropped below 30 bucks. Luckily all the things that made FC3 fun to play are here in FC4. In fact, and maybe a small criticism, is that it stays maybe a little too close to the formula...'),
(N'Carol', N'Torres', N'carol.torres3958@example.org', '2016-06-28', 4, N'This looked like an interesting gaming headset, so I ordered it. I find it to have nice sound, to be very light and comfortable, and to look cool, but that the microphone is not very sensitive, and that the microphone does not work on a phone. A gaming headset has a couple of important aspects. The first is sound. This headset has good quality sound. Bass notes carry through very well. The mid and high ranges are not as strong, but definitely present. I like the sound for just about any type of music - modern, jazz, new age, classical, or pop. The sound was good on my computer or on my phone. The headset has a volume control on the left earpiece that works quite well. The second item is the microphone. Here, the story is not as good. I would characterize the microphone as fair. I had to go to the Windows 10 controls and boost the input to maximum, and also add additional boost. At that point the microphone was recognized. However, for chat in gaming, this would only be useful if...'),
(N'Linda', N'Walker', N'linda.walker9573@example.org', '2016-06-28', 5, N'Works well with Galaxy S7 and Gear VR'),
(N'Emma', N'Perry', N'emma.perry1692@example.net', '2016-06-28', 5, N'Cheap and looks great for kids.'),
(N'Megan', N'Thompson', N'megan.thompson4954@example.net', '2016-06-28', 1, N'Wow, just a complete letdown. Zipper gets stuck on one of the corners far too easily since it''s just poorly stitched and located. And the "storage" for the games? What a joke. 8 games? Yeah, maybe if you blended them first. FOUR of the eight spots aren''t sized right at all, were tiny, like they''d fit a PS Vita game instead of a DS or 3DS cartridge. Shoddy quality in every respect. I returned it within 5 minutes of opening it up.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Wright', N'daniel.wright1472@example.org', '2016-06-28', 5, N'As Expected'),
(N'Jacob', N'Murphy', N'jacob.murphy9379@example.com', '2016-06-28', 5, N'This is a great game but its alot cheaper on the nintendo E shop its only 29.99 plus taxs Id go there before Id pay this price if your getting it as a gift buy a nintendo e card and let that person download load it them selfs because this price is a little crazy!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Campbell', N'jeffrey.campbell8897@example.com', '2016-06-29', 4, N'Fun and mindless entertainment.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Bell', N'brenda.bell8907@example.com', '2016-06-29', 4, N'got this for my cousin last minute and gave him the code over the phone. was awesome.'),
(N'Helen', N'Carter', N'helen.carter1098@example.net', '2016-06-29', 5, N'I been playing for almost 10 hours now and the game is pretty fun so far... I don''t know if I love too much anime games with Japanese voice but I''m having a blast oh well if you wanna play, have the money and time just get it! AND DO your own judgement!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Hughes', N'barbara.hughes2684@example.net', '2016-06-29', 5, N'System seller! Must have! Amazing story and fantastic graphics!'),
(N'Debra', N'Wright', N'debra.wright5794@example.com', '2016-06-29', 5, N'Works well with most of my Wii Guitar Hero games as well as Just Dance'),
(N'Nancy', N'Walker', N'nancy.walker4211@example.org', '2016-06-29', 5, N'Great !!!'),
(N'Heather', N'Nelson', N'heather.nelson7152@example.com', '2016-06-29', 4, N'Not as good as the amiibos, but still very good. Gotta have them as an amiibo collector'),
(N'Nicole', N'Smith', N'nicole.smith7154@example.com', '2016-06-30', 5, N'Enjoying the game'),
(N'Diane', N'Murphy', N'diane.murphy2564@example.com', '2016-06-30', 5, N'Still play this game. My favorite FF'),
(N'Henry', N'Chen', N'henry.chen9495@example.org', '2016-06-30', 5, N'great handheld'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ross', N'ethan.ross8918@example.org', '2016-07-01', 5, N'Awesome product. Works with modded WII U!'),
(N'Mei', N'Allen', N'mei.allen1432@example.org', '2016-07-01', 4, N'This game is so much fun to play so many modes to keep you playing new characters special moves and the best wrestling game ljn has ever made and that''s saying something as they made a couple but only two of those games or 3 if you count wrestling challenge are good games the rest are trash I recommend you buy this game if you love fun old school wrestling games.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Adams', N'tyler.adams3525@example.com', '2016-07-01', 1, N'its not full screen for ps4 and a bit lag/delay'),
(N'Ivan', N'Nelson', N'ivan.nelson4073@example.com', '2016-07-01', 5, N'all good'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Kelly', N'stephanie.kelly7466@example.org', '2016-07-01', 1, N'gets old quick cant even jump broring'),
(N'Pamela', N'Myers', N'pamela.myers8388@example.com', '2016-07-01', 5, N'With the new one coming out soon I decide to give it a try. This game is a riot! Funny adult humor, fun combat(controls can be frustrating at times). A decently long campaign.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Chen', N'brenda.chen1723@example.org', '2016-07-01', 5, N'I''m writing this for the free Xbox 360 Games with Gold version that came out a year/ish ago. Great puzzle game that offered a lot of fun. Somehow, despite the boards all being pretty similar, it didn''t get old for me!'),
(N'Maria', N'Stewart', N'maria.stewart8349@example.net', '2016-07-02', 5, N'Very funn'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Adams', N'jeremy.adams6979@example.net', '2016-07-02', 3, N'The graphics are alright, but the controls are kind of edgey compared that of Gran Turismo and Forza Motorsport. The way the game is arranged is somewhat odd. It is still quite fun to play because it has multiple racing types.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Martin', N'rebecca.martin9100@example.com', '2016-07-02', 5, N'This game is just great so addicting great graphics'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Robinson', N'kimberly.robinson8254@example.com', '2016-07-02', 4, N'Nice stand. Wish it would somehow actually hold the PS4 in place. All it has is a mold where you place it. It''s ment to be somehwere the PS4 won''t be touched.'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez7512@example.com', '2016-07-02', 3, N'not as good as I remembered, because it has some of same levels repeating when you do the cheat code so kind of redundant and only couple cool levels'),
(N'Raymond', N'Lewis', N'raymond.lewis2800@example.com', '2016-07-02', 5, N'I wanted to play this game before reviewing it. Crazy right? I will not be touching on the censorship of the fans as I find it had zero impact on the quality of the game, which is the only thing I care about. The game is great...borderline amazing. I''m not sure I''ve ever played an rpg where everything works like this game. The characters work, the mirages work, the j-pop idol theme works, the dungeons work, and most importantly, the battle system works. In fact, the battle system is one of my all time favorites, and it''s always fun. Playing on hard mode requires real thought and execution to take down powerful enemies, and that''s when the game really shines. Sure, I could play on normal and fly through the game, using session links over and over again with little worry about my health and buffs. But to me, that would be stale. Hard mode forces me to use everything, health, buffs, recarns(lots of these), defense, charges. It feels like old RPGs where beating bosses was an...'),
(N'Scott', N'Price', N'scott.price4862@example.org', '2016-07-02', 5, N'Good game.. Graphics are cool..'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Murphy', N'jacqueline.murphy2216@example.net', '2016-07-02', 4, N'missing the pamplhet or the remaster doesnt come with one??'),
(N'Betty', N'Parker', N'betty.parker5237@example.org', '2016-07-02', 4, N'It was good aside from the chipped case and loose disc'),
(N'Alexander', N'Martinez', N'alexander.martinez1487@example.com', '2016-07-03', 1, N'Sound quality awful. Mic quality awful. Uncomfortable. Completely plastic. Nothing but bad experiences with Sades.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Wright', N'dennis.wright5727@example.com', '2016-07-03', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Wood', N'kimberly.wood2530@example.net', '2016-07-03', 1, N'I was looking forward to the split screen multiplayer. Unfortunately you can''t access your menu (for inventory, crafting and navigation). This makes the game unplayable. In single player there is a significant lag between when you move the controls and your on screen character responding. Also, ever few seconds the game freezes for half of a second. This is really jarring and destroys what could be a great game.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2016-07-04', 5, N'the star fox zero video game for the wii u is the greatest video game in the universe a true classic the best of the best the star fox zero video game for the wii u rocks ^_^'),
(N'Justin', N'Edwards', N'justin.edwards7041@example.org', '2016-07-04', 4, N'It''s Microsoft brand, so it does what it''s supposed to do.'),
(N'Karen', N'Brown', N'karen.brown1081@example.org', '2016-07-04', 3, N'They are practical, you won''t have problems if you miss a pen.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Kumar', N'andrew.kumar7491@example.com', '2016-07-04', 1, N'I paid only .49 for this, and still struggled just to finish it. The graphics are awful, there are far too many HOGs, and they are all ridiculously dark, with the same objects appearing over and over. The story is disjointed and leaves little to the imagination. Wish I''d passed up the bargain.'),
(N'Henry', N'Rivera', N'henry.rivera4445@example.com', '2016-07-04', 5, N'Metro Redux Pros: -Looks good running at 1080p 60fps -Both games look very similar graphically making it seems like one big game -Great Atmosphere for the most part -Combat is solid -Great overall ending Cons: -Uneven voice acting for some characters -Fascial animations don''t always fit dialogue Side notes:Metro Last Light has alternate endings. A lot like Bioshock, save instead of killing and you''ll get the good ending but its difficult to get but both endings are good. If you are a fan of games like Bioshock,Dishonored, Far Cry, Gone Home, you''ll love this game.'),
(N'James', N'Morgan', N'james.morgan3381@example.com', '2016-07-04', 4, N'Not quite as good as Arkham City, but it''s still definitely an enjoyable game.'),
(N'James', N'Morgan', N'james.morgan3381@example.com', '2016-07-04', 5, N'These work great & are a cheap solution for extending NES controllers.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Alvarez', N'jeremy.alvarez3282@example.org', '2016-07-04', 1, N'You''re better off waiting for Shin Megami Tensei: Persona 5 to come out.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Chavez', N'alexander.chavez8117@example.com', '2016-07-04', 1, N'Did not work with my computer, even though all the specs to be able to play were checked before purchase!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Powell', N'michelle.powell3386@example.org', '2016-07-04', 1, N'I bought this to work with my Samsung Galaxy with the VR goggles. It never worked, seemed the phone thought it was a keyboard and not a controller, so the games I tried didn''t even recognize it. I don''t know what to try next, but there must be a controller that works.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Torres', N'evelyn.torres8991@example.org', '2016-07-04', 5, N'Both the headphones and microphone work extremely well. i am very happy with the purchase and timely delivery. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Butler', N'ethan.butler8460@example.com', '2016-07-04', 4, N'Great secondary mouse,my main is a wireless,G700s. The G600 is not as ergonomic and significantly bulkier than the G700s,The G600 took a lot of adjustment to get used to. The G600 is a Great value, almost double the buttons, although the G600 is a MAJOR sacrifice to poll rate and DPI,both are not needed for MMO''s, yet. The Logitech software recognized the G600 without a reboot or driver download, the macros I wrote for the G700s also work for the G600 straight out of the box. Switching from the G600 back to the G700s is a simple as plugging in. I would like to see Logitech make a 20 button mouse with the ergonomics, DPI and Poll rate of the G700s.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Cruz', N'gregory.cruz8105@example.com', '2016-07-04', 5, N'Valkyria Chronicles was one of the best games for the PS3, so I was stoked when I heard of the remastered version. The price is right on, and it plays exactly like the original. My only gripe is that they could''ve added an auto-save feature, but it''s not a deal-breaker by any stretch of the imagination.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Perez', N'joseph.perez4035@example.org', '2016-07-04', 5, N'Nice and VERY long so the husband can play and charge at the same time'),
(N'Joseph', N'Perez', N'joseph.perez4035@example.org', '2016-07-04', 5, N'Looks cool. works well, takes up a lot less space than most chargers'),
(N'Janet', N'Allen', N'janet.allen4269@example.com', '2016-07-04', 5, N'My son love this game and we got it for a great price.'),
(N'Jose', N'Ruiz', N'jose.ruiz7746@example.org', '2016-07-05', 5, N'Best game i ever played! works great on windows 10 also.'),
(N'Anna', N'Rodriguez', N'anna.rodriguez4322@example.net', '2016-07-05', 5, N'Beautiful paint job and adorable looking the amiibo line just get better. this metaknight fills the void left by the Smash Bros. version I was never able to get, and I absolutely love it!'),
(N'Susan', N'Allen', N'susan.allen7913@example.org', '2016-07-05', 5, N'good game, plenty hours of gsaming'),
(N'Adam', N'Bell', N'adam.bell3781@example.com', '2016-07-05', 5, N'I have this installed on my New 3ds XL and all I had to do was press down a little to get it to fit over the analog, problem. There''s six in a pack and it''s good to have five in reserve since Monster Hunter Generations will release in a week and these games will put your 3ds it''s paces. They come in different grip patterns so you can pick your favorite. Also you can close your 3ds with no issue as the covers have very little profile in height. A very pleasant buy for the price. So don''t delay, order a pack today! P.S. Playing Monster Hunter is so intense on your hardware, you may want to invest in a spare analog part and c-stick part for your current machine. Eventually the UP input becomes unresponsive. The replacements are not hard to install as long as you are carefull. I had to replace two in my 3ds xl and one in my New 3ds xl. Make sure you order for your correct machine as the analogs for the 3ds''s are different sizes.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Diaz', N'ashley.diaz2944@example.com', '2016-07-05', 3, N'I''d give this game a solid 3/5 stars. As a standalone game I''d rate it a tad higher, but it didn''t amount to what everyone expected. The gameplay is fine for the most part. No wall jumping kinda sucks, and the dash to kill your enemies isn''t that fun..... other than that. I''d still recommend this game if you want a new Megaman game. It''s all your gonna get for now anyway. Just don''t expect it to be groundbreaking or anything.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2016-07-06', 5, N'the video game company square-enix is the greatest video game company in the universe there true genius''s the best of the best the video game company square-enix rock,final fantasy XI is the greatest video game in the universe a true classic the best of the best final fantasy XI rocks,2015 and 2016 for square-enix are the greatest years for square-enix in the universe there perfect years the best of the best 2015 and 2016 for square-enix rocks ^_^'),
(N'Amanda', N'Gomez', N'amanda.gomez3839@example.net', '2016-07-06', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Patricia', N'Edwards', N'patricia.edwards1282@example.com', '2016-07-06', 5, N'I actually really likes this game. I got it at the onset and did hate the original online only mode. They changed this pretty fast to make offline. I like the multiple specialized cities approach. It can get a bit old after a while, but that is simcity for you. After a while of playing you start to think of trick and new designs. You are always eager to run back and try these new ideas either on your current city or a new city.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Wright', N'dennis.wright6461@example.org', '2016-07-06', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Walter', N'Ivanov', N'walter.ivanov4510@example.org', '2016-07-06', 5, N'Wonderful, I love it.'),
(N'George', N'Miller', N'george.miller5085@example.org', '2016-07-06', 5, N'So let me start off by saying, don''t listen to all these weak babies crying about the weight on the rival 700. It''s truly been over exaggerated at people saying this thing is "heavy". The ducky secret felt much more heavier than this mouse. Off the bat the mouse performs beautifully and I love the fact that it''s a bit smaller than the rival 300 cause it fits my hands just right. If you''re gonna commit to this mouse and you''re scared of the weight just do what I did get yourself a low friction mouse pad to help it glide and if that isn''t enough I suggest you go to the gym and lift weights.'),
(N'Carol', N'King', N'carol.king2932@example.net', '2016-07-06', 5, N'Great service and price.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Alvarez', N'rachel.alvarez3671@example.org', '2016-07-06', 3, N'Works flawlessly but my only complaint is they are too short, its like playing on an snes or sega and you have to sit close to the console'),
(N'Jose', N'Sanchez', N'jose.sanchez6201@example.com', '2016-07-06', 4, N'I actually wanted to use this as a lunchbox. It can''t hold a huge amount of stuff, but you can easily fit a small bag of chips, banana, regular size water bottle diagonally, a not-too-big tupperware, and still have room for an apple or other small snacks. Only downside is zipping it back up can be a little annoying since the zippers are separate and can get caught on the inside material. Not really a dealbreaker, though. It''s also difficult to carry it and other items in the same hand, but the handle seems strong enough to support being carried awkwardly.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Myers', N'daniel.myers5615@example.org', '2016-07-06', 5, N'I needed a longer cord for my PS4 headphones, these worked perfect.'),
(N'Peter', N'Garcia', N'peter.garcia1713@example.org', '2016-07-06', 4, N'I like this RAZER DEADADDER Mouse but, I returned it for the RAZER MAMBA TOURNAMENT EDITION MOUSE which I found to be smoother with a VERY, VERY GOOD WHEEL !!! The Deadadder mouse''s wheel was VERY ROUGH and was VERY LOOSE !!! The MAMBA has better Chroma LEDs and go''s great with my RAZER FIREFLY MOUSE PAD !!! *** PLUS*** - THE TEFLON FEET ARE VERY, VERY SHORT WITH THE MIDDLE ON BEING THE WORTH, BUT ALL ARE SO BAD THAT THE BOTTOM OF THE MOUSE SCRAPS ON THE RAZER FIREFLY MOUSE PAD !!!! WHERE THE MAMBA''s FEET ARE HIGHER AND I GET "NO" SCRAPING AT ALL !!! i REALLY LIKE THE DEADADDER BUT FOR THE FEET AND LOOSE (SIDE TO SIDE) WHEEL !!! DEADADDER 4 STARS - MAMBA 5 STARS !!! MAMBA WINS !!!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Kumar', N'thomas.kumar5819@example.org', '2016-07-06', 5, N'The first gaming system I''ve ever had and it worked wonders for me.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Jones', N'amanda.jones2075@example.org', '2016-07-07', 5, N'Great bag to keep my son''s NDS with cover, charger, and extra games. We got it in red so that its much more visible when we go out to eat and take it with us.'),
(N'Justin', N'Martinez', N'justin.martinez8589@example.org', '2016-07-07', 1, N'Certified refurbished doesn''t mean what you think it does. Arrived scratched and beat up in a different box than advertised. Should have looked brand new. Even small scuffs would have been fine. Looked like it was skipped down a brick road. Label your stuff better guys. Don''t list a product on Amazon with a trash description and bait customers. Get your act together.'),
(N'Wei', N'Jones', N'wei.jones5178@example.com', '2016-07-07', 5, N'Great Product, Great Value!'),
(N'Scott', N'Sullivan', N'scott.sullivan9682@example.com', '2016-07-07', 5, N'cool'),
(N'Daniel', N'Howard', N'daniel.howard3032@example.com', '2016-07-07', 3, N'It''s okay I guess. It''s pretty fun, but I wasn''t really all that impressed by it. I guess I expected a bit more than a point and click game.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ivanov', N'tyler.ivanov9005@example.net', '2016-07-07', 5, N'Best game ever!'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ivanov', N'tyler.ivanov9005@example.net', '2016-07-07', 5, N'Quick and painless.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Lewis', N'sarah.lewis7796@example.org', '2016-07-07', 1, N'The first thing you need to know is that this is not a continuation of Dragon Age 1 or 2. It is a new story with a few people from them in the game as NPCs. The second thing you need to know is that this one has the worst character interactions of the series. The interplay and relationship building that you could enjoy in the first two games is gone. The NPCs that you can interact with are such a-holes that you won''t even want to interact with them. I found myself adventuring around with only one other NPC instead of a full party cause I didn''t like them. The story line is a poor one. It felt as if EA simply threw it together without any thought. An experience of grinding through missions you''re not interested in with no rewards when completed. The Dragon Age series is now officially dead.'),
(N'David', N'Boyd', N'david.boyd7930@example.org', '2016-07-07', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Angela', N'Wilson', N'angela.wilson3074@example.org', '2016-07-07', 5, N'Everything was perfect!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Kim', N'stephanie.kim4374@example.net', '2016-07-07', 5, N'It worked great because my dsi turned on'),
(N'Mark', N'Richardson', N'mark.richardson1431@example.com', '2016-07-07', 4, N'Pretty fun game!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Patel', N'kathleen.patel3832@example.org', '2016-07-08', 5, N'My son collects Amiibos, and he actually wanted this very basic one to try his hand at creating his first custom Amiibo...he learned online how to boil it, remove the original figure, and add his own figure...and it works great with his Wii system!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Castillo', N'tomasz.castillo7988@example.com', '2016-07-08', 5, N'great game!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Nguyen', N'brenda.nguyen8957@example.org', '2016-07-08', 5, N'Best game I''ve ever played. Looks great on the PS4. Nobody can tell a story like Naughty Dog.'),
(N'Heather', N'Myers', N'heather.myers1408@example.net', '2016-07-08', 4, N'work as advertised.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Cook', N'kofi.cook5811@example.org', '2016-07-09', 5, N'My son won''t stop playing. He loves this game.'),
(N'Amara', N'Richardson', N'amara.richardson2080@example.org', '2016-07-09', 5, N'This game is terrific. Had bought it a few years back but recently started playing and I''m hooked. You have several races you can customize and a pet that can be fed fish to morph into different creatures with a variety of stats. Then it''s off to dungeon crawling and slaying tons of creatures,leveling up and finding better equipment. Don''t be decieved by the cartoonish graphics style. This game has ton of content. You have 3 towns with their own set of dungeons that go past level 40,and a variety of townsfolk offering endless subquests as you descend. Not only that,but once you beat the game you can choose not to retire your hero and go deep delving. If you do,there are 2.1 billion dungeon levels. I have not seen a game like this anywhere. To me it''s a monumental point in gaming. If I have any complaints,it''s that there''s a glitch in earlier versions that won''t spawn hero items in the last town''s dungeons. The hero items are necessary to continue deeper in the game and beat it. But...'),
(N'Mark', N'Flores', N'mark.flores5383@example.net', '2016-07-09', 5, N'Everything is Perfect I got it new thanks'),
(N'Aisha', N'Roberts', N'aisha.roberts7698@example.com', '2016-07-09', 5, N'Cool game. Purchased three of these for my boys ages 10-12. They said game was overall fun especially if u r a Kirby fan. They play the game on and off and do lose some interest. Great purchase!'),
(N'Jason', N'Morgan', N'jason.morgan6861@example.net', '2016-07-09', 5, N'Very fun :)'),
(N'Maria', N'Lopez', N'maria.lopez2200@example.net', '2016-07-09', 4, N'Isn''t massive, but has enough room for like 20 games at least. Also I have fit my charger and some headphones in there. Doesn''t fit in your pocket, but it does the job!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Ramirez', N'hannah.ramirez6931@example.net', '2016-07-09', 5, N'great wii game, my sister loves it a lot'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Watson', N'tomasz.watson1184@example.org', '2016-07-09', 2, N'So for now this gets two stars. Why? There are a lot of little things that need to be improved, and hopefully will be with a simple update or two. First off, none of the games I own on Android are compatible. Literally none. Pokemon Go? No. Katamari? No. Tapped Out? No. To be fair, there are some games I want to play that are, like the various Final Fantasy games, but that''s about it. Hopefully a software update can fix this. Second, I can''t get Gamefly to load. According to the French language error message (and that''s another slow eye-roll, but I do read French, so no big deal), my speed isn''t sufficient. Which is odd, since I can easily stream Netflix, Hulu, Vudu, Amazon, etc, through my Roku, which is in the same room. Finally, there''s the fiasco of setup. Getting the various controllers paired with the device was a serious challenge. Myself, who works in technical support, and my friend, who has even more skills than I do, took nearly ten minutes to get everything up and...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Adams', N'kelly.adams4844@example.net', '2016-07-09', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Cook', N'jeremy.cook4103@example.net', '2016-07-09', 2, N'Having some wifi issues. Xbox right next to PS4 gets better connection speeds. Both have 4 bars, but PS4 is only connecting at 4mbs instead of 85mbs. Connect a cat5 and it works perfect. Playing DS3 offline now, but will eventually have to return for a better working unit.'),
(N'Larry', N'Webb', N'larry.webb8250@example.net', '2016-07-10', 5, N'Fun SNES Game!'),
(N'Amara', N'Rivera', N'amara.rivera5046@example.net', '2016-07-10', 5, N'It was shipped on time... It was for an excellent price. I had to buy a new one because mine decided it was no longer going to read disks anymore but it wouldn''t give me an error just the game no longer registered. After several attempts to make it work I said F*** it and got on amazon to buy a new one.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Butler', N'ronald.butler1498@example.com', '2016-07-10', 5, N'looks very nice'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Lewis', N'rebecca.lewis5721@example.net', '2016-07-10', 5, N'If you have played the souls games and you love them like we do, then this is a great collector''s edition. I love it, the steal book looks great and so does the statue. The art book and the map are also very nice. I''m really glad I bought this and any souls fan should have it! The game is definitely an improvement from DS2 but as with just about any game, there are still things that need to be worked on. Overall, it''s still a good game though. Worth playing for sure!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Collins', N'christopher.collins9862@example.net', '2016-07-10', 5, N'GREAT PRODUCT! WOULD BUY FROM SELLER AGAIN!!!'),
(N'Christina', N'Cox', N'christina.cox5456@example.org', '2016-07-10', 5, N'Good character for mario party'),
(N'Maria', N'Gray', N'maria.gray7167@example.org', '2016-07-10', 5, N'Daughter very pleased'),
(N'Larry', N'Richardson', N'larry.richardson9874@example.net', '2016-07-11', 3, N'The Division, what can I say? You got the good and the bad. The game is pretty fun with friends, though I don''t like playing it alone much. I played it a bunch when it first released, but to me, the game died off and I don''t really play it that much. I would recommend to get it only if there was a good sale on the game and you had a friend to play with. Otherwise it''s a pretty repetitive game that was a bit too over-hyped.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Walker', N'patricia.walker6985@example.net', '2016-07-11', 5, N'Works great and in the USA as advertised, love the ability to just set my controller down on it and let it charge'),
(N'Mateo', N'Russell', N'mateo.russell2479@example.com', '2016-07-11', 5, N'Im glad they made final fantasy x/x-2 on ps4 remastered I love this game compare the other final fantasy this game is the best'),
(N'Gary', N'Nelson', N'gary.nelson8810@example.net', '2016-07-11', 5, N'good game fast delivery'),
(N'James', N'Tanaka', N'james.tanaka1354@example.org', '2016-07-11', 5, N'The original version was good. The deathinitive version is fantastic. Better graphics is always a big thing'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Martinez', N'tomasz.martinez4094@example.net', '2016-07-11', 5, N'A real cutie for my collection.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Brooks', N'elizabeth.brooks6804@example.org', '2016-07-11', 5, N'The Inside Out Play Set is a lot of fun, though it is a bit different than the others. This play set is more of a side scrolling game instead of an open world where you can fully explore and find collectibles. This game is much more similar to a Mario or Donkey Kong game than it is to the Toy Story in Space Play Set, which came out for Disney Infinity 1.0. Though it is side scroller, it''s a lot of fun and it still has that element of exploration. It''s a great video game companion to the movie!'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Reed', N'tomasz.reed2482@example.net', '2016-07-12', 5, N'This thing extends my controller all the way to the couch. you can also connect bth cable for a longer reach if you need it.'),
(N'Amara', N'Smith', N'amara.smith3817@example.org', '2016-07-12', 4, N'It''s a great game. If you''re into turn based RPG then this''ll be great for you!'),
(N'Adam', N'Jimenez', N'adam.jimenez7685@example.net', '2016-07-12', 5, N'Best mouse I''ve ever owned. Love the comfort and the responsiveness. Hear a lot of negative things about the quality of Razer products but after 6 months of use I am very happy with it.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Diaz', N'hiroshi.diaz2538@example.com', '2016-07-12', 4, N'Almost like a SNES controller. Something feels off about it. The cord is a little short, but it works.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Martinez', N'victoria.martinez6567@example.org', '2016-07-12', 1, N'This game is free on PC.'),
(N'Omar', N'Adams', N'omar.adams1043@example.com', '2016-07-12', 5, N'I just purchased this for a great price on prime day (got this for $16.44 for brand new!).This is THE premier baseball experience of this console generation(until MLB 17 the show comes out that is). Great graphics, great gameplay. Love the fact that it has a dynamic difficulty that scales up down for both pitching and batting depending on how well/poor you do. Love the fact that you can play games with the most current roster(checks/updates roster everytime you load the game) that the mlb has for every team in addition to getting live news via ticker. If you are a baseball fan this game is a must get.'),
(N'Helen', N'Cook', N'helen.cook8169@example.net', '2016-07-12', 4, N'Had a few issues getting it to work at first but after switching controllers it seems to work much better.'),
(N'Debra', N'Mitchell', N'debra.mitchell9353@example.com', '2016-07-12', 5, N'Bought this in 2008 on my ps3 when I worked for gamestop. Bought again for my ps4 in 2016. A sense of teary eyed nostalgia hit me when I played through it again. Fantastic game worth your time. For $30 it''s worth it.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Scott', N'thomas.scott9870@example.com', '2016-07-12', 5, N'Game came fast. Great game, and was not too beat up.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Scott', N'thomas.scott9870@example.com', '2016-07-12', 5, N'Came fast and worked'),
(N'Amanda', N'Morales', N'amanda.morales1219@example.org', '2016-07-13', 5, N'I''ve played every Souls game and loved every minute. The graphics are stunning, the areas are diverse and give you that great feeling of discovery. No more cheap 3on 1 fights like DS2. The new weapon techniques are interesting. Makes you adjust your playstyle if you want yo implement them. Cool NPCs with storylines. Bosses are mostly a treat. I don''t need to say much more, buy it'),
(N'Susan', N'Mitchell', N'susan.mitchell7304@example.org', '2016-07-13', 4, N'The Atelier games have long been a favorite here. An interesting twist on the more traditional JRPG genre, the Atelier games are about being an alchemist, brewing concoctions, and generally saving the world/solving some big problems/learning alchemy/maintaining an atelier. After a length weight, Atelier Sophie: Alchemist of the Mysterious Book is finally here and is Gusts'' first Atelier title built for the PlayStation 4. Does the Atelier series transition well to a next-gen console? Pretty darned well. First off, I love the Atelier games. They are great, seriously, we have covered a few. Each title is chalkfull of a cast of lovable characters that each have their own struggles that tug at your heartstrings (nnnngggghhhh ... Ateleir Ayesha ...). Atelier Sophie is no different, though at times feels more lightweight than previous titles, with the affable, if airheaded Sophie leading the troupe this time around. While Eschy and Logy, or even Ayesha all had wonderful supporting...'),
(N'Steven', N'Ward', N'steven.ward9563@example.net', '2016-07-13', 4, N'First thing I like to note is that I''m not a kickstarter backer for this game, and I personally think this game has a lot of bad press due to the delays and kickstarter backers expecting too much from the product, horrible marketing campaign, etc. This review is based on the game itself as a standalone product. This video game is essentially a Mega Man game with a dash mechanic with high emphasis on speed runs (more on this later) as it has the same theme and plot you''d expect from Mega Man: Robot masters (Mighty Numbers) go out of control, and it''s up to you to re-program them/snap them out of their trance or virus, etc and save the world from a mad scientist. Despite the infinite dash mechanic and optional free boost upgrades after each death, the game is really challenging like past Mega Man games. The first boss may be challenging, but after the defeating one, the rest of the bosses should be easy (aside from the final) after you find out which mighty number ability is weak...'),
(N'Brenda', N'James', N'brenda.james9882@example.org', '2016-07-13', 4, N'It doesn''t plug in as easily or flow as smoothly with the controller as its 360 counterpart did, but it still does the job just as well. Make sure you attach it to your controller and update the controller before you start using it, though.'),
(N'Dee', N'Harris', N'dee.harris3554@example.net', '2016-07-13', 5, N'Works as good as the one that came with the Wii U.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Khan', N'olivia.khan3437@example.net', '2016-07-13', 5, N'Great product. Fast shipping. Buy with confidence!'),
(N'Amara', N'Taylor', N'amara.taylor7362@example.org', '2016-07-14', 5, N'love it is a most have'),
(N'Anna', N'Nelson', N'anna.nelson5066@example.org', '2016-07-14', 5, N'Love every thing about this bag/case!!'),
(N'Justin', N'James', N'justin.james8863@example.org', '2016-07-14', 5, N'It has a lot of codes for most of the latest games.'),
(N'Carol', N'Davis', N'carol.davis6461@example.net', '2016-07-14', 5, N'I''ve been playing this and cant seem to put it down.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Carter', N'ryan.carter3168@example.org', '2016-07-14', 5, N'a+'),
(N'Luis', N'Chen', N'luis.chen1218@example.com', '2016-07-14', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Eric', N'Kelly', N'eric.kelly6884@example.org', '2016-07-14', 5, N'Arrived as described works as advertised'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Anderson', N'jeffrey.anderson2138@example.org', '2016-07-14', 5, N'I beat this game June 24th 2016'),
(N'Kyle', N'Henderson', N'kyle.henderson8955@example.com', '2016-07-14', 5, N'The item was as described and was delivered in a timely manner.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Thomas', N'andrea.thomas3934@example.com', '2016-07-14', 5, N'Just got it yesterday (a day before i was suppose to) which made me super happy. Lol i love it. Plays great. Almost smoother than the version on the wii virtual counsel. Which surprised me considering its a 20 year old game. Could be that im playing on my retro duo though. (which works amazing if u need a system to play NES or SNES games on.)'),
(N'Priya', N'Henderson', N'priya.henderson5198@example.org', '2016-07-14', 4, N'Yoshimiibo'),
(N'Lucia', N'Gonzalez', N'lucia.gonzalez2772@example.org', '2016-07-14', 5, N'Love it with the Pip-Boy.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Hernandez', N'nathan.hernandez9252@example.net', '2016-07-15', 5, N'Quick and easy add on to Rock Band 4 for harmony vocals. Be sure you''ve got an open USB port, or you may also need a USB splitter.'),
(N'Mei', N'Ross', N'mei.ross7621@example.net', '2016-07-15', 5, N'The item came in great condition...'),
(N'Deborah', N'Ferreira', N'deborah.ferreira9410@example.org', '2016-07-15', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Jason', N'Khan', N'jason.khan9495@example.org', '2016-07-15', 4, N'Great mouse for the money. Bit larger so it might not be for those who use a "Claw" style grip. Honestly the Software seems superfluous for how simple this mouse is, but who am I to judge.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Ortiz', N'hiroshi.ortiz4766@example.com', '2016-07-15', 3, N'It''s a Lego Batman Game. And you know what to expect. There''s very little DLC released for this game as it doesn''t really need it. There''s plenty of obscure DC characters in the game itself. Each one of them having their own powers and personalities. However, it did seem like a step-down from the previous games (Marvel Heroes included). Considering those games had a huge open space to explore with many secrets and missions scattered, this game uses the Watchtower as its main hub. The rest is levels. I wish there were open spaces to explore as your one or two favourite DC superheroes and villains.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Price', N'jacqueline.price5528@example.net', '2016-07-15', 3, N'JD3''s interface feels old compared to later products. Maybe because it is. Gameplay is still the same, but if you are already used to the more streamlined motion controlled interface of JD4 and up, the clunky menus in JD3 may turn you off.'),
(N'Edward', N'Collins', N'edward.collins8977@example.com', '2016-07-15', 5, N'kid loves it'),
(N'Maria', N'Gray', N'maria.gray7167@example.org', '2016-07-15', 5, N'Kids enjoyed this'),
(N'Amy', N'Gomez', N'amy.gomez4346@example.org', '2016-07-16', 5, N'Good Quality! 100% recommended'),
(N'Brian', N'Brooks', N'brian.brooks8293@example.org', '2016-07-16', 5, N'great and the best one.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wright', N'rachel.wright7912@example.net', '2016-07-16', 5, N'I love playing old school games that I grew up on'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wright', N'rachel.wright7912@example.net', '2016-07-16', 5, N'My daughter and I love playing these it is like we are really there'),
(N'Mateo', N'Perry', N'mateo.perry4895@example.net', '2016-07-16', 5, N'Fantastic'),
(N'Richard', N'Collins', N'richard.collins6958@example.org', '2016-07-16', 5, N'Love it. Protects my precious nes 3ds.'),
(N'Henry', N'Evans', N'henry.evans2423@example.com', '2016-07-16', 5, N'Super fun game!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Nowak', N'andrea.nowak9989@example.org', '2016-07-16', 5, N'My son loves it. No complaints'),
(N'Andrea', N'Nowak', N'andrea.nowak9989@example.org', '2016-07-16', 5, N'My son loves collecting amibbo figures. I have ordered quite a few from Amazon already and he loves them. The package arrives in perfect condition.'),
(N'William', N'Sanchez', N'william.sanchez8612@example.com', '2016-07-16', 2, N'The A,B,X,Y buttons are the worst I''ve ever experienced. They hardly click at all (not the noise but the depression level). They need to move about 2-3 times more when pressed than they do. A huge glaring inconsistent failure. No other controller ever is this bad and any amount of proper Q/A would have picked up on this. Other than that, they get 1 star for having both start/select & back/home button combos which practically zero controllers do. So it works well for LiquidSky. The other star is for being generally pretty decent quality. The other buttons are normal and work. How did they screw this up...? Other notes: - It should have had built in lithium rechargeable batteries. It''s de-facto now. - I got two of these for $0/100% free. They aren''t worth much more than that.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ali', N'cynthia.ali7462@example.org', '2016-07-17', 5, N'The Sims Life Stories, despite being more restricted than the normal Sims 2, is awesome! It is a great game for those who are curious on what The Sims games play like, and what they have to offer you. The game doesn''t restrict you too much, though you can have only up to 4 Sims on each lot, whereas the original Sims 2 lets you have 8. The second restriction is video capturing isn''t possible with the built-in recorder, so an external recorder must be used if one wants to record. In terms of how good the stories are? They''re awesome! I enjoyed playing them both immensely. The one gripe I have is during the second story, something got messed up halfway through and I couldn''t proceed and had to start over... The best aspect about the whole game is if you are just starting out with the series and want to try it out, pick this up by all means! But if you have the original Sims 2 with all expansions + stuff packs, then... I don''t know. If you are a diehard Sims fan and want to play it for...'),
(N'Susan', N'Hall', N'susan.hall7257@example.net', '2016-07-17', 5, N'Bought it for my son. He loves it. Looks and feels like an xbox controller. Light weight attaches easily.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Evans', N'kofi.evans1387@example.org', '2016-07-17', 5, N'I love this game!'),
(N'Wei', N'Foster', N'wei.foster5500@example.com', '2016-07-17', 4, N'Nice little box to play Classic PSOne tittles. PSVita games are a hit or mis.'),
(N'Jack', N'Stewart', N'jack.stewart8401@example.com', '2016-07-17', 5, N'can''t go wrong with an original'),
(N'Timothy', N'Hall', N'timothy.hall8244@example.net', '2016-07-17', 5, N'Great for the price. The ability to change the game volume, chat volume (friends voices), treble, bass, and mic mute/low/high makes for a very versatile headset. I often times listen to music in this headset and the bass and treble makes for a great experience. Personally never been a fan of wireless headsets, as I don''t like messing with the batteries for something that I''m going to use while stationary at my computer desk for sometimes many hours at a time. You can even use this as a headset with your phone without the amp, it sounds great, it just can''t get as loud as with the amp.'),
(N'Dee', N'Harris', N'dee.harris1840@example.com', '2016-07-17', 5, N'Product is great. My mouse glides smoothly on mat. 2 sets of replacement skates for a great price. Will buy again.'),
(N'Larry', N'Kumar', N'larry.kumar3937@example.net', '2016-07-17', 5, N'good!'),
(N'Jose', N'Thomas', N'jose.thomas9884@example.com', '2016-07-17', 5, N'My boyfriend loves this game. He says it''s a great fan service game that will hold him until MH5. He''s been playing this with his friend and alone for hours so I am guessing it''s a hit lol.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Gray', N'lauren.gray8974@example.com', '2016-07-17', 5, N'Received my code promptly upon purchase. Good alternative to buying RP through riot''s store.'),
(N'Heather', N'Rogers', N'heather.rogers8625@example.org', '2016-07-18', 5, N'Great game and good price my grandkids love this game'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ali', N'cynthia.ali7462@example.org', '2016-07-18', 4, N'This particular expansion is wonderful, but the amount of SecuROM that is bundled with it can really cripple your PC. Thus, I strongly suggest you use a fixed EXE, which essentially has all the SecuROM removed, and you won''t need to stick the disc in every time. It''s sad you have to go this route. I agree: Piracy is wrong, and people should be paid for their hard work (especially with a game as huge as this!), but malicious DRM which messes with your PC to the point where you might even have to format your PC to remove every trace of it is NOT the answer! The expansion itself is one of my most favorites, because of all the little things you can do on vacation. My most favorite thing is the Unsavory Charlatan, a con man who will try and scam your Sims out of their hard earned money. He''s so funny to watch!'),
(N'Larry', N'Suzuki', N'larry.suzuki8720@example.net', '2016-07-18', 5, N'Thank you.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Tanaka', N'kimberly.tanaka7006@example.com', '2016-07-18', 5, N'Had to get it again every true Transformers fan should have this in the collection. A++++'),
(N'Hannah', N'Sanchez', N'hannah.sanchez1949@example.com', '2016-07-18', 5, N'Awesome, thanks!'),
(N'Judith', N'Henderson', N'judith.henderson2163@example.org', '2016-07-18', 5, N'Just hooked these up to my GameCube and can confirm what other reviewers here have said, these are excellent cables. No checkerboard pattern or static interference of any kind. I actually compared these to Monster S-Video cables and could straight up not tell the difference. Those Monster S-Video Cables are the best quality S-Video cables for the GameCube known to man, but will run you $100. So you understand why I am excited. I don''t have a SNES or N64 so I cant speak for those. I think why they are so good is a couple of reasons. One, they are lacking the yellow composite cable which is notorious for splitting and degrading the signal. Two, the video and audio cables are on a sort of ribbon cable that keeps their signal from interfering with each other. But who cares why, get them while they last. To be clear, these are Gam3Gear S-Video Cables that are lacking the yellow video line. Ive seen some Gam3Gear that include that yellow line so be careful to avoid those. I bought these...'),
(N'Emily', N'Moore', N'emily.moore6827@example.org', '2016-07-18', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Patrick', N'Hughes', N'patrick.hughes2738@example.com', '2016-07-18', 5, N'Having been waiting to try one of these games in a language I understand, the excitement was unreal when I saw this was coming out. I went and bought this just a few days back. I could not put this down... until my 3DS died. The feel is like a Persona game, but with less symbolism. I think I actually prefer this game to Persona Q Shadow of the Labyrinth. Well worth checking out the demo at the very least.'),
(N'Donna', N'Allen', N'donna.allen5375@example.com', '2016-07-19', 5, N'Even more than just having it as a AMIIBO, its nice to have as a figure.'),
(N'Mary', N'Gray', N'mary.gray8671@example.com', '2016-07-19', 5, N'Great product, would buy again.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Ivanov', N'christopher.ivanov8785@example.org', '2016-07-19', 3, N'Sound quality is awesome just like Sennheiser HD 598. But GAME ONE''s mic detects too much background noise. Sennheiser HD 598 + Antlion ModMic is a much better choice. The ear cups on GAME ONE is tighter compared to Sennheiser HD 598.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Flores', N'jerry.flores7535@example.com', '2016-07-19', 5, N'This product is great. it is the right length and customer service was very helpful to me.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Kim', N'elizabeth.kim9624@example.net', '2016-07-19', 5, N'great+++++'),
(N'Barbara', N'Walker', N'barbara.walker3372@example.com', '2016-07-20', 2, N'People want to compare it to the Souls franchise which is understandable. However as a souls player from the beginning (and earlier if you count Kings Field) Bloodborne was a game I had so much anticipation for and was so thoroughly let down by it when I finally did get to play it. (after a huge problem with amazon & the order of my PS4 which forced me to have to wait nearly a month to get to a physical store to buy a PS4) Anyone who knows about the game essentially knows it is like a souls game but faster paced. That is very much true and that is the problem. The joy of a souls game is the ability to play your way and use your strategic methods to work around the problems presented by the environment and enemies. Bloodborne removes the strategic element and transforms the gameplay into a twitch gaming affair with one primary change. The removal of Shields. Thats all it took to quicken the pace of the game and transform it into Twitch gameplay dark souls. Imagine if Halo had...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Thomas', N'pamela.thomas4648@example.com', '2016-07-20', 4, N'I was mislead as to the region of this product. The image shows a NA region 1. I was sent a European release. The playstation is indeed region free and will play fine. However when it comes to DLC and add-on. You are not going to be able to use whatever you purchase.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Sanchez', N'andrew.sanchez9556@example.com', '2016-07-20', 5, N'Great product for the price'),
(N'Scott', N'Gomez', N'scott.gomez3724@example.com', '2016-07-20', 5, N'bought for grandson he loved it'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Wilson', N'jonathan.wilson9338@example.org', '2016-07-20', 5, N'Works great, had no issues playing it what so ever.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Stewart', N'deborah.stewart9652@example.net', '2016-07-20', 3, N'The joysticks needed a bit of breaking in. With 2 seperate controllers, I started experiencing the leaning joystick problem.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Rogers', N'joseph.rogers1351@example.org', '2016-07-20', 4, N'RE5 remaster is a good game. It''s actually damn good. Some of it''s gameplay elements don''t stand the test of time though, such as having to stand still while you aim, shoot or reload. The performance is where this remaster falters. Unlike the re-release for Resident Evil 6(running at 1080p 60), the frame-rate(as of launch up until July 20th) isn''t very smooth. Even though you get to enjoy the game in 1080p, you''ll notice frequent jittering when panning the camera left and right in most areas of the game. There are some instances where there aren''t any enemies and the game feels smooth as butter but when the action kicks in, the game often dips to the low 50''s to upper 40''s so keep that in mind in case you were expecting a perfect remaster. If you haven''t played Resident Evil 5 last generation, then you have no reason to avoid spending 20 bucks on this excellent action game. It doesn''t carry the horror elements of the earlier entries of RE, but the addiction of shooting things and...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Sullivan', N'kyle.sullivan6591@example.net', '2016-07-20', 1, N'I used a Ouija board to communicate with the ghost of my brother who was killed by playing this. This is what he said. \\=()=// ''_( )( ,_)~()~_ UGH THIS KILLED ME () Then he died.'),
(N'Patricia', N'King', N'patricia.king1590@example.org', '2016-07-20', 5, N'Best game ever play. If you don''t have it well do it its amazing'),
(N'Gary', N'Flores', N'gary.flores3979@example.org', '2016-07-20', 5, N'Item is as described. Came in great condition. Amazing collectors edition with a great art book.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Clark', N'nicholas.clark3168@example.net', '2016-07-20', 3, N'It is OK'),
(N'Rachel', N'Mitchell', N'rachel.mitchell8964@example.com', '2016-07-20', 5, N'cute'),
(N'Wei', N'Boyd', N'wei.boyd6330@example.net', '2016-07-20', 5, N'works as expected'),
(N'Wei', N'Boyd', N'wei.boyd6330@example.net', '2016-07-20', 5, N'pretty cool system, you can hook up your old sega controlers to this system for an orginal feel. it comes with wireless controlers that are smaller than the orginals.it comes preloaded with the games listed and will play sega games. its about the size of the sega 3.'),
(N'Joan', N'Ramos', N'joan.ramos6038@example.com', '2016-07-20', 5, N'D.VA is waifu'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ruiz', N'aisha.ruiz9452@example.org', '2016-07-21', 5, N'Good price a must have.'),
(N'Brian', N'Ross', N'brian.ross6139@example.net', '2016-07-21', 5, N'Works great with my kids do and tablet'),
(N'Lisa', N'Henderson', N'lisa.henderson6397@example.net', '2016-07-21', 5, N'Great game, graphics, story.'),
(N'Mary', N'Cook', N'mary.cook3611@example.com', '2016-07-21', 5, N'Excellent. Very nice!'),
(N'Shirley', N'Diaz', N'shirley.diaz4781@example.net', '2016-07-21', 5, N'Skylanders keep getting better and better with each released. The vehicles is a nice addition.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Mitchell', N'jacob.mitchell1493@example.net', '2016-07-22', 5, N'So far my grandson plays it at home, but during the school year he played it at my house, it kept him entertained for the couple of hours he spent with me each day after school.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Garcia', N'nadia.garcia7023@example.net', '2016-07-22', 5, N'I use this thing to navigate PS VUE and it works great'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Richardson', N'cynthia.richardson7318@example.net', '2016-07-22', 5, N'I bought this for my son and he really likes it.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Chavez', N'elizabeth.chavez3277@example.org', '2016-07-22', 5, N'Great quality, Highly recommended for S7 VR games, I would buy again'),
(N'Frank', N'Chavez', N'frank.chavez8741@example.net', '2016-07-22', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Michelle', N'Jimenez', N'michelle.jimenez4721@example.com', '2016-07-22', 5, N'Fast shipping for Japanese import and cool to have the the different packaging'),
(N'Brenda', N'Thompson', N'brenda.thompson4278@example.net', '2016-07-22', 2, N'plug and play works well, but I coudent get used to the way it works so I returned it.'),
(N'Anita', N'Barnes', N'anita.barnes4317@example.org', '2016-07-22', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Larry', N'Suzuki', N'larry.suzuki3411@example.com', '2016-07-22', 1, N'This game is monkey crap!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Rogers', N'nathan.rogers3441@example.net', '2016-07-23', 1, N'I knew I wasn''t gonna be ceazy about this game because this series is known for asking way too much of the player, as in you''re constantly having to run all over the map because your bases are in perpetual trouble and your "allies" can''t even defend themselves. For some reason, being a game that Nintendo is involved with, maybe that crap would be toned down, and it is for the first few levels. After that though, it''s pure pandemonium. I''ve barely had this game for a week and I''ve already gotten so pissed off that I ripped the cartridge right out and threw it. I even manhandled my New 3DS in my fury. No wonder it can''t be rented! It was a mistake to buy this, and in fact, it was probably a mistake to get a 3DS since this seems to be best it has to offer. I don''t just hate this game, now I''m starting to hate games in general because of trash like this! Burn in hell, Tecmo-Koei!'),
(N'Amara', N'Evans', N'amara.evans6169@example.net', '2016-07-23', 5, N'This is the 3rd time I had to buy this game.. I keep losing it.. Anyways, its not a bad game overall.. Especially of you like guilty gear.. Tue mini games can be a bit of a problem though..'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Parker', N'stephanie.parker6868@example.com', '2016-07-23', 5, N'If you collect Skylanders its a must buy if you don''t already own it.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Parker', N'stephanie.parker6868@example.com', '2016-07-23', 5, N'Digital code work like it suppose to and the game is great.'),
(N'Scott', N'Wang', N'scott.wang1230@example.com', '2016-07-23', 5, N'Now let''s get this straight, this is no Call Of Duty so if you''re expecting an unrealistic shooter where you can shoot these weapons with accuracy and no mechanics go back to playing COD. This game is simple, simple level designs, simple objectives, but not so simple execution as the game can get tough if you go Gung-Ho. You have to strategize by assessing your environment and slowly scoping out the area so you are not surrounded by hordes of zombies. If you play your cards right and strategize you can eliminate the hordes of zombies and move on. If you don''t yo are screwed. The sniper rifle is your best friend I. This game and what is there not to like about sniping undead Nazis? The game has a solo campaign which is extremely fun to play (I recommend you play with headphones) or you can play co-op online and pic any of the levels from ththe game. I prefer playing solo. If you like first person shooters and zombies this is a must have. Awesome game that you won''t be able to put down.'),
(N'Steven', N'Thompson', N'steven.thompson9141@example.org', '2016-07-23', 5, N'I loved this game on Dreamcast in middle school. I bought it for about $5 in the Xbox store for 360 and it is now compatible with Xbox One! So anyone who loved this game, buy it in the Xbox store! The controls all work very well and it has transitioned nicely onto the newer systems. Very fun to play and my kids love it even though they have zero interest in my other vintage video games. No cussing, blood, gore or anything which is great for the fam. This is my favorite fishing game on any system and it''s in my personal top 10 favorite games ever. It''s just simple and fun.'),
(N'Mary', N'Lee', N'mary.lee5458@example.com', '2016-07-23', 5, N'Waiting for the PSVR!'),
(N'Angela', N'Singh', N'angela.singh6535@example.org', '2016-07-24', 3, N'Being a long-time AC fan, I was hoping for some evolution to the series, especially regarding combat. Unfortunately, combat is one aspect that has not evolved much if at all. While the upgrade system does add to the depth of combat, most events feel clunky and unresponsive, especially when you try to counter an opponent who is relentless. The weapons upgrade system feels like a setup to bait you into spending more real cash on points in order to get your character up to par. The only other option is to grind for money to get better gear which becomes quit repetitive. All in all, Syndicate feels like a mediocre outing, and I hope Ubisoft can find a way to re-energize this series in the near future.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ward', N'rachel.ward1225@example.com', '2016-07-24', 5, N'I like all "Need For Speed" games. I just added this one to my collection.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Mendoza', N'stephanie.mendoza5053@example.net', '2016-07-24', 5, N'This game is so fun! It''s also very comical, they crack plenty of jokes in this game. However, though it is a game, not very realistic. A witness changing their story 4+ times in the real world would have gotten your case thrown out. lol.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Jenkins', N'tomasz.jenkins5322@example.com', '2016-07-24', 5, N'Milon''s Secret Castle is a pretty good Metroid-style exploration game with a cutesy kiddish style, but there''s two BIG things you need to know before playing it. One is that without an online guide, you''re going to be completely lost and confused because the game gives you no information to figure out where you''re supposed to go and two, when you eventually make a lot of progress and lose, make sure you hold left + start on the controller in order to continue where you left off. Yes even the continue screen is a big secret! You do NOT want to start over at the beginning- this game''s at least an hour long. With that out of the way, Milon''s Secret Castle is one of those games that usually results in mixed feelings. Some people think it''s a hidden masterpiece that offers solid castle exploration, while others think it''s just not good enough compared to other games in the genre. I fall in the first category- I enjoy Milon''s Secret Castle, but it has its share of faults. Let''s talk...'),
(N'Joan', N'Young', N'joan.young5168@example.net', '2016-07-24', 1, N'This mouse did not fit in my hand comfortably and I needed to return it. I use a claw grip and have an average size hand and simply could not get this mouse to work correctly. The mouse hump is tilted to the right and has no thumb rest, and its a very small mouse in my opinion that would not allow my to grip it while gaming. Very uncomfortable for me but it might work for you.'),
(N'Wei', N'Allen', N'wei.allen2685@example.com', '2016-07-24', 1, N'NO STORY POOR & STUPID HARD PUZZLES THIS GAME SUCKS'),
(N'Megan', N'Powell', N'megan.powell3514@example.com', '2016-07-24', 5, N'My daughter loved the game. The only thing that she did not like was that only one person could play it. The graphics were good, and the directions were clear. She stated that it was adventurous and challenging, because she could do more actions as she learned the fighting moves. Her favorite part was the training.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Morgan', N'samantha.morgan2183@example.net', '2016-07-24', 4, N'Probably the BEST AC game I''ve played, out of the 4 that I owned. Visually stunning, good story, excellent side missions, and really fun! I''m a huge Caribbean and pirate fan and this is spot on. There''s a ton of things to do in this massive open free-roam world including being captain of your own ship and going whaling. Of course, it does have your traditional AC things about the game like Eagle Vision, climbing, and synchronizing cities from atop the tallest buildings. What else is good about this game is that it doesn''t have that same repetative feel to it as prior games in the AC series. The only problem I had, overall, was the main story became somewhat boring and main missions weren''t that fun. I also didn''t like how much time I needed to spend on sending out my fleet in order to gain currency to purchase weapons and upgrades. That was too much. Other than that, I definitely recommend buying this, especially now that it''s way low in cost.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Ramirez', N'daniel.ramirez4401@example.org', '2016-07-24', 5, N'Super cute and light. It does its job.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Moore', N'lauren.moore8654@example.net', '2016-07-24', 1, N'Clamp is weak and sours the experience of use. Dpad might as well have not been included it''s so bad.'),
(N'Adam', N'Tanaka', N'adam.tanaka5557@example.org', '2016-07-25', 1, N'I was upgrading from XP elevens and thought it would be great just to be able to disconnect the wire. These are a total disappointment their sound quality can be easily beaten by $10 pair of Sony earphones that I own they come nowhere near the XP 11 which were a cheaper set of Turtle Beach phones ... do not buy these the audio is horrible.'),
(N'William', N'Howard', N'william.howard1107@example.com', '2016-07-25', 5, N'I was gonna give it 4 stars because its not the most amazing game ive played but the art direction of this game is SO AMAZING that it deserves 5 stars just for the art alone! So far im liking this game a lot, i find it a little bit too easy but its enjoyable and the concept of using summons called Servans to help in battle is pretty cool. Keep in mind this isn''t turn based, its a real time jrpg with a little micro managing your servans. very fun and the characters are APPEALING ( ). Looking at you Lilysse-sama'),
(N'Jessica', N'Ward', N'jessica.ward1487@example.net', '2016-07-25', 4, N'MGS V might be the end of an era. Hideo Kojima has long spoken out thru his characters about the dnagers of nuclear weapons. And his philosophies about war in general as spoken by David Hayter throughout the series. But this is a whole new snake. He is older, at a loss for words, shell-shocked. He is even voiced by Donald Sutherland. This Snake had previously been in MGS V: Ground Zeroes. Nine years later, he awakens from a coma and is severely injured. By this time Snake, or should we say his predecessor Big Boss, has suffered much in a somewhat private war. Solid Snake''s reign stretches from two classic MSX games to the original Metal Gear Solid on PSone, one of the sequels on PS2 (Sons of Liberty... mostly a cameo role for the majority of the game if that) to MGS 4 on PS3 where he was Old Snake. There''s a convoluted plot involving the ethics of genetic engineering and cloning where two soldiers are created from the DNA of a world class, legendary soldier known as Big Boss. Big...'),
(N'Frank', N'Butler', N'frank.butler7237@example.net', '2016-07-25', 5, N'very good game'),
(N'Henry', N'Castillo', N'henry.castillo6314@example.com', '2016-07-25', 3, N'Amazing controls. Simply amazing! the led on the mic arm that indicates the mute is on is a life saver. I have had many conversations with my self thinking that I was apart of the conversation to only realize that my mic muted. I hope other headset manufactures take notice of that touch and the controls in general. As soon as you open the packaging, you know that these are a high quality pair of headphones. The build and presentation is amazing. I love the white and beige color, classy enough to take to work and listen to music. Music sounds great with them too, better than my sony mdr-v6s. Even with all of these positives, I am returning these headphones. The cracks every once in awhile if you change tone, such as yelling expletives at 13 year olds, and the overall game audio is terrible to be honest. I don''t understand how music can sound so good with these, but the game audio sounds so hollow. I tried testing the sound wirelessly, and passively. Game audio sounded terrible both...'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Martinez', N'jennifer.martinez4423@example.net', '2016-07-25', 5, N'I love the game..the controls..fluid it is..5 stars easy...clean game start u off to get u into controls...and the time era..I love it'),
(N'Brandon', N'Okonkwo', N'brandon.okonkwo2537@example.org', '2016-07-26', 5, N'this is a fun game. we had a great time playing it'),
(N'Donna', N'Roberts', N'donna.roberts6351@example.org', '2016-07-26', 4, N'fast shipping.happy with the product'),
(N'Ivan', N'Ali', N'ivan.ali4384@example.org', '2016-07-26', 5, N'Cool'),
(N'Alexander', N'Rogers', N'alexander.rogers9721@example.com', '2016-07-26', 4, N'Didn''t think it would be anything special but I love how it charges my ps4 controllers and has extra usb hubs to become a charging station. Really nifty'),
(N'Luis', N'Jones', N'luis.jones1519@example.net', '2016-07-27', 5, N'This is a masterpiece of a game. The tactical aspect of the game and the battles are very impressive. I bought it when it was released. I''m about to buy it again.(new hard drive) Everything from the gameplay to pacing to graphics or music, they''re all top notch for a game released at the time it was originally. I also own Total War Warhammer which is a brand new Total War game. Medieval 2 is better as far as being enjoyable and impressive. I like the graphics of Medieval II better also. I wish they would make Medieval III Total War and hopefully with it being licensed by Sega. I don''t own Total War Attila or Shogun I and 2 so I can''t compare those. There is nothing I don''t like about this game and so much that I do like about it. I don''t know if the population on multiplayer is still there so it might be a primarily single player game.'),
(N'Scott', N'Rogers', N'scott.rogers9094@example.org', '2016-07-27', 2, N'I regret buying it. I bought the G29 with this. I love the G29... This, this sits on my bookshelf. The few times I used it I just wanted to throw it away. It feels fine and functions similarly (eh... ) to the real thing. But when in game (Project Cars) I was having a nightmare shifting to the right gear. I just gave up and used the paddle shifters. Which... makes me wonder why I bought it Should you get this? Hmmm... maybe, hoping the next GT game for the PS4 supports the G29 properly.... There isn''t that many games that use it. So make sure to check if your game supports it (and on what platform)'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Allen', N'stephanie.allen8012@example.org', '2016-07-27', 5, N'Cousin loves this game.'),
(N'Michael', N'Nguyen', N'michael.nguyen3773@example.com', '2016-07-27', 5, N'I ordered this for my sister, and she absolutely loves it.'),
(N'Megan', N'Russell', N'megan.russell5578@example.net', '2016-07-27', 5, N'Works perfectly! Great purchase'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Lee', N'jacqueline.lee4916@example.net', '2016-07-27', 5, N'Cool. Fits perfect. Fan uses USB power from the front of the PS4 which i kind of annoying. Turns on only when PS4 is powered on. Quiet operation. Turbo boost setting is optimal.'),
(N'Christina', N'Ross', N'christina.ross9730@example.net', '2016-07-27', 5, N'Absolutely the best Xbox family games we have. I ordered Rayman Legends and was so surprised at how awesome it is. My kids love it and there''s no naughty content. Its just a bunch of obstacle courses. The graphics and the musical score is fabulous. Great for adults too. Very addicting and the whole family will love it.'),
(N'Henry', N'Butler', N'henry.butler7046@example.net', '2016-07-27', 4, N'Good controllers but feel cheap, wish the cords were longer but can''t knock it for the price'),
(N'Christine', N'Cook', N'christine.cook6040@example.org', '2016-07-28', 5, N'Worked great and in the condition as described. Old favorite that we enjoy playing.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Price', N'joseph.price1430@example.net', '2016-07-28', 5, N'My brother called up a gamestop in alabama checking if they had it. Went over there and bought it new. He bought one new himself from another gamestop. Not many from the small town in alabama even could afford games anyway lol. Good thing we had jobs. I''d rather keep my Guitar Hero machine ds lite over this, though. It''s nice, has nice reddish-purplish tint to it. Looks better than the actual picture on the box. It''s really worth it if you''re a collector, but I''m not selling it for a lame $180. I can wait. People will get desperate.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Flores', N'ethan.flores6118@example.net', '2016-07-28', 5, N'Great product, and got it for an awesome deal.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Hill', N'evelyn.hill9581@example.net', '2016-07-28', 5, N'Great mouse'),
(N'Jessica', N'Martinez', N'jessica.martinez3071@example.net', '2016-07-28', 5, N'Kids love this one.'),
(N'George', N'Lee', N'george.lee7064@example.org', '2016-07-28', 2, N'It truly is a shame to see a game with this amount of potential fall as flat on its face as TNMT: Mutants in Manhattan does. The fact that you cannot play local 2 player is a sad slap in the face and is also a clear indicator of the lazy and lousy effort put forth to make this succeed. The combat is horrendous and its a bummer that we can''t get a decent TNMTworthy of the namesake in our time and age. The NES version even reigns supreme when compared to this sloppy embarrassment of a game. Its a waste of money and I simply cannot find it in me to recommend this to anyone. I had high hopes for this, but like all the others, was shocked at the results this terrible failure of a game introduced. The fact that the game even wears the TNMT logo is such a disgrace to the TNMT brand and fans of it and the show should not let that sway them in a decision to buy this. One of the worst games I''ve played this year. if you simply must have or try it, I HIGHLY advise waiting for the price to...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Robinson', N'ethan.robinson4160@example.org', '2016-07-28', 5, N'It''s the best expansion for Sims 4. I liked Get to Work but it got boring after you finished the careers once. In this expansion you get to really get your sims out and about. I was hesitant about the clubs, but they are terrific and you can have any type of club you want.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'King', N'jonathan.king6213@example.net', '2016-07-28', 1, N'I wanted to like this game. I REALLY did. We preordered it and bought the season pass because my BF had been so excited about it. I''m not a huge fan of FPS games but I love the Star Wars motif and my BF has an addiction to Shooters. So why did we only play this game for a week? For me - it has no story. There is no point to what I''m doing, no end game, no anything other than - be this person, shoot other people, repeat. Once the Star Wars novelty wore off, I was over it. Me and the 8 other people who bought this game together - we downloaded Magika 2 for free and played that for more entertainment. For my Man - he was level capped at the end of day two. By the end of day three he was bored. He played for a whole week, knew everywhere on the map to be and had tried every option the game offered. The DLC started coming out - He played it, I asked "Does it have a story now?" He said no, so I didn''t bother. He played the new maps and modes for less than a day and went back to the...'),
(N'Jose', N'Alvarez', N'jose.alvarez6111@example.org', '2016-07-28', 5, N'It works.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Raghunathan', N'rachel.raghunathan5738@example.org', '2016-07-28', 4, N'Great game but controls on PC are rough, just like on iPad. May need to bind a steam controller.'),
(N'Betty', N'Foster', N'betty.foster1884@example.net', '2016-07-29', 5, N'2 great classic fighting games. If you love 2d vs fighting in the style of SF you''ll love this game. The visuals are still hold up well after all these years, though not as good as current 2d hand drawn fighters like Guilty Gear, BlazBlue, fighting climax, aquapazza. Thats because hd wasn''t around back then. But nowadays we are spoiled with HD 2d visuals that could pass for an anime. But these hand drawn graphics are still colorful and nicely drawn. Very nostalgic for those who enjoyed the 1990''s 2d fighters. This game controls as well as SF2 with the same 6 button scheme. Of course if your looking at this game chances are you played it in the arcades, on the saturn, or ps at home. Or the more recently the DarkStalker psp game. Of course you get to choose from classic monsters like a vampire, frankenstein''s monster, the mummy, yetti. Some of these characters are in other capcom games like puzzle fighter, capcom evolution and MvC series. These games are classic capcom games that you...'),
(N'Helen', N'Scott', N'helen.scott8616@example.org', '2016-07-29', 5, N'Shipped quickly and was brand new sealed and everything like it was described. Would buy from seller again.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Garcia', N'lucia.garcia5756@example.com', '2016-07-29', 5, N'grandson loves this game'),
(N'Jerry', N'Flores', N'jerry.flores7535@example.com', '2016-07-29', 3, N'It will keep you busy'),
(N'Jerry', N'Flores', N'jerry.flores7535@example.com', '2016-07-29', 3, N'it''s fine but it can use more codes on it.'),
(N'Michael', N'Ross', N'michael.ross5808@example.net', '2016-07-29', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Anna', N'Rivera', N'anna.rivera2501@example.net', '2016-07-29', 5, N'Love this keyboard. Has many features for the RGB leds. Easy to clean. The volume scroll and the mute button are great. The buttons are pretty sensitive. I opted for the brown keyswitches this time around..feels the same as the blue switches on the blackwidow but a lot less noise.'),
(N'Scott', N'Hall', N'scott.hall1232@example.org', '2016-07-29', 4, N'The game is awesome i would all day and night but the game came with reedem code it was death shroke and Knight fall pack thy was both Reedem or expired'),
(N'Christina', N'Hughes', N'christina.hughes2855@example.org', '2016-07-29', 5, N'Dreams come true in the kirbys dreamland!! So fun and sweet!'),
(N'Lauren', N'James', N'lauren.james7170@example.com', '2016-07-29', 5, N'This is a great lego dimensions fun pack, it features ghostbusters, which is one of my favorite franchises. Slimer is so cute and is the perfect character to play in the ghostbusters level. If you bought the ghostbusters level pack, then this one is a must have. Buy it now, if you have the lego dimensions game, you won''t regret it.'),
(N'Megan', N'Robinson', N'megan.robinson1048@example.net', '2016-07-30', 5, N'WOW! What an end to the series! I''m an experienced gamer with my beginnings being on Commodore 64 so I have seen quite a lot and I tell you this is one of those games you remember.. Forever..'),
(N'Carol', N'Davis', N'carol.davis6461@example.net', '2016-07-30', 5, N'I love this system and it came early.'),
(N'Emma', N'Taylor', N'emma.taylor3826@example.com', '2016-07-30', 5, N'Brings back old memories of platforming games and I''m over 30.'),
(N'Carol', N'Harris', N'carol.harris8262@example.com', '2016-07-30', 5, N'A+'),
(N'Brenda', N'Miller', N'brenda.miller6434@example.org', '2016-07-30', 5, N'My son has used this for about a month now and it works great. It even tells you what % of charge your controllers are at. It is easy for him to put them on unlike some chargers that need the batteries set on them just right.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Chavez', N'brandon.chavez8155@example.org', '2016-07-30', 4, N'Shipped pretty fast and such a fun and addicting game. The only reason its 4/5 stars is because the game always jams up and crashes on me. Other than that, an amazing buy'),
(N'Patrick', N'Scott', N'patrick.scott6196@example.com', '2016-07-31', 3, N'ok'),
(N'Jacob', N'Campbell', N'jacob.campbell5837@example.com', '2016-07-31', 5, N'Bought this for my son as a birthday gift a while back he loves it. The statue has some weight to it and looks incredible as well as the booklet overall he enjoyed it and for the price it was a good deal.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Carter', N'kenneth.carter7117@example.org', '2016-07-31', 5, N'I haven''t had a chance to check it out on the x-box yet...I bought this game for my son''s 13th birthday which isn''t until October. But I can''t wait to see his face when he opens this, as he has been bugging me for this game :)'),
(N'Donna', N'Ali', N'donna.ali9209@example.net', '2016-07-31', 5, N'Graphics are wonderful. Like all games it takes time to get use to controls, but similar to past years.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Walker', N'nicholas.walker2675@example.com', '2016-07-31', 5, N'Absolutely wonderful keyboard! Very sturdy, and absolutely great price. Highly recommend.'),
(N'Diane', N'Parker', N'diane.parker6208@example.org', '2016-07-31', 5, N'This is the first add on for a new system for me. This one is cool because its temperature controled and automatically turns on when needed.'),
(N'Angela', N'Patel', N'angela.patel9053@example.net', '2016-07-31', 5, N'Great little charging station for us, we have it set up behind the TV so it is out of the way. We have some silicon covers that my daughter uses on her controller and it still charges her controller. You just have to get it on there just right but it still works.'),
(N'Helen', N'Cook', N'helen.cook4236@example.com', '2016-08-01', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Paul', N'Wang', N'paul.wang3001@example.org', '2016-08-01', 5, N'I love this game so much!!'),
(N'Judith', N'King', N'judith.king9188@example.net', '2016-08-01', 5, N'Better than the actual Zelda limited edition N3DS look!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Murphy', N'douglas.murphy8405@example.net', '2016-08-01', 5, N'bess'),
(N'Patricia', N'Edwards', N'patricia.edwards1282@example.com', '2016-08-01', 5, N'These fit the original remotes perfectly. They help up well after years of use and a nice colors'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ali', N'cynthia.ali7462@example.org', '2016-08-01', 1, N'I had gotten this game pretty much at launch date, and no major issues arose with it, but speed up to last year, when I tried installing it to a laptop. The DRM crippled this laptop and made it border-line unusable until I was FORCED to re-install Windows! It saddens me seeing how confident Will Wright was when he was showing it off at various game conventions, and it was his little pride and joy. but then EA changed it up by quite a bit and then added SecuROM to the game, and effectively eliminated all chances of this game being even half-decent. Steer clear from this one, unless you want HEADACHES!'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ramirez', N'rachel.ramirez7028@example.com', '2016-08-01', 5, N'Great story and plenty of places to explore. Plenty of action and building the farms was a great addition to the game.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Bell', N'barbara.bell9432@example.org', '2016-08-01', 5, N'Work just as expected.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Murphy', N'nathan.murphy4942@example.org', '2016-08-01', 5, N'This makes playing some of those more frustrating mouse/keyboard games worth every penny. I love the ergonomics of the Xbox ONE controller more so than any other gaming controller on the market. My only complaint is that I don''t have the Elite one.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Hughes', N'amanda.hughes4692@example.com', '2016-08-01', 4, N'This headset sounds great! I see a lot of negative reviews, but I really like this headset. The sound quality is excellent and I have played several games in party chat and my friends said I had the clearest mic of the group (6 people.) I would recommend following the included instructions when setting up the headset. I went in and just set it up based on a lot of other headsets and I was wrong. If you setup the headset as the documentation advises then you will avoid some issues and complaints. I gave the review four stars for two reasons. The first being that they mute button is in an odd location and a little difficult to press if you need to quickly turn of the mute. The second reason being that this headset is mildly uncomfortable at first and requires you to break it in.'),
(N'Noah', N'Ruiz', N'noah.ruiz2588@example.org', '2016-08-01', 5, N'Comfortable to wear for hours and they sound great.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Davis', N'brenda.davis9447@example.net', '2016-08-01', 1, N'This could have been a really good game- not a great game, but a good one. It''s beautiful, deeply fleshed out, all of the quality parts of Assassin''s Creed that we''re used to. I have played all the AC games and they share one thing in common- THE CONTROLS SUCK! There''s no other way to put it. They were really bad for the first three releases on PS3. But for AC III they got a little less sucky, and Black Flag had the least sucky of all the versions I''ve played. Then apparently they tore everything down and built it back from scratch. Well, they did a typical sucky job with the controls. They are, BY FAR, the worst controls of any AC game I''ve ever played. I mean the person responsible for these controls should be whupped like a red-headed step-child. Having said that, I''m only about 20 or so hours in, and because I love everything else about Assassin''s Creed, I''m going to finish this one. But I just wanted to warn everyone that by far, the toughest enemy you''ll encounter in this...'),
(N'Adam', N'Morales', N'adam.morales7683@example.org', '2016-08-01', 4, N'Love the game.'),
(N'Mary', N'Smith', N'mary.smith2851@example.org', '2016-08-01', 5, N'Great game, match making is a bit confusing, but when selecting your characters the team suggestions helps you figure out what your teams weakness is. Can''t wait for updates.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Davis', N'rachel.davis5755@example.org', '2016-08-01', 5, N'It has met every expecting that I had. It is an amazing game and a challenge, which is hard to come by these days with games having hints to help young gamers along. 5 stars'),
(N'Emma', N'King', N'emma.king8068@example.org', '2016-08-01', 3, N'Its decent. Map is pretty big and gameplay wise it is similar to previous Farcry games. Only thing I notice different is that this game compare to previous Farcry is that its sort of harder. Gun''s accuracy and damage seems to be much lower. Driving a car is harder too or that just might be me. Compare with GTA and Saint row, driving seems to be way more buggy and hard to steer.'),
(N'Anna', N'Chavez', N'anna.chavez4265@example.net', '2016-08-02', 5, N'I''ve been a long time xbox fan all the way back the the first one. I bought the 360 at launch and had issues. Then purchased a new 360 when the smaller ones came out. This time I went PS4 for my first purchase but now I own a XBOX ONE and I have to say it''s beyond awesome. Great console. Can''t wait for gears 4!!!'),
(N'Anthony', N'Hall', N'anthony.hall8652@example.net', '2016-08-02', 4, N'If you like the just dance franchise, this is just fun.'),
(N'Joan', N'Murphy', N'joan.murphy3344@example.org', '2016-08-02', 3, N'I mean it''s CoD: Ghosts. Don''t buy this now. Buy the newest CoD: Black Ops 63: Advanced Nuclear Space Aliens (featuring Barrack Obama). Worked as expected. Camera is a neat touch. Beats buying a GoPro if you just want to mess around.'),
(N'Joan', N'Murphy', N'joan.murphy3344@example.org', '2016-08-02', 4, N'Great headset. Microphone is poor quality, but an amplifier firmware update does help improve that.'),
(N'John', N'Turner', N'john.turner3724@example.com', '2016-08-02', 5, N'A more robust system and easier handling of weapons, the style arts are quick to access are extremely helpful. The revamped felyne armour system is better instead of the terrible broken one in MH4. Its best played with multiplayer, its great fun and gathering materials is a lot better now without the insane rarity mh4 had'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez7512@example.com', '2016-08-02', 3, N'kind of fun but was even a little violent on this?? ugh oh well I was hoping to get it because I thought looked bit more innocent but was still not perfect haha oh well can''t win in this world easily'),
(N'Pamela', N'Kim', N'pamela.kim9572@example.com', '2016-08-02', 5, N'Cool!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Turner', N'joshua.turner9601@example.com', '2016-08-02', 3, N'An essential for game user'),
(N'Joyce', N'Sullivan', N'joyce.sullivan2709@example.org', '2016-08-02', 5, N'So I have a day 1 edition Xbox one and decided to upgrade and have 2 Xbox ones in our house. So glad I did first off it seems a lot faster and I could swear some games actually run/look better. Well I did some research and sure enough the video card is over clocked which helps with some games. That aside I really love the look of it and the new controller is nice. Did I mention it plays 4K blue rays also?'),
(N'David', N'Jackson', N'david.jackson9629@example.net', '2016-08-02', 5, N'Amazing graphics, voiced-over characters, fun soloing and more fun with friends and other players. Buy game then Free to Play. The game makers have constantly improved and expanded this World of Tamriel. The adventures we have had, wow! You can create and play an almost limitless combination of skills and abilities with your own racial abilities, weaponry, wizardry, armor and clothing enhancements, potions, food and drinks, poisons, etc. The version (update) coming out fall 2016 will be called One Tamriel and will allow anyone at any level to go anywhere and group with others regardless of level. In game, you can play as a noble knight, a healer, a thief, an assassin, etc. Every character class and race can wield any weapons and wear any kind of armor. If you like, you can craft armor, clothes, weapons, potions, poisons, food, drinks, equipment enhancing runes, and even have fun fishing. Yes, fishing can be fun in Tamriel when you catch trophy fish and other special things. Even if...'),
(N'Andrew', N'Richardson', N'andrew.richardson5822@example.net', '2016-08-02', 5, N'Thank you for this.. This was a hit in my house as i knew it would be,. Great product great shipping and just great service..'),
(N'Douglas', N'Kelly', N'douglas.kelly8671@example.org', '2016-08-03', 5, N'I received a sample of this GAMING HEADSET in exchange for an honest review. With its large-comfortable, padded ear covers, it really helps reduce surrounding room noises. The sound quality is excellent, with plenty of volume range if you like higher levels of sound. While it is not ''Bluetooth'' this system is designed to be compatible with most major brands of electronic devices and platforms. The "Stereo-Surround-Sound" quality is among the best available at any price, and the microphone is perfectly located for maximum affect. Hard to believe all the quality that is built into this system is only $16.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wood', N'jacqueline.wood9765@example.org', '2016-08-03', 5, N'8/5/2016 - Doom4 is a great game. But It needs more enemies in the levels. I like big open world games that are full of action, npc''s, etc. The graphics are great eye candy but there is not enough npc''s in the levels. And when you''ve taken out the npc''s it can feel boring because there is nothing or no one to challenge you for the items (HINT: The Ultimate Doom moded with Project Brutality and Fearrific and GZDOOM is full of Npc''s, challenges, and draws me into the game). 8/3/2016 - Highly recommend playing with a good set of stereo headphones for a truly immersive experience. There is no doubt in my mind that DOOM or DOOM4 is an awesome game. I love everything about it. And I agree that is the best shooter of 2016 so far. But what about PROJECT BRUTALITY with ULTIMATE DOOM, DOOM 2 HELL ON EARTH, and FINAL DOOM - PLUTONIA EXPERIMENT, TNT EVILUTION? I have been playin PROJECT BRUTALITY with ULTIMATE DOOM and some other mods on PC. For me, it is just as intense, fast, challenging,...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Patel', N'nathan.patel8584@example.com', '2016-08-03', 5, N'A bit unusual for a first timer, but my son loved it, so it''s kid approved!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Suzuki', N'kevin.suzuki3412@example.com', '2016-08-03', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Christine', N'Green', N'christine.green1497@example.com', '2016-08-03', 5, N'One of my top 2 MMO''s of 2014-2016.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Jackson', N'douglas.jackson3047@example.com', '2016-08-03', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Michelle', N'Powell', N'michelle.powell3386@example.org', '2016-08-03', 3, N'Still not sure what he can do compared to others. I like Slimer, and I had to buy for my collection, but you could probably do without.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Brown', N'barbara.brown7198@example.org', '2016-08-03', 5, N'Loved it!!!!'),
(N'Anna', N'Brown', N'anna.brown1280@example.net', '2016-08-03', 5, N'Fun game'),
(N'Anna', N'Brown', N'anna.brown1280@example.net', '2016-08-03', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Anna', N'Brown', N'anna.brown1280@example.net', '2016-08-03', 5, N'They work great'),
(N'Debra', N'Williams', N'debra.williams4966@example.net', '2016-08-04', 4, N'The long-awaited third game in the Zero Escape series is a great game full of twists and turns. It has a few mishaps, and unfortunately doesn''t really bring full closure to the series, but it was worth the wait.'),
(N'Christina', N'Watson', N'christina.watson3847@example.org', '2016-08-04', 5, N'This is a really nice figurine for the price, in my opinion. Definitely would buy again.'),
(N'Christina', N'Watson', N'christina.watson3847@example.org', '2016-08-04', 5, N'Good quality, favorite guitar-playing dog ever. For a functional piece of electronics, its a really well made figurine, love it!'),
(N'Betty', N'Jimenez', N'betty.jimenez7842@example.com', '2016-08-04', 4, N'13 y.o. review "a good game for all ages, it might be online, but there is no chat so it is appropriate for all ages. It is easy to learn and a challenge to rise up the levels in head to head play." From what I''ve seen the kids most enjoy the online mini games (3 - 4 minute rounds with 2 teams made up of people from around the world). It is only one player at a time however which is a bit of a disappointment for homes with multiple kids.'),
(N'David', N'Evans', N'david.evans3132@example.com', '2016-08-04', 4, N'Works perfectly for my GS7 and my Gear VR, though the mode gets confused sometimes and it takes a littler longer than normal to connect but once it does it''s great.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Rodriguez', N'zachary.rodriguez7234@example.net', '2016-08-04', 1, N'No way to filter content. Probably great for sailors.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Myers', N'marcus.myers3798@example.com', '2016-08-04', 5, N'Wonderful, exactly as described!'),
(N'Charles', N'Kowalski', N'charles.kowalski2226@example.net', '2016-08-04', 5, N'I wanted to play Syndicate but figured I''d better play this first. I got burned out on the AC series years ago and didn''t play far into III so I was hesitant to try it again but wow is this a fun game! The storyline is meh and the background, to me, looks closer in details and graphics to Skyrim than it does to the beautiful Witcher 3 but those are my only two minor complaints. No bugs so far, the locations and gameplay are really fun and of course the piracy is awesome! This game held up really well and is definitely still worth playing now, 3 years after release. Heads up parents: my six year old was horrified at aharpooning mission so now I have to do them when she is not around lol.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Bailey', N'ryan.bailey5637@example.org', '2016-08-04', 5, N'Awesome design and keys are very tactile and functioning properly.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'King', N'jonathan.king6213@example.net', '2016-08-04', 5, N'I bought this system over a year ago and I don''t regret it at all. Though I immediately traded in Batman Arkham Asylum for a game I''d actually play. This is a huge update over the PS3 (my poor PS3 was blown to bits by a lightening strike RIP). What I love: 1) The available graphics are amazing, I didn''t expect them to be such a huge step up from the PS3 - mind blown. 2) functions off of and app like structure rather than a more computer style structure 3) The online voice chat - this is huge to me. It has never been so easy to just set up a chat room and have up to 7 other friends hop in to talk to, you don''t even have to be playing the same game any more to talk to people. 4) The PS Store works much better on this than my PS3 - I actually have several games in digital format only that I can actually use (they were a nightmare to play on my PS3). 5) Playstation Sharing - we have two PS4''s in the house and can buy a digital copy of the game once and put it on both PS4''s. 6) Netflix...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Thomas', N'rachel.thomas4298@example.com', '2016-08-04', 4, N'Nintendo makes another hit with Yoshi''s Woolly World. Graphics are colorful and really cool to look at. Good controls, fluid action, fun to play overall. It is a little bit on the "cute" side, i.e. kid-focused, but it is still worth picking up if you are a Nintendo fan of any age. Some of the levels seem super easy and then others will provide a decent challenge. Not sure what is up with that, but still a great game.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Nelson', N'sharon.nelson2264@example.org', '2016-08-04', 3, N'I am posting this one star rating in the hopes that the issues I''m having will be resolved, and then I''ll come back and change it to a 5 star rating. I bought this specifically for the Bluetooth functionality. I already have an Xbox One controller, and I wanted tk get away from using the adapter. 1st problem - The Xbox Accessories app does not recognize this controller when it is connected via Bluetooth. I plugged it in with a cable so I could update the firmware. With the latest firmware, it is still not recognized via Bluetooth. I read somewhere that you could customize the buttons and create profiles via the Xbox Accessories app similar to the way you can with the Elite controller. That doesn''t work even when you plug the controller in. 2nd problem - Steam Big Picture mode appears to see this as two separate controllers at the same time... I think that''s the problem. Anyway, some very odd behavior in Steam Big Picture. When you click A to select an option it seems to choose that...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Jenkins', N'michelle.jenkins3871@example.net', '2016-08-05', 4, N'Nice, long microUSB cable - Perfect for a PS4 controller.'),
(N'Debra', N'Butler', N'debra.butler7839@example.net', '2016-08-05', 5, N'One of the best computer games of all time'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Murphy', N'jeremy.murphy1113@example.net', '2016-08-05', 5, N'Really fun!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Murphy', N'jeremy.murphy1113@example.net', '2016-08-05', 3, N'I prefer COD'),
(N'Dennis', N'Raghunathan', N'dennis.raghunathan1043@example.org', '2016-08-05', 5, N'FIRST OF THE GREATS!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Raghunathan', N'dennis.raghunathan1043@example.org', '2016-08-05', 5, N'I REALLY LIKE THIS GAME. THE PRICE WAS CRAZY LOW SO I COULDN''T PASS IT UP.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Nowak', N'kimberly.nowak7431@example.org', '2016-08-05', 2, N'Been playing for couple hours and really isn''t that cool or dosent live up to the hype it has potiential it seems but not for me seems like a rip off combination of uncharted and farcry'),
(N'Megan', N'Lopez', N'megan.lopez6079@example.net', '2016-08-05', 5, N'good product!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Gonzalez', N'pamela.gonzalez7605@example.org', '2016-08-05', 4, N'I am tempted to give this game 5 stars but I can''t do it. The graphics, story, sound and action are all amazing. My main problem with this game is that it has too many slow parts, and too many interactive movie parts (click triangle or circle quick). You can get away with that here and there, but they did it too often for my liking. That being said, I need to keep this at 4 stars because when the action hits, it''s a great game. Still has the same gum battle style that any uncharted fan will love, and some new features that make jumping and climbing more exciting. I only wish they could find more creative ways to tell the story without having us occasionally press triangle as fast as possible. The online play is decent but I haven''t gotten too far into it yet. So far I''d say the campaign is the bright point for this game.'),
(N'Anita', N'Young', N'anita.young7223@example.org', '2016-08-05', 5, N'great!'),
(N'Michael', N'Flores', N'michael.flores3457@example.net', '2016-08-05', 5, N'It gorgeous,small doenst make any noise its beautiful'),
(N'Jonathan', N'King', N'jonathan.king6213@example.net', '2016-08-05', 5, N'I purchased this controller about 3 years ago (I bought it new directly from Amazon, not a third party seller). We had two PS3''s at the time and so we needed additional controllers. I bought this one for me and the same in red for my man. I couldn''t be happier, after 3 years of use and abuse, it is still working fine. All of the buttons and the sticks work, the vibration works and it still holds a charge that lasts a whole day of playing. The one I have is a genuine PS3 controller by Sony, and I wouldn''t hesitate to get it again provided I knew I was getting an authentic one. I have heard that there are a lot of issues with knock offs, I can''t comment on those - but I can say that the actual pink PS3 controller works great.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Hernandez', N'pamela.hernandez2451@example.org', '2016-08-05', 5, N'worked as good as original'),
(N'Samuel', N'Sanders', N'samuel.sanders2791@example.com', '2016-08-05', 5, N'So far so good. The controls are a little odd, but it is a fun game that feels pretty good. I would recommend this to anyone who likes shooters'),
(N'Luis', N'Scott', N'luis.scott1511@example.com', '2016-08-06', 5, N'Love it and love the music, graphics. It''s definitely on my top list.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Cooper', N'elizabeth.cooper1846@example.org', '2016-08-06', 5, N'My PS4 controller now feels exactly like my elite controller minus rear triggers. The rubber on the thumbsticks seem similar but not identical. The elite is a softer grippier rubber. I tried my elite stick on these and they don''t fit quite the same. It''s not a huge deal though since these seem nice enough as is. Took 5 mins to install. 100% satisfied.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Bell', N'yuki.bell9871@example.net', '2016-08-06', 5, N'Man as a child i would run to the t.v before my sisters to grab the remote to watch this those time were special and now that it is ending feels like memories fading into the sunset'),
(N'Ryan', N'Suzuki', N'ryan.suzuki5105@example.com', '2016-08-06', 4, N'Very happy with this product'),
(N'Noah', N'Perry', N'noah.perry7921@example.net', '2016-08-06', 5, N'A great game, but it is for mature gamers, do not let young teens play this game.'),
(N'John', N'Brooks', N'john.brooks4846@example.org', '2016-08-07', 3, N'Works fairly well but not as well as the G5 it replaced. Logitech doesnt make those anymore so this seemed the closest. If you need the buttons to change the sensitivity on the mouse for games like i use it for its okay but not stellar. In its price range you may not do any better but it is a matter of like on these things. The buttons are not as responsive as the G5 and just don''t have the quality feel Logitech used to put out.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Khan', N'jennifer.khan8462@example.net', '2016-08-07', 5, N'This is a game where you play as Spyro the dragon and you do different kinds of quests as you progress through the game,I believe that this is the first Spyro game because it shows the story of Spyro as an egg then how he met sparks the dragonfly who travels with Spyro and helps you a little bit through the game. This game is challenging and incredibly fun. This is my favorite Spyro game.'),
(N'Omar', N'Chen', N'omar.chen4601@example.net', '2016-08-08', 5, N'My kids liked the game.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Perez', N'ravi.perez1299@example.net', '2016-08-08', 5, N'It''s such a great deal for the price, only downside which I don''t really mind is that mine were gray other than that it saved me about 25$ per controller which I appreciate!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Cook', N'aisha.cook4160@example.com', '2016-08-08', 5, N'Came in perfect condition, also at the best price.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Gomez', N'kevin.gomez7735@example.net', '2016-08-08', 5, N'Bought these for the raspberry pie system, worked perfectly !'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Ali', N'hiroshi.ali1878@example.net', '2016-08-08', 5, N'Two Final Fantasy games I had never played before, they are definitely worth playing. They are towards the lower end of my rankings for Final fantasy games go, but that is grading on a tough scale, so they are definitely worth playing.'),
(N'Eric', N'Mitchell', N'eric.mitchell9969@example.com', '2016-08-08', 4, N'I love these stands. We have all of our controllers standing up and on display.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Reed', N'sarah.reed2596@example.net', '2016-08-08', 5, N'great'),
(N'Carlos', N'Flores', N'carlos.flores5354@example.com', '2016-08-08', 5, N'love this all of duty'),
(N'Melissa', N'Jackson', N'melissa.jackson6953@example.com', '2016-08-08', 4, N'Works well enough. It is a little hard to make sure the units are actually sitting correctly in their charging docks.'),
(N'George', N'Barnes', N'george.barnes7873@example.org', '2016-08-08', 5, N'I don''t see why people are complaining about the game it sounds like they THINK they''re discouraging others into playing it them selves I enjoyed the game in general including if you have a full 1080p HDTV it will look even better. I know there was supposed to be more content out of the game but they did the best they can because there is a disc data limit. I have a feeling though instead of Solaris Sonic Team was gonna make Robotnik of course as the final boss but replaced it with a super dimensional being that can destroy time. The storyline is not that bad its self but if you want to spare the whole negative ranting try the game out your self instead of listening to idiotic kids bickering how it''s not titled Sonic Adventure 3 TBH I really don''t give a damn about a SA3 because in this modern day of gaming it will probably be ruined.'),
(N'Jason', N'Suzuki', N'jason.suzuki1608@example.org', '2016-08-08', 5, N'Uses tabs, it was a brilliant program, it breaks my heart it is gone forever, it had such potential. I used both Rocksmith editions and this was a better teacher.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Myers', N'ronald.myers2257@example.net', '2016-08-09', 1, N'Update: Software loaded with SPYWARE. Causes just as much wrist pain as it relieves, software is pretty buggy too. Sometimes gets in the way of other game controllers and has to be unplugged. Adjustability is a 3/5, it''s not that you get to adjust it, you kinda have to. The entire thumb control hub wobbles around like crazy everytime you push one of its buttons. The rubber grips are completely insufficient despite what some shill reviewers on youtube say,and this thing slides around on my desk like crazy. The lower wrist rest is a crazy dust magnet. I ripped it off, cut it up, and stuck it on the bottom so it actually stays still on my desk. Then I rolled up a sock and wrapped and tied it above the upper wrist wrest as kinda a platform so my wrist doesn''t hurt so much from using it. I''ll look for somethijng a lil less ghetto later on. I also have it sitting on a laptop stand which is oriented sideways, have thought of gluing it to a wooden triangle block or something. I just got...'),
(N'Hannah', N'Wood', N'hannah.wood6848@example.com', '2016-08-09', 5, N'Best one I have ever bought.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Cox', N'raymond.cox4486@example.com', '2016-08-09', 4, N'Very fun game.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Gonzalez', N'samantha.gonzalez6646@example.org', '2016-08-09', 5, N'Works great and brought back a lot of memories, works fine and shipped fast'),
(N'Ronald', N'Nguyen', N'ronald.nguyen6008@example.org', '2016-08-09', 4, N'I''ve played through the first two levels, and so far it''s a great game. No gripes.'),
(N'Jack', N'Miller', N'jack.miller9433@example.com', '2016-08-09', 1, N'The main left and right clicker buttons MALFUNCTION regularly. For some reason, when I single-click it registers a double-click instead, roughly 2/3 of the time. I have tried new mouse drivers, no change. I tried a new operating system (not just hoping to fix this problem, but because it was time for an upgrade) and it still does it. I have tried using it on another computer. STILL DOES IT. I brought it back for an exchange then, thinking maybe it was a hardware issue but nope the new mouse (same model) DOES THE SAME THING. I try to single click to select something; nope the mouse decides by itself that I actually wanted to double-click to activate the object instead. Maybe it is crappy Chinese parts. Maybe it is a problem with the design, how the clicker buttons have big grooves supposed to fit your fingers, maybe I''m hitting the left and right sides of that groove when I click so it literally is physically clicking twice. I don''t know. All I know is, it''s very annoying. So since...'),
(N'Christina', N'Nguyen', N'christina.nguyen8383@example.com', '2016-08-09', 1, N'Game was broken, wouldn''t load up at at.'),
(N'Laura', N'Khan', N'laura.khan5075@example.org', '2016-08-09', 4, N'As others have pointed out the game audio cuts out randomly. Besides this huge fault this is not really a big improvement over the 2011, 2013 or Pro models. Unless you need USB chat or more customization you''re probably better off staying with an earlier model. Update 9/12/2016 Ive noticed the TR cuts out most frequently in very noisy/busy audio environments in game. Its really sad Astro cant build a device that can handle all the console can throw at it. The TR will remain one star until I get an update or recall that fixes the audio drops. Update 4/25/2017 I haven''t had a cutout from the Pro TR in several months so I figured Id update. Since new, Ive only had one update to the firmware but the issue persisted even after. This leads me to believe the problem was with Sony which theyve fixed via one of their numerous updates and I just didn''t notice right away. So like I said, its preformed flawless since. I stand by my original comment that I don''t notice any measurable...'),
(N'Anthony', N'Martinez', N'anthony.martinez7594@example.net', '2016-08-10', 5, N'excellent product'),
(N'Donald', N'Williams', N'donald.williams8731@example.org', '2016-08-10', 5, N'Good purchase.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Laura', N'Rivera', N'laura.rivera6415@example.com', '2016-08-10', 1, N'Cons: - Poorly made - Lightweight, slippery plastic - No clips - Only gravity and your fingers keep the 3DS mounted. Pro: - Marginally more comfortable Follow up: MYLIFEUNIT harassed me for this review on my cell phone. Here is a bonus video showing how terrible their product is.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Russell', N'kelly.russell4699@example.org', '2016-08-10', 1, N'Spent so much money, and now when I try to play it just asks me to buy the expansion. Why did I spend 150 for an incomplete game? I really don''t understand it. I''m pretty frustrated with this game. I still have this huge crate sitting next to my television, all for a game I can''t play.... Will they ever make the expansion free? Am I supposed to sell this "ghost edition" and then buy the new version with the expansions? I don''t know. I feel very burned, and I can''t afford to keep dumping money into a game I already paid for. I recommend everyone AVOID games with "season pass", it''s ruining the game industry... Every game I buy... It just wants more and more money.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Campbell', N'ethan.campbell4681@example.net', '2016-08-10', 5, N'18 hours into the game, only in my third system from the start point. I keep telling myself to delve deeper into the core, but then another side mission pops up that I have to complete, or a ship enters the space station I''m on that looks like I should upgrade to. I''ve been chased by pirates, sentries, weird looking dinosaurs and rat-dogs. I''ve befriended other animals by feeding them iron or zinc. I''ve blown up more rocks than a crack addict. I''ve learned hundreds of words in an alien language but still cant translate a simple sentence. I have to consciously stop myself from playing. 5-6 hour sessions pass with ease. There is no "just one more thing". The game is surprisingly addictive for me. It''s honestly the first game I want to shut off everything else in my house to just sit and play. I''ve even busted out the headphones and turned down the lights. I''m totally engrossed by it. It''s got far more stickiness for me than Fallout or other open world games, but I realize my tastes...'),
(N'Lucia', N'Ramos', N'lucia.ramos3799@example.net', '2016-08-10', 5, N'A must have if you use any apps'),
(N'Jose', N'Thompson', N'jose.thompson1687@example.com', '2016-08-10', 3, N'I was expecting more from this game. I loved the Animal Crossing original game on Gamecube and was hoping for the same type of gameplay. This game feels more lacking, and I played for a week or so and still had no animals give me quests so I was basically just fishing and hunting for bugs while playing and eventually got bored. Like many Wii games, I feel like to make the most of this game, you need to actually have people to play with.'),
(N'Heather', N'Bailey', N'heather.bailey4638@example.net', '2016-08-10', 5, N'Excellent!!'),
(N'Eric', N'Castillo', N'eric.castillo9738@example.net', '2016-08-10', 4, N'great game tricky'),
(N'Edward', N'Jenkins', N'edward.jenkins3140@example.net', '2016-08-10', 5, N'Excellent product, as needed.'),
(N'Wei', N'Williams', N'wei.williams3620@example.com', '2016-08-10', 5, N'I''ve written just a few reviews although I purchase an extreme amount of games especially from Amazon. Anyone that is a gamer will know the West doesn''t see many releases of these types of games. Japan has an enormous amount of games that a lot may deem weird, but they are a lot of fun and can be a break from the Adrenalin rushed action of a lot of US games and GalGun Double Peace is an extremely fun and addicting game. A lot of the other reviewers have already explained a lot of what the game is about and you can check out videos online as well. I just want to add it has a lot of replay value.. with multiple endings to unlock and for people that like to complete everything, let''s just say to fully complete this game you''ll have to play it for a a good while. The game is rated Mature but doesn''t have anything too drastic except for a little bit of fan service here and there. My main reason for writing this review is I recommend everyone give these games a shot as it will unlock...'),
(N'Ivan', N'Collins', N'ivan.collins6813@example.com', '2016-08-10', 3, N'If you like to explore then this game will be 5 stars to you,for me I get sleepy'),
(N'Amanda', N'Coleman', N'amanda.coleman1760@example.com', '2016-08-11', 5, N'Been waiting for this since the early 2000''s, FINALLY they came back with a sequel. It really is that good. We haven''t seen any Resident Evil games since then.'),
(N'Alexander', N'White', N'alexander.white4954@example.com', '2016-08-11', 5, N'Still love it and have it lined up next to my Naga Epic - both wireless/wired compatible and one in case the battery goes on the other. I spoil myself.'),
(N'David', N'Rogers', N'david.rogers4742@example.org', '2016-08-11', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Wei', N'Ramos', N'wei.ramos2883@example.org', '2016-08-11', 5, N'Good exercise'),
(N'Scott', N'Clark', N'scott.clark9787@example.net', '2016-08-11', 5, N'ThankS!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Wood', N'yuki.wood6398@example.net', '2016-08-11', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Scott', N'Webb', N'scott.webb4609@example.com', '2016-08-11', 3, N'Its nice to hold and look at. The protective case makes my controller look like the white one which is why i give it 3 stars. I took 2 stars out cause the analog sticks are stiff with the looking around and the trigger buttons need to be pressed or hold a bit harder. You can''t play normally. This protective case so far? Not bad, lol.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Boyd', N'samantha.boyd2426@example.net', '2016-08-11', 5, N'With no exaggerations, this game has becone my number one game of all time.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Diaz', N'stephanie.diaz7640@example.org', '2016-08-11', 5, N'If you want to have fun in the most upsetting way possible get this game. If you''ve only played Call of duty and viva pinata please stick to what you''re good at.'),
(N'Helen', N'Martin', N'helen.martin4883@example.org', '2016-08-11', 5, N'I love this game, the graphics are awesome and the game play is really good. I love the feel of this assassins greed game.'),
(N'Megan', N'Adams', N'megan.adams6065@example.com', '2016-08-11', 5, N'wonderful game, i love it, because i am a fanatic all of the lord of the rings'),
(N'Priya', N'Davis', N'priya.davis6077@example.org', '2016-08-11', 5, N'Lots of fun. My boys love it.'),
(N'Walter', N'Davis', N'walter.davis4976@example.com', '2016-08-12', 5, N'Logitech mice are usually very decent. There have only been a couple times where the logitech mouse I got was a dud. This is not the case with this mouse so far. I recommended it as it''s cheap and it works great.'),
(N'Donald', N'Russell', N'donald.russell3456@example.com', '2016-08-12', 5, N'As always, Bethesda created a solid Blockbuster, I can''t get enough Wolfstein, so I''ll be waiting for another installment or spin off about the nazi killer Blaskovitch.-'),
(N'Daniel', N'Flores', N'daniel.flores6186@example.net', '2016-08-12', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Douglas', N'Raghunathan', N'douglas.raghunathan1534@example.org', '2016-08-12', 4, N'Like it'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Jimenez', N'hiroshi.jimenez1446@example.net', '2016-08-12', 5, N'It adds more grip to the controller I recommend'),
(N'Sandra', N'Singh', N'sandra.singh9035@example.net', '2016-08-12', 5, N'Cool'),
(N'Marcus', N'Hall', N'marcus.hall2866@example.com', '2016-08-13', 5, N'Its good for wirless mouse but i perfer razer deathadder over this. Still its wireless.'),
(N'James', N'Nowak', N'james.nowak9517@example.org', '2016-08-13', 5, N'No problems during installation or gameplay!'),
(N'Gary', N'Coleman', N'gary.coleman1388@example.org', '2016-08-13', 5, N'Works great so far.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Morris', N'brandon.morris5339@example.org', '2016-08-13', 3, N'Just what you''d expect from a cheap Japanese game: poor environment quality, poor menu systems, bad/silly level design, low-quality enemies/bosses. Though it''s got great combat, tits, and ass. The Japanese voice acting is a plus since English voice acting for games of this quality is normally horrid. Costume variety is lacking. There''s not many costumes to unlock in-game and I''m definitely not going to spend another ~$30 on DLC to get more. I spent about 12 hours on this to get everything I wanted (including unlocking all in-game costumes). I''ve got no desire to play more. I don''t regret the $20 I spent on it.'),
(N'Amara', N'Boyd', N'amara.boyd4730@example.net', '2016-08-13', 5, N'Best mouse I''ve had for a simple shape mouse. Has perfect weight, feels right. And since my new keyboard does not have a dedicated calculator key, I programmed one of the side buttons to open calculator! :-)'),
(N'Raymond', N'Khan', N'raymond.khan2595@example.com', '2016-08-13', 3, N'It looked shiny, and vivid in the pictures. but it isn''t shiny, and is kinda dull, and blurry..'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Suzuki', N'jeffrey.suzuki2064@example.net', '2016-08-13', 5, N'Feels great in my hand, with easily accessible thumb buttons. It lights up red, and has a braided USB cable. Three position DPI settings with different lights so you know which one you are using. It has all these features and cost me about $13. Tremendous value.'),
(N'Linda', N'Thompson', N'linda.thompson8289@example.org', '2016-08-13', 4, N'Works pretty well. I got used to having the side buttons and now almost cant function without them. The buttons all click nicely and work well. The mouse wheel also works well and has a nice feel to it. The DPI selection makes a big difference depending on what you are using the mouse for. I generally use it in 1200 mode but its useful in a few games to set it to 2000. The only real downside I can find is that it is very slippery. I actually had trouble holding it for a few days, but I finally got used to it. I have the Bronze model, so I cant speak for the other models about the finish. It looks great though. I have used several different mice in the past at this price point and higher, and this one does the job very well. The light stays on when my PC is off, but my PC is set up to charge USB devices when off, so that explains the light always being on. Its no problem to unplug it, or just ignore the blue light. Its not very bright.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Baker', N'stephanie.baker6691@example.net', '2016-08-13', 4, N'Some Reviewers have been posting reviews based on what they read or have watched on YouTube these are falsely making the community negative. I have played this game for over 40 hours now and have things to say that are not based on what I read or watched based on other sites. Pros Colors and Imagery are breathtaking. You sit there and say o I want a photo of that. Space flight is smooth Ability to name Planets, Star systems, plants, animals. I named an animal Rick James to test. Great game for kids and family''s Lots of reading and some puzzles too. The enjoyment of not knowing what your going to see next. I''ve seen planets with nothing on them and I have also seen planets with bad storms like Acid rain, radiation, fire, water, wind, and very hostile planets where everything wants to kill you. Sandbox fun do everything at your own pace. Cons Not Multi-player Space fighting is clunky Had a couple critical errors No guide Inventory menu needs improvement No maps Needs a selectable way...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Ortiz', N'brenda.ortiz2123@example.net', '2016-08-13', 2, N'The title says it all. Meh. Graphics are OK, but repetitive (at least what I''ve seen). Planets may have different colors, etc. But, caves, structures and creatures etc. are generally all way too similar. Game play is repetitive. Go to planet, mine some stuff, learn a few words, get frustrated that the atmosphere is too cold/toxic/hot, so leave and find the next planet. By the way, not sure what kind of planet could support life with the abundance of space junk floating just outside the atmosphere. I''d expect extinction level events on a daily basis. Space combat sucks (at least early on). Get jumped for no reason and totally randomly, and die. Period. No chance at all. Ground combat isn''t much better. Sentinel comes by and attacks you because you were mining iron?? WTF? What''s the point?? There is minimal incentive to do anything but log out and play another game. If had it to do over, I wouldn''t have bought this. Maybe at a $10 price point... I''m sure the defenders will disagree,...'),
(N'Betty', N'Ortiz', N'betty.ortiz3955@example.org', '2016-08-13', 5, N'Classics!'),
(N'Anita', N'Baker', N'anita.baker8091@example.org', '2016-08-13', 3, N'Spent a lot of time crawling around in a cardboard box. Pretty fun game but it didn''t hold my attention very long.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Robinson', N'patricia.robinson7104@example.org', '2016-08-14', 3, N'Con: the combined num keys area is quite difficult to get used to (consider going tenkey-less or full size); function lock key can get annoying; poor Mac OS X support (some of the function keys weren''t working for me) Pro: good, easy, hardware-based adjustment of the light levels and modes; braided cable Neutral: be *sure* that you want RED switches -- I found I far prefer Cherry MX Blue switches; red felt too mushy and prone to errors'),
(N'Marcus', N'Nelson', N'marcus.nelson2442@example.com', '2016-08-14', 5, N'It''s a rubber cover and does great showing off your 3ds while protecting it from scratches and dings. I have the NEW Monster Hunter 3ds so I use this to keep it mint while looking good'),
(N'Amanda', N'Green', N'amanda.green3509@example.net', '2016-08-14', 2, N'All I can really say good about this game is that it is visually stunning . Other than the graphics this game is very lame and boring .'),
(N'Kofi', N'Wright', N'kofi.wright7449@example.net', '2016-08-14', 5, N'i remember playing this game on the original Wii system and thought it was amazing. however i wasn''t a big fan of the controls and only completed the game once. now it''s playable on a controller and it is a great improvement. the game is now in HD and controls are smooth and much more accurate. i enjoy playing every minute of this game.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Bell', N'lisa.bell1747@example.org', '2016-08-14', 4, N'Awesome headset. Of course it will be awesome Razer makes outstanding hardware. My only gripe no mute for the microphone. If this was built in somewhere it would be the perfect headset. The sound is awesome and clear. They are comfortable to wear.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Jackson', N'andrea.jackson5831@example.net', '2016-08-14', 5, N'I spilled some water on a previous model of this keyboard and it was permanently broke. Other than that, it is a great keyboard and feels solid and will improve your typing speed. Keep liquids away from it though...seriously - drinks go in a different room than the keyboard room.'),
(N'Jason', N'King', N'jason.king7941@example.com', '2016-08-14', 5, N'Amazing'),
(N'Aaron', N'Morales', N'aaron.morales9432@example.net', '2016-08-15', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Samuel', N'Jones', N'samuel.jones7384@example.net', '2016-08-15', 5, N'Works excellent need these to charge your games. :P'),
(N'Debra', N'Russell', N'debra.russell9209@example.org', '2016-08-15', 4, N'I didn''t like the game, but my husband has really loved it. He has been playing it for a few weeks. It is similar to Minecraft in that you have to collect supplies to build what you may want. For instance, you need wood and stone to create an ax in order to chop wood faster for a home or other defenses. Animals can be killed in order to make better clothing. There are random supply drops to help players stock up in addition to being able to find abandoned items, like cooking pots or grills. Every seven days, large groups of zombies appear to kill the player. The goal is to survive. My husband has survived several weeks within the game at this point.'),
(N'Henry', N'Morgan', N'henry.morgan4200@example.net', '2016-08-15', 5, N'A very good pack. Great job EA and Amazon for such simple and quick paint option.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Gonzalez', N'gregory.gonzalez5135@example.net', '2016-08-15', 2, N'A little contextual background on this before we dive into the meat of things: Does anyone out there remember Super Mario Bros. 2 on the NES? You probably do. Back in 1988, a lot of us young NES enthusiasts simply considered it another "black sheep" sequel, like The Adventures of Link, or Simon''s Quest, and just ran with it. In actuality (for anyone still not in the know) the North American version of "Super Mario Bros. 2" was the result of a switcheroo perpetrated by Nintendo of America. Originally, the Mario 2 that most of us know was a Japanese Famicom game called Doki Doki Panic. Nintendo made a few tweaks, altered the sprites to look like the Mario cast, and then dropped it into stores across the country as the hotly-anticipated sequel to Super Mario Bros. What does this have to do with Final Fantasy II? Well, Square pulled similar tricks on its North American audiences with their early Final Fantasy releases, only with more frequency than Nintendo. If you mention Final...'),
(N'Melissa', N'Jackson', N'melissa.jackson3443@example.net', '2016-08-15', 4, N'A bit shorter than Ultimate Alliance 1 and the Xmen Legends 1 & 2, but overall still a very fun play though.'),
(N'Zachary', N'King', N'zachary.king2328@example.com', '2016-08-15', 5, N'Nephew loves this game, along with anything Mario Brothers.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Rodriguez', N'brandon.rodriguez6044@example.net', '2016-08-15', 2, N'I really wanted to like this game and give it a fair chance. I''m a huge fan of the Langrisser series and had played the Japanese versions long ago. I was shocked to hear of a new game being made after all these years, but when the Japan reviews were coming in negative I got worried. And unfortunately, it lived up to the negativity I was hearing. The music is very nostalgic, as it pretty much uses old Langrisser tracks. But the gameplay is clunky, the graphics not great even for a 3ds game, the battle animations were terrible, and it just wasn''t fun. I really tried to give it a chance, I played it a few hours and did the first several scenarios but in the end I just wasn''t enjoying it enough to continue and finish. Shame, sadly. If you''re an old fan of the Langrisser series, you can give it a try if you like since it''s only like $15 now. But you''ll probably be disappointed.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Long', N'lucia.long1408@example.com', '2016-08-15', 5, N'Exactly as expected.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Clark', N'elizabeth.clark1709@example.org', '2016-08-15', 5, N'A'),
(N'Jerry', N'Wilson', N'jerry.wilson3159@example.org', '2016-08-15', 5, N'This is a great mouse works very well BUT it has a very cheap and plastic feel'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Adams', N'hiroshi.adams7855@example.org', '2016-08-15', 5, N'My Razer Vespula was wearing out, and I had just got the Blackwidow Chroma, so I decided to splurge a bit and get this Chroma mousepad. The surface is a nice texture, like a combination of the smooth and rough surface of the Vespula. It is awesome that the lights can sync up with my keyboard, and I can use hotkeys to change the configuration of both. It was definitely a vanity purchase, as I''m sure you can get a mousepad that performs just as well for half the price, but the lights are super cool and make my setup look amazing.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Butler', N'joseph.butler5724@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'This game is just as much fun as the first one, if not more. There is more single player style games that can be enjoyed and even smoother graphics to make the whole experience better. There have been characters added to the game to increase the level of chaos on any given map and a great feature is that you can migrate your stickers and money from the first game to this one which saves you from having to collect every single piece over again. All in all a great time and totally suitable for younger kids as low as age 4, beyond that they cant really handle the controllers very well and as we all know kids below the age of three are generally covered with a sticky film all over their hands which never really goes away and seemingly transfers from surface to surface with ease. For this fact alone i would recommend not letting very small children play this game. You don''t want to have to give your control an overhaul after a toddler jams the buttons and analogs full of toddler gunk.'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez2456@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'good game it is relaxing'),
(N'Christopher', N'Bell', N'christopher.bell2632@example.net', '2016-08-16', 2, N'Hurts my ears after wearing for too long.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Richardson', N'ivan.richardson5189@example.org', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Plays great, a fun Kirby game.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Gray', N'douglas.gray8072@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Cities: Skylines (I have the Steam version) is what SimCity should have been, but EA failed. So an Indie Team called "Colossal Order" took the City Builder genre in their hands and made it happen. Cities: Skylines has everything from sandboxes, custom made buildings/cars, and more. Best of all it''s moddable for those who like that kind of thing, you can have mods replace a certain vehicle, building or even plant. The mods go in-depth and make Cities: Skylines expand into a game that you can put countless hours into. As a plus side, you can sync your game saves to "Steam Cloud" (if you are using Steam) so you can have them on the go if you have different computers. From one minute you could be the cleanest city in the game, but in minutes you can have the dirtiest city in the world, have poop take over, flood everything and get people sick. This is one of the best City Building games ever made, and you can spend countless hours building your own city, your own way. It''s like playing...'),
(N'Joan', N'Lee', N'joan.lee5140@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Worked just like it says it would. No problems whatsoever, people if you want this to work properly please read the instructions literally that is all it takes... don''t manhandle the item and you should be good to go. Also for all the paranoid potential buyers it is quite safe it even has notes in the software for you not to mess up your save files, can''t be any easier than that'),
(N'Julie', N'Thomas', N'julie.thomas9959@example.org', '2016-08-16', 1, N'Same as a few people here, I bought Destiny in December 2014 fell in love with the game, I just loved it because it was so different to everything else I had played and bought the season pass in March 2015. I kept playing the game and there were rumors about TTK, until released in September 2015, blocking all the game, blocking all the fun you had and forcing you to rebuy the whole Destiny with the 2 DLCs you had already bought. It is a great deal for new comers, but day one players just ended up quitting. There should have been a huge discount for this DLC alone for people that already had it, and leave the 40 - 50 bucks for new comers to get Destiny with 3 DLCs. I ended up quitting, I don''t mind the 40 bucks I had to pay back that, I mind the fact and the way they did everything to corner you completely leaving you no choice but to buy the game again. If you like grinding, play solo, and can manage frustration when playing with groups because it seems not everyone has a headset...'),
(N'Henry', N'Thomas', N'henry.thomas6714@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Love love love this product! There are times my hands will sweat and this grip helps a lot to keep my hands stationary to allow an uninterrupted game play trying to wipe your hands off. I love the thumb tabs to provide the extra grip, I like to use the smaller ones but I''ve bought 2 of these so far because I love them so much!'),
(N'Jack', N'Smith', N'jack.smith1839@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Piktek has always been one of my favorite companies to get low priced computer mice from, and they''ve done it again with this great gaming mouse. The design of this product is very high quality for the price range. It''s made out of a light plastic but feels robust in the hand. The design is sharp making it one of the nicest looking mice in this price range. The different colored LED''s make parts of the mouse glow many different colors, as controlled by the software or buttons on the top of the mouse. It fits very comfortably in my hand, and my hands are slightly large. The mouse cord is a standard rubber that seems like it should last if handled with care. The clickyness of the mouse is not too loud and is not too soft. The scroll wheel moves fluidly, and all the extra buttons seem to be in a good place. Although the mouse is unfortunately light, for this price range you can''t expect anything else. With that said, some people actually prefer light mice for their quicker reaction...'),
(N'Sofia', N'Ramos', N'sofia.ramos4206@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'A bit pricey but for some it should be OK..'),
(N'Nicole', N'Wisniewski', N'nicole.wisniewski7963@example.org', '2016-08-16', 5, N'I upgraded from the 3.5G DeathAdder from 3 years back without hesitation I knew I wanted another DeathAdder. It''s by far the best gaming mouse for the price, looks and comfort. The fact it can now look very colorful to match my Chroma keyboard it makes it that much better. I love the colors but all in all the mouse. It''s a Death Adder. Get it!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Anderson', N'brandon.anderson9174@example.net', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Patricia', N'Mendoza', N'patricia.mendoza2973@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Shipped fast ,works great and easy to use ...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Murphy', N'cheryl.murphy1613@example.net', '2016-08-16', 5, N'its very well done'),
(N'Katherine', N'Ivanov', N'katherine.ivanov9483@example.net', '2016-08-16', 4, N'They go on easily and have no broken or come off after a couple months. Did they really make my accuracy better? idk maybe? in theory they should help with slight aiming adjustments but who knows'),
(N'Victoria', N'Suzuki', N'victoria.suzuki4189@example.org', '2016-08-16', 3, N'forgot how choppy this game is, the FPS it self is 15-30. Gameplay seems dull you finish a stage then move on to next area do a few things to another stage then move on -_- i mean for $10 and a few hours but come on games need to be 10+ hours to be fun and this games graphics could of been way better it was like it was just shoved out the door'),
(N'Peter', N'Hernandez', N'peter.hernandez2636@example.org', '2016-08-16', 5, N'Great game. A most have if you like FPS. Best deal for the price.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Allen', N'victoria.allen8707@example.com', '2016-08-16', 5, N'I love these things. For $10 I now have both of my remotes displayed nicely on my coffee table for easy access to gaming. I keep 2 spare batteries in the compartment, so if the ones I have run out, I can quickly replace them. For $5 a piece, you really can''t go wrong. If you have nice remotes, but don''t want to spend the cash on expensive stands, this one is nice looking for a great price. *All my reviews are done after at LEAST a month of using the product. To assure a fair and honest opinion, and to test it''s durability.*'),
(N'Jack', N'Henderson', N'jack.henderson4225@example.org', '2016-08-17', 5, N'Arrived quickly and safely. Great game!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Coleman', N'andrew.coleman4143@example.com', '2016-08-17', 4, N'This game is great for any fans of the movie. You will find yourself singing along as you fight. The story seems probable. The map was really confusing and sometimes the objectives were a bit unclear. The art style was really good, and it was fun to see all of the familiar faces from the movie. There is one level, in the forest, that is utter hell. You basically walk around for a really long time, getting lost and wanting it to be over.'),
(N'Linda', N'Roberts', N'linda.roberts1319@example.net', '2016-08-17', 5, N'Amazing game! Recommend if you enjoyed the 1st Super Mario Galaxy!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Thompson', N'kofi.thompson3935@example.com', '2016-08-17', 5, N'kids love it'),
(N'Victoria', N'Jones', N'victoria.jones1422@example.com', '2016-08-17', 1, N'works'),
(N'Emma', N'Williams', N'emma.williams8028@example.net', '2016-08-17', 5, N'the perfect game and good price!'),
(N'Lucia', N'Adams', N'lucia.adams8279@example.org', '2016-08-17', 5, N'New. Product as described.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Johnson', N'deborah.johnson4260@example.org', '2016-08-17', 5, N'These look and feel awesome!'),
(N'Aisha', N'Nelson', N'aisha.nelson1721@example.com', '2016-08-17', 5, N'love the game'),
(N'Alexander', N'Kowalski', N'alexander.kowalski4939@example.org', '2016-08-17', 5, N'A fun hidden object game, one for the whole family with no objectionable objects to find. No dialogue and nothing violent about it. I''ve played it through several times now. Even goofed and bought it 2 more times as I forgot I had it.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Wisniewski', N'joshua.wisniewski6354@example.net', '2016-08-17', 1, N'To be fair, the sound quality, comfort, and mic quality on these aren''t too bad for what they cost. That''s all kind of meaningless when key components like the cable and 3.5mm jack are cheaply made and prone to failure. I used these headphones 3 times, and the 3.5mm jack would frequently shift from it''s sweet spot where I got audio in both channels. The last time I used it the cable became it''s own annoyance as all audio would simply cut out if if the section that leads into the headset was jostled too far, which basically happened everytime I''d move my head. I really wish they''d have dumped money into the core pieces of the headset that allow it to function rather than trying to be flashy with a weird cobra design and shiny plastic accents.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Wisniewski', N'victoria.wisniewski4887@example.com', '2016-08-17', 5, N'Love this amiibo, building a collection'),
(N'Betty', N'Ali', N'betty.ali7509@example.org', '2016-08-17', 5, N'Kid loves it'),
(N'Raymond', N'Mitchell', N'raymond.mitchell1149@example.net', '2016-08-17', 4, N'I really enjoyed this story of Walking Dead. I just wish it was longer. The action was good and the graphics have stepped up in detail and quality than the old ones. I love Telltale games. I am looking forward to the Batman series from Telltale.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Lopez', N'hannah.lopez9507@example.org', '2016-08-17', 5, N'I see people crying about these all the time, but they''re great! Have two and they work fine,but even if they did break, I wouldn''t complain about it seeing as how they are clearly knockoffs... Well built ones. Don''t be one of those millennials who has to have everything perfect... Button mash with your loved ones till these things explode in your hands!'),
(N'Eric', N'Henderson', N'eric.henderson9102@example.com', '2016-08-17', 5, N'Highly recommend this keyboard, lights up red and clicks when you type, was easy to install and I''m very pleased with my purchase. Has an arm rest that snaps on easily, read the reviews and bought after much research and am very happy that I bought it.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ivanov', N'jacob.ivanov8373@example.com', '2016-08-18', 5, N'It works perfect'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Reyes', N'evelyn.reyes8420@example.org', '2016-08-18', 5, N'Perfect sensibility and fantastic grip!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Khan', N'olivia.khan7431@example.org', '2016-08-18', 5, N'One of my all time favorite games. Let''s you run around dual wielding lightsabers merking fools'),
(N'Maria', N'Kelly', N'maria.kelly3908@example.com', '2016-08-18', 5, N'Love it! Lots of Fan service and super fun if you have a friend or 2 to play with online to level up your girls before you do versus matches online.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Campbell', N'ryan.campbell1160@example.org', '2016-08-18', 5, N'Thanks for the amazing game I''m a huge fan of Zelda I''m shure many people are to but this game brings back memories of my child hood so thanks .also thanks for selling this I give this seller 10/10 super awesome seller'),
(N'Hannah', N'Morgan', N'hannah.morgan6912@example.net', '2016-08-18', 5, N'as expected'),
(N'Amanda', N'Perez', N'amanda.perez9415@example.net', '2016-08-18', 5, N'If you love God of War,then this the game for you.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Carter', N'samuel.carter1283@example.com', '2016-08-18', 5, N'Reaper of Souls is the expansion to Diablo 3. The new area is cool, the story is pretty good too. Though all you seem to do is fight hundreds of annoying little critter things, which is kind of disappointing. But all the new additions this game brings, like the new level cap of 70 and the Crusader character to name a few, it adds even more to the end game content, allowing you to spend two lifetimes playing it if you choose to do so. But do not buy this game unless you own Diablo 3! You need it to play this. If you don''t own Diablo 3, then go and buy it quickly, you don''t know what you are missing!'),
(N'Justin', N'Morris', N'justin.morris6712@example.net', '2016-08-19', 3, N'I did not play the first Wasteland so I didn''t buy it out of nostalgia as I''m sure many people did. I enjoy strategy and tactics games. To the point, Wasteland 2 is a pretty decent tactics game. It''s got the RPG HP/XP elements, more than a few possible specialization options, and okay graphics. The music is nice but becomes repetitive about halfway through. The voice acting is hit or miss - there are several spoken phrases which made me wonder if they had any audio direction at all. There are many oddities in the game that indicate that it was a fairly rushed product. As in many games where possible attacks are shown with percentage to hit, it does seem like the player gets some crap luck throughout. This is fine, as it is a wasteland and everything is falling apart anyway. Sort of adds to the feel of it. I am about halfway through and have no emotional attachment to any character beyond my natural OCD to never let a comrade fall (which means save often). The storyline is amateur...'),
(N'Patricia', N'Murphy', N'patricia.murphy2702@example.org', '2016-08-19', 5, N'As Expected'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Gomez', N'kimberly.gomez2268@example.net', '2016-08-19', 5, N'I was excited to see Celeste made into an Amiibo. Of course I had to have her to keep Blathers company! She is perfectly detailed like all the Nintendo Animal Crossing Amiibo''s I own. No issues getting her to work on the Animal Crossing board game for the Wii U. She''s one super cute pink owl and I''m mighty happy to add her to my collection!'),
(N'Carol', N'Nguyen', N'carol.nguyen7023@example.org', '2016-08-19', 4, N'It''s sonic.'),
(N'Maria', N'Ivanov', N'maria.ivanov8291@example.com', '2016-08-19', 3, N'I don''t get the hype with Razer gear for the most part. This is a remarkably modest mouse that I didn''t really like any better than your standard cheap-o mouse.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Mendoza', N'nathan.mendoza1040@example.org', '2016-08-19', 5, N'You can''t go wrong with any of the Castlevania games!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Okonkwo', N'marcus.okonkwo1733@example.net', '2016-08-19', 1, N'I always hate the idea of writing a negative based on one product experience. You are going to get a lemon once in awhile and that hurts any product when a review is written. Do not take my one bad experience out of hand and I fully acknowledge that my one bad could very easily have been from having that 1% of possible defects. My problem was I got it and touched the power button on the headset after plugging everything into my 360. Luckily I had an Aux cable as the newest 360s do not have Optical ports which this headset comes with. I figured the Headset would not have a charge and so I was not surprised when the headset did not light up. So I charged it and I assume it was working because the light was a bright red. Let sit on the charger for an hour and tried again. Nothing. Hooked it back to the charger and let it charge completely. Tried again and nothing. Following the instructions it should have tried to pair after holding the Power button for 6 seconds, but it was like the...'),
(N'Mary', N'Sanchez', N'mary.sanchez7024@example.com', '2016-08-19', 5, N'I see a lot of people confusing themselves with these so I''ll explain everything properly. This will give you a Zulian Tiger right away in your mail....................... I KEED I KEED!!! I do have one though :) This is a 60-DAY Game Time Card for your WoW account. You DO NOT save any money by buying these as some are saying. The ONLY WAY to save on your subscription is to buy 6 months at a time through account management. I personally like to do 1 month at a time and as soon as my subscription is paid for a month I go right in and cancel recurring so at the end of the 30 days I have to physically go in and do it again. I do it this way because I like to be able to make sure I''ll have available time to play the game and I can''t know that a month in advance so I like to go in and physically pay every month. Every so often like now with the release of Legion I KNOW I''ll be playing so I buy a game card. In this RARE OCCASION I bought 4 but Amazon messed up and sent me 5 so I have 10...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Lee', N'benjamin.lee6576@example.com', '2016-08-19', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Angela', N'Webb', N'angela.webb2753@example.net', '2016-08-19', 5, N'GREAT GAME!'),
(N'Henry', N'Ruiz', N'henry.ruiz4823@example.net', '2016-08-19', 5, N'One of the best game series out there.'),
(N'Linda', N'Ivanov', N'linda.ivanov1643@example.org', '2016-08-19', 5, N'All good'),
(N'Jerry', N'Edwards', N'jerry.edwards1164@example.org', '2016-08-20', 3, N'Although the story is intriguing and often scary, the gameplay is kind of a letdown. Every button you push basically changes the outcome of the story, but there are no tutorials or checkpoints, so all you can do is press the wrong buttons and hope your next attempt yields better results.'),
(N'Susan', N'Richardson', N'susan.richardson4607@example.org', '2016-08-20', 5, N'Excellent graphics and story. The multiplayer is good too.'),
(N'Brian', N'Kowalski', N'brian.kowalski3824@example.net', '2016-08-20', 4, N'Honestly, I love this game. I had the original for the PS3 and when I heard of the remastered version (something long overdue), I had to buy it. It''s one of the best games that they put out and really sparks the love of the Back to the Future series all over again. As much as I''d love to 5 star it, I can''t. There''s a few bugs that can be quite annoying and do take away from the quality of the game.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Tanaka', N'hannah.tanaka8410@example.org', '2016-08-20', 5, N'This mouse is great. The feel, the speed, and the price are all superb. Look no further for casual gaming than this mouse.'),
(N'Priya', N'Ramos', N'priya.ramos6644@example.net', '2016-08-20', 3, N'good tool'),
(N'Nicole', N'Cox', N'nicole.cox4184@example.org', '2016-08-20', 5, N'Fantastic game. Great collector''s edition extras.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Sanders', N'kimberly.sanders5897@example.com', '2016-08-21', 5, N'good'),
(N'Carol', N'Tanaka', N'carol.tanaka2944@example.org', '2016-08-21', 5, N'Excellent game would highly recomend it'),
(N'Robert', N'Collins', N'robert.collins1051@example.org', '2016-08-21', 4, N'Awesome, awesome. With these games I wish there was a Tutorial of the moves.'),
(N'Laura', N'Stewart', N'laura.stewart8218@example.com', '2016-08-21', 5, N'Classic.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Phillips', N'jacqueline.phillips2098@example.org', '2016-08-21', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Megan', N'Campbell', N'megan.campbell5262@example.com', '2016-08-21', 5, N'MUST have for collectors and fans of the Metal Gear universe. Has a ton of games for the price of a full game these days. I recommend playing these and getting caught up to the series.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Johnson', N'sofia.johnson5643@example.org', '2016-08-22', 1, N'I received 1 New 3DS XL stylus and 2 of the originally 3DS XL stylus, which are too long for the New 3DS. The tip of the only New 3DS stylus has a molding line running down the end of it which seems like it might scratch my screen. But it was $3 so I can''t justify the effort for a refund.'),
(N'Peter', N'Murphy', N'peter.murphy5915@example.org', '2016-08-22', 5, N'One of the best games, and part of the best Fps series ever made!!!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Lee', N'brenda.lee3745@example.net', '2016-08-22', 5, N'Finally got one of these because I was getting tired of having to sit so close to the TV while my controller was charging. This cable works well and is perfect to be able to sit on the couch or bed and still be able to play while your controller is charging.'),
(N'Helen', N'Okonkwo', N'helen.okonkwo1821@example.net', '2016-08-22', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Anna', N'Ali', N'anna.ali4121@example.net', '2016-08-22', 5, N'Amazing and work great'),
(N'Raymond', N'Harris', N'raymond.harris8861@example.org', '2016-08-22', 5, N'Son loves it'),
(N'Brian', N'Cox', N'brian.cox8601@example.net', '2016-08-23', 4, N'Please be aware that there is a ~4GB update (version 1.02) to download. This review is based off that version. Quick Review: It''s all about choice in Deus Ex Mankind Divided, and while it feels much like it''s predecessor Human Revolution, the variety of ways to finish missions and achieve your goals is as vast as it is satisfying. The graphics are better and the audio is well done (though the music is too loud to hear the voice-overs clearly without adjustment). There is no multiplayer. I encourage everyone to NOT SPEND MONEY ON MICROTRANSACTIONS that SquareEnix has added. I''m not knocking any stars off because it doesn''t interfere with the game at all, but is still a dishonest and greedy cash grab from corporate. Full Review: After roughly 20 hours of playing, I feel like I can confidently say I think Deus Ex Mankind Divided is a great game. Not perfect, but I already feel like I have received my money''s worth. Mankind Divided feels like a continuation of the previous Deus Ex,...'),
(N'Michael', N'White', N'michael.white3767@example.com', '2016-08-23', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Cheryl', N'White', N'cheryl.white7946@example.net', '2016-08-23', 5, N'Fun times'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Brown', N'cheryl.brown6314@example.net', '2016-08-23', 5, N'Timeless and classic plat former that was beautifully remade and it almost better in every aspect compare to the original game. A must buy for PS4 owners.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Roberts', N'stephanie.roberts9213@example.org', '2016-08-23', 3, N'Kinda bumbed. I liked the mouse while it worked but about three weeks in it started to track diagonally. It was impossible to continue using it. I i tossed it after trying a few things. I also was disappointed in the fact that it did not work well on my white desk. I have used plenty of other gaming mice on my desk as I have had this desk for years and this is the only mouse that didn''t respond on my desk surface. once I got a mouse pad that issue was resolved. I don''t think I will hold this against roccat though. the brand is highly recommended by people that I know have good taste in gaming peripherals. The software was a bit intimidating but thankfully you barely need the software if you''re happy with the mouse''s performance out of the box. only reason I''m giving this unit 3 stars is because it went south so quickly. I''ve had a sentey revolution pro since early 2015 and the thing is a beast.. may be it killed the roccat while I wasn''t looking. I think it may ultimately come down...'),
(N'Yuki', N'Boyd', N'yuki.boyd5821@example.org', '2016-08-23', 5, N'It''s that time of year again, the air is crisp, the days are getting shorter, pre-season football is on and oh yes the newest Madden is out. Last year''s Madden was as close to perfect as you''re going to get, however EA got a few inches closer to perfection. I didn''t dive too far in to see all the changes to franchise mode yet as they hyped it heavily this year because UPS delivered it late and I had to go to work. But from what I did get to play wow. The defense is tight, the running game is improved with the precision running and they even added new elements to the special teams game. There are two new commentators that just from the few games that I have played are already tons better than the last few teams they have had in there, and if EA sticks to their guns they are going to have these guys in the studio on a weekly basis adding more to the game. I have been playing the Madden series since it''s debut on the Sega Genisis back in 1989 and this is by far the best version they...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Barnes', N'cynthia.barnes6553@example.org', '2016-08-23', 5, N'Crash ''n Burn is a game I would recommend to anyone. From the high energy graphics, to the amazing, varied gameplay, there is something for everyone to love here. This game, while having a not very good career mode, offers tons of variety and customization in the single event modes. The graphics in this game are good by PS2 standards, and I have yet to experience any slowdown. In this game, your car, as well as the AI cars, can be destroyed. Debree gets left on the track, and if you don''t watch out, you could crash into it. In the single event modes, there are many other modes than just the common "race", such as a destruction derby or a bomb tag, or a head-on race. All of these things combine to help make Crash ''n Burn a must have game for any collection.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Cox', N'kimberly.cox9267@example.net', '2016-08-23', 5, N'The best worst game ever'),
(N'Aaron', N'Cook', N'aaron.cook7436@example.net', '2016-08-23', 5, N'The team behind Madden 17 has taken the initiative necessary to make this a top flight game once again. The mechanics in this years Madden measure closer to real football than ever before. They have toned down the aggressive catch mechanic considerably and attributes actually matter this year. Nothing like having a 75 OVR WR complete an aggressive catch against Revis, 4 times a game. You will not see that this year. I also noticed that player movement during the game is much more realistic. Tackles look better than ever, especially gang tackles. The running game has received much needed love and makes running the ball "fun" again. MUT still feels like a money grab, but it is only that way if you allow it to be. The new Salary Capped MUT H2H is also a sweet function. I hated being matched up with ridiculously stacked teams last year. This is one way to avoid that. You are going to love the new announcing crew. I found myself mocking Simms last year, as childish as that is. I...'),
(N'Victoria', N'Jimenez', N'victoria.jimenez9422@example.net', '2016-08-23', 1, N'Wonder why no one is returning NMS?? sound pretty bad everyone here and youtube saying how horrible it is.'),
(N'Linda', N'Morales', N'linda.morales4348@example.org', '2016-08-23', 5, N'Haven''t played madden in years. Huge improvements in franchise mode and game play itself. Don''t like the music though it sucks. Anyways I like how they update the commentary as well so the same things aren''t repeated during game play. I like this madden a lot it tries to stay fresh and never go dry on the simple things that make a good sports game'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Wilson', N'jacqueline.wilson7993@example.org', '2016-08-23', 5, N'The size and weight of this mouse are AMAZING. I have maybe medium/medium-large size hands and hold a mouse with the fingertip grip and this mouse works perfectly for me. I''m coming to this mouse from a Razer Orochi Elite Notebook Gaming Mouse (2013 Edition) which took me some time to get used to because of how small it was and the back/forward & DPI up/down buttons were placed on either side of the mouse. I always accidentally pushed the buttons on the side and the mouse was just too small, but I made due with it for the last 3 years... The M65 Pro has weights in it that make it feel a bit more significant and give you better control over the mouse since it''s not like you''re just waving around a flimsy, light piece of plastic. The build quality feels amazing. The RGB lights just add that cherry on top. Worked right out of the box, but after installing the Corsair CUE software from the Corsair website, it went straight to rainbow fading in & out which I thought was pretty neat. You...'),
(N'Andrea', N'Phillips', N'andrea.phillips5403@example.com', '2016-08-23', 5, N'Best mouse for the money'),
(N'Hannah', N'Lopez', N'hannah.lopez9507@example.org', '2016-08-23', 1, N'Whatever you do, DO NOT purchase this item through INFOWEB... ALWAYS CHECK SELLER RATINGS FIRST... Product had smudges and oily fingerprints on it, and I kid you not, I dunno if it was a bad coincidence, but I had pink eye the day after I started using it. It came with a battery that couldn''t hold a charge, and two awful games I didn''t ask for, in a dingy case I didn''t ask for... Without the CHARGER I was supposed to get. It''s as though tossing in extra junk was supposed to make up for crucial missing components.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Wilson', N'deborah.wilson2555@example.com', '2016-08-24', 2, N'The learning curve is high. But once you get there the game shows some promise. However, level 14, even on easy difficulty, is almost impossible to get past. It really ruined the game for me. When a video game becomes a chore it is no longer fun; and that''s the whole point. Also, too many ways to fall became a frustration as well. I really wanted to like this game and played it alot. But, it''s a broken game that wasn''t finished. I''m going to try the Wii version and see how it goes. It seems to be much higher rated. A better game that is similar is Green Lantern. The things in Thor that are bad are missing from that title.'),
(N'Luis', N'Nowak', N'luis.nowak6125@example.net', '2016-08-24', 4, N'This was purchased as a Christmas present and has not been removed from the package yet. It appears to be good quality and it exactly as represented.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Butler', N'patricia.butler8446@example.org', '2016-08-24', 5, N'In retrospect it''s hard to believe Shovel Knight started out as nothing more than a modest kickstarter project in 2013. It exceeded expectations on kickstarter, but the developers behind it were very meticulous about their design. Kickstarter doesn''t exactly have the best reputation among gamers. Not every game has been a dud, but there are certainly more controversial standouts among crowd-funded games than success stories. Shovel Knight is not only proof that crowd-funding a game can work, but that it can exceed expectations. It doesn''t always happen, but if more games were designed with Shovel Knight as a template there would be a lot more great ones. Shovel Knight borrows from some of the best classic NES games of the day. Combining elements of Mega Man, Castlevania and even the old Duck Tales games, Shovel Knight is like a time capsule of retro gaming presented in a modern day. It''s one of the few games I would fashion as being perfect because of the meticulous nature of the...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Flores', N'stephen.flores5916@example.com', '2016-08-24', 5, N'A fun addition to PlayStation, can''t wait to do some live playing.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Parker', N'stephanie.parker6868@example.com', '2016-08-24', 5, N'Love this keyboard I got it to replace my Razer Blackwidow 2014. I think this is a much better keyboard and a lot quieter as well. You can change ever key to a different color which is very cool and it has game profiles that light up just the keys you need to use.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Brown', N'cheryl.brown6314@example.net', '2016-08-24', 5, N'Greatest baseball game out there. Put hundreds of hours into this version! Graphics and gameplay are very realistic and extremely fun!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Peterson', N'jeremy.peterson1254@example.org', '2016-08-24', 4, N'If you liked Far Cry 3, this is basically more of the same. Not at all a bad thing.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Bailey', N'rebecca.bailey2183@example.org', '2016-08-24', 4, N'I''ll write a more detailed review after my franchise is played a little more, work gets in the way lol. Updated Positives Running mechanics are vastly improved. Graphics are touched up but not drastically different Offensive and Defensive line play is fun again Special teams is challenging but adds depth. No more auto 45 yard FGs. Franchise so far is by far the best it''s been since 2013, with teams really trying to build and not just take 4 QBs. New zone coverages. Cons Qb will lineup off center sometimes. New running mechanic can cause issues on lower difficulties as they will perform amove that may cost yardage. Presentation does slow it down.(though you can hold x on the ps4 version anyway) Audio can get repetitive if you akip ahead in the action. Ultimate team was meh. Overall 8 out of 10. If you love Madden and haven''t upgraded in a while, this is a good year to jump in. Offensive and defensive line play is fun and special teams are challenging again (some may say negative,...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Jones', N'jeremy.jones8219@example.org', '2016-08-24', 4, N'If you toss the one ratings I think you would get a better picture of what this game is ... Solid improvement. I miss having free hall of fame players but this is by far the best football video game ever. Draft Champions and Franchise Mode are my favorite areas of the game.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Howard', N'douglas.howard7470@example.com', '2016-08-25', 5, N'This will always be one of my favorite games. It''s a bit tricky to get working on Windows 10, but the story is awesome, the humor is great, and the gameplay is challenging and fun.'),
(N'Gary', N'Ali', N'gary.ali8270@example.com', '2016-08-25', 4, N'Game was great. Hard as expected. I was a little disappointed in UPS. It wasn''t amazon''s fault, but UPS didn''t get me the game until almost 8pm on release day. Worked great on the xbox one!'),
(N'Jose', N'Bailey', N'jose.bailey8908@example.net', '2016-08-25', 5, N'One of the best games ever! I didn''t like the other FarCry games but this one is AWESOME! Maybe because i enjoy this B.C. A.D time-frame. Fiance played it and was addicted, it is a nice length of a game with plenty to do and action. You get to tame wild animals and even ride a mammoth! There is a crazy witch doctor who likes to pump you full of various fluids that make you go on one heck of a trip with all other fun activities to accomplish. Buy it. You won''t regret it!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Bailey', N'raymond.bailey9952@example.com', '2016-08-25', 5, N'This came in great condition and works on my Windows after some fine tuning needed to be done. For one, you need you to definitely get the updated drivers from Blizzard and run the game under old compatibility (Win7 - Professional). After that, the game works and didn''t crash once. It brings back good memories.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Bennett', N'michelle.bennett6717@example.org', '2016-08-25', 5, N'rob is awesome'),
(N'Jack', N'Ross', N'jack.ross3859@example.com', '2016-08-25', 5, N'This product is great. Love all the colors.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Morgan', N'yuki.morgan9069@example.org', '2016-08-25', 5, N'This case is tough and perfect for the PlayStation Gold headset. It has a convenient carry handle as well. Two thumbs up.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Hall', N'benjamin.hall1627@example.com', '2016-08-26', 5, N'grateful'),
(N'Scott', N'Ramirez', N'scott.ramirez7723@example.org', '2016-08-26', 2, N'Had a hard time getting immersed in this world because of the horrendous audio lip sync. It felt like I was playing a game that was 10 years old. It was so bad they almost had to have not even tried to get it right. Had a very Metro feel to it, I really liked both of those games but this never clicked. No emotion in the game. The frame rate is nice but the graphics are low quality, the world feels fake and flat, and the gameplay is lackluster and there is no texture in the world. The needless restriction on power cells only makes the game unnecessarily cumbersome.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Gomez', N'alexander.gomez3367@example.org', '2016-08-26', 5, N'REALLY NICE LOOKING. QUICK CHARGE'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Cook', N'tomasz.cook8387@example.net', '2016-08-26', 5, N'My kids love it. They already had minecraft accounts ($27) and now they can take it to go.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Gonzalez', N'stephen.gonzalez6419@example.com', '2016-08-26', 5, N'great game for a steal'),
(N'Christine', N'Jenkins', N'christine.jenkins4098@example.com', '2016-08-26', 5, N'The Good: Fantastic and memorable story, well-written characters, beautiful art direction, fun time travel abilities The Bad: Story takes some jarring turns, final episode is a mess, your choices don''t affect the overall outcome of the story Have you ever wanted to time travel and change the past? How about just the last 30 seconds? You get that option in Life is Strange. You play as Maxine Caulfield who discovers she can rewind time by saving her lifetime childhood friend from a fatal gunshot wound in the girl''s bathroom. This changes Max''s life and everyone around her, but it''s up to you to decide if it''s for good or worse. Life is Strange tells a fantastically beautiful story with wonderfully written characters. The game will keep you hooked and have you playing all 8 hours with barely a blink. Life is Strange tries to build on the revolutionary point and click adventure genre that The Walking Dead revived from Telltale Games. The game is a little more open-ended, but not by...'),
(N'Kevin', N'Webb', N'kevin.webb5039@example.org', '2016-08-26', 5, N'My eight year old is super excited about this purchase. He loves getting Amazon gift cards and then spending them on Skylanders and he loves getting Skylander mail. It arrived quickly and in good condition, it has been running amok in Skylander land for some time now.'),
(N'Frank', N'Cruz', N'frank.cruz2920@example.org', '2016-08-26', 1, N'The screen no longer turns on and I had this for less than a Year!!!!'),
(N'Frank', N'Cruz', N'frank.cruz2920@example.org', '2016-08-26', 5, N'the best game ever!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Morris', N'kelly.morris1504@example.net', '2016-08-26', 5, N'GF loves it'),
(N'Rachel', N'Adams', N'rachel.adams9294@example.com', '2016-08-27', 4, N'My Opinion: The best cheap version of Gta! The game is so fun and addicting! Once you start a mission, you want to do the others.'),
(N'Linda', N'Webb', N'linda.webb2358@example.org', '2016-08-27', 5, N'good'),
(N'Linda', N'Ivanov', N'linda.ivanov2473@example.org', '2016-08-27', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Kumar', N'brenda.kumar7787@example.com', '2016-08-27', 5, N'Love this stand, fits PS4 like a glove.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Martinez', N'joyce.martinez4006@example.com', '2016-08-27', 5, N'The Beat Madden Ever!!! Best graphic!!! Best game play!!! I have downloaded it to my Xbox One S 2TB'),
(N'Hannah', N'Long', N'hannah.long1101@example.com', '2016-08-27', 5, N'Works great!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Coleman', N'aaron.coleman1815@example.org', '2016-08-27', 3, N'Just recently bought this and a SS Rival 300 at the same day. I bought the Rival 300 from Amazon and then, since I''m impatient, bought the G502 on sale at another seller that is local to me. I initially tried to cancel the Rival 300 since I made another decision, but I''m glad that I didn''t. Here''s why: * It''s heavy WITHOUT any weights. Would be far more ''Tunable'' if it were lighter out of the box. I can''t imagine putting more weight into it. * Rubber side grips are made of a harder rubber that doesn''t really grip well. * The mouse itself is pretty narrow, leaving no room for my right hand ring finger and pinky. I tried to adjust my grip but that led to slippage from the non-grippy rubber * Scroll wheel is awful, heavy and wobbly (likely due to side to side click feature, which are kinda worthless IMO) * Button placement was awkward for me. I found myself accidentally hitting the side button closest to my thumb, which I usually use for reloading... Not good. I gave 3 stars due to...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Adams', N'aaron.adams6033@example.net', '2016-08-27', 5, N'It''s a sad testimonial to game making that a polished up 13 year old game from the Gamecube is the 5th highest rated game on the Wii U but there is something special about Wind Waker that survives the test of time. I played the original Wind Waker and it may well be my favorite Legend of Zelda game beating even Ocarina of Time and Majora''s Mask. I loved the cell shaded graphics and lighthearted artistry and I never understood why Nintendo never returned to the style of Wind Waker (outside of the DS). If there had never been a Wind Waker released in 2003 this game would absolutely feel like a current generation game and not some retro throwback. There are some subtle game mechanic changes and some quests were modified in response to criticisms of the original game but the vast majority of changes are graphical and not game play. Don''t expect to find more NPC''s littering the world or all new quests. What sets Wind Waker apart from a lot of recent games is a sense of grandeur and a...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Garcia', N'pamela.garcia8958@example.org', '2016-08-28', 5, N'I''m a very casual gamer. I''m not into story driven games. I''m under the impression stories should be in movies and tv and leave the games to being games. Saying that, I''ve now spent 40 hours in No Man''s Sky and really like it. I''ve read ALOT of reviews where people absolutely hate the game and pissed at Hello Games for lying and leaving out features, for an ending that sucks.... Although, what sucks is that I honestly believe that most of those reviews are completely off base. I hate games that hold your hands, highlight every pick-up and collectible. I hate the games that point you in the direction your supposed to go, highlight the guys that are behind walls, etc. It''s not gaming. Feels like the past decade has birthed a generation of gamers that are pansies when it comes to their games. To play a game that doesn''t tell them at all what to do, where to go, who to speak to... HOW TO OPEN PORTALS, they start whining and ask for a refund. Then there''s the gamers that have discovered...'),
(N'Yuki', N'Walker', N'yuki.walker9890@example.net', '2016-08-28', 5, N'I really love this headset. Been using it for over 2 years now, and it still works great. Be aware that when you are wearing it, you''ll hear basically nothing from outside. Husband has gotten ticked a few times because he was talking and I didn''t hear him(I was gaming dear, you know better). Comfortable for long term wear!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Turner', N'kathleen.turner9555@example.com', '2016-08-28', 3, N'I am a command and conquer fan and already owned them all, just wanted early access to the new command and conquer, which got cancelled'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Ross', N'rebecca.ross6604@example.org', '2016-08-28', 1, N'Word of advice to players: If you''re on the Atlas Path, you have to grab an Atlas stone from each station, instead of going to another set of planets (for resources like I *had* to do), then coming back, because then your entire game will be screwed up and you''ll have no choice but to restart the game completely. This really hits hard especially if you''re, like I was, two Atlas stones away from completing the Atlas Path. Coupled with the crashes and bugs and JOURNEY MILESTONE COMPLETED... no. Just, no.'),
(N'Carol', N'Rodriguez', N'carol.rodriguez8832@example.org', '2016-08-28', 4, N'Got very bored of it after I beat the campaign, but fun up until then!'),
(N'Mei', N'Raghunathan', N'mei.raghunathan8696@example.net', '2016-08-28', 5, N'Great looking console, and extras were great. Not a fan of the new battlefront compared to the old ones'),
(N'Justin', N'Chen', N'justin.chen1555@example.net', '2016-08-28', 2, N'OBVIOUSLY NOT FINISHED'),
(N'Kyle', N'Powell', N'kyle.powell5783@example.net', '2016-08-28', 5, N'A lost classic to the wii library. It''s very unique, though it does get old if played in a straight line. Fortunetly, it has a good story to keep you going.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Chavez', N'amanda.chavez6762@example.net', '2016-08-28', 5, N'Awesome game. I was a little skeptical about playing a PC based game on a console, but I''m 100% glad I got it for the 360. Awesome story line, awesome mechanics. Only thing I have to say I am not a huge fan of is local multiplayer. It pulls the screen left and right unless you''re always bunched up. That''s all. 5 star.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Khan', N'samantha.khan6878@example.net', '2016-08-28', 1, N'Sean lied there is no MP . He hyped this boring game.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Turner', N'elizabeth.turner8602@example.org', '2016-08-28', 4, N'Its good. Its like Halo but more like an RPG game. Its not as good as real RPG games, though, because you cant really decide what to do. I mean when you talk to the characters in the game, they only sell you stuff or tell you to do the regular mission. There is no decision making. Some of the game modes you cant play by yourself. Either it won''t let you, or itss too hard. Examples of these modes are Raids, Nightfall Strikes, and certain modes in the Crucible (online death match stuff). I mean theres no matchmaking for certain types of game modes. Also, the missions (mainly the quests) are vague and sometimes you have to go look on the internet to see how to beat it, which means youll have to waste time looking at random crappy sites and ads. You get to customize your character, but the armor gets outdated and you cant always update it. Some will be too weak for certain missions. Its the same for the weapons too. You don''t get unlimited storage for all your stuff either. And, like...'),
(N'Paul', N'Martin', N'paul.martin1589@example.org', '2016-08-28', 1, N'Over-hype is not the reason I am giving this game a one-star rating. I truly wish that it was; I can get over the over-hype, but I cannot get over a game that is a mere fraction of what the developers promised and showed us over years of development time (and delays). I pre-ordered No Man''s Sky back in March; the passion the creators had for evoking a missing element in the current gaming market had me ecstatic for the universe that they were creating. Connect that to their final released product: I could simply link the reddit post that lists all the features that were promised to be present in the game, yet are completely missing or in some cases, removed. If/when some of these features are slowly added in over time, I may pop in the game 2 or 3 times a year to check in. But until then, the game fundamentally upsets me. It''s upsetting because I purchased the Limited Edition copy of this game, fully trusting the promises of the developers and the expectation of content warranted...'),
(N'Matthew', N'Edwards', N'matthew.edwards8814@example.org', '2016-08-29', 1, N'Game not as advertised, this game should be recalled by the studio and everyone should receive full refunds.'),
(N'Laura', N'Taylor', N'laura.taylor5430@example.com', '2016-08-29', 5, N'Excellent, without any mishap'),
(N'Scott', N'Brown', N'scott.brown1130@example.org', '2016-08-29', 3, N'One of the best mouses i have ever witnessed. I''m not a gamer but this comforts my hand quite well. The only reason i gave this 3 stars is that the roller click stops after a year or 2. I thought it happened for me only but unfortunately this happens generally to every DeathAdder as youtube is FULL of videos showing how to fix it, but it doesn''t worth fixing it cause you might damage it eventually. Other than that problem, this remains the best.'),
(N'Amara', N'Mitchell', N'amara.mitchell7195@example.com', '2016-08-29', 5, N'Very fun action/adventure game.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Robinson', N'kyle.robinson5039@example.com', '2016-08-29', 4, N'fine'),
(N'Linda', N'Young', N'linda.young5473@example.org', '2016-08-29', 5, N'The game seems fresh with the all new six button guitar controller and a ton of music to play on the GH TV mode! Fun game and sad to see it go!'),
(N'Gary', N'Ramirez', N'gary.ramirez3270@example.net', '2016-08-29', 4, N'My kids were big fairly odd parents fans, this game really did not delivery. It was pretty boring and storyline was not that great either. Kids got bored very quick and only played it few times.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Gomez', N'joseph.gomez1324@example.net', '2016-08-30', 3, N'It''s just truly average. The same game every year except now in the future. I have problems connecting to lobbies and it is a dead game on PC. The gameplay is ok but nothing special.'),
(N'Jason', N'Scott', N'jason.scott8315@example.net', '2016-08-30', 4, N'The DEA should investigate the producers of this game, because it is more addictive than crack cocaine. CONS 1) The graphics are not state of the art, and there is more repetition of scenery than you would expect in a game in 2016. 2) The animal movement is clumsy, although they fixed the bug that got them stuck as easily. 3) There are bugs. Not game-breaking, but there are bugs. 4) All the zombies of a given type are identical. 5) It is addictive. PROS It is unlike any other zombie platform game I have played. I play in solo mode (at least 80 hours so far), and there are no NPCs. Moreover killing zombies is not the goal (although you will end up killing a lot of zombies), but rather raw survival. You run away a lot (which makes the times when you stand and fight so very, very satisfying). You manage resources, build items, seek recipes, and above all build your base. Your base is half the game. You need a place to store your stuff, and to build the facilities that let you build...'),
(N'Luis', N'White', N'luis.white8052@example.org', '2016-08-30', 4, N'I had been following this game for a long time. I will keep this review short and to the point. This game had one of the largest "hype trains" of any game ever. Whenever that happens, I take what the developers say and then realize that only about 50% of the stuff will make it into the game. With that said, I was pleasantly suprized with what did make it into this game. No Man''s Sky is a fun "play when you are bored of everything else" game. It''s not meant for hardcore gamers or people that want to have an "end" to the game. It''s a relaxing jaunt through a universe to find and discover different animals and planets. Its not a story of universal domination. One thing that is missing is multiplayer. It would have been nice, but then again. Not needed for what this game is.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Nowak', N'samantha.nowak7126@example.org', '2016-08-30', 5, N'Great product. Super Satisfied.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Morgan', N'nadia.morgan5946@example.org', '2016-08-30', 5, N'I love this keyboard it is really nice to have if you want to have a fancy keyboard and is really good for gaming. I love how it lights up in all different colors. The only downside is that it is really loud like most other mechanical keyboards.'),
(N'Edward', N'Cruz', N'edward.cruz6286@example.com', '2016-08-30', 5, N'A must buy! Just an incredible experiance!'),
(N'Richard', N'Chen', N'richard.chen4586@example.com', '2016-08-30', 5, N'very good !'),
(N'Jacob', N'Stewart', N'jacob.stewart5078@example.net', '2016-08-30', 1, N'This is the worst game I have played in years. It was fun for 2 hours then all of sudden the content just kept repeating itself. Everything is the same in this game.'),
(N'Luis', N'Anderson', N'luis.anderson4804@example.net', '2016-08-30', 5, N'perfect!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Brooks', N'nicole.brooks2917@example.net', '2016-08-30', 5, N'perfect condition'),
(N'Tyler', N'Brown', N'tyler.brown6427@example.org', '2016-08-30', 4, N'GOOD GAME & STORY LINE'),
(N'Paul', N'White', N'paul.white9314@example.com', '2016-08-31', 3, N'Eh, it''s good, but not great. For the record, I loved Deus Ex Human Revolution. The story was enveloping, the world was detailed and the script was well-written. In Human Revolution the gameplay mechanics were the weakest link. I could look past it in that game as it was the first Deus Ex on a console platform. The problem is that the same gameplay problems exist in Mankind Divided. This is a PS4 next-gen game. In many ways it feels like a last-gen game. The controls are clunky, really clunky. The shooting mechanics are sub-par. The stealth is decent but it''s difficult to control Adam Jensen in a fluid way. The graphics are good but are brought down big time by the frame-rate of 30 fps. Personally, 30 fps in a next-gen game is becoming borderline unacceptable. To note, I just came from playing Doom which has 60 fps and super smooth gameplay mechanics. Going to this game after felt like I was playing in slow motion. Mankind Divided is not a bad game but after years of development...'),
(N'Larry', N'Suzuki', N'larry.suzuki8720@example.net', '2016-08-31', 5, N'Thank you. My friend''s younger brother was satisfied and mostly likely replay the game again when he has more spare time on his schedule.'),
(N'Adam', N'Myers', N'adam.myers9750@example.com', '2016-08-31', 5, N'yes,'),
(N'Laura', N'Perez', N'laura.perez1186@example.net', '2016-08-31', 5, N'The only game my son plays. Great updates and new contents. Perfect for your elementary school kids.'),
(N'Christina', N'Howard', N'christina.howard6243@example.net', '2016-08-31', 3, N'MEh.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Rodriguez', N'brandon.rodriguez6044@example.net', '2016-08-31', 4, N'It was an alright keyboard. For the price, it''s not too bad. If you''re a serious gamer, I''d give it a pass. I tried it and it just didn''t work for me. It felt too plasticy and delicate. The backlight is also not quite bright enough for me. It does show through the letters, which was nice, but at a normal sitting angle the top letters of the keyboard you can barely see because of the previous note that the maximum brightness just might not be enough. It''s a shame because it was one of the better looking keyboards I was browsing and I like it has the indention in the caps lock. If you''re on a low budget, or not too serious about heavy gaming then it probably might work well for you.'),
(N'Debra', N'Campbell', N'debra.campbell3300@example.net', '2016-08-31', 3, N'fun game but is no Overwatch'),
(N'Nathan', N'Perez', N'nathan.perez5301@example.org', '2016-08-31', 5, N'It is a smaller wired controller. Great for kids or adults with smaller hands. Works perfect, great response.'),
(N'Angela', N'Webb', N'angela.webb2753@example.net', '2016-08-31', 5, N'sweet'),
(N'Katherine', N'Kim', N'katherine.kim5808@example.com', '2016-08-31', 5, N'great'),
(N'Carol', N'Lee', N'carol.lee5904@example.org', '2016-08-31', 5, N'Fantastic purchase.'),
(N'Michael', N'Nowak', N'michael.nowak6534@example.net', '2016-09-01', 5, N'Good way to use headphones without having to bother with a chat mic'),
(N'Nicole', N'Smith', N'nicole.smith6095@example.com', '2016-09-01', 4, N'Got this for my sons birthday and he absolutely loves it! The only complaint I have is that we have purchased songs in the past for other rockband games through the PlayStation network and they aren''t available to us anymore.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ferreira', N'kenneth.ferreira7222@example.net', '2016-09-01', 5, N'Perfect !!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Russell', N'nathan.russell4725@example.org', '2016-09-01', 5, N'Son likes these to play with infinity game that he has, its good to have different characters.'),
(N'Maria', N'Bailey', N'maria.bailey8910@example.com', '2016-09-01', 1, N'no player interactions. no running into other players.. Not a lot of excitement. I like renaming silly creatures but I could play the sims and have more fun. It was a waste of money as they did not deliver what they promised with this game.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Morgan', N'lauren.morgan2378@example.org', '2016-09-01', 4, N'Great combat, beautiful visual, and a cast of totally dorky, utterly over the top silly anime Pop Idol characters. It''s no Persona but it''s fun and silly and has fun music. Basically if you like JRPGs and J Pop Idols, this game is a lot of fun. Very long if you want it to be with New Game + replayability.'),
(N'Noah', N'Wang', N'noah.wang9745@example.net', '2016-09-02', 5, N'Great graphics and made my son happy.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Turner', N'deborah.turner9229@example.org', '2016-09-02', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Nguyen', N'jacqueline.nguyen8169@example.com', '2016-09-02', 4, N'Solid vid signal outta this little monoster(pun intended), it''s just a strange mix of generational cabling. I was hoping for a compatible OG XBOX signal hookup but it isn''t the case. Otherwise solid connection for the price, though I''m not sure why they went with super-bright white. Looks out of place with all my other spray painted component cables. ;)'),
(N'Eric', N'Ali', N'eric.ali2190@example.net', '2016-09-02', 4, N'Its different. Arcade like and since I saw saga was doing this I had a feeling it was sticking to this arcade like shooter. Very different from other shooters and even to this day (2016) the controls you will easily get adjusted to it is somewhat different but nothing complicated. There is no story to this besides doing all these rounds in this tournament. Is it fun? Sure yeah. It definitely helps you improve in other shooter games. This game is based on how good you are rather than if you survive. There is a point scale from body and head shots. The multiples go down once you aren''t shooting anyone. The point is to shoot many enemies to gather more points and multiples. Is one hell of a game that has created something new. Its worth checking it out if you haven''t.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Lee', N'lauren.lee4104@example.org', '2016-09-02', 5, N'Great product fits perfectly.'),
(N'Henry', N'Morales', N'henry.morales8238@example.org', '2016-09-02', 2, N'Got a invalid cd key and it refused to play after update'),
(N'Eric', N'Suzuki', N'eric.suzuki8283@example.org', '2016-09-02', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Shirley', N'Phillips', N'shirley.phillips5967@example.org', '2016-09-02', 5, N'At first I was pretty hesitant to purchase this game, as I thought it would be so competitive and hard to have fun with since there would be so many people playing this game hardcore and seriously. I decided to take a leap and purchase it and try my luck! And I am so glad I did. Such a great price for a game that is constantly updating and adding new content at no additional price. Sure if you want to unlock special accessories or customization''s faster, you might make purchases to hope to get what you want for your favorite character. I have already spent hours and hours playing this game for the last 2 months that I have owned it and that is definitely my only regret purchasing this game. The hours I have lost this summer haha! But hey, that means the game is definitely worth your money if you keep coming back and back again to play it. The graphics are great and the fast paced action is just amazing. This game has instantly become one of my favorites that I expect to be playing...'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Chen', N'hiroshi.chen6000@example.com', '2016-09-02', 5, N'Shipton condition promised and probably dump and game works excellently Thank you..'),
(N'Lisa', N'Watson', N'lisa.watson5663@example.com', '2016-09-02', 5, N'This is a very fun game, for kids especially. As for adults, if you''re a "collector" or just love kid friendly games that are a bit mindless, you''ll enjoy it too. It''s a bit rough on the performance and graphics side, as a first entry (this is improved in later entries such as Giants and Swap Force), but generally it works just fine without any slow downs in frame rate.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Khan', N'brandon.khan3032@example.com', '2016-09-02', 5, N'its a fun game'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Johnson', N'carolyn.johnson3080@example.com', '2016-09-03', 5, N'Nice controller'),
(N'Aaron', N'Gonzalez', N'aaron.gonzalez6751@example.com', '2016-09-03', 5, N'Great price amazingly fast shipping'),
(N'Joseph', N'Thompson', N'joseph.thompson1081@example.com', '2016-09-03', 5, N'I''m new to Guilty Gear Xrd Revelator. It''s a beautiful looking game. At first I thought it was kind of slow (I''ve been playing a lot of SFV), but the more I play it the faster it seems. The gameplay is solid and the animations are top notch. Great fighting game!!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Young', N'douglas.young3855@example.net', '2016-09-04', 5, N'I think this game is great. It has a lot of extra textures which really makes this old title pop out more like its name; "HD" Though its not always perfect, because it would have require a complete re-tooling of the game. It does fit well in reason, and fixes some of the bloom issues of the original. I bought this version cause it came with the Amiibo and was well worth the extra cost. But yeah, don''t expect much more than the original game and what they added to the Amiibo functionality.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Martinez', N'pamela.martinez6835@example.com', '2016-09-04', 4, N'I''m not the biggest fan of wired controllers, but they do still have a place in gaming-- Especially since Microsoft seems completely unwilling to license their wireless technology to third-party controller companies and the only truly wireless controllers for Xbox One are Microsoft-branded. Third party doesn''t have to mean "cheap" though. Such is the case with PDP''s Face-Off controller. The controller itself feels good. It doesn''t squeak or creak, and the grip is decent. The included faceplate is textured, and while that''s to make it look like a football (complete with actual laces; They aren''t a plastic mold!) it also adds to the grip quality of the controller. I ordered the free team faceplate (an easy process, though I do wish they had more than just NFL teams and had a few generic offerings for those of us who really don''t have any team loyalty), but I haven''t received it yet so I can''t comment on the feel of that plate. The buttons all feel good, and the analog sticks are...'),
(N'Eric', N'Foster', N'eric.foster7743@example.com', '2016-09-04', 5, N'This is an awesome holder for me ds and 3ds games. i would tell everyone to get one.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Anderson', N'joseph.anderson8160@example.com', '2016-09-04', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Gonzalez', N'tomasz.gonzalez4788@example.org', '2016-09-04', 5, N'Nice product, everything it''s ok!'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Clark', N'carolyn.clark3639@example.com', '2016-09-04', 3, N'I don''t like that you have to get to a certain point before you''re able to save. I''ve started the game 3 times so far, and never had the time to continue to that point where saving is an option. I''m sure it''ll be much more fun when I can take the time to make some progress!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Collins', N'melissa.collins6204@example.com', '2016-09-04', 5, N'No problems at all. This works really well for my old school WII. Now I can connect my WII directly to my audio receiver via HDMI and still have just one HDMI cable going to the TV. I also was able to switch the WII display settings from 480i to 480p. I wasn''t able to see a difference in video quality but I''m sure there is an improvement (just can''t do a side by side).'),
(N'Noah', N'Ortiz', N'noah.ortiz4081@example.org', '2016-09-04', 4, N'I think the online portion of G T 5 XL was better than G T 6 but G T 6 has some race tracks that were on the G T 5 XL online portion of the game before it stop''d the online support in G T 5 and i don''t remember Willow Springs being in the G T 5 game or in the online portion of the game so that a new one for GT 6'),
(N'Nadia', N'Smith', N'nadia.smith6627@example.com', '2016-09-04', 5, N'I love this case! The 8-bit Super Mario design and coin zipper drew my attention, but the case works very well, considering how slim it is! It fits six games, and the 7th can be in the 3DS.'),
(N'Justin', N'Taylor', N'justin.taylor7270@example.net', '2016-09-04', 5, N'I love this expansion pack. It really adds a lot to my game and makes it more realistic. I feel it''s a must have expansion pack.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Gomez', N'tomasz.gomez1917@example.org', '2016-09-05', 5, N'These fit like a GLOVE!! Love them. Gives grip on controller!! Very highly recommended. Every gamer needs these!!'),
(N'Amara', N'Mitchell', N'amara.mitchell7195@example.com', '2016-09-05', 1, N'If you buy this game, you''re part of the problem. This is a terrible game. Nfl 2k5 was much better than this and it came out 11 years ago.'),
(N'Emma', N'Wilson', N'emma.wilson2807@example.net', '2016-09-05', 2, N'This game is the epitome of glitchy. Great concept for kids though.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Robinson', N'shirley.robinson5273@example.org', '2016-09-05', 5, N'Good game scared the crap out of me'),
(N'Katherine', N'Torres', N'katherine.torres3047@example.org', '2016-09-05', 1, N'Neither work! Buy somewhere else'),
(N'Amara', N'Long', N'amara.long2346@example.org', '2016-09-06', 4, N'Unless you received an awesome discount as a Prime Member, it''s still pointless to buy any World of Warcraft (WoW) expansions physically. Much like the previous expansion, Warlords of Draenor (WoD), the standard price for this at release is still a bit much. Part of the game license key enables you to receive a "free character boost to 100" which helps new comers and veterans who want to play the new content as soon as possible. Still in hindsight, $39.99 is a better price in my opinion, especially how this expansion will eventually become part of the complete WoW game package a year later. If they included free game time, that would have sweetened the deal...but this is Blizzard we''re talking about. Regardless, even if you just have the starter/free trial from the Battle.net app, you technically have everything downloaded including the 100-110 content and other new expansion only features. Now that''s out of the way, is Legion, the sixth expansion for the only good monthly...'),
(N'Linda', N'Rodriguez', N'linda.rodriguez1444@example.net', '2016-09-06', 5, N'Great racing sim with great graphics, its so much more rewarding learning to master a hard sim like this one. You have to put in the hours to get faster lap times. I think the driving physics are the best among all the sims on both of the New Gens. Track has more details than project cars. The sound blows away project cars, Assetto Corsa is really fun.'),
(N'Janet', N'Ross', N'janet.ross6214@example.com', '2016-09-06', 5, N'Great'),
(N'John', N'Watson', N'john.watson2173@example.org', '2016-09-06', 5, N'I have every Madden that''s been on PS4 from 25 to this one! This ones the best yet! Really like the small new features they have added and happy the announcers are different this year! Don''t believe the 1 star BS reviews on here! Great game!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Peterson', N'joshua.peterson2098@example.net', '2016-09-06', 5, N'Great alternative to full on set-ups. WIth this I have a G25 and I use it for my PC to play Assetto Corsa, definitely one of the best set-ups and it folds neatly to be stowed away easily. A tad heavy but honestly you want that for something that will be holding a steering wheel. Easy-setup, easy storage and best of all the quality is 100%.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Miller', N'samuel.miller9651@example.org', '2016-09-06', 5, N'This is a good video game.'),
(N'Luis', N'Nowak', N'luis.nowak6125@example.net', '2016-09-06', 5, N'Love the cover - very attractive'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Sanders', N'stephanie.sanders1957@example.org', '2016-09-06', 5, N'The colors are a little bright, but otherwise this is perfect. I pretty much leave it plugged in all the time.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Ivanov', N'brenda.ivanov3063@example.org', '2016-09-06', 3, N'E'),
(N'Richard', N'Murphy', N'richard.murphy8004@example.com', '2016-09-06', 5, N'Screw you Sony for making us buy your overpriced memory cards. Having said that, I''m glad I bought the 64gb card. Filled it immediately. In fact, I need to finish up some games to make room for more.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Allen', N'brandon.allen7879@example.com', '2016-09-06', 3, N'The story is pretty bad but atleast the gameplay is somewhat fun....i guess'),
(N'Janet', N'Suzuki', N'janet.suzuki8162@example.com', '2016-09-07', 5, N'a complex and interesting turn based strategy game. I remember playing this on the xbox first which offered less of a tutorial and left me a bit confused as to how the game worked. the ps2 version I feel is slightly better in that regard. all in all though the game revolves around a simulated scenario where you must command your armies and defend several areas of japan from an unknown invading force, utilizing terrain, unit strengths and weaknesses to your advantage and developing strategies on the fly.'),
(N'Mary', N'Gonzalez', N'mary.gonzalez1688@example.com', '2016-09-07', 4, N'It worked'),
(N'Omar', N'Robinson', N'omar.robinson3778@example.org', '2016-09-07', 5, N'fun game'),
(N'Larry', N'Kelly', N'larry.kelly2591@example.net', '2016-09-07', 5, N'If you haven''t played Resident Evil 4 now is a great time to try! This game is a thinking man''s shooter. You get limited ammo and have to figure out how to survive. Fun corny horror with very engaging gameplay! A great time!'),
(N'Lucia', N'Boyd', N'lucia.boyd4572@example.org', '2016-09-07', 5, N'Yeah!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Castillo', N'kelly.castillo6278@example.com', '2016-09-07', 5, N'Great buy! Would highly recommend this seller! : )'),
(N'Sharon', N'Williams', N'sharon.williams3712@example.org', '2016-09-07', 1, N'I was highly excited for this game. Unfortunately, the game did not live up to the hype. Maybe if the game was priced cheaper then it would possibly be a more likable product. The fact that the developer pushed their game as a Triple A title with a high price tag is where they completely failed. Not only does the price not sit well with the substance of the game but the missing features that were suppose to be there at release is another low blow. Maybe one day, this game will be amazing. Maybe it will bring in a new generation of gaming. Right now though, I would save your money or wait until it drops in price.'),
(N'Laura', N'Bailey', N'laura.bailey1952@example.net', '2016-09-08', 5, N'very good, thank you.'),
(N'Anna', N'Nelson', N'anna.nelson5066@example.org', '2016-09-08', 5, N'Love this game, it is my new favorite!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Morris', N'nicholas.morris7256@example.net', '2016-09-08', 5, N'Great for me; maybe not for you; form your own opinion.'),
(N'Adam', N'Anderson', N'adam.anderson8276@example.org', '2016-09-08', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Michelle', N'Perry', N'michelle.perry3978@example.net', '2016-09-08', 5, N'thank you i am get my order 100/100'),
(N'Janet', N'Bell', N'janet.bell9318@example.net', '2016-09-08', 5, N'Real cute I liked it, not too hard, not too easy.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Chen', N'kathleen.chen6721@example.com', '2016-09-09', 5, N'Love it and works just like the original SNES version.'),
(N'David', N'Stewart', N'david.stewart8026@example.com', '2016-09-09', 5, N'Great price disk mint'),
(N'Larry', N'Rivera', N'larry.rivera7933@example.com', '2016-09-09', 5, N'Looks great, works great, cant complain!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Moore', N'joshua.moore8037@example.com', '2016-09-09', 5, N'It doesn''t get any better.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Nowak', N'ashley.nowak6499@example.com', '2016-09-09', 5, N'Just as good a game now as it was back then.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Lewis', N'nicole.lewis6971@example.net', '2016-09-09', 5, N'Skylanders is a new venture for our grandchildren. They love playing this game with each other and their parents. As grandparents, we look forward to stepping up and learning how, too. As we understand each figure is different and allows for a new player. Want to buy them all!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Torres', N'kyle.torres9361@example.org', '2016-09-09', 5, N'Good fighting game until tekken 7'),
(N'Kyle', N'Torres', N'kyle.torres9361@example.org', '2016-09-09', 4, N'Good but short game.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Green', N'joshua.green9947@example.com', '2016-09-09', 4, N'Looks really good. Goes on easy. Has a slight texture to it, almost like real wood grain. Only complaint is that the pieces are just a hair short on every side and your not going to be able to cover each panel 100%'),
(N'Kevin', N'Suzuki', N'kevin.suzuki9001@example.org', '2016-09-10', 5, N'The characters on here are love. But the plot is so predictable. I understand the Tales series don''t want to stray too far from the Japanese role playing story line that it usually has kept but I think it''s time for an upgrade. I still love the series though, but it get predictable. "This person is a part of this group? Whaaaaaaaaaat?" =Sarcasm lol'),
(N'Olivia', N'Clark', N'olivia.clark7042@example.net', '2016-09-10', 5, N'good classic. I love killing Nazi''s. never could get that last mission'),
(N'Olivia', N'Clark', N'olivia.clark7042@example.net', '2016-09-10', 3, N'the game itself is good but you better bring a friend to play with you, otherwise the AI will get you killed....trust me. but if you get a partner play it.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Khan', N'stephanie.khan5898@example.org', '2016-09-10', 1, N'i was robbed!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Walker', N'sarah.walker4467@example.net', '2016-09-10', 3, N'its alright, songs are ok, not much of a selection though'),
(N'Sarah', N'Walker', N'sarah.walker4467@example.net', '2016-09-10', 5, N'Played it, loved it, played it again and still loved it.'),
(N'Carol', N'Davis', N'carol.davis6461@example.net', '2016-09-10', 5, N'this makes it so easy for me to find a game I want and saves me so much space. love these.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Morales', N'kevin.morales4871@example.net', '2016-09-10', 5, N'So much fun playing this game, feels very rewarding practicing a song higher in difficulty that I could only get standard on then getting a perfect on it. Plenty of customization with the costumes since their is so much to unlock. hope for more games to be released in the future'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Edwards', N'jeffrey.edwards5632@example.com', '2016-09-10', 3, N'It is a good game, but it is also very team based. If you play solo mostly, think twice before you buy it.'),
(N'Christina', N'Rivera', N'christina.rivera8889@example.net', '2016-09-11', 4, N'This controller is cost effective, easy to use, and performs well for VR games. I have limited VR experience but so far it''s worked perfectly for every game I''ve tried that has controller support. Comfortable to hold and the buttons all feel fine. The D-Pad is not my first choice but it works fine. It doesn''t compare to the Xbone controller I use on my PC, but it also costs less and pairs with my phone so it''s absolutely worth while in my book.'),
(N'Susan', N'Davis', N'susan.davis3281@example.net', '2016-09-11', 5, N'It makes your Xbox One S sit vertically. . . . I wish I could make this sound more thrilling than it is but it makes your Xbox One S sit vertically. That being said, I spent $20+ tax for that option and I ain''t even mad. Does exactly what it claims it will do. 5/5 would buy again.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Cox', N'jonathan.cox4041@example.net', '2016-09-11', 1, N'Bad controls, terrible lighting, nothing but cut scenes and quick time events. I loved RE4 and even RE5 had some fun parts and decent story; this one is just terrible. Worst part of game play: they made it basically an on-rails shooting game that doesn''t give you enough ammo to make it through successfully. Each basic enemy can take 10 bullets to take down, poor balance. I can''t say this any more clearly: don''t buy this game ever.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Alvarez', N'joshua.alvarez4847@example.org', '2016-09-11', 5, N'timely and acurate'),
(N'Mary', N'Johnson', N'mary.johnson7747@example.com', '2016-09-11', 3, N'Just like the casual jewel quest game. However other math three games runs the gems smoother than this game. It''s like a fast slideshow of the gems moving.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Baker', N'nicole.baker1653@example.com', '2016-09-12', 5, N'I''ve played the Sims since the beginning and this was one of my favorite expansions. Loved the weather and the amount of detail and immersion it brought to the game. The holidays are cute though after you do it a few times loses it''s luster. The new objects are great and add alot of variety and expand on the enjoyment of the game. Enjoyed the festivals and new skill object too! All in all this expansion did exactly what it was suppose to do. Expanded an already good base game and caused me to play it many hours more than I already did. Great expansion worth buying.'),
(N'Frank', N'Sullivan', N'frank.sullivan7879@example.org', '2016-09-12', 5, N'So much fun!!! Great shipping! Very happy customer!'),
(N'Jason', N'Turner', N'jason.turner5654@example.org', '2016-09-12', 5, N'code worked fine'),
(N'Donald', N'Lopez', N'donald.lopez9651@example.org', '2016-09-12', 1, N'This game was awful. The controls were not intuitive at all. If you want to play Call of Duty buy a better system.'),
(N'Judith', N'Okonkwo', N'judith.okonkwo7465@example.org', '2016-09-12', 5, N'Awesome game!!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Wood', N'brandon.wood2543@example.org', '2016-09-12', 3, N'Not a bad little r t s game.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Sullivan', N'ivan.sullivan9443@example.net', '2016-09-12', 5, N'This is a great game! I''ve played it through twice, and both times I was on the edge of my seat, scared and anxious about playing! It''s made me jump more times than I can count lol.'),
(N'Dee', N'Chavez', N'dee.chavez2252@example.net', '2016-09-12', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Megan', N'Reyes', N'megan.reyes7280@example.com', '2016-09-12', 4, N'I really think this is a gun game. However, the load times do get in the way of enjoyment at times.'),
(N'Linda', N'Sanders', N'linda.sanders6833@example.net', '2016-09-13', 4, N'good and cheap product works like a charm'),
(N'Lucia', N'Alvarez', N'lucia.alvarez9738@example.net', '2016-09-13', 4, N'had some trouble getting things working'),
(N'Linda', N'Mitchell', N'linda.mitchell9598@example.com', '2016-09-13', 5, N'S-video and RCA worked as expected.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Carter', N'jerry.carter6802@example.org', '2016-09-13', 2, N'It''s incredibly ironic this game has ''evolution'' in its title as there''s little to no evolution here whatsoever. This game is nothing more than a 2016 version of 2002''s Dirt To Daytona with updated cars/tracks and slightly updated graphics, that''s it, literally everything else is copy/pasted directly from their previous game, Dirt To Daytona, which came out nearly 15 years prior. The physics and audio are 100% recycled, they did absolutely nothing to improve it (the twitchy car is back once again 15 years later). The car audio is comical in how dated and awful it sounds, it''s dull, the cars simply don''t sound like that anymore. The crash audio, tire screeches, wall contact sounds are all the same and recycled. And you might say "that''s fine, I liked Dirt To Daytona" and that''s exactly what I thought, but once you sit down and actually play it after dumping $65 on it, you''re left with nothing but disappointment and it gets boring really quick as in the end, it plays like a PS2 game...'),
(N'Kofi', N'Harris', N'kofi.harris6037@example.net', '2016-09-13', 1, N'I guess I have to give it a star only because I have to. Worst game ever for new console. This is not a 60 dollar game, it should be one of those free Xbox games you can download from the store for free. NASCAR thunder 2002 on original Xbox has way better graphics, gameplay, realistic, can actually wreck, etc.'),
(N'Susan', N'James', N'susan.james4604@example.com', '2016-09-13', 4, N'my son loves the game'),
(N'John', N'Robinson', N'john.robinson4208@example.com', '2016-09-13', 5, N'So cool I got this at such a low price and now I have this collectible forever. Worst part is that it started my collectible desire and now I''m always wanting the Collectors editions.'),
(N'William', N'Moore', N'william.moore4709@example.org', '2016-09-14', 1, N'Hot garbage'),
(N'Yuki', N'Hernandez', N'yuki.hernandez5772@example.org', '2016-09-14', 5, N'Works great, just what i needed for the slippery thumb stick.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Hughes', N'hannah.hughes5304@example.com', '2016-09-14', 4, N'So far so good.'),
(N'Anthony', N'King', N'anthony.king6527@example.net', '2016-09-14', 5, N'FUN GAME'),
(N'Patrick', N'Boyd', N'patrick.boyd1771@example.com', '2016-09-14', 5, N'Doom II is a totally awesome first person shooter game. It is a remake of the 1994 computer game of the same name. In this sequel, the main character returns to Earth only to realize that billions of people have been killed by the demons from Hell. So Doomguy has to go on another journey. He must battle the demons, save the remaining humans of Earth, and destroy the Icon Of Sin. This game is so good. It also has some really useful cheats like an ''''Invincibility'''' cheat, and a cheat that gives you all the weapons in the game with full ammo. These cheats will come in handy, as the game is pretty hard in some parts. This is a great FPS game, and I highly recommend it.'),
(N'Lauren', N'White', N'lauren.white8048@example.org', '2016-09-14', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Jack', N'Jenkins', N'jack.jenkins8143@example.com', '2016-09-14', 5, N'My son loved them & they were easy to put on.'),
(N'John', N'Ivanov', N'john.ivanov3458@example.org', '2016-09-14', 5, N'This game shines as a darker, scarier version of dark souls with a more simplified upgrading and inventory system.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Roberts', N'amanda.roberts8025@example.net', '2016-09-14', 5, N'This game was so much f-ing fun. If you like decimating zombies and running around an open world like a ninja warrior hopped up on speed then this game is for you. The free running is wicked fun, but not as fun as killing zombies. There are so many ways to kill these poor damned souls. The game is challenging in the beginning but as you progress, you open more skills and get better gear. Near my end game I was pretty deadly. I didn''t have to worry about much, except at night time. Night time is freaking crazy in this game.'),
(N'Mei', N'Torres', N'mei.torres7934@example.net', '2016-09-14', 5, N'Buy this ASAP'),
(N'Nancy', N'Rivera', N'nancy.rivera5280@example.net', '2016-09-15', 5, N'Very versatile controller. Works great for racers and indies. Would not use for FPS, stick with KB&M of course. Surprisingly ergonomic and customizable.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Gray', N'jessica.gray5554@example.org', '2016-09-15', 5, N'Fun Gameplay'),
(N'Edward', N'Patel', N'edward.patel3928@example.org', '2016-09-15', 4, N'This game is near perfect. The music, sound, art, combat, story, progressions system. Everything is masterful, a pinnacle of rpg gaming. The only flaw, and its a massive one, is you''re essentially beating the game several times as different characters who don''t play that differently from one another. The art and animation in this game is as good as any game in existence. The colors pop, the animated backgrounds are vibrant and breathtaking, The animation is crisp and consistent, no lag even as hordes of enemies swarm the screen. Every character and costume design is highly memorable. This game is the perfect justification of videogames as art. The story is phenomenal. I know gamer scum will hate to read this but Gwendolyn''s story is female positive and feminists would love it. She is a brilliant soldier that wages war on behalf of her father odin. After her older sister, favored by her father, falls in battle she wields her legendary spear to conquer the world for her father. The...'),
(N'Susan', N'Mitchell', N'susan.mitchell7304@example.org', '2016-09-15', 4, N'The apocalypse has already come and gone. Humanity stands rather divided in its factions with some still holding on to previous ideals and others simply praying to survive one more day. Being lynched isn''t quite the best way to start your day but unfortunately for you, youve been possessed and it was time to die. Not wanting to go down with the mortal coil that it took over, the spirit that took over your body leaves in the nick of time. Barely surviving, you are cut down from the tree and are allowed to live. Asked to help out the small settlement known as Devils Crossing, you pick up your weapon and head out into the aftermath of what has become known as the Grim Dawn. I originally wrote about Grim Dawn back in its earlier Early Access stages before multiplayer was even implemented and am happy to say that it stands very well on its own but is made even better with a partner. Honestly, can you think of a better way to face the aftermath of the apocalypse than with a friend? Now...'),
(N'Mark', N'Okonkwo', N'mark.okonkwo3125@example.net', '2016-09-15', 1, N'I''ve been playing EA''s NHL games for over two decades now. After making a couple of excellent games near the end of the PS3''s life cycle EA has regressed, with NHL 17 being one of the worst games they have ever made in terms of my main reason for gaming -- fun. This game is simply tedious to play and not much fun. EA has added a draft game mode that is actually a nice mode and well designed. HUT has been modified a bit and still a great mode. Likewise, franchise mode has seen some changes for the better and I commend EA for showing some love to gamers looking to play offline modes. The various other modes are ok, but nothing special. Unfortunately, EA has failed miserably in the most important aspect of a sports game -- gameplay. It''s poor. After applying the four-plus gb update to the game I began playing the various modes at various difficulty levels. The top two difficulty levels are the only levels that gave me anywhere close to a competitive game, so that is where I''ve played...'),
(N'Justin', N'Murphy', N'justin.murphy9494@example.com', '2016-09-15', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Brian', N'Roberts', N'brian.roberts4072@example.com', '2016-09-15', 5, N'My husband loves it, and the graphics are amazing .'),
(N'Charles', N'Fisher', N'charles.fisher7202@example.net', '2016-09-16', 1, N'Horrible'),
(N'Ravi', N'Perry', N'ravi.perry1756@example.com', '2016-09-16', 3, N'its okay game is still .......'),
(N'Eric', N'Wilson', N'eric.wilson1832@example.org', '2016-09-16', 5, N'This is an amazing mouse. The DPI settings go up so much higher than anyone would need. The input lag is amazing for a wireless mouse. Battery life could be better but im not complaining. Now I just need the G810 and G933s to match!'),
(N'Charles', N'Ruiz', N'charles.ruiz3150@example.org', '2016-09-16', 5, N'Awesome game. Graphics are amazing, character development is fantastic (first game where the majority of characters actually "talked" so that was also nice), the mini games were interesting, and the storyline was well-written. Definitely worth playing.'),
(N'Charles', N'Ruiz', N'charles.ruiz3150@example.org', '2016-09-16', 5, N'This was one of the best games I''ve ever played. The puzzles aren''t your run-of-the-mill challenges. They are new and different and keep you interested in the game. The storyline was extremely well written and the graphics were solid.'),
(N'Richard', N'James', N'richard.james2044@example.com', '2016-09-16', 3, N'It was perfect, but then my system stopped working out of nowhere'),
(N'Stephen', N'Lewis', N'stephen.lewis6877@example.com', '2016-09-16', 2, N'A lot of fun... For the first 30 hours or so. Seriously, i don''t think ive ever played another game that i was so into, and then had zero interest in. I bought the game at launch, and played it nonstop, saw its flaws, but loved it anyway. I finally made enough money to buy a new ship, and then... Now what? I can store more materials... So i can make money... To buy another ship... At this point, as far as i was concerned i had beaten the game. I flew to a new planet in my new ship. And this planet was hardly different from any other id been on. I then turned the game off, and after a few weeks of gathering dust, finally sold it. I guess its a game you will either love or hate, i was into it for a while, and i have some friends who are still into it, but i would recommend passing on this one, at least until the price goes Down a bit.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Evans', N'ivan.evans3732@example.com', '2016-09-16', 5, N'For a multiplayer gamer this is essential. I like having easy access to the volume and mute commands. If you have one of the older controllers and need to connect a headset with the 3.5 jack this is a must.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Evans', N'ivan.evans3732@example.com', '2016-09-16', 2, N'The product was fine when for a few weeks after I first received it but it didn''t even last 3 months of normal use. After a few weeks I started to notice what seemed like a short in the cable that would cause the headphone to go in and out and a popping sound from the mic. That lasted for a couple of weeks then the headset went out all together. Its currently in the trash needless to say... I ended up using my cell phone''s headset and it actually works just a good as this unit right out the box.'),
(N'Linda', N'Ramirez', N'linda.ramirez6018@example.org', '2016-09-16', 5, N'Love it and the seller booksandstuff was a great seller'),
(N'Anna', N'Ortiz', N'anna.ortiz1760@example.org', '2016-09-16', 5, N'what an upgrade.... definitely needed and no regrets... oh yeah you need to buy the power supply separate...'),
(N'Anita', N'Richardson', N'anita.richardson7469@example.com', '2016-09-16', 5, N'Component cables for your psp. Will not play psp full screen by itself.'),
(N'Amara', N'Reyes', N'amara.reyes1571@example.org', '2016-09-16', 5, N'GOOD 100%'),
(N'Larry', N'Anderson', N'larry.anderson5387@example.com', '2016-09-17', 3, N'Deus Ex: my favorite game hands down. Human revolution was a fine form and a dream to play. This game was disappointing. Graphics were not next-generation console worthy. Lip syncing was distractingly terrible. Story was clunky. That being said I had fun playing it, combat and stealth was still really fun. 10 hours later it was finished and I''m scratching my head. So many story holes, so abrupt and unsatisfying ending. If they delayed this game by a year it''s scary to think what it would have been with the original release date, just a 20 minute tutorial? This game has definite positives, but after beating it all I want to do is go play Human Revolution again. A sequel should not make you pine for the original, it should enhance and outdo it. Oh well, guess I learned my lesson about pre-ordering games this time. Sold it after a week (all it took to get to the end).'),
(N'Frank', N'Sullivan', N'frank.sullivan7879@example.org', '2016-09-17', 5, N'My fiance loves this game! Great buy!'),
(N'Paul', N'Wang', N'paul.wang2015@example.com', '2016-09-17', 4, N'Very good game.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Rodriguez', N'kevin.rodriguez2694@example.com', '2016-09-17', 5, N'Excellent!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Rodriguez', N'kevin.rodriguez2694@example.com', '2016-09-17', 4, N'good!'),
(N'Susan', N'Torres', N'susan.torres5384@example.org', '2016-09-17', 5, N'very pleased with item and seller'),
(N'Steven', N'Peterson', N'steven.peterson4926@example.org', '2016-09-17', 5, N'it''s a N-Gage, what''s not to love?'),
(N'Deborah', N'Baker', N'deborah.baker9681@example.net', '2016-09-17', 5, N'I''m a big fan of one shooter games , This one doesn''t disappoint . I''m a grandma of 16 and Love my Games . I blog my walkthrough so at nanaswardiaries.blogspot.com'),
(N'Deborah', N'Baker', N'deborah.baker9681@example.net', '2016-09-17', 5, N'My only problem is you can''t play Campaign with my 360 I do give it a 5 star only because was my fault for not reading up on it.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Thomas', N'hannah.thomas8298@example.net', '2016-09-17', 2, N'Why is there no pause on this game??? So the story starts out slow and its irritating that you can free roam. You are forced to walk through a location with someone (without spoilers) for approximately 20 minutes and it DRAGS on and on.. You can only do certain movements and walk down certain rows. The story is good and could be a much better game if there was a pause control, and if you weren''t forced to hang out with some dork in the beginning.'),
(N'Megan', N'Thompson', N'megan.thompson4954@example.net', '2016-09-17', 4, N'There are parts of this game that are nice, and others that are just annoying. But over time, the annoyances become a bit less, other than the long load times. The game starts out fine - interesting story, that reveals itself bit by bit with audio logs and such, leaving you wondering what happened. The dog is cute, especially as you get to upgrade it. Gameplay starts out alright - combat isn''t difficult, and enemies with different colors are best attacked with corresponding colors in your energy weapon. You use the D-pad to change that, starting out with just white, then getting red, and eventually the others. But soon the repetition and annoyances step in. I''m not a fan of "timed" games. And once you get to the second area in this game, "dungeons" are timed to get "good" things. So you have X minutes to rush through to find the good things. For me, rushing through things takes away the fun, and that''s where this immediately became something I''m likely not going to bother trying to...'),
(N'Donald', N'Martin', N'donald.martin2193@example.net', '2016-09-17', 5, N'b'),
(N'Steven', N'Williams', N'steven.williams3044@example.org', '2016-09-18', 5, N'the PlayStation belongs to my children ,but I like the charger it help to keep up with the controls'),
(N'Ivan', N'Nowak', N'ivan.nowak3680@example.org', '2016-09-18', 4, N'The game play is very basic and it''s platforming elements are pretty solid...the same can''t be said for the load times. The game isn''t very difficult and the combat is pretty generic but the story itself is pretty solid. Expectations weren''t high going in but I was surprised by how much fun I was actually having. Microsoft did a good job pricing this more into the budget range of $40...still maybe too much but better than a full $60 price tag.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Scott', N'lauren.scott7605@example.org', '2016-09-18', 5, N'fun'),
(N'David', N'Adams', N'david.adams5761@example.net', '2016-09-18', 5, N'Very Good'),
(N'Scott', N'Turner', N'scott.turner8411@example.org', '2016-09-18', 5, N'I bought cheap. I very very love it.'),
(N'Christine', N'Collins', N'christine.collins4793@example.net', '2016-09-18', 1, N'poor quality rpg all around. graphics suck, control sucks, the attacks suck, gameplay sucks. is not worth the cost for this game'),
(N'Joseph', N'Clark', N'joseph.clark2391@example.com', '2016-09-18', 5, N'This game is beautiful. And it plays well. I enjoyed it far more than uncharted 3. A fitting ending to a great series.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Myers', N'yuki.myers4418@example.com', '2016-09-18', 5, N'Nice game'),
(N'Yuki', N'Myers', N'yuki.myers4418@example.com', '2016-09-18', 5, N'Nice item'),
(N'Jason', N'Moore', N'jason.moore8348@example.net', '2016-09-18', 5, N'Soft, yet sturdy... Love this case, perfect amount of room would recommend'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ali', N'ethan.ali2520@example.org', '2016-09-19', 5, N'This game is awesome. I believe nobody finished this game. If somebody did, put it on youtube so I can see the credits. When it''s something finished theirs credits afterwards so a person see you finished the game.'),
(N'Anna', N'Garcia', N'anna.garcia5144@example.org', '2016-09-19', 4, N'Stand works well - holds the ps4 in place, however, like others have posted, if the PS4 is in a location where someone can bump into it, odds are the system will fall out of the stand. As for the noise of the fans, if I''m just sitting in my room staring at the PS4 home screen and not playing anything - I can slightly hear them. However, once in game the fan noise is drowned out completely. Charging ports and USB locations all work as long as the PS4 is on or in standby mode.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Nowak', N'cheryl.nowak1631@example.net', '2016-09-19', 5, N'Good quality'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Nowak', N'cheryl.nowak1631@example.net', '2016-09-19', 5, N'Love Xbox 360,console worked great'),
(N'Olivia', N'Turner', N'olivia.turner6213@example.org', '2016-09-19', 5, N'Great controller. I added some lead golf weights to it until it was the same weight as the genuine controller. It''s virtually identical!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Kowalski', N'brandon.kowalski9665@example.net', '2016-09-19', 5, N'Love this Retro Mario amiibo. It has the classic color scheme compared to the modern colored version. It''s slightly larger than the average size of other amiibo. It goes well with a PDP Spinning Fire Bar Display [see photo]. Recommended.'),
(N'Scott', N'Scott', N'scott.scott1245@example.net', '2016-09-19', 5, N'Another addition to my collection of Xbox One S video games that I can play solo since I''m from the console generation.'),
(N'Scott', N'Scott', N'scott.scott1245@example.net', '2016-09-19', 5, N'What can I see.....The Best!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Clark', N'sofia.clark2098@example.org', '2016-09-19', 5, N'I bought this for my nephew''s, so they could play with each other, better than playing on ipad. The game will keep your kids busy for hours!'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Hernandez', N'rebecca.hernandez3846@example.org', '2016-09-19', 5, N'Works wonderfully, keeps my ps4 cool for hours and hours'),
(N'Emma', N'Thompson', N'emma.thompson7974@example.com', '2016-09-19', 5, N'I own this game from the Xbox 360 I love this game'),
(N'Janet', N'Ali', N'janet.ali6366@example.net', '2016-09-19', 5, N'All good'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Green', N'kimberly.green4947@example.net', '2016-09-19', 5, N'good'),
(N'William', N'Moore', N'william.moore4709@example.org', '2016-09-20', 1, N'Xbox version = worst version of everything'),
(N'Henry', N'Miller', N'henry.miller8448@example.com', '2016-09-20', 5, N'My husband and I got this PS4 camera yesterday on sale, so that was a plus. PROS : The Playroon games are fun to play and interact with. The bots are adaptive to how the controller is set and your playability is. Picture quality is decent, not excellent like one would expect. The mic is a fairly cool add on, and it''s nice to be able to move the camera up and down, for the few games it is compatible with. CONS : Not many games out there that are compatible with the camera. Picture quality may be an issue for some, but I don''t mind it that much, could have been worse. Nothing for Skype users, or for those who use the messaging on the PS4, which I hope changes soon, since I do use the messaging quite a bit with friends'),
(N'Samuel', N'Edwards', N'samuel.edwards6584@example.org', '2016-09-20', 1, N'5 months old, and it won''t read discs anymore. Just spins up and down, making awful noises. Sent to Sony, and was informed warranty is rejected because of abuse. Yet my console was pristine when I sent it to them as I take excellent care of my things. This is the 2nd time they''ve used that excuse to wiggle out of warranty repairs. Stay away from Sony - they have a bad reputation for a reason.'),
(N'Anna', N'Ali', N'anna.ali4121@example.net', '2016-09-20', 4, N'Lol, I just looked back a year or so and saw I bought this. Still a fun classics'),
(N'Emma', N'Thompson', N'emma.thompson7974@example.com', '2016-09-20', 5, N'I had a great experience with this product I own this game'),
(N'Katherine', N'Torres', N'katherine.torres3047@example.org', '2016-09-20', 3, N'OK case'),
(N'Sofia', N'Green', N'sofia.green6215@example.com', '2016-09-20', 5, N'This product''s main purpose is to be used with the PS4 console (any variant). However, it is also possible to use this with PC via 3rd party programs, however I would highly recommend getting a controller capable of doing that without such programs (such as the Xbox One controller which is pretty much plug and play) Now, if you purchased a PS4, chances are you already have one of these controllers. I personally bought 3 more of these controllers during the Black Friday sale for the sole purpose of playing with friends. This controller should be your go-to product when looking for a controller to use for your PS4, unless you are looking for design variants, but in the end, it''s the same controller with the same purpose. From personal experience, the controller feels nice and slim. The touch pad is very convenient and the light sensor actually reacts to certain games in various ways! Highly recommend purchasing this product if you need spare controllers or even replacements. I...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Carter', N'amanda.carter2789@example.net', '2016-09-21', 5, N'it''s better than X'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Richardson', N'stephanie.richardson3009@example.org', '2016-09-21', 4, N'This is a generic break-away pigtail at a premium price. I found nearly identical units for one-half to one-third the price and the all have the same fit, finish and function. This is used with the Rocksmith cable to adapt it to any computer that requires a USB connection. I keep spares as these can get lost.'),
(N'Megan', N'Rogers', N'megan.rogers5617@example.com', '2016-09-21', 5, N'this is the best resident evil 5 i have ever bought i highly reccomend it to anyone'),
(N'Christina', N'Watson', N'christina.watson3847@example.org', '2016-09-21', 5, N'This is one of my favorite games from growing up. I played this in high school all the time. The fun thing about this series is that while it''s an RPG series, is that the combat is actually multiplayer, so you can enjoy playing through the stories or powering through the bosses with your friends. I''ll never forget those days with me and my friends sitting around trying to beat the hardest optional boss in this game on the hardest difficulty, timing combos together and screaming each time something went wrong, there aren''t many other RPGs that can do that..if there are any outside of this series at all. This includes Tales of Symphonia and the sequel to Tales of Symphonia, where all of the characters return a few years later, though you are playing the game from a more outside perspective, it''s fun and interesting to meet your old heroes through someone elses eyes later in the story. All of these Tales game have similar motifs, where its the story of a group mostly comprised of...'),
(N'John', N'Howard', N'john.howard6134@example.com', '2016-09-21', 1, N'I have been looking forward to this coming out since before it was ever even announced. As a huge killer instinct fan and unfortunatly someone who does not have home internet this package seemed to be made just for me. I have the last physical release of Killer Instinct, so this purchase was mainly to get all the additional content that I can''t download due to not having home internet. When I popped the disc in the Xbox everything started to install from the disc including all the DLC characters that I purchased this release specifically for. Well to my huge disappointment when I opened the game after the full install the game would not let me play any dlc characters. I keep getting an error message to "connect to Xbox live". I thought this was a mistake as everything seems to have downloaded from the disc and installed so I deleted everything and tried the download again. Obviously because of my rating it did not work. In my opinion KI is a 5 star game and if you have never owned...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Coleman', N'joshua.coleman5718@example.org', '2016-09-21', 5, N'Amazing game and beautiful plates!'),
(N'Betty', N'Coleman', N'betty.coleman2689@example.com', '2016-09-22', 5, N'Came new , and works great !'),
(N'Nicole', N'Bailey', N'nicole.bailey2639@example.net', '2016-09-22', 5, N'NOTHING BEATS A HORI.'),
(N'Michael', N'Powell', N'michael.powell3201@example.com', '2016-09-23', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Noah', N'Alvarez', N'noah.alvarez9774@example.com', '2016-09-23', 5, N'GIft for friend.'),
(N'Carol', N'Chen', N'carol.chen2796@example.org', '2016-09-23', 3, N'Games aren''t great but I like the voice functionality.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Campbell', N'ryan.campbell7405@example.com', '2016-09-23', 5, N'Whats not to like?!? Tons of games and an easy to use and attractive interface.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Campbell', N'ryan.campbell7405@example.com', '2016-09-23', 5, N'I played since Beta and quit around Cataclysm. Tried Mists and didn''t like it and quit again. This time I feel they got the right balance. Lots to do whether you are hard core or casual. Good expansion and worth picking up if you are thinking about playing again.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Price', N'elizabeth.price7450@example.net', '2016-09-23', 5, N'Absolutely amazing!'),
(N'Joseph', N'Perry', N'joseph.perry1560@example.net', '2016-09-23', 5, N'This game is sort of like GTA, but in the old West. Trade cars for horses and criminals with outlaws then you have Red Dead Redemption.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Davis', N'nicole.davis9569@example.org', '2016-09-23', 5, N'When finding out that other sellers really tried to scalp this item, I was pleased finding it at a reasonable price at Amazon. This Yoshi goes beyond the amiibo feature, it''s a great little pocket plushie as well and was woven neat and tightly. I mess with it myself sometimes when I''m bored, and this was a gift. It''s a must have, in my opinion.'),
(N'Betty', N'Nguyen', N'betty.nguyen9169@example.com', '2016-09-23', 5, N'Great system. The elite controller is a must. The controller has an excellent feel and weight. The rear controls add a lot.'),
(N'Omar', N'Cook', N'omar.cook1547@example.org', '2016-09-24', 3, N'I actually dig it. But what''s up with the weeird slow down sluggish game play at certain moments? Also I''ve never had more field goals blocked in any video game ever. It''s a beautiful game to look at. EA needs to ease up a bit on trying to be so realistic to the point it doesn''t feel like it. Field goals, running etc.'),
(N'Donald', N'Wang', N'donald.wang4239@example.org', '2016-09-24', 5, N'Best RTS on Xbox!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Richardson', N'stephanie.richardson3009@example.org', '2016-09-24', 4, N'Simple cable adapter for those who connect their Rocksmith cable to USB PORTS. THESE BREAK-away pigtails are a must, so I keep spares everywhere. I found a lighter grade cable for half this price.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Stewart', N'carolyn.stewart9803@example.com', '2016-09-24', 2, N'I''m not a verified purchase, but I''m a big amazon shopper and I like reviewing products for other people to be informed. Do not buy this controller. Every Micro$oft controller messes up. I went through countless Xbox 360 controllers and now its happening all over again with Xbox One. I''ve bought a 3rd party controller from gamestop and have dropped the thing, flung it in anger unplugged it accidentally and it still has no issues that I''m aware of. The MAIN issue with Micro$oft controllers is the drifting thumbstick. Just by using the sticks, they eventually will come to a point of no return and your character will begin to look towards the ceiling without you touching the controller. You can move the thumbstick slightly back down to change character view and it corrects it, but this is such an annoying thing. Not only that, but one of my shoulder buttons on the launch Xbox One was not working right straight out of the box. They''re cheaply made and I suggest going with a gamestop...'),
(N'James', N'Ross', N'james.ross7889@example.net', '2016-09-24', 5, N'A really fun game and quite addictive. Shipping was super fast.'),
(N'Adam', N'Ross', N'adam.ross3210@example.org', '2016-09-24', 5, N'This 2016-17 version of the game continues the excellent features and gameplay of the NBA 2K franchise, I''ve had many versions over the years ever since the first one. And to be honest - I also bought it because Kobe is on the box cover (for the last time), but when you fire up the game in the console you actually see Paul George on the start screen. Whatever,...it''s just a start screen - but the game itself is still fun to play. Graphics are top notch, animations and gameplay are crisp and realistic. The inclusion of past superstar teams (i.e. the Shaq and Kobe era) add to the fun, but I really didn''t care much for the Euroleague teams since most of the players are unknown for me. Also, the My Career mode is challenging and very in depth; I could stand for a few less cut scenes but it makes sense that they''re there to move the story along. Finally, as is every year, the 2K team compiled an excellent selection of background music. Even if Kevin Durant is in the game, I''ll still...'),
(N'Katherine', N'Diaz', N'katherine.diaz5564@example.com', '2016-09-25', 5, N'If you enjoy MMORPG''s (such as World of Warcraft) then you just might enjoy this game. You don''t have to be an MMORPG fan to enjoy it however I can''t stand those types of games but I did enjoy this one Squarenix does it again that.la guys for the countless hours of entertainment from all the titles you''ve made over the years I''m a huge fan and I will continue to be a huge fan so many games your working on that I''m currently waiting for keep up the awesome work. No problems with this seller arrived on time and in perfect condition.'),
(N'Debra', N'Morgan', N'debra.morgan6194@example.com', '2016-09-25', 3, N'Game plays OK, but on my PS4 I was expecting a higher quality graphic detail -- maybe because I just finished Doom which has incredible graphics. Many scenes looked like PS3. If the game plays great, maybe I''ll come back and add a star.'),
(N'Emma', N'Thompson', N'emma.thompson7974@example.com', '2016-09-25', 5, N'I had a great experience with this game my family no longer own this game'),
(N'Katherine', N'Phillips', N'katherine.phillips9656@example.org', '2016-09-25', 5, N'Came in fantastic condition, fun and colorful game!'),
(N'Brian', N'Murphy', N'brian.murphy3507@example.com', '2016-09-25', 5, N'My kids absolutely love this, and I haven''t even tried the Blu-Ray player yet. Our TV is not a 4K but it does a very nice job displaying clear graphics on our standard HD TV. Glad we got this upgrade. Looks great, too.'),
(N'Charles', N'Kelly', N'charles.kelly6814@example.net', '2016-09-26', 5, N'Great product - Awesome Price!'),
(N'Judith', N'Gray', N'judith.gray1134@example.net', '2016-09-26', 5, N'Charges two controllers at once and looks cool. Supremery PS4 Dualshock 4 Charger Dockingstation [2 Extra USB Outputs] Charging Station for Sony Playstation 4'),
(N'Samuel', N'Perry', N'samuel.perry7400@example.net', '2016-09-26', 5, N'Don'' listen to the negative reviews. Dead Island was a buggy mess, but it was fun and I personally loved it. Techland hasn''t done alot to speak of. So how did they do with Dying Light? They killed it! Dying Light is a sweeping, epic, open world game. The graphics and atmosphere are the best representation of any apocalypse I''ve seen in a game (zombie-themed or otherwise). The melee combat is spot on, with satisfying thuds and slashes, and really interesting momentum physics and visible damage. The single player campaign is interesting and lengthy, with some great voice work from the lead and supporting players. The game mechanics are a blast, as you slowly evolve from a clumsy scrapper to a parkour expert, zombie-slaying machine. The upgrade system is based on what you''re doing, and progression is rewarding. Each new skill gives you a new tool to play with...it''s been a long time since I''ve felt like I was playing with a character that I could do so many things with. If you''re a...'),
(N'Joan', N'Khan', N'joan.khan2388@example.com', '2016-09-27', 5, N'best fps to come out for a long time'),
(N'Debra', N'Kowalski', N'debra.kowalski1196@example.net', '2016-09-27', 5, N'psp'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Jackson', N'jacqueline.jackson7713@example.com', '2016-09-27', 5, N'Let''s start this simple review. Story Summary: Haunting Ground is the story of a young 18 y.o. girl named Fiona Belli who has been trapped within the confines of a very scary castle that hosts a few frightful people. These people chase and harass Fiona in different ways while she solves puzzles, finds key items to progress and looks for ways around the castle. Fiona is accompanied by a canine companion named Hewie shortly after the game starts. Gameplay Summary: Fiona controls very simply. You move her around with the control stick, she is able to run (but can get tired), and she has the ability to attack (weakly) by kicking or shoving. There are lots of items in the game, but these are mostly key items for story progression or health/stamina recovery items. There isn''t much else to preoccupy your thought and there are no stats, health/stamina meters or lives to keep track of. The game has no HUD and there is light background music to accompany your time in the castle. The game has...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Walker', N'kenneth.walker3302@example.net', '2016-09-27', 5, N'I love this PSP. It''s way better than my PSP1000. It''s lighter, smaller and more portable than my PSP1000. This is a great system with tons of playable games, watchable movies and listenable device. It has a nice crystal clear LCD screen, ergonomic design and overall media center device. It can connect to Wifi and browse the internet with decent speed. The best part about this system are the games. There''s tons of games to chose from, from different genre and categories. It an amazing little device with tons of great features.'),
(N'Emily', N'Coleman', N'emily.coleman7040@example.org', '2016-09-27', 1, N'Sincerely only time will tell about this device. This is only my first few days using it but so far it has been more of a headache than it needed to be. So first physical impressions are good. The device looks well built, sturdy and heavy. No fancy random colors just a nice black that will match anyone''s setup. The cable is flexible and braided but sincerely the length of the cable is to be desired. Most folks have their PC on the right side of their desk and since this device is supposed to be on your furthest left than it would be understandable to have given it a little extra to accommodate for it. But I just used a USB extension and it all works fine. Second comes the setup... and this is when the shortcomings start to happen. Why as many others have said would you require an account in order to use the program software??? This got to be the most ridiculous thing I have seen in my PC gaming years. My Logitech mouse didn''t require it, my Corsair keyboard didn''t require it and...'),
(N'Tyler', N'Murphy', N'tyler.murphy4708@example.com', '2016-09-27', 5, N'The best game ever'),
(N'Lucia', N'Okonkwo', N'lucia.okonkwo2478@example.com', '2016-09-27', 5, N'Easy to apply and not a single bubble. Best screen protector ever!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Singh', N'ryan.singh3628@example.com', '2016-09-27', 5, N'AWESOME CONSOLE! I got mine at walmart, the menus are quick the whole interface is great!'),
(N'Edward', N'Sullivan', N'edward.sullivan8294@example.org', '2016-09-27', 4, N'my grandson likes this. He''s older.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Young', N'katherine.young5090@example.org', '2016-09-28', 4, N'Fan of GTA game on NDS. If you like GTA5, you may not like this one.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Young', N'katherine.young5090@example.org', '2016-09-28', 4, N'Really enjoy the game, if it can have more relation with the movie, could be 5 stars.'),
(N'Judith', N'Myers', N'judith.myers6664@example.org', '2016-09-28', 5, N'I absolutely love the far cry series and the graphics were just mind blowing on this one, like the stories more than the other far cry s. Pagan min is the bad guy of the year. riding elephants was awesome. Might go back and play this game again in a few year cause its was just so much fun.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Clark', N'yuki.clark1154@example.org', '2016-09-28', 2, N'well it it didn''t fit my ps3 big fat so should have readed more before al well it happens.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Clark', N'ronald.clark7125@example.com', '2016-09-28', 5, N'Arrived quickly and works. My only complaint is that the new 3DS XL does not come with a charger out-of-box, which is very stupid.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Evans', N'benjamin.evans5940@example.com', '2016-09-29', 4, N'The only quirk with this keyboard that might bother some is the combination of the arrow keys and the number pad, and I do find it slightly cumbersome at times, but as I do not use the arrow keys in any games, and only to navigate certain aspects of Windows at times, it''s not too bad. Keep in mind that your Delete, Print Screen, and some other functions are included in this combination, so you will have to press the NUMLK key if you need to take a screenshot, or use delete, or a few other functions. Decide if this is an issue before purchasing. Other than the slight annoyance of using NUMLK sometimes when I need to switch key functions, this keyboard is flawless. Perfect anti-ghosting allows you to use as many keys as you want at the same time, the Windows lock button to prevent you tabbing out of games by accident is great, and the LED brightness control (as well as setting it to just the WASD keys!) is great. Build quality seems strong so far, nice mechanical keys.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Myers', N'olivia.myers2728@example.org', '2016-09-29', 3, N'Wow it ends fast even with doing all the side missions. Wait till the game of the year edition because as of now it is a big ass dlc cash grab BS'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Wang', N'jennifer.wang7418@example.net', '2016-09-29', 5, N'I bought this mostly for ''Golden Axe'', but the other games don''t hurt either.. although one is ''echo the dolphin'' which I never had interest in, and the other is sonic pinball.. which is impossible unless your insane or lucky enough to beat any level past the first level. its like asteroids and joust, they''re great to have in your collection but don''t rely on these for fun, they''re all but physically impossible to beat. it was hard enough on the sega.. and with no save feature for sonic pinball, its just as hard here. - Three classic games originally on the sega genesis via GBA cartridge, sonic pinball, golden axe, and echo the dolphin now ported to GBA and playable on the DS like they deserve to be - Golden axe Is multiplayer but NOT on the DS lite, but two carts or more at your own risk, at least two GBA''s plus the link cable required'),
(N'Kelly', N'Roberts', N'kelly.roberts3681@example.com', '2016-09-29', 5, N'the atmosphere is great. the kills are good. they did a very good job at making sheva. she looks beautiful when she gets the jungle outfit. the bad thing is you have to beat the game and collect all the emblems that are hidden in the game to get her to look that way, its painstaking. fighting jill was is pretty cool. has jiggle effect.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Roberts', N'kelly.roberts3681@example.com', '2016-09-29', 5, N'this is a very cool game. you can make the worrier chick the way you want and have her run around in underwear with a gang of chicks killing medieval creatures. it has the jiggle effect. the thing that sucks is you need armor to fight the bosses and win.'),
(N'Susan', N'Suzuki', N'susan.suzuki6179@example.net', '2016-09-29', 5, N'Grandson loves this game.'),
(N'Janet', N'Patel', N'janet.patel3436@example.org', '2016-09-29', 5, N'Awesome game great for co-op'),
(N'Lucia', N'Wilson', N'lucia.wilson5654@example.org', '2016-09-29', 3, N'Enjoying the game so far. A lot of customizing to fit play style - arcade style if you feel like tearing sh*t up - or - simulation if you feel like testing your reflexes/skills (fine tuning included). That being said, was curios what the "ultimate" edition fully included, so did a quick search, when outta nowhere.... My wallet slid out of my pocket, laughed hysterically, yelled at me for not doing my research ahead of time, all while repeatedly b*tch slapping me in the face. Why a $100 "ultimate" edition doesn''t include future expansions is beyond me. Not surprised - I should''ve seentit - just pissed off and disappointed they didn''t explain/announce this ahead of time. Really didn''t want to give this a bad rating, because the game is good, but after feeling like someone pulled a fast one on me, I had to voice. Just avoid the "Ultimate" edition (your wallet and pride will thank you). Edit 10/4/16: On my 3rd attempt to get my pre-order bonus code. Amazon customer support started off...'),
(N'Steven', N'Sullivan', N'steven.sullivan1167@example.net', '2016-09-29', 4, N'One of the best version of the game. The reason is... if you suck at the combos you could always just tap on the screen. It doesn''t have everything the console version have, but it gets the job done.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Butler', N'cynthia.butler7364@example.net', '2016-09-30', 5, N'Awesome Game. Love the different characters and adventures. I love the hordes!!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Scott', N'nadia.scott5104@example.net', '2016-09-30', 5, N'I have a brother who was considered mentally handicapped (past away). He was always rough with his controllers. Whether it was Atari, Sega, PS2 or PS3, my parents always had to replace controllers. Every Easter, Birthday, and Christmas he was given a new one, but surprisingly he never once needed to replace his PS4 controller. The system was given to my nephew, who is also rough with his controllers, and after a total of 2.5 years the controller is still going strong. I wish I had that luck, but I myself am rough with controllers too, though that is on me (I throw them), over all these have been the best made controllers Sony has put out. Their lightweight, comfortable to use, and highly responsive. Sonys subtle changes such as rounded handle ends, spreading the sticks apart, trigger style R2 and L2 buttons, and providing greater stick resistance really makes these controllers stand apart from other Sony controllers.'),
(N'Robert', N'Brooks', N'robert.brooks8328@example.com', '2016-09-30', 5, N'The game made me cry... several times. I don''t normally cry as a general rule for life, but damnit this game made me tear up three or four times. It''s well worth the price!'),
(N'Robert', N'Brooks', N'robert.brooks8328@example.com', '2016-09-30', 2, N'Game is ok, I take some issue with the mechanics - particularly with the crafting and hunting systems. Wild animals are nowhere near where the map tells you they are. Also, combat is supposed to be the draw for this game, but I found it tedious and repetitive - not challenging or fun.'),
(N'Emily', N'Reed', N'emily.reed9488@example.net', '2016-09-30', 5, N'Fantastic game! Really, love the whole choosing your story. Among all the games I''ve played with choosing your story, Life is Strange is my favorite. Much better than Until Dawn. And it''s got lots of details in every environment for you to find and learn more back story on all the character. Really interesting gameplay mechanics too with the whole time warp back and have new conversations. I highly recommend.'),
(N'Jose', N'Ali', N'jose.ali6179@example.net', '2016-09-30', 5, N'Good game, fun game. Challenging, at least for me.'),
(N'Charles', N'Reyes', N'charles.reyes6641@example.org', '2016-09-30', 5, N'This is the first generation Xbox One controller so it doesn''t have the 3.5 headphone jack or the back grip nor does it include batteries. If you could accept these drawbacks than this is one hell of a deal! Great as a second/back up controller'),
(N'Shirley', N'Hughes', N'shirley.hughes3662@example.org', '2016-09-30', 5, N'Roomy, easy for my 6 year old to use and nice price.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Price', N'jessica.price5101@example.net', '2016-09-30', 5, N'Exactly how a collectors edition should be and not to pricey.'),
(N'Gary', N'Cook', N'gary.cook5831@example.net', '2016-09-30', 3, N'I''ve been playing FUT since 14 and this is the most horribly scripted game ever. How I usually get all the coins were by playing single mode and go up to division 2~3 and by the time I have tons of coins and the given packs. But EA increase the difficulty and now pro level feels like legendary. Even semi-pro, which I used to beat by 8-0, feels like world class. Seriously, they just want money money money.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Chavez', N'marcus.chavez7951@example.org', '2016-10-01', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Mei', N'Flores', N'mei.flores9724@example.net', '2016-10-01', 5, N'Works as intended. What more could you ask for?'),
(N'Nadia', N'Gray', N'nadia.gray8107@example.org', '2016-10-01', 4, N'The gameplay/physics etc is amazing. The sounds and graphics are awesome as well. My only real gripe is that the presentation is pretty lacking and the career mode is very bland and doesn''t flow very well from start to finish. But all in all it is a very challenging and thus a very rewarding racing game once you get over the learning curve. I love rally games and this is one of the best you can find.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Tanaka', N'sarah.tanaka7012@example.com', '2016-10-02', 2, N'Not really a fan of these types of games but if you like MMORPG and elder scrolls, then this is the game for you.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Thomas', N'nicole.thomas3089@example.net', '2016-10-02', 5, N'Much better for men with bigger hands.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Johnson', N'jacob.johnson8770@example.com', '2016-10-02', 5, N'Works like it should for my PSVita'),
(N'Donna', N'Nelson', N'donna.nelson1054@example.org', '2016-10-02', 4, N'Worked just fine.'),
(N'Donna', N'Nelson', N'donna.nelson1054@example.org', '2016-10-02', 4, N'Great. :)'),
(N'Michelle', N'Murphy', N'michelle.murphy6447@example.com', '2016-10-02', 5, N'this is perfect for displaying of my Amiibo figures they look nice on top of my book case'),
(N'Jacob', N'Collins', N'jacob.collins5753@example.org', '2016-10-02', 5, N'Great game, I''m not even a batman fan and I fell in love with the game'),
(N'Ivan', N'Campbell', N'ivan.campbell1913@example.com', '2016-10-02', 5, N'I''d like to state that this review is only for the Amiibo itself and not the packaging. Additionally, I''m not concerned with the in-game compatibility with these because I don''t own the new Kirby game yet; simply like to collect these guys. The new line of Kirby Amiibo''s are incredible. From the weight, to the coloring (none of the ones I picked up had any printing mistakes - and I''m the guy in the story holding up three different versions of the same figure to compare), to the over all aesthetic of the characters is exactly what I look for in Amiibo. Even though most of the characters are reprints from the Super Smash Bros. line of Amiibo in different poses, I really appreciate that Nintendo gave them a distinct feel. This figure is so freaking adorable. If you buy only one Amiibo from this line, grab this guy because this is the first time Waddle Dee has been made into an Amiibo.'),
(N'Michael', N'Hughes', N'michael.hughes4708@example.net', '2016-10-03', 1, N'I was only able to play this game on a 2 day PlayStation Plus trial and then it was forcing me to sign up for a monthly subscription in order to keep playing. I will NEVER pay to play a game!! It''s bulls***. Lesson learned'),
(N'Mary', N'Rogers', N'mary.rogers3295@example.com', '2016-10-03', 5, N'My son already had this game but the console just stopped recognizing it (no scratches no nothing). Found it affordable to buy a new one and worked like a charm.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Jones', N'marcus.jones1043@example.net', '2016-10-03', 1, N'What a crap game. So much fun leveling up and than nothing. The game just ends. The couple little tasks they give you are repetitive and boring. What a great layout of a game gone to waste. Unimaginative.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Turner', N'nicholas.turner2807@example.com', '2016-10-03', 5, N'Much cheaper than an xbox branded controller and comes with a cable. It''s a bargain. It''s the same exact controller, with a USB cable (it also works wirelessly) but it''s in a PC branded box and cheaper. It works perfectly fine as a wireless controller for xbox one. It is NOT just for PC. Save yourself a few bucks and get this. Note: As of time of review my controller did NOT have the 3.5mm headphone jack, so that is one difference.'),
(N'Amara', N'Kowalski', N'amara.kowalski2153@example.com', '2016-10-03', 2, N'Ghost Recon really took a nose dive after the first incarnation. The first Ghost Recon was an excellent tactical team shooter and military sim. Everything about it was mostly fantastic and it was much loved by many. Then the game developers tried to fix something that wasn''t broke. They added a bunch of crap that didn''t need to be added and cluttered the screen with a bunch of stuff that detracts from the game. Advanced War fighter 2 is one of the most annoying military style shooting games I''ve ever played. I absolutely hate the format of nearly everything in the game. The game doesn''t feel remotely realistic at all. The original Ghost Recon was far better in nearly every way.'),
(N'James', N'Baker', N'james.baker2005@example.org', '2016-10-03', 4, N'a fun and very challenging but seems to make you race the same type of races more than others + as you reach the top tears they block too many races together in one event and you cant really stop after three or four races & come back to it later without having to restart the whole thing over.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Brown', N'kenneth.brown3486@example.net', '2016-10-03', 5, N'I''ve held off on upgrading my keyboard for a long time. I used to just play with whatever came with the machine and was content not knowing anything better. When that keyboard was just no longer usable I decided to get a real upgrade and see what it was about. I did do some research beforehand and went to a brick and mortar store to try some out before deciding on this one. Holy cow. I now know why gaming keyboards are priced the way they are. This is the best experience I''ve ever had typing or gaming, and I''ve been using a computer for the better part of 20 years. The most important thing to me was tactile feedback and this thing has got that down pat. Switching to mechanical keyboards is one the best quality of life improvements to gaming I''ve done. The satisfying click sound makes everything worth it, and it is amazing the difference between this and the keyboards I''d been using. The backlighting is nice and it works well, improving the visibility a lot. I haven''t mapped any of...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Baker', N'aaron.baker8994@example.org', '2016-10-03', 2, N'I couldn''t figure out how to get it to work. Maybe it''s o.k. I still have it. I think I might have to put it out.'),
(N'Megan', N'Murphy', N'megan.murphy2403@example.com', '2016-10-04', 4, N'Great way to learn. I get minor lag and my A string at the 14th fret doesn''t register, despite repeated tuning.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Lopez', N'patrick.lopez8662@example.com', '2016-10-04', 3, N'Game could''ve been better in my opinion. I think I preffered one of the older ROTK games where you had a little more control in the war aspect of the game. I started to abuse the option where I just let my people govern themselves once I had taken enough territory which started to make the game rather dry.'),
(N'George', N'Nowak', N'george.nowak1401@example.com', '2016-10-04', 5, N'Perfect Thanks!!!'),
(N'Luis', N'Rodriguez', N'luis.rodriguez7323@example.net', '2016-10-04', 5, N'It''s a Razer. The quality is worth the lifespan. My last one was with me for five years. These are the best mid price gaming mouse''s imo.'),
(N'Maria', N'Nguyen', N'maria.nguyen1367@example.com', '2016-10-04', 5, N'I am using this as my daily mouse, but also with games. I love all the button options and it is one of the best I have ever used'),
(N'Helen', N'Ferreira', N'helen.ferreira9230@example.com', '2016-10-04', 5, N'This is my first fight stick. Bought it to use on my pc to play Killer Instinct. No complaints and it seems to handle my button mashing just fine haha.'),
(N'Betty', N'Roberts', N'betty.roberts7989@example.net', '2016-10-04', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Ryan', N'Price', N'ryan.price3747@example.net', '2016-10-05', 5, N'great product -- thank you!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Flores', N'jeremy.flores8280@example.com', '2016-10-05', 5, N'If you''re a fan of simple old-school shooters like Galaga, this game is great. If you''re play it on a handheld capable of color, this game makes great use of its limited 3 color-palette. Its easy to forget it isn''t in full color sometimes.(Which is probably partially due to the game being set in space, but still, its nice to look at)'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Raghunathan', N'jennifer.raghunathan8570@example.net', '2016-10-05', 3, N'Achievement hunters only need apply.'),
(N'Mary', N'Rogers', N'mary.rogers3295@example.com', '2016-10-05', 5, N'Worked perfectly!!!'),
(N'William', N'Howard', N'william.howard4803@example.org', '2016-10-05', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Garcia', N'evelyn.garcia9488@example.com', '2016-10-05', 5, N'Everything was in the box & was a great gift for my little brother.'),
(N'Scott', N'Ward', N'scott.ward2191@example.org', '2016-10-05', 4, N'Having owned this mouse for several years, the rubberized coating on the top has broken down to the point where it feels like the mouse is always covered in something like dried maple syrup. I''ve tried sanding it down, but it doesn''t go away no matter what I try. It still works, no other problems, but the grip coating WILL eventually wear out and you''ll wind up looking for a new mouse.'),
(N'Jason', N'King', N'jason.king9968@example.net', '2016-10-05', 5, N'It''s expensive, but if you hate wires like me... it can''t be beat. I''m an avid World of Warcraft player and I could never use a different mouse now. It''s simply the best out there.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Perry', N'sandra.perry1661@example.org', '2016-10-05', 5, N'it works as advertised'),
(N'Barbara', N'Cruz', N'barbara.cruz5281@example.net', '2016-10-06', 5, N'If you''ve had a good time with destiny this expansion is no different. if you don''t have a fire team go to destinylfg.net there''s a ton of people looking for a fire team to run mission strikes crucible and raids with. I''m having a great time with the new expansion and everyone I''m playing with seems to dig it too.'),
(N'Donna', N'Ortiz', N'donna.ortiz7840@example.com', '2016-10-06', 5, N'AWESOME CONTROLLER. THE BATTLE FRONT GAME SUCKS THOUGH LOL'),
(N'Anna', N'Price', N'anna.price3129@example.net', '2016-10-06', 5, N'If you''re looking for a cheap replacement for your genuine Genesis 6-button pad, then this is it. From what I remember, the layout''s exactly the same. I''ve beaten Sonic 3 & Knuckles with it, and played many other games here and there, and it''s been holding up fine. It''s as responsive as the original, and the build quality seems more or less the same. My only complaint is the button presses feel a bit more stiff and noisy than the original, but it''s still perfectly playable. I recommend it, especially at this price.'),
(N'Scott', N'Richardson', N'scott.richardson4064@example.org', '2016-10-06', 5, N'One great system and a bundle at that. Non stop fun and back in the days experience.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Jenkins', N'zachary.jenkins5584@example.com', '2016-10-06', 1, N'So i installed this and the left trigger stopped working. so i took it apart and reinstalled these and the left trigger didn''t work. I then took it apart while plugged into the xbox, and when i click a thumbstick into the left thumb stick dome, the left trigger stops working. when i take the thumbsticks off, TRIGGER WORKS. My only guess is that the left trigger wires run around the dome.. and somehow the magnet in these are interfering with the signal. So sad, these are SO WELL MADE.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Jenkins', N'lisa.jenkins7950@example.com', '2016-10-06', 5, N'This is a good article easy to use and very good material recommend it ...'),
(N'Lisa', N'Jenkins', N'lisa.jenkins7950@example.com', '2016-10-06', 5, N'Very good article I recommend it ...'),
(N'Luis', N'Wright', N'luis.wright4794@example.org', '2016-10-06', 4, N'You see, I greatly enjoyed the first game. Though it had flaws, like the inability to go to certain areas, overall it was a fantastic experience and one that I went through at least twice. This one is supposed to be more of the same, and in reality it is with some extra overpoweredness. But what really bugged on this one: it simply didn''t make any sense. - In the first game, you are whisked away. Mind you, you''re like level 80 or something. In this game, they reset you back down to 40 even if you load save data. This is a HUGE turn off. What they should have done is let you keep everything you earned in the first game, instead you get a few pity items and little else. You don''t even get to keep wearing your Class VII uniform (you''re forced to beat the game to get it back. Why? He''s wearing it at the beginning of the game!) - The new Cryptids are a significant challenge, but never to the point you feel like you''re going to lose. It''s more like they abuse skills to get an unfair...'),
(N'Lucia', N'Nelson', N'lucia.nelson5579@example.org', '2016-10-07', 5, N'Nothing surprising in this set, but it does feature a beautiful iteration of the top-notch puzzle game, Puzzle League, which is arguably more addictive than Tetris and certainly boasts better multiplayer.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Tanaka', N'rebecca.tanaka1497@example.net', '2016-10-07', 5, N'Genuine Nintendo product and works perfectly. Love the Luigi theme.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Jones', N'joseph.jones2759@example.com', '2016-10-07', 5, N'Good game so far. Great graphics and lots of fun. Sound''s are solid and the unreal engine is flawless as always in delivering a great game.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Omar', N'Jackson', N'omar.jackson7003@example.org', '2016-10-07', 2, N'This year''s game is extremely similar to last year''s. The My Career story isn''t exactly a story but more like a few cutscenes in between every few games. Gameplay is still broken as sometimes the view is from under the stadium and the game also frequently lags out. Many of the Commentator''s phrases are repeated very periodically and 2K servers are still broken (as usual). There is a few patches that have come out but none of them seem to be fixing the problem. Most likely 2K doesn''t know how to fix their servers as it would have been done by now. Once you overlook most of these issues the game is pretty fun and has more fluid graphics. New controls have been added such as buttons for different passes (bounce & overhead). To all the annual buyers I would pass on this year''s and update your 2K16 roster. To the first buyers, this game is a good introduction into the 2K basketball world. I will update if 2K fixes any of these issues.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Kowalski', N'christopher.kowalski5529@example.org', '2016-10-07', 5, N'Arrive on time and was easy to install on my Xbox 360. I did use a transfer cable (purchased separately) to transfer the data from my old disk drive to this new one. Everything went smoothly.'),
(N'Michael', N'Thompson', N'michael.thompson8193@example.com', '2016-10-07', 5, N'Excellent game and series. Highly recommended. As I mentioned in the other reviews, the bouncing camera effect can take a bit to get used to. I''m not sure why they added it since it does nothing for the game, especially since many people get motion sickness.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ward', N'ravi.ward7250@example.com', '2016-10-08', 5, N'Soooo cute! Took forever to get here from Japan, but I knew that going in. It''s super cute and even comfy to use thanks to the plush covering on the length of the stylus. The cord isn''t really helpful as it''s too short to really use it while attached, but it was a nice thought. Doesn''t take away from the cute factor in any way. Love it!'),
(N'Susan', N'Evans', N'susan.evans1544@example.net', '2016-10-08', 5, N'Games cases. Like it'),
(N'Ravi', N'Murphy', N'ravi.murphy7082@example.com', '2016-10-08', 5, N'Very nice case.'),
(N'Dee', N'Campbell', N'dee.campbell9423@example.org', '2016-10-09', 5, N'Love the game a little confusing but you can pick up fast once you get the hang of it.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Boyd', N'jeffrey.boyd5599@example.com', '2016-10-09', 5, N'Best game ever. Great graphics and realism plus lots of adventures. Worth every penny. I love the Arena, the gyro copter and the Shangri-la.'),
(N'Paul', N'King', N'paul.king8555@example.net', '2016-10-09', 5, N'This is the best keyboard I have ever bought. I''ve spilled a beer on it, huge cups of water, too many times. Nothing is broken. If this was a logitech keyboard it would be three times dead, or at least have a couple dead keys.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Clark', N'sharon.clark2264@example.com', '2016-10-09', 5, N'Great replacement item.'),
(N'Laura', N'Ali', N'laura.ali1219@example.net', '2016-10-09', 5, N'Works great! Superior image quality to traditional Yellow / Red / White video cable that came with the Nintendo 64 / SNES / Gamecube. No image problems that I read about other video cables having. If you have S-Video input on your TV then this is the cable to get for your N64 / SNES / Gamecube.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Wright', N'joshua.wright4048@example.com', '2016-10-10', 5, N'Love the game , Great Comeback'),
(N'Frank', N'Reed', N'frank.reed7044@example.net', '2016-10-10', 5, N'A lot easier to control the mouse when it''s this size!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Long', N'melissa.long4473@example.org', '2016-10-10', 5, N'love it!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Brooks', N'jacqueline.brooks4471@example.net', '2016-10-10', 4, N'product as advertised'),
(N'Luis', N'Suzuki', N'luis.suzuki7748@example.net', '2016-10-10', 5, N'I played Rise of the Tomb Raider before this and LOVED IT, so decided to give this a shot. I honestly wasn''t expecting it to be anywhere near as good as Rise was but I was utterly blown away. I freakin'' LOVE this game, it''s just as good as Rise, with an even better map, in my opinion. The game mechanics are pretty much identical, so it''s a helluva journey. This is hands down one of the best games I''ve played on the Xbox One and wholeheartedly recommend it.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Stewart', N'jennifer.stewart9929@example.org', '2016-10-10', 5, N'This headphone has great sound. It can be used wired with a standard audio cable(included) or wireless with a special transmitter which is included(this is NOT Bluetooth; the transmitter is dedicated to this headphone). First of all, this can be used with anything that has an audio jack(wired) or anything with a USB port(wireless). You are not restricted using it with PlayStation 4. When used wired, the volume control on the headphone will not work and you don''t actually have to turn it on in the first place. Of course, you must turn it on in wireless mode. There is a mode button that will turn the bass boost on and off. This is extremely well padded and comfortable. It is fully adjustable. Just be sure you don''t loose the transmitter!'),
(N'Jason', N'Rivera', N'jason.rivera6642@example.net', '2016-10-10', 5, N'Love It'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Perry', N'jonathan.perry1629@example.com', '2016-10-10', 5, N'My son absolutely loves this! Easy as pie to set up and use, and zero lag! We''d definitely buy it again and will be buying the Mayflash adapters for other systems he owns. Highly recommend!'),
(N'Anita', N'Diaz', N'anita.diaz9217@example.net', '2016-10-10', 5, N'The ultimate edition is awesome, the amount of extra content is great! Now the game itself, it blows my mind! The graphics are so clear, crisp, and realistic looking that sometimes it''s hard to even tell it''s a game and not video. The car options and customization allows even the smallest details to be personalized exactly how you want, yet the system is still simple enough for non car enthusiasts to understand and utilize. This is the best racing game on the market, period.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Ward', N'brenda.ward9015@example.net', '2016-10-11', 5, N'Item received as described with fast shipping.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Suzuki', N'sofia.suzuki8049@example.net', '2016-10-11', 4, N'I love this thing! It''s a very nice mousepad and it''s full of features but you have to diwload an additional app to use audio visualizers.'),
(N'Mark', N'Peterson', N'mark.peterson6867@example.org', '2016-10-11', 4, N'First off, Amazon DID supply the Goldberg code. I got an email from them last night. If you didn''t, do a customer service chat and ask them for it. And I''m not much of a wrestling game player, but a big fan of Goldberg. This is fun. I wish there weren''t all the optional characters (such as The Rock) but this is still a lot of fun. Great graphics. Like watching TV. My only criticism is Goldberg shouldn''t have been separate. But I''m glad he''s in it.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Ortiz', N'amanda.ortiz2555@example.com', '2016-10-11', 4, N'Works well, I guess'),
(N'Amanda', N'Ortiz', N'amanda.ortiz2555@example.com', '2016-10-11', 5, N'Super-convenient and saves a ton on batteries. Can be a bit difficult to seat into the charger. I appreciate that it leaves the controller unmodified so you can pop in some regular batteries if you''re in a really long session.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Johnson', N'kyle.johnson3005@example.com', '2016-10-11', 4, N'I like the headset for the most part. I''ve never worn a headset or even over-the-ear headphones before so it''s definitely something to get used to. I decided to pick up a headset because a long time friend of mine told me to get the video game Destiny and I needed to use voice chat to play with him. I find the cushioning may not be soft enough around the ears; it feels like a lot of pressure around some of the muscle/tissue. I also noticed my ears were getting sweaty after a while. I''m assuming this is just because I never wear anything around my ears though. When I press the cushioning with my hand it definitely feels quite soft. I tested them out with a 3D audio video on YouTube and I think they sound really good, almost like I didn''t have anything on. I didn''t like that it only came it a resealable plastic bag and not a box, but it''s not that important. Another thing is that the description on the product page says that the 3.5mm plug is gold plated, but the plug coming directly...'),
(N'Jason', N'Boyd', N'jason.boyd5677@example.net', '2016-10-11', 5, N'Played it on Xbox One because I couldn''t wait for the PS4 release. Phenomenal then and phenomenal now. So excited to replay and platinum on my PS4.'),
(N'William', N'Lee', N'william.lee8782@example.net', '2016-10-11', 5, N'an awesome game'),
(N'Peter', N'Kowalski', N'peter.kowalski4686@example.net', '2016-10-11', 4, N'This is a good stylus. The small ridge at the top helps keep the stylus in your 3DS stylus slot. The fact that it has some resizing capabilities is cool, but I haven''t found much of a use for it since styluses are already small.'),
(N'Dee', N'Khan', N'dee.khan2123@example.org', '2016-10-11', 5, N'love the new features this game has to offer, especially the fighting in the crowd! THIS IS AWESOME'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2016-10-12', 5, N'the final fantasy mystic quest video game for the super nintendo is the greatest video game in the universe a true classic the best of the best the final fantasy mystic quest video game for the super nintendo rocks ^_^'),
(N'Michael', N'Morales', N'michael.morales8043@example.com', '2016-10-12', 1, N'Stops working after a few months. It constantly slides off my head. The materials are cheap and tacky. The audio quality is terrible.'),
(N'Angela', N'Evans', N'angela.evans2609@example.com', '2016-10-12', 5, N'A favorite game - had to have it in our library after we rented it to try it out.'),
(N'Megan', N'Mitchell', N'megan.mitchell4172@example.org', '2016-10-12', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Samantha', N'Boyd', N'samantha.boyd7241@example.org', '2016-10-12', 2, N'Take Civ 5, remove everything that made each civilization unique, then reskin it as a "space" game and you''ve got Beyond Earth. Actually, Beyond Earth is worse than that -- they don''t have good quotes from historical figures or books; instead they''re made up nonsense from fictitious people in the game. You land on the planet and found your first city, but you have no idea what the map looks like because your astronauts are too stupid to take a few photos from space before landing. There are fewer victory types available -- for example, cultural victory and diplomatic victory have been removed in this game.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Fisher', N'stephanie.fisher1713@example.com', '2016-10-12', 5, N'I love this system. It really is a one stop shop for all of my television entertainment, I only need to recover the halo master chief collection games and I''m set. Tech support for the recovery of the other programs has been excellent. Hopefully I can get another console for the bedroom soon.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Morales', N'aaron.morales2363@example.org', '2016-10-12', 5, N'i loved it'),
(N'Sandra', N'Johnson', N'sandra.johnson6534@example.net', '2016-10-12', 4, N'The cover is nice and the grips feel nice, but the grips interfere with the motion of the stick. That''s OK since I only got this for the cover.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Hughes', N'olivia.hughes9373@example.com', '2016-10-12', 1, N'it is kinda foolish to pay $60 for A YEAR OLD game for DLC content i don''t care about. also, if you search ''Rise of the Tomb Raider Input Lag PS4'' on youtube, then you will find people showing input lag not fixed in ps4. they had a whole year to fix it. they still epic fail. they are charging us $60 for that input lag epic fail. no, it is not worth the wait for $60 A YEAR OLD game with input lag epic fail --------------------------- survival instinct broke the gameplay immersion like reboot. but without it, you sorta cant easily find the things you looking for. but there should be better way to replace survival instinct, so yup developer epic fail 1>it will be nice to have mini map that show things 2>things should also glow within your proximity. this game mostly does not focus on combat. it focus on exploring for things. it is kinda idiotic to explore things without survival instinct, but survival instinct really break gameplay immersion. they really need to use mini map and make...'),
(N'Mateo', N'Reed', N'mateo.reed6983@example.org', '2016-10-12', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Jackson', N'jonathan.jackson1872@example.org', '2016-10-12', 1, N'I''m not paying $60 for an old game that is cheaper on another console. Maybe I will play this when it''s $20, if I still remember.'),
(N'Amara', N'Okonkwo', N'amara.okonkwo8793@example.net', '2016-10-12', 3, N'Its good but it sucks you cant adjust it on the xbox like you can on PC. You can increase voice monitoring but not by much and you really cant tell unless the mic is super close to your mouth. I also wish the actual amp had a mute button.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Lewis', N'sharon.lewis5375@example.org', '2016-10-12', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Kelly', N'Watson', N'kelly.watson7508@example.net', '2016-10-13', 3, N'Its alright I guess. I bought it for them sweet vita exclusive japanese games but sadly they have started porting them to PC on Steam so I''m like damn I didn''t need this after all. Also the Crash and Spyro ps1 classics are not available for the vita in the ps store which made me mad. Overall I regret buying it.'),
(N'Gary', N'Thompson', N'gary.thompson8316@example.net', '2016-10-13', 5, N'great series'),
(N'Mateo', N'Morgan', N'mateo.morgan3317@example.com', '2016-10-13', 5, N'The storyline is pretty good and it''s also an open world game, so you can explore and do other stuff. I can''t wait for GTA 6.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Ramos', N'raymond.ramos2082@example.com', '2016-10-13', 5, N'Have always loved this game and will continue to play is no matter how old I am. Lots of twists and turns.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Chavez', N'douglas.chavez6119@example.com', '2016-10-14', 5, N'good'),
(N'Thomas', N'Diaz', N'thomas.diaz1178@example.com', '2016-10-14', 5, N'back when wrestling games was good and not a copy and paste series like today''s wwe games that got tookover by 2k'),
(N'Carol', N'Davis', N'carol.davis6461@example.net', '2016-10-14', 1, N'it didn''t work for me. I gave it away to someone else.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Hernandez', N'barbara.hernandez9118@example.net', '2016-10-14', 3, N'This game don''t work on my GameCube.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Bailey', N'nicholas.bailey5908@example.org', '2016-10-14', 4, N'This is a great package, as Blizzard C.E.''s are known to be, and this is likely the best expansion to date.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Wright', N'lisa.wright6214@example.net', '2016-10-14', 3, N'3 might be a little harsh, but I''m hypersensitive about this game. They should have done better, and in some ways I think the game is worse. First off the gameplay is different, more organic, more rag doll, not as l easy to cheese. This is the best thing about the game. If you are a 2K collector, or just a collector, sure get the Kobe Legacy Gold Edition. However if you aren''t a collector I wouldn''t bother with it. The best part is the 100K of VC, but you''ll blow through it fast. I got it cuz I''m a huge Kobe fan, but disappointed what you get. A Kobe poster that''s just a replica of the cover, a mouse pad of the cover that I thought was lame, but if you need a mouse pad sure. A Kobe Topps card, that I thought was cool. A Kobe controller skin, but that won''t last long. The in game Kobe My Team is a 5 game card, I thought that was weak. Were paying $100 for this edition and we can''t get a permanent Kobe card ? The shoe collection isn''t complete only some off his shoes, that was false...'),
(N'Anita', N'Diaz', N'anita.diaz9217@example.net', '2016-10-14', 5, N'This cable works great for me, charges whether I''m using the 3DS or not, and lets me charge it on the go. It''s a great thing to have and for the price I can''t imagine a better option. I highly recommend this to anyone looking for the versatility of USB chargers for their 3DS!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Rogers', N'samuel.rogers2451@example.com', '2016-10-15', 5, N'my boys love it'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Jimenez', N'kathleen.jimenez2657@example.org', '2016-10-15', 5, N'this is my first scribblenauts game so it took a while to figure things out. Let''s get things straight. Don''t make villains dead or immobile. You need them alive. Other than that it''s a great game. I like that you have to use your imagination sometimes and that you can make your own superheroes and make actual dc superheroes and Villans. and there is a lot of action for a scribblenauts game cause, yeah, superheroes. But I do not like it when mister mxyzptlk shows up and gives you a challenge that sometimes affects what you can create. Then it makes it impossible to complete a request. Overall I''m pretty sure its the best Scribblenauts game ever.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Castillo', N'ryan.castillo9943@example.org', '2016-10-15', 5, N'Great for a legend of zelda fan!'),
(N'Wei', N'Powell', N'wei.powell9699@example.com', '2016-10-15', 5, N'Doom is back and is better than ever. The must play reimaging of classic Doom. If I could give it 10 stars I would. A must play.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Nguyen', N'patrick.nguyen4365@example.com', '2016-10-15', 4, N'Gamers will probably get mad and dislike the review and chew me out because no, I don''t have an XBox. I got this because it says it''s PC compatible and I occasionally use platforms like Steam and Origin to play PC games. Mostly I make characters on The Sims 4, for which a joystick isn''t necessary, but sometimes I play other games. And have you ever tried playing Need for Speed with a keyboard? I mean steering a car with keyboard arrow keys is kind of annoying. And playing action games with a keyboard and mouse is kind of a pain too. The thing is, the gamepad doesn''t seem to work on all of my PC games on Origin and Steam. It probably depends on the age and such of the individual games. Anyway, when it does work it works like a pretty normal game control. I didn''t see much exceptional about it versus other gamepads I''ve used throughout the years. On an aesthetic point, the camouflage is barely noticeable. It''s basically black on very dark gray. I had to look closely to even see the...'),
(N'Anthony', N'Ramos', N'anthony.ramos4957@example.com', '2016-10-15', 3, N'So here it goes. I am a game designer, producer and artist; that should count for something hopefully. This game is... a little less than so so. If you come following the franchise (you know anime and first game etc), you should be fine with this game since the expectations are not an issue anymore. Me, I tried a few other games similar to this one (beat the boss, grab the parts, makes weapons and armors with them), starting with all the monster hunter series followed by Toukiden Kiwami. From the general art point of view, this game is ... lazy, like reaaally lazy. Environments and main base feels empty with few props lying here and there to try sell the environment, but they look like something put together by a group of amateurs. The "tutorial" is bad, there is little explanation on what does what, and why should I use this instead of that, ideally you should be able to play the game for a few days until you start catching up on A FEW things. The animations are the worst of it,...'),
(N'Walter', N'Nelson', N'walter.nelson5756@example.net', '2016-10-15', 4, N'For Dragon Ball fans or just someone looking for mindless fun. This game is for you. It''s a side scrolling beat em up where you can choose from the 3 main characters from Dragon Ball GT. You can get upgrades, choose your path of levels (sort of like Star Fox level select) and the graphics are surprisingly good for the time. I had fun playing this 10 years ago when it came out, a friend had it and I wouldn''t be able to stop playing it. Bought it recently for less than $7 and it''s worth every penny.'),
(N'Gary', N'Williams', N'gary.williams9138@example.org', '2016-10-16', 4, N'Good game. You can go in stealth or guns blazing. Decent graphics and voice.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Rivera', N'zachary.rivera8834@example.com', '2016-10-16', 5, N'Tested with: PS navigation controller Logitech G502 Ps4 Xbox one (wireless controller with 3.5mm output) Single player gaming Initial set up Advantage: XIM4 While the cronus max required using a pc for updating after downloading software and installing, the XIM4 only required to download the app on my iphone and ipad. Gaming setup Advantage: XIM4 (not even close) Cronusmax requires a pc connected to the device in addition to connecting to console. Both require controller to be wired while using The XIM4 requires a micro usb cable which is included while the cronus max is usb ready by itself On cronus max devices like mouse and keyboard are wired to the pc, on XIM4 these are wired to the XIM4. The XIM4 has bluetooth and it can connect to controller like the ps navigation controller. Software management Advantage: XIM4 In the cronus max the pc manages everything and that includes gamepacks and control adjustments. The XIM4 has the option of using an android or ios device to control...'),
(N'Patrick', N'Nguyen', N'patrick.nguyen4365@example.com', '2016-10-16', 4, N'Gamers will probably get mad and dislike the review and chew me out because no, I don''t have an XBox. I got this because it says it''s PC compatible and I occasionally use platforms like Steam and Origin to play PC games. Mostly I make characters on The Sims 4, for which a joystick isn''t necessary, but sometimes I play other games. And have you ever tried playing Need for Speed with a keyboard? I mean steering a car with keyboard arrow keys is kind of annoying. And playing action games with a keyboard and mouse is kind of a pain too. The thing is, the gamepad doesn''t seem to work on all of my PC games on Origin and Steam. It probably depends on the age and such of the individual games. Anyway, when it does work it works like a pretty normal game control. Despite all the jibber-jabber about "Deliverer of Truth" I didn''t see much exceptional about it versus other gamepads I''ve used throughout the years. You can take the face plate off of this and put on a different one, though this...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Gutierrez', N'amanda.gutierrez8590@example.net', '2016-10-16', 1, N'Meh, just more boring Destiny trash. I''m so mad with myself for giving Bungie more money. I''m not supporting them any more. Halo is a terrible series and Destiny is just as terrible. Don''t buy this garbage. It''s the same stuff you''ve been doing, with different scenery. I hate crucible but I read that the new one released with this is very bad. I don''t have experience with it though.'),
(N'Priya', N'Morales', N'priya.morales8782@example.com', '2016-10-16', 3, N'WWE 2K17 is the fourth offering from 2K Sports since they took over the WWE''s franchise from THQ. Ever since, there''s been a certain level of achievement, yet a certain level of inconsistency that''s prevented 2K from putting out that "phenomenal" wrestling game. That trend hasn''t ended with this release, it has merely been continued. So let''s start with what''s good. The new promo engine is great, wherein the wrestler needs to cut a promo based on their character and based on the audience they''re performing for (the latter part being something I''ve long wished in a "booker/GM" mode - More on that later.) The MyCareer mode was revamped to include a four-part tutorial where your performance dictates your rank in the WWE (do well and end up in the WWE, do poorly and end up in NXT.) All of the current WWE roster members are here, only the legends are made to be unlocked. Considering that there isn''t a "showcase" mode this season (which I didn''t miss, to be blunt), the legend wrestlers...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Brown', N'kathleen.brown5615@example.com', '2016-10-16', 5, N'Big hit with my kids, and other kids that come over.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Edwards', N'gregory.edwards8909@example.org', '2016-10-16', 2, N'I have been trying to find games that are more fun than violent. This looked interesting and I liked the idea of my choices affecting game play...but the "game" is a movie with annoying puzzles attached to tasks I have no interest in completing. I also hate when when movies do montage sequences to music..there is a ton of that in this. The concept of "rewinding time" also gets old because seeing a bad movie once is enough!'),
(N'George', N'Sanders', N'george.sanders3864@example.org', '2016-10-16', 5, N'I''m 26 years old, and this game had me addicted for two days until I finished it. Its clever. You play as WALL-E and EVE and both characters have unique abilities and game styles that perfectly mesh with the film. Its unique, in that I have never played anything like it. Picking up different types of trash cubes to solve many interesting puzzles, and flying around as EVE lent me hours of enjoyment. Also the graphics are beautiful. Its like you''re playing around in the movie! Not to mention the multiplayer minigames my son and I played together, this game in a nutshell is challenging, gorgeous, and just really fun. Good for the whole family.'),
(N'Gary', N'Williams', N'gary.williams9138@example.org', '2016-10-17', 5, N'Great graphics. Great game play. Lots of action. Good acting. Good mix of enemies. If you like shooters and you don''t like this game, you have some serious issues.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Hughes', N'pamela.hughes6879@example.com', '2016-10-17', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Janet', N'Watson', N'janet.watson6779@example.net', '2016-10-17', 5, N'I own one of the original guitars that you buy with guitar Hero and the Wii Game but everything is locked in my storage that the military is holding for me at the moment. Those were $99 dollars. And it looked very much like a dumb toy. This design, color and key sync is very good at a much better price. I wasn''t expecting much so this was a surprise.'),
(N'Christine', N'Young', N'christine.young2002@example.net', '2016-10-17', 5, N'Great flight stick, for serious flight sims or arcade flying this will do the job perfectly.'),
(N'Christine', N'Young', N'christine.young2002@example.net', '2016-10-17', 5, N'Oh yea, classic, but so, so good, with the right mods of course... I used tales of the two wastelands, which connect both fallout 3 and new vegas games making it into a whole game with added mechanics... storyline is 10/10 combat is very engaging... just get the mods to get better graphics and a dx9 patch to make it work with windows 10 and 3440x1440 monitors...'),
(N'Christine', N'Young', N'christine.young2002@example.net', '2016-10-17', 5, N'This is simply outstanding two of my top favorite PS3 games now on PS4'),
(N'Mei', N'Davis', N'mei.davis6217@example.com', '2016-10-17', 5, N'Works Awesome with my PC. thanks!'),
(N'Adam', N'Martin', N'adam.martin4055@example.com', '2016-10-17', 5, N'This is like minecraft, but now you have better graphics and can control a cutter character.'),
(N'Amara', N'Ali', N'amara.ali5160@example.org', '2016-10-18', 5, N'My favorite part of this Xbox 360 is that it''s blue and beautiful. It has served me well since I bought it and it''s still going strong.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ferreira', N'brandon.ferreira5707@example.com', '2016-10-18', 5, N'Great price for the money. Good quality.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Wood', N'tomasz.wood6426@example.org', '2016-10-18', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Christine', N'Young', N'christine.young2002@example.net', '2016-10-18', 5, N'What can I say, I loved it, I am a huge mindnight club fan, wish they would make this game for next gen consoles..'),
(N'Christine', N'Young', N'christine.young2002@example.net', '2016-10-18', 5, N'Time crisis is an amazing game, just be sure to get a ps move gun controller, will really enhance the gameplay..'),
(N'Joyce', N'Foster', N'joyce.foster9856@example.org', '2016-10-18', 4, N'Read everything in order to understand my point. Mic doesn''t work well right from the start. There are settings that need to be changed in order to have optimal quality, otherwise there will be a lot of background noise. You need to go into the recording devices, choose the sound drivers your pc comes with, do not use tge default. Then you set the recording volume to 90%, and the mic booster to +20db(or 10), and enable noise cancellation. This makes the microphone infinitely more clear and louder.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Webb', N'brandon.webb9944@example.net', '2016-10-18', 1, N'This works for cooling really well except mine makes an annoying vibration noise when it starts up and shuts down even with the xbox is off. it dos not look like i can call to ask if it normal and request a replasemint so I am hopeful to get some resolve here & will follow back up if any one gets this to correct the problome.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Lopez', N'hannah.lopez3820@example.net', '2016-10-18', 4, N'Fun, I love how you have access to much all of the characters in the game and then you have the option to add on to that. It''s just fun.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Adams', N'ivan.adams4125@example.org', '2016-10-18', 5, N'You cannot possibly go wrong with this purchase'),
(N'Ivan', N'Adams', N'ivan.adams4125@example.org', '2016-10-18', 4, N'Pretty good game however the Dunwall City Trials can crash sometimes'),
(N'Barbara', N'James', N'barbara.james7632@example.org', '2016-10-18', 5, N'I bought this for my boyfriend and he seems to really enjoy it. The first part though, the narrative part when he was learning the game and he was trying to get out of the hospital he hated it. He said that he felt like he spend the whole day watching a movie. I am not sure if there was a skip that he could have pressed and he did not know at that time but he found it really tiring. After that part he loved the game!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Gray', N'andrew.gray7135@example.org', '2016-10-18', 4, N'I wished i had gotten the fallout 4 season pass earlier when it was 29.99 but i didn''t,as most of the time season passes are worthless,call of duty season passes are a joke(a season pass should give you all of the future dlc)but i found out that fallout does include all of the dlc,and all of it is good especially far harbor,but 49.95 is expensive,which is why i only gave it 4 stars'),
(N'Andrea', N'Patel', N'andrea.patel5429@example.net', '2016-10-18', 5, N'Amazing build, software...'),
(N'Andrea', N'Patel', N'andrea.patel5429@example.net', '2016-10-18', 1, N'Stay away from this, bronken min (hang and muted) in just 4 mothsof use and it''s not my fault, i have the older version and it''s ok, different build and quality.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Morris', N'brandon.morris5339@example.org', '2016-10-19', 2, N'Imagine a different company saw Dark Souls and wanted to make a clone: That''s exactly what this game seems like. This game is sub par to the original in many ways (graphics, animations, enemies, level design), but the biggest issue to me is atmosphere. I just don''t feel like I''m in a Souls world. The story and your goal in the game is much more video-gamey. From the onset, you''re instructed to kill the bosses and become the new king. It seems like every NPC in the game expects you to do this, compared to the original, where the NPCs seemed to care less what you did. Also, there''s loads of NPCs that are doing just fine. They''re just there and ready to strike up a conversation like nothing horrible is happening in the world. Unlike the original, where you get a great sense of fear or survival from each. The main hub town plays a big part in the overall feel and atmosphere in the game. It''s a wide-open bright area with a bunch of NPCs standing around (after you collect them all) with...'),
(N'Tyler', N'Hill', N'tyler.hill8954@example.com', '2016-10-19', 4, N'love it'),
(N'Megan', N'Taylor', N'megan.taylor1609@example.net', '2016-10-19', 5, N'Best experience on planet earth.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Rogers', N'jacob.rogers6686@example.org', '2016-10-19', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ali', N'kimberly.ali7148@example.net', '2016-10-19', 5, N'The game is absolutely incredible, all the way around. I cannot say enough good things about it and I can''t find any flaws with it. It''s very fun in every aspect. People may get sick of hearing this, but it may even rival Uncharted 4. Stop reading reviews and buy it right now.'),
(N'Timothy', N'James', N'timothy.james7196@example.org', '2016-10-19', 3, N'I have been playing games passionatly for 20 years now. I gave this three stars not because its a bad product but because it could be so much better. The box this controller comes in is great. Can''t beat it for the price. The controller itself is sturdy, it can take a beating. But it always feels like plastic in your hands. The d pad and the face buttons are super squishy which is a real dissapointment. However the L and R shoulder buttons are fantastic which is really weird but Ill take it! The rest of the buttons are okay to decent. This comes with a really nice Nintendo great flat usb cord. What needs to be better is how this thing connects to devices. You have to turn it on with different button combinations, look at the lights, reset it, turn it off, turn it back on, and all sorts of weird things to get it to work. Its better than a lot of other devices in that its bluetooth is actually reliable and the latency is pretty good (could still be better). And its stand is actually...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Nowak', N'kenneth.nowak9464@example.net', '2016-10-19', 5, N'Very good!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Edwards', N'ryan.edwards8370@example.net', '2016-10-19', 5, N'Pros: - Durable plastic - Ample space for up to 12 DS games - Secure latching - Nice aesthetic presentation Cons: - Clear plastic makes scratches easily visible - Has 4 SD card slots, which seems pretty generous if you mainly play DS games Now, it won''t fit 3DS games since those cartridges have the little piece that hooks right off the top, but fits DS games nice and snugly with the proper amount of give, same with SD cards, which most other reviews seem to disagree with. The trays turn smoothly, but you might need to put them back in place in order to close the case, which takes little to no effort. Otherwise, great case to carry in your backpack or keep at your house.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Stewart', N'evelyn.stewart4684@example.net', '2016-10-19', 3, N'Similar in game action to the Virtua Fighter series makes this title a quasi-crossover. I prefer more fluid action and less rigid single shots, but if you enjoy DOA or VF, you won''t be disappointed. Story mode plays just like a movie, albeit predictable and mediocre in doing so.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Stewart', N'evelyn.stewart4684@example.net', '2016-10-19', 5, N'After being slightly dismayed by the delay in delivery Plugged in to my 32 inch Vizio with RGB input and I was relieved to see that the audio adapters were flexible enough to reach from the vga port to the composite audio ports. The cable is beautiful and well made, and the image quality can hold up to stretching without losing detail. Can''t wait for Soul Calibur to arrive!'),
(N'Betty', N'Coleman', N'betty.coleman2284@example.com', '2016-10-20', 4, N'it was a gift for my nephew, he loves it because it''s a challenge.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Perez', N'lucia.perez8914@example.com', '2016-10-20', 3, N'Good not great. I prefer Naga version better.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Campbell', N'tyler.campbell8347@example.com', '2016-10-20', 5, N'Nice videogame!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Sanders', N'barbara.sanders2036@example.net', '2016-10-20', 4, N'good'),
(N'Barbara', N'Sanders', N'barbara.sanders2036@example.net', '2016-10-20', 4, N'OK'),
(N'Aaron', N'Ortiz', N'aaron.ortiz5400@example.org', '2016-10-20', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Helen', N'Taylor', N'helen.taylor2360@example.org', '2016-10-20', 5, N':)'),
(N'Henry', N'Barnes', N'henry.barnes7151@example.com', '2016-10-20', 4, N'I got this controller to use with SMM and MK8 as an alternative to using the gamepad (I also purchased the HORI Battle Pad Pikachu verson controller as well at the same time, more about that in a moment). I have to say, this is a very solid controller and feels very durable, and it looks very cool. I got it to match with the Yoshi Wiimote, and the colors match perfectly. The Gamecube controller is my favorite style Nintendo controller and it''s very close in design. I love everything about it except one thing: the L2 and R2 shoulder buttons are set in SO deeply that they are somewhat unresponsive. The L2 R2 buttons themselves are not recessed, rather they are huge and require you to depress them down so far that it actually affects the responsiveness. None of the other buttons have an issue with this. When playing Mario Kart 8, those buttons are important, and the way they are actually hinders my gameplay. Yes you can use L1 and R1, but they''re up so much higher that it''s...'),
(N'Susan', N'Adams', N'susan.adams7174@example.net', '2016-10-20', 3, N'it was ok'),
(N'Scott', N'Thompson', N'scott.thompson6073@example.org', '2016-10-20', 5, N'Excellent game! I love the art book. It''s a treasure.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Morgan', N'kenneth.morgan6152@example.net', '2016-10-20', 3, N'This review is written in 2016. I originally played this game back when it released in 2002-2003 and I recall even then that it didn''t live up to the first 2 games in the series. Silent Hill 3 does some good things though. The sound effects are still good, the eerie feeling of using your flashlight to illuminate the dark corridors is still there although it somehow started to feel a little too familiar after the first 2 games. Combat is roughly the same although it felt tougher in this game because some enemies are just near impossible to avoid being struck by. The story is pretty decent and has many ties to the original Silent Hill game. Unfortunately you don''t actually visit Silent Hill until past the midpoint in the game, and that''s a shame. Instead you go from shopping mall to sewers to construction site to office building, etc. with none of the "open world" that the first 2 games offered. Even when you do finally actually hit the streets of Silent Hill itself, you''re limited...'),
(N'Timothy', N'Cox', N'timothy.cox4471@example.org', '2016-10-20', 5, N'Very Good!'),
(N'David', N'Diaz', N'david.diaz1285@example.org', '2016-10-21', 1, N'TERRIBLE AND BORING GAME !'),
(N'Andrew', N'Gutierrez', N'andrew.gutierrez3312@example.net', '2016-10-21', 5, N'Worked'),
(N'Sarah', N'Powell', N'sarah.powell3195@example.com', '2016-10-21', 4, N'I had fun playing it. "Cheap" version of the 3DS and good for young children.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Turner', N'benjamin.turner9444@example.org', '2016-10-21', 2, N'some functions that use the 6 axis don''t work with this controller.'),
(N'James', N'Coleman', N'james.coleman1668@example.org', '2016-10-21', 5, N'Great item/ cost, excellent/great condition, brand new, unopened item, sealed, 100% positive rating/feedback, on time, great/fast shipping'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Parker', N'tomasz.parker1452@example.com', '2016-10-21', 4, N'great game to play'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Parker', N'tomasz.parker1452@example.com', '2016-10-21', 4, N'i hope that they will make this NFC reader/writer compatible with the Nintendo switch is released. so far i have no complaints about this product except for that a family member gave me the new Nintendo 3ds as a Christmas present just weeks after purchasing this item.'),
(N'Emma', N'Hughes', N'emma.hughes5500@example.com', '2016-10-21', 5, N'short but great game'),
(N'Emma', N'Hughes', N'emma.hughes5500@example.com', '2016-10-21', 1, N'game is so broken couldn''t even play it kept shutting down thought it was going to be good game but i was wrong'),
(N'Omar', N'Perry', N'omar.perry6900@example.org', '2016-10-21', 3, N'I bought this at local store. Its lightweight which is good. The main problem is I have a large head (my hat size is XL). This tighten on my head. The tighten band gave me headaches. When I pressed the button for lens to up closer to my eyes, it fogs up the lens. I guess it was because I am in small room where the AC doesn''t blow there much? I don''t see anyone here in reviews complaining about the fog on the lens. By the way the resolution was disappointing. I was hoping to see it real HD like I see on my HDTV. Overall I gave this 3 stars. I will return this PSVR bundle tomorrow. Maybe I will buy it again only if they have better games and improved resolutions.'),
(N'Christina', N'Thomas', N'christina.thomas4627@example.net', '2016-10-21', 5, N'It is great to look at. The gold sparkles and the clear shell gives the cover a sense of depth. Very good quality.'),
(N'Heather', N'Sullivan', N'heather.sullivan4680@example.org', '2016-10-22', 5, N'Very good game. I''ve spent many hours playing this, and has definite replay ability.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Diaz', N'ethan.diaz2406@example.org', '2016-10-22', 2, N'The first part of the game where everything looks like cartoon like graphics with the stupid robots sucks almost traded it in then as i played and the creatures finally started to apear i like it more i can go without that who beginning of the game liked the older gears better'),
(N'Wei', N'Brown', N'wei.brown2927@example.net', '2016-10-22', 5, N'Great stuff'),
(N'Lucia', N'Gomez', N'lucia.gomez2988@example.org', '2016-10-22', 2, N'it feels good but it its peeling off and I''m pissed off'),
(N'Mateo', N'Coleman', N'mateo.coleman7307@example.net', '2016-10-22', 5, N'Ordered this and in just a few minutes I had the email and was able to redeem on SWTOR''s website and got not only the full amount but also the free exclusive mini pet. This is cheaper here than off SWTOR''s market as well. I''m very pleased!'),
(N'Michael', N'Rodriguez', N'michael.rodriguez4259@example.net', '2016-10-22', 5, N'I bought this for my son for his birthday. He uses it for all of his Super Smash Bros games. He wants more and more Amiibo! This was a perfect gift, and him and my daughter both have their amiibos and play together!'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brown', N'katherine.brown3929@example.com', '2016-10-23', 5, N'Working great so far. Lots of options to customize it.'),
(N'Helen', N'Alvarez', N'helen.alvarez1959@example.com', '2016-10-23', 3, N'This game unfortunately was a bit of a let down. Black Ops 2 was one of the best CODs of last generation so I was really excited for this game. Sadly its a bit of a letdown. The campaign is alright, nothing special but ok. The abilities your suit give you can be really fun at times and provide a slight breath of fresh air. However the story is boring and uninteresting. Black Ops 3 abandons the story and game play elements of the previous two games and sets it far into the future. Some of the enemies you face are even androids. Advanced Warfare did the futuristic thing right but this game just takes it a bit too far. The futuristic powers are a bit interesting and fun to use but androids seriously??? This doesn''t feel like Call of Duty at all. And then theres the multiplayer which while not as bad as say Ghosts was(And ghosts can be somewhat forgiven since it was on both generation of consoles) still leaves a lot to be desired. First off the wall running element. This was just a...'),
(N'Laura', N'Nowak', N'laura.nowak3268@example.com', '2016-10-23', 5, N'Ok product.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Patel', N'kyle.patel5768@example.org', '2016-10-24', 3, N'The game only allows you into the world to murder all of it inhabitants. Former allies can only be slaughtered and in return everything wants to kill you. More options would have been nice.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Scott', N'elizabeth.scott8903@example.org', '2016-10-24', 5, N'Comes with poster and keychain'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Morris', N'jennifer.morris3470@example.org', '2016-10-24', 1, N'Take everything good about 3. Take it all away. Add a crappy setlist, cheaper feeling instruments, and also make it damn right ridiculous to try getting any of your previous dlc back. That''s 4. People can say oh accept it for what it is. You know what. i shouldn''t. I''ve played every guitar hero, and rock band, and easily 4 is the worst. I''ve calibrated it a million times and the sensors are terrible in the guitar! I tried my self so many times and it will not be as close to accurate as it was on 3 the first time around. Oh, and rivals? so pointless. WHO WANTS TO RANDOMLY ADD PEOPLE TO TRY PLAYING ONLINE?? I was thinking for like, rock band 2 band quickplay online??? but no. that too is no where to be found. This game is dissapointing at best.'),
(N'Karen', N'Taylor', N'karen.taylor5962@example.com', '2016-10-24', 5, N'If you own an xbox one this edition is for you. There is a lot of wonderful content in this game. But, I did encounter one serious problem with the season pass code. I did not receive all of the content on launch day. I''m not the only person that has experienced this problem. There are Gears of war 4 forums for anyone experiencing the same issue.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Harris', N'kofi.harris5532@example.net', '2016-10-24', 5, N'awsome'),
(N'Gregory', N'Cruz', N'gregory.cruz7456@example.org', '2016-10-24', 5, N'They don''t make games like this anymore. It''s a little too short but its worth every dime. I will buy this again for my Nephew.'),
(N'Amara', N'Jimenez', N'amara.jimenez2622@example.com', '2016-10-24', 4, N'good'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Kelly', N'tomasz.kelly9024@example.com', '2016-10-25', 4, N'Great game'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Ortiz', N'cheryl.ortiz4276@example.com', '2016-10-25', 3, N'Decent. It works but there is lag and it dosconnects regularly.'),
(N'Omar', N'Stewart', N'omar.stewart5427@example.net', '2016-10-25', 5, N'A++++++'),
(N'Amanda', N'Turner', N'amanda.turner5862@example.com', '2016-10-25', 5, N'Mine works just fine, sorry for anyone who got a defective controller'),
(N'Christine', N'Young', N'christine.young2002@example.net', '2016-10-25', 5, N'Perfect wheel'),
(N'Richard', N'Lopez', N'richard.lopez6278@example.net', '2016-10-25', 5, N'At $3 this was cheap. It took forever to get here due to shipping from China. It makes displaying my controllers nice and I put it on my PC. Highly Recommended. Just in case you are wondering, it will not hold a xBox 360 controller...just an xBox One.'),
(N'David', N'Patel', N'david.patel1029@example.org', '2016-10-25', 5, N'Loving this game'),
(N'Amanda', N'Wood', N'amanda.wood2253@example.com', '2016-10-25', 5, N'If you''re looking for a high quality fighting game pad to beat down your friends, online and offline, the HORI FIghting Commander is the shiznet (Yes I said shiznet, who cares?) The only draw back is the lack of thumbsticks, I miss those.'),
(N'Linda', N'Edwards', N'linda.edwards3687@example.org', '2016-10-25', 5, N'The Nvidia Shield is an awesome entertainment browsing and gaming system that has powerful component, sleek design and great game selection and gaming performance. It''s able to deliver stunning HD / 4K content to a living room TV without breaking a sweat! It''s faster than the traditional set-top boxes we''ve grown to love. An excellent product that I am so happy with.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Patel', N'cheryl.patel6860@example.org', '2016-10-25', 5, N'I brought this to work because everyone is adopting those low profile laptop-inspired keyboards that I hate and cannot type well on. I can''t type well on anything, but I do better on the deeper keyboards like I learned on. There''s a real tactile thing here that you don''t get with a membrane keyboard wither. It''s just better. And this one has rainbow lights. What more could you ask.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Martinez', N'jerry.martinez8221@example.org', '2016-10-26', 4, N'Amazing graphics and the tried and true Gears experience but it was unexpectedly short. Beat it in about 6-7 hours.'),
(N'Betty', N'Collins', N'betty.collins2903@example.com', '2016-10-26', 5, N'Excellent price and fast shipping!'),
(N'Christine', N'Young', N'christine.young2002@example.net', '2016-10-26', 5, N'great'),
(N'Frank', N'Jones', N'frank.jones4694@example.net', '2016-10-26', 4, N'Holds up nicely on a 3DS. Some good thrills and tension when playing in the dark with headphones. Gave 4 stars only cause I couldn''t beat the end boss and went to Youtube to just watch the ending there.'),
(N'Scott', N'Harris', N'scott.harris7453@example.org', '2016-10-26', 5, N'Fun fun! Great family game, excellent workout activity! Good song selection.'),
(N'Amy', N'Flores', N'amy.flores2498@example.com', '2016-10-26', 3, N'Work for ps 4 and Xbox one but work best placed over the existing analog stick rubber. If product is placed on the plastic with the rubber worn or picked off then it slides around and is not set in place. Over all it is a nice product and does add some nice pop to the controller.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Robinson', N'zachary.robinson7336@example.com', '2016-10-26', 5, N'Nice!'),
(N'Zachary', N'Robinson', N'zachary.robinson7336@example.com', '2016-10-26', 5, N'Spectacular!'),
(N'Henry', N'Jackson', N'henry.jackson3229@example.net', '2016-10-26', 2, N'This was the most complicated Battlefield I have ever played. For that, I consider this the weakest entry in the Bad Company series and my least favorite of the Battlefield franchise as a whole. Man, and I thought Medal of Honor Warfighter was terrible. Oh wait, it still is.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Robinson', N'jacob.robinson9605@example.org', '2016-10-26', 1, N'Product is a dudd'),
(N'Noah', N'Turner', N'noah.turner7417@example.net', '2016-10-27', 5, N'Works! Basically I wanted it just to play KH 1.5 and KH 2.5 as they were my favorite games growing up. And it does just that! Oh and plays blue ray but I now have 3 blue way players between this, PS4, and well an actually blue ray player.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Raghunathan', N'rachel.raghunathan8103@example.com', '2016-10-27', 5, N'This game has received many harsh reviews regarding the control scheme and you should know that there is indeed a high learning curve but it makes sense once you master them and every other snowboarding game will seem like a joke afterwards. This game is not meant to play like SSX/STEEP or other more arcadey games where you fly down the mountain doing tricks. It is meant to be more of a snowboarding simulation. That means if you love the art of snowboarding, of practicing hitting jumps with perfect speed and timing and just the right amount of spin to hit the landing perfectly, then this game may appeal to you. If you love the feel of just smoothly carving down powder, you may like it. This game is more about finesse and skill. Landing a simple spin or flip is satisfying. You have to deliberately control your 3 axes of rotation, your grabs, your spin speed, your weight balance. I can tell that the developers spent a great deal of time and effort consulting with experts and getting...'),
(N'Adam', N'Ortiz', N'adam.ortiz4852@example.org', '2016-10-27', 3, N'It''s an ok game. I bought my version of the game directly from the Xbox marketplace, instead of from Amazon because it was a "spur of the moment purchase" What I expected was "An awesome game dealing with space, and a sandy planet and building a robot army all with awesome exploration"..I guess I expected triple AAA gameplay. The price, I didn''t think much of it, because it was a new IP and I figure MS was floating the game a bit to test the waters. What I got, was a goofy kiddy platformer, with platforming elements that sometimes failed me, because buttons were not always registered when pushed. Brand new controller, haven''t had any issues with any other games. Rise of the Tomb Raider from cyrstal Dynamics and company ... has come to be my gold standard when it comes to combining platforming, rpg and action adventure elements all in one awesome package.. It just works, and it works well! That''s an awesome feeling! ReCore doesn''t have the seriousness...its clunky. They have the...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Bailey', N'stephen.bailey3958@example.com', '2016-10-27', 5, N'This is an amazing game. Now they just need to keep bringing the Dragon Quest to the west. Come on square enix!!!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Sullivan', N'jennifer.sullivan6154@example.org', '2016-10-27', 5, N'Great game that i found late in life. a real hidden gem'),
(N'Anita', N'Kim', N'anita.kim8969@example.org', '2016-10-28', 5, N'great'),
(N'Douglas', N'Smith', N'douglas.smith8312@example.org', '2016-10-28', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Richard', N'Torres', N'richard.torres3170@example.com', '2016-10-28', 5, N'Great! Intense workout. Lots of situps and pushups.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Williams', N'ivan.williams7563@example.org', '2016-10-28', 4, N'I really like this game. it is fun, movement seems smooth and if your looking for a alternate to COD this is the next best thing. I do not think it is as good as Battlefield 1 but I do not regret getting this at all.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Gray', N'lisa.gray5533@example.com', '2016-10-28', 4, N'Grandchildren play this game extremely frequently and like it.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Stewart', N'sharon.stewart9209@example.org', '2016-10-28', 5, N'I love it!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Myers', N'andrea.myers1069@example.com', '2016-10-29', 5, N':)'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Ivanov', N'tomasz.ivanov1969@example.org', '2016-10-29', 5, N'Always loved playing Madden which ever year comes out, will always upgrade!!'),
(N'Peter', N'Okonkwo', N'peter.okonkwo1322@example.net', '2016-10-29', 4, N'A good little game that is easy for this senior to use. It is visually appealing and I like the music. It''s a good time waster.'),
(N'David', N'Torres', N'david.torres1156@example.net', '2016-10-29', 1, N'This game is so so, not too impressed'),
(N'Sarah', N'Williams', N'sarah.williams3829@example.net', '2016-10-29', 5, N'This is probably the first VR experience for most of you reading this, so here are my thoughts on what to expect: the good, the bad, and ultimately whether it''s worth giving VR and Sony a shot. There''s a comparison to Oculus and HTC Vive below for those who are curious as well as a TLDR at the bottom. Pros: - Very easy to put on, works well with glasses and is comfortable on the head even for longer gaming sessions. - Tracks position easily when moving around a reasonably large area. - Easy to re-center with just the touch of the ''options'' button so you can get in a nice comfy position to play. - Comes with a lot of different types of VR demos, games, videos, experiences to try out of the box. - Guaranteed to impress friends, family, and significant others - Just had a party and it was an unabashed hit with gamers and "non-gamers" alike - Lets you play regular games and watch movies on a big virtual theater screen (up to about IMAX size). - Lets you play games privately when...'),
(N'Christine', N'Singh', N'christine.singh9222@example.net', '2016-10-29', 5, N'good quality, fast delivery'),
(N'Marcus', N'Sanchez', N'marcus.sanchez3958@example.org', '2016-10-29', 4, N'it was a fun little game but not something you''d give a second run'),
(N'Marcus', N'Sanchez', N'marcus.sanchez3958@example.org', '2016-10-29', 5, N'jack is amazing no more need be said'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Parker', N'tomasz.parker1452@example.com', '2016-10-29', 4, N'great game'),
(N'Brian', N'Ward', N'brian.ward5594@example.org', '2016-10-29', 4, N'I played this game on PC before and tend to think that it''s easier to use a keyboard rather than PS2 controller for it (navigation keys that is). That being said it''s the same good, old Quake.'),
(N'Debra', N'Bailey', N'debra.bailey2467@example.org', '2016-10-30', 1, N'Black Ops 1 vs Black Ops 2. First game had great ''feel'' to the gameplay. Black Ops 2 felt like a cheap SEGA arcade port to PC. That''s what Titanfall 2 feels like. Lot''s of bouncing and hopping around. Titans have lost all of their charm, and feel like cheaper, easier to play versions of their once mighty selves. Everything just feels weak and shallow in comparison to the first version. Easier to play for the XBOX crowd, but lame for real fps gamers. I will give it a go for a few days, but looking like I will spend $60 to switch over to COD... Revised review. Single Player: Compelling but seriously short campaign. Multiplayer: Aimbot/Wall hacked on the day of release. Not even worth logging in to the server it is so bad, Pre-fire is rampant. I bought two extra copies as gifts for my brothers, and am spending days apologizing for how bad the game play is. Felt so bad I went out and purchased the new COD in it''s place. Until RESPAWN can get a hold of the hacking problem, I won''t buy...'),
(N'Megan', N'Rodriguez', N'megan.rodriguez4166@example.com', '2016-10-30', 4, N'Bought it for a friend and he seem''s to be having a pretty good time with it. Halo is a prolific game and this game seems to do the name justice.'),
(N'Amy', N'Ali', N'amy.ali6296@example.org', '2016-10-30', 5, N'This worked perfect with my two different Raspberry Pi 3''s. I tried 2x PS1 dual shock controllers, and 2x PS2 controllers and all work as expected. You can even set the left stick AND left D-Pad to work at the same time (which you can''t do on the actual PS controllers when they''re plugged into a PS1 for example). I bought 4 other versions of these and NONE worked with the Raspberry Pi. Worked on my Mac running 10.11 El Capitan as well (might have been Sierra 10.12 when I tested, not 100% positive).'),
(N'Peter', N'Perez', N'peter.perez4193@example.org', '2016-10-30', 4, N'Nice Playing Game'),
(N'Mei', N'Coleman', N'mei.coleman8409@example.net', '2016-10-31', 1, N'compared to the previous titles and PD Future Tone, PDX feels like a giant step back. The bigger insult is that the vita version doesn''t even run that consistently and seems to have controller polling issues and frame rate drops that aren''t present in the PS4 version. These problems exist in both the japanese and NTSC-U versions. Aside from technical problems, the shorter song list, cop out dances-instead-of-movies, the randomly drawn outfit unlock system, and the terrible medleys make this title hard to recommend to anybody who''s not already a huge vocaloid fan.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Adams', N'patricia.adams1591@example.net', '2016-10-31', 5, N'I bought this game because I am tired of Call of duty. I''m not against futuristic sci-fi games, but I hate that COD went from real war to metal robots. Because I have always been a cod fan (until the latest games), I purchased my first battlefield game. Man, BF1 makes me wish I would have switched to battlefield long ago. I didn''t know what to expect because I had never played battlefield before. I first tried multiplayer, and I have to say that the graphics and sound are great. Matchmaking is good, unlike BO3, where the scores are always different by 40+ points. Also, the maps are fun to play, with much structure, and they are the perfect size, so the game pace is just perfect. Also, EA/Dice did a phenomenal job of portraying the WWI theme. Mark my words, this game is going to be the game that finally kills COD for good.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Taylor', N'sharon.taylor6087@example.com', '2016-10-31', 5, N'Works like it''s supposed to!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Watson', N'kimberly.watson9706@example.org', '2016-10-31', 4, N'Its cheesy but still like it'),
(N'Ronald', N'Webb', N'ronald.webb2612@example.org', '2016-10-31', 5, N'Challenging, but doable. Bright enough so that you know what the clues look like, unlike the Haunted House game.'),
(N'Jason', N'James', N'jason.james8921@example.org', '2016-10-31', 5, N'I''m fully aware that EA puts out the Battlefield series, and my title was poking fun at EA due to the crap games they released prior to Battlefield 1. Battlefield 4 was broken for a long time, but now runs flawlessly. Hardline was crap, Battlefront was also crap, UFC 2''s gameplay is crap compared to UFC 1. Battlefield 1 has been great since launch, which is very unlike most of EA''s games. Battlefield 1 is a breath of fresh air. The graphics are solid, the gameplay is smooth and I haven''t noticed any netcode issues with this title. It''s also nice that the game takes place during WWI. I was feeling all fps were starting to feel the same, and nothing new was being done for this genre. I take my hat off to DICE, and not EA. The developers for DICE are the real heros for this title and went above and beyond to make a fun and fully functioning game. EA still has more to prove to the world that they''re more about making great games instead of pocketing our hard earned money. They should...'),
(N'Joan', N'Gutierrez', N'joan.gutierrez4680@example.org', '2016-10-31', 5, N'Battlefield brings me back to Battlefield 2 back in 2005! I did not like any of the following Battlefield games, especially the single player campaigns. They just were not good before. Battlefield 1 brings great atmosphere, an AMAZING single player campaign with war stories, and multiplayer that is just fun. It can take some time to learn everything, but it is well worth it. If modes like Operations deter you, start by joining a game of Domination. Domination has smaller maps and, with a good team, lots of fun to play. I can recommend this to anyone that like mulitplayer games and singleplayer, though the SP game is short. It even brings back the Gamespy days with a multiplayer browser! :) My one hope is that Dice does the same with Star Wars for their single player games in the future.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Walker', N'hiroshi.walker6354@example.org', '2016-10-31', 5, N'FITS AND LOOKS GOOD PEACE OF MIND! SECURITY FOR THE 3DS XL'),
(N'Christine', N'Richardson', N'christine.richardson2485@example.net', '2016-10-31', 1, N'Resident Evil 6 is the worst game so far out of the series . I Liked Resident Evil outbreak file 1 and 2 better. Also Resident Evil 3 and the original game the remastered remake on ps4 was good as well.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Reyes', N'nadia.reyes4834@example.org', '2016-10-31', 5, N'Everything about this game is pure magic. I''ve beaten the campaign on normal and it was an absolute thrill to play. I''m already planning my next take on the hardest difficulty after I do a collection hunt. The multiplayer is more fun than I may have ever had on a first person shooter ever! If you''re considering purchasing this game? Then do dive in. I bought the deluxe version for the skins, the standard or deluxe is up to your preference, and how much you want to support the developers. This is what true love feels like my friends, my wife will be devastated.'),
(N'Priya', N'Perry', N'priya.perry1212@example.org', '2016-10-31', 4, N'As a owner of Xbox one and PS4 console my review is unbiased and objective. I have this game on Xbox as my friends that i met in college have it on Xbox as well. So i wanted to play with them but I have also tried the PS4 version of the game. Although the game being great in terms of gameplay and campaign co-op, i have to say that there are some differences between the Ps4 version and the Xbox one. Also be wary of the business model of EA. They tend to not fully release everything of the game unless you spend on more DLCs but i don t think it s the case here. My review is based on the fact that the Xbox one version has some frame rate drop compared to the PS4 also the graphics slightly gets sometime ugly but it s hard to notice. For everyone to notice this, i recommend to watch a video that shows both side by side ps4 and xbox one versions. As of my experience the frame rate have dropped more on xbox one since the machine is underpowered compared to PS4. The loading time is...'),
(N'Noah', N'Turner', N'noah.turner7417@example.net', '2016-11-01', 5, N'Worked great! My old PS2 cable had a tear in it and was working anymore. This did the trick'),
(N'Mary', N'Rogers', N'mary.rogers3295@example.com', '2016-11-01', 4, N'The real thing.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Stewart', N'jacob.stewart8678@example.net', '2016-11-01', 3, N'ON behalf of my daughter. I got it for her birthday thinking it would be like Minecraft. The camera huge problem, and she ended up stuck in a hole. She is 8, but amazing with Minecraft can even make cake trees, trampolines, etc... This though not as user friendly for kids, but still a neat game.'),
(N'Christina', N'Ramirez', N'christina.ramirez3561@example.com', '2016-11-01', 5, N'Awesome service. Will buy again.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Wang', N'jennifer.wang7418@example.net', '2016-11-01', 5, N'Brutally hard, requiring TWO cartridges to work on TWO DS''s over local wifi, this is a good though merciless multiplayer game for the DS. the prices on these things as they do have a very limited pool of availability are far from fair though. Theres a FAR more expensive version for the Japanese market. im not sure if its the same game, but at SEVENTY dollars minimum usually for one one of those, AND in Japanese kanji, this game im reviewing is pennies by comparison.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Clark', N'daniel.clark6360@example.net', '2016-11-01', 2, N'These got a second start because they are indeed tri wing screwdrivers. They''re terrible. They''re tiny. If you have stubborn screws it''s really hard to apply enough pressure, and actually doing so is pretty painful. I think I''ve got two striped screws despite giving as much pressure on the screw as possible with these awful screwdrivers.'),
(N'Scott', N'Nelson', N'scott.nelson8543@example.com', '2016-11-01', 5, N'When the Wii U first came out, I, like many people, didn''t actually understand what the hell it was. The system had literally been out for well over a year before I realized it WAS a new gaming system and not just a Wii peripheral. Unfortunately, this seems to have been a fairly common situation because only now as the Wii U reaches the end of its lifespan are we finally getting games that should have been there right at launch to showcase what this system is and why you want it. Xenoblade Chronicles X is exactly the kind of game that could have carried the Wii U to a broader market and showed developers what they needed to do to really take advantage of the system. In many games, the second screen inset into the primary Wii U controller is distracting, unnecessary, poorly utilized, or some combination of the three. If you''ve played Pokken Tournament, you may have even noticed that it can serve as a deliberate handicap when playing local multiplayer. Xenoblade Chronicles X, on the...'),
(N'Justin', N'Sullivan', N'justin.sullivan8055@example.org', '2016-11-01', 5, N'I bough this for my Nitendo so far is the best you can place evrithing inside. Has a zipper. A strap to carry .i love it'),
(N'Anthony', N'Price', N'anthony.price1274@example.net', '2016-11-01', 1, N'when i emailed about these i was told they were bullet casings. not some shitty scrap billet aluminum. it would be diff if the quality was better. but this are total s***. it looks like a 3rd grader did these in shop class with a bob the builder drill. i will be buying a different brand and throwing these away.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Hall', N'marcus.hall2792@example.com', '2016-11-01', 4, N'The game is amazing 9.7/10 but be careful who you buy this from some people will trick u and give u a book instead of the game. I love the game so much best RPG and the storyline crushes Skyrim''s. Buy this you will love it more than skyrim'),
(N'Laura', N'Ferreira', N'laura.ferreira4275@example.com', '2016-11-01', 5, N'Very fun! The only drawback is that you have to be connected to the internet in order to play, even the skirmishes.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Nowak', N'patrick.nowak6189@example.net', '2016-11-02', 5, N'i don t know much about farming but i love this game best money spent'),
(N'Karen', N'Evans', N'karen.evans4795@example.net', '2016-11-02', 3, N'Work as it''s intended to do. Only problem I see, is, it is to bright.'),
(N'Amy', N'Turner', N'amy.turner6387@example.net', '2016-11-02', 5, N'Great device, a little small but works perfectly for on the go. The MOGA Hero we have is paired with a Samsung Galaxy Note 5. A separate app is required to configure the controller, but the controller is fully functional and really convenient for playing some of the more interactive games available. We have used the controller with the Samsung Gear VR and it plays games like minecraft no problem. I have not noticed any input lag coming from the device and the battery life is more than adequate for short gaming sessions (1-2 hours)'),
(N'Mateo', N'Bailey', N'mateo.bailey8378@example.com', '2016-11-02', 5, N'Really helps keep my ONE cooler. Love the design.'),
(N'Steven', N'Edwards', N'steven.edwards6625@example.net', '2016-11-02', 4, N'I really enjoyed AoE3. I haven''t played it for years but when I did I put a lot of hours in it :)'),
(N'Mary', N'Gomez', N'mary.gomez4023@example.org', '2016-11-02', 2, N'This headset is cool, and it''s fun to have one that is themed like the game. However, it is made out of the cheapest, thinnest plastic and feels like it could snap in half at any moment. The sound quality isn''t great, either. Overall, with this headset you''re simply paying for the name and decorative factor.'),
(N'Noah', N'Fisher', N'noah.fisher5510@example.com', '2016-11-02', 3, N'Fun for a bit. Story is lacking. Action scenes are fun.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Reed', N'nancy.reed6351@example.com', '2016-11-02', 3, N'Why did I buy the game? Two reasons, 1 it''s Battlefield, the best online FPS game, or I would go as far as simulation there is out there as far as consoles go.. 2, it''s not C.O.D. which went into a complete nosedive after Black Ops 2. I played Black Ops 3 for about two weeks, it just didn''t bring me into the fight like say Black Ops, MW2, or Black Ops 2 did. I refuse to completely give up my Ps3 just yet, well maybe until Christmas, and getting back into Battlefield is really the only options since COD is overrun with hackers to the point it''s unplayable. You still have the occasional hacker in the Battlefields but nothing like COD has become on the PS3, or the XBox360. So I got into these Battlefields 3&4 kinda late in the game, but the online community is still very active. Ok so what about Battlefield 4, Well, it is what it is, but not as good as it was. Battlefield 3, as far as multiplayer is still my favorite, 2 being second. 4 just doesn''t have that simulation, like your...'),
(N'Sandra', N'Morgan', N'sandra.morgan2287@example.com', '2016-11-02', 4, N'The stand is excellent for charging controllers. Just pop the controller into the molded hole and you''re good. Holding games is where the stand fails though, the slots are not spaced properly so games just, fall out.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Hall', N'tyler.hall9502@example.net', '2016-11-02', 5, N'Very easy to install with the adapter.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Barnes', N'nancy.barnes1236@example.org', '2016-11-02', 5, N'Thank you!'),
(N'Walter', N'Young', N'walter.young2233@example.com', '2016-11-03', 5, N'Thanks'),
(N'Lauren', N'Gomez', N'lauren.gomez5263@example.org', '2016-11-03', 5, N'My son had been asking for this game for so long after finally placing my order, i recieved it in mail few days later, the excat day i got it Color Splash came out and of course my son being the you tube junkie he is, this game was quickly knocked off the list and replaced...little does he know, hes getting this one for Christmas and not Color Splah'),
(N'Mark', N'Khan', N'mark.khan9340@example.org', '2016-11-03', 3, N'It is the same thing over and over and over again. I heard great reviews about this game and I am very disappointed. I liked Ocarina of time and beat that because it kept me interested. This game has a three day time that keeps repeating itself and when ever you seem to get 2 steps ahead you go 2 steps back like it never happened. Unless you play with a guide sitting out in front of you then you are going to get frustrated playing this game.'),
(N'Henry', N'Garcia', N'henry.garcia6405@example.com', '2016-11-03', 5, N'My kids love it.'),
(N'Henry', N'Garcia', N'henry.garcia6405@example.com', '2016-11-03', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Edwards', N'samuel.edwards2728@example.com', '2016-11-03', 5, N'I only have one remote now, but I am considering buying an elite controller and wanted a charging station that would be compatible with those. I was able to charge the second battery by taping it in place, so that I could play using the other battery, when I first got the docking station. *I am sure that''s not a manufacturers recommended way to charge, but it worked. I have had battery charging stations where you have to take the battery pack off, and I appreciate this style instead...plus, it''s a nice way to store the controller instead of throwing it somewhere.'),
(N'Betty', N'Baker', N'betty.baker9465@example.net', '2016-11-03', 1, N'If you don''t have the HTC vive you will probably have your mind blown with Psvr. That being said, I''ve had the Vive since day 1 and was excited to try PSVR and just chill on my couch. The Vive is like a Mercedes S class compared to a geo metro aka "PSVR"'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ortiz', N'ethan.ortiz4051@example.com', '2016-11-03', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Ravi', N'Rodriguez', N'ravi.rodriguez1149@example.com', '2016-11-03', 3, N'I like the game, but it has a lot of scratches and don''t play every time!'),
(N'Joan', N'Watson', N'joan.watson7442@example.net', '2016-11-03', 5, N'Product arrived on time and was as described.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Perez', N'cheryl.perez2584@example.net', '2016-11-04', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Morales', N'nicholas.morales5809@example.com', '2016-11-04', 5, N'The story was good and it was not a narrow story. You could take different paths to get to the last mission.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Butler', N'patrick.butler3054@example.net', '2016-11-04', 1, N'Negative five stars! I''m not a hater of COD. I own all 12 COD games for my consoles. Enjoy most of them. This is pure garbage. Not fun all all. Skip at all costs. Worst COD ever made. If you want a good future FPS, get Titanfall 2 or just get BF1. Pros: NONE Cons: - Graphics are horrible for current gen. BO3 was better - Sound and Music isn''t great at all - Controls, including stuff like double jump, are clunky and bad. - MP are terrible. Maps are horribly made. Too many head glitches and pathways. Not fun. The so called special abilities, perks, etc. are laughable, OP, ridiculous, and a complete joke. Weapons and equipment are nothing special. - Zombies are WTF. I enjoy old school themes but this is terrible. It looks like a terrible kid''s cartoon. This is not zombies nor scary nor fun. It''s a complete joke. - Campaign is just another COD campaign. Nothing special. ...it''s just not fun'),
(N'Donald', N'Lewis', N'donald.lewis1180@example.net', '2016-11-04', 5, N'I buy every COD game every year and have done so since Big Red One on PS2, in all these years the only title I did not like was Ghosts. I predicted space age COD years ago but they released black ops 1 instead haha anyway it''s finally here and I love it. Campaign is solid, multiplayer is solid, zombies is solid (as well as my personal favorite zombies to date). If you want a game that isn''t futuristic guess what? Battlefield has you covered. Leave COD alone and let them release quality games. I''m a dedicated fan and I support them.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Rivera', N'sharon.rivera4966@example.com', '2016-11-04', 1, N'Infinity Ward has found a way to make this game worse than Advanced Warfare. The only good thing about this game is that it comes with MW Remastered and even that is missing modes and maps. I guess Activision is expecting there fanbase to rebuy the Remastered map packs. Waste of money!'),
(N'Steven', N'Gomez', N'steven.gomez5245@example.org', '2016-11-04', 3, N'What you should know about COD IW. The campaign is decent 8/10; however, the MP feels like a knock off of BO3. The controls feel slightly clunker compared to BO3 (examples Wall running and advanced movement) the maps feel childish and just bland, and that specialist that BO3 has feels better IMO. MP rating 6/10. Now, if you are big into Zombies, which I never have cared for or spent much time in other then here and there it may be for you. Zombie rating N/A. If you mainly play for MP though, you may want to continue in BO3, TF2, or if you want a game that offers destructive maps and a different feel BF WW1. This game isn''t bad, it just isn''t the MP that is should be, lacks any real change from BO3, maps are overall worse in the series, lacks big maps that actually take advantage of a sniper and maps that change like "Ghosts". So you mainly only see aim assist quick snipers. If you like quick shooters highly recommend going to route of Titanfall 2. BTW, everyone knows how good...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Stewart', N'kathleen.stewart5456@example.com', '2016-11-04', 5, N'fun game'),
(N'Mateo', N'Sanchez', N'mateo.sanchez8303@example.net', '2016-11-04', 3, N'Fit loose bad for fighting games not an issue when i play gta5'),
(N'Joshua', N'Green', N'joshua.green7293@example.com', '2016-11-04', 3, N'I loved this game as a child and bought it as a gift for my girlfriend. However, there is something wrong with the disk as she cannot progress beyond a certain level. Therefore my rating does not reflect the game, but the quality of the disk.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Coleman', N'thomas.coleman1668@example.com', '2016-11-04', 5, N'This is one of my favorite open world games ever, Along with Yakuza 4. You get a realistic depiction of Hong Kong, and the story and action is all there just like an 80s Jackie chan acton flick. There aren''t as many mini games or places to explore as GTA - but it makes up for it because 1) asian setting is very detailed 2) Kung fu and parkour action and 3) you get to play as both a cop and a gangster. So yeah, its awesome, and its sad that the studio shut down because I was really waiting for a sequel.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Bell', N'lisa.bell6406@example.com', '2016-11-04', 1, N'If I could give this game a 0 star I would. It is the biggest pile of garbage of a Call of Duty game that has ever been released. It feels like this Call of Duty was made by Capcom garbage garbage garbage'),
(N'Anita', N'Russell', N'anita.russell7221@example.org', '2016-11-04', 4, N'fun 2plyr game'),
(N'Linda', N'Gomez', N'linda.gomez7499@example.net', '2016-11-04', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Amanda', N'Cooper', N'amanda.cooper2767@example.org', '2016-11-04', 5, N'I''m a big 6''6" guy and this mouse feels like it was tailored for my hand, I love it.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Perry', N'samuel.perry7400@example.net', '2016-11-04', 5, N'First off I want to say that they are extremely comfortable. I was actually able to wear them for abour 3 hours straight playing Overwatch with my friends the other evening. There was not one point in which I needed to take off the headphones due to discomfort. The second thing I wanted to talk about was the sound quality provided by the headphones. Both the sounds of the game and the voices of my friends came through clearly. The basses are deep and the trebles are crisp and high, and I was overall very pleased with the sound produced. I am a stickler for sound quality, so I can pretty confidently say that if I am happy you probably will be too. The build seems fine. They aren''t made out of concrete, so be aware that you probably don''t want to try to bend things in a way that they weren''t intended to. The mic swings down to be next to your mouth, and can easily move right back up if you want it out of your way. The cord is nice and long and splits into a mic out and a sound out at...'),
(N'Samantha', N'Hill', N'samantha.hill5396@example.net', '2016-11-04', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Patrick', N'Chen', N'patrick.chen4364@example.org', '2016-11-05', 5, N'IT''S SO AWESOME I LOVE IT! & Shipping was fast. But you cant See the keyboard keys all that well in the dark when its lit the light doesn''t seep through the keys as you would expect so one can distinguish each letter on the keyboard you can only see the keys unless your close or your computer screen is bright or in the day time all in all its great for the price. & the Mouse is simply astonishing love how it changes colors constantly. xD'),
(N'Tyler', N'Allen', N'tyler.allen1641@example.com', '2016-11-05', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Jacob', N'Torres', N'jacob.torres8369@example.com', '2016-11-05', 5, N'I was hesitant buying this game. I wanted MW Remastered, so I caved. I thoguht infinite would be bad. But alas. Infinity ward came through again. Never fear, do not listen to the fake reviews. This game is amazing. I won''t get into how much I love the campaign, if you read about the web you''ll see that critics are really enjoying the campaign and if you need details, just go watch some gameplay. This campaign is no exception. It''s a good romp. While I may be the minority, I will say that Zombies is an absolute masterpiece. Not that I don''t love their past zombies games, but this is probably their best zombies mode yet. I won''t give away too much, but the Zombies takes place sometime in the 80''s amusement park. Yes, the 80''s. 80''s characters, 80''s clothes, 80''s music, 80''s arcade, and yes, you can go into the arcade and play Activision games!! No, you really can!! I''ll just say, there are some greats in there! The graphics are solid. No slow down, things can get really crazy on...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Fisher', N'olivia.fisher6524@example.net', '2016-11-05', 4, N'Solid game in every category. If you like good graphics, good character design, 60 fps, and have fun shooting up enemies at a frantic pace, grab this game.'),
(N'Karen', N'Jimenez', N'karen.jimenez4248@example.org', '2016-11-05', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Douglas', N'Butler', N'douglas.butler4389@example.org', '2016-11-05', 1, N'I''m not really sure if I''m playing Call of Duty video game or StarWars. MWR is good though. Thank god.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Wang', N'lisa.wang5605@example.org', '2016-11-05', 5, N'Loved this game, great fun!'),
(N'Sandra', N'Powell', N'sandra.powell4318@example.org', '2016-11-05', 5, N'very good game another good rpg to pick up if you like rpg''s'),
(N'Sarah', N'Sullivan', N'sarah.sullivan4993@example.com', '2016-11-06', 2, N'Good build quality, really like the metal plate and floating key design. RGB mode works great. Plug and Play on Windows 10 (Anniversary Update) with no problems. The switches definitely are different than Cherry switches, but I would say it is correct to lump them in with the general feel and response of Cherry MX Green switches after testing it alongside my CMStorm w/ green switches. Good job on this item and a nice price. UPDATE (11-10) : Windows did a standard update and upon reboot the keyboard no longer worked. Had to plug in another keyboard and find the problem then update the drivers manually. Not impressed at all. Returning. UPDATE #2 (11-10) ChallengerUSA provided anti-help in the form of broken English canned responses to annoy me further about this item. That means they don''t care so, yeah why bother with them?'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Gonzalez', N'kimberly.gonzalez5154@example.com', '2016-11-06', 4, N'This game is not the best of the battlefield franchise but it is decent and is in its own modern way it''s better than Bf1 but not better than bf3 nothing can ever be better than bf 3 let''s see if that sparks some good competition between the company''s to make better games in 2017'),
(N'Heather', N'Turner', N'heather.turner5406@example.org', '2016-11-06', 4, N'brain food'),
(N'Laura', N'Edwards', N'laura.edwards8197@example.com', '2016-11-06', 1, N'I was pretty amazed by the sound, and how comfortable it felt. But, almost 4 months and very gentle use and the top part broke! Cheap plastic that holds the pad just broke. .. I mean I don''t throw them around, I am very careful because they cost. =(, update : replacement broke again and warranty is gone :('),
(N'Peter', N'Bailey', N'peter.bailey4268@example.net', '2016-11-06', 5, N'These are for my boys. They are obsessed with Disney Infinity. Too bad they discontinued the platform.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Scott', N'jacqueline.scott4927@example.org', '2016-11-06', 5, N'Scratch my earlier review, this is a great game. It''s faced paced, like the good ole days of unreal tournament.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Scott', N'timothy.scott3684@example.org', '2016-11-06', 4, N'This is a great game that suffers from pacing and variety. It does atmosphere like Bioshock but fails to achieve anything more, whereas Bioshock is hauntingly beautiful while it disturb you, Dead Space is just disturbing. Still, it does disturbing right. So for that I commend it.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Scott', N'timothy.scott3684@example.org', '2016-11-06', 2, N'This is not gameplay. It''s a tv show that you react to. Quick Time Events are the worst form of game interactivity. In Super Mario, you can jump, you can run, there''re enemies. You can run and jump to jump further, you can jump on enemies. There''s no melding of mechanics here. You press x to not die. And you do this for the entire game. Yes. Heavy Rain is the first to do this well, but QTE done well is like polishing a turd. I would rather watch a good tv show, of which there are too many to count, than play an interactive story. Obviously not everyone agrees with me, as Telltale keeps making this kind of ''game'' and is still in business. The difference is I like quantic dream. Hopefully their next game utilize more story branching and gameplay rather than QTE.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Scott', N'timothy.scott3684@example.org', '2016-11-06', 4, N'HR feels like a 5 star game for the first 10 hours. It throws all of it''s mechanics at you from the start, giving you the sense of overwhelming freedom and makes you believe you would love to replay this game using the different path. 30 hours in, however, you realize that every path is basically the same. It''s the same first 10 hours repeated in a different setting. So in a sense I did replay the game. If the campaign was rather 10 hours long instead, I would still spend 30 hours replaying it. The world is intricately built, varied, and stands out as one of a handful of games that tries to do cyberpunk right. However, the world and the gameplay is much more interesting than the plot. So once I felt the aforementioned were explored, I had no reason to continue. HR is a good game that I did not finish, simply because the campaign is too long for how interesting it is.'),
(N'William', N'Raghunathan', N'william.raghunathan3046@example.net', '2016-11-06', 1, N'Probably the worst COD of the series. Even worst than Ghosts'),
(N'Steven', N'Davis', N'steven.davis7867@example.org', '2016-11-06', 5, N'Love it!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Jenkins', N'nicole.jenkins7618@example.net', '2016-11-06', 5, N'enjoy this game'),
(N'Amara', N'Flores', N'amara.flores6291@example.net', '2016-11-06', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Brian', N'Gonzalez', N'brian.gonzalez5264@example.org', '2016-11-07', 5, N'Always loved skyrim. But I''m confused as to why the game still had to download on the ps4 when I have the physical copy. You would think only updates would be downloaded. But instead it''s the whole game. Yet you still need the disk to play. I''m still giving it a 5 tho because it''s a great game and looks great now.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Lewis', N'melissa.lewis5097@example.com', '2016-11-07', 5, N'Amazing collector''s edition for a great game, the edition includes the figure which is outstanding without a doubt, very well sculpted, the metal case for the disc looks gorgeous (personally I would''ve prefer to get the classic Doom style art, the one packed as an alternate cover over the standard console editions). I don''t like games being attached to a steam account but is almost mandatory in recent times (unfortunately), and I couldn''t care less for the DLC included because it''s for the multiplayer part of the game which I consider lackluster and not so "Doomy". Regarding pricing, $120.00 dollars seems to be a little bit pricey for my taste, but once you get the statue you may began to feel OK with the money you spent, in my case I was able to get this edition for less than 50 bucks which was a deal I couldn''t let go.'),
(N'Diane', N'Bailey', N'diane.bailey1875@example.net', '2016-11-07', 5, N'Works'),
(N'Olivia', N'Jones', N'olivia.jones9283@example.com', '2016-11-07', 5, N'Great controller. I had to replace and older one my children broke and this one is perfect. I love the color and you can''t beat the price. Arrival was quick as well.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Phillips', N'nathan.phillips4596@example.com', '2016-11-07', 4, N'Essentially, it is a mixture which consists of: The atmosphere of SAW The soundtrack of Silent Hill The amount of blood of Resident Evil The logic of philosophy The fiction of physics And all of this garnished with fiction I cannot explain without spoiling the game.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Edwards', N'raymond.edwards5276@example.net', '2016-11-07', 5, N'Excelente producto.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Raghunathan', N'jeffrey.raghunathan6103@example.net', '2016-11-07', 5, N'I won''t go into a lot as others have said it all already. Graphics are a 10! Game play is a 10! Sound is a 10! Stories are a 10! Speaking of story line.. I love how they give you a choice of what story you want to do first or next. It reminds me of a James Bond movie of how you go to different locations with different assassin jobs to do but you are a different person in each location with a new story line. Call of Duty will lose this time around to Battlefield hands down.'),
(N'Donna', N'Stewart', N'donna.stewart6124@example.net', '2016-11-07', 5, N'This game is a master piece for modern first person shooters! the gameplay is flawless, everything flows really well, the multiplayer is a ton of fun! The campaign is great! the story in games is what I care about and titanfall has it this time around. The campaign is only a few missions but each mission is really flipping long so you feel like you''ve played on a different level within a mission! its hard to explain but you have to play it for your self. If you want a fast paced fun shooter to play with your friends, Titanfall 2 should be your top pick and not infinite warfare'),
(N'Kofi', N'Gonzalez', N'kofi.gonzalez3637@example.com', '2016-11-07', 5, N'This game is soo much fun. You get to ride in tanks,planes,horses,and motorcycles. I can play in a group with my friends and the detail is amazing. I definately recommend this game'),
(N'Maria', N'Harris', N'maria.harris2759@example.com', '2016-11-07', 5, N'I got this cause i found my old ps2 and wanted to finish playing some games that i didn''t finish when i was younger. I had this memory card for a while now and haven"t had any issues with. Its well worth the price for the original. Just make sure you get the right one for you because they''re some games that require a lot block of memory space and some games require a little bit. This memory card should be good for good amount of games.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Torres', N'katherine.torres7016@example.com', '2016-11-07', 1, N'so i ordered this and everyone who know this is a game well in mine i got a movie called yugioh the movie i have contacted amazon to help me get the game but i was really wanting to play this game again :''('),
(N'Donna', N'Allen', N'donna.allen1022@example.org', '2016-11-08', 5, N'Absolutely fantastic in all ways and yes the story is also brilliant. Really one of the best RPGs behind the Tales Series games.'),
(N'Donna', N'Allen', N'donna.allen1022@example.org', '2016-11-08', 5, N'Excellent RPG game, no issues whatsoever. The multi disc is necessary to encompass the whole story and the great games are multi discs like blue dragon and lost Odyssey.'),
(N'Donna', N'Allen', N'donna.allen1022@example.org', '2016-11-08', 4, N'As its name suggests, you start out from the very beginning, with no resources and it takes a while to build your resources but once that''s done with, game gets fun.'),
(N'Joan', N'Mitchell', N'joan.mitchell8749@example.com', '2016-11-08', 5, N'Great give, kids love it'),
(N'Edward', N'Ferreira', N'edward.ferreira8883@example.org', '2016-11-08', 5, N'Just a blast to drive. Racing is just so-so, as with all Forza games not a single rule, and that sucks. You get a bunch of ''brian samurai'' types that would rather crash and cause mayhem rather than learning to drive. But, all Forza games are like this. Graphic''s over the top great, very well done indeed. Shiny, of the Old Coots Clan'),
(N'Nicole', N'Butler', N'nicole.butler9563@example.org', '2016-11-08', 3, N'Is good game but have first time error'),
(N'Walter', N'Morales', N'walter.morales1391@example.org', '2016-11-08', 5, N'about wore it out.thanks.'),
(N'Emily', N'Lopez', N'emily.lopez1815@example.org', '2016-11-08', 5, N'This is a really good and funny game enjoyed it a lot'),
(N'Emily', N'Lopez', N'emily.lopez1815@example.org', '2016-11-08', 5, N'Love the Zelda games this one is really good as well'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Foster', N'nicholas.foster2723@example.net', '2016-11-08', 5, N'Easy to apply and I''ve been using the same one for a year now.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Ruiz', N'ashley.ruiz8141@example.net', '2016-11-08', 3, N'I''m updating this review. After a month I''ve deleted this and gone back to BO3. The main reason I buy these games is for multiplayer, and Infinite Warfare''s is just not good. Very unbalanced, I can shoot a guy 10 times, he turns around and I''m dead. Even Modern Warfare Remastered feels balanced. The campaign and zombies were good though. Stick with BO3 for multiplayer.'),
(N'Linda', N'Parker', N'linda.parker9101@example.org', '2016-11-08', 5, N'my best game'),
(N'Ivan', N'Jones', N'ivan.jones5393@example.org', '2016-11-08', 4, N'mine allows me to turn left and right when I am holding only down or up on the D-pad, thats a big problem for me but could be a plus for other gamers. Still the best 3rd party solution I''ve found'),
(N'Samuel', N'Khan', N'samuel.khan8642@example.com', '2016-11-09', 1, N'Hard to dock controllers for my kids, one of the USB connectors snapped in a month''s time.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Hughes', N'carlos.hughes2710@example.net', '2016-11-09', 5, N'I''ve played the Tomb Raider games since I was a kid and I was definitely disappointed when they initially released the game as an Xbox exclusive. I found the story to be compelling and there are enough unique challenges to keep you occupied. I always wish a good game''s story-mode was longer but this one''s is pretty lengthy. My only complaints are that there weren''t enough side quests and some of the challenges were impossible to complete if you didn''t do it on the first go-round.'),
(N'Anita', N'Allen', N'anita.allen7458@example.net', '2016-11-09', 5, N'This case is so awesome! Literally has everything you could ever possibly need'),
(N'Melissa', N'Hall', N'melissa.hall6664@example.net', '2016-11-09', 5, N'Works flawlessly and is very easy to program. I have large hands and it adjusts easily to fit most any hand'),
(N'Ivan', N'Wright', N'ivan.wright3290@example.org', '2016-11-09', 4, N'This was my entry point to the Halo franchise and loved the stories but the Multiplayer is far from great :('),
(N'Ivan', N'Wright', N'ivan.wright3290@example.org', '2016-11-09', 5, N'Another fantastic release from Turn 10. As a fan of the Forza series, Microsoft continues to push the boundaries of what the Xbox can offer and this game is Amazing on the Xbox and PC platform. I always prefer the Horizon version of Forza as I love the open world nature without the constraints of a track (Imagine crashing a Lamborghini in the Australian desert) as imposed by the Motorsport version of Forza.'),
(N'Diane', N'Richardson', N'diane.richardson4514@example.com', '2016-11-09', 5, N'Great game, enjoyed playing it'),
(N'Victoria', N'Butler', N'victoria.butler2167@example.com', '2016-11-09', 1, N'*UPDATED 1-10-17* After messing around with this remote and continuing to be disappointed the remote finally stopped working altogether. Returned it and got the PDP Talon Remote. The Talon works very well and offers more functionality and is $10 cheaper. I do not recommend this product, very disappointing. I bought this remote last year and I don''t even bother using it anymore. The remote overall is ok, it''s very lightweight and compact. I''ve noticed that you do need to be aiming at the console for it to respond and that sometimes the console is sluggish to respond to the remote or it just doesn''t respond to it at all. Unfortunately I have given up on the remote and have gone back to my controller. You can only hope the remote works for so long then have it not work and not work before you say "forget it" and go back to a controller. It''s simple to setup with your Xbox One. The remote could be better built adding a few more buttons for functionality as a TV remote and if the remote...'),
(N'Victoria', N'Butler', N'victoria.butler2167@example.com', '2016-11-09', 5, N'I bought this a year ago and have been very pleased with this chatpad. If you have to do any typing this accessory shortens your time typing, turning a minute of typing into seconds. This current generation of typing pad is better then the old one on the 360 with slightly bigger buttons and a few user control buttons thrown in too that add for a better experience. Unlike the old design there is no wasted space and little weight is added or noticed. Pros: -Light weight -Bigger buttons then the old 360 typing pad -Back-light -Volume control -My controller still charges on my Energizer Charging station with this pad connected to it. Some of my friends have said the extra weight tilts the controller off of the contacts enough to interrupt the charge, I have not had this problem at all. Cons: -Price This typing pad has a lot to offer although it might not be for every gamer but it is still a very good product. I would definitely recommend this to a friend or anyone really. You could try...'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ivanov', N'sarah.ivanov6261@example.org', '2016-11-09', 5, N'GAME WORKS AS STATED IN REVEIW... WORKS WITH MY SYSTEM. LOVE IT!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Murphy', N'patricia.murphy2702@example.org', '2016-11-10', 5, N'Everything as expected'),
(N'Mateo', N'Chavez', N'mateo.chavez8486@example.net', '2016-11-10', 5, N'Recommended A++++'),
(N'Adam', N'Wood', N'adam.wood3161@example.org', '2016-11-10', 5, N'Love this game.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Wisniewski', N'samuel.wisniewski9056@example.net', '2016-11-10', 5, N'Product works as described and arrived in a timely manor!'),
(N'Edward', N'Turner', N'edward.turner5597@example.net', '2016-11-10', 5, N'This is the DS port of the best game of all time. The extra content isn''t really needed (and is even somewhat pointless as the original best equipment already made you unfairly super powerful), and the new translation doesn''t have the same charm that the original SNES translation has, but this is still Chrono Trigger on the go, with multiplayer functions, the anime cutscenes from the PS1 version, and flawless load times! If you''re unable to play the SNES version (on an original SNES or from the Wii Shop Channel), then this is the version to get.'),
(N'Robert', N'Hernandez', N'robert.hernandez7355@example.net', '2016-11-10', 5, N'item as described'),
(N'James', N'Reed', N'james.reed9872@example.com', '2016-11-10', 5, N'Works great. I am very happy with it.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Chavez', N'yuki.chavez8142@example.net', '2016-11-10', 5, N'Such a blast to play. Loved the campaign and the interactions between the pilot and his titan. Action is smooth and challenging but not too difficult. I had alot of fun. Multiplayer was fun and fair. I would highly recommend this game.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Reyes', N'kimberly.reyes9639@example.com', '2016-11-11', 5, N'One of the best games I''ve ever played. I wanted to try something retro and got myself a Game Boy SP with this game and I loved it!. Now I know why people are crazy about Metroid. Good story, challenging, fun! It''s a must buy'),
(N'Victoria', N'Campbell', N'victoria.campbell5410@example.net', '2016-11-11', 5, N'Works perfectly w/ my PS One (slim) and Sony Trinitron HD CRT TV. Cables are nice and thick, connections feel secure. Length is ideal.'),
(N'Christine', N'Gonzalez', N'christine.gonzalez9832@example.net', '2016-11-11', 5, N'Love the game.'),
(N'Christine', N'Rivera', N'christine.rivera8996@example.com', '2016-11-11', 3, N'B Button broke after a few weeks of use. Make the dodge function in Tomb Raider a pain, since Lara might just not move sometimes, or keep moving right off a cliff. Also feels like a piece of plastic in the bad way. Preferred the Elite or PS4 controller.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Murphy', N'stephen.murphy4432@example.net', '2016-11-11', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Richardson', N'jeffrey.richardson4603@example.org', '2016-11-11', 4, N'These headphones are much more comfortable than the first Titanfall headphones. The padding is better, and the earpieces do not make your ears hurt after a longer time as with the first version. The microphone works very well, and the noise cancelling works nicely. You can bend the microphone to your selected position easily, and it folds back out of the way if you are not using it. The sound quality is very nice for a fairly-inexpensive set of headphones, and the sound comes straight through the connection to the Xbox controller without additional cabling. If I could change anything about these headphones, I would have included a wireless dongle so that you could use these without connecting directly to the controller, but this is a minor issue. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Peter', N'Baker', N'peter.baker9824@example.org', '2016-11-11', 1, N'High quality price.... Low quality headset... Sounds good but breaks easy. Been through 3 of the best quality ones they had and all break at the same spot about the earphone piece. Know of other gamers with the same issue. Waste of money is turtle beach.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Thompson', N'brandon.thompson1351@example.org', '2016-11-11', 5, N'Razer Naga Chroma I like even better than my previous Razer Naga. Must use a big Razer mousepad. I use it with a Razer Orbweaver Keypad'),
(N'Jessica', N'Powell', N'jessica.powell3613@example.com', '2016-11-11', 5, N'My favorite game, it really scares you out sometimes, but over all it''s a great game.'),
(N'William', N'Taylor', N'william.taylor6946@example.net', '2016-11-11', 5, N'I already knew I''d be downloading the game via Steam, so that wasn''t a problem for me... took about 6 hours. It fired up cleanly and after adjusting (down) some of the video specs (my PC is high-end i7/16gigs, etc. but my card is the minimum required - GTX 660). However, the detail, rendering, texture and resolution is still very nice - more than adequate! And, I might add being a graphic designer, I revel in the ''Steam Punk'' environment. I''ve not run into any issues with game play or stuttering (yet), so I''m not sure what all the complaints are about. Personally, I love this game! So many choices, so much to explore... many side missions, some downright ''scary'' - high replay value with each of two characters. The inhabitants are very well textured and the AI is even better than the first game. I was going to upgrade my video card, but after several hours of game play, I see no need. I ran through the new Doom and was glad to be done with it... this one, however, I''m going to savor!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Smith', N'kevin.smith3119@example.com', '2016-11-12', 3, N'I''m a huge fan of the Paper Mario series, but this isn''t like the rest of the series and it sucks.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Clark', N'alexander.clark1491@example.com', '2016-11-12', 3, N'sorry cannot write a review as such as it has gone to my grandson for Christmas! In the new year I will know whether or not he likes it!!!!'),
(N'Judith', N'Hill', N'judith.hill9998@example.com', '2016-11-12', 5, N'great nascar racing game.. very fun and entertaining and graphics are good.. driving is simulation style with up to 40 drivers via multiplayer..'),
(N'Alexander', N'Lopez', N'alexander.lopez1946@example.com', '2016-11-12', 1, N'DONT BUY THIS VERSION because MODERN WARFARE IS NOT INCLUDED AND YOU WILL GET BORED OF THE INFINITE WARFARE''s MULTIPLAYER AND ZOMBIES. The MP feels like Ghosts with Black ops 3 wall running and jumping. THERE IS TERRIBLE LAG COMPENSATION (****YOU RATHER FREQUENTLY SHOOT SOMEONE A BUNCH OF TIMES AND THE GAME DOESNT REGISTER AND THEY TURN AROUND AND SHOT YOU AND YOU DIE****) My internet connection is wired and is pretty fast so this crap should not be happening this often (if at all).'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Foster', N'tomasz.foster9059@example.net', '2016-11-12', 3, N'Very Good. Difficult episode. Glitch maybe? Returned.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Foster', N'tomasz.foster9059@example.net', '2016-11-12', 1, N'Returned it. Did not play well on XBOXONE.'),
(N'Amara', N'Phillips', N'amara.phillips3115@example.net', '2016-11-12', 5, N'Love it so cute'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Morales', N'evelyn.morales3962@example.com', '2016-11-12', 5, N'EXCELENTE'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Hernandez', N'jeremy.hernandez4599@example.com', '2016-11-12', 5, N'Works just like the official one.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Gutierrez', N'shirley.gutierrez8260@example.com', '2016-11-12', 4, N'GREAT product. LOOKS great works great. Reasonably priced.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Cox', N'kofi.cox8643@example.org', '2016-11-12', 4, N'Wish there were more games'),
(N'Joshua', N'Butler', N'joshua.butler2475@example.org', '2016-11-12', 4, N'its overall a great game. However, the xbox makes it look TERRIBLE. And also why did I get a british version?'),
(N'Sharon', N'Nelson', N'sharon.nelson2264@example.org', '2016-11-12', 5, N'Update: I have decided that I like the Logitech G302 better. I prefer the Xornet for shape, textured rubber grips, the side buttons, the DPI buttons, and the scroll wheel. But the G302 has a noticeably better sensor. ---original review--- Wow, glad I snagged this up when I did. Got it for $22, and now I see it is back up over $28. I have been using a Logitech G400s for gaming, but all of my other mouses (mice?) that I have ever used are smaller, so the G400s feels very unusual in my hand. I guess I prefer to use something betweena claw and fingertip grip with the bottom of my palm resting on same surface the mouse is sitting on for stability and with my thumb and pinky clenching the mouse to make it easier to lift and move around. The shape of this mouse is perfect for me, and it definitely feels like quality to use.'),
(N'Susan', N'Reyes', N'susan.reyes5064@example.org', '2016-11-12', 5, N'exactly as described great!'),
(N'James', N'Morris', N'james.morris8543@example.com', '2016-11-13', 4, N'Good quality game, Lots of replay value , but a bit of a weak and overused story-line and repetitive at times. A must for dragon quest fans.'),
(N'James', N'Morris', N'james.morris8543@example.com', '2016-11-13', 3, N'Incredibly repetitive, Objectives can be confusing and Boss battle systems convoluted. a Mediocre game. Not bad, not great.'),
(N'Priya', N'Lewis', N'priya.lewis9827@example.org', '2016-11-13', 5, N'I''m debating giving it four or five stars. Lets get the downside out of the way first. There are some frame rate issues (not too many, but some) and the controls can get jerky at this time, which fortunately doesn''t happen too much. Early on, when you''re very resource constrained, the open world doesn''t feel that open, but that''s probably by design. Still makes for a slow start. Also some areas in the beginning really don''t give you enough clues that you should be exploring...again, I guess that''s by design, but I hate getting to the summary screen and discovering I only found 30% of the things on a level because I didn''t look hard enough. Maybe its just been too long since I played the original Dishonored, which is another criticism...I think if you didn''t play the original Dishonored, the story might not make a lot of sense. And the overlong cut scenes at the beginning probably hurt more than help. That said, the game really opens up about halfway through the second area, and the...'),
(N'Donald', N'Ortiz', N'donald.ortiz3826@example.net', '2016-11-13', 5, N'Years after the collapse of civilisation in the great resource wars, former cop-turned-survivalist Max Rockatansky is headed for the Plains of Silence in his trusty car, the Interceptor. He runs afoul of Scabrous Scrotus, the ruler of Gastown and son of Immortan Joe, who steals the Interceptor - after Max stabs him in the head with his own chainsaw - and leaves Max to die. Max is rescued by Chumbucket, a maverick and zealous engineer-priest who believes that Max is "The Saint", a holy figure who will save the world using an amazing car that Chumbucket has been building for years, the Magnum Opus. Max reluctantly takes on the mantle of the Saint so he can find and defeat Scrotus and reclaim his Interceptor. Given that the Mad Max franchise has been around for almost forty years, it''s surprising that it hasn''t been the inspiration for a good video game before. There was one previous attempt, a rather poor action title released in 1989, but that''s it. This game is very different. It''s...'),
(N'Jack', N'Lee', N'jack.lee2586@example.com', '2016-11-13', 4, N'Kind of a Final Fantasy meets Pokemon. I''m not a huge Pokemon fan, but I do love classic Final Fantasy so I''m a fan of this.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Brown', N'ivan.brown5572@example.net', '2016-11-13', 4, N'With the Kinect sensor, Just Dance 2017 is a pretty great workout tool. I was really surprised by how much energy it took just to get through a single song. The dance moves take a little bit to adjust to, but you can quickly see the sequence that they''re going for, and it''s easy for most people in the target age group to get the hang of it quickly. For some reason, the karaoke bonus function didn''t seem to score. Maybe I''m just bad. Either way, I liked the inclusion of the lyrics. There were a few things that kept this from being a 5-star game, though: 1) If you go too far outside of where the game expects you to be, it creates a new dancer on the fly, and scores you separately. 2) While there are a lot of songs, it seemed like almost a third of them weren''t performed by the original artist. 3) As soon as you install the game, you''re given a 48-hour unlimited pass -- which is awesome in that there''s a deep library, but once the pass is over, you see that the songs you have left are...'),
(N'Tyler', N'Campbell', N'tyler.campbell8462@example.net', '2016-11-13', 5, N'I played this one for about a year and it was a lot of fun.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Jones', N'patrick.jones4033@example.org', '2016-11-13', 3, N'This is an action stealth game with sniping it''s cool to shot someone with your rifle never gets old that''s the best of this game You can play stealthy which is good The story is meh I skipped it and the enemy AI is kinda bad and sometimes like glitchy with bugs or something also this game doesn''t included the Hitler dlc mission so that''s not cool But the gameplay is good the stealth and the sniping is what makes this game fun to play If the AI worked better and if they included the Hitler mission I would give this game 4 stars I hope sniper 4 corrects sniper 3 mistakes'),
(N'Christopher', N'Jimenez', N'christopher.jimenez3666@example.net', '2016-11-14', 5, N'Fun game to play if you wanna murder people.'),
(N'Heather', N'Henderson', N'heather.henderson3947@example.com', '2016-11-14', 5, N'Cult classic very underrated game.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'White', N'elizabeth.white8174@example.com', '2016-11-14', 3, N'This game was clearly a money grab. The story was pointless and the game ends with a cliffhanger. Is it that hard to make a decent story these days? The trailer had a better story than the actual game itself!!!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Raghunathan', N'deborah.raghunathan7073@example.net', '2016-11-14', 1, N'they always fall off and can even hurt when they do'),
(N'Angela', N'Wright', N'angela.wright6304@example.net', '2016-11-14', 5, N'It''s in good shape and works great'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Alvarez', N'kimberly.alvarez7779@example.org', '2016-11-14', 5, N'Great product. Fast Shipping.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Torres', N'elizabeth.torres9975@example.org', '2016-11-14', 5, N'Amazing Game'),
(N'Aaron', N'Ortiz', N'aaron.ortiz5400@example.org', '2016-11-14', 5, N'Love'),
(N'Pamela', N'Watson', N'pamela.watson3311@example.com', '2016-11-14', 2, N'the only damaged item in a combined order . cd cracked and taped'),
(N'Sofia', N'Harris', N'sofia.harris9136@example.org', '2016-11-14', 1, N'Titanfall was the best fast paced FPS ever. When I heard they were making a #2, I was beyond excited. When I played Titanfall 2, I was eternally disappointed. They removed everything good about first Titanfall and added all the crap of the new Call of Duty''s to it. It is a beautifully designed piece of crap with glitter if top. It is a great game for those who lack substance, structure and have a short attention span. Your 12 year old cousin would love it. Reasons why I don''t like it. 1. It does not flow like the original. The feel of movment is less reactive. 2. They desided to go with quantity rather than quality. They have 7 horribly designed titans, rather than 3 well balanced good ones. 3. Pilots do mass damage to titans. Titans are an after thought. Weak, brittle, frail. They don''t last long. Maps are to cramped for real titan battle. Titans no longer have shields. Unique titan voices are diminished. 4. It''s a call of duty knock off. I couldn''t tell if I was playing Call of...'),
(N'Jack', N'Powell', N'jack.powell1769@example.org', '2016-11-14', 1, N'Didn''t work'),
(N'Emma', N'Kim', N'emma.kim2785@example.org', '2016-11-15', 2, N'I agree with the other people this just dance is horrible'),
(N'Mark', N'Torres', N'mark.torres5307@example.net', '2016-11-15', 5, N'A must have horror game. This sets the standard for all other resident evil games in my book, be prepared for a frightening challenge.'),
(N'Mark', N'Torres', N'mark.torres5307@example.net', '2016-11-15', 4, N'Great collection of all the Halo games. Graphics could be better in places, but for the price it is worth it.'),
(N'Peter', N'Cook', N'peter.cook5087@example.org', '2016-11-15', 5, N'This is one of the best Pokemon games for the 3Ds'),
(N'Raymond', N'Edwards', N'raymond.edwards5276@example.net', '2016-11-15', 5, N'good...!!! Excelent...!!!'),
(N'Eric', N'Ali', N'eric.ali2190@example.net', '2016-11-15', 3, N'Ps2 launch title with such amazing graphics at its time. I love beat me ups. But the problem is the game is more of a movie. The game has short fight sequences. While it concentrates on dialogues and cut scenes that are 20 minutes long the game is relatively short. The game feels long because of the cut scenes but if you remove that the gameplay falls into 5 hours or even a bit less. The multiplayer is fun and if you have that 4 player analog thing you''ll have lots of fun. In the end the game comes to a average fighter.'),
(N'Diane', N'Singh', N'diane.singh2566@example.org', '2016-11-15', 5, N'In spite of this game crashing 3 times when I crawled out to the deck of the Whaler, I love this game. I chalk that up to Bethesda''s shoe-horning style of cramming as much as they can into a game that barely fits on a console (PS4 in my case). However, for whatever reason, the crashes did not persist (without a patch) and I guess I found a path on the deck to get off the ship. Don''t forget to dive for the rune right off the side of the ship, you''ll see it if you use the heart BEFORE you tell the captain your ready to go ashore. Its things like that that the game leaves to you to solve of which there is always a plethora of different ways to do it in this game. Do it YOUR way is what the game encourages. I was discouraged a few times once I got to Karnaca''s docks, but that was when I was trying to get past the wall of light with brute force. Once you concede that you have to find a different way to do things other than blast your way through which is VERY possible in this game: you...'),
(N'Peter', N'Fisher', N'peter.fisher2265@example.com', '2016-11-15', 5, N'My 8 yr. old son loves it!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Gonzalez', N'andrew.gonzalez5505@example.org', '2016-11-15', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Andrew', N'Gonzalez', N'andrew.gonzalez5505@example.org', '2016-11-15', 5, N'Worked'),
(N'Ryan', N'Reyes', N'ryan.reyes9070@example.com', '2016-11-15', 5, N'Good product'),
(N'Emma', N'Hughes', N'emma.hughes5500@example.com', '2016-11-15', 4, N'its cod if u like cod u will like this if u don''t like cod u will not like this simple as that'),
(N'Anna', N'Reyes', N'anna.reyes4997@example.org', '2016-11-16', 4, N'For my daughter.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Murphy', N'rebecca.murphy5875@example.net', '2016-11-16', 5, N'Fun for all ages. Gets you up and moving.'),
(N'Omar', N'Martinez', N'omar.martinez1561@example.net', '2016-11-16', 5, N'Works like a charm. The only knock is that you have to charge it often. PlayStation should do a better job of allowing the charge to last longer. Besides that it is worth buying.'),
(N'Walter', N'Garcia', N'walter.garcia9290@example.com', '2016-11-16', 5, N'This review is only for the single player campaign, since I don''t have PS Plus and I don''t like playing MP games online. With that said, Titanfall 2 was great! I didn''t know what to expect since I didn''t play the original on the Xbone, but after hearing glowing reviews on the game at Neogaf and other sites, I decided to try it for myself. Good story, great gameplay, great ride- Titanfall 2 may be short but it is totally worth it if you like single player campaigns. If the price tag is too steep for your taste, I''d tell you to rent it or definitely put it on your list to buy when the price goes down. I don''t know what else to say besides this, and I don''t want to over hype it and create unrealistic expectations. But Titanfall 2 certainly needs the support of gamers for it''s great campaign and great precedent it set- no season pass, small patch (90mb). I hope one way or another, you will give it a pass.'),
(N'Michael', N'Rogers', N'michael.rogers4135@example.com', '2016-11-16', 3, N'Fits kinda "meh" but it does what it''s supposed to.'),
(N'Steven', N'Kelly', N'steven.kelly5486@example.org', '2016-11-16', 4, N'I''ve played this for about 8 hours now and have not completed the game yet so this is an early impression. Overall a good game, especially if you enjoyed the first one, but it''s a bit more awkward. That could be because I played the first one when it was older and most likely patched quite a bit. It is a good stealth game with lots of different ways to get somewhere or accomplish your tasks. You get a lot of options on how you wish to increase your skill. A lot more options than the first game. You can play as Corvo or the Empress. I can see how this game would have a lot of replayability. The problem seems to stem from them attempting to make the game harder than the first one. In the first one, Dark Vision gave you a constant view of their sightlines. In this one, it pulses instead. Also, they sometimes see me before they are even in range of my Dark Vision. Also, I went inside a 5-story building yet the stairs only leads up to the 3rd floor. That''s because they want you to find...'),
(N'John', N'Diaz', N'john.diaz7033@example.org', '2016-11-16', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Brian', N'Ortiz', N'brian.ortiz7451@example.com', '2016-11-16', 5, N'Wonderful game'),
(N'Victoria', N'Lopez', N'victoria.lopez7901@example.org', '2016-11-16', 2, N'I''ve had this for about two and a half weeks, using daily. Pro: holds keyboard (Corsair Vengeance K70) securely; sturdy single-corded connection to computer and power adapter; lip at right and near side of mouse area helps prevent mouse from falling off; USB ports on side; includes hex-driver for access/assembly; build quality solid, except for the one significant flaw*. Cons: *ALREADY coming apart at a key place --> the magnets that connect the keyboard platform to the padded lap section have begun to detach [description below*]; having the keyboard all the way to the side creates the need to shift the device away from a centered position to type comfortably; lack of a lip to the top of the mouse area allows mouse to slide off easily in that direction placing additional stress on the mouse cord & connection; USB hub randomly cuts off recognition of one of the devices (keyboard usually), usually when computer is idle, requiring me to unplug it and re-plug it in to resume normal...'),
(N'Andrew', N'Ramos', N'andrew.ramos4500@example.com', '2016-11-16', 5, N'Excellent addition to my gaming computer lights up bright and fully adjustable via Razer Software.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Williams', N'nancy.williams7603@example.com', '2016-11-17', 5, N'A great fun game. But the ps3 ver of it will stop being supported soon so get it on a different system'),
(N'Emma', N'Martinez', N'emma.martinez7889@example.org', '2016-11-17', 3, N'I bought two of these used, and they both arrived in decent condition. Joystick action is good, and I like being able to use my left and right hands. Throttle control is solid but feels insubstantial compared to a separate throttle. I was mainly disappointed by the short throw on the trigger, I would prefer something with more travel.'),
(N'Susan', N'Raghunathan', N'susan.raghunathan9831@example.net', '2016-11-17', 5, N'I bought this game for $30 and on the 4 mission on campaign,wow this game is awesome love the gameplay and graphics. I''m also playing dishonered 2 and this game titanfall 2 is a great game to take a break from all the stealth mission in dishonered , highly recommend this game'),
(N'Samuel', N'Gonzalez', N'samuel.gonzalez6117@example.com', '2016-11-17', 2, N'Couldn''t get it to work w my visual land tablet'),
(N'Brian', N'Kelly', N'brian.kelly4550@example.org', '2016-11-17', 2, N'After several months, the tracking and mouse buttons still work fine, but the scroll wheel has become very faulty. For example, if I''m scrolling down in a document, it will begin to scroll down, only to jump back up a little at the last second. This isn''t as pronounced scrolling up, but happens occasionally. Games that rely on the scroll wheel are entirely unplayable now. I''m assuming this is due to dirt and grime getting in the wheel, but the only way to open the mouse is by tearing apart the serial number at the bottom, and I don''t want to do that. I expected to get more use for $70.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'King', N'cynthia.king6137@example.com', '2016-11-17', 3, N'***11-17 update removed 2* *** So the left headphone has started a rattle inside when the bass amp is turned on, low or high. I cannot seem to find a place to open it to see if I can fix it. I haven''t dropped it or anything, so not sure why it started all of a sudden. ***Orginal Review 5* *** I bought this to use with my works phone system. I was not disappointed. The force feedback feature is simply amazing, when I listen to music, I max out this feature (two presses of the button) and the bass comes alive. Pros: Audio quality is great Bass feedback makes it feel like your head is going to fall off Microphone is good, have had no complaints with almost 5 months of use daily You can turn the light off that''s on the earpieces (long press the force feedback button, twice) Earpieces are EXTREMELY comfortable Easy to adjust to your head Cons: Software is horrible. You are better off manually setting the EQ and other options through windows sound control panel The volume knob turns way...'),
(N'Justin', N'Anderson', N'justin.anderson1686@example.net', '2016-11-17', 5, N'I love this game so much'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Brown', N'jonathan.brown5305@example.org', '2016-11-17', 4, N'Son writes this: This game is good but hard. For the VC version, 1. It plays exactly like the original 2. Holding L and R at the same time, and pressing Y while doing so allows you to switch from B&W to green 3. Hold START and SELECT while the game is booting up to get a GameBoy frame around the game!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Young', N'ashley.young1219@example.net', '2016-11-17', 5, N'Nice amiibo!'),
(N'Michael', N'Boyd', N'michael.boyd8562@example.com', '2016-11-17', 5, N'I like the game so far.'),
(N'Richard', N'Foster', N'richard.foster5221@example.org', '2016-11-18', 4, N'For it''s time, probably the most ambitious and technologically advanced game a 10 year old system can handle.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Turner', N'rachel.turner3359@example.net', '2016-11-18', 3, N'I feel like the product is not worth the price. I love officially that this is an officially licensed product and I love the idea behind it, but I feel like it is cheaply constructed and will ultimately not protect the amiibo cards very well. The pages are bound too tightly and as you fill up your album it will become harder to flip pages without causing damage to the innermost amiibo cards. It has been difficult for me putting away cards in the innermost slots and even more difficult to remove them for use. It is a cute product, and I did buy the albums for the four card series available at the moment. I just wish the design was thought through better, like having rings inside instead or having a larger margin between the pins and the seams of the card sleeves. For these being $25 I feel like the quality should be much higher. Definitely not the Nintendo item quality I am used to.'),
(N'Betty', N'Foster', N'betty.foster1884@example.net', '2016-11-18', 5, N'I got the digital version PSN for 5.99, unless a plastic disc is worth a markup of 60+ dollars to you, I''d get the digital version, plus you''ll get to play it on your psp as well, can''t do that with a disc. I just don''t get the mentality of gamers anymore. Why are people paying more for physical versions of games that have been released digitally. I guess it looks great on the shelf as a collectors item, but I prefer to play my games. Anyway It''s classic straight forward castlevania game, there is 2 versions original and a version with updated graphics and music. Got ps3 get for 5.99 well worth it plus it''ll save you about 60 bucks.'),
(N'William', N'Wilson', N'william.wilson6552@example.org', '2016-11-18', 5, N'Perfect. This definitely takes me back.'),
(N'Richard', N'Carter', N'richard.carter2010@example.com', '2016-11-18', 5, N'Don''t be confused by the title. What you actually get is the Limited Edition which includes Dishonoured 1 Definitive Edition - Download Code from PS store where you choose Standard option. When I bought the game, there were only 2 options, Collectors Edition and standard edition. the game takes a long time to download and install. Overall - Exactly what I hoped for.'),
(N'Julie', N'Khan', N'julie.khan1141@example.com', '2016-11-18', 5, N'Quite possibly the best handheld Zelda game to date. They found ways to make new puzzles for a game that''s been around for ages. 3D graphics were very well done (best use of 3DS screen I''ve ever seen). I love the new items too. Writing this review makes me want to go back and replay it.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Robinson', N'sharon.robinson3331@example.net', '2016-11-18', 5, N'My husband loves this game. It reminds him of the classic Final Fantasy games. It is turn based and not real time. The story is good and the voice acting is cheesy, as it should be.'),
(N'Priya', N'Richardson', N'priya.richardson7847@example.net', '2016-11-18', 4, N'The reviews about the echoey surround sound are true. However, I got used to it that way. The default EQ settings are horrible for footsteps so I had to change my EQ settings to be able to hear footsteps better. I used the beatmode EQ settings on the astro gaming forums (google it if you want it). The echoey surround sound is very much true for this Mixamp. I still have my 2013 Mixamp and I used to prefer that Mixamp to the TR Mixamp. However, the TR Mixamp is actually slightly better for footsteps when you have the right EQ settings. You should eventually get used to hearing the echo in the surround sound. I like the convience of not needing a chat cable, because my old chat cables kept breaking with my old 2013 A40 + Mixamp Pro. So the new TR Mixamp is great in that it doesn''t need a chat cable (voice goes over USB and sounds much clearer than the old Mixamps). All in all, the old Mixamps sounded better because there was no echo, so I''d only "upgrade" to this one if you need to....'),
(N'Nancy', N'Perez', N'nancy.perez4318@example.net', '2016-11-18', 4, N'I loved the gameplay here, my only complaint was that the game is too short.'),
(N'Maria', N'Chen', N'maria.chen1077@example.org', '2016-11-19', 5, N'VERY NICE = )'),
(N'Noah', N'Thomas', N'noah.thomas8315@example.org', '2016-11-19', 5, N'MY CHILDHOOD!'),
(N'Noah', N'Thomas', N'noah.thomas8315@example.org', '2016-11-19', 5, N'I LOVE IT I LOVE IT I LOVE IT'),
(N'Barbara', N'Lee', N'barbara.lee7732@example.net', '2016-11-19', 5, N'muy bien'),
(N'Ryan', N'Brown', N'ryan.brown2524@example.org', '2016-11-19', 5, N'Tomb raider is always good. Reminds of playing zelda on my old Nintendo, always challenging puzzles and boss battles!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Kim', N'stephanie.kim4374@example.net', '2016-11-19', 5, N'Really quite nice and fits the Xbox one controller perfectly ( and a picture of a Xbox 360 controller for comparison, it doesn''t fit BTW)'),
(N'Carlos', N'Martinez', N'carlos.martinez2458@example.net', '2016-11-19', 3, N'Multiplayer is ok. Takes to long to get into a game. The load screens you just stare at them. Don''t try to leave a game after finishing it freezes to often. Game play is same as other BF. Just not a good a COD. large maps are fun but again the spawn kills a getting old.'),
(N'Henry', N'Jackson', N'henry.jackson3229@example.net', '2016-11-19', 3, N'Bought this 3 years ago, no less than 6 months in 2013, at the time I got my PS3 for Christmas of 2012 3.5 going on 4 years. Skate is an okay game. I like the open world enviroments for the player to move their created Skater in, much like in bygone recent Tony Hawk games such as American Wasteland (2005), graphics sort of hold up even for a 2007 game in 2016-17, the skate challenges were sort of difficult for me. Not a big fan of the control system. I had to use the analog sticks ("Thumbsticks" if on Xbox) to rotate and turn my skater around to make the moves. Also not a big fan of selected copyrigihted/licensed songs featured in the name neither. Heck, the Tony Hawk games had better soundtracks than that. Plan on getting Skate 2 and 3 soon.'),
(N'Henry', N'Jackson', N'henry.jackson3229@example.net', '2016-11-19', 3, N'Campaign is very short, but I never played the Multiplayer modes. Good game though in terms of graphics, gameplay and somewhat voice acting. Also from the look of the covers, the masks remind me of the Neo Vipers from G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra (2009). You know, the G.I. Joe movie a lot of those hated so much and still.'),
(N'Donna', N'Allen', N'donna.allen5375@example.com', '2016-11-20', 1, N'False advertising ruined the game, setting expectations way over what you find in the actual game.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Tanaka', N'lucia.tanaka1672@example.org', '2016-11-20', 5, N'Work as expected.'),
(N'Charles', N'Chavez', N'charles.chavez5656@example.com', '2016-11-20', 4, N'If you liked the first dishonored game then you will like, if not love, this game. The story is excellent and allows you to play as two different characters, which means you have two single player campaigns. The main complaint is the performance issues. You can do a search to get an in depth report about these issues. Once they release a patch to fix these problems, assuming they do, it will be a five star game.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Flores', N'sandra.flores5998@example.org', '2016-11-20', 5, N'Works great. I like that it has clips on it that clips right into the Kinect unit. I have the Wii bar and PS move camera on top of the Kinnect too. Holds all of them perfectly.'),
(N'Adam', N'Adams', N'adam.adams5725@example.net', '2016-11-20', 5, N'I figured this was going to be a flashy reskin of Watch Dogs 1. I mean, look at what UbiSoft has done to Assassins Creed! But they actually IMPROVED upon the first entry. (Stunned silence...) If you haven''t played Watch Dogs 1, that''s fine. You don''t need to have. Basically the hacker Marcus is accused of a crime he didn''t commit. Conspiracy begins. Marcus then has to dodge the conspirators while using his amazing hacking skills to survive in the San Francisco bay area. I won''t go beyond that because it''s really fun to watch the story develop. What gives me the happy game fun smiles is the amazingly detailed open world surrounding the Bay Area. San Francisco and the surrounding cities are brought to life. And as someone who travels regularly to SF, there are a lot of familiar sights. Granted it''s not a 100% accurate city rendering, but it feels like you could really be walking or driving around SF. It does have a bit of that Grand Theft Auto V feel, especially with the immense open...'),
(N'Mateo', N'Reyes', N'mateo.reyes3066@example.net', '2016-11-20', 5, N'Looks great!! If you''re a borderlined psychopath or into blood, this is for you.'),
(N'Donna', N'Williams', N'donna.williams6298@example.net', '2016-11-20', 5, N'Great Item. Thanks!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Kelly', N'patrick.kelly6630@example.com', '2016-11-21', 5, N'This Is, One Of, The Best, Game Boy, Games, I Have, Ever Played, Because, You Get, The Spread Gun, Early On, Into The Game, There Are 6 Levels, In This, Game, Including A Level, With Moving Trees, In The Background, So If, You Have A, Game Boy, Classic/Pocket/Color System, Buy This Game, Or, Bill And Lance, Will Show Up, At Your Door, With Spread Guns, And Blast You, To Bits, And Pieces, Just Kidding.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Patel', N'gregory.patel3793@example.com', '2016-11-21', 2, N'couples issues here. The first more minor one is that the light settings don''t save when you turn your pc off and therefore you have to reset your light every time you turn on your pc. The second being tracking is pretty garbage which you can really tell while you play games, otherwise it works for everyday computing purposes. To bad its over priced. I don''t like Razor after trying a few of their products'),
(N'Walter', N'Kelly', N'walter.kelly9437@example.com', '2016-11-21', 5, N'Awesome game, great campaign, excellent multiplayer mode. Super fun overall. A must have.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Walker', N'douglas.walker4681@example.org', '2016-11-21', 2, N'Lost sensitivity, of the bottom screen after using this. Top screen cover worked well, quality ok. 2 stars since it worked on stop screen and does not work well on the bottom.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Fisher', N'olivia.fisher6524@example.net', '2016-11-21', 3, N'I finally decided to try BLOPS3. Kinda burned out of COD, but at this price, figured why not. The campaign is just weird and the story is awful. The multiplayer is ok, but doesn''t feel like anything new or original. Glad i didn''t pay $60 for it when it came out. I will say it''s better than infinite warfare, PLayed at my friend''s house. Wow, worst COD ever. Saving grace was remaster. Anyway, fir $20 not a bad deal. But i''m not buying the dlc pack, especially this late in BLOP 3''s life cycle.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Hill', N'rachel.hill8938@example.net', '2016-11-22', 5, N'Daughter will not stop playing this game.'),
(N'Diane', N'Williams', N'diane.williams3057@example.net', '2016-11-22', 4, N'I got tired of trying to play first person shooters on my phone, while trying to use the on screen buttons. This controller paired perfectly with my Google pixel XL. Now games are actually fun to play. Great quality, feels comfortable in your hand. Only complaint I have is it doesnt work too well with my Apple iPhone 5s, but I think that is an apple issue, not a gameir one.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Ortiz', N'kevin.ortiz7615@example.net', '2016-11-22', 5, N'This an awesome-looking controller and it plays just as well. We have an Elite Xbox controller, and it''s almost as nice (one picky difference). I tested this with an Xbox, not a PC. Here''s the Pros: - despite being a wired controller, there is plenty of line and there was definitely some good thought put into how it connects to the controller, it''s not going anywhere - feedback on buttons and other elements of controller, especially the analog sticks, are much better than the plain old vanilla controller, and almost as good as the Elite controller - the top and side grips are useful and I found them to be really handy during serious play - the faceplate images are not printed onto the plastic, it''s a molded design so the controller looks really serious There was only one downside, and it''s really a personal preference thing, but I found the buttons on the back to be a bit clumsy and maybe it''s because I''m used to the Elite controller. I found myself frequently hitting the center...'),
(N'Nathan', N'Bailey', N'nathan.bailey3412@example.com', '2016-11-22', 5, N'Thank you'),
(N'Victoria', N'Boyd', N'victoria.boyd4516@example.com', '2016-11-22', 5, N'Love this game excellent very cool.'),
(N'Paul', N'Collins', N'paul.collins9162@example.net', '2016-11-22', 5, N'Rented Titanfall 2 at Redbox, loved it, bought it.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Henderson', N'ronald.henderson1055@example.net', '2016-11-22', 4, N'It''s super duper cute! I cant wait to try it with acnl''s amiibo update. Compared to my mabel figure it''s a lot smaller than I thought it would be.'),
(N'Christina', N'Reyes', N'christina.reyes7092@example.com', '2016-11-22', 1, N'This was a very childish version of Nancy Drew. Stinker. They mailed it in, instead of crafting it.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Walker', N'kathleen.walker1822@example.com', '2016-11-22', 3, N'Waiting for the internet hate when I state - this game is a tad overrated. That said, it came out 2 months before Witcher 3, so I understand why there was some initial fanboy fanfare and continued nostalgic gushing that is completely unnecessary for a game that literally hates you. I always praise and gush and prance in fondness over games that hate me. But if this were a DRINKING game, where you had to take a drink every time you nearly throw a controller, try to fold and break the controller, either/or while yelling "tell me how that''s fair" or "this game cheats!" or the most popular response "STUPID F^*# CAMERA"...you would be dead from cirrhosis of the liver. And yet somehow, if a sticker was put on the box or in the description on PSN for Bloodborne that brazenly stated "This game will give you cirrhosis of the liver, and laryngitis, and will kill you" it would still be a a "top rated" PS4 game because we now judge fortitude and strength not by our accomplishments in society,...'),
(N'Priya', N'Sanchez', N'priya.sanchez9609@example.com', '2016-11-22', 1, N'There are loads of details I could go into about why this game is garbage, but here''s the overarching theme I keep coming back to. It''s all form and no function. You''ll rarely play a better looking game. If graphics are paramount for you, then by all means, this is your game. The troublesome fact is that for every detailed animation or carefully crafted level, it seems like they designed the game to make a good looking trailer. Once you''re in the game, the mechanics are pretty awful. For starters, the weapons are a joke. For example, Assault class has essentially two weapons. An SMG, or a shotgun. Sure, there are numerous variants for both guns, but compare that to BF4 where you had dozens of weapons and dozens of attachments for each weapon, and BF1 feels like a demo by comparison. The levels are another example. While it''s fantastic that you can deform the earth, level buildings, and knock down trees, it means nothing when the level itself is lopsided in one sides favor. When fog...'),
(N'Donna', N'Jones', N'donna.jones2565@example.com', '2016-11-22', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Wilson', N'raymond.wilson2282@example.net', '2016-11-23', 1, N'The game is just ok for us using a wheel. The steering is about the worst, can''t drive the car straight, there''s no adjusting dead zones. By the way it''s the game that ios the problem. My wheel works great with Wheels of steel. But of course EA and Criterion can''t programs themselves out of a wet brown paper bag!!! My suggestion if you play with a wheel stay away from Need For Speed!!!!'),
(N'Richard', N'Cruz', N'richard.cruz1947@example.org', '2016-11-23', 5, N'very god graphis good'),
(N'Sofia', N'Williams', N'sofia.williams2831@example.com', '2016-11-23', 5, N'Awesome controller. Love the white color as well.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Chavez', N'matthew.chavez8861@example.com', '2016-11-23', 5, N'A lot better than part 1. The single player adventure is surprisingly awesome. Not over hyping but its fun to play as a trooper and a mech and all the customizations. I''m a couple hours in and didn''t think i would like it as the first game the single player was just a tutorial..... but its really good, looks really good, and is fun.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Martin', N'gregory.martin2644@example.com', '2016-11-23', 5, N'I bought this as a gift for a 7 year old and he loves it.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Chavez', N'lucia.chavez9251@example.org', '2016-11-23', 5, N'Ninja Gaiden II for Xbox 360 and Bayonetta 2 are the best games in their genre. Bayonetta 2 improves upon its fun original by expanding its color-palette. Bayonetta 1 was very brown and gray. Bayonetta 2 introduces blues and purples. Bayonetta 2 also keeps its deep and fun battle-system. It wasn''t dumbed down. There are a ton of unlockables and purchaseables using skill and in-game currency.'),
(N'Heather', N'Nelson', N'heather.nelson7152@example.com', '2016-11-23', 5, N'Adorable!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Ramos', N'nicholas.ramos4640@example.net', '2016-11-23', 5, N'Perfect, love these grips and the price can''t be beat'),
(N'Eric', N'Chavez', N'eric.chavez3654@example.com', '2016-11-24', 4, N'It is a nice game and is fun. That being said... It is not though, a "hunting" game. Really more of a hunting theme assasians creed type of game. Sneak / hide to get to areas to take a shot. Combat against animals, well more of shoot then get out of the way. Does have nice open world to roam around for some fast shooting and animal combat. The jeep / truck is a bit clunky for movement, but it beats walking. Game finishes quite fast, a day or two with not a lot of replay value.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Ward', N'samantha.ward4112@example.net', '2016-11-24', 5, N'Maybe the plastic could be a little thicker and well finished, but I have no issues with this control set up at all. The pedal assembly is going to move around some no matter what...I just put them up against a cabinet. The force feedback is fun, especially with the off road titles I have, less so with the Grand Prix stuff. And you can''t beat the price, as long as the company keeps up with the updates.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Green', N'ethan.green8471@example.com', '2016-11-24', 2, N'I can''t even begin to say how much I''m disappointed in this game. YES, I''ve had it since release date and consistently play it. Huge street fighter fan and this game just makes me so sad. 1. Characters are all messed up feeling now. I used to play with Cammy a lot in old SF games, now I don''t even use her because I don''t like what they''ve done with her moves. Feels like they''ve made her bad. And I''m not even going to start on how bad Juri is. 2. Characters look awful. All of them look warped somehow, especially Ken whom they''ve had to remake a model for because of how bad he looked. Only Ryu and Chun-li look acceptable. 3. Work for colors now. Old games would either come with all the colors OR you''d have to play the game a lot and unlock colors for your costumes. Now you either have to buy it(nope) or attempt to get them in small amounts through survival. 4. No more arcade. I mean come on. When we weren''t playing online or locally with others, chances are we were doing trials,...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Gonzalez', N'carolyn.gonzalez1811@example.net', '2016-11-24', 5, N'My children love them !'),
(N'Daniel', N'Price', N'daniel.price2001@example.net', '2016-11-25', 5, N'It''s not the best looking, but it''s a great keyboard. I looked long and hard for a keyboard to use for gaming/regular use that I wouldn''t have to pay out the butt for, and this is what I found.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Reed', N'douglas.reed9531@example.net', '2016-11-25', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Brown', N'jonathan.brown5305@example.org', '2016-11-25', 2, N'Son writes again When I got it so I could play Skyward Sword, it worked nicely. Then after a while it stopped working and now won''t stay connected to the Wii remote. Guess I''ll have to get a Wii Remote Plus.'),
(N'Anita', N'Howard', N'anita.howard3284@example.org', '2016-11-25', 1, N'Bought this at Target on Black Friday because it was $35. At that price, even if it was the total garbage I expected it to be, no gigantic loss. Well, it''s a total disaster. It does little things well (goal songs, ECHL, AHL) but the most important thing is gameplay, and this game is not fun to play. Here is what you will experience if you buy this game: 1. Terminator level AI. They are out to destroy your firstborn. You cannot pass, shoot, or skate without them crushing you. 2. Random goals. Never for you, always against. Shot from behind the blue line, random bouncy puck, shot your goalie sees all the way, just terribad. 3. "Physics". at EA, they must think this word is similar to pinball, because that is what the puck does. 4. Opponent God mode. They will cycle sometimes, and you just know a goal is coming. Nothing you do will separate man from puck, literally nothing. 5. A soundtrack that feels like you''re shopping at Forever 21. It''s fitting for this game, there is no...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Lopez', N'ronald.lopez9137@example.com', '2016-11-25', 5, N'Very nice mouse for the cost, I have the Razer Naga but it just wasn''t cutting it for FPS games as it is a little bulky and has a bunch of extra buttons. This, however, is very nice for FPS games. It can go up to 10,000 DPI, has the Chroma Sync to match the color scheme of your other Razer devices, has 2 side buttons and fits comfortably in the palm of your hand. Would highly recommend this mouse to anyone who plays FPS games.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Powell', N'samantha.powell7810@example.com', '2016-11-26', 1, N'Don''t buy for multiplayer. The lag comp is the worst it has been since MW3, maybe even worse if that is possible. This series has made billions and it is pathetic they can''t offer a quality online experience when so much of Call of Duty is based around just that. There are much better options on the market, don''t waste your money on this trash. If you are buying for zombies and campaign that is an entirely different review.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Powell', N'samantha.powell7810@example.com', '2016-11-26', 5, N'Great game. Stable online play that plays consistently, and doesn''t make you feel cheated by bad connections. Solid campaign. Lots to unlock, and free DLC on the way so no season pass and no dividing of the player base. Don''t hesitate, this is a superb title.'),
(N'Steven', N'Morris', N'steven.morris9818@example.com', '2016-11-26', 5, N'If you like the other dualshock 4 controllers you''ll like this one as well, works great just like the other colors, and the red color itself looks sharp.'),
(N'Steven', N'Morris', N'steven.morris9818@example.com', '2016-11-26', 4, N'Mouse works fine, pretty much what one would expect from a cheaper gaming mouse. The 2 additional buttons are nice. One annoying thing is the blue lighting of the mouse on the sides will reset every time my computer is booted up and the default is fading in and out which can get annoying but you can turn it off or make it solid - it is just annoying to have to reset it every time my computer reboots. The mouse has worked fine so far, no functional problems. The weights are a nice addition so you can change the weighting of the mouse to your liking.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ortiz', N'jeremy.ortiz5746@example.org', '2016-11-26', 5, N'Fun game with an expansive map. Recommended for kids 12+. Of course when playing online you''ll run into all types but they can be muted.'),
(N'Emily', N'Smith', N'emily.smith5865@example.com', '2016-11-26', 5, N'This game is everything I had hoped it would be. Operations is unreal. It is beyond intense. I find myself in awe as I am sprinting towards objectives with artillery explosions falling all around me with incredible realism. Get surround sound with a subwoofer and you will be extremely impressed with how detailed the sights, sounds, and experiences are while playing online.'),
(N'George', N'Campbell', N'george.campbell1990@example.org', '2016-11-26', 5, N'Well-made product. The stand in the back works well and is quite sturdy.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Jimenez', N'patricia.jimenez2474@example.com', '2016-11-27', 5, N'my kids love it.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Watson', N'pamela.watson2034@example.org', '2016-11-27', 5, N'Great game. I use to spend hours building houses with legos until I ran out of blocks to build with. Now with minecraft I have unlimited blocks. Great for any kid or adult that likes building with legos.'),
(N'Michael', N'Ramirez', N'michael.ramirez1847@example.net', '2016-11-27', 3, N'If it is any different than regular FSX, I have yet to discover it. I am a strong advocate of disc backup and that is why I bought this. Also, I did a lot of research about the Steam Version. Supposed to be much less crashing of program and able to handle heavier settings, more scenery, more of everything, etc. Right off the bat the program crashed, then it settled down and has worked ok so far. I really cannot see any difference. I have the settings medium to high. Will continue to experiment with that. Its an involved process to load but it works out. You can only load it on one computer. I am using Win 7 - 32bit OS. I have found that that is a Very Good OS for FSX and FX2004. I also run Win 8.1 and Win 10. There are a few more challenges with those OS''s but they do work. There are instructions for uninstalling and reinstalling if that becomes necessary, although they are a bit confusing. Hopefully, if I have to uninstall and reinstall I will be able to figure it out. One thing I...'),
(N'Peter', N'Bennett', N'peter.bennett9855@example.com', '2016-11-27', 1, N'The game is broken. There no season 3 and all the season 3 characters in the game and no updates to fix this. I tried taking to Iron Galaxy. No. Np answer to them. "Thanks, Iron Galaxy. Th-thanks for the help." Everyone, don''t get ripoff by Iron Galaxy. I realized that they are doing this for money so they can run with your money. Don''t bother with them. This is a bunch of crap. They know it''s a bunch of crap. They are not doing anything about it. They don''t want to do anything about it. Therefore, we have been con.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2016-11-28', 5, N'every single zelda video game in existence that nintendo made from the 80s,90s,2000s,2010s,2015 and 2016 are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best every single zelda video game in existence that nintendo made from the 80s,90s,2000s,2010s,2015 and 2016 rocks,the legend of zelda video game franchise is the greatest video game franchise in the universe a true classic the best of the best the legend of zelda video game franchise rocks,the video game company nintendo is the greatest video game company in the universe there true genius''s the best of the best the video game company nintendo rocks,every single video game in existence that nintendo made from the 70s,80s,90s,2000s,2010s,2015 and 2016 are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best every single video game in existence that nintendo made from the 70s,80s,90s,2000s,2010s,2015 and 2016 rocks ^_^'),
(N'John', N'Ramos', N'john.ramos3293@example.org', '2016-11-28', 4, N'got this in white and black and while I had my doubts because its not an official Nintendo product it works and that''s what matters in the end. update - 5month later and it still works great.'),
(N'Maria', N'Jackson', N'maria.jackson5754@example.org', '2016-11-28', 5, N'PS2 for life'),
(N'Ravi', N'Rodriguez', N'ravi.rodriguez8938@example.org', '2016-11-28', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Nicole', N'Butler', N'nicole.butler9563@example.org', '2016-11-28', 4, N'good game the problem have bugs'),
(N'Nadia', N'Okonkwo', N'nadia.okonkwo2756@example.net', '2016-11-28', 5, N'There''s not much that can be said, but this is a great cable/charger for the Nintendo DS systems. I have a New Nintendo 3DS XL & it works wonderfully. It''s a great charger for travel & it charges the system rather quickly. The cable itself is thick & durable. I highly recommend!!!'),
(N'Michelle', N'James', N'michelle.james3382@example.net', '2016-11-28', 5, N'Friend says, " couldn''t ask for a cheaper, high quality product, even if bought brand new!"'),
(N'Helen', N'Long', N'helen.long3334@example.com', '2016-11-28', 5, N'Arrived on time as expected. I can''t wait to play this one... thanks.'),
(N'George', N'Ward', N'george.ward3760@example.net', '2016-11-28', 5, N'For my son...he likes it'),
(N'Emma', N'Ramirez', N'emma.ramirez3834@example.com', '2016-11-29', 4, N'Easy to install, work great on 3ds xl.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Morris', N'jerry.morris7470@example.net', '2016-11-29', 4, N'Purchased for the Modern Warfare remaster only, and it met my expectations. I tried Infinite Warfare but it''s too much like Halo or Titanfall for me... I prefer old school without all the crazy jetpacks and boosting. MW remaster is easily 4/5 stars alone-- the multiplayer is great!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Richardson', N'ashley.richardson3159@example.net', '2016-11-29', 1, N'As the title states, the USB power connector will only charge if wiggled. Cheap plasticy charger, disappointed.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Sanders', N'jacob.sanders9347@example.net', '2016-11-29', 2, N'Very cheap plastic. I thought there might be some grip gained, maybe a softer plastic feel but these grips are just cheap plastic. Additionally, they did not go on easy and two of the clips broke. Probably will not buy from this manufacturer again.'),
(N'David', N'Henderson', N'david.henderson8114@example.org', '2016-11-29', 4, N'This is actually a very good game with a decent story and graphics along with gameplay. I haven''t tried MP so I can''t speak to that. The re-mastered COD is done better than any re-mastered game I have tried.'),
(N'Omar', N'Peterson', N'omar.peterson1384@example.org', '2016-11-29', 3, N'Don''t get if you planned on getting side grops that are non-slip. they aren''t that great but rather just okay.'),
(N'Jason', N'Boyd', N'jason.boyd5677@example.net', '2016-11-29', 5, N'I''ve played every major entry since the first one on the NES. This game lives up to that legacy and feeds into the nostalgia of the series while growing it. May have been 10 years coming but it was worth the wait. The king of RPGs is back.'),
(N'Susan', N'Roberts', N'susan.roberts2273@example.org', '2016-11-29', 5, N'IT WORKS VERY USEFULL'),
(N'Joshua', N'Lee', N'joshua.lee6467@example.org', '2016-11-29', 5, N'The original Xbox controller. Good so far'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Wisniewski', N'carolyn.wisniewski4034@example.org', '2016-11-29', 5, N'Excellent Product. Excellent Vendor. I truly recommend it. 100% trusted.'),
(N'Paul', N'Thompson', N'paul.thompson1673@example.org', '2016-11-29', 5, N'GREAT COLLECTION ONE OF MY FAVORITE GAMES'),
(N'Yuki', N'Singh', N'yuki.singh4685@example.org', '2016-11-29', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Kevin', N'Khan', N'kevin.khan7265@example.org', '2016-11-30', 5, N'This is different from the other Project Diva games but just as good! It has a story to it instead of just playing down a list of songs. 10/10 recommend!'),
(N'Linda', N'Butler', N'linda.butler6642@example.org', '2016-11-30', 5, N'It''s a hockey video game. What''s not to love? Buy this product right now!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Thompson', N'kyle.thompson5053@example.net', '2016-11-30', 5, N'Got it for my brother for Christmas'),
(N'Anna', N'Rodriguez', N'anna.rodriguez4322@example.net', '2016-11-30', 4, N'Not my cup of tea, but for the price, it was worth the wait! Graphics, game play, and over all fun with friends online this meets exceeds!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Coleman', N'yuki.coleman2710@example.net', '2016-11-30', 3, N'Pretty rough man, you do get to shoot aloens though'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Kowalski', N'nicholas.kowalski5548@example.com', '2016-11-30', 5, N'Item arrived as described and in great condition.'),
(N'Steven', N'Reed', N'steven.reed3597@example.com', '2016-12-01', 5, N'EA made a fantastic game with Battlefield 1. Campaign was a blast to play, multiplayer is quick and easy, and the new modes for multiplayer brings much needed excitement.'),
(N'Larry', N'Brooks', N'larry.brooks5667@example.org', '2016-12-01', 3, N'An okay game that tries to capture the essence of the Star Trek Voyager TV show, all the while still retaining the flavor of a First Person Shooter computer game for the PC. By today''s standards both graphics and game play are a bit dated, but hold up okay. I''ve played through this game a couple of times, and one of my major beefs with it is that it feels like a Quake knock off with Star Trek trappings. It''s tough for this computer gamer to shirk that, because I''ve spent an ungodly amount of time with a variety of computer games, and I just couldn''t get over the fact that this is essentially the Quake 2 renderer that''s been updated for Quake 3, but again given a Star Trek coat of paint. You play as Ensign Munroe, and are given a number of challenges as you navigate ruined starships, empty space, the Voyager itself, all the while fighting aliens of a variety of sorts (familiar and new). Voyager is still stuck out in far flung space, trying to get back home to the Alpha Quadrant when...'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Jackson', N'benjamin.jackson5614@example.org', '2016-12-01', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Thomas', N'Diaz', N'thomas.diaz1178@example.com', '2016-12-01', 5, N'This is the first game that I''ve ever played that got me into the Tekken series'),
(N'Brian', N'Foster', N'brian.foster5229@example.net', '2016-12-01', 5, N'Good on my xbox one. I play on game.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Richardson', N'kathleen.richardson3079@example.com', '2016-12-01', 5, N'Awesome product'),
(N'Mateo', N'Bailey', N'mateo.bailey8962@example.com', '2016-12-01', 5, N'Gift for bf he loves it'),
(N'Daniel', N'Boyd', N'daniel.boyd1183@example.org', '2016-12-01', 5, N'Bought this for my brother for his birthday. He''s a huge fan of Skyrim and the mobile shelter game. Being that those are both by Bethesda, I figured this was a good bet. He absolutely loves this game and is quite addicted to it. Happy with the purchase!'),
(N'Michael', N'Myers', N'michael.myers4447@example.net', '2016-12-01', 5, N'GOOD GAME'),
(N'Deborah', N'Ramirez', N'deborah.ramirez5475@example.org', '2016-12-01', 5, N'This fan works so far'),
(N'Luis', N'Young', N'luis.young4015@example.org', '2016-12-01', 5, N'Great amiibo, very detailed and is pretty fun to use in its designated games. Fun also for Super Mario Maker.'),
(N'Luis', N'Young', N'luis.young4015@example.org', '2016-12-01', 4, N'Okay, where to start? First off, this game is pretty basic, meaning you won''t find "gimmicks" like Swap Force, Trap Team, or Superchargers. That''s not a bad thing; this game is packed with everything, and even has online racing (even if you don''t have vehicles from Superchargers, you can still play with the digital vehicles). The game has gorgeous graphics, although I feel for Wii U, they kept the graphics a little lower than for the PS4 and XBO, which is unfair seeing as the Wii U has the capabilities to show smoother graphics. The game''s map is large, but there are only 10 levels, and you get 2 more with adventure packs, and 1 more with Crash Bandicoot. Still, the map is large, and has many "doors" to mini-levels that can confuse you when traveling around, so it can get confusing, but it''s a fun way to get around Skylands. In later levels, things can get extremely confusing with the too many enemies on the screen, and if you play on Hard from the start, this can cause you to lose...'),
(N'Thomas', N'Diaz', N'thomas.diaz1178@example.com', '2016-12-02', 5, N'Best tomb raider game for its time Things u can do that no other tomb raider game that the past and present are still not able to do like Shooting underwater and staying underwater for As long was u want and climb and shoot at the same time none of the tomb raider games still doesn''t have these features the environments was taking from realistic locations and was added into the game ,it has great smooth responding controls and its a squeal to legend with a even better storyline Yeah the combat system lacks because u can only kick enemies besides shooting them but what makes it better than all the previous games is the movement controls are so much easier to play and great boss fights some is challenging u can choose outfits before starting the next level also drive different vehicles in some parts of the game The only downfall is the squeal for this that was made into a Xbox exclusive'),
(N'Alexander', N'Kim', N'alexander.kim9755@example.org', '2016-12-02', 4, N'This is a review of the Single Play campaign since I don''t play multiplayer so idk about that part. I was hoping for the variety of GoW III and was disappointed. I wanted to go underwater, fire the cannons on a gunship, solve puzzles like when you had to get the engine and fuel into the submarine in III. It was fun, but I paid way too much ( Ultimate Edition ) for what I got out of the single player. The graphics, sound, weapons, and enemy AI are all top notch, they did a much better then with GoW UE remaster where either I or my companions got stuck on the environment or had pathing problems.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Lee', N'ethan.lee6361@example.com', '2016-12-02', 1, N'Most disappointing COD of all time. seriously annoyed and wish there was a way to be refunded. I W means infinite waste of time for me.'),
(N'Karen', N'Thompson', N'karen.thompson9642@example.com', '2016-12-02', 5, N'This tomb raider reboot is amazing! Really fun game! Looks great!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Barnes', N'stephanie.barnes1365@example.org', '2016-12-02', 5, N'Love this game'),
(N'Zachary', N'Peterson', N'zachary.peterson3772@example.org', '2016-12-02', 3, N'gift'),
(N'Helen', N'Myers', N'helen.myers8507@example.net', '2016-12-02', 5, N'So I am just about a complete noob on SFV and I will tell you about this from a noob perspective. First. It takes some time to get used to this. Your inputs will be more accurate but all the moves you usually do naturally you will have to re practice. Also I personally always end up jumping when I try to move the stick left and right really fast. Definitely the hardest thing to adjust so far. Combos and inputs are far more accurate as long as you practice. AS IN PRACTICE. E sport style. I am having to go to practice mode and do stuff over and over to try and get it working. But my very few combos I know come out much easier. I personally am a ibuki main and so long as I don''t have to use kazigiri then my combos are infinitely better. Getting used to the button placement hurts my right hand a little bit but I assume that will go away. The start button being on the front is quite literally the only negative in this design. You can get the front faceplate switched out if you don''t...'),
(N'Brandon', N'Jenkins', N'brandon.jenkins3355@example.net', '2016-12-02', 2, N'Nice controller. Had to return because it was constantly disconnecting from my xbox.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Chen', N'kelly.chen4180@example.org', '2016-12-02', 3, N'This Sims 3 Generations expansion pack is okay in my opinion but not really what I was hoping for and I feel neutral about it. I was hoping it would have more baby and nursery room items but it doesn''t really have that much. It does have two types of strollers but I was hoping it would have rocking chairs and maybe a changing table for sim babies but the rocking chairs are available with the Supernatural expansion pack which I do not understand. Sim teenagers and children can become grounded with this Generations expansion pack which is both a blessing and a curse because after one of my teenagers got over her grounding she was still sneaking around and acting sneaky well into adulthood and I had to move her to another neighborhood to get her to walk normally and quit sneaking around. I am thinking this was an error in this expansion pack but it was irritating because it made my teenager walk much slower and made her almost late for school and work. Overall I would recommend this...'),
(N'Gary', N'Hall', N'gary.hall8371@example.org', '2016-12-02', 5, N'This game kicks ass. If you''re a Tom Clancy fan, it will blow your mind how advanced this game has become. It pulls you in, and doesn''t let up on the grip. With all of the updates as well, it''s definitely worth the adventure. Do it.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Sandra', N'Morgan', N'sandra.morgan2287@example.com', '2016-12-02', 4, N'A powerful system that feels good to hold. The thumbsticks are comfortable and the buttons have a satisfying click to them. Games are a joy to play on with the crisp display. The battery life continues to impress and the games themselves are unique and make the system stand out from home consoles and the 3DS (Also an amazing system). The only real issues I''ve found are common complaints for the Vita. Memory cards. Sony killed the system with the proprietary, overpriced, and unreliable memory cards. This Vita model comes with an internal 1GB memory card. For a reference Minecraft with the latest update takes up 874MB. This means that memory cards are a necessity. And that''s the disappointment about this system. A 16GB Micro-SD card can be found on Amazon for $6.99. A 16GB Vita memory card is $39.99 on Amazon. The memory cards aren''t great either. I purchased a 32GB Vita memory card for $69.97 at the same time as my Vita, three weeks later it failed. I lost all the progress on games...'),
(N'Paul', N'Sanchez', N'paul.sanchez7704@example.com', '2016-12-02', 4, N'good but the need of PlayStation online purchase sucks'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Cooper', N'kenneth.cooper8965@example.com', '2016-12-02', 5, N'Was not not expecting a licensed xbox product for the price, But this is great. Just pop the batteries in and you''re off. I really like the feel of the material used. Now for the real test: the test of time.'),
(N'Emily', N'White', N'emily.white3432@example.net', '2016-12-03', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Alexander', N'Gomez', N'alexander.gomez3367@example.org', '2016-12-03', 5, N'Great charger!!!'),
(N'Emma', N'Edwards', N'emma.edwards8903@example.com', '2016-12-03', 5, N'love bookworm'),
(N'Mateo', N'Ortiz', N'mateo.ortiz9041@example.org', '2016-12-03', 3, N'small size and expensive. Sony your proprietary memory cards suck, please never do this again.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Butler', N'benjamin.butler3809@example.org', '2016-12-03', 4, N'I bought Pokémon Sun while my girlfriend got Pokémon Moon. We both played the 6th gen as well. Pros 1. Fresh story line with some fresh Pokémon in a new location. Everything looks good. 2. Some new mechanics to help keep things interesting. 3. The trials are a fun new thing to replace gym battles. 4. Tons of extra game content to keep you busy. 5. Easy to engage with online players. 6. Better options and game menus help make things faster. 7. You can trade up using Poke Bank from prior generations. 8. This game just throws stuff at you all the time. Spend your money wisely and you''ll never run out of anything. 9. Love how you can heal Pokémon of status effects after battle. 10. Enough of the same old experience to feel familiar and nostalgic. 11. Love the whole night and day mechanic when catching Pokémon. Gives you motivation to pick up and play during certain hours. Cons 1. There are some lag issues on the older 3DS models. Especially in combat and some menus load slowly. 2. The...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ramirez', N'cynthia.ramirez3895@example.org', '2016-12-03', 2, N'Razer Synapse is the worst program I have ever used (an I''ve been on PC for over two decades) for setting up key maps. There are other problems with it, too, but if it actually worked well, I might be able to overlook them. But it doesn''t. Setting up the keys for a single game is a long, tedious, and boring process. The key mapping aspect of the software is an abomination, a crime against good UI and user experience. The Orbweaver might be superior to the G13 in hardware (I have both), but they''re nowhere near the same level of sophistication when it comes to the software. And for the record, I was never a huge fan of the G13 software but I definitely appreciate it a lot more now.'),
(N'Helen', N'Okonkwo', N'helen.okonkwo4103@example.com', '2016-12-03', 5, N'Even though there are hundreds of ''worst game ever'' reviews for Homefront: The revolution, I took a chance on it because I enjoyed the first one for the 360. Also, it was $21 with season pass on Xbox live. The premise is that North Korea has taken over the US, and you become a key figure in a revolution to take back our country. Controls are great, graphics are really good and the game plays very similar to the recent versions of Far Cry - as you regain key areas, you weaken the Korean army and inspire citizens to fight again. As you complete side missions, you gain money and experience to level up your abilities, and unlock and improve weapons. One of the great things about this game is that as you scavenge, you can find materials to build needed items on the fly - explosives, electronic hacking devices, etc. You are free to approach missions any way you like, using stealth, guns blazing, etc. one of my favorite aspects of the game is completing side missions in an area and...'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Gonzalez', N'tomasz.gonzalez7382@example.net', '2016-12-03', 5, N'Well worth the wait!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Lewis', N'christopher.lewis8221@example.net', '2016-12-03', 5, N'Great headset for the price the sound is good and its very comfortable. Although its kind of a bulky headset its still great for the price and i recommend it to anyone thati s not trying to spend a whole lot of money on an expensive headset but still look for good quality'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Hill', N'jennifer.hill4117@example.com', '2016-12-03', 5, N'Great product. KontrolFreek is the best add on sticks in the business. They are uncomfortable at first but add precision to your game. Buy some if you don''t like them you aren''t out too much money.'),
(N'Jack', N'Ramos', N'jack.ramos6588@example.com', '2016-12-03', 5, N'My son has had good luck with his system. He loves it.'),
(N'Jack', N'Ramos', N'jack.ramos6588@example.com', '2016-12-03', 4, N'My son liked this game'),
(N'Anthony', N'Ali', N'anthony.ali4930@example.org', '2016-12-04', 5, N'Best game I have ever played! There is an incredible amount of stuff to do! If you play this game to its fullest you''ll love it!!'),
(N'Steven', N'Young', N'steven.young5644@example.net', '2016-12-04', 5, N'Very satisfied'),
(N'Paul', N'Collins', N'paul.collins9162@example.net', '2016-12-04', 5, N'Bought this because it can be easily modded and it works with practically every system. Nothing bad to say about it.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Patel', N'samuel.patel7086@example.org', '2016-12-04', 3, N'I gave it three stars , Because 1st there is not much difference playing different races except the perks , & Looks . Playing a Dalish PC was disappointing , Because they knew to much information on humans , & Their customs , & They say the Dalish race basically does not trust humans , & Try to avoid them in the older games . The Dalish PC on Origins was more real . Second is the irritating requisition officers the put in your camps , Because they remind me of a nagging kid'),
(N'Amanda', N'Adams', N'amanda.adams6214@example.com', '2016-12-04', 4, N'I was able to exchange the code without problem, why should we pay taxes for a digital game?'),
(N'Brenda', N'Price', N'brenda.price7661@example.org', '2016-12-04', 5, N'excellent!'),
(N'Angela', N'Adams', N'angela.adams5035@example.net', '2016-12-04', 5, N'Fans of the series won''t be dissapointed'),
(N'Joyce', N'Morris', N'joyce.morris3692@example.com', '2016-12-05', 4, N'Makes up for the no replay-ability value with the fact that you have to replay each scene multiple times to reach the end. Decent story, though it got really confusing, weird, and a bit awkward at the end.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brown', N'katherine.brown2144@example.com', '2016-12-05', 5, N'Looks awesome, fits a lil bit tight but snaps in place just fine. The chrome is a fingerprint nightmare so be aware of that but man it looks good all cleaned up.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Peterson', N'ivan.peterson7713@example.org', '2016-12-05', 4, N'It''s super boring, but you can get it if you want. I give the 4 stars because it''s cute and just ain''t my personal fave.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Davis', N'christopher.davis4205@example.com', '2016-12-05', 5, N'muchas gracias'),
(N'Anthony', N'Harris', N'anthony.harris3547@example.com', '2016-12-05', 5, N'Couple months later, and he''s still playing! Both by himself, and with friends. He''s actually asked for all three PIkmin games. Don''t understand why Pikmin 2 is so expensive right now, but he''s had a lot of fun with Pikmin 1, & Pikmin 3. Which is saying something! Lol! Normally he beats a game, and moves on to the next one, so we have definitely gotten our moneys worth out of this one! BTW he is 8, his group is 7-10uears old. Coming up our older boy''s (up to college age) enjoyed playing Pikmin too, and will on occasion sit, and play the Pikmin games with him. I think it''s because the Pikmin are so cute, and because the puzzles (it is a puzzle game) can get a little difficult. Hope our review helped!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Brooks', N'kimberly.brooks5207@example.com', '2016-12-05', 2, N'Not sure if mine is broken or not but there is no brighter or darker with FN+ pgup or down...or FN+ anything. Same brightness, constant pulsing....It is a distraction. I thought the SADE 74 was bad..... This thing pulses between 5 colors, up,down,over and over and over..... ALSO, Space bar does not sit high enough. Relaxed typing position will not allow for a thumb space without a conscious attempt to depress it or unless you ride high on the bottom, palms on the slanted base Never thought having long hands would be a problem with a keyboard. I press space with the thumb joint which rests firmly on the slant....so annoying. I should have not gone cheap and replaced my g510. ok, going to struggle with a grand mal seizure from this strobing while I file a return. The information in the listing was less than forthcoming. I mean, there is a LOT OF SPACE on this page to type things like...Lights pulse, no static state on any single color...may distract a person who is not used to...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Raghunathan', N'kimberly.raghunathan6733@example.org', '2016-12-05', 5, N'What can I say about Chrono Trigger that hasn''t already been said ad nauseum. This game is a classic, pure and simple. But it''s more than just that. Chrono Trigger might just be the greatest JRPG, or RPG period, of all time. This game unquestionably ranks among my top three video games of all time (Video Gaming is by far my favorite past-time.) This game is my favorite JRPG ever made to boot. A little bit of history. The mid to late nineties were in many respects the golden age of the JRPG genre, with titles such as "Final Fantasy" and "Secret of Mana," demanding some of the most respect of any games of the time. There is one game in that genre that, to me, stands head and shoulders above all of those titles. That game is none other than "Chrono Trigger." What makes Chrono Trigger so special, one may ask. On the surface, it might look just like any old rpg. But beneath it, it does so much different from other games of its era, and even today. It features a simple, yet unique and...'),
(N'Douglas', N'Campbell', N'douglas.campbell7727@example.org', '2016-12-06', 5, N'I was blown away by this game. If you have a high end pc then you need this game it will punish your GPU and its beautiful doing so. It''s fast paced gameplay no reloads so that''s good. Story is kinda there and the soundtrack is one of the best I heard in a while'),
(N'Dee', N'Gutierrez', N'dee.gutierrez6646@example.org', '2016-12-06', 5, N'Very fun game'),
(N'Ronald', N'Tanaka', N'ronald.tanaka8014@example.com', '2016-12-06', 5, N'love it! i''m glad i can get some of the old games i use to play. i''ve already bought 2 more (of the mario kind) and have others that i have saved to buy later! (earthbound, link, and such) glad that they''re making these available again!'),
(N'Barbara', N'Tanaka', N'barbara.tanaka1395@example.net', '2016-12-06', 5, N'Great game. There are many completions with this game at my house'),
(N'Ryan', N'Henderson', N'ryan.henderson9472@example.org', '2016-12-06', 5, N'Wow! Ok while no game is perfect this one just has that magic that other games can''t dream of having. It''s like ICO/SOCT all over again in that sense but the gameplay is more like a mix of the best parts of those games and blending it together. Trico really is adorable and the bond you create with it is unlike any other experience in a game other than maybe Joel and Ellie in TLOU. If you can take anything from this review, that this game is a wild breath of fresh air after the holiday AAA rush of games that don''t push any boundaries should be it.'),
(N'Wei', N'Scott', N'wei.scott8771@example.net', '2016-12-07', 2, N'They pop or roll off right in the middle of gameplay. I have one brand new PS4 controller and an older one. On the older controller they pop off more frequently, which I suppose is understandable given the sticks are more rounded and smooth from use. But on the brand new controller they pop off at least 1-5 times per gaming session, random left and right or both. They do aid my gameplay and control when they''re attached, but since they''re inconsistent, it causes issues right at the most inopportune moments! I just got a PS4 Pro with a brand new controller, and so far they haven''t popped off much, if at all to my recollection. Not sure if it''s a slight design difference in the sticks or not, but they work better on that one for now.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Reyes', N'jacqueline.reyes8544@example.com', '2016-12-07', 1, N'I found this game to be redundant.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Nowak', N'michelle.nowak4898@example.com', '2016-12-07', 3, N'Had this product for over a year now. Not a big fan of it anymore. At first, I loved it! Great looks, battery was great, and I loved how the LED would turn green when the controller is ready. Plus its Energizer! But there was one design flaw.. If you have attachments such as the chat pad or thumbstick tops (FPS Freaks), I feel as if it weighs the charger down more. Because of this, I cannot get a solid connection to the charger. I would have to be VERY VERY VEEEERY careful to angle the controller in to have it begin charging. And if the stand gets touched in any way, it would stop. Pros: Looks great. Energizer brand. Great long life battery. Cons: Design flaw mentioned above. Great charger, but that design flaw... So I ended up purchasing the deluxe charger now.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Parker', N'andrea.parker9967@example.org', '2016-12-07', 5, N'IMPORTANT ADVICE: If you''re feeling bogged down but the first island and are wondering why people like this game so much, don''t worry. I was in that same boat. The first island is pretty terrible in terms of slowness, linearity, handholdy-ness, and being overly cutscene-driven, but it is only 2-3 hours or so long, and the game gets *far* better afterwards, and almost every problem with that area starts to quickly go away. For ages, Pokemon Gold (Pokemon Gen II) has been my favorite Pokemon game, hands down, and one of my favorite games of all time. Particularly, the music, difficulty, new Pokemon, region, upgrades to the formula, story, characters, legendaries, and surprises the game threw at you (particularly in the second half) were at worst still pretty solid, and at best top notch. No generation has even come close to how consistently strong that game is in almost every respect. That is, until I played Pokemon Moon. I''m not saying it''s my favorite Pokemon game yet, but it''s...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Miller', N'kathleen.miller3827@example.net', '2016-12-07', 1, N'Trying to get in contact with seller but can''t find the link. The game freezes and skips when I play it.'),
(N'William', N'Russell', N'william.russell8090@example.net', '2016-12-07', 5, N'Fun game great for kids and adults'),
(N'Diane', N'Cooper', N'diane.cooper9662@example.net', '2016-12-07', 5, N'Totally worth the wait! I strongly recommend that you stay clear from reviews from corporate gaming sites that demand free copies of games or else they write negative things about the game. If you enjoyed Ico and Shadow of the Colossus then you absolutely need to buy The Last Guardian because it truly is an incredible gaming experience. If you are more of a non-stop action gamer then you should stick with your preferred FPS games because The Last Guardian is all about patience but in a great way. I never thought I would be so emotionally attached to the main loveable animal companion in this game but you will also feel the same as you progress through the remarkable story.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Miller', N'deborah.miller2432@example.com', '2016-12-07', 2, N'this game is not as good as Human Revolution in any way. the Vibe of the city of Prague feels broken for some reason, definitely not as captivating as Detroit and Hengsha in HR. maybe its the style thats out of place??? city feels more like Assassins Creed and doesnt really belong in a Deus Ex game. the people in the city literally STAND IN ONE PLACE FOREVER, making the city feel dead and uneventful. HR had this issue as well but it was alot less Obvious. the shooting with the larger guns is Uncomfortable and at times its really hard to aim with them so small arms were my go to for combat. and i dunno if its just me but i didn''t care about the story at all. i played 1/3rd through it and just lost interest. if youv never played a Deus Ex game, download HUMAN REVOLUTION, its well worth it. leave this one alone completely and just watch a walkthrough, its NOT WORTH PLAYING AT ALL but if you MUST play it, get it for under 20 bucks.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Barnes', N'barbara.barnes2671@example.net', '2016-12-07', 2, N'Sum kid running around playing tarzan acrobat superhero with ginormous Falcor ripoff. I hate the game but Falcor is cool thog.'),
(N'Jack', N'Martinez', N'jack.martinez6923@example.com', '2016-12-07', 5, N'very useful'),
(N'Hannah', N'Morgan', N'hannah.morgan3875@example.com', '2016-12-07', 5, N'Plays well, excellent condition. Great addition to my collection.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Phillips', N'kenneth.phillips3470@example.net', '2016-12-08', 5, N'A++'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Miller', N'kathleen.miller3280@example.com', '2016-12-08', 5, N'Very cool cute adorable It glows in the dark & a fun too use in games on Wii u & 3ds games.! I love it thanks Nintendo once again all your amiibos are great.!'),
(N'Joshua', N'Richardson', N'joshua.richardson9521@example.com', '2016-12-08', 5, N'Another of my favorite games of all time. Works great!!!'),
(N'Jason', N'Wood', N'jason.wood7433@example.com', '2016-12-08', 5, N'very good love it!!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Barnes', N'sofia.barnes8554@example.com', '2016-12-08', 4, N'With big hands like mine, I had to disable all the other buttons because I would keep clicking them on accident. Only buttons aside the basic mouse I can have on is the sensitivity. Aside that it''s a super nice mouse'),
(N'Nicole', N'Cox', N'nicole.cox4184@example.org', '2016-12-08', 5, N'Great price for a trip down memory lane!'),
(N'Noah', N'Green', N'noah.green5384@example.org', '2016-12-09', 4, N'Mainly put 4 because while entertaining, this type of game isn''t exactly my favorite type. The first game is crap, but you can''t expect much on that cause it''s so old, The second and third are good and playable, they definitely make some improvements with each new game, bought the collection cause I haven''t played these in the past and wanted to play the new one coming out but wanted the back story and had some time to kill, worth the buy for the money.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Johnson', N'kelly.johnson2107@example.net', '2016-12-09', 5, N'Hopefully we can dial it in soon'''),
(N'Jerry', N'King', N'jerry.king5937@example.org', '2016-12-09', 5, N'Love this game! it is fun for everyone!'),
(N'Eric', N'Foster', N'eric.foster2114@example.com', '2016-12-09', 5, N'Love its design and how it feels. I have large hands but it works out better than I had expected.'),
(N'Amy', N'Edwards', N'amy.edwards6146@example.com', '2016-12-09', 2, N'Sounds really good, confusing to hook up. Hurts ears wearing this for a few hours. Broke after 3-4 months, don''t buy it.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Turner', N'jessica.turner1704@example.net', '2016-12-09', 2, N'Right out of the box on release day, ridiculously huge update and can''t play for 3 hours while it loads. Then, the loading menus take another 20 minutes, like I give a sh** about commentary updates. The menus are slow and jump around which is annoying, and then the gameplay starts. As with most Madden games, receivers can''t catch the ball if there is a defender on the field ... no run/pass blocking ... and it doesn''t matter if you are playing the browns, if you are up 45-0 in the 4th, they will come back and win and you can''t stop them. This game is crap, bring back the 2K series so we can have choices instead of this stupid monopoly. Selling this POS, didn''t even finish a full season'),
(N'Aaron', N'Jackson', N'aaron.jackson5756@example.net', '2016-12-09', 5, N'Has been dropped several times and still works like new... what more could you ask for. :)'),
(N'Andrea', N'Hill', N'andrea.hill7362@example.net', '2016-12-09', 1, N'Graphics are terrible don''t waster your money!'),
(N'Dennis', N'Thompson', N'dennis.thompson1356@example.org', '2016-12-09', 5, N'Christmas present for grandson. He wanted it, so that gives it 5 stars.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Kim', N'kelly.kim8360@example.net', '2016-12-09', 3, N'Not there Best game but not the worst. still enjoy it but I might be just losing my passion for first person shooter games.'),
(N'Jason', N'Peterson', N'jason.peterson8498@example.org', '2016-12-09', 5, N'I liked it per the star rating'),
(N'Barbara', N'Martin', N'barbara.martin2285@example.com', '2016-12-09', 5, N'we like this.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Jenkins', N'victoria.jenkins9842@example.net', '2016-12-10', 5, N'works great glad i got it A++++ product i would recomend it'),
(N'Edward', N'Webb', N'edward.webb4597@example.org', '2016-12-10', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Karen', N'Clark', N'karen.clark5997@example.org', '2016-12-10', 5, N'Exactly what it says it is'),
(N'Michael', N'Carter', N'michael.carter1510@example.org', '2016-12-10', 3, N'Good for pc and ps3,but it did not even last a year because the part that holds the cable opened to were you can see the wires then the white wire riped off weeks later.'),
(N'Carol', N'Lewis', N'carol.lewis6142@example.net', '2016-12-10', 5, N'Timesuck But in the good way. .'),
(N'Melissa', N'Singh', N'melissa.singh1118@example.org', '2016-12-10', 5, N'A mishmash of video game characters from Disney and Square Enix. very cool rpg battle system. live not turnbased like some rpg.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ramos', N'jacob.ramos2458@example.net', '2016-12-11', 5, N'For what it is, it is very good value. A decent gaming mouse and keyboard. Not a premium set by any means, but it more than gets the job done for the price point.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Johnson', N'benjamin.johnson9272@example.net', '2016-12-11', 5, N'Good solid item. I been using it for a while now and have had no problems with it.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Sullivan', N'nicholas.sullivan4538@example.net', '2016-12-11', 5, N'Family loves it.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Smith', N'tomasz.smith3521@example.org', '2016-12-11', 5, N'Wow... this is a game that starts off as an intense gore-fest and stays that way until the very end! The action is non-stop and people who are squeamish should steer clear of this. If you loved the 1993 "Doom" you should feel right at home here.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Smith', N'michelle.smith2512@example.org', '2016-12-11', 4, N'Nice'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ruiz', N'jacob.ruiz4218@example.com', '2016-12-11', 5, N'The game is great! Code came with no issue as well.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Campbell', N'patrick.campbell7878@example.com', '2016-12-11', 5, N'Gamers heaven'),
(N'Jerry', N'Davis', N'jerry.davis4138@example.net', '2016-12-11', 5, N'I love the Sims franchise'),
(N'Kofi', N'Foster', N'kofi.foster4395@example.net', '2016-12-11', 4, N'Extremely fun game, that can sometimes be ruined by the people that you play online with. The guns are new and refreshing from all of the future military shooters out there right now. The graphics are amazing! Single player campaign is fun, but short. You will be playing online more anyways.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Martin', N'jessica.martin3146@example.org', '2016-12-12', 5, N'Rise of the Undermine was what being a Super is all about. Chasing the bad guy, and blowing up everything he/she owns spoiling their plans! Beating up all of their hence men on the way. It was a little disappointing that out of all the Supers you only play as two of them. Mr. Incredible and Frozone. But it''s a simple, and addicting game with loads of fighting and a puzzle here and there so it doesn''t get old. However, my biggest problem was that there were no subtitles. Usually that won''t be a problem, but the games audio would go in and out so when someone was saying something you couldn''t hear them. Also, there are a ton of robots in this game and with them the story is told. So I get confused when I can hear something clearly and important info is told as an add on to info that I could hear. Despite this the game is worth the money. Just don''t waste your time on the first one!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Smith', N'thomas.smith4837@example.net', '2016-12-12', 5, N'Christmas gift'),
(N'Barbara', N'Long', N'barbara.long8964@example.net', '2016-12-12', 5, N'Pokemon "Gotta catch em all" + Final Fantasy series = This little gem. I love the game. It doesn''t take itself seriously, and is a lot of fun to play. I love catching and training all of the little monsters.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Hall', N'nathan.hall5380@example.org', '2016-12-12', 4, N'Enjoying it'),
(N'Richard', N'Butler', N'richard.butler8531@example.org', '2016-12-12', 5, N'one of my favorite zelda games!! a must play!'),
(N'Lucia', N'Powell', N'lucia.powell9160@example.net', '2016-12-12', 1, N'Didnt work'),
(N'Kofi', N'Reyes', N'kofi.reyes1734@example.org', '2016-12-12', 4, N'I played the first and second AC games but never bothered finishing them because they rapidly became insanely boring and repetitive. Then I took a long hiatus from the series until I decided to give Black Flag a try, several years after it was initially released. I am very glad that I did. Black Flag is a vast improvement over the earlier games (at least the first two; I can''t speak to the others). The open world is very fun to explore, and engaging in sea battles and taking prizes is surprisingly amusing. I have spent hours just sailing around and plundering every ship I can find, taking every fort I come across, and just generally being a pirate. It never gets old. The main storyline is solid so far (I haven''t quite finished it). Combat on land seems improved, with a nice mixture of weapons. That said, some of the same issues that plagued the earlier AC games still exist. The most serious is the controls. Just like previous versions, your character will be dashing ahead and then...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Reed', N'cheryl.reed9870@example.com', '2016-12-12', 5, N'Dead Rising 4 is a phenomenal sandbox style game It''s a huge step forward in the series It''s also to some extent a soft re-boot of the Dead Rising series Dead Rising 2-3 and Case West appear to have never happened Which is a real shame since the ending of Case West had a slick cliff hanger that should''ve lead into Dead Rising 3 I''ve put a good 18hours into this game Still in Chapter 2 and at level 62 This is the Capcom game worth your hard earned money Controls: dumbed down in a good way everything is streamlined It''s more of a classic Arcade pick up and play game In less then 15 minutes you''ll be adjusted to the changes The only negative regarding the controls is trying to use the camera You have to tap the right analog stick it just feels "off" In DR: Off The Record it was so much easier to take HQ pictures on the fly Gameplay: If you played the Dead Rising series from the beginning on the 360 you know what you are in for The only real difference is now you can play the game...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Raghunathan', N'kimberly.raghunathan6733@example.org', '2016-12-12', 5, N'The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time is, hands down, my favorite video game of all time. I know that that is a statement that is beyond clich at this point, but, from the bottom of my heart, it really is true. When I first played this game at the age of ten, after having borrowed a friends Nintendo 64, I fell in love with it at first sight. To this day, very, very few games have even come close to this game in my eyes. It wasn''t until later that I finally got my own copy, but I was obsessed with the game from start to finish. I remember playing the game while my sister read from the strategy guide, and even getting my dad into it (he made it as far as the shadow temple.) Simply put, this game holds an insurmountable amount of memories. Hearing the beautiful music again always brings a tear to my eye, so you can imagine by now how special this video game is in my heart. When I first heard that there was going to be a 3DS remaster of Ocarina of Time, I was very excited. I held off...'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Long', N'kathleen.long8030@example.org', '2016-12-12', 4, N'Received the package. It was well packaged with bubble wrap in the box. Haven''t tried it as it going to be a stocking stuffer for xmas.(5 year old pulled the cable out of the original one. This looks to be durable. And hopefully Nick my oldest will enjoy it'),
(N'Joan', N'Lee', N'joan.lee2127@example.net', '2016-12-12', 5, N'Best game ever is all i Need to say'),
(N'Joan', N'Lee', N'joan.lee2127@example.net', '2016-12-12', 5, N'Cant go wrong with sm3. Great game'),
(N'Angela', N'Richardson', N'angela.richardson4854@example.org', '2016-12-12', 1, N'Did use. item returned.'),
(N'Noah', N'Lopez', N'noah.lopez8861@example.net', '2016-12-13', 5, N'One of the top 3 COD games'),
(N'Anna', N'Hernandez', N'anna.hernandez3363@example.net', '2016-12-13', 3, N'Different games on one disk satisfy the whole family'),
(N'Joyce', N'Campbell', N'joyce.campbell3726@example.net', '2016-12-13', 5, N'Cables come well wrapped and well packaged. They work perfectly with the Plug-and-Play Xbox 360 kit as well. Also allows you to use Xbox 360 controller on the system without any batteries or any battery pack inserted into the controller.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Campbell', N'joyce.campbell3726@example.net', '2016-12-13', 5, N'Free and easy to redeem on Steam.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Smith', N'sarah.smith1292@example.org', '2016-12-13', 5, N'birthday present. my granddaughter loves it'),
(N'Deborah', N'Richardson', N'deborah.richardson6917@example.org', '2016-12-13', 5, N'Have you ever wanted to play an open world game were you can rob banks be revived unlimitedly Well now you can on GTA V. I really wanted this game for many moons, all my friends had it, and it looked so fun to me to be able to run around, work together, earn money, and live (in a way) a different life. Jaden. I got the game in 2014 a year after it came out, I saved up enough money to finally get the game, and when I got it, it exceeded my expectations, with beautiful graphics, and awesome gameplay it was astonishing. Keaton. It was rated 4.5 stars in the U.S.A, It won most anticipated game in 2011, It won Game of the year in 2013, Best video game in 2013, game of the year from inside gaming awards, most immersive game also in 2013, Xbox 360 game of the year, also best Xbox game in 2013, studio of the year in 2013, Best re-mastered game 2013, Best tech in 2013. So it has racked up many accolades over the years since 2013. Some pros of the game are graphics are great, storyline is...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Ramos', N'brenda.ramos5518@example.org', '2016-12-13', 5, N'new, fast, fun'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ramos', N'patricia.ramos2613@example.com', '2016-12-13', 5, N'Love all things Max. Wanted this for a while so when I found it at this price I grabbed it. I have all the bits already but it is nice to have them all in one place. If you are a fan it is a great edition including a statue (not 100% Max but close enough and good quality), posters, music, a key chain and the game. I may be mature in years but I love my video games and getting this turned me into a kid on Christmas morning'),
(N'Maria', N'Martinez', N'maria.martinez7958@example.net', '2016-12-13', 4, N'good game, cant beat the last boss'),
(N'Jerry', N'Carter', N'jerry.carter8166@example.com', '2016-12-13', 5, N'this is one of the best racing games ever'),
(N'Nancy', N'Gonzalez', N'nancy.gonzalez7817@example.net', '2016-12-13', 5, N'Great mouse. Software is very well done. I''d suggest not to update the firmware as it''s been the biggest complaint. I got mouse installed Steelers engine n skipped updates and it works great. I''ve got 8 inch long hands so the size is pretty good for claw or I guess some would call it hybrid claw since my palms on the back. But the side grips sit perfect to grip with two fingers on right side. Comfy and works so well. Fps strat fprpg tprpg moba... I play pretty much everything and this mouse works great.'),
(N'Mark', N'Ramos', N'mark.ramos2674@example.org', '2016-12-14', 5, N'Grandsons said game was very good. They played it a lot.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Coleman', N'tomasz.coleman4050@example.net', '2016-12-14', 1, N'I don''t know what it is with these Wii U pro controllers but all the ones I buy don''t work right! It keeps doing things that I don''t make them do. For example it will all of a sudden move the cursor without me moving the analog stick. So annoying.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Scott', N'jennifer.scott6527@example.net', '2016-12-14', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Emily', N'Morales', N'emily.morales1832@example.net', '2016-12-14', 5, N'This series is great. It has all the awesome C&C games that I''ve spent so much time in my life wasting on planning bases and rushing my enemies. There are additional fixes out there to increase the resolution and FOV for the older games. I also had no issues playing this on Windows 10.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Gonzalez', N'tomasz.gonzalez4788@example.org', '2016-12-14', 5, N'excelent saga, good product, fast buying process and delivery'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Cook', N'cynthia.cook3881@example.com', '2016-12-14', 3, N'Amazing mouse but had to return because of my large hands, every time i picked up the mouse to move it i would hit the thumb button. It was unavoidable and if the thumb button was either removed or just moved back more toward the front of the mouse i would buy this again.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Diaz', N'ryan.diaz9006@example.org', '2016-12-14', 4, N'The battery seems fine but I think the device may have quit working'),
(N'Hannah', N'Cox', N'hannah.cox4667@example.net', '2016-12-14', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Hannah', N'Cox', N'hannah.cox4667@example.net', '2016-12-14', 5, N'So fun. I just now need friends to play with.'),
(N'Amara', N'Patel', N'amara.patel3111@example.org', '2016-12-14', 5, N'A great online shooter experience this year.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Harris', N'ashley.harris5829@example.com', '2016-12-14', 5, N'As advertised. Fun and addictive.'),
(N'Mei', N'Ward', N'mei.ward1750@example.net', '2016-12-14', 5, N'Fumito Ueda has once again proven that video games can be considered works of art. The Last Guardian tells the tale of a boy''s bond with a majestic beast you will know as Trico. Your character and Trico are attempting to escape a series of connected towers and dungeons encased within a massive wall of Earth and rock. This game is centered around working with Trico to solve puzzles. If you have played Ico and/or Shadow of the Colossus, you should have a good idea of what to expect from the puzzles. Some involve finding and pulling switches, some involve environmental traversal through riding Trico. They are fairly simple in the beginning, the solutions get a bit trickier and more creative as you go, but nothing truly mind-bending. Trico, like most animals, is not going to listen to you right off the bat. You have to earn its trust, and as your bond grows, things go more smoothly. This game can and will be frustrating for some of you, but paying attention to the narrator''s tips and...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Evans', N'rachel.evans4566@example.com', '2016-12-15', 5, N'These feel great and add a good amount of grip to the sticks that are not present on the PS4 controller originally. If you are missing the original grip for the stick completely you will need to glue these on or it will slip off during use occasionally'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Henderson', N'evelyn.henderson1490@example.org', '2016-12-15', 5, N'I Loved. Excelent product.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Torres', N'kathleen.torres6007@example.org', '2016-12-15', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Stephen', N'Singh', N'stephen.singh8099@example.com', '2016-12-15', 5, N'Great case and 3 slot for cartbridge'),
(N'Olivia', N'Fisher', N'olivia.fisher6524@example.net', '2016-12-15', 2, N'kinda boring. wish i didn''t get it.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Parker', N'zachary.parker4826@example.net', '2016-12-15', 5, N'Works perfectly and great price.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Butler', N'victoria.butler2167@example.com', '2016-12-15', 3, N'Many years ago when the Xbox 360 was my default console, Alright so not so terribly long ago, my brother received a random game for his birthday that we had never seen or heard of before. After both of us putting some time into the game we found it to be a fun and sort of relaxing game to play. It was a nice change of pace from COD at the time. Last month I happened to be at a local game store and picked up Crackdown 2. After replaying it again I said the same thing I did the first time I beat it: Cool, and with that I put it to the side and began playing another game. This game isn''t terrible or mediocre but it isn''t hitting all the high notes either. What you do have with this game is a fun/laid back gameplay with no real storyline that has some hiccups in game mechanics and some objectives in the game are laid out somewhat wonky. The negatives for this game start with the voice of the Agency talking to you all the time. And I mean ALL the time. At first this voice is helpful in...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Williams', N'olivia.williams6339@example.com', '2016-12-15', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Barbara', N'James', N'barbara.james7632@example.org', '2016-12-15', 5, N'If you are a friend of martial art related games you should play that. I really enjoyed it. It is one of these games that I was really sad when it was over! It is open world and It has everything!! police, yakuza , learning new techniques for your character, drive vehicles, even boats and the last very important shop clothes! A lot of them! Costumes, suits anything you want! I highly recommend it!'),
(N'Sandra', N'Patel', N'sandra.patel2411@example.com', '2016-12-16', 2, N'I''m giving this two stars because it broke down after a few months -- the keypad still works but if you plug in a headset you either have no sound or the sound is distorted.'),
(N'William', N'Perez', N'william.perez8511@example.com', '2016-12-16', 5, N'Excellence'),
(N'Sharon', N'Gomez', N'sharon.gomez7185@example.com', '2016-12-16', 5, N'returned for xbox'),
(N'Jack', N'Martin', N'jack.martin8488@example.net', '2016-12-16', 5, N'Oh the nostalgia of this game. I have so many memories of playing this game with my brother and friends when it came out. DD2 was a smash hit for the original NES system. It was one of the first games to feature 2 player co-op in a side scrolling action game. The game was loaded with play options. You could play 3 different play modes through the game and select your difficulty. The play control was excellent and it was an easy game to just pick up and play. Once you became familiar with the game you could make your own combos and find the best way to attack each enemy. The game is fun and exciting to play through. No part of the game is a cake walk and several sections will required you to make well timed jumps to advance. The stage backgrounds and platforms were all interesting and kept the game moving briskly. DD2 improved upon everything that was great about the first game. The music was excellent throughout the game, the games story was in Ninja Gaiden style cutscenes before...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Webb', N'ethan.webb5981@example.org', '2016-12-16', 1, N'After two weeks the cords stopped charging. Buy PlayStation merchandise. Not independent manufacturers. Horrible cords!!!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Robinson', N'timothy.robinson2722@example.org', '2016-12-16', 5, N'Great game for a 9 yr old and up'),
(N'Jerry', N'Bailey', N'jerry.bailey5714@example.org', '2016-12-17', 5, N'Great headphones, but more for PC gaming than console gaming. With a video game console like PS4 you''ll have to get an adapter that combines the microphone and headphones into one jack. There are pretty cool lights on the ears, and microphone, but unfortunately those only work with the USB plugged in. 5 stars, even needing an adapter, and with non functioning lights these are still my sons go-to favorite headphones for console play. adapter we used: "StarTech 4-Pin de 3,5 mm a 2 x 3-pin muyhsmff adaptador divisor de auriculares de 3,5 mm"'),
(N'Aaron', N'Gonzalez', N'aaron.gonzalez6751@example.com', '2016-12-17', 5, N'Son loves it'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Richardson', N'kimberly.richardson4091@example.org', '2016-12-17', 5, N'Perfect working order. So happy I made this purchase!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Richardson', N'kimberly.richardson4091@example.org', '2016-12-17', 5, N'Bought this as a gift for my younger brother, who absolutely loved it!'),
(N'Marcus', N'Garcia', N'marcus.garcia6546@example.net', '2016-12-17', 4, N'After having played The Walking Dead Seasons One and Two and The Wolf Among Us by TellTale, this is another masterpiece. I encountered a few errors during my play, like slow loading when starting next episode, and sometimes the game takes few seconds to load into next scene making the game less enjoyable. The storyline is absolutely brilliant, and even as an adult I do find it quite interesting, although it''s seems to be more aimed at teens.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Jones', N'samantha.jones5060@example.net', '2016-12-17', 5, N'great job'),
(N'Mateo', N'Powell', N'mateo.powell5221@example.net', '2016-12-18', 5, N'Best gears game in a while.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Nowak', N'raymond.nowak2946@example.com', '2016-12-18', 5, N'For those people that grew up watching dragon ball and can''t seem to get tired of the story, even when being repeated over and over in video games, this game is for you. It is a good title with good 3DS graphics. Gameplay is good as well. There doesn''t appear to be much to complain about with this title. So I''ll leave it at that. Is it a must buy? No. But if you have a few bucks lying around, why not... it''s dragon ball. Can''t go wrong with a very well liked title.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Chavez', N'michelle.chavez8649@example.net', '2016-12-18', 5, N'Love playing the classics'),
(N'Joan', N'Carter', N'joan.carter9182@example.com', '2016-12-18', 3, N'Fun idea, but very repetitive'),
(N'Walter', N'Johnson', N'walter.johnson5956@example.com', '2016-12-18', 5, N'As posted in my PSX review it is the best game in the series and definitely one of the greatest games of all time. Love this game! The gameplay, storyline and atmosphere make this game, stand the test of gaming from 1998 up until this point. It''s hard to come by games like this nowadays. I don''t want to reveal to many details but the game introduces two new characters in Leon/Claire and you can play and A and B scanerio for both characters giving the game high replay value. Furthermore, there is a new virus which a mad scientists of Umbrella was working on and of course the rest if history!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Martinez', N'joyce.martinez3533@example.com', '2016-12-18', 5, N'will play next Sunday know will love it'),
(N'Matthew', N'Wood', N'matthew.wood7192@example.com', '2016-12-18', 3, N'B-'),
(N'Matthew', N'Wood', N'matthew.wood7192@example.com', '2016-12-18', 3, N'b+'),
(N'Matthew', N'Wood', N'matthew.wood7192@example.com', '2016-12-18', 3, N'It broke in less than a month.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Nguyen', N'sofia.nguyen9767@example.net', '2016-12-18', 3, N'I got this game today popped in, and was thinking to myself wtf is wrong with Nintendo, what are they thinking. Okay I''ll tell you about the good parts of the game first, and what I liked then get to why I was thinking wtf. First off, all 5 games counting the battle mode of the Original Mario Brothers is awesome to have on one disc, and does give you that sense of nostalgia when playing. The controls seemed pretty good especially when playing with the Wii classic controller pro, and the button setup they give you. If you don''t have the classic controller pro I would suggest getting one, because it''s not that fun playing with the Wii remote sideways. Haven''t tried it with gamecube controller yet but the classic controller pro just seemed like it was that perfect right fit for these games, and the controls were spot on. The game is fun, and has a lot of replayability just for the nostalgia sake, and just for seeing if you can remember how to get past certain levels, and if you can...'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Mitchell', N'nicholas.mitchell6964@example.org', '2016-12-19', 5, N'great fun'),
(N'Jerry', N'Carter', N'jerry.carter8166@example.com', '2016-12-19', 4, N'it''s zelda'),
(N'Barbara', N'Sanders', N'barbara.sanders6275@example.net', '2016-12-20', 5, N'Exactly what I wanted. Works great!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Ross', N'joyce.ross8954@example.org', '2016-12-20', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Steven', N'Hill', N'steven.hill2277@example.net', '2016-12-20', 5, N'Works as a stereo headset for game sound as well as chat on xbox one. Very pleased. We''ll see if it lasts, but seems sturdy and flexible.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Miller', N'marcus.miller1575@example.org', '2016-12-20', 4, N'Must improved over the original Watch Dogs. The original just had so much promise but fell so flat. WD2 includes not only gameplay improvements but quality of life as well. Driving is completely overhauled as well as the actual in game hacking. You don''t have to feel like you''re limited to killing everyone on the screen in order to achieve your objective. The environment also feels much more lively even if the content of the story world is more grim. While WD1 had quite a bit of levity built in, WD2 feels darker and more pressing. There is quite a bit of grinding still involved, getting missions, getting drops, getting currency, etc. All in all though, it feels much cleaner and more fun than the original.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ferreira', N'victoria.ferreira1424@example.org', '2016-12-20', 5, N'Excellent product'),
(N'Linda', N'Patel', N'linda.patel2420@example.com', '2016-12-20', 5, N'does the job.'),
(N'Noah', N'Jones', N'noah.jones5424@example.com', '2016-12-20', 2, N'I have had two of these are they are wonderful at first, then the glue problems start. You start to feel a little bit of stickiness on your hands after playing. Then the whole wrist wrest starts slipping around while you are trying to play, causing a mess and sometimes interfering with the keys. I would really like to recommend this keypad, but I can''t until they fix this horrible glue problem'),
(N'Wei', N'Sanchez', N'wei.sanchez9245@example.org', '2016-12-20', 5, N'Love the blue tint and it has an elite feel'),
(N'Donna', N'Coleman', N'donna.coleman8948@example.org', '2016-12-20', 5, N'Great product, it worked as described and I had it for 4 years before I stopped using my ps3.'),
(N'Edward', N'Howard', N'edward.howard3292@example.com', '2016-12-20', 4, N'I will list my findings and experience: 1. This is not an actual RPG game, it have RPG elements but aside a skill tree and exp bar there its not much from it. 2. The stealth mechanics are pretty basic, just pass over the enemies quick enough for it perception bar not to turn red and you''ll be fine. 3. Story wise not the best narrative, if you like a strong story driven game, go somewhere else. 4. The Battle mechanics feels like a refined version of what WB did with Batman Arkham Origins (which its a good thing). 5. Sometimes the camera get stuck at walls in the middle of a fight, specially if you try to climb over a structure. 6. I feel they needed to polish more the parkour/climbing elements, sometimes i get stuck on ropes or if I want the character to jump in a certain direction the response does not reflect what I''m trying to do. Despite all of this the game feels fun and its fun to play so I''m still giving my 4 stars, also to have all the DLC content avaliable its a great...'),
(N'Emily', N'Wright', N'emily.wright7598@example.org', '2016-12-20', 5, N'good!'),
(N'Karen', N'Sanders', N'karen.sanders6614@example.net', '2016-12-20', 3, N'Graphics are incredible, but it become monotonous. Changes in weather add a nice touch, but it just feels like it needs more substance.'),
(N'Gary', N'Baker', N'gary.baker7858@example.net', '2016-12-20', 5, N'When I brought this it came with One and Two. It is a good game to play if every once in awhile you feel like going old school and pulling out the good ol'' PS2 which it works with very well.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Mitchell', N'nicole.mitchell8628@example.com', '2016-12-21', 5, N'My husband loves this game'),
(N'Richard', N'Evans', N'richard.evans9694@example.com', '2016-12-21', 5, N'was a gift and he loved it'),
(N'David', N'Sanders', N'david.sanders9992@example.org', '2016-12-21', 2, N'No ability to melee. I stopped playing it because so many missions require stealth yet I can''t sneak up behind an adversary and knive them.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Gonzalez', N'jacob.gonzalez5288@example.net', '2016-12-21', 4, N'had to get a nunchuk for thisgame which was annoying'),
(N'Christopher', N'Myers', N'christopher.myers6104@example.net', '2016-12-21', 5, N'These are awesome! We have had a hard time getting used to the Wii controller. Maybe I''m too old... but I wanted something easier, plus our son had troubles too. These work just right, almost like a Nintendo 64 controller. It plugs into the Wii controller and doesn''t eat up the battery. No delay as far as I can tell.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Peterson', N'stephanie.peterson6520@example.org', '2016-12-21', 5, N'Good Game.'),
(N'Jack', N'Mendoza', N'jack.mendoza8032@example.org', '2016-12-21', 2, N'2nd hand game, had to pay for returning.'),
(N'Jack', N'Mendoza', N'jack.mendoza8032@example.org', '2016-12-21', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Jack', N'Mendoza', N'jack.mendoza8032@example.org', '2016-12-21', 2, N'It did not read hard drive.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Davis', N'aaron.davis1695@example.net', '2016-12-21', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Mark', N'Lee', N'mark.lee9259@example.net', '2016-12-21', 5, N'Perfect gift... perfect price'),
(N'Samantha', N'Adams', N'samantha.adams5529@example.net', '2016-12-22', 4, N'A good Lego game.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Anderson', N'barbara.anderson9104@example.net', '2016-12-22', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Hill', N'jeremy.hill9087@example.com', '2016-12-22', 5, N'Xmas gift my son wanted.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Perez', N'amanda.perez5617@example.com', '2016-12-22', 5, N'Honastly its 100% worth it but the controller needs some improvement im not sure if the guy who shipped it just threw it down but up and down on the D-Pad works its just left and right you have to push hard i also noticed one pin missing in the controller port'),
(N'Kevin', N'Perez', N'kevin.perez7357@example.org', '2016-12-22', 5, N'it just came in the mail today! i love the music CD that came with it. im listening to track two so much xD i recommend this game to any veteran fan of Shantae or new fans as well they will enjoy it and have loads of fun cause i know i will. Even If you are not familiar with the series all the characters are introduced at some point in the game :) so rep 2 go! this game leaves no disappointments :) it is a real treasure! do not pass this up! :) the box art is the same as the ps vita case just smaller. the cd features the four girls (Sky, Rotty, Risky and Shantae)'),
(N'Nicole', N'Nguyen', N'nicole.nguyen2117@example.org', '2016-12-22', 5, N'Absolutely love them, super comfortable. Only querk I have is some games trigger spot is different from others. I can set it for destiny right before the shot and it works great. Turn on another game and your R2 or L2 button don''t work until you adjust it out. You can also use the non trigger stop grips that are also included. I didn''t know it would come with both. I highly recommend them to anyone. The regular grips are perfect, they are easy to swap on and off.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Roberts', N'aisha.roberts7698@example.com', '2016-12-22', 4, N'My son bought this with his own money as a preorder but we are having problems with the game that Nintendo should have corrected before release. There are delays in the story mode talking and then it suddenly stops and goes back. I really don''t get it but my 4 kids state that it lags. Is there a problem where the game should be returned? I don''t know.. they do really like this but it doesn''t play smoothly!?!'),
(N'Edward', N'Torres', N'edward.torres6516@example.net', '2016-12-22', 5, N'Completely fixed my Astro A50 Xbox live chat issues. SHAME ON YOU ASTRO GAMING.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Ward', N'ronald.ward6366@example.com', '2016-12-22', 4, N'In the seemly never ending stream of movie games trying (and usually failing) to cash in on their movie counter part, Robots stands above the rest of the junk. Is it a great game? No, but it''s certainly better than one may think at first glance. For story, the movie follows the plot of the movie somewhat, but there is a lot of deviation from it to justify a game. But that''s okay, because now we can focus on what matters most: Gameplay. Robots is your standard third person action game, where Rodney has a small arsenal of weapons and gadgets to take care of the enemies in his path, as well as some second function to solve puzzles. But with the exception of a few, to get access to these you must find the pieces and bring them to an NPC to have them. In other words, I hope you like fetch quests, because that''s what this game spends a lot of time with. There are multiple things Rodney needs to find to progress. This isn''t awful, but it can get old towards the end. The combat is pretty...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Nelson', N'cynthia.nelson1685@example.org', '2016-12-22', 5, N'Received without problems. Thanks.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Chen', N'nicole.chen4479@example.org', '2016-12-23', 3, N'its ok but i don''t like the feeling of the mouse pad its to slippery i guess you could say it makes it very hard to aim in games and is just a pain i recommend the Razer Goliathus control edition'),
(N'Karen', N'Brown', N'karen.brown1081@example.org', '2016-12-23', 4, N'Perfect Christmas gift for younger brother!'),
(N'Gregory', N'Nelson', N'gregory.nelson7363@example.org', '2016-12-23', 5, N'It works great when I play stargate or joust. I just have to lock doaywn controller so it doesn''t move than I''m good to go..'),
(N'Nancy', N'Brooks', N'nancy.brooks6661@example.net', '2016-12-23', 1, N'But the second one instead of this. I played this one, then went right to second. The second game is pretty much the 1st one but better.'),
(N'Maria', N'Long', N'maria.long4295@example.org', '2016-12-23', 3, N'I felt this game was pretty good overall and is faithful to the franchise. However flying the planes in space was just plain frustrating. Really a big flaw in the game.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Evans', N'jeremy.evans6803@example.net', '2016-12-23', 2, N'I''m a Star Wars nut, but I found this game to be a little too simplistic. I felt the same way about the Lego games. Your mileage may vary.'),
(N'Wei', N'Lewis', N'wei.lewis4433@example.com', '2016-12-23', 5, N'Works'),
(N'Ryan', N'Cook', N'ryan.cook3364@example.org', '2016-12-23', 3, N'It is more frustrating than fun, and maybe its just not for me, but I did not enjoy this game very much. I am glad I was able to get on sale.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Lee', N'ashley.lee5719@example.com', '2016-12-24', 1, N'Was all BAD VERY DIRTY WOSE THING EVER HOW MEAN'),
(N'Ivan', N'Allen', N'ivan.allen7699@example.com', '2016-12-24', 5, N'This PDP controller feels just like an official Xbox controller. It works with both an Xbox One and a PC, and in fact I have been using it as my primary Retro Pi controller for the past week and it''s brilliant. On a PC running Windows 10, the wired controller works perfect. It automatically downloaded a needed driver, and it just works. On an Xbox, it simply works right out of the box, didn''t have to configure anything. The weight, feel, and control action is spot on. Unless you knew this was a PDP, you would just assume it came from Microsoft. But because it is corded, there is no chance of your controller running out of power during game play.'),
(N'Carol', N'Alvarez', N'carol.alvarez8011@example.org', '2016-12-24', 1, N'DO NOT BUY THIS! I bought a Steam Link and a Controller together and both were bricks out of the box. They both turn on but do absolutely nothing. Complete garbage.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Sanchez', N'rebecca.sanchez1225@example.org', '2016-12-24', 5, N'I bought this as a Christmas present for my son, the packaging and game are in perfect condition. I know he will just love it!!!'),
(N'Stephen', N'Hughes', N'stephen.hughes8978@example.net', '2016-12-24', 4, N'Great services and no complaints'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Sanders', N'jeremy.sanders7511@example.net', '2016-12-24', 5, N'Very nice figure'),
(N'Megan', N'Jackson', N'megan.jackson8368@example.net', '2016-12-25', 5, N'Amazing items and very nice'),
(N'Anna', N'Price', N'anna.price3145@example.com', '2016-12-25', 5, N'great'),
(N'Nicole', N'Butler', N'nicole.butler9286@example.org', '2016-12-25', 5, N'Great Deal'),
(N'Deborah', N'Stewart', N'deborah.stewart4477@example.org', '2016-12-25', 5, N'Enjoyed very much.'),
(N'Karen', N'Kowalski', N'karen.kowalski6941@example.com', '2016-12-25', 1, N'This game sucks. End of story.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Rodriguez', N'brandon.rodriguez3819@example.org', '2016-12-25', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Patrick', N'Thompson', N'patrick.thompson6755@example.com', '2016-12-25', 5, N'I got this from Target and my son was super happy on this wonderful Christmas morning! It looks great on the lime green system!! Fits like a glove! Easy installation. It''s not much protection from drops, but will protect against scratches. It''s just so adorable!!! I would love to have a phone case with this design.'),
(N'Emily', N'Adams', N'emily.adams5132@example.net', '2016-12-25', 4, N'Dec 30, 2016 Note: The + and = key is labeled reverse from what it should be. the + is on the left when it should be on the right. The key action is correct, it is just the label that is incorrect. Original Review Dec 25, 2016 I am not a gamer. I just had particular desires for a keyboard and put this one on my Christmas list. My parameters were this: - Good typing feel for me as I am a touch typist (for the most part). - Smaller keyboard without the number pad on the right side. - Back-lit keys - Wired or wireless - Back-lit keys show light through the letters, not just backlit around the edges of the keys. - I wasn''t looking for a mechanical keyboard and don''t understand the advantage of one. I''ve never had a problem with my membrane keyboard. How well does this Drevo meet my goals? - Feel: It always has taken me a while to get used to a new keyboard. But I feel at home very soon after installing this Drevo. The change from a flat, non mechanical, quiet, keyboard has been quite...'),
(N'Joan', N'Jenkins', N'joan.jenkins1357@example.net', '2016-12-25', 5, N'BEST BATMAN GAME YET. You will die. You will get frustrated. You will get a beatdown. But your FREAKING BATMAN!As hard as points of this game can be you are still the bat. You can win. I have 100% completed this game. It took me hpirs upon hours to do so. But it is epic#'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Harris', N'tomasz.harris4539@example.net', '2016-12-25', 4, N'It does everything it advertises to do, but I have noticed the cord tend to pull it left/right/forward depending on how you have it set up. If you are in a move intensive game such as a shooter, and you flex your hand just a second away from the mouse it can and will cause problems. The only other issues I have with the mouse is the location for the side/thumb buttons. If you have big hands, which I do, they are constantly in the way, this thing needs to be about 1/2 inch higher to work well for someone with large hands. All that said, the customer service with this seller is excellent. If you have a problem they will strive to make it right!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ruiz', N'kimberly.ruiz2787@example.net', '2016-12-26', 5, N'This is a wonderful addition to the Zelda franchise. While I wish there were more dungeons - and travel was such a chore - I immensely enjoyed this game.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Ruiz', N'kimberly.ruiz2787@example.net', '2016-12-26', 1, N'This is a huge improvement upon Phantom Hourglass. The stylus controls are much more fluid. When changing weapons, the game actually pauses, which makes more complex battles a touch easier. However, all of that being said, all movement is again forced through the stylus, and in the latter end of the game when everything becomes harder, this forced mechanic becomes downright terrible. I was unable to finish this game because I became so frustrated with the constant micromanagement and the stylus.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Kowalski', N'kyle.kowalski5828@example.org', '2016-12-26', 5, N'Now I can finally charge one controller while playing Skylanders and using the cord for the second controller. Those who play the game know what I mean. Decent quality, and charges the controllers quickly. The red to blue light indicator is a bonus!'),
(N'Kyle', N'Kowalski', N'kyle.kowalski5828@example.org', '2016-12-26', 5, N'We keep either losing cables, the tips break, or the dog chews them up. I bought these and found them to be great for the money.'),
(N'Susan', N'Wood', N'susan.wood4755@example.org', '2016-12-26', 4, N'Fromm quality of design and comfort standpoint, this is awesome. Once the game play begins, it''s a little less than awesome. I wouldn''t go so far as to say the games look like a ps2 as some people have said, however, the graininess of the video display inside the headset can be a distraction to an otherwise fantastically immersive experience. What''s worse is the image drift and trouble shooting. This is not a plug and play set up. It takes time to set up, time to troubleshoot and some research and reading. It can even take a little rearranging of some furniture. I will say though, it''s worth it. Without going into a game review kind of write up, the VR Worlds disc that comes with is a good introduction to VR. Whatever studio did the London Heist demo needs to get a full blown sequel out soon. There is also the VR Playroom available for download, it''s pretty entertaining as well. As far as VR nausea or motion sickness, only my daughter was affected. She played Eve:Valkyrie for 20...'),
(N'Jose', N'Campbell', N'jose.campbell7509@example.net', '2016-12-26', 5, N'Love this game. For the price it''s impossible to beat this offer. If you enjoyed the 360 version these remastered ones will definitely make you smile. It comes with all the DLC''s and then some. You even get extra golden keys for buying the collection. Can''t wait for another Boarderlands!'),
(N'Christine', N'Jenkins', N'christine.jenkins4098@example.com', '2016-12-26', 4, N'The Good: Many old features make a fun comeback, multiplayer is great, Horde 3.0 is fantastic, new weapons are fun, larger enemies make for a greater challenge The Bad: Campaign lacks epic set pieces of previous games, has more old tricks than new, graphics are a letdown, story doesnt advance the series much, boring level design First off I have to say Gears of War is one of my favorite game series of all time. It was the first game to really show me true next-generation fidelity when I got my Xbox 360 on Christmas of 2006. The art style, the characters, the lore, the story, and the atmosphere all drew me in with fantastic revolutionary gameplay and amazing online multiplayer. It was one of the most cloned games since Resident Evil 4 (which I know Gears took much inspiration from). Here we are 10 years and 5 games later. I honestly didn''t go into Gears 4 expecting much after Gears 3 was so satisfying and I accepted that it was the end. When Judgement was released I lost hope in the...'),
(N'Patrick', N'Rodriguez', N'patrick.rodriguez1675@example.net', '2016-12-26', 4, N'The big sticker in the back that says " USED, VERY GOOD" was not nessesary....'),
(N'Peter', N'Ramos', N'peter.ramos4499@example.com', '2016-12-26', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Mateo', N'Fisher', N'mateo.fisher3100@example.com', '2016-12-26', 5, N'This game is so cool! I love the cel shaded graphics! It reminds me of Jet Set Radio!'),
(N'Laura', N'Roberts', N'laura.roberts9895@example.com', '2016-12-26', 5, N'I recommend anyone purchase this product if you need a new controller you won''t regret it and you save money.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Bailey', N'joshua.bailey4919@example.org', '2016-12-27', 5, N'my kids love this game'),
(N'John', N'Morales', N'john.morales3764@example.com', '2016-12-27', 5, N'hours of play'),
(N'Henry', N'Henderson', N'henry.henderson2078@example.com', '2016-12-27', 4, N'Love this new version of the xBox One S. It''s got a few new features over the normal xBox One. The HDR looks great and adds a lot of depth in games Like Final Fantasy 15. If only they could fix the blu ray software so it can play my movies too I wouldn''t have to take off a star.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wood', N'kelly.wood2339@example.org', '2016-12-27', 4, N'Good Game!!!'),
(N'Scott', N'Allen', N'scott.allen3619@example.org', '2016-12-27', 5, N'My son loves it!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Alvarez', N'brenda.alvarez1869@example.com', '2016-12-27', 5, N'As Expected.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Green', N'hannah.green5115@example.org', '2016-12-27', 5, N'It''s just like watching the old school Transformers TV series, but this one you get to play with it & explore the areas. The graphics are great & controlling the characters is good.'),
(N'Walter', N'Jackson', N'walter.jackson5236@example.org', '2016-12-27', 5, N'Very Satisfied thank you will be doing business again'),
(N'Victoria', N'Butler', N'victoria.butler2167@example.com', '2016-12-27', 5, N'I was late in giving this game a try but when I saw the first episode was free on Xbox I figured why not give it a try. TBH, I knew nothing about this game and figured this was going to be a game about a werewolf or something dumb like that. From my own personal gaming experience and my memories, this is the only game in the past few years that I wanted,scratch that, NEEDED to play more of. Ive played other TT games but this ones story is by far the best. The graphics are typical TT style and there were moments that I noticed a lag between the animation and audio. For example I would hear the conversation continue between characters but the animation would be still on the screen. The soundtrack to the game is really good and matches the mood and tone for each scene very well. There are achievements that do require another play through in certain chapters, which can be annoying for other games, but this game didn''t annoy me having to do another play through of a chapter. I actually...'),
(N'Adam', N'Young', N'adam.young7128@example.net', '2016-12-27', 3, N'good'),
(N'Heather', N'Mendoza', N'heather.mendoza7342@example.net', '2016-12-27', 1, N'The title says "reusable," but these are identical to the screw-it-up-once-and-you-may-as-well-toss-it plastic protectors with which many smartphone users are familiar with struggling. The back part is cut far too skinny in the openings for where your fingers are supposed to "grip," and the "cutaway" part for the front camera is position such that you have to chose between not covering the left joystick or not covering the camera. I was also hoping for a screen protector that might protect from bumps and stuff, too, but no these are pure finger-print "protection." I know there aren''t as many options for protecting a Vita as there are for protecting an iPhone, but if there were, I''d say pass on this.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Reed', N'patricia.reed9318@example.net', '2016-12-27', 5, N'As advertised. great product.'),
(N'Judith', N'Cox', N'judith.cox8280@example.com', '2016-12-28', 3, N'My 6yr got her first game system for Christmas. This game is a little challenging for her.'),
(N'William', N'Nguyen', N'william.nguyen9886@example.com', '2016-12-28', 5, N'If you watch a couple of videos and see how simple it is to put these grips on, you will have these in no time. The package comes with two sets, one with trigger stops and one without. They are both amazing, The trigger stop ones are more for fps shooters, and the normal grips are for basically everything else. These really work! If you get them to just right, you can be a lot quicker in your shooting. Great product.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Kumar', N'patricia.kumar1864@example.org', '2016-12-28', 2, N'left anolog glitches movement, unable to move right direction for ssx on tour (lots of lag/latency) very frustrating! went back to my big & heavy old Logitech wireless that used 2 AA which I had for for over 5 years now.'),
(N'Joan', N'Webb', N'joan.webb3275@example.com', '2016-12-28', 5, N'Product arrived on time and was as described.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Singh', N'joseph.singh3855@example.com', '2016-12-28', 4, N'The lights are nice to look at with different settings of light patterns, different brightnesses, or turned off. It''s a decent gaming keyboard with back-lighting if you''re on a budget. It seems a little flimsy in the front middle edge. Putting enough pressure in the middle (where the space bar is) will push the front middle edge of the keyboard down past the feet on either end and bottom out. This is easily remedied by picking up a pack of rubber sticky feet (or buttons) from any hardware store for a dollar or two and placing one in the middle underneath the spacebar. Due to that, I''ve removed one star. Other than that, this is a decent gaming keyboard that looks good and works like it''s supposed to so far.'),
(N'Emma', N'Bailey', N'emma.bailey9461@example.net', '2016-12-28', 1, N'Not happy left Me Hanging, was damaged during delivery'),
(N'Jason', N'Sanders', N'jason.sanders8040@example.org', '2016-12-28', 5, N'Sweet son loves it thanks'),
(N'Amanda', N'Cook', N'amanda.cook5316@example.com', '2016-12-28', 3, N'Ok'),
(N'Ivan', N'Webb', N'ivan.webb3783@example.com', '2016-12-28', 3, N'Not my favorite battlefield game'),
(N'Katherine', N'Foster', N'katherine.foster6761@example.com', '2016-12-28', 5, N'Lot of fun. Always liked Ubisoft games.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Morris', N'carolyn.morris1693@example.org', '2016-12-29', 5, N'When I first got this mouse, it was primarily for a couple of games, but I had a hard time getting used to it. I have large hands, and was accustomed to a Logitech Performance MX ergonomic mouse. I was used to resting my hand on a mouse, so I actually let this sit for a few months before I tried it again. Now, it is my favorite and I use it almost 100% of the time -- great tracking, comfortable to use, and it looks good to boot. I still use the Performance MX on occasion, along with a G600 for one game, but the DeathAdder is now my all around favorite.'),
(N'Brian', N'Gray', N'brian.gray1912@example.net', '2016-12-29', 4, N'Really fun for my whole family.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Watson', N'yuki.watson7171@example.org', '2016-12-29', 5, N'Super cute!!!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Baker', N'ryan.baker8403@example.org', '2016-12-29', 5, N'Kids enjoy the console. I can even navigate the system.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ivanov', N'ryan.ivanov5502@example.net', '2016-12-29', 4, N'Its a little "thin" feeling, I feel like I could break it in a second. But hey, its a good controller and hopefully it''ll last.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Okonkwo', N'lauren.okonkwo3068@example.org', '2016-12-29', 5, N'This is a much better case than the previous yellow Pikachu case that came out recently. It''s much more attractive and durable than the yellow one (yellow gets dirty pretty easily and the Pikachu peeled with time). Great case to have for Pokemon fans'),
(N'Barbara', N'Singh', N'barbara.singh8766@example.net', '2016-12-29', 4, N'Good deal on PS4 game. Thank you.'),
(N'Wei', N'Bailey', N'wei.bailey8447@example.com', '2016-12-29', 5, N'Arrived on time and as expected.'),
(N'Edward', N'Morris', N'edward.morris8973@example.org', '2016-12-29', 5, N'Great game! Love the new Pokemon. I am a little disappointed in how much hand-holding goes on in the game, but its also a totally new experience so at the same time it''s nice to have a Pokemon game that stepped a bit away from the usual template. Even your "rival" is not really a rival, always being helpful and even chooses the starter weak to yours!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Murphy', N'evelyn.murphy3345@example.com', '2016-12-29', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Khan', N'jeffrey.khan6940@example.com', '2016-12-29', 5, N'Absolutely love! I was using it every day, sometimes more than once. Then my brand new Wii decided not to work, so I haven''t been able to use for a couple months.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Cooper', N'sharon.cooper7963@example.com', '2016-12-29', 4, N'Works fine for what it is at, $9.99 or less it is worth it to give you a controller stand.'),
(N'Helen', N'Murphy', N'helen.murphy7275@example.com', '2016-12-29', 1, N'Not really worth watching mini movie cartoons.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Richardson', N'kofi.richardson3862@example.com', '2016-12-29', 4, N'good'),
(N'Helen', N'Suzuki', N'helen.suzuki9730@example.net', '2016-12-29', 5, N'I don''t bother with any controllers not made by Sony. They are the best quality and hold up the longest while staying consistent. The newer ones seem to hold up better then the original ones that came at launch.'),
(N'William', N'Lopez', N'william.lopez3455@example.net', '2016-12-30', 5, N'I love it! The Gameboy has always been a part of my childhood and this brings back a lot of memories. I have this sitting on my shelf with the collection. I always pick it up to play my favorite gameboy games!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Chavez', N'stephanie.chavez7625@example.org', '2016-12-30', 4, N'I would have rated this 5/5 but I took one off because the battery packs are easy to loose As the title states the charger is great and the battery packs make the PS4 controller last a lot longer. However once you loose a battery pack then you''re out of luck. I haven''t been able to find extra battery packs. So if you have kids I would not recommend this.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Diaz', N'raymond.diaz8939@example.net', '2016-12-30', 3, N'Scary for all the wrong reasons. Though it definitely captures the aesthetic of the original ALIEN, i really can''t claim that this game is all that great. Put simply, i had to take breaks from the game because it was too stressful and not for the right reasons. I ALIEN and always pop a stiffy for xenomorphs, but the cheapness of 99% of my deaths left me wanting to throw the controller. The game isn''t hard, the AI is cheap and the ALIEN can apparently teleport. I know in the movies the ALIEN is just magically behind characters, but in the game I''ve watched the ALIEN run down a corridor, only to step out and get killed from behind. However, hands down, the outside scene at the end was AMAZING.'),
(N'Emily', N'Parker', N'emily.parker7595@example.com', '2016-12-30', 5, N'GOOD GAME'),
(N'Andrea', N'Morgan', N'andrea.morgan9338@example.org', '2016-12-30', 5, N'Received as described.'),
(N'Ronald', N'King', N'ronald.king2623@example.org', '2016-12-30', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Jason', N'Boyd', N'jason.boyd5677@example.net', '2016-12-30', 5, N'I''ve played the others and found them very fun. This one is no different. Much of the same, but adds new material on top of it. Just a great game with the right amount of challenge.'),
(N'Eric', N'Morris', N'eric.morris1727@example.com', '2016-12-30', 5, N'couldn''t be happier'),
(N'Larry', N'Sanders', N'larry.sanders1133@example.org', '2016-12-30', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Nguyen', N'deborah.nguyen3250@example.org', '2016-12-30', 5, N'Works great for me. Isn''t too tight or anything.'),
(N'Angela', N'Perez', N'angela.perez7435@example.com', '2016-12-30', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Lucia', N'Diaz', N'lucia.diaz4388@example.com', '2016-12-31', 5, N'Great game so far and loved all the content. The Statue is dope and fit well with my collection.'),
(N'Omar', N'Raghunathan', N'omar.raghunathan8297@example.net', '2016-12-31', 5, N'So far so good. I like it. It has a small form factor and that''s what I needed since my space is very limited. The switches may not be legit cherry switches but just like the Razer black widow it has alternative ones. For the price, its a must own.'),
(N'Laura', N'Ferreira', N'laura.ferreira3650@example.org', '2016-12-31', 3, N'Good Megaman game for Megaman X all the way to X6 man I wish they would put this on the PS4'),
(N'Luis', N'Sanchez', N'luis.sanchez6287@example.net', '2016-12-31', 5, N'This brand actually worked and LASTED. I use a TB px51 and the packaged cable broke quickly. So did the ienza replacement I got. This one lasted more than a year and a half. Will be buying a couple new ones.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Richardson', N'aisha.richardson6236@example.org', '2016-12-31', 2, N'I purchased this elsewhere but here is my review. It''s got great graphics and is a lot of fun and my kids love it. The big problem with it is that it freezes during gameplay. This is evidently a HUGE prolonged problem that should have been fixed awhile ago, but has never been addressed. Google search Playstion freezing and there are TONS & TONS of people having this problem. My unit was brand new and I let it update the software, so everything is up to date, but it still freezes. It''s very annoying when you are in the middle of a game and it locks up. Had I done more research I probably would have gone a different route. Even the PS4 is freezing up on people! My kids Wii is more reliable than this. I have always been a big fan of Sony, but this has been an on going problem for years and they don''t seem to want to fix it.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Castillo', N'patricia.castillo5087@example.net', '2016-12-31', 5, N'Fantastic end to a wonderful series. Great love letter to fans.'),
(N'Eric', N'Smith', N'eric.smith8320@example.org', '2016-12-31', 4, N'Good product.'),
(N'Jose', N'Bailey', N'jose.bailey7112@example.org', '2016-12-31', 1, N'Do not buy this. It''s a complete pain. The "adapters" do not stay on the controller when not charging and they do not easily fit into the station without said controller. Add the inconvenience of each adapter being Left and Right your left to guess which plug will work. The adapters get lost and so will your patience. Maybe if you live alone I would give this 2 stars. Buy the ones that let you dock the controller with no nonsense garbage getting in the way. For less than 10$ more. Just look at the people wanting new adapters because they are lost/broken. Case closed. I threw mine out!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Perez', N'brenda.perez7441@example.com', '2016-12-31', 5, N'This game is only my 4th platinum ever. Yes i enjoyed it that much. Ive been a customer of Amazon since 2005 and an employee since 2014. Ive only posted 10 or so game reviews either because i felt they weren''t getting the credit they deserved (Pandora''s Tower Wii) or having some emotional impact (Nier PS3). This game fits into the former, charming art, gorgeous to look at, fluid fun gameplay, and a strong contender for soundtrack of the year. Support Wayforward, support their best game of the series buy this game. Lots of heart was put into this. Thank you for this game Wayforward and of course the backers!:D'),
(N'Ivan', N'Alvarez', N'ivan.alvarez7887@example.net', '2017-01-01', 4, N'Fast shipping and great game.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Sanders', N'sarah.sanders8238@example.org', '2017-01-01', 5, N'I like this game. I know a lot of fans are complaining but I am a big Halo fan so I do not mind the futuristic look and play. The play is smooth and fun. Having said that I love Battlefield 1 as well'),
(N'Joseph', N'Patel', N'joseph.patel8167@example.org', '2017-01-01', 4, N'If this were the current gen version I would have given five stars, but a great many sacrifices were made to port this game back to previous gen consoles, and what angered me is that the original Tomb Raider reboot for 360 looked and played smoother, in terms of the game itself it is an amazing adventure with a dash of rpg elements in terms of weapon upgrades and craft/gather systems. If you have the option of consoles, get this for PS4, it is a beautiful game that older systems simply can''t manage to realize.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Smith', N'jacqueline.smith9731@example.org', '2017-01-01', 2, N'I don''t know what''s going on. I''m getting a Direct X installation error for this game & the Mass effect Trio on 3 PC''s I have. I''ve put a ticket in & waiting for a call back from Customer Support with hope they can assist me via Remote assistance. All 3 of my Systems are updated & have Direct X 12 compliant GPU''s. it seems these games that you must download & install using Origin have problems Downloading & installing the correct Direct X run time routine. They expect you to go into your registry & fix it on your own. This is unacceptable to me. I''m not happy.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Coleman', N'jessica.coleman8648@example.net', '2017-01-01', 5, N'Great game. My grandson loves it!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Gonzalez', N'kathleen.gonzalez4665@example.com', '2017-01-02', 3, N'It works but the joystick is pretty stiff, honestly get the retrolink brand instead.. I bought them both and the retrolink brand is the closest to an identical you can find.'),
(N'Steven', N'Green', N'steven.green1826@example.com', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Factory sealed cardboard was not damaged'),
(N'Angela', N'Suzuki', N'angela.suzuki5225@example.com', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Bought this for Christmas and my 7 yr old loves this!!'),
(N'Emily', N'Jackson', N'emily.jackson6821@example.com', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Excellent! The kids (and Me) love playing this - great way to work up a sweat. Be aware of in game purchases. . . otherwise, great game in the series.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Jackson', N'stephen.jackson1543@example.org', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Awesome and my friend is loving it.'),
(N'George', N'Kim', N'george.kim8595@example.net', '2017-01-02', 4, N'This is actually a DS gem I got my hands on it finally. the game can be very calming and a little spooky I like remixing its fun and creative totally worth it.'),
(N'Carol', N'Lopez', N'carol.lopez7608@example.org', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Awesome graphics, OK gameplay.. conclusion: perfect Christmas gift'),
(N'Kyle', N'Nguyen', N'kyle.nguyen2115@example.com', '2017-01-02', 4, N'Great, here on time... Son loves them'),
(N'Donald', N'Jenkins', N'donald.jenkins3933@example.org', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Kids love this game'),
(N'Carlos', N'Coleman', N'carlos.coleman5312@example.org', '2017-01-02', 4, N'Great game as was the first...graphics amazing, good story and awesome weapons..like doom in space.'),
(N'Julie', N'Flores', N'julie.flores1179@example.com', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Absolutely amazing. Been playing Fifa since 2010 and the game is improving every year. PES is kind of catching up in the last 2 years but with Ultimate Team and Journey modes, Fifa will always be the best selling.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Gutierrez', N'jacob.gutierrez1619@example.com', '2017-01-02', 5, N'I''ve played this for hours upon hours, finally able to play not just a good fighting game, but an amazing one on a portable system. If that''s what you''re looking for, look no further.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Long', N'mateo.long5672@example.net', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Patrick', N'Ramos', N'patrick.ramos9435@example.net', '2017-01-02', 5, N'Came in time with no damage to the case and our kids love it.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Nelson', N'tomasz.nelson5429@example.com', '2017-01-03', 1, N'This was a bad buy, I didn''t know you cant use this to connect to the pc to use a wireless controller as a wired one. It also feels like cheap quality and came in a bag not in a box like pictured.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Nowak', N'dennis.nowak7926@example.com', '2017-01-03', 5, N'Son is learning how the hunt ethically through these videos. Never shoot unless you have a clear unobstructed shot at the vital organs so the shot will be as humanitarian as possible. We are a whole foods plant based diet family, so we do not hunt. But if put in a survival situation, these instructions will be valuable in extreme situations.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Collins', N'aisha.collins8444@example.net', '2017-01-03', 5, N'It is Great!'),
(N'Helen', N'Cruz', N'helen.cruz9250@example.net', '2017-01-03', 5, N'Works as advertised!!! :o)'),
(N'Paul', N'Ward', N'paul.ward3009@example.org', '2017-01-03', 5, N'Gorgeous graphics, catchy tune & FUN game play! A definite win!'),
(N'Amara', N'Patel', N'amara.patel3498@example.net', '2017-01-03', 5, N'Great game and was in wonderful condition. Thank you for my order. It was fast and the product was exactly what I wanted. I look forward to ordering from you again! Marshall'),
(N'Anna', N'Foster', N'anna.foster5811@example.net', '2017-01-03', 4, N'Great throwback game, especially the hidden old school game (took me back to the early 90''s when I first played it!!). Good paced game with great graphics.'),
(N'Donald', N'Kumar', N'donald.kumar7787@example.net', '2017-01-03', 3, N'Got to try this mouse. The build quality feels so CHEAP! Plastic feels hollow and doesn''t seem like a product that will last you a few years. Its light, which I like, a little too big for my liking, but it will fit large hands well. I guess its reasonable for the price. Only 49 at the time of this post, but Razr needs to do something about quality control.'),
