(N'Michael', N'Evans', N'michael.evans2362@example.com', '2017-01-03', 5, N'My daughter loves this video game'),
(N'Barbara', N'Singh', N'barbara.singh8766@example.net', '2017-01-03', 4, N'Good deal on PS4 game. My kids love it with their 2017 also.'),
