(N'Jacqueline', N'Gomez', N'jacqueline.gomez4971@example.org', '2017-01-03', 5, N'Arrived quickly, looked nice, brother loved it.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Wilson', N'ravi.wilson5309@example.net', '2017-01-04', 3, N'Not a bad battery pack, but the stupid little tabs that click into the controller will break off just from normal use. Plug this thing in and never take it out.'),
(N'Amy', N'Johnson', N'amy.johnson4590@example.org', '2017-01-04', 5, N'Good idea'),
(N'Alexander', N'Cruz', N'alexander.cruz3822@example.net', '2017-01-04', 5, N'This game is very fun its the best of the paper mario games so far and much better than sticker star. fun storyline too'),
(N'Heather', N'Gray', N'heather.gray7285@example.net', '2017-01-04', 5, N'Fun interactive game for kids. It holds my child''s attention and it is rewarding for them when they complete actions in the game'),
