(N'Heather', N'Chavez', N'heather.chavez7879@example.com', '2017-01-04', 5, N'Gave as gift! They loved it!'),
(N'Edward', N'Gray', N'edward.gray5936@example.org', '2017-01-04', 5, N'Awesome game! Great graphics and game play. Only complaint would be that it is not that long. Runs super smooth on the PS4 as well!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Lee', N'thomas.lee8208@example.com', '2017-01-04', 2, N'I LOVED Shadow of the Colossus, but I just couldn''t get into this game, and wish I hadn''t bought into the 7-year buildup it took to finally get this game released.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Nowak', N'daniel.nowak6257@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'great gift'),
(N'Megan', N'Cook', N'megan.cook4167@example.com', '2017-01-05', 5, N'A dream'),
(N'James', N'Myers', N'james.myers7414@example.com', '2017-01-05', 5, N'A great, often overlooked gem for the SNES. If you are an RPG fan look'),
(N'Jessica', N'Sullivan', N'jessica.sullivan5095@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'I had a cheap $8 pair that worked for about 6 months until the people on the other end could not hear me and it was scratchy when they talked to me. These worked much better and are still working a year later.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Robinson', N'ravi.robinson6811@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'I like these controllers since they really look fancy with the Xbox 360 console. I would recommend it anyone who needs it.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Garcia', N'ryan.garcia6319@example.net', '2017-01-05', 5, N'As advertised. Quick delivery.'),
(N'Wei', N'Hughes', N'wei.hughes7892@example.com', '2017-01-05', 5, N'Bought this for my daughter and she loves to play as Elsa in Disney Infinity. Great quality figure too.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Ortiz', N'deborah.ortiz4598@example.com', '2017-01-05', 5, N'Great hit with the little one.'),
(N'Frank', N'Lewis', N'frank.lewis9349@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'love harvest moon! thanks'),
(N'Kyle', N'Myers', N'kyle.myers8419@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'Perfect OEM fit, looks great and protects your Wii!'),
(N'Jose', N'Hughes', N'jose.hughes6101@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'Windows 7 failed to download it''s drivers correctly at first. I removed it from the devices list and tried again. Worked the second time. Works perfectly. Automatically connects to the controller when you turn the controller on.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Kowalski', N'ronald.kowalski4905@example.com', '2017-01-05', 5, N'Controller functions well and holds a decent charge. Looks really good to.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Watson', N'timothy.watson5726@example.com', '2017-01-05', 5, N'An amazing Collector''s Edition for an amazing game. The statue is beautiful.'),
(N'Luis', N'Wisniewski', N'luis.wisniewski1878@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'Excellent game, very funny, I really recommend it.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Kim', N'sarah.kim3809@example.org', '2017-01-05', 5, N'Excelente timming in the shipping'),
(N'Thomas', N'Garcia', N'thomas.garcia5592@example.com', '2017-01-06', 5, N'This thing is bomb. The cord is very long so it should work for most setups. The battery life is decent, feels a little longer than the 360 battery packs and stays tucked inside the controller and charges with any micro usb.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Young', N'kimberly.young7421@example.org', '2017-01-06', 5, N'Amazing'),
(N'Lauren', N'Hernandez', N'lauren.hernandez4957@example.org', '2017-01-06', 5, N'gift for my son. he loves it.'),
(N'Christine', N'Sanders', N'christine.sanders4437@example.com', '2017-01-06', 5, N'this is the longest keyboard i ever had, and it still works great, great buy and would buy again if i ever need another'),
(N'Stephen', N'Jenkins', N'stephen.jenkins7816@example.net', '2017-01-06', 3, N'Son got this for xmas along with Imaginators (Xbox One). He played Swap Force second and was frustrated that his imaginators didn''t work (which We knew going into this). The larger issue was that even at 7, he commented on how much poorer the swap force graphics were. He went back to imaginators very quickly.'),
(N'Luis', N'Robinson', N'luis.robinson3514@example.com', '2017-01-06', 5, N'Awesome game and you get to choose between 2 main characters and each of them has their own play style.'),
(N'Adam', N'Barnes', N'adam.barnes5693@example.net', '2017-01-06', 5, N'good'),
(N'Lauren', N'Young', N'lauren.young8599@example.org', '2017-01-06', 5, N'Great game! I''ve been a fan of the Madden games for a long time and they just keep getting better. Graphics are pretty amazing and pretty simple to play.'),
(N'Gary', N'Brooks', N'gary.brooks9429@example.org', '2017-01-06', 5, N'Great control for a beginner such as me, D-pad is comfortable and the controller fits very well in my hands. Plus this controller has ps4,ps3 and pc configuration on the go, defenitly recommended for starters such as me.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Martin', N'kelly.martin2899@example.net', '2017-01-06', 5, N'Awesome console, wanted to get one before the 360s went extinct so I could play some of my favorite old games annnnd some original xbox gems that I still own, and I''m glad I did... They did get rid of a few connections (Read other reviews for details on this as I''m not super tech savvy), however, I found they weren''t necessary at all for me... Has HDMI connection, can still hardwire this to the internet if you don''t want to rely on WIFI, has enough space for two wired remotes and two wireless (or just four wireless remotes), fan is a LOT more quiet than previous models (would still recommend buying an add-on fan for the top, very easy to find I.E. https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00MWH4FL4/ref=oh_aui_detailpage_o08_s00?ie=UTF8&psc=1 ). Etc... The only drawback is when putting a hard disc in to play, the motor sounds like a jet engine, hasn''t bothered me too much but if you''re lookin for pure stealth, then this model is probably not for you, try to find a 360S before they are...'),
(N'Melissa', N'Henderson', N'melissa.henderson7454@example.net', '2017-01-06', 5, N'Item was received quickly and was as described. Very pleased'),
(N'Kevin', N'Rivera', N'kevin.rivera2440@example.com', '2017-01-07', 3, N'Didn''t realize we needed the motion plus adapter for this game, so we had to order it on Christmas day. Fortunately, Amazon is fast. Not really fun game though. It''s okay..just has too many cutscenes and bs. Honestly, haven''t really gone through it much, Probably because it''s such a huge letdown.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Cruz', N'lucia.cruz8861@example.com', '2017-01-07', 5, N'GOOD'),
(N'Kevin', N'Morris', N'kevin.morris5450@example.net', '2017-01-07', 5, N'cool as heck worth it hope they work on switch'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Kumar', N'carolyn.kumar1340@example.net', '2017-01-07', 5, N'Quality headset. Perfect for gaming. Still in perfect condition even after heavy use.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Collins', N'ashley.collins8139@example.org', '2017-01-07', 3, N'It''s honestly hard to recommend this stick when the Mad Catz TES+ exists. That fighting stick does everything better. It''s heavier, I prefer the buttons and actual stick, though that is personal taste, and it actually has the extra buttons like Start and the touchpad on the face of the case. I have no idea why Hori thought it would be a good idea to put all the extra buttons and touchpad on the side of the case. Ridiculous IMO. Overall, the TES+ is more sturdy and seems to have a better build than this light piece of hardware. Nevermind the fact that the cable door does not fall off at the slightest touch like it does with this one. Yes, this Hori is normally cheaper at 150, but if you are spending this much money you really need to think about the future. The TES+ looks better to me with the nice Shadaloo art as well. There is honestly nothing I prefer about this Hori stick. I just got my TES+ for 160 shipped from Amazon when they had a sale, and to be quite honest this Hori is...'),
(N'David', N'Patel', N'david.patel3226@example.com', '2017-01-07', 2, N'Yet another terrible product with the Maximum Games brand. Even with the patch (that took them far too long to release), the game is still a complete mess. The framerate is still unbearable during combat sequences. They were so focused on trying to correct the terrible framerate issue, that the "fix" now causes constant hitching problems. Every ten seconds or so, the framerate will hit 0 and then recover. Playing this game is such a chore. On top of it all, it has a horrible story, far too linear to be fun and I can''t even tell you how frustrating it is to move a few steps and be bombarded by an overwhelming amount of enemies and yet another boss that takes 30 minutes to kill. I think the biggest offender here is that this is so typical of Maximum Games. Literally take a look at the game they put their name on. They''re all giant turds. Middle-market titles are few and far between these days and companies like Maximum Games are the reason they''re falling under the radar.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Tanaka', N'kimberly.tanaka8147@example.org', '2017-01-07', 5, N'Good seller nice and reasonable price mouse'),
(N'Jack', N'Okonkwo', N'jack.okonkwo6574@example.net', '2017-01-07', 5, N'Great headset and still using after long gaming sessions. Would recommend this to someone especially for the price\quality.'),
(N'Jack', N'Okonkwo', N'jack.okonkwo6574@example.net', '2017-01-07', 3, N'Figure was perfect looks great. The packaging was completely mangled and not recommend for collector''s.'),
(N'Dee', N'Hall', N'dee.hall6666@example.com', '2017-01-07', 4, N'Works and plays great.'),
(N'Larry', N'Nguyen', N'larry.nguyen1809@example.com', '2017-01-07', 5, N'bella'),
(N'Jose', N'Young', N'jose.young1619@example.org', '2017-01-07', 5, N'This is a true ski/snowboard game. This is not like an SSX game where you can do crazy unrealistic stunts. This is as close to real skiing/snowboarding as I have ever seen in a game. Kudos to the designers for this. You can pretty much free ride anywhere in the game which is very cool. The graphics are much much better than I expected. Very sweet. You have to really pick your lines and you can''t just bomb down the hill unrealistically. The challenges are fun and challenging especially the gliding suit ones. The wing suit and paraglider challenges are fun but I actually have more fun with the ski and snowboard challenges. Overall a pretty awesome game and the most realistic ski/snowboard experience in a console game. Definitely recommended.'),
(N'Mei', N'Perry', N'mei.perry9551@example.com', '2017-01-07', 5, N'selling rune scimitar 30k I wish the price of membership was still $5.00, like back in the day.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Chavez', N'alexander.chavez1571@example.com', '2017-01-07', 5, N'Perfect'),
