(N'Raymond', N'Cox', N'raymond.cox4486@example.com', '2017-01-08', 5, N'Great game. Lots of fun.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Rogers', N'sandra.rogers7661@example.net', '2017-01-08', 5, N'many years ago i bought this thing it was 15.6 gigs out of 16 not a bad size as we all know size verrys, id like to add i washed it in a washing machine and it still works fine so its built majorly tough never had one issue used it 100x more than a standard user would . (if this review help at all pls like my review as it helps my amazon ranking)'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Walker', N'jennifer.walker1784@example.org', '2017-01-08', 5, N'Very'),
(N'Luis', N'Hill', N'luis.hill4174@example.net', '2017-01-08', 5, N'A new take on a classic series. 5 stars.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Wang', N'sofia.wang2093@example.com', '2017-01-08', 5, N'bought it with no problems'),
(N'Amanda', N'Martin', N'amanda.martin7814@example.org', '2017-01-08', 5, N'My daughter loves Minecraft on the ipad but she always likes playing with other players which isn''t possible unless they have their own ipads. So I bought this for her as a Christmas present and she loved it. Just a heads up though in order to play with others you need to have the Wii pro controller. We didn''t realize this and spent awhile trying to figure out how to get into multi-player mode. I had to search Google to figure out we needed the pro controller and then ordered a set. Now she''s able to play with other players and loves the game.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Raghunathan', N'mateo.raghunathan2512@example.org', '2017-01-08', 5, N'My nephew had been asking for a game like this! I''m glad that I found it! He is so excited to play it.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Brooks', N'kimberly.brooks3406@example.com', '2017-01-08', 5, N'One of my favorite FPS campaign games of all time. They literally don''t make them like this any more. Hilarious banter between characters, excellent game play, and just plain fun! Dice and Frostbite knocked it out of the park with this. Own it on PC and Xbox now.... Have fun!'),
(N'Wei', N'Turner', N'wei.turner4597@example.com', '2017-01-09', 5, N'My kid loves Lego everything so this was a must have lol :)'),
(N'Alexander', N'Wisniewski', N'alexander.wisniewski8528@example.com', '2017-01-09', 1, N'the original model is pictured but i received a different model. system could be fine, its been working okay so far but im definitely a little uneasy receiving an expensive piece of electronics and its not exactly what you led me to believe. update the picture/description to staye what model you''re selling and ill ukdate my review to be more accurate.'),
(N'Noah', N'Taylor', N'noah.taylor9508@example.org', '2017-01-09', 5, N'Comfortable, cool, and responsive... that''s what this mouse is! It looks and feels like one of those $75-100 gaming mouse, but it''s only $10! Couldn''t be happier with the look, feel, and performance of this mouse!'),
(N'Megan', N'Evans', N'megan.evans2467@example.com', '2017-01-09', 5, N'Works great. Extra buttons help with configuring game buttons to the mouse for ease of access.'),
(N'Helen', N'Raghunathan', N'helen.raghunathan5057@example.com', '2017-01-09', 5, N'Sadly, haven''t gotten around to actually playing my copy of the game yet (due to lack of time), but I had to get for that awesome price! From the little I''ve played on a friends copy however, I can say that the game is phenomenal. Game-play is smooth!'),
(N'Patrick', N'Myers', N'patrick.myers4025@example.org', '2017-01-09', 5, N'The improvement in picture quality is fantastic with this cable. I knew what I was getting into when I bougt it so I cant really complain about the ridiculous price that much. I do think its a shame they are so expensive though because most people won''t be willing to buy it and therefore won''t get to experience their gamecube in progressive scan mode. A good alternative is a Wii with a $5 component cable. Its strange that these cables have no audio capability and one still has to use the standard Gamecube A/V cable along with this one in order to get sound.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Parker', N'lucia.parker7863@example.org', '2017-01-09', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Nicole', N'Collins', N'nicole.collins9223@example.net', '2017-01-09', 5, N'I love Devil May Cry 4 as a Devil May Cry fan this game in my opinion is my absolute favorite game out of the whole series I love the music when you have to fight the demons and I love the way Dante is just crazy this game is awesome!'),
(N'Eric', N'Rivera', N'eric.rivera8482@example.com', '2017-01-09', 1, N'waste of money'),
(N'Noah', N'Chen', N'noah.chen1813@example.net', '2017-01-09', 5, N'Only one of the best games of all time!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Ferreira', N'raymond.ferreira3947@example.org', '2017-01-09', 5, N'love it, amazing'),
(N'Jason', N'Alvarez', N'jason.alvarez1413@example.org', '2017-01-09', 5, N'Great Game for when it was popular!'),
(N'Victoria', N'Myers', N'victoria.myers2330@example.net', '2017-01-09', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Bailey', N'carolyn.bailey1872@example.net', '2017-01-10', 4, N'it glow.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Bell', N'carlos.bell8864@example.com', '2017-01-10', 5, N'Best Halo game ever, even 10 years after it''s release'),
(N'Gregory', N'Bennett', N'gregory.bennett7727@example.net', '2017-01-10', 5, N'So far, it''s worked absolutely amazing. Nothing wrong and nothing defective.'),
(N'Heather', N'Henderson', N'heather.henderson3947@example.com', '2017-01-10', 5, N'Game is fun and it plays like a classic Sonic game.'),
(N'Jason', N'Sullivan', N'jason.sullivan6213@example.org', '2017-01-10', 4, N'Not being a huge online gamer I actually bought this for the single player campaign. Honestly, I thought it was pretty solid. About on par with your average cop action drama. Nothing groundbreaking, but very well done. The game plays very well, the environments are solid, the characters are pretty interesting (if a touch generic). and the game has a decent length (took me about a week playing about an hour or two a night, which isn''t bad when the average single player campaign in a multiplayer focused game can usually be finished in a night). I can''t really speak to the online aspect, but Battlefield has always been a pretty good name in general, so Id guess it''s at least competent.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Campbell', N'kathleen.campbell3659@example.org', '2017-01-10', 5, N'Works great.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Jenkins', N'brenda.jenkins7998@example.com', '2017-01-10', 5, N'I love HO games and like the variety that is out there and in this game.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Lewis', N'alexander.lewis6160@example.net', '2017-01-10', 3, N'Good sound and controls for gaming and movies but my head is not big and now both sides are broken, very bad design, that plastic is so weak, that''s the reason why you need metal only in that place. I own many different headphone for my main job like Sennheisers, Beyerdynamic, AKG and KRK and all they work perfectly after years. Fortunately Amazon was very efficient about this issue. Note: I hated the leds, it should have an option the option to turn them off.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Allen', N'samantha.allen3904@example.org', '2017-01-10', 5, N'Air Conflicts - PC The best damn game. I will play this game forever. A lot of good stuff. No key code crap, no streaming crap either. AMAZON please get the rest of the series out, without streaming.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Okonkwo', N'yuki.okonkwo9800@example.net', '2017-01-10', 2, N'I was lucky enough to try the Batman VR game first; it was a great experience! Though incredibly short... As for the other 4 or so games I played, I was incredibly underwhelmed. There are two major, unforgivable faults with the Playstation VR. The first is definitely the resolution, as this is something that is hardware bound, so it can''t be fixed with and update. The second is the incredibly bad and inaccurate motion controls. The resolution is roughly half of the standard resolution you get with the headset off; half, as they simply split the output in half, for each eye. It''s tough to want to see the dropped resolution, with a perfectly good big screen HD TV behind it. The motion controls remind me of a game from long in the past, Jurassic Park Trespassers. I have to make the most uncomfortable unnatural posses to get the results I want from the games. Batman was the only exception. The head tracking is a bit dodgy too. A few titles I own: Valkyrie, Robinson, Batman, Eagle,...'),
(N'Jose', N'Reed', N'jose.reed7831@example.com', '2017-01-10', 5, N'My gamer says he can get more clicks a second than ever before with this mouse'),
(N'Amanda', N'Kowalski', N'amanda.kowalski7641@example.net', '2017-01-10', 4, N'Well worth the money, you are saving tons buying this vs paying a monthly from the application or site, plus its 3 months and no billing info having to be entered in multiple sites. Love it because its fast, low cost and easy to reorder when the time comes without forgetting or adding a automatic billing agreement.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Kowalski', N'amanda.kowalski7641@example.net', '2017-01-10', 5, N'Saved a lot of money, got it really fast and loved the game. Watch dogs was a amazing game i enjoyed a lot of & streamed it on Twitch.tv while making some videos as well on YouTube. Im not here to promote those but it was very fun learning about the characters and how we could mess their lifes up hacking lol. Well Watchdogs 2 takes all that fun i had in the first one and lives up to its reputation in delivering even more fun and huge open world exploring. You will want to have this game in your collection!'),
(N'Emma', N'Bell', N'emma.bell4564@example.org', '2017-01-11', 5, N'very pleased'),
(N'Justin', N'Jimenez', N'justin.jimenez5954@example.com', '2017-01-11', 5, N'Is the best game fantastic.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Sanders', N'tyler.sanders3884@example.org', '2017-01-11', 5, N'I have been using this pad on The Legend of Zelda: Majora''s Mask (which I downloaded onto the Wii U). It works flawlessly. The buttons are nice and responsive. It''s lightweight and durable. And best of all, it''s half the price of an official one!'),
(N'Mei', N'Murphy', N'mei.murphy1525@example.net', '2017-01-11', 5, N'my girls love it!'),
(N'Tyler', N'Gutierrez', N'tyler.gutierrez5982@example.net', '2017-01-11', 5, N'RuneScape.'),
(N'Gary', N'Sanchez', N'gary.sanchez1371@example.net', '2017-01-11', 5, N'A lot of fun. Excellent adventure. So much to see and do. And infinitely mod-able. I highly recommend this game.'),
(N'Emily', N'Young', N'emily.young2603@example.com', '2017-01-11', 4, N'I have purchased 12 of these to repair nes console and some are just way too tight. It''s best to take a clean cheap or non working game insert it into the connector before installing and work it up and down to loosen the pins. Otherwise it may put a death grip on the cartridge when it''s all put back together.'),
(N'Helen', N'Garcia', N'helen.garcia2995@example.net', '2017-01-11', 4, N'another hard to find amiibo added to my collection.'),
(N'Larry', N'Ross', N'larry.ross3183@example.org', '2017-01-11', 5, N'Great item. Works great. I use it everyday.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Watson', N'sharon.watson2061@example.net', '2017-01-11', 5, N'My kids and I played this on the PS4 in Best Buy and fell in love with it. For those that can''t figure it out, it''s a multiplayer soccer-style game with cars. Yes, it sounds absolutely ridiculous, but it''s a total blast. We ordered it for the Xbox One, and the first thing I noticed was that the game comes with all the DLC you had to order on the PS4, and it''s all part of the game. The visuals are decent, the game is very fast, the controls are tight, the sound is great, and the multiplayer setup is both easy and deep. My kids (8 and 5) like to play split-screen local. The Xbox One allows you to play up to 4 people on the same system, and matches can be up to 4 vs 4, so you can have all four on the same team or split them up as you like. There''s also a robust online league, with quick matchmaking and access to an interesting lobby where you can watch highlights from other matches. And yes, every game seems to have at least highlight-worthy play. It''s not a racing game. There are no...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Murphy', N'jeremy.murphy5718@example.org', '2017-01-11', 5, N'As described'),
(N'Mei', N'Scott', N'mei.scott8969@example.org', '2017-01-12', 5, N'Purchased as a gift.'),
(N'Robert', N'James', N'robert.james6676@example.com', '2017-01-12', 3, N'came in bubblewrap closed with a rubber band. Works fine, so I''ll give it an okay rating but the packaging was quite bad. lucky it made it in one piece.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Scott', N'shirley.scott9272@example.org', '2017-01-12', 5, N'Good game.'),
(N'Carol', N'Price', N'carol.price5458@example.com', '2017-01-12', 5, N'Nice'),
(N'Lisa', N'Howard', N'lisa.howard4514@example.com', '2017-01-12', 5, N'Good spinoff game. The game''s story and dialogue are what made it for me. The combat is good, but there is a total lack of focus on exploring worlds. It''s all heavy combat. Not a bad thing since the combat is good, but expect it to be different from the other Ratchet & Clank games.'),
(N'Mark', N'Butler', N'mark.butler7681@example.net', '2017-01-12', 5, N'nephew loves it!'),
(N'Donald', N'Chavez', N'donald.chavez7156@example.net', '2017-01-12', 5, N'Classic game, one of the best PS2 had to offer'),
(N'Carlos', N'Kim', N'carlos.kim6732@example.com', '2017-01-12', 1, N'For the price it is actually pretty comfortable but unfortunately that''s the only plus so far. Worked fine initially but about an hour into the first session friends had reported interference through my mic. They stated it sounded like an electrical disruption and at times my voice would cut out or come over completely distorted. Have tried it on multiple devices now with the same result.'),
(N'Linda', N'Evans', N'linda.evans8421@example.org', '2017-01-12', 4, N'Grips well and the extra battery life is a great thing. My hands usually got numb after holding the base vita for over an hour. With this grip I can hold for an extended period of time. I''ve had this grip for about a year and it hasn''t caused any damage to the system. The system can be played while charging the grip as well. I use the vita and grip almost daily, so here are some things I''ve noticed, all are very rare, but should still be observed carefully: Always monitor when charging, I have had it overheat and worry me before. It can make a strange buzzing sound when connected to a vita and not being charged. It starts to heat up at this point too. I disconnect the grip from the vita when that happens, and that solves the problem. Rare occurrence. If it makes a buzzing sound when charging up from 0, disconnect the vita from the grip and charge separately. I believe the vita draining power from the grip is the cause of all these issues.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Tanaka', N'deborah.tanaka5572@example.org', '2017-01-12', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Yuki', N'Torres', N'yuki.torres2535@example.net', '2017-01-12', 5, N'it worked as sdescribed'),
(N'Alexander', N'Alvarez', N'alexander.alvarez4707@example.net', '2017-01-12', 5, N'Apart from seeing a friend play it for about 10 minutes on a laptop years ago, this was my first experience with Minecraft. I bought it for myself, and already there''s a problem - it''s obvious to see this is one of those games that is way too easy to sink hours and hours into without even realizing it. By the same merit, it''s also easy to see why this game is so popular - it is a perfect game for creative types. I haven''t even tried "Creative Mode" yet. I really enjoyed the main "Survival Mode" because I figured it would be no problem making a rudimentary shelter and surviving. What they don''t tell you is, those Creeper dudes explode. And the Skeletons with the arrows have amazingly good accuracy. Still, I have built my first cave, and of course, all you want to do is keep expanding and exploring the world around you. Great game.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Kim', N'hannah.kim1684@example.net', '2017-01-12', 2, N'After playing the ps3 and Xbox 360 versions of the game, the ds version it''s really poor, I know that the ds is a handheld but I could have been better..'),
(N'Eric', N'Clark', N'eric.clark9901@example.com', '2017-01-13', 1, N'I want to love this mouse. I''ve had 2 of the prior Razer Naga MMO mice. The first version was my favorite. This one is much like the later editions in terms of shape, but I like how it''s heavier. It feels solid. Presumably due to the battery inside. It has a slightly different shape than the 2014 version I replaced which feels a tad better. Problem is, that this wireless mouse is just as unreliable as you''d expect from a wireless mouse. It''s HORRIBLE. Loses connection constantly. Also, the battery dies before I''m done for the night. You can plug it directly in, but for some reason that switches drivers requiring a restart or else you''ll have even worse performance than when you''re wireless. So, I thought I''d just leave it plugged in all the time. However, I still get tons of bugginess. Right now, I''m getting constant glitching even though I''m wired directly in. In short. This is definitively the WORST mouse I''ve ever used. I''m replacing it with my 2014 broken Razer Naga awaiting...'),
(N'Jacob', N'White', N'jacob.white2487@example.net', '2017-01-13', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Ronald', N'Harris', N'ronald.harris5124@example.com', '2017-01-13', 4, N'very good'),
(N'Christine', N'Ruiz', N'christine.ruiz9606@example.com', '2017-01-13', 5, N'Nice, well packaged'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wilson', N'rachel.wilson7443@example.net', '2017-01-13', 4, N'Very fun game'),
(N'Priya', N'Powell', N'priya.powell4462@example.com', '2017-01-13', 5, N'Worked perfectly out-of-box with no special software on RetroPie and Windows.'),
(N'Priya', N'Powell', N'priya.powell4462@example.com', '2017-01-13', 5, N'Great mouse. Does/has everything I want: side buttons, smooth movement, great ergonomics, etc.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Reed', N'joshua.reed4713@example.org', '2017-01-13', 5, N'As expected.'),
(N'George', N'Clark', N'george.clark7770@example.net', '2017-01-13', 1, N'Game is way too linear. You go 10 ft outside of where you are supposed to be and you get the ''leaving mission zone, reuturn now'' warning. It''s like going through a fun house - you MUST follow the path. In a gaming world where open-world games rule, this one missed the boat. You are basically just constantly following someone ahead of you or told to stay in bounds. Forget about using your own brains to circle around someone to come up from behind, if it''s not in the plan, it''s not allowed. It''s like all the work is done for you and you just pull the trigger. Gets old. This is for single player, I suppose multi-player would be better. And the amount of cut scenes that you cannot skip are insane, for every minute of playing there''s about a minute of a cut scene, some are 5 minutes long and you can''t skip them !'),
(N'Betty', N'Barnes', N'betty.barnes4538@example.net', '2017-01-13', 5, N'Good product.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Raghunathan', N'deborah.raghunathan4079@example.net', '2017-01-13', 5, N'good to go'),
(N'Amara', N'Turner', N'amara.turner1382@example.org', '2017-01-14', 5, N'You gotta play it to see it for yourself. Exceeded expectations. This is the ultimate in gore and action and suspense and adrenaline raising game experiece!'),
(N'David', N'Singh', N'david.singh2766@example.org', '2017-01-14', 5, N'purchased for a friend had no complaints'),
(N'Nancy', N'Brooks', N'nancy.brooks6661@example.net', '2017-01-14', 5, N'I never played any Doom games, but this one make me want to try my skills at all of them. The story is.....I don''t even remember what was going on. Just kill everything and don''t die. Buy this game!'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ruiz', N'tyler.ruiz8213@example.org', '2017-01-14', 4, N'Makes your controller look so badass. Fits great with only minimal customizations. Make sure you have a tiny saw and some super glue.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ruiz', N'sarah.ruiz3744@example.com', '2017-01-14', 1, N'Good game but over a YEAR of people not being able to share levels it still doesnt work. The Devs state it is Microsofts responsibility to update and keeps the servers running. "Microsoft are maintaining Screamride themselves, and are responsible for the servers and updates to the game. They are aware of this issue. Their technical support team are the best people to ask about an ETA for a fix. " and yet Microsoft still claims the developers are the ones to contact. Microsoft fixed it three months ago but only for about a week then "the servers" went down again. Shame on Microsoft pointing the finger at the devs when they KNOW that Microsoft is responsible.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Baker', N'nicholas.baker7550@example.com', '2017-01-14', 1, N'Boring.'),
(N'Emma', N'Rivera', N'emma.rivera9872@example.org', '2017-01-14', 5, N'Loved it! I missed ur when it came out on the PS2, but so glad I got to play it on the PS3! :D'),
(N'Timothy', N'Rivera', N'timothy.rivera9341@example.com', '2017-01-14', 5, N'Purchased for my son... He like to have mono headphone for chatting online when he needs to hear other things going on in the room and his regular gaming headset prevents that. I have heard no complaints from him with quality, echo, or other issues for casual use. He says the audio quality is about the same as the standard Xbox One headset, but this one is built nicer and looks better.'),
(N'Kofi', N'James', N'kofi.james5723@example.com', '2017-01-14', 5, N'Arrived as expected. My son enjoys the game.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Murphy', N'jessica.murphy2506@example.net', '2017-01-14', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'John', N'Chen', N'john.chen3778@example.org', '2017-01-14', 5, N'Good game. Kids play this all the time.'),
(N'Donald', N'Perez', N'donald.perez9162@example.com', '2017-01-15', 5, N'Rmabo is a tough but well-made game. When I was a kid, I was stuck in an endless loop and didn''t understand a thing, forcing me to give up on the game many times and rendering it a hopeless task. Years later, looking up the Internet to understand how the game works, my experience is actually better this time around; I just wish I knew all of that stuff back then, which makes it unfair to say the least. All in all, give Rambo a try and make sure to understand how the game works; if you do, I''m pretty sure you will get the most bang for your buck. By the way, I made a series of walkthrough videos of how to play Rambo, so go to Youtube and search for "Mr. Math Expert Rambo."'),
(N'Thomas', N'Thomas', N'thomas.thomas6017@example.org', '2017-01-15', 5, N'awesome game! love it a lot, great plot, good physics, all around cool zombie game, not typical either'),
(N'Emma', N'Taylor', N'emma.taylor3826@example.com', '2017-01-15', 5, N'Very fun game and happy to have it.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Nguyen', N'mateo.nguyen6177@example.com', '2017-01-15', 4, N'The first set I received my son was very happy with. However the left earphone stopped working-no sound. Customer service was great and promptly shipped a replacement.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Wright', N'joshua.wright5656@example.net', '2017-01-15', 5, N'Does what it is supposed to'),
(N'Hannah', N'Price', N'hannah.price9022@example.org', '2017-01-15', 5, N'Hey guys! Shame on me for not knowing the Shantae franchise even existed until maybe this past November. I''m usually aware of 2D platformers, so I''m not sure what happened here. Thanks to the wonderful folks at Amazon for eventually bringing it to my attention! [Combat] It''s been awhile since I''ve said this about a 2D platformer; but the combat was actually decent. You''ll be able to use magic or melee; and they both served different purposes. In the earlier levels, you''ll be able to get away with using just your melee attack, but as time goes on; you''ll be better off incorporating magic into your arsenal, especially for those hard to reach enemies. Although I enjoyed the combat; there was one rather useless mechanic that I later unlocked. I forget the name of the move; but it was a backward dash used to ''avoid'' enemy attacks. I placed an emphasis on avoid because I was never successful, lol! [Weaponry] As a famous hip hop artist once said: "long hair don''t care."So yeah, Shantae''s...'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Lopez', N'tomasz.lopez6566@example.net', '2017-01-15', 5, N'good'),
(N'Peter', N'Miller', N'peter.miller5767@example.org', '2017-01-15', 3, N'If your Xbox is your ONLY form of DVD playback, this is fine solution. Works well and allows DVD play on original Xbox consoles.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Collins', N'ethan.collins7799@example.com', '2017-01-16', 3, N'Decent, kinda short.'),
(N'Dee', N'Tanaka', N'dee.tanaka6531@example.org', '2017-01-16', 5, N'Bought this used, was skeptical as I am buying an new electronics online but figured I''d give it a shot and glad I did. My son was so happy to get a new controller that the buttons don''t stick. Controller works like new and looks new. He''s had it since Christmas and its still working great.'),
(N'George', N'Ramirez', N'george.ramirez5354@example.com', '2017-01-16', 5, N'If you plan on using this for UNCHARTED 4 on PS4 get the tall concave one you will really notice the difference'),
(N'Nicole', N'Price', N'nicole.price5190@example.org', '2017-01-16', 5, N'My son loves this game! The gameplay is basically like every other Lego game, just a different story line. Great for someone who loves the Lego genre of video games. I haven''t actually played it through so I''m not sure how much it''s like the movie unfortunately'),
(N'Nicole', N'Price', N'nicole.price5190@example.org', '2017-01-16', 4, N'Kind of sucks that this is only one of the stories but it''s ok. Not sure what the gameplay is like since this was a gift but I''ve heard no complaints so far. I''m hoping it was worth the money'),
(N'Lisa', N'Butler', N'lisa.butler1715@example.org', '2017-01-16', 5, N'Got this for my little girl for Christmas and she is still playing it so she can beat her own records.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Hill', N'jerry.hill7611@example.net', '2017-01-16', 5, N'Good thanks'),
(N'Dee', N'Nowak', N'dee.nowak6964@example.net', '2017-01-16', 3, N'I''m a huge assassin''s creed fan but i got into gaming somewhat late so i started with AC3, then AC4, Rogue, Unity, and Syndicate. When the Ezio collection was released I went back to play this game since I never played anything before AC 3. This game has a strong story but the movements are pretty bad for a 2009 game considering many other games had better movements. Towards the end starting with memory 13 it is a pain and the boss battle is pretty bad. They are having a full on 20 min convo while fighting and I feel like Ezio let''s a lot of enemies get away and he doesn''t even kill the man who murdered his family, he fights him and is close to ending him but is just like nah nevermind. Overall 7/10 AC3 and AC4 were 9.5/10 for me so it''s not that I don''t like assassin''s creed.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Jimenez', N'kenneth.jimenez6706@example.net', '2017-01-17', 1, N'This is the worst remote of anything that I''ve ever used. I tried very hard to like it. I had very high hopes for it that were quickly dashed. To begin with, the so-called "Quick Start Guide" is a joke. The only thing it is good for is to figure out how to install the batteries, and some simple one word descriptions of the buttons (View, Select, Back, etc.) and that''s it. The rest is useless safety and warranty information in several different languages, nothing else. You are on your own trying to figure the rest of it out. I did manage to get the Directv guide to work, however, it is not the guide that you normally expect or use from Directv, but rather some kind of generic grid that Xbox apparently generates, which is far from easy to use. The box advertises that you can set up this remote to be able to use it to control your home theater system, but all I could ever get it to do was to control the tv volume, which I never use. To top things off, the thing is not even comfortable...'),
(N'Nadia', N'Baker', N'nadia.baker4984@example.net', '2017-01-17', 2, N'This game is way too short, its the worst entry in the series, and their is no co-op campaign. This really isn''t worth 40. Save your money on a different game.'),
(N'Mei', N'Powell', N'mei.powell7290@example.org', '2017-01-17', 5, N'Huge fan of this game since the Original Titanfall, Titanfall 2 really upped the ante with this release.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Carter', N'kofi.carter4047@example.net', '2017-01-17', 4, N'son loves it'),
(N'Rachel', N'Webb', N'rachel.webb5118@example.com', '2017-01-17', 5, N'I like this joystick cover set. It''s a little tricky to put on, but fits on the joystick cap snugly. The small cat paw one is the best hehe. Best part is that it provides traction when games make hands sweaty, and the 3ds unit can still close with the cap in place. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Coleman', N'jessica.coleman1606@example.net', '2017-01-17', 1, N'Got this as a gift, the game seems to be designed very lazy, definitely NOT worthy of a FINAL FANTASY, i grew up on FINAL FANTASY games since #1 on NINTENDO - and i can assure you, this falls well below standards for the brand name - its so clunky and BAD - i can''t even imagine paying a subscription for this garbage I''ve played smoother HTTP games - where the creators actually seemed to care about what their presenting and their gameplay content. its pretty clear from the 1st few days you spend playing this garbage if you can stomach it that long, that the designers clearly are just milking a brand name with absolutely zero care factor to actually the game itself, the combat, and even movement of your character in general is SO BAD it reminds me of pre-diablo 2 clumsiness its like the creators have never played a single MMO but just kinda had an "idea" what an MMO is and tried to abstractly create it - which i could accept IF they actually stuck with what a Final Fantasy should be,...'),
(N'Omar', N'Williams', N'omar.williams2815@example.com', '2017-01-17', 5, N'Purchase for my grandson. He loves it!!!'),
(N'Mateo', N'Wilson', N'mateo.wilson1356@example.net', '2017-01-18', 3, N'5 stars for the game itself...1 star for the price I had to pay for something that should have been included as a part of the game cartridge. I have enjoyed all of the DS/3DS versions of Fire Emblem, but this whole Birthright/Conquest/Revelation ordeal was quite the ripoff. I would have much preferred a game cartridge to a digital download code, especially since you can''t play it by itself unless you have Birthright or Conquest. They really should have given some free DLC if you purchased all three versions of one game. That''s covered in my review of Map Pack 1. You must really enjoy the other games in the series or the sRPG genre to make this worth it.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Foster', N'deborah.foster4987@example.org', '2017-01-18', 5, N'The single player is fantastic albeit a bit short (5-7 hrs for one play through.) Multiplayer is a blast as well. This game is geared toward playing with others online so if that''s not your cup of tea my recommendation would be to wait for the price to drop drastically before giving this a go. The short length of the campaign makes the single player beatable in a weekend easily.'),
(N'Edward', N'White', N'edward.white4626@example.com', '2017-01-18', 5, N'Great game! Even though I didn''t get mega man 2, I ordered mega man 2, but received mega man 1. Still great to have in my collection, but it''s not what I ordered so I''m kinda mad about that because I really need mega man 2 in my collection!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Baker', N'kofi.baker5385@example.org', '2017-01-18', 5, N'It looks great with my others Super Mario amiibo.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Diaz', N'ryan.diaz8878@example.org', '2017-01-18', 5, N'I''ve been using Razer Nagas for about 8 years now and can''t get used to anything else. It really is a great mouse and I''ve never had any problems with any of the nagas I''ve had. The build quality is not as good as the originals (they are now lighter, narrower and feel cheaper), but I''m still happy with my purchase.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Roberts', N'kofi.roberts6663@example.org', '2017-01-18', 5, N'I love this keyboard with mouse I bought for my daughters laptop since she broke her keyboard. I figured out why I couldn''t scroll on the mouse using the wheel and it was because there was no mouse pad. I''m so glad I bought a mouse pad too and it looks like a nebula. This is so cool! I''m an adult and want one too!'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Campbell', N'jonathan.campbell1333@example.net', '2017-01-19', 5, N'I''ve owned and played just about any and every Dynasty and Samurai Warriors games, and their various spinoffs. I also include the empire series and the more strategic games such as Nobunaga and the Three Kingdoms series. That said, I''m currently playing Samurai Warriors 4 and 4-II along with Dynasty Warriors 8 Extreme Legends Complete Edition and I have to say, I enjoy Warriors 3 Orochi Ultimate for PS4 as much if not more than any of the other games, it''s truly incredible. Pros: Massive Roster Map diversity and count Numerous costumes, in-game Ability to use three fighters interchangeably Weapon Fusion and upgrades, unique collectables Game Modes: Duel, Gauntlet, Musou, Free and others - lots of content Cons: Contrast of maps seems to be way off at times, overly bright and not as colorful as they should be - very washed out compared to the PS3 version of which I own as well, I have all my graphic settings on auto, with a PC monitor set to 0-256, have tried full mode as well, ended...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Castillo', N'ravi.castillo1549@example.org', '2017-01-19', 5, N'Excellent in my opinion. The battery lasts long, the controls are comfortable(not overly large in form or cramped), and responsive.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Turner', N'pamela.turner5155@example.org', '2017-01-19', 5, N'Great game! A fun edition to the series.'),
(N'Mary', N'Williams', N'mary.williams5986@example.net', '2017-01-19', 5, N'Thank you!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Sullivan', N'daniel.sullivan8959@example.org', '2017-01-19', 4, N'Good price and arrived on time. Helps complete our collection.'),
(N'Betty', N'Parker', N'betty.parker5237@example.org', '2017-01-19', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2017-01-20', 5, N'the walking dead episodic video games are the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the best the walking dead episodic video games rocks ^_^'),
(N'Christopher', N'Phillips', N'christopher.phillips2322@example.com', '2017-01-20', 5, N'ENTERTAINING'),
(N'Gary', N'Johnson', N'gary.johnson4138@example.com', '2017-01-20', 5, N'I wanted to catch up on the story before i bought uncharted 4. I loved these games ! i beat the whole series in like 2 weeks.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Boyd', N'barbara.boyd9172@example.net', '2017-01-20', 5, N'Exelent'),
(N'Douglas', N'Baker', N'douglas.baker3038@example.net', '2017-01-20', 5, N'Very study and well made!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Gutierrez', N'ethan.gutierrez3162@example.org', '2017-01-20', 5, N'I ordered 6 of these and there serving my purpose of full body motion capture for my video games animation very well!'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Webb', N'jonathan.webb9839@example.org', '2017-01-21', 5, N'This game has a nice soundtrack and the battle animations look cool! I recommend playing the american gameboy advance Super Robot Taisen Original Generations games first, to get a good idea of the layout of the menus. So that way you have a better understanding of the japanese text menus layout, which is for the most part the same layout as those US versions, and mean the same thing. This game came earlier than expected from Japan. Nicely wrapped and in perfect condition. The game plays perfectly on my U.S. PS3. It was very cheap to bring it here. No shipping and handling fees. Deputi-Japan is the seller where I bought it from, and I highly recommend them.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Flores', N'aisha.flores4544@example.net', '2017-01-21', 5, N'worked well'),
(N'Sarah', N'Kim', N'sarah.kim8580@example.com', '2017-01-22', 5, N'Granddaughter loved it.'),
(N'Dee', N'Cox', N'dee.cox2719@example.org', '2017-01-22', 5, N'A very fun game'),
(N'Brandon', N'Ferreira', N'brandon.ferreira6598@example.com', '2017-01-22', 3, N'weird game kind of confusing, over all cute though.'),
(N'Anna', N'Sanders', N'anna.sanders3826@example.net', '2017-01-22', 4, N'Once I heard back before the game was released that they excluded Showcase mode to focus more on MyCareer and Universe modes, I was excited, but ultimately disappointed because they did not seem to change much from the previous game, except for only the presentation. And I have played many hours and matches within both modes to see only little changes. MYCAREER: The Ranking system takes way too long to climb to the top. You stay stuck at a position for many long months while other superstars are changing their ranks weekly. Although I have to admit that I like how long it takes to actually win a championship. Still, there needs to be other stories going on and the ranking system needs to be more genuine. You fight the same superstars over and over again on a weekly basis. There really is no randomness to your match contenders. I would always fight John Cena for weeks on end. Always fight John Cena about 90% of the time for the U.S. title at all pay per views. The Authority...'),
(N'Amy', N'Gray', N'amy.gray4933@example.com', '2017-01-22', 4, N'This game pretty fun :3 ! I like the art design ! The combat is somewhat stiff but only compared to action games like Devil May Cry but this game is more along the lines of Chaos Legion (ps2) if not more polished. It can get a bit grindy leaving you wanting more story and less sub quests but the action keeps you entertained for the most part.'),
(N'Larry', N'James', N'larry.james7076@example.net', '2017-01-22', 5, N'happy with purchase'),
(N'Nathan', N'Adams', N'nathan.adams5428@example.org', '2017-01-22', 5, N'good job'),
(N'Julie', N'Murphy', N'julie.murphy3861@example.org', '2017-01-22', 5, N'Durable, comfy and holds a few games with it. Would be nicer if it held the charger too. The straps keep the system secure and I never worry about it getting damaged due to hard polyester outside and padded inside.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Taylor', N'timothy.taylor5874@example.net', '2017-01-23', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Joshua', N'Khan', N'joshua.khan9380@example.org', '2017-01-23', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Michael', N'Hughes', N'michael.hughes4708@example.net', '2017-01-23', 1, N'I didn''t even bother returning it! First off you can ONLY play an ''exhibition game'' otherwise you have to purchase a PlayStation Plus membership to enjoy franchise mode and everything else. This made me really upset! You cant just download the updates and start a season or build a team with out being forced to pay first. I refuse to ever pay to play a game! The game play is very difficult!! I put the AI on rookie level and I kid you not it is IMPOSSIBLE to run against the computer!!! This will frustrate the hell out of you!! I can pass no problem but forget about trying to run. Add freezes, glitching and slow loading and this game is all hype and pretty much garbage!! I will stick to older, less complicated Madden games on my ps3 until major improvements are made on future Madden games coming out. Madden has become a money hungry football franchise, I wish their was another NFL series besides Madden for the ps4. Sucks'),
(N'Kelly', N'Fisher', N'kelly.fisher7508@example.org', '2017-01-23', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Ronald', N'Boyd', N'ronald.boyd8739@example.com', '2017-01-23', 5, N'AWESOME'),
(N'Frank', N'Jimenez', N'frank.jimenez9171@example.net', '2017-01-23', 4, N'all is good'),
(N'Adam', N'Adams', N'adam.adams5725@example.net', '2017-01-23', 4, N'We really do need some quality snowboarding, skiing, skateboarding games in our lives! Well, Ubisoft decided to go for the alpine sports and the results are mixed. This game is trying to go more for a simulation style than arcade style... but it''s almost too simulation like. I would have enjoyed a few gameplay options with some different control styles: perhaps an arcade style version where button tapping can create cool tricks, like the old Tony Hawk games. The controls take a bit of getting used to, but it rewards with a lot of practice. Which is why I would have enjoyed a stripped down, easier mode to just shred and have fun with. There are a lot of glitches in this game, and hopefully Ubi will update some patches soon. Though they are notorious for leaving some interesting and potentially game breaking glitches but taking out the fun ones, like the creepy big eyed guy in Assassin''s Creed (or the horrific skinless people in Unity). I will of course update as time progresses, but...'),
(N'Jacob', N'Hill', N'jacob.hill8377@example.com', '2017-01-23', 5, N'I received it ok, I recommend the seller. Thank you very much for everything');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Carlos', N'Ivanov', N'carlos.ivanov2469@example.org', '2017-01-23', 5, N'Awesome game!!!!!'),
(N'Anna', N'Thomas', N'anna.thomas3059@example.org', '2017-01-23', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Steven', N'Martinez', N'steven.martinez5250@example.net', '2017-01-23', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Brenda', N'Okonkwo', N'brenda.okonkwo3890@example.net', '2017-01-23', 1, N'i just buy this game to know the end of the history'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ramos', N'tyler.ramos6007@example.com', '2017-01-24', 5, N'Purchased Feb 2015, came as stated,m worked 100%, awesoem game.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Ramirez', N'andrea.ramirez3594@example.net', '2017-01-24', 5, N'I LOVE THIS CONTROLLER. I have the NES30 from 8bitdo that I use with my retro freak and it is an incredible controller for the price point. I bought this for use with my PC knowing the quality would be there and hoping it would be my new go to controller. I called that one right. It''s balanced, it''s responsive, it feels perfect in my hands, it looks the part... I just love this thing. Anything from Skyrim to A Boy and His Blob is playable on this little badass. Top notch.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Torres', N'nicole.torres5083@example.net', '2017-01-24', 5, N'Fun game'),
(N'Mei', N'Butler', N'mei.butler7136@example.net', '2017-01-24', 5, N'Definitely play with friends. DLC are definitely worth the five dollars.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Wood', N'christopher.wood8217@example.org', '2017-01-24', 5, N'Purchased as a gift. Child very happy'),
(N'Ravi', N'Reyes', N'ravi.reyes7722@example.org', '2017-01-24', 5, N'This is a very solid third-party Bluetooth controller. Feels good in your head good text years. I use this for my Raspberry Pi and it took me a couple tries but it did get picked up by the Bluetooth within the system. Someone already mentioned how to pair it with standard mode running on emulation station. It''s a little more tricky with a 32 gig attract mode but it can be done. You may have to reboot it a couple times as you go through each staff'),
(N'William', N'Mendoza', N'william.mendoza2729@example.net', '2017-01-24', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Laura', N'Harris', N'laura.harris7024@example.com', '2017-01-24', 5, N'Dude, you either want it or you don''t. You either got it or you didn''t. I ain''t tellin you nothing you didn''t already know. And I did so in proper English.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Brown', N'shirley.brown9630@example.com', '2017-01-24', 1, N'This does not work on androids! Consistent Bluetooth issues with app!!'),
(N'Frank', N'Perez', N'frank.perez5798@example.net', '2017-01-25', 2, N'I used this mic a couple times and found myself putting it away each time. It is not very comfortable. The mic works adequately, but the audio is sub par. You are much much much better off saving up a bit and getting better headphones if you are an avid gamer like myself. Turtle Beach is always my go-to now!'),
(N'Justin', N'Ramos', N'justin.ramos6407@example.org', '2017-01-25', 5, N'Excellent! Great game!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ramirez', N'kenneth.ramirez4518@example.net', '2017-01-25', 5, N'While I have only put two hours into the Aqua portion of the game, just based on the overall package, this game warrants five stars. I have already played DDD on the 3DS and it is easily one of the best games in the series. Definitely top four. I really look forward to playing through this game again on a console and TV screen compared to the 3DS. It should definitely be a much better experience gameplay wise. The narrative while confusing, is enjoyable. This is also one of only a couple of KH games where you get to play as Riku, who is one of my favorite characters and is also fun to play as. The big highlight of Chain of Memories for example was the Riku story mode, and same goes for DDD. The combat itself is fun too and for those wondering about boss fights and difficulty, its a KH game so there is always a couple fights that will frustrate you. All in all DDD is a great game and worth playing for any KH fan. Now in regards to the Aqua portion of the game, this is essentially...'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ross', N'ethan.ross8918@example.org', '2017-01-25', 5, N'Save your money and buy these! Charging cable is way nicer than any you already have!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Brown', N'andrea.brown8898@example.com', '2017-01-25', 2, N'The video game quality is bad, during play STOPED - BEGIN - STOPED - BEGIN. I paid for a videogame expensive and I didn''t''t like it.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Fisher', N'kelly.fisher1829@example.com', '2017-01-25', 3, N'its very expensive and i have used up 3/4 of it already.'),
(N'Jason', N'Williams', N'jason.williams8042@example.com', '2017-01-25', 3, N'+ Worked great at the beginning - Charging this was a real pain. It was a hit or miss, tried another cord I ordered and the same thing. I sort of had to prop the controller at an angle so that it would continually charge. - Shuts off quickly, which was a pain given I used it for gaming as well as Vue If you are using Vue I would highly suggest this remote (https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B000M17AVO/ref=oh_aui_search_detailpage?ie=UTF8&psc=1). Excellent, makes using Vue flawlessly easy relative to this remote.'),
(N'George', N'Campbell', N'george.campbell2792@example.com', '2017-01-25', 5, N'Oh my gawd but thing thing NOW! It''s so cheap worth every bit of $100. I snagged it for less then $30.'),
(N'Susan', N'Roberts', N'susan.roberts2273@example.org', '2017-01-25', 5, N'THIS IS A WONDERFULL GAME AND I RECIEVED IT AS STATED BY THE SELLER IN GREAT CONDITION PLUS THE DISK WAS CLEAN'),
(N'Susan', N'Roberts', N'susan.roberts2273@example.org', '2017-01-25', 1, N'omg couldn''t at least clean the disk full of sugar residue ? REALLY ? PLACED IN A BOX OUT OF THE TRASH ? REALLYYY ? A PAPER SLEEVE IS ONLY TWO PENNIES'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Gray', N'kathleen.gray9707@example.net', '2017-01-25', 2, N'Bought this game for 15 bucks for the purpose of playing competitively online but the online users are non existent. Normally i wouldn''t give it 2 stars if it had a campaign story mode to make up for the lack of users online. The graphics, however, when set to ultra at 2k resolution is the best looking graphics I''ve ever seen. Don''t buy this game if your main intentions are to play competitively with others. I''m sure you could find a game online but you would have to wait hours. Sorry. No time for that.'),
(N'Priya', N'Stewart', N'priya.stewart3868@example.com', '2017-01-25', 5, N'gift love'),
(N'Gregory', N'Myers', N'gregory.myers9809@example.net', '2017-01-26', 5, N'son loves it!'),
(N'Gregory', N'Myers', N'gregory.myers9809@example.net', '2017-01-26', 5, N'my son loves it! Keeps a teenager entertained!'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ruiz', N'sarah.ruiz4708@example.net', '2017-01-26', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Pamela', N'Roberts', N'pamela.roberts6696@example.org', '2017-01-26', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Aisha', N'Adams', N'aisha.adams8248@example.org', '2017-01-26', 5, N'Finally a Wario worth writing about! Okay, I have used these for the games, but I also collect them as statues (not in boxes). I believe toys were meant to be played with. This Wario is basically a high quality (small-sized) statue. I have action figures with Wario and other art-work, but this is great 3D quality statue work for such an inexpensive price. You will not be disappointed! I guess if you are into the gaming aspect, that''s a bonus...HA!'),
(N'Heather', N'Parker', N'heather.parker2349@example.com', '2017-01-26', 2, N'well the screw drivers work very good But the blue plastic pry tool became unusable immediately I mean the very first grip panel on my controller the tip of the tool just peeled off. I''m not happy'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Campbell', N'jennifer.campbell1670@example.net', '2017-01-26', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Peter', N'Hall', N'peter.hall4820@example.com', '2017-01-26', 5, N'I truly love this game--Minecraft in outer space is how I think of it--naming planets, finding unknown animals/flora/fauna--it''s a trip like no other. For those who don''t "get" the game for what it is I really don''t understand that--if you read what it was meant to be and ignore the hype both good and bad that preceded the game, I think it will stand on its own for what it ended up being--a vision for what an unlimited virtual universe could be, inasmuch as the limitations of a gaming system can give. Watch some videos on youtube, or better yet email someone who gave it some 3-4-5 stars and ask what the best thing about it was--that would go a long way as to giving a positive outlook on what this game really is. As far as the one or two star reviews go--I would agree the cost was a bit high at the outset and perhaps a few months of tweaks were in order--but as it plays out now I just love it.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Suzuki', N'benjamin.suzuki2215@example.net', '2017-01-26', 4, N'Great game. It''s tied with uncharted 2 for me. The only underwhelming aspect of the game for me is the villain wasn''t as menacing as I had hoped. My all time favorite was uncharted 3. Environments are very pretty and my favorite level of the entire game was the Scotland section. Combat is very fast and fluid and the cinematic storytelling is as great as ever. Only reason I take away a star is because they took away the counter button from uncharted 3 except for when you''re engaged in a grapple. That seemed to me to be counter intuitive and it really bothered me. Besides that it was a great game'),
(N'Sarah', N'Patel', N'sarah.patel8623@example.net', '2017-01-26', 5, N'The wife had wanted this keyboard for quite some time. Finally got it for her and she loves it. Working great so far.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Smith', N'kelly.smith2688@example.net', '2017-01-27', 4, N'She''s beautiful and cuts a striking figure. There is a lot of detail involved although I did find it kind of funny how large the feet are. I had to get her to add to my husband''s Metroid collection. I took one star off because I bought this online not knowing she is available in stores locally for a much lower price. So maybe shop around at your local game store or grocery big box store before buying online and being taken advantage of with the price gouging. I did get the import version and from what I''ve seen in stores locally the regular one looks exactly the same.'),
(N'Joan', N'Jimenez', N'joan.jimenez4091@example.org', '2017-01-27', 5, N'Must buy, must play. Even though it''s not the newest game out there, very few can compare to the experience that is the last of us'),
(N'Cheryl', N'White', N'cheryl.white5673@example.org', '2017-01-27', 4, N'Really easy to beat. Did it in about 3 days just playing a little at a time. Graphics were good.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Gomez', N'lucia.gomez2988@example.org', '2017-01-27', 4, N'its true that it does have a big dead zone. about 2/3 of the joystick has a dead zone but i always push it to the edge anyways so i think its great. it has high sensitivity and you don''t really notice the dead zone'),
(N'Ryan', N'Nguyen', N'ryan.nguyen8153@example.net', '2017-01-27', 5, N'Don''t listen to other reviews that say the plastic is weak. For a game card case, the plastic is definitely nothing short of durable. You get two hard, plastic cases that hold a total of 12 games together, a great deal! The only issue I have is that the plastic inside the case, the one that holds the game cards, can be a bit more durable. The plastic hangs off a hinge that isn''t completely trustworthy to hold its own through rough handling. The case is still very nice. The inside hinge is a little weak, and I''ve read that some people had it come off, apparently. I highly doubt mine will come off anytime soon, unless I pull with some force. Anyways, give it a go. Overall, 5 stars!'),
(N'Sofia', N'Robinson', N'sofia.robinson2201@example.com', '2017-01-27', 1, N'i don''t like this game'),
(N'Sharon', N'Reed', N'sharon.reed3148@example.com', '2017-01-27', 5, N'scary and suspenseful.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Wright', N'daniel.wright5935@example.com', '2017-01-28', 5, N'loved it, fast delivery service too, thank you'),
(N'Sofia', N'Jones', N'sofia.jones3253@example.org', '2017-01-28', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Singh', N'timothy.singh1209@example.org', '2017-01-28', 1, N'Terrible uninspired game. I managed to trade it in and only lose about a dollar of value.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Gray', N'rebecca.gray6993@example.net', '2017-01-28', 4, N'Let me just start by saying I LOVED this game. Loved it. I even turned right back around and started re-playing it after I beat it the first time, I was just so interested in it. It''s a puzzle/exploration game before it''s an action game. You play as a boy waking up to find himself in a place he doesn''t know beside a great beast he''s only heard tales of. You spend the game trying to get home with the help of your giant animal sidekick. So those of you who are suckers for animal sidekicks and big flying beasts, puzzles, fantasy, world exploration, this game might be right up your alley. That being said, I can understand that this game won''t be for everyone. The controls, as other people have said, are a little janky. The camera drags a bit, and a couple times it took me out of the game and was distracting, but never during a time when tensions were high and I had to move fast and precisely. Despite one or two parts where I repeatedly died because of bad controls, they did not lessen...'),
(N'James', N'Taylor', N'james.taylor2058@example.com', '2017-01-28', 5, N'I am very happy with this mouse. My previous mouse was the Razer Naga, but I found that having all the buttons on the side was a nuisance. Before buying this one I decided to give Corsair a try. It was their version of the Naga. Disappointed to say the least, I returned it and got this bad boy. I play mostly HoTS and Overwatch these days and the mouse is perfect for both. There are two buttons on the side and it allows me to punch while playing Overwatch which I couldn''t do before with a simple mouse click. Its comfortable on the hand and a brand you can rely on.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Singh', N'brenda.singh5429@example.org', '2017-01-28', 5, N'Good game.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Young', N'nicole.young4611@example.com', '2017-01-28', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Ronald', N'Fisher', N'ronald.fisher3526@example.net', '2017-01-29', 5, N'Product is high quality. Quick Effective Seller. Remember this is Just a Mario amiibo it won''t be any different then the Super Smash one you have.'),
(N'Carol', N'Clark', N'carol.clark3789@example.org', '2017-01-29', 5, N'I personally love game!'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Perez', N'carolyn.perez5845@example.org', '2017-01-29', 5, N'I love this action pose. I like the detail on his clothing, but I feel they could have done better on his face and hair. I like the detail on the Ocarina Link better. Still a great figure.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Kumar', N'stephanie.kumar3881@example.org', '2017-01-29', 5, N'A chilling introduction as you play the character Ethan, attempting to find Mia. This horrifying game will really keep you on your toes. I think I''ve been frightened 3 times when one of the family members almost catches me. Don''t play this game if you aren''t ready for a horrifying and intense video game.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Anderson', N'kelly.anderson6057@example.net', '2017-01-29', 5, N'I love punch out Mr dream is like Mike Tyson but a definite name'),
(N'Steven', N'Torres', N'steven.torres7483@example.org', '2017-01-29', 5, N'Very satisfied with this purchase. Good build, a lot bigger than I thought it would be, and works perfectly with my mouse. The best thing about this, for me personally, is the size of it. I thought it would be a fairly small mouse pad but upon placing it down, it was a lot bigger than what I was use to. Because of the added size, I can now move my hands and wrists further distances than I could before, perfect for lowering your sensitivity in First Person Shooter games where you want to practice aiming. And no, you don''t HAVE to have it plugged in to for your mouse to work, despite people thinking this is the case.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Perry', N'cheryl.perry8517@example.org', '2017-01-29', 5, N'Nice stuff'),
(N'Sharon', N'Ortiz', N'sharon.ortiz9806@example.org', '2017-01-29', 5, N'A Christmas gift, the grandson loved it.. I thought it was a bit old for 7year old, but he adapted to the play and loves it.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Davis', N'jeremy.davis6541@example.org', '2017-01-29', 5, N'Awesome & fast ship'),
(N'Mateo', N'Cox', N'mateo.cox6440@example.net', '2017-01-29', 5, N'gift for kids, they played regularly.'),
(N'George', N'Morris', N'george.morris9817@example.net', '2017-01-29', 5, N'Fantastic!'),
(N'Christine', N'Murphy', N'christine.murphy6953@example.org', '2017-01-30', 4, N'Looks cool, but the top layer of paint starts to wear off after a little gaming. Still a cool look, nonetheless.'),
(N'Susan', N'Roberts', N'susan.roberts2273@example.org', '2017-01-30', 2, N'THE GAME FUNCTIONED HOWEVER THE PACKAGING WAS HORRIBLE DIRTY . THE CD WAS FILTHY LOOKED LIKE IT CAME FROM THE GARBAGE CONTAINER. IS A TWO CENT SLEEVE TOO MUCH TO ASK FOR ?'),
(N'Patricia', N'Foster', N'patricia.foster5028@example.org', '2017-01-30', 5, N'Good.'),
(N'Jose', N'Parker', N'jose.parker1943@example.org', '2017-01-30', 5, N'loved it thank you'),
(N'Jacob', N'Anderson', N'jacob.anderson3102@example.com', '2017-01-30', 5, N'nice controller, great look and feel.'),
(N'Jack', N'Martinez', N'jack.martinez6923@example.com', '2017-01-30', 5, N'fun game'),
(N'Olivia', N'Ivanov', N'olivia.ivanov6834@example.net', '2017-01-30', 4, N'This is a standard Xbox One controller, plus a long USB cable, so you can pretty much envision what you are getting before you buy it. Works wirelessly with the Xbox and has been as reliable as any other Microsoft controller in the time that I have owned it. The only thing I didn''t like is the lack of a 3.5mm headphone jack. This is the older controller style with the port for the headphone adapter, but if you buy a more modern controller it doesn''t require the adapter and has a 3.5mm jack built right in.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Ferreira', N'tomasz.ferreira7636@example.net', '2017-01-30', 5, N'A classic by the lovers of blue bomber'),
(N'Emily', N'Nowak', N'emily.nowak9363@example.com', '2017-01-30', 3, N'ok'),
(N'Donna', N'Singh', N'donna.singh8496@example.net', '2017-01-31', 5, N'If you are the type of person who likes to purchase available downloads for your games, you are out of luck when it comes to PGA 14. EAS Sports ended it''s contract with Tiger Wood''s in 2013 at which time I believe downloads became unavailable. I just purchased this game used and I''m glad I didn''t pay the average price of $55 for a new game. With that being said, I will say that I love this game aside from that. Online play is still available from what I can tell but I have yet to participate since I''m currently more interested in the career mode. The voice commands are excellent but this is what I''ve learned about that. If your sensor sits at the bottom of your TV screen like mine and the sound to the TV is on, it''s hard for voice commands to register. I mute the sound on my TV and run the sound through two external speakers and problem solved. As always lighting can cause issues when using Kinect if the room is too bright. I turn the kitchen light on which provides adequate...'),
(N'Michelle', N'Cox', N'michelle.cox1031@example.com', '2017-01-31', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Raymond', N'Lopez', N'raymond.lopez9253@example.com', '2017-01-31', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Ramos', N'carolyn.ramos4274@example.net', '2017-01-31', 5, N'Amazing game one of the best in the series very scary'),
(N'Pamela', N'Ali', N'pamela.ali6216@example.com', '2017-01-31', 5, N'Madden does it again, TY'),
(N'Hannah', N'Wang', N'hannah.wang3112@example.org', '2017-02-01', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Steven', N'Jenkins', N'steven.jenkins6128@example.net', '2017-02-01', 3, N'Game is great but ended up returning it and getting it on WII, find that they work much better with the WII remote than the Kinect system'),
(N'Carol', N'Adams', N'carol.adams2788@example.com', '2017-02-01', 3, N'Never played the game, but I have never heard so many people complain about a game that was explained to them PERFECTLY a YEAR before it came out. This explains Trump as president.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Wood', N'jacob.wood1235@example.net', '2017-02-01', 3, N'Looks cool with pretty blue lights when plugged in. But it comes with discs and says you need to download the discs to your computer. But the discs are little and don''t fit in the tray. Still worked with out the disc downloads. Occasionally loses sound while using but is easily fixed.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Wood', N'jacob.wood1235@example.net', '2017-02-01', 5, N'This was a great game and an awesome remake. It adds great components from the older ratchet and Clank games. Came in great condition also.'),
(N'Steven', N'Hill', N'steven.hill8301@example.net', '2017-02-01', 3, N'I miss the old days of madden when you could play the franchise mode offline and it was so fun to play with your friends and was so much easier to navigate. This game has totally changed and is geared more for online play vs offline. The graphics have improved quite a bit but I do notice the occasional freeze up in menus every once in a while which have been noted by other reviewers as well. It''s ok I guess if your an online gamer.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Martinez', N'victoria.martinez9624@example.net', '2017-02-01', 4, N'So far it''s a nice mouse. That''s a good thing from someone who''s been on a trackball since 95. It feels very ergonomic but I haven''t had any long runs with it yet. I''m more curious about the stats that get generated on your usage. Hopefully unlike the other reviewers mine doesn''t breakdown.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Nowak', N'victoria.nowak1113@example.com', '2017-02-01', 5, N'Great game plus $12 off for pre ordering can''t beat it.'),
(N'Donna', N'James', N'donna.james6183@example.com', '2017-02-01', 5, N'Very satisfied thank you'),
(N'Mark', N'Lee', N'mark.lee6994@example.net', '2017-02-01', 5, N'it was cheap'),
(N'Jose', N'Wang', N'jose.wang6072@example.org', '2017-02-01', 5, N'Best mouse I have ever purchased. Period.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Jackson', N'tomasz.jackson3620@example.net', '2017-02-01', 3, N'Was a gift.'),
(N'David', N'Powell', N'david.powell9822@example.net', '2017-02-01', 5, N'Really fun'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Morgan', N'kenneth.morgan6152@example.net', '2017-02-01', 5, N'Resident Evil VII feels like the first true sequel to the original on Playstation 1 as far as the overall feel and theme of the game. Yes, it''s first person instead of pre-determined camera angles and tank controls (thank God for that), but the rest of it sticks to the original''s roots. Exploring a mansion full of terrors and puzzles? Check. Limited inventory space? Check. Scarce ammo? Check. A large conspiracy unraveled in the story? Check. If you''ve played the demo, don''t let it mislead you. This isn''t another Outlast clone just because it''s first person. It''s a true survival-horror game, just like the original Resident Evil. My only complaints are these: it''s a bit short. Even if you aren''t rushing the game can be finished in 10 hours. But it''s a dense 10 hours which is good. The other complaint is a lack of enemy variety. That''s partially explained by the story which I won''t spoil, but it would have been nice to have a few more enemy types to battle. All in all I was well...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Johnson', N'kenneth.johnson5183@example.com', '2017-02-01', 3, N'its ok'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Jenkins', N'rebecca.jenkins2827@example.org', '2017-02-02', 5, N'Jak & Daxter #1 is my favorite. LOVE IT!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Lopez', N'aaron.lopez7546@example.net', '2017-02-02', 5, N'This game is great not only for a 7yr old ,but great for the whole family !!!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Watson', N'kenneth.watson3031@example.org', '2017-02-02', 5, N'Fantastic game! Awesome'),
(N'Pamela', N'Suzuki', N'pamela.suzuki9358@example.org', '2017-02-02', 5, N'Works just like the original. Fits perfect and no problem charging'),
(N'Anthony', N'Hernandez', N'anthony.hernandez2360@example.org', '2017-02-02', 5, N'I''ve been wanting this Amiibo for the new Zelda: Breath of the Wild coming in March 3, 2017. I already have the Twilight Princess GCN version. I''ll use this Amiibo a lot.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Bell', N'joseph.bell1401@example.com', '2017-02-02', 4, N'Definitely a piece of work and addition to the Resident Evil franchise BUT the fact they cut the gameplay to 10 hours for the base game and same day released DLC to expand the story is extremely irritating. If you can find a deal or want to support the game as is, I would definitely recommend it at this point (for a lower price tag).'),
(N'Justin', N'Ali', N'justin.ali8548@example.com', '2017-02-02', 5, N'One of the best portable Mario games ever created in my opinion, the game is challenging, frustrating and genuinely exciting at times. The controls are more tighter and responsive than they have ever been, and I think this game is superior to New SMB 2, which was a bit too easy.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Murphy', N'cynthia.murphy8244@example.net', '2017-02-03', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Dee', N'Cox', N'dee.cox2719@example.org', '2017-02-03', 5, N'Gift'),
(N'Dee', N'Cox', N'dee.cox2719@example.org', '2017-02-03', 4, N'Works good.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Nelson', N'gregory.nelson7363@example.org', '2017-02-03', 5, N'great workouts'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Wilson', N'cynthia.wilson4799@example.org', '2017-02-03', 5, N'THE FEEL IS UNDESCRIBABLE'),
(N'Carol', N'Robinson', N'carol.robinson3769@example.net', '2017-02-03', 5, N'These work pretty well and have an extra z button on the other side, they seem well built and hopefull handle the stress of 8 player ssb4'),
(N'Amanda', N'Diaz', N'amanda.diaz8327@example.com', '2017-02-03', 4, N'Assassin''s Creed Syndicate is a new branch of the AC Series, allowing the player for the first time, to experience the city with the ability to use a grappling rope to zipline up and down the rooftops at will. This one feature alone brings the game into the realm of Batman Arkham City, the game that really got that game mechanic established in current times, long after Bionic Commando''s grappling hook hero from Capcom. The city is large yet the variety is lacking, as soon enough, one city street appears nearly the same as the hundreds of others. There are of course some unique variations, but in general, you may get the sense of sameness as you traverse the city''s more mundane streets. That said, the detail in the character battles, architecture and citizens, all highly polished and impressive. To top it off, it also includes a day into night cycle, with a healthy portion skewed to daylight, with night time only lasting a short fraction of the cycle. If you''re a fan of this series,...'),
(N'Pamela', N'Johnson', N'pamela.johnson7858@example.org', '2017-02-03', 4, N'Like the open world feel, dislike the same problem I have with almost all of these racing games: the computer cheats like a mofo. Hard to compete with ''perfect drivers'' when you are using a gamepad.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Hall', N'evelyn.hall4645@example.org', '2017-02-03', 4, N'We just recently got this game for our wii u and for the most part it''s been a ton of fun. Very colorful worlds and very creative. There are a couple of things I would change though. First of all the distance it sets you back when you die is frustrating. I am also playing Rayman Legends and when you die in that game you only go back a few seconds. Between my wife, son, and friends, we''ve all agreed that it is very frustrating when you have to begin levels again after dying. I will say though that this is a fresh feeling compared to Super Mario bros. The DK worlds are great and addictively creative. It can be a hard game but it is very fun. If I didn''t have to start so far back after dying, it''d be perfect.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Wood', N'evelyn.wood5164@example.org', '2017-02-03', 5, N'Cool'),
(N'Adam', N'Torres', N'adam.torres6794@example.com', '2017-02-03', 5, N'BEST game'),
(N'Jerry', N'James', N'jerry.james4283@example.net', '2017-02-04', 4, N'Nostalgia, i wanted to get the 3 kanto starters, and this is the best game to do it'),
(N'Brandon', N'Wang', N'brandon.wang2097@example.net', '2017-02-04', 5, N'love it Thankyou very much'),
(N'Alexander', N'Anderson', N'alexander.anderson4446@example.com', '2017-02-04', 4, N'I like Pokemon Sun but i just wish it would have less dialogue. Product came in perfect shape.'),
(N'George', N'Coleman', N'george.coleman9955@example.net', '2017-02-04', 4, N'I got this game for $10 bucks and have had immense fun with it. The value surely has added to it but overrall, fun game especially with friends.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Campbell', N'dennis.campbell6075@example.org', '2017-02-04', 5, N'My husband has spent countless hours on this game and I do not think that he will stop anytime soon. It has great graphics and a great story line.'),
(N'Wei', N'Brown', N'wei.brown2692@example.org', '2017-02-04', 5, N'Easily redeemed'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Chavez', N'jennifer.chavez8604@example.net', '2017-02-04', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Joan', N'Clark', N'joan.clark6294@example.net', '2017-02-05', 5, N'Great audio quality for the price. Build quality is pretty darn good and they are pretty comfy to wear as well.'),
(N'Angela', N'Hill', N'angela.hill5313@example.net', '2017-02-05', 5, N'Muy buen Producto gracias'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Howard', N'jeffrey.howard7251@example.net', '2017-02-05', 5, N'One of the best controller, works also on PC with Steam, Windows 10 Store,Origin, and others online stores with cable, or you can buy the wireless adapter. It''s a classic design and make the job.'),
(N'Donna', N'Henderson', N'donna.henderson5521@example.org', '2017-02-05', 5, N'Very Good.'),
(N'Donna', N'Henderson', N'donna.henderson5521@example.org', '2017-02-05', 5, N'Good.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Carter', N'ryan.carter9676@example.net', '2017-02-05', 5, N'I have every call of duty game, as much as i prefer the older games this is still fun and a bit different from the last.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Reed', N'lisa.reed8358@example.com', '2017-02-05', 5, N'Easy upgrade and not too expensive! Love it!'),
(N'Lisa', N'Reed', N'lisa.reed8358@example.com', '2017-02-05', 5, N'Made my upgrading a piece of cake'),
(N'Samuel', N'Howard', N'samuel.howard4996@example.com', '2017-02-06', 5, N'Outstanding! ! ! Very Satisfied! ! ! :D'),
(N'Lucia', N'Gutierrez', N'lucia.gutierrez8476@example.org', '2017-02-06', 4, N'Very enjoyable game but has several bugs. EA is known for letting its consumers figure out the bugs for them.'),
(N'Paul', N'Wright', N'paul.wright1930@example.net', '2017-02-06', 5, N'I was hesitant to buy this game because it reminded me a bit too much of Final Fantasy 13-2. However, this was easily very addictive.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Reyes', N'brandon.reyes8251@example.org', '2017-02-06', 2, N'This was the most tedious game HOG I''ve ever played. There is no interactive or any other kind of map, so one must go back and forth and back and forth. There is a strategy guide (similar to a walk-through, though less detailed.) I finished it only so I could honestly write this review.'),
(N'Gary', N'Ramirez', N'gary.ramirez4173@example.org', '2017-02-06', 5, N'It''s Ratchet and Clank and it''s awesome.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Robinson', N'stephen.robinson3762@example.org', '2017-02-06', 4, N'My 5 year old son really enjoys this'),
(N'Gregory', N'Ward', N'gregory.ward3145@example.com', '2017-02-06', 5, N'a very scary and difficult game but all people need to play this game'),
(N'Mateo', N'Kumar', N'mateo.kumar4765@example.org', '2017-02-06', 5, N'One of best final fantasy games I''ve played its a great game'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Thompson', N'benjamin.thompson6128@example.com', '2017-02-06', 5, N'Best played in VR.'),
(N'Aaron', N'Hall', N'aaron.hall4287@example.com', '2017-02-06', 5, N'Not a "verified customer" because I purchased these at Gamestop, 3 years ago, alongside my PS4 because my old PS3 headset was bluetooth operated and could not function with the new system since PS4 didn''t have bluetooth support. 3 years. I eventually upgraded to the Playstation Gold Headset for $100 because it was bluetooth enabled again, but this was always a good choice for a mono headset when I wanted to make sure I wasn''t being too loud when my parents were asleep so I didn''t wake em. After 3 long years, it finally stopped working, but considering I purchased it for (at the time) $30, I was very happy with how long it worked, and how well it performed. The sound quality is very clear, whether you use it just for chatting or also switch it to have in-game audio, and my friends could hear me clearly as well. Easy access to "mute microphone" button, and a volume dial to turn the volume down low during loud dramatic moments and raise it during soft emotional moments. Trusted brand...'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ruiz', N'jacob.ruiz4218@example.com', '2017-02-06', 5, N'I have been a fan of the RE series for a long time now. I was really missing the old school horror survival that I loved back in the PS1 days. Finally Capcom has listed to the fans and brought the game back to it''s roots. Have the game first person was a nice twist too. The gore was in your face.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Allen', N'amanda.allen3685@example.com', '2017-02-07', 5, N'... Great Finger Grips - Recommend It.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Brooks', N'pamela.brooks8337@example.org', '2017-02-07', 5, N'Definitely a good buy from this seller'),
(N'Timothy', N'Walker', N'timothy.walker5759@example.org', '2017-02-07', 4, N'Its Skyrim... again... Not bad if you missed out on all the DLC.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Jones', N'nancy.jones5289@example.net', '2017-02-07', 5, N'Super game and very cheap. Ty for all!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Nguyen', N'kimberly.nguyen8868@example.net', '2017-02-07', 4, N'This is a good game so far!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Rodriguez', N'amanda.rodriguez3902@example.net', '2017-02-07', 1, N'This hardly had any songs was completely disappointed'),
(N'Jack', N'Okonkwo', N'jack.okonkwo6574@example.net', '2017-02-07', 4, N'Great amiibo! It looks a little cleaner than the original Meta Knight but way easier to come by. The price was great and WAY cheaper than any other amiibo.'),
(N'Jack', N'Okonkwo', N'jack.okonkwo6574@example.net', '2017-02-07', 4, N'Awesome 3-pack and the alternate colors are a bit better than my original 3-pack.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Long', N'sandra.long2116@example.org', '2017-02-07', 3, N'Three stars for the quality which is pretty good'),
(N'Deborah', N'Chen', N'deborah.chen9488@example.org', '2017-02-08', 5, N'Yes. I get teary-eyed at certain points of this game despite being a straight man. I love RPGs which is my favorite genre. I enjoy the semi strategy battle system and the music is so good. The characters are lovable too. The story goes to show us that eternal life is not all it''s cracked up to be. Find out what I mean by playing it. Enjoy.'),
(N'Jose', N'Ramirez', N'jose.ramirez2341@example.org', '2017-02-08', 5, N'excellent product'),
(N'Brandon', N'Okonkwo', N'brandon.okonkwo2537@example.org', '2017-02-08', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Jerry', N'Kim', N'jerry.kim3979@example.com', '2017-02-08', 1, N'ugh... this is another item that will waste hours of your day just trying to get it to work. The drivers don''t work, it will crash (blue screen of death) your system, and once you FINALLY get it to work it''s a flipping pain to assign buttons. I used mine for maybe an hour or so, with maybe 10 hours into fixing it. What nonsense. I''m selling mine on Ebay and going with a Thrustmaster, it may cost more but you won''t spend your weekend trying to get it to work. Can''t believe Saitek makes such terrible software, I mean countless blogs about this same thing are out there. This is why reviews are important. Head my warning, DON''T BUY!!!!'),
(N'Helen', N'Clark', N'helen.clark3005@example.org', '2017-02-08', 5, N'Loved this back in the day.. it is still just as awesome... only works on a CRT and NOT on HD CRT''s or LED/LCD or plasma.'),
(N'Helen', N'Clark', N'helen.clark3005@example.org', '2017-02-08', 5, N'Works fine for me on retro bit trio and retron duo, best fits with the original controllers but the knockoff controllers fit ok on them too.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Fisher', N'sofia.fisher1937@example.com', '2017-02-08', 5, N'I completely agree with the other reviews that feel this game is underrated. Can''t believe it got a 68% overall rating on gamerankings. Excellent story, best graphics of any game I''ve played on PS4, most intense gun and grenade audio, and very likeable characters. The reason, for those who are wondering, that this game got poor reviews is due to: no multiplayer, linear path without free roaming, and not overly long. Guess what? I can''t stand multiplayer, I never go online with my PS4. I hate free roaming games (think Elder Scrolls, etc.). 7-10 hours is my sweetspot for a game, where it''s long enough to create value, but not too long to wear itself out. Meaning, the "negatives" of The Order are all "positives" in my book. You can get this at bargain basement pricing if you check around, and it''s definitely worth it. I''d say anything $29.99 and below won''t disappoint. I have a 47 pound Harman Kardon receiver, excellent speakers, and a 15" down firing Cerwin Vega subwoofer. When the...'),
(N'James', N'Jimenez', N'james.jimenez6089@example.net', '2017-02-08', 4, N'GOOD'),
(N'Walter', N'Richardson', N'walter.richardson7029@example.org', '2017-02-08', 4, N'I bought this game for my nephew! He love soccer and it was a perfect present for him. I played with him the game and I enjoyed it.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Robinson', N'jacob.robinson9605@example.org', '2017-02-08', 5, N'AWESOME STUFF!!!!!!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Edwards', N'ashley.edwards2913@example.net', '2017-02-09', 3, N'It worked'),
(N'Linda', N'Carter', N'linda.carter9440@example.net', '2017-02-09', 5, N'It jumps you right into the action and doesn''t insult your intelligence the same way other modern games do. It''s tutorial is basically just an easy version of what you will face later. It''s still fun and fast paced, and from there the momentum just builds. The visuals were great, the sound was great, the feel was great.'),
(N'Linda', N'Carter', N'linda.carter9440@example.net', '2017-02-09', 5, N'If it were just Skyrim in a metal case, it''d be 3 stars as I think TES games are only okay. THIS ONE HAS MODS!!! Mod support is the only reason I bought it, and man! Some of those make this game frickin awesome! Use magick to make heads pop, have Wolverine''s claws come out of your hand, have all the dragons replaced with Macho Man Randy Savage etc get this game, and mod it to hell and back'),
(N'Ravi', N'Brown', N'ravi.brown4524@example.net', '2017-02-09', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Adam', N'Wood', N'adam.wood3161@example.org', '2017-02-09', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Perry', N'marcus.perry1076@example.org', '2017-02-09', 5, N'This game lasted for months!! Awesome story and timeline sequences which made the journey realistic and enchanting.'),
(N'Brian', N'Gonzalez', N'brian.gonzalez5264@example.org', '2017-02-10', 3, N'I bought this for my friend as a birthday present. I do own one myself I bought over 2 years ago and still works. But I saw this and was supposed to be an updated version than what I have. At least that''s what I thought. I found my headset and it said "old version" click here for "new version" which was this link. Well that''s a lie. I was decieved by the pictures. This is not the same version as in the pictures. It''s still a great headset but I''m lowering the stars because you don''t get what''s listed. The mic is different and so is the box with all the functions. According to the pics they say what everything does. But when you get the headset it''s only pictures. Very disappointed with false advertising.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Peterson', N'nancy.peterson1488@example.org', '2017-02-10', 5, N'Ah, Star Wars! What els is there to say and just like everyone els this is defiantly one of the better ones!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Peterson', N'nancy.peterson1488@example.org', '2017-02-10', 5, N'It''s a must have for a true fan! This will take you through the series it''s quite amazing actually! Very fun and addicting in my opinion.'),
(N'Christina', N'Perry', N'christina.perry8453@example.net', '2017-02-10', 4, N'It was absolutely intriguing. This was a game I was very happy to play through. This setting was superb, and the gameplay was agreeable. However, I will speak on something I was not fond of. There is a character, Triss, that loves the character you play as, Geralt. I even read Triss''s character page and it read, "She loves Geralt and wants more than anything for him to choose her" or something. So I got to know Triss, and I liked her. The voice actress portraying her was a good choice, she has a very sweet voice, and her character design is different than most women, as she has a unique hairstyle. Also, they give her good dialogue and she feels like a real person, as is the case with many characters in this game. So, anyway, there are whores in the game that you can have sex with, but I never had sex with any of them or did anything with any women in the game. I was hoping that there would be a dialogue option to tell Triss, "I choose you," but, there wasn''t. Nothing happens. At...'),
(N'Thomas', N'Alvarez', N'thomas.alvarez2648@example.net', '2017-02-10', 5, N'good'),
(N'Thomas', N'Alvarez', N'thomas.alvarez2648@example.net', '2017-02-10', 5, N'works'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Harris', N'elizabeth.harris2068@example.org', '2017-02-10', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Justin', N'Chen', N'justin.chen1555@example.net', '2017-02-10', 5, N'Better graphics, gameplay than the Yakuza games & it came out in 2012. Needs sequel'),
(N'Edward', N'Turner', N'edward.turner5597@example.net', '2017-02-10', 5, N'This is easily the best game in the Mega Man Zero series. It''s not crushingly hard like the first two games, not too easy like MMZ4, and controls are very tight. The OST is some of the best in the series, as well as the Mega Man franchise as a whole. Gameplay itself is more reflex intensive than most other Mega Man games, or platformer games in general. This is not for someone new to platformers by any stretch. This is a game for experienced gamers who want to stretch their platforming skills to new limits. Don''t get this game expecting a grandiose plot and lore. It won''t deliver that. It''s fast-paced action that will last you only as long as it takes you to master both the gameplay and stages. Speed runs (playing through as fast as you can) take about 2 hours or less for experienced players. Most people will probably take 5 or so hours their first time.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Edwards', N'alexander.edwards3785@example.com', '2017-02-10', 4, N'I find it decent enough, but I had expected somewhat better avatar modeling, I also find it more tedious than need be with the way it tracks quests, important NPCs, movement, etc. Just seems that much of one''s gameplay is wasted on talking to everyone just to find out who they are, much less to determine if they have anything pertinent to offer. Likewise with the movement, trying to locate the means to get from point A to point B most efficiently (and determining a point B to begin with).'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Smith', N'kenneth.smith5976@example.org', '2017-02-11', 5, N'Granddaughter''s loved it!!!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Hill', N'jeffrey.hill5776@example.com', '2017-02-11', 5, N'GOOD WORKS WELL.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Williams', N'ronald.williams4949@example.net', '2017-02-11', 5, N'The pedal was back and working again.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Russell', N'jerry.russell2985@example.com', '2017-02-11', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Jacob', N'Kelly', N'jacob.kelly6372@example.org', '2017-02-11', 5, N':)'),
(N'Jacob', N'Kelly', N'jacob.kelly6372@example.org', '2017-02-11', 3, N':('),
(N'Larry', N'Wilson', N'larry.wilson8163@example.net', '2017-02-11', 1, N'I really want to love this game, but it is a very challenging game - more in a buggy way than a good way. My kids want to play this, but I dread it, because it is non-stop complaints about how hard and confusing the game is. I have to sit over their shoulders taking the controls constantly to figure things out. It usually takes me awhile to figure it out. My kids play Mario, Kirby, Nintendo World, Pokemon and a ton of other games with no issues. The Lego games are always a big letdown and this one is no different. Hopefully they release an update to make everything more intuitive and less about "puzzle solving" for no reason.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Nguyen', N'lucia.nguyen6990@example.net', '2017-02-12', 5, N'Product as described, quick delivery!'),
(N'Alexander', N'Barnes', N'alexander.barnes2492@example.org', '2017-02-12', 4, N'Yes it works so far.'),
(N'Walter', N'Ramirez', N'walter.ramirez2273@example.com', '2017-02-12', 5, N'Great cables!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Mendoza', N'sharon.mendoza3134@example.net', '2017-02-12', 5, N'very fun game'),
(N'Mary', N'Cook', N'mary.cook3611@example.com', '2017-02-12', 5, N'Excellent recommend!!!'),
(N'Helen', N'Flores', N'helen.flores9432@example.net', '2017-02-13', 1, N'Mistake #1 -- I bought this without realizing that it was a CD-rom Game BOX with a code to download the game, and not a set of game disks. Mistake #2 -- I should''ve read the customer Q&A section a little closer, where I might''ve seen how long it would take to download/install this game from its host site, Origin. Now I must wait 14 hours+ for it to download, despite my high speed internet and fast computer.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Wright', N'tyler.wright1212@example.com', '2017-02-13', 5, N'Excelent product.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Nowak', N'rachel.nowak4319@example.org', '2017-02-13', 5, N'As advertised...works great! My Step son thoroughly enjoyed this gift!!'),
(N'Amara', N'Brooks', N'amara.brooks1121@example.org', '2017-02-13', 5, N'I realy love this game.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Alvarez', N'rebecca.alvarez9230@example.org', '2017-02-13', 4, N'Kinda cool it''s fun fighting game if you can get it at good price'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Kowalski', N'kimberly.kowalski7391@example.com', '2017-02-13', 5, N'Seller met all my expectations and price for product was good. Is a good game with good graphics but is somewhat short. Enjoyed it for the price. Would purchase from this seller again.'),
(N'Eric', N'Morales', N'eric.morales5193@example.net', '2017-02-13', 5, N'MY GRANDDAUGHTER LOVES IT.'),
(N'Adam', N'King', N'adam.king3563@example.com', '2017-02-14', 5, N'excelente producto'),
(N'Emily', N'Jackson', N'emily.jackson2353@example.net', '2017-02-14', 3, N'I remember when this game was in development and being talked about way back in hmm about 2008 or so. For PS3. Looked very cool, but I was weary about whether the game would actually look like it did in the presentation. So I''m glad they transferred it over to PS4. And after finally getting this for 34$ at Gamestop I can confirm it''s not BAD looking. But graphically it still has a lot of last generation elements, even though it is a special art style of graphics. You can tell some cleaning up and sharpening was done though. And probably the most realistic thing in the game is Trico. Sometimes he looks great, other times he looks odd. But he''s the real "star" of the game. And it''s really amazing how they made his A.I, and responses so realistic. There is no "real story" here, it''s all in Japanese (subtitles) but you really start to get into it once you learn where to go and what to do. Which takes some time. So it''s slow paced, and not really action driven. But still quite...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Wood', N'joyce.wood3120@example.net', '2017-02-14', 5, N'Another well made arkham game. of course with a few new things like, a bigger Gotham and more upgrades and harder boss battles. A great game'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez7512@example.com', '2017-02-14', 1, N'doesn''t seem to work, may work on like one game I tried out of ten others that didn''t..but wouldn''t recommend..couldn''t figure it out that easy..my other ones are temperamental too but not this bad at all. usually one of the other two I have will work if other one doesn''t..but one is full and other if that doesn''t work, and then this doesn''t..then I can''t save oh well.!'),
(N'Robert', N'Brown', N'robert.brown2449@example.com', '2017-02-14', 5, N'Good Games'),
(N'Jack', N'Castillo', N'jack.castillo1418@example.com', '2017-02-14', 5, N'as advertised'),
(N'Lisa', N'Howard', N'lisa.howard2972@example.com', '2017-02-15', 5, N'Looks good!!'),
(N'Kofi', N'Collins', N'kofi.collins2496@example.com', '2017-02-15', 5, N'My son must have said, "These are sick" which is teenager slang for fantastic, about a dozen times as he took these out of the box, tried them on, and plugged them into his computer. They block the noise around you to help keep you from getting distracted from your game. Amazed by the bold sounds coming from the game which includes the sound of the wind in League of Legends. Comfortable to wear, even if playing for awhile. Mic works well. Think he was most impressed with the looks though, the lights on the side and mic. He did mention that the cord is really thick, heavily protected from wear. As well they are easy to adjust to your head. Price makes them really reasonable too to purchase for others who game in the house.'),
(N'Helen', N'Clark', N'helen.clark3005@example.org', '2017-02-16', 5, N'Fun game, it is a bit long though compared to its predecessors.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Young', N'ryan.young9757@example.net', '2017-02-16', 5, N'I love this game works very good'),
(N'Ryan', N'Young', N'ryan.young9757@example.net', '2017-02-16', 4, N'Controller worked good'),
(N'Jack', N'Cook', N'jack.cook2810@example.org', '2017-02-16', 5, N'great price fast delivery'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ruiz', N'michelle.ruiz9813@example.net', '2017-02-16', 3, N'It''s really small if that makes any sense'),
(N'Donald', N'Kelly', N'donald.kelly7980@example.org', '2017-02-16', 5, N'Was hoping for more puzzles, but this is still a great game. Lots of homage''s to the past games, and some horror films. I''d say one could wait for a price drop if not a hardcore RE fan. After beating it once, you unlock a harder mode (like any other game) but this one makes that mode a whole new experience. i.e. moving items around, thus creating all new tensions etc.) It''s a more story and suspense driven game, than an action-shoot ''em up, so depending on your play style will determine if it''s for you. If your fav RE games were 5 and 6 you will probably not like this one.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Johnson', N'nicole.johnson2454@example.org', '2017-02-16', 5, N'Bought it on the PS3 originally but now that I updated to a PS4 Pro I figured this game should come along for the ride'),
(N'Sofia', N'Green', N'sofia.green2441@example.com', '2017-02-16', 3, N'This game is a pretty decent game for anyone, child and adult alike. After extensive hours of gameplay I find that sometimes the control is a little hard at times. Not because of game difficulty but because there is a strange ''AI'' built into the Chimera named Trico, which is the cat/dragon/bird looking creature. Don''t get me wrong the Chimera is gorgeous to watch move about, and at times seems so realistic. It''s just that Trico has a mind of it''s own, and sometimes just will not respond to my input until after I give the command a few times. And at times that can become a little frustrating. So for that reason alone I removed 1 star. However, I do believe that the game developer built the game to respond this way intentionally, so as to give Trico it''s own mindset or attitude if you will. However, this creates a distraction in the gameplay that will not go unnoticed. And then there is your character, he has a problem following simple commands to either jump in a specific direction...'),
(N'Angela', N'Moore', N'angela.moore1880@example.net', '2017-02-17', 5, N'Pros: Excellent tracking, especially with a decent mouse pad Great for large hands NOT problematic for small hands Intuitive and comfortable layout of extra buttons (I personally think the thumb buttons could be slightly lower, but I am the only one I know who has this complaint) Durable buttons with excellent tactile feedback. You will never ask yourself "Did I really press that button all the way?" Cord is made of fabric. Durable, with a very favorable cord length. Plenty of length to work with but not too much. Comes with a strap to shorten or shorten it if desired The optional metal weights are no gimmick; They went a very long way toward improving my experience on my very slick gaming mat The software for it works perfectly. Does everything it claims to and more. The color control is very intuitive, simple and effective. The lighting itself is accurate; Red light settings give you red light, not slightly pink lighting Scroll wheel may seem rather heavy and awkward to begin...'),
(N'Robert', N'Gutierrez', N'robert.gutierrez4486@example.org', '2017-02-17', 3, N'Very cool looking, sound is average, awesome for young adults or kids, not so much for adults. I was expecting a fuller sound, I was not expecting $100 quality for $20, but I did expect some bass. It honestly had almost zero bass response. It''s akin to going into your car, turning up the music and turning the bass all the way down. I''ve had greater bass response from in-ear skullcandy headphones than I did from these. Another complaint and is they didn''t fully cover my ears. I don''t have large freak ears or anything like that so with normal size ears this sat on the ears but didn''t not go around them. This is huge for big earphones like this because going around your ears and sealing to the side of your head is what noise cancels and eliminates background noise. By sitting on the ear you can still hear everything around you. I think they may work perfectly for a kid. I plan on just giving these to my younger son because it really was not what I was looking for. Again for the price...'),
(N'Edward', N'Mitchell', N'edward.mitchell4066@example.org', '2017-02-17', 1, N'THE GOLD edition is not working!!!!!!! no extra content!!!!!! I contacted microsoft and they informed me it was a problem with UBISOFT. I tried to contact their support chat and email with no response. I am not happy paying $99bucks and getting nothing extra. contacting amazon next.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Rivera', N'mateo.rivera3618@example.net', '2017-02-17', 5, N'Lego did it again and put out one of the best Lego Star Wars games. Plenty of replay value and length of levels are nice and long. Very happy with the value of the Deluxe Edition.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Ortiz', N'timothy.ortiz9951@example.com', '2017-02-17', 5, N'LOVED THIS GAME AS A FAN OF THE DRAGONQUEST FRANCHISE I WAS A BIT WORRIED THIS GAME WOULD NOT BE GOOD CANT WAIT TO PLAY THE SEQUEL AND DRAGONQUEST 11.'),
(N'Mei', N'Adams', N'mei.adams7719@example.net', '2017-02-17', 5, N'Very pleased with product'),
(N'Aaron', N'Parker', N'aaron.parker4472@example.net', '2017-02-17', 3, N'First one was better, it''s not bad, just not as fun with the multiplayer as the titan battles are not as engaging. Graphics during multiplayer also don''t seem improved over the first game. I was slightly disappointed though it does have a single player campaign this time around.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Martinez', N'jessica.martinez5014@example.com', '2017-02-17', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Edward', N'Parker', N'edward.parker5577@example.net', '2017-02-18', 5, N'nice statue and great conditions'),
(N'Edward', N'Parker', N'edward.parker5577@example.net', '2017-02-18', 5, N'best game ever'),
(N'Angela', N'Taylor', N'angela.taylor7866@example.net', '2017-02-18', 5, N'great'),
(N'Anthony', N'White', N'anthony.white1917@example.org', '2017-02-18', 1, N'Over heated and clogged fan'),
(N'Linda', N'Young', N'linda.young4095@example.com', '2017-02-19', 5, N'I love this game, however I ordered the wrong version and had to return it. Returning it was simple.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Bailey', N'joshua.bailey4919@example.org', '2017-02-19', 5, N'good classic 2k game'),
(N'Hannah', N'Gray', N'hannah.gray6288@example.org', '2017-02-19', 5, N'greatest ps1 game hands down. as I write this I cant image how Nintendo''s games sell for 3x times the amount of ps1 ps2 games n don''t hold a candle to gems like this one'),
(N'Jose', N'Ramirez', N'jose.ramirez1548@example.com', '2017-02-19', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Luis', N'Barnes', N'luis.barnes4640@example.net', '2017-02-19', 5, N'Gift'),
(N'Aisha', N'Roberts', N'aisha.roberts7698@example.com', '2017-02-19', 4, N'I have a few of these cases but the last one I ordered there was a small black loose piece inside the game case. It is needed to keep the game in the slot. It is a little knob and we cannot put a game there and use the one slot. Amazon rectified the situation ASAP! But otherwise it is a nice case:)'),
(N'Andrew', N'Boyd', N'andrew.boyd8452@example.com', '2017-02-19', 2, N'very lame compared to a stylus for a lap top....'),
(N'William', N'Taylor', N'william.taylor6946@example.net', '2017-02-19', 2, N'Got bored quickly as the in-game progress was repetitive - by shooting swarms, unrelenting swarms - of enemies. I do admire the designs, texture and action (PC)... works smoothly... and always like to offer kudos to the programmers and artists. However (perhaps I''m getting too old for this kind of game)... exploration is practically non-existent. Puzzles are fine but not enough to entertain me. Perhaps this is your kind of game.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Phillips', N'joyce.phillips3368@example.com', '2017-02-20', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Carol', N'Green', N'carol.green9024@example.net', '2017-02-20', 5, N'Some of these reviews are either super uneducated people who are mind numbingly unqualified to use technology that their opinion and review is pointless and makes very little sense. Alright then I''m a tech guy for sure. I love collecting headphones for quality and gaming and trying out new mice. My first mouse ever was the deathadder back when it first came out and ever since then have been avoiding name brand expensive gaming mouse. My most recent love was the sharkoon drakonia which lasted 2 years before breaking and being replaced by the T1 Thunderbird 6 months ago. Fast forward to now and I currently own this one and love loads more over the thunderbird. I''m a Quake guy and name is Turok and I hate missing. My aim is everything to me that it is almost untouchable in quake and moSt other games I play. Been playing overwatch lately and the thunderbird just didn''t feel right in any way for control and was very depressing for me to play online games. It felt like the delay was...'),
(N'Steven', N'Castillo', N'steven.castillo2689@example.com', '2017-02-20', 3, N'Great mouse. I had the wired version and wanted a wireless one to un-clutter my desk. The wired option was nice because I don''t have to wait to use it when it needs a charge. Most ones with removable batteries didn''t last long in my experience. But to have to turn it on and off without a switch seems like they didn''t think out the dual mode (wired/wireless) very well when designing this mouse because it''s an annoyance I''ve never had to deal with in any other wireless mouse. The battery meter software is terrible and updates very slowly so you can''t really tell if the mouse is fully charged or not other than reading when the dock tells you it''s fully charged. The battery life is as advertised but I wish it were longer. For these drawbacks I''m giving this mouse a 3/5. If it was the wired counterpart'),
(N'Andrew', N'Russell', N'andrew.russell4903@example.com', '2017-02-20', 5, N'great game brings you back to sword fighting at it''s best.'),
(N'Angela', N'Adams', N'angela.adams5035@example.net', '2017-02-20', 4, N'It works with the PS2 slim, lots of ready to use codes. The only reason it isn''t 5 stars for me is because the load times are absolutely atrocious, the world could end and it will still be loading. However, for what it''s worth, it provides lots of replay value to your favorite games. It''s also pretty user friendly.'),
(N'Heather', N'Reyes', N'heather.reyes2399@example.org', '2017-02-20', 5, N'Too much fun!'),
(N'Wei', N'Turner', N'wei.turner3353@example.net', '2017-02-21', 3, N'It''s kind of difficult to play for my son he has 8 years'),
(N'Sofia', N'Foster', N'sofia.foster3650@example.org', '2017-02-21', 5, N'grandkids are happy'),
(N'Christine', N'Roberts', N'christine.roberts7189@example.com', '2017-02-21', 5, N'great game.'),
(N'Gary', N'Wisniewski', N'gary.wisniewski2977@example.org', '2017-02-21', 4, N'It''s a decent game but nothing nearly as good as the orginal games'),
(N'Ronald', N'Hall', N'ronald.hall7238@example.com', '2017-02-21', 3, N'Not very heavy so it will knock over when you pick up controllers from the base but Visually it looks great'),
(N'Amanda', N'Nelson', N'amanda.nelson9326@example.org', '2017-02-21', 3, N'Game is okay'),
(N'Henry', N'Wisniewski', N'henry.wisniewski6053@example.org', '2017-02-21', 3, N'Pros: Controller feels great and seems to be built well. Okay solution if used with a wire but you might as well get the Gamesir G3W and save cash. Cons: The bluetooth/wireless connection has serious problems and due to this makes it a subpar controller. Not all games will work well with this controller due to being different from the original ps3 controller. The range and strength of the bluetooth/wireless controller in connection to the ps3 is a real problem.'),
(N'David', N'Nelson', N'david.nelson4010@example.com', '2017-02-21', 3, N'Didn''t need it.'),
(N'David', N'Nelson', N'david.nelson4010@example.com', '2017-02-21', 5, N'A nice bag for my 3DS XL & Vista. Big enough to hold games and power supply. Perfect for my needs!'),
(N'Alexander', N'Thompson', N'alexander.thompson4582@example.net', '2017-02-22', 4, N'Thank you'),
(N'Ronald', N'Moore', N'ronald.moore6230@example.com', '2017-02-22', 3, N'PROS: * Intuitive functions (backlight, sound, etc) * Good selection of function add-ons (sound and mute, screen lock, etc) * Single color LEDs (rainbow gets distracting) CONS: * Brightness adjust does not have a dim setting. Only medium through bright. * Backlight turns itself back on at full bright after reboot or unplug/replug * Same quasi-space-age font as BesTek and other 87-key keyboards * Exact same frame and layout as BesTek and other 87-key keyboards * Claims "Cherry Green" equivalent for keys, but is exactly like the "Cherry Blue" keyboards I have, and less than the original Type M I have. I like this better than the other keyboards, due to single color light, and better FN+ keys; however, not storing backlight settings, and not having a lower brightness level between off and medium still gets it minus 1 star. Minus another star for claiming stiffer/clickier buttons than they really are. I would not have bought it if I''d known it was going to be the same. Cost is 20% more...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Adams', N'ryan.adams7006@example.com', '2017-02-22', 3, N'These broke literally after 3 months.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Kim', N'nadia.kim6286@example.org', '2017-02-22', 4, N'A little stiff. I''m yet to verify how it works with PS3'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Wright', N'stephanie.wright1759@example.org', '2017-02-22', 2, N'its slow moving and flashes on my screen all the time to recompute.'),
(N'Betty', N'Gonzalez', N'betty.gonzalez6143@example.org', '2017-02-22', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Anna', N'Wilson', N'anna.wilson7165@example.com', '2017-02-23', 4, N'My kid love this toys.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Gonzalez', N'elizabeth.gonzalez3504@example.net', '2017-02-23', 5, N'heck of a great game'),
(N'Angela', N'Wang', N'angela.wang5887@example.org', '2017-02-23', 3, N'The subtitle and back of the box for Scarface on the PSP (Money. Power. Respect.) should clue you in that it isn''t a port of the console version but it''s own made from the ground up experience on the handheld. We all know the console version by developer Radical Entertainment is an open world GTA clone, but the PSP version by developer Farsight Studios is a turn based strategy game where you have to take over Miami piece by piece. I like that as, while they could have just ported the console version over to the PSP, they decided to make it it''s own unique experience for the handheld. You have to build your drug empire little by little, hire henchmen, buy and sell drugs for maximum profit, pay off law enforcement, purchase buildings to store and move your coke, etc. It''s actually a pretty solid, if a bit easy, game. I''d say it''s worth the pick it up if you''re interested.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Jenkins', N'joseph.jenkins2470@example.com', '2017-02-23', 5, N'Thanks!'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Scott', N'nicholas.scott2668@example.net', '2017-02-23', 5, N'gift'),
(N'Lisa', N'Howard', N'lisa.howard4514@example.com', '2017-02-24', 4, N'Good kart racer. The controls are not as tight as Crash Team Racing, however this game is still a lot of fun. Crash was the biggest competition to Mario Kart, and hopefully more Crash kart racers will be made. The story is enjoyable and has nice cutscenes. There are two separate stories depending on if you play as Team Bandicoot or Team Cortex.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Ortiz', N'benjamin.ortiz7279@example.com', '2017-02-24', 5, N'This is quite a fun game. My son enjoys it thoroughly - and I enjoy playing it with him!'),
(N'Anna', N'Reed', N'anna.reed5913@example.net', '2017-02-24', 5, N'Works just fine!'),
(N'James', N'Ruiz', N'james.ruiz2184@example.net', '2017-02-24', 5, N'Really not a whole lot you can say here. I plugged it in and it worked exactly as I expected. What I wasn''t expecting was the beautifully long, high quality USB cable that came with it. If you''re looking for a wireless adapter for your Xbox One controller to run on Windows, this is exactly what you''re looking for. Top notch Microsoft built wireless receiver. No compatibility issues, and for anyone interested, naturally works perfectly with Windows 10.'),
(N'Judith', N'Wright', N'judith.wright3185@example.net', '2017-02-24', 4, N'It''s a great game with great graphics but don''t expect to be the best one of the series.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Tanaka', N'cheryl.tanaka7103@example.com', '2017-02-24', 5, N'Great Game even on Xbox, came on time and as described'),
(N'Kelly', N'Webb', N'kelly.webb5673@example.org', '2017-02-24', 1, N'This is my 2nd DeathAdder, and as much as I''ve wanted to like them, the first (non chroma) failed in 14 months from double clicking issues, the 2nd (chroma) in 7 months with the middle mouse button failing. Upon disassembly I found a board mounted switch in my junk pile to replace the middle mouse button switch, which was of very poor quality, and the rest of the components in the mouse weren''t much better. I love the feel and performance of the mouse when it''s new, but the internals are very very cheap, and the longevity has been abysmal for me.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Khan', N'ronald.khan3340@example.org', '2017-02-24', 3, N'Wouldn''t work on my system. Froze up a lot trying to get to the main start up screen. Worked on a different system. Don''t understand why it wouldn''t work on mine when all my other games did work. But the game did arrive fast and the sticker on front was in good condition'),
(N'Anna', N'Myers', N'anna.myers5241@example.net', '2017-02-25', 5, N'Great product. Expeditious shipping.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Foster', N'benjamin.foster4142@example.org', '2017-02-25', 5, N'Another good game'),
(N'Michael', N'Rodriguez', N'michael.rodriguez9249@example.net', '2017-02-25', 5, N'Works great on my computer!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Jenkins', N'kenneth.jenkins6296@example.com', '2017-02-25', 5, N'Works as described. I would buy it again.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Green', N'samuel.green5837@example.com', '2017-02-25', 5, N'I am always hearing men asking what game they can play with their significant other. (Flower is the correct answer by the way.) Catherine is not the correct answer. It may seem as a simple game that deals with relationships and commitment. It isnt. The game tells you that you will be judged. If you play with your girlfriend or wife I guarantee you it won''t just be the game judging you. First the good bits. This is surprisingly well written. Yes Katherine with a K is a bit of a trope as a harridan making her man grow up. Yet she isn''t wrong and plenty of women in their early thirties struggle with the same issues with their partners. (Particularly partners that play video games and watch anime such as the audience for this game.) There is also a lot more depth to the story and characters than may first appear during the playthrough, The main gameplay is two-fold. One is sitting around a bar talking to patrons and friends and answering text messages. The game has multiple endings...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Roberts', N'joshua.roberts2542@example.net', '2017-02-25', 5, N'fine thanks'),
(N'Peter', N'Campbell', N'peter.campbell6232@example.org', '2017-02-25', 5, N'As described . Highly recommended.'),
(N'Edward', N'Castillo', N'edward.castillo3716@example.org', '2017-02-26', 4, N'The perfect default installment toward the series blow D/P out of the water. I have a lot of things to say this game has a story as compelling as Mass Effect 2 one of my favorite games of all time. This game''s villainous team are a huge improvement over the pedestrian team flare villainous team. Team skull is funny they feel like they want to be part of the community but keep failing and eventually team up with Aether paradise to summon the ultra beast. Lusamine is nihilistic and crazy. the game has my favorite characters mostly Gladion and Lillie. the reason I can''t give it a perfect score because it only plays good on new 3ds.'),
(N'Mark', N'Henderson', N'mark.henderson7900@example.org', '2017-02-26', 5, N'One of the best final fantasy games I have played in a long time. Replay value is definitely high.'),
(N'Emma', N'Phillips', N'emma.phillips9267@example.net', '2017-02-26', 5, N'My son has always loved pokemon games and he enjoyed this.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Powell', N'kevin.powell1528@example.com', '2017-02-26', 4, N'works, interface is a little quirky looking for a better solution for my samsung vr'),
(N'Scott', N'Jimenez', N'scott.jimenez8646@example.com', '2017-02-27', 1, N'My controller failed, in the same way that they have for many others. The left and up on the D-pad failed at the same time as the Square and Triangle buttons failed. Sony did not bother to replace an obviously failed design version of the early controller, even though it was never dropped, had been exposed to liquid or temperature extremes, and offered no ability to pay for a way to swap it out with a new version. I highly recommend being wary of this product, if it''s an earlier generation model.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Jackson', N'cheryl.jackson6448@example.org', '2017-02-27', 4, N'Nice product'),
(N'Raymond', N'Ross', N'raymond.ross4162@example.com', '2017-02-27', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Yuki', N'Turner', N'yuki.turner4183@example.org', '2017-02-27', 5, N'I like this piece very much'),
(N'Jerry', N'King', N'jerry.king3467@example.net', '2017-02-27', 5, N'very aweosme'),
(N'Kofi', N'Tanaka', N'kofi.tanaka6347@example.org', '2017-02-28', 4, N'4 cuz after you download the second disc & play through the added stories. You only level up 10 more times. Even if you haven''t finished the added stories. For example lvl 20-30 is the max.'),
(N'Donna', N'Powell', N'donna.powell2291@example.net', '2017-02-28', 3, N'The boss fights really ruined this game for me with that armor BS, SMFH. This is still a good game but you''re better off playing Dragon Quest Heroes, Dynasty Warriors 8 Xtreme Legends complete edition or Samurai Warriors 4 II'),
(N'Justin', N'Clark', N'justin.clark9334@example.com', '2017-02-28', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Brian', N'Myers', N'brian.myers5451@example.org', '2017-02-28', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Deborah', N'Ramos', N'deborah.ramos3619@example.org', '2017-02-28', 5, N'ThANk you!'),
(N'Ivan', N'Collins', N'ivan.collins6813@example.com', '2017-02-28', 5, N'If you look at the 1-2 star reviews they didn''t even buy the game,the game looks insane on PS4 pro and the story so far is great. So for all the haters,just buy a PS4 is your gamer tag on Xbox that important?? Xbox first party''s on PC so why even have a Xbox ?'),
(N'Susan', N'Walker', N'susan.walker9915@example.com', '2017-03-01', 4, N'once i installed this bad boy i could finally beat my dad at hyper street fighter ii champion edition. thanks sanwa!'),
(N'Megan', N'Russell', N'megan.russell6333@example.org', '2017-03-01', 1, N'Online still required? WHY? It''s a singleplayer console game. No other Hitman has required online. It also loads too damn slow, like most games this generation. p.s. Why the hell is it steelbook only? That''s not a "Standard edition." The only good steelbook game case I''ve ever seen was the one for Perfect Dark Zero. Others always have these terrible disc holders.'),
(N'Joan', N'Garcia', N'joan.garcia6743@example.com', '2017-03-01', 5, N'Looks way cooler than the 360 adapter'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Young', N'rebecca.young2180@example.org', '2017-03-01', 5, N'Just what I needed. Fits my XL DS perfectly. Like how 3 of my games can be stored in it as well.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Cox', N'michelle.cox2546@example.com', '2017-03-01', 3, N'Well it charges and works with my 3ds but my big issue is that the micro usb plug is a tight fit and it broke the spring nubs on the cable I use. Now the 3ds adapter fits tight and the cable I used for my phone thay I tried it on slips off like butter. Make sure you use a seperate cable to use this adaptor and not your primary cable.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Collins', N'samantha.collins8687@example.net', '2017-03-01', 5, N'A must have!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Henderson', N'sharon.henderson1676@example.com', '2017-03-01', 5, N'So far the product arrived and is as advertised. I have both an Xbox One s controller and Xbox Elite controller and they have been charging with no issues. This item comes with 4 battery covers for your controls which you must use if you are to utilize the dock. Overall the build quality is good and the power cable is tucked in the back of the cradle which is nice for keeping the wire clutter hidden from sight.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Green', N'sofia.green2441@example.com', '2017-03-01', 5, N'Just to keep this short and to the point... I have owned ALL of the Need For Speed series of games offered on the Playstation gaming consoles. and this iteration is probably the best one yet. I''m sure there are probably a lot of die hard fans out there who may not agree with my opinion as it is an awful bold statement, but IMO I think given the re-playability, track selection, car customization options, online gameplay, graphics, pause button being avail, I feel this iteration may be hard to top. I have hours of game play into this game and it''s still just as fun and fresh as it was when new! If you like racing games that are semi realistic with GREAT graphics, then this very well may be the game you are looking for!'),
(N'Douglas', N'Miller', N'douglas.miller3564@example.org', '2017-03-01', 5, N'PERFECTO'),
(N'Heather', N'Butler', N'heather.butler2287@example.org', '2017-03-02', 5, N'It''s not the "greatest RPG" like some claim but it''s defiantly tied with Bethesda or Dragon Age for first place.'),
(N'Debra', N'Alvarez', N'debra.alvarez4522@example.net', '2017-03-02', 4, N'First let me say that StarCraft (and Brood War...) was my favorite multiplayer game, and top 3 on the single player list too. Having finally finished all 3 games, it''s time for a review. Before replaying the first 2 SC2 games, I also replayed SC and BW. I really enjoyed playing all 3 games, and especially this one which I thought was the best, even though Terran is my worse race... There are many problems with them though, let''s focus on this one game for now that to me has the fewest. 1) Jim Raynor is now a thief and murderer, not just a hero like in the past: He goes to steal from the Tal''darim and when they try to chase him off, he just kills them. Didn''t anyone in the Blizzard team thought about that for more than 5 seconds? Sure he''s a fighter and side casualties are a sad part of his life, but having a mission to steal from people that haven''t done anything to him? 2) Globally having one game per faction makes it seem like the others are out of the picture. We get to see...'),
(N'Steven', N'Parker', N'steven.parker5409@example.org', '2017-03-02', 4, N'I give this 4 stars due to the obvious. It''s truly a real AAA achievement, everybody knows that. It is beautiful, open world, solid combat, etc. But much like uncharted 4, I''m just not feeling it that much. I''m not feeling compelled to play it the way I am with Nioh or FF15 for example. Just not as fun for me. The story and characters don''t do much for me. And I''m really not loving the camera/controls. Close up action feels loose and un-intuitive. It also takes too long to open up into the full open world experience.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Cooper', N'olivia.cooper1461@example.net', '2017-03-02', 5, N'So, as we know Horizon Zero Dawn came with a lot of hype and anticipation, and so far it lives up. The game is gorgeous even on a PS4, the gameplay is superb and probably some of the best mechanics I have ever experienced. I did preorder this game from Amazon and I didn''t receive it when it came out but the day after. I feel like that''s an amazon issue not an issue win the game or publisher. Therefore I''m rating on gameplay and game experiences. Yes, the first few house are story driven and might be slow paced but once you get out of mother land and into the wild. This is truly where the game excels on all fronts. The graphics are bright, vibrant, and jaut overall gorgeous. The look and feel of Aloy is supurb. He robotic dinosaurs are always great and you feel great killing one (especially bigger ones). I hope this review helped and I hope you pick it up and support the team that brought us the Killzone series for years and years. This is their new IP and I couldn''t be happier.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Miller', N'douglas.miller3564@example.org', '2017-03-02', 5, N'100% +'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ross', N'patricia.ross5350@example.com', '2017-03-02', 4, N'It was a tad overpriced... For a 2DS. But at least my godson liked it as his christmas gift so I can''t complain too much. Also Yoshi''s New Island was a big hit so it was still worth buying.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Ivanov', N'joseph.ivanov3983@example.net', '2017-03-03', 5, N'Great looking figure and character'),
(N'Douglas', N'Moore', N'douglas.moore4165@example.com', '2017-03-03', 2, N'Limited macros makes this mouse subpar.'),
(N'Joan', N'Green', N'joan.green5716@example.org', '2017-03-03', 5, N'It''s awesome. Easy game of the year candidate early on. Yes the story could probably be more compelling but it''s plenty good enough and the gameplay is rock solid.'),
(N'Paul', N'Moore', N'paul.moore7505@example.org', '2017-03-03', 5, N'It was fun'),
(N'Sandra', N'Wright', N'sandra.wright6076@example.org', '2017-03-03', 5, N'Best Doom Ever!!!!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Thomas', N'jessica.thomas6328@example.org', '2017-03-03', 5, N'This is the best Zelda to date . I have it both digitally and physically for my Wii U and am awaiting Amazon to deliver my copy along with my Nintendo switch . Only thing that sucks is physical media games should not ever sell out . It''s unheard of in this day and age . But if you gotta buy is digitally then that''s what ya gotta do'),
(N'Jose', N'Tanaka', N'jose.tanaka9792@example.org', '2017-03-03', 4, N'Heartmelting story but the Stability of combat makes some imaginitive stretches.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Sullivan', N'katherine.sullivan8077@example.com', '2017-03-04', 4, N'awesome games to play have great stories ans gameplay'),
(N'Debra', N'Kelly', N'debra.kelly3437@example.com', '2017-03-04', 4, N'Vinyl is awesome!!! Game is fun :)'),
(N'Debra', N'Kelly', N'debra.kelly3437@example.com', '2017-03-04', 5, N'Really sweet CE! Awesome game also.'),
(N'Mei', N'Green', N'mei.green5777@example.net', '2017-03-04', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Green', N'evelyn.green3814@example.net', '2017-03-04', 5, N'This game is unbelievably good. The lighting is the best I''ve seen. The shadow Aloy casts is so realistic that I can''t remember seeing anything like it before. When your in a forest, the way the light filters through the trees is amazing. Watching the sun set/rise while looking out over an area from a mountain top, is something I never get tired of. The story and world is well thought out and realized. And amazingly detailed. Which outfit Aloy is wearing has an effect on how random npc''s respond to you. Your actions also effect how your talked about. Example would be, after you ride a machine and your seen you start being referred to as machine rider and only after your seem doing it. The combat is a hybrid of tomb raider for the projectile weapons, and dark souls melee (right shoulder buttons are light and hard and combat roll with circle button). You save respawn and fast travel with campfires that are basically bonfires. The different areas are unique and interwoven with each...'),
(N'Edward', N'Kim', N'edward.kim7424@example.org', '2017-03-04', 5, N'It works'),
(N'Omar', N'Watson', N'omar.watson5328@example.org', '2017-03-05', 1, N'Horrible game, do not buy.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wang', N'nathan.wang7229@example.com', '2017-03-05', 5, N'Critically Acclaimed as one of the best games out for the PS4 and I must agree. Combat is intuitive, exhilarating and fluid. The scenery and the characters are truly breath-taking especially in 4K. Highly highly recommended'),
(N'Priya', N'Price', N'priya.price9228@example.com', '2017-03-05', 3, N'So I''ll keep this thing brief, this wasn''t that good of a game. I disliked the fact that you couldn''t fight off the damn alien and it was hard to play even in the beginning. If you''re the type of guy who likes strategy gaming have fun because this is the game for you but I like to go out guns blazing instead of hiding. I will say the graphics and story on the game itself far acceded any of my expectations. But you have to play to really see if you like it, from personal experience don''t ever go off of what other people say. Hopefully you do enjoy because it''s a great game just not for everyone.'),
(N'Scott', N'Turner', N'scott.turner3712@example.net', '2017-03-05', 5, N'Fantastic screen protectors.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Webb', N'tomasz.webb2194@example.com', '2017-03-05', 4, N'This one the best DBZ game since budica days man the graphics on ps4 plus the combat plus it new storyline help make a origin dragon Ball z game'),
(N'Yuki', N'Kelly', N'yuki.kelly3206@example.net', '2017-03-05', 5, N'easy to use, play all your old game boy advance games and, with some doing, nintendo and sega too!'),
(N'Heather', N'Myers', N'heather.myers7631@example.com', '2017-03-05', 3, N'Great game but horrific matchmaking unless you''re playing with a full team. Near impossible to carry a team solo and if one player stinks then it''s an uphill battle. Was an awesome game but unless you really like pain then don''t bother unless you have a dedicated team. Fix the matchmaking blizzard! It gets worse with every season'),
(N'Ethan', N'Raghunathan', N'ethan.raghunathan7570@example.net', '2017-03-06', 3, N'Nice game to my nephews'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ramos', N'jeremy.ramos6785@example.org', '2017-03-06', 5, N'My son enjoys playing this game. Obtaining via digital code was easy and my son had his game within the hour.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ramos', N'jeremy.ramos6785@example.org', '2017-03-06', 5, N'My son enjoys playing this game.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Morgan', N'nancy.morgan4484@example.net', '2017-03-06', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Nancy', N'Morgan', N'nancy.morgan4484@example.net', '2017-03-06', 5, N'Purchased this as a gift and it was a hit. Great for anyone who used to love find waldo :)'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Chavez', N'nicholas.chavez2341@example.net', '2017-03-06', 3, N'not impressed'),
(N'Charles', N'Powell', N'charles.powell3431@example.com', '2017-03-06', 5, N'I was going to write a big long review, but assume most have watched the reviews. So I will just say that this might be the greatest game I have ever played. It covers almost all genres except racing...unless you include riding your hacked machines.'),
(N'Amy', N'Brown', N'amy.brown9094@example.net', '2017-03-06', 4, N'I really like this game! As usual, I wish it was a little longer which is the reason I gave it a 4/5. I also don''t care for how long it can take to kill some of the enemies. I thought this was a neat game, especially for the fact that I had played this before I had a project about gods/goddesses for a class. I actually did my project on Isis, which just happened to be in this game! As I was researching it for my project, I realized it was following the story of this game with Horus & Set. I beat this game with my boyfriend and it is up to 4-player without split screen!'),
(N'Christopher', N'Nelson', N'christopher.nelson8339@example.net', '2017-03-06', 5, N'Had to have it! Good condition thanks!!'),
(N'Megan', N'Jimenez', N'megan.jimenez7512@example.com', '2017-03-06', 4, N'fun game so far'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Robinson', N'carolyn.robinson5095@example.com', '2017-03-06', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Linda', N'Young', N'linda.young4095@example.com', '2017-03-07', 5, N'Came as described...no issues'),
(N'Karen', N'Mendoza', N'karen.mendoza9545@example.com', '2017-03-07', 1, N'Fake, ingenuine product. The picture shoes an OEM controller. You will receive a cheap Chinese knockoff, with no Xbox logo, no breakaway, a shorter cable (OEMs were ten feet) and crappy plastic. The controller will not work inside of modded BIOs or homebrew. Just spend the money on a genuine proudct instead.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Miller', N'hannah.miller8729@example.org', '2017-03-07', 5, N'Holds plenty of titles.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Scott', N'samuel.scott4901@example.org', '2017-03-07', 5, N'Insten Battery Door Compatible With Sony PSP 1000 Series, Black Just like the original battery door. Works great!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ruiz', N'michelle.ruiz9813@example.net', '2017-03-07', 5, N'bit cheaply made but still works'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ruiz', N'michelle.ruiz9813@example.net', '2017-03-07', 5, N'i love this game'),
(N'Janet', N'Robinson', N'janet.robinson4267@example.org', '2017-03-07', 5, N'I have always been a home theater surround sound guy. Headsets always seemed to be for chatting online and I was never really into that. I have owned a few in my life and they were always kind of meh. The sound was never as good as my home theater setup so I always ended up selling them or giving them away. As I have gotten more into online gaming the need for a headset has increased and its hard to wear a headset and listen to my home theater. So I decided to give it one last chance and try one more headset. With my of finding a satisfying experience VERY low here are my thoughts on this headset. Build Quality - This headset is a tank! It feels premium. I don''t feel like its going to break if I toss it down or accidentally knock it off my couch. 5 out of 5 Customization - One of the reasons I chose this particular headset was because I can pretty much make it look anyway I want and I persoanlly think most ''gaming'' headsets are a little tacky. 4.5 out of 5 Comfort - I have worn...'),
(N'Luis', N'Perez', N'luis.perez3786@example.com', '2017-03-07', 3, N'Getting tired of these games. graphics are very good but will spend a lot of time stumbling around and running around looking for stuff or places.'),
(N'Robert', N'Hughes', N'robert.hughes2343@example.net', '2017-03-07', 5, N'7 Metal Slug games for the price of 1. Anthology gives you the option to turn off unlimited continues and adjust the number of lives, to adjust difficulty. All 7 games are 2-player, and can be played 1-player as well. Well worth the price if you''re a fan of games like Contra.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Diaz', N'alexander.diaz1073@example.com', '2017-03-07', 5, N'Recommended'),
(N'Larry', N'Ross', N'larry.ross3183@example.org', '2017-03-07', 4, N'Very old school. You are left alone to figure out what to do in missions. It was frustrating at times given that you don''t get any hints or anything to help you figure out what to do. But overall a fun game.'),
(N'John', N'Bennett', N'john.bennett9221@example.net', '2017-03-07', 5, N'Excellent!'),
(N'Charles', N'Fisher', N'charles.fisher5328@example.org', '2017-03-07', 5, N'Exactly as described, works great'),
(N'Ryan', N'Evans', N'ryan.evans4927@example.org', '2017-03-08', 4, N'Really seems to get the job done. The first one didn''t work up to par but customer service sent another quickly and this one works well. Thank you!'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brown', N'katherine.brown2144@example.com', '2017-03-09', 3, N'Ok, Dont get me wrong this thing is a great sim Wheel, I tested on Project Cars, Nascar Heat, Driveclub, and Dirt Rally. The Wheel overall feels good, great sturdy build. The Force feedback is very strong and accurate Depending on the game your playing. Project Cars was in my experience the only time i noticed any Force feedback Dead zone about a Mm or 2 (very small), thats to be expected with a gear driven wheel tho. Also it can get loud, you will hear chatter and popping on higher FFB settings. If noise is a issue 4 you then you should look into a belt driven wheel. Can be pretty quite on lower settings also though. The pedals are Grade A Love them the brake mod feels perfect After it gets broke in. Only Problom is a Big one. ALOT of These G29s are Defective They Stop working Randomly, and the wheel makes a bad ringing sound when turning, i had 2 get a replacement for Mine squeaking very badly. Amazon sent a new one and ive had it 4 days and it started squeaking even louder than...'),
(N'Aisha', N'Sullivan', N'aisha.sullivan6117@example.org', '2017-03-09', 5, N'A gift that was well received.'),
(N'Charles', N'Robinson', N'charles.robinson8110@example.org', '2017-03-09', 5, N'This Chatboost Chat Pad has worked out much better than I was expecting. First thing that I have to praise is the clever integration with my PS4 Dualshock controller. Easy to attach and remove, but it is so well designed that it sits very securely in place. It doesn''t wiggle or slide at all, but most importantly, it is not in the way of my grip on the controller. I was worried that this my make my grip uncomfortable, or cause me to drop the controller more often, or just be in my way... None of that is true. It''s practically "invisible" to my handling of the controller. Pairing was effortless, and I don''t have any connectivity issues at all. The convenience of the lighted keyboard is awesome for quick messaging in the dark, or anytime another player deserves praise for great gameplay, or "constructive criticism" for less desirable behavior. And there is nothing like being able to flip a switch for more battery power when the controller is getting low, but you don''t want to or can''t...'),
(N'Omar', N'Tanaka', N'omar.tanaka1343@example.org', '2017-03-09', 4, N'Pretty good keyboard for the price. The lighting is hard to see unless looking directly down at it.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Powell', N'nancy.powell9559@example.org', '2017-03-10', 5, N'This game has lasting appeal to me. Nice game.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Russell', N'jerry.russell2909@example.net', '2017-03-10', 5, N'Game works, Fast shipping'),
(N'Emily', N'Wood', N'emily.wood9439@example.com', '2017-03-10', 5, N'Fun old game for PS2. Glad I found it again. I got mine from Bass5441. As described!'),
(N'Lucia', N'Gomez', N'lucia.gomez2988@example.org', '2017-03-10', 3, N'its an ok game but i don''t really know hoe to do the mission mode. like i can only do the challenges.'),
(N'William', N'Rivera', N'william.rivera2644@example.com', '2017-03-10', 5, N'brother loved his gift!'),
(N'Victoria', N'Jones', N'victoria.jones4291@example.org', '2017-03-10', 5, N'Excellent Game'),
(N'Patricia', N'Johnson', N'patricia.johnson6961@example.net', '2017-03-10', 4, N'Tough but fun..very complex but I have never played before'),
(N'Victoria', N'Sullivan', N'victoria.sullivan5635@example.net', '2017-03-10', 5, N'I wanted something that gave the Switch Pro Controller sticks more grip. These covers fit very nicely and blend in with the controller very well. Exactly what I was looking for. I gotta be honest though, the Geltabz I have on my dualshock 4 do have more grip, but they aren''t solid black. [Update] After using Geltabz and Grip-tis for a while now I have to say these are the best for long lasting. The little bumps on the Geltabz eventually wore down and it has a good bit less grip on them. While Grip-its stayed exactly the same. These are the best you can buy.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Moore', N'lisa.moore7917@example.com', '2017-03-11', 5, N'This game is a lot of fun to me. Maybe not much replay value after you land the Platinum trophy but it most certainly is a enjoyable game! Much respect to those who designed this game, good taste from the creators! This game reminds me MUCH of games like DIABLO and also some of the DYNASTY WARRIORS games. Strong recommendation to buy this game. It is VERY easy but fun and addictive.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Collins', N'daniel.collins5548@example.org', '2017-03-11', 5, N'Was a gift, they loved it.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Collins', N'daniel.collins5548@example.org', '2017-03-11', 5, N'Gave as a gift, they loved it!'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Rogers', N'hiroshi.rogers9372@example.net', '2017-03-11', 5, N'What a great game Nintendo has made! Very fun! Exploring, puzzle solving, adventure. Fun open world gameplay. Would recommend to everyone who has a Wiiu, to buy, play and end the Wiiu''s run on a high note!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Wood', N'ryan.wood5400@example.org', '2017-03-11', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Shirley', N'Reed', N'shirley.reed4713@example.com', '2017-03-11', 5, N'Best controller unless you want to buy the original ones'),
(N'Donald', N'Flores', N'donald.flores3279@example.org', '2017-03-11', 5, N'Came as described.'),
(N'Charles', N'Evans', N'charles.evans4125@example.net', '2017-03-11', 5, N'Superb game!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Suzuki', N'raymond.suzuki7121@example.com', '2017-03-12', 1, N'mic not working'),
(N'Gregory', N'Jimenez', N'gregory.jimenez7848@example.net', '2017-03-12', 5, N'Resident Evil + PSVR = Amazing. Just got my PSVR Monday and started playing this again and its like a completely different game. Love it'),
(N'Ethan', N'Suzuki', N'ethan.suzuki2096@example.com', '2017-03-12', 4, N'Enjoyable game. Repetitive to a degree, but as you progress continues to be enjoyable. Graphics are superb, the voice acting starts out fun however the commentaries, I believe, become distractive. Plenty of loot and upgrades to also keep the game interesting. Very large environment to explore. Sandbox games typically overwhelm me but this game is different in that as you defeat an area, in the order which you chose, progresses the storyline. My 13 year old son also enjoys this game!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Robinson', N'andrea.robinson5084@example.org', '2017-03-12', 5, N'Works very well, no problems at all. Shipped very fast.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Reed', N'shirley.reed4713@example.com', '2017-03-12', 5, N'Works with Wii U and computer (need drivers)'),
(N'Kelly', N'Jackson', N'kelly.jackson5077@example.net', '2017-03-13', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Nicole', N'Gutierrez', N'nicole.gutierrez4388@example.net', '2017-03-13', 5, N'This is a great quality product, definitely worth the buy. It goes well with my new RGB (LED) keyboard and its a nice size too, not small and not too big like some of the others. Loving the LED colors,plus It feels great in my hand. 10/10 5 stars definitely a great buy.'),
(N'Megan', N'Jones', N'megan.jones8190@example.org', '2017-03-13', 4, N'50 mini games. That''s a ridiculous amount of multiplayer mini games. Unfortunately, not all of them are great. But that''s OK. The biggest disappointment here is the "main game". There''s just not much here for a single player. Some of the older super monkey ball games have great main games.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Lopez', N'stephen.lopez9024@example.com', '2017-03-13', 5, N'Awwwww yeah'),
(N'Susan', N'Raghunathan', N'susan.raghunathan9831@example.net', '2017-03-13', 5, N'It''s a great game, takes time to get into it (learning how to get weapons, upgrades for the skill of you and the team) but overall this games graphics are amazing, it''s a huge map and doesn''t glitch as you move along the map with you''re vehicle. I strongly suggest this game it''s nothing compared to The Division'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Reyes', N'kathleen.reyes2677@example.net', '2017-03-13', 5, N'SO NICE !'),
(N'Susan', N'Murphy', N'susan.murphy5745@example.net', '2017-03-13', 5, N'Awesome. Fast delivery'),
(N'Joshua', N'Roberts', N'joshua.roberts2542@example.net', '2017-03-13', 5, N'Excellent Thank you'),
(N'Amy', N'Foster', N'amy.foster5202@example.com', '2017-03-13', 5, N'My last razer mouse lasted about 5 years. Most peoples don''t last that long, but my middle scroll clicker finally stopped working and i use it all the time in gaming. so I got a new one. You can make it change all types of colors. Great mouse, i hope it holds up at least half as long as the one its replacing'),
(N'Steven', N'Patel', N'steven.patel2944@example.net', '2017-03-13', 2, N'came broken, the right shoulder button hangs when it is not upright at times.'),
(N'Steven', N'Patel', N'steven.patel2944@example.net', '2017-03-13', 3, N'not great but would work in a pinch, mine didn''t last very long but I use them every day. Would be good for someone who only plays on occasion, if you play a lot though get a better one.'),
(N'Laura', N'Murphy', N'laura.murphy4864@example.com', '2017-03-14', 5, N'great gift'),
(N'Carol', N'Ortiz', N'carol.ortiz6228@example.net', '2017-03-14', 3, N'I did enjoy the ending to this game, but the gameplay could be better and there are parts of the story that are not enjoyable. I bought it for four bucks total though so I win.'),
(N'Michael', N'Mendoza', N'michael.mendoza1674@example.net', '2017-03-14', 5, N'My husband loved it'),
(N'Jerry', N'Smith', N'jerry.smith8704@example.org', '2017-03-14', 5, N'Assassin''s Creed IV Black Flag gave a great description of land battles and sea battles with ships.'),
(N'Maria', N'Foster', N'maria.foster5323@example.com', '2017-03-14', 4, N'This worked well overall, but the plastic looks and feels very cheap.'),
(N'Larry', N'Moore', N'larry.moore5505@example.com', '2017-03-14', 3, N'Nicely built controller. The A and B buttons work well but the Start and Select stick sometimes. I had to exercise the D-Pad a little because they wouldn''t register at first but now seem to be working fine.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Hall', N'anthony.hall2441@example.com', '2017-03-14', 3, N'Good budget headset. Comfortable for long periods of time with its over the ear design when not wearing glasses. When wearing glasses these do become uncomfortable and cannot stand more than about 20 minutes of wear. This comes in a single 3.5mm jack with the adapter to split the signal to plug into respective headphone/ mic jacks on a computer. The splitter died after 2 days of use and I had to replace it, but after about 9 months this headset still works.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Hall', N'anthony.hall2441@example.com', '2017-03-14', 4, N'Blizzard did a great job designing this game and concept. Imagine World of Warcraft mixed with Call of Duty. This is all online play so you must have Xbox Live. I would give this 5 stars but matchmaking can be slow no matter how you queue.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Khan', N'brandon.khan7907@example.net', '2017-03-14', 5, N'That is to say, I would probably have loved it if it had worked. Unfortunately the game will not run on my PC a HP BO All In One running Windows 10. This is only the second one to do so, however, and for the price I can''t complain. I would advise others running Windows 10 not to purchase this game, and to make sure others for earlier versions of Windows will work.'),
(N'Scott', N'Wood', N'scott.wood2591@example.com', '2017-03-14', 5, N'It''s nice, a little learning curve , but getting it!'),
(N'Mark', N'Lopez', N'mark.lopez6727@example.org', '2017-03-15', 4, N'good game'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Nelson', N'jeremy.nelson1734@example.net', '2017-03-15', 5, N'Great Item - works fine just as the original would'),
(N'John', N'Hall', N'john.hall2660@example.net', '2017-03-15', 5, N'This was a gift, but my daughter loves it'),
(N'Christopher', N'Lewis', N'christopher.lewis8221@example.net', '2017-03-15', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Angela', N'Hernandez', N'angela.hernandez7866@example.org', '2017-03-15', 5, N'For some reason my Playstation 4 has trouble verifying my debit card on every purchase so I''ve started buying digital codes through Amazon. It''s actually a simple process and this is now my main source of getting Playstation Plus.'),
(N'Frank', N'Ramos', N'frank.ramos3890@example.com', '2017-03-16', 5, N'Ahh, the memories.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Young', N'nicole.young9722@example.com', '2017-03-16', 5, N'Delivered on time, product itself works flawless.'),
(N'Amy', N'Kim', N'amy.kim1612@example.net', '2017-03-16', 2, N'As a skilled coast-guard officer, you''ll have to use every resource available to battle a shipful of hideous abominations and the game''s camera.'),
(N'Amy', N'Kim', N'amy.kim1612@example.net', '2017-03-16', 5, N'An amazing journey to exotic locations & wild people who you get to punch over and over again.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Bennett', N'kyle.bennett5472@example.net', '2017-03-16', 5, N'This is the reason I got a PS4. Ive had every Xbox and have been using my XB1 since launch but just grabbed a PS4 because I always was jealous of this game and had to play it. It has lived up to my expectations and beyond. Im a few hours in and the story telling, graphics and game play are top notch. I cannot believe this game is several years old and is still better than the stuff coming out today. If you are looking for a great single player experience this is a great game for a great price.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Reed', N'kofi.reed2460@example.com', '2017-03-16', 5, N'product is just as described , great service'),
(N'Mei', N'Allen', N'mei.allen9705@example.org', '2017-03-16', 2, N'I didn''t care for this game. It was bright and colorful but the game play, like all 3-d Mario games, is difficult to aim jumps and you are always guessing and checking. Mario games are about precision and timing and that''s hard to blend with a 3-d environment.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Singh', N'jeffrey.singh3960@example.org', '2017-03-16', 4, N'It''s good'),
(N'Sharon', N'Reed', N'sharon.reed3148@example.com', '2017-03-16', 5, N'One word...AWESOME!!!!'),
(N'Judith', N'Wood', N'judith.wood9626@example.com', '2017-03-16', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Nancy', N'Kowalski', N'nancy.kowalski7976@example.org', '2017-03-17', 5, N'Great product'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Perry', N'cheryl.perry8517@example.org', '2017-03-18', 5, N'Good console although the PlayStation 3 is better.'),
(N'John', N'Chavez', N'john.chavez2445@example.net', '2017-03-18', 4, N'Fun online play'),
(N'Aisha', N'Clark', N'aisha.clark2145@example.com', '2017-03-18', 4, N'Not bad'),
(N'Sandra', N'Bailey', N'sandra.bailey9094@example.com', '2017-03-18', 5, N'Very fun game to play, a bit old but i still enjoy playing it.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Bailey', N'sandra.bailey9094@example.com', '2017-03-18', 5, N'tons of new items etc. and new features. i loved it.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Morales', N'nadia.morales4348@example.net', '2017-03-18', 2, N'I''ve almost completely lost interest after two levels of the "campaign" which is a disjointed series of tutorials, the theme of which is "who cares?"'),
(N'Richard', N'Torres', N'richard.torres9982@example.com', '2017-03-18', 5, N'Came two days later, game works great, would purchase more from this seller. Thanks!'),
(N'John', N'White', N'john.white4638@example.com', '2017-03-18', 5, N'another great bethesda game!'),
(N'Ravi', N'White', N'ravi.white3452@example.com', '2017-03-18', 5, N'Love being able to buy these time cards from Amazon'),
(N'Joan', N'Foster', N'joan.foster4809@example.org', '2017-03-19', 5, N'Love it never want to leave the game Its best shooter i play so far.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Collins', N'kevin.collins8978@example.net', '2017-03-19', 4, N'It was neat. Not as great as the hype train had me believe, but what else should I have expected?'),
(N'Hannah', N'Wood', N'hannah.wood4128@example.org', '2017-03-19', 4, N'Tatsunoko vs Capcom is in the long line of "Versus" games from Capcom. This time the famous game company is pitting their characters against anime characters from Tatsunoko animation studios. Most of these characters will likely not be known to most US audiences accept for a couple characters from Gatchaman aka G-force & Battle Of The Planets as it''s known in the States. Fans of the long running series will feel right at home with the controls. I would highly advise getting a pro controller because using the wii remote/nunchuck makes fighting games very difficult. The graphics are great and the fighting mechanics are smooth. The cast of characters is really varied but not as robust as the Marvel vs Capcom games. If your a fan of this series then I highly recommend it. On the plus side for those Nintendo lovers, this is a Wii exclusive.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ward', N'ravi.ward3929@example.net', '2017-03-19', 3, N'Meh. First off, I will admit that I am not the biggest fan of jrpg''s. However I am a fan of great games regardless of their genre and so with all the good rviews decided to give Nier a shot. This is just a meh any way you slice it. Combat alone is a 5, but the story, silly dialog, bad camera angles and crappy save system are constant disappointments. Wish I had redboxed it or waited for a deep discount rather than dropping full priced coin on it.'),
(N'Donald', N'James', N'donald.james8890@example.com', '2017-03-19', 5, N'Works great for gamecube controllers to reach further.'),
(N'James', N'Brooks', N'james.brooks9180@example.net', '2017-03-19', 1, N'Well, it''s definitely a PS3, albeit a cheaply made, cut-corners model of the system. Due to the placement of the disc drive, which is now a slider on top of the system vs mechanically fed like the fat model or the second iteration, it''s loud, too! You can hear every movement of the discs loading up or installing. It didn''t bother me at first, but coupled with how you load the disc-pull it off from and push it back onto a disc spindle mechanism, the whole thing screams value engineering. Also, 12GB flash for storage is an absolute joke. If you add in a new HDD, make sure you get a mounting bracket to go with it-the system does not come with one natively. Avoid, avoid, avoid. This system''s user base deserved a better sendoff than this, Sony.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Davis', N'lisa.davis1872@example.net', '2017-03-19', 5, N'Got my video game and I love it it''s fun to play'),
(N'Dennis', N'Hernandez', N'dennis.hernandez3545@example.com', '2017-03-19', 4, N'Ok'),
(N'Gregory', N'Kelly', N'gregory.kelly8624@example.org', '2017-03-20', 5, N'The ultimate co-op shooter returns! Borderlands 2 is one of my favorite games of all time. Me and my friends absolutely adored playing through this behemoth of a game back in 2012 when it released and now we get to do it all over again with many subtle improvements! I have nkt yet played the Pre-Sequel, but I assume it plays about as good as BL2 and honestly even if you get this for one of the two games you''re getting one heck of a deal.'),
(N'Priya', N'Price', N'priya.price9228@example.com', '2017-03-20', 5, N'This game brought back a load of great memories for me, and with all of the games on this disc there''s a very small chance of getting bored.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Campbell', N'deborah.campbell5987@example.org', '2017-03-20', 5, N'worked great with my controllers.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Evans', N'brenda.evans5481@example.com', '2017-03-20', 5, N'Works well very fun to play Thanks so much Amazon'),
(N'Barbara', N'Turner', N'barbara.turner8362@example.com', '2017-03-20', 3, N'I have big hands so my fingers always extend over the end of the mouse. Not usually a problem but for some reason they made the right side of this mouse curve out at the end, so it gets very wide and the RMB goes all the way out to the edge. So where am I supposed to put my ring finger? It either drags against the mat or rubs against the sharp corner of the mouse button and gets pinched when I right click. And either way it doesn''t get much grip because it is a straight finger lying across a concave shape. Maybe they intended it to rest on the right click as well, but having two fingers on one button feels very unnatural, causes me to accidentally click, and severely reduces the grip which is already a problem because the plastic is very slick and the only grip comes from 2 tiny rubber strips on either side. For contrast my Zowie ec1 has no rubber grips but the entire plastic shell is grippy. Its also very smooth and comfy with rounded edges. I had to return this Deathadder....'),
(N'Brian', N'Ortiz', N'brian.ortiz7451@example.com', '2017-03-20', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Kelly', N'Cook', N'kelly.cook6937@example.com', '2017-03-20', 5, N'Looks good!! Fits everything for this item!!!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Kelly', N'yuki.kelly1090@example.com', '2017-03-20', 5, N'Great value and very satisfied with purchase'),
(N'Ravi', N'Kim', N'ravi.kim2062@example.org', '2017-03-20', 4, N'I think this is a good game , I didn''t finish it yet it''s alittle hard for me to do some of the missions'),
(N'Emily', N'Kim', N'emily.kim3200@example.org', '2017-03-20', 5, N'arrived well and intact'),
(N'Noah', N'Thomas', N'noah.thomas2630@example.com', '2017-03-21', 5, N'Works and charges great for the nintendo DS Lite. The only problem is if you have a clear case for it like I do. You have to take off the case to charge it. It makes the DS Lite bigger with the case. So will not fit in the slot charger dock.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Bell', N'douglas.bell7105@example.com', '2017-03-21', 1, N'This game is every bit as embarrassingly bad as the reviews say. I pre ordered this and after playing Horizon this was frustratingly pathetic. Oh my my my. Electronic Arts should be ashamed. This PS4 pro optimized game is a joke and you''ll see similar graphics in the PS3. These graphics are not what you see in trailers. Glitches galore. Animations are what you see in mariocart and I had to return this wretched crap and now it''s wasting even more of my time to have me write this review but I hope you don''t buy it as a result. Wow.'),
(N'Anita', N'Parker', N'anita.parker8801@example.com', '2017-03-21', 5, N'This worked very well for plugging my Sega Saturn into my older 1080p Sony TV. I was convinced I was going to have to buy an XRGB-mini Framemeister after seeing how poor the video quality was with the composite RCA plugs (yellow, red, white). I''m glad I tried this first! I''m sure the video quality of the Framemeister would be better but overall, this is good enough that I can enjoy it and I saved myself over $300. Plus if I ever do splurge for a Framemeister, this will be a good way to connect it to that so it will still be of use. One point of confusion for me was why this cable had the yellow video cord with it. Really, it''s just a duplicate so you can plug your Saturn into either s-video or composite. When you use the s-video connection, you plug that in plus the red and white for audio and that''s it. If you do decide to get one of these for the upgraded signal, just make sure your TV has an s-video plug as those are getting more rare on newer TV''s.'),
(N'Emily', N'Anderson', N'emily.anderson6024@example.org', '2017-03-21', 1, N'Not a ME fanboy, I haven''t even played the other iterations although I am faintly aware of the contentious ME 3 Ending debacle. All I can say is no thank you to this thing. I purchased it off the hype from the other games and was expecting a next gen masterpiece of a game. Instead, you get garbage animation, story, buggy design, and moronic characters. Looks like something that should have come out a decade ago. Next time perhaps focus on making a decent game instead of skimping on animation and wading into social/political issues. You obviously aren''t attuned to your demographic. Dont buy this trash.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Evans', N'patrick.evans8650@example.net', '2017-03-21', 4, N'This game really gives you a bang for your buck. I''m 25 hours in and I think I''m about half way through. The animations are quite a bit choppy, but when you think of modern games like Etrian Odyssey that have no animations at all, it looks pretty good. I have to say that the character designs and monsters are great. You really have to level up your weapon skills to improve your accuracy, but that is one of the only frustrations. The dungeons are fun with a few puzzles mixed in and they are quite lengthy. Highly recommended!'),
(N'Katherine', N'Kim', N'katherine.kim5808@example.com', '2017-03-21', 5, N'son loved it'),
(N'Andrew', N'Moore', N'andrew.moore9732@example.net', '2017-03-22', 5, N'Fun for the family.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Cruz', N'ravi.cruz9706@example.com', '2017-03-22', 5, N'In 1992, Mario''s nemesis, Wario, debuted in Super Mario Land 2: 6 Golden Coins for Game Boy. Since then, Wario has made his OWN mark as the "anti"-hero in consecutive sequels for the Game Boy Color, Game Boy Advance, and so on. In Wario Land 2, Syrup the evil pirate and her henchmen storm into Wario Castle and steal his treasure right from under his nose! Once Wario realizes what just happened, he pulls out all of the stops to get it all back! Our comical, VERY greedy mischief maker will punch, throw, and stomp his way through 25 levels. Unlike Super Mario Land 3, Wario doesn''t die in this game. But what WILL happen is that he gets a variety of "aliments" whenever he touches certain enemies (and please forgive my wording): he gets flattened into a pancake, allowing him to crawl under smaller nooks and crannies; he gets stung like a bee, allowing him to fly up to an otherwise unreachable platform; he gets drunk and wobbles back and forth; he gets set on fire and runs around in a...'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Campbell', N'hiroshi.campbell3386@example.net', '2017-03-22', 3, N'Meh. Do not buy it if you have an enough room space. The lens quality is so bad that a camera recognition goes bad.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Edwards', N'patrick.edwards7974@example.com', '2017-03-22', 5, N'When I first saw trailers for this game last year, I thought it was going to be just another graphics demo. I assumed this would be like Killzone where the graphics are amazing but the actual game is mediocre. Fast forward a couple months and I''m stuck playing only Overwatch, which is a fantastic game, but I wanted more. Battlefield and Call of Duty were fun for a while but I wanted something new. Given that the only other big title coming out besides Horizon was Mass Effect: Andromeda, I didn''t really have to worry about what other games I could be saving up for. So I took the risk and I bought the digital version. Sure, I could have bought the disk and returned it if it wasn''t any good, but digital download is too good albeit the no return policy. But I am damn glad I choose to get it digital and it was well worth $60. I would never want to return this game because its surprisingly replayable. The game has a fun, well paced story. The game mechanics feel pleasantly polished. Even...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Martin', N'jonathan.martin4484@example.net', '2017-03-22', 1, N'Promotion has many hoops to jump through..and still didn''t get the in game items.. so don''t count on it. since I already had a different old Ubisoft account I could not link the other two together, more than likely, even though I bought the PS4 game. It was prob. sent to a PC format, because that was the only way it recognized me. Unfortunately, there is no way to contact anyone, because it was passed through Amazon, Twitch, then Ubisoft.'),
(N'Dee', N'Khan', N'dee.khan2123@example.org', '2017-03-22', 5, N'Great game, the driving at first was a little hasty, but you get use to it. Awesome free world game to play both single and online.'),
(N'Megan', N'Edwards', N'megan.edwards2673@example.net', '2017-03-23', 3, N'The first thing you''ll notice is just how expansive and beautiful this open world game is. It almost puts GTA V to shame in its draw distances and overall performance - especially remarkable given how limited the horsepower is of the Xbox One. Overall the game is fun but not enough to drag me into a 30+ hour commitment. It feels like more of the same to me. Yes it''s slightly different than other military shooters out there. Yes it employs a good amount of strategy into the mix with your squad and commands, etc. Is it fun? Sure. Uninspired? Yes. Just like the motion picture industry big budget game studios pump out the same stuff with more technology or a slightly different twist on a genre to differentiate a game just enough from similar ones. This one does that. It looks gorgeous but after awhile you''ll feel like you''ve played this game before. Ubisoft needed a redemption and this title certainly does it for them. Unfortunately playing it safe and keeping the company afloat...'),
(N'Amara', N'Walker', N'amara.walker1976@example.org', '2017-03-23', 5, N'I don''t own a Playstation 4. I''m not sure it''s worth buying, as I have an Xbox One and a decent gaming machine. But I''ve been watching the development of Horizon Zero Dawn for a long time and oh did I want to play it... So when an opportunity arose shortly after launch to take a long weekend with the wife and kids out of town, I rented a Playstation 4 for more than I''m willing to admit and picked up a copy of HZD. Time and money well spent... Science Fiction is hard to do right. It''s easy to create a bottleneck of lore where one crucial element of your story is necessary to understand and accept in order to make everything else you''re making up make sense. It''s also easy to work yourself into a circle in a way in which you create your own paradoxes to your own story, thus making it hard to fully appreciate. HZD however predicts a rather-believable short-term future in order to justify a mind-numbing distant future, and then places the player beyond that distant future to only then...'),
(N'Daniel', N'Young', N'daniel.young6682@example.org', '2017-03-23', 5, N'Great gong experience, love the open world map and great grafics.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Smith', N'lauren.smith1125@example.net', '2017-03-23', 5, N'Even to this day, SMB 2: Yoshi''s Island is a great game with excellent replay-ability. The pastel graphics fit the game nicely from scene to scene, and the music is toe-tapping and catchy. It was nice to be able to expand on Yoshi after Super Mario World and actually have him as a playable character in his own game. For enthusiasts, I highly recommend getting this game for their Super Nintendo system. The game holds up well, however, it is fairly easy in my opinion.'),
(N'Steven', N'Ward', N'steven.ward9563@example.net', '2017-03-23', 4, N'Tale as old as time True as it can be Barely even released Then Sony bends Unexpectedly Just a little change Small to say the least Both a little scared Neither one prepared The Boy and the beast -- The following review is for the PS4 original (not Pro) console A game stuck in development hell since late ps2/early ps3 era has finally been released. Despite the hype, the game came out pretty decent overall with amazing story/lore and world building, but stuck in the past in terms gameplay. Story: You wake up next to a chained up creature you named Trico. You try to get home, but realize you need Trico''s help to escape the torn down you were placed in. Along the way you build an emotion bond with each other while discovering the lore of the world through gameplay interactions and visual perception of the world rather than solely relying on narrative. To get a full grasp of what is happening you have to put the pieces together yourself instead of the game telling you what is happening...'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Raghunathan', N'kimberly.raghunathan6733@example.org', '2017-03-23', 5, N'**The following review is rather lengthy and in-depth. If you enjoy those kinds of reviews, I encourage you to read this one. The other thing I should mention is that I preordered this game from amazon, but it didn''t arrive on time. I ended up getting the game elsewhere for the Will U, but will likely purchase the Nintendo Switch version from Amazon in the future. With that out of the way, on to the review.** Wow, who would have thought that after thirty incredible years of Zelda, with some of the best and most critically acclaimed games ever, Nintendo would manage to create what is, hands down, the best Zelda game to date in the form of The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild. A Link to the Past, Ocarina of Time, Majoras Mask, it is time to step aside. The Zelda series has a new champion. Breath of the Wild is a Masterpiece, and feels destined to be a classic. The Legend of Zelda series is, I must admit, my favorite video game series of all time (which is my favorite past-time) I...'),
(N'Gregory', N'Morgan', N'gregory.morgan5516@example.net', '2017-03-24', 3, N'Purchased as a gift. Recipient was pleased.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Martinez', N'evelyn.martinez9616@example.org', '2017-03-24', 1, N'This game is really bad. The shooting mechanics are terrible. After several attempts to adjust sensitivity nothing helps. The dialogue and storyline is okay but everything could be so much better. Menu options and layout is confusing and a hassle to get to learn. Definitely not what I was expecting. Oh well. Back to Ghost Recon and Nier Automata'),
(N'John', N'Gomez', N'john.gomez2913@example.net', '2017-03-24', 2, N'too difficult to master'),
(N'Christine', N'Scott', N'christine.scott1621@example.net', '2017-03-24', 3, N'I feel the same way many disappointed fans of the ME trilogy do. I really DO want to like this game as the series itself is amazing, but there are just too many small let downs that clump together and end up making this a big let down. Maybe I just had my expectations too high? Yes, I do have an issue with the glitches and graphics, but to be fair Skyrim also had numerous glitches when it was first released. Hopefully,just as in the case with Skyrim, more patches will be created and more issues addressed. The characters and the environment (600 years after ME3) were both ok, but I would much rather being going on a new mission with my dear friends (and romantic interests lol) Liara and Tali... Maybe even add EDI as a potential partner this time :) One of my other beefs with this game is that it suffered from another trait that somewhat ruined the experience for me with ME3. Though I will probably get roasted by other gamers for saying this, while I enjoyed ME3, it was in fact my...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Allen', N'joshua.allen3820@example.net', '2017-03-24', 5, N'I like it'),
(N'Christina', N'Ross', N'christina.ross9730@example.net', '2017-03-24', 5, N'Excellent value. All the games are fabulous especially portal'),
(N'Samuel', N'Ali', N'samuel.ali4733@example.com', '2017-03-24', 5, N'Absolutely nothig I say will do justice to this game. An incredible leap forwar from an already fantastic series. The music is emotional, the acting is personal and dynamic. I felt invested the moment the opening video began. I have now platinumed this game and replayed it three times. Great game!'),
(N'Samuel', N'Ali', N'samuel.ali4733@example.com', '2017-03-24', 5, N'This game was fantastic! It far exceeded my expectations and left me craving for a sequel. I can''t wait to see what they do next!'),
(N'Amy', N'Powell', N'amy.powell8880@example.org', '2017-03-25', 5, N'This is a great game. Honestly I think this game is getting so much hate is because commander Shepard is not in it. The game has a solid story and can be really fun to play. The face animations were a little werid but I Believe they patched either way I am 45 hours into the game I don''t really notice it anymore. I will admit I do not feel as attached to the crew like I was in Mass effect 2 but that''s ok because they can be interesting enough. I play on a 4k TV with a PS4 pro to me graphics are really good. The only thing I wish they did with this game was let u have more customization with colonizing colony/outposts. I am glad I got this game if you enjoy Mass effect get this game'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Bennett', N'kimberly.bennett1521@example.org', '2017-03-26', 2, N'Mouse was faulty within a few months. I also preferred the shape of other mice'),
(N'Mark', N'James', N'mark.james2071@example.com', '2017-03-26', 2, N'I''m glad I didn''t pay full price for it. It''s a combination of a 1st and 3rd person shooter. I don''t like the 1st person perspective on games.'),
(N'Emily', N'Nowak', N'emily.nowak9853@example.com', '2017-03-26', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Thompson', N'kimberly.thompson4605@example.org', '2017-03-26', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Ivan', N'Webb', N'ivan.webb2300@example.net', '2017-03-26', 5, N'like this game alot nice to just drive around without doing anything'),
(N'Pamela', N'Anderson', N'pamela.anderson8840@example.net', '2017-03-26', 2, N'I have been playing the game for 3 hours now on a NEW 3ds which is more powerful than the 3ds that was available when the game got released. Even with the NEW 3ds, the game lag when there is music. It''s very disappointing. The video and dialog between games are very slow and not skippable until you finish the mission. It means that you have to "wait" between 3 minutes to 5 minutes between 20 minutes of game play. It makes the game pace to get slow. I tried to get into the game story but all the Japanese names make it impossible to remember who is who. This is also a problem in game when you need to figure out who to save or to kill. The mechanic of the game is a little bit hard to understand even if there is some explanation in the game''s booklet. There is many attack and power attack but some of them never seem to get trigged as supposed. Maybe it requires more than 3 hours to get it or I might just not get it. Enemies are very easy or very hard. I find it hard to get middle...'),
(N'Sharon', N'Myers', N'sharon.myers2038@example.org', '2017-03-26', 5, N'20+ hours of gaming and zero issues. Much better than the Bluetooth.'),
(N'Janet', N'Morales', N'janet.morales8087@example.org', '2017-03-27', 4, N'I''m about 12 hours in and felt this was as good a point as any to write a review for this game (I''ll adjust my review as necessary later if the game pulls a Mas Effect 3 on the ending) The game is good. It''s not the best Mass Effect offering to date nor is it the least among them. To me it feels very reminiscent of ME1 in both style and lack of overall polish. If you are a longtime fan of the series it may be a bit of a disappointing entry because mechanically, storywise, dialogue-wise, the game has definitely not learned all of its lessons from its predecessors. For a game that has been in development as long as ME:A has it lacks the polish you would expect from Bioware. Despite the lack of polish I''ve found myself having fun with the game, I was very invested in the original ME Trilogy and I find myself becoming just as invested in this new direction for the series. If you''re new to the series you''ll really enjoy this game, if you''re a seasoned vet of the franchise give it an...'),
(N'Christina', N'Robinson', N'christina.robinson9107@example.net', '2017-03-27', 5, N'rare unit, has a nice ghost like paint job.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Gomez', N'tomasz.gomez1917@example.org', '2017-03-27', 5, N'This is exactly what my son wanted! And we preordered it so even got some bonuses with it!'),
(N'Anita', N'Jackson', N'anita.jackson5515@example.com', '2017-03-27', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Donna', N'Campbell', N'donna.campbell6238@example.org', '2017-03-27', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Jason', N'Rivera', N'jason.rivera6642@example.net', '2017-03-27', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Patrick', N'Sanders', N'patrick.sanders1343@example.com', '2017-03-27', 4, N'As with any sport, gaming requires tools to perform to your best abilities. Tools extend further than just a PC, it includes both your keyboard and mouse. Without a decent mouse, accuracy and precision can be hampered. Without enough buttons, time can be wasted, and in certain scenarios...time is precious. Here is where the Scimitar Pro RGB; with a 16000 DPI sensor and 12 buttons, it ticks off the check boxes of a solid gaming peripheral. Having the features does not always tell the whole story. How does the SCIMITAR feel? The short answer is solid. Buttons feel tactile with smooth clicking, but not too squishy. Allowing you to adjust the position of the 12 buttons is solid, as well as an amazing addition. Scroll wheel doesn''t wobble and feel cheap. Overall, the mouse feels premium, better than past Gaming mice that I have used. The feel of the SCIMITAR in your hand is hard to compare with any other gaming mouse. I personally love larger mice, it feels better in my hand and I can...'),
(N'Thomas', N'Cooper', N'thomas.cooper8810@example.com', '2017-03-27', 5, N'perfect, fast ship.'),
(N'Noah', N'Brown', N'noah.brown1727@example.org', '2017-03-28', 2, N'I pre-ordered this game expecting it to be awesome. I loved Mass Effect''s original trilogy, apart from the ending and loved that my decisions did something in the universe. I love the experience and the exploration theme of the game really made me happy. Part of what makes Mass Effect great is the story. I will try not to spoil anything for those who want to play. If you are on the fence, I know you''ve heard about the facial animations. You MIGHT be able to get this fixed in a patch / mod later on - but there is a huge issue with the writing on this game in general. It is jarring, and prevents you form becoming immersed in the game. You ARE your character in this game, and choices for dialogue mean a lot. You are pigeon holed into feeling certain ways about a conversation. In key moments of story where I wanted to tell my colleagues "You can believe in me" and the only options I got were to be pessimistic and "Well, I can try, but I don''t know". Another thing that really takes you...'),
(N'Helen', N'Ivanov', N'helen.ivanov6687@example.com', '2017-03-28', 4, N'worked perfectly'),
(N'Raymond', N'Nowak', N'raymond.nowak2946@example.com', '2017-03-28', 5, N'I was able to get Nier: Automata for free during a Target buy 2 games get 1 free sale. I wasn''t sure if I was gonna like it at first as it was just an option at the time so I said, why not. I was gonna get Gravity Rush 2, but it wasn''t available at the time and wasn''t sure what to expect. Well I received it about a week after I ordered it and popped the disc in right when I got my hands on it. Played it for a couple hours, and then I found myself coming back to this game again and again since I received it. And I do have to say, I''m still hooked even after 40 or so hours into the game. I have to admit, I don''t usuallly get hooked on games that easily but I''m glad I was able to pick this game over others available. Now as far as the gameplay. It is rather fast paced for a semi open world game. The graphics aren''t the best around, but who cares, it''s a great title. So looking past the graphics, I was really captured by the characters that are available to play as or interact with....'),
(N'Sandra', N'Sullivan', N'sandra.sullivan5663@example.com', '2017-03-28', 5, N'Loved this game growing up, and now my kids love it!'),
(N'Donald', N'Jenkins', N'donald.jenkins2105@example.com', '2017-03-28', 2, N'Not fun like i expected my girls didn''t like it'),
(N'Tyler', N'Perry', N'tyler.perry8492@example.net', '2017-03-28', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Matthew', N'Rivera', N'matthew.rivera2872@example.net', '2017-03-28', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Raymond', N'Butler', N'raymond.butler5534@example.com', '2017-03-29', 4, N'For some reason I received a Netherlands version where the package and instructions had minimal English on it. So it lost a star for that. Thank goodness the PS4 doesn''t split their games by regions and it played just fine. (Just make sure you pick the right language when setting the game up!) As far as the game goes I really like it. It''s kind of a cross between GTA, Just Cause, & The Division. The controls aren''t entirely perfect and some GTA style control things are missing. (Like honking your car horn.) But I like that when you aim, you can stay in 3rd person or go to 1st person and look down the gun sights or scope. I also really like that you can play the story as a team of 4, and the others are AI rather than demanding co-op with others. Sometimes the AI isn''t as intuitive as you want them to be, but you can order them to go to locations or pick targets for them to shoot, etc. I was a little lost when first starting the game in terms of how the story and missions were...'),
(N'Olivia', N'Mitchell', N'olivia.mitchell6890@example.com', '2017-03-29', 2, N'Not sure why it took so long to release this game, it''s full of lackluster graphics, horrendous camera work, shoddy controls, stuttering frame rates, and repetitive environments. The only saving grace is Trico who is truly wonderfully animated and programmed. It''s a tragedy that he is stuck inside such a crummy game. I absolutely loved Shadow the Colossus, but evaluated as a game, the Last Guardian is terrible.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Powell', N'deborah.powell2212@example.net', '2017-03-29', 5, N'One per cart random nature. easy if you have a fresh file and keep resetting! good buy and good luck!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Edwards', N'yuki.edwards4242@example.org', '2017-03-29', 5, N'OK'),
(N'Michelle', N'Smith', N'michelle.smith7485@example.com', '2017-03-29', 5, N'Bought a set of these as well as the original stereo headset that Microsoft sells. I have to say the build quality and audio quality on these are amazing. nothing feels like it''s going to break when handling them and the cushions really do stay cool against your face, they even feel cool to the touch. Every time I see other headsets they just don''t come close to the build quality and attention to detail that went into these. I bought just the headset without any adapter and plugs into the new style Xbox one controller and works fine. The dashboard lets you tweak all the settings for sound balancing from the dash so you don''t need any adapters. This will save you spending the $25 for the Xbox adapter or $40 for the turtle beach adapter.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Turner', N'brenda.turner4713@example.org', '2017-03-29', 1, N'This was the wrong cord. It says Playstation 2 but it was a Playstation 1 cord.'),
(N'Adam', N'Ortiz', N'adam.ortiz4852@example.org', '2017-03-29', 5, N'I REALLY like this head set. Because of its build. It''s light to a degree, doesn''t squeeze my head to death, the ear pads are comfortable. And the biggest thing is COMPLETELY WIRELESS! No tied into your controller BS. (I hope these things get a firmware update or something and their compatible with the next xbox system, scorpio. probably too much to ask for?) I have bought Trittons, Turtle beach... and wish I had bought these Astro A50 sooner.. The last gaming headset''s I bought were the KatanaHD 7.1 Wireless headset (Not truly wireless though, you have that stupid connection with your controller.. so when you set it down, and then turn to do something else, you jerk your controller, off of whatever solid object it was on, into the floor.. which leads to high blood pressure and curse words, don''t ask how I know) I got fed up with this.. so I bought the ASTRO A50 hoping and praying it would be worth the price tag. I also bough the Xbox one Striker ProZX.. decent headset, but again,...'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ortiz', N'rachel.ortiz5458@example.net', '2017-03-29', 5, N'Great game....characters are addictive. .and fun to portray. ..great graphics. .'),
(N'Jacob', N'Moore', N'jacob.moore4269@example.com', '2017-03-29', 5, N'good'),
(N'Shirley', N'Ramirez', N'shirley.ramirez9257@example.org', '2017-03-29', 3, N'Its a slow paced game with no lag the Time aprox 3 to 5 Hours. Button delay has vanish this time around I don''t care for the story its more of a Saturday morning cartoon story is not as Advance and deep as Sonic Adventures 2 or Sonic the hedgehog (2006) witch is fine I loved the RPG style and direction the Sonic and the secret rings was going. so control Vs RPG mechanic I''ll go with RPG Mechanic I do think you should pick this up if your a Sonic fan tho its a Allright game no where near The GENESIS Trilogy because those games are not a waste of your hard time and cash.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Sanchez', N'andrea.sanchez1746@example.com', '2017-03-30', 5, N'The voice acting <3'),
(N'Hannah', N'Howard', N'hannah.howard8766@example.org', '2017-03-30', 5, N'Great Game'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Collins', N'jacqueline.collins2643@example.com', '2017-03-30', 5, N'so good that you won''t want stop playing on tales the very end.'),
(N'Christina', N'Nelson', N'christina.nelson2574@example.com', '2017-03-30', 5, N'Good timing and quality!'),
(N'Alexander', N'Torres', N'alexander.torres7266@example.org', '2017-03-30', 5, N'It''s a great bag, can hold many stuff. Unlike my old bag, it has compartments meant for specific things. I give it 5 stars but its small size meant for only the essentials and not for the extra stuff I have is the only con.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Young', N'marcus.young7176@example.org', '2017-03-30', 4, N'kind of like bioshock infinite but not really'),
(N'Christine', N'Jones', N'christine.jones4264@example.org', '2017-03-30', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Megan', N'Alvarez', N'megan.alvarez4808@example.com', '2017-03-30', 5, N'this reveals so much id get it if i were you, im a die hard halo fan and this revealed so much, my only regret is not getting this when it first came out'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Ferreira', N'tomasz.ferreira7636@example.net', '2017-03-30', 4, N'Great game!! It''s a good memento of his spiritual predecessor Valkyrie profile'),
(N'Hannah', N'James', N'hannah.james5863@example.com', '2017-03-30', 5, N'Pricey these cards are but if ya like your games and have a ps plus memebership or just play mad games like myself..screw 16 or any lower..go big and game on. Quick ship and good packaging'),
(N'Yuki', N'Hill', N'yuki.hill9437@example.com', '2017-03-31', 5, N'Very good game'),
(N'Karen', N'Coleman', N'karen.coleman3676@example.net', '2017-03-31', 3, N'Too involved. Too much to do and remember.'),
(N'David', N'Watson', N'david.watson2272@example.net', '2017-03-31', 1, N'One of the worst tom clancy games ever released. Second only to the division. garbage money grab of a game. DO NOT BUY');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Patricia', N'Suzuki', N'patricia.suzuki4525@example.org', '2017-03-31', 5, N'This game is awesome! The booklet was useful (though I made sure not to read past the point where it said there''d be spoilers).'),
(N'Maria', N'James', N'maria.james2660@example.com', '2017-04-01', 4, N'excellent deal. Thanks'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Peterson', N'benjamin.peterson2550@example.com', '2017-04-01', 5, N'If you liked any of the previous Mass Effect games, this one is for you. I must be lucky, because I have yet to run into any technical issues yet and I''ve put 30+ hours into the game so far. You can run through the story if you want, but there is a ton to do with side quests. One of the bigger changes to me from the past games is how many abilities are at your disposal. You can learn a lot and you''re not restricted in learning anything, but you are in using them. You are only able to have 3 active abilities at a time, so you have to decide what you want to use when you go out in a mission. You can swap out your loadouts easily enough though, so it''s not much of a hindrance, but it would be nice if you could have more than 3 at a time.'),
(N'Megan', N'Allen', N'megan.allen3323@example.org', '2017-04-01', 4, N'Crysis - PC Sold by: secondchances1414 Ordered January 4, 2017 Delivered Jan 11, 2017. and had no trouble installing on my win 10.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Rivera', N'kyle.rivera3384@example.com', '2017-04-01', 5, N'GOOD PRODUCT'),
(N'Ryan', N'Cox', N'ryan.cox6043@example.org', '2017-04-01', 1, N'This was WAY too rushed. I have daily game-breaking bugs that require reloading previous saves and *hopefully* fixing the problem. Right now I can''t develop two planets because of piss-poor scripting. Datapads that won''t activate, containers that won''t open, vaults that are broken and never do the cleansing cloud bit. AVP missions broken. Side missions broken. Animations broken. 5 minute load time. Loot boxes that won''t open and are required for key missions. Save often. Save before doing anything. Unfortunately, many major "quests" / missions / etc. don''t allow saving - so if you hit a bug you need to start over. Then there''s the fish-eyed, squid-lip facial animations...... Companions that drop from the sky when exiting the Nomad. Enemies that rain down from the trees in groups of three or four, all occupying the same space (Fun to headshoot.)'),
(N'Olivia', N'Khan', N'olivia.khan3437@example.net', '2017-04-01', 5, N'helps organize you gear while charging all you need'),
(N'Timothy', N'Perez', N'timothy.perez7910@example.com', '2017-04-02', 5, N'GOOD'),
(N'Jose', N'Reed', N'jose.reed7831@example.com', '2017-04-02', 5, N'Worth the money'),
(N'Amanda', N'Murphy', N'amanda.murphy5074@example.com', '2017-04-03', 5, N'Enjoying it'),
(N'Douglas', N'Moore', N'douglas.moore4165@example.com', '2017-04-03', 5, N'Another great mouse from Razer!'),
(N'Pamela', N'Brooks', N'pamela.brooks4440@example.org', '2017-04-03', 5, N'I am never disappointed when I play this game. It is fun and very entertaining. Great for all ages.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Diaz', N'thomas.diaz1178@example.com', '2017-04-03', 3, N'For years resident evil feels outdated even on ps3 and ps2 with tank controls that feel like it only belongs on consoles like ps1 n64 despite capcom outdated game engine there storylines for this series was amazing and well thought out before the creator of resident evil lefted capcom and later on made titles like "the evil within" since capcom new approach with this series is turning resident evil into silent hill not to get off topic but i hope u get my point anyways i want to start off to review resident evil code veronica x i already mentioned the tank controls that''s in three of these titles but some are useful but others are not before i get to that here are some good things about this game u can use two weapons at the same time the storyline is great as i said before and it was good for its time despite outdated game engine that was used in re1 re2 re3 & re4 also re5 as welland here''s why i think some tank controls are more useful in later games because although some doesn''t...'),
(N'Hannah', N'Cox', N'hannah.cox3539@example.com', '2017-04-03', 4, N'Great game, a bit difficult to control de cars but it''s ok... Miss the multiplayer mode offline...'),
(N'Henry', N'Tanaka', N'henry.tanaka4010@example.com', '2017-04-03', 4, N'Great deal, fast shipping and all exact description.'),
(N'William', N'Ramos', N'william.ramos7958@example.org', '2017-04-03', 5, N'Three remastered games on one disc for less than $20. Are you kidding? Buy this.'),
(N'Laura', N'Sanchez', N'laura.sanchez8431@example.com', '2017-04-03', 1, N'Is it supposed to come in all-gold? What kind of laziness is this? The detail is sub-par.'),
(N'Laura', N'Sanchez', N'laura.sanchez8431@example.com', '2017-04-03', 5, N'I was one of the lucky few who got this thing at launch. Then one night I needed booze and was out of cash, so I sold it. I''m pretty sure the staff members at my local records shop bought it minutes later. Good memories.'),
(N'Megan', N'Diaz', N'megan.diaz4858@example.com', '2017-04-03', 5, N':)'),
(N'Christine', N'Rivera', N'christine.rivera8996@example.com', '2017-04-04', 5, N'I ended up getting my copy (Take your Heart away edition) a day early cause of amazon fairies, and played about 5~6 hours last night trying to get past the first main arch, and I can safely say all I want to do is dive back into the story. The combat is good solid turned based combat with an awesome negotiations part. Basically if your able to knock down all the enemies with crit or weakness hits your able to speak with them, when you speak with them your given the option of getting extra money, Item or they can become your new Persona. I haven''t failed a negotiation yet, but I do get the impression I can since you have actual dialog choices that need to match what they''re saying. Very cool. Story wise the game starts off dark and heavy and hasn''t shy away from the darker subject matter, but that said it''s not exploitation and handles it very well, while still sighting some good old fashion angry not just from the characters but from me as well towards the first main bady. very...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Johnson', N'kyle.johnson7264@example.org', '2017-04-04', 5, N'Came in good condition, Though the Square button gets stuck i can deal with it'),
(N'Carol', N'Perry', N'carol.perry4396@example.com', '2017-04-04', 5, N'Love this game! It''s hours of fun and you can make it as challenging as you''d like. I also love the ability to play with friends as well!'),
(N'Noah', N'Robinson', N'noah.robinson2343@example.com', '2017-04-04', 5, N'Great quality figures, and great quality gameplay.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Mendoza', N'jennifer.mendoza3252@example.org', '2017-04-04', 5, N'works great.'),
(N'Judith', N'Smith', N'judith.smith2874@example.org', '2017-04-04', 5, N'Great game! Not for little ones or those who get offended easily.'),
(N'Julie', N'Williams', N'julie.williams5777@example.net', '2017-04-04', 5, N'Works great but doesn''t feel as sturdy as the one for 360. Overall it was a great and very worthwhile buy!!!! Be sure to update your controller firmware with the included cable before trying to use it!'),
(N'Matthew', N'Peterson', N'matthew.peterson9391@example.com', '2017-04-04', 2, N'My wife and I were looking forward to this since we were both big fans of the first one. Ultimately, it was a disappointment... feels like another clone of Grand Theft Auto rather then a sequel to Watch Dogs. The story line is uninteresting and the dialog and cut scenes are campy. By the end, we found ourselves skipping through a lot of the scenes. We were just glad to finish it, and unfortunately don''t see any chance of replaying it.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Khan', N'lauren.khan8046@example.net', '2017-04-04', 4, N'I already had the base game since beta. I took a break when the expansion was coming out. It felt like the expansion was scaring away a lot of my friends, who all did not want to sink more money into the same game they''ve been grinding loot on for years. I totally understood that perspective, but the expansion has been in a lot of sales with great discounts. I decided to go ahead and take advantage of that, because none of the newer MMORPGs were satisfying the itch like Guild Wars 2 did. This expansion is magnificent. It adds gliding, glider skins, elite specializations, mastering map-specific skills, a new Revenant class, and many other features. It gives you access to more areas to explore which may or may not work well on your old gaming rigs. I can''t run around in some of the new maps without experiencing some lag or framerate issues, but it''s bearable and it''s worth it for the size of these new maps. Overall, it adds a lot of value to the game.'),
(N'George', N'Khan', N'george.khan4487@example.net', '2017-04-05', 5, N'Great game & arrived quick!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Martin', N'melissa.martin1376@example.net', '2017-04-05', 5, N'Waited such a long time for this game to come out and it does not disappoint!!! The steelbook is gorgeous collectors item and I received it a day earlier from release which was a nice plus! But the game so far is FLAWLESS! Every detail of the world is beautiful and realistic! I even got lost changing subway lines (which would happen if I were there in real life lol). The music as always is nice and catchy. Voice acting is spot on!! Just everything is great and is a must buy for allll JRPG fans'),
(N'Ashley', N'Evans', N'ashley.evans3219@example.org', '2017-04-05', 5, N'Amazing delivery got here in two days! & it was in case with no scratches thank you very much! No issues at all'),
(N'Lauren', N'Walker', N'lauren.walker5265@example.com', '2017-04-05', 5, N'Great headset, high quality sound with titan fall art, a nice tribute to the game while keeping high quality sound blasting you into the game.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Coleman', N'kelly.coleman3199@example.net', '2017-04-05', 3, N'I don''t like the story'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Baker', N'benjamin.baker3925@example.net', '2017-04-05', 4, N'I did not get my game a few days to a week early from Amazon like some did. Amazon released the majority of copies on release day. Gamestop had a 9 o clock release the night before. Just a note. This edition was taken off preorder on Amazon and in store at Gamestop as early as 3 weeks before release, but it remained up for pre-order via Gamestop and at least 3 other online stores up until release. The reason it was taken off early was due to the con artists on ebay who were buying them and selling them 10 months before they released. One such con artist bought and sold 160 preorder for almost a $50 profit each. Preorder of these editions need to be restricted to 3 each. Anyways. I''ll be reviewing the edition, and then the game. I have played every single Person game besides #1, from 2 to Q. That''s 8 games. For anyone who enjoys this, I can''t express how vital it is to actually play the rest of the series. Box - the box is huge. It''s a laminated shiny flip top with a magnetized...'),
(N'Ryan', N'Raghunathan', N'ryan.raghunathan1169@example.com', '2017-04-05', 3, N'was that just ok'),
(N'Dennis', N'Rodriguez', N'dennis.rodriguez6917@example.net', '2017-04-05', 5, N'Easy install. Works great. Awesome company'),
(N'Kyle', N'Martin', N'kyle.martin4848@example.com', '2017-04-05', 4, N'This is a great upgrade from JD 2016 and it packs in quite a few new songs. I appreciate the trial offering of the cloud-based version of the Just Dance music library. This version seems to provide the ability to replace all previous versions, as the "unlimited" feature allows access to all previous songs. After the trail there is a purchase option for the subscription to the unlimited service, and based on what I have experienced with it so far, I am likely to purchase it. I personally rarely play the game, but my children who are 8 and 6 absolutely love the game. It provides a great outlet for exercise while also having fun. The controls on the Nintendo Switch are intuitive and user friendly, and they seem much more responsive than the Wii U. This is likely a hardware improvement versus software. The one gripe I have is that you cannot play with both a Joy-Con controller *and* a mobile phone. You can either play with all mobile phone controllers *or* all Joy-Con controllers. I...'),
(N'Barbara', N'Kelly', N'barbara.kelly1453@example.org', '2017-04-05', 1, N'Have to say I am very disappointed in VI. Not as fun to play and so complicated now. Wish I had not bought it.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Young', N'ashley.young1219@example.net', '2017-04-05', 5, N'I bought this one just for Skull Kid figure, but the 3DS version of Majora''s Mask was great!'),
(N'Joan', N'Ivanov', N'joan.ivanov7190@example.org', '2017-04-05', 5, N'Ive had the game since it released however i do have to admit it really holds up well even after all these months. Its actually one of the easier games to get the platinum.'),
(N'Robert', N'Singh', N'robert.singh2783@example.org', '2017-04-06', 5, N'My game came as described new in box. Shipping was very fast. Kingdom Hearts is a game with an enduring storyline and whimsical graphics. The presentation is always top notch and Dream Drop Distance does not disappoint. The new moves are very impressive that you can pull off in this action RPG. Music is also a staple of the Kingdom Heart Series and this version might very well be the best ever for the series. Any fan of action RPG''s will love this game. To me it''s not quite as good as a Zelda action RPG but it holds its own as an excellent experience.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Jackson', N'cynthia.jackson6450@example.net', '2017-04-06', 2, N'I really wanted to like this game, I did. I loved the original Mass Effect Trilogy, but this one just completely misses the mark. Every side quest feels more like a chore, and the overall game is just tedious. There''s nothing here that makes me care about the lore or the characters the way the originals did. There''s just nothing to to get excited about. The premise is good, but wasted in a lackluster execution, and the bad guys (the kett) along with a dead alien race (the remnant) are just poor rehashes of the collectors and protheans.'),
(N'Christina', N'Ross', N'christina.ross2241@example.net', '2017-04-06', 5, N'This is coming from a person who grew up playing SFII and MK in arcades, then dabbled in SFIV - and that''s really it. I always liked fighting games, but never got too in-depth. I bought this based on great reviews (and the garbage reviews SFV was getting) and thought I''d give it a shot. It has since become one of my favorite games of any genre. Even though I am an absolute scrub, I play it all the time. The graphics and sound are amazing. The story is a little crazy with maybe seven million characters, but if you like anime it''ll work for you. The variety of game modes is the best I''ve ever seen in a fighter. The gameplay, at least for me, is very complex but rewarding to practice. There are combos I will honestly never be able to do, and some concepts I won''t master - but it is still fun to practice and steadily improve. The tutorial, combos, and missions are really helpful to understanding game mechanics. The only reason to not buy this is if you are easily frustrated by losing...'),
(N'Larry', N'Martin', N'larry.martin7932@example.net', '2017-04-06', 1, N'The software is the biggest killer. You have to have steam to use it. It defaults to mouse and keyboard configuration not as a joy pad. It forgets settings if offline and sometimes even online. Requires steam overlay to work too so even if you import the game to steam if the game does not support overlay you cannot use it properly. The software has many options and makes it great for some games like stardew valley with a mix of keyboard and controller binds, but again it is buggy. I can basically do what this does with a saitek pad, xpadder, or ds4windows.at the time of this review my vibrate on controller is broken in software. The hardware is mediocre. The curve on front of pad is uncomfortable for me. I like the buttons on back but should be individual buttons instead of massive panels. These panels can make clicking and moving the joypad or buttons tough. The triggers are awesome and so are the touch pads and joystick, but the need for steam and steam overlay makes this not...'),
(N'Emma', N'Phillips', N'emma.phillips9267@example.net', '2017-04-06', 5, N'Works great, as advertised, would recommend to others.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Walker', N'hiroshi.walker6354@example.org', '2017-04-06', 4, N'FINALLY! It came. Older game system for a little kid but it came and is well worth it. The bundle is perfect it''s new [not the box] durable classic. JMS Is trustworthy people you can go there to get this lost treasure.'),
(N'Diane', N'Smith', N'diane.smith4918@example.net', '2017-04-07', 5, N'We love skylanders at our house.'),
(N'Frank', N'Butler', N'frank.butler6500@example.com', '2017-04-07', 5, N'Excellent product!!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Long', N'melissa.long9557@example.org', '2017-04-07', 5, N'I love it'),
(N'Melissa', N'Long', N'melissa.long9557@example.org', '2017-04-07', 5, N'Very Good console'),
(N'Andrea', N'Anderson', N'andrea.anderson9358@example.net', '2017-04-07', 1, N'Doesn''t work'),
(N'Gregory', N'Richardson', N'gregory.richardson6875@example.com', '2017-04-07', 4, N'It''s really conventional but it has a bit less audio commands than I thought it would.'),
(N'Mei', N'Rivera', N'mei.rivera1721@example.com', '2017-04-07', 2, N'There''s like 8 mini games. I used to play the originals as a kid with my family for hours. My kids played this game like 3 times and got bored of it. The effort isn''t put into making these games lovable by kids and families anymore. It''s about making just enough content, colors, and signature "Nintendo" to call it done.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Morris', N'jessica.morris9876@example.net', '2017-04-07', 4, N'This is a beautifully rendered game with gorgeous graphics, with multiple, varied locations and lots to do. In a nutshell, this game is just plain fun! It''s fun to look at, it''s fun to play, and the frequently silly humor brought a smile to my face many times. For me, all the games in the series are about the numerous, sometimes hilarious weapons. This is an action game first, and a puzzle-platformer second. The weapon variety is once again exceptional, with each being uniquely useful for certain situations which compels the player to switch weapons mid-fight for a much more memorable experience. I am usually an action/RPG gamer, but this game reminded me again that it is a good idea to change things up occasionally and refresh your gamer batteries. The game is around ten hours long to complete, with Easy, Normal, and Hard modes. The first mode (Easy) is for the kids, and a little too easy for most gamers. The second mode (Normal) I would recommend for gamers who have never played...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Raghunathan', N'joyce.raghunathan3279@example.org', '2017-04-08', 5, N'This game is spectacular. It has an amazing soundtrack, great atmosphere, great cast of characters, and the combat is simple but complex at the same time. I bought this at Best Buy but felt like leaving my 2 cents here on Amazon. This is actually my first Persona game and I''m loving every minute of it; I''ve already got 40 hours into the game. Building up your relationships (known as confidants in the game) feels satisfying as well. I could honestly go on and on about this game but I won''t. Just do yourself a favor and pick this game up, probably the best JRPG I''ve ever played.'),
(N'Gary', N'Johnson', N'gary.johnson4513@example.org', '2017-04-08', 5, N'Great nostalgia game'),
(N'Hannah', N'Lopez', N'hannah.lopez3645@example.com', '2017-04-08', 5, N'Had since april 4th and still nothing wtong with it at all...ima buy more of these for my ps3 soon...Im not into console wars,i love them all,and this controller is xbox style but is super amazing on all the ps3 games i have ive tested em all...and the quality and feel is amazing,way beyond what i had expected...they build there controllers way better than just about all that i have tried! Id reccomend it fast to everyone! 5 stars from me.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Sanchez', N'kevin.sanchez4779@example.com', '2017-04-08', 4, N'I have always liked this game overall, and it will always have a special place in my heart. With that said, the rubberbanding A.I. in this game is beyond ridiculous. No lead is safe as the game cheats to catch up to you by increasing the speed of its controlled drivers to higher than they can possibly go. I don''t know if later Mario Kart games ditched the rubberbanding A.I., but its presence is strong in this one.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Wilson', N'andrew.wilson9720@example.com', '2017-04-08', 2, N'The combat, the thing they got *closest* to right differs from previous ME games in that you can''t freeze combat and control squad abilities. So, your squad as far as combat is concerned is almost meaningless. The interactions between the squad mates you have with you are sometimes enjoyable, but none of the characters are particularly interesting. Pros Combat is almost passable Animations are funny in a bad way The premise is interesting enough Pretty Cons Literally everything else'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Jenkins', N'tomasz.jenkins7853@example.com', '2017-04-09', 5, N'great product'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Castillo', N'evelyn.castillo9009@example.com', '2017-04-09', 5, N'My son loved playing the game on his PS4'),
(N'Donald', N'Cox', N'donald.cox5289@example.com', '2017-04-09', 4, N'Nice fun game to own worth having if your a fan'),
(N'Gary', N'Chavez', N'gary.chavez3632@example.net', '2017-04-10', 5, N'So much fun'),
(N'Nicole', N'Cook', N'nicole.cook3981@example.org', '2017-04-10', 4, N'Quick delivery. Relaxing game.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Cook', N'nicole.cook3981@example.org', '2017-04-10', 5, N'My son loves the Madden games.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Harris', N'marcus.harris1281@example.org', '2017-04-10', 5, N'I''m hopping happy for this edition of the sims 3 pets, for weather it be horses, cats, or dogs you are sure to have a blast.'),
(N'Steven', N'Singh', N'steven.singh4795@example.net', '2017-04-10', 5, N'My son love it'),
(N'Steven', N'Singh', N'steven.singh4795@example.net', '2017-04-10', 3, N'Ok'),
(N'Hannah', N'Alvarez', N'hannah.alvarez7359@example.net', '2017-04-11', 5, N'These are great, BUT make sure when to slide Gen cartridges into them, To go from the Corner. Once you slide a corner of the game in, Then the Cartridge will slide in great. Don''t go into this thinking they are just like the SNES Sleaves.'),
(N'Dee', N'Young', N'dee.young3228@example.net', '2017-04-11', 5, N'Thank you so much :-)'),
(N'Adam', N'Lee', N'adam.lee4812@example.org', '2017-04-11', 5, N'On time and as advertised. No complaints here.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Morris', N'ryan.morris9725@example.org', '2017-04-11', 5, N'satisfait !'),
(N'Betty', N'Sanders', N'betty.sanders4952@example.org', '2017-04-11', 4, N'Story: In my opinion, I lost interest in the story. There are multiple of reasons why I didn''t care about the story, but one reason was your own character is dull. I don''t understand why he/she has any dialogue throughout the story. He/She just stands near other main characters and just listen to what they have to say. Like did Division see what Call of Duty did (Besides Call of Duty: Black Ops 3) and just copy it. Gameplay: IS VERY REPETITIVE. Most guns have recoil, but every enemy is the same. Sometimes you may encounter a sniper and flamethrower, but all of them act the same. Often, they will disregard to cover and just walk towards your position. What''s worst is if the enemy''s level is above you, you most likely going to die. I recommend having a turret as one of your skill sets to keep the enemies away from you. Boss Battle are COMPLETELY BORING. They are just Bullet Sponges. There isn''t any tactical or clever way to take down them. The Loot is decent. I may be wrong, but...'),
(N'Ashley', N'Morris', N'ashley.morris3227@example.org', '2017-04-11', 5, N'This game is absolutely amazing and my copy arrived with it''s box and the game also works perfectly.'),
(N'Dee', N'Price', N'dee.price1546@example.net', '2017-04-11', 5, N':)'),
(N'Jason', N'Raghunathan', N'jason.raghunathan1895@example.com', '2017-04-11', 5, N'I never got a chance to play this game on GameCube. Man did I missed out! This game is amazing! Especially if you are a Zelda fan! The HD makes the experience a whole lot better! If you never played this game and you own a WiiU, you need to get this game! Highly recommended!'),
(N'Jason', N'Raghunathan', N'jason.raghunathan1895@example.com', '2017-04-11', 5, N'This game is amazing! I''m not a hardcore gamer but once in a while you run into something worth playing. This game is definitely worth playing! The reply value is pretty high as well!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Lopez', N'ryan.lopez4614@example.net', '2017-04-12', 5, N'like it'),
(N'Ashley', N'Jackson', N'ashley.jackson2677@example.com', '2017-04-12', 4, N'Best MGS when it comes to gameplay. Good control. Solid graphics. Cool music when you can hear it (go find it on Youtube). Story is cool but is presented poorly. There are various accounts of what is missing from the game online and it suffered from them being removed. Namely it having to be ported to older systems (ps3, xbox 360) this lead to a lot of stuff being cut and some poor stage designs. There was suppose to be a big Russia stage with armed guards and far less open but was cut because of the ports. The last chapter is missing because of pushed release. The game would''ve been legendary if Konami hadn''t stepping over Kojima. Prob gonna be the last MGS that is over all solid so drink it in. Dont buy Konami they are doing some bonkers stuff with their titles.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Taylor', N'yuki.taylor8992@example.net', '2017-04-12', 3, N'Controller had damage and joystick doesn''t work well. But worth keeping.'),
(N'Megan', N'Anderson', N'megan.anderson8573@example.net', '2017-04-12', 5, N'exelente'),
(N'Raymond', N'Evans', N'raymond.evans5917@example.net', '2017-04-12', 5, N'Incredible'),
(N'Walter', N'Reyes', N'walter.reyes6568@example.org', '2017-04-13', 5, N'Very very good.'),
(N'George', N'Ramos', N'george.ramos8802@example.com', '2017-04-13', 3, N'I should have believed the negative reviews. It is just one mission! I purchased for $13 played and finished Metal Gear Phantom Pain "loved it, what a bargain" and thought this was at least be somewhat equal to game play. Nope! Finished it in about three hours unlike Phantom Pain that took me days and DAYS to reach last levels. This is no bargain unless you can pick it up for a couple of dollars. I paid $10 and its not worth that in my opinion. I cant imagine how mad people were who paid full price when it was released, betrayed... Maybe it was used as a funding game. Lot of interesting history on the developing of Metal Gear franchise.'),
(N'Joan', N'Khan', N'joan.khan7394@example.com', '2017-04-13', 3, N'These are ok. They sometimes pop off during play, so I''ve stopped using them. They do not, however, impede the use of the sticks on my PS4 at all, like some competing products do.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Ali', N'andrea.ali8105@example.net', '2017-04-13', 5, N'I like Playstation network. I like even better waiting for them to go on sale before buying a 1-year card.'),
(N'Mary', N'Garcia', N'mary.garcia6440@example.com', '2017-04-14', 5, N'You will have amazing experience with PSVR! Very realistic rally driving physic. Gran Turismo series rally driving physic is always been terrible so don''t get turn off by rally games.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Jones', N'ivan.jones1410@example.com', '2017-04-14', 2, N'Too complicated for my 5 year old who loves Monster High. Not a lot of gameplay outside talking to "ghouls" and walking around the school.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Cruz', N'deborah.cruz1975@example.net', '2017-04-14', 2, N'In good condition but does not save.'),
(N'Mary', N'Ramos', N'mary.ramos5178@example.com', '2017-04-14', 4, N'This headset works great. The only flaw is that the mic is "literally" next to your mouth. I''ve tried bending the mic just a little bit but little success. So I''m only able to make it an inch away from my mouth. Not sure why these headsets are like that. Despite that it comes with a mute, volume up, & volume down button. The design is very sturdy. I would recommend this headset for Xbox One owners out there just wanting a headset to chat on Xbox Live.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Diaz', N'gregory.diaz7508@example.com', '2017-04-14', 4, N'not as good as persona 4 but still amazing, I wish there was more explanation on where to get charm guts ect.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Myers', N'stephanie.myers5350@example.com', '2017-04-15', 5, N'amazing control'),
(N'Linda', N'Ruiz', N'linda.ruiz2999@example.org', '2017-04-15', 1, N'SCAM'),
(N'Olivia', N'Martinez', N'olivia.martinez3442@example.org', '2017-04-15', 1, N'Sades Arcmage mic is so bad my friends and family said it sound like I was eating the mic and or trying to talk with my mouth shut,as to the speakers there is a thumping going on when there is no sound going on, so pretty much like the speakers are ready to blow out. if I could I wouldn''t even give a one start to this product.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Sullivan', N'sarah.sullivan3515@example.org', '2017-04-15', 1, N'Absolute garbage. I could write an essay on why this and the Steam Link are trash but I am done wasting my time with this product. I will make it fast. 1. Doesn''t hold a link between the controllers and the Steam link. 2. It gets confused which controller is 1 and which is player 2 and will switch them around or completely DC. 3. Its so customizable that its not worth dealing with, most of the time I just default to xbox 360 controller settings, which it does second rate. I have a wired connection and it still lags. 5. THE SCREEN FLICKERS RANDOMLY! Yes, every 10-60 seconds the screen flicks off black for a moment and back on ( kiss playing any competitive games good bye with this pile. #5 has been a problem since steam link was released, they have no addressed it and anyone with an AMD GPU is likely to experience game breaking #5. Steam...you failed on this product biiiiiiiiiiiiiiiig time. Absolute trash.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Myers', N'joyce.myers7567@example.org', '2017-04-15', 3, N'Feels better in your hand than it''s official counterpart but when the cord is being bent around the Wii remote connector too much (easy to happen with different ways these things get handled) then it will have an unreliable connection and may as well be completely broken. I blame Nintendo more for it, it''s an issue with the official numchuks, but it''s still an issue. With these disconnecting from the Wii remotes is an unnecesary pain and might confuse your kid.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Williams', N'kyle.williams6037@example.org', '2017-04-15', 5, N'Had it for awhile and it has been working flawlessly!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Gutierrez', N'nicole.gutierrez4388@example.net', '2017-04-16', 5, N'Looks sleek and does its job. Goes nicely with my black wii.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Edwards', N'jacqueline.edwards3117@example.org', '2017-04-16', 5, N'Nice selection for people of any age to dance.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Gonzalez', N'rachel.gonzalez5353@example.net', '2017-04-16', 1, N'While this game has a lot of wonderful, wonderful qualities. The customer service is a complete joke. For the longest time this did not effect me, but I promise you the moment it does, the entire experience will be ruined completely. When you get the automated "Thank you for your support ticket" you have to actually respond to it, or they will marked the ticket as resolved. Responding to this gives you another email, thanking you for your patience. This email must also be responded to. At this point, I was two weeks through fighting with it, to get a very bland "we can''t help you." If you get the game and are a fan of Elder Scrolls, you will probably enjoy it, as I did. However do not risk crown store purchases.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Martin', N'ronald.martin2493@example.com', '2017-04-16', 5, N'Single player FPS games are a dying art but this one is a rare gem.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Scott', N'pamela.scott7262@example.net', '2017-04-17', 5, N'All lego games are so great! Funny and very easy and enjoyable.'),
(N'Frank', N'Reyes', N'frank.reyes5565@example.org', '2017-04-17', 5, N'I remember buying this game on the PS2 way back in 2007. I had to buy another copy on the PS2 in 2014 because of how badly scratched it was. When I got to the last story, it would always lock up. Now in 2017, I got an Amazon card and used it to buy this game on the GameCube. The game came in with NO SCRATCHES o ANYTHING in particular. The disc was crystal clear. I only did 1 ending so far. I am happy with my purchase and I would buy it again if this copy stops working!'),
(N'Anita', N'Torres', N'anita.torres2874@example.com', '2017-04-17', 5, N'Great story, great characters, amazing environment. What a breath of fresh air in gaming!'),
(N'Jason', N'White', N'jason.white3457@example.net', '2017-04-17', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Peter', N'Edwards', N'peter.edwards5119@example.net', '2017-04-17', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Marcus', N'Castillo', N'marcus.castillo8530@example.com', '2017-04-17', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Julie', N'Kumar', N'julie.kumar9133@example.com', '2017-04-17', 4, N'good system shipped quick'),
(N'Julie', N'Kumar', N'julie.kumar9133@example.com', '2017-04-17', 4, N'good game for fans'),
(N'Judith', N'Taylor', N'judith.taylor6241@example.org', '2017-04-17', 5, N'I have two of these -- one for myself and one for my husband. Initially, after switching from console gaming to PC gaming I tried to get the hang of using a keyboard rather than a controller. It worked well for some games, but for a select few I still really wanted to use controllers. This has allowed me to have that without having to use additional programs and at a relatively affordable cost. I really like these receivers and would recommend them.'),
(N'Mark', N'Allen', N'mark.allen1663@example.com', '2017-04-17', 1, N'EXTREME WASTE OF MONEY. DO NOT BUY THIS GAME EVEN USED. I FELT RIPPED OFF AND I WASTED A TON OF MONEY. THIS GAME ALONE MAD ME RETHINK PRE ORDERS ENTIRELY'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Ramos', N'evelyn.ramos4790@example.org', '2017-04-18', 3, N'I was intrigued by this keyboard. I wondered how good it could possibly be for this price. The answer is: about as good as you''d expect, though a bit worse in some aspects. The key response is excellent for a cheap keyboard. I don''t love the layout, and the next keyboard I get will definitely have the backslash key above the enter key again, but overall not too bad. What I cannot abide by is the arrow-key/WASD swap. I can kinda see this being an advantage for people wanting to play older games without having to rebind everything, so they''ll just swap and use WASD as the arrows in games like Doom or Duke3D, but for the most part, this is incredibly frustrating when you do it on accident and have no idea how to put things back the way they were. I rarely use the red functional keys. I pretty much don''t use anything but the volume keys on most boards since the media keys are so selective with what they''ll actually control. As mentioned before, the key layout is not perfect, but the...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Stewart', N'kyle.stewart7925@example.org', '2017-04-18', 5, N'I bought this in the DLC (downloadable content) package, and this is clearly the best Tomb Raider game since the original of 1996. It uses the same system as Tomb Raider, the 2013 reboot game, but it is simply better in the way game play meets story. And, the 20th Anniversary Edition is very good, particularly because of the Croft Manor addition, which is similar to the earliest editions from 20 years ago, though this is not a training exercise the way those are. Croft Manor, and generally the Rise of the Tomb Raider missions, focus as a prequel to the 2013 Tomb Raider reboot, and Croft Manor spends a lot of time on the main character''s story, Lara Croft, and her aristocratic family, Lord Richard Croft, her father. The best thing about the way this game plays is that the missions and Croft Manor move at a casual pace--meaning as fast as the player wants to go through these missions. The controllable difficulty ranges from somewhat easy to mainly impossible in all scenarios,...'),
(N'Kelly', N'Lee', N'kelly.lee3035@example.net', '2017-04-18', 5, N'These truly do give beautiful surround-sound hearing and allow you to be fully immersed in the game. You can get an edge on your opponents in online multiplayer games too, being able to hear around corners and across rooms. Highly recommend this product.'),
(N'Jack', N'Khan', N'jack.khan4080@example.org', '2017-04-18', 4, N'works great'),
(N'Zachary', N'Ramos', N'zachary.ramos3186@example.net', '2017-04-18', 5, N'This is a very solid game. The story will pull you in and the combat will challenge you enough that you won''t get bored. I like all of the real conflicts that the characters go through. Without spoiling any of the story i just made it through the first palace which took me about 14hrs which is crazy that I''ve barley scratched the surface. Well worth the money.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ortiz', N'rachel.ortiz5458@example.net', '2017-04-18', 5, N'great price...great unique game ..thanks ..satisfactory.'),
(N'Donna', N'Cook', N'donna.cook9009@example.com', '2017-04-18', 5, N'Great fighting game, Classic anime introduction, story line is also awesome. If your''re a fan of Guilty Gear X, this is one game to check out!'),
(N'Lisa', N'Okonkwo', N'lisa.okonkwo6098@example.org', '2017-04-19', 5, N'Two thumbs up thanks.'),
(N'George', N'Reed', N'george.reed4015@example.org', '2017-04-19', 5, N'Had these things for about 3 years and they still work just as good as they did when I first got them'),
(N'Kelly', N'Lee', N'kelly.lee3035@example.net', '2017-04-19', 5, N'This game is SO MUCH FUN. I''ve played for maybe 100 hours and it never really gets old. It''s fun talking to the other animals in town and acquiring items for your house. It''s like The Sims and Harvest Moon if you like those games. It has lovable character and can bring joy to any age group. I highly recommend this game.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Henderson', N'douglas.henderson7124@example.net', '2017-04-19', 5, N'Very nice product!!!'),
(N'Wei', N'Flores', N'wei.flores8954@example.org', '2017-04-19', 2, N'Can''t really play it for all the bugs in it. If you go in a building there''s a chance the game will crash. This includes every cutscene, death, and busted scene as well.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Rivera', N'kyle.rivera9284@example.org', '2017-04-20', 5, N'It''s a basic case but it has everything my son wanted for his 3DS. He''s 16 years old and didn''t want anything overly flashy, but still wanted a decent case. This one was perfect. Made well and not at all cheap feeling. After months of daily use, living in a backpack, taking rides on the bus, rolling around on a teenager''s bedroom floor, it''s still in perfect condition. Zipper works great and the case hasn''t scuffed up at all. Great non-flashy case.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Webb', N'ivan.webb4327@example.com', '2017-04-20', 5, N'A little on the big side for a 7 year old but they perform flawlessly. Great headphones. They sound great. Pairing was effortless and set up was super easy.'),
(N'Mark', N'Khan', N'mark.khan8790@example.com', '2017-04-20', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Edward', N'Martinez', N'edward.martinez4414@example.net', '2017-04-20', 5, N'People say this game is repetitive. So is any open world sdventure like gta. They''re all the same thing. It so happens this one is very good. Upgrade system progresses fast enough. Side missions are good. Graphics are very good. One knock is the billets bouncing off foliage which is ridiculous but outside of that little niggle I''m really enjoying it.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Powell', N'tyler.powell2352@example.net', '2017-04-20', 5, N'Love it!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Ross', N'kenneth.ross7027@example.org', '2017-04-20', 4, N'Good quality, but too light and small for me. The shape isn''t felt right neither. I still like my old Logitech g602 better.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Adams', N'jonathan.adams2384@example.org', '2017-04-20', 4, N'Skyrim is a very captivating game, and the ability to add modifications to it makes it even more so. It is a violent game, but a satisfying one as you role-play life in a magical viking-like world of swords, magic, and dragons. It offers endless hours of play. It portrays the struggle of good versus evil, and lets you play out various choices in this dark world of fantasy.'),
(N'Mark', N'Allen', N'mark.allen1663@example.com', '2017-04-20', 1, N'Same thing every year with Madden. I LOVE football, but Madden 15 is just the same ole same ole product. They take features away then add others and then scheme with those ultimate team packs. This is RNG non sense.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Thomas', N'melissa.thomas2003@example.net', '2017-04-21', 5, N'A pretty fun game! Nostalgia for the win!'),
(N'Jose', N'Clark', N'jose.clark8320@example.com', '2017-04-21', 5, N'They work well with both quality audio and voice over the mic. The mute switch is convenient but may be placed a little to far down the line. This would work with glasses because the ear muffs are secure but not to tight'),
(N'Samantha', N'White', N'samantha.white5520@example.com', '2017-04-22', 3, N'It''s an alright sonic game, haven''t played much, the game wasn''t that interesting.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Boyd', N'cynthia.boyd3372@example.org', '2017-04-22', 5, N'just great'),
(N'Ashley', N'Rogers', N'ashley.rogers6315@example.com', '2017-04-22', 5, N'I really enjoyed this game. It''s action packed. You can play with any of the 4 characters and esch of them have their own storyline. As you progress through the game, you can see how all the stoies come together in order to conplete a huge one. There is single player, online and offline co-op. This game is a must have if you''re a RE fan.'),
(N'Debra', N'Price', N'debra.price9457@example.org', '2017-04-22', 4, N'This has to be the best case we have ever had for a DS or other portable gaming device. It is a great size, durable zippers and materials. There is planety of space for the device, games and chargers. The only negative is the strap clasp broke after 4 months. However, a quick fix and it still works just fine.'),
(N'Carol', N'Davis', N'carol.davis6461@example.net', '2017-04-23', 5, N'what a classic these are . Love them ..'),
(N'Andrew', N'Young', N'andrew.young1274@example.com', '2017-04-23', 4, N'Cool game, not as good as others in the series, tho...'),
(N'Susan', N'Ali', N'susan.ali2700@example.org', '2017-04-23', 5, N'Grandson loves this game got him for Christmas ..'),
(N'Michelle', N'Jackson', N'michelle.jackson2995@example.net', '2017-04-23', 5, N'Love this mouse! Although it''s not high DPI, I could not tell a difference from a super crazy high dpi mouse i had. Yes you don''t have too many sensitivity levels, but the highest number is still pretty amazing. I''m using it on a regular glossy table surface and it works flawlessly. I''m no professional gamer, just casual and this mouse is perfect for me. It''s much more ergonomic, fits very nice in hand, battery lasts forever, there''s 0 lag or connection pause even when coming form sleep mode. I love that I can program buttons to many applications or games, super handy. Also, very happy it doesn''t look like something from an alien movie. This design is much better than other gaming monsters I''ve seen.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Thomas', N'pamela.thomas5856@example.net', '2017-04-24', 5, N'Played the single player campaign only and it is an amazing game! I typically don''t care about multiplayer and would have liked more content for the single player. It is short but still a fantastic experience.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Smith', N'brenda.smith4681@example.com', '2017-04-24', 1, N'Latency was horrible over bluetooth for my PS4. I cannot recommend this at all. It studdered all the time. It frequently thought I was holding one direction for a long time as well. So I couldn''t depend on this to work correctly. It was super fun to have the turbo modes that this enabled. I loved that part of it. It did handle turbo modes really well. I tried this in Watchdogs 2 and you could VERY quickly empty your pistol clip with this. It made my 8 round pistol feel like a shotgun lol :) Really cool device and has some great features, but if you want to do wireless, don''t buy this. It seemed to do ok corded, but that wasn''t how I wanted to use it.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Bell', N'joyce.bell2780@example.com', '2017-04-24', 5, N'This game is great by far the best game I played on the XB1.. Although I bought this from gamestop for $69.99 the deluxe edition is not worth the extra money but if you buy it here it''s $25 cheaper that gamestop!!'),
(N'Helen', N'Allen', N'helen.allen5536@example.net', '2017-04-24', 3, N'okay game'),
(N'Helen', N'Allen', N'helen.allen5536@example.net', '2017-04-24', 4, N'great game'),
(N'Gary', N'Perez', N'gary.perez6334@example.net', '2017-04-24', 1, N'it broke like after 2 weeks i had it did not want to work after I used it it was like new still and did not want to connect to my Xbox'),
(N'Jessica', N'Henderson', N'jessica.henderson5015@example.com', '2017-04-24', 5, N'Exelent product'),
(N'Priya', N'Howard', N'priya.howard9653@example.net', '2017-04-24', 5, N'Sent as a gift, they loved it.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Parker', N'christopher.parker2518@example.com', '2017-04-25', 4, N'Capcom is back and they have successfully brought new life into the Resident Evil series. This game is creepy, has puzzles, themed keys and doors, and much more. This would be a perfect game if it had more enemy variety as that is the only thing it''s missing.'),
(N'Maria', N'Rogers', N'maria.rogers5517@example.org', '2017-04-25', 5, N'Super family fun! Can be a good time killer when you have guests and friends over.'),
(N'Noah', N'Henderson', N'noah.henderson7145@example.net', '2017-04-25', 2, N'platinum hits not original'),
(N'Linda', N'Anderson', N'linda.anderson1989@example.net', '2017-04-25', 3, N'This is an awesome idea but in lacks in the sticking to the Xbox part I just have it resting on top. All in all its a nice product and hoping it works better then the corded one. But it would be even better if those suction cups worked how there suppose to.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Parker', N'matthew.parker5573@example.com', '2017-04-25', 5, N'is too fanny, if you still have a ps3 and miss that game, give him a chance, the price is very low.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Chavez', N'katherine.chavez9682@example.net', '2017-04-25', 5, N'Great game.'),
(N'Amara', N'Jones', N'amara.jones2444@example.com', '2017-04-25', 5, N'I was concerned that sweaty palms would eat away at the clear coat and paint, but after months of play there''s no sign of decay. Great quality!'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Wood', N'kimberly.wood6960@example.com', '2017-04-26', 5, N'The game play is great, love the game I recommend it.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Watson', N'jennifer.watson4805@example.org', '2017-04-26', 5, N'No complaints here!'),
(N'Noah', N'Rodriguez', N'noah.rodriguez5692@example.org', '2017-04-27', 5, N'Great Product! I work highly recommend!'),
(N'Nathan', N'Perez', N'nathan.perez2649@example.org', '2017-04-27', 5, N'excellent product'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Henderson', N'jacqueline.henderson8815@example.com', '2017-04-27', 5, N'Reviewing an early release of a wheel is difficult. There are normally some hardware revisions, firmware updates, and software updates that will happen before a wheel is "mature". In this case I''ll have to make the normal recommendation- early signs are good, I like this wheel. Pros: Great styling and setup. The "yoke" grips, the paddles, plenty of buttons. This looks just like an actual race wheel on a car. The "Thrustmaster" plate seems to be removable too, so I can pretty much guarantee someone is going to cook up a rev counter screen as an add-on. There are even extara buttons on the base, so you get ~13 total buttons including a "mode" switch I haven''t even looked at yet. Great power. This week pulls just as hard as an actual car without power steering. Trying to turn the wheel all the way over when it''s "at rest" and simulating tires fighting your grip I''m almost afraid to let loose or it could seriously smack my hands. There''s a demo mode in settings that simulates various...'),
(N'Ronald', N'Cooper', N'ronald.cooper1872@example.org', '2017-04-27', 5, N'Too much fun.'),
(N'Anna', N'Wood', N'anna.wood4753@example.org', '2017-04-27', 5, N'I managed an overall 30% boost to my stats in Overwatch after 150 hours of these, with 500 hours in, for a total of 750 hours of game experience. Definitely a must have for the serious FPS''er and a great way to put Xim-users on equal footing ;)'),
(N'Alexander', N'Kumar', N'alexander.kumar2570@example.com', '2017-04-27', 5, N'I just received mine today!! I love it!!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Wang', N'hannah.wang3112@example.org', '2017-04-28', 5, N'Loves it'),
(N'Steven', N'Anderson', N'steven.anderson3889@example.net', '2017-04-28', 5, N'Old game but still fun to play. I hope the next movie follows this game.'),
(N'Karen', N'Webb', N'karen.webb4994@example.net', '2017-04-28', 3, N'I really like psychopass, but I found myself falling asleep playing this game. It just didn''t capture my attention like I expected it to. The female character is very bland and strange.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Myers', N'ronald.myers5359@example.com', '2017-04-28', 5, N'HORI is known as a good company so what can I say? It fits perfectly on my son''s 3 DS!'),
(N'Heather', N'Jackson', N'heather.jackson4539@example.net', '2017-04-29', 5, N'I''m obsessed with this amazing game. Going completely stealth and undetected has been a great challenge -- and you can carry over powers from previous play!'),
(N'Diane', N'Sullivan', N'diane.sullivan5899@example.net', '2017-04-29', 3, N'I bought these for my son he likes them but we''re nervous because my XO 7 Pro''s just broke, so I can''t imagine these will last much longer. Beware TB does not make them like they used to.'),
(N'Gary', N'Johnson', N'gary.johnson4513@example.org', '2017-04-29', 5, N'Great case, everything fits well'),
(N'Ravi', N'Reed', N'ravi.reed3218@example.com', '2017-04-29', 5, N'Great buy'),
(N'Deborah', N'Morris', N'deborah.morris3304@example.org', '2017-04-29', 5, N'item arrived fast and works great as expexcted.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Boyd', N'jeffrey.boyd5599@example.com', '2017-04-29', 3, N'Its great just like Far cry 4 and 3. The animals return including Rhinos, Eagle, Dholes, Wolves, crocodiles even the badger. The scenery is fantastic. What bored me is that characters do not speak English like in previous games. What''s the point of marketing a game to English players that contains no English? A lot of time and money must have been spent to create that stone age language more than it would have taken to use English which video gamers would comprehend.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Long', N'melissa.long4473@example.org', '2017-04-29', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Walker', N'nicholas.walker4021@example.org', '2017-04-29', 5, N'Awesome pair of Xbox live gaming headsets. Very comfortable. Definitely worth the money.'),
(N'Susan', N'Garcia', N'susan.garcia6536@example.net', '2017-04-29', 5, N'The game came sealed and the disc''s case was not damaged from shipping. This is especially a plus for collectors.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Garcia', N'mateo.garcia2651@example.com', '2017-04-29', 3, N'The driverless options for this mouse are pretty nice. The 3310 sensor is also one of the best. I don''t like the shape, though. Even though I''ve gotten the largest version of FK mouse, the ''pinch grip,'' concave shape is uncomfortable to me. The coupled with decreasing slope where the buttons are, I routinely find myself not having enough space to put my ring and pinky fingers. It''s a great mouse if you like this shape, but I reverted back to the G203/G Pro style with its more convex contours.'),
(N'Adam', N'Clark', N'adam.clark7735@example.org', '2017-04-29', 4, N'Works well in PS4'),
(N'Joan', N'Walker', N'joan.walker5142@example.org', '2017-04-30', 3, N'Game time is game time.'),
(N'Mary', N'Morris', N'mary.morris5425@example.org', '2017-04-30', 5, N'This review is for the Thrustmaster VG TS-PC Wheel. I was a little concerned when I read the review mentioning the Fan clicking noise. He must have gotten a bad unit because mine is perfect. Typically I like to test a product out for about 3 weeks before commenting on it, but the TS-PC just blew me away last night and I felt a need to come and sing it''s praises. I own a T300 and T500 so if you have one of those wheels I can give you a good idea of what to expect with the TS-PC. First of all it just blows the T300 out of the room. It''s so much more powerful and smoother that it''s in a totally different ball park. Against the T500 its a much closer match. The T500 has about 40% less feedback power when compared to the TS-PC and the smoothness of the TS-PC feels about 50% smoother in the turns. So yeah its a huge jump even against a T500. Last night at 11pm I told myself that I am going to do a quick 10 Lap drive. A couple hours later I had to force myself to stop driving. (That...'),
(N'Linda', N'Nguyen', N'linda.nguyen1134@example.net', '2017-04-30', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Janet', N'Wang', N'janet.wang3072@example.net', '2017-04-30', 5, N'This game is an excellent addition to TLoZ franchise and completely pushes the boundaries of expectations for a Zelda title. I have had this game since release day and still haven''t beaten the final boss yet - there are so many sidequests and other things to do! There is no wrong way to play - there are tons of options for all play styles. I purchased the Wii U version since I''m waiting for the new Mario title to be released before buying a Switch.'),
(N'Donald', N'Harris', N'donald.harris6928@example.com', '2017-04-30', 5, N'Designed to go over existing padded stick. In my case, the pad came off so they did not fit snug. If you still have the original rubber pad on stick it will fit perfect.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Stewart', N'joseph.stewart2653@example.net', '2017-04-30', 3, N'Game hangs up and has to be reset. The graphics are great but actual play is frustrating. Can only play at beginners level. Social hook ups are complicated and take the fun out of play as you sit and wait. Microsoft tries to sell you something everytime you turn around, while in game!! The concept is good but Microsoft ruins it with corporate greed!'),
(N'Anna', N'Carter', N'anna.carter7496@example.com', '2017-05-01', 5, N'My kids love this game, and it takes me back to my own teenage years when I had the original version of this game on the SNES back in the mid-1990s! Now, even better, they''re in HD!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Campbell', N'kathleen.campbell3659@example.org', '2017-05-01', 5, N'Very enjoyable game. Have been playing for 3 weeks.'),
(N'Luis', N'Perez', N'luis.perez8885@example.net', '2017-05-01', 5, N'This is my second copy (so I can play with family members). Great game! One of my favorites!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Campbell', N'amanda.campbell2491@example.net', '2017-05-01', 5, N'Fast and Easy!'),
(N'Melissa', N'Taylor', N'melissa.taylor2727@example.net', '2017-05-01', 4, N'Works great! Only complaint, is the many ways to connect via bluetooth.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Allen', N'barbara.allen9928@example.com', '2017-05-01', 5, N'I have a hard time finding a gaming mouse that is comfortable for my hand. My mouse of choice was the Lachesis. However, that mouse is hard to come by now. So I ended up trying this. It is very similar to the Lachesis but it has a VERY low profile. Thankfully I''m a claw grip so this doesn''t bother me. If you are a palm grip this may cause discomfort. Switching DPI is easy by access to a button located on the bottom of the mouse. It lets you know what DPI you have based on color. It is very responsive has great pick up tracing and is just an awesome mouse. Only complaint, it shows oil and fingerprints really easily'),
(N'Lauren', N'Ward', N'lauren.ward3900@example.org', '2017-05-02', 5, N'Greate price fast shipping'),
(N'Pamela', N'Johnson', N'pamela.johnson7818@example.com', '2017-05-02', 5, N'delivered quickly. brand new as described.'),
(N'David', N'Kowalski', N'david.kowalski3131@example.org', '2017-05-02', 4, N'It is ok but expensive'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Baker', N'stephanie.baker6691@example.net', '2017-05-02', 5, N'Love this game! If you don''t have the time to sit and put multiple hours in one sitting at a time. This is the game for you. Move at your own pace and the learning curve is very easy.'),
(N'Betty', N'Cooper', N'betty.cooper5341@example.com', '2017-05-03', 4, N'Bought as a replacement. Amazon sent me the wireless version by mistake. I kept it anyway and just plugged it in (I don''t care for wireless mice). Anyway using with the "Aurora" app on Win10 to set my own colors across multiple products (Logitech G810 keyboard and Razer mouse)'),
(N'Michael', N'Hernandez', N'michael.hernandez4851@example.com', '2017-05-03', 5, N'An excellent follow on to Dungeon Siege 1.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Gutierrez', N'lauren.gutierrez7800@example.net', '2017-05-03', 5, N'Legion is the best expansion since Wrath and I think most of the player base would agree with that.'),
(N'Luis', N'Bell', N'luis.bell4748@example.org', '2017-05-03', 4, N'Classic shooter with full co-op mode for the campaign, something of a rarity in gaming. The intro sequence is better than most music videos or movie trailers. Action itself is okay-- it''s an old title so it''s not as good as the latest CoD obviously. Worth a play, especially if you want to play co-op in something other than one-off missions or zombie hordes.'),
(N'Noah', N'Watson', N'noah.watson8503@example.net', '2017-05-03', 4, N'There''s a lot to love about Just Cause 3, but also plenty to bemoan. Graphically, the game is a beauty: colorful palettes, impressive draw distances, and jaw-dropping explosions aplenty. Sadly, for every mouth-watering visual treat, there are persistent frame-rate drops and increasingly monotonous environments to laggingly blast your way through. Gameplay wise, JC3 hits most of its marks-- the ever-present grappling-hook and parachute return, while new features like a wingsuit and the ability to attach tethers to objects add new avenues of physics-based insanity to the mix. Fooling around with just about anything in JC3''s enormous open world can be a hoot, but mission structures and some mini-games miss the mark. Gotta love that wingsuit, though :) Story-wise, JC3 improves upon its predecessors, but that isn''t saying much... characters are ridiculously thinly drawn (not a complaint, but not an endorsement either), the dialogue''s somewhere between giggle inducing and groan inducing,...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Wilson', N'cheryl.wilson5738@example.org', '2017-05-03', 3, N'alright'),
(N'Gary', N'Moore', N'gary.moore6739@example.net', '2017-05-04', 5, N'My boys love this game and it has kept them busy for quite a while.'),
(N'Priya', N'Stewart', N'priya.stewart2842@example.net', '2017-05-04', 4, N'I like to play the game to relax and have fun. These newer games get way to complicated, it''s not fun, it''s more like work! I like to play a quick game, or play by myself Heck they don''t even make any pro-golf games or pro-baseball anymore!'),
(N'Megan', N'Russell', N'megan.russell6204@example.net', '2017-05-05', 5, N'Great item, the case looks cool and happy to have it.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Smith', N'aisha.smith3891@example.com', '2017-05-05', 5, N'I love Horn Blast Whirlwind because he looks like Spyro in a differint way, and that is why I picked him because I''m a Spyro fan.'),
(N'Emily', N'White', N'emily.white5846@example.com', '2017-05-05', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Barbara', N'Brooks', N'barbara.brooks3943@example.net', '2017-05-05', 4, N'Someone lost my charger and needed a new one, performed as expected and would buy another one if need to.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Richardson', N'evelyn.richardson7149@example.net', '2017-05-05', 5, N'Thank you for making my heart happy, excellent product'),
(N'Kelly', N'Turner', N'kelly.turner8256@example.net', '2017-05-06', 5, N'Brings the best of Melee and Brawl together into a solid fighting/party game mix. DLC adds more fighters and maps'),
(N'David', N'King', N'david.king4616@example.com', '2017-05-07', 4, N'I purchased the RGB Cherry MX keyboard and could not be more pleased with the keyboard. It has been just short of six months since my purchase. The switches are perfect. They have a soft sound to them, as I personally hate the loud clicky-clack, and it is immediately noticeable the difference between a mechanical and a membrane keyboard. They macro recording, and M1-M3 buttons, as well as the media control buttons are out of the way, which is a big plus for me. I hate keyboards that have stuff in the way of my hands resting on the palm rest. The Macro G1-G6 keys off to the left of the keyboard are also fantastically placed. I am easily able to reach them in WASD games without having to take more than one finger from the WASD set. The palm rest is comfortable with a soft-ish rubber-like plastic texture and is easily removed or reconnected as needed. The build quality is top-notch. this thing has some good heft to it. The metal bar around the top and on the sides makes it easy to...'),
(N'Betty', N'Kim', N'betty.kim8180@example.com', '2017-05-07', 4, N'Katsura Hashino is easily one of my favorite game directors of all time. With Persona 5, you can tell that he has truly brought Persona to the next generation. Overall, I would say that Persona 5 is very much worth your time. While there were several things about the game that made me enjoy it less than Persona 4, I still found it a worthy game of the Persona name. Note: This is a review for the Playstation 3 version of the game, which if you have any concern runs very well on the console. It seems that the Playstation 4 version is in 1080p instead of 720p and has better loading times than the PS3 version. Pros: -Persona 5 has easily the best gameplay the series has ever seen. We see a return of the great gameplay of Persona 3 and 4 with a smooth and streamlined execution that really makes battles and Palace exploration/sleuthing a treat. The Baton Pass feature is also something that I found added a really cool layer of depth to the battle system. -Artistically, this is by far the...'),
(N'Kyle', N'Green', N'kyle.green2419@example.org', '2017-05-07', 5, N'This Official Ninitendo charger charges my New 3DS XL and my 3DS XL exactly as it should. Highly Recommended if you need a new or additional charger!'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Russell', N'jeremy.russell5628@example.org', '2017-05-07', 4, N'Goofy checkpoints which make you unnecessarily replay big chunks of the game when you die and clunky, messy in game map.. Other than those two complaints this game is pretty damn well perfect and loads of fun!!!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Carter', N'samantha.carter2191@example.org', '2017-05-08', 5, N'Great item. Item came on time and in good condition. would but again if i ever need another item from like this'),
(N'Deborah', N'Butler', N'deborah.butler1003@example.com', '2017-05-08', 5, N'not 60 but you get 55 so be happy your 30 fps is not in this game but not quiet 60'),
(N'Joyce', N'Jackson', N'joyce.jackson6272@example.net', '2017-05-08', 5, N'Cooking Mama: Cook Off was hailed by the kids as a super fun game on the Wii. Cooking Mama World Kitchen was dubbed as not as good as the first, but still great. Fast Forward three years when I finally conceded and got younger kid her own game console - guess what game she wanted for her new New Nintendo 3DS XL - Pikachu Yellow Edition - I''ll give you a hint, it wasn''t Pokemon. The newest offering from the Cooking Mama series, Cooking Mama 5: Bon Appetit! was extremely well received by Kid v2.0. This game is great for younger audiences - or for adult audiences who are looking to play a large variety of games in a short period of time. The cooking element that is present in all Cooking Mama games is included with plenty of chopping, dicing, egg cracking, and vegetable peeling. In addition to the cooking element of the game, there are also a large number of additional mini games. The games are broken up into 5 sections: "Let''s Cook", "Cooking Dojo", "Let''s Help in the Shop", "Let''s...'),
(N'Wei', N'James', N'wei.james8197@example.org', '2017-05-09', 5, N'Not everyone likes the Wii Remote. I feel like this product has been out long enough that most people have developed an opinion on it. The feel of the remote does take some getting used to since it isn''t your standard controller. I do feel that this controller does compliment the Wii and Wii U''s systems nicely. The response rate is pretty seamless, I''ve never noticed a lag in response. I like the features that come with using this type of controller and I''ve grown accustomed to using it when playing either the Wii or Wii U. The controller itself is pretty sturdy, I''ve had several of these throughout the years and thus far Nintendo''s Wii Remote has never failed me. I do like to use rechargeable batteries instead of regular ones so I''m not sure how long normal batteries can support the controller before dying. Rechargeable batteries can last a long time depending on how long and often you play.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Thomas', N'ronald.thomas4274@example.net', '2017-05-09', 2, N'Cheaply made, sometimes inputs don''t recognize. So cheap, you can see seems in the plastic from the mold. You''d be better off spending a bit more on a better controller.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Lewis', N'ashley.lewis2477@example.net', '2017-05-09', 4, N'This is a game that challenges you. At any moment, you could be instantly killed by falling into lava or falling off of a building. I like this game a lot. The only thing I don''t like about this game is the controls. It does not take advantage of the dual analog and you have to use the shoulder buttons to strafe and look up and down.'),
(N'Donald', N'Jenkins', N'donald.jenkins2105@example.com', '2017-05-09', 5, N'Loved this game play it non stop although i should but the graphics on this one id say the first batman game was better but still pretty nice to play it'),
(N'Anthony', N'Wisniewski', N'anthony.wisniewski4988@example.org', '2017-05-09', 3, N'I play "offline" but for some strange reason I have to connect to UBI to play it. And that is where the fun begins. If I did nothing after hitting the play icon sometimes the game would show up on my screen (in about 5 minutes) and sometimes it won''t.( I use a ctrl/alt/del to get around the screens before it starts out). It still takes a VERY long time to boot up! Visually the game is stunning, but the are STILL several bugs. Once when invading a fortress no bad guys showed up, also when I attacked the Royal Fortress no enemy showed up and I was left outside. The second time I invaded the same fortress my C4 charges failed to blow open the main gate although I saw done in a you-tube video. In several other missions the first time I would go though them I would end up in a place that would not complete the mission because it lacked the characters, when I reset back the the last saved point and replayed, the characters appeared. Frustrating at times Not worth more that $10 in my opinion'),
(N'Sandra', N'Peterson', N'sandra.peterson7099@example.com', '2017-05-09', 5, N'The item arrived on time and the quality of product is good. No any problem can be found. Fantastic seller.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Johnson', N'samuel.johnson5675@example.net', '2017-05-10', 5, N'Awesome game and entertaining, graphic and sounds game different from xbox 360 version. But still fun to play as batman on xbox one consoles. Hope they make more BATMAN ARKHAM series games for xbox 360 and xbox one in the future.'),
(N'Donna', N'Lopez', N'donna.lopez2074@example.net', '2017-05-10', 5, N'Great game, works good. What''s all this minimum word amount for A dang review? I mean, four words should cut it, but no, not today... Sheesh..'),
(N'James', N'King', N'james.king9649@example.org', '2017-05-10', 5, N'This is very good for holding the ps vita with some focus but using it without it at times seem like you could break the slim ps vita from gaming hard. Pros: Easy grip and it fit the slim comfortable easy to use Cons: No R3 or R2 button on the grip but it will make using the item better ( IF YOU GO WITH THIS ONE OVER THE R2/R3 ONE) Could move up in with the slim version but its really for ps1000 version'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Allen', N'evelyn.allen2942@example.com', '2017-05-10', 5, N'The game arrived in a timely manner and plays terrific with no issues. it was packaged well too. Having a requirement for amount of words is completely fun.'),
(N'Omar', N'Brooks', N'omar.brooks3686@example.net', '2017-05-10', 5, N'this was an OEM harddrive for xbox 360 slim. said it had 320gb but once formatted only 260gb were available. still plenty of space for dlc and games'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Patel', N'evelyn.patel9983@example.org', '2017-05-10', 3, N'This mouse is cheap, sturdy, and fits my hand perfectly. I started noticing the left click doesn''t always register though. I''m giving it another try because it''s relatively cheap and fits my hand well, but if it fails again I''ll probably never buy any Logitech products for the next decade or two.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Russell', N'marcus.russell8152@example.com', '2017-05-11', 5, N'good game! good price!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Richardson', N'thomas.richardson8975@example.net', '2017-05-11', 5, N'When I bought this a year ago on Amazon, I did not expect to get an unopened copy for $10.00, but that''s what I got. Lucky me, but now there is one less sealed copy in the world. DoA is my fighting series. Everyone has their favorite, be it Tekken, Killer Instinct, Street Fighter, Mortal Kombat, etc. This one appeals to me. Boob physics aside, the characters are interesting, and all have their strengths and weaknesses. In story mode, the game is tough but never feels like its cheated you out of a win. Just get better and you will win. Coming out after Dead or Alive 3 and Extreme Beach Volleyball, DoA 2 is enhanced over its initial Dreamcast version and Playstation 2 port. Looking superior to DoA 3 and very close to the quality of DoA 4 on Xbox 360. Dead or Alive 1 is presented (mostly) its original format. More or less included in the pack as a bonus disk. With DoA 5 the series lost it''s charm, as well as its creator and most of the Team Ninja staff. It focuses on...'),
(N'Charles', N'Gonzalez', N'charles.gonzalez9947@example.com', '2017-05-11', 5, N'Love it!'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ramirez', N'jacob.ramirez8688@example.org', '2017-05-11', 5, N'Played great. I met no issues while playing it.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Ramirez', N'jacob.ramirez8688@example.org', '2017-05-11', 5, N'Brand new, just as expected. Naturally plays great.'),
(N'James', N'Jimenez', N'james.jimenez1647@example.net', '2017-05-11', 5, N'An anniversary game to one of the most influential FPS games of all time. With fresh visuals and new easter eggs for halo fans this is a very valuable buy.'),
(N'Laura', N'Moore', N'laura.moore1365@example.net', '2017-05-11', 5, N'Game works 100% from the pause menu to actually gameplay. I love that it came on time, the packaging was handled very nicely. Awesome game, nice packaging and came in the original casing (with the code and instruction manual)'),
(N'Timothy', N'Wisniewski', N'timothy.wisniewski2357@example.org', '2017-05-11', 5, N'My son LOVES this keyboard!!!! Great buy!'),
(N'Nicole', N'Perry', N'nicole.perry6508@example.org', '2017-05-12', 4, N'Bought it for my brother and he loved it!'),
(N'Carol', N'Wright', N'carol.wright4471@example.org', '2017-05-13', 5, N'Great product.'),
(N'William', N'Foster', N'william.foster1764@example.net', '2017-05-13', 1, N'You do not get the M80 mix amp that is shown in the picture'),
(N'Wei', N'Stewart', N'wei.stewart5814@example.com', '2017-05-13', 5, N'Brilliantly thought out game! My 5 year old loves it just as much as I do! My only qualm is, I wish there was more!'),
(N'Jack', N'Fisher', N'jack.fisher7641@example.org', '2017-05-13', 5, N'Could''ve been a good game but it wasn''t up to everyone''s hype.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Fisher', N'barbara.fisher8015@example.org', '2017-05-13', 4, N'My son played this game and this his review.... Quantom break was a excellent game i liked the story line and everything the only thing like was that it required internet to watch part of these videos to show whats happaning. I received this item for my honest opinion and was not compensated.'),
(N'Adam', N'Lee', N'adam.lee7269@example.net', '2017-05-14', 4, N'Fine'),
(N'Brandon', N'Moore', N'brandon.moore4010@example.org', '2017-05-14', 1, N'More video less game'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Garcia', N'jonathan.garcia8377@example.net', '2017-05-14', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Joshua', N'Barnes', N'joshua.barnes9839@example.com', '2017-05-14', 2, N'They were too big'),
(N'Amy', N'White', N'amy.white4358@example.com', '2017-05-14', 5, N'Fell apart after a month'),
(N'Joshua', N'Allen', N'joshua.allen8757@example.com', '2017-05-14', 2, N'Terrible, cars just slip and slide, Grand Turismo,Ridge Racer,Grid,Full Auto,Race pro,NASCAR unleashed,Driver Club all far better games! I have over 400 games from PC to ten plus systems all mint,so I know my games! Those are just two of pics of my setups including three gaming laptops 4k monitors etc! But I still consider myself a casual gamer,I play LESS THAN 2 hours a month,and I enjoy games you can pick up and play ,set up in 30 minutes and enjoy! This isn''t that game! So if you''re a extreme gamer, then this may be for you. I found graphics and control subpar!'),
(N'Mei', N'Lopez', N'mei.lopez9627@example.org', '2017-05-15', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Lauren', N'Lee', N'lauren.lee1148@example.com', '2017-05-15', 5, N'One of the best old school RPG''s.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Ruiz', N'nadia.ruiz3849@example.com', '2017-05-15', 5, N'It was a gift for my grandson. He loves it has some of the others.'),
(N'Luis', N'Phillips', N'luis.phillips2326@example.org', '2017-05-15', 5, N'Interesting game'),
(N'Jason', N'Robinson', N'jason.robinson4022@example.org', '2017-05-15', 5, N'Wish I''d Bought it Long Ago. This thing is great. Very solid and well made. Completely changes the experience. Batteries last a long time. It''s just nice all around. It is about the size of a Roku remote control but just slightly heavier. The auto-illumination is fantastic. Just pleased all around - others have covered specifics already and I have none of the complaints that have been mentioned, only positive things to say. I sure wish MS would come through with the promised DVR functions for live tv and then my Xbox actually WOULD be the all-in-one entertainment piece they envisioned and championed to begin with. Oh well. Great job on the remote at least. The only thing I sometimes miss is the chat-pad on the regular controller but I have it tucked in the coffee table so if we really need it (which really isn''t that often I''ve come to realize) it''s not far away.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Martin', N'yuki.martin2336@example.net', '2017-05-16', 5, N'Awesome game for the price.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Gutierrez', N'deborah.gutierrez3209@example.com', '2017-05-16', 4, N'CAME IN SUPER LATE. But everything works and looks great.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Young', N'ryan.young8468@example.com', '2017-05-16', 5, N'This was a gift for my son I know he enjoyed himself playing the game on his xbox.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Wilson', N'patricia.wilson8284@example.net', '2017-05-16', 1, N'The amiibo box was damaged and it is no good for my collection.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Morgan', N'jessica.morgan1774@example.org', '2017-05-16', 2, N'Terrible, Don''t even bother. Crap comes off after an hour of use, not to mention its a struggle to even get on. Did enjoy the sticker it came with, Its been on my laptop for 2 years now. That is the only positive thing there is.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Webb', N'samuel.webb7607@example.com', '2017-05-16', 5, N'perfect'),
(N'Jack', N'Smith', N'jack.smith1792@example.org', '2017-05-17', 3, N'The graphics are good if you like bright orange I guess. There are a lot of easy achievements/trophies to get. It''s the same story as another apocalypto/borderlands game though . The machines get annoying after new areas open up. They can be high levels and lurk around every corner. The platforming experience is difficult due to unstable foooting that occurs. It is easy to fall from a ledge and Aloy will not auto catch herself. The robots really get annoying when trying to explore the map. Each battle feels like a desperate fight for survival (like the cover of the game shows). Main quests award a lot of xp which is really the only reason I play them. There isn''t much to do in the game anyways. Compared to masterpieces like Fallout 4 this game is more of a casual experience without enriching character development. Overall good but wonky platforming and enemies are unfairly tough.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Ivanov', N'matthew.ivanov6093@example.net', '2017-05-17', 5, N'Held my games and memory card, but lost it along with my vita'),
(N'George', N'Campbell', N'george.campbell3776@example.com', '2017-05-17', 5, N'For the money, these are great headphones. The sound quality is nice although does benefit from EQ software. The LEDs can be turned on or off. The cable is a bit rigid and the control unit is very large and unwieldy but the headset itself is great and comfortable for long wear sessions.'),
(N'Frank', N'Hernandez', N'frank.hernandez8677@example.net', '2017-05-17', 3, N'The mouse input itself is solid, but there is raised plastic where the tip of your thumb rests that is annoying. Also the side button towards the front of the mouse is very pointy and is uncomfortable to click and to rest your thumb near. I''m half tempted to file it and the raised plastic part down, which would make it more comfortable.'),
(N'Justin', N'Ivanov', N'justin.ivanov9698@example.net', '2017-05-17', 5, N'Works perfectly'),
(N'Dee', N'Butler', N'dee.butler8651@example.net', '2017-05-18', 5, N'Very fun game to test some driving skills/to have fun/and be creative with tracks (making your own). Always loved these games!'),
(N'Ryan', N'Sullivan', N'ryan.sullivan2859@example.org', '2017-05-18', 5, N'This game is simply a masterpiece because the gameplay and the story is very combined and tied together by the soundtrack. This is the best game so far from Yoko Taro and Platinum Games.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Wright', N'andrew.wright1598@example.org', '2017-05-18', 5, N'Amazing Price and Game!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Carter', N'sharon.carter3887@example.org', '2017-05-19', 5, N'Favorite rock band! So many songs and venues took me over a month to do them all!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Thompson', N'thomas.thompson5660@example.org', '2017-05-19', 4, N'Not sure still early to tell, I can see it being fun if I can get the controls down . Good graphics and sounds'),
(N'Zachary', N'Morales', N'zachary.morales3162@example.com', '2017-05-19', 4, N'Nice.'),
(N'Henry', N'Raghunathan', N'henry.raghunathan9449@example.com', '2017-05-19', 5, N'Very Compact and Great Device. Will little explain what this small device can do: Awesome opportunity to play Vita games and (PSP games - download only) games on your Big HD TV screen with normal controller (I using PS4 controller, also can be connected PS3 controller). Has port for HDMI and USB 2.0 / 3.0, uses PS Vita small memory card. More suggesting to buy physical PS Vita games, because You can play them without installing.(rare some take some space as updates for games) But some 8 Gb or better 16 Gb PS Vita memory card needs also for saves and digital downloads for PSP games. (which are not very big) Unfortunately - Not all games PS Vita games are compatible with it, so check Web for compatible games. Better - Official Wiki for All USA released games on PS Vita - List of PlayStation Vita games. Unfortunately Can''t here provide a full Link - Not allowed by rules. There You can check which games are compatible or Not before buying them. Hope this Helps, Enjoy.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Gutierrez', N'samuel.gutierrez5247@example.com', '2017-05-20', 5, N'Very good sev'),
(N'Janet', N'Wang', N'janet.wang3072@example.net', '2017-05-20', 5, N'Another excellent game by Bethesda! While I personally am not a huge MMO fan, my husband is and enjoys playing with his buddies whenever they''re all online. The game I purchased was just the base game for Xbox One - there was no additional DLC included. However, he''s had enough to explore and enjoy so far in this iteration of Tamriel that he hasn''t even thought about purchasing additional content yet. If you are a fan of The Elder Scrolls series/world and are also a fan of MMO games, I would highly recommend this game!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Richardson', N'joyce.richardson5858@example.com', '2017-05-20', 1, N'Very disappointed, there is no artbook inside the case for my game, it doesn''t make any sense.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Richardson', N'joyce.richardson5858@example.com', '2017-05-20', 5, N'Good as expected.'),
(N'Frank', N'Butler', N'frank.butler7237@example.net', '2017-05-20', 5, N'really cool game'),
(N'Raymond', N'Edwards', N'raymond.edwards3690@example.com', '2017-05-21', 4, N'There is a slight delay in response if you let it sit for more than a few minutes. Other than that, it''s great,'),
(N'Janet', N'Tanaka', N'janet.tanaka9597@example.org', '2017-05-21', 5, N'I don''t buy the game from Amazon but I still do a review on it anything. So this is the first Robocop console game and I liked it even you''re moving at walking speed with limited short jump where you have to time your shooting and jumping. But with limited moving speed and jumping there is power-up items and weapons to help pass some level parts which you can''t pass without them. Plus this game has password setup so you can skip to any level in the game but if you do use the passwords you''ll always start with the handgun no matter just like most SNES games with password you''ll start with the first weapon you''re given. And if you can''t beat the game and want to know the story there is comics for the game telling the story that I might get someday.'),
(N'Joshua', N'James', N'joshua.james8975@example.com', '2017-05-21', 4, N'GLITCH but actually liked'),
(N'Raymond', N'Anderson', N'raymond.anderson4092@example.org', '2017-05-22', 5, N'Fantastic Kit! Even though I purchased it only for the neoprene slim case, I was amazed at how nice and useful everything in the package is. The joy-con grips look great on the neon joy-cons with the Sheikah patterns on it. They look like the ancient shrines from the game. The included game case was nicer than expected, holds six games. The neoprene case is perfect. Great for traveling light where you don''t want to carry a bulky heavy case. Note: I have a glass screen protector installed so I did not use the included protector film. Pro Tip: You can combine the grips with a clear protector back panel and thumbstick caps for complete coverage.'),
(N'Paul', N'Wilson', N'paul.wilson8937@example.com', '2017-05-22', 5, N'Great sandbox play, Hitman style. I love how the "Opportunities" steer you to find the many ways to go through missions, and I think the idea of unlocking better drops and starting locations as you conquer levels is a brilliant idea. The online component for Hitman gets better and better, especially with elusive targets.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Kim', N'nadia.kim6286@example.org', '2017-05-22', 5, N'It works perfectly. Three games in one at an amazing price. The only minor issue I have with it is that loading takes forever (especially Tekken 6) and it always installs the trophies and other stuff every time.'),
(N'David', N'Allen', N'david.allen5527@example.org', '2017-05-22', 5, N'As a former Xbox user for 8 dedicated years I have to say the PS4 really is ahead of its time. Compared to the Xbox One, well, there in no comparison. Where the Xbox would lag, stutter and randomly disconnect from the internet (as well as a host of other issues) the PS4 has done none of those things. It''s very fast. The UI is great. The build quality is better. The graphics are better and the games are better. The reason I decided to switch was not on my own accord, Xbox decided to ban me out of the blue and for literally no reason, I''ve never cheated, cursed, or done anything even remotely close to being a bannable offense, with that being said, I''m glad they did and my only regret is that they didn''t do it sooner. Couldn''t be happier.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Anderson', N'nicholas.anderson2708@example.org', '2017-05-22', 5, N'One of the best Japanese style action games ever made! Great graphic. Complicated control. Versatile weapons and fighting style. One of the last great Japanese style action games.'),
(N'Amy', N'Raghunathan', N'amy.raghunathan1407@example.org', '2017-05-22', 4, N'Really good game. I was surprised that the price was actually that low, but I think the only drawback is that it is a very short game. Probably takes a good 5 hours.'),
(N'Helen', N'Richardson', N'helen.richardson7198@example.org', '2017-05-22', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Helen', N'Richardson', N'helen.richardson7198@example.org', '2017-05-22', 5, N'just loved it'),
(N'Helen', N'Richardson', N'helen.richardson7198@example.org', '2017-05-22', 5, N'it was what it was good job'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Ivanov', N'jennifer.ivanov2358@example.org', '2017-05-23', 3, N'This never really worked well with my Kinect. I ended up getting rid of the Kinect once i couldn''t get it to work with my computer. This powered it probably 3/4 of the time.'),
(N'Karen', N'White', N'karen.white9657@example.net', '2017-05-23', 5, N'thank youl in good shape.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Baker', N'ryan.baker8403@example.org', '2017-05-23', 5, N'Good value for the price. Works well.'),
(N'Gary', N'Wright', N'gary.wright8546@example.org', '2017-05-23', 2, N'Not fun. Stopped after 3 hours. Just too boring trudging around the desert. Also I got killed by like 20 scorpions, how rude. Yes I am the only person who doesn''t like NV. Who knew?'),
(N'Sofia', N'Edwards', N'sofia.edwards4981@example.org', '2017-05-23', 5, N'It haven''t failed me yet'),
(N'Jack', N'Reed', N'jack.reed9864@example.org', '2017-05-23', 5, N'Quite happy'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Hernandez', N'hiroshi.hernandez9916@example.org', '2017-05-23', 1, N'It''s a clunky game, no way to organize your decks or add new cards to it'),
(N'Peter', N'Miller', N'peter.miller5767@example.org', '2017-05-23', 3, N'This came in damaged so I had to return it- but the Amiibo series overall is a 4/5 experience. DLC for an average of 7.5, plus you get a consumer grade figure to keep or even re-sell if deemed a "1 time use". Just hope Nintendo finds a deeper use for the per-exisiting figures.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Wright', N'christopher.wright8328@example.com', '2017-05-24', 2, N'works but doubt it new'),
(N'Christopher', N'Wright', N'christopher.wright8328@example.com', '2017-05-24', 1, N'Disk won''t read, junk'),
(N'Jason', N'Martinez', N'jason.martinez8838@example.net', '2017-05-24', 4, N'Good product and fast shipping, I''m really enjoying this.'),
(N'Megan', N'Russell', N'megan.russell6204@example.net', '2017-05-24', 5, N'Case looks great, item did not disappoint, thanks.'),
(N'Henry', N'Kowalski', N'henry.kowalski1326@example.com', '2017-05-24', 5, N'Loved this game!'),
(N'Katherine', N'Stewart', N'katherine.stewart7062@example.com', '2017-05-24', 5, N'This cable is working flawlessly. Performs exactly as advertised. I probably won''t buy another braided cable, but only because of preference, not because there''s anything wrong with this cable.'),
(N'David', N'James', N'david.james9857@example.org', '2017-05-25', 5, N'awesome game want more.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Gonzalez', N'aisha.gonzalez7967@example.org', '2017-05-25', 3, N'Fun while it lasts... it gets boring and redundant. Only thing I look forward to is the sniping mini-video. I am going to give it a try again.... but there isn''t enough weapons surrounding the sniper to make it worth while. Full stealth mode here. Even then the game is lacking variety. Still cool though. Don''t want to sound harsh'),
(N'Peter', N'Nguyen', N'peter.nguyen8014@example.org', '2017-05-25', 5, N'So much better than Madden16...'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Martinez', N'stephanie.martinez5867@example.org', '2017-05-25', 5, N'Works as advertised at a good price. What else needs to be said. Warranty is great as well.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Wang', N'victoria.wang7392@example.net', '2017-05-26', 5, N'When changing the speed of the mouse, colors indicate the speed toggled. Great for gaming, and normal use. Feels comfortable. The back/ forward buttons are a nice extra, but I never really use them.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Chen', N'olivia.chen8304@example.net', '2017-05-26', 5, N'Exactly as described. Great price and shipping right on time.'),
(N'Emily', N'Gutierrez', N'emily.gutierrez7606@example.org', '2017-05-26', 5, N'Purchase for my son. He loves it.'),
(N'Robert', N'Ferreira', N'robert.ferreira8017@example.org', '2017-05-26', 5, N'Amazing game! more than 40 hours of gameplay'),
(N'Samantha', N'Barnes', N'samantha.barnes8382@example.org', '2017-05-26', 3, N'Well, the headset works fine, but after a few months the head lining and the soft ear cups are coming apart. The material seems to be a little substandard for active use, falling apart into little red and black pieces on my head and ears. I''ve had headsets before and none of them came apart like this. I''m not sure I''ll buy any more like it.'),
(N'Larry', N'Bell', N'larry.bell3224@example.org', '2017-05-27', 5, N'I love the MGS Game Series. The Story Rocks. Taking Phantom Pain & Ground Zeroes as part of my collection. Now I''m enjoying it with the brand new Fox Engine.'),
(N'Walter', N'Morgan', N'walter.morgan6582@example.com', '2017-05-27', 5, N'The graphic, gameplay and story makes this game one of my favorite games all time.'),
(N'Emily', N'Young', N'emily.young1879@example.org', '2017-05-27', 5, N'delivered as described'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Richardson', N'elizabeth.richardson8965@example.org', '2017-05-28', 2, N'Thankfully EA released Sim City a few years ago, or this would be the biggest disappointment they have delivered me in my recent memory. Yes, I loved the original trilogy (and I didn''t even mind the original ending to ME3). This game soured those memories as surely as Jar Jar Binks trampled over millions of Star Wars childhoods. To be honest, if someone tried this game without previously playing the ME series, it might seem okay. But with the weight and honor of such a distinguished name behind it, this game falters badly in *almost* every way - characters, story, graphics, and sound. Only the combat is a notch up from its predecessors. I can''t recommend this game, but it''s not the worst game ever made. Just an incredible let-down.'),
(N'David', N'Kowalski', N'david.kowalski3131@example.org', '2017-05-28', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'David', N'Kowalski', N'david.kowalski3131@example.org', '2017-05-28', 5, N'Great'),
(N'David', N'Kowalski', N'david.kowalski3131@example.org', '2017-05-28', 4, N'Good'),
(N'Joyce', N'Chen', N'joyce.chen7856@example.org', '2017-05-29', 4, N'Mouse itself i like. Does what its supposed to. Big enough for my hands to feel comfortable. One small con, and this happen to two of these already after few months of use the scroll wheel button(middle button) stops registering in windows. The scroll itself works but the button doesn''t actually do anything even though you can hear the click. Apparently its a defect in the 2013 model so keep that in mind.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Garcia', N'sharon.garcia3541@example.net', '2017-05-29', 2, N'This item is garbage the microphone would not work but it was easy to return. Do not waste your time in buying this product.'),
(N'Brian', N'Cruz', N'brian.cruz8366@example.net', '2017-05-29', 5, N'The game was darn hilarious. I had a great time playing it, so much fourth wall breaking and funny jokes. Outside of that the controls were really easy to use, and the additional combos made the game enjoyable.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Davis', N'kimberly.davis3556@example.net', '2017-05-29', 4, N'I really enjoyed this game. It scratched an itch I haven''t felt since Baldur''s Gate. Get this if you liked XCOM and enjoy turn based RPGs. It''s nice to see the developers take Fallout back to it''s roots. There are a few minor complaints, but I got over them soon enough such as ambushes could be set up better and I wish there were more character portraits. Also, one or two stats are less important than others. Great game overall.'),
(N'Helen', N'Richardson', N'helen.richardson7198@example.org', '2017-05-29', 4, N'i like it'),
(N'David', N'Campbell', N'david.campbell4266@example.com', '2017-05-30', 3, N'Struggling with how to play the actual game now that Disney retired the game console and the online usage. My daughter plays with the other pieces in the Toy Hub but I''m sad that I can''t figure out how to download the Toy Story Game to our set.'),
(N'Noah', N'Cruz', N'noah.cruz4076@example.net', '2017-05-30', 5, N'its Great'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Miller', N'jennifer.miller7101@example.org', '2017-05-30', 5, N'rhx'),
(N'Douglas', N'Wilson', N'douglas.wilson7910@example.com', '2017-05-31', 5, N'Silent Hill 2 was true to the original (not too fast to play for we NUMEROUS old folks). SH3 was a bit harder. Perhaps too hard. Nice for the Xbox 360!'),
(N'Scott', N'Thomas', N'scott.thomas6497@example.com', '2017-05-31', 4, N'Great game.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Ramirez', N'benjamin.ramirez9377@example.com', '2017-05-31', 4, N'Great grip and also comes with stickers in the box good for when you play a game for a long period of time.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ramos', N'michelle.ramos3577@example.net', '2017-05-31', 1, N'Cd player didn''t work,description said works fine. Thanks game on. Had to pay shipping back.'),
(N'Frank', N'Perez', N'frank.perez5798@example.net', '2017-06-01', 4, N'I grew up playing DOOM and DOOM II on my Playstation. The aspects of the game were very simple, yet addicting. It was like a violent, demon-filled maze and that''s what led to countless hours of fun. This game does a great job in bringing that element back with a more modern style. I especially love that each level has a hidden room that pays tribute to the original DOOM games. Such a nice touch. If you loved the original DOOM games and you enjoy today''s FPS games you will most certainly enjoy this game. Also, I have to add that the soundtrack is simply amazing! It gave me goosebumps during intense moments. Just don''t play it in the car or you WILL speed and ram other cars out of the way. XD'),
(N'Robert', N'Price', N'robert.price8266@example.org', '2017-06-01', 5, N'Amazing game. Had no issues with anything. No bugs, graphical glitches, nothing. Great deal that I got this with my Xbox One bundle for $299. Extremely fun action adventure game with RPG elements (weapon leveling, etc).'),
(N'Kelly', N'Perez', N'kelly.perez9673@example.net', '2017-06-01', 5, N'Fun, scary and sometimes very frustrating. If your a fan of any of the Alien movies than you got to try this game!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Campbell', N'stephanie.campbell8359@example.com', '2017-06-01', 5, N'What can''t I say! THIS GAME IS FRICKING BRILLIANT! I absolutely love this game and it is the BEST racing game I''ve ever played! PROS: -Gravity Control -No Ulala -Tempest Waterway -4-Player Splitscreen CONS: -SUPER SONIC IS SO HARD TO GET! -Not enough courses -Story Mode is too short -Astral Babylon (I MEAN, COME ON!) But that''s what I think in a nutshell. Hopefully u guys think this is helpful!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Green', N'olivia.green7250@example.com', '2017-06-01', 4, N'Works ok with playstation'),
(N'Jessica', N'Alvarez', N'jessica.alvarez6447@example.com', '2017-06-02', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Alvarez', N'tomasz.alvarez2915@example.org', '2017-06-02', 5, N'YES! No such thing as a bad Shantae game. Play this now! The only criticism I have is that this game is too short.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Powell', N'kelly.powell9239@example.org', '2017-06-02', 5, N'Razer is always a great choice when it comes to your gaming needs. These headphones definitely do no fail to impress with their sound quality. With the noise cancellation of the padded and comfortable ear phones, you can easily hear in every direction, giving you a great sense of three dimensional sound during gameplay. This can come in handy and give you an edge over other players since you will no longer be snuck up on in games without hearing them coming. The microphone works great, providing clear voice transmittance to your friends and other players. No more static noise in the background as you talk thanks to its ability to mask and filter out noises other than your voice. Definitely a better quality than a logitech heaphone too btw. While the price on here is often cheaper due to the overwatch logo vs the no logo headphones, they are exactly identical so why not save the money. Besides, who doesn''t enjoy a game of overwatch anyways? Happy fragging.'),
(N'Donna', N'Rogers', N'donna.rogers6449@example.org', '2017-06-02', 5, N'Great buy, well worth the money. Only thing i did not like is that the mouse wheel spins. Scrolling is hard to control. However hot glue fix works fine.'),
(N'Janet', N'Rivera', N'janet.rivera6292@example.net', '2017-06-02', 1, N'Instantly returned to GameStop. Get ready to see the most lazily put together game of the year. - No tutorial. How is this even possible? - No trials. Same as above. - Arcade is only 5 CPU fights with no character endings. What''s the point? - Story mode is about an hour long (this is bad because Arcade mode is worthless). - Character customization is very bad compared to Tekken 6. Don''t be fooled by the trailers. - Zero replay value for story. - Input lag is way higher than SFV and rest of competition. - All female character models are using the same model and you can see this as proof when you customize them. Tekken fanboys will spin this to hide the truth and create damage control. So pathetic. This game was in development since forever and this is what they managed to do with it? By the way, if you play on controller, get ready, because this game isn''t controller friendly at all either. Don''t be fooled by the misleading trailers, which are conveniently edited to leave these...'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Patel', N'jacqueline.patel7561@example.org', '2017-06-03', 5, N'I love pokemon'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Morris', N'jennifer.morris3470@example.org', '2017-06-03', 5, N'Hands down. The best and ONLY keyboard I will ever own from now on. I''ve tried most of the best competition for gaming keyboards. Brother has the corsair, friend has the deathadder. Tried messing around with cheaper ones.. no. Neither, and I mean it.. feel as perfect as this, look as perfect as this, and behave in such a way that I can''t explain. Good Sofware, Good Hardware. Don''t even bother with the spectrum that was used to replace it. I immediately regretted buying it due to the fact they took away what I loved about the spark. Keys, lighting, feel, usage, all are great.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Turner', N'amanda.turner5862@example.com', '2017-06-03', 5, N'I freakin'' love this game. I had no idea the game was gonna go like it was, with the skynet thing. I like the open world, you slowly but surely become a badass. Was feministic to the core though. But it doesn''t matter, I like playing with women anyways. Barely any glitches, except for this one that I truly think is one, when I destroyed a deathbringer in no more than 20 shots. 1 shot took half it''s life'),
(N'Maria', N'Campbell', N'maria.campbell9236@example.net', '2017-06-03', 5, N'Have played all the Borderland games and love them. This was unexpecteed. I tried the demo when it came out and had a hard time with the controls and how it''s played, but enough of my friends told me the story was worth it, when it went on sale I picked it up and tried again. It did take me 2 chapters to get the hang of it, and more than once I died just because I got distracted with the story and missed my cue. It is a short game compared to most of the ones I play, but it was really good once I got into it and I will replay it since each choice you make, does make a difference.'),
(N'Joan', N'Baker', N'joan.baker3415@example.com', '2017-06-03', 5, N'Excellent gaming mouse. The high DPI should be enough for almost any gamer, and the Corsair software is easy to install and use. The mouse comes out of the box with 5 preset dpi settings, which can be selected using the button under the scroll wheel and display on the top of the mouse via the 5 LED bars that light up depending on the DPI setting. This feature also works if you use an operating system with no Corsair mouse software, like Mac OS. On Windows, the Corsair software installed quickly and works great. They bungle their keyboard and mouse software into one program, which is nice if you own a Corsair keyboard and want to change settings for everything in one place. The software itself is very similar to the Logitech mouse software, although I felt this a little less intuitive. Still, in just a minute I had all my settings the way I wanted them and it''s very easy to program macros as well. Overall, the mouse feels great, and probably my favorite feature is the...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Lewis', N'ravi.lewis8475@example.org', '2017-06-03', 5, N'I love the X-ray sniper shots. Very good game! I would highly recommend the game especially at the current price point.'),
(N'Steven', N'Ward', N'steven.ward9563@example.net', '2017-06-04', 5, N'This game is essentially more Mass Effect, but with a new story, different crew and some gameplay tweaks. Story have you as a pathfinder exploring new worlds to inhabit, but as luck will have it you''ll encounter a race of aliens trying to take over the universe. Game starts off really slow. There''s a lot of exposition in terms of story and gameplay. It doesn''t get good till maybe 2-3 hours in or after you completed the first major mission/fully establish an outpost on a planet. There are dialogue choices, but like most RPGs, most of them doesn''t really effect the main plot/ending of the story rather give you varying dialogue interactions depending on who you interact with, having some leading to possible romances, friendships, have a crew member/group of people hate you, or help build up alliances later down the line. Instead of renegade and paragon choices like the original trilogy; this one is more personality based choosing to whether to be emotional, logical, professional or...'),
(N'Deborah', N'Foster', N'deborah.foster3091@example.org', '2017-06-04', 2, N'First off, For Honor is intended as an online PvP game. If you are looking for a solid single-player fighting game, stop reading now. To play For Honor, you must have a UbiSoft account and be logged in at all times, even in single player mode. Not that campaign mode is worth playing. It consists of three 6 level sections, each designed to introduce the 3 races and character classes within that race (knights, vikings, samurai, in that order). They''re basically tutorials, and you are interrupted every level or so with a lesson that pops up in the sidebar and pauses the game (how to block, how to parry, etc). Characters are chosen for you for each level. There''s no choice in the matter. The voice acting is horrible and anachronistic, not befitting an AAA title. The AI is laughable. If you walk away from enemies, they''ll wander back to their post and just stand there, giving you time to heal and come back. After several levels, you are given a perk that allows you to heal while not in...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Lee', N'brenda.lee3745@example.net', '2017-06-05', 5, N'I got this for my brother since he really liked the demo version. Great game'),
(N'Brenda', N'Lee', N'brenda.lee3745@example.net', '2017-06-05', 5, N'These games are so much fun to watch and/or play. A little sad, but good'),
(N'Katherine', N'Howard', N'katherine.howard1743@example.com', '2017-06-05', 3, N'Boring and disappointing. I don''t understand why your targets are even real targets. They are not all the menacing as the ones from the first game. Also the final boss fight is bad and nothing like the rest of the game. The worst is that most enemies will see you through a wall or from the other side of the map. Luckily I got this dirt cheap and the code for the first game still worked. Play the first game and pass on this.'),
(N'Maria', N'Ivanov', N'maria.ivanov8291@example.com', '2017-06-06', 1, N'Worst mouse I''ve ever had. The DPI settings are horrid and the mouse constantly skips, especially in games'),
(N'Andrew', N'Chen', N'andrew.chen2193@example.com', '2017-06-06', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Andrew', N'Chen', N'andrew.chen2193@example.com', '2017-06-06', 5, N'great but it eats up you pokeballs'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Jackson', N'nicholas.jackson2445@example.net', '2017-06-06', 3, N'I am a huge fighting games fan, from King of fighters, Guilty Gears, Blazblu, and etc. Here is my honest review after a few days playing Tekken7: Combat: Over all the fighting was really well done. Controls were exactly what i expected from a Tekken series game. Just the the right feel when you land a punch/combo was perfect and when you get hit its like... Sh*t i deserved that one. Any gamer knows what i mean. There''s no bullsh*t here. I found the story mode to be a fun addition, a really short and ridiculous story but a fun couple hours if you wanted some nostalgia. But after it''s done, its done. Offline mode: Arcade was OK, I was hoping for some sort of small put personalized story but sadly didn''t get it, so playing through the same sequence was getting tiresome even with different characters. Could have been longer. Practice mode wasn''t what i was expecting, I like games where it has more of a tutorial for at least a run down of the basics or each character''s moves. A nice...'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Morales', N'nicholas.morales5809@example.com', '2017-06-07', 5, N'This game is so much fun to play. I like even more than MKX and part of the reason is I know a lot of the characters on the game. I would recommend this game to anyone.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Garcia', N'jerry.garcia4599@example.net', '2017-06-07', 5, N'Probably one of the best couple dollars I ever spent. After several years the case is showing signs of wear and tear but no complaints.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Diaz', N'ivan.diaz3037@example.com', '2017-06-07', 5, N'Super Mario Bros 3 is probably the pinnacle of NES titles, and it''s aged incredibly well. As a port, this is about as accurate as you can get, with the game itself untouched. The only thing missing is that there''s no simultaneous 2-player ''battle mode'' possible since it''s restricted to a single 3DS, but you can still do the 2 player pass-the-controller type of play to progress through the game. With the usual Virtual Console enhancements of adding save-states and the ability to suspend the game to play later at any time, it''s added a lot of modern convenience to a true classic NES title. As for the game itself, Mario Bros 3 expands on the original Super Mario Bros formula with a huge variety of new worlds, enemies, powerups, and boss fights. With an art style that''s aged incredibly well for 8-bit pixel gaming, Super Mario Bros 3 still manages to feel like a fresh experience even today. There''s tons of levels to explore, every world has a unique look and gimmick, and you can even...'),
(N'Donald', N'Price', N'donald.price1744@example.org', '2017-06-07', 2, N'Not a fan, it''s hard to play and just not my thing... I expected to be able to make more decisions and have some fun but it''s more like an old time game that forces you down a path...'),
(N'Anthony', N'Nguyen', N'anthony.nguyen5069@example.net', '2017-06-08', 5, N'Great keyboard. I use it for typing and gaming and it works great for both.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Thompson', N'evelyn.thompson5261@example.net', '2017-06-08', 5, N'the camera it self is ok. but the mic it self is awsome it works thats all it matters. And the price was verry cheap. I was lucky i got it for 24 bucks sometimes buying stufff used isn''t all that bad lol'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Lee', N'kimberly.lee6463@example.net', '2017-06-08', 5, N'My kid loves it. That''s good enough for me'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ivanov', N'aisha.ivanov6609@example.org', '2017-06-09', 5, N'Going great so far. Good quality.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Chen', N'brenda.chen2275@example.com', '2017-06-09', 5, N'Received this game as a gift . Finally started playing it a couple of weeks ago . This game is one of the best games I ever played .I put it up there with last of us or uncharted 4 . Don''t miss out on this game'),
(N'Barbara', N'Perez', N'barbara.perez8611@example.com', '2017-06-09', 5, N'It''s just a great mouse for gaming and productivity, the materials used feels very nice on the hand, the size of the mouse is perfect, not too small and not too big, for $39 is really worth buying,'),
(N'Emma', N'Taylor', N'emma.taylor1774@example.org', '2017-06-09', 5, N'Runs well on Windows 7 & 10. There is a patch download right after install, I recommend doing this. There isn''t any DRM (which is nice), just a CD key code. The game will allow LAN play on multiple computers with only 1 copy. There are still servers online as well. This is a great objective based team FPS. Its way better then any COD, or other mindless twitch shooter in my opinion. Since the game isn''t available on Steam, or GOG I recommend grabbing your disk while you still can!'),
(N'Brian', N'Martinez', N'brian.martinez7928@example.net', '2017-06-09', 5, N'I got rid of this once and now I''m glad I got it back. EPIC.'),
(N'Edward', N'Gonzalez', N'edward.gonzalez7230@example.com', '2017-06-09', 4, N'not for adults'),
(N'Nathan', N'Wang', N'nathan.wang3149@example.com', '2017-06-09', 5, N'Works great. Great sound all around. Great price fast service'),
(N'Anna', N'Myers', N'anna.myers8154@example.net', '2017-06-09', 5, N'IS WHAT IT WAS'),
(N'Gary', N'Long', N'gary.long7516@example.org', '2017-06-10', 5, N'aaaaa'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Price', N'jeffrey.price9103@example.net', '2017-06-10', 5, N'This is a cool version of Street Fighter. Awesome to play!'),
(N'Rachel', N'Gomez', N'rachel.gomez4938@example.com', '2017-06-10', 1, N'Just buy action replay its basically the same thing'),
(N'Nicole', N'Smith', N'nicole.smith8388@example.net', '2017-06-10', 5, N'Lots of fun for the entire family!!'),
(N'Janet', N'Diaz', N'janet.diaz8283@example.org', '2017-06-10', 5, N'I think there were too many people expecting too much due to too much hype from before this game was published. Frankly, I don''t care. I really enjoyed this game, from beginning to end. I thoroughly enjoyed the original trilogy, so I was ready to play Andromeda, and my expectations were reasonably high but I most certainly didn''t expect Andromeda to outdo any of the trilogy games, that would''ve been wishful thinking. I think it was roughly on par. And it had to be different, because of the way(s) that the trilogy ended, and it was. And so it had to be original, yet respectful of the trilogy, and it was. It had to have the same basic gameplay elements and aspects as was had in the trilogy, and it does. Is it a perfect game? No, of course not. Are there causes for disapointment? Sure, but playing to the end I''m over them. The biggest disappointment (which I got over) is that there is really no proper introduction to your crew and ship. They''re just suddenly there, and you''re in this...'),
(N'Douglas', N'Reyes', N'douglas.reyes2741@example.org', '2017-06-11', 5, N'Was easy to install. Works good.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Morgan', N'kevin.morgan9961@example.net', '2017-06-11', 5, N'very nice'),
(N'Christopher', N'Williams', N'christopher.williams8964@example.org', '2017-06-11', 5, N'Sit on your couch way away from your giant TV. Works perfect'),
(N'Steven', N'Mendoza', N'steven.mendoza4987@example.org', '2017-06-11', 5, N'This game was amazing and I cannot recommend it enough. I was fearful that the combat and game would be too hard and intense but they did a really good job balancing difficulty and gameplay. The game is very fast paced and intense and the weapon system is really nice as well. I beat it on normal and found it to be a good difficulty without being too easy. I started to play on Hard which requires a bit more effort but it isn''t extremely hard like higher difficulties will be.'),
(N'Christina', N'Mitchell', N'christina.mitchell7489@example.com', '2017-06-11', 5, N'Awesome and just perfect'),
(N'Patricia', N'Hall', N'patricia.hall3866@example.com', '2017-06-11', 5, N'Grandson loved it~'),
(N'Ryan', N'Kowalski', N'ryan.kowalski1138@example.com', '2017-06-12', 5, N'It''s LEGOs, so you know it''s great.'),
(N'Anita', N'Ward', N'anita.ward4165@example.net', '2017-06-12', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Lewis', N'benjamin.lewis8079@example.org', '2017-06-12', 1, N'Absolutely worthless. It''s June, 2017 and Cortana gets worse and worse and worse. I''m sitting here, right now, saying "Hey, Cortana, play," it says "listening," then goes away without doing anything. She listens when you don''t want her to, she mishears me all of the time. Not once has Cortana ever been useful. I don''t recommend the connect for anyone.'),
(N'William', N'Jones', N'william.jones4843@example.org', '2017-06-13', 1, N'Does not fit charger with the skin on. Disappointing.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Foster', N'deborah.foster4987@example.org', '2017-06-13', 5, N'Absolutely incredible game that stands alone. Its crafting/collecting system is reminiscent of Far Cry and combat similar to the Witcher 3 with slick movements and a tool bar to change things on the fly. I feel drawn to learn more about the lore which is unique and focused on the apocalypse that happened many years ago. Aloy has a riveting story as well, she has depth as a character. My only gripe is the facial animations aren''t perfect (better than ME:A though) and the dialogue can be somewhat dull but it''s a minor inconvenience that doesn''t detract from the game whatsoever.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Hughes', N'nicholas.hughes9795@example.net', '2017-06-13', 5, N'love the sims. always have. like watching my characters unfold. good game.'),
(N'Anita', N'Miller', N'anita.miller8658@example.org', '2017-06-13', 2, N'It''s too buggy to be playable, the story and graphics are good, but it crashes, hangs, freezes too often. I have a 64bit win 7, the game maybe 32bit, at least some of the libraries it installed are. It''s been out long enough the bugs should have been fixed.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Rodriguez', N'olivia.rodriguez7147@example.org', '2017-06-13', 5, N'Yes!'),
(N'Michael', N'Jimenez', N'michael.jimenez4601@example.com', '2017-06-13', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Joshua', N'Richardson', N'joshua.richardson9521@example.com', '2017-06-13', 5, N'Great for my collection.'),
(N'Robert', N'Adams', N'robert.adams5040@example.com', '2017-06-13', 5, N'Great mouse that feels sturdy and comfortable. And the weights give people the option to customize the weight of the mouse for those gamer''s. Would definitely recommend this to my friends.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Tanaka', N'daniel.tanaka6993@example.net', '2017-06-13', 5, N'Better than what people whine about. The patches fix all the bugs, almost. There are a few glitches, but not as many as Mass'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Boyd', N'stephanie.boyd7321@example.net', '2017-06-14', 5, N'Favorite Xbox One game'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Patel', N'jacqueline.patel7561@example.org', '2017-06-14', 5, N'I love Pokmon games'),
(N'Ashley', N'Barnes', N'ashley.barnes2808@example.net', '2017-06-14', 5, N'Works great, no compatibility issues'),
(N'Jack', N'Jackson', N'jack.jackson5565@example.com', '2017-06-15', 5, N'Fits well and does its intended job with GBA.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Bennett', N'sarah.bennett6068@example.com', '2017-06-15', 3, N'While this game is entertaining in its own right, it is a far cry from the quality of the game that inspired it. Final Fantasy Tactics on the original Playstation was one of the greatest games of its generation, if not all time. Final Fantasy Tactics Advance, on the other hand, pales in comparison. The deep, politically intriguing plot of the original is replaced with a much simpler, more kid-friendly tale of children playing as soldiers. The graphics are very nice for a Gameboy Advance Game, however the "cuter" art style leaves something to be desired. My biggest complaint is the addition of the judge system, seemingly arbitrary rules that govern the battles. Most of the time I just found them frustrating to deal with, and could not see any way in which they added to my enjoyment of the game. The locking of certain classes to specific species is also disappointing as it limits the freedom you had in the original game to completely customize your team as you see fit. Perhaps if...'),
(N'Melissa', N'Kim', N'melissa.kim7420@example.com', '2017-06-15', 5, N'If you have played the previous 2 Max Payne games you pretty much know what your getting into lots of action, many weapons, nice graphics, and loads of fun if you enjoy action adventure games then this is a must but beware lots of gore and profanity may not be suitable for children overall great game.'),
(N'Jose', N'Wisniewski', N'jose.wisniewski4601@example.org', '2017-06-15', 5, N'Good buy'),
(N'Jerry', N'Bailey', N'jerry.bailey4017@example.com', '2017-06-16', 1, N'***UPDATE*** July, 16th 2017 so I was playing an online video game and I kept having trouble playing because I kept feeling like my pinky was on the wrong key over and over so I turned the light on to see what was going on and it turns out that the shift key on the left side cracked in half! what kind of cheap garbage is this? I am not a hard core gamer nor do I abuse my stuff so this thing is absolute trash and should not be on amazon in my opinion. The keys are less than 1cm in thickness of some cheap clear plastic painted over back. have a look at my pictures. ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- It is not bad for the money but it is pretty cheap product. one of the legs on the keyboard already broke off after only about a month of use and I''m honestly very gentle with my stuff only playing one PC game in total less than 5 hours a...'),
(N'Joshua', N'Reed', N'joshua.reed3289@example.org', '2017-06-16', 5, N'Works great.'),
(N'Maria', N'Miller', N'maria.miller8335@example.org', '2017-06-16', 5, N'Despite it being the reason I got a PS4 two years ago, I got this game a few months late, worried it might not live up to the hype, but it did. A beautiful, memorable world intertwined with a story that, while dropping hints to the plot twists along the way, still makes a stunning impact at every turn. Combine that with the easy-to-learn, difficult-to-master combat that relies more on brains that brawn, classic RPG elements including branching dialogue, branching storylines, sidequests, and crafting, and you have not only one of the best games of the year, but quite possibly THE best game of this console generation. Even when finished with the impactful story, there are dozens of sidequests, dungeons, and collectibles to keep you occupied for at least 100 hours. Set across Colorado and Utah (and bits of the surrounding area) some 1500 years in the future, humanity has been pushed back to the bronze age by hulking robotic animals. It''s up to Aloy, a pariah cast out from her tribe at...'),
(N'Jack', N'Cox', N'jack.cox6672@example.net', '2017-06-16', 1, N'Terrible. Worst game I''ve ever played. Ubisoft is trash.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Gonzalez', N'samuel.gonzalez2564@example.com', '2017-06-16', 4, N'Fun when the internet goes out..'),
(N'Joshua', N'Richardson', N'joshua.richardson9521@example.com', '2017-06-16', 4, N'Did it''s job but the contacts were rather tight.'),
(N'Wei', N'Jenkins', N'wei.jenkins7662@example.org', '2017-06-16', 4, N'I went into prey with a very incorrect idea about what I was getting into- And ended up loving it. A friend of mine had described it as a "game where the enemy can pose as any object". As such I thought it was a survival horror game where the whole premise was being wary of your surroundings, afraid of what object the monster could be. Turns out thats only an incredibly small portion of the game has that type of enemy as a focus, and for the rest of it they are kind of a gimmick. In reality the game is more of a story/exploration based game with a variety of enemies throughout. A cool element of the game is that you are slowly exploring a location, and depending on how you explore the tech tree, taking it over in a sense, giving you some areas that feel safe and relaxed, and others that feel sketchier, and you''d only feel comfortable venturing into well stocked on supplies and creeping around. It isn''t scary at all really, so fortunately I wasn''t exclusively looking for that...'),
(N'Dee', N'Allen', N'dee.allen1196@example.com', '2017-06-17', 3, N'Definitely the weakest in the trilogy, though this version does mix things up from the original version. Just don''t bother with Sorcery & Miracles as both have been nerfed to utter uselessness. Hexes are good though!'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ortiz', N'cynthia.ortiz3249@example.com', '2017-06-17', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Timothy', N'Watson', N'timothy.watson8397@example.com', '2017-06-17', 5, N'Perfect Thank You!'),
(N'Jessica', N'Collins', N'jessica.collins9091@example.org', '2017-06-17', 4, N'excelente'),
(N'Alexander', N'Lopez', N'alexander.lopez1946@example.com', '2017-06-17', 5, N'They sort of feel cheap (compared to expensive headphones) but they provide good sound and now they are even lower than what I paid for mine ($55).'),
(N'Nadia', N'Torres', N'nadia.torres3876@example.org', '2017-06-17', 3, N'It''s a nice idea, but the game part does not work. Lighting and Holly do, but I wanted the whole set to work.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Ali', N'cynthia.ali7462@example.org', '2017-06-18', 5, N'This game is a masterpiece, and Maxis put all they could into making this the best life simulation game available. It has many little fine details which are put in (for instance, if a child''s parent comes home from work and the kid is up, they''ll run out and hug their parent). The game does have some severe issues, though. Primarily unavoidable corruption. The version found here is just the base game, and the base game has a limit of 1,000 Sims. Once you hit that limit your neighborhood screws up bad. Buying an expansion pack later than Nightlife will increase the limit to 32,767. If you get several mods (Google "Sims 2 essential mods") you can avoid corruption for quite a long time, though if you don''t play neighborhoods for a long time then you probably won''t ever experience corruption in the first place. It''s also suggested by many to replace the original neighborhoods shipped on the disc with some fixed up versions (they play the same as the originals! same characters and...'),
(N'Kyle', N'James', N'kyle.james9376@example.org', '2017-06-18', 5, N'One of the best Resident Evil games out there, if not the best. It really is a return to form in more ways than it isn''t. Like the very first Resident Evil the game mostly takes place inside a giant manor with plenty of key finding and some light puzzle solving. Ammo and health are again precious resources. Safe rooms make a return and when you find them you''ll want to curl up into a ball and never leave since it is very scary to venture out with all the things that are trying to kill you. The story is pretty simple and basic like the first one. Your girlfriend goes missing while visiting this manor and when you go to try to find her you get locked inside and all hell breaks loose. One of the problems with the later Resident Evils is that the story got too complicated with too many characters and subplots that all got tangled into a giant mess that was impossible to follow. Thankfully all that gets rebooted and we start fresh. This game can be played without playing any of the...'),
(N'Shirley', N'Carter', N'shirley.carter9770@example.org', '2017-06-18', 3, N'Works well for a CSGO type game, but the feet are very thin for games that require speedier tracking. The mouse wheel is also not so suitable, either, where an Asus Gladius kind of wins in this regard(The Asus Gladius is probably the most similar to the old Razer Diamondback wheel which was very smooth).'),
(N'Sandra', N'Nelson', N'sandra.nelson6281@example.com', '2017-06-18', 5, N'I bought the LTD edition gold PS4 slim, and it has only 2 USB ports on the front of the system, I also bought an extra gold controller. So charging both controllers at the same time would''ve used both ports, so this charger saved one port so I could hook up the external hard drive.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Clark', N'jennifer.clark2745@example.com', '2017-06-18', 1, N'Game does not take advantage of the main 3D screen'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Ramos', N'nicholas.ramos4640@example.net', '2017-06-18', 5, N'This is by far one of the best games I''ve ever played and let me tell you why. Most games side quest or content or boring and tedious. This games side content and is just as fun as the main content, and that is rare. So but this game and play it right now, you won''t be disappointed.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Ortiz', N'douglas.ortiz4122@example.net', '2017-06-19', 5, N'You simply can''t go wrong with this, remastered??? Count me in! Great games which I had to play again to boost my expectations for Uncharted 4 at an amazing price!'),
(N'Donald', N'Cox', N'donald.cox5289@example.com', '2017-06-19', 4, N'Do to a mail problem I bought mine in a store the item feels good in my hand the bottom where the micro sd card feels a bit flimsy like it will snap if you hold the bottom to hard the hard ware is good the 3d is also very good . I would buy it'),
(N'Ethan', N'Harris', N'ethan.harris5249@example.org', '2017-06-19', 5, N'This is a DEAL. Get it.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Harris', N'ethan.harris5249@example.org', '2017-06-19', 5, N'Perfect.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2017-06-20', 5, N'both the silent hill movies are the greatest movies in the universe there true classics the best of the best both the silent hill movies rocks ^_^'),
(N'Steven', N'Rodriguez', N'steven.rodriguez2082@example.com', '2017-06-20', 5, N'Good remaster and you do get the rest of the GOW for digital download!'),
(N'Karen', N'Moore', N'karen.moore1039@example.org', '2017-06-20', 5, N'awesome game'),
(N'Timothy', N'Watson', N'timothy.watson5726@example.com', '2017-06-20', 4, N'This game is cute, charming and lots of fun. It''s not nearly as in depth as Minecraft, being that you can''t just did forever and there is no crossing water unless the game wants you to by placing bricks down to make a bridge, but what it lacks in scale it makes up for in enjoyment. The RPG elements is where this game really shines. You''ll encounter lots of classic Dragon Quest monsters, the graphics are gorgeous and bright and the music is beautifully done. So far the only real downside I have is when fighting monsters you have to get all up in their grill in order to hit them which makes sense because you''re using melee weapons but can get annoying getting bombarded without any real way to dodge or block *at least none that I have found so far*'),
(N'Ethan', N'Morales', N'ethan.morales5532@example.net', '2017-06-20', 3, N'It''s a meme controller'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2017-06-22', 5, N'the sega forever compilation game for the mobile phone is the greatest compilation game in the universe a true classic the best of the best the sega forever compilation game for the mobile phone rocks ^_^'),
(N'Deborah', N'King', N'deborah.king2834@example.org', '2017-06-22', 5, N'great'),
(N'Anita', N'Rogers', N'anita.rogers7948@example.net', '2017-06-22', 5, N'awesome - great'),
(N'Steven', N'Morris', N'steven.morris2720@example.com', '2017-06-22', 5, N'Worked perfectly.. received on time !'),
(N'William', N'Phillips', N'william.phillips1617@example.org', '2017-06-22', 5, N'Wonderful game if you are a Sly Cooper fan.'),
(N'Emma', N'Bell', N'emma.bell8369@example.org', '2017-06-23', 5, N'great. brought back great memories.'),
(N'Emma', N'Bell', N'emma.bell8369@example.org', '2017-06-23', 5, N'worked great. would buy from this seller again.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Roberts', N'jonathan.roberts2972@example.net', '2017-06-23', 2, N'I''m coming late to the uncharted series, but after playing through all three of these I really don''t understand the hype. The controls are floaty, the shooting doesn''t feel impactful, the enemies are bullet sponges, the puzzles are easy, the story is structured the same game from game (every game has a "supernatural, but in the scooby doo sense" enemy). Should you die and need a respawn checkpoints have an annoying habit of plopping you in between enemies for no fun instakills. "Exploration" in these games is lacking as well, these are linear to the point that going in a direction that looks like it should be a viable escape or path but is not the way the designers want you to go leads to instadeath as well. If you have to build in a hint system because you don''t give full freedom of exploration to the player but then don''t make the only viable path obvious enough to see it then I think you have failed at game design. I have 4 waiting for me as well, but after playing through all...'),
(N'Paul', N'Morales', N'paul.morales7318@example.net', '2017-06-23', 5, N'Excellent quality game and packaging.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Green', N'jeremy.green5055@example.net', '2017-06-24', 1, N'After a few uses it goes the wrong way'),
(N'Thomas', N'Hughes', N'thomas.hughes8563@example.net', '2017-06-24', 5, N'So weird getting back in the groove of things since it''s been years of gameplay but everything works like new. Was delivered earlier than expected yesterday in perfect condition! Very clean disk, booklet and case on point! Great game, fun memories.'),
(N'Larry', N'Peterson', N'larry.peterson5739@example.org', '2017-06-24', 4, N'Finished this game, it was enjoyable'),
(N'Lucia', N'Brooks', N'lucia.brooks1989@example.com', '2017-06-24', 3, N'Bound by Flame was sort of poorly thought out, with missable sidequests and trial and error combat. No, its not really a ''souls-type'' - reminding me more of Dragon Age then anything - just with more player interaction during combat. Voice acting is abysmal, especially the female player voice. The worst I''ve ever heard.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Jimenez', N'tyler.jimenez6966@example.org', '2017-06-25', 4, N'Bought this thinking I needed it but don''t with the one s controllers. still nice options'),
(N'John', N'Russell', N'john.russell2881@example.com', '2017-06-25', 5, N'Good product and fast delivery'),
(N'Steven', N'Sullivan', N'steven.sullivan9477@example.org', '2017-06-26', 5, N'So good I bought it twice. Sold my original PS4 after upgrading to a Pro. Added this game to spark more intrigue and ... Sold super fast. Had to replace the game to keep it in the collection.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Brown', N'benjamin.brown2693@example.net', '2017-06-26', 3, N'Got this for completion reasons, the sculpt and overall pose is unfortunately just objectively inferior to the Smash version.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Brown', N'brenda.brown7794@example.com', '2017-06-26', 5, N'Everything that I expected.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Morris', N'brenda.morris9017@example.org', '2017-06-26', 5, N'Good game. Feels like it belongs in The Godfather storyline. As a fan I enjoy it.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Evans', N'nadia.evans4303@example.org', '2017-06-27', 5, N'Amazing But i have so many games i need like 4more unfortunately wish there was a vita game slot that you can a memory card into to act like another memory card slot'),
(N'Nadia', N'Evans', N'nadia.evans4303@example.org', '2017-06-27', 5, N'Kool'),
(N'Nadia', N'Evans', N'nadia.evans4303@example.org', '2017-06-27', 5, N'Amazing'),
(N'Debra', N'Webb', N'debra.webb5747@example.org', '2017-06-27', 5, N'nice'),
(N'Richard', N'Gonzalez', N'richard.gonzalez8611@example.com', '2017-06-27', 5, N'Doom just amazing game never get bored of it .'),
(N'Patrick', N'White', N'patrick.white2116@example.net', '2017-06-27', 5, N'Great controller for a great price! I have had absolutely no issues with this controller. Very nice to have two for when a friend comes over.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Martinez', N'deborah.martinez7542@example.net', '2017-06-28', 5, N'Love the price and the styling. Plenty of buttons for a "simple" stick, with lots of support and features. Great introductory flight stick, well worth the money to have a good backup in case your super-advanced flight system goes down.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Murphy', N'ivan.murphy1374@example.net', '2017-06-28', 5, N'Wonderful game, if you haven''t played it yet. Even in 2017 it has an enormous number of people online playing it. especially on playstation, there is no shortage of matches out there to play in.'),
(N'Debra', N'Hughes', N'debra.hughes7248@example.org', '2017-06-29', 5, N'Great game really enjoyed!'),
(N'Scott', N'Sanders', N'scott.sanders3681@example.org', '2017-06-29', 5, N'Definitely a great product for a great deal! I got so tired of buying batteries! If your child has a Wii, then you definitely need this!'),
(N'Larry', N'Wright', N'larry.wright5287@example.com', '2017-06-29', 4, N'I bought this for my grown son so I asked for his review of this game. Here''s what he thinks - "It''s very fun to play and watch. Moves are logical and smooth to execute. Landing hits and knockouts is extremely satisfying. There are a ton of interesting characters and the extensive customization options can you allow you to make the few uninteresting characters more compelling. The game does next to nothing to teach you how to play. And if you want any hope of getting better you''ll need to watch a quite a lot of online content or have previous Tekken experience. The online aspect is serviceable but not particularly fast or reliable."'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Collins', N'jeremy.collins6830@example.org', '2017-06-29', 1, N'RETURNED'),
(N'Justin', N'Clark', N'justin.clark5682@example.com', '2017-06-30', 5, N'I really enjoyed this game. I liked it so much I completed it on madhouse level. I have yet to try the VR mode on this game, but can''t wait to. Will update when able. The story is quite good and the creep factor is high.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Ali', N'timothy.ali1437@example.org', '2017-06-30', 5, N'Nice product.'),
(N'Carol', N'Ward', N'carol.ward5913@example.com', '2017-06-30', 3, N'These cymbals are very durable don''t get me wrong. But the problem is that they are too durable. I actually have to "hit" the cymbals just for it to register in the game but that could be my drums that actually have the issue. Even still the fact that the drums in general need to be broken in before the real gameplay begins. These cymbals are like turbines: they start off slow but eventually they will finally get running right.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Reed', N'nicole.reed3725@example.net', '2017-06-30', 1, N'Saved one game and now it will no longer work. stick to brand name memory cards'),
(N'Pamela', N'Williams', N'pamela.williams8592@example.org', '2017-07-01', 4, N'Pros: Mouse is very comfortable. It has good handfeel. Customization per game is excellent feature. Length was good for me, might be too long for others. Cons: Plugs into USB port, requires a special software download (SteelSeriesEngine) - the setup begins automatically when you go to the website listed on the Quick Start Guide. Install works in one USB port but not the other, so if it doesn''t work for you, try the install on your computer''s other USB port. Once it is installed, it will work on all the USB ports. Summary: I''m giving this four stars because despite how nice this mouse feels in my hand, I''m still staying with my Logitech G602. Four stars.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Rivera', N'marcus.rivera5055@example.com', '2017-07-01', 5, N'good console games.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Gray', N'pamela.gray3039@example.org', '2017-07-01', 5, N'This Work Great and easy to replace, I would not hesitate purchasing these again. So much could be said about how wonderful they work!'),
(N'Dee', N'Thompson', N'dee.thompson2115@example.org', '2017-07-01', 5, N'works good'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Rivera', N'stephanie.rivera7984@example.net', '2017-07-01', 5, N'good for my son'),
(N'Douglas', N'Moore', N'douglas.moore9157@example.com', '2017-07-01', 5, N'Much better than the first game'),
(N'Daniel', N'Castillo', N'daniel.castillo2388@example.net', '2017-07-01', 5, N'Simple purchase, and activation on battle.net''s website, immediate code straight to your mail.'),
(N'Jason', N'Boyd', N'jason.boyd7860@example.org', '2017-07-01', 5, N'I love this gaming console!!! Sony needs to show it more love/support.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Gray', N'jennifer.gray8102@example.org', '2017-07-01', 5, N'love it. thank you'),
(N'Brandon', N'Cox', N'brandon.cox6366@example.net', '2017-07-02', 5, N'This is the lift RE6 needed, and the No mercy Mercs mode was always what I wanted on the ps3 version. but it is annoying you have to earn all the content you already had on the ps3 version back again. Great buy for the price, highly recommended.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Baker', N'brandon.baker3540@example.net', '2017-07-03', 5, N'I knew nothing about ratchet and clank but liked the artwork and saw the 4 star. Loved the game. Adorable characters with fun worlds to explore. Highly recommend.'),
(N'Priya', N'Roberts', N'priya.roberts4989@example.org', '2017-07-03', 5, N'Kid loved it.'),
(N'James', N'Baker', N'james.baker2005@example.org', '2017-07-03', 4, N'I liked this game ,, so much,, I had already bought the other two games . The 40th day & the devils cartel , they''re all really good games ,,, I liked the fact that you change characters if you wanted to'),
(N'Dee', N'Cook', N'dee.cook5833@example.com', '2017-07-04', 5, N'It is detected by your computer as a sound output device, not as a bluetooth device.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Martinez', N'lisa.martinez2040@example.net', '2017-07-05', 5, N'Chances of this game getting localized at this point is slim so might as well import this awesome game'),
(N'Ryan', N'Murphy', N'ryan.murphy6762@example.org', '2017-07-05', 5, N'This game will never get old. This was one of the first Wii games I bought and it still entertains. Great to play by yourself or in groups. There''s a lot of combos of characters and their cars to play with. All of the levels are fun, unique, and challenging. 100% recommend.'),
(N'David', N'Jenkins', N'david.jenkins5419@example.net', '2017-07-05', 3, N'Been using it for about a year and it works just fine. However the m1 and m2 buttons seem to be slanted/bent to the right making m2 stick out from the right side and feels uncomfortable on my ring finger.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Green', N'dennis.green7684@example.net', '2017-07-05', 5, N'This game is amazing!! I didn''t know much about it when i bought it but I enjoyed every moment. A big open world game, lots of fun side characters and quests. The main quest was great, really fun and exciting and a few moments nearly brought me to tears, including the end. I''d totally recommend it to anyone who loves a good story, or open world games with excellent fighting and stealth/trap mechanics.'),
(N'Mark', N'Barnes', N'mark.barnes8638@example.net', '2017-07-05', 5, N'My kids, friends and the hole family love Just Dance! Good songs!'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Evans', N'kathleen.evans5970@example.org', '2017-07-05', 5, N'Charges nice, nice and sleek. This is a nice accessory for ppl that don''t like these bulky PS move chargers.... Also has a nice night light glow'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Collins', N'jeremy.collins6830@example.org', '2017-07-05', 5, N'Plays great.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Carter', N'cheryl.carter8278@example.org', '2017-07-06', 4, N'Decent out of the box, but much better after some tweaking. I removed the jacket on the cable, replaced the wheel with a G700 wheel and bent the spring stop down on 5 of the switched(L, R, one behind the wheel, and both sensitivity buttons). The cable is much better without a jacket, the G700 wheel is the way it should have been without clacking on sharp movements, and the buttons are less noisy without double bouncing though it took a few tries to get them how I like them. I use the G502 for most things only breaking out my weight reduced Taipan for when I need some low sensitivity high flick mousing. I love freewheelin.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Reyes', N'samuel.reyes6343@example.com', '2017-07-06', 1, N'Got it April 22 2017 and it already stop working.i have hold the wire in different positions to talk.my advise is to save your money and buy a better headset'),
(N'Anna', N'Ramos', N'anna.ramos6890@example.net', '2017-07-06', 4, N'A fun game that makes some improvements from Far Cry 3.'),
(N'Richard', N'Mendoza', N'richard.mendoza7841@example.com', '2017-07-06', 5, N'I thoroughly enjoy playing this game... It is like Grand Theft Auto meets Far Cry meets Call of Duty. Lots of stuff to do in this game.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Hill', N'lisa.hill1290@example.com', '2017-07-06', 3, N'Difficult to recommend as having played the majority of up to then current AC games. Liked rags to riches story, felt forced many times but character felt real. As a whole felt it was most watered down and trite in the franchise to date. Severely disappointed in how short it was, felt like a true case of the devs pandering to the masses for a cash crop and a big ******* to loyal and hardcore fans. Of the ilk who was more impressed by three. Water combat was great.... at first. Traveling was enormously tedious and naval combat overall after long. However I felt it was a smoother transition of main characters than most other franchises. Montreal does really fine work despite the misgivings. Enjoyed it despite tediousness and shortness, would recommend at sale price.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Collins', N'jeremy.collins6830@example.org', '2017-07-06', 5, N'Very fun game.'),
(N'Christina', N'Henderson', N'christina.henderson2061@example.org', '2017-07-07', 5, N'Awesome!'),
(N'Aaron', N'Wisniewski', N'aaron.wisniewski7205@example.net', '2017-07-07', 5, N'Excelente'),
(N'Anthony', N'Kowalski', N'anthony.kowalski1719@example.net', '2017-07-07', 1, N'Only access to one table? You have got to be kidding! You have to pay extra to access other tables. A waste of money...shame on them for this rip off.'),
(N'Julie', N'Turner', N'julie.turner8592@example.com', '2017-07-07', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Julie', N'Turner', N'julie.turner8592@example.com', '2017-07-07', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Thomas', N'Price', N'thomas.price9244@example.org', '2017-07-07', 4, N'Good game overall. I love the class/job system. You get to revist old areas and are introduced to new ones. The two new characters are interesting, fun and loveable.'),
(N'Jose', N'Ali', N'jose.ali4593@example.com', '2017-07-07', 5, N'one of the best games i''ve ever played , can''t wait for the expansion'),
(N'David', N'Sanchez', N'david.sanchez3959@example.org', '2017-07-07', 5, N'I was four when I saw advertisements for this game and back then, seeing all the pretty colors and cool cars fascinated me so much. A decade later, I dismissed this as some Fast and Furious rip-off (and I hate Fast and Furious). Now, a couple of weeks ago, I purchased this game and to my surprise, it wasn''t some fake, over-stylized, Hollywood glitz-and-glamour racing game. Instead, it''s a fun, competitive racing game with hours of gameplay. In fact, I''ve been playing this game for almost two weeks now and I''ve only gotten through about 35 of the 111 or 112 levels in the game. The customization, albeit not as good as Underground 2, is still good and the graphics and sound are fantastic even after 15 years or so. Also, even if you lose a race, you still earn experience to unlock cool things. Unfortunately, the story isn''t interesting, and the soundtrack, while not bad, could have been better. Still, a great, beautiful game with lots of replay value.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Bennett', N'raymond.bennett2008@example.org', '2017-07-08', 4, N'This mouse is ambidextrous, with side buttons on both sides of the mouse, so it is suitable for both left and right-hand users. I would recommend it to people with small hands for palm/claw, and for medium-large hands for claw/fingertip. Pros - Awesome optical sensor (3310) - Awesome rubber coating - No sensor rattle - Ambidextrous design with two side buttons on both sides - DPI Buttons - Small hands (palm/claw), med-large (claw/fingertip) - Weighs roughly 104g without the cable - RGB Lighting - Braided cable (isnt too thick or stiff) - Programmable buttons - DPI / Polling / LOD options - Surface calibration Cons - Scroll wheel click is quite tough - I had an issue with the Mouse1 button registering as double click (was able to fix) - Some people complain about accidently hitting the side buttons that they don''t use - Requires update to latest firmware for best performance I have had this mouse for 19 months now and it still works fine. After about a year I developed a double...'),
(N'Raymond', N'Bennett', N'raymond.bennett2008@example.org', '2017-07-08', 5, N'This mouse continues the classic ergonomic shape of the previous DeathAdders, which is loved by many, though I would only recommend it to people with medium-large hand size, and those who play palm/claw as opposed to fingertip grip. That said, it still isn''t the best mouse for claw grip, but many players pull it off successfully, including eSport professionals. Pros - Excellent optical sensor (S3989) - No sensor rattle - Ergonomic design with two side buttons on the left - Medium - large hands - Weighs roughly 105g without the cable - RGB Lighting - Braided cable (isnt too thick or stiff) - Programmable buttons - DPI / Polling / LOD options - Surface calibration Cons - Feels a little cheap - Not suitable for small hands - Could have a more durable coating - No DPI buttons - Software requires signup I have had this mouse for 1 year now and it still works as well as the day that I got it, though the coating has become smoother and more shiny near the mouse 1 button, which I have...');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Sarah', N'Rivera', N'sarah.rivera4545@example.net', '2017-07-08', 5, N'My Xbone power supply went bad, and this one came in the post very quickly. A buddy who works at Xbox gave me another "original" Xbone brick while I was waiting. This one is much quieter than the original - great job on the QUITE part (joking reference to the product title spelling)'),
(N'Maria', N'Bailey', N'maria.bailey9891@example.com', '2017-07-09', 5, N'Loved this game spent many hours playing it.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Alvarez', N'rebecca.alvarez9230@example.org', '2017-07-09', 5, N'This is the best sega genesis system they ever made and my favorite system bar none !'),
(N'Dee', N'Phillips', N'dee.phillips3671@example.org', '2017-07-10', 5, N'Lightly scratched. Case was a mess, but I just moved it all over to a different one. Game plays great and I feel like I''m reliving my entire childhood.'),
(N'Jason', N'Jenkins', N'jason.jenkins7787@example.org', '2017-07-10', 5, N'great product'),
(N'Eric', N'Kim', N'eric.kim7672@example.com', '2017-07-10', 5, N'Give your controller and nice look.'),
(N'Lucia', N'King', N'lucia.king9049@example.org', '2017-07-10', 5, N'My original N64 was stolen from me, so I ended up having to buy a new one. And by "new" I meant just a replacement. The one I got arrived without any issues. Didn''t come with the expansion pack but I bought one separately. The N64 had to have been the best system I ever remember playing. While it was the first foray into 3D gaming, all of the games seemed new and innovative, and the system had a pretty good longevity as well. When the Gamecube came out it was also exciting, though the N64 had all of what people would define as classics. Today, the existence of things like the Everdrive make it much easier to play games and homebrew titles without having to switch cartridges all the time, and serves as a more secure way to back up your save data too.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Scott', N'kyle.scott7863@example.org', '2017-07-10', 5, N'son says it works great and easy to program'),
(N'Carlos', N'Russell', N'carlos.russell2522@example.com', '2017-07-10', 5, N'Awesome game, very fun. Great shipping and a good price.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Taylor', N'kenneth.taylor4129@example.net', '2017-07-11', 3, N'good game, no replay value though. errors out on me few times with corrupt data and had to start over from new profile'),
(N'Stephen', N'Watson', N'stephen.watson8429@example.net', '2017-07-11', 5, N'Very comfortable mouse. Feels solid and well built. No complaints with this guy at all. Razer has not let me down. I enjoy there products and is a great mouse for general browsing or gaming.'),
(N'Adam', N'Carter', N'adam.carter9598@example.org', '2017-07-11', 3, N'It''s alright. It''s easy to hookup I just hate taking it down and then having a little circle I have to wash off the screen.'),
(N'George', N'Kim', N'george.kim8698@example.org', '2017-07-12', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Hannah', N'Clark', N'hannah.clark4457@example.com', '2017-07-12', 5, N'Great addition to pokemon series. Fun to play with friends.'),
(N'Charles', N'Edwards', N'charles.edwards4466@example.org', '2017-07-12', 4, N'Good game. If it had a few more characters and more free premium costumes, I''d give it 5 stars.'),
(N'Justin', N'Campbell', N'justin.campbell9001@example.org', '2017-07-12', 5, N'This is a safe shape if you want a lightweight mouse from Zowie. - Pretty good for claw grip - Perfect for fingertip grip - Too low for palm grip'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Stewart', N'jacqueline.stewart2279@example.net', '2017-07-12', 5, N'Great stylish mouse if you don''t want to spend more. If you can spend more, take a look at the G900 or G700S. I got this for a useless laptop that doesn''t deserve this and I''m pleased with it.'),
(N'Emma', N'Price', N'emma.price4674@example.com', '2017-07-13', 5, N'My Daughter loves it.'),
(N'Amara', N'Rivera', N'amara.rivera5046@example.net', '2017-07-14', 5, N'Was looking for this game forever glad I found it works awesome no problems!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Harris', N'ashley.harris7844@example.org', '2017-07-14', 5, N'Limited Edition was very well put together. The game itself is fun. Space travel (minecraft in space with much much better graphics). Its relaxing to explore space and travel around seeing interesting things. Hello Games has added a ton of updates to No Man''s Sky making overall gameplay and experience better.'),
(N'Amara', N'Ruiz', N'amara.ruiz9449@example.net', '2017-07-14', 4, N'a fun game!'),
(N'James', N'Ward', N'james.ward1535@example.net', '2017-07-15', 4, N'I''m a PC gamer first, a portable Nintendo gamer second, and anything else is a far and away third. We got this thing is mainly for PS4 exclusives and to serve as our BluRay player. I''m glad I got it for cheap. This thing can get loud on some games, with the fans running as fast as they can to keep the thing cool. If you are serious about getting into the PS4 ecosystem today, get the PS4 Pro. If you don''t care much, yeah, try to find an old PS4 on the cheap. It''ll be fine.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Powell', N'pamela.powell8091@example.net', '2017-07-15', 5, N'Happy'),
(N'Patricia', N'King', N'patricia.king9908@example.com', '2017-07-15', 5, N'Hunt big scary monsters. Die a few times trying. Finally get the kill and feel a sense of accomplishment and victory. Carve their carcasses for a chance to receive their rarest piece to craft their armor with. Didn''t get it? Damn. Okay. Go at it again. This time you almost die but don''t, leaving you with adrenaline pumping in your veins and a need to see if you can carve that rare piece up. You got some other piece that''s equally as important, but not the right one. Damn. Okay. This time, you know what to expect. You dodge the wide sweeps from the enemy''s tail, the balls of literal fire that explode in your face, and the rabid successive attacks of its enraged state. Soon enough, you realize that you only took a few hits over the course of the fight. You feel pride and a feeling of elation at knowing that you, and not the character, are getting better. You carve and carve and finally get that chest scale you wanted. You repeat the hunt a few more times to get the last remaining...'),
(N'Mary', N'Turner', N'mary.turner8794@example.com', '2017-07-15', 5, N'OK! As announced'),
(N'Anna', N'Diaz', N'anna.diaz1926@example.com', '2017-07-15', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Nicole', N'Ortiz', N'nicole.ortiz7835@example.net', '2017-07-15', 4, N'Great sale & fast shipping. Very different but fun game...'),
(N'Mark', N'Allen', N'mark.allen1663@example.com', '2017-07-15', 3, N'Combat system and upgrade system is cool. Story development could be better'),
(N'Linda', N'Adams', N'linda.adams5114@example.net', '2017-07-16', 4, N'This an aftermarket controller for the Sony PlayStation 1, and PlayStation 2 gaming consoles. It''s has a 6 a foot cord, is pretty nice looking, seems decently made, and (most importantly) works fine. Not much else I could really ask for at this price.'),
(N'Walter', N'Lopez', N'walter.lopez5725@example.net', '2017-07-16', 5, N'Come on now - it''s Mewtwo. As an amiibo. For use in Smash.... Can we say 10/10 for sure? Haha. Honestly, though, it works great (as promised) and looks even better. Such a great addition to a growing collection!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Watson', N'kelly.watson9047@example.com', '2017-07-16', 4, N'An ok fighting game.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Ruiz', N'barbara.ruiz4522@example.com', '2017-07-17', 4, N'I like the color combination on this controller. The microphone connect is a little stiffer and troublesome to get the mic into... not sure if its just this controller or the model in general. I use rechargeable AA batteries in this controller so battery usage doesn''t come into play much for me. I would purchase again in between $40-50 on sale.'),
(N'George', N'Anderson', N'george.anderson1437@example.com', '2017-07-17', 3, N'A bit too bulky for my tastes but the image quality is good. Be sure to switch to ypbpr mode before using this cable.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Chavez', N'amanda.chavez4452@example.com', '2017-07-17', 5, N'Who doesn''t love WindWaker! I myself am not a huge fan of Nintendo''s creative choice to add a ton of bloom to the game. But I suppose that is more of a knock towards the Wii U''s lack of horsepower than the game itself. Outside of that it is wonderful to have the game that myself and my family spent so many hours playing in HD!'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Lewis', N'benjamin.lewis5907@example.org', '2017-07-18', 4, N'AMAZING MOUSE! I love the customization of LED, DPI, and mouse pad track. It does take some getting used to per it is bigger than a typical mouse.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Coleman', N'barbara.coleman2615@example.com', '2017-07-18', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Angela', N'Price', N'angela.price6075@example.net', '2017-07-18', 5, N'Good game so far. No issues so far.'),
(N'Christina', N'Ross', N'christina.ross1020@example.net', '2017-07-18', 5, N'Son loves it'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brown', N'katherine.brown2144@example.com', '2017-07-19', 3, N'First off, this is a Driving SIMULATOR. There is no custom paints, No buying/selling cars, No NOS. This Game is 4 True Racing enthusiast. So Please Ignore any reviews complaining about the lack of those things. Those are stupid ppl who expect every console racer to play and drive like Need 4 Speed. This Game is ment to be played on a wheel n pedal set up. I would not buy this if your a controler user unless your rly good with one and just love motor sport. What assetto gets right is the driving itself, its the most realistic Driving you will get on console. The Force feedback feels great with little adjusting. And each car feels different and unique, as they should. The Online Racing here is very intense with a decent community that for the most drive clean and are respectful. Unfortunately thats where it ends, the lack of content here slaps you in the face as soon as u start it up. Theres 90 cars that are not DLC, but alot of those are just multiple variants on the same car, its...'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Taylor', N'jennifer.taylor2923@example.com', '2017-07-19', 5, N'Works perfectly so far on my iMac. Plug and play, nothing else necessary. Everything about the controller feels identical to my orignal Saturn controllers, although the buttons actually feel a bit better (probably due to the age of the originals). The L and R buttons are bit more "stuck" than they should be, though, which could be a bit of a problem. They''re a bit stiff. The games I play don''t utilize them though so it''s not an issue for me. The D-Pad may be a bit less precise than the original but it''s not something I''ve noticed in the games I''ve played. Highly recommended.'),
(N'Jose', N'Jones', N'jose.jones4489@example.net', '2017-07-19', 5, N'Love it, shooting is very realistic.'),
(N'Emma', N'Taylor', N'emma.taylor2753@example.net', '2017-07-19', 1, N'Macro buttons in the way (obviously?), can''t lift the mouse with out pushing them, WAY too light for a serious gaming mouse, Giving this away and getting another G700S (personal preference not a shameless plug....weeeell)'),
(N'Shirley', N'Anderson', N'shirley.anderson4574@example.net', '2017-07-19', 5, N'Fun game.'),
(N'George', N'Powell', N'george.powell7584@example.net', '2017-07-19', 1, N'It doesnt explain that some games u have to download that is suppose to come on it and some games u have to have a xbox 360 account on ur xbox one in order to play it'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ward', N'victoria.ward4031@example.net', '2017-07-20', 4, N'IT DOESNT FIT VERY WELL'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Perry', N'evelyn.perry9374@example.org', '2017-07-20', 5, N'I finally know how to actually play Mario Kart now. No more not being able to play 150cc.'),
(N'Gregory', N'Hall', N'gregory.hall2515@example.org', '2017-07-20', 4, N'Good gude'),
(N'Julie', N'Peterson', N'julie.peterson6054@example.org', '2017-07-20', 5, N'Very happy'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Coleman', N'kathleen.coleman7432@example.com', '2017-07-21', 5, N'Awesome game. One of my favorites, if not my favorite, Tom Clancy game. A little pricey for the gold package ($99) but awesome'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ramos', N'ravi.ramos1539@example.net', '2017-07-21', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Judith', N'Henderson', N'judith.henderson6467@example.org', '2017-07-21', 5, N'Very good'),
(N'Mark', N'Allen', N'mark.allen1663@example.com', '2017-07-21', 5, N'Hidden Gem'),
(N'Sofia', N'Collins', N'sofia.collins8989@example.org', '2017-07-22', 5, N'used for a few months and no issues so far'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Ramirez', N'hiroshi.ramirez4924@example.com', '2017-07-22', 5, N'It''s a screen protector'),
(N'Sarah', N'Ali', N'sarah.ali9073@example.net', '2017-07-22', 5, N'Love this stand a must have if you love Halo, and a great price.'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts1962@example.org', '2017-07-22', 5, N'Good Back up'),
(N'Edward', N'Davis', N'edward.davis1330@example.net', '2017-07-22', 5, N'Amazing controler. excellent battery life and very comfortable.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Phillips', N'raymond.phillips9983@example.org', '2017-07-23', 2, N'What harm can only be played online and updated; How terrible, that loses everything; I do not recommend it at all'),
(N'Joyce', N'Robinson', N'joyce.robinson3300@example.org', '2017-07-23', 5, N'great gift for my son'),
(N'Jerry', N'Gonzalez', N'jerry.gonzalez6429@example.org', '2017-07-23', 5, N'Great. The keypad on the side is functional and nice if you''re a big MMO player, or if you''re fond of games with lots of hotkeys. You can adjust the sensitivity with buttons beneath the scrolling wheel. If you have small hands, clicking the middle wheel can be a slight problem, but nothing serious. The adjustable weight thing is kind of a gimmick that I don''t find very useful, but I guess it''s still a nice option. I think it''s kind of redundant with the ability to control sensitivity much more easily. Coolest thing is that you can change the lighting from blue to red, pink, yellow or green. Very stylish. Beyond that, the mouse works just as you''d expect from a laser mouse.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Morales', N'ivan.morales9246@example.com', '2017-07-23', 4, N'Good game if you don''t have wi fi because its only single player. Now a days, i cant really enjoy a single player game. Lack of competition. It got me thru for a couple weeks when my internet was down, the same way fallout 4 did.'),
(N'Robert', N'Kelly', N'robert.kelly9317@example.org', '2017-07-23', 2, N'Although it is far too late and prob won''t be read by anyone I warn people that are not ''gamers'' that this game is not like Battlefield or other types like it. The game is simply too involved and not simple aim and shoot like the others, it requires too many button sequences many of which don''t work correnctly on first try or you may have to double press if you can manage to remember it like the drone. So,if you are not a gamer and don''t like your games involved with correct button presses etc I would stay far from this game.'),
(N'Amara', N'Cox', N'amara.cox7918@example.com', '2017-07-23', 5, N'I''m sure we will enjoy it when it is delivered.'),
(N'Walter', N'Rivera', N'walter.rivera2442@example.org', '2017-07-23', 5, N'yay'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Chen', N'jonathan.chen7791@example.com', '2017-07-24', 1, N'These games did not hold up to the test of time. Blacks ops 1 and 2 do, though.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Wisniewski', N'joshua.wisniewski6354@example.net', '2017-07-24', 5, N'Final Fantasy XII has always been an under appreciated classic, largely because it was an odd animal that was originally released towards the end of the great JRPG boom. Now that things have quieted down in JRPGs considerably this lovingly crafted classic has it''s chance to shine brighter than ever. I''m sure a lot of work was done under the hood to get this remaster looking up to par for the PS4 but the original looked great and the biggest graphical changes apart from a resolution boost and enhanced widescreen are small fixes like removing Vaan''s weird abs. Now, maybe you''ve played FFXII before and you''re wondering "what''s new for me here", the answer is that the majority of the changes are subtle and while it''s more of a matter of remixing than anything it makes a world of difference. They''ve removed the original license grid and replaced it with 12 job based grids which force you to make hard and meaningful choices. No more can your characters all be shiny golden gods capable of...'),
(N'Joan', N'Raghunathan', N'joan.raghunathan8678@example.net', '2017-07-25', 5, N'great'),
(N'Laura', N'Gutierrez', N'laura.gutierrez3962@example.net', '2017-07-25', 5, N'Nothing else to say.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Roberts', N'kelly.roberts1422@example.com', '2017-07-25', 4, N'I''ve read several reviews bashing this game but I thought it was terrific (and can''t beat the current price). I do tend to prefer an open world with all the exploration and completionist tendencies that implies, so this title scratched that itch. It doesn''t have the depth of a bethesda title but it''s still a fun open-world game. If you''re purely a fan of action games and have little tolerance for spending time in a game for the sake of immersion, than this probably isn''t the game for you. Specifics: World: The world of Mad Max is stark and beautiful. I''m tempted by the obvious post-apocalyptic comparisons to Fallout, but this world is much more stark than that. This is a realistically rendered desert world ruled by sand, dust-devils, howling winds, dunes, rocky outcrops, chasms, and sun. The last remnants of humanity are bleached and broken wrecks. The humans that inhabit this world are generally your standard Mad Max Movie psychopaths - heavy on violence and short on depth - for...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Fisher', N'aaron.fisher4609@example.com', '2017-07-25', 5, N'Better than replacing batteries. Just charge and play.'),
(N'Karen', N'Jackson', N'karen.jackson6003@example.com', '2017-07-25', 5, N'Got it for my GPD Win and it''s great. I hold my USB Type C charging cable and power brick in it and still have room for headphones. The GPD Win fits perfectly and the slots are great for holding extra USB flash drives.'),
(N'Henry', N'Stewart', N'henry.stewart2666@example.com', '2017-07-25', 5, N'Works great. Sits alright, sometimes the connection to the battery pack doesn''t line up so you have to wiggle around the controller until it hits and lights up.'),
(N'Wei', N'Fisher', N'wei.fisher2311@example.net', '2017-07-26', 5, N'This is a fun game and is basically a Scooby Doo version of temple run . It follows the movie pretty well for being such an old game the graphics invoices are good too!'),
(N'Eric', N'Singh', N'eric.singh2048@example.org', '2017-07-26', 4, N'Love how it looks but didn''t add much. Gonna try again in the survivor(?) mode'),
(N'Christine', N'Clark', N'christine.clark1772@example.org', '2017-07-26', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Ravi', N'Morales', N'ravi.morales1159@example.net', '2017-07-26', 4, N'It''s a bit slow, and the control for the character is lagging, so I need to figure out how to make him walk more steadily.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Allen', N'kofi.allen3685@example.org', '2017-07-27', 5, N'Great case for a 3ds or ds lite'),
(N'Lauren', N'Cook', N'lauren.cook8626@example.net', '2017-07-27', 1, N'After less than a year of light use, the left thumbstick started going left when pressed right and other wackiness. Now its limp and won''t bounce back to the center. Broken turd. Every Power A controller I try is a POS.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Chavez', N'cheryl.chavez1195@example.net', '2017-07-27', 4, N'np compainys from my son..he gives 4 stars'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Russell', N'kimberly.russell7978@example.net', '2017-07-27', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Peter', N'Hill', N'peter.hill8724@example.org', '2017-07-27', 4, N'nice'),
(N'Shirley', N'Rogers', N'shirley.rogers1963@example.com', '2017-07-28', 5, N'One of the best video games I ever played.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Collins', N'jonathan.collins1672@example.net', '2017-07-28', 5, N'I''ve used the wheel and pedals for a month or so and find them to be a significant upgrade from the Logitech GT wheel of the PS3 generation. Yes, more expensive, but I''d say a much better value. The whole rig is more substantial and the force feedback is more realistic. It operated on belts rather than gears, so much quieter as well.'),
(N'Edward', N'Parker', N'edward.parker1627@example.com', '2017-07-28', 5, N'Came as described and was delivered fast'),
(N'Charles', N'Mitchell', N'charles.mitchell6288@example.net', '2017-07-28', 4, N'Very good'),
(N'Debra', N'Kelly', N'debra.kelly5603@example.com', '2017-07-28', 5, N'Love it!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Rogers', N'kenneth.rogers3995@example.com', '2017-07-28', 5, N'Nice game.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Rodriguez', N'cheryl.rodriguez2299@example.org', '2017-07-28', 2, N'I ordered this, but what I got was the Amiibo Card. It still works, but it isn''t what I ordered according to the description of the item.'),
(N'Luis', N'Garcia', N'luis.garcia5301@example.com', '2017-07-28', 5, N'In recent years I''ve tended to overlook the Call of Duty campaigns because they had become such a boring setup for gallery-shooting and huge prop explosions with an obscure story that would be almost entirely narrated to you in a loading screen. I decided to try the campaign for COD: Advanced Warfare because the trailers for the story seemed interesting. I was not disappointed, in fact I would say this was one of the most enjoyable campaigns for a shooter that I''ve played since Halo 1/Halo 2. Without spoiling the story I just want to say that the creators showed wisdom in making sections of the campaign that were slow and story-focused, I felt as though I got to know most of the characters in a way that made me curious about their potential fate. As a gamer to the developers, I just want to say THANK YOU for this great campaign. I''m still digging into the multiplayer but I''m appreciative of a longer TTK (Time To Kill) than other Call of Duty games.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Sullivan', N'cynthia.sullivan7496@example.org', '2017-07-28', 5, N'For any gamer this is probably the best product you could get for your console. Save so much on batteries. Must have'),
(N'Samuel', N'Garcia', N'samuel.garcia9023@example.net', '2017-07-29', 5, N'The super smash Bros of PlayStation. You don''t know what super smash is? Then stop playing videogames noob.'),
(N'Debra', N'Murphy', N'debra.murphy6998@example.com', '2017-07-29', 5, N'Completely satisfied'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Ruiz', N'kathleen.ruiz4227@example.com', '2017-07-29', 1, N'Game is extremely boring and in standard Ubisoft fashion, it''s just a lot of busy work.'),
(N'Julie', N'Morgan', N'julie.morgan4511@example.com', '2017-07-29', 4, N'This review is for the PS4 version. After playing the first Dishonored, I liked it enough to want to get this sequel, especially after the price dropped. I will say that if you liked the first game, then you will like this one as it has a very similar feel as the original game. Considering the original is several years old now, this sequel has the look of the original but with far better graphic detail. The level design and aesthetics of the areas are well done with nice attention to detail. Since I had recently played the first game, the learning curve was lessoned with the game as the controls work pretty much the same as the original. Even if you are not familiar with the game, at least there is a decent tutorial to get you started. Like the first game, DH2 primarily focuses on stealth and avoiding killing as killing creates high chaos and consequences for game world. Like the first game though, you can play in different styles (stealth versus assassination) with different...'),
(N'Michael', N'Clark', N'michael.clark3833@example.org', '2017-07-30', 5, N'Its got great battery life and overall I am happy with my purchase. Note to potential buyers, though: The case that fits over the battery fits it and the 3DS to a T, so it was very hard fitting it together correctly while being gentle. Be very careful while screwing it in and make sure that you have it snapped in place because as I snapped each area in place before screwing in each screw I forgot to snap it for the last one and when screwing it in the plastic case around the screw hole snapped instead due to the push/pull of the screw and unsnapped case. Despite this, however, it has stayed on securely. Another note: if you have wrist problems do keep in mind that this makes your 3DS a bricks weight. Playing games for long periods of time have made my wrists sting from holding it up for so long, so I have taken to resting my hands against something while playing to alleviate the weight.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Gonzalez', N'samantha.gonzalez6646@example.org', '2017-07-30', 5, N'Such a fun game, and the mechanics and graphics are actually decent. Worked great too :)'),
(N'Melissa', N'Nowak', N'melissa.nowak2856@example.net', '2017-07-30', 4, N'it is a good controller has a excelent response for a camara with the right pad.'),
(N'Carol', N'Kumar', N'carol.kumar4302@example.com', '2017-07-30', 5, N'This game is fun if you like stealth. It''s a lot stealthier than it''s console counterparts. The visuals are fantastic and controls are very responsive.'),
(N'Heather', N'Khan', N'heather.khan9866@example.org', '2017-07-30', 5, N'Come see this in action! TyvanTV @ Youtube'),
(N'Heather', N'Khan', N'heather.khan9866@example.org', '2017-07-30', 5, N'I upload very single day! TyvanTV @ Youtube'),
(N'Lucia', N'Myers', N'lucia.myers9871@example.com', '2017-07-30', 5, N'Brought new life to my trusty 360 controller (which is now backup to my xbox one controller), and very easy to install. While you have the controller opened up it doesn''t hurt to take a minute and clean it out, its crazy (and gross) how much gunk can make its way in the crevices over the years. After a cleaning and the new thumb sticks it looks brand new minus a scuff on the back of the controller.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Bennett', N'kyle.bennett4760@example.org', '2017-07-30', 5, N'Works on Gamecube Wii and Wii-U. Amazing build quality and feel, as well as being an official controller created by nintendo.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Carter', N'victoria.carter1641@example.net', '2017-07-30', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ross', N'victoria.ross7148@example.org', '2017-07-31', 4, N'Game is really fun once you learn the mechanics. Has an intermediate learning curve but if you play enough times, you will eventually pick up on it. There are plenty of game modes available & good times to be had. My favorite weight class is MIDDLE WEIGHT class because you get the best of all classes. It feels like a solid fight as oppose to the other classes which are either too quick or too slow. The LIGHTWEIGHT class is fun if you just want a slugfest & don''t really care about strategizing too much. Don''t get me wrong, you still have to pay attention but it feels more liberating in that the fight is a bit faster pace. When you first play the game, there is much to learn! Make sure you do the tutorials & pass each level with an excellent grade. Start with the easy drills & work your way up. Stay offline until you learn it or you will get your butt handed to you. At first I was frustrated because I didn''t do the tutorials & thought I could handle myself by simply button smashing....'),
(N'Jessica', N'Lopez', N'jessica.lopez8773@example.org', '2017-07-31', 4, N'I needed a wii so bad and this was in great shape'),
(N'Wei', N'Hughes', N'wei.hughes7240@example.org', '2017-07-31', 5, N'Really plug n play mics!! I''m using 2 of them connected to a laptop and using it with Ultrastar. They work as a charm!!! No troubled configuration, anything. And cable is long enough for those that like to perform while singing!'),
(N'Richard', N'Richardson', N'richard.richardson4915@example.net', '2017-07-31', 5, N'Excelent!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Jones', N'kenneth.jones8932@example.com', '2017-08-01', 5, N'Love the zombies on here!'),
(N'Daniel', N'Perry', N'daniel.perry7439@example.com', '2017-08-01', 3, N'Great concept, but I personally don''t like the game. Playing with the keyboard is unbearable. You''ll definitely need a controller for this game.'),
(N'Samantha', N'King', N'samantha.king3713@example.net', '2017-08-01', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Raghunathan', N'stephanie.raghunathan4172@example.com', '2017-08-02', 5, N'Love how beautiful this game is on my ps4 pro'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Brooks', N'jonathan.brooks5122@example.net', '2017-08-02', 4, N'Bought this used so I could get a lower price, and it also came with the case so that was a major bonus. Game worked well, and though there weren''t as many guns as Black Ops DS or MW3 DS, it still was very fun.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Cooper', N'victoria.cooper4098@example.net', '2017-08-03', 5, N'It''s pretty decent toy I like the design of the firgure it''s decent'),
(N'Paul', N'Boyd', N'paul.boyd1455@example.org', '2017-08-03', 2, N'Wow--what a bad mouse. It''s super heavy in the back, making it difficult to move around. It doesn''t have enough buttons compared to other mice in it''s category (should have at least one more to control the sensitivity of the mouse. It''s a bit small, so not as comfortable as other mice. If you''re interested in getting a much better mouse, try the Roccat Kone XTD or the Logitech G900.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Evans', N'christopher.evans9652@example.org', '2017-08-03', 5, N'Updates went smooth without issue. Console is responsive and working smoothly. Controller connects immediately upon startup. No issues noted.'),
(N'Heather', N'Stewart', N'heather.stewart3906@example.com', '2017-08-03', 5, N'Great game!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Myers', N'ethan.myers6039@example.net', '2017-08-03', 3, N'This ok package but i thought it was for the shorter newer motion plus. Spaces to put controllers was made for the added attachment motion plus.'),
(N'Dee', N'Gutierrez', N'dee.gutierrez6646@example.org', '2017-08-04', 4, N'I had never played a Persona game before but it was highly reccommended by a friend and she''s never steered me wrong before whenever I''ve asked her what game to get. Somewhere around my 1st 5 hours of gameplay I started to doubt my purchase because it''s a very confusing game mainly when it comes to "fusing" personas and all the other things you can do with them. It has a help section for this aspect of the game but I was still confused. I stuck with the game, however, and I''m glad I did because the characters are great, the story is great and I enjoyed the flow of the turn-based combat. Plus there is just so much to do as you step into the shoes of the protaganist and live his high school life. You go to school and even get asked questions and take a lot of exams etc. I actually learned a lot about Japanese history and culture as well as some other things. You can go shopping at various stores, go to the batting cages, arcade, get multiple part-time jobs if you want, watch dvds,...'),
(N'Ravi', N'Collins', N'ravi.collins5609@example.com', '2017-08-04', 5, N'Great controller.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Brooks', N'kenneth.brooks2369@example.com', '2017-08-05', 1, N'Outdated graphics, bad voice acting, numerous glitches, the character often getting stuck in environments or trapped in corners leading to a super fast death, bad camera, totally useless partners, and the difficulty on the easiest level is absolutely absurd! There is just no reason for a game to be so unfairly hard that you die every few minutes no matter what level you are! No fast XP or cheats or exploits either! If you''re a masochist who loves games like this and has infinite patience then go for it! I have much better games to play than this. Why this gets such high ratings I will never know!'),
(N'Zachary', N'Moore', N'zachary.moore7090@example.org', '2017-08-05', 4, N'FF1 is still a classic and I honestly enjoyed playing it way more than I thought I would (a big improvement over the original NES version). FF2.....is still not very good. It has some interesting ideas and was the first game to do a LOT of revolutionary things in the franchise, but so much of these new things were very flawed or unneeded/pointless (the conversation system for example). The worst thing, however, is that this game is COMPLETELY unplayable using the PS3''s PS1 emulation. DO NOT play this on a PS3. The game will crash any time you attempt to revive a character from death, any time you teleport, at various random points throughout the game, and I eventually got to a point (right after lighting Egil''s Torch) where I literally couldn''t progress because the game crashed in the exact same spot over and over despite trying all potential resolutions found online.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Ali', N'mateo.ali3669@example.net', '2017-08-06', 5, N'there are a couple listing for this one, but I got one listed at $17, a Japanese import. It came in the mail just fine! Great Amiibo to have for playing BotW! You get weapons with boosted stats to them, which you rarely find in-game. The exclusive sword you get only with this Amiibo, can be gotten more than once. also, thanks to this game allowing to to save at will, I would create a save, do the Amiibo, and if I didn''t like what I got, reload my save, making it easy to reload as many times as I wanted to till I got want I wanted.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Thomas', N'stephanie.thomas6694@example.com', '2017-08-06', 5, N'Ras.'),
(N'Brian', N'Davis', N'brian.davis1832@example.org', '2017-08-06', 2, N'I have all original n64, GameCube, Wii, PlayStation, Genesis and had NES but, was broken. So I have 2 FC Twin consoles for 4 years now SNES don''t work. So I bought Retron-bit NES didn''t work. Power light on but, my tv screen says no signal. I checked SNES and Genesis perfect. I returned it and got another the screen was shaking the colors were wrong and I returned it. Then I bought this one NES don''t work. The slot looks loose. SNES and Genesis is perfect but the controls don''t work right to lights flash when push a button but, I can''t start the game or anything. I don''t care of the wireless controllers just about NES, SNES and Genesis. I''m going to have to return with back and hope to get a console that will work perfectly like it''s supposed to. If not I''ll send it back and buy an original SNES and plug for Genesis and it works just no plug Lol. Right now I''m Disappointed that''s 3 in 1 consoles don''t work right.'),
(N'Richard', N'Reed', N'richard.reed4031@example.net', '2017-08-06', 5, N'Real s-video no fake'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Jones', N'kenneth.jones8932@example.com', '2017-08-07', 5, N'Love it!'),
(N'George', N'Ramos', N'george.ramos3467@example.com', '2017-08-07', 3, N'I''m a huge AC fan and I liked some of the innovation here. The problem is that it wasn''t executed very well. It''s sometimes great, sometimes infuriating. Overall 3/5.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Johnson', N'lucia.johnson9949@example.net', '2017-08-07', 5, N'Works as advertised!'),
(N'Jose', N'Smith', N'jose.smith3715@example.net', '2017-08-07', 5, N'Thanks! works great!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Murphy', N'kenneth.murphy4819@example.com', '2017-08-07', 3, N'This does add some kids room things that are very nice in their own right, this doesn''t seem to add enough for the price. I would have loved to see bunk beds or other options of the sort, but that didn''t happen. Other than the beds, this does add some other pieces of furniture for the room, but just not enough for the price. I expected more.'),
(N'Jack', N'Gomez', N'jack.gomez4992@example.org', '2017-08-07', 5, N'Hiya! Game arrived intact and safely!!! Thankyou!!! Poppy in Georgia'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Ross', N'tomasz.ross1337@example.org', '2017-08-07', 5, N'Product just as advertised. Prompt shipping. My Thanks!!'),
(N'Joyce', N'Price', N'joyce.price5883@example.com', '2017-08-08', 5, N'Fantastic game. Wish I knew I was getting PS4 as a gift, then I would have it on PS4 instead, but the PS3 version is very good with good graphics too. Probably my favorite RPG since FFVI'),
(N'Melissa', N'Ramos', N'melissa.ramos2419@example.com', '2017-08-08', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Long', N'elizabeth.long2165@example.net', '2017-08-08', 1, N'If you are buying this for a windows 10 pc, don''t bother. They are falsely advertised at 7.1 but only show up in windows as 5.1. On the xbox one they will be 7.1, just not on pc. This is a problem with their software/drivers and Astro refuses to admit it. This is one of the worst companies I have ever delat with when it comes to lying nonstop and being absolutely useless when it comes to tech support.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Watson', N'tyler.watson5680@example.org', '2017-08-09', 5, N'Sister loves them'),
(N'Nadia', N'Okonkwo', N'nadia.okonkwo4969@example.net', '2017-08-09', 5, N'love this game. Played it 5 times. The combat is exquisite. The characters and side quests are quirky and great.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Thompson', N'ivan.thompson1707@example.com', '2017-08-09', 3, N'Returned, uncomfortable to wear for extended periods.'),
(N'Heather', N'Ferreira', N'heather.ferreira3521@example.com', '2017-08-09', 5, N'Item came incredibly fast and item was exactly as described.'),
(N'Omar', N'Wilson', N'omar.wilson4514@example.com', '2017-08-09', 5, N'WAAAY better release than the Mega Man Legacy games. This game, you get 10 games in one, AND it is backwards compatibility on the 360 (although a tad glitchy). Only complaint is it lacks the Sega Saturn version of Mega Man 8, and I would have thrown in the Japan only on SNES game Mega Man and Bass (Rock Man and Forte).'),
(N'Omar', N'Wilson', N'omar.wilson4514@example.com', '2017-08-09', 5, N'Worked as intended. Isn''t bubbling up, like other people claim it is.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Sanders', N'nicholas.sanders3641@example.net', '2017-08-10', 5, N'The controller works great. A fine item for collectors of video games, or anyone who like Star Wars. Highly recommend it.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Foster', N'patricia.foster8184@example.org', '2017-08-10', 5, N'This screwdriver was meant to open an Xbox 360 controller and it did just that. After 2 years I still own it, i don''t use it anymore, but I have it just in case, you never know.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Hall', N'jeremy.hall1508@example.com', '2017-08-10', 5, N'Love sly!!'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Long', N'elizabeth.long2165@example.net', '2017-08-10', 1, N'The battery is complete GARBAGE. Full charge lasts maybe 3-5 hrs when brand new and after about 6 months it won''t hold a charge for 5 mins after being fully charged. Don''t buy this garbage or any other play and charge kit form M$. You''re better off buying a Smatree dual battery charger that comes with 2 battery packs.'),
(N'Angela', N'Miller', N'angela.miller2307@example.net', '2017-08-10', 2, N'if only for looks, nice 64 retro controller, but i could not get the analog to map different than the directional pad buttons on my computer, I bought 2 and returned them both'),
(N'Olivia', N'Morris', N'olivia.morris5813@example.org', '2017-08-11', 1, N'Code did not work waste of money'),
(N'Henry', N'Chavez', N'henry.chavez3636@example.org', '2017-08-11', 3, N'A Decent game but received an European copy, luckily, I don''t see any add-ons coming out for this game in the future, BUT, if this was a different game with dlc this would have been a HUGE problem because US dlc are not compatible with a European game copy and vise versa. The seller must put the type of region version on the details.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Suzuki', N'victoria.suzuki4189@example.org', '2017-08-11', 5, N'works'),
(N'Jose', N'Sanchez', N'jose.sanchez3720@example.net', '2017-08-12', 5, N'Game plays well.'),
(N'Justin', N'Russell', N'justin.russell9958@example.com', '2017-08-12', 5, N'Great mouse for the price. Good weight and ergonomic shape. Accurate sensitivity. Replaced a $70 mouse with this one and like it much more. May buy a second one for my laptop.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Myers', N'cynthia.myers6272@example.net', '2017-08-12', 5, N'Great item'),
(N'Steven', N'Jenkins', N'steven.jenkins6128@example.net', '2017-08-13', 5, N'Such a fun game. A great continuation of an excellent series.'),
(N'Deborah', N'King', N'deborah.king2834@example.org', '2017-08-13', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Stephen', N'Mendoza', N'stephen.mendoza7134@example.org', '2017-08-13', 3, N'Just couldn''t get used to it - too funcky. Can''t use it for FPS and for keyboard games, I''d rather just use a keyboard.'),
(N'Jack', N'Okonkwo', N'jack.okonkwo8175@example.net', '2017-08-13', 4, N'Good remote, but the cord started shorting out after three or four months. worked good for a little while at least.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Boyd', N'rebecca.boyd8069@example.net', '2017-08-14', 5, N'I ripped a robots arm off and beat him to death with it.'),
(N'Patricia', N'Kim', N'patricia.kim5885@example.net', '2017-08-14', 2, N'Little boring. Story playing was short'),
(N'Stephen', N'Ali', N'stephen.ali5406@example.org', '2017-08-14', 2, N'I loved the way this controller felt out of the packaging. Solid, and almost identical to the original. Then I used it. The joystick was hypersensitive to the point where it couldn''t be used. It''s a real shame, this one came close to being a winner. To date, no third-party N64 controller that I''ve used comes close to the real thing.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Nguyen', N'brandon.nguyen6931@example.com', '2017-08-14', 4, N'Grow a beard and fight the Taliban. What more do you need to know?'),
(N'Brandon', N'Nguyen', N'brandon.nguyen6931@example.com', '2017-08-14', 5, N'I LOVE my PS4. The exclusives are great, and as of now the OS has been updated finally to use external hard drives and folder sorting of installed applications. My only serious complaint with the system is the lack of available USB ports. Once you steal one for an external hard drive, you only have one left. Definitely necessitates the need for a USB hub for the system.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Castillo', N'douglas.castillo2862@example.net', '2017-08-14', 2, N'These controllers have to be plugged in one at a time before you can use them, otherwise they both try to connect to the first available receiver. They don''t connect to a paired receiver with a unique identifier.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Howard', N'barbara.howard5723@example.com', '2017-08-15', 5, N'Best multiplayer fps to be released in a long while. Now includes co-op mode called "Frontier Defense". Both "Frontier Defense" and all additional multiplayer maps are available free of charge! If you''re looking for some intense action and a progression system you can sink your teeth into, this is the one!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Wisniewski', N'kelly.wisniewski6670@example.com', '2017-08-15', 5, N'price was a good deal'),
(N'Jason', N'Morgan', N'jason.morgan3083@example.net', '2017-08-15', 5, N'Excellent keyboard. I wanted a keyboard with white LED''s (OR RGB where I could set to white.) I personally owned the G610 Orion with cherry MX brown switches, and hated the feel of brown switches. Too many mistakes by accidentally clicking keys. The keyboard switches are personal preferences, and you should honestly try them out in person before buying anything. This keyboard is a lot longer, and has more features thanks to the 6 macro buttons and macro switches. I kind of wish it was more minimal, (e.g. no blue border around the macro G keys, and no grey ASDW keys.) But those are overall a great keyboard, feels solid and durable. It does take 2 USB ports, but has a USB port passthrough on the keyboard to offset. Summary: Pros: -Powerful and easy to use software -Excellent Tactile Cherry MX Blue keys -White LED''s are beautiful and bright -Macro keys are nice -Volume wheel is nice touch -Solid feeling and responsive media controls Cons: -Very Large and Wide -Wrist rest is kind of...'),
(N'Sandra', N'Adams', N'sandra.adams4148@example.com', '2017-08-15', 5, N'Best Golf game ever made. Tiger Woods fans can fight me.'),
(N'Patricia', N'James', N'patricia.james4914@example.org', '2017-08-15', 4, N'The buttons are slightly flimsy, like used. Not a problem at all though. Works fine.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Cruz', N'jessica.cruz8293@example.net', '2017-08-15', 5, N'fun game'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Smith', N'nicholas.smith4665@example.com', '2017-08-15', 2, N'returned, ordered wrong item'),
(N'Anthony', N'Jackson', N'anthony.jackson3082@example.org', '2017-08-15', 5, N'I love it.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Wright', N'douglas.wright4732@example.net', '2017-08-16', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Jason', N'Davis', N'jason.davis5540@example.net', '2017-08-16', 5, N'Old school game that''s pretty fun, worth looking into if your tired of final fantasy.'),
(N'Charles', N'Morales', N'charles.morales9693@example.com', '2017-08-16', 5, N'This SHOULD have been shipped with the console. but, it''s a good charger with great design and quality.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Sanchez', N'sofia.sanchez2442@example.com', '2017-08-16', 5, N'i just love this game 100%'),
(N'Adam', N'Williams', N'adam.williams2096@example.org', '2017-08-16', 5, N'life changing, I have big fingers so the vita is quite uncomfortable when trying to play with those tiny flat analogs. Would recommend to anyone looking for a better feel and grip for their vita.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Ivanov', N'jacqueline.ivanov7375@example.com', '2017-08-17', 5, N'This case protects and stores your PS Vita along with 4-5 games.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Butler', N'raymond.butler5834@example.com', '2017-08-17', 5, N'Great game. Beautiful visuals and exciting game play.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Coleman', N'thomas.coleman1668@example.com', '2017-08-17', 5, N'This game is like a combination of Saints Row .+ Crackdown so if you liked those two games you''ll like this. I like that its set in a futuristic Asian city. I like that you can switch between characters instantly, and the humor in this game is great too. Its just great wholesome fun and picks fun at a lot of the action tropes from the 80s too. Don''t believe the low review scores given by "professional" publications - look at the user scores.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Martinez', N'yuki.martinez7144@example.net', '2017-08-18', 5, N'These headphones work great on my PS4. I had to watch a youtube video to figure out how to use them. You have to go to the PS4 settings and change to all audio. Also, there is a level on the cord to adjust the volume. I love these headphones. They really help me get into the games better.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Smith', N'jacqueline.smith9731@example.org', '2017-08-18', 5, N'Just got mine, & I must say, Nice! The control fits perfect in the case,like a bug in a Rug that is so comfortable it don''t move. I don''t care that much for the Rubber Sleeve for 2 reasons. I have the extended play time Battery pack add on sold here at Amazon. It''s a Battery Pack that is made to be mounted & locked in place on the back of the Control & will give you longer play time. The Rubber Sleeve may need to come off if you put the Control in a Charging Cradle. Having it on & trying to get the Control in the Case makes it tight to do so. The Control without the Sleeve fits in perfect, with hardly any room to spare. No movement at all. The 3 Pouch''s in the top are useful. I was able to slide the extended life battery Pack into the Pouch, & it fit good & tight, & the Cover flap for the Screen covers it perfect, & also protects the pack from doing any damage to the Screen, & the Case closes fine. I''m really happy to be able to store both items in the Case. I agree, an absolute...'),
(N'Patricia', N'Parker', N'patricia.parker1657@example.net', '2017-08-18', 5, N'As 7 year old kid, During 2001 year ago, I remember my mother show me a commercial telling me that this N64 games about coming out during after watching Spongebob or Rugrats on TV and then I stop watching TV and my mother bought me this N64 games and she and I like it this N64 games. Paper Mario was my first times played Paper Mario series during come out on 2001.'),
(N'Frank', N'Cruz', N'frank.cruz2920@example.org', '2017-08-18', 1, N'did not work'),
(N'Susan', N'Powell', N'susan.powell3179@example.com', '2017-08-19', 4, N'cool.'),
(N'Marcus', N'Peterson', N'marcus.peterson7432@example.org', '2017-08-19', 5, N'I thought my son was going to explode when he opened the box and saw this. I hear him everyday in his room playing with his Sports Resort items.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Rivera', N'cheryl.rivera4308@example.net', '2017-08-19', 5, N'Tank'),
(N'Debra', N'Jenkins', N'debra.jenkins2713@example.org', '2017-08-19', 1, N'I figured I would wait until the price dropped and it would be worth it, but this game is still a waste of money in 2017. Cap-con has released a game with next to no content, and locked the majority of the characters behind a pay wall. You can buy the characters with digital currency earned in game, but you don''t make enough money to afford every character in solo player, so you have to pay for PS Plus. This means you''re paying real money for the characters, even if you don''t go on the PSN store and pay the ridiculously high DLC price. This game also requires an internet connection and an account that signs into their system. If you get disconnected for any reason, you don''t get ANY digital money, even if you sign back in after you 100% the few content there is. I feel Capcon did this on purpose to make us buy the characters as DLC. -_- If you have to play this game, I would recommend downloading it for free on PC. I only paid 17 bucks for this, but I still feel like I got cheated...'),
(N'Donald', N'Cox', N'donald.cox5289@example.com', '2017-08-19', 3, N'it is ok not the best but not worth trying'),
(N'Sarah', N'Boyd', N'sarah.boyd9387@example.net', '2017-08-19', 5, N'cool'),
(N'William', N'Long', N'william.long9035@example.com', '2017-08-19', 2, N'Poor game'),
(N'William', N'Long', N'william.long9035@example.com', '2017-08-19', 3, N'Good'),
(N'Hannah', N'Myers', N'hannah.myers5627@example.net', '2017-08-19', 5, N'+Durable. Seriously durable. +Feels great despite 100% plastic construction. +Rubber feels just right. +Steering speed isn''t restricted unless you''re playing with force feedback. +900-degree turning radius! That''s a full turn and a quarter in each direction. +Sim-quality experience when playing GT5. -You _need_ the appropriate Logitech utility to take advantage of that 900-degree turning radius under Windows. -Paddle shifters are actually hard-to-reach buttons. -Different sims support the wheel''s buttons differently. Some don''t pick up on the shifter at all. ***DO NOT grab the wheel while plugging it in!*** The wheel performs a self-test every time it starts up, and it does that as soon as it''s powered on and has its USB connector plugged in.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Reed', N'mateo.reed8085@example.com', '2017-08-20', 5, N'awesome game..easily 100+ hours of gameplay and when you are done with it, it leaves you wanting more and you will give it another go...'),
(N'Mark', N'Hall', N'mark.hall5946@example.org', '2017-08-20', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Debra', N'Reed', N'debra.reed5173@example.com', '2017-08-20', 3, N'Missing case and manual other than that great game'),
(N'Noah', N'Ward', N'noah.ward6562@example.com', '2017-08-21', 5, N'Poor quality peel and reveal mechanism. The card ended up damaged and the numbers obfuscated. I contacted Amazon for support since I was unable to return it. Wow. The person i spoke with much have been new. I was put on hold multiple times and asked for the number on the front of the card. There isn''t a number on the front of the card. About 30 seconds into the Amazon call it became clear this person was not going to be able to help and certainly not in a timely manner. By the time the Amazon rep verified my email address a 3rd time, I had snapped pics of the card and submitted them to Steam, got a response and a working code. I thanked the Amazon rep and said everything is now fine but he kept on insisting he send me an email. My inbox is now blowing up with emails from this rep and the link to submit photos of the card is broken. SMH.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Campbell', N'rachel.campbell3823@example.com', '2017-08-21', 4, N'Its nice to have to play games in the dark'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Gonzalez', N'elizabeth.gonzalez3504@example.net', '2017-08-21', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Joseph', N'Kim', N'joseph.kim7191@example.com', '2017-08-21', 5, N'I love these switches and the price of this board is perfect. My only dislike is the font on the keys, but I plan on getting some different keys so it''s not a big deal. Great product so far. I noticed for games I have to have the keys set to 20C/S or else my shift button won''t work right in vidya. I''m new to mech keyboards, but this seems great. I prefer the gateron browns over the cherry mx browns I''ve used before.'),
(N'Mei', N'Ferreira', N'mei.ferreira7929@example.org', '2017-08-21', 5, N'works'),
(N'Aaron', N'Russell', N'aaron.russell7883@example.net', '2017-08-22', 5, N'For the missions I have made it thru all I can say is "Get ready to die." Why do they make these games so darn hard. I hate dying over and over though completing a mission leaves a good feeling of accomplishment in your system.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Anderson', N'dennis.anderson1579@example.com', '2017-08-22', 1, N'I''ll never buy another Logitech product ever again.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Clark', N'pamela.clark9500@example.org', '2017-08-22', 1, N'Terrible product. Not durable, feels foamy not grippy. Removed it from my controller and replaced with actual grip tape.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Stewart', N'nancy.stewart8718@example.net', '2017-08-23', 5, N'This is a review of the Microsoft Xbox Wireless Adapter for Windows Summary Wanted a way to connect my Xbox One controller to my laptop as I was using the corded wireless Xbox 360 controller. Using a Windows 10 64 Bit o/s, this installed in less than 2 minutes flat. I plugged in the receiver and windows auto installed the software needed. When I paired (binded) the controller, Windows then loaded another small piece of software. Nothing else was needed. When using, there was no noticeable lag, however, I am not an avid gamer. Worked well for pinball fx which would certainly be non-playable with any type of lag. I have yet to have any connection issues or dropping of signal. (Again, using directly plugged into a laptop and only a few feet from the controller.) I am happy with this and would recommend to anyone. As with all my reviews, I will update this review should this item develop any issues with ongoing use. Pros Allows use of Xbox Controller on pc, laptop or tablets. Feels...'),
(N'Noah', N'Gutierrez', N'noah.gutierrez2728@example.net', '2017-08-23', 5, N'must buy!'),
(N'Janet', N'Adams', N'janet.adams8349@example.net', '2017-08-24', 1, N'Not control'),
(N'Andrea', N'Gutierrez', N'andrea.gutierrez8799@example.net', '2017-08-24', 5, N'This is worth it for sonic alone. The crt 3d effect is awesome and probably the best way to play sonic besides on original hardware and old TV. I only bought this for sonic, and at under $20 its easily worth it. The other games have really nice 3d effects too.'),
(N'William', N'Evans', N'william.evans6474@example.net', '2017-08-24', 4, N'He loved it'),
(N'Samantha', N'Kelly', N'samantha.kelly8353@example.org', '2017-08-24', 2, N'The woman annoy to much, bad gameplay.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Kelly', N'samantha.kelly8353@example.org', '2017-08-24', 2, N'This game is fake and hacked.'),
(N'Mateo', N'James', N'mateo.james9124@example.org', '2017-08-25', 4, N'Really liked this little Amiibo stand even though I didn''t use it as one. I have only one Amiibo on it. I''ll let the picture do the explaining. :) I will say, make sure to understand the directions clearly, they are a little confusing. But when finished you''ll have a very unique Amiibo or decorative piece for your game room.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Phillips', N'ivan.phillips2330@example.org', '2017-08-25', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Christopher', N'Bell', N'christopher.bell5953@example.org', '2017-08-25', 5, N'This game is so incredible. The adventure, new game mechanics, everything is spot on and leaves little to be desired. Thank God they did away with HMs - no more HM slaves wasting a spot in your party! With the new daycare not leveling up your pokemon, the new IV judging system, and SOS battles making it super easy to raise EVs, there has never been a better time to get into competitive breeding and playing. I highly recommend this game to any pokemon player, seasoned and new alike.'),
(N'Henry', N'Thomas', N'henry.thomas5402@example.com', '2017-08-25', 5, N'The essential Bioshock Edition if you like BioShock you''ll really enjoy these many many R Us of fun'),
(N'Andrea', N'Raghunathan', N'andrea.raghunathan5296@example.org', '2017-08-25', 1, N'wow no charge at all coming from it!'),
(N'Frank', N'Mendoza', N'frank.mendoza8830@example.org', '2017-08-25', 5, N'Great for pairing a game controller to your PC. Worked right out of the box with little to no setup.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Wright', N'christopher.wright6817@example.com', '2017-08-25', 4, N'Great start to an incredible series.'),
(N'Noah', N'Johnson', N'noah.johnson6772@example.org', '2017-08-25', 5, N'Honestly the best game ever but I hate when they capture your family it''s a harder part. This game is not for children. Awesome story and characters. Intense sneaking or run and gun or both. Cool to collect 3 star rating per mission to unlock art'),
(N'Steven', N'Moore', N'steven.moore5104@example.org', '2017-08-25', 5, N'Despite having worked with computers and playing pc games for nearly three decades, I only made the transition to mechanical keyboards about several years back. Having run the gauntlet of mechanical keyboards, I think the Redragon is a great starter mechanical keyboard for someone looking to up their experience without breaking the piggy bank. The ''clickity-clack'' of the keys is a great sound and feeling when gaming or writing. Sturdy and reliable, there''s a stability to it provided by its weight. Like any keyboard, it''s susceptible to liquid spillage. Doesn''t bounce back quite as well as others, but superb all the same.'),
(N'David', N'Sanchez', N'david.sanchez3959@example.org', '2017-08-25', 5, N'As much as I would love to review this game, what else can I say about this fantastic game that hasn''t already been said by all of the reviewers? Nice soundtrack (Ramones, Alien Ant Farm, Motorhead, etc...), cool challenges, the ability to create your own skate park, fun tricks, and great split-screen. If you haven''t already, go ahead and purchase this game (and Tony Hawk''s Undeground, while you''re at it), you won''t regret it!'),
(N'Emily', N'Peterson', N'emily.peterson8586@example.com', '2017-08-26', 5, N'Like most amiibo''s this one is also a nice quality design as pictured. Definitely worth displaying alongside other amiibo''s or your Splatoon collection. This figure actually unlocks some challenges in the game (Splatoon). All levels are the same you played before in the single player campaign but it focuses around the charge shot weapon; playing through them will help you be more proficient and you get a Hero Charger (along with other unlocks) upon completion. All in the this amiibo is worth it both in game and out.'),
(N'Amy', N'Bell', N'amy.bell4412@example.com', '2017-08-26', 3, N'Concludes the trilogy, and it''s very rare that novel adventure game series get finished (not that anybody remembers LOOM anymore, or is aware of how Monkey Island reportedly changed hands after 2, and let''s not even get started on the meddling in Inherit the Earth). However, it feels like a real rush to the finish, and the branching paths feel more contrived this time around. Somehow it still feels linear. If you''ve been a far of the series this far, though, it''ll be fun enough for you; just probably not the most memorable of the series.'),
(N'Debra', N'Kowalski', N'debra.kowalski3988@example.org', '2017-08-26', 5, N'Brand new in packaging, bought as a gift works great! Kids love it!'),
(N'Emily', N'Green', N'emily.green2644@example.org', '2017-08-26', 5, N'Love this mouse. Two years use ams still feels like new. Very reactive and precise. The razor program is insanely easy to touch and customize the mouse. Love it!!!'),
(N'Jose', N'Parker', N'jose.parker1943@example.org', '2017-08-26', 5, N'looks good this was a gift'),
(N'Dee', N'Johnson', N'dee.johnson8666@example.com', '2017-08-27', 5, N'My boy really likes it and plays it a lot.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Ward', N'timothy.ward9764@example.org', '2017-08-27', 5, N'good product'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Baker', N'jeffrey.baker8782@example.com', '2017-08-27', 4, N'Not a bad game. Clean play and decent graphics. It''s not Saints Row. SR4 had me LOLing even during the character creation mode and I didn''t stop. AOM, not so much.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Jimenez', N'lauren.jimenez1626@example.com', '2017-08-28', 5, N'I was so glad when Insomniac Games came back to make more Ratchet and Clank Game and they really delivered. The action, the suspense the new game mechanics and all new villains made this game worth while.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Bennett', N'lucia.bennett4220@example.net', '2017-08-28', 4, N'Lots of fun, though leveling gets tedious at times. Especially if you''re trying to unlock everything.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Perry', N'carolyn.perry3748@example.org', '2017-08-29', 5, N'As described. Very nice packaging, item in-tact and perfect.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Adams', N'stephen.adams6145@example.com', '2017-08-29', 4, N'It an okay game.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Tanaka', N'jeffrey.tanaka6240@example.org', '2017-08-30', 5, N'super mario oydessy for the switch,splatoon for the wii u and arms for the switch are three of the greatest video games in the universe there true classics the best of the bet super mario oydessy for the switch,splatoon for the wii u and arms for the switch rocks ^_^'),
(N'Scott', N'Kumar', N'scott.kumar1114@example.com', '2017-08-30', 5, N'good service the game sucks'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Long', N'benjamin.long4044@example.com', '2017-08-30', 5, N'Works great!'),
(N'Samantha', N'Price', N'samantha.price7372@example.org', '2017-08-30', 5, N'Works well with PC and Raspberry Pi'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Tanaka', N'stephanie.tanaka8803@example.org', '2017-08-30', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Joyce', N'Jenkins', N'joyce.jenkins3312@example.org', '2017-08-31', 5, N'Hands down one of the best games I''ve ever played. Including an AMAZING soundtrack.'),
(N'Jose', N'Bell', N'jose.bell9491@example.com', '2017-08-31', 5, N'Love Popcan video games'),
(N'James', N'Wilson', N'james.wilson9297@example.net', '2017-09-01', 5, N'Exactly as expected! I would recommend!'),
(N'Diane', N'Johnson', N'diane.johnson9336@example.com', '2017-09-01', 5, N'Good wheel accessory! Its glossy and gives you a ''secret boost'' when playing'),
(N'Helen', N'Thomas', N'helen.thomas7129@example.net', '2017-09-01', 5, N'I have bought 3 pair of headphones from this company for my children to use in video gaming. They love them. I had to replace a pair because they were stepped on and destroyed, but on their own, they work perfectly for my gamers. They say that they are comfortable, and the sound is good. Good luck!'),
(N'Joan', N'Roberts', N'joan.roberts6744@example.org', '2017-09-02', 1, N'Pass on these an go with kontrol freeks is what i recommend, not a paid advertisement nor am i affiliated with them but i have tried both and these were terrible'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Wood', N'jennifer.wood6416@example.net', '2017-09-02', 4, N'After a few months of using, scroll wheel starts to flicker, still a fantastic mouse although sometimes it''s lighting randomly will shut off. Can''t go wrong with this bad boy.'),
(N'Justin', N'Russell', N'justin.russell9958@example.com', '2017-09-02', 5, N'Very likely the absolute best story of any game I''ve ever played, on-par with if not surpassing the likes of Final Fantasy. Terrific combat system which is simple and easy to learn, but tough and rewarding to master. Simply put, if you haven''t played this game you have no idea what you''re missing, An absolute must-play of this generation and a game I will revisit multiple times in the future. I was the kid who skipped school to play video games. I played PS3 so much that I burnt them out and needed a new one every two years. Out of all the games I''ve played between the Sega Dreamcast, PS1/2/3/4, PC and Xbox, I can confidently put this game is in my top 3 of all time, easily.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Rodriguez', N'nicholas.rodriguez9700@example.com', '2017-09-02', 5, N'Great Product, Thank you'),
(N'Jason', N'Jenkins', N'jason.jenkins3009@example.net', '2017-09-03', 4, N'games ok a little slow.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Khan', N'nadia.khan1299@example.com', '2017-09-03', 1, N'If your thing is no stealth allowed, run and gun destroy as many zombies in as many ways as possible. NO story that I could see. Lots of blood and guts. This is your game.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Morris', N'raymond.morris4686@example.org', '2017-09-03', 3, N'I really wanted to love this mouse. I had been using a 20 dollar mouse for a while I decided it was time to upgrade as I was getting an RGB set up and wanted an RGB mouse to match. The programming is for the RGB is decent. Not bad in any sense but what you can actually do is a bit limited. The color intensity is awesome, very vibrant and flashy. Unfortunately, this isn''t just a light up thing like my RGB mousepad. It needs to be good at what it does, and unfortunately for me this mouse doesnt cut it. It frequently would lose tracking and shoot across the screen and due to the ambidextrious design it lacks any solid grip like dedicated a righty or lefty mouse would. Honestly I can only recommend this mouse if your a lefty and having a hard time finding a decent RGB mouse. I ended up going back to my 20 dollar mouse that performs better than this one. UPDATE: As of now as well the mouse wheel has now reached an issue where it invert scrolls for now explainable reason or will miss...'),
(N'Christopher', N'Nelson', N'christopher.nelson4221@example.org', '2017-09-03', 3, N'It works and was recognized by my pc, but the controls in game are not smooth. Aiming is off and jumpy, not smooth. I went into setting and tried may changes but still issues. Makes gaming with controller on pc impossible. Dont have Xbox 360, so cant test. If anyone has any ideas please let me know.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Jimenez', N'stephen.jimenez4815@example.org', '2017-09-03', 5, N'Great game. Amazing graphics and story.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Cook', N'thomas.cook9085@example.com', '2017-09-04', 5, N'This was a must buy for me since I loved all the previous SSX games. This game is even better then I remembered, I''m happy I picked this up!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Taylor', N'nancy.taylor8298@example.net', '2017-09-05', 5, N'came quick and really easy to setup'),
(N'Rachel', N'Clark', N'rachel.clark5491@example.net', '2017-09-05', 2, N'All the colors, lights, buttons, and settings cannot compensate for a lagging mouse input. The mouse will intermittently lag for a fraction of a second, often times putting a gamer in a precarious situation (got me killed in a simple kid''s game earlier today with my son). It happens quite often. Bad for click-fest games such as StarCraft. The software crashes often and the settings that I save do not work, so I have to wait for synapse to start working properly to once more reconfigure my settings. Synapse is what kills this mouse. I like the feel of the mouse, but none of that matters if the mouse doesn''t operate effectively. Two stars. I''m currently speaking with Razer about a warranty refund. Have owned the mouse for only two months. This issue has been recurring but I cannot ignore it any longer. Designers, ditch the gimmicks like lights....just please give us products that function properly. I bought this mouse solely for gaming (as it was advertised as a gaming mouse), and...'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Nowak', N'kenneth.nowak7729@example.net', '2017-09-05', 5, N'Great addition to the collection!'),
(N'Lauren', N'Davis', N'lauren.davis1928@example.net', '2017-09-05', 5, N'Love it! Now my controllers are always charged when I want to play!! I''m considering getting another one so I can get more controllers!'),
(N'Lisa', N'Cox', N'lisa.cox6368@example.com', '2017-09-05', 3, N'If you just want a cheap stand that will allow you to charge the Switch tablet, this does the job. Outside of that though, its fairly useless. It feels fairly cheap, which is sort of expected with this price point, but there are a few things that could definitely make this unit better. I was hoping that this stand would elevate the switch higher than the built in kickstand. I like using the Switch in tabletop mode on my desk, but the kickstand is a little low which makes it uncomfortable for long play sessions- my neck is always slightly pointed downward. Unfortunately, this stand does not provide much additional height vs. the kickstand, even on the highest setting. A ledge flips out that the Switch just sits on, but it doesn''t secure the Switch at all. I would have liked to see clips or something to hold it firmly in place, sort of like you''d see on a vehicle phone holder. It actually feels more precarious using this stand vs the included kickstand, like the Switch could...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Jimenez', N'cynthia.jimenez2322@example.org', '2017-09-05', 5, N'Love it.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Jimenez', N'cynthia.jimenez2322@example.org', '2017-09-05', 5, N'As advertised.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Chavez', N'jacqueline.chavez5784@example.net', '2017-09-05', 5, N'Great game, great price!'),
(N'Olivia', N'Moore', N'olivia.moore5788@example.net', '2017-09-06', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Mark', N'Raghunathan', N'mark.raghunathan6521@example.net', '2017-09-07', 5, N'Still working great loving it'),
(N'Henry', N'Wilson', N'henry.wilson2064@example.net', '2017-09-07', 5, N'excelente'),
(N'Ivan', N'Diaz', N'ivan.diaz3037@example.com', '2017-09-07', 4, N'Don''t be scared off by people saying that XCOM is hard or unforgiving. It can be, if you want it to be (which a lot of people do) but more casual players can still enjoy this game at their own pace and on lower difficulty settings. It''s a lot of fun even without the excessively difficult challenge a lot of people like experiencing from XCOM. Now, with that said, XCOM is a great game. It brings the turn-based tactics genre into a modern era and looks real good while doing it. The game''s story is engaging enough, but the personal narrative you forge with your soldiers and their successes and failures as you progress through the game is really the best part. You will lose characters you love. You will unexpectedly find that one of your soldiers you didn''t pay attention to suddenly saves everyone. That guy who keeps missing every shot he takes? And you hate him for it? He''s going to end up becoming the most reliable sniper in your whole roster. And you''re going to feel real awful when...'),
(N'Helen', N'Sanchez', N'helen.sanchez2210@example.org', '2017-09-07', 5, N'Hands down one of THE best horror genre games I''ve ever played. It''s a must have for any horror fan.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Morales', N'evelyn.morales4890@example.org', '2017-09-07', 4, N'I''m a big fan of the underground series and this one was more like the pro skater series and I liked it. The game was hard even on easy, it was to easy to fall in the game. Overall a great game.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Morgan', N'ivan.morgan4993@example.org', '2017-09-07', 5, N'I had this game back in 2011, but loaned it out only for it to never return. I remembered it becoming a favorite of mine (on the PS3) over GT5. I guess the simplicity of the menu navigation and the invites and events were more engaging to me. I realized the other day I no longer had this game and wished to play it again so I sought out to find another copy and bought it for both the PS3 (again) and the 360. After briefly playing it again, I remembered how much I really did enjoy it (even after all this time and originally playing with the force feedback wheel, but now with the controller). Great game! IDK if I''ll try shift 2, doesn''t have as good of reviews, but I probably will if I find it cheap enough. I mean now I bought both copies for less than what I paid for my single original copy, and my replacements were new as well. No more online, but that''s OK, the game itself is interesting enough!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Davis', N'amanda.davis7274@example.com', '2017-09-07', 4, N'I love shooter games.'),
(N'Peter', N'Alvarez', N'peter.alvarez2665@example.org', '2017-09-08', 5, N'What was the price paid for the game even though it is a collectors and a classic it''s well worth it it came very well packaged no damage to the cartridge at all no damage what so ever very clean all over'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ramirez', N'ravi.ramirez1709@example.org', '2017-09-10', 5, N'A good game lots of fun sick moves sick death kills no color all b&w and blood spater gameplay is good real smooth very challenging f but alot if fun one of the better adult games on wii'),
(N'Emma', N'Watson', N'emma.watson1141@example.com', '2017-09-10', 5, N'awesome.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Brown', N'victoria.brown6936@example.net', '2017-09-11', 5, N'good game'),
(N'Heather', N'Turner', N'heather.turner5406@example.org', '2017-09-11', 5, N'Is Ok for Lego fans'),
(N'Heather', N'Turner', N'heather.turner5406@example.org', '2017-09-11', 5, N'Sexy game :))'),
(N'Alexander', N'Diaz', N'alexander.diaz5520@example.org', '2017-09-11', 1, N'Disc was bad. Same issue many other buyers have had.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Nowak', N'ethan.nowak2493@example.org', '2017-09-11', 5, N'Works great for controllers that don''t have the 3.5mm headphone jack built in. Being able to turn headset off from adaptor is a handy feature to have. Worth the buy'),
(N'Matthew', N'Okonkwo', N'matthew.okonkwo5489@example.net', '2017-09-11', 4, N'The game seems quite good so far. I''ve not played too far into it but visuals/style/gameplay/concepts all seem very good. Note: I don''t care for Amazon''s 0/5 star ratings hence, to me, 4 is normal/good, 5 is almost never... (should be 0,1,2 instead) The five stars set up expectations that everything 5 is excellent and all else is crap. Bad system...'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Cruz', N'cynthia.cruz5408@example.com', '2017-09-11', 1, N'I wanted the game in which I had thought came with time, but it turns out no - just time for it. What do I do about this? I can''t just use a card without the actual game.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Allen', N'lauren.allen2729@example.org', '2017-09-11', 5, N'good deal'),
(N'Rachel', N'Phillips', N'rachel.phillips5413@example.com', '2017-09-11', 5, N'Great Product.'),
(N'Walter', N'Turner', N'walter.turner6870@example.com', '2017-09-11', 5, N'Good for use on the original Nintendo 3DS playing Majora''s Mask.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Suzuki', N'victoria.suzuki4189@example.org', '2017-09-12', 5, N'i got a used copy and it looked new no scratches at all thank you i hate scratched discs'),
(N'Nathan', N'Sullivan', N'nathan.sullivan9020@example.com', '2017-09-12', 5, N'Would buy it again. Works very well. Been using for months.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Coleman', N'yuki.coleman4967@example.org', '2017-09-13', 5, N'This is a great game for my children. It has been played for many hours and It was a good bargain at the time. Good quality game big bang for the money that I spent.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Coleman', N'yuki.coleman4967@example.org', '2017-09-13', 5, N'Great game, I love it has great game aspects and the colors are great too. It seems so true to life'),
(N'Daniel', N'Kelly', N'daniel.kelly4937@example.org', '2017-09-14', 5, N'Great wireless headset for the money. It has long battery life and a good range. It can be used while charging. The audio through the ear muffs is pretty good. The bass is a bit high imo, but still great for 20 dollar headphones. Also they are pretty comfortable and the ear muffs are big enough to not squash my ears. The voice quality is above average to the people that listen to me through the mic. Works on a PS4 too.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Chen', N'nadia.chen5882@example.com', '2017-09-14', 3, N'Seller stated it was like new but the case was bent seemingly from heat or pressure from weight. Game plays good with some light scratches but isn''t like new as described.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Chavez', N'ivan.chavez1108@example.net', '2017-09-15', 5, N'My son and Husband love this game. I like to play it and like that you can create your own custom track.'),
(N'Barbara', N'Adams', N'barbara.adams3001@example.org', '2017-09-15', 1, N'Very uncomfortable, the microphone is practically useless unless you boost the signal and that comes with lots of added static. Look elsewhere!'),
(N'Edward', N'Hernandez', N'edward.hernandez9049@example.com', '2017-09-15', 5, N'enjoed it!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Sullivan', N'nadia.sullivan8509@example.net', '2017-09-15', 1, N'Game itself is not the problem- New Vegas is great, easily my favorite in the series and I would recommend it in a heartbeat. 4/5. Just DO NOT buy second hand. Despite there being no mention within the summary, this game IS tied to steam and will require a one time activation code to finish installation. I''ve purchased an unplayable paperweight.'),
(N'Justin', N'Khan', N'justin.khan3338@example.org', '2017-09-16', 5, N'Thank you'),
(N'Diane', N'Chavez', N'diane.chavez4005@example.com', '2017-09-16', 2, N'This is one of the most boring games I''ve ever played with some of the worst driving/ racing mechanics ever. Vehicles don''t handle during races like they do normally. At the most critical points in any race you ever do you''re going to be pissed off. Do yourself a favor and never play this game. The only reason I didn''t give it one star is because of the open-world environment. Other than that the driving mechanics suck so bad they ruin what might have been a passable experience. If you like being frustrated then definitely play this game because you will come away frustrated like few games can ever make you. Ultimate grade: D-'),
(N'Christopher', N'Coleman', N'christopher.coleman8657@example.com', '2017-09-16', 1, N'Doesn''t fit in any of my controllers. Very stiff movement.'),
(N'Paul', N'Lewis', N'paul.lewis4541@example.org', '2017-09-17', 5, N'Looks great! Some assembly required but its easy and the directions included are very simple. Would definitely recommend for those who have Amiibos. One thing is certain I need more Amiibos to fill my display up lol!'),
(N'Michael', N'Russell', N'michael.russell6275@example.net', '2017-09-17', 5, N'iloveit'),
(N'Joyce', N'Allen', N'joyce.allen6085@example.net', '2017-09-17', 1, N'Wish I had bought it sooner so I didn''t waste so much time wanting one. It is a must for the cancer that is console ports, and unlike the 360 controller it is mappable. Problem is the incredibly stupid layout. Now to be fair I was (original) xbox, and 360 before PC so lots of muscle memory there. That point aside this has a layout unlike any other controller, mostly bacause other controllers are designed for gaming. This *thing* is just some track pads, buttons, and A joystick strapped to a fat slab with some "handles." By far my biggest mistake was giving it a chance. I hated it within 15 minuts, but thought "Hey, it''s new, lets play with the setup. Download some configurations. Try some different genres." *Spoiler* FPS, RTS, RPG, flying, racing, all crap all the time. Now I''m past the return window, and own the worlds ugliest $37 paper weight. The sole bright spot is I got in on sale, so technically didn''t waste another $13. Woo-Hoo. Guess I can blow that on a pizza, and see if...'),
(N'Aaron', N'Rivera', N'aaron.rivera6753@example.com', '2017-09-17', 5, N'Great build quality,looks good ,nice compact size'),
(N'Matthew', N'Ramirez', N'matthew.ramirez9150@example.com', '2017-09-18', 5, N'Very happy with purchase thank you'),
(N'Laura', N'Morris', N'laura.morris4516@example.net', '2017-09-18', 5, N'Awesome.'),
(N'Shirley', N'Ramos', N'shirley.ramos1574@example.org', '2017-09-18', 5, N'Best laid back Portable game ever. Could seriously spend a day lounging on the couch and play "golf"'),
(N'Joshua', N'Rodriguez', N'joshua.rodriguez5296@example.net', '2017-09-18', 5, N'love this mouse! the buttons all work and feel great, i play World of Warcraft regularly and this mouse doesnt miss a beat!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Boyd', N'brenda.boyd5463@example.org', '2017-09-19', 3, N'It works, that''s about all that can be said. The buttons function and the D-pad is actually a hair above average for these cheap controllers. They are paper light and shoulder buttons are extremely loud.'),
(N'Walter', N'Morales', N'walter.morales1391@example.org', '2017-09-19', 5, N'my son loves it'),
(N'Noah', N'Carter', N'noah.carter7411@example.net', '2017-09-20', 5, N'This game is fantastic. I was not really much of a fan of older Tomb Raider games. I felt that they had too much "Super Mario Stuff" with the jumping on to certain things at certain times and all that. Rise of the Tomb Raider has some of that but it''s fairly straight forward and not crazy hard to do. You can play the game a lot of different ways: as a completionist, as action, as collector. You can put a lot of time into everything if you want to or you can watch youtube videos and basically skip all the puzzles and play as an action game. I recently purchased my Xbox One S and I thought I would play this first saving sequels to games I loved on the 360 for later because I was worried I wouldn''t enjoy it as much and I wouldn''t finish it. I am enjoying it a lot more than I thought I would. The action and fighting can be stealth like old Splinter Cell games or like a FPS. The game is visually amazing. I have attached several of my actual xbox screenshots and a video (gameplay looks...'),
(N'Amara', N'Collins', N'amara.collins8086@example.net', '2017-09-20', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Ronald', N'Ivanov', N'ronald.ivanov5100@example.net', '2017-09-20', 5, N'Still one of my favs of all time.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Evans', N'daniel.evans8350@example.net', '2017-09-20', 5, N'Awesome game.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Thomas', N'victoria.thomas8117@example.net', '2017-09-21', 1, N'Sound is horrible wish I never bought it. The sound level is limited like kids headphones that protect hearing loss'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Sanchez', N'evelyn.sanchez7054@example.com', '2017-09-21', 4, N'Went from A50s to these, and I love them more. The only problem is the cable that goes from the headset to the mix amp is very finicky. If it moves the slightest, it resets power to the mixamp.'),
(N'Carol', N'Ross', N'carol.ross8581@example.com', '2017-09-21', 5, N'Great product, love it!'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Cook', N'stephanie.cook6756@example.net', '2017-09-21', 4, N'great case. if you have a case on your 3ds, space will be tight.'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Long', N'jeremy.long4899@example.org', '2017-09-21', 5, N'very nice and fast shipping'),
(N'Jason', N'Hill', N'jason.hill3344@example.net', '2017-09-21', 5, N'Quick and easy download.'),
(N'Linda', N'Lee', N'linda.lee3317@example.com', '2017-09-22', 5, N'Had it about 2.5 years. Worked great. Held up to a fair amount of use (and abuse)'),
(N'Kyle', N'Powell', N'kyle.powell5783@example.net', '2017-09-23', 5, N'Not only is it well made, but unlike other amiibos it unlocked something worth having in it''s tie in game. Co op Shovel knight almost 2 years before it officially came out along with a slew of bonuses.'),
(N'Christine', N'Wood', N'christine.wood1960@example.com', '2017-09-23', 5, N'addicting :)'),
(N'Christine', N'Wood', N'christine.wood1960@example.com', '2017-09-23', 3, N'Great game but having to down load as opposed to loading from a disk Sux .'),
(N'James', N'Howard', N'james.howard4893@example.org', '2017-09-24', 4, N'the product is nice. it connects to my ps3 and pc with no issues. audio is good. the ear pieces are pretty comfortable. it feels good.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Russell', N'rachel.russell7570@example.com', '2017-09-24', 5, N'The hand held fighting game ever'),
(N'Brenda', N'Chavez', N'brenda.chavez4487@example.org', '2017-09-25', 5, N'Product worked flawlessly. I usually wait a minimum of six months before writing any review in order to fully test a product and its durability.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Raghunathan', N'andrea.raghunathan5296@example.org', '2017-09-25', 1, N'barely gives the controllers any charge now'),
(N'Emma', N'Ortiz', N'emma.ortiz9616@example.net', '2017-09-25', 5, N'Works better on the Xbox One S. I have a 3.0 USB hard drive connected. The game installs to the drive and you only need disc 2 to play after its installed. Load screens are super quick compared to the 360 or ps3 versions. This game is 9 years old but its still great to me.'),
(N'Megan', N'Russell', N'megan.russell6092@example.net', '2017-09-25', 5, N'I don''t think it really looks like Han Solo, but hey, you gotta buy''em all. Han Solo is pretty cool'),
(N'Daniel', N'Howard', N'daniel.howard9604@example.org', '2017-09-26', 3, N'It''s really nice and plays well, like other comments suggest, but I don''t get hooked the way I did with Tiger Woods games. I also have mixed feelings about playing the same few holes each round of the shortened tournament play style. This really takes the challenge out and makes it so repetitive that I feel like I''ve been playing too long. My wife appreciates that I don''t spend so much time playing it; so there''s that.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Fisher', N'brandon.fisher3654@example.org', '2017-09-26', 5, N'Incredible mouse. Feels absolutely perfect in my hand, incredibly smooth. Beautiful response and looks'),
(N'Charles', N'Walker', N'charles.walker5571@example.net', '2017-09-26', 2, N'I bought this solely for the single player campaign. I wasn''t expecting anything great, but was surprised at how short and lame it was. The writing is simply awful, the game play fairly boring and dangerously close to being a game on rails. If you can get it for under $10, it''s a way to blow off five to seven hours. I have the rest of the CoD titles on my Steam wish list, but after this game, I''m not spending more than $5 for any of them. Even then, I''m not sure I''ll continue on with the series.'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Young', N'carolyn.young1847@example.net', '2017-09-26', 5, N'excellent product'),
(N'Eric', N'Jenkins', N'eric.jenkins1261@example.org', '2017-09-26', 5, N'This is a great replacement cable for the 1000 model series of the Playstation Vita! I love how snug this cable feels when it is plugged in! Very good and sturdy! Definitely worth buying as a replacement or backup cable.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Miller', N'andrea.miller8715@example.com', '2017-09-27', 3, N'Poor story, even after watching the additional content. Fighting is bland. Characters are great and so is the scenery/graphics. Side quests were unbearable and boring.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Chen', N'olivia.chen8304@example.net', '2017-09-28', 5, N'Great fun. Lots of action but the choice to shoot-um-up or race them. This is not my usual as I like slower, build your avatar games like Fallout more often but like the Mass Effect series this one keeps you coming back and making you plan attacks and use strategy to win. I have really enjoyed it.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Morris', N'ashley.morris3227@example.org', '2017-09-28', 3, N'This game puts me to sleep when I play but it''s still alright for the most part. Some of the character designs are pretty lame though.'),
(N'Susan', N'Coleman', N'susan.coleman9697@example.net', '2017-09-28', 5, N'Great game, it is really fun. Don''t believe people when they say not to get it just because the community is gone. This game is just as fun in single player. The only issue with this game is that the DLC comes on a code, so if you purchase the ultimate edition, be sure to get it new if you''re wanting all of the DLC.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Bailey', N'deborah.bailey2118@example.org', '2017-09-28', 5, N'Just adding games to my collection.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Lopez', N'nathan.lopez7753@example.org', '2017-09-29', 4, N'bought this for my child who likes it a lot. You get what you pay for, but the sound is good and so is the mic.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Ivanov', N'lauren.ivanov3755@example.com', '2017-09-29', 5, N'These are really nice.'),
(N'Betty', N'Price', N'betty.price2497@example.org', '2017-09-29', 5, N'This works great for the ol Smash bros. I wish it worked for more Wii U games as the Gamecube controller is my most favorite controller type but there''s a plus side to this, it works for the Nintendo Switch quite well but not with all games. So far as i can tell the Gamecube controller is a complete fiasco with Lendgend of Zelda Breath of the wild but it works quite well with every other game i''ve tried so far. It totally works for the new Pokken tournament DX and Sonic Mania too. I''ll come back with an update on which games this can work for'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Wang', N'jeffrey.wang8887@example.org', '2017-09-30', 5, N'my son loves it'),
(N'Rachel', N'Foster', N'rachel.foster9712@example.com', '2017-09-30', 5, N'HANDY'),
(N'Hannah', N'Sanders', N'hannah.sanders4641@example.com', '2017-10-01', 3, N'Superb audio. Love the surround, I''m able to detect newbs a mile away! For simple audio surround, this set has me satiated. The microphone? Well, it''s not great. It gets the job done, peeps on ps4 and YouTube claim that I sound "alright" but that''s just not good enough. The audio is amazing! But the microphone is simply mediocre. If you are a YouTuber, or a Twitch streamer, this is basic level. Didn''t really wow me, to any regard. Microphone is really lacking, otherwise, this headset is on point! Just don''t speak into it!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Perry', N'deborah.perry7492@example.com', '2017-10-01', 5, N'Good game. there are a lot of levels to play and a lot of items to collect. It''s actually pretty challenging even for an adult, so you may want to consider that before buying, but its a very well done game with loads of content to keep you and up to 4 people playing.'),
(N'Helen', N'Turner', N'helen.turner2230@example.org', '2017-10-01', 4, N'Brings back so many memories. This was the madden that was just complicated enough to allow versatility, but not overly complicated like the new Maddens.'),
(N'Daniel', N'Castillo', N'daniel.castillo2388@example.net', '2017-10-01', 4, N'The razer software didn''t pick up the mouse, but just using it on its own is fine. There''s 12 buttons on the side of the mouse (1 through = on the keyboard) and the mouse wheel works great, The click sound is a little loud though for such a high dollar mouse, usually like less clicky sounds... Overall, the precision and use of the mouse is superb and one of the best I''ve had the pleasure of using. Edi 12/4/17 It seems to sometimes stall for a few seconds, mouse not move at all. it''s happened twice now and I''m not sure what causes it. Once was mid game but it wasn''t during any crucial moment, though that could be a serious issue if it happened during a competitive match.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Williams', N'kenneth.williams7534@example.org', '2017-10-01', 5, N'By far the best and most comfortable Open Back gaming headset. It is light, comfortable, and highly adjustable. Mic is nice and clear however you will need an extra cable to use that mic one your console. Sound is crisp and clear and you can wear this for a long time. If you want an open back headset then this is the one for you'),
(N'Mateo', N'Sanchez', N'mateo.sanchez8303@example.net', '2017-10-02', 1, N'At first I enjoyed the game, then I played against "zoners" who basically cheese on the same repetative projectile and stay om the far end so you cant fight back'),
(N'Zachary', N'Sanders', N'zachary.sanders4392@example.net', '2017-10-03', 5, N'Badass ,way cooler than 007 .'),
(N'Joyce', N'Ward', N'joyce.ward3874@example.com', '2017-10-03', 4, N'kids like'),
(N'David', N'Sanchez', N'david.sanchez3959@example.org', '2017-10-03', 5, N'Great tactical shooter, worth the money. Not as good as Socom 2, however.'),
(N'Lauren', N'Gutierrez', N'lauren.gutierrez7800@example.net', '2017-10-04', 5, N'Saves me from having to waste gas and drive to the store.'),
(N'Joan', N'Morris', N'joan.morris7532@example.com', '2017-10-05', 5, N'Is perfect'),
(N'Amanda', N'Gutierrez', N'amanda.gutierrez8590@example.net', '2017-10-05', 4, N'This is much better than Smash for 3DS. Good graphics and decent controls with many play options and tons of characters. For 3DS has garbage graphics with impossible controls. So bland. Pick this up.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Lewis', N'samantha.lewis4817@example.org', '2017-10-05', 2, N'Wish I would have known this game was for kids and was no longer supported online by Disney before I bought it. If you like games like MineCraft, you will probably like it. I was very bored.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Collins', N'kelly.collins1288@example.net', '2017-10-06', 2, N'Do not buy refurbished. I have 3 and this one would not work with my pi for some reason. I hooked it up to my computer and had issues as well. The other are GREAT. Refurbished is not good.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Evans', N'hannah.evans8846@example.net', '2017-10-06', 5, N'Love it works great!'),
(N'Jose', N'Collins', N'jose.collins9435@example.org', '2017-10-06', 4, N'As a huge fan of the Souls series, I found this game disappointing. The control scheme seems to have changed and camera movement is entirely wonky. Put it on the shelf after one time and never touched it again.'),
(N'Janet', N'Lewis', N'janet.lewis4841@example.net', '2017-10-06', 5, N'Honestly one of the best series out there. It''s just so unique from the art to the music and whole atmosphere of the game. This is the first game of the series and I''d recommend it to people who like visual novels with a twist. From what I heard, it plays like the Ace Attorney games but with a different vibe.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Ramirez', N'ravi.ramirez1709@example.org', '2017-10-07', 3, N'Ok game long and gets old boring after a while its a 3 disc game i recieved all 3 discs in paper covers and arrived as expected'),
(N'John', N'Diaz', N'john.diaz7033@example.org', '2017-10-07', 5, N'Works as it should'),
(N'Anthony', N'Clark', N'anthony.clark9676@example.org', '2017-10-07', 4, N'I love this game. It''s also the real reason why I began to love Deadpool as a character. It''s really fun. You get to buy and upgrade your weapons and DP yells at you if you suck badly. Gameplay is great but it was laggy the entire playthrough. I don''t know if it''s just my ps4 but it kept lagging in and out even when I get back to it. Perhaps I will play it again to see if maybe my ps4 just needed an update and hopefully it did the trick.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Baker', N'brandon.baker3540@example.net', '2017-10-08', 2, N'Got bored with this one.'),
(N'Christina', N'Coleman', N'christina.coleman7642@example.com', '2017-10-08', 5, N'My new favorite game. I rarely play video games, at max maybe twice a month. After I recived this and started it I couldn''t stop playing. I had 24 hours played within the first day. Definitely worth getting it!'),
(N'Charles', N'Peterson', N'charles.peterson3412@example.net', '2017-10-09', 5, N'Ive used many kinds of headphones and these outperform all other sensible competition. Yes, their a bit more expensive than many other gaming headphones but their worth it. The sound and music quality easily compares to some pairs in the 600-900 dollar range. While the excellent boom mic has great pickup is highly adjustable and holds positions well. I removed the foam from the mic so I could easily tell where the mic is pointed. Only better mics Ive used are from Blue for around 150 for a desktop one. Beyerdynamic has great customer support and many customization options available. Their a German company, same country bringing fine vehicles and Ocktoberfest every year.'),
(N'Dee', N'Harris', N'dee.harris4901@example.net', '2017-10-10', 5, N'Great Game!'),
(N'Andrea', N'Hughes', N'andrea.hughes9447@example.net', '2017-10-10', 5, N'It''s good I love the original on the GameCube that''s why I bought this one got to love these Zelda games lol'),
(N'Deborah', N'Foster', N'deborah.foster5810@example.net', '2017-10-10', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Donna', N'Kim', N'donna.kim2832@example.org', '2017-10-10', 5, N'All nostalgia-appealing, just in crisper, layered graphics. Also, a retake on the OST. Same PS2 masterpiece, only enhanced by a few aspects.'),
(N'Judith', N'Williams', N'judith.williams5125@example.org', '2017-10-10', 5, N'Big fan'),
(N'Hannah', N'Price', N'hannah.price9022@example.org', '2017-10-10', 4, N'Prior to Nier: Automata, I wasn''t too familiar with the Nier franchise. I think I read about Nier: Automata somewhere, and it piqued my interest, so I decided to give it a go. Its only fair for me to admit I only finished the first playthrough (Route A, I believe its called). However, I spent 30 hours on the game, and Im thinking Ive gathered enough intel to give it a fair shake. Ok, here are eight things that jumped out at me during my 30 hours. [1] Its a Platinum game; so of course the combat was top notch. Part of the reason why it took me 30 hours to complete a short campaign is because I often ran around looking for random enemies to fight! Now, THATs the mark of a game that has great combat! Each swing of my chosen weapon (a spear) felt smooth and realistic. Top that off with the ability to shoot lasers (A companion called a Pod), and I was a happy customer. I feel the need to point out that if you play the 2nd campaign (9S''s campaign) he''s not great at melee combat (from...'),
(N'Lisa', N'Stewart', N'lisa.stewart5293@example.com', '2017-10-10', 1, N'Bought mine in May 2017 and it is "double clicking" on single click after 5 months :( Unfortunately I have to deal with Corsair support for this since it has been discovered that this is a hardware issues due to the Omoron switches in the mouse itself. It''s not a software bug sadly, they can''t patch it out. Sad, I really loved this mouse too. It was easily my favorite.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Mitchell', N'katherine.mitchell3750@example.org', '2017-10-10', 3, N'Okay game bought it bc friends have it so we could play online together but not my type of game.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Howard', N'lisa.howard4514@example.com', '2017-10-11', 3, N'The campaign is challenging. It offers a variety of gameplay, from sniping, tanks, helicopters, close quarters, and heavy machine guns. The graphics are very dated, but the Xbox 360 version is better looking and has the highest resolution. In the campaign, you can change control from one soldier to another. It makes the levels very replayable, as you can try the level with different classes or vehicles. Online has been shut down.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Ali', N'evelyn.ali4594@example.com', '2017-10-11', 5, N'This game is a classic. I highly recommend it.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Morgan', N'kenneth.morgan6267@example.com', '2017-10-12', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Brandon', N'Chavez', N'brandon.chavez8618@example.org', '2017-10-12', 2, N'Cheaply made product. I''m pretty sure it''s not shielded at all. Theres a hum ion the audio if the game is silent for whatever reason.'),
(N'Victoria', N'Rodriguez', N'victoria.rodriguez2747@example.com', '2017-10-13', 5, N'Nice remote. Works great. Very cute especially if your a Yoshi lover. Would recommend this to Wii and Wii U users.'),
(N'James', N'Miller', N'james.miller5118@example.org', '2017-10-14', 3, N'It was shipped in a bubble wrapped envelope, works well on one of my dses, I have three and it couldn''t be read on two of them. Works well, I forgot that this game has so many side quests lol'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Castillo', N'evelyn.castillo1170@example.com', '2017-10-14', 5, N'I loved this game before and I still love it now. Works perfectly, thank you so much.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Ross', N'alexander.ross6411@example.com', '2017-10-14', 2, N'Feels like a mobile game - collect, upgrade, repeat.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Walker', N'yuki.walker9890@example.net', '2017-10-15', 1, N'This is the second pair of these I''ve gotten and I thought maybe I got a bad pair the first time but these also died really quickly. They are comfortable though'),
(N'Joseph', N'Edwards', N'joseph.edwards4287@example.com', '2017-10-15', 5, N'UPDATE: Still works amazingly with my Galaxy Note 8 with Android 8.0. Works great with my Galaxy S5. Everything I wanted in a controller. The clip is perfect for it. It connects quickly and easily after initial setup. It has vibration. The L2/R2 keys don''t give much feedback, but you won''t be using those keys much outside of PS1 emulation. Still feels great. The controller also can charge while you play. The sticks feel pretty good. The Dpad does a nice job as well. It was effective in tests involving a DS Castlevania game, Megaman Zero, and even Gundam Battle Assault 2. I wouldn''t replace my Street Fighter fightpad, though. Overall, I love it. It [Hero Power] fits in my pocket, it has a clip for the phone, it charges my phone, and it does all that while being cheaper than an 8Bitdo pro. Best part? Virtually no input lag'),
(N'Amanda', N'Bailey', N'amanda.bailey3544@example.com', '2017-10-15', 1, N'purchased in July 2017 was non functional by October of the same year...the cord tends to curl its self causing crimps and eventually they start dropping sound regularly.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Scott', N'jerry.scott7259@example.net', '2017-10-16', 5, N'My brother loves it, best razer mouse'),
(N'Jack', N'Hernandez', N'jack.hernandez3376@example.org', '2017-10-16', 5, N'Yes!'),
(N'Diane', N'Walker', N'diane.walker2496@example.org', '2017-10-17', 3, N'was just pedals witch it doesnt show pedals it shows the wheel and took a while to find just a wheel. good set all together when you get the cords and full set'),
(N'Aisha', N'Garcia', N'aisha.garcia7654@example.org', '2017-10-17', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Betty', N'Sanders', N'betty.sanders4952@example.org', '2017-10-17', 4, N'Very Underrated game, the only problem I have with this game is the servers. Though since there aren''t many players around my region, I wouldn''t be surprised. The story is fairly good, at least THERE IS A STORY compare to the lackluster on the first one. Hopefully, EA will make a third one. 8/10'),
(N'Joshua', N'Campbell', N'joshua.campbell4355@example.com', '2017-10-17', 5, N'another madden game.....most are similar, with some changes that make them unique...I understand this Madden 17 is the last Madden made for the PS3, so I purchased it . Nice game, not much different than all the rest....SO....it is what it is....It''s Madden, what else needs said?'),
(N'Zachary', N'Coleman', N'zachary.coleman6705@example.org', '2017-10-17', 1, N'Somehow, multiplayer still pairs pro-level gamers with newbies to create epically one-sided multiplayer matches. I can''t get anyone to play this game with me because a new player will loose in spectacular fashion. Look elsewhere.'),
(N'Larry', N'Patel', N'larry.patel6197@example.org', '2017-10-17', 1, N'I have enjoyed Gran Turismo... up until now. This game has extremely limited cars, tracks (most of which look okay at best), and the online races are all scheduled, meaning you''ll be waiting awhile before playing.'),
(N'Janet', N'Price', N'janet.price7803@example.org', '2017-10-18', 4, N'love it'),
(N'Amanda', N'Bailey', N'amanda.bailey7270@example.com', '2017-10-18', 5, N'As described'),
(N'Patrick', N'Bell', N'patrick.bell7192@example.org', '2017-10-18', 4, N'Got for my son.'),
(N'Linda', N'Hughes', N'linda.hughes7332@example.com', '2017-10-19', 5, N'Finally. I''ve been looking for a nice, solid, lighted keyboard without a dozen extra keys/controls that I wouldn''t use, that doesn''t light up like a merry go round at the county fair, and that doesn''t have a huge footprint. This keyboard fits the bill. Well built and weighty. You will need to download the G610 s/w from Logitech to add a lot of features, especially the one for turning off the wave lighting (very annoying). The scrolling wheel volume feature is a great addition. The s/w has the option of installing "Overwolf". This will detect games and automatically highlight the keys for gameplay. In short, great keyboard. You might want to purchase a wrist pad for $10.00.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Collins', N'jacob.collins5753@example.org', '2017-10-19', 5, N'GTSport is what the genre needed to change the game. This is definitely building blocks I can''t what to see what they add to the game overtime with FREE DLC or Paid doesn''t matter.'),
(N'George', N'Howard', N'george.howard2125@example.com', '2017-10-19', 4, N'Very impressed with this. Polished and perfect. Made me look forward to playing my ps4 again! Of course no game is perfect though. 4 stars'),
(N'James', N'Raghunathan', N'james.raghunathan8560@example.com', '2017-10-19', 4, N'Grandson loves this thing.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brown', N'katherine.brown2144@example.com', '2017-10-20', 3, N'I will say I am extremely glad to have a ranked multiplayer racer on Console now. The physics are not the greatest and single player content is lacking. Force feedback is very vague at best (varies from car to car) The fact the game is always online just does not make sense. And there''s just no content there, the single-player is basically just training you for the multiplayer. theres only 17 tracks with 40 layouts some of those being just reverse layouts. The only reasons I give it 3 stars is because of one how amazing the game looks on just a standard PS4, it still is fun to drive no matter how bad the physics can be (at times), and it does the matchmaking ranked multiplayer very very well similar to iRacing, so I will personally get my money''s worth out of it. Also at this time there are no microtransactions and future DLC such as tracks and cars are supposed to be free. But if you''re going into this expecting Gran Turismo 7 you''re going to be very disappointed, but in the games...'),
(N'Michael', N'Torres', N'michael.torres1836@example.org', '2017-10-20', 5, N'This M750 keyboard has a crazy ton of extra features that make it look super cool. I love that the software works with a Mac and is intuitive in needing to set up any different keyboard configurations. In the end, this is a keyboard - I''ve no problem typing on it. My only initial worry was the keyboard base plus keys seemed to be a little higher (millimeters) than I was used to, however, this wasn''t a problem in the end.'),
(N'Jacob', N'Khan', N'jacob.khan5292@example.net', '2017-10-20', 5, N'Any game that gets me into it along with my boys gets an A+ from me! :)'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Parker', N'hiroshi.parker7864@example.org', '2017-10-21', 5, N'And again more forza cry babies acting like they have played this game before lol'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Taylor', N'benjamin.taylor4894@example.org', '2017-10-21', 4, N'It may look like a knock-off Xbox 360 controller, and you''re probably right. But for what it''s worth, you may tolerate it over time. The ergonomic design and control layout keeps to what makes the core gaming experience at its most comfortable setup, especially where you wouldn''t need to re-adjust your hands to reach everything. This way has always worked very effectively for the controllers of this generation''s top brand platforms, and it''s the same for this controller as well. If you''re expecting to hold an Xbox 360 controller, be surprised at the differences and flaws this has in comparison. For one, it''s incredibly light. There are no built-in vibration motors and no need to install a battery pack since it has one built-in and rechargeable through micro-USB. It''s also made from different materials and doesn''t have much housing, which makes the bumpers click very loudly.. Through a Bluetooth wireless connection, the controller will be treated as a generic gamepad. This means the...'),
(N'Amara', N'Williams', N'amara.williams7074@example.com', '2017-10-22', 5, N'Good condition, works well!'),
(N'Ravi', N'James', N'ravi.james8814@example.com', '2017-10-22', 1, N'I know is been out for a year but I''m only posting this in the hopes that someone from Ubisoft might take note. I''m tired of kicking this football, Lucy. I keep buying these damn games hoping, "surely this time it will be better." The original AC came out 10 years ago and this game is essentially exactly the same. AC2 was awesome but each iteration of the game since then has simply added more gimmicks not better play. The addition of the spider-man-magic grappling hook even takes the fun out of the parkour elements. I found myself intentionally not using it to make the game more challenging. Whats next? Is Imhotep going to give us a flying carpet in the next game? Just adding hundreds of redundant missions doesn''t make for a compelling game. How many times do they expect us to kill the same villain sprites in slightly different locations? How about a game where we actually have to do some recon not just kill everybody wearing red pants? How about actually needing to solve a few...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Wood', N'jeremy.wood2107@example.com', '2017-10-22', 4, N'Very fn game. It gets a little long winded though.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Nguyen', N'raymond.nguyen7852@example.com', '2017-10-22', 5, N'Very well'),
(N'Sandra', N'Lewis', N'sandra.lewis9330@example.com', '2017-10-22', 5, N'works'),
(N'Samuel', N'Ferreira', N'samuel.ferreira1263@example.net', '2017-10-22', 5, N'GOOD GAME LOADS UP FINE.AND THE PRICE WAS GREAT.'),
(N'Megan', N'Phillips', N'megan.phillips3317@example.com', '2017-10-23', 1, N'I honestly didn''t like these headsets at all and refunded them, the sound was terrible, the mic was bad, they hurt my ears really badly because of how tight they squeezed my ears, Customer support was quick to refund me and gave me no issues, but the product itself was not enjoyable to me at all I might have gotten a defective one but this was the experience I had.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Hernandez', N'amanda.hernandez5363@example.org', '2017-10-23', 5, N'Bought as a gift. No complaints! Thank you!'),
(N'Kevin', N'Suzuki', N'kevin.suzuki5510@example.net', '2017-10-23', 5, N'wonderful game it really gives that Gothic feeling, if you are into RPG games, you have to explore A LOT, this is not an online game, you play solo, and fighting you have to be skillful on it, awesome story line, great monsters and armors, the jetpack was a plus, even better face animations than mass effect andromeda. and open world with infinite possibilities, if you cant fight any monster to finish the mission just sneak in, get the item and run away, you will get more experience from the missions than killing monsters, this is not a mmorpg, so grinding monsters won''t help to level.'),
(N'Stephen', N'Barnes', N'stephen.barnes9738@example.com', '2017-10-24', 3, N'Good game'),
(N'Ronald', N'Martin', N'ronald.martin8085@example.net', '2017-10-24', 5, N'great looking cover for your xbox one controller. easy to install'),
(N'Walter', N'Clark', N'walter.clark5485@example.net', '2017-10-24', 5, N'After buying it... play it, when your board... play it, after a scary movie... play it!!! This game has one of the best replay values ever. Total replay value and it makes you feel like your character.'),
(N'Noah', N'Coleman', N'noah.coleman2313@example.com', '2017-10-24', 3, N'ok game'),
(N'Linda', N'Peterson', N'linda.peterson7830@example.com', '2017-10-24', 1, N'I''ve been looking forward to this game for so long only for them to pull an EA and demand online play only!!! I''m done with this company.'),
(N'Kofi', N'King', N'kofi.king7434@example.org', '2017-10-25', 5, N'It was a really good bye plus it worked where I couldn''t get it on line at Star Wars'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Raghunathan', N'benjamin.raghunathan8555@example.net', '2017-10-25', 5, N'this game is great for windows 7 not sure about windows 10'),
(N'John', N'Turner', N'john.turner6486@example.org', '2017-10-26', 4, N'ok'),
(N'Deborah', N'Carter', N'deborah.carter2010@example.org', '2017-10-27', 4, N'The only complaint I have is that it is very loud when it''s on. I wasn''t expecting it to be so noisy. But otherwise it is exactly what I needed and wanted. Not other complaints.'),
(N'Lucia', N'Lopez', N'lucia.lopez2320@example.net', '2017-10-27', 5, N'It get the job done'),
(N'Karen', N'Richardson', N'karen.richardson9907@example.net', '2017-10-27', 5, N'While the graphics in the storyline films are definitely 2012, the gameplay graphics movements are phenominal even in 2017. The way you can move your player to cover, roll, jump and rapidly move from one spot of cover to another is fantastic. Taking control of drones, robots and using sensors to spot and mark enemies for simultaneous takedowns is loads of fun. Very, very long single person campaign storyline, and online gaming to boot! The gun smith feature allows you to customize trigger, gas system, surpressor or flash hider, paint, magazines, underbarrel attachments like grenade launcher or pistol grip and more, and try them out before launching a mission. The game is 3rd person, so you see your character moving, crouching behind and switching cover, shooting, etc. The movements are insanely realistic, but it does take a bit to get used to shooting 3rdperson as opposed the 1st person shooters like Call of Duty. Also, no maps, so you only see what the character does. However,...'),
(N'Amy', N'Myers', N'amy.myers1131@example.net', '2017-10-28', 5, N'I like it'),
(N'Donald', N'Scott', N'donald.scott1348@example.org', '2017-10-28', 5, N'Great game'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Patel', N'elizabeth.patel1038@example.net', '2017-10-28', 5, N'When i think of my LOVE for my 3DS Xl and RPGs i think of Chrono Trigger, this perhaps the best RPG ive ever played! If you live RPGs and have not played this youll wonder why you did not do it sooner. You will not be disappointed.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Lee', N'douglas.lee6514@example.com', '2017-10-28', 5, N'Back in the day, Activision made some of the best games in the business. Now here they are, on one cartridge, almost just like they were then.'),
(N'George', N'Adams', N'george.adams9645@example.org', '2017-10-28', 5, N'Great mic, combined with the Elite Pro Headset and the TAC. Sound quality is amazing, noise cancelling is great. No complaints from me!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Bell', N'hannah.bell7302@example.com', '2017-10-28', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Rachel', N'Walker', N'rachel.walker3946@example.net', '2017-10-29', 5, N'Excellent, thanks!'),
(N'Betty', N'Kim', N'betty.kim8180@example.com', '2017-10-29', 2, N'After getting this and having it apply with a ridiculous amount of dust underneath, I ended up just cutting a Zagg iPad screen protector, which comes with an application liquid that works insanely well in comparison.'),
(N'Emily', N'Ruiz', N'emily.ruiz5087@example.net', '2017-10-29', 5, N'Works great.'),
(N'Jessica', N'Price', N'jessica.price3004@example.org', '2017-10-29', 5, N'I was quite surprised when Blizzard created an FPS game. I know for a fact that they wanted to cover another aspect of MOBA game, but in a form of FPS. Each character represents each kind of persons play style for sure. The art and graphics is amazing from the PS4 and PC. The leveling system is nice and also the fact that you can pick different costumes for your characters is so neat because, many people love different play styles and different play styles means customizing your characters looks. Definitely a fun and must have FPS game especially for kids since this one isn''t gory at all.'),
(N'Edward', N'Bailey', N'edward.bailey8498@example.org', '2017-10-30', 5, N'Cables are a little short for my setup, but enough to reach my seat. We just have to watch out for accidental decapitations. Responsive, beautiful and heavy. Great addition to my arsenal! Too bad we only use this for Injustice 2, Mortal Kombat and those kinds of games on occasional game night. Good to have around, but unless you play huge on fighting games, it''s a waste of space and simply a novelty to have.'),
(N'Dee', N'Phillips', N'dee.phillips3037@example.net', '2017-10-30', 5, N'Worked as expected.'),
(N'Dee', N'Phillips', N'dee.phillips3037@example.net', '2017-10-30', 4, N'These work 100% as advertised, but the connections are a little loose on the extension-controller female end. I''ve had it slip out a few times.'),
(N'Edward', N'Edwards', N'edward.edwards6876@example.org', '2017-10-30', 4, N'Got this as a gift and they loved it.'),
(N'Amara', N'Davis', N'amara.davis9183@example.com', '2017-10-30', 5, N'Really great love it'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Davis', N'jeremy.davis1514@example.com', '2017-10-31', 5, N'This game is worth your time. Even more so than the original. as a matter of fact, the original is also included in with this game.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Castillo', N'sarah.castillo1286@example.com', '2017-10-31', 5, N'This one is for me the best COD ever. Didn''t like Infinity Warfare at all'),
(N'Karen', N'Wisniewski', N'karen.wisniewski5028@example.net', '2017-11-01', 5, N'Excellent merchandise'),
(N'Victoria', N'Mitchell', N'victoria.mitchell8920@example.com', '2017-11-01', 2, N'A ton of money for 2 cheap pieces of plastic'),
(N'Michael', N'Sullivan', N'michael.sullivan3528@example.org', '2017-11-01', 5, N'Works great, really like the weight. Braided cord is obnoxious and kinks,but otherwise great.'),
(N'Emily', N'Robinson', N'emily.robinson9880@example.com', '2017-11-01', 5, N'good video game'),
(N'Omar', N'Khan', N'omar.khan4626@example.net', '2017-11-01', 5, N'It''s the Japan version, but the actual Amiibo is the same as the domestic release. I use this for Breath of the Wild, and yes it works as expected. For what it''s worth, you get just random stuff unless/until you free one of the divine beasts. Then you will get (immediately in my case) the Sword of the Six Sages...the first time Link actually has ever wielded this weapon, incidentally, being that it has been in Ganon''s care ever since it was used against him those many years (and games) ago. It''s a decent sword, decent power (two handed, incidentally) and give a bit of oomph to the game. I was initially hesitant to go for the Japan import version, but I needn''t have worried...it works great and the packaging has the nifty katakana/kanji script so I can pretend I grok Japanese. Given the scope of Breath of the Wild, having Amiibos handy really does smooth things over and minimizes grinding, and this one is no exception. I like it.'),
(N'Christine', N'Garcia', N'christine.garcia6194@example.org', '2017-11-02', 5, N'They work on my gamecube! Can''t ask for much more than that.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Gonzalez', N'kathleen.gonzalez4665@example.com', '2017-11-02', 2, N'Feels extremely cheap and the buttons are not as responsive as they should be. I''d recommend a different brand, which is unfortunate because Hori has been great in the past'),
(N'Alexander', N'Hughes', N'alexander.hughes2605@example.com', '2017-11-02', 5, N'Excellent item.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Smith', N'douglas.smith8074@example.com', '2017-11-02', 5, N'Has worked very well for me. I was very worried buying an aftermarket hard-drive, but it has functioned flawlessly.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Rodriguez', N'katherine.rodriguez9541@example.org', '2017-11-02', 4, N'Works great, don''t forget the mount if you order.'),
(N'Linda', N'Patel', N'linda.patel1487@example.com', '2017-11-02', 5, N'great'),
(N'John', N'Harris', N'john.harris1351@example.net', '2017-11-02', 1, N'I had the product for 6 months and i don''t know if it a manufacturer issue or a product issue but mine disconnects on its own after a few minutes on wireless. I didn''t have this issue for the first 2 months and now it does it more than ever i would like to give it five star as it has alot of capabilities just wish I could use it more hope i can try there product once its improved.'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Howard', N'jeffrey.howard8321@example.net', '2017-11-02', 3, N'This was an okay edition of the game. To be honest I didn''t play very much of the Infinite Warfare just because I did not like it at all. I only really played COD 4 remastered which I still to this day play. COD remastered looks awesome and still has that classic feel to it. I can still pop that game in and play it for hours without really paying attention to the time with my buddies. Infinite Warfare on the other hand is your regular run and gun type of COD game. Not a huge fan of it due to all of the unrealistic futuristic gunplay and how you actually play the game. Had I waited and known, I would have just got COD 4 remastered when it came out. Overall I give the game 5 out of 10. Basically 5 out of 5 for COD 4 remastered. The other version of the game is garbage in my view.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Cook', N'sofia.cook9103@example.com', '2017-11-02', 4, N'Let me start of by saying I''ve always been kind of biased when it comes to South Park because I''ve always been more of a Simpsons fan. But my wife really likes South Park, and I really enjoy the South Park movie. This game''s graphics are superb. It literally looks like you are watching an episode of South Park, and those who walk by may think it''s just that. The game''s story is largely based on a parody of the DC vs Marvel rivalry which has been going on lately with all the movie releases. For that, I was much more interested than I normally would have been as I''m a huge fan of both and love superheroes! The game can be really funny at times, but some other jokes fall flat. The RPG is pretty in depth for a South Park game! I figured it''d be very simple, but it can get pretty intricate with strategizing and leveling up. Overall I think the Stick of Truth is still a better game, but this game is a solid successor! BONUS: It does include a digital copy of the Stick of Truth game for...'),
(N'Maria', N'Alvarez', N'maria.alvarez4494@example.org', '2017-11-03', 4, N'Great game, disks are in great shape.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Evans', N'kyle.evans4256@example.com', '2017-11-03', 1, N'This game is terrible. Muted colors throughout so it''s hard to see what to do or interact with. Confusing level design. Terrible play quality. And don''t get me started on the three-step process to throw a "grenade" in which you end up dead! I hate this game.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Henderson', N'jennifer.henderson2197@example.net', '2017-11-03', 5, N'product as described'),
(N'Walter', N'Fisher', N'walter.fisher7919@example.net', '2017-11-03', 5, N'i enjoy sports games and this Madden NFL Football was much worth it glad it''s apart of my nintendo 3DS collection now thanks'),
(N'Deborah', N'Cruz', N'deborah.cruz1975@example.net', '2017-11-04', 5, N'This game works!!!'),
(N'Edward', N'Phillips', N'edward.phillips7988@example.com', '2017-11-05', 5, N'Was a good buy back when MSP was a thing.'),
(N'Edward', N'Phillips', N'edward.phillips7988@example.com', '2017-11-05', 5, N'Way better then being wired into the PC for me minimal input lag I don''t even notice it tbh.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Martinez', N'rachel.martinez5626@example.net', '2017-11-05', 4, N'Fun games but one thing I HATE is no matter what some times you seem to not be able to out the enemy even when you killed and we''re driving off to get away and they always will find you'),
(N'Ravi', N'Campbell', N'ravi.campbell1144@example.net', '2017-11-05', 5, N'Get the game. Mod the game. Be a king.'),
(N'Anita', N'Reed', N'anita.reed1396@example.net', '2017-11-05', 4, N'Great wireless controller for the ps2. Also grest see through design.'),
(N'Samantha', N'James', N'samantha.james8357@example.com', '2017-11-05', 5, N'A+++++ !!!!!'),
(N'Christine', N'Flores', N'christine.flores5148@example.com', '2017-11-05', 5, N'very happy, thank you!'),
(N'Paul', N'Boyd', N'paul.boyd3179@example.net', '2017-11-05', 5, N'Good game one of the best sports games I have played in a while.'),
(N'John', N'Miller', N'john.miller7373@example.net', '2017-11-06', 4, N'Picked one of these up to try replacing the stick on one of my n64 controllers since it was getting a bit wobbly. Installation was easy, no modification was needed to make the connector fit. Stick has a solid feel to it, though as others have mentioned, it is a bit more sensitive and may take some readjustment on your part for some games. In my brief testing, aiming in Ocarina of Time with the bow is very touchy, not that I ever claim to have been an expert marksman in the game, but it was noticeable.'),
(N'Donna', N'Foster', N'donna.foster9646@example.com', '2017-11-06', 5, N'Loved it ! would buy!'),
(N'Matthew', N'Parker', N'matthew.parker6025@example.org', '2017-11-06', 5, N'Just an awesome game!'),
(N'Thomas', N'Patel', N'thomas.patel3389@example.org', '2017-11-07', 2, N'By the time I fight the camera controls to see the target my team has killed it.'),
(N'Jerry', N'Coleman', N'jerry.coleman9258@example.com', '2017-11-07', 5, N'great product'),
(N'Shirley', N'Cox', N'shirley.cox3354@example.com', '2017-11-08', 5, N'Don''t be put off by its female lead. This game is a platformer just like any good Mario or Mario-related game. It''s plenty of fun.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Singh', N'hannah.singh1708@example.com', '2017-11-08', 5, N'This product almost looked new. The screen had little scratches that I could barely see.'),
(N'Gary', N'Brown', N'gary.brown1806@example.com', '2017-11-08', 5, N'Love the whole Horizon family of games. I prefer over the Motorsport brand'),
(N'Pamela', N'Stewart', N'pamela.stewart9293@example.com', '2017-11-09', 2, N'Great!!!!!'),
(N'Edward', N'Mendoza', N'edward.mendoza8718@example.com', '2017-11-09', 5, N'I had forgotten the controls but I am relearning them and starting to run through this game. Pretty good old school shooting game. Definitely belongs in a game collection. Graphics are poor by today''s ps4 standards but they were pretty cutting edge for their day.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ferreira', N'rachel.ferreira8573@example.net', '2017-11-09', 2, N'Just wasn''t for me. Bit too much DLC being pushed as well.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Reyes', N'lisa.reyes9671@example.org', '2017-11-09', 5, N'Fzero but for sega saturn and with weapons. Pretty cool game'),
(N'Walter', N'Butler', N'walter.butler9302@example.org', '2017-11-10', 5, N'Great game. Second time around beating it (1st was on PS3) The graphics are an improvement for sure with the remake.'),
(N'Diane', N'Wood', N'diane.wood5370@example.org', '2017-11-10', 5, N'S++'),
(N'Larry', N'Garcia', N'larry.garcia2981@example.net', '2017-11-11', 5, N'Same as the sequel. Will update when I play and beat the game. Got it in 2 days which was nice.'),
(N'Paul', N'Webb', N'paul.webb1380@example.net', '2017-11-11', 5, N'Very good experience'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Perry', N'jennifer.perry3620@example.org', '2017-11-11', 5, N'Works great holds my games neatly in place'),
(N'Linda', N'Walker', N'linda.walker1797@example.com', '2017-11-12', 5, N'Fast shipping ! Great game !'),
(N'Thomas', N'Wright', N'thomas.wright8687@example.org', '2017-11-12', 4, N'I''ve just had my butt handed to me in this game for the second time today. I don''t play Civ very well, that''s the long and the short of it. I think my planning thresholds are always too long, and I always try to save money on my military. However, I had two stimulating, exciting games. I continue to play Civ IV, V and VI and enjoy them all. They''re all different; they each have a distinctive "feel". In a way that''s hard to explain, they are chess-like. Highly recommended!'),
(N'Judith', N'Clark', N'judith.clark9639@example.net', '2017-11-12', 5, N'Great.'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Nowak', N'kathleen.nowak9778@example.com', '2017-11-13', 5, N'Excellent feedback - especially with FM7 configuration. I''ve increased the resistance to help simulate actual driving a bit more. Only complaint is that I wish that the steering ratio would match each car individually instead of having a global ratio... maybe it does, but it doesn''t seem like it. I like the fact that Dirt Rally has a preset configuration which works nicely... and makes the game 500% more enjoyable (you can actually rally now). As a novice racer in real life, this is pretty good... aside from the brake pedal stiffness (which is unreal to get 100% in FM7 w/default settings). Contrary to another review, you should NOT modify the brake pedal - as this may void the warranty and is unnecessary with newer games (I''m unsure of how far back for games you''d need to physically modify the brake pedal). The correct solution is to modify the outer dead zone for deceleration to about 50-70% -- you can test the optimal setting by driving and watching the red bar on the...'),
(N'Matthew', N'Rogers', N'matthew.rogers4296@example.org', '2017-11-13', 5, N'Awesome'),
(N'Matthew', N'Rogers', N'matthew.rogers4296@example.org', '2017-11-13', 5, N'Works great'),
(N'Lucia', N'Baker', N'lucia.baker1293@example.com', '2017-11-13', 5, N'I was looking for a replacement to my expensive wireless Turtle Beach headphones I dropped and broke. I wanted something that would not break the bank and make me upset if I broke them like my last headphones. The G2000 were recommended to me for their sound and price. I was like no way will these sound as good as my expensive turtle beach headphones but took a chance. I was very surprised at the sound quality and sounded as good as my other headphones costing many times more. The mic works great no issues and I like how they glow Blue. Now they don''t have all the features and as plush as my Turtle Beach but they work and fit great with good adjustment features. I picked up a second G2000 for my son and he has been using them exclusively over his Razor headphones he raved about for months.'),
(N'Adam', N'Watson', N'adam.watson9748@example.org', '2017-11-13', 1, N'Like many others here I fell victim to a defective cable upon arrival. It was missing more than half of the copper connections inside the cable, and the RCA plugs themselves are extremely flimsy and cheaply-made. I contacted Amazon and got a refund and they told me to just pitch the cable, obviously I''m not the only one having this problem. I''m not sure how this item receives a 4-star rating when it has over 25% negative reviews.'),
(N'Heather', N'Ross', N'heather.ross1312@example.com', '2017-11-13', 5, N'thank you. everything was good. was shipped immediately and it works well and the cartridge is in good shape. i always write alot on these things bc amazin sends me all these emails insisting on reviews, so here are my lengthy verbose reviews. i am such a nerd when i say this, but its really awesome how you can pause this game and take a break from all the button mashing(compared to other system versions of the game in which you cant pause the game). i understand reviewing the game itself is not what these reviews are meant for, but i cant help in expressing it. the simplicity of this version of the game makes it superior i think.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Suzuki', N'christopher.suzuki3278@example.net', '2017-11-14', 5, N'Perfect!'),
(N'Patricia', N'Sanchez', N'patricia.sanchez2267@example.org', '2017-11-14', 5, N'Being my first time ever playing this game, and not even playing it for very long, the time I have spent in this game is amazing and I''ll be playing this alot more often. It''s got that tomb raider feel to it and I love it and also love how quickly it shipped to me. 10/10 Would have a pet dog robot again'),
(N'Jack', N'Boyd', N'jack.boyd3038@example.net', '2017-11-14', 3, N'The game is a time sync. It takes considerable effort to learn. The tutorials in the beginning of the game are great. They show you how to operate the machinery, buy livestock, make hay bales, etc. What they lack is detail. For example, the tutorials don''t show you how to get grain out of your silo once you put it in there. There is some kind of train tack gizmo in the game, but no tutorial on how to use it. In the very beginning, you will probably want to spend a good amount of time driving around to the various farms and doing their work, and hiring workers to work your fields. It will help a lot with getting money quickly, without cheating. Be careful buying land, because you can''t sell it after you buy it.'),
(N'Noah', N'Stewart', N'noah.stewart1836@example.com', '2017-11-15', 4, N'Great game set in a semi post apocalyptic like setting in New York city. Excellent game to play with your friends and it tries your patience which is something I commend in a game these days. Also have the season pass and I was not disappointed.'),
(N'Noah', N'Stewart', N'noah.stewart1836@example.com', '2017-11-15', 5, N'This game is a little different than the others as it isn''t based on zombies or Los plagus but a family of sinister maniacs. It keeps the jumps and thrills coming and is great in the dark with the sound cranked up. Awesome!!!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Miller', N'ashley.miller1991@example.org', '2017-11-15', 5, N'Arrived quickly, just as described'),
(N'Carol', N'Wright', N'carol.wright5078@example.com', '2017-11-15', 5, N'No idea what I did with them'),
(N'Carol', N'Wright', N'carol.wright5078@example.com', '2017-11-15', 5, N'So pretty and works great.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Khan', N'hannah.khan5362@example.org', '2017-11-15', 5, N'was a pain to get the driver took hours of methods to get working but since then its great. its suppossed to install its own drivers and it did on one pc but didn''t on the second both running win 8.1'),
(N'Heather', N'Ross', N'heather.ross7318@example.com', '2017-11-16', 5, N'im a big fan of the saints row series and got this as i lost the orginal download i had and i find it interesting the DLC content are on the disc instead of a bunch of codes i don''t understand why alot hate this game while i love it');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Carolyn', N'Wisniewski', N'carolyn.wisniewski3108@example.net', '2017-11-16', 5, N'came in goods shape love the game'),
(N'Samantha', N'Gutierrez', N'samantha.gutierrez2670@example.org', '2017-11-16', 3, N'potential but ultimately unfinished.'),
(N'Samantha', N'Gutierrez', N'samantha.gutierrez2670@example.org', '2017-11-16', 5, N'Fantastic game, and the statue is beautiful.'),
(N'Maria', N'Smith', N'maria.smith1419@example.org', '2017-11-16', 4, N'Awesome game, though on a DS/ 3DS screen it has tiny characters, would be nice if you could zoom in, or if characters weren''t so small on screen. Watched the game on YouTube first. i thought what I saw on the browser screen would be the same size on the 3DS. Nope. Getting past that the music and gameplay are excellent. Well worth the price and harder to find these days.'),
(N'Shirley', N'James', N'shirley.james3826@example.com', '2017-11-17', 1, N'This product is used'),
(N'Brandon', N'Cruz', N'brandon.cruz1044@example.com', '2017-11-17', 2, N'Its fine'),
(N'Joseph', N'Reed', N'joseph.reed4651@example.com', '2017-11-17', 5, N'Works great! I''ve missed playing this!'),
(N'Ashley', N'Thompson', N'ashley.thompson9584@example.com', '2017-11-18', 5, N'Dark souls 3 got me into the series... But demons souls will have me replaying till my hands have rigamortis. Imo, it''s a deeper experience, not keen till late game or if you''ve read up on guides. I really like the world tendency and weapon upgrade system which I still don''t have down but working on my second play through and I just beat it 2 days ago'),
(N'Omar', N'White', N'omar.white9791@example.net', '2017-11-18', 4, N'Connect the Wii-U to the internet through the LAN line for faster more reliable speeds.'),
(N'Omar', N'White', N'omar.white9791@example.net', '2017-11-18', 4, N'I''ve had mine since launch day and I''ve enjoyed having it.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Henderson', N'evelyn.henderson3101@example.com', '2017-11-18', 4, N'Awesome'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Torres', N'cheryl.torres1724@example.com', '2017-11-19', 5, N'Works fine with my system. Arrived on time.'),
(N'Laura', N'Okonkwo', N'laura.okonkwo6928@example.com', '2017-11-19', 5, N'Amazing keyboard. Best mechanical keyboard I''ve used. Not just for gaming, but I love it for typing any the tactical feedback. They can be noisy, but it''s not an issue. I have no complaints, other than the LED on my + key on the numeric pad doesn''t work. Build quality is amazing though, very ergonomic.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Mendoza', N'timothy.mendoza1845@example.net', '2017-11-20', 3, N'Not best collection at all-only got it for the dynamite headdy and it is good that it has saving progress feature..but the other games are like worst ever if like g-rated classics none are on here except this one and ristar and sonic ones..the rest are r rated shooter type games why they are included on this collection that is rated e is beyond me..do not except family games as it says unless you are a family of nazis hahah?? maybe from america there is mostly german descent people but really can''t we be honest or why even rate the game??! do we have to add lying to our german notorious ness too?! oh well..yes like we can''t do without decapitation game..that was a winner not!! that made sega look bad some of these on here..they should have just put a few of better ones and forgotten the rest for the more xrated lousier compilation version or something..'),
(N'Timothy', N'Ali', N'timothy.ali1077@example.net', '2017-11-21', 5, N'I''ve already been using this mouse for over 2 years and it''s still working perfectly. Best gaming mouse I''ve ever bought.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Phillips', N'ryan.phillips9206@example.org', '2017-11-21', 4, N'Updates are just as long as every other Xbox Ive owned. Graphics are unnoticably a bit better and game screens load faster but my new Scorpio has already froze 3 Times and shut itself off in the middle of gaming twice so its problems have enhanced as well.'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Castillo', N'jacqueline.castillo9904@example.org', '2017-11-21', 5, N'The most powerful and coolest home gaming system even stronger than the Playstation 4 Pro that I own.'),
(N'Dennis', N'Wisniewski', N'dennis.wisniewski3701@example.net', '2017-11-21', 5, N'Keeps them safe and organized, easy to carry!'),
(N'Luis', N'James', N'luis.james9758@example.net', '2017-11-21', 5, N'Worked perfect.'),
(N'Betty', N'Ramirez', N'betty.ramirez4256@example.net', '2017-11-21', 1, N'Unplayable on PS4'),
(N'Patrick', N'Walker', N'patrick.walker6952@example.net', '2017-11-22', 3, N'This is a great and smooth mouse. IT feels great and the weight can be adjusted. The only negative which for me brings it down to a 3 instead of a 4 or 5 is the second button position on the right. It is very long and easy to hit. I often find I can click on anything in windows because it is depressed. Also this happened while playing games as well. I am very careful with it and I am adjusting but I may go back to my Logitech Proteus mouse just because of the feel. This is a highly accurate mouse for its price. GamDias is definitely deserving of praise on this mouse. Competitive and very useful. If you can master the right side button then this is better than or comparable to most mice even in the $20 to 25 range.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Khan', N'raymond.khan7680@example.net', '2017-11-22', 5, N'Link to the past was my favorite zelda game of all time so playing this is a real throwback and brings a smile on my face. Although I would have likely been happier with SNES style graphics they still did a great job of imitating the world map and and certain landscapes with updated graphics giving it a fresh feel to it as well. I have only gotten so far in the game right not, but I am thoroughly enjoying it. It''s enough like the original that it offers nostalgic relief at the same time its got a completely new story and graphics design making it feel fresh and new at the same time.'),
(N'Megan', N'Robinson', N'megan.robinson5784@example.org', '2017-11-22', 4, N'Most of the fighting games I''ve been playing are Battlefield or from the Call of Duty series, and those are still my staples. This is a slight variation on that, more hack and slash than shooting with guns, so a bit more gory, and a bit more fight orientated. The micro transactions it tries to get you to buy are quite annoying, but the game has a decent campaign and the multiplayer is fairly good as well.'),
(N'Amara', N'Evans', N'amara.evans1594@example.net', '2017-11-22', 5, N'amazing love this game'),
(N'Deborah', N'Cox', N'deborah.cox3091@example.org', '2017-11-23', 5, N'I love persona games bought a vita to play persona 4 golden, and 5 is another great entry in the series.'),
(N'Donald', N'Martin', N'donald.martin7464@example.net', '2017-11-24', 5, N'Nice light that does what it says, it lights up the screen for your Gameboy Color so you can see better in dark places. Seems silly they didn''t just build the Gameboy with a screen that''s lit up, but whatever. Great product, definatly recommend for anyone who plays Gameboy Color :)'),
(N'Rachel', N'Wisniewski', N'rachel.wisniewski6934@example.net', '2017-11-24', 5, N'If you enjoy games and do not know who was the first heroine, here is your chance to take her home, Samus is simply fantastic, the details of his armor were very well done.'),
(N'Noah', N'Lopez', N'noah.lopez8861@example.net', '2017-11-25', 5, N'Really fun and easy to start game. I am amazed at how many tricks you can learn quickly. Great price and loads of quick play fun. Works on my laptop'),
(N'Brenda', N'Ruiz', N'brenda.ruiz6073@example.com', '2017-11-25', 5, N'thank you'),
(N'Carlos', N'Peterson', N'carlos.peterson1043@example.net', '2017-11-25', 1, N'Really Hot garbage.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Perry', N'jennifer.perry3620@example.org', '2017-11-25', 5, N'Great game to play'),
(N'Kenneth', N'James', N'kenneth.james1490@example.org', '2017-11-26', 2, N'product does not last long joy sticks tend o stick to the right so every thing continues to move right'),
(N'Laura', N'Johnson', N'laura.johnson6380@example.net', '2017-11-26', 5, N'BOUGHT THIS FOR OUR SON. HE''S A GREAT FAN OF ZELDA!!!! HE ENJOYS MANY HOURS WITH THIS GAME...'),
(N'Karen', N'Diaz', N'karen.diaz7680@example.org', '2017-11-26', 5, N'You like south park you''ll like this game. Almost as good as stick of truth. And... You get stick of truth.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Webb', N'jonathan.webb5064@example.org', '2017-11-27', 1, N'One of the worst games I''ve ever played. Amazingly little depth for a RTS. 2 difficulty settings, so easy you basically can''t lose, and... impossible. Couldn''t wait to get this off my machine.'),
(N'Charles', N'Henderson', N'charles.henderson8606@example.com', '2017-11-27', 5, N'PS+ for 20 less than usual? Absent the days of PS3 when the network was free, this is about as good as it gets. Enough said. If it is the same price as buying it on PSN, then be more seamless to just buy it there because you will not have to enter the code.'),
(N'Sharon', N'King', N'sharon.king9120@example.org', '2017-11-27', 4, N'I like this game! Life is strange is very interesting and fun. I don''t own an xbox one but got xbox360 and i played this game once before on pc but only a few minutes on it but not the full game though.'),
(N'Eric', N'Parker', N'eric.parker1752@example.com', '2017-11-28', 5, N'Fun'),
(N'Betty', N'Ward', N'betty.ward6245@example.net', '2017-11-28', 5, N'Fantastic game! The puzzles are difficult, yet manageable. Think escape rooms x 10'),
(N'Lauren', N'Young', N'lauren.young3662@example.net', '2017-11-28', 5, N'Absolutley love these. My friends tell me how they would yell my name, practically screaming it, and I couldn''t hear them.'),
(N'Christina', N'Ivanov', N'christina.ivanov5723@example.org', '2017-11-28', 5, N'Thank you.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Wright', N'hiroshi.wright3915@example.org', '2017-11-29', 5, N'I love this keyboard! This my first Razer keyboard (first Razer anything really) and I fell in love with the feel and response time, the slickness & the clickyness of this keyboard. the lighting is actually pretty bright even though the lighting falls on a dark background. the only thing that would have made this keyboard ultimate is if they put a couple of USB ports on it, made the cord detachable and maybe made it spill proof and the underside metal and not plastic. My only nitpick about this keyboard really is that they didn''t make all the symbols on the keyboard able to be illuminated (ex. ~!@#$%^ etc.) Overall this is a pretty solid keyboard and every bit worth the money.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Wisniewski', N'deborah.wisniewski3432@example.com', '2017-11-29', 5, N'A must for those who love showing off your amiibo''s!'),
(N'Amanda', N'Collins', N'amanda.collins6039@example.net', '2017-11-29', 5, N'Love it. feels great. Best mouse to any use. Easy set up. love the capability to adjust and customize everything with the mouse.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Edwards', N'nancy.edwards4622@example.org', '2017-11-29', 5, N'This here works.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Edwards', N'nancy.edwards4622@example.org', '2017-11-29', 5, N'This game is fun. Annoying but fun and challenging.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Scott', N'sandra.scott8293@example.org', '2017-11-29', 5, N'better than the new game'),
(N'Kathleen', N'Raghunathan', N'kathleen.raghunathan8685@example.net', '2017-11-30', 5, N'This game is great.'),
(N'Karen', N'Richardson', N'karen.richardson9907@example.net', '2017-11-30', 2, N'The graphics and gameplay are reminiscent of something from 10 years ago. Open storyline is cool, but this game could be so much better with better control of character and graphics. Developers should take classes from CoD or Battlefield.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Torres', N'alexander.torres1160@example.com', '2017-11-30', 5, N'I''ve been playing this game almost two years and you never fell bored or tired of doing the same thing all over and over. Despite the same maps and operators (every 3 moths you have 1 new map and 2 operators) you always have new ways to do your stuff. The game is simple but extremely tactical and if you play regularly with a team the fun multiplies by two.'),
(N'Richard', N'Ali', N'richard.ali3923@example.org', '2017-12-01', 2, N'Great concept....Horrible material. 15$ for peices of plastic that don''t even last 2 months with heavy gameplay. My thumb starts slipping after a month. I love the idea anf love the product, for the very short time I get to use them. Please remake them with a stronger material.'),
(N'Amy', N'Miller', N'amy.miller4708@example.org', '2017-12-01', 5, N'An absolute beast in every sense of the word! Microsoft has delivered on all of their promises with this new system: games with amazing true 4K graphics with HDR, faster load times, outstanding backwards compatibility with two previous generations of Microsoft Xbox systems, (the Xbox 360 and the original Xbox), and a great 4K Blu-Ray player built into the system!'),
(N'George', N'Ramos', N'george.ramos3467@example.com', '2017-12-01', 2, N'I paid $5 for it on psn. Put a few hours in. I''m surprised people liked it as much as they did according to the overall rating. It looks nice l but it is more tedious than fun. Downright frustrating and offensively stupid mechanics at times. Occasionally I wonder if the game devs were purposefully trolling.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Alvarez', N'matthew.alvarez1835@example.org', '2017-12-01', 5, N'Got it fast and code worked!'),
(N'Amara', N'Garcia', N'amara.garcia8741@example.org', '2017-12-01', 5, N'thank you'),
(N'Ivan', N'Hill', N'ivan.hill5679@example.net', '2017-12-01', 5, N'Not a huge fan (didn''t like it all) of the first installment of the series, but Just Cause 2 redeems the franchise a bit; open world intermingled with a story line complete with collectibles, unlockables and dual wield for any single handed weapons (akimbo SMGs rule). Free fall from a plane or helicopter roughly about a 1000 feet and grapple the ground just before impact to pull out of a near death incident (who needs a parachute). Outside of a few nonsensical glitches in the game like the one I mentioned (of which is more than likely well known) game play is pretty solid once you get your keyboard mapped well. One fatal flaw is turning on "decals" in the Advanced Video settings --this will crash your game so turn "Decals" off and you''re good to go. Seems to be a memory leak (concerning the "Decals" debacle) that never got patched, but there could very well be a mod floating around somewhere that solves the issue, but have not investigated the existence of such just yet. The game...'),
(N'Lucia', N'Kumar', N'lucia.kumar1856@example.org', '2017-12-02', 5, N'Platinum for this game it was great.'),
(N'Priya', N'Torres', N'priya.torres9753@example.com', '2017-12-02', 4, N'Fightstick for Beginners. Square gate. Cannot be modded. The feel is nice and the size fits a kid who wants to excel at fighters. It''s kind of small and very light, but the buttons feel nice. The stick itself is on the stiffer side. It performs well with Tekken 7, but you''ll feel like you want more out of your stick. The size does matter after you get use to using a fightstick so I''ll save you the trouble THIS MAY BE YOUR FIRST FIGHTSTICK BUT IT WON''T BE YOUR LAST SO DO YOURSELF A FAVOR, BUY ONE THAT YOU WILL HAVE FOR A LONG TIME FOR $100-150 I have about 5 fighters that I love and want to excel at. It took a couple months of casual play before I realized that I wanted a better stick. Thinking about a Mayflash F500 or the Hori RAP 4. Still deciding, but I''ll tell you one thing, this is a good introduction. you''ll want something better soon later.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd2289@example.net', '2017-12-02', 4, N'Views.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd2289@example.net', '2017-12-02', 4, N'Wow! So good!'),
(N'Timothy', N'Boyd', N'timothy.boyd2289@example.net', '2017-12-02', 3, N'Meh.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Baker', N'raymond.baker9556@example.net', '2017-12-02', 4, N'Fun dungeon crawler,personally I think its better then Dungeon Travelers 2 but to each their own..Either way its a fun time killer to pick up. Only issue I had the game crashed a few times losing progress -star'),
(N'Laura', N'Johnson', N'laura.johnson6380@example.net', '2017-12-02', 5, N'THIS GAME IS FOR OUR SON FOR HIS BIRTHDAY SO THIS HAS TO BE A GREAT GAME!!!'),
(N'Jack', N'Jimenez', N'jack.jimenez2701@example.org', '2017-12-02', 5, N'Perfect condition.'),
(N'Jose', N'Campbell', N'jose.campbell4587@example.com', '2017-12-03', 4, N'This game is awesome'),
(N'Patrick', N'Lee', N'patrick.lee7640@example.org', '2017-12-03', 5, N'Best house of the dead game hands down. add some friends to the mix, surround sound and snacks and you have yourself a zombie shooter party!'),
(N'Richard', N'Ali', N'richard.ali3923@example.org', '2017-12-03', 5, N'My favorite high rise kontrol freaks besides the vortex.'),
(N'Jack', N'Gonzalez', N'jack.gonzalez1388@example.org', '2017-12-04', 5, N'Thanks!'),
(N'Ivan', N'Richardson', N'ivan.richardson3273@example.com', '2017-12-04', 1, N'Comes without cables and there was still other user info and a couple screws unscrewed...........'),
(N'Diane', N'Parker', N'diane.parker6208@example.org', '2017-12-04', 3, N'This experience was like watching a long movie. There were more cut scenes than game. The movement is like assassins creed but more fluent and just better. The story was like every adventure movie like goonies meets Indiana Jones. By the end I just wanted to beat it instead of enjoying and taking my time. In my opinion skip this one there are way better games like last of us and witcher.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Wood', N'raymond.wood5441@example.com', '2017-12-05', 5, N'I paid like 5 dollars for 6 games and even if they aren''t great games they are still alright games. Plus thats like 5 games for a dollar and then a free game.'),
(N'Helen', N'Lopez', N'helen.lopez3800@example.com', '2017-12-05', 4, N'Ok game THANK YOU'),
(N'Emma', N'Moore', N'emma.moore5596@example.net', '2017-12-06', 4, N'What to say, what to say. At release, this was one of the most disappointing releases in recent history (if not of all time). The promises made by the developer made this sound like a sure GOTY contender, but then it turned out he was straight up lying about 1/3 of the major features and details. But I''m almost certain you''ve heard all of that already. What you may not have heard is that this game has gotten a large number of updates since release, bringing us the majority of what had been promised, as well as a lot of cool extra content. While the game is still far from perfect, it is no longer a game I feel sorely disappointed with. I truly feel fine with recommending this game now, and enjoy it enough that I bought it on PC as well'),
(N'Wei', N'Mitchell', N'wei.mitchell4039@example.org', '2017-12-06', 5, N'one of the best spidey games'),
(N'Richard', N'Brooks', N'richard.brooks2628@example.com', '2017-12-06', 5, N'Loved the campaign! It''s my kind of thing, though. I''m always seeing fans of CoD talking about how they don''t like the futuristic stuff. I love the futuristic stuff! I had a lot of fun playing through this game''s campaign. Especially during the space arcade battles and even the soldier floating parts. Story was decent, nothing special but decent. The levels were pretty epic and the pacing was good. Multiplayer meh.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Scott', N'alexander.scott5227@example.com', '2017-12-07', 2, N'Brain dead by the numbers Ubisoft open world experience. Far Cry in the City with romanticized computer geek concepts.'),
(N'Jose', N'Morgan', N'jose.morgan9283@example.net', '2017-12-07', 5, N'my son loves this'),
(N'Victoria', N'Coleman', N'victoria.coleman6509@example.org', '2017-12-07', 3, N'Works well, but you have to use a "claw" grip on the mouse. I prefer having some support for the bottom part of my hand (near the wrist). It also features a very bright LED Corsair logo, which is too bright for a dark bedroom, since it stays on even when the PC goes to sleep. In order to turn it off or change the color, you have to download and install their massive 176 MB Corsair driver.'),
(N'George', N'Mitchell', N'george.mitchell5408@example.net', '2017-12-07', 3, N'I don''t know if I would pay full price for this one. Its story is typical. One thing I did like is the same sex relationship in the game. You never seem to see same sex relationships yet I am sure there are enough people out there who are gamers and can relate. That being said, I think the Guardian of the Sacrifice is a strong character ( which make her very attractive), I just cant say the same for the Sacrifice Girl...I guess opposites attract?'),
(N'Julie', N'Alvarez', N'julie.alvarez5935@example.org', '2017-12-08', 5, N'PS4 Exclusive Game. Every gamer should have this.'),
(N'Julie', N'Green', N'julie.green1146@example.com', '2017-12-08', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Adam', N'Miller', N'adam.miller2563@example.com', '2017-12-08', 5, N'Great mouse until my cats ate the cord, will have to see if replacement cords are sold.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Bailey', N'timothy.bailey5891@example.org', '2017-12-08', 4, N'a very very fun game!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Campbell', N'kelly.campbell2491@example.org', '2017-12-09', 5, N'Awesome game.'),
(N'Nicole', N'Bailey', N'nicole.bailey7987@example.net', '2017-12-09', 5, N'Best system yet. I purchased day one addition. Fan got loud after 4 yrs. Cleaned dust out and good as new. Cleaned busy out 12/2017. Was getting loud. Once cleaned quiet as day one.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Smith', N'ronald.smith2437@example.net', '2017-12-10', 2, N'I hate that I need to run their software in the background to keep the RGB backlight from looking like a rainbow. My case has a red theme, and I want the keyboard to match, but it doesn''t until the OS is booted and I''m logged in. It''s stupid. The thing has firmware, it should be able to store a profile without the software running. The volume wheel also sticks. It looks like it should scroll freely and smoothly, but it doesn''t. It feels like crap. I''ll be sending this keyboard back, I think. I really like the switches, but dislike just about everything else about this keyboard.'),
(N'James', N'Sanchez', N'james.sanchez2603@example.net', '2017-12-10', 5, N'Still love the game! This game never grows old.'),
(N'Sarah', N'Campbell', N'sarah.campbell7598@example.org', '2017-12-11', 4, N'Good game.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Morris', N'carlos.morris3677@example.org', '2017-12-11', 5, N'I bougt this afew days ago. Its a great game. I highly recommend'),
(N'Emma', N'Adams', N'emma.adams3985@example.com', '2017-12-12', 5, N'Loved it. Absolutely loved it. Near flawless. It''s one flaw is that it may not appeal to all gamers because it''s a visiual novel. No real gameplay. Truly amazing though.'),
(N'Priya', N'Davis', N'priya.davis4354@example.com', '2017-12-13', 4, N'I would give this a five, But it''s so hard! I mean, I would love this if it had a difficulty setting, Because I die in this game every five seconds! But than again, The story is awesome, And so I''m not unhappy at all with how they did it. You can hunt animals, And cook! It''s so fun!'),
(N'Tyler', N'Campbell', N'tyler.campbell8462@example.net', '2017-12-13', 1, N'it''s supposed to be elder scrolls, it''s marked elder scrolls (even on the disk) but when I play it, it''s Morrowind 3. What the blankety-blank is going on here?'),
(N'Omar', N'Gray', N'omar.gray9990@example.com', '2017-12-14', 5, N'Great purchase. Came exactly as described ,and came in excellent condition.'),
(N'Henry', N'Anderson', N'henry.anderson4139@example.org', '2017-12-15', 5, N'Works great for everyday computer stuff and for gaming. Changes colors, too'),
(N'Joshua', N'Tanaka', N'joshua.tanaka4612@example.org', '2017-12-15', 5, N'Good,very good!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Moore', N'raymond.moore8466@example.net', '2017-12-15', 5, N'Nice quality! Feel and sound great! I own a few sets of headphones mainly for gaming and I''m really enjoying these so far. I have been able to use them with my PS4 and PC and really like the compatibility and sound quality I get from these. They are very solid for music as well. I have a set of Lucid Sound LS30s that are pretty awesome too but have had software issues where they freeze up sometimes. Got these as backups but now they have become my primary PC headsets. I cannot overstate how comfortable they are. The faux leather earmuffs feel silky smooth and they come with an extra set of cloth ones if you prefer. I haven''t tried those yet. I''ve heard about the issues with the wiring connections a few people have had so I will update if I experience any of that. I''ve had them for a couple weeks now and so far so good. I got them for a great price but would have paid more for them anyway after having tried them out.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Garcia', N'kelly.garcia4240@example.net', '2017-12-15', 5, N'SEEMS LIKE A GOOD GAME. I HAVE NOT PLAYED IT ENOUGH TO GIVE DETAILS.'),
(N'Amara', N'Brown', N'amara.brown1104@example.org', '2017-12-16', 5, N'Very good product'),
(N'Tyler', N'Campbell', N'tyler.campbell8462@example.net', '2017-12-16', 1, N'Boring. Not nearly as good as expected.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Wilson', N'douglas.wilson7910@example.com', '2017-12-17', 5, N'This machine is ready to go. It is everything that was advertised. Had everything you need to play it. If your TV lacks an RCA composite input, you''ll need to get a wii video adapter to match it (probably a HDMI)'),
(N'Noah', N'Alvarez', N'noah.alvarez9774@example.com', '2017-12-17', 3, N'Not very comfortable/'),
(N'Anna', N'Wang', N'anna.wang5813@example.org', '2017-12-17', 3, N'Bought this game recently and was shocked how fun it is (especially playing with others). This is one of my most played games at this time, I can play for hours. Horde mode is cool (once you learn the maps) but campaign mode is awesome. If you like shooting hordes of undead with friends this is the game for you. Update: was trying to connect to a game this morning and some guy with 10 dollar dsl (or a bad sony) had a lobby up. No one could connect (you could watch people try to connect and then leave) and there''s no way to connect to another game, the 90''s match making system just keeps connecting to the same lobby (even though it doesn''t work). Knocking off 2 stars for lame game matching.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Gomez', N'cynthia.gomez6223@example.com', '2017-12-18', 5, N'Best game ever... Honestly the story-line gives you exactly what you expect.. An amazing ride with heart tugging moments.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Baker', N'kyle.baker6846@example.net', '2017-12-18', 5, N'trying this game out and i have to say i really love it as its light in control as well as a good variety to to do with character and arcana combination the cast is also very creative with being the reason i wanted to try this game out cuz of Petra and also liking lilicia playstyle as well very fun underrated game , also arc system works games nuff said'),
(N'Daniel', N'Sanders', N'daniel.sanders1887@example.com', '2017-12-18', 5, N'This game was very fun just like all of the previous and future Mario Parties after this one.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Rivera', N'stephanie.rivera7984@example.net', '2017-12-18', 5, N'my son love it'),
(N'Angela', N'Henderson', N'angela.henderson6805@example.org', '2017-12-18', 5, N'Amazing console, weirdly overlooked. Great but limited library. Also, SM3DW is my favorite Mario game ever.'),
(N'Mei', N'Wisniewski', N'mei.wisniewski8386@example.org', '2017-12-19', 1, N'I have always liked turtle beaches..had x41, tango, 420,500,(800x (x2)) and at least another set but can not recal the model was COD model. the worst thing about ALL of them was the head band breaking right about the one year mark. I CAN NOT UNERSTAND WHY THEY MAKE SUCH A CHEAP HEAD GEAR. WAIT I DO..... SO THEY CAN SELL MORE........SUCH A SHAME......ON TO BUY SOME OTHER SORT OF HEAD GEAR NOW. iLL UPDATE LATER Ok I have calmed down... now for a longer review. I started with the X41 they would "pop" in the ear peice all the time. so i gave them to my nephew. I bought next the COD Dealta model. they did not even last to the next release of COD game. the head setband broke. I then bought the Tango set. they were great and at a year i gave them to my Brother. (battery was beginning to charge with less amount). I moved onto the 500 model. i bought two pair. one failed at a year as i would trade off charging to hlep make it last Longer...... soon after the other head band also broke. I...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Carter', N'jonathan.carter6375@example.org', '2017-12-20', 5, N'HD or not, is doesn''t matter. it is Twilight Princess.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Flores', N'jonathan.flores8105@example.com', '2017-12-20', 5, N'Works great!'),
(N'William', N'Butler', N'william.butler4681@example.org', '2017-12-20', 5, N'one of my fav childhood games'),
(N'Nicole', N'Thompson', N'nicole.thompson1140@example.net', '2017-12-20', 5, N'Very minor motion-sickness that passes the longer you play. FANTASTIC experience. Probably the best VR experience I''ve had to date. The game itself wouldn''t stand well on it''s own merits I don''t think, but in VR, it''s just such an atmospheric experience.'),
(N'Henry', N'Wang', N'henry.wang3659@example.net', '2017-12-20', 5, N'Very satisfied with item, no complaints'),
(N'Ivan', N'Flores', N'ivan.flores8966@example.org', '2017-12-20', 1, N'Backstory (not a tl;dr) I mainly use my mouse for work and not gaming. I decided to try out a new mouse as I just wanted to see what was on the market when my current macro mouse Logitech G600 has been working without issue for the past 3 years. I''m only trying out this mouse because it''s on sale. I experiened none of the below issues on my mouse. Hardware (Mouse) : 1) The cable, although a braided cable, is not a very nice one that folds easily or has much give especially after it has sat in a box. Folding and pulling on it to flatten it out makes it feel like you''re going to break the cable. Some manufacturers loop their cables to avoid the cable from folding like this. 2) The feel of the mouse is great with finger, palm, and claw grip. The clicks are great as expected. The buttons are also very responsive and the macro buttons feel great and are the most accessible than other vendors especially if you don''t have the largest hands. I wish there was a added weight option as the...'),
(N'Wei', N'Harris', N'wei.harris7066@example.com', '2017-12-21', 5, N'great game'),
(N'Helen', N'Thompson', N'helen.thompson4217@example.com', '2017-12-21', 5, N'Good game'),
(N'Laura', N'Turner', N'laura.turner3998@example.com', '2017-12-22', 2, N'I''ll say first the graphics, attention to detail and the landscapes are breathtaking. Absolutely beautiful. The presentation overall is great. Voice acting is good, sound is good. The gameplay feels smooth, that aside, I was very underwhelmed by this game. I''ll give you the rundown on just about every scene you''ll encounter: "Hey, that''s what we need, way over there! We''ll have to figure out how to get to it" Then it''s climb, climb, climb. Oh, hey there''s a place you needed to solve a puzzle (that nobody would ever take the time to make) just to get into, and turns out there''s a group of bad guys. Climb, shoot a few bad guys. Climb some more. Oh, and then a cut scene where everything breaks and you''re way high up and Nate almost falls to his death but hangs on with one arm, and then gameplay resumes and you have to climb back up. After about 20 times of that, it loses its impact. The story was a bit weak. It was more about the relationship between Nate and his brother (who was...'),
(N'Ivan', N'Alvarez', N'ivan.alvarez8593@example.org', '2017-12-22', 5, N'Blast from the past! Love this game! Well worth the $23'),
(N'Dennis', N'Hill', N'dennis.hill3337@example.org', '2017-12-22', 5, N'This is a great case!'),
(N'Wei', N'Perez', N'wei.perez9845@example.org', '2017-12-23', 4, N'Good game'),
(N'Tyler', N'Wright', N'tyler.wright3086@example.org', '2017-12-23', 5, N'GREAT'),
(N'Kofi', N'Lopez', N'kofi.lopez6515@example.org', '2017-12-23', 1, N'Worked fine at first, but now it won''t even turn on or take a charge.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Fisher', N'cheryl.fisher7020@example.org', '2017-12-23', 5, N'Awesome game. Very well done. Characters are fun to play with and are engaging. Detail is incredible especially on Xbox One X.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Reyes', N'rebecca.reyes9001@example.org', '2017-12-23', 5, N'Was a gift, but the person I gave it to really enjoyed it and said it works great.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Rogers', N'aisha.rogers8349@example.com', '2017-12-23', 4, N'Fantastic call back to Final Fantasy I-VI. I thought the characters were lovely (age controversy aside/I really wish Japan would start using adults in their stories already) the voice acting was lovely, and the motivations and mistakes made sense from a human standpoint. The game does a poor job of making you feel like you make any progression though by using narrative devices to reverse or undo everything you accomplished. It felt like a lazy attempt to write in a reason why the game needed to go on. You can do better than that, Squeenix. Otherwise, the rest of the game is good as far as turn based Jrpgs go.'),
(N'Julie', N'Webb', N'julie.webb4896@example.net', '2017-12-24', 5, N'Breat, gighly recommend'),
(N'Karen', N'Thomas', N'karen.thomas7173@example.net', '2017-12-24', 2, N'Seriously disappointed at my blind faith "FBW" would be as good or better than "Stick of Truth" I pre-ordered and paid full price, it''s now dirt cheat because word is out this game is extremely predictable, easy to defeat and the constant nagging for "joining" online groups. There are a few chuckles here and there but nothing like the 1st. Guess we all know the reason this game kept getting delayed.'),
(N'Sofia', N'Roberts', N'sofia.roberts3142@example.org', '2017-12-25', 5, N'Awesome mouse. Perfect fit and the buttons are just the right resistance even though not mechanical. Love the extra button near the left click. Software is weak but still manageable.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Ali', N'elizabeth.ali7827@example.org', '2017-12-25', 4, N'Did a quick test and seems to work just fine, has a decent click when plugging in. It does however feel and look cheap, I will update this review if any longevity issues are found in the future. So far pretty darn good for the price.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Moore', N'carlos.moore4270@example.net', '2017-12-26', 1, N'Both battery backs that I received looked to be melted/bent slightly and batteries could not even be inserted into them. Buy something else.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Turner', N'andrea.turner6559@example.org', '2017-12-26', 5, N'I really love this game !!!'),
(N'Ethan', N'Nguyen', N'ethan.nguyen9075@example.net', '2017-12-26', 5, N'This unit works like it''s brand new despite being used. Needed a back-up unit in case my current one breaks down. PS2 is as high as I''ll go, because I just don''t care for the current game market -_-'),
(N'Nathan', N'Brown', N'nathan.brown4051@example.net', '2017-12-26', 5, N'Excelent'),
(N'Jack', N'Jimenez', N'jack.jimenez2701@example.org', '2017-12-27', 5, N'Just how I remember it! Perfect!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Okonkwo', N'nadia.okonkwo4969@example.net', '2017-12-28', 5, N'Great campaign story. You develop a real interest in the bro-mance between man and titan. Warning, if you don''t like jumping puzzles, everything is a jumping puzzle. If you are able to grasp the mechanics it is fluid and very enjoyable, but until then you feel like you are banging your head ageist a wall. The multiplayer is fun and you unlock things quickly.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Ruiz', N'ethan.ruiz2961@example.net', '2017-12-29', 5, N'Love it. Great arcade stick, easy to use and allot of fun.'),
(N'Joyce', N'Bell', N'joyce.bell2780@example.com', '2017-12-29', 5, N'This controller is great the buttons do not stick and you can mute the volume of the headset from the controller!! No need in spending $60 or more on a Microsoft controller when this when feels better and works the same as the original controller!! A++++++'),
(N'Frank', N'Lewis', N'frank.lewis9349@example.org', '2017-12-29', 5, N'Great gift shipped quick thank you'),
(N'Donna', N'Nelson', N'donna.nelson2540@example.com', '2017-12-29', 5, N'Thx sonic sale'),
(N'John', N'Young', N'john.young7116@example.org', '2017-12-30', 5, N'Item was as described Fast shipping!'),
(N'Yuki', N'Hernandez', N'yuki.hernandez4408@example.org', '2017-12-30', 5, N'just what i needed'),
(N'Scott', N'Flores', N'scott.flores2614@example.com', '2017-12-30', 5, N'Works as expected'),
(N'Dennis', N'Ivanov', N'dennis.ivanov2648@example.org', '2017-12-31', 5, N'Game works good.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Kim', N'kenneth.kim1804@example.com', '2018-01-01', 5, N'very happy with it'),
(N'Hannah', N'Nguyen', N'hannah.nguyen8151@example.net', '2018-01-01', 5, N'I''ve had since 2015 and this cutie is still working great. I''m a graphic designer, so I use them almost 8 to 12 hours per day since then and have no problems with it.'),
(N'George', N'Wang', N'george.wang8248@example.org', '2018-01-01', 1, N'Buy civ 5 or 6'),
(N'Anthony', N'Reyes', N'anthony.reyes8454@example.org', '2018-01-01', 4, N'I''ve only played about an hour or so, but it''ll be a good game I''m sure. Especially since I paid half retail.'),
(N'Laura', N'Mitchell', N'laura.mitchell1860@example.com', '2018-01-01', 5, N'Had this on for about a year and the trigger adapters already showing some stress. Still holding on with no issues. If it breaks I''ll update the review.'),
(N'Scott', N'Walker', N'scott.walker8975@example.com', '2018-01-01', 5, N'One of the best Xbox games'),
(N'Marcus', N'Tanaka', N'marcus.tanaka3064@example.org', '2018-01-03', 5, N'As described. Happy customer.'),
(N'Anita', N'Stewart', N'anita.stewart6248@example.org', '2018-01-03', 4, N'I love these little controllers. Strong vibration in the handles. Light with three modes. (On, off, and flash when controller vibrates)'),
(N'Wei', N'Patel', N'wei.patel1255@example.net', '2018-01-03', 5, N'Far cry 3 and 4....AWESOME games!!!! Highly recommend.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Ortiz', N'yuki.ortiz1986@example.org', '2018-01-03', 4, N'A cool idea but a waste of pokeballs and Pokemon. I feel like my catch rate is around 80% with using 1-4 balls with out this. Using it is about 50% and you run out fast, but tend to miss out on stronger CP Pokemon. So I guess it is good for farming and hitting lots of stops.'),
(N'Aisha', N'Ali', N'aisha.ali2973@example.org', '2018-01-04', 5, N'Very good thanks'),
(N'Megan', N'Allen', N'megan.allen3323@example.org', '2018-01-04', 3, N'I have not played much of the game yet. I have win 10 and it does not support this game.to get it to play you will need to download a crack. I do not thing it is wrong I won the game and used my cd key.'),
(N'Christina', N'Walker', N'christina.walker6556@example.net', '2018-01-04', 1, N'This was my favorite SNES game of all time but it turns out I could not use my old Wii to download it. I guess I will have to buy a Wii U if I want to play it eventually. I bought it because one of the comments here mentioned that it did work on the old Wii, which is NOT true. Gameplay wise, maybe younger generations will not care for it, but this is one of the Top 10 2-D action side scrollers of all time. At some point it was considered the best game of all time. It''s immersive, amazing from beginning to end, and you feel like you''re all along in the depths of an unknown planet. I could never get bored of it and cannot recommend it enough.'),
(N'Patrick', N'Stewart', N'patrick.stewart3106@example.org', '2018-01-04', 5, N'Highly recommend this stand. Awesome build quality! Better than I expected! Well worth the money!'),
(N'Robert', N'Lee', N'robert.lee1770@example.net', '2018-01-05', 1, N'People...Clearly this item is a scam...dont buy this one..'),
(N'Kevin', N'Baker', N'kevin.baker9816@example.net', '2018-01-05', 5, N'It''s very comfortable! I just wish the left and right buttons were maybe on the edges rather than on top but that probably just takes getting used to. I get to them just fine.'),
(N'Diane', N'Powell', N'diane.powell9806@example.net', '2018-01-05', 5, N'1 more year of great online gaming!!'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Henderson', N'evelyn.henderson3101@example.com', '2018-01-05', 3, N'Its OK'),
(N'Amy', N'Jackson', N'amy.jackson8076@example.com', '2018-01-05', 3, N'Got this back on release date, been playing it on and off since. Campaign is fun. Nothing groundbreaking, and quite short but it was a fun play through. Multiplayer is pretty much dead. Ive played a few games this past week and the player count has never been over 4,000 players online at peak times. Usually takes 5 minutes to find a game. For the price its set at now its worth it.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Ali', N'anthony.ali4930@example.org', '2018-01-06', 5, N'Fun game!'),
(N'Brenda', N'Edwards', N'brenda.edwards8303@example.net', '2018-01-06', 2, N'I have gone through 3 of these now. These head phones stop charging and will not turn on. I''ve tried charging only with the base and only with a cable. No matter what i do they stop working a few months down the road. Short life expectancy for such an expensive product.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Ross', N'elizabeth.ross7228@example.net', '2018-01-07', 5, N'as odd as it seems, i like this mouse better than the corsair scimitar pro. these buttons are a little more spread out and have a more clicky feel to them. software alot easier to use too. i had a razer mouse that died before on me before....but now looking back, it was a trooper....it survived 4 moves and 3 computers. so, im going to give this a go. UPDATE: been a few months since ive been using it, i still love it and its working great. my only little tiny nit pick would be there is no dedicated forward and back buttons for navigation. but i mean, there are 12 side buttons, but still, im a pc nerd, i want what i want lol.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Brooks', N'katherine.brooks9948@example.net', '2018-01-07', 1, N'I thought maybe this was going to be a Harvest Moon clone. Turns out you run a shop and....that''s it. You go outside to pick mushrooms and things to sell in your shop. Once I figured out that was all the game had to offer, I never picked it up again.'),
(N'Noah', N'Rivera', N'noah.rivera4835@example.net', '2018-01-07', 4, N'Surprisingly fun, despite the long opening and awkward first level.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Kowalski', N'evelyn.kowalski4420@example.com', '2018-01-08', 5, N'I love this game, I just have to keep some spare batteries on the side for this.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Campbell', N'ronald.campbell4078@example.org', '2018-01-08', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Kowalski', N'jeremy.kowalski6375@example.org', '2018-01-08', 4, N'excellent'),
(N'Debra', N'Cruz', N'debra.cruz7039@example.net', '2018-01-08', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Alexander', N'King', N'alexander.king7423@example.com', '2018-01-08', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Rachel', N'Ferreira', N'rachel.ferreira8573@example.net', '2018-01-08', 4, N'Good little bundle. Only complaint is that as always, these things are too pricy.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Brooks', N'sharon.brooks8188@example.net', '2018-01-09', 5, N'Love the game play! I purchased this to enjoy it once again from my childhood. Do not regret it one bit!'),
(N'William', N'Henderson', N'william.henderson4743@example.net', '2018-01-09', 5, N'Work like a charm, love it the Cherry MX Brown for typing and playing games. Good Illumination and got the sound of the goddess on this keys. Wife will kill me one night xD'),
(N'Nadia', N'Jackson', N'nadia.jackson3121@example.net', '2018-01-09', 5, N'I assume this game is fun, I bought it for my daughter a while back and she still plays it every now and then. I don''t know much about it and I think she still prefers Animal Crossing, but I do remember her saying she liked it when she played it more.'),
(N'Brian', N'Rogers', N'brian.rogers6152@example.com', '2018-01-10', 5, N'This game is not as easy as one might think.'),
(N'Anthony', N'Allen', N'anthony.allen4164@example.org', '2018-01-11', 5, N'Great headphones! But SUPER noise cancelling. I prefer to hear my surroundings. If you enjoy deep immersion without any outside noise, these are for you.'),
(N'Ashley', N'Morales', N'ashley.morales2534@example.org', '2018-01-11', 5, N'The 5 FPS with all the explosions and when spiders come around are part of the charm'),
(N'Dennis', N'Wisniewski', N'dennis.wisniewski3701@example.net', '2018-01-11', 5, N'Fun to play around in the pokemon version of france! Standard story, but no less fun!'),
(N'Andrew', N'Watson', N'andrew.watson8414@example.org', '2018-01-11', 5, N'work great'),
(N'Olivia', N'Thompson', N'olivia.thompson1587@example.com', '2018-01-11', 3, N'really not worth the money... vanity items you spend this on are way over priced.'),
(N'Frank', N'Ward', N'frank.ward3618@example.org', '2018-01-12', 5, N'Bought for nostalgic reasons. I. Enjoyed playing this game as a kid, it was fun to play through it again. In all, I finished the game in 2 hours of gameplay. A lot shorter than I remember. The levels and puzzles were relatively easy but the controls made it difficult at times. Still a childhood favorite of mine.'),
(N'Tyler', N'Ali', N'tyler.ali1802@example.com', '2018-01-12', 5, N'works as advertised. On PS2 though, only some games support progressive scan of 480P or 1080i (which requires this cable). I didn''t see much a difference in resolution between 480i and 480p. But in games like SOCOM which were almost impossible to see in darker missions are MUCH MUCH better in 480P mode. If you have an HDTV and still rock the PS2 for some retro gaming, this cable is a must!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'Ali', N'jacqueline.ali2990@example.com', '2018-01-12', 5, N'Combine Max Payne with Asians and this is what you got Good combination.'),
(N'Frank', N'Howard', N'frank.howard7745@example.com', '2018-01-12', 3, N'As a self-proclaimed "huge" fan of the Final Fantasy series, I must say, that XV, after all the wait, did not live up to the hype. The game itself was called Final Fantasy XIII vs. I think many years back when Square Enix was trying to milk Final Fantasy XIII for all its worth. First off, for me, the Final Fantasy series has not been the same since XII... I still consider that the last good Final Fantasy of the high-def era of gaming. For me, nothing will ever come close to Final Fantasy VI (III in the US), but I digress. I purposely did not read any reviews on it, so I just bought the game since it was a Final Fantasy game... So I''ll start with the gameplay itself. It leaves behind the turn based system of yesteryear. It has more a hack and slash feel to it. There are some new dynamics to the game such as having three computer controlled teammates fighting alongside you in real time. You can still input your own commands when you want. Battles are set to an aggro system that''s...'),
(N'Jerry', N'Kim', N'jerry.kim1001@example.net', '2018-01-12', 5, N'Excellent quality Amiibo as always. Arrived in perfect condition and worked flawlessly.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Patel', N'evelyn.patel1677@example.com', '2018-01-12', 5, N'Just got a PS4 (I''m pretty late to the game...literally!) and this was the first thing I ordered since I heard so many great things about the Uncharted series. What an incredible series. Finished all three games in about three weeks and I''m excited to move on to Uncharted 4! BTW, make two save files during gameplay. When I started the first in the series, I thought it had been saving my progress, but when I went to load it again it said that it was a corrupted file, so I had to start all over again. From that point on, I saved TWO slots on each game, just incase something bad happened to the first.'),
(N'Karen', N'Morgan', N'karen.morgan7030@example.com', '2018-01-12', 3, N'This game is boring'),
(N'Sharon', N'Hernandez', N'sharon.hernandez1596@example.org', '2018-01-12', 5, N'My first non-standard Xbox One controller. Has such a great matte but smooth feel to it. Has such an amazing design. Has batteries included. Just overall a great controller'),
(N'Walter', N'Kelly', N'walter.kelly5371@example.org', '2018-01-13', 5, N'Pretty cool high quality metal case also comes with four other downloads which are the previous games to this game Gears of War 4, also comes with the season pass, comes with the Gears of War Gears of War 2 Gears of War 3 and Gears of War judgement wow must buy'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Powell', N'benjamin.powell9467@example.org', '2018-01-13', 5, N'Item was as advertised. It is a great game. I am having fun playing.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Powell', N'benjamin.powell9467@example.org', '2018-01-13', 5, N'Item was as advertised. Game is a lot of fun to play.'),
(N'Paul', N'Morgan', N'paul.morgan2477@example.com', '2018-01-13', 5, N'very good excellent'),
(N'Rachel', N'Williams', N'rachel.williams1213@example.com', '2018-01-13', 5, N'I put my new slim works good recommend it'),
(N'Yuki', N'Carter', N'yuki.carter3686@example.com', '2018-01-14', 5, N'fun'),
(N'Yuki', N'Carter', N'yuki.carter3686@example.com', '2018-01-14', 5, N'super fun game'),
(N'Robert', N'Cox', N'robert.cox7465@example.org', '2018-01-15', 5, N'This is a great game. There are enough unlocks to have you coming back just to see what you''ll get next. But besides that, this game is all kinds of fun. My boys can''t seem to put it down, and we have Lego Worlds as well. Couldn''t be happier with this.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Suzuki', N'olivia.suzuki5570@example.org', '2018-01-15', 5, N'This guy who created this game is a genius'),
(N'Susan', N'Martinez', N'susan.martinez3930@example.net', '2018-01-16', 1, N'I bought these because logitech usually makes good products... The headset itself is kind of tight in that you will start to feel them pinch on those little protrusions on your ear after about an hour or so. The cable is covered in some fabric, not plastic so when you wear them you get this amplified sound of this fabric brushing against your clothes and this sound is loud as hell because of the stethescope effect of the headsets. Oddly enough I bought these to replace some turtle beach headsets that i *thought* were inferior. Looks like I will be going back to them. EDIT: Less than 2 months later, this flimsy piece of trash broke at the swivel joint between the head and left ear piece. Total piece of garbage. Cheap materials. Shoddy construction. Just an overall piece of garbage. Avoid at all costs. 1 star because 0 stars is simply not an option. Turtle Beach makes a hands down superior product to this. This is trash and you''ll know it the minute its out the package.'),
(N'Justin', N'Webb', N'justin.webb2491@example.net', '2018-01-16', 4, N'Feel the ARCADE'),
(N'Kelly', N'Campbell', N'kelly.campbell1006@example.net', '2018-01-17', 5, N'Great game, love it, love the price, love everything about it!'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Cox', N'jonathan.cox8533@example.com', '2018-01-17', 5, N'The graphics, the gameplay, the plot, were all phenomenal. This is hands down my favorite female main character of any video game to date. It''s is an open-world sandbox type game where you can wander in to areas where the enemies are much higher level than you are, so be sure to level up first so you''re on equal ground.'),
(N'Jack', N'Brown', N'jack.brown4376@example.net', '2018-01-18', 5, N'excelent product'),
(N'Douglas', N'Nelson', N'douglas.nelson1857@example.net', '2018-01-18', 2, N'Works for a few days then it becomes too loose and won''t connect unless I have a finger pressing it down to make it connect. At first, I thought it was my remote, but after going through two remotes, I decided to borrow my cousin''s cable and realize it that it worked perfectly.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Lewis', N'kyle.lewis8488@example.com', '2018-01-18', 4, N'Fun lego game'),
(N'Sandra', N'Long', N'sandra.long9458@example.net', '2018-01-18', 4, N'A little too much in the way of repetition, and one too many loose ends for my taste (I mean, if you''re going to have 9 separate paths, you''d think you could clear up all the loose ends across those paths...) But the three protagonists are fantastic, and generally the game''s concept is very cool. Also, fantastic soundtrack by Kevin Penkin.'),
(N'Brenda', N'Johnson', N'brenda.johnson8833@example.com', '2018-01-18', 5, N'First console didn''t work, and the seller was very quick to respond. We agreed on an exchange, and though I had to clean the pins in the cartridge slot (no surprise there) the second console works perfectly. Item even shipped with an ascii controller! Very happy. Five stars for the service and ease. Now, a bits of warning - not about this seller, but in retro consoles, in general. They''re old. Expect problems and learn about them. They''re time machines and need care. Finding a working SNES period is getting more and more difficult. Know how the machines work, and understand that such fragile systems can be damaged when shipped in ways we can''t predict. This seller was amazing about this, and I recieved my replacement within one week. Be patient, and at least know somebody that can work on these old babies; or just check the internet for troubleshooting. Also, some SNESes I''ve run across are bundled with 9v power supplies. 850ma, but 9v. This will fire up Super Mario World just...'),
(N'Carolyn', N'Morris', N'carolyn.morris5463@example.org', '2018-01-19', 5, N'Kid loves the game however we came to realize that it''s the GameCube version revamped.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Anderson', N'andrea.anderson1286@example.com', '2018-01-19', 5, N'These seem to work just fine. I bought them for my wife and she loves them. For the price point you can''t really argue for a 7.1 headphone. And, while they don''t do 100% noise cancelling, they definitely do block out a lot of outside noise. My wife uses them for PUBG and she says they work wonders for telling where every little sound is coming from in game. I am using 5.1 headphones and I don''t get the detail she does AT ALL.'),
(N'Jack', N'Hughes', N'jack.hughes5312@example.com', '2018-01-20', 2, N'junk'),
(N'Adam', N'Adams', N'adam.adams9162@example.com', '2018-01-21', 3, N'Great Game but no one plays it anymore!'),
(N'Hannah', N'Davis', N'hannah.davis1924@example.net', '2018-01-21', 5, N'long cord, smooth and lagging isn''t noticeable. great buy! A year later and it''s going strong.'),
(N'George', N'Perez', N'george.perez7919@example.org', '2018-01-21', 1, N'horrible "antique" game; hardly able to play'),
(N'Kyle', N'Lewis', N'kyle.lewis8798@example.org', '2018-01-22', 5, N'If you like metal gear, buy this and Acid 1'),
(N'Barbara', N'Perry', N'barbara.perry4239@example.com', '2018-01-22', 5, N'Son loves it.'),
(N'David', N'Henderson', N'david.henderson8114@example.org', '2018-01-23', 5, N'Delivers on promise of true 4k gaming. All games get a boost to performance. Many games with no enhancement automatically play and look great. It would be great if Microsoft could encourage software publishers to update more previously released games.'),
(N'Ivan', N'Robinson', N'ivan.robinson8744@example.org', '2018-01-23', 5, N'Excellet'),
(N'Lisa', N'Coleman', N'lisa.coleman6241@example.net', '2018-01-23', 3, N'i love this game. its awesome, of course. but there are two things that really get to me. one is that i could only download 32 bit version from cd. i have downloaded 64 bit for every game i have, so its not my computer. second is that every time i start up the game, ITS ON LEFTY FLIP. it is so friggin annoying. and when i change that, it doesnt save that way.'),
(N'Kelly', N'Lee', N'kelly.lee2896@example.com', '2018-01-24', 5, N'easy to activate under games tab on amazon there will be a link to activate it through sony 1 click.'),
(N'Mark', N'Thompson', N'mark.thompson8812@example.com', '2018-01-24', 5, N'On sale for $55. Great value for the price.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Reyes', N'stephanie.reyes7418@example.org', '2018-01-25', 5, N'Runs perfectly. Came in the original packaging with the original manual/booklet. A perfect way to experience some nostalgia.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Carter', N'douglas.carter7517@example.org', '2018-01-25', 4, N'The controls are not as easy as it was playing on PlayStation but still fun. Its still one of my favorite games.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Carter', N'douglas.carter7517@example.org', '2018-01-25', 4, N'Its fun, but I wish you could play multiple people on the same console instead of just Xbox live and having a storyline you could play.'),
(N'Douglas', N'Collins', N'douglas.collins4679@example.org', '2018-01-25', 5, N'A+++'),
(N'Larry', N'Singh', N'larry.singh7131@example.net', '2018-01-25', 5, N'I liked all the extras that come with this game. There''s plenty to do beyond the min story. I did not like the inclusion of micro transactions.'),
(N'Gary', N'Kelly', N'gary.kelly2494@example.com', '2018-01-25', 2, N'The controls on this game are a problem. That being said, there''s a fun game underneath. It''s hard to enjoy the game when your fighting with the awful controls. The motion controls are sloppy and unreliable. Having to look back and forth at the game pad and tv is awkward. This game could have been great but I just can''t recommend it.the biggest challenge in the game is fighting the controls, not the enemies.'),
(N'Dee', N'Collins', N'dee.collins7179@example.net', '2018-01-26', 5, N'my kid is vey happy with this Amiibo'),
(N'Kyle', N'Coleman', N'kyle.coleman5533@example.net', '2018-01-26', 5, N'Was fun'),
(N'Steven', N'Butler', N'steven.butler7308@example.com', '2018-01-26', 5, N'excellent'),
(N'Barbara', N'Bailey', N'barbara.bailey8680@example.net', '2018-01-26', 3, N'Just got it today. The picture threw me off but that is my fault for not checking the description. I thought I was getting 2 sets and it was only one. For this price I could have bought 3 from another seller. In fact I did buy another set with the tri wing screw driver for about the same price. But the product itself is eh.... When you move the left thumbstick diagonally left actually any direction really. It hits the housing and because the stick is a little short than the original it rubs weird against it. I feels like it also sits deeper which could be part of the issue. I am not sure if it is also because mine is a wave bird if that makes a difference, but I couldn''t find anything online indicating that there was. So product is fine for what it is. Just too expensive I thought I was paying for better fit, I would suggest to try a different one.'),
(N'Megan', N'Flores', N'megan.flores9861@example.com', '2018-01-26', 5, N'Love this game. You can change up your play style at any time and try things anyway you want. The massive open world environment is just fantastic.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Martinez', N'joseph.martinez3528@example.org', '2018-01-26', 5, N'Excellent toy. Grabbed it on sale on black friday'),
(N'Samantha', N'Price', N'samantha.price7372@example.org', '2018-01-27', 5, N'Still one of the greats. F the haters, this game is gold!'),
(N'Jacqueline', N'White', N'jacqueline.white8765@example.net', '2018-01-28', 5, N'Works really well, fits things nicely. My son loves the orange color.'),
(N'Brian', N'Barnes', N'brian.barnes9204@example.com', '2018-01-28', 5, N'Very good wheel for the price, especially if using on PS4/PS3. Note: the G27 was compatible with PS2, but this one is not.'),
(N'Janet', N'Wang', N'janet.wang6036@example.com', '2018-01-28', 5, N'first played this cutie during a break while attending a severe weather spotter symposium at Waukesha county technical institute. loved it then and still do this little critter was made when video games were meant to amuse and make you laugh he certainly does all that.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Reed', N'raymond.reed5992@example.net', '2018-01-28', 5, N'works!'),
(N'Gregory', N'Brown', N'gregory.brown6892@example.net', '2018-01-29', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Kelly', N'Okonkwo', N'kelly.okonkwo8930@example.org', '2018-01-29', 5, N'Product was exactly as advertised, came on time, I would recommend this seller/vendor.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Hernandez', N'nicholas.hernandez4339@example.net', '2018-01-29', 5, N'Megaman Powered Up, next to Maverick Hunter X, is one remake that is truly awesome, especially with Protoman as an unlockable character. Too bad there is no plans for sequels. What a bummer.'),
(N'Nicholas', N'Hernandez', N'nicholas.hernandez4339@example.net', '2018-01-29', 4, N'Despite the D-Pad having some issues (nothing serious), the Controller works great. Why Sony want to jack up the prices on their Dualshock controllers, I''ll never know.'),
(N'Nathan', N'Ramos', N'nathan.ramos1409@example.com', '2018-01-30', 5, N'It''s thick, and good protection if you accidently drop the console while it''s inside of the case, but don''t go hurling it around ahaha. It holds three games, I don''t know if it''ll close with the plug inside. I haven''t tried to do it but it seems to me that it wouldn''t fit. Either way, it''s a good purchase to keep the handheld safe and dust free when you''re not using it.'),
(N'Pamela', N'Jackson', N'pamela.jackson8989@example.net', '2018-01-30', 5, N'Great mouse for gaming'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Hernandez', N'evelyn.hernandez7643@example.com', '2018-01-30', 4, N'Does what it needs to, is a bit sticky.'),
(N'John', N'Perry', N'john.perry8240@example.com', '2018-01-30', 5, N'I love the skylander. Thank you.'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Robinson', N'elizabeth.robinson3981@example.com', '2018-01-31', 5, N'Easily my favorite game besides GTA5. I love the cool gadgets you can use on missions. Pretty cool game so far!'),
(N'Alexander', N'Wang', N'alexander.wang5726@example.com', '2018-01-31', 5, N'great quality for little money'),
(N'Pamela', N'Morris', N'pamela.morris6290@example.org', '2018-01-31', 4, N'Its like playing golf you will hate it and love it at the same time. I have no idea why people like to subject themselves to 100 hours of very difficult type of video games, sure its a beautiful game etc etc. I have played them all, and i can understand that the very serious gamer needs these games. But man, i think I prefer the Lounger, Pina Coladas & playing Skyrim, Witcher, Shadow of Modor etc etc than slipping into this dark world and self mutilating myself to die 80 times to finally beat thst boss, whew, God bless u if u can play these type of games haha. Ok I played for a longer period, finally getting the hang of the game so i added a star to 4. Its hard but more forgiving than i initially thought once u get the hang of it and ask people how to play'),
(N'Barbara', N'Bailey', N'barbara.bailey8680@example.net', '2018-01-31', 3, N'Game was brand new which is awesome. But the song selection is so lame. Luckily I can bring over a bunch that I have purchased in the past but the songs aren''t not the best. Everything else is just Rock Band so nothing new to report. Is does look better but game play hasn''t really improved since the last.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Kowalski', N'joseph.kowalski3358@example.com', '2018-02-01', 5, N'Good price and helps with fps games like Call of Duty.'),
(N'Andrea', N'Russell', N'andrea.russell9352@example.net', '2018-02-01', 5, N'I have a small keyboard/mouse/keypad area. This looks nice, works great, and fits my need. Great product.'),
(N'Alexander', N'Parker', N'alexander.parker5970@example.org', '2018-02-01', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Ivan', N'Thompson', N'ivan.thompson3495@example.org', '2018-02-01', 5, N'Get ready to get lost and sink in a crap ton of hours into this game. This game is really good (not the best in the entry in the series)'),
(N'Barbara', N'Khan', N'barbara.khan6069@example.net', '2018-02-01', 5, N'Purchased as gifts. Was exactly as advertised.'),
(N'Luis', N'Gomez', N'luis.gomez8483@example.org', '2018-02-02', 5, N'Another classic from Sid Meier. A steal at the PS3 prices!'),
(N'Luis', N'Gomez', N'luis.gomez8483@example.org', '2018-02-02', 5, N'this is the controller you use when your giant mickey mouse hands can''t hold those tiny square controllers for your youth. Do you have hands like the guy in Pink Floyd''s Comfortably Numb? Then this will be awesome to play all your emulators on the big screen. GAME ON!'),
(N'Nadia', N'Boyd', N'nadia.boyd3658@example.com', '2018-02-02', 5, N'Im a big resident evil fan . This is a must buy for any true fan .'),
(N'Melissa', N'Ross', N'melissa.ross1714@example.net', '2018-02-02', 5, N'Very useful for someone who can''t afford another controller. Works perfectly.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Clark', N'benjamin.clark6677@example.com', '2018-02-02', 5, N'Feels wonderful in the hands.'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Foster', N'kenneth.foster3555@example.org', '2018-02-02', 3, N'game ok for a few hours'),
(N'Patricia', N'Kowalski', N'patricia.kowalski2871@example.com', '2018-02-03', 5, N'Its a incredible product'),
(N'Judith', N'Walker', N'judith.walker9191@example.net', '2018-02-04', 5, N'Excellent service and product'),
(N'Aisha', N'Richardson', N'aisha.richardson6236@example.org', '2018-02-04', 4, N'I bought these for my son to use with his PS3 and they look and sound great! I am knocking off a star because the instructions are garbage, just a drawn diagram that is a little confusing. I will help anyone buying for the ps3 so here is what you have to do. If you have a newer tv like we do (Samsung 4k) with NO RCA jacks, you MUST use the Sony A/V cable that came with your ps3, it plugs in the back of the box and has 3 rca jacks coming out of it. Plug the headphones into the USB jack in the front, then plug the rca jacks into the rca jacks that cone from your Sony A/V cable. The rca plugs on these headphones have a female end on the bottom of the male plugs so you can plug male rca jacks into the bottom of them. Then you have to go to the settings on the PS3 and change the sound settings from HDMI to the A/V setting and they will work. It''s a little confusing but it works great after that. I was frustrated for awhile until I figured it out, Thank you Google and Toms guide.com! I...'),
(N'Jose', N'Brown', N'jose.brown3419@example.com', '2018-02-04', 5, N'i love it'),
(N'Betty', N'Alvarez', N'betty.alvarez2068@example.com', '2018-02-04', 5, N'my son loves this'),
(N'Anita', N'Morales', N'anita.morales4817@example.org', '2018-02-04', 5, N'This game is pretty much Need for Speed''s version of Forza motorsport.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Phillips', N'jennifer.phillips7294@example.net', '2018-02-05', 5, N'Love this game!!'),
(N'Joseph', N'Green', N'joseph.green5426@example.org', '2018-02-05', 3, N'This review is for the Rosewill Gaming Keyboard. I have always favored a mechanical keyboard. Construction-wise, this is a well-made keyboard that will hold up over time. I have no complaints about the construction. This is advertised as a "gaming" keyboard but doesn''t have the normal customization features one would expect. Other gaming keyboards I own, for example, allow you to set the backlight specifically on core keys, like highlighting the WASD keys for movement or just highlighting the F1, F2, etc keys for hotkey use. The only customization is changing the entire backlight color and presentation, so you can have a solid one color or multi-color or a wave effect. The raised keys and spacing reduce mistypes and slips, which is important when you type as fast as I do. If you are someone who uses the "hunt and peck" typing technique, you may have a problem with this keyboard. There is very little contrast between the numbers and the keys, and the lack of contrast is compounded...'),
(N'Dee', N'Nelson', N'dee.nelson9427@example.net', '2018-02-06', 3, N'As Expected'),
(N'Shirley', N'Rodriguez', N'shirley.rodriguez3392@example.org', '2018-02-06', 5, N'It''s a good game.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Sullivan', N'hiroshi.sullivan1280@example.com', '2018-02-06', 5, N'I''ve never played a Persona game in my 10 years of been a PlayStation user. And 3 weeks ago when I thankfully decided to buy this game out of mere curiosity, i can say i regret nothing. From any point of view this game might seem like a game only anime fans would enjoy, "wrong". 78hrs of playing and still I started a new + game. I''m a few words, this is a must buy If you want to take advantage of PlayStation exclusives.'),
(N'Adam', N'Ramirez', N'adam.ramirez8153@example.net', '2018-02-06', 5, N'awesome'),
(N'Timothy', N'Mendoza', N'timothy.mendoza1845@example.net', '2018-02-06', 3, N'soo so much talking erg its like it looked on the youtube video..but may get better if i figure out how to get past this beggining hard part it seemed it had like most games do at times have super puzzling parts so may get batter as go along..because looked also very very cool unique graphics as well if i can ever get to them much'),
(N'Kevin', N'Sanchez', N'kevin.sanchez4779@example.com', '2018-02-06', 5, N'It seems like a good game for its time, but it totally wasn''t what I expected. I bought this game expecting something that had more up-to-date graphics and mechanics, but instead it was just a bunch of old mini-games, and it is frustrating to control the characters. In fairness, though, I should have read closer when it came to the features of this game.'),
(N'Emily', N'Ferreira', N'emily.ferreira5982@example.org', '2018-02-07', 5, N'very cool really takes things to whole new level plus i love the fact that your going around the galaxy and the new abilities that the yoshi''s have are so fun and funny i picked this up at a pawn shop and found myself enjoying it a lot well worth the money plus somewhat fun for 2 players Skilled players will want to collect new Comet Metals, which will unlock harder levels with even more challenges Mario collects stars as he travels from galaxy to galaxy, sometimes upside-down, sometimes floating from place to place. On some stages, Mario can find an egg, smash it open and hop onto the back of Yoshi. New power-ups include a drill that Mario uses to tunnel through the planet''s surface all the way to the other side of a planet Every level is new, but the game retains the charm, sense of wonder and beauty in line with Mario''s history Yoshi can use his tongue to grab items and shoot them back at enemies, or to snag attach points and swing across chasms When he eats a Dash Pepper, he...'),
(N'Anita', N'Perry', N'anita.perry1903@example.net', '2018-02-07', 4, N'Fun!'),
(N'John', N'Martin', N'john.martin6810@example.com', '2018-02-08', 5, N'OMG do I love this game! Awesome MC, cute af girls, and a plot and pacing that makes actual sense! Bad aspect: Dungeon Explore mechanics, beware!'),
(N'George', N'Russell', N'george.russell5950@example.net', '2018-02-08', 5, N'ok'),
(N'Timothy', N'Walker', N'timothy.walker5759@example.org', '2018-02-09', 4, N'Got this on sale. it was worth it'),
(N'Linda', N'Brown', N'linda.brown6235@example.com', '2018-02-09', 5, N'great game hours of fun'),
(N'Andrea', N'Chavez', N'andrea.chavez1849@example.org', '2018-02-09', 5, N'Got for my wife, she loves retro games and this is her favorite. She played non stop and i watched alot of it. Highly recommendes'),
(N'Kevin', N'Kelly', N'kevin.kelly4084@example.org', '2018-02-09', 2, N'Great feeling mouse. Poor battery life. Center wheel button failed within days of use. Has latency issues that cannot be overcome. Looks great and feels good but has poor software support and bad customer support from Logitech. Buyer beware. There are better mice out there for the money that do it better.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Alvarez', N'raymond.alvarez8347@example.net', '2018-02-09', 4, N'It''s a nicely designed case, and seems to be of good quality. Somewhere in the description I thought I had seen that it was a "hard" case and it''s not - it''s a stiff case. Not hard, though.'),
(N'Anna', N'Patel', N'anna.patel2294@example.com', '2018-02-09', 5, N'This game rocks. I really enjoyed the soundtrack and the way this game put you into the 60''s. Very fun.'),
(N'Amara', N'Fisher', N'amara.fisher7019@example.org', '2018-02-09', 4, N'A little hard to play, but have to get deeper into it and understand it better'),
(N'Eric', N'Okonkwo', N'eric.okonkwo8352@example.com', '2018-02-09', 2, N'I''m a left-handed user, and prefer left-handed mice for the way they fit in my hand. However, like most lefties I grew up with the Left button as the primary and it''s how I to work today. Razer DeathAdder doesn''t allow this -- even in their customization software. While you can map everything else, you cannot change the left-button setting. They aren''t clear on this in their literature or sales info, so you don''t know until you bought it. This was a BIG setback for me. I''m not going to change how I use a computer for one brand of mouse, and I share the computer with right-handed folks as well (they definitely won''t change). You can bypass Razer by flipping the primary button in Windows settings, but if you have more than one computer on your windows account, it''ll flip those settings too, screwing with your other mice and laptop trackpads. I know some games allow you to flip the buttons, but I''m not a gamer -- I''m a designer and wanted an accurate mouse for its responsiveness in...'),
(N'James', N'Gomez', N'james.gomez9119@example.net', '2018-02-10', 5, N'thank you , god seller .. abu turki riyadh'),
(N'Katherine', N'Howard', N'katherine.howard7305@example.com', '2018-02-11', 5, N'My all time favorite dinosaur game a really good shooting game feels like the arcade but at home so good. buy it'),
(N'Victoria', N'Flores', N'victoria.flores1521@example.com', '2018-02-12', 1, N'This headset is an absolute garbage. The sound is acceptable for the price, but they are such a pain to use! The headset gets really hot for some reason, it is cheaply made, the glossy parts take in all the dust within seconds after removing the protective covering and there is almost no control over how they fit on the head. Also don''t forget that these are open-type headphones, so the sound will leak like hell! I bought these only because I still use PS3 for gaming and I wanted to play with my normal headphones. However, in order to use them (after so many updates, so many reissues of the console), I had to buy this piece of trash just to get the USB cable that allows you to connect any other 3.5mm headphones to the PS3. Why not to sell it separately? No idea. The usb cable does work and it even has a volume control on it, doesn''t seem to be fragile, so that is a plus. My luck is that I got this for 25$ refurbished. Other than that, do NOT buy this headset to play your games. It...'),
(N'Amanda', N'Scott', N'amanda.scott8693@example.org', '2018-02-12', 4, N'Great. Only wish it had more game slots and a bigger screen flap.'),
(N'Susan', N'Ferreira', N'susan.ferreira3007@example.org', '2018-02-13', 5, N'My favorite RPG series. I have replayed these games several times now.'),
