(N'Linda', N'Perez', N'linda.perez7061@example.org', '2018-02-20', 5, N'I had skyrim for Xbox 360 so I wanted to play it on my ps4. Great time playing it especially with the DLCs included!'),
(N'Nancy', N'Boyd', N'nancy.boyd4751@example.org', '2018-02-20', 5, N'Excellent.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Sanchez', N'thomas.sanchez9997@example.org', '2018-02-20', 3, N'Good game.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Torres', N'kofi.torres1203@example.org', '2018-02-21', 5, N'Came just as advertised.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Morgan', N'jennifer.morgan2858@example.org', '2018-02-21', 5, N'Best headset for value by far'),
(N'Shirley', N'Bell', N'shirley.bell2938@example.net', '2018-02-22', 5, N'Excellent.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Ortiz', N'ryan.ortiz7156@example.com', '2018-02-22', 5, N'Only issue I found is, it doesn''t have a screw like the original which allows you to open it to Grease parts... This has clips but once you try to pry on it, it seems glued shut..'),
(N'Nadia', N'Webb', N'nadia.webb3013@example.org', '2018-02-23', 5, N'Pirates!! Brings back memories when I played this on the Commodore 64 in the 80s. Not much has really changed,a few additions to the game,but none really jump out at you as "over the top" changes. I was not expecting this version to be so much fun!! But when this game was rebooted for xbox then more recently for the xbox one...it just raised the bar on a whole new level of "retro" video gaming fun!! I wish more companies would bring back the older games we remember on this level. I think its the best "reboot" for Pirates! and the overall story and playability was left up to fun,and for you to ask yourself "okay what next?" its that kind of game that does not dictate how YOU should play it,but moreover it lets you think out each movie as you go!! Great job Sidmeiers for a wonderful update to this Classic Game'),
(N'Aisha', N'Garcia', N'aisha.garcia7654@example.org', '2018-02-23', 5, N'works great on my ps4 n my xbox 1'),
(N'Angela', N'Hernandez', N'angela.hernandez7587@example.net', '2018-02-24', 4, N'It''s great only problem is to use on Xbox you need an adapter otherwise it''s fine.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Miller', N'cheryl.miller1959@example.org', '2018-02-24', 1, N'Item came with a charge. I used the charge, battery charged just 1 time after that then would no longer take a charge. I wanted this as a back up battery to a very old original. Next please'),
(N'Noah', N'Jones', N'noah.jones8890@example.net', '2018-02-25', 5, N'Love the god of war games great story to them'),
(N'Victoria', N'Ross', N'victoria.ross5283@example.org', '2018-02-26', 5, N'very good'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Gray', N'benjamin.gray4888@example.org', '2018-02-26', 5, N'One of the best keyboards i ever bought'),
(N'Ryan', N'Cook', N'ryan.cook3287@example.net', '2018-02-26', 5, N'Son loved it.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Brown', N'kofi.brown2093@example.org', '2018-02-27', 5, N'Firstly, there are thousands of great youtube videos on retro video games so you can be sure the product is right for you. That being said, I love it.'),
(N'Amy', N'Brooks', N'amy.brooks9159@example.com', '2018-02-27', 5, N'great game.'),
(N'Scott', N'Turner', N'scott.turner3712@example.net', '2018-02-28', 2, N'Too many characters to keep track of. Best thing about Halo 5 is some of the music is great and the graphics are nice (I played on Xbox One X in 4K) I can really say I enjoyed Halo 4 much more than this game in every way. 343i seem to want to make a Halo 2 like game with introducing a new character but it completely fell on its face, the story I can''t say enough was really bad. People keep saying the campaign is short but I couldn''t wait for it to end. Also it is very linear (much like Halo 2) but even more so. The multiplayer is a broken experience for me because of 1 gameplay change, the spartan boost. For a fan of all the Halo''s, this to me has been the worst one yet. I really feel like this series should go back to basics and please for the love of god, get some good writers and bring Marty back for the music. If the story and music is good in Halo 6, I can forgive all the dumb modern gameplay changes they have added to this series over the years.'),
(N'Nancy', N'Jones', N'nancy.jones5289@example.net', '2018-02-28', 5, N'excellent turtle beach audio!'),
(N'Raymond', N'Raghunathan', N'raymond.raghunathan7478@example.org', '2018-03-01', 4, N'It''s alright.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Martin', N'ryan.martin6723@example.net', '2018-03-02', 3, N'The B and Y buttons on my controller require a bit more force than I would like but other than that this controller is great. I got this primarily for SMM and if you''ve ever played it you know you need something other than the gamepad to play on. When I first started using this controller I thought maybe I just needed a few minutes for my hands to adjust to the controls since I kept dying in stupid ways. I quickly realized that the buttons weren''t registering my presses unless I pressed rather hard. This is unacceptable in a controller especially in games that can require very quick inputs.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Foster', N'stephanie.foster1471@example.net', '2018-03-02', 5, N'Thank you'),
(N'Timothy', N'Price', N'timothy.price5748@example.com', '2018-03-02', 5, N'good'),
(N'Christopher', N'Johnson', N'christopher.johnson8306@example.com', '2018-03-02', 5, N'awesome game.'),
(N'Kyle', N'James', N'kyle.james2760@example.net', '2018-03-03', 5, N'works like it should.'),
(N'Yuki', N'Hernandez', N'yuki.hernandez4408@example.org', '2018-03-04', 2, N'played most the way through but had date scratch that prevented me from playing last few levels'),
(N'Samantha', N'Robinson', N'samantha.robinson7584@example.org', '2018-03-05', 5, N'Console was in great shape, definitely looks better than my original snes'),
(N'Joseph', N'Russell', N'joseph.russell9254@example.net', '2018-03-05', 5, N'Having a blast (no pun intended )'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Reyes', N'jonathan.reyes2624@example.net', '2018-03-06', 5, N'I dusted off my old PS2 wanted to play some of my old games relive my youth. So I plug my PS2 to my HDTV using the original AV cables and boy was I suprised to see the image quality looking so bad nothing like I remember when I played them on my old CRT TV. Then I remembered back in the day when people would say component was the way to go so I got my self this awesome cable. This thing is high quality super thicc and dam is the image quality great was a world of difference. I''m really impressed how this cable delivers such a great image quality compared to the original AV Cable truly a must for your PS2. And it''s a added bonus that it can be used with a Wii and the old Xbox 360. Overall super happy I got this can''t stop playing my PS2.'),
(N'Samuel', N'Miller', N'samuel.miller2556@example.net', '2018-03-06', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Olivia', N'Webb', N'olivia.webb2763@example.com', '2018-03-06', 5, N'Another game to the collection, something almost any age can play.'),
(N'Rachel', N'Suzuki', N'rachel.suzuki8743@example.net', '2018-03-06', 5, N'Excellent'),
(N'Ryan', N'Henderson', N'ryan.henderson1836@example.com', '2018-03-06', 3, N'So i''m eventually gonna beat Tales of Zestiria on the PS4, but I said screw it, and decided to do my review on it. Yes it''s over 4 years old lol, but why not? Graphics: For a PS4 game, it''s primitive, but goddammit it looks amazing still to this day. The large areas look beautiful and still impressed me to this day on the beauty of the fields and the towns too. Characters look good, but the NPCs, you can tell, took a big hit in quality. The walking animation looks silly too. Overall, it''s a very bright, colorful game, w/ very dark tones that do very well in many areas. Music: Ok, I might get hit by this one, but Motoi Sakuraba is an amazing artist, w/ some of the best OSTs on old Genesis games, Golden Sun, Bravely Default, and even the Dark Souls games. But goddammit, his music in Tales of Zestiria is....so boring. Nothing stands out very well, except the four dungeons where you acquire the powers for the four elements. Even Tales of Hearts R on the Vita, which I''m playing right...'),
(N'Donald', N'Nelson', N'donald.nelson5111@example.com', '2018-03-07', 5, N'kids loved it'),
(N'Jose', N'Taylor', N'jose.taylor1148@example.com', '2018-03-07', 5, N'CLASSICK!!!!! I LOVED RUBY IN THIS GAME THE ACTION IS ON OVERLOAD!!!! ITS LIKE PLAYING KILL BILL IN A VIDEO GAME BUT WAY COOLER TO ME ANYWAY".....'),
