(N'Kenneth', N'Kumar', N'kenneth.kumar9233@example.com', '2018-03-09', 5, N'Oure nostalgia right here. I was skeptical at first but it arrived well and it was at a great price!'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Young', N'jennifer.young3661@example.com', '2018-03-09', 3, N'Its an ok thing just didn''t get into the fighting system of the game other then that yeah works greak looks good so 3 start gives it an a ok'),
