(N'Richard', N'Jackson', N'richard.jackson2684@example.net', '2018-03-12', 5, N'Amazing game. I originally played this game on PS3 and was glad they released it on PS4 as well. A gripping story, loveable characters, situations that are realistic, multiple choices to make, etc. are all part of this amazing game. I was weary to try it at first but I''m so glad I did. I highly recommend this game for a mature audience only.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Martinez', N'michelle.martinez4948@example.com', '2018-03-12', 5, N'Love ut'),
(N'Peter', N'Jackson', N'peter.jackson2626@example.net', '2018-03-13', 5, N'Pretty short game main game better. Still cool game thanx.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Flores', N'matthew.flores9981@example.com', '2018-03-13', 3, N'This was a fun simulator when I bought it in 2010 and ran it on an XP PC. Two PCs later I pulled it out of my stack of old games to see whether it would run on my Windows 7 PC. I tried all sorts of compatibility combinations but, alas, no dice. Too bad. It wouldn''t even install. Still, if you have the right equipment it''s a fine game.'),
(N'Lisa', N'Torres', N'lisa.torres9867@example.net', '2018-03-13', 5, N'Beat it in a few days great game'),
(N'Angela', N'Edwards', N'angela.edwards4503@example.com', '2018-03-13', 5, N'Kiddos love it'),
(N'Joan', N'Watson', N'joan.watson7442@example.net', '2018-03-13', 5, N'Arrived on time and product was as described.'),
(N'Angela', N'Reed', N'angela.reed3111@example.net', '2018-03-14', 5, N'Great item highly recommend'),
(N'Ravi', N'Turner', N'ravi.turner2925@example.net', '2018-03-14', 5, N'Great Game'),
(N'Robert', N'Campbell', N'robert.campbell5032@example.org', '2018-03-14', 5, N'This game is amazing, though slow at times. It has many varied landscapes and tons to explore. I put about 85 hours into it and I could easily play again with using a different set of main characters. This game has the best dragon battles of any game ive played, and this game takes what is the best elements of DA:O and DA:2 for DA:I. The only cons (and these are minor) are that the worlds are very large and you have to walk everywhere initially, and the combat can get repetitive (but it''s fun, think Diablo 3). Overall I highly recommend this game if you like fantasy RPG''s.'),
(N'Wei', N'Allen', N'wei.allen2685@example.com', '2018-03-14', 1, N'This game sucks and its a waste of time The AI is hyper sensitive while also dumb at times getting caught for dumb reasons is stupid the mini games are very poorly made and broken the fire button has the worst button placement ever in video game history instead of the shoulder button were it should be. its on the stick and didn''t work on the 2nd mini game and the fishing game has a timer for no reason when the area had no guards. screw that.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Ruiz', N'thomas.ruiz8617@example.net', '2018-03-14', 5, N'great price'),
(N'Melissa', N'Nguyen', N'melissa.nguyen3623@example.org', '2018-03-14', 5, N'I bought this to convert my PS4 fightstick so I wouldn''t have to buy one just for an Xbox One. First thing I did was update the firmware of the stick. So far I tested the adapter with the following: 1. Dualshock 4 2. Hori RAP 4 KAI (both PS4 & PS3) 3. Mad Catz MIDI Pro Adapter for PS3 (all three modes) I have not been disappointed by its functionality. The amount of lag produced is so minimal that it''s hardly noticeable. My only caveat is that you need to update the converter''s firmware, but it''s necessary in a world where either Sony or Microsoft can transform any device into a brick just by releasing their own update. And this has happened just recently for the PS4 variants of this converter when firmware 5.50 came out. Another thing I would like to point out is that since the stick is recognized as a Xbox One controller, you can use this on PC as an easy way to play games that require Xinput. The converter is wireless capable, so after pairing feel free to ditch the cable. NOTE:...'),
(N'David', N'Ruiz', N'david.ruiz6444@example.net', '2018-03-15', 5, N'Gift for my son; he loves it!'),
(N'Debra', N'Hernandez', N'debra.hernandez3749@example.org', '2018-03-15', 5, N'Works great with my Nintendo Wii. Have had no problems since my original one broke.'),
(N'Eric', N'Price', N'eric.price5492@example.com', '2018-03-15', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Wei', N'Gutierrez', N'wei.gutierrez6720@example.net', '2018-03-15', 4, N'Present for a friend'),
