(N'Jason', N'Jones', N'jason.jones8079@example.org', '2018-03-16', 5, N'Exactly as described.'),
(N'Angela', N'Castillo', N'angela.castillo9861@example.com', '2018-03-16', 2, N'Terraria is one of the favorite games that get played in my home. I''ve played it on xbox 360 and the computer - the PC version is the best. The controls on the gamepad aren''t that bad, but they aren''t very good, either. Some things are much harder to do using the gamepad. I will say that it is easier to see on the gamepad, but on the TV itself it''s comparable to the xbox 360 version - tiny. Which leads me to local multiplayer. If each player has a character and world on their own profile then you can do local multiplayer. Being second player is horrible. Half because the controls on a wii mote are bad (may be better using a wired or classic controller. Don''t know. Haven''t tried), and half because it''s so damn small on the screen you can barely see anything. That was my main problem with the xbox 360 version - it''s so tiny on multiplayer. I''ve gotten a much bigger TV since we last played it on the xbox and it''s still Tiny. The only redeeming quality is that as first player you get...'),
(N'George', N'Taylor', N'george.taylor8301@example.com', '2018-03-16', 5, N'Arrived quickly. Works great. Looks nice. I bought the 2 or 3 yr warranty (the lowest one) just to be safe because I have never used the product before. At this rate I don''t think I''ll need it. But it was only like 2 bucks. Overall it works great and I recommend it'),
(N'Mark', N'Anderson', N'mark.anderson8931@example.org', '2018-03-17', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Stephen', N'Brooks', N'stephen.brooks8599@example.net', '2018-03-17', 4, N'I got this at Best Buy but it is the same model. I was just on here looking to see if maybe I got the "cheaper" model but apparently they only make 2 models anymore, this and the F710. I don''t want wireless function so this is the best gamepad they offer. Its a really nice controller, but it has some quirks. I have gotten it to work with any game I''ve wanted to use it for without any fuss, just making sure it was plugged in before I started my computer (sometimes it won''t register in games properly if it isn''t plugged in at boot). Its comfortable, the buttons are the perfect amount of "stick" and I love the feel of the game pad. However, I was on here looking for an upgrade because mainly two reasons. 1.) Most important, is I finally realized that something was missing during games... this controller has no rumble feature. None. I went one day from playing on XB1 and then transitioning to the same game on PC and finally realized that''s what it was. The other model does support...'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Price', N'jennifer.price9337@example.net', '2018-03-17', 5, N'A VARY NICE AND FUN GAME. MY SON JUST LOVE THIS CARS GAME. SO VARY FUNNY AND MAKE YOU THINK YOU ARE WATCHING THE MOVIE. THEY LOOK SO CUTE. MY SON LIKES HOW THEY EYES LOOKS. MY SON JUST LAUGH AT THEM WHEN THEY BE TALKING AND SAYING FUNNY THINGS. YOU JUST THINK HOW FUNNY THAT IS TO SEE SOME TALKING CARS. YOU JUST START LAUGHING.I SAY THIS IS A VARY GREAT GAME TO BUY FOR YOUR KIDS TO PLAY. LOVE IT...'),
