(N'Deborah', N'Powell', N'deborah.powell8009@example.org', '2018-04-01', 2, N'Way too firm on the control stick. Almost impossible to steer in a racing game, it''s almost 90 degrees left or 90 degrees right. Any maneuver requiring precision is out the window'),
