(N'George', N'Anderson', N'george.anderson1437@example.com', '2018-04-04', 5, N'Amazing game. A smash bros RPG beat-em-up. Good micro management, fun co-op and a nice art style ;). Some people may be turned away from the exaggerated sexuality of the game it has what can only be described as loads of anime fan service. It didn''t bother me personally but I wouldn''t buy this game for a child.'),
