(N'Nancy', N'Rivera', N'nancy.rivera5280@example.net', '2018-04-12', 5, N'Game is definitely fun with friends to explore. Certainly is lacking depth and content at the moment but once content updates release, it''ll be worth it. My advice is get the Xbox Game Pass 14 day trial to try the game. You get access to it on Xbone and PC, although I highly suggest you play on PC as it is the superior version with 60fps. Not even the X version runs at 60fps which is pathetic on MS part. Anyway, you need friends for this game and you have to enjoy it for what it is right now. A pirate exploring stealing adventure.'),
