(N'Karen', N'Ramos', N'karen.ramos1858@example.org', '2018-04-18', 3, N'Extremely lacking in content for 60 bucks. Hold off for a sale or to let the dev''s put more content in the game.'),
(N'Amara', N'Garcia', N'amara.garcia8741@example.org', '2018-04-19', 5, N'code works'),
(N'Lucia', N'Perry', N'lucia.perry1992@example.com', '2018-04-20', 5, N'I pre ordered, got it on time. Awesome Game, The Graphics are Amazing on the PS4 PRO. My Son And have been waiting for this Game, ever since it was announced. Every PS4 owner should have this Game in their PS4 collection. I see Game of the Year for sure. So glad I was able to pre order and get my Prime discount as well. AMAZON IS THE BEST.......'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Henderson', N'evelyn.henderson3101@example.com', '2018-04-20', 4, N'Good and fun game. Great price too.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Hughes', N'kyle.hughes8118@example.com', '2018-04-21', 5, N'I love this game because of how many various things you can do in it plus the leveling up/xp system that a typical rpg game should have. What makes this game so great vs other rpgs is that it''s star wars.'),
(N'Linda', N'Harris', N'linda.harris4639@example.org', '2018-04-21', 5, N'Loved it'),
(N'John', N'Young', N'john.young8900@example.net', '2018-04-21', 5, N'Perfect in almost every way possible.'),
(N'Luis', N'Price', N'luis.price3105@example.org', '2018-04-21', 5, N'Great Game'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Perez', N'jeremy.perez5869@example.com', '2018-04-22', 1, N'The material is pretty inconsistent, and they don''t grip as well due to the shape. They actually fit the PS2 dualshock better than most modern controllers.'),
(N'Betty', N'Anderson', N'betty.anderson7144@example.com', '2018-04-22', 5, N'So, so good. Starts off slow, but you will be addicted after the 2nd hour. Best game I''ve played in a long time.'),
(N'Christine', N'Howard', N'christine.howard2605@example.com', '2018-04-23', 5, N'works perfectly, glad I listened to the reviews and didn''t spend for the more expensive one when not needed'),
(N'Nadia', N'Hall', N'nadia.hall8060@example.org', '2018-04-23', 5, N'Short and sweet incredibly unique action card based rpg.');
INSERT INTO #reviews (firstName, lastName, email, submitted, rating, feedbackContent) VALUES
(N'Patrick', N'Perry', N'patrick.perry1882@example.org', '2018-04-23', 5, N'razer products work well love em use em'),
(N'Kofi', N'Roberts', N'kofi.roberts5157@example.com', '2018-04-23', 5, N'I have already bought and owned the first 2 Diablo games. I have always enjoyed the games.'),
(N'Melissa', N'Thompson', N'melissa.thompson4052@example.org', '2018-04-24', 5, N'Perfect item, just as described. Speedy delivery!'),
(N'Maria', N'Scott', N'maria.scott3505@example.net', '2018-04-24', 5, N'Great grand kids love this game'),
(N'Deborah', N'Chen', N'deborah.chen9488@example.org', '2018-04-24', 5, N'Sure it borrows a few things from the 1st Mass Effect,however they made it thier own. I''m not a fan of the timed response mechanic,I know where they were going with that to make it authentic but I can do without it. The graphics are lacking a little like it was made for ps2 but it was ported to the ps3 for example. I like the story and making allies or foes is a GOOD feature. You can play this over and over again. NEVER PLAY THE SAME GAME TWICE.'),
(N'Thomas', N'Watson', N'thomas.watson9355@example.com', '2018-04-24', 5, N'thanks'),
(N'Joyce', N'Ross', N'joyce.ross9743@example.org', '2018-04-25', 5, N'Muy buen producto.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Hernandez', N'hiroshi.hernandez9916@example.org', '2018-04-25', 5, N'The king of the original Fire Emblem games in that came to the west. A harsh but fair system where the enemies are hard and the weak are easily weeded out'),
(N'Peter', N'Nelson', N'peter.nelson3868@example.org', '2018-04-26', 4, N'I was looking for some low price gaming headphones for my ps4. Amazon had plenty, but most are from unknown Chinese brands. This was one of the few I found was actually sold in stores (Walmart) so I ordered them. The headphones arrived on schedule and are very nice. They have some weight to them which surprised me since at under $30 I expected them to be lighter and cheaper feeling. Make no mistake, they aren''t expensive heaphones with all the plastic on them, but that''s not why you buy them, they are for gaming. They have nice and loud sound that doesn''t crackle. However, one complaint I have is the low bass. It has some, but it''s certainly lacking. What its missing in base it makes up with the volume. These things can get loud, real loud, enough to make your head hurt. As for the mic, it is also very nice and doesn''t distort your voice, not much else to say about it. My second and last complaint are that the USB cable should be longer than it is. I need an extension in order for...'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Stewart', N'jonathan.stewart9734@example.com', '2018-04-26', 5, N'Great product, fantastic condition.'),
(N'Christine', N'Ramos', N'christine.ramos1580@example.org', '2018-04-28', 5, N'Loved it'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Lewis', N'kimberly.lewis2877@example.org', '2018-04-29', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Andrea', N'King', N'andrea.king6170@example.net', '2018-04-29', 5, N'This thing is solid. It feels great, and the RomerG Switches have a nice response and feel to them. The key caps are cheaply made though, and have started to wear down pretty bad on some keys, but they still work so whatever. This thing has survived 2 spills and a water bath 99.9% working. (sometimes I get some double letters when I press a key, but I think I need to get switch lube). I picked mine up at a brick and mortar store a while back, and was thinking about replacing it with another one because I like it so well.'),
(N'Jonathan', N'Gonzalez', N'jonathan.gonzalez5275@example.com', '2018-04-29', 4, N'Decent wired gaming mousing from SteelSeries. This one is a solid performer with precise control and response and well positioned buttons and wheel just where you''d expect them to be in the cradle of your right hand. This one is rated at 12,000 CPI and also has a somewhat gimmicky (but still neat) liftoff feature that retains your pointer position even when the mouse is raised off of its surface. Unweighted - the mouse is 96 grams but it can be increased up to an additional 32 grams with the inclusion of 8x 4g weights that can be added and placed as you see fit. Bottom line - great tracking and good ergonomics makes this a reliable performer for your day to day gaming needs.'),
(N'Tomasz', N'Gray', N'tomasz.gray3513@example.org', '2018-04-29', 5, N'Still playing this'),
(N'Frank', N'Nguyen', N'frank.nguyen3065@example.com', '2018-04-30', 5, N'good'),
(N'Mei', N'Harris', N'mei.harris9644@example.com', '2018-04-30', 4, N'Amazing controller for iphone. Solid build, feels great. Doesnt work for all games though, the game has to support bluetooth controllers, but this applies to all controllers. The only reason I gave it 4 stars is that it appears that the companion app is no longer updated.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Patel', N'katherine.patel9956@example.net', '2018-04-30', 5, N'Best Color for a PS4 controller, these are a must have!'),
(N'Michelle', N'Ferreira', N'michelle.ferreira2234@example.com', '2018-04-30', 5, N'k'),
(N'Laura', N'Turner', N'laura.turner1348@example.com', '2018-05-01', 4, N'Exactly what youd expect'),
(N'Michael', N'Thomas', N'michael.thomas5629@example.net', '2018-05-01', 4, N'Works well, fast delivery, good price.'),
(N'Sharon', N'Watson', N'sharon.watson8669@example.net', '2018-05-02', 5, N'These stay on much more nicely than one would expect. They were not overly hard to apply and I haven''t had one come free. The deal is these are a godsend for use on a controller when you want precision. It doesn''t turn you into a superhero, but it does help overcome one of the big shortcomings of an analog stick: precision. They lengthen the "throw" of the thumb sticks making it easier to control your smaller inputs into the game. I found my steering more precise in Forza, and my shooting just a tad bit better in Destiny. I like they included convex and concave shapes. These would be improved if there was a height in between the tall and short. They also do nicely to change the angle of your thumb making it a bit more comfortable to use. Honestly the xbox one has to short of thumb-sticks stock.'),
(N'Ravi', N'Williams', N'ravi.williams8735@example.net', '2018-05-02', 5, N'Pretty nice system, especially for the price.'),
(N'Debra', N'Carter', N'debra.carter3588@example.org', '2018-05-02', 5, N'Love it'),
(N'Omar', N'Robinson', N'omar.robinson6097@example.org', '2018-05-03', 5, N'Love these!! Helps my thumbs from getting rought up. I have these on all my controllers and would recommend these for anyone who spends hours at a time playing video games.'),
(N'Mei', N'Parker', N'mei.parker1122@example.com', '2018-05-04', 5, N'Nice one fast shipping'),
(N'Wei', N'Jenkins', N'wei.jenkins8585@example.org', '2018-05-04', 5, N'Don''t need to know what the lyrics are if the game is still fun :D'),
(N'Stephen', N'Gonzalez', N'stephen.gonzalez9484@example.org', '2018-05-05', 5, N'for grandkids.'),
(N'Brandon', N'Cox', N'brandon.cox5702@example.net', '2018-05-06', 5, N'works great'),
(N'Cynthia', N'White', N'cynthia.white8229@example.com', '2018-05-06', 5, N'This affordable headset is one of my most impressive purchases to date! Everyone is getting one of these for Christmas!!! It has great Sound quality, good ergonomics with the design and volume controls and flex-mic. In fact, I decided to plug it into my Samsung S5 just for fun and my contacts said the voice quality was a significant improvement over the phone''s mic. Wish I could carry the headset around with it all the time! When gaming I sometimes tend to overstretch or slightly jerk the cable. I had expected this to cause a short in the wire in quick order, but it DID not...yet. The only weakness I have found is that after a few hours my ears start to hurt, as with ALL headsets I have ever used. I do not know if larger muffs would help or just be an exercise in futility. So I cannot fault this particular headset for that. Great bang for the buck! Buy it already! ;)'),
(N'Justin', N'Fisher', N'justin.fisher1354@example.org', '2018-05-07', 5, N'this is a most for someone who plays fastpest shooters'),
(N'Kevin', N'Patel', N'kevin.patel1959@example.com', '2018-05-07', 5, N':)'),
(N'Elizabeth', N'Nguyen', N'elizabeth.nguyen7618@example.com', '2018-05-07', 5, N'I am hooked. Absolutely hooked. Looks and performs great in 4K. Story pacing is phenomenal. Humor is subtle but entertaining and makes for some great memes. Really emotional and cinematic experience. The new combat is nearly perfect. The world is open, but not too open and really feels like it rewards you for exploring.'),
(N'Patricia', N'King', N'patricia.king2717@example.net', '2018-05-07', 1, N'first it shows a fun looking game and tells you that you don''t currently own this game, but would you like to go online and buy it. then after jumping thru the hoops you get some off the wall game that is not anything like regular casino games. total waste of money,'),
(N'Nancy', N'Clark', N'nancy.clark7076@example.com', '2018-05-07', 5, N'Only downside was the individual career segments both cop and racer is very very short. I blew through it so fast without even trying.'),
(N'Maria', N'Cruz', N'maria.cruz5721@example.net', '2018-05-08', 3, N'Its got some good songs, its a matter of what your looking'),
(N'Joan', N'Anderson', N'joan.anderson1297@example.org', '2018-05-08', 5, N'As as stated. They work with the screwdriver I already have and they make taking apart games a breeze.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Phillips', N'timothy.phillips6138@example.com', '2018-05-09', 4, N'good'),
(N'Charles', N'Jackson', N'charles.jackson5196@example.org', '2018-05-09', 5, N'One of my favorite games of all time and the portable version is just as good as the arcade. The sound track suffers a bit but that is to be expected going from the original format to Game Boy Advance. But for what it is, it is very enjoyable.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Boyd', N'raymond.boyd4354@example.org', '2018-05-10', 5, N'Great, works as described'),
(N'Katherine', N'Thompson', N'katherine.thompson7415@example.org', '2018-05-10', 3, N'This was a gift. She said it was really awesome right up until she got stuck and no amount of internet diving got us a solution. So she only got about a week out of it. Not worth it.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Gutierrez', N'kyle.gutierrez5864@example.org', '2018-05-11', 5, N'These control sticks behave more like the GAMECUBE variants. They have a smooth, round body underneath them so they glide around unlike the originals which had a single-point pivot that would get ground down into dust and become loose. The only "complaint" I''ve gotten is that they are too sensitive.'),
(N'Walter', N'Lee', N'walter.lee9004@example.org', '2018-05-11', 1, N'Original feeling was really good and I enjoyed this controller. Feels great in my big hands and works with everything. Although not even 24 hours in, and the left stick is already sticking to the right. Not much I can do, must be a cheap model. You can see in the photo without the case that the left stick is more towards the middle and ruins a lot of games. UPDATE: I returned the controller and got a new one, and the same exact problem occurred. The left stick is sticking to the right and makes all games unplayable. I would not recommend this controller, the quality control is awful.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Diaz', N'raymond.diaz8939@example.net', '2018-05-12', 4, N'Original remake - GREAT! RE0 remaster - terrible. This game is a waste of time.'),
(N'Evelyn', N'Johnson', N'evelyn.johnson7286@example.org', '2018-05-12', 5, N'A++++++++++++'),
(N'Katherine', N'Thompson', N'katherine.thompson7415@example.org', '2018-05-13', 4, N'My kids loved this. I hated it. It was really inappropriate to be played around younger kids and constantly having to remind them was such a pain. I was happy when it fell out of favor.'),
(N'Judith', N'Morris', N'judith.morris8195@example.net', '2018-05-13', 1, N'Should have called it Skyrim 2. Not like GOW at all. Just walk in the only directions your are allowed to and yell at a kid. Kid doesn''t look at all like him. Bet the mother was fooling around while he was out saving the world haha.'),
(N'Sandra', N'Ivanov', N'sandra.ivanov4466@example.org', '2018-05-13', 5, N'Decent headphones and my son prefers these over some many more expensive ones purchased. They are falling apart however still working not sure if there is a warranty as would like to replace the foam and mic seems to be the problem points but as mentioned sound quality and overall usage is good... He is a heavy gamer so wear is probably expected -'),
(N'Mary', N'Kim', N'mary.kim8942@example.net', '2018-05-15', 2, N'I bought this grip with the specific intent of avoiding my hands to get cramps while playing for more than 15 minutes on my 3DS. The problem with this grip is that its NOT very ergonomic at all. Your hands will not grip this grip by the sides in a comfortable manner. Mainly because the sides aren''t thick enough for that. My hands are big, so maybe it will work for a person with smaller hands (young girl, child). But if you have huge hands, forget it. This will not do. Seek a better grip designed for big hands. I wished that I had done that myself.'),
(N'Raymond', N'Morris', N'raymond.morris4686@example.org', '2018-05-15', 4, N'The light at the top right corner is my only complaint, if bumped or the mouse rubs across it, the mouse tracking can get crazy. But other than that the mouse pad does all it says and more. For RGB mouse pads its one of the best, primarily because of the Razer software'),
(N'Maria', N'Johnson', N'maria.johnson1928@example.org', '2018-05-15', 5, N'Wow. Just wow. This is a must-own game for the PS4, no question. In my top 5 all time games of all time. Beautiful environment, exciting combat, great story/characters, meaningful side quests. I can''t think of any negatives. It''s challenging (but fair) on normal difficulty.... and without crushing your spirit (I''m looking at you Bloodborne & Demon/Dark Souls). This is a no brainer. Cheers to the game devs for the extraordinary effort and care they put into this game. Cheers!'),
(N'Mei', N'Hernandez', N'mei.hernandez7469@example.org', '2018-05-15', 5, N'Great game for the money lots of hours of game play here'),
(N'William', N'Webb', N'william.webb4383@example.com', '2018-05-15', 5, N'I did not get a chance to install it on my Laptop but, played it on the PS3!!! Great game!!!'),
(N'Paul', N'Martin', N'paul.martin1748@example.net', '2018-05-18', 1, N'This controller is total crap. It takes more batteries than necessary, the buttons are all stiff and uncomfortable, the plastic (no rubber grips) analog sticks aren''t even analog, and the controller is unwieldy and uncomfortable. Barely works on PS3'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Russell', N'cheryl.russell4178@example.org', '2018-05-18', 4, N'Bought as a present whom enjoyed it very much.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Suzuki', N'olivia.suzuki5570@example.org', '2018-05-20', 5, N'Ryu translates surprisingly well in figure form. Simple yet very good.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Suzuki', N'olivia.suzuki5570@example.org', '2018-05-20', 5, N'Lucina is a pretty detailed amiibo, from her clothes to the cape on her back and from her sword. All done very well, she translates very nicely in figure form. Best fire emblem wifu.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Wright', N'mateo.wright2435@example.org', '2018-05-21', 5, N'This controller works great with my Windows games. It arrived fairly quickly.'),
(N'Dee', N'Parker', N'dee.parker3458@example.com', '2018-05-21', 5, N'works as intended'),
(N'Steven', N'Alvarez', N'steven.alvarez7367@example.org', '2018-05-21', 5, N'Perfect, bought for our daughter and she loves the Disney Infinity game, and all of the characters.'),
(N'Kimberly', N'Long', N'kimberly.long6753@example.org', '2018-05-22', 5, N'Kids love it.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Flores', N'matthew.flores9981@example.com', '2018-05-22', 3, N'There isn''t much in this expansion pack that would appeal to single adults. It might as well have been called "families" than "generations." Content for a broader audience is very thin.'),
(N'Stephanie', N'Kelly', N'stephanie.kelly9059@example.org', '2018-05-22', 5, N'SOD fan here. We played at least 50 hours on the first game. Wife and I currently put in a solid 3 hours on SOD2. Its the basically the same as SOD1 with improved graphics, options, and story. Still has the occasional bugs too. That may improved as game developers tend to work these out the first few weeks after release. I can imagine well playing a solid 50+ hours before we get bored. For 30 bucks. Its a steal.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Richardson', N'benjamin.richardson4884@example.net', '2018-05-23', 5, N'Good'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Howard', N'rebecca.howard1875@example.com', '2018-05-23', 1, N'Does not fit and it blocks all access points like the charger and the game cartridge spot plus others'),
(N'Richard', N'Coleman', N'richard.coleman3527@example.com', '2018-05-23', 5, N'I heard a lot of mixed reviews about this game but I must say I really enjoyed it. Do not listen to the bad reviews. Youll definitely enjoy this game.'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Gonzalez', N'hiroshi.gonzalez2420@example.org', '2018-05-24', 5, N'Cool game'),
(N'Hiroshi', N'Gonzalez', N'hiroshi.gonzalez2420@example.org', '2018-05-24', 5, N'Awesome game'),
(N'Ashley', N'Morales', N'ashley.morales2534@example.org', '2018-05-25', 5, N'Reminds me a lot of some of the old arcade Sega & Konami games. Really fun if you have multiple people to play with.'),
(N'Christina', N'Ross', N'christina.ross2241@example.net', '2018-05-26', 5, N'A very fun game - not that difficult but has challenges at times, the music is fantastic, as far as platformers go it''s extremely solid and won''t disappoint.'),
(N'Amanda', N'Hill', N'amanda.hill2475@example.org', '2018-05-26', 4, N'good game'),
(N'Amanda', N'Hill', N'amanda.hill2475@example.org', '2018-05-26', 1, N'my software says not safe to install'),
(N'Aisha', N'Butler', N'aisha.butler4551@example.org', '2018-05-26', 5, N'I bought more than 10 beads of this product and did not find any flaws'),
(N'Ronald', N'Miller', N'ronald.miller1098@example.com', '2018-05-27', 5, N'love'),
(N'Emily', N'Cooper', N'emily.cooper1017@example.net', '2018-05-28', 5, N'I''ve played a lot of J-RPGs over the years and as of the past decade or so, I feel like the quality of those games have gotten worse and worse. Sure, the graphics continue to improve, but there''s usually nothing innovative, the characters annoy me and feel cliche, and sometimes it''s either over simplified or way too complicated. This was my first Persona game ever and I bought it based off the rave reviews and it did not disappoint. It was an amazing game and I got the platinum trophy after about 160 hours of play time. It feels familiar yet fresh, the characters and dialogue were great and funny, and I enjoyed it all the way through. When it was over, I honestly felt kind of sad. I can''t wait for the next game and you can consider me a Persona fan from now on! This game was WAY better than the last Final Fantasy 15 game in my opinion, if you''re a RPG fan and haven''t played this game, get it now and prepare to be hooked!'),
(N'Deborah', N'Adams', N'deborah.adams4314@example.com', '2018-05-29', 5, N'Worked flawlessly, not plug and play but i dotn care about that stuff it works. Was able to use my old xbox controllers'),
(N'Anna', N'Wood', N'anna.wood4753@example.org', '2018-05-29', 4, N'It''s a DeathAdder Chroma... ''Nuff said.'),
(N'Amara', N'Turner', N'amara.turner1382@example.org', '2018-05-31', 3, N'good'),
(N'Melissa', N'Lee', N'melissa.lee1053@example.net', '2018-06-01', 5, N'This game has its issues like most games now a days and it''s not triple A graphics or anything but I have so much fun playing this series . Theres something special about how they do it you cant put your finger on it . I would''ve happily played max price for this. Reviews are anywhere from 9/10 to 5/10 people cant make there mind up . Give it an actual chance and you will be in love . Especially if you like zombie/shooters with rpg elements .'),
(N'Charles', N'Mendoza', N'charles.mendoza1461@example.net', '2018-06-01', 4, N'thanks'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Kowalski', N'jeremy.kowalski6375@example.org', '2018-06-01', 5, N'love it'),
(N'Lisa', N'Morales', N'lisa.morales5451@example.org', '2018-06-01', 5, N'the best you can get for your xbox. I do not know how I played with the regular controller, this is amazing'),
(N'Joseph', N'Coleman', N'joseph.coleman9545@example.com', '2018-06-02', 4, N'To be honest this surpassed my expectations. A must play for FPS gamers.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Wright', N'cheryl.wright6669@example.com', '2018-06-02', 5, N'Thanks for such a great conditioned and priced new game! Didnt even know this game came out!'),
(N'Alexander', N'Powell', N'alexander.powell3277@example.com', '2018-06-03', 5, N'for the price wow this the best keyboard and mouse I ever had... and I''m 33..BUY THIS ASAP.. THE KEYS FEEL RICH'),
(N'Andrea', N'Raghunathan', N'andrea.raghunathan5296@example.org', '2018-06-03', 1, N'doesn''t charge fast enough and doesn''t keep charge'),
(N'Michelle', N'Sanders', N'michelle.sanders8690@example.org', '2018-06-04', 5, N'very detailed ! great amiibo.'),
(N'Joseph', N'Hill', N'joseph.hill3620@example.net', '2018-06-04', 5, N'Yes'),
(N'Betty', N'Kim', N'betty.kim8180@example.com', '2018-06-05', 5, N'This is the second best game I''ve played on the Vita as of writing this review. The 2D art style is colorful and looks amazing on the Vita screen, especially on the OLED of the 1000 model. Pros: -Gorgeous colorful 2D art style that looks great on the Vita. -60FPS in most places. -Portable, which suits this game very well. -Tons of content. -Platinum Trophy isn''t difficult to obtain if you put the time in. -Adjustable Difficulty modes. Cons: -Frame rate can drop when many enemies are on the screen and after battles. -Game can feel repetitive after a while, which is a big reason why this plays better on the Vita, allowing for a pick-up-and-play experience.'),
(N'Katherine', N'Thompson', N'katherine.thompson7415@example.org', '2018-06-05', 3, N'This was a gift for a mystery game lover. She said some of the search and find were really hard to see because they were so dark. She also said she got to a certain point and could never figure out how to get past it. Up until then it was really fun though.'),
(N'Michael', N'Wright', N'michael.wright7558@example.org', '2018-06-06', 1, N'When I contacted customer service they said that it would NOT work with my arcade stick even though it is listed as one of the compatible devices, very disappointed.'),
(N'Olivia', N'Hughes', N'olivia.hughes9373@example.com', '2018-06-06', 1, N'this is so expensive and so easily break. i buy this to protect my ps4 controller. it is so easily break. i am thinking why i waste money buying this thing?'),
(N'Amanda', N'Chavez', N'amanda.chavez7245@example.org', '2018-06-06', 5, N'Purchased for a friend of mine, he loves it.'),
(N'Justin', N'Collins', N'justin.collins5930@example.org', '2018-06-08', 5, N'I have been trying various wireless headsets for my PS4 Pro and stumbled across the LS30. For reference, I already own the Steelseries Arctis 7 and Hyperx Cloud Flight. While both of those headsets are very impressive, i still wasn''t fully satisfied with either. Both headsets lacked overall volume and the Cloud Flight is mostly plastic. Enter the LS30 from Lucidsound. This headset is metal and very durable. Granted its about 2oz heaviet than my other headsets but nothing that noticeable. I can play for hours with no problems. Sound wise i think the Cloud Flights sound a little better but not by much. The LS30 has 3 eq settings and sounds very good for both games and music. They definitely are the loudest of the 3 by a good margin. I keep the LS30 at about 50% volume and the others at about 80-90%. Comfort wise i actually like all 3 pretty equally. For microphone quality, the Arctis 7 has the best microphone but the other 2 are still very good and perfect for chatting in game. The...'),
(N'Brenda', N'Ferreira', N'brenda.ferreira3575@example.org', '2018-06-08', 4, N'Great keyboard. Software could use a major update. The keyboard feels great. I use it for shooters mostly and found that it to be responsive and accurate almost to the fault, partly my fault, but I have lost a few ultimates grazing for the Q button. The software is another story. The latest software driver was horrible, Framework errors and settings being reset at every start up. I went back to the G.Skill site to download the older driver (WIN10 below the most recent) and all the issues seem to be resolved. Even then, if you decide to buy this product you definitely notice the archaic driver software. That being said, I am very happy with my purchase and would recommend it to my buddies.'),
(N'Wei', N'Chavez', N'wei.chavez1218@example.net', '2018-06-10', 4, N'Grands gave this score.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Howard', N'hannah.howard8766@example.org', '2018-06-10', 3, N'These don''t seem like they clip on as well as the other KontrolFreek sticks that i have.'),
(N'Mark', N'Nguyen', N'mark.nguyen6794@example.org', '2018-06-10', 5, N'Since we never got a Vita release in the U.S I decided to pick up the JP version. It''s just like the ps3 version, except now I can play on the go. And this game takes 80hrs or so to complete so having it on the go was great. Love the game, still need a DW Gundam 4 from TK.'),
(N'Christopher', N'Ward', N'christopher.ward5563@example.com', '2018-06-10', 5, N'good item & service.'),
(N'Kyle', N'Hughes', N'kyle.hughes9518@example.org', '2018-06-10', 4, N'A great idea to have buttons on the side that you can map to your game, it can make it so you have quick access to your most used keyboard buttons and not having to look down at the keyboard to hit a certain key. The downside so far is that I tend to press the #4 button by mistake a lot. The buttons are easy to press but it seems to easy since my thumb tends to rest on the #4 button. I cant rest my thumb any more forward or rearward since its not a practicle hand grip for the mouse. So frantic FPS games are a no go for this mouse. I use it for RPG/MMO where there are usually a lot of key presses. Wouldve been nice if the button were a little more former so you don''t accidentally press them when you''re moving the mouse around.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Gray', N'cheryl.gray4116@example.com', '2018-06-11', 3, N'Bumpers break easily. Make sure you buy a protection plan.'),
(N'Gary', N'Young', N'gary.young7311@example.com', '2018-06-11', 4, N'I read reviews about this game before trying it. Ive played other Paper Mario games before and enjoyed them. I decided to take a chance on this game, despite some of the negative reviews I read. Im glad I did. I have really enjoyed this game so far. Some parts can be tricky (some of the problem solving parts), but overall this is a fun, humorous game. I also like the graphics.'),
(N'Ivan', N'White', N'ivan.white2213@example.org', '2018-06-11', 5, N'Works great. The custom keybinding is a bit of a pain, but once you figure out how to make it work, its not a problem. I wish they sold a protective case to keep the investment safe. I use it for Guild Wars 2 and have all the keys set so can move around really cleanly.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Ramirez', N'jennifer.ramirez5099@example.com', '2018-06-11', 5, N'Awesome product'),
(N'Daniel', N'Wisniewski', N'daniel.wisniewski1736@example.org', '2018-06-11', 3, N'mouse buttons on side don''t fit right. they are where most people rest there thumbs'),
(N'Debra', N'Collins', N'debra.collins2865@example.net', '2018-06-13', 5, N'Everything fits great and it offers some protection. Nice for the price.'),
(N'Debra', N'Collins', N'debra.collins2865@example.net', '2018-06-13', 5, N'Love this mouse. Programmed the two extra buttons to page up and page down, now I can never go back to a normal 5 button mouse.'),
(N'Cynthia', N'Cooper', N'cynthia.cooper7509@example.org', '2018-06-14', 2, N'no av cables was sent to me when open package and no hdmi cables or s cable was sent to me was included when open package nes doesnt work only snes and sega works very disappointing when get this cartridge i paid 75 dollars with credit card so amazon is refund me back the money next time i am get the hyperkin nes console with av cables'),
(N'Lisa', N'Bennett', N'lisa.bennett5698@example.org', '2018-06-14', 3, N'satisfied'),
(N'Christine', N'Martinez', N'christine.martinez3178@example.org', '2018-06-15', 3, N'Achievements still glitched 2 years later. Techland has a lazy, apathetic dev team'),
(N'Gary', N'Bennett', N'gary.bennett7066@example.com', '2018-06-18', 5, N'I use a PS4 as my main system and want to have a few xbox one only games for my xbox one S that I cant get for PS4 and this is one of them. If you were big into Halo for the Xbox 360 days then this is one of the few Xbox One Games to get. Only COn if online multiplayer can be very slow at times finding matches and at times games fail to load. Other that that it is great'),
(N'Raymond', N'Rivera', N'raymond.rivera3519@example.com', '2018-06-18', 4, N'Great game and loved the gameplay similar to Batman series. The villains get redundant but this was fixed in sequel'),
(N'Heather', N'Hill', N'heather.hill8418@example.com', '2018-06-18', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Heather', N'Hill', N'heather.hill8418@example.com', '2018-06-18', 5, N'Great'),
(N'Alexander', N'Peterson', N'alexander.peterson3127@example.net', '2018-06-20', 5, N'Easy to order, easy use to retrieve code, easy to redeem'),
(N'Ryan', N'Price', N'ryan.price3747@example.net', '2018-06-20', 5, N'The controllers work great - no issues with connectivity or game play.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Wang', N'matthew.wang3548@example.com', '2018-06-20', 5, N'The touch controller with the 3rd sensor setup is amazing. They are extremely comfortable and natural to use and the tracking is great.'),
(N'Deborah', N'Miller', N'deborah.miller4709@example.com', '2018-06-21', 4, N'Great mouse'),
(N'Ryan', N'Miller', N'ryan.miller9733@example.net', '2018-06-21', 5, N'New and packaging was great'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Henderson', N'benjamin.henderson9960@example.net', '2018-06-22', 5, N'been using this for a while now with no issues. great buy'),
(N'Mark', N'Tanaka', N'mark.tanaka1469@example.org', '2018-06-22', 1, N'first one i had for about 2 years than for some reason the arrow keys switched with the left analog. so i purchased a new one. the new one the R2 button needs to ne pushed pretty hard for it to register. unlike the R1 L1 or L2.'),
(N'Richard', N'Cook', N'richard.cook3974@example.org', '2018-06-22', 5, N'First of all... remember that the difficulty is what makes games fun for a lot of people who play FromSoftware''s titles. Death is a mechanic that forces you to learn or die. If you want something that you can run right through or you get easily aggravated, this game may not be for you. And although this game has it''s flaws, it still lands in my top 10 favorite games. Pros The design of the game is my favorite of all time. Yharnam is where the game takes place and has a very cool Victorian era vibe. Everything from the enemies to the clothes to the weapons follow this victorian style mixed with the blood theme found throughout the game. But it''s not just the style of the game that makes it cool, it''s the fact that everything is very tightly interconnected. You could be mid-way through the game and find a shortcut that leads to a locked door found in the very first spawn area. This makes each new area exciting to explore knowing that you may run into an area that was out of reach...'),
(N'Jeremy', N'Ferreira', N'jeremy.ferreira6382@example.com', '2018-06-23', 5, N'Great quality, I like the way they feel when I''m wearing them, the adjustable mic is nice, buttons are straight forward. Looks pretty stylish too. Would recommend, you get a good product for the price.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Perez', N'ethan.perez5975@example.com', '2018-06-24', 5, N'These are great docs and batteries. We''ve been using them for several months. They save so much on buying batteries for the controllers.'),
(N'Karen', N'Hughes', N'karen.hughes5244@example.net', '2018-06-24', 5, N'good product fast shipping.'),
(N'Scott', N'Walker', N'scott.walker4930@example.org', '2018-06-26', 4, N'Good sound. Mine looked and felt brand new. Easy setup on PC Only real con is that i have huge Dumbo ears so the ear muffs don''t cover them completely unless i fold my ears.'),
(N'Ryan', N'Walker', N'ryan.walker5544@example.com', '2018-06-26', 4, N'Great except for the cheap feeling cable. Its thin, fragile looking and the tip looks as though it will snap at any time.'),
(N'Kevin', N'Parker', N'kevin.parker3320@example.net', '2018-06-27', 5, N'Battery holds charge again.. not much to say other then its still working!'),
(N'Helen', N'Ortiz', N'helen.ortiz8918@example.net', '2018-06-28', 5, N'works awesome! very comfy. 12000 dpi is pretty sick. also the branding and the wrapping on the cable is premium.'),
(N'Walter', N'White', N'walter.white1025@example.com', '2018-06-28', 5, N'good'),
(N'Nancy', N'Peterson', N'nancy.peterson1488@example.org', '2018-06-29', 1, N'Ill stick my with my PS4 golds... Ive had these and the Astros both are $300 headsets and sure I might sound better on the other end but for the price they suck!!! I dislike these as well as astros. My $89 headset will be better than these all day long!'),
(N'Diane', N'Jimenez', N'diane.jimenez6883@example.com', '2018-06-29', 5, N'great story'),
(N'Jose', N'Powell', N'jose.powell4884@example.net', '2018-06-30', 5, N'Great!'),
(N'Susan', N'Lopez', N'susan.lopez3237@example.com', '2018-07-01', 5, N'Love it. Recommended.'),
(N'Michelle', N'Reed', N'michelle.reed9722@example.org', '2018-07-02', 5, N'very good!!!'),
(N'James', N'Ferreira', N'james.ferreira5973@example.net', '2018-07-02', 5, N'Pros: Crazy stunts, explosions, men on planes, jeeps on planes, boats on planes, planes on boats, boats on satellite dishes, a few goats, and lots of insane dictator to dethrone. Yah know, normal JC stuff. Cons: Its not the same Rico! New V.A. talent. Also Denuovo or leaderboards always online DRM bullsh! t.'),
(N'Rebecca', N'Patel', N'rebecca.patel5571@example.net', '2018-07-02', 5, N'I like it'),
(N'Raymond', N'Robinson', N'raymond.robinson6283@example.com', '2018-07-02', 5, N'Amazing game. Now that its backwards compatible on xbox one there is new life in this game. Really well done physics.'),
(N'Nadia', N'Turner', N'nadia.turner9918@example.org', '2018-07-03', 5, N'Had to buy this because our Wii wore out and the kids were sad. Weve had this a few months and so far its been great. We even forget that its a replacement.'),
(N'Hannah', N'Howard', N'hannah.howard2865@example.net', '2018-07-03', 5, N'Perfect'),
(N'Julie', N'Morgan', N'julie.morgan4511@example.com', '2018-07-04', 4, N'This review is for the PS4 game of the year edition. Even though it has been a long time since I played the original Dragon Age, it has stayed in my mind as a fun and memorable one. Unfortunately, DA2 ended up as being a bit of a disappointment to me, losing some of the things that made the first DA memorable. So I was a bit reluctant to get Inquisition as I was not sure if I would get a return to form or more of the same linear limited open world of DA2, but decided to take a chance after the price dropped to under 20 bucks. Like the previous game, I was able to import the results from the previous games into Inquisition, which seems to affect the story a bit and character interactions, which is a nice touch to show the results of your previous games actions. DA2 was a bit more action-oriented hack and slash kind of combat RPG, whereas DA was more of a traditional RPG with more dialogue and choices with dialogue that affects the game. I personally preferred the gameplay of the...'),
(N'Kofi', N'Kelly', N'kofi.kelly9408@example.net', '2018-07-09', 5, N'I haven''t played the original in over 30 yrs so it was a pleasant surprise seeing it available to purchase for the Nintendo 3ds. I bought this for both my sons and my 3dss only to figure out I also had it in a game bundle for the Nintendo GameCube. Now we have it for the big screen or on the go which is pretty dang cool. Great value for the price of an old game.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Reyes', N'timothy.reyes1059@example.com', '2018-07-10', 5, N'Okay, so here''s the dealio. This is a great headset! Love it to death. It''s got a quality mic so everyone can hear everything I''m saying properly, it''s design is top notch and I barely notice that I''m wearing it (even when gaming for six hours), and the cord is the proper length to not get in the way. There''s only one flaw: sometimes, people''s voices come through in a high-pitch volume that''s rather unpleasant. I play with guys and girls alike. One of the girls, for instance, has a much higher pitch to her voice than the guy friend in question. I have no problems listening to her voice. Randomly, when playing with my male friend, it picks up his voice strangely and blares it in a high-pitched screech. I know it''s something to do with my mic because it doesn''t do it on any of the other mics I own and he has not bought a new one. It seems to level itself out after a while of playing. If it doesn''t, I turn it down and it seems to help. It''s something of a mystery, but alas, great mic,...'),
(N'Joyce', N'Lopez', N'joyce.lopez5487@example.com', '2018-07-13', 2, N'Super fun game but with some questionable practices. So let''s review. I bought XL for 30.00$. I want to unlock all brutalities and have learned that they made this unnecessarily cumbersome in hopes you go for the 20.00$ unlocked all in krypt, main issue there is the full game cost me 30.00$ new, so WTF? Why does DLC never seem to depreciate in value? I''m not coughing up an additional two thirds of the game''s price to unlock peripherals and other things that quite frankly shouldn''t be locked. Also, wanna pick a faction NP pick one, want to change factions? Oh well ya gotta go on-line for that. Sure makes sense to me, but are you sure, Netherealms, that you aren''t in cohoots with Sony to maximize their on-line profits? Cause Im currently not paying for PS on-line as this is the only game I have that requires me to, in order to experience what I want to experience. 60$ for on-line PS services, 20 $ for all unlocked and 30 $ for the game, makes this a 110.00 $ game. For shame, Noob...'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Murphy', N'cheryl.murphy5301@example.net', '2018-07-14', 5, N'Great game with awkward at first but tight control.. Get used to it and have fun'),
(N'Steven', N'Carter', N'steven.carter7739@example.net', '2018-07-14', 2, N'Functional, but defective. The power cable supplies enough power to boot the wii, but is either unshielded and interferes with the wii''s AV output (I tested this with 2 AV cables) or the power draw is too low to fully power the wii. The cable gets extremely hot and the power brick itself feels like it''s completely empty, I''m guessing it''s just there for show. The plug also doesn''t properly fit into the wii''s power socket. Worst of all (and this is the reason I am returning it) It generates a strobing effect on the screen at all times. I took pictures and will post.'),
(N'Omar', N'Clark', N'omar.clark1949@example.org', '2018-07-15', 5, N'love it thank you great service'),
(N'Joyce', N'White', N'joyce.white1819@example.net', '2018-07-16', 5, N'Amazing 10 key less board. I had the full size of this board and It was just too clunky, my mouse kept smacking into the num pad. Got this one instead and It''s GREAT!'),
(N'Anna', N'Williams', N'anna.williams3319@example.com', '2018-07-18', 5, N'not as great as lollipop chainsaw but still lots of fun. if you love killing zombies, you''ll enjoy this'),
(N'Samuel', N'Sullivan', N'samuel.sullivan7144@example.org', '2018-07-18', 4, N'Cloud comfort indeed. Lovely comfort, just worry leather will crack in time. Good inline remote. Comfortable and self adjusting. Heat up a little bit on the ears. Giant microphone you yank out, detachable but not very practical, cant go out in public with this mic but at the same time yanking it off might make me leave it and get it lost. The cable is non detachable. Mic sound had lots of peaks and chops, static, so mic was a big NO for me. Not just in sound, but its giant design makes them look bad. Rather have stashable mics. Headphone sound was decent, fair reproduction of music, games and movies. Turning Dolby on for games was above average. The positional queues in games from the surround weren''t impressive. The best I can say about this headset is the comfort, yes the cushion is legendary it actually holds to what the manufacturer describes. If comfort is what you''re looking and biggest priority, these are just right for you Update: USB dongle now makes white noise when Dolby...'),
(N'Samuel', N'Butler', N'samuel.butler2192@example.org', '2018-07-20', 3, N'They work well but they are easily broken. Already had to glue one to the joy stick when the small plastic tab broke that keeps them on.'),
(N'Cheryl', N'Watson', N'cheryl.watson8941@example.net', '2018-07-20', 5, N'Logitech are pretty good at what they do, I don''t know how the other manufacturers are keeping up with them when it comes to mice. It''s amazingly ergonomic and easy to use, very precise as well - can''t be more pleased with this mouse.'),
(N'Mateo', N'Evans', N'mateo.evans4237@example.com', '2018-07-22', 5, N'my son loves it.'),
(N'Shirley', N'James', N'shirley.james3826@example.com', '2018-07-23', 1, N'Worst experience'),
(N'Aisha', N'Jenkins', N'aisha.jenkins4778@example.org', '2018-07-23', 5, N'Holy crap this game is sick! Waited quite a while to review it. Everything is great. Sometimes the servers are pretty laggy but im not entirely sure that is the game as much as it is on my end. Like shooters? Dont hesitate.'),
(N'Carlos', N'Mendoza', N'carlos.mendoza8789@example.net', '2018-07-23', 5, N'A++++++'),
(N'Stephen', N'Brown', N'stephen.brown8943@example.com', '2018-07-25', 3, N'Windows 10 does not recognize it as a "gaming mouse" therefore the indicated software cannot control the lights or function of the third thumb button. Other than that it feels fine and works as intended, lights are tied to your dpi settings which can be changed with the dpi setting buttons right below the scroll wheel.'),
(N'Kofi', N'Webb', N'kofi.webb1477@example.org', '2018-07-25', 5, N'An amazingly beautiful controller that has a wonderful feel as well. I got this and a second controller to share with my Son that was of a different color. He ended up wanting mine. This one has a nice grip to it as the shell isn''t just regular old slick plastic. Really feels great! Let my Son enjoy this one as he is a hardcore PS4 player while I just wanted a controller to use with my Raspberry Pi Builds (works awesome with those too BTW).'),
(N'James', N'Kumar', N'james.kumar3670@example.org', '2018-07-26', 3, N'Its ok, but a littler expensive'),
(N'Maria', N'Stewart', N'maria.stewart5709@example.net', '2018-07-27', 4, N'awesome game a lot of fun.'),
(N'Jack', N'Jimenez', N'jack.jimenez2701@example.org', '2018-07-28', 5, N'Bought this months ago and still works perfectly.'),
(N'Matthew', N'Stewart', N'matthew.stewart6917@example.com', '2018-07-29', 4, N'I rated 4/5 for the moment - I''ll change in time perhaps - because where the game is super awesome to play and experience as an RTS, the storyline in the campaign seems just as mundane as the first game before it. Or random, however you want to see it. Really, I was more excited about the story than I was about the gameplay. And the game leaves me feeling... unsatisfied. Call me crazy. But hey, I enjoy playing old Fable II on my Xbox 360 better than I do playing competitive on Overwatch with Xbox One. So bite me, lol. Anyway, being a veteran of the former game of Halo Wars, I was really excited to see that a second game of the series was coming out! It was a sad time back in the day to see the Ensemble Studios ended their days after the game, as I had been playing their games - especially Age of Mythology - since childhood. Now, with Creative Assembly or whatnot, the game seems way more fast paced, has new in depth game modes and the blitz gameplay/cards are really awesome to try...'),
(N'Stephen', N'Williams', N'stephen.williams4984@example.org', '2018-07-30', 4, N'Its Gran a Turismo and it has Local Multiplayer. Excepted more from this game but I still like it though.'),
(N'Noah', N'Hernandez', N'noah.hernandez9843@example.com', '2018-07-31', 5, N'i don''t remember this game not one single little ittle bit'),
(N'Aisha', N'Sullivan', N'aisha.sullivan6117@example.org', '2018-08-01', 5, N'Can''t have a DS without it.'),
(N'Ethan', N'Mendoza', N'ethan.mendoza8824@example.org', '2018-08-01', 5, N'I love it thanks'),
(N'Susan', N'Moore', N'susan.moore2167@example.com', '2018-08-01', 5, N'I like the rainbow LED with the keyboard and the mouse is comfortable with my hand. It is also easy to install, just plug into the USB ports and they are ready to use[windows 10 here]. Great product for the price.'),
(N'Benjamin', N'King', N'benjamin.king7824@example.com', '2018-08-01', 5, N'Worked on super smash bros Wii U. Did not work with super smash bros brawl Wii disc.'),
(N'Jose', N'Green', N'jose.green5407@example.org', '2018-08-02', 5, N'I bought this controller months ago and I have only charged it when I first got it. I use it about 4 times a week.'),
(N'Jose', N'Green', N'jose.green5407@example.org', '2018-08-02', 5, N'This is an excellent controller for the Wii U, especially for those who prefer the Xbox 360 design. One issue I have with it, though, all the pictures of it show the A button at the bottom, like the 360 controller, but it isn''t actually there. The button layout is exactly like Nintendo controllers. It''s a minor problem, but it''s there.'),
(N'Jose', N'Green', N'jose.green5407@example.org', '2018-08-02', 5, N'Got two of these for the price of 1 nintendo controller. They feel good and the WiiU has USB ports on the back for charging as well. No problem syncing or handling during games.'),
(N'Jose', N'Green', N'jose.green5407@example.org', '2018-08-02', 5, N'Love these controllers, they are just as good as the Wii U brand and half the price. You charge them via USB plugged into the Wii U, and the charge lasts for a very long time. Has a nice grip in your hands and seems pretty durable.'),
(N'James', N'Kowalski', N'james.kowalski4335@example.com', '2018-08-04', 5, N'Definitely the mic you want to use if you have rock band four I was using the rock been three Mike but it wasn''t as good as this one this one just sounds clear and much better'),
(N'Amy', N'Khan', N'amy.khan7934@example.org', '2018-08-05', 4, N'For $20 not bad at all. For some reason it occasionally loses connection to my laptop and I have to push the plug in and the sound is not a full as say the $50 corsair set i also bought. Still recommended for a cheap headset.'),
(N'Jennifer', N'Lopez', N'jennifer.lopez5783@example.org', '2018-08-05', 5, N'A+'),
(N'Sandra', N'Mendoza', N'sandra.mendoza3531@example.com', '2018-08-08', 4, N'1st off, this works incredibly well on a Windows 10 device. Bluetooth connects up well, and once calibrated and the buttons set for the game you''re playing it feels like an old SNES controller. I''ve not noticed any lag or the like yet. The main knock is that it''s status is given by flashing LED''s along the rim, and it makes it somewhat difficult to see what''s happening. When off the lights are off. But when charging it appears the device automatically turns on, and you have to press the power button when you stop charging or it remains on. The LED flashes green when charging, but then just goes to flashing Blue when it''s fully charged--or so I''m led to believe. Instructions are a bit sparse. You might have to be diligent about turning it off after charging, but it does work as a compact travel controller.'),
(N'Ronald', N'Torres', N'ronald.torres2385@example.net', '2018-08-09', 5, N'The OEM one we had in there has a noticeable bulge. It was pushing against the back cover before I removed it and tucked it safely away. The new one seems much more content remaining flat and holding a charge extraordinarily well. Would buy again. Since we have like 8 3DS devices, I suspect we will.'),
(N'Charles', N'Hill', N'charles.hill6332@example.net', '2018-08-09', 5, N'I got him so that when I play the game my brother who is a villains fan can have one to play with other than the heroes I have and he loves playing him. I don''t know when but soon I''ll get more villains so he can have more of a pick.'),
(N'Deborah', N'King', N'deborah.king6628@example.org', '2018-08-10', 5, N'The Steel Series Optical Wired Mouse offers great tactile feel, precision track at various settable speeds and has looks good. The software offers lighting enhancements. good investment for a gamer.'),
(N'Joshua', N'Khan', N'joshua.khan7792@example.net', '2018-08-10', 4, N'Slightly dissapointed by the range but while connected this works well. No lag as long as you don''t stray too far from the adapter with the controller.'),
(N'Andrew', N'Wright', N'andrew.wright1149@example.com', '2018-08-10', 5, N'Astonishing this game is massive and probably one of the most immersive RPG Ive played since Falout 4 I can not describe how addicted I was to this game when I purchased it definitely recommend this to anyone that wants to be immersed into a world like the Witcher 3'),
(N'Benjamin', N'Johnson', N'benjamin.johnson9272@example.net', '2018-08-11', 4, N'Fun game. It covers more than just the avenger movies. The only downside is it just feels like I am playing the first lego Marvel game.'),
(N'Zachary', N'Lewis', N'zachary.lewis9695@example.net', '2018-08-14', 5, N'If you''re looking for complete games from yesteryear, then this isn''t for you. Yes, they emulate the games perfectly, but you don''t get to play them all the way through. You''re presented with many original NES games to start out with, but they''re individual challenges. You might get a whole stage of a game, but that''s it. And it''s not bad, either - each game has a lot of different challenges, like "pop so many balloons" or "jump to the flagpole" - different tasks in classic NES games, and you get to unlock new games and new challenges. It''s brilliant, really. When you play these challenges, you unlock various mash-ups with the classics, like playing as Link in Donkey Kong without the ability to jump. That one kind of perturbed me, but it was still a trip to play, and there are so many others. If you grew up with a NES, this game is for you. The day I got it, I found myself noticing the morning sun showing up at my window, I''d been playing it and unlocking new games and challenges...'),
(N'Patricia', N'Ortiz', N'patricia.ortiz2197@example.net', '2018-08-15', 5, N'Corresponds to the description !'),
(N'Katherine', N'Reed', N'katherine.reed1835@example.com', '2018-08-16', 5, N'I freaking love Gears of War, it has changed my gaming life forever and I love it! I will admit this one is not the best however, the feels this game gives you is a tear jerker. Love it! If you are dedicated to the story line you just have to continue. Show the love, play Gears of War 4!'),
(N'Christine', N'Anderson', N'christine.anderson7655@example.net', '2018-08-16', 5, N'It is a decent headset for the price, for sure. Very Solid!!I like my 7.1 surround sound and this is the best price performance headset, and like amazon for fast shiping. I LOVE THESE get them trust me they isolate sound, sound just like beats but with a different name and mic.'),
(N'Joan', N'Kumar', N'joan.kumar3466@example.net', '2018-08-18', 3, N'The mouse is super cool and love it. The keyboard has some issues: You cant select a solid color for the LEDs - it only allows rainbow, which makes it hard to see sometimes. The buttons are non standard so when you expect to press something, its an entirely different button. Overall - this is a good entry level keyboard and mouse combo for kids'),
(N'Henry', N'Miller', N'henry.miller3305@example.net', '2018-08-21', 5, N'My daughter loves this game, she''s very happy with it...therefore I am happy..!'),
(N'Sharon', N'Gray', N'sharon.gray8853@example.org', '2018-08-24', 5, N'I received'),
(N'Jack', N'Adams', N'jack.adams7340@example.org', '2018-08-27', 3, N'As I have completed most of the one-player activities in Far Cry 5 (which I have loved!), I thought I would check out FC Primal, to keep me occupied until some of the fall''s exciting new releases drop in price or go on sale... I have only been playing FCP for a few hours, but I''m sorry to report that it''s just not grabbing me the way FC5 did. I guess I miss the guns, driving, and flying activities of the regular FC games too much. This title also has a lot of different activities to learn, along with their control schemes, but it feels more like learning than playing. There are some cool touches like checking out a territory with an owl''s eye view or taming a beast and setting him loose on your enemies, but so far the missions haven''t been very compelling, and the game seems to lack a singular and memorable enemy like the cult leader in FC5. I''ll report back if I feel differently after playing more, but so far, I can play FCP for only a half an hour or so at a time before I get...'),
(N'Megan', N'Roberts', N'megan.roberts4261@example.org', '2018-08-29', 5, N'My son loves it.'),
(N'Amy', N'Evans', N'amy.evans2809@example.net', '2018-09-04', 3, N'I usually struggle with FPS but wanted to give this one a try because it seemed interesting. I''m usually one to play games like The Last of Us or the Uncharted series so this one is ok. The loading time took forever for some reason and I find there''s something lacking in the story, but maybe it''s more fun to be played as multiplayer vs the single player experience. Not too excited about this one, but overall not bad.'),
(N'Larry', N'Perry', N'larry.perry2344@example.org', '2018-09-04', 5, N'This controller came on time, was well packaged and was in the original xbox package! I bought this for my 19 year old grandson and he loves it, it has a good feel to it and is a bit more updated for the one that can with his xbox! Thanks for having this item at a decent price!'),
(N'Kenneth', N'Rivera', N'kenneth.rivera8066@example.net', '2018-09-08', 5, N'This game is great, the graphics are amazing, hell just swinging around in the city is fun lol. The combat is quick and intuitive, lots of suits, powers and gadgets. Living it so far!'),
(N'Jeffrey', N'Edwards', N'jeffrey.edwards9781@example.org', '2018-09-09', 5, N'Good price'),
(N'Sofia', N'Cox', N'sofia.cox4598@example.net', '2018-09-11', 4, N'This works out great since you can just slip your controllers on these and they always have a full charge between play sessions. I got these trying to organize my gaming setup a bit more and they really did help pare down some wires. I think my only complaint is that they lights on the side are super bright and they are always pulsing even when fully charged.'),
(N'Timothy', N'Russell', N'timothy.russell4921@example.com', '2018-09-12', 1, N'Terrible sound quality, these were a gift for my boyfriend''s birthday and he didn''t like them. The volume has a limit and you can still hear things over the game while wearing these. He did not even want to test out the mic the sound was so bad.'),
(N'Betty', N'Martinez', N'betty.martinez3957@example.com', '2018-09-13', 5, N'Kids love it'),
(N'Robert', N'Moore', N'robert.moore2653@example.net', '2018-09-20', 3, N'This game is okay. It starts off fun as you swing through New York stopping crimes. You know, what Spiderman does. However, there are far too many forced sequences that are just boring. Playing as Mary Jane and Miles Morales quickly turns into a chore and brings the game to a crawl. Pun intended, because as MJ and Miles, all you do is crawl and sneak for missions that are far too long. The game is beautiful on PS4 Pro, when it is daylight. Unfortunately Insomniac was too afraid to venture from the Arkham formula and the majority of the game takes place at night. Story missions change the time of day so you will find yourself trying to get through the story just to make it daylight so you can swing around the city and actually see something. After you beat the game you will have the ability to change the time of day at will. Which would have been nice while playing through it. One shining spot is the costumes. Insomniac made all of the costumes look amazing and the pace at which you...');
